# game/script.rpy:1166
translate chinese map005_86570cbd:

    # "Everything is burning. I can do little to stop it from spreading.{w}\nAn immense pain assaults my head, and I throw my face into my hands.{w}\nThe same question repeatedly plays in my mind: \"What am I doing here...?\""
    "一切都在燃烧，我几乎无力阻止火势蔓延。{w}\n一阵剧痛袭上头顶，我双手掩面。{w}\n同一个问题在我脑中反复回响：“我为什么会在这里……？”"

# game/script.rpy:1170
translate chinese map005_63907572:

    # "I have no knowledge of what happened up until this point.{w}\nMy brain is struggling to fill in the blanks, not gaining any headway.{w}\nIt was almost like, until this exact moment, I never existed."
    "在此之前发生了什么，我一无所知。{w}\n我的大脑拼命想填补这些空白，却毫无进展。{w}\n就好像，直到这一刻之前，我从未存在过一样。"

# game/script.rpy:1172
translate chinese map005_fea3fe66:

    # "Then why is it {i}now{/i} that cognition has found me?{w}\nWas there something I could do to put out these flames?{w}\nOr perhaps, was I the cause of this inferno to begin with?"
    "那么，为何偏偏是{i}现在{/i}，意识才找到了我？{w}\n我是否有办法扑灭这些火焰？{w}\n又或者，这场大火最初就是由我引起的？"

# game/script.rpy:1174
translate chinese map005_61d8481e:

    # "A foolish thought, and one I throw away.{w}\nIf I was responsible, then I wouldn't feel this sense of dread.{w}\nAn emotion shared by those who stand beside me."
    "这是个愚蠢的念头，我把它抛开。{w}\n若真是我造成的，我便不会感到这种恐惧。{w}\n一种站在我身旁之人也同样怀有的情绪。"

# game/script.rpy:1201
translate chinese map005_5529578e:

    # voice "se/z00001.ogg"
    voice "se/z00001.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:1203
translate chinese map005_9715e1e6:

    # char_valessa "Come on, pick up the pace...!\nIf we waste any more time, we won't make it out alive!\nThere's no way the Elder would let me live that one down."
    char_valessa "快，加快脚步……！\n要是再浪费时间，我们就别想活着出去了！\n长老绝不会让我把这事轻易揭过去的。"

# game/script.rpy:1234
translate chinese map005_04064a5a:

    # "I feel like she's escorting me, and I should follow her.{w}\nCould it be that she's been tasked with my protection?{w}\nI grasp at the straws that are the memories in my mind.{w}\nI'm only able to latch onto one. It's the title that I go by."
    "我感觉她在护送我，我应该跟上她。{w}\n难道她的任务就是保护我？{w}\n我拼命抓住脑海中那些记忆的稻草。{w}\n可我唯一能抓住的，只有我所背负的那个头衔。"

# game/script.rpy:1245
translate chinese map005_5b75d458:

    # voice "se/z00002.ogg"
    voice "se/z00002.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:1248
translate chinese map005_dd8a4cdc:

    # char_valessa "Are you even paying attention!?" nointeract
    char_valessa "你到底有没有在听！？" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:1255
translate chinese map005_5e3b4dc2:

    # voice "se/z00003.ogg"
    # char_valessa "What!? I know who you are, Seeress!\nDid you hit your head or something...?"
    voice "se/z00003.ogg"
    char_valessa "什么！？我当然知道你是谁，先知！\n你是撞到头了吗……？"

# game/script.rpy:1267
translate chinese map005_3f4ba59d:

    # voice "se/z00005.ogg"
    # char_valessa "I know who you are, Seer!\nDid you hit your head or something...?"
    voice "se/z00005.ogg"
    char_valessa "我知道你是谁，先知！\n你是撞到头了吗……？"

# game/script.rpy:1279
translate chinese map005_6c53a550:

    # "She scoffs as she turns the other way.{w}\nBut I know she's right. I'm not taking this seriously.{w}\nIt feels like a dream, and I doubt that it's all happening."
    "她哼了一声，把头转向另一边。{w}\n但我知道她说得对，我根本没把这一切当回事。{w}\n这一切像一场梦，我怀疑它是否真的在发生。"

# game/script.rpy:1281
translate chinese map005_332902fa:

    # "A few moments later, a sudden sensation startles me.{w}\nThere's a firm grip on my shoulder. We aren't alone.{w}\nUnderneath a veil of fright, I turn to greet this second stranger."
    "片刻之后，一阵突如其来的触感吓了我一跳。{w}\n有只手牢牢抓住了我的肩膀。我们并非孤身一人。{w}\n我怀着满心惊恐，转头去迎接这第二个陌生人。"

# game/script.rpy:1311
translate chinese map005_79eb87e1:

    # voice "se/z00006.ogg"
    voice "se/z00006.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:1313
translate chinese map005_ac224d51:

    # char_ulric "Valessa has our safety in mind, okay?\nForgive her hot-headedness for me.\nFreedom isn't too much farther."
    char_ulric "瓦莱莎是在为我们的安危着想，明白吗？\n替我原谅她的一时冲动吧。\n自由就快到了。"

# game/script.rpy:1318
translate chinese map005_060c198d:

    # voice "se/z00007.ogg"
    # char_ulric "We need to stay calm and think this through.\nTwo guys like us? We should have no problem.\nWe'll be safe and sound before you know it."
    voice "se/z00007.ogg"
    char_ulric "我们得保持冷静，好好想清楚。\n像我们这样的两个大男人？肯定没问题。\n转眼之间我们就能平安无事。"

