    char_ulric "瓦莱莎是在为我们的安危着想，明白吗？\n替我原谅她的一时冲动吧。\n自由就快到了。"

# game/script.rpy:1333
translate chinese map005_c2e08b35:

    # voice "se/z00008.ogg"
    # char_ulric "We need to stay calm and think this through.\nTwo girls like you? I'm sure you can come up with something.\nWe'll be safe and sound before you know it."
    voice "se/z00008.ogg"
    char_ulric "我们得保持冷静，好好想清楚。\n像你们这样的两个姑娘？我相信你们能想出办法。\n转眼之间我们就能平安无事。"

# game/script.rpy:1357
translate chinese map005_72fe7d9b:

    # "We weave through the houses and alleys to remain unseen.{w}\nDoing our best to be completely silent, we bring no attention to ourselves.{w}\nThe flames encourage our urgency, but we're careful not to be fast or reckless."
    "我们在房屋与小巷间穿行，避开别人的视线。{w}\n我们竭力保持安静，不引来任何注意。{w}\n火焰催促着我们加快脚步，但我们小心不让自己过快或过于鲁莽。"

# game/script.rpy:1359
translate chinese map005_25a0535f:

    # "Our silence makes everything else more prominent, however.{w}\nThe screams of those being slaughtered fill me with a feeling of disgust.{w}\nWe need to find cover, and Valessa points out a small alcove waiting nearby."
    "然而，这份寂静反而让其他一切更加醒目。{w}\n被杀之人的惨叫声让我心中充满厌恶。{w}\n我们需要找个藏身处，瓦莱莎指了指附近一个现成的小壁龛。"

# game/script.rpy:1383
translate chinese map005_6c25a244:

    # voice "se/z00009.ogg"
    voice "se/z00009.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:1386
translate chinese map005_76e3fce8:

    # char_valessa "Look. They're dying because they panicked.\nWe need to stay calm and think through this together.\nIf we freak out, we'll only end up like them, you know?"
    char_valessa "看吧。他们之所以会死，是因为慌了神。\n我们必须保持冷静，一起把这事想清楚。\n要是我们也慌了，下场只会和他们一样，懂吗？"

# game/script.rpy:1415
