    # char_ulric "Would you rather perish with them, Valessa?\nThat's what'll happen if you go running out there.\nWe're not equipped to handle this on our own."
    char_ulric "你宁愿和他们一起死吗，瓦莱莎？\n你要是冲出去，结果就是这样。\n凭我们自己是应付不来的。"

# game/script.rpy:1666
translate chinese map005_4e2cb335:

    # voice "se/z00019.ogg"
    # char_ulric "You have to remember what I'm doing here!\nIt's my job to protect the both of you.\nEveryone else is expendable."
    voice "se/z00019.ogg"
    char_ulric "你可得记住我来这儿是干什么的！\n我的职责就是保护你们俩。\n其他人都可以牺牲。"

# game/script.rpy:1690
translate chinese map005_bbae4624:

    # "My suspicions are correct. Ulric is the one protecting us.{w}\nBut why exactly are we a higher priority than the civilians?{w}\nI venture a guess that we're currently in this \"Valinorth\"."
    "我的猜测没错，保护我们的人是乌尔里克。{w}\n可为什么我们会比平民更要紧？{w}\n我大胆猜测，我们现在就在这个“瓦利诺斯”。"

# game/script.rpy:1692
translate chinese map005_a0c2fa9e:

    # "The pain in my head pulses again, and I stumble back.{w}\nAs I let out a groan, Ulric rushes over to my side.{w}\nHis exaggerated concern is now understandable."
    "头上的剧痛再次阵阵袭来，我踉跄着后退。{w}\n我发出一声呻吟，乌尔里克立刻冲到我身边。{w}\n他这份夸张的关切，如今总算说得通了。"

# game/script.rpy:1718
