# game/script.rpy:1884
translate chinese map005_9e550f45:

    # "He steps away for a few moments, and inspects the ground around him.{w}\nThere's a brief period where I can't see him, but he returns with a blade.{w}\nThe fire causes it to glisten, almost like it's begging me to take it."
    "他走开了一会儿，仔细打量着四周的地面。{w}\n有那么短短一阵我看不见他，等他回来时手上多了一把剑。{w}\n火光映得剑身闪闪发亮，仿佛在恳求我把它拿走。"

# game/script.rpy:1914
translate chinese map005_ed1b5a6b:

    # voice "se/z00026.ogg"
    voice "se/z00026.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:1916
translate chinese map005_9242f544:

    # char_ulric "I don't care what's going on in that head of yours.\nBut it's not more important than your survival.\nWe're all overwhelmed, it's not just you."
    char_ulric "我才不管你那脑袋里在想些什么。\n但那比不上保住你的命重要。\n我们都快撑不住了，不只你一个。"

# game/script.rpy:1927
translate chinese map005_ee319370:

    # "He holds out the blade, expecting my compliance.{w}\nAt this rate, it seems like fighting may be inevitable."
    "他把剑递过来，等着我乖乖接过。{w}\n照这样下去，恐怕一战在所难免。"

# game/script.rpy:1941
translate chinese map005_cda3f02a:

    # voice "se/z00027.ogg"
    voice "se/z00027.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:1944
translate chinese map005_ea367c02:

    # char_ulric "Take it. We won't be standing here forever.\nAs soon as we leave this alcove, we'll be vulnerable.\nI can't take care of you all the time, you know." nointeract
    char_ulric "拿着。我们不会一直站在这儿。\n一旦离开这个壁龛，我们就毫无掩护。\n我可没法时时刻刻照看你，你知道的。" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:1958
translate chinese map005_73cf90b7:

    # voice "se/z00028.ogg"
    # char_ulric "You must be mistaken. This wasn't an option.\nI can't keep an eye on both of you in the heat of battle.\nValessa has her daggers, and you need something as well."
    voice "se/z00028.ogg"
    char_ulric "你一定是误会了。这可不是商量。\n战况激烈时，我没法同时照看你们两个。\n瓦莱莎有她的匕首，你也得有件武器。"

# game/script.rpy:1970
translate chinese map005_a96ae755:

    # "He grabs my hand and places the blade in my grasp.{w}\nHe's strong enough that I knew resisting was worthless.{w}\nIt's probably better not to fight, so I take it and nod."
    "他抓住我的手，把剑塞进我手里。{w}\n他的力气大得让我明白反抗毫无意义。{w}\n最好还是别较劲，于是我接过剑，点了点头。"

# game/script.rpy:1984
translate chinese map005_be9f4456:

    # voice "se/z00029.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Now that's what I like to hear.\nI'll feel better if you have something to fight with.\nValessa has her daggers, but you had nothing."
    voice "se/z00029.ogg"
    char_ulric "这才像话。\n你手里有武器，我会安心些。\n瓦莱莎有她的匕首，你却什么都没有。"

# game/script.rpy:1996
translate chinese map005_09cc22a8:

    # "I grab the blade and swing it a couple times, testing its weight.{w}\nIt seems good enough for me, and I wouldn't have any problems using it.{w}\nThough it was a far cry from the massive blade that Ulric carried."
    "我握住剑，挥了两下，试试它的重量。{w}\n手感还不错，用起来应该没问题。{w}\n只是和乌尔里克背着的那把巨剑比起来，差得远了。"

# game/script.rpy:2017
translate chinese map005_41b35fd0:

    # voice "se/z00030.ogg"
    voice "se/z00030.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:2019
translate chinese map005_8318715a:

    # char_ulric "Now then, it's time to move.\nSeems like some of the noise has finally died down.\nWe should start by investigating the town square."
    char_ulric "那么，该动身了。\n外面的动静似乎终于小了些。\n我们先去城镇广场看看吧。"

# game/script.rpy:2035
translate chinese map005_d1b8af4f:

    # "He walks off, expecting us to follow along.{w}\nBut as I'm about to take a step, Valessa grabs my arm.{w}\nThe look on her face tells me something is wrong."
    "他抬脚走了，等着我们跟上。{w}\n可我刚要迈步，瓦莱莎抓住了我的手臂。{w}\n她脸上的神情告诉我，出事了。"

# game/script.rpy:2066
translate chinese map005_b6788d7b:

    # voice "se/z00031.ogg"
    voice "se/z00031.ogg"

