translate chinese map005_fc341297:

    # char_valessa "You're confused about all this, right?\nI bet you don't even know what being the \"Seeress\" means.\nOr how we've known each other for our entire lives..."
    char_valessa "你对这一切都很困惑，对吧？\n我猜你连“先知”意味着什么都不知道。\n也不知道我们俩从小就相识……"

# game/script.rpy:2088
translate chinese map005_e18a1cd5:

    # "I look at the ground in both shame and confusion.{w}\nShe's completely right, my head is a mess.{w}\nAs I try to think of an excuse, her response surprises me."
    "我既羞愧又困惑地低下头。{w}\n她说得一点没错，我的脑子乱成一团。{w}\n我正想找借口，她的反应却出乎我的意料。"

# game/script.rpy:2103
translate chinese map005_023156f3:

    # voice "se/z00033.ogg"
    voice "se/z00033.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:2105
translate chinese map005_9612bb31:

    # char_valessa "That's normal, but please listen.\nWe only have a few moments before Ulric notices we're not there.\nThe Seer is special. You wield spirits to induce prophetic visions."
    char_valessa "这很正常，但请听我说。\n我们只有一小会儿，很快乌尔里克就会发现我们没跟上。\n先知很特别。你御使灵，以此引出预言的幻象。"

# game/script.rpy:2112
translate chinese map005_e4edcd80:

    # voice "se/z00034.ogg"
    voice "se/z00034.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:2114
translate chinese map005_074880e6:

    # char_valessa "That's normal, but please listen.\nWe only have a few moments before Ulric notices we're not there.\nThe Seeress is special. You wield spirits to induce prophetic visions."
    char_valessa "这很正常，但请听我说。\n我们只有一小会儿，很快乌尔里克就会发现我们没跟上。\n先知很特别。你御使灵，以此引出预言的幻象。"

# game/script.rpy:2120
translate chinese map005_c7262dd6:

    # voice "se/z00035.ogg"
    voice "se/z00035.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:2122
translate chinese map005_175e9c88:

    # char_valessa "When you have these visions, you're unable to remember anything.\nWhen you wake up, you'll dismiss it as a dream and forget it ever happened.\nAs your Scribe, it's my job to help you take advantage of this."
    char_valessa "当你身处这些幻象中时，什么都记不住。\n醒来后，你会把它当成一场梦抛诸脑后，忘记它曾发生过。\n作为你的书记官，我的职责就是帮你利用这一点。"

# game/script.rpy:2137
translate chinese map005_8c70e785:

    # voice "se/z00036.ogg"
    voice "se/z00036.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:2139
translate chinese map005_3cdc807a:

    # char_valessa "We have to follow Ulric now, but know {i}one{/i} thing.\nThe way you're acting. I'm certain this is a vision.\nThat means you can use it for information."
    char_valessa "我们现在得跟上乌尔里克了，但你只需记住{i}一点{/i}。\n看你的举止，我确信这是一场幻象。\n也就是说，你可以利用它来获取情报。"

# game/script.rpy:2150
translate chinese map005_a28345f8:

    # "She takes a few steps closer to me, and grabs my hands.{w}\nStaring right in my eyes, I notice a glimmer of hope shining within her."
    "她朝我走近几步，握住我的双手。{w}\n她直直凝视着我的眼睛，我注意到她眼底闪烁着的一线希望。"

# game/script.rpy:2177
translate chinese map005_ea6b42bb:

    # voice "se/z00037.ogg"
    voice "se/z00037.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:2179
translate chinese map005_7b1133a4:

    # char_valessa "I'm relieved. This means Valinorth is still fine!\nWhen you wake up, use this vision to save everyone.\nIt's your duty as Seer to ensure this doesn't become real!"
    char_valessa "我松了口气。这说明瓦利诺斯还好好的！\n等你醒来，就用这场幻象去救所有人。\n作为先知，你的职责就是确保这一切不会成真！"

# game/script.rpy:2186
translate chinese map005_88abcafa:

    # voice "se/z00038.ogg"
    voice "se/z00038.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:2188
translate chinese map005_6080f01f:

    # char_valessa "I'm relieved. This means Valinorth is still fine!\nWhen you wake up, use this vision to save everyone.\nIt's your duty as Seeress to ensure this doesn't become real!"
    char_valessa "我松了口气。这说明瓦利诺斯还好好的！\n等你醒来，就用这场幻象去救所有人。\n作为先知，你的职责就是确保这一切不会成真！"

# game/script.rpy:2204
translate chinese map005_6ac684bf:

    # "She lets go of my hands, and follows after Ulric.{w}\nThough it's hard to believe what she said, I'm less confused.{w}\nI finally had a reason for why I felt so \"disconnected\"."
    "她松开我的手，跟上了乌尔里克。{w}\n虽然她的话很难让人相信，但我没那么困惑了。{w}\n我终于明白自己为何会有那种“格格不入”的感觉。"

# game/script.rpy:2206
translate chinese map005_79411e7e:

    # "But if this was a vision, then what would become of Ulric and Valessa?{w}\nWould all of this carnage be undone as soon as I woke up?{w}\nWhat if they died — or what if I died in this vision?"
    "可如果这是一场幻象，那乌尔里克和瓦莱莎又会怎样？{w}\n我一醒来，这场屠杀就会全部烟消云散吗？{w}\n要是他们死了呢——或者，要是“我”在这场幻象中死了呢？"

# game/script.rpy:2208
translate chinese map005_8c598e57:

    # "I follow after Valessa, realizing I might never know.{w}\nBut a faint sense of determination rises up within me.{w}\nIf there was a chance I could stop this? I had to do it."
    "我跟上瓦莱莎，意识到自己也许永远无从得知。{w}\n但一股淡淡的决心在我心中升起。{w}\n只要有一线机会阻止这一切，我就必须去做。"

# game/script.rpy:2267
translate chinese map035_be1608f2:

    # "In the present day, The Triumvirate conspires with their Grand Inquisitor.{w}\nFor the events that led to Valinorth's destruction had yet to be set in motion.{w}\nSovy knelt before his masters, more eager to serve than he had ever been before."
    "而在当下，三人执政团正与他们的大审判官密谋。{w}\n因为导致瓦利诺斯覆灭的事件，此时尚未拉开序幕。{w}\n索维跪在他的主上面前，比以往任何时候都更渴望效命。"

# game/script.rpy:2293
translate chinese map035_7a82f57f:

    # voice "se/z00039.ogg"
    voice "se/z00039.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:2296
translate chinese map035_c3c97bf1:

    # char_the_triumvirate "Rise, Sovy.\nBut please, assure us of your certainty.\nWe'd hate to act without knowing everything."
    char_the_triumvirate "起来吧，索维。\n但请你让我们确信万无一失。\n我们不愿在一切未明之前贸然行动。"

# game/script.rpy:2319
translate chinese map035_b1be16a0:

    # voice "se/z00040.ogg"
    voice "se/z00040.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:2322
translate chinese map035_10c49dc0:

    # char_sovy "The prisoner mentions \"Valinorth\" over and over.\nThe Rebels are hiding something of importance there.\nAlong with recent events, we can only surmise one thing."
    char_sovy "那囚犯一遍又一遍地提到“瓦利诺斯”。\n反抗军在那里藏了某样重要的东西。\n结合近来发生的事，我们只能推断出一件事。"

# game/script.rpy:2349
translate chinese map035_c47e204b:

    # voice "se/z00041.ogg"
    voice "se/z00041.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:2351
translate chinese map035_7209ef9b:

    # char_the_triumvirate "The Blade of Exodus?"
    char_the_triumvirate "放逐之刃？"

# game/script.rpy:2378
translate chinese map035_e4627821:

    # voice "se/z00042.ogg"
    voice "se/z00042.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:2380
translate chinese map035_46812f45:

    # char_sovy "I am almost certain.\nBut if that's where they've chosen to hide it?\nIt means that our other target is also there."
    char_sovy "我几乎可以确定。\n但要是那就是他们藏剑的地方呢？\n那就意味着我们的另一个目标也在那里。"

# game/script.rpy:2407
translate chinese map035_c4e70a9d:

    # voice "se/z00043.ogg"
    voice "se/z00043.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:2409
translate chinese map035_272ed944:

    # char_the_triumvirate "Your compliance pleases us, Sovy.\nYour plan was risky, but it worked out in the end.\nA final interrogation would influence our decision further."
    char_the_triumvirate "你的顺从让我们很满意，索维。\n你的计划虽有风险，但最终还是奏效了。\n最后再进行一次审讯，会进一步影响我们的决定。"

# game/script.rpy:2436
translate chinese map035_3c2af341:

    # voice "se/z00044.ogg"
    voice "se/z00044.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:2438
translate chinese map035_da657860:

    # char_sovy "You'd have me interrogate the prisoner once more?\nIf I may be so bold — to what end do you request this?"
    char_sovy "您要我再审那囚犯一次？\n恕我斗胆——请问您为何有此要求？"

# game/script.rpy:2455
translate chinese map035_71cc2df5:

    # voice "se/z00045.ogg"
    # char_the_triumvirate "Not you, Sovy.\nWe want your {i}Apprentice{/i} to do this.\nIt is time for him to prove his worth."
    voice "se/z00045.ogg"
    char_the_triumvirate "不是你去，索维。\n我们要你的{i}学徒{/i}去做这件事。\n是时候让他证明自己的价值了。"

# game/script.rpy:2479
translate chinese map035_f9075571:

    # "Their voices echoed loudly through their darkened chambers.{w}\nIt mattered not which Triumvir spoke, for they were all of one mind.{w}\nWith a clear irritation in his voice, Sovy did his best to stay calm."
    "他们的声音在昏暗的殿堂里回荡。{w}\n无论开口的是哪位执政官都无所谓，因为他们同心一体。{w}\n索维的声音里透着明显的恼怒，却尽力保持镇定。"

# game/script.rpy:2505
translate chinese map035_2d86ae27:

    # voice "se/z00046.ogg"
    voice "se/z00046.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:2507
translate chinese map035_55c244b7:

    # char_sovy "My Apprentice...?\nI've told you many times, I want to work alone.\nIt would be more efficient for me to do this myself!"
    char_sovy "我的学徒……？\n我已经说过很多次了，我想独自行动。\n我一个人来做会快得多！"

# game/script.rpy:2534
translate chinese map035_b1a6a772:

    # voice "se/z00047.ogg"
    voice "se/z00047.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:2536
translate chinese map035_10f2c4fd:

    # char_the_triumvirate "Insubordination...?\nThis is unbecoming of you, Sovy.\nWe demand that you obey."
    char_the_triumvirate "抗命……？\n这不是你该有的样子，索维。\n我们命令你服从。"

# game/script.rpy:2541
translate chinese map035_7d5ea589:

    # voice "se/z00048.ogg"
    # char_the_triumvirate "The role of Grand Inquisitor can be very dangerous.\nIf we were to lose you, a replacement would be necessary.\nYou must train this replacement while you still breathe."
    voice "se/z00048.ogg"
    char_the_triumvirate "大审判官这个职位可能非常危险。\n万一我们失去了你，就必须有人接替。\n你必须趁还活着的时候培养这个接班人。"

# game/script.rpy:2569
translate chinese map035_a83fdf33:

    # voice "se/z00049.ogg"
    voice "se/z00049.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:2571
translate chinese map035_57818fb6:

    # char_sovy "As you command."
    char_sovy "遵命。"

# game/script.rpy:2599
translate chinese map035_233ab8f0:

    # "Sovy turned his back to The Triumvirate and spotted his Apprentice.{w}\nHe was standing by the door, listening to their conversation.{w}\nIf he'd heard of Sovy's distaste for him, he showed no concern."
    "索维背过身离开三人执政团，目光落在他的学徒身上。{w}\n那学徒正站在门边，听着他们的谈话。{w}\n即便他听到了索维对他的厌恶，也没有表现出任何在意。"

# game/script.rpy:2629
translate chinese map035_7b172898:

    # voice "se/z00050.ogg"
    voice "se/z00050.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:2631
translate chinese map035_83a39702:

    # char_halin "Interrogation, hmm?\nAnd what would you have me extract?\nI thought the prisoner was at his wit's end."
    char_halin "审讯，嗯？\n那您想让我从他嘴里撬出什么？\n我以为那囚犯已经山穷水尽了。"

# game/script.rpy:2666
translate chinese map035_f782077e:

    # voice "se/z00051.ogg"
    voice "se/z00051.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:2668
translate chinese map035_d833ae95:

    # char_sovy "Anything to confirm our suspicions about Valinorth.\nIf you fail, I will not hesitate to punish you.\nRemember what we're on the verge of."
    char_sovy "任何能证实我们对瓦利诺斯怀疑的东西。\n要是你失败了，我会毫不犹豫地惩罚你。\n记住我们即将成就什么。"

# game/script.rpy:2695
translate chinese map035_5312fed7:

    # voice "se/z00052.ogg"
    voice "se/z00052.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:2697
translate chinese map035_4c745390:

    # char_halin "I understand, Master.\nI'll do my best to get you what you need.\nWhat are the limits when it comes to my approach?"
    char_halin "我明白，师父。\n我会尽力弄到您需要的东西。\n在手段上，我的底线是什么？"

# game/script.rpy:2724
translate chinese map035_b2ffa4fc:

    # voice "se/z00053.ogg"
    voice "se/z00053.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:2726
translate chinese map035_8aa7ded0:

    # char_sovy "Keep him alive, Halin.\nI find that psychological pain is the most valid approach.\nHe cares more for his Rebel Allies than he does for himself."
    char_sovy "让他活着，哈林。\n我发现精神上的折磨才是最有效的手段。\n他关心反抗军的同伴，胜过关心自己。"

# game/script.rpy:2753
translate chinese map035_f4594276:

    # voice "se/z00054.ogg"
    voice "se/z00054.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:2756
translate chinese map035_c9c3ce9f:

    # char_halin "Then I will threaten The Rebellion's very core.\nI'm grateful to have this opportunity, Master.\nThings are starting to line up well for me."
    char_halin "那我就去威胁反抗军的命脉。\n我很感激能有这样的机会，师父。\n局势开始对我有利了。"

# game/script.rpy:2783
translate chinese map035_96e6bf0a:

    # voice "se/z00055.ogg"
    voice "se/z00055.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:2785
translate chinese map035_44edb6d1:

    # char_sovy "They tend to do that when you have The Triumvirate's blessing.\nWe should take care of this immediately, and catch them unprepared.\nEvery moment we waste — is a moment they gain, Halin."
    char_sovy "有三人执政团的庇佑，事情往往就会如此。\n我们应当立刻行动，趁他们毫无防备。\n我们浪费的每一刻——都是他们赢得的一刻，哈林。"

# game/script.rpy:2818
translate chinese map035_6dbc96ac:

    # "They leave the room together, talking amongst themselves.{w}\nThe Triumvirate waits until they're gone before speaking.{w}\nA faint smile on their faces, as age-old plans come to fruition."
    "他们一同离开房间，边走边低声交谈。{w}\n三人执政团一直等到他们走远，才开口说话。{w}\n他们脸上浮现出一丝浅笑，因为筹划已久的计划即将实现。"

# game/script.rpy:2848
translate chinese map035_5d9b56d0:

    # voice "se/z00056.ogg"
    voice "se/z00056.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:2850
translate chinese map035_799638f7:

    # char_the_triumvirate "So it's finally going to happen, isn't it?\nWhat we've been waiting for, all these years.\nDo you think we should tell Sovy our true plan?"
    char_the_triumvirate "那么，终于要发生了，是吗？\n我们这些年来一直在等待的事。\n你觉得我们该把真正的计划告诉索维吗？"

# game/script.rpy:2903
translate chinese map036_8b978ef7:

    # "Halin entered the prison cell, without Sovy at his side.{w}\nHis Master remained outside as a pseudo-display of trust.{w}\nBut it was evident to Halin that no trust existed."
    "哈林走进牢房，索维没有跟在他身旁。{w}\n他的师父留在外面，装出信任他的样子。{w}\n但哈林心里清楚，根本不存在什么信任。"

# game/script.rpy:2905
translate chinese map036_cf8922f2:

    # "The prisoner looked up, surprised to see a different face.{w}\nYet within him, was still a slowly dwindling hope.{w}\nCut off from The Rebellion, these would be his final days."
    "囚犯抬起头，看到一张陌生的脸，有些意外。{w}\n然而在他心中，仍残存着一丝慢慢熄灭的希望。{w}\n与反抗军断了联系，这将是他的最后日子。"

# game/script.rpy:2932
translate chinese map036_5523cf6e:

    # voice "se/z00057.ogg"
    voice "se/z00057.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:2934
translate chinese map036_778d6371:

    # char_shane "So someone different has finally come...?\nWhat are you, the executioner or something?\nI figured it was only a matter of time."
    char_shane "所以终于换了个生面孔来……？\n你是什么人，刽子手之类的？\n我早就料到，这只是时间问题。"

# game/script.rpy:2965
translate chinese map036_d83d5c08:

    # voice "se/z00058b.ogg"
    voice "se/z00058b.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:2967
translate chinese map036_ba95b538:

    # char_halin "Actually, Sovy said to keep you alive.\nYou seem to underestimate your value, Shane."
    char_halin "其实，索维说要留你一条命。\n你似乎低估了自己的价值，肖恩。"

# game/script.rpy:2994
translate chinese map036_564d455a:

    # voice "se/z00059.ogg"
    voice "se/z00059.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:2997
translate chinese map036_4808e03e:

    # char_shane "You think I'm important...?\nThat's not what I expected to hear."
    char_shane "你觉得我重要……？\n这可不在我的意料之中。"

# game/script.rpy:3024
translate chinese map036_c3fefa44:

    # voice "se/z00060.ogg"
    voice "se/z00060.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:3026
translate chinese map036_4a9ec26b:

    # char_halin "Don't take it the wrong way.\nYou must not know what I meant."
    char_halin "别误会了。\n你肯定没明白我的意思。"

# game/script.rpy:3049
translate chinese map036_ea58d0c2:

    # "He knelt down in front of the prisoner.{w}\nWith a sinister smirk, he tried to intimidate Shane."
    "他在囚犯面前蹲下身。{w}\n带着一抹阴森的冷笑，他试图恐吓肖恩。"

# game/script.rpy:3075
translate chinese map036_fba4434b:

    # voice "se/z00061.ogg"
    voice "se/z00061.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:3077
translate chinese map036_232c5567:

    # char_halin "You're important as a bargaining chip.\nAnd the fact I must keep you alive — is a curse.\nWhen I'm through with you, you'll beg for death."
    char_halin "你的重要性只是作为筹码。\n而我必须留你活命——这简直是诅咒。\n等我把你收拾完，你会求着去死。"

# game/script.rpy:3082
translate chinese map036_40883ce5:

    # voice "se/z00062.ogg"
    # char_halin "You see, I'm different from Sovy.\nHe's passed the bar — they no longer need to test him.\nBut I'm in the position where results must happen. "
    voice "se/z00062.ogg"
    char_halin "你看，我和索维不一样。\n他已经通过了考验——他们不再需要测试他。\n可我的处境，是必须拿出成果。"

# game/script.rpy:3088
translate chinese map036_bc2b49fb:

    # voice "se/z00063.ogg"
    # char_halin "When we give you back — you'll be a broken man.\nAnd soon after, the foundation of The Rebellion will crumble. \nYou think we don't know that Damek is your leader?"
    voice "se/z00063.ogg"
    char_halin "等我们把你放回去——你就会是个废人。\n再过不久，反抗军的根基就会崩塌。\n你以为我们不知道达梅克是你们的首领？"

# game/script.rpy:3116
translate chinese map036_4aca8f09:

    # voice "se/z00064.ogg"
    voice "se/z00064.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:3118
translate chinese map036_30c2d658:

    # char_shane "What...!?"
    char_shane "什么……！？"

# game/script.rpy:3141
translate chinese map036_f415c20c:

    # "Shane's eyes shot wide open, in utter shock.{w}\nIt seems that Halin's threats worked to great effect."
    "肖恩的双眼猛地瞪大，惊骇万分。{w}\n看来哈林的威胁效果显著。"

# game/script.rpy:3171
translate chinese map036_f5fda10b:

    # voice "se/z00065.ogg"
    voice "se/z00065.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:3173
translate chinese map036_0a89aa5e:

    # char_halin "You'd be stupid not to think we have inside men.\nI could order Damek's execution in a matter of seconds.\nYou don't value your life — but you value his."
    char_halin "你要是以为我们没有内应，那就太蠢了。\n我可以在几秒之内下令处决达梅克。\n你不看重自己的命——却很看重他的。"

# game/script.rpy:3189
translate chinese map036_9705414b:

    # char_shane "..."
    char_shane "……"

# game/script.rpy:3204
translate chinese map036_ec8cc4d6:

    # voice "se/z00066.ogg"
    # char_halin "Good — now I expect you to answer my questions.\nThe Blade of Exodus, is it in Valinorth Village?\nAnd the one who can wield it, do they live there as well?"
    voice "se/z00066.ogg"
    char_halin "很好——现在，我希望你如实回答我的问题。\n放逐之刃，是不是在瓦利诺斯村？\n还有那个能驾驭它的人，是不是也住在那儿？"

# game/script.rpy:3262
translate chinese map037_c6464eb7:

    # "By the time we catch up with Ulric, it's already too late.{w}\nHis large blade is in deadlock with one of the enemy soldiers.{w}\nValessa draws her daggers, and I hold out my sword, ready."
    "等我们追上乌尔里克时，已经太迟了。{w}\n他的巨剑正与一名敌兵僵持不下。{w}\n瓦莱莎拔出匕首，我也举起剑，严阵以待。"

# game/script.rpy:3289
translate chinese map037_7ec735b8:

    # voice "se/z00067.ogg"
    voice "se/z00067.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:3291
translate chinese map037_3b9d137a:

    # char_honor_guard "We order you to cease your resistance!\nThose who support The Rebellion must perish!"
    char_honor_guard "我们命令你们停止抵抗！\n拥护反抗军的人都得死！"

# game/script.rpy:3327
translate chinese map037_739d7fc5:

    # voice "se/kick.ogg"
    voice "se/kick.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:3329
translate chinese map037_5f13c30a:

    # "To break the deadlock, Ulric kicks his opponent in the gut.{w}\nThey stumble back, and ready their blade with a flourish.{w}\nIt isn't much longer until they charge toward him again."
    "为了打破僵局，乌尔里克一脚踹在对手的腹部。{w}\n那人踉跄着后退，炫技般重新举起剑。{w}\n没过多久，他们又朝他冲了过来。"

# game/script.rpy:3350
translate chinese map037_992c838f:

    # voice "se/z00068.ogg"
    voice "se/z00068.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:3352
translate chinese map037_029d0f3d:

    # char_ulric "Valessa, your dagger!"
    char_ulric "瓦莱莎，你的匕首！"

# game/script.rpy:3378
translate chinese map037_fed2d708:

    # "Ulric jumps out of the way, and rolls toward us.{w}\nLanding on his knees, he pries one of the daggers from her grip.{w}\nWithout even looking, he throws it behind himself."
    "乌尔里克闪身跃开，朝我们这边翻滚过来。{w}\n他双膝着地，从瓦莱莎手中掰下一把匕首。{w}\n他连看都不看，就把它朝身后扔了出去。"

# game/script.rpy:3385
translate chinese map037_35af0443:

    # "He closes his eyes and looks down at the ground.{w}\nWhen he hears the impact of the dagger, his ears fold back.{w}\nFor a moment, it looks like he's actually sad."
    "他闭上眼，低头看着地面。{w}\n听到匕首命中的声音，他的耳朵向后耷拉下去。{w}\n有那么一瞬间，他看起来竟真的有些悲伤。"

# game/script.rpy:3418
translate chinese map037_60392714:

    # voice "se/z00069.ogg"
    voice "se/z00069.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:3420
translate chinese map037_ed21bd00:

    # char_ulric "Spirits, please forgive my misdeeds.\nI acted only to protect those under my watch."
    char_ulric "灵啊，请宽恕我的罪过。\n我这么做，只是为了保护受我守护的人。"

# game/script.rpy:3443
translate chinese map037_ede95555:

    # "Ulric cares about the spirits? For some reason, I didn't expect that.{w}\nBut before I can think about this further, something happens.{w}\nCatching Valessa and I off guard, we're in complete disbelief."
    "乌尔里克竟然在意灵？不知为何，我没想到会这样。{w}\n可还没等我细想，意外就发生了。{w}\n我和瓦莱莎猝不及防，简直不敢相信自己的眼睛。"

# game/script.rpy:3473
translate chinese map037_4dc0b709:

    # voice "se/z00070.ogg"
    voice "se/z00070.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:3475
translate chinese map037_f7c8325e:

    # char_ulric "Huh...?"
    char_ulric "嗯……？"

# game/script.rpy:3498
translate chinese map037_059cada2:

    # "He notices the shocked expression on both of our faces.{w}\nRising to his feet, it's not long before he wears the same look.{w}\nThe enemy soldier fell, as expected, but there was nothing inside."
    "他察觉到我们俩脸上震惊的神情。{w}\n等他站起身，脸上很快也露出了同样的表情。{w}\n那名敌兵如预料般倒下，可里面却空无一物。"

# game/script.rpy:3500
translate chinese map037_13fee09f:

    # "Scattered pieces of armor litter the ground.{w}\nAs we process this revelation, confusion soon assails us.{w}\nThis was no ordinary attack. What we just saw was {i}impossible{/i}."
    "散落的盔甲碎片铺了一地。{w}\n我们消化着这个惊人的事实，困惑随即涌上心头。{w}\n这绝非寻常的袭击。我们刚刚所见，是{i}不可能{/i}发生的。"

# game/script.rpy:3527
translate chinese map037_b4d2b435:

    # voice "se/z00071.ogg"
    voice "se/z00071.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:3529
translate chinese map037_e05804e6:

    # char_valessa "What's going on...?\nUlric, what are those things!?"
    char_valessa "这是怎么回事……？\n乌尔里克，那些东西到底是什么！？"

# game/script.rpy:3556
translate chinese map037_340e705e:

    # voice "se/z00072.ogg"
    voice "se/z00072.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:3558
translate chinese map037_3e73b3ee:

    # char_ulric "I — I don't know!\nCome closer you two, this doesn't feel right.\nEmpty suits of armor with a hatred for The Rebellion?"
    char_ulric "我——我不知道！\n你们俩靠近点，这感觉不对劲。\n空荡荡的盔甲，却对反抗军恨之入骨？"

# game/script.rpy:3585
translate chinese map037_d96196d8:

    # voice "se/z00073.ogg"
    voice "se/z00073.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:3587
translate chinese map037_51991425:

    # char_valessa "Only those who've mastered the spirits could do this.\nI'm afraid this is much larger than we thought."
    char_valessa "只有掌控了灵的人才能做到这种事。\n恐怕这远比我们想象的要严重得多。"

# game/script.rpy:3614
translate chinese map037_8239be54:

    # voice "se/z00074.ogg"
    voice "se/z00074.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:3616
translate chinese map037_4835180c:

    # char_ulric "But that can't be true.\nThe spirits are pure, they {i}aid{/i} us."
    char_ulric "但这不可能。\n灵是纯洁的，它们{i}帮助{/i}我们。"

# game/script.rpy:3643
translate chinese map037_fbff68a5:

    # voice "se/z00075.ogg"
    voice "se/z00075.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:3645
translate chinese map037_27fb73d4:

    # char_valessa "Yeah, sure looks like they wanted to help!\nThat's not my only concern though. Look at this."
    char_valessa "是啊，看起来还真像是来帮忙的！\n不过这不是我唯一的顾虑。看这个。"

# game/script.rpy:3668
translate chinese map037_cc92121f:

    # "She scoffs as she steps toward the helmet.{w}\nKneeling down, she pulls her dagger out of it."
    "她嗤笑一声，朝那头盔走去。{w}\n她蹲下身，把匕首从里面拔了出来。"

# game/script.rpy:3698
translate chinese map037_91a26af3:

    # voice "se/z00076.ogg"
    voice "se/z00076.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:3700
translate chinese map037_7344c618:

    # char_valessa "Do you recognize these colors, Ulric...?"
    char_valessa "你认得这些颜色吗，乌尔里克……？"

# game/script.rpy:3727
translate chinese map037_9b065cc3:

    # voice "se/z00077.ogg"
    voice "se/z00077.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:3729
translate chinese map037_d79f459b:

    # char_ulric "No, why would I—"
    char_ulric "不认得，我怎么会——"

# game/script.rpy:3756
translate chinese map037_60431698:

    # voice "se/z00078.ogg"
    voice "se/z00078.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:3759
translate chinese map037_a2a56b34:

    # char_valessa "Gold and White — The Triumvirate's Standard.\nI would have never made such a deduction, but...\nOnly they could wield the spirits in this fashion." nointeract
    char_valessa "金色与白色——三人执政团的旗号。\n我本绝不会做出这样的推断，可是……\n只有他们才能以这种方式御使灵。" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:3773
translate chinese map037_c5073a1f:

    # voice "se/z00079.ogg"
    # char_valessa "Our supposed protectors.\nTo some, even the creators of Alestia.\nI have no idea why they'd want to do this to us."
    voice "se/z00079.ogg"
    char_valessa "我们所谓的守护者。\n在某些人眼中，甚至是阿莱斯蒂亚的创造者。\n我真不明白他们为何要这样对待我们。"

# game/script.rpy:3790
translate chinese map037_841ab0b9:

    # voice "se/z00080.ogg"
    # char_valessa "That's what I'd like to know.\nThey're supposed to be our protectors.\nSome people even think they created Alestia."
    voice "se/z00080.ogg"
    char_valessa "这正是我想弄明白的。\n他们本应是我们的守护者。\n有些人甚至认为他们创造了阿莱斯蒂亚。"

# game/script.rpy:3818
translate chinese map037_f6a013fb:

    # voice "se/z00081.ogg"
    voice "se/z00081.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:3820
translate chinese map037_2387f2e8:

    # char_ulric "Wouldn't be the first time they attempted \"occupation\".\nThey hinted that The Rebellion was involved here?\nValessa, do you know anything about that...?"
    char_ulric "这也不是他们第一次试图“占领”了。\n他们暗示反抗军也牵连其中？\n瓦莱莎，这事你知道些什么吗……？"

# game/script.rpy:3847
translate chinese map037_d9dea9e1:

    # voice "se/z00082.ogg"
    voice "se/z00082.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:3849
translate chinese map037_f703a20c:

    # char_valessa "I don't. So much has changed lately.\nWith our last Elder gone, Mylus has been in charge.\nMaybe he has something to tell us..."
    char_valessa "我不知道。最近变化太多了。\n上一任长老失踪后，一直是迈勒斯主事。\n也许他能告诉我们些什么……"

# game/script.rpy:3876
translate chinese map037_f32b5ce5:

    # voice "se/z00083.ogg"
    voice "se/z00083.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:3878
translate chinese map037_019ecc48:

    # char_ulric "It's worth a shot, we should see if he's alive.\nProtecting you is my goal, but now I want answers.\nIf anyone knows about this, it would be him."
    char_ulric "值得一试，我们该去看看他还活着没。\n保护你是我的目标，但现在我想要答案。\n若有人知道内情，那一定是他。"

# game/script.rpy:3905
translate chinese map037_d3b26615:

    # voice "se/z00084.ogg"
    voice "se/z00084.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:3907
translate chinese map037_70406907:

    # char_valessa "To the Elder's house, then?"
    char_valessa "那就去长老的家？"

# game/script.rpy:3934
translate chinese map037_59d57ae0:

    # voice "se/z00085.ogg"
    voice "se/z00085.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:3936
translate chinese map037_92ce701f:

    # char_ulric "Yeah."
    char_ulric "好。"

# game/script.rpy:3959
translate chinese map037_c3cffb56:

    # "I follow after Valessa and Ulric.{w}\nWe walk along the circular road surrounding the water tank.{w}\nI make note of it for later, it might help put out the flames."
    "我跟着瓦莱莎和乌尔里克走。{w}\n我们沿着环绕蓄水池的环形道路前行。{w}\n我把它记在心里，说不定之后能用来灭火。"

# game/script.rpy:3961
translate chinese map037_488b746d:

    # "More suits of armor litter the ground, there's so many of them.{w}\nIt makes me feel a bit hopeful, like we stood a chance.{w}\nThe village wasn't defenseless, and this was proof."
    "地上散落着更多盔甲，数量多得惊人。{w}\n这让我稍稍燃起希望，仿佛我们还有胜算。{w}\n村子并非毫无防备，这就是明证。"

# game/script.rpy:3991
translate chinese map037_03751eff:

    # voice "se/z00086.ogg"
    voice "se/z00086.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:3993
translate chinese map037_0cc380fb:

    # char_ulric "Aren't you glad we waited, now?\nIf we rushed in head-first, we'd be dead."
    char_ulric "现在你该庆幸我们等了吧？\n要是我们一头冲出去，早就没命了。"

# game/script.rpy:4020
translate chinese map037_7fc654c8:

    # voice "se/z00087.ogg"
    voice "se/z00087.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:4022
translate chinese map037_891de92f:

    # char_valessa "Then where are the villagers' bodies?\nI only see the suits of armor lying around."
    char_valessa "那村民们的尸体在哪儿？\n我只看到散落一地的盔甲。"

# game/script.rpy:4045
translate chinese map037_c36cad47:

    # "That was a good question, actually.{w}\nNo blood, no signs of a major struggle.{w}\nOnly the fire, and the glistening of the white armor."
    "这问题问得好。{w}\n没有血迹，没有激烈搏斗的痕迹。{w}\n只有火焰，和白色盔甲的反光。"

# game/script.rpy:4075
translate chinese map037_b9ab3e93:

    # voice "se/z00088.ogg"
    voice "se/z00088.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:4077
translate chinese map037_e7fb88b6:

    # char_ulric "That's a good sign.\nThen they won, and fled to safety.\nAre there any havens in Valinorth?"
    char_ulric "那是个好兆头。\n这么说他们赢了，逃到安全的地方去了。\n瓦利诺斯有什么避难的地方吗？"

# game/script.rpy:4104
translate chinese map037_c917a0a8:

    # voice "se/z00089.ogg"
    voice "se/z00089.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:4106
translate chinese map037_945da433:

    # char_valessa "I'd say The Elder's house, and The Grand Tree.\nThe fire may not have reached either, yet."
    char_valessa "我想是长老的家，还有巨树。\n大火也许还没烧到这两处。"

# game/script.rpy:4133
translate chinese map037_0b1d54d5:

    # voice "se/z00090.ogg"
    voice "se/z00090.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:4135
translate chinese map037_f4975519:

    # char_ulric "Wait, how many people can fit in The Grand Tree?"
    char_ulric "等等，巨树里能容纳多少人？"

# game/script.rpy:4162
translate chinese map037_d5730b40:

    # voice "se/z00091.ogg"
    voice "se/z00091.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:4164
translate chinese map037_51ab45bf:

    # char_valessa "Hundreds, easily."
    char_valessa "几百人，轻而易举。"

# game/script.rpy:4191
translate chinese map037_ac1b6a0b:

    # voice "se/z00092.ogg"
    voice "se/z00092.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:4193
translate chinese map037_09c82444:

    # char_ulric "Not as good of a sign as I thought.\nThe enemy could be trying to round everyone up.\nPut them all in one place before killing them."
    char_ulric "这兆头没我想的那么好。\n敌人可能正想把所有人赶拢到一起。\n在杀掉他们之前，先把他们集中到一处。"

# game/script.rpy:4220
translate chinese map037_f1f3c042:

    # voice "se/z00093.ogg"
    voice "se/z00093.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:4222
translate chinese map037_92d19f2d:

    # char_valessa "That's dirty...!"
    char_valessa "真卑鄙……！"

# game/script.rpy:4249
translate chinese map037_e8be82bd:

    # voice "se/z00094.ogg"
    voice "se/z00094.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:4251
translate chinese map037_c1a00104:

    # char_ulric "But it works.\nWe still don't know what they're after.\nIt can't be genocide, it must be something else."
    char_ulric "可这招管用。\n我们仍不知道他们图的是什么。\n不可能是种族灭绝，一定另有目的。"

# game/script.rpy:4266
translate chinese map037_07f58958:

    # voice "se/z00095b.ogg"
    voice "se/z00095b.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:4268
translate chinese map037_2216353e:

    # char_ulric "Does Valinorth have anything The Triumvirate would want?\nDid the change in leadership bring anything with it?"
    char_ulric "瓦利诺斯有什么是三人执政团想要的吗？\n这次权力更迭有没有带来什么变化？"

# game/script.rpy:4295
translate chinese map037_3cab3b9b:

    # voice "se/z00096.ogg"
    voice "se/z00096.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:4297
translate chinese map037_a537bd5e:

    # char_valessa "Like I said, we'd have to talk to Mylus.\nBut I doubt he'd be at The Grand Tree."
    char_valessa "我说过了，得去问迈勒斯。\n不过我猜他不在巨树那儿。"

# game/script.rpy:4320
translate chinese map037_ecbc8a77:

    # "They look at each other, and then look at me.{w}\nI could tell that Valessa was pushing us toward Mylus.{w}\nBut that's because she knew this was a vision."
    "他们互相看了看，然后又看向我。{w}\n我看得出瓦莱莎在把我们往迈勒斯那边引。{w}\n那是因为她知道这是一场幻象。"

# game/script.rpy:4350
translate chinese map037_49610ad2:

    # voice "se/z00095.ogg"
    voice "se/z00095.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:4352
translate chinese map037_c5e642e1:

    # char_ulric "But what if there {i}are{/i} people in The Grand Tree?\nIs Mylus more important than all of them?\nIt would be cold to let everyone die."
    char_ulric "可要是巨树里{i}真的{/i}有人呢？\n迈勒斯比他们所有人都重要吗？\n任由所有人去死，未免太冷酷了。"

# game/script.rpy:4379
translate chinese map037_52280c81:

    # voice "se/z00098.ogg"
    voice "se/z00098.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:4381
translate chinese map037_abc46143:

    # char_valessa "Ulric, this is larger than Valinorth!\nEspecially if it involves The Rebellion.\nInformation could save entire villages!"
    char_valessa "乌尔里克，这件事比瓦利诺斯更大！\n尤其如果牵扯到反抗军。\n情报能救下整个整个的村庄！"

# game/script.rpy:4408
translate chinese map037_fe3a7032:

    # voice "se/z00099.ogg"
    voice "se/z00099.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:4410
translate chinese map037_3496ba03:

    # char_ulric "I don't like what you're suggesting."
    char_ulric "我不喜欢你话里的意思。"

# game/script.rpy:4427
translate chinese map037_e93beeff:

    # voice "se/z00100.ogg"
    # char_valessa "Like it's any better than what you suggested!\nUsing the people as pawns to buy us time.\nHow is this any different!?"
    voice "se/z00100.ogg"
    char_valessa "好像你提的就有多高明似的！\n拿人民当棋子换取时间。\n这又有什么不同！？"

# game/script.rpy:4451
translate chinese map037_bbaebe27:

    # "They fume at each other, but realize it's a stupid argument.{w}\nIn the midst of this battle, nothing was so black-and-white.{w}\nThough I find it odd that Ulric switched viewpoints so fast."
    "他们互相生着闷气，但也都意识到这争论毫无意义。{w}\n在这场战乱之中，没有什么事是非黑即白的。{w}\n不过我觉得奇怪，乌尔里克怎么这么快就转变了立场。"

# game/script.rpy:4482
translate chinese map037_0c49c57f:

    # voice "se/z00101.ogg"
    voice "se/z00101.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:4484
translate chinese map037_a8244d03:

    # char_valessa "This is a matter of Valinorth's future.\nSuch things are under the jurisdiction of the Seer.\nI stand by his side, and you stand by both of ours."
    char_valessa "这关乎瓦利诺斯的未来。\n这类事情归先知管辖。\n我站在他这边，而你站在我们两人这边。"

# game/script.rpy:4489
translate chinese map037_9aaca339:

    # voice "se/z00103.ogg"
    # char_valessa "That is, unless you want to abandon your job.\nBut that wouldn't look good on your perfect record."
    voice "se/z00103.ogg"
    char_valessa "当然，除非你想撂挑子不干。\n可那会有损你完美的履历。"

# game/script.rpy:4518
translate chinese map037_e2ca8bb7:

    # voice "se/z00102.ogg"
    voice "se/z00102.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:4520
