    # char_ulric "Good to know we're on the same page.\nMylus can't be the only one with information."
    char_ulric "很高兴我们想法一致。\n掌握情报的人不可能只有迈勒斯一个。"

# game/script.rpy:4693
translate chinese map037_18e5d0e2:

    # voice "se/z00107.ogg"
    voice "se/z00107.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:4695
translate chinese map037_ebdfd17e:

    # char_valessa "Are you sure about this!?\nRemember what we talked about."
    char_valessa "你确定要这样吗！？\n别忘了我们谈过的。"

# game/script.rpy:4718
translate chinese map037_f51754c1:

    # "I nodded, and reiterated my stance on the matter.{w}\nNothing was more important than saving innocent lives.{w}\nAll the better if some of them had important information."
    "我点了点头，重申了我在此事上的立场。{w}\n没有什么比拯救无辜者的性命更重要。{w}\n如果他们中有人掌握重要情报，那就更好了。"

# game/script.rpy:4720
translate chinese map037_b3e2bcd1:

    # "We change our course and head to The Grand Tree.{w}\nIt didn't feel good to abandon Mylus, but we had to.{w}\nThis was real. I'd use the future to cheat the present. "
    "我们改变路线，朝巨树而去。{w}\n抛下迈勒斯让人心里不好受，但我们别无选择。{w}\n这是真实的。我要用未来去欺骗当下。"

# game/script.rpy:4743
translate chinese map037_05c8def0:

    # "I vowed to stop this attack, and I needed information.{w}\nIf anybody could give us that information, it would be Mylus.{w}\nHe'd be able to shed light on The Rebellion's involvement, too."
    "我发誓要阻止这场袭击，而我需要情报。{w}\n若有人能给我们情报，那一定是迈勒斯。{w}\n他也能为我们揭开反抗军牵涉其中的内情。"

# game/script.rpy:4769
translate chinese map037_4a7caffb:

    # voice "se/z00108.ogg"
    voice "se/z00108.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:4771
translate chinese map037_2d80f2de:

    # char_valessa "Good, we're on the same page.\nWe can use that information to help others.\nIt would be selfish to focus only on Valinorth."
    char_valessa "很好，我们想到一块儿去了。\n我们可以用这些情报去帮助其他人。\n只盯着瓦利诺斯，那就太自私了。"

# game/script.rpy:4798
translate chinese map037_3fb6b302:

    # voice "se/z00109.ogg"
    voice "se/z00109.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:4800
