    # char_ulric "I hope you two are certain about this!\nYou're gambling with hundreds of lives!"
    char_ulric "但愿你们俩确定要这么做！\n你们是在拿几百条人命赌博！"

# game/script.rpy:4823
translate chinese map037_e9dddd52:

    # "Ulric didn't understand this like we did.{w}\nAnd we weren't about to waste time lecturing him.{w}\nI was grateful that his job required following us."
    "乌尔里克不像我们这样明白其中缘由。{w}\n而我们也不打算浪费时间跟他讲道理。{w}\n我反倒庆幸，他的职责要求他必须跟着我们。"

# game/script.rpy:4825
translate chinese map037_c866b3d6:

    # "We continued in the same direction, heading to Mylus' house.{w}\nIt didn't feel good to abandon others, but we had to do it.{w}\nThis was real. I'd use the future to cheat the present."
    "我们继续沿原方向前行，朝迈勒斯的家走去。{w}\n抛下别人让人心里不好受，但我们不得不这么做。{w}\n这是真实的。我要用未来去欺骗当下。"

# game/script.rpy:4865
translate chinese map038_56e0fcb2:

    # "In the present day, Damek found himself lost in thought.{w}\nUsing the tunnels under Mazeo for solitude, he found peace.{w}\nThere was much to plan, but for once, they had the upper hand."
    "而在当下，达梅克陷入了沉思。{w}\n他借马泽奥城下的隧道独处，寻得一片安宁。{w}\n有许多事要谋划，但这一次，他们占了上风。"

# game/script.rpy:4892
translate chinese map038_4f7c7a19:

    # voice "se/z00110.ogg"
    voice "se/z00110.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:4895
translate chinese map038_4344e864:

    # char_damek "Valinorth... The Blade of Exodus...\nThere must be something the spirits aren't telling us.\nSomething we could use to take down The Triumvirate."
    char_damek "瓦利诺斯……放逐之刃……\n灵一定还有什么没告诉我们。\n某种我们能用来了结三人执政团的东西。"

# game/script.rpy:4900
