    # voice "se/z00111.ogg"
    # char_damek "When I touched the blade, I saw our victory.\nBut I'm not trained to interpret such things.\nI pray for the cooperation of Valinorth..."
    voice "se/z00111.ogg"
    char_damek "我触到那把剑时，看到了我们的胜利。\n但我不懂得如何解读这类事物。\n我祈求瓦利诺斯愿意合作……"

# game/script.rpy:4932
translate chinese map038_ab79c573:

    # "One of his advisors approaches, careful not to startle him.{w}\nWhen he realizes he's detected, he lets out a soft yawn."
    "他的一名顾问走过来，小心翼翼地不惊扰他。{w}\n当他意识到自己已被察觉，便轻轻打了个哈欠。"

