# game/script.rpy:8740
translate chinese map087_a10e7717:

    # "We nod, and make our way out of The Grand Tree.{w}\nI smile softly, as this knowledge would be invaluable.{w}\nWe had probable cause of the attack, {i}and{/i} knew Mylus' involvement.{w}\nAs soon as I woke up, I'd have everything I needed to help Valinorth."
    "我们点点头，动身离开巨树。{w}\n我微微一笑，因为这些情报价值连城。{w}\n我们找到了袭击的可能缘由，{i}还{/i}知道了迈勒斯的牵涉。{w}\n只要我一醒来，就有了拯救瓦利诺斯所需的一切。"

# game/script.rpy:8780
translate chinese map039_dbd24f9d:

    # "We enter Mylus' house and immediately spread out.{w}\nAfter a few moments, it's evident that nobody is here.{w}\nUlric sighs, but Valessa isn't ready to give up."
    "我们走进迈勒斯的家，立刻分头搜查。{w}\n片刻之后，显然这里一个人也没有。{w}\n乌尔里克叹了口气，但瓦莱莎还不肯放弃。"

# game/script.rpy:8807
