    # char_valessa "Ulric, The Triumvirate is burning down Valinorth!\nThey seem to think we're caught up with The Rebels.\nThinking The Elder is clueless? That's stupid!"
    char_valessa "乌尔里克，三人执政团正在烧毁瓦利诺斯！\n他们似乎以为我们和反抗军有牵连。\n以为长老毫不知情？真是愚蠢！"

# game/script.rpy:8916
translate chinese map039_076ae7f8:

    # "She walks over to the large window and looks outside.{w}\nWe're all relieved that the flames haven't reached us yet.{w}\nLooking through some papers, she whispers to herself."
    "她走到那扇大窗前，望向外面。{w}\n我们都松了口气，火焰还没蔓延到这里。{w}\n她翻看着一些文件，低声自言自语。"

# game/script.rpy:8946
