    # char_valessa "Come on Mylus, give us something!\nYou're smarter than this, I know it.\nShipping manifests — anything!"
    char_valessa "别这样，迈勒斯，给我们留点线索啊！\n你比这聪明，我知道的。\n货运单——什么都行！"

# game/script.rpy:8975
translate chinese map039_b109fcf4:

    # "With a renewed determination, Ulric examines the large table.{w}\nHe shuffles papers aside and flips through the books.{w}\nIt's almost like he's in a rush to find something first."
    "乌尔里克重新打起精神，检查起那张大桌子。{w}\n他把文件拨到一旁，翻开那些书。{w}\n简直像是急着要先找到什么似的。"

