# game/script.rpy:9634
translate chinese click_map084_4_EV004_73d5460d:

    # "I walk over to the bookshelf and see what I can find.{w}\nIt seems to be full of books about the Spirit Realm, and Valinorth.{w}\nSomehow, I don't think either of these subjects will help."
    "我走到书架前，看看能找到什么。{w}\n上面似乎摆满了关于灵界和瓦利诺斯的书。{w}\n不知怎的，我觉得这两类书都帮不上忙。"

# game/script.rpy:9636
translate chinese click_map084_4_EV004_f423b179:

    # "Eventually, I come across a book about The Rebellion.{w}\nI doubt it's what we need, but I decide to take a look.{w}\nAs I open it up, a piece of paper falls out."
    "终于，我翻到一本关于反抗军的书。{w}\n我怀疑这不是我们要找的，但还是决定看看。{w}\n我打开它时，一张纸片掉了出来。"

# game/script.rpy:9698
