    # voice "se/y00053.ogg"
    # char_valessa "I wish. This whole place is a mess.\nHonestly, I don't even know what to look for.\nMylus isn't stupid though. He'd leave {i}something{/i}."
    voice "se/y00053.ogg"
    char_valessa "我倒希望如此。这地方一团糟。\n说实话，我连该找什么都不知道。\n不过迈勒斯不傻。他一定会留下{i}什么{/i}。"

# game/script.rpy:9833
translate chinese Valessa2_map084_6_0_9888827b:

    # voice "se/y00054.ogg"
    voice "se/y00054.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:9835
translate chinese Valessa2_map084_6_0_7e6d36c8:

    # char_valessa "Honestly, only a few months.\nHe was thrust into the position against his will.\nSomething happened to his Father, the previous Elder."
    char_valessa "说实话，才几个月。\n他是被迫坐上这个位置的。\n他父亲，也就是上一任长老，出了事。"

# game/script.rpy:9840
translate chinese Valessa2_map084_6_0_34bf8035:

    # voice "se/y00055.ogg"
    # char_valessa "But he's done such a good job, it's crazy.\nThe leadership of Valinorth did {i}not{/i} skip a beat!\nHe must've been training under his Father." nointeract
    voice "se/y00055.ogg"
    char_valessa "可他做得非常好，简直让人难以置信。\n瓦利诺斯的领导层{i}丝毫{/i}没有出现断层！\n他一定一直在父亲手下受训。" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:9858
translate chinese Valessa2_map084_6_0_85b91681:

    # voice "se/y00056.ogg"
    # char_valessa "Nobody knows, actually.\nHe went on a trip to Mazeo and never came back.\nSearch parties came up with nothing, it's like he vanished."
    voice "se/y00056.ogg"
    char_valessa "其实没人知道。\n他去马泽奥一趟，就再也没回来。\n搜索队一无所获，他就这样凭空消失了。"

# game/script.rpy:9864
translate chinese Valessa2_map084_6_0_55d2a833:

    # voice "se/y00057.ogg"
    # char_valessa "Normally we'd hold an election, but things were crazy.\nThat, and Valinorth is really big on \"family\" and \"tradition\".\nEveryone just seemed to expect that Mylus would take over."
    voice "se/y00057.ogg"
    char_valessa "按惯例我们该举行选举，可当时局面太乱。\n再加上瓦利诺斯格外看重“家族”与“传统”。\n大家似乎都认定迈勒斯会继任。"

# game/script.rpy:9886
translate chinese Valessa2_map084_6_0_35607c81:

    # voice "se/y00058.ogg"
    # char_valessa "Sorry, I guess you're right.\nI'm not really treating this as \"real\".\nIt's something you learn to do early on."
    voice "se/y00058.ogg"
    char_valessa "抱歉，我想你说得对。\n我确实没把这一切当成“真的”。\n这是你从小就得学会的事。"

# game/script.rpy:9892
translate chinese Valessa2_map084_6_0_2703be51:

    # voice "se/y00059.ogg"
    # char_valessa "But this seems premeditated, to say the least.\nThe Triumvirate must've been planning this for a while.\nMylus taking over? I doubt that's directly related."
    voice "se/y00059.ogg"
    char_valessa "但至少可以说，这一切像是早有预谋。\n三人执政团一定谋划了许久。\n迈勒斯继任？我怀疑那没有直接关系。"

# game/script.rpy:9914
translate chinese Valessa2_map084_6_0_f6c20cb5:

    # voice "se/y00060.ogg"
    voice "se/y00060.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:9916
translate chinese Valessa2_map084_6_0_871602ab:

    # char_valessa "He's performed admirably for the position he's in.\nI doubt even a full election would find a better candidate.\nI was scared for a while, but he really filled the role."
    char_valessa "以他的处境而言，他表现得相当出色。\n我怀疑就算举行完整的选举，也找不到更好的人选。\n我曾担心过一阵，但他确实胜任了这个角色。"

# game/script.rpy:9921
translate chinese Valessa2_map084_6_0_fb33620e:

    # voice "se/y00061.ogg"
    # char_valessa "He didn't want to do it, but he kind of had to.\nIt all happened so fast, I'm not sure of the specifics.\nBut it was seamless, you almost couldn't notice." nointeract
    voice "se/y00061.ogg"
    char_valessa "他并不想这么做，但又不得不如此。\n一切都发生得太快，我不清楚细节。\n但过渡得毫无破绽，你几乎察觉不到。" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:9939
translate chinese Valessa2_map084_6_0_963b366b:

    # voice "se/y00062.ogg"
    # char_valessa "I guess, but we can't all get what we want.\nIt's not like I grew up wanting to be a Scribe.\nHe'll grow into the role, I'm sure of it."
    voice "se/y00062.ogg"
    char_valessa "也许吧，可我们没法都如愿以偿。\n我从小也没想过要当书记官。\n他会慢慢胜任这个角色的，我确信。"

# game/script.rpy:9945
translate chinese Valessa2_map084_6_0_08291e1c:

    # voice "se/y00063.ogg"
    # char_valessa "But we can worry about that after this is over.\nThere's lots to do, and we can't even find him.\nI really hope that nothing bad has happened."
    voice "se/y00063.ogg"
    char_valessa "但这些等事情结束后再操心吧。\n有太多事要做，我们却连人都找不到。\n我真希望没有出什么坏事。"

# game/script.rpy:9967
translate chinese Valessa2_map084_6_0_54bdf297:

    # voice "se/y00064.ogg"
    # char_valessa "Wait, you want to be the Elder?\nAre you sure you don't have a full plate right now?\nI mean, we could always try to find someone more willing."
    voice "se/y00064.ogg"
    char_valessa "等等，你想当长老？\n你确定现在你手头不是已经够忙了吗？\n我是说，我们总能找个更愿意的人。"

# game/script.rpy:9973
translate chinese Valessa2_map084_6_0_69f57e90:

    # voice "se/y00065.ogg"
    # char_valessa "But we can worry about that after this is over.\nThere's lots to do, and we can't even find him.\nI really hope that nothing bad has happened."
    voice "se/y00065.ogg"
    char_valessa "但这些等事情结束后再操心吧。\n有太多事要做，我们却连人都找不到。\n我真希望没有出什么坏事。"

# game/script.rpy:9995
translate chinese Valessa2_map084_6_0_888d6600:

    # voice "se/y00067.ogg"
    # char_valessa "I agree, but I feel a bit sorry for him.\nYou can see it in his eyes, it stresses him out.\nMaybe we can find someone more willing, you know?"
    voice "se/y00067.ogg"
    char_valessa "我同意，但我有点替他难过。\n从他眼神里就能看出来，这让他压力很大。\n也许我们能找个更愿意的人，你懂的？"

# game/script.rpy:10001
translate chinese Valessa2_map084_6_0_60625498:

    # voice "se/y00068.ogg"
    # char_valessa "But we can worry about that after this is over.\nThere's lots to do, and we can't even find him.\nI really hope that nothing bad has happened."
    voice "se/y00068.ogg"
    char_valessa "但这些等事情结束后再操心吧。\n有太多事要做，我们却连人都找不到。\n我真希望没有出什么坏事。"

# game/script.rpy:10023
translate chinese Valessa2_map084_6_0_b38879cc:

    # voice "se/y00069.ogg"
    voice "se/y00069.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:10026
translate chinese Valessa2_map084_6_0_2048b12d:

    # char_valessa "I'd want to get to the bottom of it, then.\nThere's more going on than we can take at face value.\nHe'd have his reasons, and I'd want to hear all of them." nointeract
    char_valessa "那我就想把事情查个水落石出。\n这里面另有隐情，不能只看表面。\n他一定有自己的理由，而我想全部听他说清楚。" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:10043
translate chinese Valessa2_map084_6_0_816feabf:

    # voice "se/y00070.ogg"
    # char_valessa "That's the thing though, it's not actually happening.\nIf he can explain himself, and we can prevent this...?\nWell, then we can deal with it in a reasonable way."
    voice "se/y00070.ogg"
    char_valessa "可问题就在于，这一切其实并未发生。\n要是他能解释清楚，而我们又能阻止这一切……？\n那好，到时我们就能用理智的方式处理。"

# game/script.rpy:10049
translate chinese Valessa2_map084_6_0_9c20cbeb:

    # voice "se/y00071.ogg"
    # char_valessa "We can't condemn him on a vision like this.\nThat's like hating someone for what they do in a dream.\nBesides, we have no way of confirming this is his fault."
    voice "se/y00071.ogg"
    char_valessa "我们不能凭这样一场幻象就给他定罪。\n那就好比因为某人梦里做的事去恨他。\n再说，我们也无从证实这是他的过错。"

# game/script.rpy:10071
translate chinese Valessa2_map084_6_0_df498441:

    # voice "se/y00072.ogg"
    # char_valessa "And it's something I'd happily listen to.\nThat is, after we find a way to prevent this.\nI'm not passing judgement until I hear more."
    voice "se/y00072.ogg"
    char_valessa "而我也乐于听他说。\n前提是，我们先找到阻止这一切的办法。\n在听到更多之前，我不会妄下判断。"

# game/script.rpy:10077
translate chinese Valessa2_map084_6_0_8562fd91:

    # voice "se/y00073.ogg"
    # char_valessa "We can't condemn him based on a vision like this.\nThat's like hating someone for what they do in a dream.\nBesides, we have no way of confirming this is his fault."
    voice "se/y00073.ogg"
    char_valessa "我们不能凭这样一场幻象就给他定罪。\n那就好比因为某人梦里做的事去恨他。\n再说，我们也无从证实这是他的过错。"

# game/script.rpy:10105
translate chinese Valessa2_map084_6_0_f4e185ed:

    # voice "se/y00074.ogg"
    # char_valessa "I'm making a pretty educated guess.\nI'm trained to detect this kind of stuff.\nBut it's so weird, because this feels like reality."
    voice "se/y00074.ogg"
    char_valessa "我是凭经验做了相当靠谱的推断。\n我受过训练，能察觉这类事物。\n可这太奇怪了，因为这里感觉就像现实。"

# game/script.rpy:10111
translate chinese Valessa2_map084_6_0_f0a2fe50:

    # voice "se/y00075.ogg"
    # char_valessa "What's going to happen to me...?\nI mean technically, I'm not real, right?\nThat's hard to take in. This feels real to me."
    voice "se/y00075.ogg"
    char_valessa "我会怎么样呢……？\n我是说，严格来讲，我不是真实的，对吧？\n这很难接受。可对我来说，这一切都无比真实。"

# game/script.rpy:10117
translate chinese Valessa2_map084_6_0_fdaeeccb:

    # voice "se/y00076.ogg"
    # char_valessa "But the way you're acting, yeah, it makes me certain.\nIt's very rare that I become lucid in a vision.\nBut with the evidence at hand, I'm very sure."
    voice "se/y00076.ogg"
    char_valessa "但看你的举止，对，这让我确信了。\n我在幻象中保持清醒的时刻极其罕见。\n但就现有证据来看，我非常确定。"

# game/script.rpy:10133
translate chinese Valessa2_map084_6_0_7a627037:

    # voice "se/y00077.ogg"
    # char_valessa "Better not talk about it too loud, though.\nWouldn't want Ulric to realize something is up.\nThe rules state that only you and I can know." nointeract
    voice "se/y00077.ogg"
    char_valessa "不过，最好别说得太大声。\n可不能让乌尔里克察觉出什么。\n规矩就是，此事只能你我知道。" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:10151
translate chinese Valessa2_map084_6_0_8f0f5c36:

    # voice "se/y00078.ogg"
    # char_valessa "Trust me, it's better for him not to know.\nHe'd act recklessly, and he'd be really confused.\nWell, more reckless than normal, I mean."
    voice "se/y00078.ogg"
    char_valessa "相信我，他不知道最好。\n他会行事鲁莽，而且会彻底懵掉。\n呃，我是说，比平时更鲁莽。"

# game/script.rpy:10169
translate chinese Valessa2_map084_6_0_67aaf12d:

    # voice "se/y00079.ogg"
    # char_valessa "There's entire books written on this subject, you know.\nBut no one must know when they're in a vision.\nIt could screw up what the spirits want to show us."
    voice "se/y00079.ogg"
    char_valessa "你知道吗，关于这个主题写了好几本书。\n但身处幻象中时，绝不能让旁人知道。\n那会搅乱灵想让我们看到的东西。"

# game/script.rpy:10186
translate chinese Valessa2_map084_6_0_fcfeaf51:

    # voice "se/y00080.ogg"
    voice "se/y00080.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:10188
translate chinese Valessa2_map084_6_0_62043aff:

    # char_valessa "These are gifts. Blessings, directly from the realm of spirits.\nWe're not in any position to harm what they give us."
    char_valessa "这是恩赐。是来自灵界的祝福。\n我们无权去破坏它们给予我们的东西。"

# game/script.rpy:10207
translate chinese Valessa3_map084_6_0_9ba3e202:

    # voice "se/y00081.ogg"
    voice "se/y00081.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:10209
translate chinese Valessa3_map084_6_0_09026a34:

    # char_valessa "As long as any other dream, I guess.\nOr maybe when the spirits decide you've seen enough.\nThat's one of the things we don't really know."
    char_valessa "我猜，和寻常的梦一样长吧。\n或者，也许直到灵认为你看够了为止。\n这正是我们并不真正了解的事情之一。"

# game/script.rpy:10224
translate chinese Valessa3_map084_6_0_30753618:

    # voice "se/y00082.ogg"
    # char_valessa "I guess something traumatic, like your death, would end it.\nOur minds aren't fit to comprehend what would happen next.\nWe should make the most of the time we {i}do{/i} have in here."
    voice "se/y00082.ogg"
    char_valessa "我猜，某种创伤性的事件，比如你的死亡，会终结它。\n我们的心智无法理解之后会发生什么。\n我们该好好利用在{i}这里{/i}所拥有的时间。"

# game/script.rpy:10246
translate chinese Valessa3_map084_6_0_9558f4ed:

    # voice "se/y00083.ogg"
    voice "se/y00083.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:10248
translate chinese Valessa3_map084_6_0_7ae25070:

    # char_valessa "Nobody knows, but we assume it's to protect us.\nIf we know what's coming, we can change what happens.\nSeers have done it time and time again for thousands of years."
    char_valessa "没人知道，但我们猜想是为了保护我们。\n若我们知晓即将发生什么，就能改变结局。\n数千年来，先知们一次又一次做到了这点。"

# game/script.rpy:10253
translate chinese Valessa3_map084_6_0_882626af:

    # voice "se/y00084.ogg"
    # char_valessa "A lot of people think they'll want something in exchange.\nThat they're planting seeds to reap later down the line.\nA stupid superstition if you ask me. They just want to help." nointeract
    voice "se/y00084.ogg"
    char_valessa "很多人以为它们会索取回报。\n以为它们在播种，日后好收割。\n要我说，这是愚蠢的迷信。它们只是想帮忙。" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:10271
translate chinese Valessa3_map084_6_0_8cff0033:

    # voice "se/y00085.ogg"
    # char_valessa "Well, I guess we'll have to disagree on that!\nThere's nothing more pure than the spirits.\nThis gift is a truly beautiful thing."
    voice "se/y00085.ogg"
    char_valessa "好吧，看来这点上我们只能保留分歧了！\n没有什么比灵更纯净。\n这份恩赐真是美好至极。"

# game/script.rpy:10293
translate chinese Valessa3_map084_6_0_e6a3b919:

    # voice "se/y00086.ogg"
    # char_valessa "Yeah, I agree!\nThere's nothing more pure than the spirits.\nWithout the visions, we'd have died out ages ago."
    voice "se/y00086.ogg"
    char_valessa "是啊，我同意！\n没有什么比灵更纯净。\n没有这些幻象，我们早就灭绝了。"

# game/script.rpy:10315
translate chinese Valessa3_map084_6_0_44500411:

    # voice "se/y00087.ogg"
    voice "se/y00087.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:10317
translate chinese Valessa3_map084_6_0_25b48cf0:

    # char_valessa "This particular vision? No.\nBut the concept of visions in general? Yes.\nWithout them, we'd have gone extinct long ago."
    char_valessa "这一场幻象？不算。\n但笼统地说，幻象这个概念本身？算。\n没有它们，我们早就灭绝了。"

# game/script.rpy:10322
translate chinese Valessa3_map084_6_0_36e1bc43:

    # voice "se/y00088.ogg"
    # char_valessa "They guide the world to a better future.\nAnd what's better, they ask for nothing in return.\nOnly that we continue to harness this amazing power."
    voice "se/y00088.ogg"
    char_valessa "它们引导世界走向更美好的未来。\n更难得的是，它们不求任何回报。\n只愿我们继续驾驭这份奇妙的力量。"

# game/script.rpy:10350
translate chinese Valessa3_map084_6_0_206bfd66:

    # voice "se/y00089.ogg"
    # char_valessa "Yeah, it's just like I said. For better or worse.\nI was trained to be your Scribe from a young age.\nWe've been inseparable ever since."
    voice "se/y00089.ogg"
    char_valessa "是啊，就像我说的。无论好坏。\n我从小就受训做你的书记官。\n从那时起，我们就形影不离。"

# game/script.rpy:10356
translate chinese Valessa3_map084_6_0_75784cc1:

    # voice "se/y00090.ogg"
    # char_valessa "It's not exactly what I grew up wanting.\nBut I'm not in a position to shun Valinorth's tradition.\nBesides, I could think of people {i}much{/i} worse to serve."
    voice "se/y00090.ogg"
    char_valessa "这并不完全是我从小心中的愿望。\n但我没有资格背弃瓦利诺斯的传统。\n再说，我想得出{i}远比这{/i}更糟的效忠对象。"

# game/script.rpy:10376
translate chinese Valessa4_map084_6_0_ad4b5a88:

    # voice "se/y00091.ogg"
    voice "se/y00091.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:10378
translate chinese Valessa4_map084_6_0_c5cc3e22:

    # char_valessa "Actually, you're seeing them firsthand.\nImagine how confused you'd be without me.\nWe're supposed to guide you through these visions."
    char_valessa "其实，你正亲眼见证着这一切。\n想象一下没有我你会有多困惑。\n我们的职责就是引领你走过这些幻象。"

# game/script.rpy:10383
translate chinese Valessa4_map084_6_0_05e5ce8a:

    # voice "se/y00092.ogg"
    # char_valessa "But when you wake up, you also need to report to me.\nOr, I guess you can report to Mylus in these dire circumstances.\nEither way, I help you in here, and you report out there."
    voice "se/y00092.ogg"
    char_valessa "但你醒来后，也得向我汇报。\n或者，我想在这种情况下，你也能向迈勒斯汇报。\n总之，我在这里面帮你，你在外面汇报。"

# game/script.rpy:10389
translate chinese Valessa4_map084_6_0_816739ed:

    # voice "se/y00093.ogg"
    # char_valessa "If it weren't for me, you wouldn't remember this.\nYou'd wake up, shrug it off, and go about your day.\nImagine what would happen to Valinorth then." nointeract
    voice "se/y00093.ogg"
    char_valessa "要是没有我，你根本不会记得这一切。\n你会醒来，耸耸肩，照常过日子。\n想想那样瓦利诺斯会是什么下场。" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:10407
translate chinese Valessa4_map084_6_0_aa115fca:

    # voice "se/y00094.ogg"
    # char_valessa "Of course not! We're two sides of the same coin!\nHonestly, I wouldn't be able to do anything without you.\nA Scribe would do little good without visions to inhabit."
    voice "se/y00094.ogg"
    char_valessa "当然不会！我们就像同一枚硬币的两面！\n说实话，没有你我也什么都做不了。\n没有幻象可供进入，书记官也派不上什么用场。"

# game/script.rpy:10429
translate chinese Valessa4_map084_6_0_4112d4fa:

    # voice "se/y00095.ogg"
    # char_valessa "Whoa, let's all make assumptions!\nI'm going to pretend I didn't hear that.\nWe work as a {i}team{/i}, we both help each other."
    voice "se/y00095.ogg"
    char_valessa "哇哦，大家可都开始妄加揣测了！\n我就当没听见好了。\n我们是{i}同伴{/i}，彼此扶持。"

# game/script.rpy:10435
translate chinese Valessa4_map084_6_0_303d0ee4:

    # voice "se/y00096.ogg"
    # char_valessa "You'd be clueless if I didn't chime in earlier.\nI don't downplay your ability, and I expect the same.\nPerhaps you lose both memory {i}and{/i} manners in visions."
    voice "se/y00096.ogg"
    char_valessa "要不是我刚才插话，你还一头雾水呢。\n我没有贬低你的能力，也指望你别这么对我。\n也许你在幻象里连记忆{i}带{/i}礼数都丢了。"

# game/script.rpy:10457
translate chinese Valessa4_map084_6_0_a5e5129b:

    # voice "se/y00097.ogg"
    voice "se/y00097.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:10459
translate chinese Valessa4_map084_6_0_194af1bf:

    # char_valessa "Yes and no. Actually it's pretty technical.\nI'm your only Scribe, but there's also a Scribe-in-training.\nHis name is Fortaime, and he's prepared to take over if needed."
    char_valessa "是，也不是。其实这挺讲究的。\n我是你唯一的书记官，但也有一位见习书记官。\n他叫福泰姆，随时准备在需要时接手。"

# game/script.rpy:10464
translate chinese Valessa4_map084_6_0_6651129b:

    # voice "se/y00098.ogg"
    # char_valessa "It's a recent addition to the ranks, but it helps out a lot.\nWithout a Scribe, your abilities would be pretty useless.\nHaving someone fully trained means no one misses a beat."
    voice "se/y00098.ogg"
    char_valessa "这是最近才增设的职位，但帮了大忙。\n没有书记官，你的能力几乎毫无用处。\n有一个受过完整训练的人，就意味着不会有任何疏漏。"

# game/script.rpy:10470
translate chinese Valessa4_map084_6_0_fb3c3661:

    # voice "se/y00099.ogg"
    # char_valessa "Imagine if you had this vision while I was gone.\nJust from that, I think you can gauge Fortaime's importance.\nHe's a nice guy too, but I'm sure he's long since fled."
    voice "se/y00099.ogg"
    char_valessa "想象一下，假如我不在时你陷入这场幻象。\n仅凭这一点，我想你就能明白福泰姆的重要性。\n他人也不错，不过我想他早就逃走了。"

# game/script.rpy:10476
translate chinese Valessa4_map084_6_0_ec1c07b7:

    # voice "se/y00100.ogg"
    # char_valessa "I'm sure you'll meet him when you get out of here.\nHe tends to knock on your door first thing in the morning.\nSo let's focus on the matter at hand, alright?"
    voice "se/y00100.ogg"
    char_valessa "我相信等你从这里出去，就会见到他。\n他总爱一大早就来敲你的门。\n所以咱们先专注眼前的事，好吗？"

# game/script.rpy:10498
translate chinese Valessa4_map084_6_0_705c4c40:

    # voice "se/y00101.ogg"
    voice "se/y00101.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:10500
translate chinese Valessa4_map084_6_0_4db7dd94:

    # char_valessa "Since I was a little kid, actually.\nI was trained to be your Scribe from the moment I could speak.\nIt's a prestigious position, and I couldn't exactly say no."
    char_valessa "其实，从我小时候就开始了。\n我刚会说话就被训练做你的书记官。\n这是个光荣的职位，我也没法拒绝。"

# game/script.rpy:10505
translate chinese Valessa4_map084_6_0_1f1de058:

    # voice "se/y00102.ogg"
    # char_valessa "Some of the other children were jealous.\nTheir parents too, which seemed really immature to me.\nApparently, there's some competition for the role."
    voice "se/y00102.ogg"
    char_valessa "别的孩子里有人嫉妒。\n他们的父母也一样，在我看来真是幼稚得很。\n据说，这个职位还挺有竞争的。"

# game/script.rpy:10511
translate chinese Valessa4_map084_6_0_e7875fdf:

    # voice "se/y00103.ogg"
    # char_valessa "But the Elder chose me, and like it or not, here I am.\nI guess I'm just blessed that I actually {i}do{/i} like this arrangement.\nIn the end, the spirits really were looking down on me."
    voice "se/y00103.ogg"
    char_valessa "但长老选中了我，不管愿不愿意，我就站在这里。\n我只能庆幸自己{i}确实{/i}喜欢这样的安排。\n到头来，灵真的眷顾了我。"

# game/script.rpy:10517
translate chinese Valessa4_map084_6_0_73b4c1d4:

    # voice "se/y00104.ogg"
    # char_valessa "Even if being here right now is terrifying, I'm still happy.\nDoing my duty to save Valinorth, it's a dream come true.\nWe don't know if the other kids would've fit this role."
    voice "se/y00104.ogg"
    char_valessa "哪怕此刻身处这里无比可怕，我依然感到幸福。\n履行拯救瓦利诺斯的职责，对我来说是梦想成真。\n我们也不知道别的孩子是否能胜任这个角色。"

# game/script.rpy:10539
translate chinese Valessa4_map084_6_0_eebef7b9:

    # voice "se/y00105.ogg"
    voice "se/y00105.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:10541
translate chinese Valessa4_map084_6_0_10bedf26:

    # char_valessa "Well I guess the answer is both yes and no.\nBefore my parents passed on, they took care of the paperwork.\nUntil I came of age, I had no choice but to obey."
    char_valessa "嗯，我想答案既是又不是。\n在我父母过世前，他们办好了那些文书。\n在成年之前，我除了服从别无选择。"

# game/script.rpy:10546
translate chinese Valessa4_map084_6_0_20d71a43:

    # voice "se/y00106.ogg"
    # char_valessa "When I did come of age, however, I got to choose.\nLeave Valinorth and pursue my own dreams, or be your Scribe.\nI guess it's pretty obvious which one I chose, huh?"
    voice "se/y00106.ogg"
    char_valessa "可等我成年后，我有了选择权。\n离开瓦利诺斯去追寻自己的梦想，或者做你的书记官。\n我选了哪个，应该很明显吧，嗯？"

# game/script.rpy:10552
translate chinese Valessa4_map084_6_0_fe8f32bf:

    # voice "se/y00107.ogg"
    # char_valessa "So, while I was forced into the role, I chose to stick with it.\nAlthough, if this is any indication, we might have to leave Valinorth.\nIn that case, I'd get to be your scribe, {i}and{/i} travel the world." nointeract
    voice "se/y00107.ogg"
    char_valessa "所以，虽然当初是被迫入行，我却选择坚持下来。\n不过，如果眼下这事算是征兆，我们或许得离开瓦利诺斯。\n那样的话，我就能既做你的书记官，{i}又{/i}游历世界了。" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:10570
translate chinese Valessa4_map084_6_0_6588835a:

    # voice "se/y00108.ogg"
    # char_valessa "Well, we can't stop this attack from happening.\nWe can only take precautions, and mitigate the damage.\nYour life is valuable, so we should move you elsewhere."
    voice "se/y00108.ogg"
    char_valessa "嗯，我们无法阻止这场袭击发生。\n只能提前防范，把损失降到最低。\n你的命很宝贵，我们该把你转移到别处。"

# game/script.rpy:10576
translate chinese Valessa4_map084_6_0_2811abae:

    # voice "se/y00109.ogg"
    # char_valessa "And wherever you go, I'm bound to follow.\nWe'd be the first duo to operate outside of Valinorth.\nNever thought we'd actually make history, but here we are."
    voice "se/y00109.ogg"
    char_valessa "无论你去哪里，我都必须跟随。\n我们将是第一对在瓦利诺斯之外活动的搭档。\n从没想过我们真能创造历史，可眼下就是如此。"

# game/script.rpy:10596
translate chinese Valessa4_map084_6_0_d78b324b:

    # voice "se/y00110.ogg"
    # char_valessa "Yeah, and same to you.\nLook at this vision. We're going to do great things.\nLet's get to the bottom of this, and save our village together!"
    voice "se/y00110.ogg"
    char_valessa "是啊，你也一样。\n看看这场幻象。我们会成就一番大业。\n让我们查清真相，一起拯救我们的村庄！"

# game/script.rpy:10666
translate chinese Ulric1_map084_7_0_3687874b:

    # char_ulric "Hmm..." nointeract
    char_ulric "唔……" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:10685
translate chinese Ulric1_map084_7_0_b7e54e1c:

    # char_ulric "No, there's not much here.\nBut I guess if we spread out, we stand a better chance.\nNot that there's too much ground to cover." nointeract
    char_ulric "没有，这里没什么东西。\n但我想，如果我们分头找，机会会大些。\n反正也没多大地方要搜。" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:10702
translate chinese Ulric1_map084_7_0_9dc85ed3:

    # voice "se/y00002.ogg"
    # char_ulric "If I knew, we'd have found it already.\nValessa seems to think Mylus left something behind.\nBut he isn't dumb. He wouldn't leave stuff out in the open."
    voice "se/y00002.ogg"
    char_ulric "我要是知道，早就找到了。\n瓦莱莎似乎认为迈勒斯留下了什么。\n可他不傻。他不会把东西明晃晃地摆在外面。"

# game/script.rpy:10708
translate chinese Ulric1_map084_7_0_64af5080:

    # voice "se/y00003.ogg"
    # char_ulric "If it were up to me, we'd all be long gone.\nI can't fight your choice though, it's your village.\nLet's do our best to hurry and get out of here."
    voice "se/y00003.ogg"
    char_ulric "要我拿主意，我们早就走了。\n可我没法反对你们的选择，这是你们的村子。\n咱们尽力快点，然后离开这里。"

# game/script.rpy:10730
translate chinese Ulric1_map084_7_0_2e5f904b:

    # voice "se/y00004.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Actually, I was going to ask you.\nI thought you two were in sync or something.\nDon't think I didn't notice your secret \"talks\"."
    voice "se/y00004.ogg"
    char_ulric "其实，我正想问你们呢。\n我还以为你们俩心有灵犀呢。\n别以为我没注意到你们的秘密“谈话”。"

# game/script.rpy:10736
translate chinese Ulric1_map084_7_0_146fb5f9:

    # voice "se/y00005.ogg"
    # char_ulric "But I'm not mad or anything.\nI know the relationship between you, and your culture.\nWhatever it is, it's not like you're plotting against me."
    voice "se/y00005.ogg"
    char_ulric "但我没有生气什么的。\n我了解你们之间的关系，也了解你们的文化。\n不管是什么，你们总不至于在密谋对付我。"

# game/script.rpy:10762
translate chinese Ulric1_map084_7_0_dc977301:

    # char_ulric "Huh? You mean today, or in general?" nointeract
    char_ulric "嗯？你是说今天，还是一直如此？" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:10781
translate chinese Ulric1_map084_7_0_8095b331:

    # char_ulric "Oh, I'm a mercenary from Mazeo.\nI was actually hired to come bring you back there.\nA summit is happening, and they want your input."
    char_ulric "哦，我是来自马泽奥的雇佣兵。\n其实是有人雇我来把你们带回去。\n那里要开一场峰会，他们想听听你们的意见。"

# game/script.rpy:10803
translate chinese Ulric2_map084_7_0_620cc045:

    # char_ulric "It's basically the hub of Alestia.\nPorts from there go to the rest of the known world.\nA huge city of commerce, it's full of strange people."
    char_ulric "它基本算是阿莱斯蒂亚的中心枢纽。\n那里的港口通往已知世界的各个角落。\n一座巨大的商业都市，满是形形色色的人。"

# game/script.rpy:10808
translate chinese Ulric2_map084_7_0_3800eb9c:

    # voice "se/y00009.ogg"
    # char_ulric "But you'd get stabbed in the back before you find help.\nThat's what puts people like me in business. Protectors of the weak.\nWell, not that I'm calling you weak, but you get the idea."
    voice "se/y00009.ogg"
    char_ulric "可你还没找到人帮忙，后背就先挨了一刀。\n这才有我们这行人的饭碗。弱者的守护者。\n呃，不是说你们弱，你懂我的意思。"

# game/script.rpy:10831
translate chinese Ulric2_map084_7_0_5315a1bc:

    # char_ulric "Because of its central location, it's the perfect meeting spot.\nThe Generals from Alarinthia and Balteus sail over annually.\nValinorth is non-partisan, so you usually sit this one out."
    char_ulric "由于位置居中，那里是绝佳的会晤地点。\n来自阿拉林西亚和巴尔泰乌斯的将军每年都会渡海前来。\n瓦利诺斯保持中立，所以你们通常不参与。"

# game/script.rpy:10836
translate chinese Ulric2_map084_7_0_f0318df4:

    # voice "se/y00011.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Maybe it's a chance to get Valinorth more invested in Alestian politics.\nBut they want your input, and I've been sent to pick you up.\nI guess it's a good thing I got here when I did, right?"
    voice "se/y00011.ogg"
    char_ulric "也许这能让瓦利诺斯更多地参与阿莱斯蒂亚的政事。\n不过他们想听你们的意见，而我被派来接你们。\n我想我及时赶到，算是件好事，对吧？"

# game/script.rpy:10859
translate chinese Ulric2_map084_7_0_348041e2:

    # char_ulric "Look, I don't ask for specifics.\nI do this to get paid, and make a living.\nIf you want, feel free to ask them when we get there."
    char_ulric "听着，我从不打听细节。\n我干这行是为了赚钱糊口。\n要是你想知道，等到了那里尽管问他们。"

# game/script.rpy:10864
translate chinese Ulric2_map084_7_0_107a65ec:

    # voice "se/y00013.ogg"
    # char_ulric "That is, if you two even agree to follow me.\nBut right now, I can't let you die on my watch.\nWe'll discuss the rest once we're out of harm's way."
    voice "se/y00013.ogg"
    char_ulric "前提是，你们俩愿意跟我走。\n但眼下，我不能让你们在我眼皮底下送命。\n等我们脱离危险，再谈其余的事。"

# game/script.rpy:10887
translate chinese Ulric2_map084_7_0_9bc98964:

    # char_ulric "Is that an accusation of some kind?\nWhere I come from, you don't accuse the guy with a bigger sword.\nI'll pretend I didn't hear that, and carry on with this search."
    char_ulric "这算是什么指控吗？\n在我的家乡，你可不会去指控一个剑比你大的家伙。\n我就当没听见，继续搜查。"

# game/script.rpy:10912
translate chinese Ulric2_map084_7_0_524a4ae1:

    # char_ulric "Actually, I come from Alarinthia.\nPractically born with a blade in my hand.\nA figure of speech of course. Don't picture that."
    char_ulric "其实，我来自阿拉林西亚。\n差不多一出生手里就攥着剑。\n当然，这只是打个比方。别去脑补那画面。"

# game/script.rpy:10917
translate chinese Ulric2_map084_7_0_9d2002a9:

    # voice "se/y00016.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Eventually you grow up, and need money of your own.\nI took the first ship to Mazeo and started selling my sword arm.\nI don't miss that place at all. It's disgustingly warm and humid."
    voice "se/y00016.ogg"
    char_ulric "等你长大，就得自己挣钱了。\n我搭上第一班船去了马泽奥，开始当佣兵，靠这把剑吃饭。\n我一点也不怀念那地方。又热又潮，让人难受。"

# game/script.rpy:10940
translate chinese Ulric3_map084_7_0_fc8cb25d:

    # char_ulric "Completely different than what you'd think.\nWe recognize power, not lineage, or claim to the throne.\nOr, I guess {i}they{/i} do, since I no longer live there."
    char_ulric "跟你想的完全不同。\n我们看重的是力量，而不是血脉或对王位的宣称。\n或者说，我想{i}他们{/i}是这样，毕竟我已不再住在那儿。"

# game/script.rpy:10945
translate chinese Ulric3_map084_7_0_80647293:

    # voice "se/y00018.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Instead of elections, there's a tournament every few years.\nOnly the strongest tribe wins the right to rule Alarinthia.\nOf course, the rule is always contested shortly after."
    voice "se/y00018.ogg"
    char_ulric "我们不搞选举，而是每隔几年办一场比武大会。\n只有最强的部族才能赢得统治阿拉林西亚的权力。\n当然，那权力往往没过多久就被人挑战。"

# game/script.rpy:10951
translate chinese Ulric3_map084_7_0_64882735:

    # voice "se/y00019.ogg"
    # char_ulric "It's good not to make any close friends.\nYou never know who you'll have to put to the blade.\nIt's a culture of war, and only the strongest prevail." nointeract
    voice "se/y00019.ogg"
    char_ulric "最好别交什么挚友。\n你永远不知道将来得把剑刺向谁。\n那是一种战争文化，唯有最强者才能立足。" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:10971
translate chinese Ulric3_map084_7_0_82adfa06:

    # char_ulric "You don't have to suck up to me. I know it's awful.\nThat's basically why I left the first chance I got.\nI'd take a stable living over that chaotic place."
    char_ulric "你不用讨好我。我知道那地方很糟。\n这差不多就是我一有机会就离开的原因。\n比起那个混乱之地，我宁愿过安稳日子。"

# game/script.rpy:10994
translate chinese Ulric3_map084_7_0_96d78182:

    # char_ulric "No offense, but you have it pretty easy here.\nThis is a paradise compared to what I had in Alarinthia.\nI mean, present circumstances excluded, of course."
    char_ulric "别见怪，但你们这儿日子过得挺轻松。\n比起我在阿拉林西亚的生活，这里是天堂。\n当然，眼下的情形除外。"

# game/script.rpy:11017
translate chinese Ulric3_map084_7_0_b9fe441c:

    # char_ulric "The weak die out pretty fast, so not really.\nI'd say there's always a stable \"top ten\" list.\nIf someone isn't on it, they aren't worth your time." nointeract
    char_ulric "弱者很快就淘汰了，所以也谈不上。\n要我说，那儿总有一份稳定的“前十”名单。\n要是不在名单上，就不值得你花时间。" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:11036
translate chinese Ulric3_map084_7_0_de6fb6b7:

    # char_ulric "Very funny. A joke question. I'll pass."
    char_ulric "真好笑。这种玩笑问题，我不接。"

# game/script.rpy:11059
translate chinese Ulric3_map084_7_0_b55ed1bc:

    # char_ulric "Hey, we're talking about putting your life on the line.\nDo you really think you'd want protection from a nobody?" nointeract
    char_ulric "喂，我们说的可是拿命去拼的事。\n你真会想要一个无名小卒来保护你吗？" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:11078
translate chinese Ulric3_map084_7_0_7c582994:

    # char_ulric "As you can tell, I'm very passionate about this.\nComes with the territory of being in the top ten.\nThough after this, I hope to rise a few ranks."
    char_ulric "你也看得出来，我对这事很有热情。\n跻身前十，自然就会有这份自觉。\n不过经此一事，我希望能再升几名。"

# game/script.rpy:11101
translate chinese Ulric3_map084_7_0_947814cb:

    # char_ulric "Congratulations. You're now on my nerves.\nLet's change the subject before I leave you behind."
    char_ulric "恭喜。你惹到我了。\n在我把你甩下之前，换个话题吧。"

# game/script.rpy:11123
translate chinese Ulric3_map084_7_0_3bf9f60c:

    # char_ulric "No, I'm with my true family in Mazeo.\nWe have a different concept of family in Alarinthia.\nYou choose your family, and members come and go."
    char_ulric "不，我真正的家人在马泽奥。\n在阿拉林西亚，我们对家庭的观念不同。\n家人是你自己选的，成员来去无常。"

# game/script.rpy:11128
translate chinese Ulric3_map084_7_0_0c5d3db2:

    # voice "se/y00028.ogg"
    # char_ulric "When I left Alarinthia, I left that family behind.\nI made a new one in Mazeo, and they're no less important.\nWe don't go by blood in Alarinthia, but by choice." nointeract
    voice "se/y00028.ogg"
    char_ulric "我离开阿拉林西亚时，也抛下了那个家。\n我在马泽奥组成了新的家，他们同样重要。\n在阿拉林西亚，我们不论血缘，而凭选择。" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:11148
translate chinese Ulric3_map084_7_0_384e5f06:

    # char_ulric "Yeah, and sorry if that sounds weird to you.\nThere's a big culture difference at play here.\nPerhaps you'll learn more when we leave Valinorth."
    char_ulric "是啊，要是这让你觉得奇怪，我很抱歉。\n这里面有很大的文化差异。\n也许等我们离开瓦利诺斯，你会了解更多。"

# game/script.rpy:11153
translate chinese Ulric3_map084_7_0_fa91adb3:

    # voice "se/y00030.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Not that I expect you to change your ways.\nBut it's always nice to learn about the world.\nAnyway, let's get back to the matter at hand."
    voice "se/y00030.ogg"
    char_ulric "我并不是指望你们改变自己的方式。\n但了解这个世界总是件好事。\n总之，我们回到正事上来吧。"

# game/script.rpy:11177
translate chinese Ulric3_map084_7_0_c280f34a:

    # char_ulric "They died during one of Alarinthia's tournaments.\nWhat stung worse, is that they made it to the final round.\nAlarinthia holds tournaments for the throne, not elections."
    char_ulric "他们死于阿拉林西亚的一场比武大会。\n更让人痛心的是，他们打进了决赛。\n阿拉林西亚靠比武大会定王位，而非选举。"

# game/script.rpy:11182
translate chinese Ulric3_map084_7_0_891bf998:

    # voice "se/y00032.ogg"
    # char_ulric "But that's not why I left the nation at all.\nI heard about this in a letter a few years back.\nHaven't been home since, and don't plan on going either."
    voice "se/y00032.ogg"
    char_ulric "但那根本不是我离开那个国家的原因。\n这事是我几年前在一封信里得知的。\n自那以后我再没回过家，也不打算回去。"

# game/script.rpy:11207
translate chinese Ulric3_map084_7_0_b0b3ea22:

    # char_ulric "Alarinthia is quite far away.\nIt easily takes a few days to reach by sea.\nThe climate is so different, I almost can't explain it."
    char_ulric "阿拉林西亚相当遥远。\n乘船也轻易要花上几天。\n那里的气候大不相同，我简直无法形容。"

# game/script.rpy:11212
translate chinese Ulric3_map084_7_0_bb93a718:

    # voice "se/y00034.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Just, don't dress in layers.\nWear as little clothing as possible.\nYou're liable to melt into a puddle." nointeract
    voice "se/y00034.ogg"
    char_ulric "只是，别穿得一层又一层。\n尽量少穿点衣服。\n否则你会被热化成一滩水。" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:11232
translate chinese Ulric3_map084_7_0_4213595a:

    # char_ulric "Alarinthia is known for its cutthroat political landscape.\nEven then, extreme heat is the leading cause of death.\nI'm not joking. Go unprepared and you'll pay for it."
    char_ulric "阿拉林西亚以残酷无情的政局著称。\n即便如此，酷热才是那里的头号死因。\n我不是开玩笑。毫无准备地去，你会付出代价。"

# game/script.rpy:11255
translate chinese Ulric3_map084_7_0_4e2e4acb:

    # char_ulric "It's better to know beforehand, than go and regret it.\nWho knows where the path ahead might take you.\nJust doing my duty to help keep you safe."
    char_ulric "与其去了后悔，不如事先了解。\n谁知道前路会把你们带向何方。\n我只是尽我的职责，帮你们保平安。"

# game/script.rpy:11282
translate chinese Ulric3_map084_7_0_f4bb9db6:

    # voice "se/y00037.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Well, yeah, if The Triumvirate {i}is{/i} truly responsible.\nAlestia is divided into four nations, right?\nValinorth, Mazeo, Alarinthia, and Balteus."
    voice "se/y00037.ogg"
    char_ulric "嗯，是啊，如果三人执政团{i}真的{/i}是幕后黑手的话。\n阿莱斯蒂亚分为四个国家，对吧？\n瓦利诺斯、马泽奥、阿拉林西亚，还有巴尔泰乌斯。"

# game/script.rpy:11298
translate chinese Ulric3_map084_7_0_ddc02001:

    # voice "se/y00038.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Each nation has a General that serves The Triumvirate.\nThey rule in their stead, and make sure everything runs smoothly.\nExcept — you guessed it. The Elder, or General, of Valinorth."
    voice "se/y00038.ogg"
    char_ulric "每个国家都有一位将军效命于三人执政团。\n他们代其统治，确保一切运转顺畅。\n只有瓦利诺斯例外——你猜对了，就是他们的长老，或者说将军。"

# game/script.rpy:11304
translate chinese Ulric3_map084_7_0_cf415fc4:

    # voice "se/y00039.ogg"
    # char_ulric "No one really knows why you remained untouched for so long.\nBut the theory is that they don't want to anger the spirits.\nYou know, because of all that spiritual energy residing here."
    voice "se/y00039.ogg"
    char_ulric "没人真正知道你们为何长久以来未受侵扰。\n但有种说法是，他们不想触怒灵。\n你懂的，因为这里汇聚着那么多灵性力量。"

# game/script.rpy:11310
translate chinese Ulric3_map084_7_0_35131136:

    # voice "se/y00040.ogg"
    # char_ulric "So I'm thinking this is a power play.\nTake the fourth nation, and control the whole world.\nThey did the same thing to Mazeo about twenty years ago." nointeract
    voice "se/y00040.ogg"
    char_ulric "所以我猜这是一场夺权之举。\n拿下第四个国度，就能掌控整个世界。\n大约二十年前，他们对马泽奥也做过同样的事。" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:11328
translate chinese Ulric3_map084_7_0_833e7ab6:

    # voice "se/y00041.ogg"
    # char_ulric "The same thing that's happening here, but with less fire.\nThey occupied the free town, and placed a General in charge.\nThey used terrible force, but the town improved because of it."
    voice "se/y00041.ogg"
    char_ulric "和这里发生的一样，只是没有那么多的火。\n他们占领了那座自由城，派了一位将军掌管。\n他们动用了可怕武力，但城市也因此变好了。"

# game/script.rpy:11334
translate chinese Ulric3_map084_7_0_fb3de224:

    # voice "se/y00042.ogg"
    # char_ulric "I'll never agree with their methods, but Mazeo is peaceful.\nIf they're burning villages down now, though? Unforgivable.\nPerhaps The Rebellion isn't in the wrong, after all."
    voice "se/y00042.ogg"
    char_ulric "我永远不会认同他们的手段，但马泽奥确实和平。\n可要是他们如今在烧毁村庄？不可饶恕。\n也许反抗军终究并没有错。"

# game/script.rpy:11358
translate chinese Ulric3_map084_7_0_59cc9df6:

    # char_ulric "The way it looks right now? They already do.\nThat's why we need to get out of here as soon as possible.\nA stiff drink at Peregrino is sounding pretty good right now."
    char_ulric "从现在的情况看？他们早就占了上风。\n所以我们得尽快离开这里。\n现在想想，去佩雷格里诺喝杯烈酒倒是不错。"

# game/script.rpy:11363
translate chinese Ulric3_map084_7_0_39d7810a:

    # voice "se/y00044.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Let's hurry up and get this finished.\nIt's turned into a fool's errand, and I'm no fool."
    voice "se/y00044.ogg"
    char_ulric "咱们快点把这事了结吧。\n这已经变成一桩蠢差事，而我可不是蠢人。"

# game/script.rpy:11387
translate chinese Ulric3_map084_7_0_ecde8fa2:

    # char_ulric "It's not like anything I've seen before.\nSo in tune with the spirits, you let them govern you.\nThe rest of Alestia has history in their own hands."
    char_ulric "这跟我见过的任何地方都不一样。\n你们与灵如此契合，任由其主宰自己。\n而阿莱斯蒂亚的其他地方，历史都握在自己手中。"

# game/script.rpy:11392
translate chinese Ulric3_map084_7_0_ed494d1d:

    # voice "se/y00046.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Not that it's a bad thing, of course.\nIt's just different from the rest of the world.\nFrom what I've seen, the spirits have a good grasp on things." nointeract
    voice "se/y00046.ogg"
    char_ulric "当然，这并不是坏事。\n只是和世界其他地方不同罢了。\n依我所见，灵对事情把握得很好。" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:11412
translate chinese Ulric3_map084_7_0_f84eea07:

    # char_ulric "Well, you're in the middle of a forest out here.\nYou know what they say about nature and spiritual energy.\nThe rest of the world has been deforested and settled differently."
    char_ulric "嗯，你们身处森林中央。\n你们知道人们怎么说大自然与灵性力量。\n世界其他地方早已砍伐殆尽，被以不同方式开发定居。"

# game/script.rpy:11417
translate chinese Ulric3_map084_7_0_46bf51b8:

    # voice "se/y00048.ogg"
    # char_ulric "It's not that they don't care for spirits.\nActually, it's more like they don't know anything else.\nThey've lived their entire lives in areas devoid of spiritual energy."
    voice "se/y00048.ogg"
    char_ulric "并不是他们不在乎灵。\n其实，更像是他们对别的全然不知。\n他们一辈子都生活在毫无灵性力量的地方。"

# game/script.rpy:11423
translate chinese Ulric3_map084_7_0_495e2c10:

    # voice "se/y00049.ogg"
    # char_ulric "But Valinorth is so peaceful, while the rest of the world isn't.\nIt might very well be the influence of the spirit realm.\nYou have a good thing going here. I can't stand what's happening."
    voice "se/y00049.ogg"
    char_ulric "可瓦利诺斯如此安宁，世界其他地方却不然。\n这很可能是灵界的影响。\n你们这里的日子过得很好。我实在无法忍受眼前发生的事。"

# game/script.rpy:11447
translate chinese Ulric3_map084_7_0_b1f08a5e:

    # char_ulric "Well, let's not jump to conclusions.\nI'm a sellsword, there's no business in peace for me.\nAfter I retire though, it's always an option."
    char_ulric "嗯，别急着下结论。\n我是个佣兵，太平盛世可没我的生意。\n不过等我退役了，也不失为一条出路。"

# game/script.rpy:11452
translate chinese Ulric3_map084_7_0_b94e358a:

    # voice "se/y00051.ogg"
    # char_ulric "If I live long enough to retire, that is.\nMy business isn't exactly the safest in the world.\nWhat's going on here is pretty good proof of that."
    voice "se/y00051.ogg"
    char_ulric "前提是我能活到退休。\n我这行当可不算是世上最安全的。\n这儿发生的事就是很好的证明。"

# game/script.rpy:11501
translate chinese click_map084_8_EV008_9921cf54:

    # "I push aside a few things, looking for anything of note.{w}\nIt's so cluttered that it's hard to find anything at all.{w}\nUlric slams his hand on the table, startling me."
    "我拨开几样东西，寻找任何值得注意的线索。{w}\n这里乱得根本什么都找不着。{w}\n乌尔里克一巴掌拍在桌上，吓了我一跳。"

# game/script.rpy:11504
translate chinese click_map084_8_EV008_f85740fa:

    # voice "se/a00003.ogg"
    # char_ulric "This is my spot.\nFind somewhere else to look, alright?\nWe need to cover more ground if we want anything."
    voice "se/a00003.ogg"
    char_ulric "这是我的地盘。\n去别的地方找，行吗？\n想有收获，我们得搜更大的范围。"

# game/script.rpy:11507
translate chinese click_map084_8_EV008_f9a5b8aa:

    # "He seems awfully defensive.{w}\nI notice he keeps looking at the papers.{w}\nAlmost like he knew what he wanted to find."
    "他好像戒备得很。{w}\n我注意到他老是盯着那些文件看。{w}\n简直就像他知道自己要找什么。"

# game/script.rpy:11544
translate chinese click_map084_9_EV009_1c114e4a:

    # "It's a map of known Alestia, I've seen it many times.{w}\nWe're in Valinorth, with Mazeo to the North.{w}\nEast of Mazeo is Alarinthia, and North is Balteus."
    "这是已知阿莱斯蒂亚的地图，我见过很多次了。{w}\n我们在瓦利诺斯，北边是马泽奥。{w}\n马泽奥以东是阿拉林西亚，北边是巴尔泰乌斯。"

# game/script.rpy:11546
translate chinese click_map084_9_EV009_7b216324:

    # "These four nations make up our world.{w}\nEach is governed over by a General of The Triumvirate.{w}\nExcept for Valinorth, which has remained non-partisan."
    "这四个国家构成了我们的世界。{w}\n每个都由三人执政团的一位将军治理。{w}\n只有瓦利诺斯例外，一直保持中立。"

# game/script.rpy:11548
translate chinese click_map084_9_EV009_751767b3:

    # "It's odd how I remember the basics, but little else.{w}\nI wonder if this attack is an attempt to occupy Valinorth.{w}\nAfter that, all four nations would be under their control."
    "奇怪的是，我只记得这些基本的东西，其余的很少。{w}\n不知道这场袭击是不是想占领瓦利诺斯。{w}\n那样一来，四个国家就全在他们的掌控之下了。"

# game/script.rpy:11585
translate chinese click_map084_10_EV010_5c371461:

    # "The flames haven't reached us yet.{w}\nMylus' house is much higher than the rest of Valinorth.{w}\nWe should hurry though, because it wouldn't be safe forever."
    "火焰还没烧到我们这里。{w}\n迈勒斯的房子比瓦利诺斯其他地方高得多。{w}\n不过我们还是得快点，这里不可能一直安全。"

# game/script.rpy:11588
translate chinese click_map084_10_EV010_28ec5533:

    # voice "se/a00007.ogg"
    # char_valessa "This isn't the time for sightseeing, you know.\nWe need to find information before we run out of time!" nointeract
    voice "se/a00007.ogg"
    char_valessa "现在可不是观光的时候，你知道吧。\n我们得赶在时间耗尽前找到情报！" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:11594
translate chinese click_map084_10_EV010_12e87a04:

    # voice "se/a00008.ogg"
    # char_valessa "Oh, sorry, I didn't think of that.\nKeeping watch is a good idea, actually.\nWhat do you see? Is it still safe out there?"
    voice "se/a00008.ogg"
    char_valessa "哦，抱歉，我没考虑到这点。\n其实，有人放哨是个好主意。\n你看到什么了？外面还安全吗？"

# game/script.rpy:11600
translate chinese click_map084_10_EV010_6c45fb75:

    # voice "se/a00009.ogg"
    # char_valessa "No need to apologize, I'm just saying.\nBesides, at least you know it's still safe.\nKeeping watch isn't too bad of an idea, normally."
    voice "se/a00009.ogg"
    char_valessa "不用道歉，我随口说说而已。\n再说，至少你知道外面还安全。\n平时的话，放哨倒也不算个坏主意。"

# game/script.rpy:11605
translate chinese click_map084_10_EV010_365c7fe9:

    # "I nod, and turn back to what I was doing.{w}\nMight want to look outside every few minutes.{w}\nThe last thing we need is an ambush."
    "我点点头，转回去继续手头的事。{w}\n也许该每隔几分钟往外看一次。{w}\n我们最不需要的就是中埋伏。"

# game/script.rpy:11642
translate chinese click_map084_11_EV011_cc66e34d:

    # "I walk over to Valessa, and stand beside her.{w}\nShe's hard at work, reading papers and pushing books aside.{w}\nI've never seen someone quite so determined."
    "我走到瓦莱莎身边，站在她旁边。{w}\n她正埋头苦干，读着文件，把书往旁边推。{w}\n我从没见过这么坚定的人。"

# game/script.rpy:11645
translate chinese click_map084_11_EV011_241ac22b:

    # voice "se/a00010.ogg"
    # char_valessa "Hey, have any luck yet?" nointeract
    voice "se/a00010.ogg"
    char_valessa "嘿，有收获吗？" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:11651
translate chinese click_map084_11_EV011_4b679ff2:

    # voice "se/a00011.ogg"
    # char_valessa "Same, it's getting a bit discouraging.\nI'm thinking it would be something written.\nHave you checked all the tables and bookshelves?"
    voice "se/a00011.ogg"
    char_valessa "一样，真有点让人泄气。\n我觉得应该是写成文字的东西。\n桌子书架你都查过了吗？"

# game/script.rpy:11657
translate chinese click_map084_11_EV011_c5ea3780:

    # voice "se/a00012.ogg"
    # char_valessa "Oh, uh, alright.\nBut maybe you should look as well.\nCheck out the tables and bookshelves?"
    voice "se/a00012.ogg"
    char_valessa "哦，呃，好吧。\n不过你也许也该找找。\n去查查桌子和书架？"

# game/script.rpy:11662
translate chinese click_map084_11_EV011_0afd26de:

    # "I nod, and turn back to the rest of the room.{w}\nI guess I should help out, instead of watching them.{w}\nShe was certain we'd find something, and I trusted her."
    "我点点头，转回房间的其他地方。{w}\n我想我该帮把手，而不是光看着他们。{w}\n她确信我们会找到东西，我也信她。"

# game/script.rpy:11699
translate chinese click_map084_13_EV013_0a1c2894:

    # "Hey, it's a ladder!"
    "嘿，是架梯子！"

# game/script.rpy:11702
translate chinese click_map084_13_EV013_5b71efa5:

    # voice "se/a00001.ogg"
    # char_valessa "Actually, it's a \"step\"-ladder!"
    voice "se/a00001.ogg"
    char_valessa "其实，它是一架“人”字梯！"

# game/script.rpy:11705
translate chinese click_map084_13_EV013_7a3408c6:

    # "I doubt we have time to argue this.{w}\nTo avoid further conflict, I nod and move on."
    "我怀疑我们没时间争论这个。{w}\n为避免再生争执，我点点头走开了。"

# game/script.rpy:11742
translate chinese click_map084_53_EV053_23f9dfc1:

    # "I crawl under the table, it's full of useless trinkets.{w}\nWhatever we were looking for, I doubt it's down here."
    "我爬到桌子底下，满是没用的零碎玩意儿。{w}\n不管我们在找什么，我怀疑它不在下面。"

# game/script.rpy:11745
translate chinese click_map084_53_EV053_01588da7:

    # voice "se/a00004.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Hey, it isn't play time.\nGet out from under there." nointeract
    voice "se/a00004.ogg"
    char_ulric "喂，现在可不是玩的时候。\n从底下出来。" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:11751
translate chinese click_map084_53_EV053_af9c2fe1:

    # voice "se/a00005.ogg"
    # char_ulric "I'm going to pretend I didn't hear that.\nIf you pass for authority around here, we're all dead."
    voice "se/a00005.ogg"
    char_ulric "我就当没听见。\n要是你这样子也算这里的权威，那我们全完了。"

# game/script.rpy:11757
translate chinese click_map084_53_EV053_3fe5580f:

    # voice "se/a00006.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Good, and don't let it happen again.\nWe can't afford to waste any time right now."
    voice "se/a00006.ogg"
    char_ulric "很好，别再犯了。\n我们现在可一点时间都耽误不起。"

# game/script.rpy:11762
translate chinese click_map084_53_EV053_291d5a81:

    # "I get out from under the table, after Ulric's verbal lashing.{w}\nHe might've disagreed, but we had to search everywhere we could."
    "在挨了乌尔里克一顿训之后，我从桌子底下钻了出来。{w}\n他也许不赞同，但我们得把所有能搜的地方都搜一遍。"

# game/script.rpy:11799
translate chinese click_map084_61_EV061_6ae7e9c1:

    # "I have no idea what this pot is doing on the floor.{w}\nMylus may have been a good leader, but he's not organized."
    "我完全不知道这口锅怎么会摆在地上。{w}\n迈勒斯也许是个好领袖，但他做事没条理。"

# game/script.rpy:11802
translate chinese click_map084_61_EV061_9193054f:

    # voice "se/a00002.ogg"
    # char_valessa "He probably just left everything in a hurry.\nThe mess means he was looking for something, right?\nMaybe it was something to leave behind for us."
    voice "se/a00002.ogg"
    char_valessa "他大概只是匆匆忙忙就走了。\n这么乱，说明他当时在找东西，对吧？\n也许是特意留下来给我们的东西。"

# game/script.rpy:11849
translate chinese map086_3d118463:

    # "This is it. This is what we needed!{w}\nI call over Ulric and Valessa, showing them what I found.{w}\nUlric seems tensed up, and even a little anxious."
    "就是这个。这正是我们需要的东西！{w}\n我把乌尔里克和瓦莱莎叫过来，给他们看我找到的东西。{w}\n乌尔里克似乎绷得很紧，甚至有些焦虑。"

# game/script.rpy:11879
translate chinese map086_1e390ffd:

    # voice "se/z00147.ogg"
    voice "se/z00147.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:11881
translate chinese map086_5c5e3325:

    # char_valessa "So Mylus {i}was{/i} working with The Rebellion!\nApparently, he was sheltering a blade...?\nCould that be why they attacked us?"
    char_valessa "这么说迈勒斯{i}确实{/i}在和反抗军合作！\n据说，他还窝藏了一把剑……？\n难道这就是他们袭击我们的原因？"

# game/script.rpy:11908
translate chinese map086_2a9323db:

    # voice "se/z00148.ogg"
    voice "se/z00148.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:11910
translate chinese map086_dc2447a5:

    # char_ulric "Doing all this for a blade?\nLet's be realistic, Valessa."
    char_ulric "做这一切就为了一把剑？\n现实点吧，瓦莱莎。"

# game/script.rpy:11937
translate chinese map086_3e713492:

    # voice "se/z00149.ogg"
    voice "se/z00149.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:11939
translate chinese map086_1aabbed1:

    # char_valessa "It must've been very important.\nI'm assuming Mylus took it with him.\nI don't see any blades lying around here."
    char_valessa "那一定非常重要。\n我猜迈勒斯把它带走了。\n我可没看见这儿有什么剑。"

# game/script.rpy:11944
translate chinese map086_3f86cfaf:

    # voice "se/z00150.ogg"
    # char_valessa "But about this envoy he mentioned...?\nAnd this supposed \"special person\"?\nUlric, why did you lie to us?"
    voice "se/z00150.ogg"
    char_valessa "可他提到的那位使者呢……？\n还有那个所谓的“特殊人物”？\n乌尔里克，你为什么要骗我们？"

# game/script.rpy:11968
translate chinese map086_068a3bd9:

    # "It's true. Anybody would've figured it out by now.{w}\nHe seems to admit defeat and closes his eyes.{w}\nAlmost like he didn't want to see us as he spoke."
    "没错。事到如今，谁都能猜出来了。{w}\n他似乎认了输，闭上眼睛。{w}\n仿佛说话时不愿看着我们。"

# game/script.rpy:11998
translate chinese map086_c9ea954a:

    # voice "se/z00151.ogg"
    voice "se/z00151.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:12000
translate chinese map086_e53a7f10:

    # char_ulric "We didn't think you'd come if you knew.\nI tried to hide it, but I guess there's no point anymore.\nAfter seeing this attack — I need to request your help."
    char_ulric "我们想，要是你们知道实情就不会来。\n我本想瞒着，但看来现在已经没意义了。\n亲眼见到这场袭击之后——我需要请求你们的帮助。"

# game/script.rpy:12005
translate chinese map086_5bc5d37e:

    # voice "se/z00152.ogg"
    # char_ulric "This is far from the first village they'll raze.\nThey're up to something much bigger.\nThat's why you wanted to come here, right?"
    voice "se/z00152.ogg"
    char_ulric "这远不是他们要夷平的第一座村庄。\n他们图谋的事要大得多。\n你之所以想来这里，就是这个原因，对吧？"

# game/script.rpy:12033
translate chinese map086_c66f5013:

    # voice "se/z00153.ogg"
    voice "se/z00153.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:12035
translate chinese map086_e3e8023f:

    # char_valessa "Yeah, you're right.\nThere's little time to argue, and nowhere else to go.\nIt looks like you got what you needed, Ulric."
    char_valessa "是啊，你说得对。\n没时间争论了，也无处可去。\n看来你得到了你想要的东西，乌尔里克。"

# game/script.rpy:12050
translate chinese map086_59957bae:

    # voice "se/z00154.ogg"
    voice "se/z00154.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:12052
translate chinese map086_d3333d3f:

    # char_valessa "Let's head back to The Grand Tree.\nThere might still be time."
    char_valessa "我们回巨树去吧。\n也许还来得及。"

# game/script.rpy:12075
translate chinese map086_46ec176c:

    # "We all nod, acknowledging an unspoken truth.{w}\nUlric didn't care about those in The Grand Tree.{w}\nHe only knew that coming here would blow his cover."
    "我们都点了点头，默认了一个没有说出口的事实。{w}\n乌尔里克并不在乎巨树里的人。{w}\n他只知道，来这里会暴露他的身份。"

# game/script.rpy:12077
translate chinese map086_6739d914:

    # "But I know that this information would be a huge advantage.{w}\nWe had a probable cause for their attack, {i}and{/i} knew Mylus' secret.{w}\nWe head back to the town square, instilled with hope."
    "但我知道，这个情报会是巨大的优势。{w}\n我们找到了他们袭击的可能原因，{i}还{/i}知道了迈勒斯的秘密。{w}\n我们满怀希望，朝镇上的广场走回去。"

# game/script.rpy:12120
translate chinese map042_76c6c0f7:

    # "The flames have spread, but it's not too bad.{w}\nI need to make sure I don't inhale too much smoke.{w}\nAs we take slow, cautious steps, my mind is conflicted."
    "火势蔓延了，但还不算太糟。{w}\n我得小心别吸进太多烟。{w}\n我们小心翼翼地缓步前行，我心里矛盾不已。"

# game/script.rpy:12122
translate chinese map042_7f64339a:

    # "There's one thing I can't seem to get off my mind.{w}\nThis blade, or whatever; was it worth all this?{w}\nDestroying an entire culture over something so simple?"
    "有件事我怎么也放不下。{w}\n这把剑，或者说别的什么；真值得这一切吗？{w}\n为了这么个东西就毁掉一整个文明？"

# game/script.rpy:12149
translate chinese map042_ee833a54:

    # voice "se/z00164.ogg"
    voice "se/z00164.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:12151
translate chinese map042_7e2c957a:

    # char_ulric "Sorry, I can't see all that well.\nYou two will have to lead the way.\nI'm not as familiar with the surroundings."
    char_ulric "抱歉，我看不太清楚。\n你们俩得带路了。\n我对这周围不太熟。"

# game/script.rpy:12174
translate chinese map042_4acc0866:

    # "We crouch, and make our way through Valinorth.{w}\nI have a rising urge to cough, but I try and hold it back.{w}\nWe wouldn't want to make it this far and get caught."
    "我们蹲着身子，穿过瓦利诺斯。{w}\n我越来越想咳嗽，但硬是忍住了。{w}\n可不想走了这么远还被逮住。"

# game/script.rpy:12176
translate chinese map042_f648862d:

    # "The water tank is cracking and leaking its contents.{w}\nA small stream trickles down through the village.{w}\nThis would be our best tool to hinder the flames."
    "水箱裂了，水正往外漏。{w}\n一股细流顺着村子淌下去。{w}\n这会是我们阻挡火焰的最好工具。"

# game/script.rpy:12203
translate chinese map042_a97c7b2c:

    # voice "se/z00165.ogg"
    voice "se/z00165.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:12205
translate chinese map042_27e75d6c:

    # char_valessa "This isn't right, not at all.\nWhere is everyone, Ulric?\nThere's not a single body."
    char_valessa "这不对劲，太不对劲了。\n人都去哪儿了，乌尔里克？\n一具尸体都没有。"

# game/script.rpy:12233
translate chinese map042_c59a6a33:

    # voice "se/z00166.ogg"
    voice "se/z00166.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:12235
translate chinese map042_d8402af3:

    # char_ulric "Like I said, they probably fled to safety.\nWe need to do that too, and fast.\nThere's nothing left for us here in Valinorth."
    char_ulric "我说过了，他们大概是逃到安全的地方了。\n我们也得这么做，而且要快。\n瓦利诺斯已经没什么可留恋的了。"

# game/script.rpy:12263
translate chinese map042_02ee0cda:

    # voice "se/z00167.ogg"
    voice "se/z00167.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:12265
translate chinese map042_53220a0b:

    # char_ulric "Like I said, they could be at The Grand Tree.\nIt's isolated, and far away from here.\nI'm willing to bet the flames won't reach it."
    char_ulric "我说过了，他们可能在巨树那里。\n那地方偏僻，离这里又远。\n我敢打赌火焰烧不到那儿。"

# game/script.rpy:12292
translate chinese map042_f8819785:

    # voice "se/z00168.ogg"
    voice "se/z00168.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:12294
translate chinese map042_fdf76250:

    # char_valessa "It doesn't make any sense, though.\nThink about it for a second.\nIn that alcove, we heard screams."
    char_valessa "可这说不通啊。\n你回想一下。\n在那个壁龛那儿，我们听到了尖叫声。"

# game/script.rpy:12299
translate chinese map042_44293157:

    # voice "se/z00169.ogg"
    # char_valessa "The people of Valinorth were dying.\nNot only burning, but getting attacked.\nThere should be bodies all over the place."
    voice "se/z00169.ogg"
    char_valessa "瓦利诺斯的人在死去。\n不只是被烧，还遭到了攻击。\n尸体应该到处都是才对。"

# game/script.rpy:12323
translate chinese map042_d3561db3:

    # "She was right, and it bothered me as well.{w}\nThe current scene didn't match what we heard.{w}\nWas it possible for visions to warp this way?"
    "她说得对，这也让我不安。{w}\n眼前的景象跟我们听到的对不上。{w}\n幻象有可能这样扭曲吗？"

# game/script.rpy:12353
translate chinese map042_582536b1:

    # voice "se/z00170.ogg"
    voice "se/z00170.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:12355
translate chinese map042_37f7cf06:

    # char_ulric "What are you suggesting, Valessa?\nDo you think they {i}stole{/i} the bodies?"
    char_ulric "你想说什么，瓦莱莎？\n你觉得是他们把尸体{i}偷走{/i}了？"

# game/script.rpy:12382
translate chinese map042_440b8960:

    # voice "se/z00171.ogg"
    voice "se/z00171.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:12384
translate chinese map042_1dfd5d27:

    # char_valessa "If they did, there'd be blood.\nThere's nothing, not even a trace.\nIt doesn't make any sense, Ulric."
    char_valessa "要真是那样，会有血迹。\n什么都没有，连一点痕迹都没留下。\n这根本说不通，乌尔里克。"

# game/script.rpy:12400
translate chinese map042_5c8b2295:

    # voice "se/z00172.ogg"
    voice "se/z00172.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:12402
translate chinese map042_605200b3:

    # char_valessa "We have protocols for this kind of emergency.\nThere should've been people in The Grand Tree.\nEven if it was those too stubborn to shun tradition."
    char_valessa "这种紧急情况我们有应对规程。\n巨树那儿本该有人的。\n哪怕只剩那些固执得不肯抛弃传统的人。"

# game/script.rpy:12429
translate chinese map042_45f69cbb:

    # voice "se/z00173.ogg"
    voice "se/z00173.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:12431
translate chinese map042_a095ca40:

    # char_ulric "Why is it so important, Valessa?\nYou seem to think everybody disappeared.\nWe should go to Peregrino, there {i}must{/i} be survivors."
    char_ulric "这有什么要紧的，瓦莱莎？\n你好像觉得所有人都消失了。\n我们该去佩雷格里诺，那里{i}肯定{/i}有幸存者。"

# game/script.rpy:12436
translate chinese map042_aab51211:

    # voice "se/z00173b.ogg"
    # char_ulric "I doubt we'll find answers in Valinorth.\nWe're on the right track, so let's not waste time.\nWe can reach Peregrino in a couple hours."
    voice "se/z00173b.ogg"
    char_ulric "我觉得在瓦利诺斯找不到答案。\n我们方向没错，别浪费时间了。\n几个小时就能到佩雷格里诺。"

# game/script.rpy:12460
translate chinese map042_6c9687de:

    # "It made sense, and finally our goals aligned.{w}\nSearching for information, {i}and{/i} getting to safety.{w}\nSurvivors could be our biggest source of information."
    "这有道理，我们的目标终于一致了。{w}\n既能搜集情报，{i}又{/i}能去安全的地方。{w}\n幸存者可能是我们最大的情报来源。"

# game/script.rpy:12490
translate chinese map042_84533aad:

    # voice "se/z00175.ogg"
    voice "se/z00175.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:12492
translate chinese map042_bd827f61:

    # char_ulric "Besides, I'm sure that Mylus will be there.\nHe can tell you everything, Valessa.\nI'm sure he knows what's going on."
    char_ulric "再说，我敢肯定迈勒斯会在那儿。\n他能把一切都告诉你，瓦莱莎。\n他肯定知道发生了什么。"

# game/script.rpy:12520
translate chinese map042_1e290426:

    # voice "se/z00176.ogg"
    voice "se/z00176.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:12522
translate chinese map042_bcdbeac9:

    # char_ulric "Let's say you're right, for arguments sake.\nWhy is it more important than going to The Grand Tree?\nTalking about it only seems to be wasting time."
    char_ulric "就算你说得对，姑且这么假设。\n这为什么比去巨树更重要？\n光在这儿说，好像只是浪费时间。"

# game/script.rpy:12549
translate chinese map042_6307224e:

    # voice "se/z00177.ogg"
    voice "se/z00177.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:12551
translate chinese map042_749377c6:

    # char_valessa "There might not {i}be{/i} anybody at The Grand Tree!\nI don't think we know what we're up against.\nWe should cut our losses and run, Ulric."
    char_valessa "巨树那儿可能{i}根本{/i}没人！\n我觉得我们根本不清楚面对的是什么。\n我们该趁还能脱身，赶紧跑，乌尔里克。"

# game/script.rpy:12578
translate chinese map042_7c683bd8:

    # voice "se/z00178.ogg"
    voice "se/z00178.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:12580
translate chinese map042_17e2dce7:

    # char_ulric "You need to make up your mind, Valessa!\nRunning back and forth will get us all killed.\nAre we going to The Grand Tree or not?"
    char_ulric "你得拿定主意，瓦莱莎！\n这样来回跑会把我们都害死的。\n到底去不去巨树？"

# game/script.rpy:12603
translate chinese map042_5d57ac1c:

    # "It's true, she was changing her mind far too fast.{w}\nAt the moment, she seems to value our survival.{w}\nCould she be starting to doubt that this is a vision?"
    "确实，她改主意改得太快了。{w}\n此刻，她好像更看重我们的安危。{w}\n她是不是开始怀疑这其实并不是一场幻象了？"

# game/script.rpy:12605
translate chinese map042_17b69e77:

    # "All I had to go on was her word.{w}\nI only believed her because it made sense at the time.{w}\nHow could I gather information if we leave Valinorth?"
    "我唯一的依据就是她的话。{w}\n我之所以信她，只是因为这在那时说得通。{w}\n要是我们离开瓦利诺斯，我还怎么搜集情报？"

# game/script.rpy:12635
translate chinese map042_094fddb0:

    # voice "se/z00179.ogg"
    voice "se/z00179.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:12637
translate chinese map042_e5e0870f:

    # char_ulric "If you want to leave, we're going to Peregrino.\nIt'd be the first place for survivors to flee.\nIf Mylus is there, he can tell us all about this attack."
    char_ulric "你要是想走，我们就去佩雷格里诺。\n那会是幸存者最先逃去的地方。\n迈勒斯要是在那儿，他能把这场袭击的来龙去脉都告诉我们。"

# game/script.rpy:12660
translate chinese map042_09b1804b:

    # "It's a good enough plan of action, and we nod to one another.{w}\nBut as we continue to move, everything changes."
    "这计划还算不错，我们相互点了点头。{w}\n可就在我们继续前行时，一切都变了。"

# game/script.rpy:12663
translate chinese map042_33171417:

    # voice "se/z00180.ogg"
    # "A laugh from atop the water tank. Almost maniacal."
    voice "se/z00180.ogg"
    "水箱顶上传来一阵笑声。近乎癫狂。"

# game/script.rpy:12678
translate chinese map042_46b5adcf:

    # voice "se/z00181.ogg"
    voice "se/z00181.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:12684
translate chinese map042_2b0dfb4e:

    # char_jit_map042_1_0_288 "Such loyalty to the man who condemned you all.\nIf you want to know where Mylus is, I'd love to show you.\nI can even reunite you with the rest of the villagers."
    char_jit_map042_1_0_288 "对那个把你们全都定了罪的人，还真是忠心啊。\n你们想知道迈勒斯在哪儿的话，我很乐意带你们去。\n我甚至能让你们和其余的村民团聚。"

# game/script.rpy:12695
translate chinese map042_e0153b64:

    # "We stop in our tracks and look up at the water tank.{w}\nA silhouette of a man stands there, gripping a large blade.{w}\nIt's white and gold, with majesty embellished by the flames."
    "我们停下脚步，抬头望向水箱。{w}\n一个男人的剪影立在那里，握着一把大剑。{w}\n剑身金白相间，火焰更衬出它的威严。"

# game/script.rpy:12697
translate chinese map042_467dd5bc:

    # "It reminds me of the suits of armor we fought earlier.{w}\nI have no doubt that there was some sort of relation.{w}\nWe must be looking at the man responsible for this."
    "它让我想起我们先前打过的那些铠甲。{w}\n我毫不怀疑两者之间有什么关联。{w}\n我们眼前这个人，肯定就是罪魁祸首。"

# game/script.rpy:12699
translate chinese map042_4d97c702:

    # "He jumps down from the water tank and lands with a roll.{w}\nI take a few steps back, ensuring that Ulric remains in the front.{w}\nIf his job was our protection, now was the time to shine through."
    "他从水箱上跳下来，就地一翻滚落地。{w}\n我后退几步，确保乌尔里克留在前面。{w}\n既然他的职责是保护我们，现在就该大显身手了。"

# game/script.rpy:12729
translate chinese map042_fed582af:

    # voice "se/z00182.ogg"
    voice "se/z00182.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:12732
translate chinese map042_1cf140cd:

    # char_sovy "What a pitiful little village.\nIt's no fun when they don't put up a fight.\nDid you know what they did in their final moments?"
    char_sovy "多么可悲的小村庄啊。\n他们不反抗，就一点意思都没有。\n你知道他们最后一刻做了什么吗？"

# game/script.rpy:12765
translate chinese map042_cfb60dd9:

    # voice "se/z00183.ogg"
    voice "se/z00183.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:12767
translate chinese map042_16f1639a:

    # char_sovy "They called out to you, Seer.\nThey wanted your help, and you let them down.\nI guess the stories I heard about you were wrong."
    char_sovy "他们曾向你呼救，先知。\n他们盼着你来救，你却辜负了他们。\n看来我听说的关于你的传闻都是假的。"

# game/script.rpy:12774
translate chinese map042_5686c472:

    # voice "se/z00184.ogg"
    voice "se/z00184.ogg"

