    # char_sovy "They called out to you, Seeress.\nThey wanted your help, and you let them down.\nI guess the stories I heard about you were wrong."
    char_sovy "他们曾向你呼救，先知。\n他们盼着你来救，你却辜负了他们。\n看来我听说的关于你的传闻都是假的。"

# game/script.rpy:12799
translate chinese map042_79aa8308:

    # voice "se/z00185.ogg"
    voice "se/z00185.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:12801
translate chinese map042_f8fbeb5d:

    # char_ulric "Sovy, you already have the blade.\nLet us leave, we can resolve this peacefully."
    char_ulric "索维，你已经拿到那把剑了。\n放我们走，我们可以和平解决。"

# game/script.rpy:12828
translate chinese map042_7baffef3:

    # voice "se/z00186.ogg"
    voice "se/z00186.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:12831
translate chinese map042_03c18c26:

    # char_sovy "No survivors, don't you remember the rule?\nLike a garden, we have to pluck all the weeds."
    char_sovy "不留活口，你不记得规矩了吗？\n就像打理花园，杂草要连根拔净。"

# game/script.rpy:12858
translate chinese map042_37fac573:

    # voice "se/z00187.ogg"
    voice "se/z00187.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:12860
translate chinese map042_9e3cce04:

    # char_ulric "Is that all these people are to you!?\nSovy, they have a culture, and history!"
    char_ulric "这些人对你来说就只是这样吗！？\n索维，他们有自己的文化，还有历史！"

# game/script.rpy:12888
translate chinese map042_42b22503:

    # voice "se/z00188.ogg"
    voice "se/z00188.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:12890
translate chinese map042_063cb2ef:

    # char_sovy "Yes, but it's not {i}theirs{/i} that I'm interested in.\nIn fact, I'm only here to claim the Seer's soul.\nEverything else was just for fun. For sport."
    char_sovy "是啊，但我感兴趣的可不是{i}他们的{/i}东西。\n其实，我来这里只是为了取走先知的灵魂。\n其余的不过是图个乐子，寻个刺激。"

# game/script.rpy:12918
translate chinese map042_8fe11080:

    # voice "se/z00189.ogg"
    voice "se/z00189.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:12920
translate chinese map042_f670d5b5:

    # char_sovy "Yes, but it's not {i}theirs{/i} that I'm interested in.\nIn fact, I'm only here to claim the Seeress' soul.\nEverything else was just for fun. For sport."
    char_sovy "是啊，但我感兴趣的可不是{i}他们的{/i}东西。\n其实，我来这里只是为了取走先知的灵魂。\n其余的不过是图个乐子，寻个刺激。"

# game/script.rpy:12943
translate chinese map042_ccb86426:

    # "This becomes personal, as they seem to know each other.{w}\nThey both worked for opposing forces, I'm sure they've fought before.{w}\nIt sickens me that he likens killing the villagers to a sport."
    "事情变得私人了，他们俩好像认识。{w}\n他们各自为对立的势力效力，肯定交过手。{w}\n他竟把屠杀村民说成找乐子，真让我恶心。"

# game/script.rpy:12973
translate chinese map042_dc8e175e:

    # voice "se/z00190.ogg"
    voice "se/z00190.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:12975
translate chinese map042_3e894349:

    # char_ulric "You don't mean..."
    char_ulric "你不会是说……"

# game/script.rpy:13002
translate chinese map042_9fd14bf4:

    # voice "se/z00191.ogg"
    voice "se/z00191.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:13004
translate chinese map042_1a66be1b:

    # char_sovy "My orders had nothing to do with burning down this village.\nI wasn't supposed to kill anyone unless I had to, either.\nBut you know, my Apprentice isn't very fun to train with."
    char_sovy "我的命令跟烧掉这个村子毫无关系。\n除非迫不得已，我也不该杀人。\n可你知道，跟我的学徒对练实在没什么意思。"

# game/script.rpy:13032
translate chinese map042_717888d4:

    # voice "se/z00192.ogg"
    voice "se/z00192.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:13034
translate chinese map042_c4ef10c7:

    # char_ulric "Disgusting...\nValessa, take the Seer and run.\nI'll catch up with you at Peregrino."
    char_ulric "恶心……\n瓦莱莎，带上先知快跑。\n我在佩雷格里诺跟你们会合。"

# game/script.rpy:13062
translate chinese map042_45eebff5:

    # voice "se/z00193.ogg"
    voice "se/z00193.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:13064
translate chinese map042_16703b07:

    # char_ulric "Disgusting...\nValessa, take the Seeress and run.\nI'll catch up with you at Peregrino."
    char_ulric "恶心……\n瓦莱莎，带上先知快跑。\n我在佩雷格里诺跟你们会合。"

# game/script.rpy:13087
translate chinese map042_df0a8cef:

    # "Ulric pulls out his blade, and assumes a fighting stance.{w}\nSovy does the same, and their eyes meet in deadlock.{w}\nI look at Valessa, and we nod before starting to run."
    "乌尔里克拔出剑，摆出战斗姿势。{w}\n索维也照做，两人的目光僵持着交汇。{w}\n我看向瓦莱莎，我们点了点头，随即开始奔逃。"

# game/script.rpy:13101
translate chinese map042_5f9a3c5e:

    # "Unfortunately, we don't make it very far.{w}\nWe hear Ulric scream, and turn back to look.{w}\nSovy smirks at us, his blade deep in Ulric's abdomen."
    "不幸的是，我们没跑出多远。{w}\n我们听到乌尔里克的惨叫，回头看去。{w}\n索维冲我们得意地一笑，他的剑已深深没入乌尔里克的腹部。"

# game/script.rpy:13131
translate chinese map042_dc30f003:

    # voice "se/z00194.ogg"
    voice "se/z00194.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:13133
translate chinese map042_f3bb61c9:

    # char_sovy "Where do you think you're going, you two?\nIt would be rude to leave before I'm done with you.\nWatch — and you'll see why you can {i}never{/i} win."
    char_sovy "你们俩，以为要去哪儿？\n我还没把你们解决掉就走，可太失礼了。\n看着——你就会明白你们{i}永远{/i}赢不了。"

# game/script.rpy:13156
translate chinese map042_f6af276c:

    # voice "se/swordstab2.ogg"
    voice "se/swordstab2.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:13158
translate chinese map042_51fa960a:

    # "With a grin on his face, he twists the blade inside Ulric.{w}\nDefying all possibility, the gear on the base starts to spin.{w}\nSoon after, everything is engulfed in a blinding white light."
    "他咧嘴一笑，在乌尔里克体内转动剑身。{w}\n不可思议的是，剑柄底部的齿轮开始转动。{w}\n紧接着，一切都被刺眼的白光吞没。"

# game/script.rpy:13177
translate chinese map042_f4e7b765:

    # voice "se/z00195.ogg"
    voice "se/z00195.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:13179
translate chinese map042_97a1d9e1:

    # char_ulric "Please, run..."
    char_ulric "快跑……"

# game/script.rpy:13195
translate chinese map042_133b6f64:

    # "We hear Ulric's final words as the light subsides.{w}\nWhen everything is back to normal, he's completely gone.{w}\nNo blood, no body, just Sovy standing there with pride."
    "光芒消退时，我们听到了乌尔里克最后的话。{w}\n等一切恢复如常，他已彻底消失。{w}\n没有血，没有尸体，只有索维得意地站在那里。"

# game/script.rpy:13225
translate chinese map042_68ff1d7e:

    # voice "se/z00196.ogg"
    voice "se/z00196.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:13227
translate chinese map042_b1ccb278:

    # char_valessa "What!?\nWhat did you do...!?"
    char_valessa "什么！？\n你做了什么……！？"

# game/script.rpy:13254
translate chinese map042_e5eee6b7:

    # voice "se/z00197.ogg"
    voice "se/z00197.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:13256
translate chinese map042_6e569498:

    # char_sovy "I put his spirit to good use.\nLike I plan to do with your little friend."
    char_sovy "我让他的灵体发挥了用处。\n就像我打算对你这位小朋友做的事一样。"

# game/script.rpy:13282
translate chinese map042_ff3d2a04:

    # "He points behind us, and we turn to look.{w}\nThe scattered pieces of armor on the ground start to move.{w}\nThey assemble, forming bodies that move in a slow, stiff fashion."
    "他指向我们身后，我们转身看去。{w}\n地上散落的铠甲碎片动了起来。{w}\n它们拼合起来，组成动作迟缓僵硬的身躯。"

# game/script.rpy:13284
translate chinese map042_76d5b1c7:

    # "But after a few moments, the movements become more natural.{w}\nIt isn't much longer until an army of automatons blocks our path.{w}\nThere was nowhere to go. Sovy blocked the other side."
    "但过了片刻，动作变得自然起来。{w}\n没过多久，一支自动人偶组成的军队堵住了我们的去路。{w}\n无处可逃。索维封住了另一边。"

# game/script.rpy:13313
translate chinese map042_02cb9b84:

    # voice "se/z00198.ogg"
    voice "se/z00198.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:13315
translate chinese map042_e137c744:

    # char_valessa "You — you're using their spirits to power that armor?\nDoes that mean we've been fighting our own...!?"
    char_valessa "你——你在用他们的灵体让那些铠甲动起来？\n那我们一直在跟自己人打……！？"

# game/script.rpy:13342
translate chinese map042_9d759b8f:

    # voice "se/z00199.ogg"
    voice "se/z00199.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:13344
translate chinese map042_7f907538:

    # char_sovy "Now you finally understand.\nThe force of life itself bends to The Triumvirate.\nThere's no way that you could hope to stop us."
    char_sovy "你终于明白了。\n连生命之力都臣服于三人执政团。\n你们根本别想阻止我们。"

# game/script.rpy:13367
translate chinese map042_f4d42f92:

    # "He takes slow steps toward me, holding out his blade.{w}\nI finally understood why it was so important to The Triumvirate.{w}\nThey could command an army of spirits simply by possessing it."
    "他握着剑，缓缓朝我走来。{w}\n我终于明白它为什么对三人执政团如此重要。{w}\n只要拥有它，他们就能号令一支灵体大军。"

# game/script.rpy:13398
translate chinese map042_e6e8276e:

    # voice "se/z00200.ogg"
    voice "se/z00200.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:13400
translate chinese map042_28b4b599:

    # char_sovy "As soon as I harvest the Seer's soul, I'll leave.\nValessa, if you behave, I might let you go.\nVisit The Rebels. Tell them what's coming."
    char_sovy "等我收割了先知的灵魂，我就走。\n瓦莱莎，你要是乖乖听话，我也许会放你走。\n去反抗军那儿，告诉他们什么要来了。"

# game/script.rpy:13428
translate chinese map042_8e223374:

    # voice "se/z00201.ogg"
    voice "se/z00201.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:13430
translate chinese map042_0ec70057:

    # char_sovy "As soon as I harvest the Seeress' soul, I'll leave.\nValessa, if you behave, I might let you go.\nVisit The Rebels. Tell them what's coming."
    char_sovy "等我收割了先知的灵魂，我就走。\n瓦莱莎，你要是乖乖听话，我也许会放你走。\n去反抗军那儿，告诉他们什么要来了。"

# game/script.rpy:13453
translate chinese map042_faff6d3a:

    # "This is it. If he attacked me, the vision would end.{w}\nI was armed with all the information I needed to counter this attack.{w}\nThe true purpose, the major players, and even the nature of the blade."
    "就是现在。只要他攻击我，幻象就会结束。{w}\n我已经掌握了应对这场袭击所需的全部情报。{w}\n真正的目的、关键人物，甚至那把剑的本质。"

# game/script.rpy:13455
translate chinese map042_77751908:

    # "He was so certain of his victory, he had no idea.{w}\nI took a step forward, embracing what was to come.{w}\nWhen this future came for Valinorth, we would be ready."
    "他如此笃定自己会赢，浑然不知。{w}\n我向前迈出一步，坦然迎接即将到来的一切。{w}\n等这个未来降临瓦利诺斯时，我们会做好准备。"

# game/script.rpy:13458
translate chinese map042_83833955:

    # voice "se/swordstab.ogg"
    # "He thrusts the blade inside of me with little effort.{w}\nThe pain is so intense, but I'm overcome with hope.{w}\nAs my vision fades, I find the strength to say one final thing."
    voice "se/swordstab.ogg"
    "他毫不费力地把剑刺入我体内。{w}\n剧痛难忍，可我心中却充满希望。{w}\n视野渐渐模糊，我攒起力气，说出最后一句话。"

# game/script.rpy:13473
translate chinese map042_9d5fe4b7:

    # voice "se/z00202.ogg"
    voice "se/z00202.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:13476
translate chinese map042_336df76f:

    # char_sovy "Hmm...?" nointeract
    char_sovy "唔……？" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:13567
translate chinese map043_036c7d31:

    # "My eyes shoot open and I instinctively clutch my gut.{w}\nThe pain from the vision lingers, pulsing through my body.{w}\nPanting heavily, I squirm in pain, waiting for it to fade."
    "我猛地睁开眼，下意识地捂住腹部。{w}\n幻象中的疼痛还残留着，一阵阵传遍全身。{w}\n我大口喘着气，痛得扭动身体，等着它消退。"

# game/script.rpy:13582
translate chinese map043_65ec2197:

    # voice "se/falldown.ogg"
    # "I fall off the side of my bed, and slam into the floor.{w}\nThankfully, this makes me fully lucid, stopping the pain.{w}\nFor a moment, it's as if I existed in both scenarios."
    voice "se/falldown.ogg"
    "我从床边摔了下来，重重砸在地上。{w}\n幸好这一摔让我彻底清醒，疼痛也止住了。{w}\n有那么一瞬间，我仿佛同时存在于两个场景之中。"

# game/script.rpy:13588
translate chinese map043_227a19c4:

    # "I rise to a sitting position, and focus on my breathing.{w}\nStill in shock at what happened, my heart beats frantically.{w}\nIt takes a while before it slows down, but I happily wait."
    "我坐起身，专注地调整呼吸。{w}\n我仍对发生的事惊魂未定，心脏狂跳不止。{w}\n过了好一会儿才慢下来，但我乐意等着。"

# game/script.rpy:13590
translate chinese map043_dfd603df:

    # "When these negative feelings subside, I stand up.{w}\nThe vision I just experienced plays on a loop in my head.{w}\nI had to warn Mylus, I had to ensure this didn't happen!"
    "等这些负面情绪平息，我站了起来。{w}\n刚才经历的幻象在脑海里循环播放。{w}\n我必须警告迈勒斯，我必须阻止这一切发生！"

# game/script.rpy:13596
translate chinese map043_8a440aef:

    # "A knock sounds on my door, and I lock up in fright.{w}\nAfter what I just saw, my mind is filled with anxiety.{w}\nThankfully, as a voice calls out to me, I'm put at ease."
    "门上传来敲门声，我吓得浑身一僵。{w}\n刚看到那样的事，我心里满是焦虑。{w}\n幸好，一个声音朝我喊来，我才放宽了心。"

# game/script.rpy:13609
translate chinese map043_5c3a32e2:

    # voice "se/z00203.ogg"
    voice "se/z00203.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:13615
translate chinese map043_a6eb8f5d:

    # char_jit_map043_1_0_42 "Hey Seer, open up!\nDon't make me wait all day again!"
    char_jit_map043_1_0_42 "嘿，先知，开门！\n别又让我等一整天！"

# game/script.rpy:13622
translate chinese map043_38a43348:

    # voice "se/z00204.ogg"
    voice "se/z00204.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:13628
translate chinese map043_7e9803c9:

    # char_jit_map043_1_0_50 "Hey Seeress, open up!\nDon't make me wait all day again!"
    char_jit_map043_1_0_50 "嘿，先知，开门！\n别又让我等一整天！"

# game/script.rpy:13639
translate chinese map043_5b518434:

    # "It's Fortaime. He's my best friend, and Valessa's student.{w}\nAs my Scribe, she had to train a \"back-up\", so to speak.{w}\nA terrible scenario to plan for, but it had to be done."
    "是福泰姆。他是我最好的朋友，也是瓦莱莎的学生。{w}\n作为我的书记官，她得培养一个所谓的“替补”。{w}\n要为之做准备的设想很糟糕，但不得不做。"

# game/script.rpy:13641
translate chinese map043_6d97209a:

    # "I rush over to the door and quickly unlock it.{w}\nWelcoming him in, I notice a huge grin on his face.{w}\nI feel relaxed. It's a brief reminder of safety."
    "我冲到门口，迅速打开门锁。{w}\n把他迎进来时，我注意到他脸上挂着大大的笑容。{w}\n我放松下来。这短暂地提醒我，这里是安全的。"

# game/script.rpy:13678
translate chinese map043_b63fb2ce:

    # char_fortaime "Did you just wake up!?\nOh jeeze, I hope we won't be late.\nDon't tell me you forgot what day it is!" nointeract
    char_fortaime "你该不会刚醒吧！？\n哎呀，可别迟到了。\n别告诉我你忘了今天是什么日子！" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:13706
translate chinese map043_55f5719d:

    # voice "se/z00206.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "Hey, I definitely took a bath!\nI just rushed it, because I had to pick you up.\nEnough about me, though. This is your special day!"
    voice "se/z00206.ogg"
    char_fortaime "喂，我可是洗过澡的！\n只是赶时间，因为得来接你。\n不过别光说我了。今天是你的大日子！"

# game/script.rpy:13743
translate chinese map043_250465b5:

    # char_fortaime "Stop that! You're saying weird stuff again!\nI should be the one flattering you, it's {i}your{/i} day.\nSomething like this only happens once a generation."
    char_fortaime "别说了！你又在说些奇怪的话了！\n该奉承你的是我才对，今天可是{i}你{/i}的日子。\n这种事一代人才轮得到一次。"

# game/script.rpy:13773
translate chinese map043_81e4b12e:

    # voice "se/z00208.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "Hey, I'm just trying to be nice!\nI didn't mean to steal your thunder.\nAfter all, this day is all about {i}you{/i}!"
    voice "se/z00208.ogg"
    char_fortaime "喂，我只是想表示好意嘛！\n我不是有意抢你风头的。\n毕竟，今天的主角就是{i}你{/i}！"

# game/script.rpy:13804
translate chinese map043_6b26d776:

    # voice "se/z00209.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "Huh? Did you forget?\nOh well, I don't blame you.\nThere's lots going on lately."
    voice "se/z00209.ogg"
    char_fortaime "啊？你忘了？\n哎，我不怪你。\n最近事儿太多了。"

# game/script.rpy:13833
translate chinese map043_dc4a2c6c:

    # voice "se/z00210.ogg"
    voice "se/z00210.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:13835
translate chinese map043_114cebfb:

    # char_fortaime "You're being officially inducted!\nYou know, the ceremony to brand you as a Seer?\nIt should've happened ages ago, but stuff got in the way."
    char_fortaime "你要正式受封了！\n就是那场给你烙上先知印记的仪式。\n早该办了，可总有事耽搁。"

# game/script.rpy:13842
translate chinese map043_6e3021e5:

    # voice "se/z00211.ogg"
    voice "se/z00211.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:13844
translate chinese map043_d03bf55f:

    # char_fortaime "You're being officially inducted today!\nYou know, the ceremony to brand you as a Seeress?\nIt should've happened ages ago, but stuff got in the way."
    char_fortaime "你要正式受封了！\n就是那场给你烙上先知印记的仪式。\n早该办了，可总有事耽搁。"

# game/script.rpy:13865
translate chinese map043_cdda809d:

    # char_fortaime "Let's not delay it anymore, alright?\nJust sign this paper before we go.\nMylus wants it. Consent for the ceremony."
    char_fortaime "咱们别再拖了，好吗？\n走之前把这份文件签了。\n迈勒斯要的，是仪式的同意书。"

# game/script.rpy:13898
translate chinese map043_c1819f94:

    # char_fortaime "Thanks, [firstname]!\nThis is exactly what he'll need.\nPut on something fancy, I'll wait outside."
    char_fortaime "谢啦，[firstname]！\n这正是他需要的。\n换身讲究点的衣服，我在外面等。"

# game/script.rpy:13924
translate chinese map043_2779851b:

    # "I reach out to try and stop him, but he's already gone.{w}\nIt's for the better though, as he mustn't know what I saw.{w}\nThe only people authorized to know were Mylus and Valessa."
    "我伸手想拦住他，可他已经走了。{w}\n不过这样也好，他绝不能知道我看到了什么。{w}\n获准知情的人只有迈勒斯和瓦莱莎。"

# game/script.rpy:13926
translate chinese map043_f6c9a33a:

    # "I walk over to my wardrobe, to look for an outfit.{w}\nAs Fortaime pointed out, I'm still in my smallclothes.{w}\nIf it was a big day, I guess I'd have to dress the part."
    "我走到衣柜前，想找身衣服。{w}\n正如福泰姆指出的，我还穿着里衣。{w}\n既然是个大日子，我想我得穿得像样点。"

# game/script.rpy:13937
translate chinese map043_21781256:

    # "Yes, that should be a fine choice.{w}\nI slip into the menswear, and turn back to my room.{w}\nI take in everything at once. It's a huge mess."
    "好，这应该是个不错的选择。{w}\n我换上男装，转身回到房间。{w}\n我一眼扫过一切。乱得一塌糊涂。"

# game/script.rpy:13941
translate chinese map043_6f335e7f:

    # "Yes, that should be a fine choice.{w}\nI slip into the dress, and turn back to my room.{w}\nI take in everything at once. It's a huge mess."
    "好，这应该是个不错的选择。{w}\n我换上裙子，转身回到房间。{w}\n我一眼扫过一切。乱得一塌糊涂。"

# game/script.rpy:13945
translate chinese map043_15be33ab:

    # "Once I meet Fortaime, we might be busy for a while.{w}\nI should finish up any last minute business while I can.{w}\nBut at the same time, I shouldn't keep him waiting for long."
    "一旦见到福泰姆，我们可能会忙上一阵。{w}\n我该趁现在把手头最后的琐事了结掉。{w}\n但与此同时，也不该让他等太久。"

# game/script.rpy:14476
translate chinese click_map078_2_EV002_e958b3bd:

    # "The town looks so peaceful, and so quiet.{w}\nIt's a far cry from the way I saw it last night.{w}\nHopefully the vision was far off, and not impending."
    "小镇看起来如此安宁，如此寂静。{w}\n跟我昨晚看到的景象天差地别。{w}\n但愿那幻象离我们还远，而不是迫在眉睫。"

# game/script.rpy:14513
translate chinese click_map078_3_EV003_9471a912:

    # "This sword has been above my bed for as long as I can remember.{w}\nIt's ceremonial, and it couldn't really do anything in a fight.{w}\nFortaime gave it to me when we were younger. That's how we met."
    "从我记事起，这把剑就一直挂在我床头上方。{w}\n它是仪式用的，真打起来派不上什么用场。{w}\n是福泰姆在我们小时候送给我的。我们就是这么认识的。"

# game/script.rpy:14550
translate chinese click_map078_4_EV004_10c5d396:

    # "I never water this plant anymore, but it's still alive.{w}\nAllegedly, plantlife is a container for spiritual energy.{w}\nIt's odd, because in that case, plants are immortal."
    "我已经不再给这株植物浇水了，可它还活着。{w}\n据说，植物是灵力的容器。{w}\n说来奇怪，照这么说，植物岂不是不死的。"

# game/script.rpy:14587
translate chinese click_map078_5_EV005_5900bd47:

    # "I was supposed to gather bags of grain for Mylus.{w}\nValinorth is self-sustaining, and we take turns harvesting.{w}\nBut I think I have something more important to talk to him about."
    "我本该去给迈勒斯收集几袋谷子的。{w}\n瓦利诺斯自给自足，大家轮流收割。{w}\n但我想，有更重要的事要跟他谈。"

# game/script.rpy:14624
translate chinese click_map078_6_EV006_0577a86d:

    # "My cooking space is so messy, it's embarrassing.{w}\nI'm glad Fortaime didn't stay and visit.{w}\nIt would've been lecture after lecture."
    "我的灶台乱得让人难为情。{w}\n幸好福泰姆没留下来串门。{w}\n不然又是一顿接一顿的唠叨。"

# game/script.rpy:14662
translate chinese click_map078_7_EV007_a9e66399:

    # "This carpet is pretty luxurious. Valessa gave it to me.{w}\nIt sure beats walking on the cold wooden floor.{w}\nScribes go all-out when it's their Seer's birthday."
    "这块地毯挺华贵的。是瓦莱莎送给我的。{w}\n总比踩在冰冷的地板上强多了。{w}\n每逢先知生日，书记官都会不惜血本。"

# game/script.rpy:14667
translate chinese click_map078_7_EV007_78fa000c:

    # "This carpet is pretty luxurious. Valessa gave it to me.{w}\nIt sure beats walking on the cold wooden floor.{w}\nScribes go all-out when it's their Seeress' birthday."
    "这块地毯挺华贵的。是瓦莱莎送给我的。{w}\n总比踩在冰冷的地板上强多了。{w}\n每逢先知生日，书记官都会不惜血本。"

# game/script.rpy:14704
translate chinese click_map078_8_EV008_185420a3:

    # "This bread is as hard as a rock!{w}\nBut I guess it's better than nothing.{w}\nI'm in a hurry, I'll grab one to eat on the go."
    "这面包硬得像石头！{w}\n不过有总比没有强。{w}\n我赶时间，拿一个边走边吃吧。"

# game/script.rpy:14742
translate chinese click_map078_9_EV009_59a77d63:

    # "I hope that Fortaime never has to step up as Scribe.{w}\nHowever, at the moment, the future seems very uncertain."
    "我希望福泰姆永远不必接任书记官一职。{w}\n然而眼下，未来显得十分不确定。"

# game/script.rpy:14803
translate chinese click_map078_9_EV009_f5fe83dd:

    # "Last time Fortaime came over, he left his journal.{w}\nOf course, he has nothing to hide, and he's always open.{w}\nI often benefit from his writings. He's smarter than he lets on."
    "上次福泰姆来的时候，把他的日记落下了。{w}\n当然，他没什么可隐瞒的，一向坦诚。{w}\n我常从他的文字里获益。他比表面看起来聪明得多。"

# game/script.rpy:14865
translate chinese click_map078_10_EV010_daeb7c5d:

    # "It's actually kind of scary to think about.{w}\nThe spirits have more sway over us than we know."
    "仔细想想，其实有点吓人。{w}\n灵体对我们的影响，比我们知道的还要大。"

# game/script.rpy:14926
translate chinese click_map078_10_EV010_4c241d1a:

    # "It's a book on the true reach of the spirits.{w}\nA very divisive topic, and one that's always debated."
    "这是一本讲灵体真正影响范围的书。{w}\n一个极具争议、总被拿来辩论的话题。"

# game/script.rpy:14988
translate chinese click_map078_11_EV011_814d952b:

    # "This book makes me wonder, where did we come from?{w}\nIf The Triumvirate are righteous, why would they attack us?{w}\nAnd if they didn't create Alestia, then who did...?"
    "这本书让我思考，我们从何而来？{w}\n如果三人执政团是正义的，为什么要袭击我们？{w}\n如果阿莱斯蒂亚不是他们创造的，那又是谁……？"

# game/script.rpy:15049
translate chinese click_map078_11_EV011_fb14e78a:

    # "One of my books, on the creation of Alestia.{w}\nAlgus Veilleur is one of the most famous scholars in the world.{w}\nI tried to collect some of his works, but he wrote so much."
    "我的一本书，讲的是阿莱斯蒂亚的创世。{w}\n阿尔古斯·维勒是世上最著名的学者之一。{w}\n我本想收集他的一些著作，可他写得太多了。"

# game/script.rpy:15110
translate chinese click_map078_12_EV012_514a67cd:

    # "I really wish I could just hop back into bed.{w}\nBut I guess I have responsibilities and stuff.{w}\nI shouldn't keep Mylus in the dark for much longer."
    "我真希望能直接跳回床上。{w}\n可我想我还有责任在身之类的。{w}\n我不该再瞒着迈勒斯太久了。"

# game/script.rpy:15148
translate chinese click_map078_13_EV013_fdebf60e:

    # "There isn't much use for my armoire right now.{w}\nI already grabbed the suit, and that's all I need.{w}\nBut maybe I'll organize it more when I get the chance."
    "现在我的衣柜没多大用处。{w}\n我已经拿了那套男装，这就够了。{w}\n不过有机会的话，也许我会把它再整理整理。"

# game/script.rpy:15153
translate chinese click_map078_13_EV013_c4021666:

    # "There isn't much use for my armoire right now.{w}\nI already grabbed the dress, and that's all I need.{w}\nBut maybe I'll organize it more when I get the chance."
    "现在我的衣柜没多大用处。{w}\n我已经拿了那条裙子，这就够了。{w}\n不过有机会的话，也许我会把它再整理整理。"

# game/script.rpy:15199
translate chinese click_map078_115_EV115_e958b3bd:

    # "The town looks so peaceful, and so quiet.{w}\nIt's a far cry from the way I saw it last night.{w}\nHopefully the vision was far off, and not impending."
    "小镇看起来如此安宁，如此寂静。{w}\n跟我昨晚看到的景象天差地别。{w}\n但愿那幻象离我们还远，而不是迫在眉睫。"

# game/script.rpy:15233
translate chinese click_map078_135_EV135_cb51cae3:

    # "You are about to visit the world map for the first time.{w}\nClick the question mark in the bottom corner for a tutorial.{w}\nThe story flow and exploration will be explained in more detail."
    "你即将首次进入世界地图。{w}\n点击角落里的问号查看教程。{w}\n剧情流程和探索玩法会有更详细的说明。"

# game/script.rpy:15378
translate chinese Fortaime1_map078_166_1_bda70beb:

    # char_fortaime "Hey." nointeract
    char_fortaime "嘿。" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:15397
translate chinese Fortaime1_map078_166_1_eaa7824a:

    # char_fortaime "Well, it's a huge mess, for one.\nYou should see mine. It's flawless.\nI'm actually tempted to start cleaning."
    char_fortaime "首先，这里乱得一塌糊涂。\n你该看看我的房间，一尘不染。\n我其实有点忍不住想开始打扫了。"

# game/script.rpy:15402
translate chinese Fortaime1_map078_166_1_fe1c180c:

    # voice "se/y00112.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "But I know I shouldn't do that without permission.\nLast time I did that, I got into a whole mess of trouble.\nStory for another time I guess. Or, whenever you ask."
    voice "se/y00112.ogg"
    char_fortaime "但我知道，没得到允许不该这么做。\n上次我这么干，惹了一堆麻烦。\n这故事改天再讲吧。或者，你什么时候问都行。"

# game/script.rpy:15422
translate chinese Fortaime2_map078_166_1_1f7ee8c5:

    # voice "se/y00113.ogg"
    voice "se/y00113.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:15424
translate chinese Fortaime2_map078_166_1_ae013fc0:

    # char_fortaime "I'm pretty sure that's an understatement, [firstname]!\nI just can't {i}stand{/i} when something is out of place.\nIt drives me insane, makes me freak out."
    char_fortaime "我敢说这还说得太轻了，[firstname]！\n我{i}实在受不了{/i}东西不在它该在的位置。\n这让我抓狂，简直要发疯。"

# game/script.rpy:15429
translate chinese Fortaime2_map078_166_1_933e1631:

    # voice "se/y00114.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "Don't be offended if you see me messing around.\nEverything has an order, a perfect place it should be.\nI just like putting things where they belong!"
    voice "se/y00114.ogg"
    char_fortaime "要是看到我瞎收拾，别见怪。\n每样东西都有它的次序，有它该在的完美位置。\n我就是喜欢把东西归到该放的地方！"

# game/script.rpy:15449
translate chinese Fortaime2_map078_166_1_be23636e:

    # voice "se/y00115.ogg"
    voice "se/y00115.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:15451
translate chinese Fortaime2_map078_166_1_7ba00906:

    # char_fortaime "Oh, thank goodness!\nI was so scared you'd get mad at me.\nGive me a few minutes, I won't take long."
    char_fortaime "哦，谢天谢地！\n我还怕你会生我的气呢。\n给我几分钟，不会太久。"

# game/script.rpy:15456
translate chinese Fortaime2_map078_166_1_231b4bb6:

    # voice "se/y00116.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "Wait, why is there a sack of grain on the floor?\nAnd your cooking area is an absolute mess!\nThis is going to take longer than I thought."
    voice "se/y00116.ogg"
    char_fortaime "等等，地上怎么会有袋谷子？\n还有你的灶台，简直乱成一团！\n这比我想的要花更长时间。"

# game/script.rpy:15476
translate chinese Fortaime2_map078_166_1_af4169d9:

    # voice "se/y00117.ogg"
    voice "se/y00117.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:15478
translate chinese Fortaime2_map078_166_1_a4cdf853:

    # char_fortaime "Is that a serious offer...?\nBecause you know, I'm very interested.\nEven if Mylus says that's against the rules."
    char_fortaime "这提议是认真的吗……？\n因为你知道，我非常感兴趣。\n就算迈勒斯说这违反规矩。"

# game/script.rpy:15483
translate chinese Fortaime2_map078_166_1_e00cea6c:

    # voice "se/y00118.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "But I'll wait until you make a formal offer.\nSometimes I act on impulse and make a fool of myself.\nThere was big trouble last time I cleaned without permission."
    voice "se/y00118.ogg"
    char_fortaime "但我会等你正式提出来。\n有时我一冲动就出洋相。\n上次我没经允许就打扫，惹了大麻烦。"

# game/script.rpy:15503
translate chinese Fortaime2_map078_166_1_dd6e5cd3:

    # voice "se/y00119.ogg"
    voice "se/y00119.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:15505
translate chinese Fortaime2_map078_166_1_ce33ae52:

    # char_fortaime "I saw a house so dirty, I couldn't resist.\nIt turned out to be Mylus' spare study home.\nEverything was messed up, but with purpose."
    char_fortaime "我看到一栋房子脏得不成样，实在忍不住。\n结果那是迈勒斯备用的书房。\n一切都很乱，但乱得有讲究。"

# game/script.rpy:15510
translate chinese Fortaime2_map078_166_1_82dc465b:

    # voice "se/y00120.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "He said it took him months to recover.\nI messed with his stuff and threw his studies off.\nI'll never forgive myself for doing that, [firstname]."
    voice "se/y00120.ogg"
    char_fortaime "他说花了好几个月才缓过来。\n我动了他的东西，把他的研究全打乱了。\n我永远不会原谅自己，[firstname]。"

# game/script.rpy:15516
translate chinese Fortaime2_map078_166_1_834c09e9:

    # voice "se/y00121.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "He said it was \"unbecoming\" of me.\nI had to look up the word, but I guess it's true.\nAs a scribe-in-training, I need to show {i}some{/i} class."
    voice "se/y00121.ogg"
    char_fortaime "他说我有失“体统”。\n那词我还得查字典，但我想他说得没错。\n身为见习书记官，我总得有点{i}风度{/i}。"

# game/script.rpy:15542
translate chinese Fortaime2_map078_166_1_bd5ff25b:

    # voice "se/y00122.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "It's pretty great, actually.\nEverything is given to me by Valinorth.\nMoney, food, a house. You name it."
    voice "se/y00122.ogg"
    char_fortaime "其实挺不错的。\n一切都是瓦利诺斯给我的。\n钱、食物、房子，应有尽有。"

# game/script.rpy:15548
translate chinese Fortaime2_map078_166_1_3c851490:

    # voice "se/y00123.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "I work with Valessa more than you, though.\nI'm kind of disappointed about that.\nWe tend to role-play real scenarios."
    voice "se/y00123.ogg"
    char_fortaime "不过我跟瓦莱莎共事比跟你多。\n对此我有点失望。\n我们常常模拟真实的场景来演练。"

# game/script.rpy:15554
translate chinese Fortaime2_map078_166_1_83e6fe61:

    # voice "se/y00124.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "She'll take on your role, and I'll take on hers.\nPlaying a Scribe {i}for{/i} a Scribe. Best possible training.\nUnfortunately, I doubt I'll ever be a real one."
    voice "se/y00124.ogg"
    char_fortaime "她扮演你的角色，我扮演她的。\n{i}演{/i}书记官的书记官。最好的训练方式。\n可惜，我恐怕永远成不了真正的书记官。"

# game/script.rpy:15574
translate chinese Fortaime3_map078_166_1_473723f4:

    # voice "se/y00125.ogg"
    voice "se/y00125.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:15576
translate chinese Fortaime3_map078_166_1_ec02db19:

    # char_fortaime "I don't think there's any protocol for that.\nBut I assume Mylus has the final word there.\nOr whoever the Elder is at any given time."
    char_fortaime "我觉得这种事没有先例可循。\n但我想那得迈勒斯说了算。\n或者说，谁当长老就谁说了算。"

# game/script.rpy:15581
translate chinese Fortaime3_map078_166_1_b8b8a360:

    # voice "se/y00126.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "Sometimes you just have to go with the flow.\nBut I hope you're not trying to say Valessa is bad.\nIs there something I'm not seeing here...?"
    voice "se/y00126.ogg"
    char_fortaime "有时候你就得随波逐流。\n但希望你不是想说瓦莱莎不好。\n是不是有什么我没看出来的……？"

# game/script.rpy:15600
translate chinese Fortaime3_map078_166_1_6e14f13a:

    # voice "se/y00127.ogg"
    voice "se/y00127.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:15602
translate chinese Fortaime3_map078_166_1_721cfda0:

    # char_fortaime "Whoa, are you serious?\nI got the feeling that I kind of annoyed you.\nSorry, I don't know how to respond to that!"
    char_fortaime "哇，你是认真的吗？\n我还以为我有点惹你烦了呢。\n抱歉，我不知道该怎么回应这话！"

# game/script.rpy:15607
translate chinese Fortaime3_map078_166_1_a7de6a13:

    # voice "se/y00128.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "But I really don't think I can be your Scribe.\nI can only take over if something happens to Valessa.\nAnd trust me, I {i}really{/i} don't want that to happen."
    voice "se/y00128.ogg"
    char_fortaime "但我真觉得我当不了你的书记官。\n只有当瓦莱莎出事，我才能接手。\n相信我，我{i}真的{/i}不希望那样的事发生。"

# game/script.rpy:15613
translate chinese Fortaime3_map078_166_1_318a3127:

    # voice "se/y00129.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "We'll have to find other ways to work together.\nOr we could even hang out in our off time.\nThere's no rule against doing that."
    voice "se/y00129.ogg"
    char_fortaime "我们得另找办法一起做事。\n或者我们甚至可以休息时一起玩。\n又没有规矩禁止这么做。"

# game/script.rpy:15633
translate chinese Fortaime3_map078_166_1_70cc9843:

    # voice "se/y00130.ogg"
    voice "se/y00130.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:15635
translate chinese Fortaime3_map078_166_1_aed33aa7:

    # char_fortaime "Whoa, do you have a thing for her?\nI guess it's natural. You work together a lot.\nNever would've expected it, that's all."
    char_fortaime "哇，你是不是对她有意思？\n我想这也正常。你们常在一起共事。\n只是我从没料到而已。"

# game/script.rpy:15640
translate chinese Fortaime3_map078_166_1_245c401c:

    # voice "se/y00131.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "Wait, don't answer that question!\nI can't have any gossip on the brain.\nWhatever you feel, keep it private!"
    voice "se/y00131.ogg"
    char_fortaime "等等，别回答这个问题！\n我脑子里可不能装八卦。\n不管你什么感觉，都藏在心里！"

# game/script.rpy:15660
translate chinese Fortaime3_map078_166_1_069e4312:

    # voice "se/y00132.ogg"
    voice "se/y00132.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:15662
translate chinese Fortaime3_map078_166_1_1f24c129:

    # char_fortaime "Oh, I guess I jumped to conclusions again.\nI really need to stop doing stuff like that.\nI hope I was able to help your curiosity though."
    char_fortaime "哦，我猜我又妄下结论了。\n我真得改改这毛病。\n不过希望我满足了你的好奇心。"

# game/script.rpy:15667
translate chinese Fortaime3_map078_166_1_6073490a:

    # voice "se/y00133.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "We have to obey the rules set in stone by Valinorth.\nI'm just happy that we all get along with each other.\nThis trio could've been a lot worse, if you ask me."
    voice "se/y00133.ogg"
    char_fortaime "我们得遵守瓦利诺斯定下的铁律。\n我挺高兴我们几个相处得不错。\n要我说，这三人组本可能糟得多。"

# game/script.rpy:15687
translate chinese Fortaime3_map078_166_1_d532ab40:

    # voice "se/y00134.ogg"
    voice "se/y00134.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:15689
translate chinese Fortaime3_map078_166_1_cc19de3a:

    # char_fortaime "Well, I really love climbing trees.\nAside from that, I love reading, and cleaning.\nIt's a simple life here, but I have no problem with it."
    char_fortaime "这个嘛，我很喜欢爬树。\n除此之外，我喜欢读书，还有打扫。\n这里生活简单，但我一点不介意。"

# game/script.rpy:15694
translate chinese Fortaime3_map078_166_1_04f51ca5:

    # voice "se/y00135.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "I have a lot of time off. Way more than Valessa.\nHonestly, I think I only do half of what she does.\nJust means I need to keep myself occupied."
    voice "se/y00135.ogg"
    char_fortaime "我空闲时间很多。比瓦莱莎多得多。\n老实说，我觉得我干的只有她的一半。\n这就意味着我得找事打发时间。"

# game/script.rpy:15700
translate chinese Fortaime3_map078_166_1_d99258d9:

    # voice "se/y00136.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "If you see me with cuts and bruises, don't freak out.\nI'm pushing myself to the limits. Climbing bigger trees.\nBefore you know it, I'll be on top of The Grand Tree."
    voice "se/y00136.ogg"
    char_fortaime "要是看到我浑身是伤，别惊慌。\n我在挑战自己的极限，爬更高的树。\n不知不觉，我就会登上巨树的顶端。"

# game/script.rpy:15719
translate chinese Fortaime3_map078_166_1_34a761d7:

    # voice "se/y00137.ogg"
    voice "se/y00137.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:15721
translate chinese Fortaime3_map078_166_1_b350d8e4:

    # char_fortaime "Wait, seriously?\nThat sounds awesome, [firstname]!\nI'll have to choose something easy, then."
    char_fortaime "等等，真的吗？\n听起来太棒了，[firstname]！\n那我得挑点简单的才行。"

# game/script.rpy:15726
translate chinese Fortaime3_map078_166_1_675f43a4:

    # voice "se/y00138.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "I don't want to throw you right into it.\nValinorth needs you, and I won't screw that up.\nBut it might be fun having an apprentice to teach."
    voice "se/y00138.ogg"
    char_fortaime "我不想一上来就让你应付难事。\n瓦利诺斯需要你，我不能把这事搞砸。\n不过带个徒弟教教，也许挺有意思。"

# game/script.rpy:15746
translate chinese Fortaime3_map078_166_1_cd564e90:

    # voice "se/y00139.ogg"
    voice "se/y00139.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:15748
translate chinese Fortaime3_map078_166_1_7f147176:

    # char_fortaime "Nope, just the perfect amount!\nIf you aren't pushing yourself, you aren't winning.\nThere's an exact formula to it, and I'm playing it safe."
    char_fortaime "不，是刚刚好的量！\n不逼自己一把，就赢不了。\n这其中有个精确的法则，我是在稳妥行事。"

# game/script.rpy:15767
translate chinese Fortaime3_map078_166_1_24105644:

    # voice "se/y00140.ogg"
    voice "se/y00140.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:15769
translate chinese Fortaime3_map078_166_1_e695319a:

    # char_fortaime "About... five years less than Valessa.\nAfter The Triumvirate took over Mazeo, we were scared.\nSo I think I was a \"worst case scenario\" type of thing."
    char_fortaime "大概……比瓦莱莎少五年吧。\n三人执政团占领马泽奥之后，我们都吓坏了。\n所以我觉得我是那种“最坏情况下的备用方案”。"

# game/script.rpy:15774
translate chinese Fortaime3_map078_166_1_57223af2:

    # voice "se/y00141.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "Some people say that Mylus' Father trained him, too.\nThat's why he was able to take over so easily.\nThat means he's like me, but for the position of Elder."
    voice "se/y00141.ogg"
    char_fortaime "有人说，迈勒斯的父亲也培养过他。\n所以他才这么容易就接了班。\n也就是说他跟我一样，只不过对应的是长老之位。"

# game/script.rpy:15793
translate chinese Fortaime3_map078_166_1_c7d6e421:

    # voice "se/y00142.ogg"
    voice "se/y00142.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:15795
translate chinese Fortaime3_map078_166_1_b50601b9:

    # char_fortaime "You must be messing with me. Is this a test...?\nI'd rather not talk about that, if it's all the same.\nAt least approach the subject a little more casually."
    char_fortaime "你一定是在逗我。这是在试探我吗……？\n要是不介意的话，我还是不想谈这个。\n至少换个更随意点的方式提。"

# game/script.rpy:15814
translate chinese Fortaime3_map078_166_1_cd48f202:

    # voice "se/y00143.ogg"
    voice "se/y00143.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:15816
translate chinese Fortaime3_map078_166_1_dec3bb28:

    # char_fortaime "Same, that would be awful!\nWe're definitely like a small family here.\nI couldn't live without either of you."
    char_fortaime "一样，那太可怕了！\n我们这儿真像一个小家庭。\n少了你们俩谁，我都活不下去。"

# game/script.rpy:15821
translate chinese Fortaime3_map078_166_1_50911cc5:

    # voice "se/y00144.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "I feel weird, existing as a fail-safe.\nBut I'm free to do much more in my spare time.\nI love this position, and I'm glad to know both of you."
    voice "se/y00144.ogg"
    char_fortaime "作为一道保险措施而存在，感觉怪怪的。\n但我的闲暇时间能自由做更多事。\n我喜欢这个职位，也很高兴认识你们俩。"

# game/script.rpy:15841
translate chinese Fortaime3_map078_166_1_cdb68c0e:

    # voice "se/y00145.ogg"
    voice "se/y00145.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:15843
translate chinese Fortaime3_map078_166_1_f72fb545:

    # char_fortaime "I don't think I'm really allowed to do that.\nThe training I go through is already mentally exhausting.\nI need to devote my spare time to blowing off steam."
    char_fortaime "我觉得我其实没被允许那么做。\n我接受的训练已经很耗心力了。\n我得把闲暇时间拿来放松一下、发泄发泄。"

# game/script.rpy:15848
translate chinese Fortaime3_map078_166_1_c2b8b10f:

    # voice "se/y00146.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "Of course, this is under Mylus' orders.\nI'm sure I could handle something if I really wanted.\nBut getting in trouble with him really isn't worth it."
    voice "se/y00146.ogg"
    char_fortaime "当然，这是迈勒斯的命令。\n要是真想，我肯定也能应付点什么。\n但惹上他的麻烦实在不值当。"

# game/script.rpy:15868
translate chinese Fortaime4_map078_166_1_8125bd2d:

    # voice "se/y00147.ogg"
    voice "se/y00147.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:15870
translate chinese Fortaime4_map078_166_1_ebcfba67:

    # char_fortaime "To be honest, I just like helping people.\nSo probably cleaning up here and there, keeping tidy.\nI consider a day successful if I've made someone else smile."
    char_fortaime "老实说，我就是喜欢帮人。\n所以大概就是到处打扫打扫，保持整洁。\n只要能让别人露出笑容，我就觉得这一天没白过。"

# game/script.rpy:15875
translate chinese Fortaime4_map078_166_1_528cfd27:

    # voice "se/y00148.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "Maybe I could be a problem solver or something.\nPeople always need some help, so I'd never go bored.\nIt would always involve something new and exciting."
    voice "se/y00148.ogg"
    char_fortaime "也许我可以当个专门解决问题的人之类的。\n人总是需要帮忙，所以我永远不会觉得无聊。\n总能碰上新鲜又刺激的事。"

# game/script.rpy:15881
translate chinese Fortaime4_map078_166_1_3125d704:

    # voice "se/y00149.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "Of course, I'm getting ahead of myself here.\nMylus says I'm not allowed to do any extra work.\nTraining has to be my most important focus."
    voice "se/y00149.ogg"
    char_fortaime "当然，我这是想得太远了。\n迈勒斯说我不准做任何额外的工作。\n训练必须是我最重要的重心。"

# game/script.rpy:15901
translate chinese Fortaime4_map078_166_1_5620cbc4:

    # voice "se/y00150.ogg"
    voice "se/y00150.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:15903
translate chinese Fortaime4_map078_166_1_c4b455c1:

    # char_fortaime "That sounds awesome, it really does.\nBut I'd never hear the end of it from Mylus.\nIf I overload my brain with work, I'll slip up."
    char_fortaime "听起来很棒，真的。\n可迈勒斯会没完没了地念叨我。\n要是用工作把脑子塞满，我就会出错。"

# game/script.rpy:15908
translate chinese Fortaime4_map078_166_1_1078cf4c:

    # voice "se/y00151.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "He says I always need to be \"at the ready\".\nUnfortunately, that leads to a lot of waiting around.\nWho would've thought too much spare time is an issue?"
    voice "se/y00151.ogg"
    char_fortaime "他说我必须随时“待命”。\n可惜这样一来，就常常只能干等着。\n谁会想到空闲太多也会成问题呢？"

# game/script.rpy:15914
translate chinese Fortaime4_map078_166_1_124f5523:

    # voice "se/y00152.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "That's why I do things I can always cut short.\nClimbing a tree? Just hop down, and try again later.\nCleaning? Just stop. The mess isn't going anywhere."
    voice "se/y00152.ogg"
    char_fortaime "所以我都做些随时能中断的事。\n爬树？跳下来，回头再试就是了。\n打扫？停下就行。乱摊子又不会长腿跑掉。"

# game/script.rpy:15934
translate chinese Fortaime4_map078_166_1_28612aba:

    # voice "se/y00153.ogg"
    voice "se/y00153.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:15936
translate chinese Fortaime4_map078_166_1_e68c247f:

    # char_fortaime "I could think of {i}much{/i} worse things to do.\nConsidering that, it's not too bad on my end.\nMy life is simple, and there's some beauty in that."
    char_fortaime "我能想到{i}远{/i}比这糟糕的事。\n这么一想，我这处境也不算太差。\n我的生活很简单，其中自有一种美。"

# game/script.rpy:15941
translate chinese Fortaime4_map078_166_1_16e455c0:

    # voice "se/y00154.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "You and Valessa always seem so busy.\nI'd rather stay in my situation than be overworked.\nI'm sure you cope with it, but I doubt I could."
    voice "se/y00154.ogg"
    char_fortaime "你和瓦莱莎看起来总是忙得不行。\n比起累死累活，我倒宁愿保持现状。\n你们肯定应付得来，但换了我可不行。"

# game/script.rpy:15947
translate chinese Fortaime4_map078_166_1_85a68515:

    # voice "se/y00155.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "I hope I never have to step up, either.\nThat would mean something terrible happened to Valessa.\nI don't even want to think about that. Let's move on."
    voice "se/y00155.ogg"
    char_fortaime "我也希望自己永远不用顶替上位。\n那意味着瓦莱莎遭遇了可怕的事。\n我连想都不愿想。咱们换个话题吧。"

# game/script.rpy:15967
translate chinese Fortaime4_map078_166_1_0b4f5abd:

    # voice "se/y00156.ogg"
    voice "se/y00156.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:15969
translate chinese Fortaime4_map078_166_1_646a9cdd:

    # char_fortaime "Oh no, I could never do that to you!\nYou need me, and all of Valinorth needs me.\nI'm not as important, but I'm still important."
    char_fortaime "哦不，我绝不会那样对你！\n你需要我，整个瓦利诺斯也需要我。\n我没那么重要，但也不是无关紧要。"

# game/script.rpy:15974
translate chinese Fortaime4_map078_166_1_b0d11af0:

    # voice "se/y00157.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "We're almost as important as The Elder, actually.\nHe even looks to us for guidance sometimes.\nI love the job, it just has some downsides."
    voice "se/y00157.ogg"
    char_fortaime "其实我们几乎和长老一样重要。\n他有时甚至向我们征询意见。\n我喜欢这份工作，只是它有些短处。"

# game/script.rpy:15980
translate chinese Fortaime4_map078_166_1_6b8e5f49:

    # voice "se/y00158.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "I wouldn't mind leaving Valinorth one day.\nBut that's probably just because I'm not allowed to.\nYou know what they say about wanting what you can't have."
    voice "se/y00158.ogg"
    char_fortaime "有朝一日离开瓦利诺斯，我倒也不介意。\n但这大概只是因为我没被允许离开。\n你知道人们怎么说得不到的总是最好的。"

# game/script.rpy:16010
translate chinese Fortaime4_map078_166_1_caf6d7b9:

    # voice "se/y00159.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "Yeah, it's great here!\nSometimes I wish I could leave, but it's dangerous out there.\nMazeo is the closest city, and we all know what happened there."
    voice "se/y00159.ogg"
    char_fortaime "是啊，这儿很棒！\n有时我真希望能出去走走，可外面太危险了。\n马泽奥是最近的城，而那里出过什么事，我们都清楚。"

# game/script.rpy:16016
translate chinese Fortaime4_map078_166_1_0e38d89d:

    # voice "se/y00160.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "Balteus would be way too cold for me.\nAnd Alarinthia would be way too warm.\nI think we have it perfect right here."
    voice "se/y00160.ogg"
    char_fortaime "巴尔泰乌斯对我来说太冷了。\n阿拉林西亚又太热了。\n我觉得我们这儿刚刚好。"

# game/script.rpy:16036
translate chinese Fortaime5_map078_166_1_5518728a:

    # voice "se/y00161.ogg"
    voice "se/y00161.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:16038
translate chinese Fortaime5_map078_166_1_50a6e4ca:

    # char_fortaime "Well, it's {i}really{/i} far up north.\nThe Triumvirate is stationed there.\nI've heard their castle is amazing."
    char_fortaime "这个嘛，它在北边{i}很远{/i}的地方。\n三人执政团就驻扎在那儿。\n听说他们的城堡很壮观。"

# game/script.rpy:16043
translate chinese Fortaime5_map078_166_1_f3173840:

    # voice "se/y00162.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "But I don't think too many people live there.\nFrom what I've read, it's full of their most loyal subjects.\nSo their Honor Guard, and prospective Generals."
    voice "se/y00162.ogg"
    char_fortaime "但我觉得住那儿的人不多。\n据我读到的，那儿全是他们最忠诚的臣民。\n比如荣誉卫队，还有未来的将军们。"

# game/script.rpy:16049
translate chinese Fortaime5_map078_166_1_644fee0a:

    # voice "se/y00163.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "I've heard they have a grand library, though!\nIn Valinorth, my reading material is really limited.\nI'd say a library like that makes up for the cold."
    voice "se/y00163.ogg"
    char_fortaime "不过我听说他们有座宏伟的图书馆！\n在瓦利诺斯，我能读的东西实在有限。\n要我说，那样的图书馆足以抵过寒冷了。"

# game/script.rpy:16069
translate chinese Fortaime5_map078_166_1_89da8182:

    # voice "se/y00164.ogg"
    voice "se/y00164.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:16071
translate chinese Fortaime5_map078_166_1_9f0a3ed9:

    # char_fortaime "The tribal lands, to the far east.\nI know very little about Alarinthia, except that it's hot.\nYou have to be really strong to live in a place like that."
    char_fortaime "那是极东之地的部族领土。\n关于阿拉林西亚我只知道那儿很热，别的几乎一无所知。\n要住在那种地方，非得特别强悍才行。"

# game/script.rpy:16076
translate chinese Fortaime5_map078_166_1_2fc3464b:

    # voice "se/y00165.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "And that's who lives there, mostly.\nThey take strength very seriously, and hold tournaments.\nFighting is a big deal. It determines who holds the throne."
    voice "se/y00165.ogg"
    char_fortaime "住在那儿的主要就是这些人。\n他们极其看重力量，还举办比武大会。\n战斗可是件大事，它决定谁来坐王位。"

# game/script.rpy:16082
translate chinese Fortaime5_map078_166_1_ad7566f4:

    # voice "se/y00166.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "But there's barely any books on it here.\nI'm really only educated on Valinorth and Mazeo.\nMaybe someone else could teach you about Alarinthia."
    voice "se/y00166.ogg"
    char_fortaime "可这里关于那儿的书少得可怜。\n我其实只对瓦利诺斯和马泽奥有了解。\n也许别人能给你讲讲阿拉林西亚。"

# game/script.rpy:16102
translate chinese Fortaime5_map078_166_1_374e04b0:

    # voice "se/y00167.ogg"
    voice "se/y00167.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:16104
translate chinese Fortaime5_map078_166_1_f7dbbb48:

    # char_fortaime "It's the trade hub of Alestia, full of docks and ships.\nI really hate talking about this, so I'll make it quick.\nIt's been over twenty years since The Triumvirate occupied it."
    char_fortaime "那是阿莱斯蒂亚的贸易中心，到处都是码头和船只。\n我实在讨厌谈这个，所以长话短说。\n三人执政团占领那儿已经二十多年了。"

# game/script.rpy:16109
translate chinese Fortaime5_map078_166_1_80d01bb5:

    # voice "se/y00168.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "They put a trade ban in effect as soon as they did.\nIt doesn't affect me too much, except for a type of apple.\nMy parents used to treat me with them when I was younger."
    voice "se/y00168.ogg"
    char_fortaime "他们一占领就实施了贸易禁令。\n对我影响不太大，除了一种苹果。\n小时候，父母常拿那种苹果哄我。"

# game/script.rpy:16115
translate chinese Fortaime5_map078_166_1_034f44dd:

    # voice "se/y00169.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "Hopefully one day they remove the stupid ban.\nThey say it keeps order on things, but I'm not sure.\nMore laws just means more rules to break, right?"
    voice "se/y00169.ogg"
    char_fortaime "但愿有一天他们会解除那条愚蠢的禁令。\n他们说这能维持秩序，可我不确定。\n法条越多，就越有规矩可以破，对吧？"

# game/script.rpy:16121
translate chinese Fortaime5_map078_166_1_0e45d0c5:

    # voice "se/y00170.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "Anyway, yeah, Mazeo is a really interesting place.\nEveryone said the force they used to occupy it was justified.\nEliminating piracy and bringing the law to Mazeo was necessary."
    voice "se/y00170.ogg"
    char_fortaime "总之，是啊，马泽奥是个很有意思的地方。\n大家都说他们占领时用的武力是正当的。\n为了铲除海盗、把法律带到马泽奥，那是必要的。"

# game/script.rpy:16141
translate chinese Fortaime5_map078_166_1_3fae47e1:

    # voice "se/y00171.ogg"
    voice "se/y00171.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:16143
translate chinese Fortaime5_map078_166_1_3a92c8d3:

    # char_fortaime "That would be cool, but I highly doubt it.\nWe have strict orders to remain in Valinorth at all times.\nAnd Mylus isn't the type of guy to let anyone break the rules."
    char_fortaime "那会很酷，但我很怀疑。\n我们有严格的命令，必须时刻待在瓦利诺斯。\n而迈勒斯可不是那种允许任何人破例的人。"

# game/script.rpy:16148
translate chinese Fortaime5_map078_166_1_a4367b03:

    # voice "se/y00172.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "It's been this way for thousands of years.\nI don't think we'll get any special treatment.\nI mean, we can dream, but it won't really go anywhere."
    voice "se/y00172.ogg"
    char_fortaime "这规矩已经延续了几千年。\n我觉得我们不会得到什么特殊待遇。\n我是说，做梦可以，但不会有什么结果。"

# game/script.rpy:16167
translate chinese Fortaime5_map078_166_1_1a65d9cf:

    # voice "se/y00173.ogg"
    voice "se/y00173.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:16169
translate chinese Fortaime5_map078_166_1_a04d76e5:

    # char_fortaime "Oh yeah? What makes you think that?\nActually, don't tell me, I don't want to get my hopes up.\nTook me long enough to come to terms with it the first time."
    char_fortaime "哦，是吗？你凭什么这么想？\n其实，别告诉我，我不想抱太大希望。\n头一回接受这事就花了我好久。"

# game/script.rpy:16188
translate chinese Fortaime5_map078_166_1_0f18ee70:

    # voice "se/y00174.ogg"
    voice "se/y00174.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:16190
translate chinese Fortaime5_map078_166_1_93aff913:

    # char_fortaime "It's called being a realist!\nI've come to terms with the life we have in Valinorth.\nIt took a while, but I'm sure you'll learn to do the same."
    char_fortaime "这叫务实！\n我已经接受了我们在瓦利诺斯的这种生活。\n花了一阵子，但我相信你也会慢慢接受的。"

# game/script.rpy:16226
translate chinese Fortaime5_map078_166_1_9072c197:

    # "This character is not in your party."
    "该角色不在你的队伍中。"

# game/script.rpy:16641
translate chinese map008_9665833d:

    # "We head back to Main Street, in search of Zamira.{w}\nThe Blade of Exodus is strapped to my back, and it's heavy.{w}\nGlances from the townspeople show that they're aware of this artifact.{w}\nHowever, being who I am, they raise no concerns to my face."
    "我们回到主街，去寻找扎米拉。{w}\n放逐之刃绑在我背上，沉甸甸的。{w}\n镇上的人瞥过来的目光说明他们认得这件神器。{w}\n不过碍于我的身份，没人当面提出疑虑。"

# game/script.rpy:16668
translate chinese map008_0307dc54:

    # voice "se/z00402.ogg"
    voice "se/z00402.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:16670
translate chinese map008_d28fb71c:

    # char_fortaime "So, Valessa, do you see him anywhere?\nI don't know what he looks like, so this is on you."
    char_fortaime "那么，瓦莱莎，你看到他在哪儿了吗？\n我不知道他长什么样，所以这事就靠你了。"

# game/script.rpy:16697
translate chinese map008_58d6cd99:

    # voice "se/z00403.ogg"
    voice "se/z00403.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:16699
translate chinese map008_5550e903:

    # char_valessa "Yeah, sorry, I'll point him out.\nI'm just not used to the villagers {i}staring{/i} like this.\nThat blade really makes us stand out, doesn't it...?"
    char_valessa "嗯，抱歉，我来指给你看。\n我只是不习惯村民们这样{i}盯着{/i}看。\n那把剑真让我们显眼，是吧……？"

# game/script.rpy:16726
translate chinese map008_eb3e79a7:

    # voice "se/z00404.ogg"
    voice "se/z00404.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:16728
translate chinese map008_679d8734:

    # char_fortaime "Or maybe they're just admiring our good looks.\nCome on Valessa, don't be so uptight.\nNobody knows what this blade can do. Let 'em stare."
    char_fortaime "也许他们只是在欣赏我们的美貌呢。\n得了吧，瓦莱莎，别那么紧张。\n没人知道这把剑有什么用。让他们看呗。"

# game/script.rpy:16749
translate chinese map008_abaf312d:

    # "She gives Fortaime no response as she scans the area.{w}\nIt's true. They could stare, but they didn't know.{w}\nTo them, it was just a cool sword. Something new.{w}\nValinorth could be pretty stagnant, and short of excitement."
    "她没理会福泰姆，只顾扫视四周。{w}\n没错。他们可以盯着看，但他们并不知情。{w}\n对他们来说，那不过是把很酷的剑，是个新鲜玩意儿。{w}\n瓦利诺斯一成不变，少有刺激。"

# game/script.rpy:16781
translate chinese map008_2535af2f:

    # voice "se/z00405.ogg"
    voice "se/z00405.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:16783
translate chinese map008_88009802:

    # char_valessa "Wait, I see him!"
    char_valessa "等等，我看到他了！"

# game/script.rpy:16804
translate chinese map008_d5aa7e76:

    # "She points to a man standing near my house.{w}\nHe has his back against it, and taps his foot on the ground.{w}\nI guess he knew where I lived. Mylus must've told him."
    "她指着一个站在我家附近的男人。{w}\n他背靠着墙，脚尖点着地。{w}\n看来他知道我住哪儿。一定是迈勒斯告诉他的。"

# game/script.rpy:16836
translate chinese map008_c57714dc:

    # voice "se/z00406.ogg"
    voice "se/z00406.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:16838
translate chinese map008_5bfa7f5a:

    # char_valessa "Hey Zamira, how's your watch going?"
    char_valessa "嘿，扎米拉，你这边放哨还顺利吗？"

# game/script.rpy:16859
translate chinese map008_d842abac:

    # "His ears perk up, and he starts to approach us.{w}\nA huge smile on his face as he quickly closes the distance."
    "他竖起耳朵，朝我们走来。{w}\n他脸上咧开大大的笑容，快步拉近距离。"

# game/script.rpy:16891
translate chinese map008_79436729:

    # voice "se/z00407.ogg"
    voice "se/z00407.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:16897
translate chinese map008_fd55ac93:

    # char_jit_map008_1_0_111 "Hey Valessa! Long time no see.\nCan't complain, things are pretty much the same.\nThis is the most excitement I've had in years."
    char_jit_map008_1_0_111 "嘿，瓦莱莎！好久不见。\n没什么可抱怨的，一切照旧。\n这是我这几年遇到的最刺激的事了。"

# game/script.rpy:16918
translate chinese map008_423400f5:

    # "He looks me up and down, before staring at the blade.{w}\nSomething told me he wouldn't stay quiet like the villagers."
    "他上下打量我，然后盯着那把剑。{w}\n我有种预感，他不会像村民们那样默不作声。"

# game/script.rpy:16950
translate chinese map008_3da50a2a:

    # voice "se/z00408.ogg"
    voice "se/z00408.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:16952
translate chinese map008_81c4e3e5:

    # char_jit_map008_1_0_111 "Whoa, that thing looks pretty cool.\nI heard a few stories, but didn't get to see it.\nYou'll have to tell me more as we head to Peregrino."
    char_jit_map008_1_0_111 "哇，那玩意儿看着真酷。\n我听过一些传闻，但一直没机会见着。\n等我们去佩雷格里诺的路上，你可得跟我多讲讲。"

# game/script.rpy:16979
translate chinese map008_567b3ff7:

    # voice "se/z00409.ogg"
    voice "se/z00409.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:16981
translate chinese map008_b552e555:

    # char_fortaime "Wait, hold on! I have a few questions to ask."
    char_fortaime "等等，先别走！我有几个问题要问。"

# game/script.rpy:17008
translate chinese map008_4acddf2f:

    # voice "se/z00410.ogg"
    voice "se/z00410.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:17010
translate chinese map008_2d6a36be:

    # char_jit_map008_1_0_111 "Oh sure. Let's walk and talk.\nIf I'm not mistaken, we're on a schedule."
    char_jit_map008_1_0_111 "哦，当然。咱们边走边聊。\n要是我没记错，我们时间挺紧的。"

# game/script.rpy:17031
translate chinese map008_ea067e8d:

    # "He points toward the gate leading out of Valinorth.\nFortaime speaks his mind as we start walking over."
    "他指向通往瓦利诺斯外面的那道门。\n我们开始往那边走，福泰姆说出了心里话。"

# game/script.rpy:17063
translate chinese map008_69a64363:

    # voice "se/z00411.ogg"
    voice "se/z00411.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:17065
translate chinese map008_630b49cb:

    # char_fortaime "So you know what's coming, right?\nI just need to make sure we're on the same page."
    char_fortaime "所以你知道要发生什么，对吧？\n我只是得确认我们想法一致。"

# game/script.rpy:17092
translate chinese map008_f955ed23:

    # voice "se/z00412.ogg"
    voice "se/z00412.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:17094
translate chinese map008_a3cc995e:

    # char_jit_map008_1_0_111 "Yeah. Unfortunately, I do.\nBut Mylus has a plan to keep everyone safe.\nAnd at the very least, we have a few days to prepare."
    char_jit_map008_1_0_111 "嗯。可惜，我知道。\n但迈勒斯有个保住大家安全的计划。\n至少，我们还有几天时间准备。"

# game/script.rpy:17121
translate chinese map008_7b5483ea:

    # voice "se/z00413.ogg"
    voice "se/z00413.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:17123
translate chinese map008_b9deec58:

    # char_fortaime "I'm confused though. He knew about this attack.\nAnd from what he said, he's known for a while.\nWhy give up Valinorth? Why not fortify and prepare?"
    char_fortaime "可我还是不明白。他早就知道这场袭击。\n而且按他说的，他知道有一阵子了。\n为什么要放弃瓦利诺斯？为什么不加固防御、做好准备？"

# game/script.rpy:17150
translate chinese map008_8fbab8ad:

    # voice "se/z00414.ogg"
    voice "se/z00414.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:17152
translate chinese map008_60b16f86:

    # char_jit_map008_1_0_111 "Actually, I heard something about that.\nDamek, the leader of the Rebels, had a vision.\nApparently, that blade is more than just a weapon."
    char_jit_map008_1_0_111 "其实，我听说过一些。\n反抗军的领袖达梅克看到了一个幻象。\n据说，那把剑不只是一件武器。"

# game/script.rpy:17179
translate chinese map008_7b3b6b91:

    # voice "se/z00415.ogg"
    voice "se/z00415.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:17181
translate chinese map008_c4123b19:

    # char_fortaime "Wait — other people can use it, then?"
    char_fortaime "等等——那别人也能用它？"

# game/script.rpy:17208
translate chinese map008_403e112d:

    # voice "se/z00416.ogg"
    voice "se/z00416.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:17210
translate chinese map008_ef004f34:

    # char_jit_map008_1_0_111 "No one else has tried, to be honest.\nBut in his vision, he saw The Triumvirate fall.\nThe cost was clear. Valinorth fell as well."
    char_jit_map008_1_0_111 "老实说，还没别人试过。\n但在他的幻象里，他看见三人执政团覆灭。\n代价很明确。瓦利诺斯也随之陷落。"

# game/script.rpy:17237
translate chinese map008_fa82fa23:

    # voice "se/z00417.ogg"
    voice "se/z00417.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:17239
translate chinese map008_00abc172:

    # char_valessa "Who says they {i}both{/i} need to happen?\nWe could take them down without abandoning Valinorth.\nIsn't a little short-sighted to do something like that?"
    char_valessa "谁说这{i}两件事{/i}都得发生？\n我们可以在不放弃瓦利诺斯的情况下扳倒他们。\n那样做是不是有点短视了？"

# game/script.rpy:17266
translate chinese map008_abf7619e:

    # voice "se/z00418.ogg"
    voice "se/z00418.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:17268
translate chinese map008_e298843e:

    # char_jit_map008_1_0_111 "We don't really know for sure, Valessa.\nBut it sure makes sense to replicate what he saw.\nThat way, The Rebellion's victory is guaranteed."
    char_jit_map008_1_0_111 "我们也不确定，瓦莱莎。\n但重现他所看到的，确实说得通。\n这样一来，反抗军的胜利就有了保障。"

# game/script.rpy:17283
translate chinese map008_ba9b1d67:

    # voice "se/z00419.ogg"
    voice "se/z00419.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:17285
translate chinese map008_54796989:

    # char_jit_map008_1_0_111 "Besides, Mylus will evacuate everyone that's willing.\nValinorth can be resettled in the future, I know it.\nI just worry about those who don't buy into this story."
    char_jit_map008_1_0_111 "再说，迈勒斯会疏散所有愿意走的人。\n将来瓦利诺斯还能重建，我确信。\n我只是担心那些不信这套说辞的人。"

# game/script.rpy:17312
translate chinese map008_ccb6835e:

    # voice "se/z00420.ogg"
    voice "se/z00420.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:17314
translate chinese map008_508159a5:

    # char_fortaime "What do you mean?"
    char_fortaime "你什么意思？"

# game/script.rpy:17341
translate chinese map008_2a11c7a4:

    # voice "se/z00421.ogg"
    voice "se/z00421.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:17343
translate chinese map008_d4d845a0:

    # char_jit_map008_1_0_111 "Well, some people will be stubborn.\nWe can't force them to leave. We just encourage it.\nThose that stay behind? Well, there's nothing we can do."
    char_jit_map008_1_0_111 "这个嘛，总有人会固执。\n我们不能强迫他们离开，只能劝。\n那些留下来的？唉，我们也没办法。"

# game/script.rpy:17371
translate chinese map008_69d3f35f:

    # voice "se/z00422.ogg"
    voice "se/z00422.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:17373
translate chinese map008_30d32d37:

    # char_valessa "That's true, and it lines up with the vision.\n[firstname] mentioned that lots of villagers perished.\nIsn't there something we can do to help them cooperate?"
    char_valessa "确实，这跟幻象对得上。\n[firstname]提到很多村民都死了。\n难道就没法让他们配合一下吗？"

# game/script.rpy:17380
translate chinese map008_3da0b717:

    # voice "se/z00423.ogg"
    voice "se/z00423.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:17382
translate chinese map008_30d32d37_1:

    # char_valessa "That's true, and it lines up with the vision.\n[firstname] mentioned that lots of villagers perished.\nIsn't there something we can do to help them cooperate?"
    char_valessa "确实，这跟幻象对得上。\n[firstname]提到很多村民都死了。\n难道就没法让他们配合一下吗？"

# game/script.rpy:17409
translate chinese map008_865b921a:

    # voice "se/z00424.ogg"
    voice "se/z00424.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:17411
translate chinese map008_9a093929:

    # char_jit_map008_1_0_111 "We should focus on ourselves, Valessa.\nThere's no point wasting time on something we can't change.\nLet's get away from these prying ears. I have some more news."
    char_jit_map008_1_0_111 "我们该顾好自己，瓦莱莎。\n在我们改变不了的事上浪费时间毫无意义。\n咱们避开这些爱打听的耳朵。我还有别的消息。"

# game/script.rpy:17432
translate chinese map008_66afc3b0:

    # "He smiles as we approach the exit of Valinorth.{w}\nNews? In our current situation, that doesn't sound promising.{w}\nBut with curiosity piqued, we follow Zamira with haste."
    "我们走近瓦利诺斯的出口时，他笑了。{w}\n消息？在如今的处境下，这听起来可不妙。{w}\n但好奇心被勾了起来，我们匆匆跟上扎米拉。"

# game/script.rpy:17436
translate chinese map008_805db909:

    # "You are about to visit the Valinorth Region map.{w}\nStory flow of the areas is the same as before.{w}\nHowever, you now have access to optional side areas.{w}\nThese are indicated by a Question Mark near the map icon."
    "你即将进入瓦利诺斯地区地图。{w}\n各区域的剧情流程与之前相同。{w}\n不过你现在可以使用可选的支线区域。{w}\n它们由地图图标旁的问号标示。"

# game/script.rpy:17719
translate chinese click_map009_13_EV013_28a25991:

    # "You chose to play along with Damek, and convert Peregrino into a barracks."
    "你选择配合达梅克，把佩雷格里诺改建成兵营。"

# game/script.rpy:17726
translate chinese click_map009_13_EV013_9a053f54:

    # "You chose to keep Peregrino intact, remaining as a tavern."
    "你选择保留佩雷格里诺的原貌，让它继续做一间酒馆。"

# game/script.rpy:17738
translate chinese click_map009_14_EV014_de6d0125:

    # "You elected Fortaime as the Elder of Valinorth."
    "你推选福泰姆为瓦利诺斯的长老。"

# game/script.rpy:17745
translate chinese click_map009_14_EV014_8bce3143:

    # "You elected Valessa as the Elder of Valinorth."
    "你推选瓦莱莎为瓦利诺斯的长老。"

# game/script.rpy:17804
translate chinese map020_a45cbee3:

    # "Taking a small detour, we decide to check out Eastcrown.{w}\nThe cold is overwhelming, so we huddle by the torchlight."
    "我们稍微绕了点路，决定去东冠看看。{w}\n寒冷逼人，我们挤在火把旁取暖。"

# game/script.rpy:17833
translate chinese map020_98e3bcf0:

    # voice "se/z00457.ogg"
    voice "se/z00457.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:17835
translate chinese map020_fcd276e6:

    # char_fortaime "Oh my gosh, this is intense...!\nI've heard the stories, but I thought they were exaggerating.\nWe shouldn't stay here too long. I feel like I'm gonna die."
    char_fortaime "我的天，这也太厉害了……！\n我听过那些传闻，还以为是在夸张。\n我们不该在这儿待太久。我感觉自己要死了。"

# game/script.rpy:17862
translate chinese map020_7bd2c8bb:

    # voice "se/z00458.ogg"
    voice "se/z00458.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:17864
translate chinese map020_a4282f31:

    # char_valessa "Oh, Fortaime. Don't be so dramatic.\nI'm sure we have time to examine the area.\nJust don't go in any further, alright?"
    char_valessa "哦，福泰姆。别这么夸张。\n我相信我们有时间查看这片区域。\n只是别再往里走了，好吗？"

# game/script.rpy:17891
translate chinese map020_e1c4771c:

    # voice "se/z00459.ogg"
    voice "se/z00459.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:17893
translate chinese map020_c4c488c2:

    # char_fortaime "Yeah, I guess so. Sorry.\nLook, I can see my breath! How cool is that?"
    char_fortaime "嗯，大概吧。抱歉。\n看，我能看见自己呼出的白气！多酷啊？"

# game/script.rpy:17920
translate chinese map020_a68d79d6:

    # voice "se/z00460.ogg"
    voice "se/z00460.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:17922
translate chinese map020_8e6cd9bd:

    # char_valessa "I'll admit, that {i}is{/i} pretty cool.\nBarely out of Valinorth, and already seeing new stuff.\nI'm guessing it has something to do with the cold."
    char_valessa "我承认，那{i}确实{/i}挺酷的。\n刚出瓦利诺斯，就见到新鲜事了。\n我猜这跟寒冷有关。"

# game/script.rpy:17949
translate chinese map020_6ed776ac:

    # voice "se/z00461.ogg"
    voice "se/z00461.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:17951
translate chinese map020_c1cb1ea8:

    # char_fortaime "It's insane..."
    char_fortaime "太疯狂了……"

# game/script.rpy:17966
translate chinese map020_f2df2c69:

    # voice "se/z00462.ogg"
    voice "se/z00462.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:17968
translate chinese map020_efbcafc4:

    # char_fortaime "I can't believe how much the spirits help us!\nWithout their power, this is what Valinorth would look like.\nThey keep us warm, and let our village fight off the cold."
    char_fortaime "真不敢相信灵体帮了我们这么多！\n没有它们的力量，瓦利诺斯就会变成这个样子。\n它们为我们保暖，让我们的村庄抵御严寒。"

# game/script.rpy:17995
translate chinese map020_56bae108:

    # voice "se/z00463.ogg"
    voice "se/z00463.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:17997
translate chinese map020_3cde94a0:

    # char_valessa "If Mylus is right, then this {i}is{/i} Valinorth's future.\nIt's only setting in now that I see it for myself.\nThere must be something we can do to save our village."
    char_valessa "如果迈勒斯说得对，那这{i}就是{/i}瓦利诺斯的未来。\n亲眼所见，这感觉才刚刚沉到我心里。\n一定有什么办法能拯救我们的村庄。"

# game/script.rpy:18024
translate chinese map020_c6f8c964:

    # voice "se/z00464.ogg"
    voice "se/z00464.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:18026
translate chinese map020_6599775e:

    # char_fortaime "I sure hope so.\nLet's take a quick look around.\nIt'd be dangerous to stay here for too long."
    char_fortaime "但愿如此。\n我们快点四处看看吧。\n在这儿待太久会很危险。"

# game/script.rpy:18047
translate chinese map020_5500d771:

    # "He inches closer to the torch, to keep himself warm.{w}\nValessa and I don't seem too bothered, and start looking around."
    "他一点点挪近火把，好让自己暖和点。{w}\n我和瓦莱莎好像不太受影响，开始四处查看。"

# game/script.rpy:18340
translate chinese click_map013_4_EV004_0f64195f:

    # "Valessa and Fortaime are huddled beside the torch.{w}\nTruth be told, I was cold as well. This place is intense.{w}\nI finally understand why it's remained unmapped for so long."
    "瓦莱莎和福泰姆挤在火把旁边。{w}\n说实话，我也冷。这地方太严酷了。{w}\n我终于明白为什么它这么久都没被测绘过。"

# game/script.rpy:18343
translate chinese click_map013_4_EV004_cc8d45ee:

    # voice "se/a00048.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "Hey, move it Valessa! You're hogging all the heat!"
    voice "se/a00048.ogg"
    char_fortaime "喂，挪挪，瓦莱莎！你把热气全霸占了！"

# game/script.rpy:18347
translate chinese click_map013_4_EV004_ac91eee2:

    # voice "se/a00049.ogg"
    # char_valessa "No way! Your outfit is {i}much{/i} warmer than mine!"
    voice "se/a00049.ogg"
    char_valessa "才不！你的衣服比我{i}暖和{/i}多了！"

# game/script.rpy:18351
translate chinese click_map013_4_EV004_c3c0ed17:

    # voice "se/a00050.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "It doesn't matter! Do you want me to die or something!?"
    voice "se/a00050.ogg"
    char_fortaime "那又怎样！你想看我死吗！？"

# game/script.rpy:18355
translate chinese click_map013_4_EV004_c9776f13:

    # voice "se/a00051.ogg"
    # char_valessa "Are you sure you want the answer to that question?"
    voice "se/a00051.ogg"
    char_valessa "你确定你想知道这个问题的答案吗？"

# game/script.rpy:18359
translate chinese click_map013_4_EV004_df80d577:

    # voice "se/a00052.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "What!?"
    voice "se/a00052.ogg"
    char_fortaime "什么！？"

# game/script.rpy:18362
translate chinese click_map013_4_EV004_cbade806:

    # "They continue arguing as I walk away from the torch.{w}\nWe probably shouldn't spend too much time in Eastcrown.{w}\nWe have a long journey ahead, we can't succumb to the cold."
    "我离开火把时，他们还在吵。{w}\n我们大概不该在东冠待太久。{w}\n前路漫漫，我们不能被寒冷击垮。"

# game/script.rpy:18400
translate chinese click_map013_6_EV006_00a0b6fc:

    # voice "se/Book10.ogg"
    voice "se/Book10.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:18435
translate chinese click_map013_7_EV007_2219c876:

    # "It looks like they didn't make it."
    "看来他们没能挺过来。"

# game/script.rpy:18460
translate chinese click_map013_7_EV007_00a0b6fc:

    # voice "se/Book10.ogg"
    voice "se/Book10.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:18495
translate chinese click_map013_7_EV007_ab3499b1:

    # "I notice a book on the ground, slightly covered in snow.{w}\nI'm not sure why it's there, but I decide to take a look.{w}\nAny information about Eastcrown would be helpful to us."
    "我注意到地上有本书，微微覆着雪。{w}\n我不确定它为什么在那里，但决定看看。{w}\n任何关于东冠的信息对我们都有用。"

# game/script.rpy:18498
translate chinese click_map013_7_EV007_da9d45ba:

    # voice "se/a00053.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "Hey, are you sure you should be taking that?"
    voice "se/a00053.ogg"
    char_fortaime "嘿，你确定该拿那个吗？"

# game/script.rpy:18502
translate chinese click_map013_7_EV007_52404f11:

    # voice "se/a00054.ogg"
    # char_valessa "It was covered in snow, Fortaime.\nWhoever owned it probably forgot about it already.\nBesides, it might contain some useful information."
    voice "se/a00054.ogg"
    char_valessa "它都埋在雪里了，福泰姆。\n它的主人大概早把它忘了。\n再说，里面说不定有有用的信息。"

# game/script.rpy:18506
translate chinese click_map013_7_EV007_aebd66ae:

    # voice "se/a00055.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "I guess you're right. \nBut at least put it back when you're done with it.\nI don't want to get in trouble if the owner {i}does{/i} come looking."
    voice "se/a00055.ogg"
    char_fortaime "你说得大概没错。\n但至少看完了放回去。\n万一{i}真{/i}有主人来找，我可不想惹麻烦。"

# game/script.rpy:18512
translate chinese click_map013_7_EV007_42571728:

    # voice "se/a00056.ogg"
    voice "se/a00056.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:18514
translate chinese click_map013_7_EV007_e26b513b:

    # char_valessa "Alright, you have a deal.\nSo, [firstname]; what does it say?"
    char_valessa "好，就这么定了。\n那么，[firstname]；上面写的什么？"

# game/script.rpy:18519
translate chinese click_map013_7_EV007_d2fa88cd:

    # voice "se/a00057.ogg"
    voice "se/a00057.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:18521
translate chinese click_map013_7_EV007_e26b513b_1:

    # char_valessa "Alright, you have a deal.\nSo, [firstname]; what does it say?"
    char_valessa "好，就这么定了。\n那么，[firstname]；上面写的什么？"

# game/script.rpy:18546
translate chinese click_map013_7_EV007_00a0b6fc_1:

    # voice "se/Book10.ogg"
    voice "se/Book10.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:18610
translate chinese click_map013_26_EV026_e7b93957:

    # "Cannot access content at this time.\nIf there is an X, you must complete preceding Heart-to-Hearts.\nIf there is a checkmark, you must move on to the next Heart-to-Heart."
    "目前无法访问此内容。\n若显示叉号，你必须先完成前置的心灵对话。\n若显示对勾，你必须前往下一个心灵对话。"

# game/script.rpy:18635
translate chinese click_map013_27_EV027_2e6056e0:

    # "The mountains go up so high, it's amazing.{w}\nIt's a shame that nobody will ever reach the top.{w}\nMaybe we aren't meant to find out Eastcrown's secrets."
    "山峰高耸入云，蔚为壮观。{w}\n可惜没人能登上峰顶。{w}\n也许我们注定无法揭开东冠的秘密。"

# game/script.rpy:18672
translate chinese click_map013_47_EV047_f294f722:

    # "There's a flag here, but I'm not sure what it signifies.{w}\nPerhaps somebody made it that far before giving up.{w}\nI don't blame them, I'm already wanting to leave."
    "这里插着一面旗，但我不确定它代表什么。{w}\n也许有人走到这里就放弃了。{w}\n我不怪他们，我已经想离开了。"

# game/script.rpy:18709
translate chinese click_map013_51_EV051_019cfba8:

    # "I take a few steps down the trail, but immediately turn back.{w}\nIt actually hurts to breathe. I didn't know nature could be so hostile.{w}\nI shrug, and turn back to my friends. We may never know Eastcrown's secrets."
    "我沿着小径往下走了几步，立刻又折了回来。{w}\n连呼吸都疼。我没想到大自然能如此凶险。{w}\n我耸耸肩，转回朋友们身边。也许我们永远无法知晓东冠的秘密。"

# game/script.rpy:18748
translate chinese map229_04471c3b:

    # "I look off into the distance, already shivering at the extreme cold.{w}\nI wanted to visit home one time before the end, and that included Eastcrown.{w}\nWe never got to find out what was out there. I start to wonder if we ever will."
    "我眺望远方，极寒已让我瑟瑟发抖。{w}\n我本想在这结束前回一次家，其中就包括东冠。{w}\n我们始终没能查明那里有什么。我开始怀疑，我们是否还能有机会。"

# game/script.rpy:18750
translate chinese map229_ba6ed428:

    # "Not that it's even important.{w}\nIt has nothing to do with our goal, or our cause.{w}\nIt's just a mystery — one of many left unsolved."
    "倒不是说这有多重要。{w}\n它跟我们的目标、我们的事业毫无关系。{w}\n它只是个谜——众多未解之谜中的一个。"

# game/script.rpy:18752
translate chinese map229_6ece5663:

    # "Howl approaches me from behind, and looks into Eastcrown.{w}\nHe seems perplexed, like not even he really knows what's over there.{w}\nIt makes sense. I doubt The Old Monarchy had the ability to survive the cold."
    "豪尔从身后走近我，望向东冠。{w}\n他似乎很困惑，好像连他也不清楚那边有什么。{w}\n这说得通。我怀疑旧王室没有能力在这严寒中存活。"

# game/script.rpy:18777
translate chinese map229_97eeb5fd:

    # voice "se/y01853.ogg"
    voice "se/y01853.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:18780
translate chinese map229_6abaeb23:

    # char_howl "We know this place. "
    char_howl "我们知道这地方。"

# game/script.rpy:18794
translate chinese map229_b91997e0:

    # "He holds out his hand, feeling the harsh winds."
    "他伸出手，感受凛冽的寒风。"

# game/script.rpy:18819
translate chinese map229_cdcf7682:

    # voice "se/y01853a.ogg"
    # char_howl "The fatal cold — death within an hour.\nNo chance of survival. Not like Alarinthia's deserts.\nWe let criminals handle their own end. A mercy."
    voice "se/y01853a.ogg"
    char_howl "致命的严寒——一小时内便丧命。\n毫无生还可能。跟阿拉林西亚的沙漠不一样。\n我们让罪犯自行了断。是一种恩慈。"

# game/script.rpy:18823
translate chinese map229_fbe3b2d2:

    # voice "se/y01853b.ogg"
    # char_howl "Because of this, it became a very mysterious place.\nWe started to wonder what was out there — if anything.\nHowever, until now, we had no way of finding out. Hmm."
    voice "se/y01853b.ogg"
    char_howl "正因如此，它成了一个非常神秘的地方。\n我们开始好奇那边有什么——如果有的话。\n然而直到现在，我们都无从得知。唔。"

# game/script.rpy:18838
translate chinese map229_2e0b11a4:

    # "Until now...?"
    "直到现在……？"

# game/script.rpy:18863
translate chinese map229_bd74f68a:

    # voice "se/y01854.ogg"
    # char_howl "This cold. We feel nothing.\nIt wouldn't harm us to venture forward.\nPerhaps now is the time to solve this mystery."
    voice "se/y01854.ogg"
    char_howl "这种寒冷。我们毫无感觉。\n往前探一探对我们并无大碍。\n也许现在是解开这个谜团的时候了。"

# game/script.rpy:18867
translate chinese map229_fbc18d9f:

    # voice "se/y01855.ogg"
    # char_howl "How fitting that we would be the first.\nA monument to death. An execution ground.\nMonarch. We would like to take a brief break."
    voice "se/y01855.ogg"
    char_howl "由我们来做第一个，再合适不过。\n一座死亡的纪念碑。一片刑场。\n君主。我们想稍作休息。"

# game/script.rpy:18882
translate chinese map229_436df7e2:

    # "How does he know for sure that he can survive...?{w}\nHe may not feel anything, but the body could still freeze."
    "他怎么能确定自己一定能活下来……？{w}\n他也许感觉不到什么，但身体照样会冻僵。"

# game/script.rpy:18907
translate chinese map229_8c2c4135:

    # voice "se/y01856.ogg"
    # char_howl "Unlikely. We would be shielded by our spirits.\nThey may die, one by one, but we would endure.\nAt the end of it, we would remain largely unchanged."
    voice "se/y01856.ogg"
    char_howl "不太可能。我们的灵体护卫着我们。\n它们也许会一个接一个地消亡，但我们会撑住。\n到最后，我们大体上仍会保持不变。"

# game/script.rpy:18921
translate chinese map229_9aa85fc9:

    # voice "se/y01857.ogg"
    # char_howl "Besides, we were not asking for permission.\nDo you not share the same curiosity as us...?" nointeract
    voice "se/y01857.ogg"
    char_howl "再说，我们并不是在征求许可。\n你难道没有和我们一样的好奇心吗……？" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:18927
translate chinese map229_3ed17adb:

    # voice "se/y01858.ogg"
    # char_howl "Interesting. Perhaps you are better than us.\nWe are not surprised, given the role you play.\nIf there is anything of note, however, we will tell."
    voice "se/y01858.ogg"
    char_howl "有意思。也许你比我们更强。\n考虑到你扮演的角色，我们并不意外。\n不过，若有什么值得注意的，我们会告诉你。"

# game/script.rpy:18933
translate chinese map229_9ecc3242:

    # voice "se/y01859.ogg"
    # char_howl "We thought so, too. Something about great minds.\nPerhaps there will be nothing. Or perhaps not.\nIt is something we will never know until we try."
    voice "se/y01859.ogg"
    char_howl "我们也这么想。所谓英雄所见略同。\n也许什么都没有。也许不然。\n这事不试就永远不会知道。"

# game/script.rpy:18950
translate chinese map229_e334f91b:

    # "He takes a few steps forward, and looks down at the ground."
    "他向前走了几步，低头看着地面。"

# game/script.rpy:18975
translate chinese map229_1e8f490f:

    # voice "se/y01860.ogg"
    # char_howl "Already, we can feel our power dwindling.\nThe spirits inside come forth to keep us warm.\nWe will hurry, and return with minimal damage."
    voice "se/y01860.ogg"
    char_howl "我们已经能感觉到力量在衰减。\n体内的灵体涌出来为我们保暖。\n我们会快点，尽量少受损伤地回来。"

# game/script.rpy:18997
translate chinese map229_4a0c15b0:

    # "He starts walking away, powered by his curiosity.{w}\nI guess he couldn't resist solving a mystery of the world.{w}\nI don't blame him. He was also uniquely qualified to do so."
    "他凭着好奇心，迈步走远。{w}\n我想他就是忍不住要去解开世界的一个谜团。{w}\n我不怪他。而且他也确实有独一无二的资格这么做。"

# game/script.rpy:19003
translate chinese map229_627272df:

    # "There must be something important inside Eastcrown.{w}\nIt was too mysterious. There had to be something there.{w}\nAnd now, we'd finally find that out. It was rather exciting."
    "东冠之内一定有什么重要的东西。{w}\n它太神秘了。那里一定藏着什么。{w}\n而现在，我们终于要弄清楚了。真让人兴奋。"

# game/script.rpy:19007
translate chinese map229_c87bd0e8:

    # "There was probably nothing of note in Eastcrown.{w}\nIt was mysterious because we made it that way.{w}\nIt's nothing. Just the top of a mountain."
    "东冠里大概没什么值得注意的东西。{w}\n它之所以神秘，是因为我们自己把它想得神秘。{w}\n没什么。不过是一座山的山顶。"

# game/script.rpy:19011
translate chinese map229_08050a21:

    # "I hold those thoughts in my mind until Howl returns.{w}\nHe shows no signs of wear, and walks as strong as ever.{w}\nIt's hard to get a read on his face. There's no emotion on display."
    "我抱着这些念头，直到豪尔回来。{w}\n他看不出一点疲态，步伐一如既往地稳健。{w}\n他的表情很难读懂。脸上不显任何情绪。"

# game/script.rpy:19036
translate chinese map229_245a600c:

    # voice "se/y01861.ogg"
    voice "se/y01861.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:19038
translate chinese map229_dd612345:

    # char_howl "We don't understand.\nFor a while, there was nothing.\nBut then — we saw something interesting."
    char_howl "我们不明白。\n有好一阵子，什么都没有。\n可后来——我们看到了点有意思的东西。"

# game/script.rpy:19052
translate chinese map229_7a629a00:

    # "I ask him to elaborate — my curiosity taking control."
    "我让他说详细点——好奇心主宰了我。"

# game/script.rpy:19077
translate chinese map229_c486e193:

    # voice "se/y01862.ogg"
    # char_howl "Eastcrown is ice. There's no water anywhere.\nIt doesn't make any sense. We saw a ship.\nCrashed, broken. Frozen among the ice."
    voice "se/y01862.ogg"
    char_howl "东冠全是冰。哪儿都没有水。\n这说不通。我们看见了一艘船。\n撞毁了，破碎了。冻结在冰层之中。"

# game/script.rpy:19091
translate chinese map229_4e43a005:

    # voice "se/y01863.ogg"
    # char_howl "A ship — sailing in ice. This is backwards.\nBut we think that perhaps this is okay.\nBackwards. Just like our thoughts."
    voice "se/y01863.ogg"
    char_howl "一艘船——在冰上航行。这是反过来的。\n但我们觉得，也许这没什么。\n反过来。就像我们的思维一样。"

# game/script.rpy:19106
translate chinese map229_ec1ebab7:

    # "Now he's lost me..."
    "这下我听不明白了……"

# game/script.rpy:19121
translate chinese map229_f74d6535:

    # voice "se/y01864.ogg"
    # char_howl "The future...? Or perhaps the past.\nThis new outlook changes almost everything.\nDo not worry, [firstname]. We were harmed in no way."
    voice "se/y01864.ogg"
    char_howl "未来……？又或者是过去。\n这个新视角几乎改变了一切。\n别担心，[firstname]。我们没有受到任何伤害。"

# game/script.rpy:19135
translate chinese map229_425438d0:

    # voice "se/y01865.ogg"
    # char_howl "As we said, the spirits inside kept us warm.\nA self-sacrifice that helped us brave the cold. A noble end.\nWe are lesser now, but only slightly; and it is an interesting feeling."
    voice "se/y01865.ogg"
    char_howl "如我们所说，体内的灵体为我们保暖。\n这是帮我们抵御严寒的自我牺牲。一种高贵的终结。\n我们现在虚弱了些，但只是略微；这感觉挺有意思。"

# game/script.rpy:19139
translate chinese map229_a8fd5e93:

    # voice "se/y01866.ogg"
    # char_howl "What we saw in Eastcrown is of no real importance.\nHowever, it has conjured up a spark in our minds.\nA spark that we must discuss promptly in Mazeo."
    voice "se/y01866.ogg"
    char_howl "我们在东冠看到的东西其实无关紧要。\n不过，它在我们的脑海中激起了一点火花。\n这火花，我们必须尽快到马泽奥去商议。"

# game/script.rpy:19153
translate chinese map229_e085acdb:

    # voice "se/y01867.ogg"
    # char_howl "There are some final matters to take care of before the end.\nThank you for coming here, [firstname]. If anything, it benefits us.\nI'm sorry if this wasn't what you expected. But that's not always a bad thing."
    voice "se/y01867.ogg"
    char_howl "在结束之前，还有些最后的事要处理。\n谢谢你来到这里，[firstname]。无论如何，这对我们有好处。\n要是这不符你的期望，我很抱歉。但那也不总是坏事。"

# game/script.rpy:19175
translate chinese map229_121e9417:

    # "I nod. As long as he found some sort of benefit in his little trip.{w}\nBefore our final battle, everybody needed to be committed to the cause.{w}\nOne error, one slip-up could cost all of us our lives. We had to be resolute."
    "我点点头。只要他这趟小出行有所收获就好。{w}\n在最终之战前，每个人都必须全心投入这项事业。{w}\n一个失误、一次疏忽，都可能让我们所有人丧命。我们必须坚定。"

# game/script.rpy:19177
translate chinese map229_3f89dfd4:

    # "But I wonder what he could want to talk about so suddenly.{w}\nThe future? Thinking backwards? Something was definitely bothering him.{w}\nI'd have to do my duty as his leader to quell any worry before we launch our attack."
    "但我好奇，他突然想谈什么。{w}\n未来？反向思考？他心里一定有什么事困扰着。{w}\n身为他的领袖，我得尽本分，在发起进攻前消除一切顾虑。"

# game/script.rpy:19183
translate chinese map229_f2020f1a:

    # "Howl's loyalty scene is now available at the War Table in Mazeo.{w}\nClick his icon in order to access this scene and earn his loyalty."
    "豪尔的忠诚剧情现已在马泽奥的作战桌解锁。{w}\n点击他的图标即可进入该剧情，赢得他的忠诚。"

# game/script.rpy:19777
translate chinese map046_62987a80:

    # "It looks like something is bothering Fortaime.{w}\nI approach him, and decide to ask what's on his mind.{w}\nHe seems a little startled, like he was indeed lost in thought."
    "看来福泰姆有心事。{w}\n我走近他，决定问问他心里在想什么。{w}\n他似乎有点受惊，像是确实陷入了沉思。"

# game/script.rpy:19808
translate chinese map046_96f2d2e7:

    # voice "se/y00361.ogg"
    voice "se/y00361.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:19810
translate chinese map046_413936bc:

    # char_fortaime "Oh, hey there [firstname].\nWhat's wrong...? Nothing, really.\nI'm just thinking about, well, everything."
    char_fortaime "哦，你好啊，[firstname]。\n怎么了……？没什么，真的。\n我只是在想，呃，一切。"

# game/script.rpy:19815
translate chinese map046_1c25bc77:

    # voice "se/y00362.ogg"
    voice "se/y00362.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:19817
translate chinese map046_413936bc_1:

    # char_fortaime "Oh, hey there [firstname].\nWhat's wrong...? Nothing, really.\nI'm just thinking about, well, everything."
    char_fortaime "哦，你好啊，[firstname]。\n怎么了……？没什么，真的。\n我只是在想，呃，一切。"

# game/script.rpy:19831
translate chinese map046_9066884a:

    # voice "se/y00363.ogg"
    voice "se/y00363.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:19833
translate chinese map046_705972d3:

    # char_fortaime "This will be the last time we see Peregrino.\nWhen and if we come back, it'll be a barracks.\nI know that's what I wanted, but I had fun here."
    char_fortaime "这将是我们最后一次看到佩雷格里诺。\n等我们回来时，它会变成兵营。\n我知道这是我想要的，但我在这儿过得很开心。"

# game/script.rpy:19836
translate chinese map046_a3ead29a:

    # voice "se/y00364.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "I'm just thinking about the future a lot..."
    voice "se/y00364.ogg"
    char_fortaime "我只是思虑未来想得太多了……"

# game/script.rpy:19851
translate chinese map046_4aef2438:

    # voice "se/y00365.ogg"
    voice "se/y00365.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:19853
translate chinese map046_bb75e0a7:

    # char_fortaime "I got a good sleep last night, so that helped.\nBetter than being restless and alone with my thoughts.\nI'm just thinking about the future a lot right now."
    char_fortaime "我昨晚睡了个好觉，所以好多了。\n总比辗转反侧、独自胡思乱想强。\n我现在只是思虑未来想得太多了。"

# game/script.rpy:19867
translate chinese map046_c2b60210:

    # voice "se/y00366.ogg"
    voice "se/y00366.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:19869
translate chinese map046_78619928:

    # char_fortaime "I gotta figure out how to make you proud. As Elder, I mean.\nJust give me some time to figure stuff out — then I'll shine.\nIt's not like I can fully adapt to being our leader in one night."
    char_fortaime "我得想办法让你为我骄傲。我是说，作为长老。\n给我点时间理清头绪——然后我就会大放异彩。\n我总不能一夜之间就完全适应当我们的领袖。"

# game/script.rpy:19883
translate chinese map046_e3163080:

    # voice "se/y00367.ogg"
    voice "se/y00367.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:19885
translate chinese map046_6c55d0f0:

    # char_fortaime "Most importantly, it's Valinorth's future that concerns me.\nWe know what Valessa wants to do as Elder, but I'm worried.\nI've read that nations fall due to a leader's stubborn nature."
    char_fortaime "最重要的是，我担心的是瓦利诺斯的未来。\n我们知道瓦莱莎当长老后想怎么做，可我很担心。\n我读到过，国家会因领袖的固执而衰亡。"

# game/script.rpy:19888
translate chinese map046_4b9c1c38:

    # voice "se/y00368.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "I'd rather see Valinorth live alongside the other nations.\nIt's a lot preferable to the concept of dying alone.\nI think it's just time to turn some pages, you know?"
    voice "se/y00368.ogg"
    char_fortaime "我更希望看到瓦利诺斯与其他国家共存。\n这比独自消亡的结局强多了。\n我觉得是时候翻篇了，你懂吗？"

# game/script.rpy:19898
translate chinese map046_8c535f94:

    # "He gives me a nervous laugh, before shuffling awkwardly.{w}\nThere's something else on his mind. I can tell.{w}\nBut it's not my place to pry, so I wait for him to speak."
    "他冲我紧张地笑了笑，然后局促地挪了挪身子。{w}\n他还有别的心事。我看得出来。{w}\n但轮不到我刨根问底，于是我等着他开口。"

# game/script.rpy:19917
translate chinese map046_7fc2a2db:

    # voice "se/y00369.ogg"
    voice "se/y00369.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:19919
translate chinese map046_1ae1f899:

    # char_fortaime "Thanks for letting me sleep here with you, by the way.\nIt helped me process things in my head a little bit more.\nIf it weren't for that, I would've been too scared to think."
    char_fortaime "对了，谢谢你让我在这儿跟你一起睡。\n这帮我多梳理了一下脑子里的事。\n要不是这样，我早就吓得没法思考了。"

# game/script.rpy:19922
translate chinese map046_de05e04a:

    # voice "se/y00370.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "Like — what if they attacked in the middle of the night?\nWe all know they'd have to pass by Peregrino first.\nI was honestly scared we might die here last night."
    voice "se/y00370.ogg"
    char_fortaime "比如——要是他们半夜来袭怎么办？\n我们都知道他们得先经过佩雷格里诺。\n老实说，昨晚我真怕我们会死在这儿。"

# game/script.rpy:19939
translate chinese map046_19623cae:

    # voice "se/y00371.ogg"
    voice "se/y00371.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:19941
translate chinese map046_3915e632:

    # char_fortaime "So yeah — thanks a million.\nBut there's one more thing I want to say.\nLast night, I had a really bad dream..."
    char_fortaime "所以——太谢谢你了。\n不过还有件事我想说。\n昨晚，我做了个很可怕的梦……"

# game/script.rpy:19958
translate chinese map046_7db4c7ad:

    # voice "se/y00372.ogg"
    voice "se/y00372.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:19960
translate chinese map046_23f628ae:

    # char_fortaime "I know I look pretty well rested, but I'm not.\nThis is pretty embarrassing for me to say, so don't laugh.\nLast night — I had a really bad dream. I almost cried."
    char_fortaime "我知道我看起来休息得不错，其实没有。\n说这话挺让我难为情的，别笑。\n昨晚——我做了个很可怕的梦。我差点哭出来。"

# game/script.rpy:19977
translate chinese map046_c6b4f8bc:

    # voice "se/y00373.ogg"
    voice "se/y00373.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:19979
translate chinese map046_3d078a66:

    # char_fortaime "We were making our way down toward Mazeo.\nBut we weren't with Pro and Ulric. It was our parents.\nI kept telling them not to go. I knew they wouldn't come back."
    char_fortaime "我们正朝着马泽奥的方向走。\n但同行的人不是普洛和乌尔里克。而是我们的父母。\n我一直叫他们别去。我知道他们不会回来了。"

# game/script.rpy:19988
translate chinese map046_1d081b55:

    # "He clenches his fists, and trembles slightly."
    "他攥紧拳头，微微颤抖。"

# game/script.rpy:19997
translate chinese map046_1265063b:

    # voice "se/y00374.ogg"
    voice "se/y00374.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:19999
translate chinese map046_9d307ce5:

    # char_fortaime "But they didn't listen. They just kept going.\nI ran until my legs could barely move. Then I ran even more.\nIt actually felt like I could save them, if I only tried."
    char_fortaime "可他们不听。他们就那样一路往前走。\n我跑到双腿几乎动弹不得。然后又接着跑。\n那种感觉就像是，只要我肯努力，就真能救下他们。"

# game/script.rpy:20002
translate chinese map046_5b31b56d:

    # voice "se/y00375.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "Eventually, we made it to the gates of Mazeo.\nOr at least I think they were. I've never actually been there.\nBut this is the worst part. They finally turned to face us."
    voice "se/y00375.ogg"
    char_fortaime "最后，我们到了马泽奥的城门前。\n至少我觉得那是城门。我从没真正去过那儿。\n但这还不是最糟的。他们终于转过身来面对我们。"

# game/script.rpy:20017
translate chinese map046_44dd4899:

    # voice "se/y00376.ogg"
    voice "se/y00376.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:20019
translate chinese map046_4b023e8a:

    # char_fortaime "And that's when I realized something shocking...\nI don't remember what my parents look like, [firstname].\nTheir faces were a blur, almost like they were nobody."
    char_fortaime "就在那时，我意识到一件令人震惊的事……\n我不记得我父母长什么样了，[firstname]。\n他们的脸一片模糊，简直就像无名之辈。"

# game/script.rpy:20024
translate chinese map046_e5ced8a2:

    # voice "se/y00377.ogg"
    voice "se/y00377.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:20026
translate chinese map046_4b023e8a_1:

    # char_fortaime "And that's when I realized something shocking...\nI don't remember what my parents look like, [firstname].\nTheir faces were a blur, almost like they were nobody."
    char_fortaime "就在那时，我意识到一件令人震惊的事……\n我不记得我父母长什么样了，[firstname]。\n他们的脸一片模糊，简直就像无名之辈。"

# game/script.rpy:20039
translate chinese map046_d48c3789:

    # voice "se/y00378.ogg"
    voice "se/y00378.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:20041
translate chinese map046_e5adcaf4:

    # char_fortaime "They started to speak, but I didn't recognize their voices.\nHas it been so long that I'm forgetting my own parents...?\nI tried so hard to picture them when I woke up. I couldn't."
    char_fortaime "他们开口说话，可我认不出他们的声音。\n是过了太久，我连自己的父母都要忘了吗……？\n醒来后我拼命想回忆起他们的模样。却怎么也做不到。"

# game/script.rpy:20046
translate chinese map046_a7203af8:

    # voice "se/y00379.ogg"
    voice "se/y00379.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:20048
translate chinese map046_97d82567:

    # char_fortaime "When they died, everyone told me they weren't really gone.\nThat they'd live on forever — inside of my memory.\nBut even that's fading, [firstname]. What happens next...?"
    char_fortaime "他们去世时，所有人都说他们并没有真正离开。\n说他们会永远活着——活在我的记忆里。\n可连那也在消退，[firstname]。接下来又会怎样……？"

# game/script.rpy:20053
translate chinese map046_fba7f279:

    # voice "se/y00380.ogg"
    voice "se/y00380.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:20055
translate chinese map046_97d82567_1:

    # char_fortaime "When they died, everyone told me they weren't really gone.\nThat they'd live on forever — inside of my memory.\nBut even that's fading, [firstname]. What happens next...?"
    char_fortaime "他们去世时，所有人都说他们并没有真正离开。\n说他们会永远活着——活在我的记忆里。\n可连那也在消退，[firstname]。接下来又会怎样……？"

# game/script.rpy:20060
translate chinese map046_bb9fc047:

    # voice "se/y00381.ogg"
    voice "se/y00381.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:20062
translate chinese map046_2ddffff0:

    # char_fortaime "Back at the Grand Tree, we shared a common goal.\nWe wanted to fight The Triumvirate to avenge our parents.\nBut this dream was sort of a wake up call, you know...?"
    char_fortaime "在巨树那儿时，我们有个共同的目标。\n我们想对抗三人执政团，为父母报仇。\n但这个梦有点像一记当头棒喝，你懂吗……？"

# game/script.rpy:20067
translate chinese map046_bbb17c99:

    # voice "se/y00382.ogg"
    voice "se/y00382.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:20069
translate chinese map046_519e3922:

    # char_fortaime "Back at the Grand Tree, I said I wanted vengeance.\nI wanted to take down The Triumvirate to avenge our parents.\nBut this dream was kind of like a wake up call, you know...?"
    char_fortaime "在巨树那儿时，我说我想要复仇。\n我想打倒三人执政团，为父母报仇。\n但这个梦有点像一记当头棒喝，你懂吗……？"

# game/script.rpy:20082
translate chinese map046_5f7276ae:

    # voice "se/y00383.ogg"
    voice "se/y00383.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:20084
translate chinese map046_ef20cbe8:

    # char_fortaime "Why should I fight for something that doesn't exist?\nAnd better yet — something I can't even picture in my head.\nThere are so many reasons to fight, all of them less selfish."
    char_fortaime "我为什么要为一个并不存在的东西而战？\n更不用说——一个我连想都想象不出来的东西。\n战斗的理由多得是，每一个都没那么自私。"

# game/script.rpy:20097
translate chinese map046_d6e6290e:

    # voice "se/y00384.ogg"
    voice "se/y00384.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:20099
translate chinese map046_c3a4797f:

    # char_fortaime "So I think I want to fight for {i}you{/i}.\nI want to make sure that you're safe, and you survive this.\nWhen it comes to you, the entirety of Alestia is at stake."
    char_fortaime "所以我想，我要为{i}你{/i}而战。\n我要确保你平安，确保你挺过这一切。\n涉及到你，整个阿莱斯蒂亚都攸关安危。"

# game/script.rpy:20108
translate chinese map046_9704aa24:

    # "He continues to tremble, and I can tell he's fighting back tears.{w}\nIt's almost like this dream is helping him move on from his parents.{w}\nHe's becoming more grounded in reality — in the here and now."
    "他仍在颤抖，我看得出他在强忍泪水。{w}\n这个梦几乎像是在帮他走出父母离世的阴影。{w}\n他正变得越发脚踏实地——活在此时此刻。"

# game/script.rpy:20118
translate chinese map046_5c3afa86:

    # "I take a few steps forward, and wrap my arms around him.{w}\nHe gasps in surprise, and I notice his trembling come to a halt.{w}\nA few moments later, I feel his arms return the hug, squeezing tight."
    "我向前走几步，张开双臂抱住他。{w}\n他惊讶地吸了口气，我注意到他的颤抖停了下来。{w}\n片刻之后，我感觉到他的手臂回抱住我，紧紧收紧。"

# game/script.rpy:20127
translate chinese map046_023e0713:

    # voice "se/y00385.ogg"
    voice "se/y00385.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:20129
translate chinese map046_227e6bc3:

    # char_fortaime "I just miss them so much..."
    char_fortaime "我只是太想他们了……"

# game/script.rpy:20138
translate chinese map046_7da59578:

    # "He sniffles softly, like he overcame his imminent tears."
    "他轻轻抽了抽鼻子，像是忍住了即将夺眶的泪水。"

# game/script.rpy:20147
translate chinese map046_48731aa4:

    # voice "se/y00386.ogg"
    voice "se/y00386.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:20149
translate chinese map046_d0926a45:

    # char_fortaime "At the end of the dream, when they turned back...?\nI ran toward them, and tried to hug them one more time.\nBut I didn't feel anything when I did, and the dream ended."
    char_fortaime "梦的最后，当他们回过头来……？\n我朝他们跑去，想再抱他们一次。\n可抱住的那一刻，我什么都感觉不到，梦境就此终结。"

# game/script.rpy:20152
translate chinese map046_ede3eb13:

    # voice "se/y00387.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "But right now...? I'm definitely feeling something.\nAnd I know this won't end. I know you're not going anywhere."
    voice "se/y00387.ogg"
    char_fortaime "可此刻……？我确实感觉到了什么。\n而且我知道，这不会结束。我知道你不会离开。"

# game/script.rpy:20162
translate chinese map046_91fe98a7:

    # "He hugs me tighter, and I do so as well."
    "他将我抱得更紧，我也收紧双臂。"

# game/script.rpy:20176
translate chinese map046_5b08544a:

    # voice "se/y00388.ogg"
    voice "se/y00388.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:20178
translate chinese map046_e3930066:

    # char_fortaime "{i}This{/i} is what I need to fight for, [firstname].\nThe things that are right in front of me.\nThe things that matter, and the things I cherish."
    char_fortaime "{i}这{/i}才是我该为之战斗的东西，[firstname]。\n是那些就在我眼前的事物。\n是那些重要的、我珍视的一切。"

# game/script.rpy:20207
translate chinese map046_10339e3a:

    # "I nod, and let our embrace continue.{w}\nIt seems to last forever, but I don't mind.{w}\nI'd let it last as long as it needs to — for Fortaime."
    "我点点头，任由这个拥抱继续下去。{w}\n它仿佛持续到永远，可我并不在意。{w}\n为了福泰姆，它需要多久，我就愿意让它持续多久。"

# game/script.rpy:20229
translate chinese map046_ade89367:

    # "I decide to stand my ground, and let him overcome this.{w}\nI wouldn't always be there to console him. He needed strength.{w}\nWithout it, he might not survive this war. This was the right choice."
    "我决定坚持立场，让他自己挺过去。{w}\n我不可能永远在他身边安慰他。他需要坚强。{w}\n否则，他或许无法在这场战争中活下来。这才是正确的选择。"

# game/script.rpy:20238
translate chinese map046_65886233:

    # voice "se/y00389.ogg"
    voice "se/y00389.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:20240
translate chinese map046_53f4406e:

    # char_fortaime "At the end of the dream, when they turned back...?\nI ran toward them, and tried to hug them one more time.\nI told them I love them. But nothing happened. I felt nothing."
    char_fortaime "梦的最后，当他们回过头来……？\n我朝他们跑去，想再抱他们一次。\n我告诉他们我爱他们。可什么都没有发生。我什么都感觉不到。"

# game/script.rpy:20253
translate chinese map046_796f7665:

    # voice "se/y00390.ogg"
    voice "se/y00390.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:20255
translate chinese map046_84ba13da:

    # char_fortaime "That emptiness, that nothingness...\nIs that what I really want to fight for?\nNo — there's real, {i}breathing{/i} people to fight for."
    char_fortaime "那份空虚，那片虚无……\n那真是我想为之战斗的东西吗？\n不——还有活生生的、{i}会呼吸{/i}的人值得我去战斗。"

# game/script.rpy:20264
translate chinese map046_697a5b06:

    # "He looks at me, and then at Valessa, at the other end of the room.{w}\nHe smiles, seeming to have stifled those imminent tears from earlier."
    "他看了看我，又看向房间另一头的瓦莱莎。{w}\n他笑了，似乎已压下了先前的泪水。"

# game/script.rpy:20278
translate chinese map046_a7f685ac:

    # voice "se/y00391.ogg"
    voice "se/y00391.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:20280
translate chinese map046_80d95582:

    # char_fortaime "So that's what I'll do.\nI won't pursue justice for a memory.\nLet alone a memory that's almost gone."
    char_fortaime "所以，我就这么做。\n我不会为一段记忆去追寻正义。\n更何况，那是一段几乎消散的记忆。"

# game/script.rpy:20283
translate chinese map046_baa4c53b:

    # voice "se/y00392.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "I'll do it for you, and those around me.\nSo nobody else has to lose a home, or parents.\nWhen this is all over? {i}Everyone{/i} will be happy."
    voice "se/y00392.ogg"
    char_fortaime "我会为你，也为身边的人而战。\n这样，就不会再有人失去家园，或是失去父母。\n等这一切结束后？{i}每个人{/i}都会幸福的。"

# game/script.rpy:20287
translate chinese map046_8ad65715:

    # voice "se/y00393.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "Fighting for vengeance would only serve {i}me{/i}.\nI'm better than that, and I'm only realizing it now.\nI wonder if this dream was a gift from the spirits...?"
    voice "se/y00393.ogg"
    char_fortaime "为复仇而战，只会满足{i}我自己{/i}。\n我比那要更好，而我此刻才意识到这一点。\n这场梦，会不会是灵体赐予的礼物……？"

# game/script.rpy:20297
translate chinese map046_27a4bfaa:

    # "His smile grows wider, and I can tell he's calmed down.{w}\nI'm glad I could help him — that I chose to talk to him.{w}\nIf I didn't, he'd suffer in silence, affecting his judgment."
    "他的笑容更加舒展，看得出他已平静下来。{w}\n我很高兴能帮到他——高兴自己选择了与他交谈。{w}\n若不然，他会独自默默承受，进而影响他的判断。"

# game/script.rpy:20327
translate chinese map046_1e493769:

    # voice "se/y00394.ogg"
    voice "se/y00394.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:20329
translate chinese map046_3c517fb0:

    # char_fortaime "Well then, let's get going...!\nWe have a long journey ahead of us.\nBetter get it started now, I'm pumped up!"
    char_fortaime "那好，我们出发吧……！\n前面还有漫长的旅程等着我们。\n最好现在就动身，我可是干劲十足！"

# game/script.rpy:20374
translate chinese map047_2c4f74bb:

    # "Valessa is walking from one end of the room to another. She looks annoyed.{w}\nIt could be any number of things, but I decide to talk to her and figure things out.{w}\nAs soon as I approach her, she stops in her tracks, and lets out an exasperated sigh."
    "瓦莱莎在房间里来回踱步，看上去有些烦躁。{w}\n原因可能有很多，但我决定找她谈谈，弄清状况。{w}\n我刚走近，她就停下脚步，恼怒地叹了口气。"

# game/script.rpy:20405
translate chinese map047_17c0e658:

    # voice "se/y00395.ogg"
    voice "se/y00395.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:20407
translate chinese map047_20c8de61:

    # char_valessa "You know, I thought things would be different.\nIf you made me the Elder, I'd have a big game plan.\nAnd I thought I did — but I realized how little I know."
    char_valessa "你知道吗，我本以为情况会不一样。\n如果你让我当长老，我会有个宏伟的规划。\n我原以为自己有——可我意识到自己懂得实在太少。"

# game/script.rpy:20420
translate chinese map047_bb71d098:

    # voice "se/y00396.ogg"
    voice "se/y00396.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:20422
translate chinese map047_7bf19123:

    # char_valessa "Obviously, keeping our independence is important, right?\nBut I've realized that's actually kind of insignificant.\nOur problems are here in the present, not out in the future."
    char_valessa "显然，保住我们的独立很重要，对吧？\n但我意识到，那其实有点微不足道。\n我们的问题就在当下，而不是遥远的未来。"

# game/script.rpy:20425
translate chinese map047_0f6d40a6:

    # voice "se/y00397.ogg"
    # char_valessa "Maintaining our identity is a plan for the {i}future{/i}.\nIf Valinorth succumbs to the cold, there'll be nothing left to maintain.\nI still believe we need our independence, but that can't happen for a while."
    voice "se/y00397.ogg"
    char_valessa "维系我们的身份，是为{i}未来{/i}做的打算。\n可若是瓦利诺斯败给了严寒，就再没有任何东西需要维系了。\n我依然相信我们需要独立，但那短时间内无法实现。"

# game/script.rpy:20439
translate chinese map047_54bd7825:

    # voice "se/y00398.ogg"
    voice "se/y00398.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:20441
translate chinese map047_f6f5909b:

    # char_valessa "So, against my better judgment, alliances might be necessary.\nI doubt we can find a way to save Valinorth all on our own.\nWe'll require knowledge from all corners of Alestia."
    char_valessa "所以，尽管违背我的本意，结盟或许是必要的。\n我怀疑单凭我们自己，找不到拯救瓦利诺斯的办法。\n我们需要来自阿莱斯蒂亚四面八方的知识。"

# game/script.rpy:20454
