    # char_valessa "I can't believe Fortaime is in charge now — no offense.\nMy vision for the future of Valinorth was just so clear.\nBut now everything is changing. It's not {i}home{/i} anymore."
    char_valessa "真不敢相信现在是福泰姆主事——无意冒犯。\n我对瓦利诺斯未来的构想曾是那么清晰。\n可如今一切都在改变。这里不再是{i}家{/i}了。"

# game/script.rpy:20485
translate chinese map047_9134691c:

    # voice "se/y00401.ogg"
