    char_valessa "哼。是啊，你说得大概没错。\n当然，身边有几个朋友总没坏处。\n我想从现在起，我们会一起度过更多时间。"

# game/script.rpy:20612
translate chinese map047_ac84fbea:

    # "I'm only joking, but she seems to take it personally.{w}\nPerhaps now isn't the best time to be cracking jokes like that.{w}\nI can tell she's even more annoyed. She grumbles under her breath."
    "我只是开个玩笑，她似乎却当了真。{w}\n也许现在不是开这种玩笑的好时候。{w}\n看得出她更加恼火了，低声嘟囔着什么。"

# game/script.rpy:20626
translate chinese map047_6ba26e94:

    # voice "se/y00409.ogg"
    voice "se/y00409.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:20628
