    # voice "se/y00410.ogg"
    voice "se/y00410.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:20644
translate chinese map047_07becb3b:

    # char_valessa "Thanks. I appreciate it — I truly do.\nIt's always good when someone has your back.\nVenting helps, as inconvenient as it's known to be."
    char_valessa "谢谢，我很感激——是真心的。\n有人挺你，总是好事。\n发泄一下是有用的，尽管大家都知道那不太得体。"

# game/script.rpy:20647
translate chinese map047_8a7920ad:

    # voice "se/y00411.ogg"
    # char_valessa "I'm glad you don't mind, because we're dealing with pretty big issues.\nIf I can trust you with this kind of stuff, I can trust you with anything.\nWhich is great, because something tells me there's a lot more to come."
    voice "se/y00411.ogg"
    char_valessa "你不介意就好，因为我们面对的是相当重大的问题。\n如果这种事我都能信任你，那任何事我都能信任你。\n这很好，因为我有种预感，后面还有更多。"

# game/script.rpy:20657
translate chinese map047_4223fbbb:

    # "It's hard to get a read on her next expression, but she shuffles about some more.{w}\nTaking a few steps away from me, she rests her back against the wall.{w}\nI step closer toward her, inching ourselves away from Fortaime."
    "很难读懂她接下来的神情，但她又挪动了几下。{w}\n她后退几步，把背靠在墙上。{w}\n我朝她走近，让两人一点点远离福泰姆。"

# game/script.rpy:20671
translate chinese map047_5cb51710:

    # voice "se/y00412.ogg"
    voice "se/y00412.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:20673
translate chinese map047_dbf441f6:

    # char_valessa "What am I going to do...?"
    char_valessa "我该怎么办……？"

# game/script.rpy:20678
translate chinese map047_3719436b:

    # voice "se/y00413.ogg"
    voice "se/y00413.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:20680
translate chinese map047_397a248c:

    # char_valessa "I want Valinorth's independence, but I can't get it alone.\nAs we travel the world, I'll need help wherever I can get it.\nConnecting our nation with the spirits isn't something I can do alone."
    char_valessa "我想要瓦利诺斯独立，可单凭我一人办不到。\n我们周游世界的途中，我需要能到手的任何帮助。\n让我们的国家与灵体重新连结，不是我一个人能办到的。"

# game/script.rpy:20683
translate chinese map047_ec8a2a22:

    # voice "se/y00414.ogg"
    # char_valessa "I have no idea how I'll get it done, though.\nLike I said, I'll need help from the outside world.\nWhat an odd idea. Alliances to achieve independence?"
    voice "se/y00414.ogg"
    char_valessa "可我完全不知道怎么才能办到。\n就像我说的，我需要外界的帮助。\n真是个古怪的念头。为了独立去结盟？"

# game/script.rpy:20687
translate chinese map047_7b955269:

    # voice "se/y00415.ogg"
    # char_valessa "No — people would just think I'm using them.\nIn order to do this efficiently, I'd have to keep it a secret.\nGlean information wherever I can, without telling anybody why."
    voice "se/y00415.ogg"
    char_valessa "不——人们只会觉得我在利用他们。\n想尽快办成这件事，我就得保密。\n尽可能地搜集情报，却不告诉任何人原因。"

# game/script.rpy:20701
translate chinese map047_bc6cecc9:

    # voice "se/y00416.ogg"
    voice "se/y00416.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:20703
