    # char_valessa "A book here, a conversation there — until I find a solution.\nAt the end of the day, nobody would know what I was up to.\nBut when our journey is over, I'd have the means to save Valinorth."
    char_valessa "这里翻一本书，那里聊一次天——直到我找到解决之道。\n说到底，没人会知道我在盘算什么。\n可等旅程结束时，我就有了拯救瓦利诺斯的办法。"

# game/script.rpy:20717
translate chinese map047_f66e368b:

    # voice "se/y00417.ogg"
    voice "se/y00417.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:20719
