    # char_valessa "Good. I'm glad we're on the same page.\nYou know what they say about dire times, right?\nLet's make sure this stays between the two of us."
    char_valessa "好。很高兴我们想法一致。\n你知道人们怎么说艰难时局的，对吧？\n这事就只留在你我之间。"

# game/script.rpy:20779
translate chinese map047_2a0a6fa6:

    # voice "se/y00422.ogg"
