    # char_valessa "But that's not what my vision of our future looks like.\nWe need to be strong on our own — completely independent.\nTaking help, and then pushing away the helpers? That could spark war."
    char_valessa "可那不是我构想的未来。\n我们需要靠自己强大起来——彻底独立。\n接受帮助，然后把帮手一脚踢开？那可能会引发战争。"

# game/script.rpy:20798
translate chinese map047_35fbbd89:

    # voice "se/y00424.ogg"
    # char_valessa "Under my lead, though? Valinorth will {i}never{/i} see another war.\nYeah — I like the sound of that. A strong, peaceful nation."
    voice "se/y00424.ogg"
    char_valessa "可要是在我的带领下？瓦利诺斯{i}绝不会{/i}再经历一场战争。\n是啊——我喜欢这个说法。一个强大而和平的国家。"

# game/script.rpy:20813
translate chinese map047_07473311:

    # voice "se/y00425.ogg"
    voice "se/y00425.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:20815
translate chinese map047_e95da8d9:

    # char_valessa "From this point forward, your visions are {i}very{/i} important.\nI doubt that the one you had about Valinorth will be the last.\nEspecially now that this blade is involved in everything."
    char_valessa "从今往后，你的预言{i}非常{/i}重要。\n我猜你关于瓦利诺斯的那次预言不会是最后一次。\n尤其现在这把剑牵涉进了所有事情里。"

# game/script.rpy:20818
translate chinese map047_ba0917c3:

    # voice "se/y00426.ogg"
    # char_valessa "We need to make an important decision, here.\nDo we involve the rest of Alestia with this stuff...?\nOr do we keep the visions to ourselves, like always?"
    voice "se/y00426.ogg"
    char_valessa "我们得在这里做一个重要的决定。\n要让阿莱斯蒂亚的其他人也牵扯进这些事吗……？\n还是像往常一样，把预言留在我们自己手里？"

# game/script.rpy:20832
translate chinese map047_55857ab1:

    # voice "se/y00427.ogg"
    voice "se/y00427.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:20834
translate chinese map047_0c28af54:

    # char_valessa "If we start to serve them with our visions, they'll be dependent.\nAfter this war is over, they could expect us to keep helping out.\nOr even worse, people with ill intent could {i}force{/i} us to help."
    char_valessa "若我们开始用预言为他们效力，他们就会产生依赖。\n战争结束后，他们可能指望我们一直帮下去。\n更糟的是，心存歹意的人可能会{i}强迫{/i}我们出手。"

# game/script.rpy:20839
translate chinese map047_91d7debe:

    # voice "se/y00428.ogg"
    voice "se/y00428.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:20841
translate chinese map047_4473095d:

    # char_valessa "Should we keep our roles as secret as possible...?\nOr should we openly tell everybody who we are?\nThis is the first time a Seer has left Valinorth."
    char_valessa "我们该尽可能隐藏自己的身份吗……？\n还是该公开告诉所有人我们是谁？\n这是先知首次离开瓦利诺斯。"

# game/script.rpy:20846
translate chinese map047_1b6650da:

    # voice "se/y00429.ogg"
    voice "se/y00429.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:20848
translate chinese map047_04d0f4ba:

    # char_valessa "Should we keep our roles as secret as possible...?\nOr should we openly tell everybody who we are?\nThis is the first time a Seeress has left Valinorth."
    char_valessa "我们该尽可能隐藏自己的身份吗……？\n还是该公开告诉所有人我们是谁？\n这是先知首次离开瓦利诺斯。"

# game/script.rpy:20852
translate chinese map047_be4001a4:

    # voice "se/y00431.ogg"
    voice "se/y00431.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:20855
translate chinese map047_3802cefd:

    # char_valessa "We're making history. \nBut what kind of history do we make?" nointeract
    char_valessa "我们正在创造历史。\n可我们创造的是怎样的历史？" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:20871
translate chinese map047_664c880a:

    # voice "se/y00430.ogg"
    # char_valessa "Do you really think so?\nThe world is full of horrible people, you know.\nWe can't trust that everybody will be on our side."
    voice "se/y00430.ogg"
    char_valessa "你真这么想？\n你知道，这世上到处都有可怕的人。\n我们不能指望所有人都站在我们这边。"

# game/script.rpy:20875
translate chinese map047_8403d11b:

    # voice "se/y00432.ogg"
    # char_valessa "Even if they act like it, they could just be using us.\nI'd say I trust our judgment, but I'm not so sure."
    voice "se/y00432.ogg"
    char_valessa "即便他们装作如此，也可能只是在利用我们。\n我本想说我相信我们的判断，可我不太确定。"

# game/script.rpy:20889
translate chinese map047_7618a9a1:

    # voice "se/y00433.ogg"
    voice "se/y00433.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:20891
translate chinese map047_add702c4:

    # char_valessa "I can play along, so it doesn't seem like I'm hiding anything.\nBut the moment someone rubs me the wrong way? I'll tell you.\nBetter to stay on our toes. Otherwise, they'd trample all over us."
    char_valessa "我可以配合着演，让事情看起来不像我在隐瞒什么。\n但要是有人惹我反感？我会告诉你。\n最好还是保持警惕。否则，他们会把我们踩在脚下。"

# game/script.rpy:20905
translate chinese map047_b2d8380a:

    # voice "se/y00434.ogg"
    # char_valessa "Yeah. Let's keep it contained to The Rebellion.\nOther than that — only if it concerns our cause.\nBetter than putting targets on our heads, right?"
    voice "se/y00434.ogg"
    char_valessa "是啊。消息就限制在反抗军内部吧。\n除此之外——除非与我们的目标相关。\n总比在自己头上贴靶子好，对吧？"

# game/script.rpy:20920
translate chinese map047_6fa70e3b:

    # voice "se/y00435.ogg"
    voice "se/y00435.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:20922
translate chinese map047_d41dc0bd:

    # char_valessa "If everybody saw the potential to cheat the future...?\nI can't even imagine what lengths they'd go to use you, [firstname].\nWe can't offer your gift to everybody. It doesn't work that way."
    char_valessa "要是所有人都看到能欺骗未来的潜力……？\n我无法想象他们会为了利用你做到什么地步，[firstname]。\n我们不能把你的天赋提供给所有人。事情不是那样运作的。"

# game/script.rpy:20927
translate chinese map047_169772f2:

    # voice "se/y00436.ogg"
    voice "se/y00436.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:20929
translate chinese map047_d41dc0bd_1:

    # char_valessa "If everybody saw the potential to cheat the future...?\nI can't even imagine what lengths they'd go to use you, [firstname].\nWe can't offer your gift to everybody. It doesn't work that way."
    char_valessa "要是所有人都看到能欺骗未来的潜力……？\n我无法想象他们会为了利用你做到什么地步，[firstname]。\n我们不能把你的天赋提供给所有人。事情不是那样运作的。"

# game/script.rpy:20933
translate chinese map047_8166dca9:

    # voice "se/y00437.ogg"
    voice "se/y00437.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:20935
translate chinese map047_aa1c4292:

    # char_valessa "If we helped as many as we could — we'd leave some out.\nTrying to help everybody...? No, we'd just be picking and choosing.\nThat's the best way to harbor spite, or in some cases, a desire for revenge."
    char_valessa "若我们尽力帮尽可能多的人——终会漏掉一些人。\n想帮所有人……？不，那不过是挑拣选择罢了。\n那是滋生怨恨、有时甚至是复仇之心的最佳途径。"

# game/script.rpy:20949
translate chinese map047_897c4c32:

    # voice "se/y00438.ogg"
    voice "se/y00438.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:20951
translate chinese map047_70d403c0:

    # char_valessa "Thanks for giving me your advice, [firstname].\nIt's good to have some direction. I was feeling lost.\nI'm glad to know we can keep working together like this."
    char_valessa "谢谢你给我建议，[firstname]。\n有点方向是好事。我先前感到很迷茫。\n很高兴知道我们能一直这样合作下去。"

# game/script.rpy:20956
translate chinese map047_816510fb:

    # voice "se/y00439.ogg"
    voice "se/y00439.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:20958
translate chinese map047_70d403c0_1:

    # char_valessa "Thanks for giving me your advice, [firstname].\nIt's good to have some direction. I was feeling lost.\nI'm glad to know we can keep working together like this."
    char_valessa "谢谢你给我建议，[firstname]。\n有点方向是好事。我先前感到很迷茫。\n很高兴知道我们能一直这样合作下去。"

# game/script.rpy:20975
translate chinese map047_e5dc792f:

    # voice "se/y00440.ogg"
    voice "se/y00440.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:20977
translate chinese map047_118cab52:

    # char_valessa "I know. Trust me, I know.\nBut is this really the time to talk about that stuff?\nIt's not that I'm not interested. It's just... timing."
    char_valessa "我知道。相信我，我明白。\n可现在是谈那些事的时候吗？\n不是我不感兴趣。只是……时机不对。"

# game/script.rpy:20990
translate chinese map047_6bf11fdc:

    # voice "se/y00441.ogg"
    voice "se/y00441.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:20992
translate chinese map047_33b3192a:

    # char_valessa "Maybe I'll feel a bit different once we get to Mazeo.\nSettling down in the Rebel HQ might make things easier.\nRight now, there's just so much happening, and we're mobile."
    char_valessa "也许等我们到了马泽奥，我会有些不一样的感觉。\n在反抗军总部安顿下来，或许能让事情容易些。\n眼下发生的事太多了，而我们又一直在赶路。"

# game/script.rpy:20995
translate chinese map047_3bae9b7c:

    # voice "se/y00442.ogg"
    # char_valessa "It'll take some time before I can think about that stuff.\nIf only the day went by normally. Who knows what would've happened."
    voice "se/y00442.ogg"
    char_valessa "我需要一些时间才能考虑那些事。\n要是那天能像平常一样过去就好了。谁知道会发生什么呢。"

# game/script.rpy:21005
translate chinese map047_098d8168:

    # "She smiles at me, and it seems like she's accepting of my advances.{w}\nHowever, the way things were — I understood her exception.{w}\nIt would be better to talk about that stuff later on."
    "她冲我笑了笑，似乎接受了我的示好。{w}\n不过，就当时的情形——我明白她为何会例外。{w}\n那些事，还是以后再说比较好。"

# game/script.rpy:21024
translate chinese map047_352e2562:

    # voice "se/y00443.ogg"
    voice "se/y00443.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:21026
translate chinese map047_5462ed0f:

    # char_valessa "And I'm glad we can rise to the challenge. That's good.\nSomething tells me there'll be many more challenges to come.\nBut as long as we band together — and talk it out — we can do this."
    char_valessa "很高兴我们能迎接挑战。这很好。\n我有种预感，往后还会有更多挑战。\n但只要我们团结一心——把话说开——就能做到。"

# game/script.rpy:21035
translate chinese map047_5410b35e:

    # "With a wide smile, I can sense a newfound determination within her.{w}\nSomething is there — something that wasn't there the moment we began talking."
    "她绽开笑容，我能感到她心中新生出一股决心。{w}\n有些东西出现了——在我们开始交谈时还不存在的东西。"

# game/script.rpy:21054
translate chinese map047_98b15005:

    # voice "se/y00444.ogg"
    voice "se/y00444.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:21056
translate chinese map047_66226860:

    # char_valessa "Oh. Well, yeah — of course.\nI'd never interrupt your training, you know.\nIf you don't learn to wield that blade, we're doomed."
    char_valessa "哦。嗯，是啊——当然。\n你知道，我绝不会打断你的训练。\n要是你学不会挥舞那把剑，我们就完了。"

# game/script.rpy:21069
translate chinese map047_9a5673d5:

    # voice "se/y00445.ogg"
    voice "se/y00445.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:21071
translate chinese map047_77e06f4c:

    # char_valessa "I think you can trust my manners are better than that.\nIf you're busy, I can guarantee that I'll leave you alone.\nJust seemed like we had some spare time right now, is all."
    char_valessa "我想你可以相信我的礼数没这么差。\n你要是忙，我保证不会打扰你。\n只是眼下好像正好有点空闲，仅此而已。"

# game/script.rpy:21084
translate chinese map047_c1bcb456:

    # voice "se/y00446.ogg"
    voice "se/y00446.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:21086
translate chinese map047_5859d11d:

    # char_valessa "Let's get things moving, alright?\nLike I said, I have a better sense of direction now.\nOr at the very least, my mind is more clear. That's all I needed."
    char_valessa "我们继续办正事吧，好吗？\n就像我说的，我现在方向感清楚多了。\n至少，脑子更清醒了。我需要的也就是这个。"

# game/script.rpy:21100
translate chinese map047_74a2b0a2:

    # "Letting out a loud sigh, she starts to walk away.{w}\nI'm glad I decided to reach out to her like this.{w}\nA clouded mind could affect her performance."
    "她长叹一声，转身走开了。{w}\n我很庆幸自己决定这样主动接近她。{w}\n思绪混乱会影响她的表现。"

# game/script.rpy:21114
translate chinese map047_a13ecba4:

    # "If we wanted to win this — everyone would need to be resolute.{w}\nI shouldn't miss {i}any{/i} opportunity to bond with my friends and comrades.{w}\nTheir survival and future would directly relate to their morale."
    "要想赢下这场战争——每个人都需要意志坚定。{w}\n我不该错过{i}任何{/i}与朋友和战友加深情谊的机会。{w}\n他们的生死与未来，直接取决于他们的士气。"

# game/script.rpy:21150
translate chinese map171_e8e466ac:

    # "Howl stares off into the ocean, deep in contemplation.{w}\nI imagine that he'd have a lot to think about — and a lot to process.{w}\nLast time we talked, he seemed conflicted about whether or not he fit in."
    "豪尔凝望着大海，陷入沉思。{w}\n我想他有很多要思考的——也有很多要消化的。{w}\n上次我们交谈时，他似乎对自己能否融入其中感到矛盾。"

# game/script.rpy:21175
translate chinese map171_f35796c5:

    # voice "se/y01191.ogg"
    voice "se/y01191.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:21177
translate chinese map171_43815564:

    # char_howl "[firstname]."
    char_howl "[firstname]。"

# game/script.rpy:21191
translate chinese map171_0e220f97:

    # "He turns to face me, and gives me a small wave, welcoming me.{w}\nI stand beside him, and we stare off into the ocean together.{w}\nThe sun causes it to glisten, sparkling with a gentle beauty."
    "他转过身面向我，轻轻挥了挥手，算是欢迎。{w}\n我站到他身旁，我们一起眺望大海。{w}\n阳光让海面波光粼粼，闪烁着柔和的美。"

# game/script.rpy:21216
translate chinese map171_b304b0a3:

    # voice "se/y01192.ogg"
    # char_howl "We're still conflicted. These thoughts won't go away.\nVisions of needless violence, and senseless destruction.\nYou may tell us that they aren't real — but we're unsure."
    voice "se/y01192.ogg"
    char_howl "我们依旧矛盾。这些念头挥之不去。\n那些无谓的暴力、无意义的毁灭的景象。\n你或许会告诉我们，它们不是真的——可我们不确定。"

# game/script.rpy:21220
translate chinese map171_9fcea484:

    # voice "se/y01193.ogg"
    # char_howl "The emotions that well up within us are far too real.\nIs it possible for fake events to elicit real emotions?\nOr are we perhaps hearing echoes of the past...?"
    voice "se/y01193.ogg"
    char_howl "我们心中涌起的情绪太过真实。\n虚假的事件，真的能激发出真实的情绪吗？\n又或者，我们听到的是过往的回响……？"

# game/script.rpy:21235
translate chinese map171_cfbff339:

    # "Echoes of the past...? What does he mean?"
    "过往的回响……？他是什么意思？"

# game/script.rpy:21260
translate chinese map171_40cdae93:

    # voice "se/y01194.ogg"
    # char_howl "Let us phrase it differently. You know visions, yes?\nThe Monarchy used them to guide us to the best possible future.\nHow can you {i}know{/i} that best possible future without trial and error?"
    voice "se/y01194.ogg"
    char_howl "让我们换个说法。你知道预言，对吧？\n王室曾用它们引领我们走向最好的未来。\n可你若不经反复试错，又怎会{i}知道{/i}那最好的未来到底是什么？"

# game/script.rpy:21264
translate chinese map171_c87f8bc9:

    # voice "se/y01195.ogg"
    # char_howl "There would still be many futures left unseen, and many pasts avoided.\nKnowing one {i}true{/i} course of action, requires disregarding millions of wrong ones.\nWhat if we are simply seeing these many avenues? Almost like our visions have evolved."
    voice "se/y01195.ogg"
    char_howl "仍会有许多未来未被得见，许多过往得以避开。\n要知晓一条{i}真正{/i}的行动之路，就得无视数百万条歧途。\n万一我们看到的，只是这诸多路径本身？就好像我们的预言进化了。"

# game/script.rpy:21278
translate chinese map171_29143663:

    # voice "se/y01196.ogg"
    # char_howl "If not evolved, then perhaps — gotten muddled.\nRather than see the one important future, we see everything.\nWe do not know if this is a good thing or a bad thing, [firstname]."
    voice "se/y01196.ogg"
    char_howl "若不是进化了，那或许——是变得混乱了。\n我们看不到那个唯一重要的未来，而是看到了一切。\n我们不知道这是好事还是坏事，[firstname]。"

# game/script.rpy:21293
translate chinese map171_3a402535:

    # "It kind of makes sense, when you think about it.{w}\nSeeing the best possible future was like one side of a coin.{w}\nThe other side still exists, and it's left covered up — unseen."
    "仔细想想，这倒也说得通。{w}\n看见最好的未来，就像硬币的一面。{w}\n另一面依然存在，只是被盖住了——不为人所见。"

# game/script.rpy:21295
translate chinese map171_336e47a5:

    # "Many wrong futures, many wrong choices made.{w}\nThe mind likely blocked these out for a reason.{w}\nMaybe he's sensitive after escaping his prison."
    "许多错误的未来，许多做错的选择。{w}\n心智将它们屏蔽掉，大概是有原因的。{w}\n也许他逃出牢笼后，变得格外敏感。"

# game/script.rpy:21320
translate chinese map171_b9549eda:

    # voice "se/y01197.ogg"
    # char_howl "If this is true, then we exist unbound from time.\nA string in a labyrinth, with no one holding the other side.\nNo one to tug — no one to guide us in the right direction."
    voice "se/y01197.ogg"
    char_howl "若真是如此，那我们便游离于时间之外。\n像是迷宫里的一根线，另一端无人牵引。\n无人拉动——无人指引我们走向正确的方向。"

# game/script.rpy:21334
translate chinese map171_ee45299f:

    # voice "se/y01198.ogg"
    # char_howl "No one, of course — except for you.\nOur visions may be useless at the moment, but are yours?\nWe would recommend that you try inducing a vision, [firstname]."
    voice "se/y01198.ogg"
    char_howl "当然无人——除了你。\n我们的预言此刻或许毫无用处，可你的呢？\n我们建议你试着主动引发一次预言，[firstname]。"

# game/script.rpy:21338
translate chinese map171_0c71f3ae:

    # voice "se/y01199.ogg"
    # char_howl "Not right now, of course. But in your own time.\nHowever, when you do so — we would request a favor.\nIf you see the future, embrace it. But also, look into the past."
    voice "se/y01199.ogg"
    char_howl "当然不是现在。等你方便的时候。\n不过，当你这么做时——我们想请你帮个忙。\n你若看见未来，就拥抱它。但也请回望过去。"

# game/script.rpy:21352
translate chinese map171_d4dc4a6b:

    # voice "se/y01200.ogg"
    # char_howl "The future you see blossoms from choice and consequence.\nLook back at those choices made, and conjure up the choices {i}unmade{/i}.\nThe loss, the heartbreak, the death. Maybe then you will know what pains us."
    voice "se/y01200.ogg"
    char_howl "你所见的未来，由选择与后果绽放而成。\n回望那些已做出的选择，再想象那些{i}未曾做出{/i}的选择。\n那些失去、心碎、死亡。也许到那时，你就会明白是什么在折磨我们。"

# game/script.rpy:21367
translate chinese map171_96e8df66:

    # "He's plagued with bad visions. He no longer sees the one true future.{w}\nHe sees {i}everything{/i}, and that is a curse that I would wish upon nobody.{w}\nI can't even imagine how many times he's seen us all die — and for what...?"
    "他被不祥的预言所折磨。他再也看不到那唯一的真实未来。{w}\n他看到{i}一切{/i}，那是我绝不愿加诸任何人的诅咒。{w}\n我甚至无法想象，他见过我们所有人死多少次——又是为了什么……？"

# game/script.rpy:21392
translate chinese map171_bafb844c:

    # voice "se/y01201.ogg"
    # char_howl "There is only one thing that remains constant throughout these visions.\nYourself, The Blade of Exodus — and the death that it feeds off of.\nThere's something self serving about all three of these things."
    voice "se/y01201.ogg"
    char_howl "在这些预言中，只有一样东西始终不变。\n你自己、放逐之刃——以及它所赖以为生的死亡。\n这三样东西身上，都有某种自私之处。"

# game/script.rpy:21396
translate chinese map171_b7cc4089:

    # voice "se/y01202.ogg"
    # char_howl "You always have that blade; and the people around you always die.\nWhen they do, it's almost like that makes the blade more powerful.\nIt's like there's an essence released from our bodies when we pass on."
    voice "se/y01202.ogg"
    char_howl "你总是握着那把剑，而身边的人总是死去。\n当他们死去时，几乎就像是让那剑变得更强大。\n仿佛我们逝去时，身体里会释放出某种精魄。"

# game/script.rpy:21400
translate chinese map171_d6b22018:

    # voice "se/y01203.ogg"
    # char_howl "But is that the essence of life, or the essence of death?\nPerhaps that is a choice the wielder of the blade must make.\nWhat do you think, [firstname]? Is that energy life, or is it death...?" nointeract
    voice "se/y01203.ogg"
    char_howl "可那是生命的精魄，还是死亡的精魄？\n也许，那是持剑者必须做出的选择。\n你怎么看，[firstname]？那股能量是生命，还是死亡……？" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:21421
translate chinese map171_acc06ba5:

    # voice "se/y01204.ogg"
    voice "se/y01204.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:21423
translate chinese map171_0f09e495:

    # char_howl "An interesting thought, to say the least.\nIf it is up to the wielder, at least we know where you stand.\nThat blade is such a mysterious thing, and it grows ever stronger."
    char_howl "至少可以说，这想法很有意思。\n若这取决于持剑者，那至少我们知道你的立场。\n那把剑真是神秘之物，而且正变得愈发强大。"

# game/script.rpy:21437
translate chinese map171_e761f4d8:

    # "He's almost cryptically telling me what I already know.{w}\nI know that the blade deals with the spirits of its victims.{w}\nThe Triumvirate used it to create their own massive army."
    "他几乎是在隐晦地告诉我我早已知道的事。{w}\n我知道那把剑会摆布受害者的灵。{w}\n三人执政团曾用它制造出他们自己的庞大军队。"

# game/script.rpy:21439
translate chinese map171_b0261dd7:

    # "Even if it kept a portion of every soul, it would get stronger with every kill.{w}\nThat, combined with the power of The Monarchy inside...? Immense power.{w}\nA bit ironic if a portion of everybody The Triumvirate killed was used to end them."
    "即便它只留下每个灵魂的一部分，也会随着每一次杀戮而变强。{w}\n再加上其中王室的力量……？那将是无穷之力。{w}\n要是三人执政团所杀之人的一部分力量，最终被用来终结他们自己，倒有点讽刺。"

# game/script.rpy:21464
translate chinese map171_7e1da29c:

    # voice "se/y01205.ogg"
    # char_howl "We wonder if you possess this ability as well.\nTo see the past, even while you stand in the present.\nIs this a curse meant only for us, or a gift to be further honed?"
    voice "se/y01205.ogg"
    char_howl "我们想知道，你是否也拥有这种能力。\n即便身处当下，也能看见过去。\n这是只为我们而设的诅咒，还是值得进一步磨砺的天赋？"

# game/script.rpy:21468
translate chinese map171_3a926b39:

    # voice "se/y01206.ogg"
    # char_howl "It eludes our understanding, and we wish to know for sure.\nWhen we come back to the mainland, please return to Valinorth.\nClose your eyes, concentrate on the past, and talk to your comrades."
    voice "se/y01206.ogg"
    char_howl "这超出了我们的理解，我们想确切地弄清楚。\n等我们回到大陆，请你回一趟瓦利诺斯。\n闭上眼，专注于过去，和你的战友们说说话。"

# game/script.rpy:21482
translate chinese map171_bd929099:

    # voice "se/y01207.ogg"
    # char_howl "Do they speak as they do now, or as they did back then?\nWe think that this answer will be very enlightening for us.\nAnd if it is, then maybe you can understand our plight."
    voice "se/y01207.ogg"
    char_howl "他们说话的样子，是如同现在，还是如同当年？\n我们觉得，这个答案会让我们大受启发。\n若是如此，也许你就能理解我们的困境。"

# game/script.rpy:21496
translate chinese map171_40074fc9:

    # voice "se/y01208.ogg"
    # char_howl "How do we know where we are, if our surroundings fluctuate?\nWhat if we already had this conversation, and this is but an echo?\nPerhaps we reside at the end of time, simply witnessing our demise."
    voice "se/y01208.ogg"
    char_howl "若周遭反复无常，我们又怎知自己身在何处？\n万一我们早已有过这番对话，而此刻不过是回声呢？\n也许我们身处时间的尽头，只是在旁观自己的消亡。"

# game/script.rpy:21511
translate chinese map171_07cb14f4:

    # "Okay, now he's lost me."
    "好吧，这下我听不懂了。"

# game/script.rpy:21536
translate chinese map171_58c09f22:

    # voice "se/y01209.ogg"
    # char_howl "Sorry, we must appear insane.\nIt's just hard — not being grounded in the present.\nThe one downside of visions. Being lost in time."
    voice "se/y01209.ogg"
    char_howl "抱歉，我们看起来一定像个疯子。\n只是太难了——无法立足于当下。\n这是预言的唯一弊端，迷失在时间里。"

# game/script.rpy:21540
translate chinese map171_afdeb35d:

    # voice "se/y01210.ogg"
    # char_howl "Dreaming of that brighter future, and ignoring the present.\nLooking back on the past, and focusing on our mistakes.\nWe experience this tenfold. Even mistakes we did not make."
    voice "se/y01210.ogg"
    char_howl "憧憬着那更光明的未来，却忽略了当下。\n回望着过去，却只盯着自己的过错。\n我们十倍地承受着这一切。甚至是并非我们犯下的过错。"

# game/script.rpy:21554
translate chinese map171_a9c8da90:

    # voice "se/y01211.ogg"
    # char_howl "When we see your death, we feel pain.\nA pain worse than death — the loss of hope.\nThat blade falls to the ground, coated in your blood."
    voice "se/y01211.ogg"
    char_howl "当我们看见你的死亡，我们会感到痛苦。\n一种比死亡更甚的痛苦——希望的丧失。\n那把剑坠落在地，沾满你的鲜血。"

# game/script.rpy:21558
translate chinese map171_68eb2403:

    # voice "se/y01212.ogg"
    # char_howl "Comrades scream in agony as they befall the same fate.\nThen why do {i}we{/i} stand there, only capable of watching...?\nWe wish to help you avoid this fate. That is our duty."
    voice "se/y01212.ogg"
    char_howl "战友们遭遇同样的命运时，在痛苦中尖叫。\n那么{i}我们{/i}为何只能站在那里，眼睁睁看着……？\n我们想帮你避开这命运。那是我们的职责。"

# game/script.rpy:21572
translate chinese map171_7e3d147e:

    # voice "se/y01213.ogg"
    # char_howl "We apologize for the lack of sense, [firstname].\nYour time is more valuable than that, limited as it is.\nPerhaps next time we will make more sense of everything."
    voice "se/y01213.ogg"
    char_howl "抱歉说得没头没尾，[firstname]。\n你的时间有限，比这宝贵得多。\n也许下次我们能把一切理得更清楚些。"

# game/script.rpy:21586
translate chinese map171_5ab5228e:

    # voice "se/y01214.ogg"
    # char_howl "But try not to forget our advice, and our request.\nWe know there is a purpose for all of this. There must be.\nTogether, we will find it, rather than stand here and complain."
    voice "se/y01214.ogg"
    char_howl "但请别忘了我们的建议和请求。\n我们相信这一切都有其目的。一定有的。\n我们会一起找到它，而不是站在这里抱怨。"

# game/script.rpy:21608
translate chinese map171_627e1f50:

    # "I nod, before leaving him behind. He was suffering, I could tell.{w}\nI had enough trouble dealing with visions of the future. Howl must feel tortured.{w}\nIf there was anything I could do to help him out, I'd have to do it when I had the chance."
    "我点点头，随即将他留在身后。看得出他正饱受折磨。{w}\n我光是应付未来的预言就已经够呛。豪尔一定痛苦不堪。{w}\n若有什么我能帮上他的，就得抓住机会去做。"

# game/script.rpy:21610
translate chinese map171_1166adbe:

    # "It's possible that his body just doesn't know how to handle all of that energy.{w}\nI was trained at a young age to handle it, so I had a grasp on what I should be doing.{w}\nIs it possible that, unless trained, someone's mind could be lost in the sea of time...?"
    "也许只是他的身体不知该如何承受那些能量。{w}\n我自幼受过训练，所以清楚自己该做什么。{w}\n会不会是，若未经训练，人的心智就可能迷失在时间的海洋里……？"

# game/script.rpy:21612
translate chinese map171_b2e32f1c:

    # "Perhaps, I suppose. But that is a topic for another day.{w}\nI return to the deck of the ship, keeping a watchful eye on my comrades.{w}\nOn my watch, they would never meet the grisly fate that Howl had witnessed."
    "也许吧，我想。但那是改天再谈的话题。{w}\n我回到船的甲板上，留神看顾着我的战友们。{w}\n有我在守着，他们绝不会遭遇豪尔所目睹的那种惨烈命运。"

# game/script.rpy:21614
translate chinese map171_41caaf18:

    # "For a moment, I decide to stare into the sea, watching the waves and ripples.{w}\nI could've looked ahead, to the future. Toward Alarinthia — our final destination.{w}\nBut for a moment, I consider looking away from the path we've set in stone."
    "有那么一刻，我决定凝望大海，看着波浪与涟漪。{w}\n我本可以向前看，看向未来。看向阿拉林西亚——我们的最终目的地。{w}\n但有一瞬间，我考虑把目光从我们已定死的道路上移开。"

# game/script.rpy:21616
translate chinese map171_cf49624d:

    # "The sea continues to move, living a life of its own, despite our interference."
    "大海依旧翻涌不息，自成其生，全然不顾我们的干涉。"

# game/script.rpy:21795
