translate chinese map062_7c4a2e25:

    # "Ulric glances over at Valessa, Fortaime and I.{w}\nI'm not sure what he meant by \"another way\".{w}\nWas there something {i}we{/i} could do here...?"
    "乌尔里克朝瓦莱莎、福泰姆和我瞥了一眼。{w}\n我不确定他那句“还有别的办法”是什么意思。{w}\n难道这里有{i}我们{/i}能做的事……？"

# game/script.rpy:24135
translate chinese map062_e6ec7e8f:

    # voice "se/z00767.ogg"
    voice "se/z00767.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:24137
translate chinese map062_87516d2c:

    # char_pro "Oh, come on!\nI had a whole routine worked out, Ulric.\nMine will work for sure. With them, it's a risk."
    char_pro "哦，别这样！\n乌尔里克，我可是准备了一整套说辞。\n我的一定管用。靠他们，有风险。"

# game/script.rpy:24162
translate chinese map062_50ed3125:

    # voice "se/z00768.ogg"
    voice "se/z00768.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:24164
translate chinese map062_47ee1113:

    # char_ulric "I just want to see how they handle this.\nDiplomacy will be really important moving forward.\nShouldn't we let them get some practice...?"
    char_ulric "我只是想看看他们怎么应对。\n往后，外交手腕会非常重要。\n难道不该让他们练练手吗……？"

# game/script.rpy:24180
translate chinese map062_e8b9aa1f:

    # "I have enough of their cryptic conversation, and step forward.{w}\nAsking them what they meant, I politely request an explanation.{w}\nIf there was something they needed to say, there was no point in hiding it."
    "我受够了他们这番云里雾里的对话，走上前去。{w}\n我问他们是什么意思，客客气气地请他们解释清楚。{w}\n若他们有什么话要说，藏着掖着也没有意义。"

