translate chinese map062_b4b9f30c:

    # "Ulric made a very good point, and we had better give it some thought.{w}\nEverything we did from now on would affect the relationship between our nations.{w}\nWe were no longer just focused on The Rebellion, but Mazeo-Valinorth relations."
