    # "I stop and think, before coming to the best possible conclusion.{w}\nWe should let Pro handle this situation, and lay low.{w}\nIt wasn't worth exposing our identities to Carmen."
    "我停下来思索，最终得出一个尽可能好的结论。{w}\n我们该让普洛来处理这局面，自己低调行事。{w}\n为卡门暴露我们的身份，不值得。"

# game/script.rpy:24827
translate chinese map062_c49aafa9:

    # "If word travelled fast, we shouldn't put a label on ourselves.{w}\nThe Seer and The Elder of Valinorth would be rather large targets.{w}\nThis entire endeavor was about remaining out of sight."
    "若消息传得快，我们就不该给自己贴上标签。{w}\n先知与瓦利诺斯的长老，会成为相当显眼的靶子。{w}\n这整件事的关键，就是隐匿行踪。"

# game/script.rpy:24829
translate chinese map062_2509344c:

    # "We'd have to take the chance that our identities wouldn't leak.{w}\nThat way, Pro could get us anonymous entry into Mazeo.{w}\nHe seemed to know Carmen as well, so he has an edge."
    "我们只能赌一把，相信身份不会泄露。{w}\n这样，普洛就能让我们匿名进入马泽奥。{w}\n他似乎还认识卡门，所以占了优势。"

