    # char_pro "Besides, what's a few more numbers on your list of failures?\nIt's not like we're gonna go squealing on you. We need discretion.\nSo just let us through, and nobody will know what happened here."
    char_pro "再说，你的失职清单上再多几条又何妨？\n我们又不会去告发你。我们需要的是低调。\n所以放我们进去，没人会知道这里发生过什么。"

# game/script.rpy:25403
