    # "He smirks, and places a hand on Carmen's shoulder.{w}\nTogether, they walk away from the gate, out of earshot.{w}\nPro leans forward, and starts whispering quietly."
    "他咧嘴一笑，把一只手搭在卡门肩上。{w}\n两人一起走到城门外的僻静处，远离旁人。{w}\n普洛凑上前，开始低声耳语。"

# game/script.rpy:25505
translate chinese map062_693bd447:

    # "A few moments later, he returns to our side.{w}\nCarmen walks back to the gate, but no longer blocks it.{w}\nA smile appears on his face, as he won his family's safety."
    "片刻之后，他回到我们身边。{w}\n卡门走回城门旁，却不再挡路。{w}\n他脸上浮现出笑容，因为他为家人赢得了平安。"

