    # "It was impossible to tell what may come from this.{w}\nWhether we agreed with Pro or not, he got the job done."
    "没人说得清这会带来什么后果。{w}\n不管我们同不同意普洛的做法，他确实把事情办成了。"

# game/script.rpy:25692
translate chinese map062_b894d89f:

    # "I stop and think, but come to a conclusion that I believe is the best.{w}\nWe shouldn't hide our identities, and we should stick to diplomacy.{w}\nIt's better than setting something up that's bound to backfire on us."
    "我停下来思索，得出一个我认为最好的结论。{w}\n我们不该隐瞒身份，应当以外交手段行事。{w}\n总比设下一个注定会反噬我们的局要好。"

# game/script.rpy:25697
translate chinese map062_fc0080f7:

    # "I turn to Valessa, and give her a nod.{w}\nI guess this would be her first political move as Elder.{w}\nWe just had to hope that Carmen was willing to play ball."
    "我转向瓦莱莎，朝她点了点头。{w}\n我想这会是她就任长老后的头一次政治举措。{w}\n我们只能指望卡门愿意配合。"

# game/script.rpy:25699
translate chinese map062_bd13e026:

    # "She takes slow confident steps toward him, until he notices her.{w}\nWhen he does, she steps, and crosses her arms, ready to talk."
    "她迈着缓慢而自信的步伐走向他，直到他注意到她。{w}\n他一看过来，她便停下脚步，抱臂而立，准备开口。"

