    char_jit_map062_1_0_825 "规矩不是这样的，女士。\n您只会把我晾在这儿。别人都是这样。\n要么出示文书，要么别再浪费我的时间。"

# game/script.rpy:25908
translate chinese map062_5ba1aa95:

    # "I can tell that Valessa is getting annoyed. I've never seen her like this.{w}\nAs if to offer assistance, Ulric steps forward, clearing his throat.{w}\nPerfect timing too, as Valessa was about to lose her temper."
    "看得出瓦莱莎开始恼火了。我从没见过她这样。{w}\n仿佛是要出手相助，乌尔里克清了清嗓子，走上前来。{w}\n时机也恰到好处，瓦莱莎正要发脾气。"

# game/script.rpy:25933
