# game/script.rpy:26553
translate chinese map062_a22bd932:

    # "I turn to Fortaime, and give him a nod.{w}\nI guess this would be his first political move as Elder.{w}\nWe just had to hope that Carmen was willing to play ball."
    "我转向福泰姆，朝他点了点头。{w}\n我想这会是他就任长老后的头一次政治举措。{w}\n我们只能指望卡门愿意配合。"

# game/script.rpy:26555
translate chinese map062_22e630e9:

    # "He takes slow, nervous steps toward him, until Carmen takes notice.{w}\nWhen he does, Fortaime stops in his tracks, his ears perking straight up."
    "他紧张地一步步慢慢走向他，直到卡门注意到他。{w}\n卡门一看过来，福泰姆就停下脚步，两只耳朵一下竖了起来。"

