    # voice "se/z00742.ogg"
    # char_pro "Excuse me!? That's not what I meant!\nI'm talking about that huge blade you have on your back!\nThe Triumvirate might have eyes in Mazeo. We need to cover it up."
    voice "se/z00742.ogg"
