    # voice "se/y00654.ogg"
    voice "se/y00654.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:30808
translate chinese Ulric6_map054_9_0_3ead1231:

    # char_ulric "With the knowledge I currently possess, yes, I think they would.\nOver twenty years later, the Mazeans are starting to realize The Triumvirate was lying.\nThey promised to turn Mazeo into a utopia. Just look around when we get there. It's not."
    char_ulric "以我目前所知，是的，我想他们会。\n二十多年过去，马泽奥人开始意识到三人执政团一直在撒谎。\n他们许诺把马泽奥变成乌托邦。等我们到了你四处看看就知道，根本不是。"

# game/script.rpy:30811
translate chinese Ulric6_map054_9_0_2249c1ed:

    # voice "se/y00655.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Their words seem to mean a lot to people, even if their actions don't follow suit.\nIn my opinion, it's only a matter of time before their promises fall on deaf ears.\nThat is — if we don't take them down first. At least we'll be keeping {i}our{/i} promises."
    voice "se/y00655.ogg"
    char_ulric "他们的话对人们似乎很有分量，哪怕行动根本跟不上。\n在我看来，他们的承诺迟早会沦为耳边风。\n也就是说——除非我们先把他们拉下马。至少我们会{i}兑现{/i}自己的承诺。"

# game/script.rpy:30839
translate chinese Ulric6_map054_9_0_bdeddf8b:

    # voice "se/y00656.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Depends what you're wanting to know. Just give me a try."
    voice "se/y00656.ogg"
    char_ulric "那得看你想知道什么。尽管问吧。"

