# game/script.rpy:30916
translate chinese Ulric7_map054_9_0_3954dcb3:

    # char_ulric "There isn't much to say. He always pops in to mess up our plans.\nEvery time we battle The Honor Guard, he's right there with them.\nThe Triumvirate barely leaves their castle, so he's almost like a stand-in for them."
    char_ulric "没什么好说的。他总冒出来打乱我们的计划。\n每次我们和荣誉卫队交战时，他都和他们在一起。\n三人执政团几乎不离开他们的城堡，所以他差不多就是他们的替身。"

# game/script.rpy:30919
translate chinese Ulric7_map054_9_0_c56cf239:

    # voice "se/y00661.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Basically, anytime we're against enemy forces, he's there.\nBut you learn a lot about the man in the way he fights. So I know a lot about him.\nI've never seen anybody with such strong conviction. He truly believes he's doing the right thing."
    voice "se/y00661.ogg"
    char_ulric "基本上，只要我们对抗敌军，他就在场。\n但从一个人的打法里能看出很多。所以我对他了解不少。\n我从没见过信念如此坚定的人。他真的相信自己做的没错。"

# game/script.rpy:30937
translate chinese Ulric7_map054_9_0_17e78828:

    # voice "se/y00662.ogg"
    voice "se/y00662.ogg"

