# game/script.rpy:30982
translate chinese Ulric8_map054_9_0_26a1a385:

    # char_ulric "I haven't been able to get a read on her yet, which is rare for me.\nNormally I'm a good judge of character — but on her, I'm drawing a blank.\nNot to say that's a bad thing. She carries herself admirably; but she's just closed off."
    char_ulric "我到现在还看不透她，这对我来说很少见。\n平时我挺会看人的——可对她，我一片空白。\n倒不是说这是坏事。她举止令人钦佩，只是太封闭了。"

# game/script.rpy:30985
translate chinese Ulric8_map054_9_0_befa2b02:

    # voice "se/y00665.ogg"
    # char_ulric "At the end of the day, she won't cause me any concern, so that's a good thing.\nBut I find myself wondering why she's so scared to open up. It's not like we'll hurt her.\nSome might say that's a personality trait on its own, but not me. I like to dig deeper."
    voice "se/y00665.ogg"
    char_ulric "说到底，她不会让我操心，这是好事。\n可我忍不住想，她为什么这么怕敞开心扉。我们又不会伤害她。\n有人也许会说这本身就是种性格，但我不这么看。我喜欢往深处挖。"

# game/script.rpy:31003
translate chinese Ulric8_map054_9_0_ce246a97:

    # voice "se/y00666.ogg"
    voice "se/y00666.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:31005
translate chinese Ulric8_map054_9_0_ac7e6c2a:

    # char_ulric "Honestly? He's a little much. Energy wise, I mean.\nI used to be like him when I was younger, but it's better to conserve your energy.\nIf you waste it without thought like he does, you won't have it when you actually need it."
    char_ulric "说实话？他有点太过了。我是说精力方面。\n我年轻时也像他那样，但还是节省点精力为好。\n要是像他那样不加思索地耗光，真需要的时候就没得用了。"

# game/script.rpy:31008
translate chinese Ulric8_map054_9_0_c721fbf9:

    # voice "se/y00667.ogg"
    # char_ulric "That's pretty much why I'm so calm all the time. I'm waiting to put my energy to good use.\nNormally, that \"good use\" involves either a fight, or some stiff drinks. You'll see.\nOnce we get to Mazeo, there's a Tavern that gets my highest recommendation."
    voice "se/y00667.ogg"
    char_ulric "这差不多就是我一直这么冷静的原因。我在等一个把精力用在刀刃上的机会。\n通常这种“刀刃”要么是打一架，要么是几杯烈酒。你会见识到的。\n等我们到了马泽奥，有家酒馆我极力推荐。"

# game/script.rpy:31026
translate chinese Ulric8_map054_9_0_dcd5d72a:

    # voice "se/y00668.ogg"
    voice "se/y00668.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:31028
translate chinese Ulric8_map054_9_0_48e5c7ed:

    # char_ulric "We don't seem to get along, but he's actually one of my best friends.\nHe just has this way of poking fun at everybody. It's his way of showing love.\nWith a troubled past like his, I wouldn't be surprised if he thought that's what love {i}is{/i}."
    char_ulric "我们看着合不来，可他其实是我最好的朋友之一。\n他就是有那种爱拿人打趣的毛病，那是他表达关爱的方式。\n有他那样坎坷的过去，他会以为爱{i}就是{/i}那样，我一点也不意外。"

# game/script.rpy:31045
translate chinese Ulric8_map054_9_0_64678825:

    # voice "se/y00669.ogg"
    voice "se/y00669.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:31047
translate chinese Ulric8_map054_9_0_7614daf7:

    # char_ulric "You're good at following orders, I'll give you that much.\nI'm not sure if you're just clueless, or full of national pride.\nEither way, it's a good thing. We can't have you full of doubt."
    char_ulric "你很听命令，这点我承认。\n我说不准你是真不懂，还是满怀家国自豪感。\n不管怎样，这都是好事。我们不能让你满心疑虑。"

# game/script.rpy:31060
translate chinese Ulric8_map054_9_0_ac012b8d:

    # voice "se/y00670.ogg"
    # char_ulric "It won't be much longer until you can kick back and relax.\nBut when you do, it'll be as Alestia's hero. Think about that.\nYou had a life of luxury just thrown into your lap. I'm jealous."
    voice "se/y00670.ogg"
    char_ulric "用不了多久，你就能彻底放松下来了。\n但到那时，你会是以阿莱斯蒂亚英雄的身份。好好想想吧。\n锦衣玉食的生活就这么砸到你怀里。我都有点羡慕。"

# game/script.rpy:31084
translate chinese Ulric8_map054_9_0_3e45fb8e:

    # voice "se/y00671.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Well, spare time is pretty scarce these days. But I love a good drink.\nNothing better than winding down a busy day with some ale, right?\nAside from that, I love a good spar. But it's hard to find a challenge."
    voice "se/y00671.ogg"
    char_ulric "唉，这些天闲工夫少得可怜。不过我很爱喝一杯。\n忙完一天来点麦酒放松放松，没什么比这更好了，对吧？\n除此之外，我还喜欢痛快地切磋一场。只是很难找到对手。"

# game/script.rpy:31102
translate chinese Ulric9_map054_9_0_8657a392:

    # voice "se/y00672.ogg"
    voice "se/y00672.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:31104
