    char_damek "我几乎不敢相信这是真的。\n能见到你实在是我的荣幸，[firstname]——真的。"

# game/script.rpy:32557
translate chinese map065_6207fba1:

    # voice "se/z00916.ogg"
    voice "se/z00916.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:32559
translate chinese map065_b89d21cf_1:

    # char_damek "I almost can't believe this is happening.\nIt's an honor to meet you, [firstname] — it truly is."
    char_damek "我几乎不敢相信这是真的。\n能见到你实在是我的荣幸，[firstname]——真的。"

# game/script.rpy:32576
translate chinese map065_2ff36c2d:

    # voice "se/z00917.ogg"
    voice "se/z00917.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:32578
translate chinese map065_b402a598:

    # char_damek "What...? Oh, cut it out.\nThere's no need to say things like that.\nTrust me — you're already on my good side."
    char_damek "什么……？哦，别这么说。\n没必要讲这种话。\n相信我——你早就已经讨我喜欢了。"

# game/script.rpy:32592
translate chinese map065_24aa980f:

    # "I reach out to shake his hand, but he immediately pulls back.{w}\nWith a nervous laugh, he rubs the back of his head. Did I do something wrong?{w}\nHe seemed excited to meet me, so I assumed a handshake was in order."
    "我伸手想和他握手，他却立刻缩了回去。{w}\n他紧张地笑了笑，挠着后脑勺。我做错什么了吗？{w}\n他看起来见到我很兴奋，所以我还以为该握个手。"

# game/script.rpy:32606
translate chinese map065_e8650fb2:

    # voice "se/z00918.ogg"
    voice "se/z00918.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:32608
translate chinese map065_02b37f4f:

    # char_damek "And you're just as polite as I imagined!\nThere's no need to be so formal. You're among friends."
    char_damek "你果然和我想象中一样有礼！\n不用这么拘谨，这里都是自己人。"

# game/script.rpy:32622
translate chinese map065_24aa980f_1:

    # "I reach out to shake his hand, but he immediately pulls back.{w}\nWith a nervous laugh, he rubs the back of his head. Did I do something wrong?{w}\nHe seemed excited to meet me, so I assumed a handshake was in order."
    "我伸手想和他握手，他却立刻缩了回去。{w}\n他紧张地笑了笑，挠着后脑勺。我做错什么了吗？{w}\n他看起来见到我很兴奋，所以我还以为该握个手。"

# game/script.rpy:32636
translate chinese map065_bac3aa55:

    # voice "se/z00919.ogg"
    voice "se/z00919.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:32638
translate chinese map065_7770b5e9:

    # char_damek "You're joking, right...?\nI think the spirits themselves have chosen you.\nIn my mind — there's no greater honor than that."
    char_damek "你在开玩笑吧……？\n我认为是灵亲自选择了你。\n在我看来——没有比这更高的荣耀了。"

# game/script.rpy:32652
translate chinese map065_1d809795:

    # "As a formality, I reach out to shake his hand, but he immediately pulls back.{w}\nWith a nervous laugh, he rubs the back of his head. Did I do something wrong?{w}\nHe seemed excited to meet me, so I assumed a handshake was in order."
    "出于礼节，我伸手想和他握手，他却立刻缩了回去。{w}\n他紧张地笑了笑，挠着后脑勺。我做错什么了吗？{w}\n他看起来见到我很兴奋，所以我还以为该握个手。"

# game/script.rpy:32666
translate chinese map065_8b80947a:

    # voice "se/z00920.ogg"
    voice "se/z00920.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:32668
translate chinese map065_3dc28b36:

    # char_damek "I hope the journey from Valinorth wasn't too bad.\nThe weather seemed fair. It's just those Bloodleaves...\nWe might have to talk about that some more in a bit."
    char_damek "希望从瓦利诺斯来的旅途不算太糟。\n天气看着还不错。就是那些血叶……\n我们待会儿也许得再谈谈这件事。"

# game/script.rpy:32682
translate chinese map065_24aa980f_2:

    # "I reach out to shake his hand, but he immediately pulls back.{w}\nWith a nervous laugh, he rubs the back of his head. Did I do something wrong?{w}\nHe seemed excited to meet me, so I assumed a handshake was in order."
    "我伸手想和他握手，他却立刻缩了回去。{w}\n他紧张地笑了笑，挠着后脑勺。我做错什么了吗？{w}\n他看起来见到我很兴奋，所以我还以为该握个手。"

# game/script.rpy:32707
translate chinese map065_afd88d7a:

    # voice "se/z00921.ogg"
    voice "se/z00921.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:32709
translate chinese map065_d566484d:

    # char_damek "Anyway — shall we get going...?\nWe have quite a busy day ahead of us."
    char_damek "总之——我们出发吧？\n今天要忙的事可不少。"

# game/script.rpy:32723
translate chinese map065_2b28c509:

    # "He starts walking, expecting us to follow.{w}\nBut as soon as he gets to Pro, he stops in his tracks."
    "他开始往前走，等着我们跟上。{w}\n可一走到普洛面前，他就停住了脚步。"

# game/script.rpy:32748
translate chinese map065_034d0822:

    # voice "se/z00922.ogg"
    voice "se/z00922.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:32750
translate chinese map065_d64c1128:

    # char_damek "Oh, just one more thing before we move along.\nYou'll be on cleaning duty for the next month, Pro."
    char_damek "哦，走之前还有一件事。\n普洛，接下来一个月你负责打扫。"

# game/script.rpy:32775
translate chinese map065_02ad6a25:

    # voice "se/z00923.ogg"
    voice "se/z00923.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:32777
translate chinese map065_83d3a92b:

    # char_pro "What!? What did I do...?"
    char_pro "什么！？我做了什么……？"

# game/script.rpy:32802
translate chinese map065_3cf9616e:

    # voice "se/z00924.ogg"
    voice "se/z00924.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:32804
translate chinese map065_d902e89b:

    # char_damek "It's more about what you {i}didn't{/i} do.\nAnd the answer to that — is everything.\nI ended up sending Ulric to pick up your slack."
    char_damek "更准确地说，是你{i}没做{/i}什么。\n而答案是——什么都没做。\n最后我只好派乌尔里克去补你的缺。"

# game/script.rpy:32807
translate chinese map065_c8925d7f:

    # voice "se/z00925.ogg"
    # char_damek "We can't afford to waste time anymore.\nI'm sure you had your reasons, but—"
    voice "se/z00925.ogg"
    char_damek "我们再也耗不起时间了。\n我相信你有你的理由，可是——"

# game/script.rpy:32833
translate chinese map065_a36714c7:

    # voice "se/z00926.ogg"
    voice "se/z00926.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:32835
translate chinese map065_8ee9a8bd:

    # char_pro "Yeah, and they were really good reasons!\nI couldn't just march into Valinorth with the blade!\nI need to have {i}some{/i} discretion. It took time!"
    char_pro "是啊，而且都是非常充分的理由！\n我总不能背着那把剑大摇大摆走进瓦利诺斯吧！\n我总得有点{i}分寸{/i}。这需要时间！"

# game/script.rpy:32860
translate chinese map065_7101a1a9:

    # voice "se/z00927.ogg"
    voice "se/z00927.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:32862
translate chinese map065_666a2464:

    # char_damek "Really, Pro?\nYou know you can't throw excuses at me.\nI know how this stuff works. You were lazy."
    char_damek "真的吗，普洛？\n你知道你糊弄不了我。\n这种事我清楚得很。你就是偷懒了。"

# game/script.rpy:32887
translate chinese map065_c389e00c:

    # "He lets out a loud sigh, while Pro shuffles in place, ashamed."
    "他长叹一声，普洛则羞愧地原地挪着脚。"

# game/script.rpy:32912
translate chinese map065_da90ddac:

    # voice "se/z00928.ogg"
    voice "se/z00928.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:32914
translate chinese map065_85fe9aef:

    # char_damek "I suppose it's my fault in the first place.\nI should've known better than to send you there.\nWith a Tavern in the way, your priorities would be clear."
    char_damek "说起来，这起初也该怪我。\n我早该知道不该派你去那种地方。\n路上有家酒馆，你会先顾哪头就可想而知了。"

# game/script.rpy:32935
translate chinese map065_8a92bfb8:

    # "After their spat, Damek turns to face me with a smile.\nEven when he was scolding — it was polite. That's interesting.\nI can start to see why people would like to follow him."
    "两人斗完嘴，达梅克笑着转向我。\n就连训人的时候，他也彬彬有礼。这挺有意思。\n我开始明白为什么人们愿意追随他了。"

# game/script.rpy:32960
translate chinese map065_4bbaeb0b:

    # voice "se/z00929.ogg"
    voice "se/z00929.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:32962
translate chinese map065_b2d95536:

    # char_damek "Anyway, we have some business with The Mayor.\nLet's head to his house — I'll explain there.\nAfter that, I'll give you a tour of our HQ."
    char_damek "总之，我们和市长有些事要谈。\n去他家吧——我到那儿再解释。\n之后我带你们参观一下我们的总部。"

# game/script.rpy:32987
translate chinese map065_e93993a1:

    # voice "se/z00930.ogg"
    voice "se/z00930.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:32989
translate chinese map065_e58e6af6:

    # char_ulric "Plans with Gryz...?\nIs it about the Pirates?"
    char_ulric "和格瑞兹的计划……？\n是关于海盗的事吗？"

# game/script.rpy:33014
translate chinese map065_d544e040:

    # voice "se/z00931.ogg"
    voice "se/z00931.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:33016
translate chinese map065_3226f94c:

    # char_damek "I said I'd explain when we get there, Ulric.\nWe can't talk about this kinda stuff out in the open.\nFinish up whatever business you have, and we'll get going."
    char_damek "我说了到了再解释，乌尔里克。\n这种事不能在大庭广众下谈。\n把手头的事办完，我们就出发。"

# game/script.rpy:33041
translate chinese map065_0a192bb6:

    # "With that said, I guess it was time to head to The Mayor's house.{w}\nI knew nothing about Mazeo, so I didn't know if this was a detour or not.{w}\nBut either way, my training with The Blade of Exodus would surely begin today."
    "话虽如此，该去市长家了。{w}\n我对马泽奥一无所知，所以不知道这算不算绕路。{w}\n但无论如何，我的放逐之刃训练今天肯定要开始了。"

# game/script.rpy:33055
translate chinese map065_f061bd87:

    # "I look at Valessa and Fortaime, and we nod at one another.{w}\nI guess I'd finish up any business here, then follow Damek.{w}\nMy legs are tired — but it feels like our trek was almost over."
    "我看了看瓦莱莎和福泰姆，彼此点了点头。{w}\n我想，我得先办完这里的事，再跟达梅克走。{w}\n我的腿很累——但感觉这趟跋涉快到头了。"

# game/script.rpy:33068
translate chinese map065_26f3cf09:

    # "Damek has now permanently joined your party.\nA new statistic, Morale, has also been unlocked."
    "达梅克现已永久加入你的队伍。\n新属性“士气”也已解锁。"

# game/script.rpy:33076
translate chinese map065_7859d261:

    # "Morale may rise and fall over the course of the game.{w}\nYour army and their welfare will be affected by your choices.{w}\nEnsure a high Morale, or your forces may not survive the coming war."
    "士气会在游戏进程中起伏。{w}\n你的选择将影响你的军队及其福祉。{w}\n务必保持高士气，否则你的军队可能撑不过即将到来的战争。"

# game/script.rpy:33427
translate chinese Damek1_map064_4_0_2f03770e:

    # char_damek "Hey." nointeract
    char_damek "嘿。" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:33444
translate chinese Damek1_map064_4_0_340dfffc:

    # voice "se/y00677.ogg"
    # char_damek "Well, it all depends on what you'd like to know.\nI mean, I'm an open book, but I don't know where to start.\nFeel free to throw a few questions at me. I'll play along."
    voice "se/y00677.ogg"
    char_damek "那得看你想知道什么了。\n我是说，我没什么好隐瞒的，可不知道该从哪儿说起。\n尽管问我几个问题，我会配合的。"

# game/script.rpy:33462
translate chinese Damek2_map064_4_0_a4911eb4:

    # voice "se/y00678.ogg"
    voice "se/y00678.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:33464
translate chinese Damek2_map064_4_0_5e3abc57:

    # char_damek "Twenty-seven. Not too young, not too old.\nI'm in the perfect place to be leading this army.\nA lot of the other victims were far younger than me."
    char_damek "二十七岁。不算太年轻，也不算太老。\n我正处在统领这支军队的最佳年纪。\n其他许多受害者都比我小得多。"

# game/script.rpy:33467
translate chinese Damek2_map064_4_0_c57acd89:

    # voice "se/y00679.ogg"
    # char_damek "And those that weren't, were far older.\nThey took on more of a \"caregiver\" role.\nPlenty of orphans needed plenty of parents."
    voice "se/y00679.ogg"
    char_damek "而那些不是的，都比我大得多。\n他们更多扮演着“看护者”的角色。\n那么多孤儿，需要那么多父母。"

# game/script.rpy:33485
translate chinese Damek2_map064_4_0_2443e861:

    # voice "se/y00680.ogg"
    voice "se/y00680.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:33487
translate chinese Damek2_map064_4_0_8ea45d91:

    # char_damek "I must've been about six or seven years old.\nA lot of the details are like a blur in my head.\nMaybe my mind did that on purpose, you know?"
    char_damek "我那时大概只有六七岁。\n很多细节在我脑中都是一片模糊。\n也许是我的脑子故意如此，你懂吧？"

# game/script.rpy:33490
translate chinese Damek2_map064_4_0_c48a33bc:

    # voice "se/y00681.ogg"
    # char_damek "But I was rescued by a small group of townspeople.\nAfter the battle died down, they started picking up the scraps.\nThe Rebellion wasn't formed just yet, that was just starting."
    voice "se/y00681.ogg"
    char_damek "不过我被一小群镇民救了下来。\n战斗平息后，他们开始收拾残局。\n那时候反抗军还没成立，才刚刚起步。"

# game/script.rpy:33494
translate chinese Damek2_map064_4_0_4b9eef4e:

    # voice "se/y00682.ogg"
    # char_damek "Salus, the previous Elder of Valinorth, came to visit.\nThe treaty, and The Rebellion, were formed shortly after.\nI had no place to go, and no family. I was forced to fight."
    voice "se/y00682.ogg"
    char_damek "瓦利诺斯的前任长老萨鲁斯来探访。\n不久之后，条约和反抗军便成立了。\n我无处可去，也无家可归，只能被迫战斗。"

# game/script.rpy:33498
translate chinese Damek2_map064_4_0_4138a321:

    # voice "se/y00683.ogg"
    # char_damek "But that's not really a bad thing, you know?\nI'm pretty strong now, trained for almost any scenario.\nI just wish I didn't have to miss out on a regular childhood."
    voice "se/y00683.ogg"
    char_damek "不过你知道，这其实也不算坏事。\n我现在挺强的，几乎什么情况都训练过。\n我只是希望自己不必错过一个正常的童年。"

# game/script.rpy:33516
translate chinese Damek2_map064_4_0_7cc7f69e:

    # voice "se/y00684.ogg"
    voice "se/y00684.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:33518
translate chinese Damek2_map064_4_0_e09daa91:

    # char_damek "Oh, of course not. I don't have time for that.\nI mean, maybe when this war is over, or something.\nBut right now? I'm far too busy with everything else."
    char_damek "哦，当然没有。我没那个时间。\n我是说，也许等这场战争结束了什么的。\n但现在？别的事已经够我忙的了。"

# game/script.rpy:33521
translate chinese Damek2_map064_4_0_5288bbbe:

    # voice "se/y00685.ogg"
    # char_damek "And truth be told, I wouldn't even know where to start.\nThe orphans of the occupation were taught war, not love.\nOther than fighting this battle, I'm not meant for much else."
    voice "se/y00685.ogg"
    char_damek "说实话，我甚至不知道该从何开始。\n占领时期的孤儿学到的是战争，而不是爱。\n除了打这场仗，我大概也做不了别的。"

# game/script.rpy:33539
translate chinese Damek2_map064_4_0_d89de14d:

    # voice "se/y00686.ogg"
    voice "se/y00686.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:33541
translate chinese Damek2_map064_4_0_6cb4ffe6:

    # char_damek "I don't really have time for hobbies, to be honest.\nUnless the war table, or sparring, count as hobbies.\nAfter this war, maybe I'll pick up a few pastimes."
    char_damek "老实说，我没什么时间发展爱好。\n除非作战桌和切磋也算爱好。\n等这场战争结束，也许我会找几个消遣。"

# game/script.rpy:33544
translate chinese Damek2_map064_4_0_f529dfbc:

    # voice "se/y00687.ogg"
    # char_damek "But right now, I really don't have the time.\nI've been training and working since I was a kid.\nThey had no hesitation in letting a child wield a sword."
    voice "se/y00687.ogg"
    char_damek "但现在，我真的没时间。\n我从小就在训练和工作。\n他们毫不犹豫地让一个孩子拿起剑。"

# game/script.rpy:33568
translate chinese Damek2_map064_4_0_7c962efd:

    # voice "se/y00688.ogg"
    # char_damek "Well, almost everything, I'd assume.\nI was one of the \"founding members\" with Salus.\nI guess they liked that term more than \"child soldier\"."
    voice "se/y00688.ogg"
    char_damek "嗯，我想几乎所有事吧。\n我是和萨鲁斯一起的“创始成员”之一。\n大概是他们觉得这说法比“童兵”好听。"

# game/script.rpy:33586
translate chinese Damek3_map064_4_0_eeaa83ee:

    # voice "se/y00689.ogg"
    voice "se/y00689.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:33588
translate chinese Damek3_map064_4_0_da0fe7a3:

    # char_damek "When The Triumvirate took over Mazeo, they had one goal.\nDig deep underground, and find the true spirit idol of this nation.\nThey made their Honor Guard do this. Those empty suits of armor."
    char_damek "三人执政团接管马泽奥时，只有一个目标。\n往地下深处挖掘，找到这个国家真正的灵像。\n他们让荣誉卫队来做这件事。就是那些空荡荡的盔甲。"

# game/script.rpy:33591
translate chinese Damek3_map064_4_0_6db646a9:

    # voice "se/y00690.ogg"
    # char_damek "But while they dug, they also created a sort of \"barracks\" down there.\nI'm not sure why, because the Honor Guard couldn't make use of it.\nBut I'm assuming it was for when real people came for inspections."
    voice "se/y00690.ogg"
    char_damek "但挖掘的同时，他们也在下面建了个类似“营房”的地方。\n我不清楚为什么，因为荣誉卫队根本用不上。\n不过我猜那是给真人来视察时用的。"

# game/script.rpy:33595
translate chinese Damek3_map064_4_0_dc045320:

    # voice "se/y00691.ogg"
    # char_damek "Either way, they basically turned it into a paradise.\nBeds, weapons, training rooms, a war table — everything.\nWhen I first saw it, I knew I had to win it for The Rebellion."
    voice "se/y00691.ogg"
    char_damek "不管怎样，他们基本上把它打造成了一个天堂。\n床铺、武器、训练室、作战桌——应有尽有。\n我第一次看到时，就知道必须为反抗军把它夺过来。"

# game/script.rpy:33609
translate chinese Damek3_map064_4_0_9176b4c8:

    # voice "se/y00692.ogg"
    # char_damek "Thankfully, Gryz had been turning to our side.\nIt wasn't hard to woo over The Mayor, and get the deed.\nHis only condition was that {i}he{/i} got access to the idol first."
    voice "se/y00692.ogg"
    char_damek "还好，格瑞兹当时已经在倒向我们。\n拉拢市长、拿到地契并不难。\n他唯一的条件就是{i}他{/i}要先接触那尊灵像。"

# game/script.rpy:33613
translate chinese Damek3_map064_4_0_dccd3172:

    # voice "se/y00693.ogg"
    # char_damek "I'm not sure what he wants to do with it.\nBut he can't really do anything, if I'm honest.\nNot without you, or The Blade of Exodus."
    voice "se/y00693.ogg"
    char_damek "我不清楚他想拿它做什么。\n但说实话，他也做不了什么。\n没有你，或是没有放逐之刃，他都办不到。"

# game/script.rpy:33631
translate chinese Damek3_map064_4_0_fceb8a0f:

    # voice "se/y00694.ogg"
    voice "se/y00694.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:33633
translate chinese Damek3_map064_4_0_e1644ea5:

    # char_damek "Salus? Well, he was a father figure to a lot of us.\nThat's probably why his sacrifice hit us all so hard.\nYou {i}do{/i} remember that he was The Elder of Valinorth, right?"
    char_damek "萨鲁斯？他就像我们许多人的父亲。\n大概正因如此，他的牺牲才让我们所有人深受打击。\n你{i}应该{/i}记得他是瓦利诺斯的长老吧？"

# game/script.rpy:33636
translate chinese Damek3_map064_4_0_40019e53:

    # voice "se/y00695.ogg"
    # char_damek "It's not like he took on a secret double life, he was still the same.\nIf anything, at least now you have an explanation for his \"trips\".\nHe was helping out The Rebellion {i}and{/i} Valinorth. That's a tall order."
    voice "se/y00695.ogg"
    char_damek "他并不是过起了什么秘密的双面人生，他还是原来那个他。\n要说有什么不同，至少现在你能解释他的那些“外出”了。\n他同时帮着反抗军{i}和{/i}瓦利诺斯。这可不是一般的担子。"

# game/script.rpy:33654
translate chinese Damek3_map064_4_0_9d33edb0:

    # voice "se/y00696.ogg"
    voice "se/y00696.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:33656
translate chinese Damek3_map064_4_0_a8a63784:

    # char_damek "Salus saw the chaos and destruction in Mazeo, and wanted to help.\nIn fact, even some people from Valinorth were here during The Occupation.\nHe likely discovered what happened by inquiring after their \"disappearance\"."
    char_damek "萨鲁斯目睹了马泽奥的混乱与毁灭，想要伸出援手。\n其实，占领期间连一些瓦利诺斯人也在这里。\n他大概是通过打听他们的“失踪”才得知了事情的经过。"

# game/script.rpy:33659
translate chinese Damek3_map064_4_0_7844beb0:

    # voice "se/y00697.ogg"
    # char_damek "Either way, he quickly met with the band of survivors and orphans.\nOffering them funding, and protection, the seeds were planted.\nThey became an organization, with a goal. They had purpose."
    voice "se/y00697.ogg"
    char_damek "总之，他很快会见了那群幸存者和孤儿。\n提供资金和保护，种子就此埋下。\n他们成了一个有目标的组织，有了自己的使命。"

# game/script.rpy:33663
translate chinese Damek3_map064_4_0_6f68f473:

    # voice "se/y00698.ogg"
    # char_damek "Salus likely knew that Valinorth would be occupied as well.\nSo training an army to enact revenge would benefit both nations.\nThey established Peregrino as a central location, and here we are."
    voice "se/y00698.ogg"
    char_damek "萨鲁斯大概料到瓦利诺斯也会被占领。\n所以训练一支军队去复仇对两个国家都有好处。\n他们把佩雷格里诺设为中枢，于是就有了今天。"

# game/script.rpy:33677
translate chinese Damek3_map064_4_0_ee9ad858:

    # voice "se/y00699.ogg"
    # char_damek "Over the next twenty years, the orphans grew stronger.\nAs soon as we were battle-ready, we launched the Exodus Raid.\nSalus told me more about {i}you{/i}, and I took over when he passed."
    voice "se/y00699.ogg"
    char_damek "接下来的二十年里，孤儿们越来越强。\n我们一做好战斗准备，就发动了放逐突袭。\n萨鲁斯跟我讲了更多关于{i}你{/i}的事，他去世后便由我接手。"

# game/script.rpy:33695
translate chinese Damek3_map064_4_0_10afef25:

    # voice "se/y00700.ogg"
    voice "se/y00700.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:33697
translate chinese Damek3_map064_4_0_6f4d8898:

    # char_damek "Several hundred, but under a thousand.\nWe're a fully realized army, and I {i}know{/i} we can do this.\nWith you and that blade, our victory is pretty much secured."
    char_damek "几百人，不到一千。\n我们是一支羽翼丰满的军队，我{i}知道{/i}我们做得到。\n有你，还有那把剑，我们的胜利几乎已是定局。"

# game/script.rpy:33714
translate chinese Damek3_map064_4_0_9d6ce4e3:

    # voice "se/y00701.ogg"
    voice "se/y00701.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:33716
translate chinese Damek3_map064_4_0_590b65d7:

    # char_damek "It's wonderful. Everybody is in a great mood.\nWe have the numbers, and the strength to put up a fight.\nBut on top of that, we have {i}you{/i}, and The Blade of Exodus."
    char_damek "非常好。每个人都斗志高昂。\n我们有兵力，也有抗衡的实力。\n而除此之外，我们还有{i}你{/i}，还有放逐之刃。"

# game/script.rpy:33719
translate chinese Damek3_map064_4_0_a209ac92:

    # voice "se/y00702.ogg"
    # char_damek "When you're trained with it, you can lead the final battle.\nThat Blade isn't just a weapon — but a symbol of hope.\nIt sets us apart from every previous insurrection."
    voice "se/y00702.ogg"
    char_damek "等你练成之后，就能领军打最后一战。\n那把剑不只是武器——更是希望的象征。\n它让我们与以往每一次起义都截然不同。"

# game/script.rpy:33725
translate chinese Damek3_map064_4_0_f107c7d0:

    # voice "se/y00703.ogg"
    voice "se/y00703.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:33727
translate chinese Damek3_map064_4_0_f0964162:

    # char_damek "With its power, you'll be unstoppable.\nI hope you're ready to go down in history as a hero.\nThe man who changed Alestia {i}forever{/i}."
    char_damek "有了它的力量，你将无可阻挡。\n希望你已准备好作为英雄载入史册。\n那个{i}永远{/i}改变了阿莱斯蒂亚的男人。"

# game/script.rpy:33732
translate chinese Damek3_map064_4_0_6274c722:

    # voice "se/y00704.ogg"
    voice "se/y00704.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:33734
translate chinese Damek3_map064_4_0_98f0cda6:

    # char_damek "With its power, you'll be unstoppable.\nI hope you're ready to go down in history as a hero.\nThe woman who changed Alestia {i}forever{/i}."
    char_damek "有了它的力量，你将无可阻挡。\n希望你已准备好作为英雄载入史册。\n那个{i}永远{/i}改变了阿莱斯蒂亚的女人。"

# game/script.rpy:33757
translate chinese Damek3_map064_4_0_97ef6cd7:

    # voice "se/y00705.ogg"
    # char_damek "We don't know too much about them, to be honest.\nThey're shrouded in mystery, and only rule from their chambers.\nWe've tried to coax them out, but so far, nothing has worked."
    voice "se/y00705.ogg"
    char_damek "老实说，我们对他们了解不多。\n他们笼罩在谜团之中，只在寝宫里发号施令。\n我们试过引他们出来，但至今毫无成效。"

# game/script.rpy:33775
translate chinese Damek4_map064_4_0_0473ea33:

    # voice "se/y00706.ogg"
    voice "se/y00706.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:33777
translate chinese Damek4_map064_4_0_340dce4e:

    # char_damek "Not a clue. It's anyone's guess.\nHopefully we'll find some answers after all this is over.\nThere's gotta be some record of their past, right?"
    char_damek "一无所知。谁也说不准。\n希望等这一切结束后能找到些答案。\n他们的过去总该有些记录吧？"

# game/script.rpy:33790
translate chinese Damek4_map064_4_0_f73a87b1:

    # voice "se/y00707.ogg"
    # char_damek "At least, that's what I'm hoping for.\nBut I'll have to be content if we never find out.\nMy main goal is liberating Alestia, and gaining freedom."
    voice "se/y00707.ogg"
    char_damek "至少我是这么希望的。\n但如果始终查不出来，我也只能接受。\n我的主要目标是解放阿莱斯蒂亚，赢得自由。"

# game/script.rpy:33808
translate chinese Damek4_map064_4_0_7bf89711:

    # voice "se/y00708.ogg"
    voice "se/y00708.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:33810
translate chinese Damek4_map064_4_0_78bc3142:

    # char_damek "At least as old as Alestia. Or something like that.\nHistory seems to have \"begun\" when they did.\nEither that, or they covered up the past."
    char_damek "至少和阿莱斯蒂亚一样古老，大概是这样。\n历史似乎是从他们出现时“开始”的。\n要么如此，要么就是他们掩盖了过去。"

# game/script.rpy:33813
translate chinese Damek4_map064_4_0_e6b5e5d7:

    # voice "se/y00709.ogg"
    # char_damek "There's no record of history prior to their rule.\nSo that's why everybody regards them as \"Gods\".\nBut there's more to the story, I can feel it in my gut."
    voice "se/y00709.ogg"
    char_damek "他们统治之前的历史没有任何记录。\n所以人人都把他们奉为“神明”。\n但事情不止于此，我的直觉告诉我的。"

# game/script.rpy:33831
translate chinese Damek4_map064_4_0_16530d5f:

    # voice "se/y00710.ogg"
    voice "se/y00710.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:33833
translate chinese Damek4_map064_4_0_7eaf88fe:

    # char_damek "No, we just know that they wear white and gold cloaks.\nThis is from reliable firsthand accounts, of course.\nSome people have met them and lived to tell."
    char_damek "不，我们只知道他们披着白金色的斗篷。\n当然，这来自可靠的第一手证词。\n有人见过他们，还活着把这事说了出来。"

# game/script.rpy:33836
translate chinese Damek4_map064_4_0_b77f7955:

    # voice "se/y00711.ogg"
    # char_damek "Underneath those cloaks, however, is anyone's guess.\nSome people even theorize that there's nothing underneath.\nThat's pretty scary, if you ask me. They'd be like living spirits."
    voice "se/y00711.ogg"
    char_damek "至于斗篷底下是什么，谁也说不准。\n有人甚至推测底下什么都没有。\n要我来说，那可挺吓人的。他们就像活着的灵。"

# game/script.rpy:33854
translate chinese Damek4_map064_4_0_07a5cb0f:

    # voice "se/y00712.ogg"
    voice "se/y00712.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:33856
translate chinese Damek4_map064_4_0_1262a964:

    # char_damek "I think so. As far as we know, they've had it forever.\nAncient writings and murals have depicted the blade.\nWe still don't know for sure, though. They could've found it."
    char_damek "我想是的。据我们所知，那把剑一直属于他们。\n古老的文字和壁画上都描绘过那把剑。\n不过我们还不能确定。也许他们是捡到的。"

# game/script.rpy:33859
translate chinese Damek4_map064_4_0_fd70a3c3:

    # voice "se/y00713.ogg"
    # char_damek "What we need to worry about, is the power the blade houses.\nIt gave them the power to enslave an entire world of innocent people.\nWe must never resort to the same thing. I want to destroy it when this is over."
    voice "se/y00713.ogg"
    char_damek "我们该担心的是那把剑蕴含的力量。\n它赋予了他们奴役这整个无辜世界的力量。\n我们绝不能重蹈覆辙。等这一切结束后，我想毁掉它。"

# game/script.rpy:33877
translate chinese Damek4_map064_4_0_cc0696e8:

    # voice "se/y00714.ogg"
    voice "se/y00714.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:33879
translate chinese Damek4_map064_4_0_8b039508:

    # char_damek "I'd like to think so, yeah.\nIt's actually a bit ironic, isn't it...?\nTheir own weapon, used against them."
    char_damek "我倒愿意这么想。\n其实还挺讽刺的，不是吗……？\n用他们自己的武器来对付他们。"

# game/script.rpy:33892
translate chinese Damek4_map064_4_0_4ba33172:

    # voice "se/y00715.ogg"
    # char_damek "As soon as you learn to use it, we'll be good to go.\nI have no doubt in my mind that it's strong enough.\nYou were chosen by the spirits for this destiny."
    voice "se/y00715.ogg"
    char_damek "等你学会使用它，我们就能行动了。\n我毫不怀疑它的力量足够强大。\n你是被灵选中来承担这份命运的。"

# game/script.rpy:33916
translate chinese Damek4_map064_4_0_119c33ac:

    # voice "se/y00716.ogg"
    # char_damek "Sure, what would you like to know?"
    voice "se/y00716.ogg"
    char_damek "当然，你想知道什么？"

# game/script.rpy:33934
translate chinese Damek5_map064_4_0_e8dae55f:

    # voice "se/y00717.ogg"
    voice "se/y00717.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:33936
translate chinese Damek5_map064_4_0_91b2496f:

    # char_damek "Well, I don't really know anything about her, yet.\nBut I'd like to change that, if I get the opportunity.\nI think she seems like a wonderful person."
    char_damek "嗯，我还不太了解她。\n但如果有机会，我想改变这一点。\n我觉得她看起来是个很好的人。"

# game/script.rpy:33953
translate chinese Damek5_map064_4_0_58454fc4:

    # voice "se/y00718.ogg"
    voice "se/y00718.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:33955
translate chinese Damek5_map064_4_0_dc4ea24d:

    # char_damek "He seems really... energetic?\nHonestly, you'll have to ask me again in the future.\nWe just haven't had the chance to hang out just yet."
    char_damek "他看起来真的很……有活力？\n老实说，这事你以后得再问我一次。\n我们到现在还没机会好好相处过。"

# game/script.rpy:33972
translate chinese Damek5_map064_4_0_0c8218b2:

    # voice "se/y00719.ogg"
    voice "se/y00719.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:33974
translate chinese Damek5_map064_4_0_5ff61aaf:

    # char_damek "Ulric is one of my best friends. He really is.\nThere's no man I'd rather have at my back in battle.\nHe's saved me from dying more times than I can count."
    char_damek "乌尔里克是我最好的朋友之一。真的。\n战场上，我最想让他守在我身后。\n他救过我性命的次数我数都数不清。"

# game/script.rpy:33977
translate chinese Damek5_map064_4_0_ae28268e:

    # voice "se/y00720.ogg"
    # char_damek "The Rebellion basically hinges on my planning, and his strength.\nHe'll be at the front of every charge, I can guarantee that much.\nThere's no man in this world quite as strong as him."
    voice "se/y00720.ogg"
    char_damek "反抗军基本上就靠我的谋划和他的武力撑着。\n我敢保证，每次冲锋他都会在最前面。\n这世上没有哪个男人比他更强。"

# game/script.rpy:33995
translate chinese Damek5_map064_4_0_fc1e9448:

    # voice "se/y00721.ogg"
    voice "se/y00721.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:33997
translate chinese Damek5_map064_4_0_7c29f535:

    # char_damek "Right now, I'm a little upset with him, but I'll manage.\nHe's my go-to man when something involves being \"sneaky\".\nHis reconnaissance work has been a great boon to our efforts."
    char_damek "眼下我对他有点不满，不过我能应付。\n凡是需要“偷偷摸摸”的事，我都找他。\n他的侦察工作对我们的行动帮助极大。"

# game/script.rpy:34000
translate chinese Damek5_map064_4_0_e5a50fb6:

    # voice "se/y00722.ogg"
    # char_damek "I suspect that you'll be working with him closely in the future.\nA lot of our final attack on Balteus will involve a stealthy infiltration.\nBut we'll get to more of that in the future. So no need to waste time on it now."
    voice "se/y00722.ogg"
    char_damek "我猜以后你会和他密切合作。\n我们对巴尔泰乌斯的最终进攻很大一部分要靠隐秘渗透。\n不过那些以后再细说，现在不必浪费时间。"

# game/script.rpy:34018
translate chinese Damek5_map064_4_0_5e89b7ed:

    # voice "se/y00723.ogg"
    voice "se/y00723.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:34020
translate chinese Damek5_map064_4_0_2682e5a5:

    # char_damek "Well, I wouldn't know where to start. \nYou're such an important figure to both me and my army.\nBut to Alestia...? You're going to be known as their savior."
    char_damek "嗯，我都不知从何说起。\n对我和我的军队来说，你是如此重要的人物。\n但对阿莱斯蒂亚……？你会被当成他们的救世主。"

# game/script.rpy:34023
translate chinese Damek5_map064_4_0_cf435e4a:

    # voice "se/y00724.ogg"
    # char_damek "I have to admit, you're a bit different than I expected.\nAll this stuff had me thinking you'd be larger than life.\nBut I guess that's my fault. You're just a normal person."
    voice "se/y00724.ogg"
    char_damek "我得承认，你和我想象中有点不一样。\n这些事让我以为你会是个传奇般的人物。\n不过这大概是我的错。你不过是个普通人。"

# game/script.rpy:34027
translate chinese Damek5_map064_4_0_7cd05ce3:

    # voice "se/y00725.ogg"
    # char_damek "The thing that makes you special is on the inside, not the outside.\nI guess it just benefits us that not everybody can see that, right?\nWe wouldn't want you to be a walking target for the enemy to find."
    voice "se/y00725.ogg"
    char_damek "让你与众不同的东西在内在，而不是外表。\n我觉得，不是人人都看得出来，这对我们反而是好事，对吧？\n我们可不想让你成为敌人眼里会走路的靶子。"

# game/script.rpy:34041
translate chinese Damek5_map064_4_0_42391d10:

    # voice "se/y00726.ogg"
    # char_damek "Sure. Anything specific...?"
    voice "se/y00726.ogg"
    char_damek "当然。有具体想问的吗……？"

# game/script.rpy:34059
translate chinese Damek6_map064_4_0_2ff9e176:

    # voice "se/y00727.ogg"
    voice "se/y00727.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:34061
translate chinese Damek6_map064_4_0_fa28a0e7:

    # char_damek "Well, I'll have you rest for the day. \nThen we'll start training you with The Blade of Exodus tomorrow.\nI think that slow exposure therapy will be the best possible approach."
    char_damek "嗯，今天你先休息。\n明天我们就开始带你练放逐之刃。\n我觉得逐步接触的疗法是最好的办法。"

# game/script.rpy:34074
translate chinese Damek6_map064_4_0_1e2a73de:

    # voice "se/y00728.ogg"
    # char_damek "As you build a tolerance for its power, you'll be able to wield it longer.\nOf course, you'll also be training in the basics of sword play.\nUlric will make sure that you learn everything you need to."
    voice "se/y00728.ogg"
    char_damek "随着你对它的力量逐渐产生耐受，你就能使用得更久。\n当然，你也会接受剑术基础训练。\n乌尔里克会确保你学会所有该学的。"

# game/script.rpy:34078
translate chinese Damek6_map064_4_0_7dfd3ef9:

    # voice "se/y00729.ogg"
    # char_damek "We have the benefit of foresight, here.\nWe know The Triumvirate will be busy with Valinorth.\nYou can train, and we can attack Balteus {i}right{/i} under their noses."
    voice "se/y00729.ogg"
    char_damek "我们在这里占着先见之明。\n我们知道三人执政团会忙于瓦利诺斯。\n你可以安心训练，而我们可以{i}就{/i}在他们眼皮底下进攻巴尔泰乌斯。"

# game/script.rpy:34096
translate chinese Damek6_map064_4_0_dbc675ff:

    # voice "se/y00730.ogg"
    voice "se/y00730.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:34098
translate chinese Damek6_map064_4_0_65700459:

    # char_damek "Yeah, and it's something you'll be hearing more of.\nWe have some stuff to take care of for now.\nYou'll get used to the war table, trust me."
    char_damek "是啊，以后你还会经常听到这说法。\n眼下我们还有些事要处理。\n你会习惯作战桌的，相信我。"

# game/script.rpy:34115
translate chinese Damek6_map064_4_0_8eff8304:

    # voice "se/y00731.ogg"
    voice "se/y00731.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:34117
translate chinese Damek6_map064_4_0_16e4dc9d:

    # char_damek "Probably in chaos, and disarray.\nWe can't expect the people to embrace the new leadership.\nBut we'll do our best to win them over, and cater to their desires."
    char_damek "大概会陷入混乱和动荡。\n我们不能指望民众会欣然接受新政权。\n但我们会尽力争取他们，并满足他们的诉求。"

# game/script.rpy:34130
translate chinese Damek6_map064_4_0_6a7c859e:

    # voice "se/y00732.ogg"
    # char_damek "Anything we learn about The Triumvirate will also be useful.\nIf we can prove that they're frauds, the people will accept us easier.\nThe only question is — how in the world do we go about doing that?"
    voice "se/y00732.ogg"
    char_damek "我们了解到的关于三人执政团的任何事都会有用。\n要是能证明他们是骗子，民众会更容易接受我们。\n唯一的问题是——我们到底要怎么做？"

# game/script.rpy:34134
translate chinese Damek6_map064_4_0_3d998cf0:

    # voice "se/y00733.ogg"
    # char_damek "Either way, we'll have lots of work ahead of us.\nWinning this battle doesn't mean we can sit back and rest.\nWe'll have an entire world to rule, and reform. I can't wait."
    voice "se/y00733.ogg"
    char_damek "不管怎样，前头都有大量工作等着我们。\n赢下这场战斗并不意味着我们能高枕无忧。\n我们要统治并改革整个世界。我都等不及了。"

