# game/script.rpy:34422
translate chinese click_map064_44_EV044_702f7c78:

    # voice "se/a00215a.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "Hey, that one looks like your sword, Ulric.\nDid you buy your sword from one of these places?"
    voice "se/a00215a.ogg"
    char_fortaime "嘿，那把看起来像你的剑，乌尔里克。\n你的剑是从这种地方买的吗？"

# game/script.rpy:34426
translate chinese click_map064_44_EV044_8f5226a2:

    # voice "se/a00215b.ogg"
    # char_ulric "No. My sword is ancient.\nRumor says it belonged to an Alarinthian legend.\nWith just how well it's made — I think that's actually true."
    voice "se/a00215b.ogg"
    char_ulric "不是。我的剑年代久远。\n据说它曾属于一位阿拉林西亚的传奇人物。\n光看它做工之精——我觉得那传言是真的。"

# game/script.rpy:34430
translate chinese click_map064_44_EV044_244aaf56:

    # voice "se/a00216.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "Wow, a legend?\nExplains why you carry it around all the time."
    voice "se/a00216.ogg"
    char_fortaime "哇，传奇人物？\n难怪你总是随身带着它。"

# game/script.rpy:34434
translate chinese click_map064_44_EV044_7f206567:

    # voice "se/a00217.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Yeah, I'd hate to leave it unattended.\nEven when I carry it, people beg me to sell it.\nBut it beats leaving it alone, and risking theft."
    voice "se/a00217.ogg"
    char_ulric "是啊，我可不想让它无人看管。\n就算我随身带着，也有人求我卖给他。\n但总好过放着被人偷走。"

# game/script.rpy:34438
translate chinese click_map064_44_EV044_fed55ac1:

    # voice "se/a00218.ogg"
    # char_valessa "So you've used that sword for your entire life?"
    voice "se/a00218.ogg"
    char_valessa "那你一辈子都在用那把剑？"

# game/script.rpy:34442
translate chinese click_map064_44_EV044_463191b9:

    # voice "se/a00219.ogg"
    # char_ulric "I have; and I'll use it for the rest of my life, too.\nIt shows no signs of wearing down. It's perfect.\nI can't say the same about the ones {i}they{/i} have for sale."
    voice "se/a00219.ogg"
    char_ulric "是的；我余生也会一直用它。\n它没有任何磨损的迹象。完美无缺。\n{i}他们{/i}卖的那些我可不敢这么说。"

# game/script.rpy:34445
translate chinese click_map064_44_EV044_7eaf3ab6:

    # "Ulric motions at the market stall that initially got Valessa's attention.{w}\nThe merchant glances over at us, understanding Ulric's accusatory gesture.{w}\nWe quickly run away from the stall before they can speak or chase after us."
    "乌尔里克朝最初引得瓦莱莎注意的那个摊位示意。{w}\n那商人瞥了我们一眼，明白了乌尔里克那透着指责的手势。{w}\n还没等对方开口或追来，我们就赶紧从摊位前溜走了。"

