    # char_fortaime "You know, when I climb trees, it's hard to get a grip.\nBut with these, I can just stab them into the tree and hold on.\nI didn't know these existed. It would make things {i}so{/i} much easier!"
    char_fortaime "你知道，我爬树的时候很难抓稳。\n但有了这些，我只要把它们扎进树里就能攀住。\n我都不知道还有这种东西。这会让事情{i}轻松{/i}太多了！"

