# game/script.rpy:34968
translate chinese map067_b4e0f24a:

    # "He grabs an apple out of his pocket, and gives me a sly smirk.{w}\nIt's the one Ulric bought for him. He must not have eaten it yet.{w}\nAs he runs away, I follow him — and we end up in a nearby back alley."
    "他从口袋里掏出一个苹果，冲我狡黠地一笑。{w}\n那是乌尔里克给他买的那个。他一定是还没舍得吃。{w}\n他跑开了，我跟了上去——最后我们来到附近的一条后巷。"

