# game/script.rpy:35012
translate chinese map067_c6088f7c:

    # "He motions to the ground. It didn't seem comfortable, but it would do.{w}\nI sit down and rest my back against the wall. He promptly sits down beside me.{w}\nHolding out the apple, he inspects it, almost like he's a bit hesitant to eat it."
    "他指了指地面。看着不太舒服，但也凑合。{w}\n我坐下，把背靠在墙上。他立刻在我身边坐下。{w}\n他举着苹果端详，像是有点舍不得吃。"

