# game/script.rpy:35192
translate chinese map067_2c3da8df:

    # "He holds it up, offering it to me.{w}\nI never got to try these when I was younger.{w}\nBut Fortaime always spoke the world of them."
    "他举起苹果递给我。{w}\n我小时候从没机会尝过这种苹果。{w}\n但福泰姆总是对它赞不绝口。"

# game/script.rpy:35194
translate chinese map067_6c629585:

    # "Accepting it with a smile, I grip it in my left hand.{w}\nTo make Fortaime more comfortable, I wrap my right arm around him.{w}\nHe leans in closer, letting out a noise I can only describe as \"happy and content\"."
    "我笑着接过，用左手握住。{w}\n为了让福泰姆更自在些，我用右臂搂住他。{w}\n他靠得更近，发出一声我只能形容为“幸福又满足”的轻哼。"

# game/script.rpy:35196
translate chinese map067_b4cb6365:

    # "With a large crunch, I bite into the apple. The sweetness immediately assaults me.{w}\nIt's overwhelming, and my eyes shoot wide open. It's shocking, and delicious.{w}\nI always doubted that they'd be as good as he said. I was unequivocally wrong."
    "我咔嚓一声咬下一大口，甜味立刻冲击而来。{w}\n强烈得让我瞪大了眼睛。既震撼又美味。{w}\n我一直怀疑它是否真有他说的那么好。显然我彻底错了。"

