# game/script.rpy:35558
translate chinese map067_77d9f12d:

    # "He holds it up, offering it to me — his hands practically shaking.{w}\nI grab it from him, and inspect it. It's incredibly soft and juicy.{w}\nThey must've grown this differently, in order to make it special."
    "他举起苹果递给我——手几乎在抖。{w}\n我接过来端详。它异常柔软多汁。{w}\n他们一定是用了不同的种法，才让它如此特别。"

# game/script.rpy:35560
translate chinese map067_7f58c6bf:

    # "But I wonder why The Triumvirate would ban this from trade.{w}\nIt seems harmless, and I can't remember the last time Fortaime was so happy.{w}\nI take a bite, with a loud crunch, and start chewing. The sweetness is overwhelming."
    "可我不明白三人执政团为什么要禁止它交易。{w}\n它看起来无害，而且我已经想不起福泰姆上次这么开心是什么时候了。{w}\n我咔嚓一声咬下一口，嚼了起来。甜味扑面而来。"

# game/script.rpy:35562
translate chinese map067_8be4f6d4:

    # "I always doubted how good this apple would be. Fortaime really talked it up.{w}\nThere was always a worry in the back of my mind that it wasn't really {i}that{/i} good.{w}\nHowever, after finally tasting it — I know I was unequivocally wrong. It was amazing."
    "我一直怀疑这苹果能有多好吃。福泰姆实在是把它吹上天了。{w}\n我心里始终隐隐担心它其实没那么{i}好吃{/i}。{w}\n可终于尝到之后——我知道自己彻底错了。好吃得惊人。"

# game/script.rpy:35587
translate chinese map067_e91f1863:

    # voice "se/y00771.ogg"
    voice "se/y00771.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:35589
translate chinese map067_096ce680:

    # char_fortaime "See, I told you...!\nI can't believe I'm eating this again.\nI just wish my parents could be here."
    char_fortaime "看吧，我说过的……！\n真不敢相信我又吃到它了。\n只是希望我父母也能在这里。"

# game/script.rpy:35603
translate chinese map067_3ca4a7a3:

    # "I hand him back the apple, and we slowly take turns eating it.{w}\nMinutes later, only the tiny core remains. We really went to town on it.{w}\nPlacing it down by his side, Fortaime rests against the wall, sighing."
    "我把苹果递还给他，我们慢慢轮流吃着。{w}\n几分钟后，只剩下一小截果核。我们吃得可真是干净。{w}\n福泰姆把果核放在身边，靠着墙，叹了口气。"

# game/script.rpy:35629
translate chinese map067_c517f60c:

    # voice "se/y00772.ogg"
    voice "se/y00772.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:35631
translate chinese map067_e387f0ba:

    # char_fortaime "Thanks for sharing that with me, [firstname]...\nActually, thanks for hanging out with me at all.\nI know there's so much to do — I'm really honored."
    char_fortaime "谢谢你和我一起分享，[firstname]……\n其实，谢谢你能陪我待一会儿。\n我知道你有那么多事要做——我真的很荣幸。"

# game/script.rpy:35636
translate chinese map067_ff205f60:

    # voice "se/y00773.ogg"
    voice "se/y00773.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:35638
translate chinese map067_e387f0ba_1:

    # char_fortaime "Thanks for sharing that with me, [firstname]...\nActually, thanks for hanging out with me at all.\nI know there's so much to do — I'm really honored."
    char_fortaime "谢谢你和我一起分享，[firstname]……\n其实，谢谢你能陪我待一会儿。\n我知道你有那么多事要做——我真的很荣幸。"

# game/script.rpy:35657
translate chinese map067_d599efd6:

    # "He smiles before standing back up. I do so as well.{w}\nThere was no point in this quest if I couldn't have fun along the way.{w}\nOur bond could flourish, even during war. That was an incredible friendship."
    "他笑了笑，站起身来。我也跟着起身。{w}\n如果一路都不能享受乐趣，这趟旅程便毫无意义。{w}\n即便身处战火，我们的羁绊也能绽放。那是一段了不起的友谊。"

# game/script.rpy:35682
translate chinese map067_3f0d4ad6:

    # voice "se/y00774.ogg"
    voice "se/y00774.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:35684
translate chinese map067_6d5687ca:

    # char_fortaime "Back to business, I guess?\nBut mark my words, I'm gonna get that climbing gear.\nAnd a second set, too. I'll make an Apprentice out of you, yet."
    char_fortaime "又该回去办正事了吧？\n但我把话撂在这儿，我一定要弄到那套攀爬装备。\n还要再买一套。总有一天我也要把你培养成学徒。"

# game/script.rpy:35698
translate chinese map067_d9c070af:

    # "He smirks, and runs back out into the markets.{w}\nI follow after him, and we regroup with everybody else.{w}\nThat was a nice distraction. But it was time to get things back on track."
    "他咧嘴一笑，跑回了集市。{w}\n我跟了上去，和大伙重新会合。{w}\n刚才那段插曲不错。但该让事情重回正轨了。"

# game/script.rpy:35731
translate chinese map231_8c7e89cb:

    # "As I wander the town square of Mazeo, I notice Sovy checking out the market stalls.{w}\nHe seems completely engrossed by everything. Like he finally has time to stop and look.{w}\nIt makes sense. Until now, it's likely that he was always on a mission for The Triumvirate."
    "我在马泽奥的城镇广场闲逛时，注意到索维正挨个看着摊位。{w}\n他看起来对一切都全神贯注，像是终于有时间停下来看看。{w}\n这倒也合理。直到现在，他大概一直忙于为三人执政团执行任务。"

# game/script.rpy:35733
translate chinese map231_e9bcd285:

    # "After exploring the markets for a while, he approaches me.{w}\nIt doesn't look like he bought anything. He was just looking around."
    "他在集市里转了一阵，随后朝我走来。{w}\n看样子他什么都没买，只是随便看看。"

# game/script.rpy:35758
translate chinese map231_56d37bff:

    # voice "se/y01888.ogg"
    voice "se/y01888.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:35760
translate chinese map231_075dd576:

    # char_sovy "So many useless items. People actually buy these things...?\nBack in Balteus I got used to having the bare minimum.\nAnything more than that is a pointless luxury. A waste."
    char_sovy "这么多没用的东西。居然真有人买这些……？\n在巴尔泰乌斯，我早已习惯了最低限度的生活。\n多一点都算毫无意义的奢侈。浪费。"

# game/script.rpy:35773
translate chinese map231_5c4aa4ff:

    # voice "se/y01889.ogg"
    # char_sovy "Yet I must say — some of it {i}does{/i} have a certain appeal.\nThere were some very unique writing utensils. I might look into them.\nNot that I fancy myself a writer, or anything. They just caught my eye."
    voice "se/y01889.ogg"
    char_sovy "不过我得说——有些东西{i}的确{/i}别有一番吸引力。\n有几件很别致的书写工具。我或许会去看看。\n倒不是说我自认是什么文人。只是它们吸引了我的目光。"

# game/script.rpy:35788
translate chinese map231_068e63c8:

    # "He points to the nearby alleyway, and tilts his head toward it."
    "他指向附近的小巷，朝那边歪了歪头。"

# game/script.rpy:35813
translate chinese map231_179e0d36:

    # voice "se/y01890.ogg"
    # char_sovy "Would you follow me into that alley, [firstname]?\nI think we need to get away from all of these people." nointeract
    voice "se/y01890.ogg"
    char_sovy "你愿意跟我进那条小巷吗，[firstname]？\n我想我们得离这些人远一点。" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:35829
translate chinese map231_e15f5da0:

    # voice "se/y01891.ogg"
    # char_sovy "It won't take too long, I promise.\nI just remembered what we talked about before.\nThere's a trick or two I can teach you with that blade."
    voice "se/y01891.ogg"
    char_sovy "不会花太久，我保证。\n我刚想起我们之前谈过的事。\n关于那把剑，我能教你一两手。"

# game/script.rpy:35845
translate chinese map231_6cc830fb:

    # voice "se/y01892.ogg"
    # char_sovy "Stop it. That's not what I meant.\nIt's about that blade. I know a trick or two.\nI think I can teach you while we have a moment."
    voice "se/y01892.ogg"
    char_sovy "别闹。我不是那个意思。\n是关于那把剑的。我懂一两手。\n趁我们现在有空，我想我能教你。"

# game/script.rpy:35861
translate chinese map231_b9a4c650:

    # voice "se/y01893.ogg"
    # char_sovy "No. But you don't have any other choice.\nYou'll be using that blade when you assault Balteus.\nIf you don't know how to use it — you'll probably die."
    voice "se/y01893.ogg"
    char_sovy "不。但你别无选择。\n进攻巴尔泰乌斯时你得用那把剑。\n要是不会用——你多半会死。"

# game/script.rpy:35877
translate chinese map231_3ddece12:

    # voice "se/y01894.ogg"
    # char_sovy "Flippant as usual, I see.\nListen — you need to learn more about that blade.\nYour life is on the line, so you need to start caring."
    voice "se/y01894.ogg"
    char_sovy "我看你还是老样子，油嘴滑舌的。\n听着——你需要多了解那把剑。\n你的命都搭在上面了，所以你得开始上心了。"

# game/script.rpy:35899
translate chinese map231_7f6ea1bb:

    # "Without saying another word, he walks to the back alley.{w}\nI follow after him, ready to learn more about The Blade of Exodus.{w}\nWhen we arrive, I start to ask him questions. Mainly about its origin."
    "他一言不发地走向后巷。{w}\n我跟在他身后，准备好更多地了解放逐之刃。{w}\n抵达之后，我开始向他提问，主要是关于它的来历。"

# game/script.rpy:35924
translate chinese map231_cf5d1853:

    # voice "se/y01895.ogg"
    voice "se/y01895.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:35926
translate chinese map231_ddcc4a76:

    # char_sovy "I couldn't tell you. It's a mystery, even to me.\nPerhaps they stole it from The Monarchy before they took over.\nI've heard that they had visions, too. Much like the blade can supply."
    char_sovy "我说不上来。这对我来说也是个谜。\n也许他们是在夺权之前从王室手里偷来的。\n我听说他们也能看到幻象，就像那把剑能提供的那样。"

# game/script.rpy:35939
translate chinese map231_acaf3dc5:

    # voice "se/y01896.ogg"
    # char_sovy "If that's not the truth, then perhaps they made it themselves.\nBut I'm starting to think they either stole it, or stumbled upon it.\nStealing isn't above them, as we've all been made aware of."
    voice "se/y01896.ogg"
    char_sovy "如果事实并非如此，那也许就是他们自己造的。\n但我开始觉得，他们要么是偷来的，要么是偶然发现的。\n偷窃这种事他们干得出来，我们都已经领教过了。"

# game/script.rpy:35954
translate chinese map231_b57271d2:

    # "He shakes his head, as if he's upset that he can't sate my curiosity.{w}\nBut that's fine — perhaps it's something we'd find out when we went to Balteus."
    "他摇了摇头，似乎因为无法满足我的好奇心而有些懊恼。{w}\n不过没关系——也许等我们去巴尔泰乌斯的时候就能弄清楚了。"

# game/script.rpy:35979
translate chinese map231_dbcaec0c:

    # voice "se/y01897.ogg"
    # char_sovy "This is probably the first trick I should teach you."
    voice "se/y01897.ogg"
    char_sovy "这大概是我该教你的第一招。"

# game/script.rpy:35994
translate chinese map231_03e76b38:

    # "He holds out a close fist, and my blade soon appears in his hand.{w}\nI've seen that happen several times. Almost like he can summon it at any time."
    "他握紧拳头伸出来，我的剑随即出现在他手中。{w}\n我见过好几次了，几乎像是他随时都能把它召唤过来。"

# game/script.rpy:36019
translate chinese map231_185a8457:

    # voice "se/y01898.ogg"
    # char_sovy "You have to be near the blade for it to work, but it's useful.\nDisarming your enemy is a viable tactic in battle, so be ready.\nThey will try to take the blade away from you, because of its power."
    voice "se/y01898.ogg"
    char_sovy "你得靠近那把剑才能做到，但这招很有用。\n解除敌人的武装是战斗中可行的战术，所以做好准备。\n他们会想从你手里夺走那把剑，因为它蕴含的力量。"

# game/script.rpy:36034
translate chinese map231_8ce61eb8:

    # "I nod."
    "我点点头。"

# game/script.rpy:36049
translate chinese map231_f26e1173:

    # voice "se/y01899.ogg"
    # char_sovy "Go ahead. Hold out your hand and reach for the blade.\nNot with your body, but with your mind. See if it works."
    voice "se/y01899.ogg"
    char_sovy "来吧。伸出手，去够那把剑。\n不是用身体，而是用你的意念。看看能不能奏效。"

# game/script.rpy:36064
translate chinese map231_cabe01b3:

    # "I close my eyes, and hold out my hand.{w}\nSovy immediately chastises me with the blunt side of the blade.{w}\nHitting it against my hand, I wince slightly and shake away the pain."
    "我闭上眼，伸出手。{w}\n索维立刻用剑的钝面教训了我。{w}\n剑身拍在我手上，我微微一缩，甩掉疼痛。"

# game/script.rpy:36089
translate chinese map231_9b8e5375:

    # voice "se/y01900.ogg"
    # char_sovy "No. Never close your eyes in battle.\nDid you not learn anything about combat in Valinorth...?\nIf you did that in a real battle, you'd be dead in mere seconds."
    voice "se/y01900.ogg"
    char_sovy "不行。战斗中绝不能闭眼。\n你在瓦利诺斯就没学到任何关于战斗的东西吗……？\n要是在真正的战斗中这么做，你几秒钟就没命了。"

# game/script.rpy:36104
translate chinese map231_8619f2c6:

    # "I shrug."
    "我耸耸肩。"

# game/script.rpy:36119
translate chinese map231_b4001e42:

    # voice "se/y01901.ogg"
    # char_sovy "Now do it again. And look me in the eye.\nI have no use for you if you can't follow directions."
    voice "se/y01901.ogg"
    char_sovy "再来一次。看着我的眼睛。\n要是你连指示都照做不了，你对我来说就没用。"

# game/script.rpy:36134
translate chinese map231_f94aadc1:

    # "Doing as instructed, I look him in the eye.{w}\nI focus as hard as I can, and try to summon the blade.{w}\nBut after a few moments, nothing happens. Nothing at all."
    "我照着他的话做，直视他的眼睛。{w}\n我尽全力集中精神，试着召唤那把剑。{w}\n可过了片刻，什么也没发生。一点动静都没有。"

# game/script.rpy:36159
translate chinese map231_961f6d8c:

    # voice "se/y01902.ogg"
    # char_sovy "Try harder. Like your life depends on it.\nBecause when you need to do this — it will."
    voice "se/y01902.ogg"
    char_sovy "再用力些。就当你的命系于其上。\n因为当你真需要这么做的时候——确实如此。"

# game/script.rpy:36174
translate chinese map231_acd9a255:

    # "I scoff softly, but try not to break the gaze.{w}\nHe squints, as if he's judging my movements.{w}\nBut after even more time — nothing happens."
    "我轻哼一声，但尽量不移开视线。{w}\n他眯起眼，像是在审视我的动作。{w}\n可又过了更久——依然什么也没发生。"

# game/script.rpy:36199
translate chinese map231_5e24793c:

    # voice "se/y01903.ogg"
    # char_sovy "I guess you need a little incentive."
    voice "se/y01903.ogg"
    char_sovy "看来你需要一点刺激。"

# game/script.rpy:36214
translate chinese map231_20da4217:

    # "Without any warning, he reaches behind himself.{w}\nPulling a dagger from the leather straps on his back, he attacks me.{w}\nI take a defensive stance, and before he can harm me, I have possession of the blade."
    "毫无预警地，他伸手探向身后。{w}\n从背后的皮带里抽出一把匕首，向我攻来。{w}\n我摆出防御姿态，在他伤到我之前，剑已落入我手中。"

# game/script.rpy:36216
translate chinese map231_a5887330:

    # "It appears in my hand, at the perfect angle and position to deflect Sovy's assault.{w}\nHis dagger is in deadlock with my blade, and he pushes me back against the alley wall."
    "它以完美的角度和位置出现在我手中，正好挡下索维的攻击。{w}\n他的匕首与我的剑僵持不下，他把我逼退到巷子的墙上。"

# game/script.rpy:36241
translate chinese map231_e8b47a0b:

    # voice "se/y01904.ogg"
    # char_sovy "So it's your fear that powers you..."
    voice "se/y01904.ogg"
    char_sovy "所以驱动你的是恐惧……"

# game/script.rpy:36256
translate chinese map231_94d6c6ff:

    # "After a few moments, he backs off, and puts away the dagger."
    "片刻之后，他退开，收起匕首。"

# game/script.rpy:36281
translate chinese map231_7c08fe4b:

    # voice "se/y01905.ogg"
    # char_sovy "I was the same, until I mastered my fears.\nThen the blade responded to my willpower. My resolve.\nIt can learn and grow, just as much as you can, [firstname]."
    voice "se/y01905.ogg"
    char_sovy "我也是这样，直到我驾驭了自己的恐惧。\n之后那把剑便回应我的意志，我的决心。\n它能学习和成长，就像你一样，[firstname]。"

# game/script.rpy:36285
translate chinese map231_100677e8:

    # voice "se/y01905b.ogg"
    # char_sovy "If you learn to remain calm in the face of battle — you'll do fine.\nWithout fear to rely on, the blade will find something else.\nWhat that is, however, is different from person to person."
    voice "se/y01905b.ogg"
    char_sovy "如果你学会在战斗面前保持冷静——你会做得很好。\n一旦没了恐惧可以依赖，剑会寻找别的东西。\n但那究竟是什么，因人而异。"

# game/script.rpy:36299
translate chinese map231_a5972aff:

    # voice "se/y01906.ogg"
    # char_sovy "I'm eager to see what kind of person you become.\nFor now, let's continue on our way. No more wasting time.\nWhen we have another moment together, I can teach you more."
    voice "se/y01906.ogg"
    char_sovy "我迫不及待想看看你会成为什么样的人。\n眼下，我们继续赶路吧。别再浪费时间了。\n等我们再有机会独处，我可以多教你一些。"

# game/script.rpy:36321
translate chinese map231_852a1e39:

    # "He smiles and leaves the alleyway. I remain there by myself.{w}\nIt was hard {i}not{/i} to be scared, given my situation, and the upcoming battle.{w}\nBut if mastering those emotions made me a better wielder, then I had to try."
    "他笑了笑，离开了巷子。我独自留在那里。{w}\n考虑到我的处境和即将到来的战斗，要做到{i}不{/i}害怕很难。{w}\n但如果驾驭这些情绪能让我成为更好的持剑者，那我必须一试。"

# game/script.rpy:36323
translate chinese map231_a7945040:

    # "I leave the alleyway, and replay the recent events in my mind.{w}\nMy eye trails over to the drawing utensils that Sovy pointed out earlier.{w}\nI wonder for a moment if I could get him a gift. A thank you for the lessons."
    "我离开巷子，在脑海里回放刚才发生的事。{w}\n我的目光落到索维先前指给我看的那些画具上。{w}\n我一时想着，能不能给他买件礼物，感谢他的教导。"

# game/script.rpy:36335
translate chinese map231_ae62f86e:

    # "It seems harmless, so I stop and buy them on my way out of the town square.{w}\nI'd have to find the right chance to give them to him. It might take a while.{w}\nBut after that was said and done, it was time to get on my way."
    "看上去无伤大雅，于是我在离开城镇广场的路上停下来买下了它们。{w}\n我得找个合适的时机送给他，也许要等上一阵子。{w}\n但等这件事了结，我该继续上路了。"

# game/script.rpy:36341
translate chinese map231_b870fb90:

    # "It probably wasn't a good idea, so I forget it and move on.{w}\nPerhaps another time — as right now I was very busy.{w}\nI leave the town square, ready to continue on my way."
    "这大概不是什么好主意，于是我把这念头抛在脑后，继续往前走。{w}\n也许下次吧——毕竟我现在很忙。{w}\n我离开城镇广场，准备好继续赶路。"

# game/script.rpy:36371
translate chinese map066_b9be18f9:

    # "As soon as we enter the Tavern, the smell of ale assaults our noses.{w}\nThis wasn't anything like Peregrino. This was on an entirely different level.{w} \nBottles of foreign alcohol line the shelves, I'd have no idea where to start looking."
    "我们一踏进酒馆，麦酒的气味便扑面而来。{w}\n这跟佩雷格里诺完全不一样。这完全是另一个档次。{w}\n架子上摆满了外国酒，我根本不知道该从哪里看起。"

# game/script.rpy:36394
translate chinese map066_c7cadc8d:

    # voice "se/z00932.ogg"
    voice "se/z00932.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:36396
translate chinese map066_aa0ec629:

    # char_ulric "Good call, [firstname].\nNo trip to Mazeo is complete without coming here.\nIf it's time to relax for a bit, I'll just take a seat at the bar."
    char_ulric "好主意，[firstname]。\n不来这儿，马泽奥之行就不算完整。\n要是该放松一会儿，我就直接坐吧台边了。"

# game/script.rpy:36401
