    # char_ulric "Good call, [firstname].\nNo trip to Mazeo is complete without coming here.\nIf it's time to relax for a bit, I'll just take a seat at the bar."
    char_ulric "好主意，[firstname]。\n不来这儿，马泽奥之行就不算完整。\n要是该放松一会儿，我就直接坐吧台边了。"

# game/script.rpy:36424
translate chinese map066_6f1d0c94:

    # "He gives me a sly smirk, and immediately takes a seat.{w}\nA bartender, who I can only describe as overwhelmed, takes his order.{w}\nPro takes a few steps forward, and afterwards, takes a deep breath."
    "他冲我狡黠一笑，随即坐了下来。{w}\n一个我只能用忙得焦头烂额来形容的酒保来记下他的点单。{w}\n普洛往前走了几步，随后深吸一口气。"

# game/script.rpy:36449
translate chinese map066_106d8eb7:

    # voice "se/z00934.ogg"
    voice "se/z00934.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:36452
translate chinese map066_5de00f6c:

    # char_pro "You just can't beat that smell!\nIf you need me, I'll just be checking my mail.\nI've been in Valinorth for a while. I'd hate to miss anything."
    char_pro "这味道真是无可匹敌！\n要是你找我，我就在那边查看信件。\n我在瓦利诺斯待了好一阵子，可不想错过什么消息。"

# game/script.rpy:36473
translate chinese map066_30ba34fb:

    # "Trotting off to the corner, he starts to inspect his mailbox.{w}\nShelves with letters and numbers line the back corner of The Tavern.{w}\nHe must pay to have an anonymous address, or something like that."
    "他快步走到角落，开始翻看自己的信箱。{w}\n酒馆后角排着一列标有字母和数字的架子。{w}\n他一定是花钱弄了个匿名地址，或者类似的什么。"

# game/script.rpy:36499
translate chinese map066_6e83207c:

    # voice "se/z00935.ogg"
    voice "se/z00935.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:36501
translate chinese map066_c8ef10fa:

    # char_damek "Taverns don't really do anything for me, [firstname].\nI don't mean any offense by this — but I'll be waiting outside.\nThat's not to rush your relaxation, or anything. You deserve it."
    char_damek "酒馆对我没什么吸引力，[firstname]。\n我无意冒犯——但我会在外面等着。\n不是要催你放松，绝对不是。你当之无愧。"

# game/script.rpy:36506
translate chinese map066_f2051c57:

    # voice "se/z00936.ogg"
    voice "se/z00936.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:36508
translate chinese map066_c8ef10fa_1:

    # char_damek "Taverns don't really do anything for me, [firstname].\nI don't mean any offense by this — but I'll be waiting outside.\nThat's not to rush your relaxation, or anything. You deserve it."
    char_damek "酒馆对我没什么吸引力，[firstname]。\n我无意冒犯——但我会在外面等着。\n不是要催你放松，绝对不是。你当之无愧。"

# game/script.rpy:36529
translate chinese map066_93d30107:

    # "With a smile, he slowly backs out of the Tavern.{w}\nI guess this would be a good chance to talk with Pro and Ulric.{w}\nWe haven't really had enough time to get to know each other yet."
    "他微微一笑，慢慢退出了酒馆。{w}\n我想这是个跟普洛和乌尔里克聊聊的好机会。{w}\n我们一直没有足够的时间彼此了解。"

# game/script.rpy:36531
translate chinese map066_6346c75a:

    # "Valessa and Fortaime take a seat and start talking amongst themselves.{w}\nI guess it wouldn't be the end of the world if we wasted a {i}little{/i} bit of time here.{w}\nUlric is chugging a large cup of ale, and Pro is carefully reading over some letters."
    "瓦莱莎和福泰姆找了个位置坐下，彼此攀谈起来。{w}\n我想，在这里浪费{i}一点点{/i}时间也没什么大不了的。{w}\n乌尔里克正大口灌着一大杯麦酒，普洛则在仔细翻阅几封信。"

# game/script.rpy:37203
