    voice "se/Book11.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:37290
translate chinese click_map063_11_EV011_f6bd0e48:

    # "It's a book on Alarinthia's Civil Conflict."
    "这是一本关于阿拉林西亚内乱的书。"

# game/script.rpy:37315
translate chinese click_map063_11_EV011_1d0e1541:

    # voice "se/Book11.ogg"
    voice "se/Book11.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:37350
translate chinese click_map063_11_EV011_c92c8809:

    # "I examine the shelves, looking for anything of note.{w}\nI don't find much, except for a piece on some current news.{w}\nIt couldn't hurt to get a better perspective on Alestia's current state."
    "我打量书架，寻找值得注意的东西。{w}\n没找到多少，只看到一篇关于时事的报道。{w}\n多了解一下阿莱斯蒂亚的现状也无妨。"

# game/script.rpy:37352
translate chinese click_map063_11_EV011_3ae36e0b:

    # "Resting my back against the shelf, I start to read it.{w}\nIt seems to be about Alarinthia. Ulric's homeland.{w}\nApparently, things aren't going very well over there."
    "我背靠书架，开始读起来。{w}\n似乎是关于阿拉林西亚，乌尔里克的故乡。{w}\n显然，那边的局势不太妙。"

# game/script.rpy:37377
translate chinese click_map063_11_EV011_1d0e1541_1:

    # voice "se/Book11.ogg"
    voice "se/Book11.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:37388
translate chinese click_map063_11_EV011_efc5590d:

    # voice "se/Advanced.ogg"
    voice "se/Advanced.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:37390
translate chinese click_map063_11_EV011_ac4aca10:

    # "I wonder who this \"Vivienne\" is.{w}\nUlric would definitely side with someone like her.{w}\nHe thinks that Alarinthia should be more like the mainland."
    "我想知道这个“薇薇安”是谁。{w}\n乌尔里克肯定会站在她这样的人一边。{w}\n他认为阿拉林西亚应该更像大陆那边。"

# game/script.rpy:37413
translate chinese click_map063_12_EV012_92d514bc:

    # voice "se/a00173.ogg"
    voice "se/a00173.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:37415
translate chinese click_map063_12_EV012_ff34f52f:

    # char_ulric "So, you ever drink this stuff before?"
    char_ulric "那么，你以前喝过这种酒吗？"

# game/script.rpy:37417
translate chinese click_map063_12_EV012_22d35fb2:

    # "He motions up to the bar, gesturing broadly at everything.{w}\nI've never seen bottles of alcohol like that, so I'm totally clueless.{w}\nWe're in a completely different region of Alestia. It's all new to me."
    "他朝吧台抬了抬下巴，挥手笼统地比划着一切。{w}\n我从没见过那样的酒瓶，所以完全摸不着头脑。{w}\n我们身处阿莱斯蒂亚截然不同的地区。这一切对我来说都是陌生的。"

# game/script.rpy:37420
translate chinese click_map063_12_EV012_3f7793e3:

    # voice "se/a00174.ogg"
    # char_ulric "You'll have to join me.\nI can pick out the good stuff.\nWithout me, you'd just be wasting time."
    voice "se/a00174.ogg"
    char_ulric "你得陪我喝一杯。\n好酒我能挑得出来。\n没我在，你只会白白浪费时间。"

# game/script.rpy:37424
translate chinese click_map063_12_EV012_62c6c902:

    # voice "se/a00175.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Half the stuff on display isn't even that good.\nTo be honest, they keep a lot of the good stuff down there."
    voice "se/a00175.ogg"
    char_ulric "摆出来的有一半根本没那么好。\n说实话，好东西他们大多藏在下面。"

# game/script.rpy:37427
translate chinese click_map063_12_EV012_c730452a:

    # "He points underneath the bar. I guess that made sense."
    "他指了指吧台下面。我想这倒也说得通。"

# game/script.rpy:37430
translate chinese click_map063_12_EV012_c5bdbf3e:

    # voice "se/a00176.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Cheers, by the way."
    voice "se/a00176.ogg"
    char_ulric "顺便，干杯。"

# game/script.rpy:37433
translate chinese click_map063_12_EV012_c32f6e84:

    # "He holds up his glass, before taking a huge swig of ale."
    "他举起杯子，然后闷了一大口麦酒。"

# game/script.rpy:37436
translate chinese click_map063_12_EV012_e8cb5c7b:

    # voice "se/a00177.ogg"
    # char_ulric "It just doesn't compare to what they had at Peregrino.\nAnyway, I'll let you take care of your business. I'm right here."
    voice "se/a00177.ogg"
    char_ulric "这根本比不上佩雷格里诺的酒。\n总之，你去忙你的事吧。我就在这儿。"

# game/script.rpy:37474
translate chinese click_map063_13_EV013_3b8997dd:

    # voice "se/a00178.ogg"
    voice "se/a00178.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:37476
translate chinese click_map063_13_EV013_8748e6d7:

    # char_fortaime "So, are you having a drink?"
    char_fortaime "那么，你要来一杯吗？"

# game/script.rpy:37479
translate chinese click_map063_13_EV013_212f286d:

    # voice "se/a00179.ogg"
    # char_valessa "No, I'm good.\nThere's too much to focus on."
    voice "se/a00179.ogg"
    char_valessa "不，我不用。\n要操心的事太多了。"

# game/script.rpy:37483
translate chinese click_map063_13_EV013_8d353dbe:

    # voice "se/a00180.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "You gotta do it sometime, you know."
    voice "se/a00180.ogg"
    char_fortaime "你知道，你总得喝一回的。"

# game/script.rpy:37487
translate chinese click_map063_13_EV013_5c1172fc:

    # voice "se/a00181.ogg"
    # char_valessa "Maybe after all this blows over."
    voice "se/a00181.ogg"
    char_valessa "也许等这一切平息之后吧。"

# game/script.rpy:37491
translate chinese click_map063_13_EV013_4419eb35:

    # voice "se/a00182.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "That could take forever!\nYou should take some time to unwind."
    voice "se/a00182.ogg"
    char_fortaime "那可能得等到天荒地老！\n你该抽点时间放松一下。"

# game/script.rpy:37495
translate chinese click_map063_13_EV013_96961e9b:

    # voice "se/a00183.ogg"
    # char_valessa "Are {i}you{/i} getting something...?"
    voice "se/a00183.ogg"
    char_valessa "{i}你{/i}要点什么吗……？"

# game/script.rpy:37499
translate chinese click_map063_13_EV013_c4d695b4:

    # voice "se/a00184.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "Yeah, I'm still deciding, though.\nI don't know any of this stuff on the menu.\nIt's like we're in a completely different world."
    voice "se/a00184.ogg"
    char_fortaime "是啊，不过我还在犹豫。\n菜单上的东西我一个都不认识。\n就像我们身处一个完全不同的世界。"

# game/script.rpy:37503
translate chinese click_map063_13_EV013_8d7a17a3:

    # voice "se/a00185.ogg"
    # char_valessa "Didn't Ulric have to buy you that apple earlier?\nWhere are you getting the money to order this stuff?"
    voice "se/a00185.ogg"
    char_valessa "刚才那个苹果不是乌尔里克帮你买的吗？\n你哪来的钱点这些东西？"

# game/script.rpy:37507
translate chinese click_map063_13_EV013_34fc7178:

    # voice "se/a00186.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "Oh... Good question.\nI'm used to the way things are in Valinorth.\nAlmost everything is provided to us, because of our roles."
    voice "se/a00186.ogg"
    char_fortaime "哦……问得好。\n我习惯了瓦利诺斯的处事方式。\n因为我们的身份，几乎所有东西都是配给我们的。"

# game/script.rpy:37511
translate chinese click_map063_13_EV013_d46f7f76:

    # voice "se/a00187.ogg"
    # char_valessa "Yeah, fair enough.\nMaybe you should go sweet-talk Ulric.\nIf it's on him, maybe I'll consider trying something."
    voice "se/a00187.ogg"
    char_valessa "是啊，有道理。\n也许你该去哄哄乌尔里克。\n要是他请客，也许我会考虑尝一尝。"

# game/script.rpy:37515
translate chinese click_map063_13_EV013_7b463ed6:

    # voice "se/a00188.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "Sounds good.\nI think he likes me, so this'll be easy.\nWait here — we'll try the fanciest thing on the menu."
    voice "se/a00188.ogg"
    char_fortaime "听起来不错。\n我觉得他挺喜欢我，所以这很容易。\n在这儿等着——我们要尝尝菜单上最贵的东西。"

# game/script.rpy:37578
translate chinese map068_1049fbb7:

    # "Pro rests his back against the mailboxes, sifting through letters.{w}\nHe must be pretty popular, as his hands were full of paper.{w}\nI can't even imagine if I got that many letters in Valinorth."
    "普洛背靠着信箱，翻拣着信件。{w}\n他一定很受欢迎，手里满是纸张。{w}\n我简直无法想象要是在瓦利诺斯收到这么多信会是什么样。"

# game/script.rpy:37603
translate chinese map068_6ee08307:

    # voice "se/y00775.ogg"
    voice "se/y00775.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:37606
translate chinese map068_f4d7015b:

    # char_pro "Oh — hey there!"
    char_pro "哦——你好啊！"

# game/script.rpy:37620
translate chinese map068_ed920c5f:

    # "He looks up at me, startled, and turns to face the mailboxes.{w}\nAs if in a rush, he starts putting various letters in various boxes.{w}\nWait — all of those letters weren't actually his? Uh-oh."
    "他吓了一跳，抬头看我，随即转身面对信箱。{w}\n他像是赶时间似的，开始把各种信件塞进不同的信箱。{w}\n等等——那些信其实都不是他的？糟了。"

# game/script.rpy:37645
translate chinese map068_ebbb319e:

    # voice "se/y00776.ogg"
    voice "se/y00776.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:37648
translate chinese map068_c2b498b3:

    # char_pro "Well, you caught me.\nJust don't tell anybody else, alright?\nThis is one of the best ways to get \"information\"." nointeract
    char_pro "好吧，被你逮到了。\n只要别告诉别人，行吗？\n这是获取“情报”最好的办法之一。" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:37662
translate chinese map068_775f2b27:

    # voice "se/y00777.ogg"
    # char_pro "You'd think so, but here we are.\nI've been doing it for years with no complaints.\nI just make sure the box owners aren't nearby."
    voice "se/y00777.ogg"
    char_pro "你大概会这么想，可事实就是如此。\n我干这行好几年了，从没人抱怨。\n我只要确保信箱主人不在附近就行。"

# game/script.rpy:37666
translate chinese map068_ab748b47:

    # voice "se/y00778.ogg"
    # char_pro "They all have schedules and jobs, you know.\nI have this thing down to a science. I'll never get caught.\nIt's just a steady supply of juicy secret after juicy secret."
    voice "se/y00778.ogg"
    char_pro "你知道，他们都各有作息和工作。\n我把这事做得像门科学，绝不会被抓到。\n源源不断的，就是一条又一条劲爆的秘密。"

# game/script.rpy:37683
translate chinese map068_de4c8223:

    # voice "se/y00779.ogg"
    # char_pro "Oh? An accomplice...?\nI've never actually thought about that.\nI guess it {i}could{/i} make things a little easier."
    voice "se/y00779.ogg"
    char_pro "哦？一个同伙……？\n我还真没想过这个。\n我想这{i}确实{/i}能让事情稍微轻松些。"

# game/script.rpy:37687
translate chinese map068_2e28e7e9:

    # voice "se/y00780.ogg"
    # char_pro "Stand guard for me, alright?\nLet me know if anybody approaches.\nIf I get caught, I can play it off as a misunderstanding."
    voice "se/y00780.ogg"
    char_pro "替我望风，好吗？\n有人靠近就告诉我。\n要是我被抓到，我可以把它说成是场误会。"

# game/script.rpy:37691
translate chinese map068_814ec40b:

    # voice "se/y00781.ogg"
    # char_pro "\"Oh, don't worry! Just a little mixup!\"\nTrust me, it works pretty much every time I'm caught.\nIt's so easy to win people over. Just admit you did something wrong."
    voice "se/y00781.ogg"
    char_pro "“哦，别担心！只是弄错了而已！”\n相信我，每次被抓到这招几乎都管用。\n赢得别人的好感太容易了。只要承认自己做错了事。"

# game/script.rpy:37695
translate chinese map068_e0bccb94:

    # voice "se/y00782.ogg"
    # char_pro "They'll immediately switch their stance to defend you.\n\"Oh, don't worry about it! It's not a big deal!\"\nPeople work in such weird ways."
    voice "se/y00782.ogg"
    char_pro "他们会立刻转变立场来替你说话。\n“哦，别放在心上！又不是什么大事！”\n人的心思就是这么奇怪。"

# game/script.rpy:37710
translate chinese map068_e912096f:

    # voice "se/y00783.ogg"
    # char_pro "Oh? Are you trying to blackmail me?\nHonestly, I didn't think you were the type.\nI'm immediately more interested in you."
    voice "se/y00783.ogg"
    char_pro "哦？你想勒索我？\n说实话，我没看出你是这种人。\n我立刻对你更感兴趣了。"

# game/script.rpy:37714
translate chinese map068_3b8fe27b:

    # voice "se/y00784.ogg"
    # char_pro "But — to be honest — that won't work on me.\nI can play my way out of pretty much any situation.\nSo do your worst, and I promise I'll adapt."
    voice "se/y00784.ogg"
    char_pro "不过——说实话——那对我没用。\n几乎任何局面我都能靠手段脱身。\n所以尽管放马过来，我保证我能随机应变。"

# game/script.rpy:37729
translate chinese map068_0515e7b0:

    # voice "se/y00785.ogg"
    # char_pro "Good, that's exactly what I wanted to hear.\nNow if you'll excuse me, I need to get back to business.\nI don't have much longer until these box owners stop by."
    voice "se/y00785.ogg"
    char_pro "很好，这正是我想听到的。\n那么失陪了，我得回去忙正事。\n离这些信箱主人过来已经没多久了。"

# game/script.rpy:37746
translate chinese map068_129ea848:

    # "He turns back to the mailboxes, and raids them once again.{w}\nI guess he assumed it was okay, since I was one of his comrades.{w}\nA big smile appears on his face as he \"borrows\" private information."
    "他转回信箱，再次大肆搜刮。{w}\n我想他以为没关系，因为我是他的同伴之一。{w}\n当他“借阅”私人信息时，脸上浮现出大大的笑容。"

# game/script.rpy:37771
translate chinese map068_7b0c0e5d:

    # voice "se/y00786.ogg"
    voice "se/y00786.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:37773
translate chinese map068_b3213cf6:

    # char_pro "It's amazing what some of these people get up to.\nThe most innocent people could be involved in awful things.\nSee — I can beat blackmail — but these people can't."
    char_pro "这些人干出的事真是令人惊叹。\n看上去最无辜的人也可能牵扯进可怕的事情里。\n你看——我能扛住勒索——但这些人不能。"

# game/script.rpy:37776
translate chinese map068_e3a976ce:

    # voice "se/y00787.ogg"
    # char_pro "It's a good way to line The Rebellion's coffers.\nSo later today, I'm gonna pay this guy a visit."
    voice "se/y00787.ogg"
    char_pro "这是充实反抗军金库的好办法。\n所以今天晚些时候，我要去拜访这家伙。"

# game/script.rpy:37791
translate chinese map068_73150462:

    # "He taps one of the papers in his hands."
    "他轻敲手中一张纸。"

# game/script.rpy:37817
translate chinese map068_1e8e2be7:

    # voice "se/y00788.ogg"
    voice "se/y00788.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:37819
translate chinese map068_dba6f875:

    # char_pro "It would seem a \"reputable\" business owner is up to no good.\nI think he'd lose some business if people found out he worked with pirates.\nIf I got him to pay me off, I could feed The Rebellion for months, [firstname]!"
    char_pro "看来一位“声名良好”的商人正在干着见不得人的勾当。\n我想，要是人们发现他跟海盗有往来，他的生意会损失一些。\n要是我能让他掏钱封口，就能养活反抗军好几个月，[firstname]！"

# game/script.rpy:37824
translate chinese map068_b538c836:

    # voice "se/y00789.ogg"
    voice "se/y00789.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:37826
translate chinese map068_dba6f875_1:

    # char_pro "It would seem a \"reputable\" business owner is up to no good.\nI think he'd lose some business if people found out he worked with pirates.\nIf I got him to pay me off, I could feed The Rebellion for months, [firstname]!"
    char_pro "看来一位“声名良好”的商人正在干着见不得人的勾当。\n我想，要是人们发现他跟海盗有往来，他的生意会损失一些。\n要是我能让他掏钱封口，就能养活反抗军好几个月，[firstname]！"

# game/script.rpy:37842
translate chinese map068_eec3be2e:

    # "He looks at me, as if waiting for my approval."
    "他看着我，像是在等我的首肯。"

# game/script.rpy:37867
translate chinese map068_890aac49:

    # voice "se/y00790.ogg"
    voice "se/y00790.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:37870
translate chinese map068_60e9bd25:

    # char_pro "Is everything okay...?\nI'm not scaring you away, am I?\nThis kinda stuff isn't for everybody." nointeract
    char_pro "你还好吗……？\n我没把你吓跑吧？\n这种事不是人人都受得了的。" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:37884
translate chinese map068_12dcbf9b:

    # voice "se/y00791.ogg"
    # char_pro "Now you're talking! This'll be my biggest score in months.\nI'll get it done tonight, and then celebrate in my room back at HQ.\nFeel free to pay me a visit, I'd be down for some quality time together."
    voice "se/y00791.ogg"
    char_pro "这才对嘛！这会是我几个月来最大的一票。\n我今晚就把它办妥，然后回总部房间里庆祝。\n欢迎你来找我，我很乐意一起共度些美好时光。"

# game/script.rpy:37899
translate chinese map068_42d63112:

    # voice "se/y00792.ogg"
    # char_pro "Damek turns a blind eye to it, you know.\nIt's better to keep our soldiers strong and fed.\nWithout my \"excursions\", everybody would starve."
    voice "se/y00792.ogg"
    char_pro "你知道，达梅克对此睁一只眼闭一只眼。\n让我们的士兵吃饱、强壮总归是好事。\n没有我的“外快”，大家都会挨饿。"

# game/script.rpy:37903
translate chinese map068_c1718fc0:

    # voice "se/y00793.ogg"
    # char_pro "You'll have to get used to it, one way or another.\nI'm doing this tonight — and then I'll celebrate in my room back at HQ.\nFeel free to pay me a visit if you change your mind. We can hang out."
    voice "se/y00793.ogg"
    char_pro "不管怎样，你都得习惯它。\n我今晚就动手——然后回总部房间里庆祝。\n要是你改变主意，欢迎来找我。我们可以一起玩玩。"

# game/script.rpy:37918
translate chinese map068_e7f373e9:

    # voice "se/y00794.ogg"
    voice "se/y00794.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:37920
translate chinese map068_0cd224b7:

    # char_pro "I mean, you still want to be friends — right?\nI hope all of this danger doesn't scare you away.\nI'm not like this all the time. Trust me, [firstname]."
    char_pro "我是说，你还是想做朋友吧——对吧？\n希望这些危险不会把你吓跑。\n我不是一直都这样的。相信我，[firstname]。"

# game/script.rpy:37925
translate chinese map068_48104bd2:

    # voice "se/y00795.ogg"
    voice "se/y00795.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:37927
translate chinese map068_0cd224b7_1:

    # char_pro "I mean, you still want to be friends — right?\nI hope all of this danger doesn't scare you away.\nI'm not like this all the time. Trust me, [firstname]."
    char_pro "我是说，你还是想做朋友吧——对吧？\n希望这些危险不会把你吓跑。\n我不是一直都这样的。相信我，[firstname]。"

# game/script.rpy:37944
translate chinese map068_c776f58d:

    # voice "se/y00796.ogg"
    voice "se/y00796.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:37946
translate chinese map068_87f7e24d:

    # char_pro "Wow, that's pretty forward.\nDoes this \"danger stuff\" turn you on, or something?\nYou know what? Don't answer that. At least, not here."
    char_pro "哇，你可真直接。\n这种“危险勾当”让你兴奋还是怎么的？\n算了，别回答。至少别在这儿回答。"

# game/script.rpy:37949
translate chinese map068_6a57c73b:

    # voice "se/y00797.ogg"
    # char_pro "Look, I have no idea what you're after.\nBut to be honest, I don't know what I'm after, either.\nIf you want to pay me a visit later, we'll see what happens."
    voice "se/y00797.ogg"
    char_pro "听着，我不知道你图什么。\n但说实话，我自己也不知道我图什么。\n要是你之后想来拜访我，我们就走着瞧吧。"

# game/script.rpy:37963
translate chinese map068_2ac2ad0d:

    # voice "se/y00798.ogg"
    voice "se/y00798.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:37965
translate chinese map068_2ee47e5a:

    # char_pro "My room back at HQ is pretty big and luxurious.\nWe can crack open a bottle of wine to celebrate my big score.\nI'm not going to promise any more than that, alright?"
    char_pro "我在总部的房间又大又奢华。\n我们可以开一瓶酒庆祝我这次大捞一笔。\n我不会承诺更多，行吗？"

# game/script.rpy:37979
translate chinese map068_9966dc6a:

    # voice "se/y00799.ogg"
    voice "se/y00799.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:37981
translate chinese map068_1df08ba7:

    # char_pro "Good, I'm glad.\nYou caught me, so I had to come clean.\nOtherwise, I would've kept this stuff secret."
    char_pro "很好，我很高兴。\n你逮到我了，所以我只好坦白。\n不然的话，我会把这事一直瞒着。"

# game/script.rpy:37984
translate chinese map068_26766a37:

    # voice "se/y00800.ogg"
    # char_pro "Not many people know what I \"actually\" do.\nBut, if you pay attention, it's not too much of a stretch.\nIt's just something I picked up from years on the streets."
    voice "se/y00800.ogg"
    char_pro "没多少人知道我“真正”在做什么。\n不过，只要你留心，其实也不算太难猜到。\n这只是我在街头混了多年学来的东西。"

# game/script.rpy:37998
translate chinese map068_07c17b87:

    # voice "se/y00801.ogg"
    voice "se/y00801.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:38000
translate chinese map068_71f0c4d7:

    # char_pro "Maybe I'll tell you a bit more back at HQ.\nI'll use this big score to buy a bottle of wine.\nWe can crack it open and get to know each other."
    char_pro "也许回总部后我会多告诉你一些。\n我会用这次捞到的钱买瓶酒。\n我们可以开瓶畅饮，彼此认识认识。"

# game/script.rpy:38014
translate chinese map068_3a0b6716:

    # voice "se/y00802.ogg"
    voice "se/y00802.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:38016
translate chinese map068_7b914241:

    # char_pro "Hmm. Fair enough.\nNot everybody is built for this kind of stuff.\nBut to be honest, I {i}do{/i} want to learn more about you."
    char_pro "嗯。有道理。\n不是人人都适合这种事。\n但说实话，我{i}确实{/i}想多了解你一些。"

# game/script.rpy:38019
translate chinese map068_57ff3a81:

    # voice "se/y00803.ogg"
    # char_pro "I can win you over, yet. Especially if you have wiggle room.\nTell you what — I'll use this big score to pick up a bottle of wine.\nWe can crack it open back at HQ and get to know each other better."
    voice "se/y00803.ogg"
    char_pro "我还是能说服你的。尤其要是你还有回旋的余地。\n这样吧——我会用这次捞到的钱买瓶酒。\n回总部后我们可以开瓶畅饮，更好地了解彼此。"

# game/script.rpy:38036
translate chinese map068_d1f0fd48:

    # "He carefully places the letters back in their respective mailboxes.{w}\nClapping his hands together, as if to brush off dust, he looks right at me.{w}\nSquinting his eyes, it's almost like he's trying to \"judge\" or \"gauge\" me."
    "他小心地把信件放回各自的信箱。{w}\n他双掌相击，像是要掸去灰尘，然后直视着我。{w}\n他眯起眼睛，几乎像是在“评判”或“估量”我。"

# game/script.rpy:38061
translate chinese map068_123376c6:

    # voice "se/y00804.ogg"
    voice "se/y00804.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:38063
translate chinese map068_7908f59f:

    # char_pro "I gotta admit, you're a bit different than I expected.\nThat's surprising, since I'm usually a good judge of character.\nYou'd make an interesting subject to write about, you know."
    char_pro "我得承认，你和我预想的不太一样。\n这很让人意外，毕竟我通常看人挺准的。\n你知道吗，你会是个很有意思的写作对象。"

# game/script.rpy:38077
translate chinese map068_1db6d7c0:

    # "I shrug, unsure of how to respond to such a thing."
    "我耸耸肩，不知该如何回应这种话。"

# game/script.rpy:38102
translate chinese map068_abd75c62:

    # voice "se/y00805.ogg"
    voice "se/y00805.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:38104
translate chinese map068_3eb77360:

    # char_pro "Now I'm getting ahead of myself. I apologize.\nLet's just stick to the plan. Bottle of wine. Rebel HQ.\nI have a new target, so I should probably get going."
    char_pro "我这下又说太远了，抱歉。\n我们还是按计划来吧。一瓶酒。反抗军总部。\n我有新目标了，大概该走了。"

# game/script.rpy:38118
translate chinese map068_ffcaec3c:

    # "He smiles at me and rests a hand on my shoulder."
    "他冲我一笑，一只手搭在我肩上。"

# game/script.rpy:38143
translate chinese map068_d8bdad7f:

    # voice "se/y00806.ogg"
    voice "se/y00806.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:38145
translate chinese map068_9ef4484a:

    # char_pro "There's not many people I can talk to about this kinda stuff.\nIf I have to be honest, I'd say I'm kinda glad that you caught me.\nNext time we talk it'll be your turn to spill some secrets, alright?"
    char_pro "能聊这种事的人，我没几个。\n要我说实话，我还挺高兴被你逮到的。\n下次聊天就该轮到你吐露些秘密了，行吗？"

# game/script.rpy:38166
translate chinese map068_91cd9a5f:

    # "With a sly smirk, he slowly walks away from the mailbox.{w}\nI guess now I know a little bit more about Pro's true nature.{w}\nBut in a time of war, I guess you had to resort to stuff like that."
    "他狡黠一笑，慢慢从信箱旁走开。{w}\n我想我现在多了解了一点普洛的真面目。{w}\n但在战时，人大概不得不诉诸这种手段。"

# game/script.rpy:38168
translate chinese map068_d073e25a:

    # "Damek must only allow it out of necessity.{w}\nI'm sure Pro would stop this behavior once the war was over.{w}\nSo rather than condemn him, I choose to take him up on his offer."
    "达梅克一定只是出于无奈才纵容它。{w}\n我相信战争结束后普洛就会停止这种行为。{w}\n所以与其谴责他，我选择接受他的邀请。"

# game/script.rpy:38170
translate chinese map068_58e59cdf:

    # "Learning more about him over a drink could prove to be entertaining.{w}\nAnd at the end of the day, it wouldn't hurt to make another friend.{w}\nI turn back to the tavern, ready to move on to the next step."
    "边喝边多了解他，想必挺有意思。{w}\n而且说到底，多交个朋友也没什么坏处。{w}\n我转身回到酒馆，准备进入下一步。"

# game/script.rpy:38201
translate chinese map069_22c2fa0c:

    # "I sit down beside Ulric and look over at him.{w}\nA couple empty glasses strewn about signal that he's already had a few.{w}\nHowever, he doesn't seem to show it. Not at all. He's calm and collected."
    "我在乌尔里克身旁坐下，望向他。{w}\n散落的几个空杯说明他已经喝了几杯。{w}\n可他一点也看不出来。完全没有。他镇定自若。"

# game/script.rpy:38227
translate chinese map069_764615f0:

    # voice "se/y00807.ogg"
    voice "se/y00807.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:38229
translate chinese map069_aafa8a50:

    # char_ulric "Hey, [firstname]. Come to join me?\nI can recommend a few drinks if you'd like.\nDo you want something strong, or should we start weak?"
    char_ulric "嘿，[firstname]。来陪我喝一杯吗？\n要是你愿意，我可以推荐几款酒。\n你想来点烈的，还是先从不烈的开始？"

# game/script.rpy:38234
translate chinese map069_45bca6dc:

    # voice "se/y00808.ogg"
    voice "se/y00808.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:38236
translate chinese map069_aafa8a50_1:

    # char_ulric "Hey, [firstname]. Come to join me?\nI can recommend a few drinks if you'd like.\nDo you want something strong, or should we start weak?"
    char_ulric "嘿，[firstname]。来陪我喝一杯吗？\n要是你愿意，我可以推荐几款酒。\n你想来点烈的，还是先从不烈的开始？"

# game/script.rpy:38253
translate chinese map069_ee03cd90:

    # voice "se/y00809.ogg"
    voice "se/y00809.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:38255
translate chinese map069_18d87037:

    # char_ulric "Perfect choice.\nHey Barkeep, more of the same."
    char_ulric "完美的选择。\n嘿，酒保，再来一样的。"

# game/script.rpy:38269
translate chinese map069_c3442e0a:

    # "He motions to the bartender, and a few moments later, I'm given a glass.{w}\nUlric watches me with a smirk as I take a large swig, and swallow it down.{w}\nIt's strong, almost enough to make me cough — but I maintain my cool."
    "他朝酒保示意，片刻之后，我面前多了一杯酒。{w}\n我大口喝下、咽下去时，乌尔里克带着坏笑看着我。{w}\n这酒很烈，几乎让我咳出来——但我保持着镇定。"

# game/script.rpy:38294
translate chinese map069_39a3773c:

    # voice "se/y00810.ogg"
    voice "se/y00810.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:38296
translate chinese map069_15f99c37:

    # char_ulric "I thought that'd be a bit much, honestly.\nGood to know you can handle it like that.\nIt's strong, but not quite on my level."
    char_ulric "老实说，我以为这对你来说会太烈。\n很高兴知道你扛得住。\n它很烈，但还不到我那个水平。"

# game/script.rpy:38310
translate chinese map069_4aecf8da:

    # voice "se/y00811.ogg"
    voice "se/y00811.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:38312
translate chinese map069_45e70b9d:

    # char_ulric "I guess we'll have to work our way up.\nDon't worry, you'll get to my level in no time."
    char_ulric "看来我们得一步步往上爬了。\n别担心，你很快就会达到我的水平。"

# game/script.rpy:38326
translate chinese map069_7af15abc:

    # "He motions to the bartender, and a few moments later, I'm given a glass.{w}\nUlric watches me with a smirk as I take a large swig, and swallow it down.{w}\nIt tastes like nothing. Practically water. Weak was actually an understatement."
    "他朝酒保示意，片刻之后，我面前多了一杯酒。{w}\n我大口喝下、咽下去时，乌尔里克带着坏笑看着我。{w}\n这酒尝起来什么味道都没有，简直是水。说它寡淡都算抬举了。"

# game/script.rpy:38351
translate chinese map069_d3b4ad8a:

    # voice "se/y00812.ogg"
    voice "se/y00812.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:38353
translate chinese map069_e68a34aa:

    # char_ulric "Wish you went for the stronger one?\nTrust me, I started out the same way.\nSometimes, you just need to dive in."
    char_ulric "后悔没选更烈的那个吧？\n相信我，我一开始也是这样。\n有时候，你就得一头扎进去。"

# game/script.rpy:38357
translate chinese map069_0f66dd5c:

    # voice "se/y00813.ogg"
    voice "se/y00813.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:38360
translate chinese map069_1796a46d:

    # char_ulric "Want another one...?\nWhat're you in the mood for?" nointeract
    char_ulric "再来一杯……？\n你想喝什么？" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:38376
translate chinese map069_e9fad408:

    # voice "se/y00814.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Now you're talking.\nHere, I promise you won't regret this."
    voice "se/y00814.ogg"
    char_ulric "这才对嘛。\n来，我保证你不会后悔。"

# game/script.rpy:38391
translate chinese map069_a27cff30:

    # "Once again, he motions to the bartender, and I'm given a drink.{w}\nI can tell that this one is stronger. It's exactly the same as Ulric's.{w}\nAs time passes, I notice him start to exhibit signs of inebriation."
    "他再次朝酒保示意，我又得到一杯酒。{w}\n我看得出这杯更烈。和乌尔里克那杯一模一样。{w}\n随着时间流逝，我注意到他开始显出醉意。"

# game/script.rpy:38393
translate chinese map069_76cc7420:

    # "I grip the glass, and take a large swig. It burns.{w}\nMy eyes shoot wide open, and I try not to spit it out.{w}\nIt's a brief battle, but I eventually stomach it all."
    "我握紧杯子，大口喝下。喉咙火辣辣的。{w}\n我双眼猛地睁大，努力不把它喷出来。{w}\n一番短暂的挣扎，我最终还是咽了下去。"

# game/script.rpy:38418
translate chinese map069_6b6b4faa:

    # voice "se/y00815.ogg"
    voice "se/y00815.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:38420
translate chinese map069_8b033f12:

    # char_ulric "Wow, you're good.\nMost people can't handle this stuff.\nMazeo is known for its strong liquor."
    char_ulric "哇，你真行。\n大多数人受不了这玩意儿。\n马泽奥以烈酒闻名。"

# game/script.rpy:38434
translate chinese map069_1dca4d9b:

    # voice "se/y00816.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Alright, one step at a time.\nHold on, I'll get you something special."
    voice "se/y00816.ogg"
    char_ulric "好吧，一步一步来。\n等等，我给你弄点特别的。"

# game/script.rpy:38449
translate chinese map069_7532d239:

    # "Once again, he motions to the bartender, and I'm given a drink.{w}\nThis one is tinted red, like a fruit. Perhaps it wouldn't be too bad.{w}\nAs time passes, I notice him start to exhibit signs of inebriation."
    "他再次朝酒保示意，我又得到一杯酒。{w}\n这杯泛着红色，像是果酒。也许不至于太糟。{w}\n随着时间流逝，我注意到他开始显出醉意。"

# game/script.rpy:38451
translate chinese map069_2309a3c4:

    # "I grip the glass, and take a large swig. It's very fruity.{w}\nThere's a bit of a burn, but it's nothing too bad. I drink it all.{w}\nSlamming the glass down on the table, I declare my victory."
    "我握紧杯子，大口喝下。果味很浓。{w}\n有点辣，但不算太糟。我一饮而尽。{w}\n我把杯子砰地砸在桌上，宣告我的胜利。"

# game/script.rpy:38476
translate chinese map069_66d06760:

    # voice "se/y00817.ogg"
    voice "se/y00817.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:38478
translate chinese map069_9b5d1c3f:

    # char_ulric "Okay, that one was easy.\nBut like I said, one step at a time.\nThe night is just getting started."
    char_ulric "好吧，那杯不算什么。\n但就像我说的，一步一步来。\n夜晚才刚开始。"

# game/script.rpy:38494
translate chinese map069_15cb3768:

    # "He crosses his arms, and stares at me with a blank look.{w}\nBut soon after, his facial expression becomes more stern.{w}\nIt's clear that the drinks are starting to hit him, and fast."
    "他抱起双臂，面无表情地盯着我。{w}\n但没过多久，他脸上的神情变得更严肃。{w}\n显然，酒劲开始上来了，而且来得很猛。"

# game/script.rpy:38519
translate chinese map069_b7c368e7:

    # voice "se/y00818.ogg"
    voice "se/y00818.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:38521
translate chinese map069_991dac13:

    # char_ulric "I guess I'll stop messing with you for now.\nTruth is, I just wanted to see how much you could handle.\nIt's a good test. A nice judge of character; and you passed."
    char_ulric "我想我暂时不逗你了。\n其实，我只是想看看你能喝多少。\n这是个不错的考验，能很好地看人品；而你通过了。"

# game/script.rpy:38535
translate chinese map069_735248d8:

    # "He was testing me...?"
    "他是在考验我……？"

# game/script.rpy:38560
translate chinese map069_f96fd627:

    # voice "se/y00819.ogg"
    voice "se/y00819.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:38562
translate chinese map069_b80a3de3:

    # char_ulric "You learn a lot about someone by how they hold their liquor.\nYou're strong. At least, you have a strong will. I respect that.\nThis is part of how they do things back in Alarinthia."
    char_ulric "从一个人喝酒的样子能看出很多。\n你很强。至少，你意志坚强。我敬重这一点。\n在阿拉林西亚，这也是他们行事方式的一部分。"

# game/script.rpy:38565
translate chinese map069_76969a0f:

    # voice "se/y00820.ogg"
    # char_ulric "I know I say I hate it, and I truly do. \nBut some of its culture sticks with me.\nYou left Valinorth, so it'll likely be the same."
    voice "se/y00820.ogg"
    char_ulric "我知道我说过我恨它，我确实恨。\n但它的某些文化还是留在了我身上。\n你离开了瓦利诺斯，大概也会一样。"

# game/script.rpy:38580
translate chinese map069_faf3949f:

    # "He waves to the bartender, who brings him another drink.{w}\nHonestly, I'm surprised he's still coherent. That's crazy.{w}\nSwigging it down, he lets out a sigh of complete content."
    "他向酒保招手，酒保又给他端来一杯。{w}\n说实话，他居然还条理清晰，我很惊讶。简直不可思议。{w}\n他一口气灌下，发出一声无比满足的叹息。"

# game/script.rpy:38605
translate chinese map069_fe34c1c7:

    # voice "se/y00821.ogg"
    voice "se/y00821.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:38610
translate chinese map069_b4f8a82b:

    # char_ulric "Sorry for rambling on like that.\nIf there's anything I hate, it's a one-sided conversation.\nIs there anything you want to ask me? Right now, I'm an open book." nointeract
    char_ulric "抱歉我那样絮絮叨叨。\n要说我讨厌什么，那就是单方面的谈话。\n有什么想问我的吗？现在我就是本摊开的书。" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:38626
translate chinese map069_2951df5c:

    # voice "se/y00822.ogg"
    # char_ulric "There isn't one to talk about. But that's by choice.\nI prefer to keep things casual, without any strings.\nI have my reasons, but it's served me just fine."
    voice "se/y00822.ogg"
    char_ulric "没什么可谈的对象。但这是我自己的选择。\n我更喜欢随性而为，不被束缚。\n我有我的理由，而这样对我一直挺管用。"

# game/script.rpy:38641
translate chinese map069_cc58b04d:

    # "He smiles at me, and takes another swig of his drink."
    "他冲我一笑，又喝了一大口。"

# game/script.rpy:38666
translate chinese map069_754e8982:

    # voice "se/y00823.ogg"
    voice "se/y00823.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:38671
translate chinese map069_49380458:

    # char_ulric "Don't worry, I've definitely noticed your interest.\nSo that's why I'm making things as clear as possible.\nKnowing that, do you {i}really{/i} want to continue down this path?" nointeract
    char_ulric "别担心，我当然注意到了你的兴趣。\n所以我才要把话尽量说清楚。\n知道这些之后，你{i}真的{/i}还想继续走下去吗？" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:38687
translate chinese map069_409d5063:

    # voice "se/y00824.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Good to know, because I share the same interest.\nWhen you live as long as I have, you pick up on these things.\nNo need to make a big deal out of this. It's just fun."
    voice "se/y00824.ogg"
    char_ulric "很高兴知道，因为我也有同样的兴趣。\n当你活得像我这么久，自然能察觉到这些。\n没必要把这事看得太重。不过是图个乐子。"

# game/script.rpy:38701
translate chinese map069_3f302a17:

    # voice "se/y00825.ogg"
    voice "se/y00825.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:38703
translate chinese map069_819c1c72:

    # char_ulric "When we get back to our new HQ, Damek will give you a tour.\nMy doors are open. If you want to do this, I'll be there.\nJust don't tell anyone. You know how rumors spread."
    char_ulric "等我们回到新总部，达梅克会带你四处看看。\n我的门随时敞开。要是你想这样，我会在。\n只是别告诉任何人。你知道流言传得多快。"

# game/script.rpy:38717
translate chinese map069_f4e8d3af:

    # voice "se/y00826.ogg"
    # char_ulric "No worries. Everybody is different.\nThanks for being honest, though. \nSo, we'll just be drinking buddies?"
    voice "se/y00826.ogg"
    char_ulric "没关系。人各有不同。\n不过谢谢你这么坦诚。\n那么，我们就只是酒友了？"

# game/script.rpy:38721
translate chinese map069_126b1fe4:

    # voice "se/y00827.ogg"
    # char_ulric "I'm fine with that.\nIt's been a long time since I've done this.\nDamek always had me running all over the place."
    voice "se/y00827.ogg"
    char_ulric "我没意见。\n我很久没这样了。\n达梅克总是让我到处奔波。"

# game/script.rpy:38736
translate chinese map069_8719b4ab:

    # voice "se/y00828.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Honestly, there's not much more to say.\nI'm a man between two worlds, and it's complicated.\nIt's hard to shake the habits of where we come from."
    voice "se/y00828.ogg"
    char_ulric "说实话，也没什么更多好说的了。\n我是个夹在两个世界之间的人，这很复杂。\n我们来自哪里的习惯，很难摆脱。"

# game/script.rpy:38751
translate chinese map069_94c14bcb:

    # voice "se/y00829.ogg"
    # char_ulric "I think so, yeah.\nWe'll have lots of work to do after we win this war.\nBut making the world a better place? That includes Valinorth."
    voice "se/y00829.ogg"
    char_ulric "我想是的。\n赢下这场战争后，我们会有很多事要做。\n但让世界变得更好？那也包括瓦利诺斯。"

# game/script.rpy:38765
translate chinese map069_30d00e7f:

    # voice "se/y00830.ogg"
    voice "se/y00830.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:38767
translate chinese map069_b2579125:

    # char_ulric "Either way, I think I've had enough.\nI'm gonna buy a bottle to bring to my chambers.\nFeel free to join me if you want to share another drink."
    char_ulric "不管怎样，我想我喝够了。\n我要买瓶酒带回我的房间。\n要是你想再喝一杯，欢迎来陪我。"

# game/script.rpy:38784
translate chinese map069_575ec1d3:

    # "I nod and stand up, but all of the drinks hit me at once.{w}\nI stumble back, and Ulric catches me, wrapping his arms around me."
    "我点头起身，可所有的酒一下子全涌上来。{w}\n我踉跄后退，乌尔里克扶住我，双臂环住我。"

# game/script.rpy:38809
translate chinese map069_188903a7:

    # voice "se/y00831.ogg"
    voice "se/y00831.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:38811
translate chinese map069_161dee7c:

    # char_ulric "Hey now, watch your step.\nThe ground here could do some real damage."
    char_ulric "嘿，当心脚下。\n这地方的地面可是能摔出真伤来的。"

# game/script.rpy:38825
translate chinese map069_d957791f:

    # "Rather than letting go, he lets his hands wander around my body.{w}\nMy heartrate increases, and I feel his hot breaths strike my neck."
    "他没有松手，反而任双手在我身上游移。{w}\n我的心跳加快，感到他滚烫的呼吸打在我脖子上。"

# game/script.rpy:38840
translate chinese map069_68cec38d:

    # voice "se/y00832.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Actually, I think I'll get a few bottles for my place.\nSomething tells me we'll be having more fun than I thought."
    voice "se/y00832.ogg"
    char_ulric "其实，我想给我的住处多买几瓶。\n我有种感觉，我们会比我想的更有乐子。"

# game/script.rpy:38862
translate chinese map069_0fbc46ce:

    # "A few moments later, before overstepping any boundaries, he lets me go.{w}\nBuying a few bottles of wine, he keeps his word before moving on to other things.{w}\nSocializing with the tavern patrons, it seemed like our moment was over."
    "片刻之后，在逾越任何界限之前，他放开了我。{w}\n他买了几瓶酒，信守了诺言，然后转而去做别的事。{w}\n他同酒馆里的客人寒暄起来，看来我们的时刻已经过去。"

# game/script.rpy:38879
translate chinese map069_81961458:

    # "I nod and stand up, but all of the drinks hit me at once.{w}\nI immediately stumble over, using the bar to brace myself."
    "我点头起身，可所有的酒一下子全涌上来。{w}\n我当即踉跄了一下，扶着吧台稳住自己。"

# game/script.rpy:38904
translate chinese map069_08614436:

    # voice "se/y00833.ogg"
    voice "se/y00833.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:38906
translate chinese map069_161dee7c_1:

    # char_ulric "Hey now, watch your step.\nThe ground here could do some real damage."
    char_ulric "嘿，当心脚下。\n这地方的地面可是能摔出真伤来的。"

# game/script.rpy:38920
translate chinese map069_a76a9eb8:

    # "I shake my head, and regain my clarity.{w}\nIt's a mystery to me how Ulric could handle this stuff.{w}\nIt would be a long time before I reached his level."
    "我摇摇头，恢复了清醒。{w}\n乌尔里克怎么能受得了这种酒，对我来说是个谜。{w}\n要赶上他的水平，我还早得很。"

# game/script.rpy:38929
translate chinese map069_ba4d7b7a:

    # "True to his word, Ulric orders a bottle of alcohol, and walks away.{w}\nSocializing with the tavern patrons, it seemed like our moment was over.{w}\nI take a few deep breaths, and ensure my head is clear before moving."
    "乌尔里克说到做到，点了一瓶酒，转身走开。{w}\n他同酒馆里的客人寒暄起来，看来我们的时刻已经过去。{w}\n我深吸几口气，确认头脑清醒后才挪步。"

# game/script.rpy:38933
translate chinese map069_fdf7129c:

    # "I guess we had to get things back on track.{w}\nAs enjoyable as that was, we had business to take care of.{w}\nHopefully we had more time like this to unwind in the future."
    "我想我们得把正事重新提上日程了。{w}\n尽管刚才很愉快，我们还有事要办。{w}\n希望将来能有更多像这样放松的时光。"

# game/script.rpy:38964
translate chinese map070_06e20397:

    # "We follow after Damek, and embark on what seems like an endless journey.{w}\nHowever, after an hour or so of walking, we end up in a residential area.{w}\nThe buildings here are built beautifully. Very different from before."
    "我们跟在达梅克身后，踏上一段似乎没有尽头的旅程。{w}\n不过，走了大约一个小时后，我们来到一片住宅区。{w}\n这里的建筑造得很漂亮，和之前所见大不相同。"

# game/script.rpy:38986
translate chinese map070_1c4e0e4c:

    # voice "se/z00937.ogg"
    voice "se/z00937.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:38988
translate chinese map070_4b1d41a6:

    # char_valessa "Wow, this place looks incredible!\nThat town square was a little bit “off”.\nNot the best first impression, if you ask me."
    char_valessa "哇，这地方看起来太棒了！\n那个城镇广场有点“不对劲”。\n要我说，可算不上最好的第一印象。"

# game/script.rpy:39013
translate chinese map070_65dd35a5:

    # voice "se/z00938.ogg"
    voice "se/z00938.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:39015
translate chinese map070_3b51e88f:

    # char_ulric "It's a sign of wealth to live far away from the markets.\nOnly those who {i}work{/i}, live near the town square.\nOnce you've got it made — you move out here."
    char_ulric "住得离集市远，是财富的象征。\n只有{i}干活{/i}的人才住在城镇广场附近。\n一旦你飞黄腾达——就搬到这边来。"

# game/script.rpy:39028
translate chinese map070_93014aef:

    # voice "se/z00939.ogg"
    voice "se/z00939.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:39030
translate chinese map070_729d03d6:

    # char_damek "That is, of course, unless you're important to Mazeo.\nGryz gets to live here free of charge for his services.\nThat offer even extends to Lillith, his assistant."
    char_damek "当然，除非你对马泽奥很重要。\n格瑞兹因为他的功绩，得以免费住在这里。\n这份优待甚至惠及他的助手莉莉丝。"

# game/script.rpy:39055
translate chinese map070_17715da9:

    # voice "se/z00940.ogg"
    voice "se/z00940.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:39057
translate chinese map070_623fc0d1:

    # char_valessa "You mean like our Elder back in Valinorth?"
    char_valessa "你是说像我们在瓦利诺斯的长老那样？"

# game/script.rpy:39082
translate chinese map070_07cad54a:

    # voice "se/z00941.ogg"
    voice "se/z00941.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:39084
translate chinese map070_10dcdbc9:

    # char_damek "Yeah, exactly. So make sure to be careful.\nIn this district, pretty much everyone is royalty.\nOr at least, they expect to be treated that way."
    char_damek "对，正是如此。所以务必小心。\n这个区里，几乎人人都算得上贵族。\n至少，他们希望被那样对待。"

# game/script.rpy:39109
translate chinese map070_03485f14:

    # voice "se/z00942.ogg"
    voice "se/z00942.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:39111
translate chinese map070_db12a9a9:

    # char_valessa "Alright. Thanks for the advice, Damek."
    char_valessa "好吧。谢谢你的提醒，达梅克。"

# game/script.rpy:39132
translate chinese map070_ce203b14:

    # "She moves to the back of the group, almost like she's worried.{w}\nWe continue to walk, but not for much longer. Damek stops in his tracks."
    "她走到队伍后面，几乎像是有些担忧。{w}\n我们继续走着，但没走多久，达梅克就停下了脚步。"

# game/script.rpy:39157
translate chinese map070_634c7bf5:

    # voice "se/z00943.ogg"
    voice "se/z00943.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:39159
translate chinese map070_8a5dc49f:

    # char_damek "To your right — Gryz's office.\nSorry it took a while, but you know how it is.\nIt'll be an even longer trek back to our new HQ."
    char_damek "你的右手边——格瑞兹的办公室。\n抱歉花了这么久，但你也知道情况。\n回新总部的路还要更长呢。"

# game/script.rpy:39173
translate chinese map070_ad7bf449:

    # "He laughs and motions to the nearby building.{w}\nIt stood out from the rest in both quality and size."
    "他笑着指向近旁的建筑。{w}\n无论品质还是规模，它都在其余建筑中脱颖而出。"

# game/script.rpy:39198
translate chinese map070_2fcffab3:

    # voice "se/z00944.ogg"
    voice "se/z00944.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:39200
translate chinese map070_c549cda2:

    # char_ulric "It's time for you to tell us what's going on.\nI hate being left in the dark like this. You know that."
    char_ulric "该你告诉我们到底怎么回事了。\n我讨厌像这样被蒙在鼓里。你知道的。"

# game/script.rpy:39225
translate chinese map070_d949aa70:

    # voice "se/z00945.ogg"
    voice "se/z00945.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:39227
translate chinese map070_11fc0675:

    # char_damek "Of course, of course. You know I'm a man of my word.\nI just didn't like talking about this stuff in the Town Square."
    char_damek "当然，当然。你知道我说话算话。\n我只是不喜欢在城镇广场谈这些事。"

# game/script.rpy:39241
translate chinese map070_a72c980f:

    # "He cracks his knuckles, like he's preparing for something.{w}\nHe faces toward Valessa, Fortaime, and myself with a smile.{w}\nIt's almost like he assumes that Ulric and Pro are up to speed."
    "他掰了掰指关节，像是要准备什么。{w}\n他面带微笑，面向瓦莱莎、福泰姆和我。{w}\n几乎像是他认定乌尔里克和普洛已经了解情况了。"

# game/script.rpy:39266
translate chinese map070_8185aac3:

    # voice "se/z00946.ogg"
    voice "se/z00946.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:39268
translate chinese map070_19443233:

    # char_damek "Well, as you know, Mazeo is rampant with piracy.\nAll of that chaos needs some sort of order — right?\nTwo pirates have risen to the challenge. Alex and Nada."
    char_damek "嗯，如你所知，马泽奥海盗横行。\n那样的混乱总需要某种秩序——对吧？\n两名海盗挺身而出，担起了这个重任。亚历克斯和娜达。"

# game/script.rpy:39271
translate chinese map070_8db8880a:

    # voice "se/z00947.ogg"
    # char_damek "Unifying all of the pirates isn't an easy task, but they did it.\nThey have established trade routes and the largest fleet in the world.\nWe want to strike a deal with them and gain some ships. Easy, right?"
    voice "se/z00947.ogg"
    char_damek "统一所有海盗绝非易事，但他们做到了。\n他们建立了贸易航线，拥有世界上最大的舰队。\n我们想跟他们达成协议，弄到一些船。简单，对吧？"

# game/script.rpy:39285
translate chinese map070_7044258e:

    # voice "se/z00948.ogg"
    voice "se/z00948.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:39287
translate chinese map070_b28c1f06:

    # char_damek "When we attack Balteus, we won't be able to hold back.\nHaving enough ships to carry our massive army over is essential.\nAnd if we can get the pirates to fight with us? Even better."
    char_damek "我们进攻巴尔泰乌斯时，绝不能留手。\n有足够的船把我们庞大的军队运过去，是必不可少的。\n要是还能让海盗跟我们一起作战？那就更好了。"

# game/script.rpy:39290
translate chinese map070_d88afffc:

    # voice "se/z00949.ogg"
    # char_damek "Gryz made it clear that he wants to cut a deal.\nIn order to win them over, we'll need to bend to their will.\nHowever, after learning that, Alex and Nada have started to fight."
    voice "se/z00949.ogg"
    char_damek "格瑞兹明确表示他想达成协议。\n为了拉拢他们，我们得顺着他们的意思来。\n然而，得知这一点后，亚历克斯和娜达开始争斗起来。"

# game/script.rpy:39304
translate chinese map070_cbacdf65:

    # voice "se/z00950.ogg"
    voice "se/z00950.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:39306
translate chinese map070_66bb53d3:

    # char_damek "Now we have to choose who we side with.\nThey both want different things, but they can both offer ships.\nThat's why we're here. I imagine they're waiting inside."
    char_damek "现在我们得选边站了。\n他们想要的东西各不相同，但都能提供船只。\n这就是我们来的原因。我想他们正在里面等着。"

# game/script.rpy:39320
translate chinese map070_5188e4cb:

    # "He speaks with such passion and enthusiasm, it's enthralling.{w}\nIt was clear that he truly cared about Alestia and its people."
    "他说话时充满热忱和激情，令人着迷。{w}\n显然，他真心关心阿莱斯蒂亚和它的人民。"

# game/script.rpy:39345
translate chinese map070_05afc860:

    # voice "se/z00951.ogg"
    voice "se/z00951.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:39347
translate chinese map070_ce6338a2:

    # char_damek "The future of Mazeo is likely going to change. It's so exciting.\nI'll negotiate with them, and Gryz will make any necessary decrees.\nI just want my favorite people present, so that's why you're all here."
    char_damek "马泽奥的未来很可能会改变。真令人兴奋。\n我会跟他们谈判，格瑞兹会颁布必要的法令。\n我只想让我最喜欢的人在场，所以你们都来了。"

# game/script.rpy:39361
translate chinese map070_17d67905:

    # "He smiles, and turns back to Ulric and Pro."
    "他笑了笑，转回身面向乌尔里克和普洛。"

# game/script.rpy:39386
translate chinese map070_84729ffa:

    # voice "se/z00952.ogg"
    voice "se/z00952.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:39388
translate chinese map070_0d851351:

    # char_damek "I trust there aren't any objections?"
    char_damek "我想应该没人反对吧？"

# game/script.rpy:39402
translate chinese map070_b8f6c436:

    # "Ulric scoffs, crossing his arms."
    "乌尔里克哼了一声，抱起双臂。"

# game/script.rpy:39427
translate chinese map070_f0689f3e:

    # voice "se/z00953.ogg"
    voice "se/z00953.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:39429
translate chinese map070_838224f3:

    # char_ulric "You sure upped the scale of our attack.\nI thought we just planned to steal a few ships.\nBut now you want an entire fleet? What changed?"
    char_ulric "你可把我们的行动规模拔高了不少。\n我还以为我们只打算偷几艘船。\n结果现在你想要整支舰队？什么变了？"

# game/script.rpy:39454
translate chinese map070_f98db189:

    # voice "se/z00954.ogg"
    voice "se/z00954.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:39456
translate chinese map070_71ff6df4:

    # char_damek "We need to give this our all if we're going to win.\nBut remember, we have a world to reshape when we're done.\nStriking a deal with the pirates is something that {i}needs{/i} to happen."
    char_damek "要想赢，我们就得全力以赴。\n但记住，事成之后我们还要重塑这个世界。\n跟海盗达成协议，是{i}必须{/i}要做的事。"

# game/script.rpy:39459
translate chinese map070_906c5c0e:

    # voice "se/z00955.ogg"
    # char_damek "I mean, we {i}could{/i} wait until after the war.\nBut if we do it now, we stand a better chance of winning.\nPlus the people need to know that we're capable rulers, too."
    voice "se/z00955.ogg"
    char_damek "我是说，我们{i}可以{/i}等战争结束后再说。\n但要是现在就做，我们获胜的机会更大。\n而且人们也需要知道，我们也是有能力统治的人。"

# game/script.rpy:39485
translate chinese map070_6be3bdf4:

    # voice "se/z00956.ogg"
    voice "se/z00956.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:39487
translate chinese map070_692232fc:

    # char_ulric "Fair enough. I concede."
    char_ulric "有道理。我认输。"

# game/script.rpy:39508
translate chinese map070_e578e8a4:

    # "Ulric smiles, the promise of more power and might appealing his curiosity."
    "乌尔里克笑了，更多权力与武力的许诺勾起了他的好奇。"

# game/script.rpy:39533
translate chinese map070_3f94ae21:

    # voice "se/z00957.ogg"
    voice "se/z00957.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:39536
translate chinese map070_5deaed7a:

    # char_pro "That's brilliant, Damek!\nTaking care of ten problems with one move — as usual.\nI'm just glad that they get to see for themselves, now."
    char_pro "太妙了，达梅克！\n一招解决十个问题——一如既往。\n我只是很高兴，他们现在能亲眼见识到了。"

# game/script.rpy:39550
translate chinese map070_72d1ae03:

    # "He motions to Valessa, Fortaime and I.{w}\nThat seemed like a sound strategy, to be honest.{w}\nGain military might, {i}and{/i} prove himself capable of leadership."
    "他指了指瓦莱莎、福泰姆和我。{w}\n说实话，这似乎是稳妥的策略。{w}\n获取军力，{i}还{/i}证明了自己有领导才能。"

# game/script.rpy:39552
translate chinese map070_a4b8c52b:

    # "The people would need to know that he's worth following.{w}\nReleasing Mazeo from the grip of The Triumvirate woud be a great start.{w}\nAnd thankfully, Gryz was on our side. This wouldn't be possible otherwise."
    "人们需要知道他值得追随。{w}\n把马泽奥从三人执政团的掌控中解放出来，会是个绝佳的开端。{w}\n所幸格瑞兹站在我们这边。不然这根本不可能。"

# game/script.rpy:39577
translate chinese map070_a0f5077a:

    # voice "se/z00958.ogg"
    voice "se/z00958.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:39579
translate chinese map070_fdc58d78:

    # char_damek "Well, I guess it's time.\nI'm a little nervous, but I'll manage."
    char_damek "嗯，我想时候到了。\n我有点紧张，但我能应付。"

# game/script.rpy:39605
translate chinese map070_0fb73ec1:

    # "With a quick smirk, he's on his way inside.{w}\nPro and Ulric go too, expecting us to follow suit."
    "他匆匆一笑，动身走了进去。{w}\n普洛和乌尔里克也跟了进去，等着我们也跟上。"

# game/script.rpy:39630
translate chinese map070_85b3ea2a:

    # voice "se/z00959.ogg"
    voice "se/z00959.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:39632
translate chinese map070_404d7cf8:

    # char_fortaime "Man, things are sure busy around here.\nI hope we get to rest when we get to our HQ."
    char_fortaime "天哪，这周围可真够忙的。\n希望到了总部能让我们歇歇。"

# game/script.rpy:39657
translate chinese map070_420cd41e:

    # voice "se/z00960.ogg"
    voice "se/z00960.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:39659
translate chinese map070_d8672966:

    # char_valessa "Come on Fortaime, it's interesting.\nWe're watching history in the making here."
    char_valessa "别这样，福泰姆，这多有意思。\n我们正在见证历史的发生。"

# game/script.rpy:39684
translate chinese map070_070f30c6:

    # voice "se/z00961.ogg"
    voice "se/z00961.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:39686
translate chinese map070_c5d7687a:

    # char_fortaime "If it's history, then it'll be in a book.\nI'd just sleep and read it when I get up."
    char_fortaime "要是它算历史，那总会写进书里。\n我干脆睡一觉，醒了再读就是了。"

# game/script.rpy:39712
translate chinese map070_2cd54067:

    # "They talk amongst themselves as they enter Gryz's house.{w}\nI guess I should hurry in, so I don't miss anything."
    "他们一边交谈一边走进格瑞兹的宅邸。{w}\n我想我该赶紧进去，免得错过什么。"

# game/script.rpy:40196
translate chinese click_map073_4_EV004_5c3d3ecb:

    # "Signs point in every possible direction.{w}\nThey're labelled things like “Town Square” and “Residential District”.{w}\nA couple of the others say “Docks” and “Church of The Triumvirate.”"
    "指示牌指向四面八方。{w}\n上面标着“城镇广场”和“住宅区”之类的字样。{w}\n还有几个写着“码头”和“三人执政团教堂”。"

# game/script.rpy:40198
translate chinese click_map073_4_EV004_4c258f15:

    # "I guess it was easy to find directions in Mazeo.{w}\nIt seems like The Rebel HQ is in the opposite direction.{w}\nAs I've learned, it's located in tunnels underneath the church."
    "看来在马泽奥辨认方向很容易。{w}\n反抗军总部似乎在反方向。{w}\n据我了解，它就位于教堂下方的隧道里。"

# game/script.rpy:40200
translate chinese click_map073_4_EV004_7d995ed8:

    # "But stealing the tunnels underneath The Triumvirate's church?{w}\nSomething about that seems incredibly risky to me.{w}\nI'm sure Damek knows what he's doing, though."
    "可是偷用三人执政团教堂底下的隧道？{w}\n这在我看来风险大得离谱。{w}\n不过我相信达梅克清楚自己在做什么。"

# game/script.rpy:40237
translate chinese click_map073_5_EV005_59991fe6:

    # "Gryz's house is much more impressive than the others.{w}\nIt stands just as tall, but it's easily twice as wide.{w}\nHe must have tons of free space in there."
    "格瑞兹的宅邸比其他的气派得多。{w}\n高度相当，但宽度足足是别人的两倍。{w}\n里面想必有大把空地方。"

# game/script.rpy:40274
translate chinese click_map073_6_EV006_e2a8f049:

    # "The residential district seems to go on forever.{w}\nBut it's all flat. There's no elevation like in Valinorth.{w}\nBack at home, social status was determined by how high you live."
    "住宅区似乎绵延无尽。{w}\n但这里一片平坦，不像瓦利诺斯那样有高低起伏。{w}\n在家乡，社会地位由你住得多高决定。"

# game/script.rpy:40276
translate chinese click_map073_6_EV006_75f657b6:

    # "The Elder lives right at the top, since he's the most important.{w}\nI was given a house right next to the Main Street, an easy walk to Mylus'.{w}\nI wonder how social status is determined in Mazeo. Maybe I'll ask Damek."
    "长老住在最顶端，因为他是最重要的人。{w}\n我分到的房子紧邻主街，走到迈勒斯家很方便。{w}\n不知道马泽奥的社会地位是怎么定的。也许我该问问达梅克。"

# game/script.rpy:40313
translate chinese click_map073_7_EV007_1701c108:

    # "Gryz's house has a massive tree right next to it.{w}\nAt the very top, I can see some apples growing.{w}\nPerhaps those are the same ones Fortaime likes?"
    "格瑞兹的宅邸旁边有棵巨大的树。{w}\n在最顶端，我能看到长出了一些苹果。{w}\n也许就是福泰姆爱吃的那些？"

# game/script.rpy:40315
translate chinese click_map073_7_EV007_3054498d:

    # "Either way, they seem well maintained and fresh.{w}\nPerhaps this is Gryz's food of choice as well."
    "无论如何，它们看起来都照料得很好、很新鲜。{w}\n也许这也是格瑞兹钟爱的食物。"

# game/script.rpy:40398
translate chinese map071_3212760c:

    # "When I enter Gryz's house, I'm taken aback by how massive it is.{w}\nA front desk, probably for his assistant, rests near the front door.{w}\nBut behind it is a massive atrium, with a staircase leading up."
    "我走进格瑞兹的宅邸时，被它的宏大吓了一跳。{w}\n前门附近有个前台，大概是给他助手用的。{w}\n但前台后面是个巨大的中庭，有楼梯通往楼上。"

# game/script.rpy:40400
translate chinese map071_f10b0470:

    # "I'm willing to bet that Gryz's office is at the top of that staircase.{w}\nI look around, and find Damek, Ulric and Pro chatting with a woman.{w}\nThis must be the assistant that Damek mentioned earlier."
    "我敢打赌格瑞兹的办公室就在楼梯顶端。{w}\n我环顾四周，发现达梅克、乌尔里克和普洛正在跟一个女人交谈。{w}\n这一定就是达梅克先前提到的那位助手。"

# game/script.rpy:40402
translate chinese map071_05774f07:

    # "After noticing me enter, she quickly approaches us.{w}\nValessa and Fortaime retreat behind me, leaving me in charge.{w}\nI take a step forward and introduce myself to her without hesitation."
    "她注意到我进来后，快步走向我们。{w}\n瓦莱莎和福泰姆退到我身后，把场面交给我。{w}\n我上前一步，毫不犹豫地向她自我介绍。"

# game/script.rpy:40428
translate chinese map071_1b90254a:

    # voice "se/z00962.ogg"
    voice "se/z00962.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:40434
translate chinese map071_55249198:

    # char_jit_map071_1_0_21 "I've heard so much about you, [firstname].\nIt's a pleasure to finally meet you in person."
    char_jit_map071_1_0_21 "我听过太多关于你的事了，[firstname]。\n终于能亲自见到你，真高兴。"

# game/script.rpy:40439
translate chinese map071_3cf21fc8:

    # voice "se/z00963.ogg"
    voice "se/z00963.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:40445
translate chinese map071_62adc304:

    # char_jit_map071_1_0_28 "I've heard so much about you, [firstname].\nIt's a pleasure to finally meet you in person."
    char_jit_map071_1_0_28 "我听过太多关于你的事了，[firstname]。\n终于能亲自见到你，真高兴。"

# game/script.rpy:40461
translate chinese map071_198e7438:

    # "She puts her hand forward, and I give her a firm handshake.{w}\nValessa and Fortaime seem immediately at ease, as she's very friendly.{w}\nFor a moment, I'm not entirely sure what they were expecting."
    "她伸出手，我同她有力地握了握手。{w}\n因为她非常友善，瓦莱莎和福泰姆立刻放松下来。{w}\n有那么一瞬，我不太确定他们原本期待的是什么。"

# game/script.rpy:40486
translate chinese map071_8171cd12:

    # voice "se/z00964.ogg"
    voice "se/z00964.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:40492
translate chinese map071_6f12fd50:

    # char_jit_map071_1_0_50 "I'm guessing that's The Blade of Exodus?"
    char_jit_map071_1_0_50 "我猜那就是放逐之刃？"

# game/script.rpy:40506
translate chinese map071_38de3e7c:

    # "She tilts her head toward my back."
    "她朝我背后偏了偏头。"

# game/script.rpy:40531
translate chinese map071_895eb554:

    # voice "se/z00965.ogg"
    voice "se/z00965.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:40533
translate chinese map071_ed453d1f:

    # char_jit_map071_1_0_50 "You can take that cloak off in here, by the way.\nEverybody in this office knows what's going on.\nThere's no need to hide around Gryz, or myself."
    char_jit_map071_1_0_50 "顺便说，你在这儿可以把斗篷脱掉。\n这间办公室里的人都知道是怎么回事。\n在格瑞兹和我面前，不必藏着掖着。"

# game/script.rpy:40547
translate chinese map071_8b3b00e6:

    # "I nod, and remove the makeshift hood covering my head.{w}\nI feel the fresh Mazean air on my face for the first time."
    "我点点头，摘下头上临时充当兜帽的东西。{w}\n我第一次感到马泽奥清新的空气拂过面庞。"

# game/script.rpy:40572
translate chinese map071_866e7a7c:

    # voice "se/z00966.ogg"
    voice "se/z00966.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:40574
translate chinese map071_c993d7f1:

    # char_jit_map071_1_0_50 "Come back here with the rest of us, alright?\nI think they're almost ready to head upstairs."
    char_jit_map071_1_0_50 "回来跟我们其他人待在一起吧，好吗？\n我想他们差不多准备好上楼了。"

# game/script.rpy:40588
translate chinese map071_ca11c73a:

    # "She motions to the main landing area of the atrium.{w}\nWe move past her desk, which acts almost like a barrier.{w}\nI'm assuming she acts as Gryz's guard as well, standing watch."
    "她指了指中庭的主休息区。{w}\n我们走过她的桌子，那几乎像是一道屏障。{w}\n我猜她也兼任格瑞兹的守卫，负责放哨。"

# game/script.rpy:40590
translate chinese map071_753521f7:

    # "After a few moments, we regroup with the others.{w}\nThey're talking amongst themselves, but Lillith brings that to an end.{w}\nClapping her hands together once, and very loudly, their attention is grabbed."
    "片刻之后，我们和其余人会合。{w}\n他们正彼此交谈，但莉莉丝终止了这一切。{w}\n她非常响亮地拍了一下手，吸引了他们的注意。"

# game/script.rpy:40615
translate chinese map071_2cc5b743:

    # voice "se/z00967.ogg"
    voice "se/z00967.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:40617
translate chinese map071_aa4fb42d:

    # char_damek "Sorry, Lillith.\nJust lots to think about at the moment.\nI'm almost nervous to walk up there, if I'm honest."
    char_damek "抱歉，莉莉丝。\n眼下要操心的事太多了。\n老实说，我几乎有点不敢走上去。"

# game/script.rpy:40642
translate chinese map071_9ac9bba7:

    # voice "se/z00968.ogg"
    voice "se/z00968.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:40644
translate chinese map071_00f7329e:

    # char_jit_map071_1_0_50 "There's no need to be nervous, Damek.\nIt won't be any different from the last time you were here.\nJust a few added bodies, that's all. Not the end of the world."
    char_jit_map071_1_0_50 "没必要紧张，达梅克。\n这跟你上次来不会有什么不同。\n不过是多了几个人罢了。又不是天塌下来。"

# game/script.rpy:40669
translate chinese map071_b74f26e7:

    # voice "se/z00969.ogg"
    voice "se/z00969.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:40671
translate chinese map071_33424879:

    # char_damek "I just don't want to make the wrong choice.\nThere's a lot riding on this, Lillith."
    char_damek "我只是不想做出错误的选择。\n这件事关系重大，莉莉丝。"

# game/script.rpy:40696
translate chinese map071_5cbb9204:

    # voice "se/z00970.ogg"
    voice "se/z00970.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:40698
translate chinese map071_7daec04b:

    # char_jit_map071_1_0_50 "Have you made the wrong choice in the past...?"
    char_jit_map071_1_0_50 "你过去做过错误的选择吗……？"

# game/script.rpy:40723
translate chinese map071_950bcb0d:

    # voice "se/z00971.ogg"
    voice "se/z00971.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:40725
translate chinese map071_30c7d78f:

    # char_damek "Well, I don't think so..."
    char_damek "嗯，我想没有……"

# game/script.rpy:40750
translate chinese map071_3390c6b2:

    # voice "se/z00972.ogg"
    voice "se/z00972.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:40752
translate chinese map071_28367857:

    # char_jit_map071_1_0_50 "Then you'll be fine.\nBesides, Alex and Nada aren't too bad.\nThey're both playing ball to get what they want."
    char_jit_map071_1_0_50 "那你就会没事的。\n再说，亚历克斯和娜达也没那么糟。\n他们俩都是为了得到想要的才肯配合。"

# game/script.rpy:40765
translate chinese map071_13b64124:

    # voice "se/z00973.ogg"
    voice "se/z00973.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:40767
translate chinese map071_c87adc78:

    # char_jit_map071_1_0_50 "That means they'll have to be on their {i}best{/i} behavior.\nSo if being in the presence of pirates was a worry for—"
    char_jit_map071_1_0_50 "这意味着他们必须表现得{i}最好{/i}。\n所以，要是与海盗共处一室让你担心——"

# game/script.rpy:40792
translate chinese map071_ccd7e629:

    # voice "se/z00974.ogg"
    voice "se/z00974.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:40794
translate chinese map071_9f685a0f:

    # char_damek "Oh no, that's not it at all.\nI'm more than happy to work with pirates.\nYou're right, though. I have a good track record."
    char_damek "哦不，完全不是那样。\n我非常乐意跟海盗合作。\n不过你说得对。我的过往记录一向不错。"

# game/script.rpy:40808
translate chinese map071_4a1b5a1b:

    # "He lets out a nervous laugh before looking up to the top of the stairs."
    "他干笑一声，然后抬头望向楼梯顶端。"

# game/script.rpy:40833
translate chinese map071_b93c6a60:

    # voice "se/z00975.ogg"
    voice "se/z00975.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:40835
translate chinese map071_3fccc5b7:

    # char_damek "I guess that'll have to do.\nAre they ready...?"
    char_damek "我想这样也就够了。\n他们准备好了吗……？"

# game/script.rpy:40860
translate chinese map071_d7a87b63:

    # voice "se/z00976.ogg"
    voice "se/z00976.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:40862
translate chinese map071_a956ed79:

    # char_jit_map071_1_0_50 "Yeah. They're expecting all of you.\nIt might be a bit crowded, but you'll manage."
    char_jit_map071_1_0_50 "嗯。他们在等你们所有人。\n可能会有点挤，但你们能应付。"

# game/script.rpy:40887
translate chinese map071_6e50dc49:

    # voice "se/z00977.ogg"
    voice "se/z00977.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:40889
translate chinese map071_845abdba:

    # char_damek "Did you happen to overhear anything?\nYou know, so I don't go in blind."
    char_damek "你有没有碰巧听到些什么？\n你知道的，免得我两眼一抹黑地进去。"

# game/script.rpy:40914
translate chinese map071_92f14b62:

    # voice "se/z00978.ogg"
    voice "se/z00978.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:40916
translate chinese map071_b70d0c81:

    # char_jit_map071_1_0_50 "Unfortunately, no.\nThey're being {i}very{/i} discreet."
    char_jit_map071_1_0_50 "很遗憾，没有。\n他们{i}非常{/i}谨慎。"

# game/script.rpy:40941
translate chinese map071_4687eb2c:

    # voice "se/z00979.ogg"
    voice "se/z00979.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:40943
translate chinese map071_e31f3c05:

    # char_damek "Oh well, worth a shot.\nI guess it's finally time to do this.\nAre you ready everybody?"
    char_damek "算了，试试也无妨。\n我想终于该做了。\n大家准备好了吗？"

# game/script.rpy:40957
translate chinese map071_4b6a0e63:

    # "He looks at all of us one by one, and we nod.{w}\nI can tell he's trying to delay this, but I'm not sure why."
    "他逐一看着我们每个人，我们纷纷点头。{w}\n我看得出他在设法拖延，但我不清楚为什么。"

# game/script.rpy:40982
translate chinese map071_a4f0d20a:

    # voice "se/z00980.ogg"
    voice "se/z00980.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:40984
translate chinese map071_7920b323:

    # char_jit_map071_1_0_50 "Gryz will give me a debriefing when you're done.\nI know you're busy, so after this, just go on your way.\nLots to do, and little time to do it, right?"
    char_jit_map071_1_0_50 "你们结束后，格瑞兹会向我做个简报。\n我知道你们忙，所以这之后就直接上路吧。\n要做的事很多，时间却很少，对吧？"

# game/script.rpy:41010
translate chinese map071_d761b823:

    # "She glances at me, and the sword on my back before walking away.{w}\nIt seemed this quick detour wasn't going to be quick at all.{w}\nDuring these negotiations, everything could change."
    "她瞥了我一眼，又看了看我背上的剑，然后走开了。{w}\n看来这趟“顺路”根本快不了。{w}\n在这场谈判中，一切都可能改变。"

# game/script.rpy:41012
translate chinese map071_dbab9278:

    # "Hopefully, Damek would be able to get what he needs.{w}\nI just hope that the pirate's demands aren't too extreme.{w}\nWith the high ground, they had the right to request anything."
    "但愿达梅克能拿到他需要的东西。{w}\n我只希望海盗的条件别太离谱。{w}\n占据优势的他们，有权提出任何要求。"

# game/script.rpy:41014
translate chinese map071_fe1725c2:

    # "We all look at the top of the stairs, ready to get things moving.{w}\nThis would be a very important moment for Damek and The Rebels.{w}\nTo that end, we shouldn't keep Gryz waiting for too much longer."
    "我们全都望向楼梯顶端，准备好让事情推进。{w}\n这对达梅克和反抗军来说，会是极其重要的时刻。{w}\n为此，我们不该让格瑞兹等太久。"

# game/script.rpy:41649
translate chinese click_map074_4_EV004_a50d1822:

    # "That's the door that leads to Gryz's office.{w}\nQuite the dramatic sight, if you ask me.{w}\nIt definitely makes him feel important."
    "那就是通往格瑞兹办公室的门。{w}\n要我说，这景象挺有戏剧性的。{w}\n这确实让他显得很有分量。"

# game/script.rpy:41651
translate chinese click_map074_4_EV004_70ecbfdb:

    # "Underneath the stairs, rests some sort of contraption.{w}\nIf I had to guess, it would be a statue representing a spirit idol.{w}\nThere's an artist's name and date on it. It must've been expensive."
    "楼梯下方放着某种装置。{w}\n要我猜，那是一座代表灵像的雕像。{w}\n上面刻着艺术家的名字和日期。一定价值不菲。"

# game/script.rpy:41688
translate chinese click_map074_5_EV005_395fd4ac:

    # "Important papers are strewn about the desk.{w}\nIt's not my business to read them, but curiosity overtakes me.{w}\nI slowly approach the desk, and try my best to make out what I can."
    "重要的文件散落在桌上。{w}\n偷看不是我的事，但好奇心占据了我。{w}\n我慢慢走近桌子，尽力辨认能看清的内容。"

# game/script.rpy:41690
translate chinese click_map074_5_EV005_9ed10220:

    # "It seems to be a bunch of papers regarding upcoming shipments.{w}\nIt's correspondence between Gryz and the Mazeo Shipping Company.{w}\nUnderneath those papers is letters between Gryz and The Triumvirate."
    "似乎是一堆关于即将到来的货运的文件。{w}\n是格瑞兹与马泽奥航运公司之间的往来信件。{w}\n那些文件下面，是格瑞兹与三人执政团之间的信件。"

# game/script.rpy:41693
translate chinese click_map074_5_EV005_7ea971a5:

    # voice "se/a00220.ogg"
    # char_jit_map071_1_0_50 "Hey, get away from there!\nThose papers aren't for your eyes.\nThat's top secret, only for The Mayor!"
    voice "se/a00220.ogg"
    char_jit_map071_1_0_50 "嘿，离那儿远点！\n那些文件不是给你看的。\n那是最高机密，只有市长才能看！"

# game/script.rpy:41696
translate chinese click_map074_5_EV005_b798d5be:

    # "Then why leave them out in the open like that...?{w}\nBefore I can continue, she gathers them up and takes them away.{w}\nShe's running all over the place. Lillith must be a busy girl."
    "那为什么把它们就那么摊在外面……？{w}\n我还没来得及多想，她就把它们收起来拿走了。{w}\n她到处跑来跑去。莉莉丝一定是个大忙人。"

