    # "We all enter the office in sync, and everyone inside stares at us.{w}\nIt's odd, but, at first glance, I can tell exactly who everybody is.{w}\nNada takes a few steps forward, a sly smirk on her face."
    "我们一同走进办公室，里面所有人都盯着我们。{w}\n说来奇怪，可乍一看，我就能准确认出每个人是谁。{w}\n娜达上前几步，脸上挂着狡黠的坏笑。"

# game/script.rpy:42524
translate chinese map072_587d0f2f:

    # voice "se/z00981.ogg"
    voice "se/z00981.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:42530
translate chinese map072_2fdf5833:

    # char_jit_map072_1_0_14 "Late, are you?\nGood to know your word is trustworthy.\nIt's not like this is important, or anything like that."
    char_jit_map072_1_0_14 "迟到了，是吧？\n很高兴知道你的话还算可信。\n又不是说这件事有多重要，或者什么的。"

# game/script.rpy:42544
translate chinese map072_72439e12:

    # "It's clear bait, and Damek doesn't take it at all.{w}\nInstead, he smirks back, and approaches Gryz and the pirates."
    "这明显是挑衅，而达梅克完全不接招。{w}\n他反而回以一笑，走向格瑞兹和那些海盗。"

# game/script.rpy:42569
translate chinese map072_c1f3cb6a:

    # voice "se/z00982.ogg"
    voice "se/z00982.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:42571
translate chinese map072_5a29e9e0:

    # char_damek "Actually, this meeting doesn't start until {i}I{/i} arrive.\nSo, Nada, you're actually early. Very obedient of you.\nA bit softer than your reputation cites, but I'll let it slide."
    char_damek "其实，这场会议要等{i}我{/i}到了才开始。\n所以，娜达，你其实来早了。真是听话。\n比你传闻中要软一些，不过我不计较。"

# game/script.rpy:42592
translate chinese map072_fa27568d:

    # "She struggles to conjure up a comeback, and simply shrugs.{w}\nDamek approaches Gryz's desk, and waves us all over.{w}\nIt isn't much longer until we're all cramped together."
    "她憋了半天想找句话反击，最后只是耸了耸肩。{w}\n达梅克走向格瑞兹的桌子，招手让我们都过去。{w}\n没过多久，我们就全挤在了一起。"

# game/script.rpy:42618
translate chinese map072_e566559d:

    # voice "se/z00983.ogg"
    voice "se/z00983.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:42620
translate chinese map072_b4d7eba7:

    # char_damek "Gryz, I'd like to introduce you to [firstname]."
    char_damek "格瑞兹，我想向你介绍[firstname]。"

# game/script.rpy:42625
translate chinese map072_88c706de:

    # voice "se/z00984.ogg"
    voice "se/z00984.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:42627
translate chinese map072_b4d7eba7_1:

    # char_damek "Gryz, I'd like to introduce you to [firstname]."
    char_damek "格瑞兹，我想向你介绍[firstname]。"

# game/script.rpy:42643
translate chinese map072_3462e6e8:

    # "I take a step forward, and offer a hand to Gryz.{w}\nHe rises from his chair, and gives my hand a firm shake."
    "我上前一步，向格瑞兹伸出手。{w}\n他从椅子上起身，有力地握了握我的手。"

# game/script.rpy:42669
translate chinese map072_19614cdb:

    # voice "se/z00985.ogg"
    voice "se/z00985.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:42675
translate chinese map072_a850dcc3:

    # char_jit_map072_1_0_83 "It's an honor to meet you, [firstname].\nAnd those two must be your friends?"
    char_jit_map072_1_0_83 "见到你是我的荣幸，[firstname]。\n那两位一定是你的朋友吧？"

# game/script.rpy:42680
translate chinese map072_05131c71:

    # voice "se/z00986.ogg"
    voice "se/z00986.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:42686
translate chinese map072_b02e0221:

    # char_jit_map072_1_0_90 "It's an honor to meet you, [firstname].\nAnd those two must be your friends?"
    char_jit_map072_1_0_90 "见到你是我的荣幸，[firstname]。\n那两位一定是你的朋友吧？"

# game/script.rpy:42702
translate chinese map072_ba9285ed:

    # "I nod, as he looks at Valessa and Fortaime."
    "他看向瓦莱莎和福泰姆，我点了点头。"

# game/script.rpy:42727
translate chinese map072_2f71d0ea:

    # voice "se/z00987.ogg"
    voice "se/z00987.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:42733
translate chinese map072_cde01046:

    # char_jit_map072_1_0_110 "Say, have you three been to Mazeo before?\nI can't put my finger on it, but you look familiar."
    char_jit_map072_1_0_110 "我说，你们三个以前来过马泽奥吗？\n我说不上来，但你们看着眼熟。"

# game/script.rpy:42747
translate chinese map072_76f81145:

    # "I shake my head, and he promptly returns to his chair.{w}\nHe looks at all of us one-by-one, and lets out a loud sigh."
    "我摇摇头，他随即回到椅子上。{w}\n他逐一看着我们每个人，长叹一声。"

# game/script.rpy:42772
translate chinese map072_71db7810:

    # voice "se/z00988.ogg"
    voice "se/z00988.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:42774
translate chinese map072_cfc13bea:

    # char_jit_map072_1_0_110 "Oh well. Not that it matters, anyway.\nI'd like to thank you all for coming to my office.\nToday we discuss the matter of Damek and The Pirates."
    char_jit_map072_1_0_110 "算了。反正也不重要。\n感谢各位来到我的办公室。\n今天我们讨论达梅克与海盗的事。"

# game/script.rpy:42799
translate chinese map072_2f9a42d1:

    # voice "se/z00989.ogg"
    voice "se/z00989.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:42801
translate chinese map072_3e9a4532:

    # char_damek "What have you got for me, Gryz?\nSurely you have their demands laid out on the table?"
    char_damek "你有什么给我的，格瑞兹？\n他们的条件想必已经摆在桌上了吧？"

# game/script.rpy:42826
translate chinese map072_87fcdd11:

    # voice "se/z00990.ogg"
    voice "se/z00990.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:42828
translate chinese map072_fd6ac016:

    # char_jit_map072_1_0_110 "Yes, of course. I made them write up their demands in private.\nI didn't want them influencing each other in any certain direction."
    char_jit_map072_1_0_110 "是的，当然。我让他们私下各自写下条件。\n我不想让他们互相影响，往某个特定方向偏。"

# game/script.rpy:42842
translate chinese map072_570c7059:

    # "He points to two pieces of paper resting on his table.{w}\nThey're turned upside down so nobody could read them."
    "他指向桌上放着的两张纸。{w}\n它们被扣着放，好让谁也读不到。"

# game/script.rpy:42867
translate chinese map072_92c6d241:

    # voice "se/z00991.ogg"
    voice "se/z00991.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:42869
translate chinese map072_7c5a4641:

    # char_jit_map072_1_0_110 "Here's how this is going to work.\nNeither pirate knows which paper is theirs.\nDamek, you and your allies are to read each one."
    char_jit_map072_1_0_110 "接下来是这样进行的。\n两名海盗都不知道哪张纸是自己的。\n达梅克，你和你的盟友要分别阅读两份。"

# game/script.rpy:42872
translate chinese map072_12699c7d:

    # voice "se/z00992.ogg"
    # char_jit_map072_1_0_110 "Afterwards, each pirate is to explain their demands out loud.\nThis is to make sure they haven't gotten greedy, or changed their mind.\nWe also need some witnesses, which is why I had you bring some friends."
    voice "se/z00992.ogg"
    char_jit_map072_1_0_110 "之后，每名海盗要当众说明自己的条件。\n这是为了确保他们没有贪心，或者改了主意。\n我们还需要一些见证人，所以我让你带几个朋友来。"

# game/script.rpy:42886
translate chinese map072_1ae68471:

    # voice "se/z00993.ogg"
    voice "se/z00993.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:42888
translate chinese map072_9404d7d5:

    # char_jit_map072_1_0_110 "At that point, Damek may converse with his allies.\nWhen a decision is made, we will both sign the chosen demands.\nTo avoid conflict, neither pirate will learn if they were chosen."
    char_jit_map072_1_0_110 "到那时，达梅克可以与盟友商议。\n一旦做出决定，我们双方将在选中的条件上签字。\n为避免冲突，两名海盗都不会知道谁被选中了。"

# game/script.rpy:42891
translate chinese map072_82dd5b95:

    # voice "se/z00994.ogg"
    # char_jit_map072_1_0_110 "When everybody leaves, the demands will be mailed back.\nThe pirate that receives a signed paper today, will know they were chosen.\nThere is no time for drama, or in-fighting on my property. Understand?"
    voice "se/z00994.ogg"
    char_jit_map072_1_0_110 "等所有人离开后，这些条件将被寄回。\n今天收到签字纸张的那名海盗，就会知道自己被选中了。\n在我的地盘上，没时间搞什么闹剧或内斗。明白吗？"

# game/script.rpy:42917
translate chinese map072_8230e144:

    # voice "se/z00995.ogg"
    voice "se/z00995.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:42919
translate chinese map072_fa46a05c:

    # char_damek "I understand."
    char_damek "我明白。"

# game/script.rpy:42940
translate chinese map072_5968a4bd:

    # "Damek looks over to Nada and Alex, awaiting their approval."
    "达梅克看向娜达和亚历克斯，等待他们的认可。"

# game/script.rpy:42965
translate chinese map072_3fff14dc:

    # voice "se/z00996.ogg"
    voice "se/z00996.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:42967
translate chinese map072_d7b730ab:

    # char_jit_map072_1_0_14 "Yeah, I understand."
    char_jit_map072_1_0_14 "嗯，我明白。"

# game/script.rpy:42980
translate chinese map072_3e154bbf:

    # voice "se/z00997.ogg"
    voice "se/z00997.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:42986
translate chinese map072_fd8c7045:

    # char_jit_map072_1_0_231 "Me too."
    char_jit_map072_1_0_231 "我也是。"

# game/script.rpy:43007
translate chinese map072_d9240f7c:

    # "Damek places his hands on the desk, looking over the papers.{w}\nBut before taking any actions, he turns his head toward me."
    "达梅克双手按在桌上，审视着那些文件。{w}\n但在采取任何行动之前，他转头看向我。"

# game/script.rpy:43033
translate chinese map072_b842523b:

    # voice "se/z00998.ogg"
    voice "se/z00998.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:43035
translate chinese map072_b6f51d5c:

    # char_damek "[firstname], I'd like your input on this.\nYou're no stranger to tough decisions, right?"
    char_damek "[firstname]，我想听听你的意见。\n你对艰难的决定并不陌生，对吧？"

# game/script.rpy:43040
translate chinese map072_23a3b1f8:

    # voice "se/z00999.ogg"
    voice "se/z00999.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:43042
translate chinese map072_b6f51d5c_1:

    # char_damek "[firstname], I'd like your input on this.\nYou're no stranger to tough decisions, right?"
    char_damek "[firstname]，我想听听你的意见。\n你对艰难的决定并不陌生，对吧？"

# game/script.rpy:43056
translate chinese map072_cc45136e:

    # voice "se/z01000.ogg"
    voice "se/z01000.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:43058
translate chinese map072_40f75c4a:

    # char_damek "And from what I've heard, we share some common views.\nIt couldn't hurt to get a second opinion from someone like you."
    char_damek "而且据我所闻，我们有些共同的看法。\n从你这样的人那里得到第二意见，总没坏处。"

# game/script.rpy:43063
translate chinese map072_c9be68ac:

    # voice "se/z01001.ogg"
    voice "se/z01001.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:43065
translate chinese map072_12aaa256:

    # char_damek "I'd like to see how you think about this kind of stuff.\nYou must've had some reason to keep Peregrino, right?\nI'd like to see your \"process\", for lack of a better word."
    char_damek "我想看看你对这类事是怎么想的。\n你留下佩雷格里诺，一定有你的理由，对吧？\n我想看看你的“思路”，找不到更合适的说法。"

# game/script.rpy:43081
translate chinese map072_9eb85588:

    # "I nod, and walk up to the desk, standing beside him.{w}\nWe stare down at the two papers, hesitant."
    "我点点头，走到桌边，站在他身旁。{w}\n我们犹豫地低头盯着那两张纸。"

# game/script.rpy:43106
translate chinese map072_3c8f32c3:

    # voice "se/z01002.ogg"
    voice "se/z01002.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:43108
translate chinese map072_4db3ffe8:

    # char_jit_map072_1_0_110 "You may begin the first phase.\nRemain silent, but read the papers over."
    char_jit_map072_1_0_110 "你们可以开始第一阶段了。\n保持安静，读完这些文件。"

# game/script.rpy:43134
translate chinese map072_66d376da:

    # "A few moments later, Damek grabs one of the papers.{w}\nHe inches closer to me, and slowly turns it around."
    "片刻之后，达梅克拿起其中一张纸。{w}\n他向我凑近，慢慢把它翻过来。"

# game/script.rpy:43136
translate chinese map072_8e73d4d0:

    # "It's Alex's offer. "
    "是亚历克斯的条件。"

# game/script.rpy:43138
translate chinese map072_30adf140:

    # "He wants the trade bans to be lifted from Mazeo.{w}\nIf this is done, the pirates must all be offered jobs in the Mazeo Shipping Company.{w}\nPiracy will be no more, and Mazeo will turn into a nation of \"free trade\"."
    "他希望解除对马泽奥的贸易禁令。{w}\n若此事办成，所有海盗必须获得马泽奥航运公司的工作机会。{w}\n海盗将不复存在，马泽奥将变成一个“自由贸易”的国度。"

# game/script.rpy:43140
translate chinese map072_1002db01:

    # "In exchange, he can offer the ships and crew of those who side with him.{w}\nThis makes up approximately 35 percent of the total pirates in Mazeo.{w}\nHe cannot guarantee how Nada's followers will react to this change."
    "作为交换，他能提供站在他这边那些人的船只和船员。{w}\n这约占马泽奥海盗总数的百分之三十五。{w}\n他无法保证娜达的追随者会对这一变动作何反应。"

# game/script.rpy:43142
translate chinese map072_a22320c6:

    # "Damek places the paper face down, and quickly grabs the other one.{w}\nHe shows no expression, wearing the perfect poker face.{w}\nTurning the paper around, it's time to see the other half."
    "达梅克把纸扣下，迅速拿起另一张。{w}\n他面无表情，完全不动声色。{w}\n把纸翻过来，该看另一半了。"

# game/script.rpy:43144
translate chinese map072_dbd7f375:

    # "It's Nada's offer."
    "是娜达的条件。"

# game/script.rpy:43146
translate chinese map072_e35169d6:

    # "She wants Mazeo to be divided into two.{w}\nIf this is done, all of the pirates will move to a new nation, out of Mazeo's way.{w}\nOf course, she must be declared head of this new pirate nation."
    "她希望马泽奥一分为二。{w}\n若此事办成，所有海盗都将迁往一个新国家，不再妨碍马泽奥。{w}\n当然，她必须被宣布为这个新海盗国家的首领。"

# game/script.rpy:43148
translate chinese map072_c6b19e14:

    # "Furthermore, her demands include more details about the division of Mazeo.{w}\nIt's done so in a fashion that gives both sides equal market and residential space.{w}\nMazeo currently owns all of this, so it would negatively affect the nation."
    "此外，她的条件还包括关于马泽奥划分的更多细节。{w}\n其划分方式让双方获得同等的市场与居住空间。{w}\n这些目前都归马泽奥所有，因此会对这个国家造成不利影响。"

# game/script.rpy:43150
translate chinese map072_2ff99115:

    # "In exchange, she can offer approximately 65 percent of the total pirates in Mazeo.{w}\nThis includes a massive arsenal of ships, making Alex's offer seem inconsequential.{w}\nBoth demands share one thing in common: Pirates criminal records are to be wiped."
    "作为交换，她能提供马泽奥海盗总数约百分之六十五的力量。{w}\n其中包含庞大的舰船武备，让亚历克斯的条件显得微不足道。{w}\n两份条件有一个共同点：海盗的犯罪记录都将被抹去。"

# game/script.rpy:43152
translate chinese map072_5067ff20:

    # "Damek places the second paper face down, and shrugs."
    "达梅克把第二张纸扣下，耸了耸肩。"

# game/script.rpy:43177
translate chinese map072_611f8ac3:

    # voice "se/z01003.ogg"
    voice "se/z01003.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:43179
translate chinese map072_1e7eb079:

    # char_damek "Well I guess that's it, then?"
    char_damek "那我想就这样了？"

# game/script.rpy:43193
translate chinese map072_ef4d7680:

    # "Gryz nods."
    "格瑞兹点点头。"

# game/script.rpy:43218
translate chinese map072_78060b33:

    # voice "se/z01004.ogg"
    voice "se/z01004.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:43220
translate chinese map072_10a1403f:

    # char_jit_map072_1_0_110 "Indeed, we can move on to phase two.\nAlex and Nada, it's your turn to step forward.\nYour verbal demands must match the papers."
    char_jit_map072_1_0_110 "确实，我们可以进入第二阶段了。\n亚历克斯、娜达，轮到你们上前了。\n你们口头陈述的条件必须与文件一致。"

# game/script.rpy:43241
translate chinese map072_e168a8bc:

    # "In response to Gryz's order, they both step forward.{w}\nThis whole thing seemed incredibly well thought out.{w}\nThere was no room for error in any possible way."
    "听到格瑞兹的命令，两人都上前一步。{w}\n这整套安排考虑得极其周密。{w}\n任何环节都没有出错的余地。"

# game/script.rpy:43266
translate chinese map072_5a41a33e:

    # voice "se/z01005.ogg"
    voice "se/z01005.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:43268
translate chinese map072_f8ffbefe:

    # char_jit_map072_1_0_231 "My demands are quite simple, actually.\nAll pirates will have their criminal records erased.\nFurthermore, the trade bans will be lifted from Mazeo."
    char_jit_map072_1_0_231 "我的条件其实很简单。\n所有海盗的犯罪记录都将被抹去。\n此外，对马泽奥的贸易禁令将被解除。"

# game/script.rpy:43271
translate chinese map072_d3b83ec1:

    # voice "se/z01006.ogg"
    # char_jit_map072_1_0_231 "Pirates will be publicly pardoned, and no longer ostracized.\nThey will be offered jobs within The Mazeo Shipping Company.\nOur clients, our cargo, and our trade routes will all carry over as well."
    voice "se/z01006.ogg"
    char_jit_map072_1_0_231 "海盗将被公开赦免，不再遭受排斥。\n他们将获得马泽奥航运公司内的工作机会。\n我们的客户、货物和贸易航线也将一并延续。"

# game/script.rpy:43285
translate chinese map072_adfd8b5a:

    # voice "se/z01007.ogg"
    voice "se/z01007.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:43287
translate chinese map072_c7cdc83a:

    # char_jit_map072_1_0_231 "This will reintroduce us to society, and legitimize all of our efforts.\nMazeo will be free, as it once was, and as it always {i}should{/i} be.\nIn exchange, I offer 35 percent of Mazeo's pirates, and their ships."
    char_jit_map072_1_0_231 "这将让我们重新融入社会，让我们所有的努力变得名正言顺。\n马泽奥将重获自由，一如往昔，也一如它{i}本该{/i}的样子。\n作为交换，我献上马泽奥百分之三十五的海盗和他们的船只。"

# game/script.rpy:43308
translate chinese map072_08ba9078:

    # "He takes a few steps back, crossing his arms.{w}\nNada scoffs before vocalizing her demands."
    "他后退几步，抱起双臂。{w}\n娜达哼了一声，然后说出了她的条件。"

# game/script.rpy:43333
translate chinese map072_f979794a:

    # voice "se/z01008.ogg"
    voice "se/z01008.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:43335
translate chinese map072_79823b03:

    # char_jit_map072_1_0_14 "I can offer the other {i}65{/i} percent.\nI think that puts me a cut above Alex."
    char_jit_map072_1_0_14 "我能献上另外的{i}六十五{/i}个百分点。\n我想这让我比亚历克斯高出一筹。"

# game/script.rpy:43349
translate chinese map072_58126910:

    # "This certainly gets a reaction from others in the room.{w}\nHowever, we can't get won over by numbers.{w}\nWe were deciding the future of Mazeo."
    "这话果然让屋里其他人有了反应。{w}\n不过，我们不能被数字冲昏头脑。{w}\n我们决定的是马泽奥的未来。"

# game/script.rpy:43364
translate chinese map072_1cc2d169:

    # voice "se/z01009.ogg"
    # char_jit_map072_1_0_14 "I also want all criminal records expunged.\nHowever, my other demands are a bit more extreme.\nI want Mazeo divided in half. I want a new nation born."
    voice "se/z01009.ogg"
    char_jit_map072_1_0_14 "我也要求抹去所有犯罪记录。\n不过，我其他的条件要激进一些。\n我要马泽奥一分为二。我要一个新国家诞生。"

# game/script.rpy:43378
