# game/script.rpy:43380
translate chinese map072_4b980408:

    # char_jit_map072_1_0_14 "All pirates will move to this new nation, under {i}my{/i} lead.\nMazeo will no longer be able to interfere with our work.\nI will determine where the nation is split in half."
    char_jit_map072_1_0_14 "所有海盗都将迁往这个新国家，由{i}我{/i}来领导。\n马泽奥再也不能干涉我们的营生。\n国家从何处一分为二，由我来定。"

# game/script.rpy:43383
translate chinese map072_bd8411d7:

    # voice "se/z01011.ogg"
    # char_jit_map072_1_0_14 "I want both residential {i}and{/i} commercial land.\nWe will be given everything we need to live happily.\nThat is my demand. A new nation, built for piracy."
    voice "se/z01011.ogg"
    char_jit_map072_1_0_14 "我要住宅用地，{i}也要{/i}商业用地。\n我们要得到幸福生活所需的一切。\n这就是我的条件。一个为海盗而建的新国家。"

