    # "He points to the same paper, and Gryz brings out a quill.{w}\nThey waste no time in signing it, making it an official decree.{w}\nAfter that, Gryz rolls both papers up, and seals them with wax."
    "他指向同一张纸，格瑞兹取出一支羽毛笔。{w}\n他们毫不耽搁地签了字，使其成为正式法令。{w}\n之后，格瑞兹把两份纸都卷起来，用蜡封好。"

