    # "And with that, it's time to get things on the move.{w}\nI'd finally start training, and see The Rebellion's new HQ."
    "就这样，该动身了。{w}\n我终于要开始训练，并一睹反抗军的新总部。"

# game/script.rpy:44601
translate chinese click_map075_3_EV003_38098da6:

    # "Gryz's desk reminds me of Mylus' place.{w}\nIt's messy, but he still has it under control.{w}\nEverything is where it needs to be, and it works."
    "格瑞兹的桌子让我想起迈勒斯那里。{w}\n乱是乱，但他仍然掌控得住。{w}\n每样东西都在该在的位置，运转良好。"

# game/script.rpy:44638
translate chinese click_map075_4_EV004_85ac6032:

    # "There's a ton of papers on the floor.{w}\nI inspect them closer. They're all dated for today.{w}\nCould Gryz's job really be {i}that{/i} busy!? Wow."
    "地上堆着海量的文件。{w}\n我凑近查看，日期全是今天。{w}\n格瑞兹的工作真有{i}那么{/i}忙吗！？哇。"

# game/script.rpy:44640
translate chinese click_map075_4_EV004_7559b787:

    # "I look over at Fortaime, and he's shaking.{w}\nI can tell the mess is bothering him.{w}\nBut he also knows he can't touch it."
    "我看向福泰姆，他在发抖。{w}\n我看得出这片凌乱让他难受。{w}\n但他也知道自己不能碰。"

# game/script.rpy:44677
translate chinese click_map075_5_EV005_594612db:

    # "Gryz's office seems to overlook the Mazean Docks.{w}\nA massive shipyard, full of impressive vessels.{w}\nI see people loading them up, preparing shipments."
    "格瑞兹的办公室似乎俯瞰着马泽奥码头。{w}\n一个巨大的造船厂，停满令人印象深刻的船只。{w}\n我看到人们正在往船上装货，准备发运。"

# game/script.rpy:44679
translate chinese click_map075_5_EV005_50fe19f7:

    # "I wonder how he could work next to such a loud place.{w}\nIt shows no signs of slowing down, and it's very busy.{w}\nWe'd be heading there next, and I couldn't wait."
    "我纳闷他怎么能在这般喧闹的地方工作。{w}\n那里毫无放慢的迹象，忙得不可开交。{w}\n我们接下来就要去那里，我迫不及待。"

# game/script.rpy:44716
translate chinese click_map075_7_EV007_0e455b5a:

    # "I start to inspect the bookshelf, but Gryz quickly stops me."
    "我正要查看书架，格瑞兹立刻制止了我。"

# game/script.rpy:44719
translate chinese click_map075_7_EV007_7e304413:

    # voice "se/a00221.ogg"
    # char_jit_map072_1_0_110 "Hey, don't touch any of that.\nThis is my office, you know."
    voice "se/a00221.ogg"
    char_jit_map072_1_0_110 "嘿，别碰那些东西。\n你知道，这是我的办公室。"

# game/script.rpy:44722
translate chinese click_map075_7_EV007_85b13c50:

    # "He crosses his arms, and I back away from the shelf.{w}\nSomething tells me I wouldn't want to get on his bad side."
    "他抱起双臂，我从书架旁退开。{w}\n我有种感觉，我可不想惹上他。"

# game/script.rpy:44759
translate chinese click_map075_144_EV144_1ebcb4e1:

    # "It's a map of Alestia.{w}\nI see everything on here:{w}\nValinorth, Mazeo, Alarinthia, and Balteus."
    "这是一张阿莱斯蒂亚的地图。{w}\n上面的一切我都看得到：{w}\n瓦利诺斯、马泽奥、阿拉林西亚，还有巴尔泰乌斯。"

# game/script.rpy:44761
translate chinese click_map075_144_EV144_fac5047c:

    # "Only the west remains unmapped.{w}\nVicious storms and unruly waters get in the way.{w}\nIt's unlikely that anything is out there, though."
    "只有西部仍是未标注之地。{w}\n凶猛的暴风雨和狂暴的海域横亘其间。{w}\n不过，那外面不太可能有什么东西。"

