    # "After we enter the door, we spend a few minutes descending into darkness.{w}\nSoon enough, however, we reach an area with torches lighting the way.{w}\nIt seems to mark a path straight forward. This must be it."
    "我们进门之后，花了几分钟向下走入黑暗。{w}\n不过很快，我们来到一处有火把照亮的地方。{w}\n火把似乎标出了一条笔直向前的路。就是这里了。"

# game/script.rpy:45496
