translate chinese map115_8941d9c2:

    # char_damek "Just give it a few minutes. Your eyes will adjust.\nI remember my first time down here. I was terrified."
    char_damek "等几分钟就好。你的眼睛会适应的。\n我还记得第一次来这儿，我吓坏了。"

# game/script.rpy:45539
translate chinese map115_2158ee21:

    # "He presses his back against the wall and waits.{w}\nWe all do the same, and wait around until we can see."
    "他背靠着墙，等待着。{w}\n我们都照做，原地等着直到能看清东西。"

# game/script.rpy:45564
