translate chinese map115_99f98d26:

    # char_damek "The torches only help so much.\nWe put a majority of them in our actual HQ.\nBasically, we only have them down here to—"
    char_damek "火把能帮的有限。\n我们把大部分火把都放在真正的总部了。\n基本上，我们把它们放在这儿只是为了——"

# game/script.rpy:45580
translate chinese map115_bd98f226:

    # "He cuts himself off and looks further down the tunnel."
    "他打住话头，望向隧道更深处。"

# game/script.rpy:45605
