    char_damek "那么，我们走吧……？"

# game/script.rpy:46161
translate chinese map115_cd587ea6:

    # "We all nod, as we continue to move through the tunnels.{w}\nHowever, Damek seems distracted. There's something on his mind.{w}\nI guess even a man in his position can't have a grasp on everything."
    "我们全都点头，继续在隧道中前行。{w}\n不过，达梅克似乎心不在焉。他心里有事。{w}\n我想，即便是他这种地位的人，也不可能事事都了然于胸。"

# game/script.rpy:46163
translate chinese map115_5dc668c8:

    # "Everyone makes conversation amongst themselves as we continue.{w}\nPerhaps it would be a good idea to talk with Damek a little bit more.{w}\nIt seems like we still have a bit of walking ahead of us after all."
    "我们继续前行，大家各自聊着天。{w}\n也许再跟达梅克多聊聊会是个好主意。{w}\n毕竟我们似乎还有一段路要走。"

# game/script.rpy:46446
translate chinese click_map121_4_EV004_e7b93957:

    # "Cannot access content at this time.\nIf there is an X, you must complete preceding Heart-to-Hearts.\nIf there is a checkmark, you must move on to the next Heart-to-Heart."
    "目前无法访问此内容。\n若显示叉号，你必须先完成前置的心灵对话。\n若显示对勾，你必须前往下一个心灵对话。"

# game/script.rpy:46469
translate chinese click_map121_6_EV006_c9ee2804:

    # "I can see a makeshift doorway at the end of the tunnels.{w}\nThat must be the entrance to the Rebel HQ. Finally.{w}\nIts a bit far away, but I'm glad it's actually in sight."
    "我能看到隧道尽头有个临时搭建的门洞。{w}\n那一定是反抗军总部的入口。终于到了。{w}\n虽然还有点远，但总算出现在视野里了，我很高兴。"

# game/script.rpy:46472
translate chinese click_map121_6_EV006_2f6eb7ef:

    # voice "se/a00400.ogg"
    # char_damek "What's the matter, are your legs sore?"
    voice "se/a00400.ogg"
    char_damek "怎么了，腿酸了吗？"

# game/script.rpy:46476
translate chinese click_map121_6_EV006_0aa1f613:

    # voice "se/a00401.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "No! Not at all.\nI'm just running out of breath.\nIs it a little stuffy down here, or...?"
    voice "se/a00401.ogg"
    char_fortaime "没有！完全不是。\n我只是有点喘不过气。\n这下面是不是有点闷，还是……？"

# game/script.rpy:46480
translate chinese click_map121_6_EV006_eb11d592:

    # voice "se/a00402.ogg"
    # char_damek "Yeah it is.\nDon't worry, you get used to it.\nA small price to pay for privacy, if you ask me."
    voice "se/a00402.ogg"
    char_damek "确实有点。\n别担心，你会习惯的。\n要我说，为了隐私，这点代价算小的了。"

# game/script.rpy:46484
translate chinese click_map121_6_EV006_14e9c4b8:

    # voice "se/a00403.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "Right..."
    voice "se/a00403.ogg"
    char_fortaime "好吧……"

# game/script.rpy:46522
translate chinese click_map121_7_EV007_ca7b82a2:

    # "There are torches lining the tunnels, freshly lit.{w}\nIt must require a lot of maintenance to keep these tunnels accessible.{w} \nI'd hate to be down here when those torches die out. Sounds terrifying."
    "隧道两侧排列着火把，刚刚点燃。{w}\n要让这些隧道保持通行，肯定需要大量的维护。{w} \n我可不想在火把熄灭的时候待在这下面。想想就可怕。"

# game/script.rpy:46524
translate chinese click_map121_7_EV007_be23ed73:

    # "Thankfully, they don't seem to be at any risk of fading away.{w}\nWe could stay down here for a while without any worry.{w}\nHowever, that doesn't seem to be on any of our agendas."
    "谢天谢地，它们似乎没有熄灭的危险。{w}\n我们大可以放心地在这里待上一阵子。{w}\n不过，这似乎不在我们任何人的计划之中。"

# game/script.rpy:46561
translate chinese click_map121_8_EV008_0b99ed84:

    # "There's wooden panels on the floor, almost acting like pavement.{w}\nHowever, it's only a bit more comfortable than the actual floor would be.{w}\nIt's seemingly more for aesthetic purposes than anything regarding comfort."
    "地上铺着木板，几乎像是路面一样。{w}\n不过，它也只比真正的地面舒服一点点。{w}\n看起来更多是为了美观，而不是为了舒适。"

# game/script.rpy:46563
translate chinese click_map121_8_EV008_b878e657:

    # "Drops of humidity and moisture hit the wooden panels, making them split.{w}\nIt looks like they've been here for a while, with clear signs of erosion.{w}\nWith what I know, I'd say that these tunnels are almost twenty years old."
    "湿气凝结的水滴落在木板上，让它们开裂。{w}\n看来它们已经在这里很久了，有明显的侵蚀痕迹。{w}\n据我所知，这些隧道大概有将近二十年的历史了。"

# game/script.rpy:46566
translate chinese click_map121_8_EV008_e0b8f98f:

    # voice "se/a00404.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "Hey, Valessa, watch your step!"
    voice "se/a00404.ogg"
    char_fortaime "嘿，瓦莱莎，小心脚下！"

# game/script.rpy:46570
translate chinese click_map121_8_EV008_530ac0f1:

    # voice "se/a00405.ogg"
    # char_valessa "Huh?"
    voice "se/a00405.ogg"
    char_valessa "嗯？"

# game/script.rpy:46574
translate chinese click_map121_8_EV008_e4448ddd:

    # voice "se/a00406.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "There's a bit of a bump here. I almost tripped."
    voice "se/a00406.ogg"
    char_fortaime "这里有块凸起。我差点绊倒。"

# game/script.rpy:46578
translate chinese click_map121_8_EV008_4b8d448d:

    # voice "se/a00407.ogg"
    # char_valessa "Oh don't worry, I'll be fine."
    voice "se/a00407.ogg"
    char_valessa "哦，别担心，我没事的。"

# game/script.rpy:46581
translate chinese click_map121_8_EV008_e82dd883:

    # "A few moments later, she trips.{w}\nIt was a clear sign that she disregarded his warning.{w}\nHe laughs, and keeps walking forward, highly amused."
    "片刻之后，她绊了一下。{w}\n这显然说明她无视了他的警告。{w}\n他大笑起来，兴致勃勃地继续往前走。"

# game/script.rpy:46584
translate chinese click_map121_8_EV008_54a7e077:

    # voice "se/a00408.ogg"
    # char_valessa "Let's not talk about this."
    voice "se/a00408.ogg"
    char_valessa "这事儿就别提了。"

# game/script.rpy:46647
translate chinese map128_ae00ad71:

    # "As we walk down the tunnels, I make my way to Damek's side.{w}\nI ask him what's on his mind, and the people behind us give us space.{w}\nI'm thankful for their consideration, as we finally get some one-on-one time."
    "我们沿着隧道前行，我走到达梅克身边。{w}\n我问他心里在想什么，身后的人给我们留出了空间。{w}\n我很感激他们的体谅，我们终于有了独处的机会。"

# game/script.rpy:46672
translate chinese map128_dbeffd5f:

    # voice "se/y01018.ogg"
    voice "se/y01018.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:46675
translate chinese map128_17cbde23:

    # char_damek "What's on my mind...?\nOh, it's nothing too major.\nSay — can you keep a secret?" nointeract
    char_damek "我心里在想什么……？\n哦，不是什么大事。\n对了——你能保守秘密吗？" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:46689
translate chinese map128_e1df36ae:

    # voice "se/y01019.ogg"
    # char_damek "Oh, wonderful.\nIts nice to have someone to talk to."
    voice "se/y01019.ogg"
    char_damek "哦，太好了。\n有个能说说话的人真好。"

# game/script.rpy:46706
translate chinese map128_02132a5c:

    # voice "se/y01020.ogg"
    # char_damek "Again with the flattery...?\nYou already made a good impression, you know.\nIf you keep doing that, I might just get the wrong idea."
    voice "se/y01020.ogg"
    char_damek "又来这套恭维……？\n你要知道，你已经给我留下好印象了。\n你再这样下去，我可能就要误会了。"

# game/script.rpy:46721
translate chinese map128_dd0324b9:

    # voice "se/y01021.ogg"
    # char_damek "Well, it's nothing too bad.\nI just wanted somebody to confide in."
    voice "se/y01021.ogg"
    char_damek "嗯，不是什么坏事。\n我只是想找个能倾诉的人。"

# game/script.rpy:46736
translate chinese map128_3ae49e3e:

    # voice "se/y01022.ogg"
    # char_damek "Well, about that..."
    voice "se/y01022.ogg"
    char_damek "嗯，关于那件事……"

# game/script.rpy:46753
translate chinese map128_0ee9ad95:

    # "He blushes and shuffles in place, embarrassed.{w}\nI'm not sure why he trusted me so easily, but I'm not complaining.{w}\nSometimes it's hard for someone in a position of power to have confidants."
    "他脸红了，尴尬地原地挪动着脚步。{w}\n我不确定他为什么这么轻易就信任了我，但我并不抱怨。{w}\n有时候，身居高位的人很难有可以倾诉的知己。"

# game/script.rpy:46778
translate chinese map128_f0a9c7c6:

    # voice "se/y01023.ogg"
    voice "se/y01023.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:46780
translate chinese map128_221fab71:

    # char_damek "About that suit of armor earlier...\nI think I scared everybody with my caution.\nBetween you and I — that was a bit of an exaggeration."
    char_damek "关于刚才那副铠甲……\n我觉得我的谨慎把大家都吓到了。\n你我之间说句实话——那有点夸张了。"

# game/script.rpy:46783
translate chinese map128_9b68288f:

    # voice "se/y01024.ogg"
    # char_damek "Like I said, those things are brittle, and weak.\nI just didn't want anybody to knock them over, you know?\nIf we kill one of them, what happens to the spirits inside...?"
    voice "se/y01024.ogg"
    char_damek "就像我说的，那些东西很脆弱，很不结实。\n我只是不想让任何人把它们撞倒，你懂吗？\n如果我们毁掉其中一个，里面的灵会怎么样……？"

# game/script.rpy:46798
translate chinese map128_dff0fafc:

    # "That was a good question, actually."
    "其实，那是个好问题。"

# game/script.rpy:46823
translate chinese map128_8363d0dd:

    # voice "se/y01025.ogg"
    voice "se/y01025.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:46825
translate chinese map128_0a49029c:

    # char_damek "I want to find a way to {i}free{/i} those spirits trapped inside.\nSomething tells me that killing them won't accomplish that.\nThis is the sole reason why I tell everybody to leave them alone."
    char_damek "我想找到办法{i}解放{/i}那些被困在里面的灵。\n直觉告诉我，毁掉它们做不到这一点。\n这就是我让大家别去碰它们的唯一原因。"

# game/script.rpy:46828
translate chinese map128_6aed1cbc:

    # voice "se/y01026.ogg"
    # char_damek "They're harmless. They mind their own business.\nIt's my belief that we should give them the same courtesy.\nThat is, at least, until we find a way to give them all freedom."
    voice "se/y01026.ogg"
    char_damek "它们没有恶意，只顾自己的事。\n我认为我们也该以同样的礼数对待它们。\n至少，在我们找到让它们全部获得自由的办法之前是这样。"

# game/script.rpy:46842
translate chinese map128_dbcc2ccf:

    # voice "se/y01027.ogg"
    voice "se/y01027.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:46844
translate chinese map128_060b1e36:

    # char_damek "Though they don't serve The Triumvirate, they're still trapped.\nNobody should be forced into a position like that. They're just like us.\nSpirits of family, and friends. Spirits of innocent occupation victims."
    char_damek "虽然它们不为三人执政团效力，但它们依然被困着。\n没有人该被逼到那种境地。它们和我们一样。\n是家人、朋友的灵。是无辜占领受害者的灵。"

# game/script.rpy:46858
translate chinese map128_d7544e84:

    # "He lets out a loud sigh, like the ability to vent is a godsend.{w}\nI can tell that this is something he's been keeping inside for a while."
    "他长长地叹了口气，仿佛能宣泄出来是天赐的恩惠。{w}\n我看得出来，这件事他已经憋在心里很久了。"

# game/script.rpy:46883
translate chinese map128_f9c41b87:

    # voice "se/y01028.ogg"
    voice "se/y01028.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:46885
translate chinese map128_fcd3f72e:

    # char_damek "Sorry for rambling on.\nI think I'm just trying to defend myself.\nLast week, I accidentally bumped into one..."
    char_damek "抱歉，我啰嗦了。\n我想我只是在为自己辩解。\n上周，我不小心撞到了一个……"

# game/script.rpy:46898
translate chinese map128_befd2abf:

    # voice "se/y01029.ogg"
    voice "se/y01029.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:46900
translate chinese map128_5e4ff4dd:

    # char_damek "It crumbled, and fell to the ground.\nI felt absolutely awful. It's like I {i}killed{/i} them.\nWho knows how many spirits were inside that {i}one{/i} suit."
    char_damek "它碎裂开来，倒在了地上。\n我心里难受极了。就像是我{i}杀了{/i}它们一样。\n谁知道那{i}一副{/i}铠甲里有多少灵呢。"

# game/script.rpy:46905
translate chinese map128_43c964b3:

    # voice "se/y01030.ogg"
    voice "se/y01030.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:46907
translate chinese map128_37f18f51:

    # char_damek "I mean, in this war — I have to draw blood. I have to kill.\nBut normally, I reserve that punishment for our enemies.\nWe're talking about the spirits of long lost family here, [firstname]."
    char_damek "我是说，在这场战争里——我不得不见血，不得不杀人。\n但通常，我把那种惩罚留给我们的敌人。\n可这里说的是逝去已久的家人的灵啊，[firstname]。"

# game/script.rpy:46912
translate chinese map128_3830b293:

    # voice "se/y01031.ogg"
    voice "se/y01031.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:46914
translate chinese map128_37f18f51_1:

    # char_damek "I mean, in this war — I have to draw blood. I have to kill.\nBut normally, I reserve that punishment for our enemies.\nWe're talking about the spirits of long lost family here, [firstname]."
    char_damek "我是说，在这场战争里——我不得不见血，不得不杀人。\n但通常，我把那种惩罚留给我们的敌人。\n可这里说的是逝去已久的家人的灵啊，[firstname]。"

# game/script.rpy:46927
translate chinese map128_7b11a28d:

    # voice "se/y01032.ogg"
    voice "se/y01032.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:46929
translate chinese map128_a5d3ec9e:

    # char_damek "I feel like I did something wrong.\nI almost feel like I'm a murderer, you know?\nIt's odd how blurred those lines can be in war."
    char_damek "我觉得自己做错了事。\n我几乎觉得自己像个杀人犯，你知道吗？\n在战争中，这些界限竟会如此模糊，真是奇怪。"

# game/script.rpy:46942
translate chinese map128_d522bed3:

    # voice "se/y01033.ogg"
    voice "se/y01033.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:46945
translate chinese map128_db472b33:

    # char_damek "Kill the enemy leader? You're nothing short of a hero.\nBut kill a citizen going about their business? You're a monster.\nMaybe at the end of the day, that's what we are. Monsters." nointeract
    char_damek "杀了敌方首领？你就是个英雄。\n但杀了一个过着自己日子的平民？你就是个怪物。\n也许说到底，我们就是这样。怪物。" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:46959
translate chinese map128_d19dde11:

    # voice "se/y01034.ogg"
    # char_damek "Maybe once this is all over, I'll believe that.\nI guess there's one big difference between us and them.\nWhen {i}we{/i} rule the world, we'll {i}stop{/i} killing. That's not {i}us{/i}."
    voice "se/y01034.ogg"
    char_damek "也许等这一切结束后，我会相信这一点。\n我想我们和他们之间有一个很大的区别。\n当{i}我们{/i}统治世界时，我们会{i}停止{/i}杀戮。那不是{i}我们{/i}。"

# game/script.rpy:46974
translate chinese map128_b75194cb:

    # voice "se/y01035.ogg"
    # char_damek "I wish that's what I felt like. \nThere's just so much pressure.\nI guess you know what it's like."
    voice "se/y01035.ogg"
    char_damek "我希望我也能这么觉得。 \n压力实在太大了。\n我想你知道那是什么滋味。"

# game/script.rpy:46989
translate chinese map128_000be4ee:

    # voice "se/y01036.ogg"
    # char_damek "I guess you're right.\nAfter this is over, things will be better.\nWe aren't like The Triumvirate. We don't {i}want{/i} to kill."
    voice "se/y01036.ogg"
    char_damek "我想你说得对。\n等这一切结束后，情况会好起来的。\n我们不像三人执政团。我们并不{i}想{/i}杀人。"

# game/script.rpy:47006
translate chinese map128_5212917a:

    # "We continue walking down the tunnels, while he vents.{w}\nI can understand where he's coming from, and I can relate.{w}\nIt was all about the greater good, regardless of what we did."
    "他倾诉着，我们继续沿着隧道前行。{w}\n我能理解他的想法，也能感同身受。{w}\n无论我们做了什么，一切都是为了大局。"

# game/script.rpy:47031
translate chinese map128_e4c45d97:

    # voice "se/y01037.ogg"
    voice "se/y01037.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:47033
translate chinese map128_4cafea37:

    # char_damek "Everybody expects me to lead us to victory.\nThey call me a master strategist, and shower me with praise.\nBut at the end of the day, I'm just following in {i}his{/i} footsteps."
    char_damek "所有人都指望我带领大家走向胜利。\n他们称我为战略大师，对我赞不绝口。\n但说到底，我只是在追随{i}他{/i}的脚步。"

# game/script.rpy:47036
translate chinese map128_f92bf3e3:

    # voice "se/y01038.ogg"
    # char_damek "Salus was the master strategist. I just worked under him.\nThey say I fill his shoes quite well, but I don't think that's true.\nI think they need something to believe in. They need hope."
    voice "se/y01038.ogg"
    char_damek "萨鲁斯才是真正的战略大师。我只是在他手下做事。\n他们说我很好地接替了他，但我不这么认为。\n我觉得他们需要一个可以信仰的东西。他们需要希望。"

# game/script.rpy:47051
translate chinese map128_d85cfd28:

    # voice "se/y01039.ogg"
    voice "se/y01039.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:47053
translate chinese map128_7f243e77:

    # char_damek "They pushed that need for hope onto me, and I {i}became{/i} that hope.\nHonestly, I think I'm more of a symbol than anything else.\nI'm sure you know what I mean. You're The Seer."
    char_damek "他们把对希望的渴求强加到我身上，而我{i}成为{/i}了那份希望。\n说实话，我觉得自己更像一个象征，而不是别的什么。\n我敢肯定你明白我的意思。你是先知。"

# game/script.rpy:47058
translate chinese map128_5b1b0fd1:

    # voice "se/y01040.ogg"
    voice "se/y01040.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:47060
translate chinese map128_42bdb1c1:

    # char_damek "They pushed that need for hope onto me, and I {i}became{/i} that hope.\nHonestly, I think I'm more of a symbol than anything else.\nI'm sure you know what I mean. You're The Seeress."
    char_damek "他们把对希望的渴求强加到我身上，而我{i}成为{/i}了那份希望。\n说实话，我觉得自己更像一个象征，而不是别的什么。\n我敢肯定你明白我的意思。你是先知。"

# game/script.rpy:47073
translate chinese map128_fa65d96e:

    # voice "se/y01041.ogg"
    voice "se/y01041.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:47075
translate chinese map128_3fd6b84e:

    # char_damek "You had this role thrust upon you whether you wanted it or not.\nIt's kind of the same for me. I'm The General. I had no say in the matter.\nThis pressure, and all those expectations? I'm afraid I might break."
    char_damek "无论你愿不愿意，这个角色都被强加到了你身上。\n对我来说也差不多。我是将军。这事由不得我做主。\n这份压力，还有那些期望？我怕我会撑不住。"

# game/script.rpy:47088
translate chinese map128_369daf52:

    # voice "se/y01042.ogg"
    voice "se/y01042.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:47091
translate chinese map128_823281e7:

    # char_damek "Do you have any advice?" nointeract
    char_damek "你有什么建议吗？" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:47107
translate chinese map128_1712120e:

    # voice "se/y01043.ogg"
    # char_damek "Together...? Like a second-in-command?\nI actually like the sound of that. We'd be a team.\nSomething to think about, at least. Thank you."
    voice "se/y01043.ogg"
    char_damek "一起……？就像副手那样？\n我其实挺喜欢这个说法。我们会成为一支队伍。\n至少，值得考虑。谢谢你。"

# game/script.rpy:47122
translate chinese map128_e85830c2:

    # voice "se/y01044.ogg"
    # char_damek "You don't think that would make them doubt...?\nTheir “mighty” leader, full of stress and worry?\nI only told you because I thought you could relate."
    voice "se/y01044.ogg"
    char_damek "你不觉得那会让他们心生怀疑吗……？\n他们“伟大”的领袖，却满是压力和忧虑？\n我告诉你只是因为我觉得你能感同身受。"

# game/script.rpy:47126
translate chinese map128_24052ad3:

    # voice "se/y01045.ogg"
    # char_damek "But I guess honesty {i}is{/i} the best solution.\nMaybe I should lower their expectations a bit, yeah?\nI'm just {i}Damek{/i}. I'm not some invincible symbol of hope."
    voice "se/y01045.ogg"
    char_damek "但我想诚实{i}确实{/i}是最好的办法。\n也许我该稍微降低一下他们的期望，对吧？\n我只是{i}达梅克{/i}。我不是什么无敌的希望象征。"

# game/script.rpy:47141
translate chinese map128_6a53038b:

    # voice "se/y01046.ogg"
    # char_damek "Brutally honest, I see.\nI wish I had that kind of courage.\nMore than anything, I want to please everyone."
    voice "se/y01046.ogg"
    char_damek "看得出来，你真是直率得毫不留情。\n我希望我也有那样的勇气。\n比起任何事，我都想取悦所有人。"

# game/script.rpy:47145
translate chinese map128_b4f25ee9:

    # voice "se/y01047.ogg"
    # char_damek "But in a position of power, that's impossible.\nI might have to start making tough calls in the future.\nWell, more tough than I've been doing so far, I mean."
    voice "se/y01047.ogg"
    char_damek "但身处高位，那是不可能的。\n将来我可能得开始做一些艰难的决定。\n嗯，我是说，比我到目前为止做的还要艰难。"

# game/script.rpy:47160
translate chinese map128_cc37d6c9:

    # voice "se/y01048.ogg"
    # char_damek "Well, we could all die.\nWe need to have {i}some{/i} sort of plan.\nI can't gamble with the lives of our forces."
    voice "se/y01048.ogg"
    char_damek "嗯，我们可能会全军覆没。\n我们必须有{i}某种{/i}计划。\n我不能拿我们部队的性命去赌。"

# game/script.rpy:47175
translate chinese map128_d9923418:

    # voice "se/y01049.ogg"
    # char_damek "A more common struggle than I realize, I guess.\nMaybe I should be honest and open with the rebels.\nWho knows — maybe a bunch of them could relate to me."
    voice "se/y01049.ogg"
    char_damek "我想，这种挣扎比我意识到的更普遍。\n也许我该对反抗军坦诚相待。\n谁知道呢——也许他们中有不少人能理解我。"

# game/script.rpy:47179
translate chinese map128_4f22ce3a:

    # voice "se/y01050.ogg"
    # char_damek "After all, we're in this thing together.\nThe fate of the world isn't just on {i}my{/i} shoulders.\nEvery one of our rebels has a massive burden upon them."
    voice "se/y01050.ogg"
    char_damek "毕竟，我们是一条船上的。\n世界的命运不只压在{i}我{/i}一个人肩上。\n我们每一个反抗军成员都背负着沉重的担子。"

# game/script.rpy:47194
translate chinese map128_84b412df:

    # voice "se/y01051.ogg"
    voice "se/y01051.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:47196
translate chinese map128_db669a3f:

    # char_damek "I guess there's not much more we can do, huh?\nPerhaps we'll have some more time to talk later on.\nMy doors are always open to you, [firstname]. I promise."
    char_damek "我想我们也没什么别的能做了，对吧？\n也许以后我们还有时间再聊。\n我的门永远为你敞开，[firstname]。我保证。"

# game/script.rpy:47201
translate chinese map128_5315b9ae:

    # voice "se/y01052.ogg"
    voice "se/y01052.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:47203
