    # "Damek turns to face me, with just the two of us in the lobby.{w}\nA few rebels run from room to room, going about their business.{w}\nI can tell from the way that they move that they don't want to disturb us."
    "达梅克转过身面对我，大厅里只剩我们两人。{w}\n几个反抗军成员在各个房间之间穿梭，忙着自己的事。{w}\n从他们走动的样子我能看出，他们不想打扰我们。"

