    # voice "se/z01113.ogg"
    # char_damek "So, let's start with those...\nAfter that, we can go to your personal quarters.\nThat's right — all of you are getting your own rooms."
    voice "se/z01113.ogg"
    char_damek "那么，我们就从这些开始吧……\n之后，我们可以去你们的私人住处。\n没错——你们每个人都会有自己的房间。"

# game/script.rpy:47725
translate chinese map116_1c9c49b4:

    # "My own room? That was pretty impressive.{w}\nThis place must go deeper than I thought.{w}\nI nod and smile, as I start to follow Damek."
    "我自己的房间？这真让人印象深刻。{w}\n这地方一定比我想象的还要深。{w}\n我点点头，微笑着，开始跟着达梅克走。"

# game/script.rpy:47727
translate chinese map116_eaebd964:

    # "We were finally here. I felt like I could relax, now.{w}\nThis entire journey has just been one thing after another.{w}\nBut now I can rest, and have privacy? I'll never take it for granted again."
    "我们终于到了。我觉得现在可以放松了。{w}\n这一整段旅程就是一件接一件的事。{w}\n但现在我能休息，还能有隐私？我再也不会把这当作理所当然了。"

# game/script.rpy:47745
translate chinese map116_f7397079:

    # "The Library and The Barracks are accessed through this area.{w}\nUse the map icons by the two doors to navigate to these optional areas.{w}\nTo move to your personal quarters, you must return to the region map."
    "图书馆和兵营都要经过这个区域才能进入。{w}\n使用两扇门旁的地图图标前往这些可选区域。{w}\n要前往你的私人住处，你必须返回区域地图。"

# game/script.rpy:48142
translate chinese click_map122_6_EV006_d4167c8a:

    # "There's light piercing through the ceiling.{w}\nThis slight exposure to the surface makes it much less stuffy.{w}\nIt's easier to breathe here, and everybody seems happy about that."
    "有光线穿透天花板照射进来。{w}\n与地面的这点连通让这里没那么闷了。{w}\n在这里呼吸更顺畅，大家似乎都为此感到高兴。"

# game/script.rpy:48144
translate chinese click_map122_6_EV006_9aa8be6c:

    # "However, the light illuminates the dust lining almost everything.{w}\nWe can even see the dust permeating the air. That's kind of gross.{w}\nWith every breath I take, I'm worried I might breathe some in."
    "然而，光线照亮了几乎覆盖在一切表面的灰尘。{w}\n我们甚至能看到空气中弥漫的灰尘。有点恶心。{w}\n每吸一口气，我都担心会吸进一些灰尘。"

# game/script.rpy:48181
translate chinese click_map122_7_EV007_d71c81d5:

    # "There's a rack full of swords, almost in pristine condition.{w}\nDamek was right. The Honor Guard really left them everything.{w}\nThis place is a fortress, and their army is much larger than I thought."
    "有一个挂满剑的架子，几乎完好如新。{w}\n达梅克说得对。荣誉卫队真的把一切都留给了他们。{w}\n这地方是座堡垒，他们的军队也比我以为的庞大得多。"

# game/script.rpy:48218
translate chinese click_map122_8_EV008_6dbd76d5:

    # "These doors are blocked by countless crates and supplies.{w}\nI guess there's nothing of purpose behind those doors.{w}\nIt seems that only the library and barracks are important."
    "这些门被无数板条箱和补给堵住了。{w}\n我猜那些门后面没有什么要紧的东西。{w}\n看来只有图书馆和兵营比较重要。"

# game/script.rpy:48220
translate chinese click_map122_8_EV008_caaf4ed1:

    # "However, Damek also mentioned the crew quarters and war table.{w}\nOne of the doors in this massive room must lead deeper inside.{w}\nI almost have a hard time believing those suits of armor made this."
    "不过，达梅克还提到了船员舱和作战桌。{w}\n这个巨大房间里的某扇门一定通向更深处。{w}\n我几乎难以相信那些铠甲造出了这一切。"

# game/script.rpy:48286
translate chinese click_map122_115_EV115_e7b93957:

    # "Cannot access content at this time.\nIf there is an X, you must complete preceding Heart-to-Hearts.\nIf there is a checkmark, you must move on to the next Heart-to-Heart."
    "目前无法访问此内容。\n若显示叉号，你必须先完成前置的心灵对话。\n若显示对勾，你必须前往下一个心灵对话。"

# game/script.rpy:48313
