# game/script.rpy:58766
translate chinese map232_7809c42d:

    # "I walk through the main atrium of the Rebel HQ.{w}\nIt's not fully clean. Blood still stains the floor. Armor is scattered about.{w}\nI'm not sure what they planned to do with the pieces of The Honor Guard."
    "我穿过反抗军总部的主中庭。{w}\n这里没有完全清理干净。地板上还留有血迹。盔甲散落各处。{w}\n我不确定他们打算怎么处理荣誉卫队的残骸。"

# game/script.rpy:58768
translate chinese map232_54e12ab6:

    # "Sovy is looking around, and he appears sad.{w}\nI don't blame him. This is where he launched his attack.{w}\nHim and his men killed almost all of us. We almost lost that day."
    "索维环顾四周，看起来很悲伤。{w}\n我不怪他。这里就是他发动进攻的地方。{w}\n他和他的手下几乎杀光了我们。那一天我们差点就输了。"

