    # char_sovy "I already had my doubt when we launched this attack.\nIf only we had our fight a little bit earlier. I could've prevented this.\nTouching that blade at the same time as you — that was the catalyst."
    char_sovy "我们发动这次进攻时，我就已经有疑虑了。\n要是我们的决斗再早一点就好了。我本可以阻止这一切。\n和你同时碰到那把剑——那就是导火索。"

# game/script.rpy:58798
translate chinese map232_f9ecb6d2:

    # voice "se/y01908.ogg"
    # char_sovy "I don't think you knew the truth of The Monarchy at that point.\nIt's almost as if they were calling out to me. Trying to change my stance.\nWell, I suppose it worked — I stand here, ready to repay you for my sins."
    voice "se/y01908.ogg"
    char_sovy "我想那时你还不知道王室的真相。\n几乎就像是他们在向我呼唤。试图改变我的立场。\n好吧，我想它奏效了——我站在这里，准备为我的罪孽向你赎罪。"

# game/script.rpy:58813
translate chinese map232_440c262c:

    # "His words seem so genuine, it's almost hard to think he could be lying.{w}\nAt first, he seemed unsure about whether or not he'd rejoin The Triumvirate.{w}\nWhat started out as a revenge quest against Halin has certainly grown quickly."
    "他的话听起来如此真诚，几乎让人无法相信他会撒谎。{w}\n起初，他似乎还不确定是否要重新加入三人执政团。{w}\n一场最初针对哈林的复仇之旅，无疑已经迅速壮大了。"

# game/script.rpy:58838
translate chinese map232_05095a1b:

    # voice "se/y01909.ogg"
    # char_sovy "But we mustn't waste time on talk like that.\nFocusing on the past stops you from seeing the future.\n{i}That's{/i} what is truly important. Your assault on Balteus."
    voice "se/y01909.ogg"
    char_sovy "但我们不能在那种空谈上浪费时间。\n沉溺于过去会让你看不见未来。\n{i}那{/i}才是真正重要的。你对巴尔泰乌斯的进攻。"

# game/script.rpy:58853
translate chinese map232_6ad0b911:

    # "I agree. Sovy doesn't seem like one to waste time with pleasantries."
    "我同意。索维不像是会浪费时间说客套话的人。"

# game/script.rpy:58878
translate chinese map232_5e7b9ad9:

    # voice "se/y01910.ogg"
    # char_sovy "So I guess I'll be teaching you {i}two{/i} lessons this time.\nFirst of all — focus on the war. Don't waste time with being friendly.\nI've seen you and your comrades. That bond is dangerous during battle."
    voice "se/y01910.ogg"
    char_sovy "所以这次我想我要教你{i}两{/i}课。\n首先——专注于战争。别浪费时间讲交情。\n我见过你和你的同伴。那种羁绊在战斗中很危险。"

# game/script.rpy:58882
translate chinese map232_5748a7af:

    # voice "se/y01911.ogg"
    # char_sovy "We can't have you taking a sword for a loved one.\nYou are this world's future, [firstname]. You need to be smart.\nFeelings...? They cloud judgment. I know this all too well, and so should you."
    voice "se/y01911.ogg"
    char_sovy "我们不能让你为了所爱之人去挨剑。\n你是这个世界的未来，[firstname]。你得聪明点。\n感情……？它们会蒙蔽判断力。这一点我太清楚了，你也该清楚。"

# game/script.rpy:58896
translate chinese map232_4d0bd2ef:

    # voice "se/y01912.ogg"
    # char_sovy "And in your situation, it is best to rely on things that serve you without hesitation.\nA friend with emotional stakes may not follow every order. That is a major flaw.\nThat blade, however — and the beings it can create — will cater to your desire."
    voice "se/y01912.ogg"
    char_sovy "而在你的处境下，最好依靠那些会毫不犹豫为你效力的东西。\n一个牵涉情感的友人未必会服从每一个命令。这是个大缺陷。\n而那把剑——以及它能创造出的存在——则会迎合你的意愿。"

# game/script.rpy:58911
translate chinese map232_4b2f7eab:

    # "He points to the suits of armor scattered around the floor.{w}\nThat means the next lesson must be related to The Honor Guard.{w}\nThe Triumvirate could create a near-infinite amount. Could I do that, too?"
    "他指向散落一地的盔甲。{w}\n这意味着下一课一定和荣誉卫队有关。{w}\n三人执政团能创造出近乎无限的数量。我也能做到吗？"

# game/script.rpy:58936
translate chinese map232_d7576610:

    # voice "se/y01913.ogg"
    # char_sovy "Normally the blade requires a sacrifice, and the energy within, to power that armor.\nBut there is so much energy within you — I wonder if you could do it by yourself.\nImagine an entire force of Honor Guard soldiers serving you. Such power."
    voice "se/y01913.ogg"
    char_sovy "通常这把剑需要祭品，以及其中的能量，才能驱动那些盔甲。\n但你体内有如此充沛的能量——我在想你是否能独自做到。\n想象一整支为你效力的荣誉卫队。何等强大的力量。"

# game/script.rpy:58940
translate chinese map232_a3bf2a55:

    # voice "se/y01914.ogg"
    # char_sovy "The Triumvirate is right to want that blade back. In your hands, it is a threat.\nAnd it makes sense why they'd want you dead, too. You are {i}The Monarchy{/i}.\nTake out that blade for me, [firstname]. Let's see if you can do what I think you can."
    voice "se/y01914.ogg"
    char_sovy "三人执政团想夺回那把剑是理所当然的。在你手里，它就是个威胁。\n他们想置你于死地也合情合理。你就是{i}王室{/i}。\n把剑拿出来给我看看，[firstname]。看看你能不能做到我认为你能做到的事。"

# game/script.rpy:58955
translate chinese map232_d6e9e77c:

    # "I do as instructed, and take out the blade."
    "我照吩咐做了，取出那把剑。"

# game/script.rpy:58980
translate chinese map232_f5b1bbd7:

    # voice "se/y01915.ogg"
    # char_sovy "It responds to your will, your desire.\nThink of it as an extension of your body.\nA new muscle — ready to be trained."
    voice "se/y01915.ogg"
    char_sovy "它回应你的意志，你的渴望。\n把它当作你身体的延伸。\n一块新的肌肉——等待被锻炼。"

# game/script.rpy:58984
translate chinese map232_26659c8c:

    # voice "se/y01916.ogg"
    # char_sovy "Hold it out, toward those scattered pieces of armor.\nSee if your resolve is strong enough to give them life.\nThat's all it takes. A spark in your mind, to ignite a flame."
    voice "se/y01916.ogg"
    char_sovy "把它朝那些散落的盔甲举起来。\n看看你的决心是否强到足以赋予它们生命。\n要的就是这个。你心中的一点火花，去点燃一团烈焰。"

# game/script.rpy:58999
translate chinese map232_449d1a35:

    # "I hold out the blade, pointing it toward the suits of armor.{w}\nI keep my eyes focused on them, trying to control them.{w}\nThe pieces start to move, rocking back and forth."
    "我举起剑，指向那些盔甲。{w}\n我目不转睛地盯着它们，试图控制它们。{w}\n那些残片开始动了起来，前后摇晃。"

# game/script.rpy:59001
translate chinese map232_1a47b8aa:

    # "I focus with all of my strength, and they start to shake more.{w}\nBut as Sovy mentioned, it's like a new muscle. I can't flex it for long.{w}\nThe pieces stop shaking, and remain still, just as soon as they began to move."
    "我倾尽全力集中精神，它们抖得更厉害了。{w}\n但正如索维所说，这就像一块新肌肉。我坚持不了多久。{w}\n那些残片刚一活动起来，就停止颤抖，归于静止。"

# game/script.rpy:59026
translate chinese map232_bd14a80e:

    # voice "se/y01917.ogg"
    # char_sovy "Disappointing."
    voice "se/y01917.ogg"
    char_sovy "令人失望。"

# game/script.rpy:59041
translate chinese map232_4d92ab94:

    # "I scoff at him, and assume a neutral stance."
    "我朝他哼了一声，摆出中立的姿态。"

# game/script.rpy:59066
translate chinese map232_56f72f35:

    # voice "se/y01918.ogg"
    # char_sovy "It seems as if you can only use the blade while under duress.\nI suppose that's not too bad. We'll be in Balteus soon enough, after all.\nAt least now you know what to do. Follow my directions, and you'll be fine."
    voice "se/y01918.ogg"
    char_sovy "看来你只有在身处险境时才能使用那把剑。\n我想这也不算太糟。毕竟我们很快就到巴尔泰乌斯了。\n至少现在你知道该怎么做了。照我的指示来，你会没事的。"

# game/script.rpy:59081
translate chinese map232_d93664cd:

    # "He starts to walk away, but quickly turns around."
    "他正要走开，却很快又转过身来。"

# game/script.rpy:59106
translate chinese map232_956c177d:

    # voice "se/y01919.ogg"
    # char_sovy "There won't be enough time for you to master your fears.\nYou might have to embrace these dangerous situations in order to prevail.\nBut that blade is so powerful, I'd do whatever it takes to harness that power."
    voice "se/y01919.ogg"
    char_sovy "你没有足够的时间去克服恐惧。\n为了取胜，你可能不得不去拥抱这些危险的处境。\n但那把剑如此强大，为了驾驭那份力量，我会不惜一切代价。"

# game/script.rpy:59120
translate chinese map232_fc83c1e4:

    # voice "se/y01920.ogg"
    # char_sovy "I'll see you around, [firstname].\nFeel free to keep practicing if you feel the need.\nThis is going better than I expected, to say the least."
    voice "se/y01920.ogg"
    char_sovy "回头见，[firstname]。\n如果你觉得有必要，随时可以继续练习。\n至少可以说，这比我预期的顺利。"

# game/script.rpy:59142
translate chinese map232_d00beaff:

    # "This time, he dismisses himself for real."
    "这一次，他是真的告辞了。"

# game/script.rpy:59144
translate chinese map232_9d895fc4:

    # "Embrace the danger to become more powerful...?{w}\nThat seemed like backwards logic, but a lot of things were backwards lately.{w}\nIf the blade responded to my fear, and danger — then I guess I knew what to do."
    "拥抱危险来变得更强……？{w}\n这听起来像是颠倒的逻辑，但最近很多事都是颠倒的。{w}\n如果那把剑回应我的恐惧和危险——那我想我知道该怎么做了。"

# game/script.rpy:59146
translate chinese map232_d903ff0f:

    # "Because Sovy was right. I could never retrain myself in time for our final attack.{w}\nWhat an odd situation to be in. But I guess in my position, I couldn't eschew risk.{w}\nHis implication was that — if I were in danger — the suits of armor would've risen up."
    "因为索维说得对。我根本来不及在最后的大决战前重新训练自己。{w}\n这处境真奇怪。但我想，以我的位置，我没法回避风险。{w}\n他言下之意是——如果我身处危险——那些盔甲就会活过来。"

# game/script.rpy:59148
translate chinese map232_8b47ddb0:

    # "When the time comes — I can only hope that his prediction is correct.{w}\nI wonder what other lessons there are to learn. What else could the blade do?{w}\nPerhaps I'll learn more from Sovy the next time we meet. Wherever that ended up being."
    "到时候——我只能希望他的预测是对的。{w}\n我不知道还有什么别的课要学。那把剑还能做什么？{w}\n也许下次见到索维时，我能学到更多。不管那会在哪里。"

# game/script.rpy:59150
translate chinese map232_59f8733c:

    # "His advice keeps playing on repeat in my mind.{w}\nEmotional stakes could be a hindrance in battle...?{w}\nWould I truly let something like that endanger our cause?"
    "他的建议在我脑中反复回响。{w}\n情感的牵绊在战斗中会成为阻碍……？{w}\n我真会让那样的事危及我们的事业吗？"

# game/script.rpy:59152
translate chinese map232_4e6dafbf:

    # "Would I sacrifice myself to save a comrade...?{w}\nOr in this case — I guess it works the other way around.{w}\nI close my eyes, and pray that we never have to find out."
    "我会牺牲自己去救同伴吗……？{w}\n又或者，在这种情况下——我想反过来也成立。{w}\n我闭上眼，祈祷我们永远不必知道答案。"

# game/script.rpy:59182
translate chinese map119_07905ff7:

    # "We enter my personal quarters after a small trek through the HQ.{w}\nIt's larger than I thought it would be. The bed as well, is quite big.{w}\nThere isn't much of a tour to be had, so Damek sighs in relief."
    "在总部里走了一小段路后，我们走进了我的私人房间。{w}\n它比我预想的要大。床也相当大。{w}\n没什么可参观的，达梅克于是松了口气。"

# game/script.rpy:59207
translate chinese map119_864732f6:

    # voice "se/z01120.ogg"
    voice "se/z01120.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:59209
translate chinese map119_2d2d6b35:

    # char_damek "Well, that about ends the tour.\nAfter this, it's just the crew quarters and the war table.\nI imagine this is where you'll spend most of your spare time."
    char_damek "好了，参观差不多到此结束了。\n之后只剩下船员舱和作战桌。\n我想你会在这里度过大部分闲暇时光。"

# game/script.rpy:59223
translate chinese map119_0ee12c1c:

    # "He walks to the back of the room, and inspects the shelf on the wall.{w}\nMoving books and papers aside, he seems a bit sad."
    "他走到房间后部，查看墙上的架子。{w}\n他把书和纸张拨到一边，显得有点伤感。"

# game/script.rpy:59248
translate chinese map119_ca36116a:

    # voice "se/z01121.ogg"
    voice "se/z01121.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:59250
translate chinese map119_52e5ac14:

    # char_damek "This room belonged to Shane. He was dear to me.\nI sent him on a dangerous mission to The Triumvirate's castle.\nHe's been gone for a while, but I know he'll be back. I can feel it."
    char_damek "这个房间原本属于肖恩。他对我很重要。\n我派他去三人执政团的城堡执行一项危险任务。\n他已经离开有一阵子了，但我知道他会回来的。我能感觉到。"

# game/script.rpy:59263
translate chinese map119_433c98c4:

    # voice "se/z01122.ogg"
    voice "se/z01122.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:59265
translate chinese map119_878bd5ea:

    # char_damek "So try not to get {i}too{/i} comfortable, alright?\nThis is just where you'll stay in the meantime.\nI wouldn't want Shane to think I forgot about him."
    char_damek "所以别在这里住得{i}太{/i}自在，好吗？\n这只是你暂时的住处。\n我不想让肖恩以为我忘了他。"

# game/script.rpy:59279
translate chinese map119_f1ea982b:

    # "I nod. That makes perfect sense.{w}\nBut I wonder why he was inspecting the shelf.{w}\nHe stopped empty-handed, so he didn't find what he wanted."
    "我点点头。这完全说得通。{w}\n但我不明白他为什么要查看那个架子。{w}\n他空手而止，说明没找到想要的东西。"

# game/script.rpy:59304
translate chinese map119_01360dae:

    # voice "se/z01123.ogg"
    voice "se/z01123.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:59307
translate chinese map119_5a27e1ea:

    # char_damek "You deserve a lot of rest, at least for today.\nJust follow me for a little bit longer. We're almost done.\nI'll show you where your comrades are staying." nointeract
    char_damek "你该好好休息，至少今天是这样。\n再跟我走一小会儿。我们快结束了。\n我带你去看看你的同伴们住哪儿。" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:59322
translate chinese map119_2caff474:

    # voice "se/z01124.ogg"
    # char_damek "Thanks for being so accommodating. \nI'll meet you outside, [firstname]."
    voice "se/z01124.ogg"
    char_damek "谢谢你这么周到。\n我在外面等你，[firstname]。"

# game/script.rpy:59337
translate chinese map119_b1ea084a:

    # voice "se/z01125.ogg"
    # char_damek "Thanks for being so accommodating. \nI'll meet you outside, [firstname]."
    voice "se/z01125.ogg"
    char_damek "谢谢你这么周到。\n我在外面等你，[firstname]。"

# game/script.rpy:59353
translate chinese map119_8547b328:

    # voice "se/z01126.ogg"
    # char_damek "Oh, uh — we should actually get things moving.\nI'll meet you outside, [firstname]."
    voice "se/z01126.ogg"
    char_damek "哦，呃——我们其实该抓紧了。\n我在外面等你，[firstname]。"

# game/script.rpy:59368
translate chinese map119_3421e1c1:

    # voice "se/z01127.ogg"
    # char_damek "Oh, uh — we should actually get things moving.\nI'll meet you outside, [firstname]."
    voice "se/z01127.ogg"
    char_damek "哦，呃——我们其实该抓紧了。\n我在外面等你，[firstname]。"

# game/script.rpy:59384
translate chinese map119_47b64491:

    # voice "se/z01128.ogg"
    # char_damek "Trust me, that's coming soon enough!\nI'll meet you outside, [firstname]."
    voice "se/z01128.ogg"
    char_damek "相信我，那很快就到了！\n我在外面等你，[firstname]。"

# game/script.rpy:59390
translate chinese map119_dcc93857:

    # voice "se/z01129.ogg"
    # char_damek "Trust me, that's coming soon enough!\nI'll meet you outside, [firstname]."
    voice "se/z01129.ogg"
    char_damek "相信我，那很快就到了！\n我在外面等你，[firstname]。"

# game/script.rpy:59406
translate chinese map119_7f96945e:

    # voice "se/z01130.ogg"
    # char_damek "Wonderful. Thank you so much.\nI'll meet you outside, [firstname]."
    voice "se/z01130.ogg"
    char_damek "太好了。非常感谢。\n我在外面等你，[firstname]。"

# game/script.rpy:59412
translate chinese map119_ee634488:

    # voice "se/z01131.ogg"
    # char_damek "Wonderful. Thank you so much.\nI'll meet you outside, [firstname]."
    voice "se/z01131.ogg"
    char_damek "太好了。非常感谢。\n我在外面等你，[firstname]。"

# game/script.rpy:59434
translate chinese map119_83db4515:

    # "He walks back toward the door, and waits outside.{w}\nI guess it was time to finish this tour. Finally.{w}\nThe Crew Quarters was our next stop."
    "他走回门口，在外面等着。{w}\n我想是时候结束这次参观了。终于。{w}\n船员舱是我们的下一站。"

# game/script.rpy:59760
translate chinese click_map125_4_EV004_163bcdf5:

    # "There's a table lined with pretty much everything I'd need.{w}\nIt seems like this room was equipped with stuff for a long stay.{w}\nHowever, something told me I wouldn't get to make much use of it."
    "桌上摆满了我几乎需要的一切。{w}\n看来这个房间是为一住很久而配备的。{w}\n可是，我有种感觉，我用不上多少。"

# game/script.rpy:59762
translate chinese click_map125_4_EV004_913796eb:

    # "My training regiment would likely be intense.{w}\nEarly to rise, and late to sleep. I could tell."
    "我的训练计划大概会很严苛。{w}\n早起晚睡。我看得出来。"

# game/script.rpy:59799
translate chinese click_map125_5_EV005_3736c665:

    # "Why are there candles so close to the bed?{w}\nI can understand wanting to be warm, but fire hazard much?{w}\nMaybe I'd blow them out if things got too concerning."
    "为什么蜡烛离床这么近？{w}\n想暖和点我能理解，但这也太有火灾隐患了吧？{w}\n要是情况太让人担心，也许我会把它们吹灭。"

# game/script.rpy:59836
translate chinese click_map125_6_EV006_459c38a3:

    # "I inspect these boxes, and they're full of food.{w}\nThey definitely stocked me up for a long stay.{w}\nThankfully it was stuff that wouldn't go bad too fast."
    "我查看这些箱子，里面装满了食物。{w}\n他们绝对是为长住给我囤足了粮。{w}\n幸好都是些不容易很快变质的东西。"

# game/script.rpy:59838
translate chinese click_map125_6_EV006_02b87d26:

    # "I rummage through it, impressed at the selection.{w}\nWas this all really provided by The Honor Guard?{w}\nThey don't need to eat. Just what were they doing...?"
    "我翻找着，对这丰富的种类感到惊讶。{w}\n这些真的都是荣誉卫队提供的吗？{w}\n他们不需要进食。他们到底在做什么……？"

# game/script.rpy:59876
translate chinese click_map125_7_EV007_b72841c8:

    # "It's Shane's journal."
    "这是肖恩的日志。"

# game/script.rpy:59937
translate chinese click_map125_7_EV007_edcada0a:

    # "There's a bunch of scrolls and books ontop of this shelf.{w}\nThey must've belonged to the previous owner, Shane.{w}\nAs Damek mentioned, this used to be his quarters."
    "这个架子上放着一堆卷轴和书。{w}\n它们一定属于上一任主人，肖恩。{w}\n正如达梅克所说，这里曾是他的房间。"

# game/script.rpy:59939
translate chinese click_map125_7_EV007_f8575912:

    # "A bit odd to give them away if he's still alive, though.{w}\nAfter investigating a bit more, I find his journal.{w}\nThe last entry is regarding his “upcoming” mission."
    "不过，如果他还活着，把这些东西送人有点奇怪。{w}\n再翻查一番后，我找到了他的日志。{w}\n最后一则记录是关于他“即将到来”的任务。"

# game/script.rpy:59964
translate chinese click_map125_7_EV007_4911a55c:

    # voice "se/Book13.ogg"
    voice "se/Book13.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:59975
translate chinese click_map125_7_EV007_efc5590d:

    # voice "se/Advanced.ogg"
    voice "se/Advanced.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:59977
translate chinese click_map125_7_EV007_4a9c639e:

    # "So he was scared, but loyal to Damek.{w}\nGood thing Damek isn't the type to take advantage of that.{w}\nI'm sure Shane would carry out his goal just fine. Definitely."
    "所以他害怕，但对达梅克忠心耿耿。{w}\n幸好达梅克不是会利用这一点的人。{w}\n我相信肖恩会顺利完成他的目标。一定。"

# game/script.rpy:60065
translate chinese click_map125_87_EV087_e7b93957:

    # "Cannot access content at this time.\nIf there is an X, you must complete preceding Heart-to-Hearts.\nIf there is a checkmark, you must move on to the next Heart-to-Heart."
    "目前无法访问此内容。\n若显示叉号，你必须先完成前置的心灵对话。\n若显示对勾，你必须前往下一个心灵对话。"

# game/script.rpy:60090
translate chinese map236_82e54d29:

    # "I sat on my bed, thinking about the blade, and what I could do with it.{w}\nAs if on some sort of cue, I hear a knock on my door. Sovy enters.{w}\nHe seems much more relaxed than normal. Like he's comfortable."
    "我坐在床上，想着那把剑，以及我能用它做什么。{w}\n仿佛得到了某种暗示，我听到敲门声。索维走了进来。{w}\n他看起来比平时放松得多。像是很自在。"

# game/script.rpy:60115
translate chinese map236_3c802b3e:

    # voice "se/y01921.ogg"
    voice "se/y01921.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:60118
translate chinese map236_241a708a:

    # char_sovy "So, did you manage to get any more practice in?\nOr were you just going to improvise when we got to Balteus?\nBoth are good options, given the circumstances. I'm just curious." nointeract
    char_sovy "那么，你有没有再多练练？\n还是打算到了巴尔泰乌斯就临场发挥？\n就目前的情况看，两种都行。我只是好奇。" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:60133
translate chinese map236_911d4e0b:

    # voice "se/y01922.ogg"
    # char_sovy "That's good. The more the better, that's what I say.\nBut at the same time, you're limited. I trained my entire life.\nIf you only have a few days, don't expect anything substantial."
    voice "se/y01922.ogg"
    char_sovy "那很好。要我说，越多越好。\n但与此同时，你的时间是有限的。我可是练了一辈子。\n如果你只有几天，就别指望有什么实质性的成果。"

# game/script.rpy:60149
translate chinese map236_3e01d92b:

    # voice "se/y01923.ogg"
    # char_sovy "It's alright. It's not like it would matter too much, anyway.\nI've had lifetimes to train — you only got the blade a few days ago.\nDon't expect any substantial results. It's better to be more realistic."
    voice "se/y01923.ogg"
    char_sovy "没关系。反正也不会有太大影响。\n我有过好几辈子的时间来训练——你几天前才得到那把剑。\n别指望有什么实质性的成果。还是现实一点好。"

# game/script.rpy:60166
translate chinese map236_997e29af:

    # "He takes a few steps forward and sits beside me on the bed."
    "他向前走了几步，在床边坐下。"

# game/script.rpy:60191
translate chinese map236_bb5c432c:

    # voice "se/y01924.ogg"
    # char_sovy "Being down here has made my mind race almost nonstop. \nI mean — what I did to you and your family is unforgivable.\nYet here we are, trying to move past it. Letting me atone."
    voice "se/y01924.ogg"
    char_sovy "待在下面这里，让我的思绪几乎一刻不停地翻腾。\n我是说——我对你和你家人做的事不可饶恕。\n可我们却在这里，试着放下它。让我赎罪。"

# game/script.rpy:60205
translate chinese map236_f1f7afab:

    # voice "se/y01925.ogg"
    # char_sovy "The most important thing on my mind, is \"why\"...?\nWhy did you welcome me with open arms after what I did?\nI feel like anybody with common sense would've put me to the blade." nointeract
    voice "se/y01925.ogg"
    char_sovy "我心中最重要的问题，就是“为什么”……？\n在我做了那些事之后，你为什么还张开双臂欢迎我？\n我觉得任何有点常识的人都会把我处死。" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:60221
translate chinese map236_07a3b213:

    # voice "se/y01926.ogg"
    # char_sovy "I'm assuming you were the only one.\nThe look I got from your comrades was definitely condemning.\nBut then what makes you different? Why could {i}you{/i} tell...?"
    voice "se/y01926.ogg"
    char_sovy "我猜你是唯一一个这样的人。\n你的同伴们看我的眼神绝对是充满谴责的。\n可那你又有什么不同？为什么{i}你{/i}能看得出来……？"

# game/script.rpy:60237
translate chinese map236_cb4b8062:

    # voice "se/y01927.ogg"
    # char_sovy "Well I guess it worked. I mean, look where we are.\nIf Ulric can redeem himself, then surely I can as well.\nHe did far worse things than I. But look at him now."
    voice "se/y01927.ogg"
    char_sovy "好吧，我想它奏效了。我是说，看看我们现在。\n如果乌尔里克能自我救赎，那我当然也能。\n他做过的事比我恶劣得多。可看看他现在的样子。"

# game/script.rpy:60253
translate chinese map236_1747d108:

    # voice "se/y01928.ogg"
    # char_sovy "You could've fooled me, [firstname].\nI've seen nothing but a capable ruler in you.\nIt's an honor to serve. This world is in good hands."
    voice "se/y01928.ogg"
    char_sovy "我可真没看出来，[firstname]。\n我在你身上只看到一个有能力的统治者。\n能为你效力是我的荣幸。这个世界交到了可靠的人手里。"

# game/script.rpy:60269
translate chinese map236_02024bfc:

    # voice "se/y01929.ogg"
    # char_sovy "I assume that most people will find themselves lost at one point in their life.\nThe scary part is — that if it hasn't happened yet — it could come at any time.\nI was so foolish, thinking that anybody back in Balteus could give me direction."
    voice "se/y01929.ogg"
    char_sovy "我猜大多数人一生中都会有迷茫的时候。\n可怕的是——如果它还没发生——它随时都可能来临。\n我太愚蠢了，以为巴尔泰乌斯的任何人都能给我指引方向。"

# game/script.rpy:60285
translate chinese map236_416bd0c6:

    # voice "se/y01930.ogg"
    # char_sovy "Maybe. But mistakes are usually clear — like choosing the wrong side.\nThe fact that you have doubts? I would take that as a good sign, [firstname].\nWorry isn't always a bad thing. It can help guide you when you're lost."
    voice "se/y01930.ogg"
    char_sovy "也许吧。但错误通常都很明显——比如站错队。\n你会有疑虑？我倒觉得这是个好迹象，[firstname]。\n忧虑并不总是坏事。它能帮你在迷茫时找到方向。"

# game/script.rpy:60301
translate chinese map236_29dfca29:

    # voice "se/y01931.ogg"
    # char_sovy "It's crazy how far that instinct has taken you.\nI did the same, even though it meant insubordination.\nIt's like — I knew I was right — no matter what happened to me."
    voice "se/y01931.ogg"
    char_sovy "这种直觉带你走到了这一步，真不可思议。\n我也一样，哪怕那意味着抗命。\n就像——我知道我是对的——无论我会遭遇什么。"

# game/script.rpy:60318
translate chinese map236_979141ea:

    # "He sighs, and slumps down a little bit."
    "他叹了口气，微微垂下身子。"

# game/script.rpy:60343
translate chinese map236_9aaa146e:

    # voice "se/y01932.ogg"
    # char_sovy "Well, that's all I really wanted to talk about.\nIf you'll excuse me — I'll be on my way.\nGood luck with everything, [firstname]."
    voice "se/y01932.ogg"
    char_sovy "好了，我想谈的就是这些。\n请恕我失陪——我该走了。\n祝你一切顺利，[firstname]。"

# game/script.rpy:60363
translate chinese map236_509e16f2:

    # "He gets up and starts to walk away, but I stop him.{w}\nThis would be a good time to get him the gift I bought.{w}\nI grab the writing utensils, and hand them over to Sovy."
    "他起身要走，但我叫住了他。{w}\n现在正是把我买的礼物送给他的好时机。{w}\n我拿起书写用具，交给索维。"

# game/script.rpy:60388
translate chinese map236_82696182:

    # voice "se/y01933.ogg"
    # char_sovy "You got me a gift...?\nReally, you shouldn't have."
    voice "se/y01933.ogg"
    char_sovy "你给我买了礼物……？\n真的，你不用这么客气。"

# game/script.rpy:60403
translate chinese map236_fbc1e8a7:

    # "He inspects them, with a soft smile on his face."
    "他端详着它们，脸上带着温柔的笑容。"

# game/script.rpy:60430
translate chinese map236_444bf7a1:

    # voice "se/y01934.ogg"
    # char_sovy "I was looking at these in the Town Square.\nIt means a lot to me that you did this, [firstname].\nAnybody else would've just went on with their day."
    voice "se/y01934.ogg"
    char_sovy "我在城镇广场上就在看这些。\n你这么做对我意义重大，[firstname]。\n换作别人，只会自顾自地继续过日子。"

# game/script.rpy:60445
translate chinese map236_1d1967c7:

    # "Maybe. But I'm not just \"anybody else\"."
    "也许吧。但我可不是什么“别人”。"

# game/script.rpy:60470
translate chinese map236_5c6468fa:

    # voice "se/y01935.ogg"
    # char_sovy "I don't really know what to say.\nSo I guess I'll take that as a sign to stop talking.\nThank you for thinking of me as a friend. Truly."
    voice "se/y01935.ogg"
    char_sovy "我真不知道该说什么。\n所以我想，这大概是个该闭嘴的信号。\n谢谢你把我当朋友。真心感谢。"

# game/script.rpy:60484
translate chinese map236_9680a7bf:

    # voice "se/y01936.ogg"
    # char_sovy "That's more than I can say about everybody else I know.\nIn fact — I don't think I've ever gotten a gift before — from anybody.\nNot even my Father, who these pens reminded me of in the first place."
    voice "se/y01936.ogg"
    char_sovy "我认识的其他人都做不到这一点。\n事实上——我想我从前从没收到过礼物——从任何人那里。\n连我父亲都没有，而这些笔最先让我想起的正是他。"

# game/script.rpy:60499
translate chinese map236_0f807642:

    # "He scoffs, and looks down at them once more."
    "他嗤笑一声，又低头看了看它们。"

# game/script.rpy:60524
translate chinese map236_4003b91c:

    # voice "se/y01937.ogg"
    # char_sovy "But that's a story for another time.\nI'm here to help you, not bore you with sad tales.\nPerhaps we can talk more before we set sail."
    voice "se/y01937.ogg"
    char_sovy "但那故事改天再讲吧。\n我是来帮你的，不是拿悲伤的故事来烦你的。\n也许启航前我们能再聊聊。"

# game/script.rpy:60546
translate chinese map236_10e8153d:

    # "Without another word, he leaves my room for good.{w}\nI'm not sure if the choice of present was a good or bad thing, now.{w}\nIt seems to remind him of something he deemed a \"sad tale\"."
    "他没再多说一句，就此离开了我的房间。{w}\n现在我不确定选这份礼物到底是好是坏。{w}\n它似乎让他想起了他称之为“悲伤故事”的某件事。"

# game/script.rpy:60548
translate chinese map236_829c4a4d:

    # "Well, there's nothing I can do about it right now.{w}\nMaybe he'd tell me that tale the next time we spoke.{w}\nWith our final battle looming, I might not have much time."
    "算了，眼下我也无能为力。{w}\n也许下次交谈时他会把那故事讲给我听。{w}\n最后的大决战迫在眉睫，我可能没多少时间了。"

# game/script.rpy:60550
translate chinese map236_550bbabc:

    # "But there's one thing I can say for sure. Sovy is becoming a friend.{w}\nA second chance is a truly great thing, as long as the person is genuine.{w}\nI can tell that if I earned his loyalty, he'd be indispensable during our attack."
    "但有一件事我可以肯定。索维正在成为一个朋友。{w}\n只要那人是真诚的，第二次机会就是件了不起的事。{w}\n我看得出，如果我能赢得他的忠诚，他在我们的进攻中将不可或缺。"

# game/script.rpy:60572
translate chinese map236_d4328b2e:

    # "He gets up and walks away, a weight clearly on his shoulders.{w}\nI'm glad I could help him out by offering answers to his questions.{w}\nBut was it enough...? Hopefully he wouldn't turn on us in Balteus."
    "他起身走开，肩上显然压着沉重的负担。{w}\n我很高兴能通过回答他的问题帮到他。{w}\n但这样够吗……？希望他别在巴尔泰乌斯背叛我们。"

# game/script.rpy:60574
translate chinese map236_d4b6023d:

    # "Something tells me we're very close to earning his full loyalty, however.{w}\nWho once appeared to be a murderous villain, was now showing a different side.{w}\nI know that if we really did win him over — he'd be an indispensable asset in Balteus."
    "可我有种感觉，我们离赢得他全部的忠诚已经很近了。{w}\n曾经看似凶残恶棍的人，如今露出了不同的一面。{w}\n我知道如果我们真能把他争取过来——他在巴尔泰乌斯将是无价之宝。"

# game/script.rpy:60576
translate chinese map236_e21c3c9b:

    # "And if that went well, he could even become a trusted soldier.{w}\nPerhaps we'd be able to spend more time together before the final attack.{w}\nI felt like we were incredibly close to ensuring he remained on our side no matter what."
    "如果进展顺利，他甚至可能成为一名值得信赖的士兵。{w}\n也许在最后的大决战前，我们能多相处些时间。{w}\n我感觉我们已非常接近确保他无论如何都站在我们这边。"

# game/script.rpy:60582
translate chinese map236_08247332:

    # "Sovy's loyalty scene has been unlocked and awaits at the war table."
    "索维的忠诚剧情已解锁，在作战桌处等待。"

# game/script.rpy:60612
translate chinese map120_1205669f:

    # "After exiting my room, he takes me to a large hallway.{w}\nAt the end of it is a grand door, surely leading somewhere important.{w}\nLining the sides, are smaller doors. I assume they lead to more private rooms."
    "走出我的房间后，他带我来到一条宽阔的走廊。{w}\n走廊尽头是一扇宏伟的门，想必通向某个重要的地方。{w}\n两侧排列着较小的门。我猜它们通向更多私人房间。"

# game/script.rpy:60637
translate chinese map120_49c1f8d2:

    # voice "se/z01132.ogg"
    voice "se/z01132.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:60639
translate chinese map120_1bfe6179:

    # char_damek "That door right there leads to the war table.\nThat's the end of this tour. It's where things start.\nI'll go over our battle plan, and give you an itinerary."
    char_damek "那边那扇门通向作战桌。\n参观到此结束。那才是事情开始的地方。\n我会把作战计划和你过一遍，再给你一份行程安排。"

# game/script.rpy:60652
translate chinese map120_d22347e1:

    # voice "se/z01133.ogg"
    voice "se/z01133.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:60654
translate chinese map120_67b5155d:

    # char_damek "Your training will commence tomorrow.\nI can't believe this is finally happening. \nIt almost feels like a dream, you know?"
    char_damek "你的训练明天开始。\n真不敢相信这终于要开始了。\n你知道，这几乎像一场梦。"

# game/script.rpy:60668
translate chinese map120_7b18d88c:

    # "He lets out a nervous laugh, before turning to face the large door."
    "他紧张地笑了笑，然后转身面向那扇大门。"

# game/script.rpy:60693
translate chinese map120_2ff68aff:

    # voice "se/z01134.ogg"
    voice "se/z01134.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:60695
translate chinese map120_3c30bbd9:

    # char_damek "Well, these doors on the side lead to your comrade's rooms.\nValessa and Fortaime have been given personal rooms, just like you.\nMy quarters are here as well, if you'd like to come spend time with me."
    char_damek "这个嘛，侧边的这些门通向你的同伴们的房间。\n瓦莱莎和福泰姆和你一样，都分到了各自的房间。\n我的房间也在这里，如果你想来找我待一会儿的话。"

# game/script.rpy:60708
translate chinese map120_de7f645e:

    # voice "se/z01135.ogg"
    voice "se/z01135.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:60710
translate chinese map120_d7580a3d:

    # char_damek "I'm going to make a quick stop in my room, actually.\nAfter that, I'll meet you at the War Table, alright?\nTake some time to unwind, you really deserve it."
    char_damek "其实，我要先回房间一下。\n之后我们在作战桌见，好吗？\n花点时间放松一下，你真的很该歇歇了。"

# game/script.rpy:60724
translate chinese map120_d7b4b34d:

    # voice "se/z01136.ogg"
    voice "se/z01136.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:60726
translate chinese map120_a4497995:

    # char_damek "It's been a pleasure, [firstname]."
    char_damek "很高兴陪你参观，[firstname]。"

# game/script.rpy:60731
translate chinese map120_33acfe79:

    # voice "se/z01137.ogg"
    voice "se/z01137.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:60733
translate chinese map120_a4497995_1:

    # char_damek "It's been a pleasure, [firstname]."
    char_damek "很高兴陪你参观，[firstname]。"

# game/script.rpy:60754
translate chinese map120_ff00d3ad:

    # "With a smile, he walks off to one of the side rooms.{w}\nI guess that's the one I'd go to if I wanted to see him.{w}\nWith some long awaited free time, it might be a good idea."
    "他微笑着走进其中一间侧房。{w}\n我想，如果我想见他，就该去那一间。{w}\n有了期盼已久的空闲时间，去看看也许是个好主意。"

# game/script.rpy:60756
translate chinese map120_8225e086:

    # "However, I should make sure to spend it wisely.{w}\nAs soon as I met him at the war table, things would begin.{w}\nAnd something told me that nothing would be easy moving forward."
    "不过，我得确保好好利用这段时间。{w}\n我一旦在作战桌与他碰面，一切就会开始。{w}\n而我有种感觉，往后的一切都不会轻松。"

# game/script.rpy:60765
translate chinese map120_f06ee536:

    # "[[Use the region map to move to the War Table and continue the story.]\n[[For now, feel free to roam the world and access content at your leisure.]\n[[Every unlocked character has a Heart-to-Heart in the Crew Quarters.]"
    "[[使用区域地图前往作战桌，继续剧情。]\n[[现在，你可以随意探索世界，自由体验各项内容。]\n[[每位已解锁的角色在船员舱都有一个心灵对话事件。]"

