    # char_jit_map138_1_0_244 "Alright, but don't get the wrong idea. It was just an offer.\nI didn't do this to help you, I'm doing it to secure my nation.\nDon't forget about the terms of Damek's little arrangement."
    char_jit_map138_1_0_244 "好吧，但别误会。那只是个提议。\n我不是为了帮你们才这么做，我是在保卫我的国家。\n别忘了达梅克那个小约定的条件。"

