    # char_ulric "You've done more than enough, Nada.\nBut before you go, we have a bit more work to do.\nWhat do you say...? Wanna finish what we started?"
    char_ulric "你已经做得够多了，娜达。\n但在你走之前，我们还有一点事要做。\n怎么样……？想不想把没做完的事做完？"

# game/script.rpy:68903
