# game/script.rpy:69207
translate chinese map138_eb70790c:

    # "They start running toward the War Room, but don't make it very far.{w}\nUlric stops in his tracks as he notices movement in the corner of his eyes.{w}\nValessa and Fortaime — they were moving! They must've survived!"
    "他们开始朝作战室跑去，但没跑出多远。{w}\n乌尔里克停下脚步，注意到眼角有动静。{w}\n瓦莱莎和福泰姆——他们在动！他们一定活下来了！"

# game/script.rpy:69232
translate chinese map138_a27622f4:

    # voice "se/z01263.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Wait, hold on!\nPro — look!"
    voice "se/z01263.ogg"
    char_ulric "等等，慢着！\n普洛——你看！"

# game/script.rpy:69247
translate chinese map138_7bb1aa73:

    # "Ulric points, and they both make their way over to Valessa and Fortaime.{w}\nCrouching down, Pro offers his hand to Valessa, and Ulric to Fortaime.{w}\nThey help them get to their feet, and they look shaken, and traumatized."
    "乌尔里克指了指，两人便一同走向瓦莱莎和福泰姆。{w}\n普洛蹲下向瓦莱莎伸出手，乌尔里克则向福泰姆伸手。{w}\n他们扶两人站起来，那两人看上去惊魂未定，深受创伤。"

# game/script.rpy:69275
translate chinese map138_e37df7a8:

    # voice "se/z01264.ogg"
    # char_ulric "What happened...?\nHow did you survive that?"
    voice "se/z01264.ogg"
    char_ulric "发生了什么……？\n你们是怎么活下来的？"

# game/script.rpy:69301
translate chinese map138_bcc26ed6:

    # voice "se/z01265.ogg"
    voice "se/z01265.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:69303
translate chinese map138_013f6c0d:

    # char_pro "He was totally convinced that you died.\nI can't believe your luck. I'm surprised."
    char_pro "他完全认定你们死了。\n我真不敢相信你们这运气。我很意外。"

# game/script.rpy:69324
translate chinese map138_6b108e87:

    # "They both look at the ground, almost as if they're ashamed."
    "两人都低头看着地面，仿佛有些羞愧。"

# game/script.rpy:69349
translate chinese map138_ab1909e0:

    # voice "se/z01266.ogg"
    voice "se/z01266.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:69351
translate chinese map138_4f89264f:

    # char_fortaime "I thought they were going to kill us...\nBut they didn't. I don't really know what happened."
    char_fortaime "我以为他们要杀我们……\n可他们没有。我真不太清楚发生了什么。"

# game/script.rpy:69364
translate chinese map138_472548aa:

    # voice "se/z01267.ogg"
    # char_valessa "They didn't attack us. They pushed us to the ground.\nIt's almost like they wanted us to stay out of harm's way."
    voice "se/z01267.ogg"
    char_valessa "他们没有攻击我们。他们把我们推倒在地。\n就好像他们想让我们远离危险一样。"

# game/script.rpy:69378
translate chinese map138_906ed789:

    # voice "se/z01268.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "Yeah. We wouldn't have stood a chance in combat.\nI don't know why they wanted to help, but they did."
    voice "se/z01268.ogg"
    char_fortaime "是啊。真打起来我们根本毫无胜算。\n我不知道他们为什么想帮忙，但他们确实帮了。"

# game/script.rpy:69392
translate chinese map138_dccc41b3:

    # voice "se/z01269.ogg"
    # char_valessa "I think I know..."
    voice "se/z01269.ogg"
    char_valessa "我想我知道……"

# game/script.rpy:69406
translate chinese map138_c002d334:

    # voice "se/z01270.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "Hmm?"
    voice "se/z01270.ogg"
    char_fortaime "嗯？"

# game/script.rpy:69420
translate chinese map138_eb7a8a53:

    # voice "se/z01271.ogg"
    # char_valessa "Never mind."
    voice "se/z01271.ogg"
    char_valessa "没什么。"

# game/script.rpy:69435
translate chinese map138_8a321d87:

    # "She quickly changes the subject."
    "她很快转移了话题。"

# game/script.rpy:69462
translate chinese map138_e215d106:

    # voice "se/z01272.ogg"
    voice "se/z01272.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:69464
translate chinese map138_f4043b12:

    # char_valessa "Where's [firstname]?\nUlric, take us to see him...!"
    char_valessa "[firstname]在哪？\n乌尔里克，带我们去见他……！"

# game/script.rpy:69469
translate chinese map138_3571bd7e:

    # voice "se/z01273.ogg"
    voice "se/z01273.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:69471
translate chinese map138_b25635ad:

    # char_valessa "Where's [firstname]?\nUlric, take us to see her...!"
    char_valessa "[firstname]在哪？\n乌尔里克，带我们去见她……！"

# game/script.rpy:69497
translate chinese map138_a0fe7bba:

    # voice "se/z01274.ogg"
    voice "se/z01274.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:69499
translate chinese map138_b71d8643:

    # char_ulric "Right, of course.\nThey must be by the spirit idol.\nDamek, too. It's not that far, follow me."
    char_ulric "好，当然。\n他们应该在灵像旁边。\n达梅克也是。不远，跟我来。"

# game/script.rpy:69520
translate chinese map138_ca10cc1a:

    # "Deciding not to question providence, they all follow Ulric.{w}\nIn a time like this, it was best not to doubt your blessings.{w}\nHowever, Valessa remains a few paces behind — thinking."
    "决定不去质疑天意，他们都跟着乌尔里克走了。{w}\n在这种时候，最好不要怀疑自己的福分。{w}\n然而，瓦莱莎落后了几步——若有所思。"

# game/script.rpy:69548
translate chinese map138_3998027a:

    # voice "se/z01275.ogg"
    # char_valessa "Mom...? Dad...?\nThank you..."
    voice "se/z01275.ogg"
    char_valessa "妈妈……？爸爸……？\n谢谢你们……"

# game/script.rpy:69596
translate chinese map139_dec4e420:

    # "My vision slowly fades back in, much to my surprise.{w}\nI've been on the verge of death for what seemed like an eternity.{w}\nI'm strong. My will, and the power inside of me, refused to give in."
    "我的视野竟然慢慢恢复了，令我大为意外。{w}\n我已在死亡边缘徘徊了仿佛永恒之久。{w}\n我很坚强。我的意志，以及体内的力量，都不肯屈服。"

# game/script.rpy:69598
translate chinese map139_4c55918c:

    # "Pain radiates from the wound in my chest, but I'm almost getting used to it.{w}\nSovy's attempts to make it more fatal had clearly failed. Or did they...?{w}\nI remember the thought I had in my mind the moment I faded away."
    "剧痛从胸口的伤口辐射开来，但我几乎已经习惯了。{w}\n索维想让它更致命的企图显然失败了。还是说……？{w}\n我记得自己在消散那一刻脑中的念头。"

# game/script.rpy:69600
translate chinese map139_3ba31702:

    # "I wanted to be saved. I wanted to make it through this alive.{w}\nCould the blade have that much power...? Could it have saved me?{w}\nI back myself up against a wall, and lay against it. Then, I scan the room."
    "我想被拯救。我想活着挺过这一切。{w}\n那把剑真的有那样的力量吗……？它救了我吗？{w}\n我靠到墙边，倚着它躺下。然后，我环视房间。"

# game/script.rpy:69602
translate chinese map139_416b5e1e:

    # "Wait, what's that...?"
    "等等，那是什么……？"

# game/script.rpy:69604
translate chinese map139_68330f94:

    # "A hulking shadow is on the other side of the room, whispering to itself.{w}\nBut Damek's body is still on the floor. Who could that be...?{w}\nI look at the exit to the room. It's still caved in. Impossible."
    "房间另一头有个庞大的影子，正对着自己低声细语。{w}\n可达梅克的尸体还躺在地上。那会是谁……？{w}\n我看向房间的出口。那里仍被堵死。不可能。"

# game/script.rpy:69606
translate chinese map139_789d0616:

    # "There was no one else in this room with us."
    "这房间里除了我们不该有别人。"

# game/script.rpy:69608
translate chinese map139_9c38d9b5:

    # "Their ears perk up. They must've heard my movements.{w}\nQuickly turning to face me, they take heavy, slow steps.{w}\nStumbling from side to side, it's almost like they can't balance."
    "他们的耳朵竖了起来。他们一定听见了我的动静。{w}\n他们迅速转身面向我，迈着沉重而缓慢的步伐。{w}\n他们左右摇晃，几乎像是站不稳。"

# game/script.rpy:69610
translate chinese map139_d621c929:

    # "I can't see their face. My vision is too blurry.{w}\nBut when they make it to my location, they kneel down.{w}\nWhile normally I would be frightened, I seem to feel at ease."
    "我看不清他们的脸。我的视线太模糊了。{w}\n但当他们走到我身边时，他们跪了下来。{w}\n按理说我会害怕，可我却似乎感到安心。"

# game/script.rpy:69632
translate chinese map139_4af42bab:

    # voice "se/z01276.ogg"
    voice "se/z01276.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:69634
translate chinese map139_ea0b547c:

    # char_howl "..."
    char_howl "……"

# game/script.rpy:69648
translate chinese map139_90270614:

    # "They reach forward, and place a hand on my chest.{w}\nI hadn't realized it, but in my confusion — the pain had stopped.{w}\nOr was it even there to begin with? Maybe I just felt it in my head."
    "他们伸出手，把手放在我的胸口。{w}\n我没意识到，但在恍惚之中——疼痛已经停止了。{w}\n还是一开始就根本不存在？也许只是我脑子里感觉到的。"

# game/script.rpy:69650
translate chinese map139_9e82005c:

    # "They let go, and shake their head dismissively.{w}\nA flicker of light from the dying idol illuminates their face.{w}\nWhen I see them, I ask who they are: but get no straight answer."
    "他们收回手，不以为然地摇了摇头。{w}\n垂死灵像的一丝微光映亮了他们的脸。{w}\n我看清他们后，问他们是谁，却没有得到明确的回答。"

# game/script.rpy:69678
translate chinese map139_821a9b60:

    # voice "se/z01277.ogg"
    # char_howl "Gaze into the abyss — after a lifelong journey, and plead.\nBeg for the answer to your most undying question, and tell me:\nWhat would frighten you most? Being left in silence, or hearing an answer?"
    voice "se/z01277.ogg"
    char_howl "凝视深渊吧——在漫长的旅途之后，然后恳求。\n为你最执着的疑问乞求答案，再告诉我：\n什么最让你恐惧？是被留在沉默中，还是听见答案？"

# game/script.rpy:69693
translate chinese map139_4fc556b6:

    # "I don't understand, and I shake my head.{w}\nBut something tells me that they look familiar to me.{w}\nI'm too delirious to think straight, so this thought goes nowhere."
    "我不明白，摇了摇头。{w}\n但有种感觉告诉我，他们看起来很眼熟。{w}\n我已神志恍惚，无法理清思绪，所以这念头也就没有了下文。"

# game/script.rpy:69718
translate chinese map139_bc9e170e:

    # voice "se/z01278.ogg"
    # char_howl "The pursuit of an answer is more defining than the answer itself.\nFor no truth can compare to the truth we've conjured in our head.\nHearing an answer may rob us of purpose. We prefer silence."
    voice "se/z01278.ogg"
    char_howl "追寻答案，比答案本身更能定义我们。\n因为没有哪份真相，比得上我们在脑中虚构的真相。\n听见答案也许会夺走我们的目标。我们宁愿沉默。"

# game/script.rpy:69722
translate chinese map139_693436a9:

    # voice "se/z01279.ogg"
    # char_howl "But sometimes, the silence can be maddening.\nWe can convince ourselves that purpose is not important.\nSelf-destructive. Purpose breeds strength, and victory."
    voice "se/z01279.ogg"
    char_howl "但有时，沉默也能令人发疯。\n我们会让自己相信目标并不重要。\n那是自我毁灭。目标孕育力量，也孕育胜利。"

# game/script.rpy:69736
translate chinese map139_2509e41b:

    # voice "se/z01280.ogg"
    # char_howl "We desire victory."
    voice "se/z01280.ogg"
    char_howl "我们渴望胜利。"

# game/script.rpy:69751
translate chinese map139_fb0669e4:

    # "He stands up, and holds out his hand.{w}\nI grab it, and he pulls me to my feet.{w}\nThis is the first time I truly see him."
    "他站起身，伸出手。{w}\n我握住他的手，他把我拉了起来。{w}\n这是我第一次真正看清他。"

# game/script.rpy:69753
translate chinese map139_a9ea13ff:

    # "He's covered in scars, from head to toe.{w}\nAlmost as if he endured torture, or something far worse.{w}\nTattoos adorn his arm, much like those on Ulric's body."
    "他浑身布满了伤疤，从头到脚。{w}\n仿佛他经受过酷刑，或者更糟的东西。{w}\n他手臂上布满纹身，和乌尔里克身上的很像。"

# game/script.rpy:69755
translate chinese map139_c95ceaa6:

    # "Who was this...?"
    "这到底是谁……？"

# game/script.rpy:69780
translate chinese map139_46f42e9b:

    # voice "se/z01281.ogg"
    # char_howl "We need no name. A name {i}defines{/i} an individual.\nWe are many, and therefore, cannot be defined.\nThis body is merely a tool. It bends to our will."
    voice "se/z01281.ogg"
    char_howl "我们不需要名字。名字会{i}定义{/i}一个个体。\n我们众多，因此无法被定义。\n这具身体不过是工具。它屈从于我们的意志。"

# game/script.rpy:69794
translate chinese map139_39f36a68:

    # voice "se/z01282.ogg"
    # char_howl "We know how confused you are. It's always the same.\nCome with me. There is still much we need to do.\nDamek, right? That's the name of your leader?"
    voice "se/z01282.ogg"
    char_howl "我们知道你有多困惑。每次都一样。\n跟我来。我们还有很多事要做。\n达梅克，对吧？那是你们首领的名字？"

# game/script.rpy:69809
translate chinese map139_7cd76e16:

    # "He turns around, and looks at Damek's body."
    "他转过身，看向达梅克的尸体。"

# game/script.rpy:69836
translate chinese map139_779e3231:

    # voice "se/z01283.ogg"
    # char_howl "You said that name in your sleep.\nYou called out to him, but only {i}we{/i} responded.\nHe lives. We took care of that while you slept."
    voice "se/z01283.ogg"
    char_howl "你在睡梦中说过那个名字。\n你呼唤的是他，但回应的只有{i}我们{/i}。\n他活着。你睡着时，我们把他料理好了。"

# game/script.rpy:69851
translate chinese map139_1ef47bed:

    # "He's alive...!?\nI look over, and watch his chest move up and down.\nHe's breathing. I'm almost in disbelief at this."
    "他还活着……！？\n我望过去，看着他的胸口一起一伏。\n他在呼吸。我几乎不敢相信。"

# game/script.rpy:69853
translate chinese map139_bb598a2b:

    # "What happened...?"
    "发生了什么……？"

# game/script.rpy:69878
translate chinese map139_71a9f5d4:

    # voice "se/z01284.ogg"
    # char_howl "We will tell you both. There is much to discuss.\nWith the exit cut off, we have sufficient time.\nA funny concept, time. Perhaps another day."
    voice "se/z01284.ogg"
    char_howl "我们会告诉你们两人的。有很多事要谈。\n出口已被堵死，我们有足够的时间。\n时间，真是个有趣的概念。改天再说吧。"

# game/script.rpy:69893
translate chinese map139_7dfadd59:

    # "We walk over to Damek, and the mystery man takes slow steps again.{w}\nHis limbs appear stiff, as if they've been unused for a long time.{w}\nI kneel down and shake Damek softly, placing my hand on his shoulder."
    "我们走向达梅克，那个神秘男子又迈起了缓慢的脚步。{w}\n他的四肢似乎很僵硬，像是许久未曾使用。{w}\n我跪下来，把手放在他肩上，轻轻摇晃达梅克。"

# game/script.rpy:69918
translate chinese map139_8e0af95c:

    # voice "se/z01285.ogg"
    # char_howl "He should have been awake by now.\nHis wounds were grievous. He was saved.\nWe were limited, but we did what we could."
    voice "se/z01285.ogg"
    char_howl "他本该已经醒了。\n他的伤势很重。他被救了下来。\n我们力量有限，但我们尽力了。"

# game/script.rpy:69932
translate chinese map139_47be202c:

    # voice "se/z01286.ogg"
    # char_howl "Rise."
    voice "se/z01286.ogg"
    char_howl "起来。"

# game/script.rpy:69950
translate chinese map139_c0002905:

    # "He says this in a demanding tone, and Damek starts to move.{w}\nHis eyes slowly open, and he looks at both of us as he comes to."
    "他用命令的口吻说出这话，达梅克便开始动了。{w}\n他的眼睛缓缓睁开，清醒过来时看着我们两人。"

# game/script.rpy:69972
translate chinese map139_fb002a3c:

    # voice "se/z01287.ogg"
    voice "se/z01287.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:69974
translate chinese map139_a4e93034:

    # char_damek "S-Salus...? Am I dead?\nWhat's going on?"
    char_damek "萨——萨鲁斯……？我死了吗？\n发生什么事了？"

# game/script.rpy:69988
translate chinese map139_665e9a10:

    # "I laugh softly, and tell him he's not dead.{w}\nBut he seems to have me confused with Salus."
    "我轻轻笑了笑，告诉他他没死。{w}\n但他似乎把我错认成了萨鲁斯。"

# game/script.rpy:70013
translate chinese map139_afe5dcbb:

    # voice "se/z01288.ogg"
    # char_damek "Salus..."
    voice "se/z01288.ogg"
    char_damek "萨鲁斯……"

# game/script.rpy:70028
translate chinese map139_e81efaa7:

    # "Wait..."
    "等等……"

# game/script.rpy:70033
translate chinese map139_a17fd967:

    # "His eyes are fixated on the mystery man as he says the name.{w}\nI take a few steps back, confused, and scared at the same time.{w}\nCould it possibly be...? No, there's no way. This makes no sense."
    "他说出这个名字时，双眼紧盯着那个神秘男子。{w}\n我后退了几步，既困惑又害怕。{w}\n难道真的是……？不，绝不可能。这说不通。"

# game/script.rpy:70058
translate chinese map139_1827d828:

    # voice "se/z01289.ogg"
    # char_damek "How are you alive...?\nHow am {i}I{/i} alive...?"
    voice "se/z01289.ogg"
    char_damek "你是怎么活过来的……？\n{i}我{/i}又是怎么活过来的……？"

# game/script.rpy:70073
translate chinese map139_797804b9:

    # "This isn't right. Salus was dead.{w}\nOur old Elder, The Rebellion's founder..."
    "这不对。萨鲁斯已经死了。{w}\n我们曾经的长老，反抗军的创立者……"

# game/script.rpy:70098
translate chinese map139_f426ae3c:

    # voice "se/z01290.ogg"
    # char_howl "Salus. The name of this vessel.\nHe no longer lives. Do not use this name.\nAs we said before, no name is required."
    voice "se/z01290.ogg"
    char_howl "萨鲁斯。这具容器的名字。\n他早已不在人世。不要用这个名字。\n正如我们之前所说，不需要名字。"

# game/script.rpy:70102
translate chinese map139_9909bdd7:

    # voice "se/z01291.ogg"
    # char_howl "We simply exist."
    voice "se/z01291.ogg"
    char_howl "我们只是存在着。"

# game/script.rpy:70117
translate chinese map139_ebf2517f:

    # "Damek and I look at one another, utterly confused."
    "达梅克和我面面相觑，彻底懵了。"

# game/script.rpy:70142
translate chinese map139_6cce9411:

    # voice "se/z01292.ogg"
    # char_damek "Please explain...\nI don't understand."
    voice "se/z01292.ogg"
    char_damek "请你解释一下……\n我不明白。"

# game/script.rpy:70157
translate chinese map139_433fc2c0:

    # "The man points to the center of the room."
    "那人指了指房间中央。"

# game/script.rpy:70182
translate chinese map139_589a88c6:

    # voice "se/z01293.ogg"
    # char_howl "You will have a seat.\nYou may be satisfied. Or perhaps not.\nWe have some answers, but not all of them."
    voice "se/z01293.ogg"
    char_howl "你们坐下吧。\n你们也许会满意。也许不会。\n我们有一些答案，但不是全部。"

# game/script.rpy:70197
translate chinese map139_9d5702e0:

    # "I reach down and help Damek up. He grunts.{w}\nThere are no wounds on his abdomen. There's nothing.{w}\nThis would require some {i}serious{/i} explanation, and fast."
    "我伸手把达梅克扶起来。他哼了一声。{w}\n他的腹部没有任何伤口。什么都没有。{w}\n这需要一番{i}严肃{/i}的解释，而且要快。"

# game/script.rpy:70199
translate chinese map139_c6edbdb0:

    # "I take Damek over to the center of the room, and we sit down.{w}\nThe other man however, walks over to the exit and inspects it."
    "我把达梅克带到房间中央，我们坐了下来。{w}\n而另一个人则走到出口处，仔细查看着。"

# game/script.rpy:70224
translate chinese map139_c8220a39:

    # voice "se/z01294.ogg"
    # char_howl "Trapped, as always.\nDo you trust your comrades?\nWe think they are your only hope."
    voice "se/z01294.ogg"
    char_howl "被困住了，一如既往。\n你们信任你们的同伴吗？\n我们认为他们是你们唯一的希望。"

# game/script.rpy:70250
translate chinese map139_92357155:

    # voice "se/z01295.ogg"
    # char_damek "If they survived..."
    voice "se/z01295.ogg"
    char_damek "如果他们活下来了的话……"

# game/script.rpy:70276
translate chinese map139_8cee6bb8:

    # voice "se/z01296.ogg"
    # char_howl "Yes."
    voice "se/z01296.ogg"
    char_howl "是的。"

# game/script.rpy:70291
translate chinese map139_bb82c81b:

    # "He walks over to our location, and sits down.{w}\nI guess all we could do was wait to get rescued.{w}\nThe Rebel HQ was full of digging tools, after all."
    "他走到我们身边，坐了下来。{w}\n我想我们只能等着被救了。{w}\n毕竟反抗军总部里满是挖掘工具。"

# game/script.rpy:70316
translate chinese map139_6aa45991:

    # voice "se/z01297.ogg"
    # char_howl "You will ask, and we may answer."
    voice "se/z01297.ogg"
    char_howl "你们问，我们或许会答。"

# game/script.rpy:70331
translate chinese map139_500621b7:

    # "He sits in silence, and waits for us to make the next move."
    "他静静坐着，等着我们走出下一步。"

# game/script.rpy:70356
translate chinese map139_015636b6:

    # voice "se/z01298.ogg"
    # char_damek "Who are you...?"
    voice "se/z01298.ogg"
    char_damek "你是谁……？"

# game/script.rpy:70382
translate chinese map139_6b1d311f:

    # voice "se/z01299.ogg"
    # char_howl "The idol is no more. Its energy was released.\nIt may still glow, but it will soon go dim. Lifeless.\nEnergy must be stored somewhere. Less wasteful."
    voice "se/z01299.ogg"
    char_howl "灵像已不复存在。它的能量被释放了。\n它也许还会发光，但很快就会黯淡。毫无生气。\n能量必须有处存放。这样才不那么浪费。"

# game/script.rpy:70386
translate chinese map139_00454327:

    # voice "se/z01300.ogg"
    # char_howl "Much of it went into that sword you carry.\nSome of it was used to heal your wounds.\nThe rest? Well, we found a vessel to use."
    voice "se/z01300.ogg"
    char_howl "其中大部分进入了你随身携带的那把剑。\n有些被用来治愈你的伤口。\n剩下的呢？嗯，我们找了一具容器来用。"

# game/script.rpy:70412
translate chinese map139_fc4555cd:

    # voice "se/z01301.ogg"
    # char_damek "A vessel...? "
    voice "se/z01301.ogg"
    char_damek "一具容器……？"

# game/script.rpy:70438
translate chinese map139_e907167a:

    # voice "se/z01302.ogg"
    # char_howl "This body expired long ago.\nIt offered no resistance, and no identity.\nWe thought it would be fitting. We desired a voice."
    voice "se/z01302.ogg"
    char_howl "这具身体早已死去。\n它没有抵抗，也没有身份。\n我们觉得这样很合适。我们渴望一个声音。"

# game/script.rpy:70464
translate chinese map139_3230830e:

    # voice "se/z01303.ogg"
    # char_damek "Who is \"we\"...?"
    voice "se/z01303.ogg"
    char_damek "你说的“我们”是谁……？"

# game/script.rpy:70490
translate chinese map139_b16ce81d:

    # voice "se/z01304.ogg"
    # char_howl "We are what you call \"The Spirit Realm\".\nUntil now, our power was stored only in objects.\nThat, and vessels which had their own voice, like you."
    voice "se/z01304.ogg"
    char_howl "我们就是你们所称的“灵界”。\n在此之前，我们的力量只存在于物件之中。\n那些，以及像你一样拥有自己声音的容器。"

# game/script.rpy:70505
translate chinese map139_3f503d6b:

    # "He looks at me. "
    "他看向我。"

# game/script.rpy:70530
translate chinese map139_a99cc895:

    # voice "se/z01305.ogg"
    # char_damek "So, let me get this straight.\nThe power released from the idol \"healed\" us.\nAnd it took over Salus' body so it could talk...?"
    voice "se/z01305.ogg"
    char_damek "那么，让我理一理。\n从灵像中释放的力量“治愈”了我们。\n然后它占据了萨鲁斯的身体，好让它能说话……？"

# game/script.rpy:70556
translate chinese map139_034e6bf2:

    # voice "se/z01306.ogg"
    # char_howl "Correct."
    voice "se/z01306.ogg"
    char_howl "没错。"

# game/script.rpy:70582
translate chinese map139_666851f8:

    # voice "se/z01307.ogg"
    # char_damek "So I'm talking to the spirit realm right now?"
    voice "se/z01307.ogg"
    char_damek "所以我现在是在和灵界对话？"

# game/script.rpy:70610
translate chinese map139_4db85ff2:

    # voice "se/z01308.ogg"
    voice "se/z01308.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:70612
translate chinese map139_e945ed59:

    # char_howl "A portion. The rest resides in {i}his{/i} body, and the sword.\nHowever, the spirit realm is just a term you created to define us.\nWe are more than that, and we finally have a voice in your world."
    char_howl "只是一部分。其余的寄居在{i}他{/i}的身体里，以及那把剑中。\n不过，灵界只是你们创造出来定义我们的说法。\n我们远不止于此，而我们终于在你的世界里有了声音。"

# game/script.rpy:70617
translate chinese map139_73e0ff6e:

    # voice "se/z01309.ogg"
    voice "se/z01309.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:70619
translate chinese map139_c980127b:

    # char_howl "A portion. The rest resides in {i}her{/i} body, and the sword.\nHowever, the spirit realm is just a term you created to define us.\nWe are more than that, and we finally have a voice in your world."
    char_howl "只是一部分。其余的寄居在{i}她{/i}的身体里，以及那把剑中。\n不过，灵界只是你们创造出来定义我们的说法。\n我们远不止于此，而我们终于在你的世界里有了声音。"

# game/script.rpy:70635
translate chinese map139_a7aae890:

    # "Damek gulps, getting a little frightened."
    "达梅克咽了口唾沫，有些害怕了。"

# game/script.rpy:70660
translate chinese map139_d349890c:

    # voice "se/z01310.ogg"
    # char_damek "Are you peaceful?"
    voice "se/z01310.ogg"
    char_damek "你们是友善的吗？"

# game/script.rpy:70686
translate chinese map139_e5ae0e6a:

    # voice "se/z01311.ogg"
    # char_howl "That is a relative term."
    voice "se/z01311.ogg"
    char_howl "这是个相对的说法。"

# game/script.rpy:70702
translate chinese map139_3874dcaa:

    # voice "se/z01312.ogg"
    # char_damek "Are you... going to hurt us?"
    voice "se/z01312.ogg"
    char_damek "你们……会伤害我们吗？"

# game/script.rpy:70728
translate chinese map139_c2a37505:

    # voice "se/z01313.ogg"
    # char_howl "No."
    voice "se/z01313.ogg"
    char_howl "不会。"

# game/script.rpy:70754
translate chinese map139_ff521ac0:

    # voice "se/z01314.ogg"
    # char_damek "What is your purpose?"
    voice "se/z01314.ogg"
    char_damek "你们的目的究竟是什么？"

# game/script.rpy:70770
translate chinese map139_67a9c7ca:

    # voice "se/z01315.ogg"
    # char_howl "An impossible question.\nDo you know {i}your{/i} purpose?"
    voice "se/z01315.ogg"
    char_howl "这是个无法回答的问题。\n你知道{i}你自己{/i}的目的吗？"

# game/script.rpy:70786
translate chinese map139_09ab9da8:

    # voice "se/z01316.ogg"
    # char_damek "No. I guess not."
    voice "se/z01316.ogg"
    char_damek "不知道。我想也是。"

# game/script.rpy:70802
translate chinese map139_0543cd34:

    # voice "se/z01317.ogg"
    # char_howl "We only wish to aid you. Please do not question.\nIt would please us greatly to see The Triumvirate fall.\nWe are their victims, just as much as you are, Damek."
    voice "se/z01317.ogg"
    char_howl "我们只想帮助你们。请不要质疑。\n能亲眼看到三人执政团覆灭，我们会非常高兴。\n我们和你一样，也是他们的受害者，达梅克。"

# game/script.rpy:70828
translate chinese map139_f38cf5d7:

    # voice "se/z01318.ogg"
    # char_damek "Victims...?"
    voice "se/z01318.ogg"
    char_damek "受害者……？"

# game/script.rpy:70854
translate chinese map139_3c95cb3d:

    # voice "se/z01319.ogg"
    # char_howl "You do not know the truth of what we are.\nIt is understandable, because we could never tell.\nUsing this voice, we wish to make our suffering known."
    voice "se/z01319.ogg"
    char_howl "你们不知道我们究竟是什么。\n这可以理解，因为我们一直无法诉说。\n借这个声音，我们想让自己的苦难为人所知。"

# game/script.rpy:70868
translate chinese map139_bdb55def:

    # voice "se/z01320.ogg"
    # char_howl "And using this body, we wish to enact our vengeance.\nIf this is acceptable, we will join you after rescue.\nIf rescue comes, that is. Until then, we talk."
    voice "se/z01320.ogg"
    char_howl "借这具身体，我们想施行我们的复仇。\n如果这可以接受，获救之后我们会加入你们。\n前提是获救。在那之前，我们交谈。"

# game/script.rpy:70871
translate chinese map139_c213024b:

    # "Damek nods. He's taking this very well, actually.{w}\nAfter all, he's talking to the corpse of his former leader.{w}\nBut a strategist needed to adapt to change, and overcome it."
    "达梅克点点头。他其实接受得相当好。{w}\n毕竟，他正在和自己前任首领的尸体说话。{w}\n但一个战略家必须适应变化，并克服它。"

# game/script.rpy:70873
translate chinese map139_abd7e935:

    # "Or maybe he's just numb from the trauma of these events."
    "又或者，他只是被这一连串事件带来的创伤弄得麻木了。"

# game/script.rpy:70898
translate chinese map139_610f3d47:

    # voice "se/z01321.ogg"
    # char_damek "Of course. But you need to explain...\nWhat is the truth of the Spirit Realm...?\nWere we so wrong that you {i}needed{/i} a voice?"
    voice "se/z01321.ogg"
    char_damek "当然。但你需要解释一下……\n灵界的真相究竟是什么……？\n我们究竟错得多离谱，才让你们{i}需要{/i}一个声音？"

# game/script.rpy:70924
translate chinese map139_a0c02edd:

    # voice "se/z01322.ogg"
    # char_howl "We do not blame you for your interpretation.\nGiven your situation, it made perfect sense.\nBut yes, you were wrong. Very wrong."
    voice "se/z01322.ogg"
    char_howl "我们不怪你们的理解。\n以你们当时的处境，那完全说得通。\n但没错，你们错了。大错特错。"

# game/script.rpy:70939
translate chinese map139_07ca3c72:

    # "Me and Damek look at each other once more.{w}\nI'd never believe this if we didn't just cheat death.{w}\nBut given the circumstances, we can't deny the truth."
    "我和达梅克再次对视。{w}\n若不是我们刚刚与死亡擦肩，我绝不会相信这些。{w}\n但事已至此，我们无法否认这个真相。"

# game/script.rpy:70941
translate chinese map139_c818443f:

    # "This was a living embodiment of the spirit realm.{w}\nMuch like the idols, but able to walk and talk as well.{w}\nAnd if that was the case, then there were no more secrets."
    "这是灵界的活体化身。{w}\n和那些灵像很像，但还能行走和说话。{w}\n而既然如此，那就再无秘密可言了。"

# game/script.rpy:70943
translate chinese map139_101fc326:

    # "He would tell us {i}everything{/i} about the Spirit Realm.{w}\nThe undying questions of our history — finally answered.{w}\nWhat was their purpose, and why did they influence us?"
    "他会把灵界的{i}一切{/i}都告诉我们。{w}\n我们历史中那些永无答案的疑问——终于有了答案。{w}\n他们的目的是什么，又为什么要影响我们？"

# game/script.rpy:70948
translate chinese map139_1fd1d605:

    # "The answers would change everything. Forever."
    "这些答案将改变一切。永远地改变。"

# game/script.rpy:70984
translate chinese map140_6ad338a2:

    # "Eventually ending up in the War Room, everyone looks around frantically.{w}\nIt wasn't much longer until they noticed the back corner of the room was caved in.{w}\nRather than digest the current events, they search for Damek and The Seer."
    "最终抵达作战室后，所有人都在慌乱地四处张望。{w}\n没过多久，他们就注意到房间后角已经塌陷。{w}\n他们无暇消化眼下发生的事，便去寻找达梅克和先知。"

# game/script.rpy:70989
translate chinese map140_fff30f33:

    # "Eventually ending up in the War Room, everyone looks around frantically.{w}\nIt wasn't much longer until they noticed the back corner of the room was caved in.{w}\nRather than digest the current events, they search for Damek and The Seeress."
    "最终抵达作战室后，所有人都在慌乱地四处张望。{w}\n没过多久，他们就注意到房间后角已经塌陷。{w}\n他们无暇消化眼下发生的事，便去寻找达梅克和先知。"

# game/script.rpy:71014
translate chinese map140_b07aafc3:

    # voice "se/z01323.ogg"
    voice "se/z01323.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:71016
translate chinese map140_77edc861:

    # char_ulric "They must be down with the idol."
    char_ulric "他们一定在灵像下面。"

# game/script.rpy:71038
translate chinese map140_83fd3ee3:

    # voice "se/z01324.ogg"
    voice "se/z01324.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:71040
translate chinese map140_63cdf717:

    # char_fortaime "Can we even get down there...?"
    char_fortaime "我们真能下去吗……？"

# game/script.rpy:71055
translate chinese map140_c6ab1726:

    # voice "se/z01325.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Go back to the crew quarters, Fortaime.\nYou too, Valessa. Bring us some equipment.\nWe should be able to reach them if we dig."
    voice "se/z01325.ogg"
