    # char_howl "It all happened in the blink of an eye.\nOur glorious monarchy, destroyed in an instant.\nThey showed no mercy. They showed nothing."
    voice "se/z01358.ogg"
    char_howl "一切都发生在眨眼之间。\n我们辉煌的王室，顷刻间被摧毁。\n他们没有丝毫仁慈。他们什么都未曾流露。"

