translate chinese map141_bcdaa34d:

    # voice "se/z01361.ogg"
    # char_howl "Neither do we. But that is what happened.\nThey stole our future, and our bodies. We were prisoners.\nBound by celestial chains as they had their way with our world."
    voice "se/z01361.ogg"
    char_howl "我们也不明白。但事情就是这样。\n他们夺走了我们的未来和身体。我们成了囚徒。\n被天界的锁链束缚，任他们肆意摆布我们的世界。"

# game/script.rpy:71996
