    # voice "se/z01370.ogg"
    # char_damek "So, The Spirit Realm is more like a prison...?\nAnd it held you and your people captive. Hmm.\nThen what are these visions and idols all about?"
    voice "se/z01370.ogg"
    char_damek "那么，灵界更像是一座监狱……？\n它囚禁了你们和你们的人民。嗯。\n那这些幻象和灵像又是怎么回事？"

