# game/script.rpy:72298
translate chinese map141_ce8d9b7c:

    # voice "se/z01375.ogg"
    # char_howl "Yes, but our power was limited, and we were censored.\nThis is why we could never tell you the truth through visions.\nWhenever we did, The Triumvirate made you see something else."
    voice "se/z01375.ogg"
    char_howl "是的，但我们的力量有限，而且受到了审查。\n这就是为什么我们永远无法通过幻象告诉你们真相。\n每当我们尝试，三人执政团就会让你们看到别的东西。"

# game/script.rpy:72324
translate chinese map141_d2b682c3:

    # voice "se/z01376.ogg"
    # char_damek "That's what they did this time, then?\nWe saw Valinorth getting attacked, and strategized about {i}that{/i}.\nBut it seems like their plan was always to attack us down here."
    voice "se/z01376.ogg"
    char_damek "那这次他们就是这么做的？\n我们看见瓦利诺斯遭到攻击，并针对{i}那个{/i}制定了策略。\n但看来他们的计划一直就是在这里攻击我们。"

