translate chinese map141_b5705190:

    # voice "se/z01377.ogg"
    # char_howl "Indeed. Which is why we chose not to create another idol.\nInstead, we chose to \"influence\" the members of their Honor Guard.\nThe barracks, the living quarters, the weapons. We did it all for {i}you{/i}."
    voice "se/z01377.ogg"
    char_howl "的确如此。所以我们才选择不再创造新的灵像。\n取而代之，我们选择“影响”他们荣誉卫队的成员。\n营房、住所、武器。这一切都是为了{i}你们{/i}。"

# game/script.rpy:72354
translate chinese map141_adb5c327:

    # voice "se/z01378.ogg"
    # char_howl "We did it so you would survive this trap, and help us seek vengeance.\nIt seems the cost was dire, but we succeeded. We shall succeed again.\nWe wish to aid your assault on Balteus, and take back our homeland."
    voice "se/z01378.ogg"
    char_howl "我们这么做，是为了让你们从这陷阱中活下来，并帮我们复仇。\n代价似乎很惨重，但我们成功了。我们还会再次成功。\n我们希望协助你们进攻巴尔泰乌斯，夺回我们的家园。"

# game/script.rpy:72380
translate chinese map141_ef8c043e:

    # voice "se/z01379.ogg"
    # char_damek "So you come from Balteus?"
    voice "se/z01379.ogg"
    char_damek "所以你们来自巴尔泰乌斯？"

# game/script.rpy:72406
translate chinese map141_3b838d0e:

    # voice "se/z01380.ogg"
    # char_howl "We lived all over Alestia, but Balteus was our capital.\nThe castle there housed the Monarch. Our King or Queen.\nWe may have been \"corrupt\", but we lived in peace. We were happy."
    voice "se/z01380.ogg"
    char_howl "我们曾遍布阿莱斯蒂亚，但巴尔泰乌斯是我们的都城。\n那里的城堡住着君主。我们的国王或女王。\n我们或许“堕落”，但我们和平地生活。我们很幸福。"

# game/script.rpy:72432
translate chinese map141_76f611bd:

    # voice "se/z01381.ogg"
    # char_damek "What do you mean by corrupt?"
    voice "se/z01381.ogg"
    char_damek "你说的堕落是什么意思？"

# game/script.rpy:72458
translate chinese map141_c2a466ca:

    # voice "se/z01382.ogg"
    # char_howl "We are not certain. Perhaps there is inherent evil in all of us.\nThe Triumvirate deemed that a flaw and re-wrote the world.\nWhen your kind was first made, you were mindless slaves."
    voice "se/z01382.ogg"
    char_howl "我们也不确定。也许我们所有人身上都生来就有恶。\n三人执政团认定那是一种缺陷，于是重写了这个世界。\n你们的族群初造之时，是无思无想的奴隶。"

# game/script.rpy:72462
translate chinese map141_0d9950ee:

    # voice "se/z01383.ogg"
    # char_howl "Forced to carry out The Triumvirate's bidding. No free will.\nThat is a gift we gave to you through the Idols we created.\nSlowly, our corruption merged with the purity of your kind."
    voice "se/z01383.ogg"
    char_howl "被迫执行三人执政团的命令。没有自由意志。\n那正是我们通过所造灵像送给你们的礼物。\n渐渐地，我们的堕落与你们族群的纯净相融。"

# game/script.rpy:72466
translate chinese map141_8370234a:

    # voice "se/z01384.ogg"
    # char_howl "That was the first step. After that, we created Seers.\nBeings capable of hearing our plight, and leading insurrections.\nTo this day, all have failed. We were not strong enough."
    voice "se/z01384.ogg"
    char_howl "那是第一步。在那之后，我们创造了先知。\n能听见我们苦难，并领导起义的存在。\n时至今日，所有的起义都失败了。我们还不够强大。"

# game/script.rpy:72492
translate chinese map141_889425b3:

    # voice "se/z01385.ogg"
    # char_damek "Wait, I know where this is going..."
    voice "se/z01385.ogg"
    char_damek "等等，我知道这话要说到哪儿去了……"

# game/script.rpy:72507
translate chinese map141_77071c69:

    # "The man stands up, motioning his arms to suggest that we do the same.{w}\nDamek and I both do as instructed, dusting ourselves off while looking up at him."
    "那人站起身，挥动手臂示意我们也照做。{w}\n达梅克和我都依言行之，一边掸去身上的灰尘，一边抬头看他。"

# game/script.rpy:72534
translate chinese map141_f0dbf0ec:

    # voice "se/z01386.ogg"
    voice "se/z01386.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:72536
translate chinese map141_7f41d907:

    # char_howl "Yes. That is why we gave The Seer all of our power.\nEnough to wield that blade against your creators, and our captors.\nThe timing seemed correct. It is a gamble, but with favorable odds."
    char_howl "是的。所以我们把全部力量都赐予了先知。\n足以挥舞那把剑，对抗你们的创造者，我们的囚禁者。\n时机似乎正好。这是一场赌博，但胜算有利。"

# game/script.rpy:72541
translate chinese map141_9dca7ca1:

    # voice "se/z01387.ogg"
    voice "se/z01387.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:72543
translate chinese map141_08fa20bf:

    # char_howl "Yes. That is why we gave The Seeress all of our power.\nEnough to wield that blade against your creators, and our captors.\nThe timing seemed correct. It is a gamble, but with favorable odds."
    char_howl "是的。所以我们把全部力量都赐予了先知。\n足以挥舞那把剑，对抗你们的创造者，我们的囚禁者。\n时机似乎正好。这是一场赌博，但胜算有利。"

# game/script.rpy:72551
translate chinese map141_0f2465c0:

    # voice "se/z01388.ogg"
    voice "se/z01388.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:72553
translate chinese map141_d92f8b17:

    # char_howl "However, there is another matter at hand. There is no more Spirit Realm.\nThe idols are all gone, and the power resides within us, and that blade.\nThe power within you, [firstname], is immense. You carry on our legacy."
    char_howl "不过，还有另一件事。灵界已经不存在了。\n灵像全都消失了，而力量寄居在我们体内，以及那把剑之中。\n你体内的力量，[firstname]，无比庞大。你承载着我们的传承。"

# game/script.rpy:72558
translate chinese map141_a1ec9b9f:

    # voice "se/z01389.ogg"
    voice "se/z01389.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:72560
translate chinese map141_d92f8b17_1:

    # char_howl "However, there is another matter at hand. There is no more Spirit Realm.\nThe idols are all gone, and the power resides within us, and that blade.\nThe power within you, [firstname], is immense. You carry on our legacy."
    char_howl "不过，还有另一件事。灵界已经不存在了。\n灵像全都消失了，而力量寄居在我们体内，以及那把剑之中。\n你体内的力量，[firstname]，无比庞大。你承载着我们的传承。"

# game/script.rpy:72564
translate chinese map141_457859cf:

    # voice "se/z01390.ogg"
    voice "se/z01390.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:72566
translate chinese map141_4a528501:

    # char_howl "So now, I will call you what you are."
    char_howl "所以现在，我要以你真正的身份称呼你。"

# game/script.rpy:72583
translate chinese map141_c896d175:

    # "He immediately kneels down, and looks at the floor.{w}\nIf I wasn't mistaken, it looks like he's swearing fealty."
    "他立刻跪下，目光垂向地面。{w}\n如果我没看错，他像是在宣誓效忠。"

# game/script.rpy:72600
translate chinese map141_25ccdaae:

    # voice "se/z01391.ogg"
    voice "se/z01391.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:72602
translate chinese map141_a617840c:

    # char_howl "Rightful heir to the throne of The Monarchy. My King.\nI will serve you in this fight to take back our world.\nAnd together, we will {i}all{/i} be free from their grip."
    char_howl "王室王位的合法继承人。我的国王。\n在这场夺回我们世界的战斗中，我将为你效力。\n我们将{i}一同{/i}摆脱他们的掌控，重获自由。"

# game/script.rpy:72607
translate chinese map141_2ccc778d:

    # voice "se/z01392.ogg"
    voice "se/z01392.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:72609
translate chinese map141_ba6f87c4:

    # char_howl "Rightful heir to the throne of The Monarchy. My Queen.\nI will serve you in this fight to take back our world.\nAnd together, we will {i}all{/i} be free from their grip."
    char_howl "王室王位的合法继承人。我的女王。\n在这场夺回我们世界的战斗中，我将为你效力。\n我们将{i}一同{/i}摆脱他们的掌控，重获自由。"

# game/script.rpy:72636
translate chinese map141_8275a65b:

    # voice "se/z01393.ogg"
    voice "se/z01393.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:72638
translate chinese map141_814cab28:

    # char_damek "King...?"
    char_damek "国王……？"

# game/script.rpy:72643
translate chinese map141_aed9d585:

    # voice "se/z01394.ogg"
    voice "se/z01394.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:72645
translate chinese map141_c150cb9d:

    # char_damek "Queen...?"
    char_damek "女王……？"

# game/script.rpy:72661
translate chinese map141_b8e4d912:

    # "We exchange glances, confused and shocked.{w}\nThe power inside of me made me heir to the throne?{w}\nKnowing the truth of the spirits was enough. But this...?"
    "我们交换了眼神，既困惑又震惊。{w}\n我体内的力量让我成了王位的继承人？{w}\n知道灵的真相已经够惊人了。可这……？"

# game/script.rpy:72663
translate chinese map141_b32f94a6:

    # "This is too much.{w}\nI take a few steps back, overwhelmed.{w}\nHow could I possibly be expected to process this?"
    "这太过了。{w}\n我后退了几步，不知所措。{w}\n我怎么可能被指望消化这一切？"

# game/script.rpy:72678
translate chinese map141_7b736e4b:

    # voice "se/z01395.ogg"
    # char_damek "Maybe we should slow down, here..."
    voice "se/z01395.ogg"
    char_damek "也许我们应该慢一点……"

# game/script.rpy:72704
translate chinese map141_ee858513:

    # voice "se/z01396.ogg"
    # char_howl "We must not. To slow down would be giving them time.\nThey've had enough. We've watched for far too long.\nThe weight of our kind is upon you. Do not let us down."
    voice "se/z01396.ogg"
    char_howl "绝不能慢。放慢就是给他们时间。\n他们已经得逞太久了。我们旁观得太久了。\n我们族群的重担落在你身上。别让我们失望。"

# game/script.rpy:72722
translate chinese map141_8aec8564:

    # "Before I can even react, I hear a sound from the other side of the room.{w}\nThe rubble that blocked the exit started to crumble, and fall to the ground.{w}\nI can hear the harsh impact of a pickaxe. They've found us...!"
    "我还没来得及反应，就听见房间另一头传来声响。{w}\n堵住出口的碎石开始松动，掉落到地上。{w}\n我能听见镐头沉重的敲击声。他们找到我们了……！"

# game/script.rpy:72727
translate chinese map141_02795d21:

    # "The man remains knelt on the ground. I tell him to rise.{w}\nHe obeys without question, clearly respecting my authority.{w}\nHe considers me his King. I have no idea what to do or say."
    "那人仍跪在地上。我叫他起来。{w}\n他毫不犹豫地服从，显然尊重我的权威。{w}\n他把我当成了他的国王。我完全不知道该做什么、说什么。"

# game/script.rpy:72732
translate chinese map141_e3c57e0c:

    # "The man remains knelt on the ground. I tell him to rise.{w}\nHe obeys without question, clearly respecting my authority.{w}\nHe considers me his Queen. I have no idea what to do or say."
    "那人仍跪在地上。我叫他起来。{w}\n他毫不犹豫地服从，显然尊重我的权威。{w}\n他把我当成了他的女王。我完全不知道该做什么、说什么。"

# game/script.rpy:72758
translate chinese map141_74f0bb15:

    # voice "se/z01397.ogg"
    voice "se/z01397.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:72760
translate chinese map141_c2c283d6:

    # char_howl "As you command."
    char_howl "谨遵您的命令。"

# game/script.rpy:72786
translate chinese map141_f1a6c2ec:

    # "All of us turn and look at the exit.{w}\nIt isn't much longer until light pierces through.{w}\nThe final bit of rubble is out of the way, and Ulric emerges."
    "我们全都转头看向出口。{w}\n没过多久，光线便穿透进来。{w}\n最后一块碎石被移开，乌尔里克出现了。"

# game/script.rpy:72811
translate chinese map141_12aed1e9:

    # voice "se/z01398.ogg"
    voice "se/z01398.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:72813
translate chinese map141_46d58371:

    # char_ulric "Damek...! We were so worried that—"
    char_ulric "达梅克……！我们担心得——"

# game/script.rpy:72827
translate chinese map141_6a7760eb:

    # "He immediately stops in his tracks, staring at us.{w}\nIt's clear that he's shocked at the sight of \"Salus\".{w}\nFortaime, Valessa and Pro enter shortly after."
    "他立刻停下脚步，盯着我们。{w}\n显然，看到“萨鲁斯”让他大为震惊。{w}\n福泰姆、瓦莱莎和普洛随后走了进来。"

# game/script.rpy:72852
translate chinese map141_42bf4bdc:

    # voice "se/z01399.ogg"
    # char_ulric "What...?"
    voice "se/z01399.ogg"
    char_ulric "什么……？"

# game/script.rpy:72867
translate chinese map141_8db8dc8e:

    # "Ulric steps forward, immediately cautious.{w}\nHe looks ready to grab his blade at a moment's notice.{w}\nI can understand how his confusion and shock manifests this way."
    "乌尔里克向前一步，立刻戒备起来。{w}\n他看上去随时准备拔剑。{w}\n我能理解他的困惑与震惊为何会这样表现出来。"

# game/script.rpy:72892
translate chinese map141_c1e73679:

    # voice "se/z01400.ogg"
    voice "se/z01400.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:72894
translate chinese map141_3b9b9fef:

    # char_damek "At ease Ulric, I'll try my best to explain."
    char_damek "放松，乌尔里克，我会尽力解释。"

# game/script.rpy:72908
translate chinese map141_a3a58ed8:

    # "Damek steps forward too, as if to guard both of us."
    "达梅克也上前一步，像是在护着我们两人。"

# game/script.rpy:72933
translate chinese map141_bbcc7f7f:

    # voice "se/z01401.ogg"
    # char_damek "Everybody, let's go back to the atrium.\nThere's much to discuss, and I'll tell you all the truth."
    voice "se/z01401.ogg"
    char_damek "各位，我们回中庭去吧。\n有很多事要谈，我会把真相全都告诉你们。"

# game/script.rpy:72948
translate chinese map141_c05b9f86:

    # "He looks over at the mysterious man, and simply gulps."
    "他看了那个神秘男子一眼，只是咽了口唾沫。"

# game/script.rpy:72963
translate chinese map141_21d715c7:

    # voice "se/z01402.ogg"
    # char_damek "Things just got a lot more complicated — for all of us."
    voice "se/z01402.ogg"
    char_damek "事情一下子变得复杂多了——对我们所有人来说都是。"

# game/script.rpy:73011
translate chinese map142_4757e115:

    # "We all enter the atrium, and I notice Ulric is still visibly shocked and angry.{w}\nPro seems the same, however it's less intense. They seem to recognize \"Salus\".{w}\nEven Valessa and Fortaime seem anxious. Our old, and very dead Elder, alive?"
    "我们全都进了中庭，我注意到乌尔里克仍明显又震惊又愤怒。{w}\n普洛也差不多，但没那么强烈。他们似乎认出了“萨鲁斯”。{w}\n连瓦莱莎和福泰姆也显得不安。我们早已死去的老长老，竟然活着？"

# game/script.rpy:73013
translate chinese map142_7886e7df:

    # "Bodies scatter the floor, as well as pieces of white and gold armor.{w}\nRebels cry, cradling the bodies of their fallen comrades in their arms.{w}\nThere weren't many people left standing. This was a catastrophic attack."
    "尸体散落一地，还有白色和金色的盔甲碎片。{w}\n反抗军们哭着，把倒下战友的尸体抱在怀里。{w}\n还站着的人已经不多。这是一场灾难性的袭击。"

# game/script.rpy:73022
translate chinese map142_10205917:

    # "Damek walks over to a nearby staircase and waves over me and \"Salus\".{w}\nWe follow after him, and slowly ascend the stairs. It was time to tell {i}everybody{/i}.{w}\nWhen we get to the top, he rests his hands on the railing, taking a deep breath."
    "达梅克走向附近的楼梯，招手叫我和“萨鲁斯”过去。{w}\n我们跟着他，缓缓走上楼梯。是时候告诉{i}所有人{/i}了。{w}\n到了顶上，他把双手搭在栏杆上，深吸了一口气。"

# game/script.rpy:73044
translate chinese map142_5bcb7a29:

    # voice "se/z01403.ogg"
    voice "se/z01403.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:73046
translate chinese map142_4ecd3902:

    # char_damek "I guess this is it...\nWhere do I even start?"
    char_damek "我想就是现在了……\n我该从哪儿说起呢？"

# game/script.rpy:73060
translate chinese map142_c162e7ad:

    # "He shakes his head, before clearing his throat. He had a lot of ground to cover.{w}\nThe noise echoes through the atrium, and the surviving rebels turn to look.{w}\nSeeing Damek at the top of the stairs, they gather to listen to their leader."
    "他摇了摇头，清了清喉咙。他要讲的东西太多了。{w}\n那声响在中庭里回荡，幸存的反抗军纷纷转头看来。{w}\n看到达梅克站在楼梯顶端，他们聚拢过来，聆听首领讲话。"

# game/script.rpy:73088
translate chinese map142_9a41f188:

    # voice "se/z01404.ogg"
    # char_damek "They say that mercy is the mark of a great man. \nBut there {i}are{/i} no great men in war. We've seen that here today.\nWar is only a game to see how much you can lose before giving up."
    voice "se/z01404.ogg"
    char_damek "人们说，仁慈是伟人的标志。\n可战争中{i}根本{/i}没有伟人。今天我们在这里已经见识到了。\n战争只是一场游戏，看你在放弃之前能失去多少。"

# game/script.rpy:73102
translate chinese map142_186929e6:

    # voice "se/z01405.ogg"
    # char_damek "But trust me. We will {i}never{/i} give up.\nJoin me Brothers, and Sisters. Grab a blade from the floor.\nEven if it belonged to their Honor Guard — take it. I'd prefer that."
    voice "se/z01405.ogg"
    char_damek "但相信我。我们{i}绝不{/i}放弃。\n加入我吧，兄弟们，姐妹们。从地上捡起一把剑。\n即使那是荣誉卫队的——也拿走。我宁愿如此。"

# game/script.rpy:73106
translate chinese map142_8bb149a6:

    # voice "se/z01406.ogg"
    # char_damek "The Triumvirate may think that they've crippled our resolve — but no.\nEach swing of that blade will carry the weight of our fallen comrades behind it.\nWe will use that weight to {i}crush{/i} their army, and make them pay for this attack."
    voice "se/z01406.ogg"
    char_damek "三人执政团也许以为他们摧毁了我们的决心——但并非如此。\n那把剑每一次挥动，都将承载着倒下战友的重量。\n我们要用这份重量{i}碾碎{/i}他们的军队，让他们为这次袭击付出代价。"

# game/script.rpy:73121
translate chinese map142_831b4cf5:

    # "More rebels start to crowd around, looking up at Damek.{w}\nThey have smiles on their faces, as they nod along to his words.{w}\nThis inspires him to continue his speech, his morale rising quickly."
    "更多反抗军聚拢过来，仰头望着达梅克。{w}\n他们面带微笑，一边点头一边听着他的话。{w}\n这鼓舞他继续讲下去，士气迅速高涨。"

# game/script.rpy:73146
translate chinese map142_a0161ac1:

    # voice "se/z01407.ogg"
    # char_damek "When The Triumvirate looks down on that blade in their final moments?\nI want them to know that they sealed their own fate. Mark my words, family.\nThe Triumvirate shall fall. They will {i}burn{/i} for what they've done here today."
    voice "se/z01407.ogg"
    char_damek "当三人执政团在生命最后时刻低头看着那把剑时？\n我要让他们知道，是他们自己注定了自己的命运。记住我的话，同胞们。\n三人执政团必将覆灭。他们会为今天在这里犯下的一切而被烈焰{i}焚尽{/i}。"

# game/script.rpy:73160
translate chinese map142_5b82ceb7:

    # voice "se/z01408.ogg"
    # char_damek "And in the end? They will {i}beg{/i} for the mercy they were too unkind to give to us.\nWe will free this world from their grip, and deliver it to the hands of the righteous.\nOur dynasty will be marked with blood, yes, but theirs was marked with far more."
    voice "se/z01408.ogg"
    char_damek "而到最后呢？他们会{i}乞求{/i}我们施予他们当年狠心不肯给我们的仁慈。\n我们要把这个世界从他们的掌控中解放出来，交到正义者手中。\n我们的王朝将以血为印记，没错，但他们的血印要深得多。"

# game/script.rpy:73175
translate chinese map142_86d97c1a:

    # "He looks over at \"Salus\", and motions for him to step forward.{w}\nDoing so, a lot of the rebels look shocked, much like Ulric and Pro."
    "他看向“萨鲁斯”，示意他上前一步。{w}\n他照做了，许多反抗军都露出震惊的神情，乌尔里克和普洛也一样。"

# game/script.rpy:73200
translate chinese map142_1e7af902:

    # voice "se/z01409.ogg"
    # char_damek "The Spirit Realm has given us one final blessing. The truth.\nStanding here before you is {i}not{/i} Salus. He has become a vessel.\nThis is The Spirit Realm embodied. Powered by our underground idol."
    voice "se/z01409.ogg"
    char_damek "灵界给了我们最后的恩赐。真相。\n站在你们面前的{i}不是{/i}萨鲁斯。他已成了一具容器。\n这就是灵界的化身。由我们地下的灵像供给力量。"

# game/script.rpy:73204
translate chinese map142_c8198ed8:

    # voice "se/z01410.ogg"
    # char_damek "Driven by the howls of countless spirits, he seeks vengeance.\nBut he has also brought with him the answers to our every question.\nNo longer, shall we live in the dark. We know the {i}true{/i} nature of things."
    voice "se/z01410.ogg"
    char_damek "被无数灵体的呼号所驱动，他寻求复仇。\n但他也带来了我们所有疑问的答案。\n我们再也不会生活在黑暗之中。我们知道了事物的{i}真正{/i}本质。"

# game/script.rpy:73219
translate chinese map142_ac60aba4:

    # "Everyone mumbles amongst themselves, clearly confused.{w}\nI glance over at Ulric and Pro, and they seem a bit more calm.{w}\nAs odd as this truth was, they seemed to trust Damek no matter what."
    "众人议论纷纷，显然一头雾水。{w}\n我瞥了一眼乌尔里克和普洛，他们似乎平静了一些。{w}\n无论这个真相多么离奇，他们似乎无论如何都信任达梅克。"

# game/script.rpy:73244
translate chinese map142_dfbe3c86:

    # voice "se/z01411.ogg"
    # char_damek "We are not the only victims of The Triumvirate's wrath.\nThe Spirit Realm is not what we believed. Not at all.\nWhat we cherished, and worshipped — was a prison."
    voice "se/z01411.ogg"
    char_damek "我们并非三人执政团暴怒之下唯一的受害者。\n灵界并非我们所信奉的那样。完全不是。\n我们所珍视、所崇拜的——是一座监狱。"

# game/script.rpy:73248
translate chinese map142_0e2594e4:

    # voice "se/z01412.ogg"
    # char_damek "A prison to house the previous residents of Alestia.\nResidents that were deemed too corrupt by The Triumvirate.\nAs they were pushed aside, {i}we{/i} were created to serve."
    voice "se/z01412.ogg"
    char_damek "一座关押阿莱斯蒂亚昔日居民的监狱。\n那些被三人执政团判定为过于堕落的居民。\n他们被排挤之后，{i}我们{/i}被创造出来服侍。"

# game/script.rpy:73262
translate chinese map142_b3b0c884:

    # voice "se/z01413.ogg"
    # char_damek "The Triumvirate did not create our world.\nBut they did create {i}us{/i}, in the image of perfection.\nWe were pure, and existed only to follow their every order."
    voice "se/z01413.ogg"
    char_damek "这个世界不是三人执政团创造的。\n但{i}我们{/i}确实是他们创造的，照着完美的模样。\n我们纯净无瑕，存在的意义只是服从他们的每一条命令。"

# game/script.rpy:73266
translate chinese map142_c9729b0b:

    # voice "se/z01414.ogg"
    # char_damek "But over time, the previous residents reached out from their prison.\nGrowing in strength, they created what we called the Spirit Idols.\nThese were used to slowly give our people the gift of free will."
    voice "se/z01414.ogg"
    char_damek "但随着时间推移，昔日的居民从他们的监狱中向外伸出手。\n力量日渐壮大，他们创造出了我们称之为灵像的东西。\n这些被用来慢慢赐予我们的人民自由意志这份礼物。"

# game/script.rpy:73280
translate chinese map142_08635058:

    # voice "se/z01415.ogg"
    # char_damek "Though pure, we lacked the ability to be ourselves.\nThis was the greatest gift we could've ever asked for.\nThey opened our eyes, allowing us to fight back."
    voice "se/z01415.ogg"
    char_damek "尽管纯净，我们却无法做自己。\n这是我们能有幸得到的最珍贵的礼物。\n他们打开了我们的眼睛，让我们得以反击。"

# game/script.rpy:73286
translate chinese map142_1edad200:

    # voice "se/z01417.ogg"
    voice "se/z01417.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:73288
translate chinese map142_a6046f57:

    # char_damek "But so far, every insurrection has failed.\nThat is what we will change, thanks to [firstname]."
    char_damek "但迄今为止，每一次起义都失败了。\n而这一点，我们将因[firstname]而改变。"

# game/script.rpy:73293
translate chinese map142_bcfef647:

    # voice "se/z01416.ogg"
    voice "se/z01416.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:73295
translate chinese map142_a6046f57_1:

    # char_damek "But so far, every insurrection has failed.\nThat is what we will change, thanks to [firstname]."
    char_damek "但迄今为止，每一次起义都失败了。\n而这一点，我们将因[firstname]而改变。"

# game/script.rpy:73311
translate chinese map142_f7d5904a:

    # "He waves me over, and I take a few steps forward.{w}\nThe Rebels stare at me, with hope in their eyes.{w}\nA perfect counter to the despair I saw earlier."
    "他招手叫我过去，我向前走了几步。{w}\n反抗军们盯着我，眼中带着希望。{w}\n与我先前看到的绝望形成了完美的对照。"

# game/script.rpy:73336
translate chinese map142_d44d7ea9:

    # voice "se/z01418.ogg"
    # char_damek "You see, the Spirit Realm is no more. \nAll of the energy in that realm has found a new home.\nSome of it is in this vessel, and some of it is in the blade."
    voice "se/z01418.ogg"
    char_damek "你看，灵界已经不存在了。\n那界域中所有的能量都找到了新的归宿。\n有些在这具容器里，有些在那把剑里。"

# game/script.rpy:73352
translate chinese map142_625fb9bb:

    # voice "se/z01419.ogg"
    voice "se/z01419.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:73354
translate chinese map142_569a4d4c:

    # char_damek "But the largest portion resides within [firstname].\nThis is why {i}he{/i} is uniquely capable of wielding the blade.\nAlestia's previous residents, the ancient Monarchy, are responsible."
    char_damek "但最大的一部分寄居在[firstname]体内。\n这就是为什么{i}他{/i}独一无二地能够挥舞那把剑。\n阿莱斯蒂亚昔日的居民，古老的王室，就是这一切的缘由。"

# game/script.rpy:73359
translate chinese map142_fd014e71:

    # voice "se/z01420.ogg"
    voice "se/z01420.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:73361
translate chinese map142_569a4d4c_1:

    # char_damek "But the largest portion resides within [firstname].\nThis is why {i}he{/i} is uniquely capable of wielding the blade.\nAlestia's previous residents, the ancient Monarchy, are responsible."
    char_damek "但最大的一部分寄居在[firstname]体内。\n这就是为什么{i}他{/i}独一无二地能够挥舞那把剑。\n阿莱斯蒂亚昔日的居民，古老的王室，就是这一切的缘由。"

# game/script.rpy:73365
translate chinese map142_c8cb87ab:

    # voice "se/z01421.ogg"
    voice "se/z01421.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:73367
translate chinese map142_01c88e47:

    # char_damek "They saw a way to help us defeat The Triumvirate, and took it.\nBut you see — we no longer fight for ourselves. We fight for {i}everybody{/i}.\nIf we lose? Both us, and the Monarchy perish. We cannot let this happen."
    char_damek "他们看到了帮助我们击败三人执政团的办法，便抓住了它。\n但你看——我们不再为自己而战。我们为{i}所有人{/i}而战。\n如果我们输了？我们和王室都将覆灭。我们绝不能让这种事情发生。"

# game/script.rpy:73370
translate chinese map142_a3543c28:

    # voice "se/z01422.ogg"
    # char_damek "We are the only people capable of carrying out this objective.\nThere won't be another chance. No more Seers, no more blades.\nWe will show them that their vision of a {i}pure{/i} world is flawed."
    voice "se/z01422.ogg"
    char_damek "我们是唯一有能力完成这个目标的人。\n不会再有第二次机会。没有更多先知，没有更多剑。\n我们要让他们看到，他们那个{i}纯净{/i}世界的构想是有缺陷的。"

# game/script.rpy:73384
translate chinese map142_6fb6ce4c:

    # voice "se/z01423.ogg"
    # char_damek "But in order to do so, I must step down as the General.\nYou see, this army is no longer mine to lead. I'm sorry.\nThis new truth changes both the world, and our cause."
    voice "se/z01423.ogg"
    char_damek "但为了做到这一点，我必须卸下将军之职。\n你看，这支军队不再是由我来统领。对不起。\n这个新的真相改变了这个世界，也改变了我们的事业。"

# game/script.rpy:73399
translate chinese map142_f434a45c:

    # "Damek motions for me to come closer, so I do. He smiles.{w}\nI'm standing right beside him, resting my hands on the bannister.{w}\nI see such a wide array of emotions coming from the rebel's faces."
    "达梅克招手让我走近些，我便走上前去。他笑了。{w}\n我站在他身旁，双手搭在栏杆上。{w}\n我看见反抗军们的脸上流露出的情绪纷繁复杂。"

# game/script.rpy:73426
translate chinese map142_3f077551:

    # voice "se/z01424.ogg"
    voice "se/z01424.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:73428
translate chinese map142_9579f39f:

    # char_damek "As I mentioned, [firstname] was blessed with immense power.\nBut what he truly has within, is the souls of the Monarchy.\nGiving him the strength to use that blade — he is our champion."
    char_damek "如我所说，[firstname]被赐予了庞大的力量。\n但他体内真正拥有的，是王室的灵魂。\n给予他挥舞那把剑的力量——他就是我们的斗士。"

# game/script.rpy:73441
translate chinese map142_0c3baebd:

    # voice "se/z01425.ogg"
    # char_damek "But he is more than just our champion. He is our King.\nRightful heir to the throne of Alestia. Our true ruler.\nBy decree of the spirits, we are his to command."
    voice "se/z01425.ogg"
    char_damek "但他不只是我们的斗士。他是我们的国王。\n阿莱斯蒂亚王位的合法继承人。我们真正的统治者。\n依灵的旨意，我们听候他的差遣。"

# game/script.rpy:73447
translate chinese map142_9764e669:

    # voice "se/z01426.ogg"
    voice "se/z01426.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:73449
translate chinese map142_921c8af0:

    # char_damek "As I mentioned, [firstname] was blessed with immense power.\nBut what she truly has within, is the souls of the Monarchy. \nGiving her the strength to use that blade — she is our champion."
    char_damek "如我所说，[firstname]被赐予了庞大的力量。\n但她体内真正拥有的，是王室的灵魂。\n给予她挥舞那把剑的力量——她就是我们的斗士。"

# game/script.rpy:73462
translate chinese map142_441196ad:

    # voice "se/z01427.ogg"
    # char_damek "But she is more than just our champion. She is our Queen.\nRightful heir to the throne of Alestia. Our true ruler.\nBy decree of the spirits, we are hers to command."
    voice "se/z01427.ogg"
    char_damek "但她不只是我们的斗士。她是我们的女王。\n阿莱斯蒂亚王位的合法继承人。我们真正的统治者。\n依灵的旨意，我们听候她的差遣。"

# game/script.rpy:73479
translate chinese map142_ad742eac:

    # "All eyes are on me, now. I glance over at Valessa and Fortaime.{w}\nThey are in complete shock and awe at this revelation. But I am, too.{w}\nWithout saying anything, I reach back for the blade, and pull it out."
    "所有的目光现在都落在我身上。我瞥了一眼瓦莱莎和福泰姆。{w}\n他们对这个揭示震惊又敬畏。但我也是。{w}\n一言不发，我伸手向后取出那把剑，把它拔了出来。"

# game/script.rpy:73481
translate chinese map142_65ba4398:

    # "I look at the rebels, and hold the blade up in the air.{w}\nThe beams of light from the surface serve to illuminate its beauty.{w}\nThis elicits rigorous applause from the rebels, as they cheer me on."
    "我看向反抗军们，把剑高举在空中。{w}\n从地面透下的光束照亮了它的华美。{w}\n这引来了反抗军们热烈的掌声，他们为我欢呼。"

# game/script.rpy:73490
translate chinese map142_f924d23b:

    # "I smile, looking down at my friends, and comrades.{w}\nIn this moment, it seems like the hope we lost had finally returned.{w}\nThere was still lots to take care of, but we knew that this wasn't over."
    "我微笑着，俯视着我的朋友们和战友们。{w}\n这一刻，仿佛我们失去的希望终于回来了。{w}\n还有很多事要处理，但我们知道这件事还没有结束。"

# game/script.rpy:73515
translate chinese map142_a53c69e0:

    # voice "se/z01428.ogg"
    # char_damek "If you'll excuse us, we need to make some new plans.\nBut I'll have an itinerary posted in the barracks by morning.\nUntil then, please do your best to clean up this atrium."
    voice "se/z01428.ogg"
    char_damek "失陪一下，我们需要制定一些新计划。\n但我会在早上把日程安排贴在营房里。\n在那之前，请尽力把这个中庭清理干净。"

# game/script.rpy:73529
translate chinese map142_0d6b1dff:

    # voice "se/z01429.ogg"
    # char_damek "And please, bring the bodies down to the spirit idol.\nIt seems only fitting, and there's plenty of room. \nWith that said, you're all dismissed. Thank you."
    voice "se/z01429.ogg"
    char_damek "还有，请把尸体搬到灵像那儿去。\n那样似乎才合适，而且那里空间很大。\n就这样，你们都可以解散了。谢谢。"

# game/script.rpy:73547
translate chinese map142_db8bdc32:

    # "Damek turns to face me and \"Salus\".\nHe smiles, realizing his job is done."
    "达梅克转身面向我和“萨鲁斯”。\n他笑了笑，意识到自己的工作已经完成。"

# game/script.rpy:73572
translate chinese map142_4fc8534f:

    # voice "se/z01430.ogg"
    # char_damek "Well then, back to the War Table?\nWe need to talk about our next step.\nWithout a bigger army, we won't win."
    voice "se/z01430.ogg"
    char_damek "那么，回作战桌那边去吧？\n我们需要谈谈下一步。\n没有更庞大的军队，我们赢不了。"

# game/script.rpy:73576
translate chinese map142_fde594a1:

    # voice "se/z01431.ogg"
    # char_damek "And I think I know what to do.\nCome on, bring your friends, too.\nI'll grab Ulric and Pro. Let's do this."
    voice "se/z01431.ogg"
    char_damek "我想我知道该怎么做。\n来吧，把你的朋友们也带上。\n我去叫乌尔里克和普洛。我们动手吧。"

# game/script.rpy:73598
translate chinese map142_63cfb45e:

    # "Something seems different about Damek.{w}\nHe's not as happy and energetic as he was before.{w}\nBut he seems a lot more confident and resolute."
    "达梅克看起来有些不一样了。{w}\n他不像以前那样快乐、充满活力。{w}\n但他似乎自信和坚定多了。"

# game/script.rpy:73600
translate chinese map142_feba391e:

    # "When I get to the bottom of the stairs, Valessa and Fortaime appear.{w}\nI can tell that they're overwhelmed, but they also seem happy for me.{w}\nThey seem to disregard the resurrection of Salus, and focus on me."
    "我走到楼梯底下时，瓦莱莎和福泰姆出现了。{w}\n我看得出他们不知所措，但也为我感到高兴。{w}\n他们似乎不再理会萨鲁斯的复活，而是把注意力放在我身上。"

# game/script.rpy:73626
translate chinese map142_83bd9af0:

    # voice "se/z01432.ogg"
    voice "se/z01432.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:73628
translate chinese map142_4d70b371:

    # char_valessa "I always knew you were special, but a King?\nAnd no more Spirit Realm? What's going to happen?"
    char_valessa "我一直都知道你很特别，可你竟然是国王？\n而且灵界也不存在了？接下来会发生什么？"

# game/script.rpy:73633
translate chinese map142_d24a395d:

    # voice "se/z01433.ogg"
    voice "se/z01433.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:73635
translate chinese map142_27ea5032:

    # char_valessa "I always knew you were special, but a Queen?\nAnd no more Spirit Realm? What's going to happen?"
    char_valessa "我一直都知道你很特别，可你竟然是女王？\n而且灵界也不存在了？接下来会发生什么？"

# game/script.rpy:73661
translate chinese map142_130bcc1a:

    # voice "se/z01434.ogg"
    voice "se/z01434.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:73663
translate chinese map142_2245c30e:

    # char_fortaime "That is so cool, [firstname]!\nOr — I guess I should call you King, now.\nOr maybe Monarch? I don't know, it's just cool!"
    char_fortaime "那也太酷了，[firstname]！\n或者——我想我现在该称呼你国王了。\n还是该叫君主？我不知道，反正就是很酷！"

# game/script.rpy:73668
translate chinese map142_eca20321:

    # voice "se/z01435.ogg"
    voice "se/z01435.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:73670
translate chinese map142_d08a7e4c:

    # char_fortaime "That is so cool, [firstname]!\nOr — I guess I should call you Queen, now.\nOr maybe Monarch? I don't know, it's just cool!"
    char_fortaime "那也太酷了，[firstname]！\n或者——我想我现在该称呼你女王了。\n还是该叫君主？我不知道，反正就是很酷！"

# game/script.rpy:73686
translate chinese map142_b4a864c5:

    # "He laughs, and shuffles in place awkwardly.{w}\nThey may not want to talk about it — but they know.{w}\nEverything feels \"off\" right now. Things are so confusing."
    "他笑着，尴尬地挪了挪身子。{w}\n他们也许不想谈这件事——但他们心里清楚。{w}\n此刻一切都显得“不对劲”。事情太让人困惑了。"

# game/script.rpy:73711
translate chinese map142_91442002:

    # voice "se/z01436.ogg"
    # char_valessa "I hope that we can work all of this out.\nLet's go plan our next move with Damek.\nI wonder what he has in mind for us."
    voice "se/z01436.ogg"
    char_valessa "我希望我们能把这一切都解决。\n我们去和达梅克商量下一步吧。\n我很好奇他为我们都想了些什么。"

# game/script.rpy:73737
translate chinese map142_2826c180:

    # voice "se/z01437.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "I bet it's something amazing.\nHe might not be the leader, but he's still a strategist.\nWe need to make sure that we come back from this loss."
    voice "se/z01437.ogg"
    char_fortaime "我打赌是些了不起的事。\n他也许不再是领袖了，但他仍是个战略家。\n我们得确保自己能从这次损失中恢复过来。"

# game/script.rpy:73752
translate chinese map142_85a58bbd:

    # "Valessa looks at all of the bodies on the atrium floor.{w}\nIt's also covered in blood, likely to stain for a long time.{w}\nIf Salus could come back from the dead — then what about them?"
    "瓦莱莎看着中庭地板上遍地的尸体。{w}\n地板也沾满鲜血，恐怕会留下很久的痕迹。{w}\n如果萨鲁斯都能死而复生——那他们呢？"

# game/script.rpy:73780
translate chinese map142_6cdf088b:

    # voice "se/z01438.ogg"
    # char_valessa "Yeah. We can't let their deaths be in vain.\nLike Damek said — they need to give us strength.\nThe only thing we can do is hope that it's enough."
    voice "se/z01438.ogg"
    char_valessa "是啊。我们不能让他们的死白白浪费。\n就像达梅克说的——他们需要给予我们力量。\n我们唯一能做的，就是希望这力量足够。"

# game/script.rpy:73828
translate chinese map143_a1aa82d6:

    # "We all arrive back at the War Table, taking sighs of relief.{w}\nDamek's speech was great. It helped the Rebels find hope again.{w}\nBut they'd need more than words to win the upcoming battle."
    "我们都回到了作战桌旁，纷纷松了口气。{w}\n达梅克的演讲很精彩。它帮反抗军重新找回了希望。{w}\n但要赢下即将到来的战斗，他们需要的远不止言语。"

# game/script.rpy:73853
translate chinese map143_88e72dd9:

    # voice "se/z01439.ogg"
    voice "se/z01439.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:73855
translate chinese map143_6dec76df:

    # char_damek "So — we need to find a new army.\nBut recruiting Mazeans would take far too long.\nWe need to take drastic measures, and fast."
    char_damek "那么——我们需要找一支新的军队。\n但招募马泽奥人耗时太久了。\n我们需要采取非常手段，而且要快。"

# game/script.rpy:73868
translate chinese map143_fad2ec97:

    # voice "se/z01440.ogg"
    # char_damek "This is where my initial plan comes into play.\nWe can use that spiritual energy to create Seers.\nThey could see the outcome of every battle. Every attack."
    voice "se/z01440.ogg"
    char_damek "这就是我最初的计划派上用场的地方。\n我们可以用那股灵性能量来创造先知。\n他们能看见每一场战斗的结果。每一次攻击。"

# game/script.rpy:73892
translate chinese map143_5b45eddd:

    # voice "se/z01441.ogg"
    voice "se/z01441.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:73894
translate chinese map143_26db7008:

    # char_ulric "That doesn't make any sense, Damek.\nVisions lied to [firstname]. Led us into a trap.\nThe Triumvirate could just do that all over again."
    char_ulric "这说不通，达梅克。\n幻象骗了[firstname]。把我们引进了陷阱。\n三人执政团随时可以故技重施。"

# game/script.rpy:73899
