# game/script.rpy:73917
translate chinese map143_adc3a68f:

    # "I notice he uses my new title. It still feels odd."
    "我注意到他用了我新的头衔。感觉仍旧古怪。"

# game/script.rpy:73942
translate chinese map143_5fe9d916:

    # voice "se/z01443.ogg"
    # char_damek "I'm not sure that's how it works...\nBeforehand, the visions came from their \"prison\".\nThat means The Triumvirate could tamper with the outflow."
    voice "se/z01443.ogg"
    char_damek "我不确定是不是那样运作的……\n在此之前，幻象来自他们的“监狱”。\n这意味着三人执政团能篡改外泄的部分。"

# game/script.rpy:73948
translate chinese map143_19a3a4ca:

    # voice "se/z01444.ogg"
    voice "se/z01444.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:73950
