    # char_damek "But now? All of that is in the hands of [firstname].\nThere's nothing getting in the way, see what I mean?\nThe power of the spirit realm is now ours to wield, Ulric."
    char_damek "但现在呢？这一切都掌握在[firstname]手中。\n没有任何东西挡在中间，明白我的意思吗？\n灵界的力量现在由我们掌控了，乌尔里克。"

# game/script.rpy:73955
