    # voice "se/z01446.ogg"
    voice "se/z01446.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:73985
translate chinese map143_f4286db9:

    # char_ulric "This still doesn't make any sense.\nThe Spirit Realm isn't what we thought it was, Damek.\nIt was just a prison. How can that help us tell the future?"
    char_ulric "这仍然说不通。\n灵界不是我们以为的那样，达梅克。\n那不过是一座监狱。它怎么可能帮我们预知未来？"

# game/script.rpy:74006
translate chinese map143_1c017126:

    # "Before Damek can respond, \"Salus\" steps forward."
    "达梅克还没回答，“萨鲁斯”就上前一步。"

# game/script.rpy:74031
translate chinese map143_ad837a2d:

    # voice "se/z01447.ogg"
    voice "se/z01447.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:74033
translate chinese map143_4dfaf115:

    # char_howl "That was our culture. We all had this ability.\nIt is how the Monarchy lived in peace and prosperity.\nThere was no danger left unchecked. No \"chance\"."
    char_howl "那是我们的文化。我们全都拥有这种能力。\n王室正是借此和平繁荣地生活。\n没有任何危险被放过。没有“偶然”。"

# game/script.rpy:74046
translate chinese map143_fe2bfed9:

    # voice "se/z01448.ogg"
    # char_howl "The world was being guided to the one true future.\nIt is not unlike the concept of \"fate\" that some believe in.\nBut it is tangible. We knew where we were going — always."
    voice "se/z01448.ogg"
    char_howl "这个世界被引导向唯一真正的未来。\n这和有些人所信奉的“命运”概念并无不同。\n但它是可触摸的。我们始终知道我们要去哪里。"

# game/script.rpy:74060
translate chinese map143_6c35144d:

    # voice "se/z01449.ogg"
    # char_howl "That is why The Triumvirate was such a shock to us.\nAn unknown variable in a future we completely mapped out.\nIt was too late to adapt. We were already shackled."
    voice "se/z01449.ogg"
    char_howl "这就是为什么三人执政团对我们来说如此震撼。\n在我们完全绘制出的未来中，出现了一个未知变量。\n我们已来不及应变。我们早已被套上枷锁。"

# game/script.rpy:74064
translate chinese map143_b3dbf23b:

    # voice "se/z01450.ogg"
    # char_howl "We slowly learned to lend our foresight to your world.\nHowever, we were only strong enough to help one individual.\nThis is the concept you have learned to call The Seer or Seeress."
    voice "se/z01450.ogg"
    char_howl "我们慢慢学会了将预见借给你们的世间。\n然而，我们的力量只够帮助一个人。\n这就是你们学会称之为先知的概念。"

# game/script.rpy:74080
translate chinese map143_1b840e6a:

    # voice "se/z01451.ogg"
    voice "se/z01451.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:74082
translate chinese map143_c439a856:

    # char_howl "Damek's theory is sound. There is no longer any interference.\nThe source of this power is now [firstname], rather than a prison.\nHe can freely give this power to any individual he pleases."
    char_howl "达梅克的理论是成立的。再也不会有任何干扰。\n这股力量的源头现在是[firstname]，而不是一座监狱。\n他可以随意把这力量赐予任何他愿意的人。"

# game/script.rpy:74087
translate chinese map143_672266bb:

    # voice "se/z01452.ogg"
    voice "se/z01452.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:74089
translate chinese map143_c53aa97d:

    # char_howl "Damek's theory is sound. There is no longer any interference.\nThe source of this power is now [firstname], rather than a prison.\nShe can freely give this power to any individual she pleases."
    char_howl "达梅克的理论是成立的。再也不会有任何干扰。\n这股力量的源头现在是[firstname]，而不是一座监狱。\n她可以随意把这力量赐予任何她愿意的人。"

# game/script.rpy:74119
translate chinese map143_178416f9:

    # voice "se/z01453.ogg"
    voice "se/z01453.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:74121
translate chinese map143_8ffc8d7e:

    # char_damek "Can he give it to himself?"
    char_damek "他能把这力量给自己吗？"

# game/script.rpy:74126
translate chinese map143_2ceb2b22:

    # voice "se/z01454.ogg"
    voice "se/z01454.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:74128
translate chinese map143_67add713:

    # char_damek "Can she give it to herself?"
    char_damek "她能把这力量给自己吗？"

# game/script.rpy:74155
translate chinese map143_3aa838d5:

    # voice "se/z01455.ogg"
    voice "se/z01455.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:74157
translate chinese map143_6a7f2aab:

    # char_howl "We would not recommend this course of action.\nEvery vision he induces would reduce his overall strength.\nIt would whittle away at the Monarchy, slowly killing us all."
    char_howl "我们不建议这样做。\n他每引发一次幻象，都会削减他自身的力量。\n这会一点点磨损王室，慢慢把我们全部杀死。"

# game/script.rpy:74160
translate chinese map143_601d27a0:

    # voice "se/z01456.ogg"
    # char_howl "Furthermore, he does not know how to ration this power.\nHe could end up expending almost all of it with a single vision.\nWe would recommend giving a small portion of power to others."
    voice "se/z01456.ogg"
    char_howl "此外，他不知道如何节制地使用这股力量。\n他可能会在一次幻象中就把几乎全部力量耗尽。\n我们建议把一小部分力量赐予他人。"

# game/script.rpy:74166
translate chinese map143_afd7ee7d:

    # voice "se/z01457.ogg"
    voice "se/z01457.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:74168
translate chinese map143_4930ef38:

    # char_howl "We would not recommend this course of action.\nEvery vision she induces would reduce her overall strength.\nIt would whittle away at the Monarchy, slowly killing us all."
    char_howl "我们不建议这样做。\n她每引发一次幻象，都会削减她自身的力量。\n这会一点点磨损王室，慢慢把我们全部杀死。"

# game/script.rpy:74171
translate chinese map143_34637564:

    # voice "se/z01458.ogg"
    # char_howl "Furthermore, she does not know how to ration this power.\nShe could end up expending almost all of it with a single vision.\nWe would recommend giving a small portion of power to others."
    voice "se/z01458.ogg"
    char_howl "此外，她不知道如何节制地使用这股力量。\n她可能会在一次幻象中就把几乎全部力量耗尽。\n我们建议把一小部分力量赐予他人。"

# game/script.rpy:74179
translate chinese map143_67f5744c:

    # voice "se/z01459.ogg"
    voice "se/z01459.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:74181
translate chinese map143_81609656:

    # char_howl "However, they would be rendered useless after this war.\nUsing this power would be too much for their mind."
    char_howl "然而，这场战争之后，他们都会变成废人。\n使用这股力量，对他们的心智来说负担太重。"

# game/script.rpy:74206
translate chinese map143_6ec200da:

    # voice "se/z01460.ogg"
    # char_damek "Useless...?"
    voice "se/z01460.ogg"
    char_damek "废人……？"

# game/script.rpy:74232
translate chinese map143_a0ad3c03:

    # voice "se/z01461.ogg"
    # char_howl "They would be unable to think for themselves. Or at all.\nThe King could only do this because he grew up with that power.\nJust like our culture. To receive it too late can wreak havoc on the mind."
    voice "se/z01461.ogg"
    char_howl "他们将无法为自己思考。甚至根本无法思考。\n国王之所以能做到，是因为他自小与那股力量一同成长。\n就像我们的文化一样。太晚获得它，会对心智造成严重破坏。"

# game/script.rpy:74258
translate chinese map143_a57d67b9:

    # voice "se/z01462.ogg"
    # char_damek "So they'd just sit around until they died...?"
    voice "se/z01462.ogg"
    char_damek "那他们就只能干坐着，直到死去……？"

# game/script.rpy:74274
translate chinese map143_74490d06:

    # voice "se/z01463.ogg"
    # char_howl "Unless you fed them."
    voice "se/z01463.ogg"
    char_howl "除非你喂他们。"

# game/script.rpy:74288
translate chinese map143_c184d6d6:

    # voice "se/z01464.ogg"
    # char_ulric "There must be another way. Just look in front of you.\nThat energy could be used to bring back the forces we lost.\nWe could create more vessels for the Monarchy. More soldiers."
    voice "se/z01464.ogg"
    char_ulric "一定有别的办法。看看你眼前的东西。\n那股能量可以用来复活我们失去的部队。\n我们可以为王室创造更多的容器。更多的士兵。"

# game/script.rpy:74303
translate chinese map143_dbd3c396:

    # "Ulric was right. There was more than one choice here.{w}\nIt wouldn't be right to condemn our people to a zombie-like existence.{w}\nIf their minds died out after the war, they'd have no victory to enjoy."
    "乌尔里克说得对。这里的选择不止一个。{w}\n把我们的族人判入行尸走肉般的处境是不对的。{w}\n如果战后他们的心智消亡，他们就无胜利可言了。"

# game/script.rpy:74328
translate chinese map143_5c70ef89:

    # voice "se/z01465.ogg"
    # char_howl "We would not advise this action. We can barely maintain this form.\nThe wounds that ended Salus are burning, as if freshly inflicted.\nIt is only tolerable because of the immense power within us."
    voice "se/z01465.ogg"
    char_howl "我们不建议这么做。我们几乎维持不住这具形体。\n终结萨鲁斯的那些伤口仍在灼烧，仿佛刚刚受创。\n只是因为体内的庞大力量，才勉强可以忍受。"

# game/script.rpy:74332
translate chinese map143_67d74a64:

    # voice "se/z01466.ogg"
    # char_howl "Lesser beings would be feeling eternal pain.\nAnd death does not come easily to a vessel like this.\nWounds endured during the war would add to this pain."
    voice "se/z01466.ogg"
    char_howl "更弱小的存在会感受到永恒的剧痛。\n而死亡不会轻易降临到这样的容器身上。\n战争中受到的创伤会加重这份痛苦。"

# game/script.rpy:74346
translate chinese map143_b0a53ab6:

    # voice "se/z01467.ogg"
    # char_howl "We would not wish this punishment upon anybody.\nLife in eternal pain, a constant memory of their own death.\nThey perished for your cause. Give them the rest they deserve."
    voice "se/z01467.ogg"
    char_howl "我们不愿把这种惩罚加诸任何人。\n在永恒的痛苦中活着，不断记起自己的死亡。\n他们为你们的理想而死。给他们应得的安息吧。"

# game/script.rpy:74372
translate chinese map143_c322f8f4:

    # voice "se/z01468.ogg"
    # char_damek "I don't know..."
    voice "se/z01468.ogg"
    char_damek "我不知道……"

# game/script.rpy:74386
translate chinese map143_496961a0:

    # voice "se/z01469.ogg"
    # char_damek "An army of Seers would be great for strategizing.\nBut stealing their own future from them? That's wrong.\nOn the other hand, bringing back the dead? I'm unsure."
    voice "se/z01469.ogg"
    char_damek "一支先知组成的军队，对制定策略会很有用。\n但把他们自己的未来偷走？那是错的。\n另一方面，复活死者呢？我不确定。"

# game/script.rpy:74412
translate chinese map143_02b047de:

    # voice "se/z01470.ogg"
    # char_ulric "The pain would fuel their rage, and make them stronger.\nThey could eventually learn to manage it, with medicine.\nAt least they'd have a future. The Seers certainly wouldn't."
    voice "se/z01470.ogg"
    char_ulric "痛苦会滋长他们的怒火，让他们更强。\n他们最终或许能用药物学会控制它。\n至少他们还拥有未来。先知们则肯定没有。"

# game/script.rpy:74438
translate chinese map143_7b3f5f59:

    # voice "se/z01471.ogg"
    # char_damek "There must be something else we can do."
    voice "se/z01471.ogg"
    char_damek "我们一定还能做点别的什么。"

# game/script.rpy:74466
translate chinese map143_c4a22f17:

    # voice "se/z01472.ogg"
    voice "se/z01472.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:74468
translate chinese map143_6075c0f8:

    # char_howl "Not if you wish to make use of this power.\nIt is powerful when used — but limited in scope.\nI will help [firstname] carry out whichever he decides."
    char_howl "若你们想动用这股力量，就没有别的办法。\n它使用时很强大——但作用范围有限。\n我会帮助[firstname]执行他决定的方案。"

# game/script.rpy:74473
translate chinese map143_f0f28611:

    # voice "se/z01473.ogg"
    voice "se/z01473.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:74475
translate chinese map143_73fe65e2:

    # char_howl "Not if you wish to make use of this power.\nIt is powerful when used — but limited in scope.\nI will help [firstname] carry out whichever she decides."
    char_howl "若你们想动用这股力量，就没有别的办法。\n它使用时很强大——但作用范围有限。\n我会帮助[firstname]执行她决定的方案。"

# game/script.rpy:74491
translate chinese map143_f8130a11:

    # voice "se/z01474.ogg"
    voice "se/z01474.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:74493
translate chinese map143_7fd3fdc9:

    # char_damek "Right. I guess it's not my place to choose.\nSorry — I must still be adjusting to this change."
    char_damek "好吧。我想这不该由我来决定。\n抱歉——我一定还在适应这个变化。"

# game/script.rpy:74519
translate chinese map143_7f8fb99b:

    # "Suddenly, all eyes are upon me.{w}\nI have no idea what to say or do.{w}\nEternal pain, or robbing futures...?"
    "忽然，所有的目光都落在我身上。{w}\n我完全不知道该说什么、做什么。{w}\n永恒的痛苦，还是剥夺未来……？"

# game/script.rpy:74521
translate chinese map143_cb5b8e53:

    # "Creating Seers would ruin their mind after the war.{w}\nThey'd just sit in a chair while we fed them to remain alive.{w}\nBut an army of vessels? They'd feel nothing but excruciating pain."
    "创造先知会在战后毁掉他们的心智。{w}\n他们只能坐在椅子上，靠我们喂食来维持生命。{w}\n可一支容器军队呢？他们只会感受到难以忍受的痛苦。"

# game/script.rpy:74523
translate chinese map143_9c99d94a:

    # "And not even death would come to free them from that pain.{w}\nThe body could get ravaged, but the power would still be inside.{w}\nIf only it were possible to cure them of this pain after the war was over."
    "就连死亡也无法让他们从痛苦中解脱。{w}\n身体可以被摧毁，但那股力量仍会留在里面。{w}\n真希望战争结束后有可能治愈他们的痛苦。"

# game/script.rpy:74525
translate chinese map143_bfaabff7:

    # "Or for that matter, I wish it were possible to preserve the Seers minds.{w}\nBut neither option has a forseeable cure. This is a choice involving the war.{w}\nWe needed an immediate boost in forces. And it seemed that no cost was too high."
    "或者，我也希望能保住先知们的心智。{w}\n但两种选择都没有可预见的解药。这是一个关乎战争的抉择。{w}\n我们需要立刻增强兵力。而且看来没有哪种代价算得上太高。"

# game/script.rpy:74527
translate chinese map143_7ddf71f2:

    # "What should I do...?"
    "我该怎么办……？"

# game/script.rpy:74555
translate chinese ChoiceMap_map143_1_0_7527f6f3:

    # voice "se/z01475.ogg"
    voice "se/z01475.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:74557
translate chinese ChoiceMap_map143_1_0_f354a3e2:

    # char_valessa "I'm sorry... I don't know.\nI really can't help you this time."
    char_valessa "对不起……我不知道。\n这一次我真的帮不了你。"

# game/script.rpy:74602
translate chinese ChoiceMap_map143_1_0_f0f6f669:

    # voice "se/z01476.ogg"
    voice "se/z01476.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:74604
translate chinese ChoiceMap_map143_1_0_04c7e29a:

    # char_fortaime "You're asking too much of me. Sorry.\nThis isn't something I could possibly decide."
    char_fortaime "你要求得太多了。抱歉。\n这绝不是我能决定的事。"

# game/script.rpy:74639
translate chinese ChoiceMap_map143_1_0_775867c5:

    # "An army of Seers would be the most useful.{w}\nWith foresight, they could dodge every attack.{w}\nThat would be essential as we attacked Balteus."
    "一支先知组成的军队会是最有用的。{w}\n凭借远见，他们能躲开每一次攻击。{w}\n在我们进攻巴尔泰乌斯时，这将至关重要。"

# game/script.rpy:74641
translate chinese ChoiceMap_map143_1_0_407ecfab:

    # "They could help us strategize as well.{w}\nBut their true use would come on the battlefield.{w}\nCalling out attacks, and preventing ambushes."
    "他们也能帮我们制定策略。{w}\n但他们真正的用处会在战场上显现。{w}\n喊出敌人的攻击，阻止埋伏。"

# game/script.rpy:74643
translate chinese ChoiceMap_map143_1_0_626da8ed:

    # "I make my choice known to my allies.{w}\nI'm met with uncertain gazes, as I expected.{w}\nThere was no right choice in this situation."
    "我向同伴们说明了我的选择。{w}\n如我所料，迎接我的是不确定的目光。{w}\n这种情况下，怎么选都不算对。"

# game/script.rpy:74668
translate chinese ChoiceMap_map143_1_0_45971704:

    # voice "se/z01477.ogg"
    voice "se/z01477.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:74670
translate chinese ChoiceMap_map143_1_0_5b756bec:

    # char_damek "Very well."
    char_damek "很好。"

# game/script.rpy:74695
translate chinese ChoiceMap_map143_1_0_0b93002d:

    # voice "se/z01478.ogg"
    voice "se/z01478.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:74697
translate chinese ChoiceMap_map143_1_0_4617be35:

    # char_ulric "So there we have it.\nWhat happens next...?"
    char_ulric "那就这样定了。\n接下来呢……？"

# game/script.rpy:74709
translate chinese ChoiceMap_map143_1_0_042069c3:

    # "An army of Monarch Vessels would be the most useful.{w}\nWe'd need the rage that would motivate their every attack.{w}\nThe resilience of their body would also be helpful to our cause."
    "一支君主容器组成的军队会是最有用的。{w}\n我们需要那股驱动他们每一次攻击的怒火。{w}\n他们身体的强韧也会对我们的事业有所帮助。"

# game/script.rpy:74711
translate chinese ChoiceMap_map143_1_0_0a53204e:

    # "An army of undying vessels seeking vengeance.{w}\nWe can only hope that they'd accept this fate.{w}\nHopefully their suffering would be worth it."
    "一支追寻复仇的不死容器大军。{w}\n我们只能希望他们愿意接受这样的命运。{w}\n但愿他们的苦难是值得的。"

# game/script.rpy:74713
translate chinese ChoiceMap_map143_1_0_626da8ed_1:

    # "I make my choice known to my allies.{w}\nI'm met with uncertain gazes, as I expected.{w}\nThere was no right choice in this situation."
    "我向同伴们说明了我的选择。{w}\n如我所料，迎接我的是不确定的目光。{w}\n这种情况下，怎么选都不算对。"

# game/script.rpy:74738
translate chinese ChoiceMap_map143_1_0_45971704_1:

    # voice "se/z01477.ogg"
    voice "se/z01477.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:74740
translate chinese ChoiceMap_map143_1_0_5b756bec_1:

    # char_damek "Very well."
    char_damek "很好。"

# game/script.rpy:74765
translate chinese ChoiceMap_map143_1_0_0b93002d_1:

    # voice "se/z01478.ogg"
    voice "se/z01478.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:74767
translate chinese ChoiceMap_map143_1_0_4617be35_1:

    # char_ulric "So there we have it.\nWhat happens next...?"
    char_ulric "那就这样定了。\n接下来呢……？"

# game/script.rpy:74782
translate chinese ChoiceMap_map143_1_0_dbc53649:

    # voice "se/z01481.ogg"
    voice "se/z01481.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:74784
translate chinese ChoiceMap_map143_1_0_700840db:

    # char_howl "I will take [firstname] to the idol, and help.\nAfter that, we must all convene in this war room.\nA strategy is required for this newfound army."
    char_howl "我会带[firstname]去灵像那里，帮忙。\n之后，我们大家都要在这间作战室里集合。\n这支新得的军队需要一套战略。"

# game/script.rpy:74789
translate chinese ChoiceMap_map143_1_0_9355af12:

    # voice "se/z01482.ogg"
    voice "se/z01482.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:74791
translate chinese ChoiceMap_map143_1_0_ca645d8d:

    # char_howl "I will take [firstname] to the idol, and help.\nAfter that, we must all reconvene in this war room.\nA strategy is required for this newfound army."
    char_howl "我会带[firstname]去灵像那里，帮忙。\n之后，我们大家都要在这间作战室里重新集合。\n这支新得的军队需要一套战略。"

# game/script.rpy:74817
translate chinese ChoiceMap_map143_1_0_536eb011:

    # "They all nod, and step closer to the table.{w}\nI follow \"Salus\" out of the room, to carry out my duty.{w}\nAs we leave, I can hear them planning, and I feel hopeful."
    "他们都点点头，向桌边靠近。{w}\n我跟着“萨鲁斯”走出房间，去履行我的职责。{w}\n我们离开时，我能听见他们在规划，我感到充满希望。"

# game/script.rpy:74826
translate chinese ChoiceMap_map143_1_0_a27cff6d:

    # "We will turn this defeat — into a most profound victory.{w}\nUnder my leadership, we would witness The Triumvirate fall."
    "我们会把这场失败——变成最彻底的胜利。{w}\n在我的带领下，我们将亲眼见证三人执政团的覆灭。"

# game/script.rpy:74858
translate chinese map144_7e88eafc:

    # "I follow \"Salus\" back to the room with the Spirit Idol.{w}\nIt's dark, and dim. With its death, the Monarchy was imprisoned no more.{w}\nHowever, existing within vessels, and the blade — was that considered freedom?"
    "我跟着“萨鲁斯”回到存放灵像的房间。{w}\n那里黑暗而昏沉。随着灵像的消亡，王室不再被囚禁。{w}\n然而，寄居于容器和剑之中——那能算作自由吗？"

# game/script.rpy:74860
translate chinese map144_2527de43:

    # "I wonder what would happen to the Monarchy after this war.{w}\nTheir bodies are likely long gone. What would become of them?{w}\nI wonder if there's a way to reverse everything The Triumvirate has done."
    "我在想，这场战争之后王室会怎样。{w}\n他们的身体多半早已不在。他们会变成什么？{w}\n我在想，有没有办法逆转三人执政团所做的一切。"

# game/script.rpy:74862
translate chinese map144_d5f65a74:

    # "But there's no time to think about that. It's time to create our army."
    "但没时间想这些了。是时候创造我们的军队了。"

# game/script.rpy:74864
translate chinese map144_78fd5f7e:

    # "Much to our luck, before we began, Mylus arrived at the Rebel HQ.{w}\nAlongside him was a massive amount of people from Valinorth.{w}\nHis evacuation was successful. This meant far more soldiers."
    "幸运的是，在我们动手之前，迈勒斯抵达了反抗军总部。{w}\n随他而来的还有大量来自瓦利诺斯的人。{w}\n他的撤离行动成功了。这意味着多得多的士兵。"

# game/script.rpy:74869
translate chinese map144_0c03bc9b:

    # "And it also meant a large number of volunteers.{w}\nKnowing the importance of being a Seer, they wanted to help.{w}\nI suppose it was only fitting that we kept this tradition within Valinorth."
    "这也意味着大量的志愿者。{w}\n明白成为先知的重要性，他们想要帮忙。{w}\n我想，我们把这一传统留在瓦利诺斯，也算恰如其分。"

# game/script.rpy:74871
translate chinese map144_8cbc1d5f:

    # "But part of me felt bad. I was doing this to my own people.{w}\nThey were made aware of the repercussions — but still agreed.{w}\nThat made me feel a bit better, but didn't relieve me of the guilt."
    "但我心里有一部分感到难过。我在对我自己的族人做这种事。{w}\n他们被告知了后果——但仍同意了。{w}\n这让我好受了一点，却没有减轻我的愧疚。"

# game/script.rpy:74873
translate chinese map144_b78f58d2:

    # "It was just like I thought. The blade is an extension of the wielder's mind.{w}\n\"Salus\" told me how to wield it, and I rested the blade on the volunteers.{w}\nAlmost like a knighting ceremony in the stories of old — I declared them Seers."
    "果然如我所料。剑是持剑者心智的延伸。{w}\n“萨鲁斯”教我如何运用它，我把剑放在了志愿者身上。{w}\n几乎就像古老故事里的授爵仪式——我宣布他们成为先知。"

# game/script.rpy:74875
translate chinese map144_4b46823c:

    # "But he also told me that the effects wouldn't happen immediately.{w}\nThey'd need to be watched carefully for the next day or so.{w}\nWhen their power kicked in, they could act irrationally."
    "但他也告诉我，效果不会立刻显现。{w}\n接下来一天左右，他们需要被仔细观察。{w}\n当他们的力量发挥作用时，可能会做出不理智的行为。"

# game/script.rpy:74880
translate chinese map144_4a153b64:

    # "And it also meant a large number of volunteers.{w}\nIt wasn't much longer until the room was scattered with corpses.{w}\nJust where Damek wanted to bury them, but also accessible to us."
    "这也意味着大量的志愿者。{w}\n没过多久，房间里就散落着尸体。{w}\n正是达梅克想埋葬他们的地方，但对我们来说也能轻易到达。"

# game/script.rpy:74882
translate chinese map144_250609c8:

    # "But part of me felt bad. Condemning them to a future of pain and misery.{w}\nWar called for desperate measures, and this truly seemed like the best choice.{w}\n\"Salus\" and I stand before the bodies, taking in the gruesome sight."
    "但我心里有一部分感到难过。把他们判给一个充满痛苦与苦难的未来。{w}\n战争需要非常手段，而这似乎确实是当下最好的选择。{w}\n“萨鲁斯”和我站在尸体前，注视着这触目惊心的景象。"

# game/script.rpy:74884
translate chinese map144_0c434c5c:

    # "It was just like I thought. The blade is an extension of the wielder's mind.{w}\n\"Salus\" told me how to wield it, and I touched the bodies of the fallen with it.{w}\nAlmost like a knighting ceremony in the stories of old — I declared them Vessels."
    "果然如我所料。剑是持剑者心智的延伸。{w}\n“萨鲁斯”教我如何运用它，我用剑触碰了倒下者的尸体。{w}\n几乎就像古老故事里的授爵仪式——我宣布他们成为容器。"

# game/script.rpy:74886
translate chinese map144_25a8dcf5:

    # "But he also told me that the effects wouldn't happen immediately.{w}\nThe corpses would need to be monitored for the next day or so.{w}\nWhen they woke up, they'd be scared, and {i}very{/i} confused."
    "但他也告诉我，效果不会立刻显现。{w}\n接下来一天左右，这些尸体会需要被监视。{w}\n当他们醒来时，会感到恐惧，而且{i}非常{/i}困惑。"

# game/script.rpy:74893
translate chinese map144_c5fc5526:

    # "After that, we make our way back to the war table.{w}\nI can only hope that things go as planned. For our future.{w}\nWhen we arrive, it seems like Damek already had a strategy."
    "之后，我们回到作战桌旁。{w}\n我只能希望一切按计划进行。为了我们的未来。{w}\n我们到达时，达梅克似乎已经想好了策略。"

# game/script.rpy:74940
translate chinese map145_beb0b63f:

    # voice "se/z01483.ogg"
    voice "se/z01483.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:74942
translate chinese map145_f1c8403a:

    # char_ulric "Absolutely not."
    char_ulric "绝对不行。"

# game/script.rpy:74967
translate chinese map145_fcd8c287:

    # voice "se/z01484.ogg"
    voice "se/z01484.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:74969
translate chinese map145_b504ba49:

    # char_damek "Ulric, we have no other choice!\nOur forces require more than one major boost.\nGoing to Alarinthia? We could convert them to our side."
    char_damek "乌尔里克，我们别无选择！\n我们的军队需要不止一次重大的增援。\n去阿拉林西亚？我们可以把他们争取到我们这边。"

# game/script.rpy:74994
translate chinese map145_2659135a:

    # voice "se/z01485.ogg"
    # char_ulric "They don't want to be converted.\nThey want blood. Plain and simple."
    voice "se/z01485.ogg"
    char_ulric "他们不想被争取。\n他们要的是血。就这么简单。"

# game/script.rpy:75012
translate chinese map145_095d1e2e:

    # voice "se/z01486.ogg"
    voice "se/z01486.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:75014
translate chinese map145_45dd4487:

    # char_ulric "Who...?"
    char_ulric "谁……？"

# game/script.rpy:75028
translate chinese map145_3fe80127:

    # "I tell him about the book I read in the tavern.{w}\nIn Alarinthia, there's also a rebellion of sorts.{w}\nA group who wants to change the way it's run."
    "我把在酒馆读到的那本书讲给他听。{w}\n在阿拉林西亚，也有某种反抗势力。{w}\n一群人想改变那里的统治方式。"

# game/script.rpy:75057
translate chinese map145_1e8d44a4:

    # voice "se/z01487.ogg"
    voice "se/z01487.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:75059
translate chinese map145_b3fb44ff:

    # char_damek "We could seek the help of Vivien."
    char_damek "我们可以去寻求薇薇安的帮助。"

# game/script.rpy:75084
translate chinese map145_a851a518:

    # voice "se/z01488.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Who...?"
    voice "se/z01488.ogg"
    char_ulric "谁……？"

# game/script.rpy:75110
translate chinese map145_222dc9e7:

    # voice "se/z01489.ogg"
    # char_damek "Alarinthia has a rebellion of it's own.\nA group of people who want to change the way it's run.\nWe could help her journey to the throne, in exchange for her help."
    voice "se/z01489.ogg"
    char_damek "阿拉林西亚有它自己的反抗势力。\n一群想改变那里统治方式的人。\n我们可以帮她登上王位，换取她的帮助。"

# game/script.rpy:75137
translate chinese map145_a192b445:

    # voice "se/z01490.ogg"
    voice "se/z01490.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:75139
translate chinese map145_5146ae77:

    # char_ulric "I've never heard of this."
    char_ulric "我从没听说过这事。"

# game/script.rpy:75164
translate chinese map145_97827caa:

    # voice "se/z01491.ogg"
    # char_damek "Apparently, they follow after ancient ideals.\nAn Alarinthian legend that wanted to change the nation.\nSo far, it seems like none have been strong enough to do so."
    voice "se/z01491.ogg"
    char_damek "显然，他们追随的是古老的理想。\n一位想要改变这个国度的阿拉林西亚传奇人物。\n到目前为止，似乎还没有人强大到能够做到。"

# game/script.rpy:75190
translate chinese map145_66740ef6:

    # voice "se/z01492.ogg"
    # char_ulric "It's because strength always wins. Plain and simple.\nAnd with strength in power, they don't want anything to change.\nThey only want to secure their own rule. Alarinthia is always the same."
    voice "se/z01492.ogg"
    char_ulric "那是因为力量总能取胜。就这么简单。\n大权在握者不想有任何改变。\n他们只想稳固自己的统治。阿拉林西亚永远如此。"

# game/script.rpy:75216
translate chinese map145_4d8c7990:

    # voice "se/z01493.ogg"
    # char_damek "Well, the mainland has never reached out before, right?\nIf we team up with them — yourself included — we could win.\nIf that's not possible, then maybe we can cut a deal with Draycu."
    voice "se/z01493.ogg"
    char_damek "嗯，大陆那边还从没主动联系过我们，对吧？\n如果我们跟他们联手——包括你自己——我们就能赢。\n如果那不可能，也许我们可以和德雷库谈个交易。"

# game/script.rpy:75242
translate chinese map145_38cfed5f:

    # voice "se/z01494.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Draycu? He wants nothing more than to flex his power.\nHe may rule over Alarinthia, but he's no ruler. Trust me."
    voice "se/z01494.ogg"
    char_ulric "德雷库？他一心只想炫耀自己的权力。\n他也许统治着阿拉林西亚，但他算不上统治者。相信我。"

# game/script.rpy:75268
translate chinese map145_dc59229c:

    # voice "se/z01495.ogg"
    # char_damek "Well, I think we have a good opportunity for him, actually.\nWhat better way to show strength, than to dethrone Gods?\nThere's a couple avenues to take here. We {i}need{/i} to do this."
    voice "se/z01495.ogg"
    char_damek "嗯，其实我觉得我们有个很好的机会给他。\n还有什么比推翻神灵更能彰显力量的呢？\n这里有几条路可走。我们{i}必须{/i}做成这件事。"

# game/script.rpy:75294
translate chinese map145_007665e1:

    # voice "se/z01496.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Excuse my lack of enthusiasm, Damek.\nI think there are more pressing matters at hand.\nWe still need to decide what to do with {i}him{/i}."
    voice "se/z01496.ogg"
    char_ulric "恕我提不起兴致，达梅克。\n我认为眼下有更紧迫的事要处理。\n我们还得决定该怎么处置{i}他{/i}。"

# game/script.rpy:75309
translate chinese map145_0cf25b21:

    # "He tilts his head toward \"Salus\", who shakes his own head in return."
    "他朝“萨鲁斯”偏了偏头，对方则摇了摇头作为回应。"

# game/script.rpy:75334
translate chinese map145_f13b246d:

    # voice "se/z01497.ogg"
    # char_howl "We require no maintenance.\nWe simply wish to fight, and teach.\nOur legacy demands to be passed on."
    voice "se/z01497.ogg"
    char_howl "我们无需照料。\n我们只求战斗，并传道授业。\n我们的传承需要延续下去。"

# game/script.rpy:75360
translate chinese map145_f0be2510:

    # voice "se/z01498.ogg"
    # char_damek "There you have it.\nI don't think there's anything we can do.\nHe won't be of any harm to us, right?"
    voice "se/z01498.ogg"
    char_damek "你也看到了。\n我觉得我们无能为力。\n他不会伤害我们的，对吧？"

# game/script.rpy:75386
translate chinese map145_7ba20371:

    # voice "se/z01499.ogg"
    # char_ulric "That's what we thought about the Honor Guard.\nAre you really going to gamble on the spirits again?\nWhat if there's a chance he's just lying to us, Damek?"
    voice "se/z01499.ogg"
    char_ulric "当初我们对荣誉卫队也是这么想的。\n你真打算再拿灵赌一次吗？\n万一他只是在骗我们呢，达梅克？"

# game/script.rpy:75400
translate chinese map145_db7d3f9a:

    # voice "se/z01500.ogg"
    # char_howl "We have no reason to lie.\nAnd we do not appreciate this accusation.\nUsing the Honor Guard, we fortified these tunnels."
    voice "se/z01500.ogg"
    char_howl "我们没有理由撒谎。\n而且我们不喜欢这种指控。\n我们借助荣誉卫队，加固了这些隧道。"

# game/script.rpy:75404
translate chinese map145_2592b24d:

    # voice "se/z01501.ogg"
    # char_howl "It is thanks to us that you survived this ordeal.\nMany of our citizens were sacrificed in order to do this.\nControlling The Triumvirate's forces was taxing, to say the least."
    voice "se/z01501.ogg"
    char_howl "你们能在这场劫难中幸存，全靠我们。\n为此，我们牺牲了许多同胞。\n控制三人执政团的军队，至少可以说是极耗心力。"

# game/script.rpy:75418
translate chinese map145_fbc40ff9:

    # voice "se/z01502.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Then why did they kill almost all of us during the attack?"
    voice "se/z01502.ogg"
    char_ulric "那袭击时他们为什么几乎把我们杀光了？"

# game/script.rpy:75432
translate chinese map145_ac32e451:

    # voice "se/z01503.ogg"
    # char_howl "Our control was strong — but not strong enough.\nIt was easy for The Grand Inquisitor to overpower us.\nUntil today, he had never set foot in these tunnels."
    voice "se/z01503.ogg"
    char_howl "我们的控制很强——但还不够强。\n大审判官轻易就压制了我们。\n在今天之前，他从未踏足这些隧道。"

# game/script.rpy:75446
translate chinese map145_5c558f76:

    # voice "se/z01504.ogg"
    # char_howl "We do not mind answering questions.\nBut we {i}do{/i} mind being accused of wrongdoing.\nEverything we've done — we've done to help your cause."
    voice "se/z01504.ogg"
    char_howl "我们不介意回答问题。\n但我们{i}确实{/i}介意被指控做了坏事。\n我们所做的一切——都是为了帮助你们的事业。"

# game/script.rpy:75460
translate chinese map145_f0c86de6:

    # voice "se/z01505.ogg"
    # char_ulric "To what end?"
    voice "se/z01505.ogg"
    char_ulric "目的何在？"

# game/script.rpy:75474
translate chinese map145_0f09e563:

    # voice "se/z01506.ogg"
    # char_howl "The Triumvirate's end."
    voice "se/z01506.ogg"
    char_howl "终结三人执政团。"

# game/script.rpy:75489
translate chinese map145_9ec13b25:

    # "Ulric concedes, simply shaking his head.{w}\nIt seems there was a counter to all of his objections."
    "乌尔里克让步了，只是摇了摇头。{w}\n看来他所有的质疑都被一一驳倒了。"

# game/script.rpy:75514
translate chinese map145_9dbcd4c2:

    # voice "se/z01507.ogg"
    # char_damek "I think we should trust him, Ulric.\nHe's answered so many of our questions.\nThings make more sense now, wouldn't you say?"
    voice "se/z01507.ogg"
    char_damek "我觉得我们该相信他，乌尔里克。\n他回答了这么多问题。\n现在事情清楚多了，你不觉得吗？"

# game/script.rpy:75529
translate chinese map145_2aea0fcd:

    # "He doesn't respond.{w}\nHowever, Fortaime steps forward."
    "他没有回应。{w}\n不过，福泰姆上前一步。"

# game/script.rpy:75554
translate chinese map145_4835458d:

    # voice "se/z01508.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "What should we call him, though?"
    voice "se/z01508.ogg"
    char_fortaime "不过，我们该怎么称呼他？"

# game/script.rpy:75568
translate chinese map145_998e6a26:

    # voice "se/z01509.ogg"
    # char_howl "We do not require a name."
    voice "se/z01509.ogg"
    char_howl "我们不需要名字。"

# game/script.rpy:75582
translate chinese map145_238e8da2:

    # voice "se/z01510.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "You might think that, but you still need one.\nIt's out of convenience, not necessity."
    voice "se/z01510.ogg"
    char_fortaime "你也许这么想，但你还是需要一个。\n这是为了方便，而非必需。"

# game/script.rpy:75596
translate chinese map145_3a0ac680:

    # voice "se/z01511.ogg"
    # char_howl "Convenience?"
    voice "se/z01511.ogg"
    char_howl "方便？"

# game/script.rpy:75610
translate chinese map145_5c9b6f39:

    # voice "se/z01512.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "Yeah. Nobody really {i}needs{/i} a name.\nIt just helps us talk to one another, you know?\nIt's especially helpful in battle, or while strategizing."
    voice "se/z01512.ogg"
    char_fortaime "对。其实没人{i}需要{/i}名字。\n它只是方便我们彼此交流，你懂吧？\n在战斗中，或者制定策略时，尤其有用。"

# game/script.rpy:75627
translate chinese map145_be88bf6e:

    # voice "se/z01513.ogg"
    # char_howl "Very well. We will think of a name."
    voice "se/z01513.ogg"
    char_howl "好吧。我们会想个名字。"

# game/script.rpy:75642
translate chinese map145_30732c07:

    # "However, before much time passes, Valessa interjects."
    "然而，没过多久，瓦莱莎插话了。"

# game/script.rpy:75670
translate chinese map145_d204b4bf:

    # voice "se/z01514.ogg"
    # char_valessa "Howl."
    voice "se/z01514.ogg"
    char_valessa "豪尔。"

# game/script.rpy:75684
translate chinese map145_c47b440a:

    # voice "se/z01515.ogg"
    # char_howl "Hmm?"
    voice "se/z01515.ogg"
    char_howl "嗯？"

# game/script.rpy:75698
translate chinese map145_7526ccd1:

    # voice "se/z01516.ogg"
    # char_valessa "That's what Damek said, right?\n\"Driven by the howls of countless spirits\".\nIt seems fitting, given the circumstances."
    voice "se/z01516.ogg"
    char_valessa "达梅克是这么说的，对吧？\n“被无数灵的嚎哭所驱使”。\n结合眼下的情形，这名字似乎很贴切。"

# game/script.rpy:75724
translate chinese map145_e2e9213a:

    # voice "se/z01517.ogg"
    # char_damek "Valessa, I—"
    voice "se/z01517.ogg"
    char_damek "瓦莱莎，我——"

# game/script.rpy:75750
translate chinese map145_a980d4e5:

    # voice "se/z01518.ogg"
    voice "se/z01518.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:75752
translate chinese map145_f7322d0f:

    # char_howl "We accept this moniker.\nHowever, we must discuss another matter.\nThis strategizing you speak of. We wish to help."
    char_howl "我们接受这个名号。\n不过，我们必须讨论另一件事。\n你所说的制定策略。我们想帮忙。"

# game/script.rpy:75777
translate chinese map145_dfae1c55:

    # voice "se/z01519.ogg"
    # char_damek "That's my job, actually."
    voice "se/z01519.ogg"
    char_damek "其实，那是我的工作。"

# game/script.rpy:75803
translate chinese map145_46be19fa:

    # voice "se/z01520.ogg"
    # char_howl "And look where it got you."
    voice "se/z01520.ogg"
    char_howl "看看它把你带到了什么地步。"

# game/script.rpy:75829
translate chinese map145_a26df054:

    # voice "se/z01521.ogg"
    # char_damek "What...?"
    voice "se/z01521.ogg"
    char_damek "什么……？"

# game/script.rpy:75857
translate chinese map145_5156bd7f:

    # voice "se/z01522.ogg"
    voice "se/z01522.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:75859
translate chinese map145_a1e88bbe:

    # char_howl "Your blind faith in spirits caused all of this.\nOur judgment will not be clouded. We wish to take your place.\nRemember, you are no longer in charge. This is the King's choice."
    char_howl "你对灵的盲目信仰导致了这一切。\n我们的判断不会受蒙蔽。我们想取代你。\n记住，你已不再掌权。这是国王的选择。"

# game/script.rpy:75864
translate chinese map145_4ac56b9c:

    # voice "se/z01523.ogg"
    voice "se/z01523.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:75866
translate chinese map145_59e84261:

    # char_howl "Your blind faith in spirits caused all of this.\nOur judgment will not be clouded. We wish to take your place.\nRemember, you are no longer in charge. This is the Queen's choice."
    char_howl "你对灵的盲目信仰导致了这一切。\n我们的判断不会受蒙蔽。我们想取代你。\n记住，你已不再掌权。这是女王的选择。"

# game/script.rpy:75882
translate chinese map145_43523896:

    # "Howl turns to face me."
    "豪尔转身面对我。"

# game/script.rpy:75907
translate chinese map145_d8929a71:

    # voice "se/z01524.ogg"
    # char_howl "We wish to be your advisor, Monarch.\nWe've watched this world for almost an eternity.\nWe know how the enemy works, and thinks."
    voice "se/z01524.ogg"
    char_howl "我们想成为您的顾问，君主。\n我们已守望这个世界近乎永恒。\n我们了解敌人如何行事、如何思考。"

# game/script.rpy:75911
translate chinese map145_cd7bf558:

    # voice "se/z01525.ogg"
    # char_howl "It would be the wisest course of action.\nDamek is responsible for this catastrophe.\nHe would be unfit to give you advice in the future."
    voice "se/z01525.ogg"
    char_howl "这将是明智的做法。\n这场灾难是达梅克的责任。\n今后他不适合再向您进言。"

# game/script.rpy:75937
translate chinese map145_9f660394:

    # voice "se/z01526.ogg"
    # char_damek "That is absolutely untrue!\nIn this world, we learn from our mistakes, Howl.\nWe don't condemn others based on bad decisions."
    voice "se/z01526.ogg"
    char_damek "这绝对不实！\n在这个世界，我们是从错误中学习的，豪尔。\n我们不会因为别人做了糟糕的决定就否定他。"

# game/script.rpy:75963
translate chinese map145_bd4e81b5:

    # voice "se/z01527.ogg"
    # char_howl "Perhaps that is why you are easily oppressed.\nThere is no room for error in these final days.\nPerhaps in the future you can atone for this."
    voice "se/z01527.ogg"
    char_howl "也许正因如此，你们才轻易被压迫。\n在这最后的日子里，容不下任何差错。\n也许将来你能为此赎罪。"

# game/script.rpy:75978
translate chinese map145_4f32b386:

    # "I can tell that they're about to get locked in a heated argument.{w}\nTo avoid this, I slam my hands down on the war table, startling them.{w}\nA loud echo reverberates through the room as I assert my authority."
    "我看得出他们即将陷入激烈的争吵。{w}\n为了避免这一幕，我双手猛拍作战桌，把他们吓了一跳。{w}\n一声巨响在房间里回荡，我借此确立了自己的权威。"

# game/script.rpy:75983
translate chinese map145_3bfc12e0:

    # voice "se/z01528.ogg"
    # char_damek "Hmm...?" nointeract
    voice "se/z01528.ogg"
    char_damek "嗯……？" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:75995
translate chinese map145_42f0686d:

    # "I let them know that I want Damek to be my advisor.{w}\nI agree with everything he'd said, and I still don't really know Howl.{w}\nBeing an advisor required both knowledge {i}and{/i} teamwork."
    "我让他们知道我属意达梅克做我的顾问。{w}\n他说的每一点我都赞同，而我对豪尔仍算不上了解。{w}\n做顾问既需要知识，{i}也{/i}需要协作精神。"

# game/script.rpy:76020
translate chinese map145_723efc09:

    # voice "se/z01529.ogg"
    # char_howl "Very well."
    voice "se/z01529.ogg"
    char_howl "好吧。"

# game/script.rpy:76046
translate chinese map145_b2c197eb:

    # voice "se/z01530.ogg"
    # char_damek "Thank you."
    voice "se/z01530.ogg"
    char_damek "谢谢你。"

# game/script.rpy:76061
translate chinese map145_2870aa0a:

    # "They still stared at each other with evil eyes.{w}\nI could tell that animosity was growing between them.{w}\nHowever, this was neither the time or the place for that."
    "他们仍恶狠狠地盯着彼此。{w}\n我看得出他们之间的敌意在滋长。{w}\n然而，此时此地都不是计较这些的时候。"

# game/script.rpy:76095
translate chinese map145_54e1ba7d:

    # voice "se/z01531.ogg"
    # char_howl "We appreciate the opportunity."
    voice "se/z01531.ogg"
    char_howl "我们感谢这个机会。"

# game/script.rpy:76121
translate chinese map145_d64e7f0c:

    # voice "se/z01532.ogg"
    # char_damek "Really...?"
    voice "se/z01532.ogg"
    char_damek "真的……？"

# game/script.rpy:76136
translate chinese map145_979e1a03:

    # "Damek looks crushed, and defeated.{w}\nBut all I did was make the best choice I could.{w}\nIt's something I'd need to get used to in my new position."
    "达梅克看上去深受打击，一败涂地。{w}\n但我只是做出了当时能做出的最佳选择。{w}\n这是我身居新位必须习惯的事。"

# game/script.rpy:76138
translate chinese map145_3fd75112:

    # "However, Damek still needed to serve The Rebellion.{w}\nSupressing his emotions, he focused on his duty.{w}\nWhile we were busy at the idol, he formulated a plan."
    "不过，达梅克仍需要为反抗军效力。{w}\n他压下情绪，专注于自己的职责。{w}\n当我们在灵像那里忙碌时，他已经拟定了一个计划。"

# game/script.rpy:76164
translate chinese map145_8e98e1a5:

    # voice "se/z01533.ogg"
    voice "se/z01533.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:76166
translate chinese map145_fc423119:

    # char_damek "Those matters aside, we still need to make our next move.\nThere's an upcoming ball in Alarinthia. It's held annually.\nThe palace is open for a few days only. We can go."
    char_damek "那些事暂且不提，我们还得决定下一步行动。\n阿拉林西亚即将举办一场舞会，每年一次。\n王宫只开放几天。我们可以去。"

# game/script.rpy:76169
translate chinese map145_c7ebc851:

    # voice "se/z01534.ogg"
    # char_damek "It's likely that Vivien will make a move against Draycu.\nIf she does, we can use that as an opportunity to form an alliance.\nIf she doesn't, then we can seek out an audience with Draycu."
    voice "se/z01534.ogg"
    char_damek "薇薇安很可能会对德雷库有所动作。\n如果她动手，我们可以借此机会结盟。\n如果她不动，我们就设法求见德雷库。"

# game/script.rpy:76183
translate chinese map145_9ccabe30:

    # voice "se/z01535.ogg"
    # char_damek "Either side would have a wealth of forces to offer.\nWe need their aid if we're going to win the final battle.\nI'll get the boats ready. We can leave tomorrow morning."
    voice "se/z01535.ogg"
    char_damek "无论哪一方，都能提供大量兵力。\n要想赢下最终决战，我们需要他们的援助。\n我会备好船只。我们明早就能出发。"

# game/script.rpy:76189
translate chinese map145_911d42a8:

    # voice "se/z01536.ogg"
    voice "se/z01536.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:76191
translate chinese map145_73945bd7:

    # char_damek "I'm sure Alex will be able to give us a capable ship.\nIf we're going to make this ball, we need the best of the best.\nShips were part of our terms, so I'm sure he'll be able to comply."
    char_damek "我相信亚历克斯能给我们一艘像样的船。\n要赶上这场舞会，我们需要最好的船。\n船只是条约的一部分，所以我相信他会照办。"

# game/script.rpy:76196
translate chinese map145_4a5cdcc0:

    # voice "se/z01537.ogg"
    voice "se/z01537.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:76198
translate chinese map145_423633a7:

    # char_damek "I'm sure Nada will be able to give us a capable ship.\nIf we're going to make this ball, we need the best of the best.\nShips were part of our terms, so I'm sure she'll be able to comply."
    char_damek "我相信娜达能给我们一艘像样的船。\n要赶上这场舞会，我们需要最好的船。\n船只是条约的一部分，所以我相信她会照办。"

# game/script.rpy:76214
translate chinese map145_b94d0024:

    # "He gathers up some papers, and starts to walk away."
    "他收起一些文件，转身离开。"

# game/script.rpy:76239
translate chinese map145_932263a1:

    # voice "se/z01538.ogg"
    # char_damek "Meet back here in the morning. All of you.\nWe can go over any last minute stuff before we leave.\nThe rest, we'll have plenty of time to discuss on the voyage."
    voice "se/z01538.ogg"
    char_damek "明早在这里集合。所有人。\n出发前我们可以再过一遍最后的细节。\n其余的，航行途中我们有充足的时间讨论。"

# game/script.rpy:76266
translate chinese map145_6a8080a5:

    # "We all nod at one another before leaving the room.{w}\nI'm thankful that I'd be able to get some sleep — however little.{w}\nI make my way back to my room, constantly checking my back."
    "我们互相点头，随后离开房间。{w}\n我很庆幸自己能睡上一会儿——哪怕很短。{w}\n我朝自己的房间走去，一路不停回头张望。"

# game/script.rpy:76275
translate chinese map145_53c874d4:

    # "They'd never catch us off guard again.{w}\nNext time we fought — it would be their end."
    "他们再也别想打我们个措手不及。{w}\n下次交锋——就是他们的终结。"

# game/script.rpy:76280
translate chinese map145_be8a0e9b:

    # "Howl has now permanently joined your party."
    "豪尔现已永久加入你的队伍。"

# game/script.rpy:76315
translate chinese map146_61242b41:

    # "I enter my room and let out a loud sigh. I can finally relax.{w}\nAs short as my rest would be, it was better than no rest at all.{w}\nI notice I was followed, but I expected as much after what happened."
    "我走进房间，长舒一口气。终于能放松了。{w}\n哪怕休息很短，也总比没有强。{w}\n我注意到有人跟了过来，但经历了那些事，我早有预料。"

# game/script.rpy:76320
translate chinese map146_492118c4:

    # "It was Damek."
    "是达梅克。"

# game/script.rpy:76322
translate chinese map146_f148a39f:

    # "He approaches slowly, and acts nervous.{w}\nAt least he doesn't appear angry with me."
    "他缓缓走近，举止紧张。{w}\n至少他看起来没有生我的气。"

# game/script.rpy:76350
translate chinese map146_1d5f1d1a:

    # voice "se/z01539.ogg"
    voice "se/z01539.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:76352
translate chinese map146_2b8fc946:

    # char_damek "Look, I just wanted to say — no hard feelings.\nIf anything, I'm angry with Howl. He was rude.\nBlaming everything on me? That's not right."
    char_damek "听着，我只是想说——别往心里去。\n要说生气，我气的是豪尔。他太无礼了。\n把一切都怪到我头上？那不对。"

# game/script.rpy:76365
translate chinese map146_bf9d5af9:

    # voice "se/z01540.ogg"
    # char_damek "There's no way that this was all my fault.\nWe were tricked, and there was no way to counter it.\nWe weren't in any position to doubt what the spirits showed us."
    voice "se/z01540.ogg"
    char_damek "这不可能全是我的错。\n我们被算计了，而且根本无从招架。\n我们当时没有立场去怀疑灵向我们展示的东西。"

# game/script.rpy:76379
translate chinese map146_8829bc22:

    # voice "se/z01541.ogg"
    # char_damek "But now? Everything is different.\nI guess I'll take a step back for the time being.\nMaybe this is a blessing in disguise, you know?"
    voice "se/z01541.ogg"
    char_damek "但现在呢？一切都不同了。\n我想我暂时会退后一步。\n也许这是因祸得福，你懂吗？"

# game/script.rpy:76393
translate chinese map146_226185ae:

    # voice "se/z01542.ogg"
    # char_damek "I'll get to relax, and spend time with the crew.\nI honestly can't remember the last time I got to unwind.\nHopefully Howl is able to strategize as well as he lets on."
    voice "se/z01542.ogg"
    char_damek "我可以放松一下，和船员们相处。\n说实话，我都记不清上次放松是什么时候了。\n但愿豪尔的谋略真如他所表现得那么好。"

# game/script.rpy:76407
translate chinese map146_4a6e8ee9:

    # voice "se/z01543.ogg"
    # char_damek "But all of those spirits inside of him...?\nI wouldn't be surprised if they could outsmart me.\nI'm curious though — do you think he can induce visions?"
    voice "se/z01543.ogg"
    char_damek "但他体内那么多灵……？\n就算他们比我聪明，我也不会意外。\n不过我很好奇——你觉得他能引出幻象吗？"

# game/script.rpy:76422
translate chinese map146_b9888c0b:

    # "I shrug, unsure of how to answer.{w}\nHowever, that would be a useful tool."
    "我耸耸肩，不知该如何作答。{w}\n不过，那会是个很有用的手段。"

# game/script.rpy:76447
translate chinese map146_2cd295c0:

    # voice "se/z01544.ogg"
    # char_damek "I'm still confused about all of this.\nHe said that visions were a part of his culture, right?\nBut they didn't see The Triumvirate coming. Not at all."
    voice "se/z01544.ogg"
    char_damek "我对这一切仍然困惑。\n他说过幻象是他文化的一部分，对吧？\n可他们没能预见三人执政团的到来。完全没有。"

# game/script.rpy:76461
translate chinese map146_4c3b091d:

    # voice "se/z01545.ogg"
    # char_damek "Just {i}what{/i} are they...? Where did they come from?\nAre there other worlds out there that have fallen victim to this?\nIf there are — then what chance do {i}we{/i} stand? "
    voice "se/z01545.ogg"
    char_damek "他们{i}究竟{/i}是什么……？他们从何而来？\n外面还有其他世界也沦为了他们的猎物吗？\n如果有——那{i}我们{/i}又有什么胜算？"

# game/script.rpy:76476
translate chinese map146_fe9d0cd2:

    # "It's true. The implications of this truth were staggering.{w}\nHowever, we had something that nobody else would.{w}\nI take the blade off my back, and rest it against the wall."
    "没错。这个真相的意味令人震惊。{w}\n然而，我们拥有别人不会有的东西。{w}\n我把背上的剑取下，靠在墙边。"

# game/script.rpy:76491
translate chinese map146_282e6702:

    # voice "se/z01546.ogg"
    # char_damek "I guess that blade really {i}is{/i} our only hope.\nLook — I'll let you sleep. I know how interruptions can be.\nI just wanted to let you know that I don't hate you. I never will."
    voice "se/z01546.ogg"
    char_damek "看来那把剑{i}真的{/i}是我们唯一的希望。\n听着——我不打扰你休息了。我知道被打断是什么滋味。\n我只是想让你知道，我不恨你。永远不会。"

# game/script.rpy:76505
translate chinese map146_7f243880:

    # voice "se/z01547.ogg"
    # char_damek "Whether I'm your strategist or not, you're still our savior.\nBesides, I could never speak out of turn. You're royalty now.\nJust make sure to be responsible with your influence, Monarch."
    voice "se/z01547.ogg"
    char_damek "无论我是不是你的战略家，你依然是我们的救世主。\n再说，我绝不会越礼妄言。你现在是王室成员了。\n只是务必善用你的影响力，君主。"

# game/script.rpy:76527
translate chinese map146_f4a10213:

    # "He gives me a slight bow, as a sign of respect, before leaving.{w}\nI'm not sure what happened — but he seemed different now.{w}\nI guess the events that happened today would change any man."
    "他微微躬身，以示敬意，然后离开。{w}\n我不确定发生了什么——但他现在似乎不一样了。{w}\n我想今天发生的事，换作谁都会有所改变。"

# game/script.rpy:76532
translate chinese map146_60a007b2:

    # "It was Howl."
    "是豪尔。"

# game/script.rpy:76534
translate chinese map146_518b8641:

    # "He approaches slowly, with resolve in his steps.{w}\nHowever, he doesn't seem angry in any way.{w}\nThat was good, since I sided with Damek."
    "他缓缓走近，步伐坚定。{w}\n不过，他看上去丝毫没有怒气。{w}\n这很好，毕竟我站在了达梅克这边。"

# game/script.rpy:76562
translate chinese map146_74beeddc:

    # voice "se/z01548.ogg"
    voice "se/z01548.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:76564
translate chinese map146_e964034d:

    # char_howl "We must express displeasure at your decision.\nDamek made a mistake, and remains unpunished.\nThe lives that were lost {i}beg{/i} for justice. We are that justice."
    char_howl "我们必须对你的决定表示不满。\n达梅克犯了错，却依然未受惩罚。\n逝去的生命{i}渴求{/i}正义。我们就是那正义。"

# game/script.rpy:76578
translate chinese map146_4b0b696a:

    # "Damek was only believing in the spirits, like we all do.{w}\nNow that we know the truth, he will approach things differently.{w}\nHe would never intentionally lead us into danger. He's honorable."
    "达梅克只是像我们所有人一样信仰灵。{w}\n既然我们知道了真相，他会用不同的方式处事。{w}\n他绝不会刻意把我们引入险境。他是个正直的人。"

# game/script.rpy:76603
translate chinese map146_670d44e2:

    # voice "se/z01549.ogg"
    # char_howl "Honor?"
    voice "se/z01549.ogg"
    char_howl "正直？"

# game/script.rpy:76618
translate chinese map146_b1366ea7:

    # "He crosses his arms, unimpressed."
    "他双臂交叉，不为所动。"

# game/script.rpy:76643
translate chinese map146_918ae48f:

    # voice "se/z01550.ogg"
    # char_howl "Honor is a term used to stay the hand in difficult situations, [firstname].\nWhen the final drop of blood must be spilled, and your {i}honor{/i} stops you?\nWhat then? Is the future of our world on the shoulders of those so weak?"
    voice "se/z01550.ogg"
    char_howl "“正直”是危急时刻用来收手的托词，[firstname]。\n当最后一滴血必须流下，而你的{i}正直{/i}却让你停手？\n那又当如何？我们世界的未来要托付给如此软弱之人吗？"

# game/script.rpy:76658
translate chinese map146_5cb0879c:

    # "He scoffs."
    "他嗤笑一声。"

# game/script.rpy:76673
translate chinese map146_38faf987:

    # voice "se/z01551.ogg"
    # char_howl "Do not concern yourself with honor. \nThe enemy does not, and this is why they win.\nConcern yourself with the correct actions — not the right ones."
    voice "se/z01551.ogg"
    char_howl "不必为正直费心。 \n敌人不会，所以他们才赢。\n你要在意的是正确的行动——而非正当的行动。"

# game/script.rpy:76687
translate chinese map146_66b2e96c:

    # voice "se/z01552.ogg"
    # char_howl "That is all the advice we have for you today, [firstname].\nBut we do not trust Damek to make the right decisions in the future.\nThe fact that he left the Honor Guard alive is proof of that. He hesitates."
    voice "se/z01552.ogg"
    char_howl "这就是我们今天能给你的全部建议，[firstname]。\n但我们不信任达梅克今后能做出正确的决定。\n他留了荣誉卫队活口，就是明证。他会犹豫。"

# game/script.rpy:76703
translate chinese map146_4cf823ec:

    # voice "se/z01553.ogg"
    voice "se/z01553.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:76705
translate chinese map146_74d49c3c:

    # char_howl "This hesitation will not go away simply because he knows what we are.\nThe truth of the \"Spirit Realm\" does not change strategy on the war table.\nWith that said, we will leave you be. Ruminate on this in the future, my King."
    char_howl "这种犹豫不会因为他知道了我们是什么就消失。\n“灵界”的真相并不会改变作战桌上的策略。\n话已至此，我们不打扰了。日后请细想，我的国王。"

# game/script.rpy:76710
translate chinese map146_a9e47cfb:

    # voice "se/z01554.ogg"
    voice "se/z01554.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:76712
translate chinese map146_ee57a96c:

    # char_howl "This hesitation will not go away simply because he knows what we are.\nThe truth of the \"Spirit Realm\" does not change strategy on the war table.\nWith that said, we will leave you be. Ruminate on this in the future, my Queen."
    char_howl "这种犹豫不会因为他知道了我们是什么就消失。\n“灵界”的真相并不会改变作战桌上的策略。\n话已至此，我们不打扰了。日后请细想，我的女王。"

# game/script.rpy:76733
translate chinese map146_37f3b7b0:

    # "He gives me a slight bow, as a sign of respect, before leaving.{w}\nBeing the Exodus wielder was intense enough, but being the Monarch?{w}\nThankfully I had the support of my friends. They would keep me strong."
    "他微微躬身，以示敬意，然后离开。{w}\n光是放逐之刃的持有者已经够让人紧绷了，更别说当君主？{w}\n幸好有朋友们的支持。他们会让我保持坚强。"

# game/script.rpy:76740
translate chinese map146_fd18128f:

    # "I lay down in bed, and it isn't much longer before I drift off to sleep.{w}\nWhen I wake up, rested and refreshed, I head to the War Room.{w}\nEveryone is there, as expected. It's time to get things moving."
    "我躺上床，没过多久便沉沉睡去。{w}\n醒来时，我精神饱满，径直前往作战室。{w}\n所有人都如约在场。是时候推动事情了。"

# game/script.rpy:76772
translate chinese map147_6b8de0c1:

    # "Howl approaches the war table, and rests his hands upon it.{w}\nBefore speaking, he moves pieces of wood around the war table.{w}\nThey represent different things. He rests The Rebellion's piece over Alarinthia."
    "豪尔走近作战桌，双手按在桌上。{w}\n开口之前，他在作战桌上挪动几块木牌。{w}\n它们各有含义。他把反抗军的木牌放在阿拉林西亚上。"

# game/script.rpy:76800
translate chinese map147_79556ea4:

    # voice "se/z01555.ogg"
    voice "se/z01555.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:76802
translate chinese map147_3209e7de:

    # char_howl "We sail for Alarinthia, to forge an alliance.\nHowever, the nature of that alliance remains to be seen.\nIt will be with either the insurgent Vivien, or the ruler Draycu."
    char_howl "我们扬帆前往阿拉林西亚，缔结同盟。\n不过，同盟的对象尚未确定。\n要么是叛军薇薇安，要么是统治者德雷库。"

# game/script.rpy:76815
translate chinese map147_74a8fb9e:

    # voice "se/z01556.ogg"
    # char_howl "We will meet with both under the guise of a ball.\nHeld annually, it is a celebration of Draycu's power and influence.\nIt is also the perfect chance for Vivien to make a move, or challenge him."
    voice "se/z01556.ogg"
    char_howl "我们将借舞会之名与两人会面。\n这场舞会每年举办，是彰显德雷库权势与影响力的庆典。\n也是薇薇安动手或向他发起挑战的绝佳时机。"

# game/script.rpy:76819
translate chinese map147_dc59764c:

    # voice "se/z01557.ogg"
    # char_howl "Both parties will be present, so we will see what both can offer.\nOur goal is Alarinthian allies to aid our final assault on Balteus.\nDamek worked with our pirate allies to secure transport."
    voice "se/z01557.ogg"
    char_howl "双方都会到场，所以我们能看看他们各自能提供什么。\n我们的目标是争取阿拉林西亚的盟友，协助我们对巴尔泰乌斯的最终进攻。\n达梅克已与我们的海盗盟友接洽，安排好了船只。"

# game/script.rpy:76833
translate chinese map147_79c38aa5:

    # voice "se/z01558.ogg"
    # char_howl "We meet at the docks after we're done talking here.\nIt will be a skeleton crew, to avoid arousing suspicion.\nThere should be enough beds for all of us to sleep."
    voice "se/z01558.ogg"
    char_howl "这里谈完后，我们在码头集合。\n为免引人怀疑，只留最基本的船员。\n床位应该够我们所有人休息。"

# game/script.rpy:76837
translate chinese map147_2e50f55e:

    # voice "se/z01559.ogg"
    # char_howl "The voyage will end at this time tomorrow.\nEnough food and drink will be packed for all of us.\nBring your essentials. We will provide everything else."
    voice "se/z01559.ogg"
    char_howl "航程将于明天此时结束。\n会为我们所有人备足食物和饮水。\n带上你的必需品。其余一切由我们提供。"

# game/script.rpy:76851
translate chinese map147_ff087a80:

    # voice "se/z01560.ogg"
    # char_howl "Are there any objections?"
    voice "se/z01560.ogg"
    char_howl "有异议吗？"

# game/script.rpy:76866
translate chinese map147_b81f5dc5:

    # "He glances over at Ulric, who returns a piercing gaze."
    "他瞥了乌尔里克一眼，后者回以锐利的目光。"

# game/script.rpy:76891
translate chinese map147_909edfd6:

    # voice "se/z01561.ogg"
    # char_howl "Except for that one."
    voice "se/z01561.ogg"
    char_howl "除了那位。"

# game/script.rpy:76913
translate chinese map147_018b8412:

    # "Ulric shrugs, and the meeting continues."
    "乌尔里克耸耸肩，会议继续进行。"

# game/script.rpy:76918
translate chinese map147_1e950f29:

    # "Damek approaches the war table, fiddling with the wooden figures resting ontop of it.{w}\nThey represent different things. The figure for the Rebellion, he places on Alarinthia.{w}\nOur next objective was clear. We'd be sailing to the far east to secure an alliance."
    "达梅克走近作战桌，摆弄着桌上的木制棋子。{w}\n它们各有含义。他把代表反抗军的棋子放在阿拉林西亚上。{w}\n我们的下一个目标很明确。我们将航向远东，争取同盟。"

# game/script.rpy:76946
translate chinese map147_36762aac:

    # voice "se/z01563.ogg"
    voice "se/z01563.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:76948
translate chinese map147_5f267d97:

    # char_damek "Each year, Draycu holds a ball. Essentially, it's to show off his power.\nIt's open to the public, which means Vivien will likely make a move.\nI'd say it's either an assassination attempt, or a tournament request."
    char_damek "德雷库每年都会举办一场舞会。本质上是为了炫耀他的权势。\n舞会向公众开放，这意味着薇薇安很可能会有所动作。\n我猜要么是行刺，要么是提出比武挑战。"

# game/script.rpy:76961
translate chinese map147_31422446:

    # voice "se/z01564.ogg"
    # char_damek "During the ball, we will meet with both of them.\nOur goal is to secure an Alarinthian army to help us out.\nIf we do this, our chance of success will increase tenfold."
    voice "se/z01564.ogg"
    char_damek "舞会期间，我们将与两人会面。\n我们的目标是争取一支阿拉林西亚军队来相助。\n若能办成，我们成功的几率将提升十倍。"

# game/script.rpy:76965
translate chinese map147_a08b5505:

    # voice "se/z01565.ogg"
    # char_damek "Each party, if they're willing, will likely request something in return.\nIt may be impossible to avoid being caught up in Alarinthian politics.\nIf it comes to anything extreme, we will have Ulric help us out."
    voice "se/z01565.ogg"
    char_damek "各方若愿意合作，多半都会提出条件作为回报。\n恐怕难免会被卷入阿拉林西亚的政治漩涡。\n若事情发展到极端，我们会让乌尔里克出面相助。"

# game/script.rpy:76979
translate chinese map147_bc365202:

    # voice "se/z01566.ogg"
    # char_damek "I trust there are no objections?"
    voice "se/z01566.ogg"
    char_damek "我想没有异议吧？"

# game/script.rpy:76994
translate chinese map147_488d4910:

    # "Nobody raises a concern, but I can tell that Ulric is upset."
    "没人提出异议，但我看得出乌尔里克很不高兴。"

# game/script.rpy:77019
translate chinese map147_0212038f:

    # voice "se/z01567.ogg"
    # char_damek "We will set sail immediately after this meeting.\nI've already arranged transportation with our Pirate allies.\nIt's a twenty-four hour voyage, so pack your essentials."
    voice "se/z01567.ogg"
    char_damek "会议结束后我们立刻启航。\n我已和海盗盟友安排好了船只。\n航程二十四小时，所以带好必需品。"

# game/script.rpy:77033
translate chinese map147_d3c0a15f:

    # voice "se/z01568.ogg"
    # char_damek "Food and drink have already been pre-packed.\nNone of us should go hungry or thirsty during the trip.\nAnd there are enough beds for all of us to sleep, too."
    voice "se/z01568.ogg"
    char_damek "食物和饮水已经提前备好。\n旅途中我们谁都不该挨饿受渴。\n而且床位也够我们所有人休息。"

# game/script.rpy:77037
translate chinese map147_cf756819:

    # voice "se/z01568a.ogg"
    # char_damek "The voyage will be a nice time to get some relaxation in.\nHowever, once we get to Alarinthia, we have to be serious.\nOur success directly affects our odds of surviving this war."
    voice "se/z01568a.ogg"
    char_damek "航程是个放松的好时机。\n不过，一到阿拉林西亚，我们就必须严肃起来。\n我们的成败直接关系到能否在这场战争中活下来。"

# game/script.rpy:77051
translate chinese map147_9b817697:

    # voice "se/z01569.ogg"
    # char_damek "We've ensured that our comrades received a proper burial.\nThey're resting with the spirit idol, and we'll close off that passage.\nFor their sake, please leave it undisturbed. They deserve rest."
    voice "se/z01569.ogg"
    char_damek "我们已经让战友们得到妥善安葬。\n他们安息在灵像旁，我们会封死那条通道。\n看在他们份上，请勿打扰。他们应当安息。"

# game/script.rpy:77073
translate chinese map147_6107a25b:

    # "He inspects a piece of paper in his hand before continuing."
    "他看了看手里的一张纸，然后继续。"

# game/script.rpy:77099
translate chinese map147_3b0fbdc7:

    # voice "se/z01570.ogg"
    voice "se/z01570.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:77101
translate chinese map147_62f65c08:

    # char_damek "The volunteers from Valinorth are starting to have visions.\nThey will accompany us to Alarinthia, and help our cause.\nThankfully, there were no side effects, or losses."
    char_damek "来自瓦利诺斯的志愿者开始出现幻象。\n他们会随我们前往阿拉林西亚，协助我们的事业。\n幸好没有副作用，也没有伤亡。"

# game/script.rpy:77114
translate chinese map147_c279d79a:

    # voice "se/z01571.ogg"
    # char_damek "We have our army of Seers, [firstname].\nHopefully you'll get to meet them soon."
    voice "se/z01571.ogg"
    char_damek "我们有了一支先知军队，[firstname]。\n希望你能尽快见到他们。"

# game/script.rpy:77120
translate chinese map147_9ddcdf6b:

    # voice "se/z01572.ogg"
    voice "se/z01572.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:77122
translate chinese map147_ee3e1d52:

    # char_damek "However, the bodies you imbued with power have started to move.\nThey will accompany us to Alarinthia, and help our cause.\nThankfully, they accepted this fate. There is no confusion."
    char_damek "不过，你注入力量的那些躯壳开始行动了。\n他们会随我们前往阿拉林西亚，协助我们的事业。\n幸好他们接受了这个命运。没有混乱。"

# game/script.rpy:77135
translate chinese map147_29e4fd0a:

    # voice "se/z01573.ogg"
    # char_damek "We have our army of Vessels, [firstname].\nHopefully you'll get to meet them soon."
    voice "se/z01573.ogg"
    char_damek "我们有了一支由君主容器组成的军队，[firstname]。\n希望你能尽快见到他们。"

# game/script.rpy:77150
translate chinese map147_55bf3838:

    # voice "se/z01574.ogg"
    voice "se/z01574.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:77152
translate chinese map147_b147f58a:

    # char_damek "With all of that said, I think it's time to end this meeting.\nAre there any questions before we head to the shipyard?\nRemember, once we leave, we may not be back for a while."
    char_damek "说了这么多，我想该结束这次会议了。\n去造船厂之前还有什么问题吗？\n记住，我们一旦离开，可能很久都不会回来。"

# game/script.rpy:77166
translate chinese map147_3ac5b95f:

    # "Fortaime steps forward."
    "福泰姆上前一步。"

# game/script.rpy:77191
translate chinese map147_ff158689:

    # voice "se/z01575.ogg"
    voice "se/z01575.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:77193
translate chinese map147_2bbc71e4:

    # char_fortaime "What exactly happens at this ball?"
    char_fortaime "这场舞会到底会发生什么？"

# game/script.rpy:77208
translate chinese map147_94482c26:

    # voice "se/z01576.ogg"
    # char_damek "I'm not sure. Dancing and feasting, I'd imagine.\nDraycu wants to pamper everybody he can. That's his goal.\nIf his people are happy, then there's less fighting over the throne."
    voice "se/z01576.ogg"
    char_damek "我不确定。我想，无非是跳舞和宴饮。\n德雷库想尽可能笼络所有人。这就是他的目的。\n子民开心，对王位的争夺就会少些。"

# game/script.rpy:77234
translate chinese map147_34ba9299:

    # voice "se/z01577.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "So basically one big party, then."
    voice "se/z01577.ogg"
    char_fortaime "所以基本上就是一场盛大的派对。"

# game/script.rpy:77260
translate chinese map147_563da4a0:

    # voice "se/z01578.ogg"
    # char_damek "Correct."
    voice "se/z01578.ogg"
    char_damek "没错。"

# game/script.rpy:77288
translate chinese map147_0024226b:

    # voice "se/z01579.ogg"
    voice "se/z01579.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:77290
translate chinese map147_1edf0bba:

    # char_fortaime "Awesome. The last party we were ever going to have was cancelled.\nLet's say we finally have your induction ceremony, eh, [firstname]?\nExcept now it's not for being a Seer. It's for being a {i}King{/i}."
    char_fortaime "太好了。我们原本最后的派对泡汤了。\n不如说，你的就任典礼终于补上了，是吧，[firstname]？\n只不过现在不是成为先知，而是成为{i}国王{/i}。"

# game/script.rpy:77295
translate chinese map147_e65f96fa:

    # voice "se/z01580.ogg"
    voice "se/z01580.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:77297
translate chinese map147_d582df2b:

    # char_fortaime "Awesome. The last party we were ever going to have was cancelled.\nLet's say we finally have your induction ceremony, eh, [firstname]?\nExcept now it's not for being a Seer. It's for being a {i}Queen{/i}."
    char_fortaime "太好了。我们原本最后的派对泡汤了。\n不如说，你的就任典礼终于补上了，是吧，[firstname]？\n只不过现在不是成为先知，而是成为{i}女王{/i}。"

# game/script.rpy:77313
translate chinese map147_4d533fed:

    # "We all nod at each other. It's true, my last ceremony was cancelled.{w}\nIt {i}was{/i} Draycu's party, but we could celebrate for our own reasons."
    "我们互相点头。的确，我上一次的典礼被取消了。{w}\n那{i}确实{/i}是德雷库的派对，但我们可以为自己而庆祝。"

# game/script.rpy:77338
translate chinese map147_217a62c7:

    # voice "se/z01581.ogg"
    # char_damek "Just — try not to draw attention to yourselves, alright?\nIt may be a party, but Alarinthia's fate will change behind the scenes.\nRemember why we're there, and don't lose sight of our original goal."
    voice "se/z01581.ogg"
    char_damek "只是——尽量别引人注目，好吗？\n它或许是场派对，但阿拉林西亚的命运将在幕后改变。\n记住我们为什么去，别忘记最初的目标。"

# game/script.rpy:77364
translate chinese map147_1ab73691:

    # voice "se/z01582.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "Of course."
    voice "se/z01582.ogg"
    char_fortaime "当然。"

# game/script.rpy:77391
translate chinese map147_4626512a:

    # "Fortaime steps back, satisfied."
    "福泰姆满意地退后一步。"

# game/script.rpy:77416
translate chinese map147_a2dfeceb:

    # voice "se/z01583.ogg"
    voice "se/z01583.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:77418
translate chinese map147_ad2d7e05:

    # char_valessa "Why didn't Vivien make a move at any of the other parties?\nI guess I mean to ask — what makes this year special?\nWhat if we go there, and she ends up doing nothing?"
    char_valessa "薇薇安为什么没在往年的任何一场舞会上动手？\n我想问的是——今年有什么特别？\n万一我们去了，她却什么都不做呢？"

# game/script.rpy:77444
translate chinese map147_74311072:

    # voice "se/z01584.ogg"
    voice "se/z01584.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:77446
translate chinese map147_d822b7a1:

    # char_howl "That is when we focus only on Draycu.\nNo matter what happens, we have options.\nIt is wise to plan for roads you may not even take."
    char_howl "那时我们就只专注于德雷库。\n无论发生什么，我们都有选择。\n为未必会走的路做准备，是明智之举。"

# game/script.rpy:77460
translate chinese map147_1d250699:

    # voice "se/z01585.ogg"
    voice "se/z01585.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:77462
translate chinese map147_28c75744:

    # char_damek "If that happens, then we focus on Draycu.\nAt the end of the day, we'll still have an option.\nWe're just planning for many possible scenarios."
    char_damek "如果那样，我们就专注于德雷库。\n归根结底，我们仍有选择。\n我们只是在为各种可能的情形做打算。"

# game/script.rpy:77488
translate chinese map147_0ada08dc:

    # voice "se/z01586.ogg"
    voice "se/z01586.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:77490
translate chinese map147_50b40b11:

    # char_valessa "Alright. "
    char_valessa "好吧。"

# game/script.rpy:77507
translate chinese map147_00a6a3e9:

    # "Valessa nods, her curiosity sated.{w}\nThere's a brief silence, and no further questions."
    "瓦莱莎点点头，好奇心得到了满足。{w}\n短暂的沉默后，再无其他问题。"

# game/script.rpy:77534
translate chinese map147_14fad7a0:

    # voice "se/z01587.ogg"
    voice "se/z01587.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:77536
translate chinese map147_05a54b06:

    # char_damek "Very well. Dismissed.\nLet's pack our things and meet at the docks.\nWe'll set sail in three hours, so don't be late."
    char_damek "很好。解散。\n大家收拾行装，在码头集合。\n三小时后启航，别迟到。"

# game/script.rpy:77551
translate chinese map147_48dc6880:

    # voice "se/z01588.ogg"
    voice "se/z01588.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:77553
translate chinese map147_de6c094d:

    # char_howl "Very well. Meeting dismissed.\nYou have three hours to pack and get to the docks.\nOur goal is important, so we {i}will{/i} leave you behind."
    char_howl "好。会议到此为止。\n你们有三小时收拾东西并赶到码头。\n我们的目标至关重要，所以{i}一定{/i}会把迟到的人留下。"

# game/script.rpy:77579
translate chinese map147_6c89d18e:

    # "With that said, almost everybody rushes out of the room.{w}\nExcept for Howl. He stays behind, and eyes me down.{w}\nBefore I get ready to leave, I ask him what he wants."
    "话音刚落，几乎所有人都冲出了房间。{w}\n唯独豪尔留了下来，盯着我看。{w}\n在我准备离开前，我问他有何事。"

# game/script.rpy:77604
translate chinese map147_16bc0247:

    # voice "se/z01589.ogg"
    voice "se/z01589.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:77606
translate chinese map147_f57fea81:

    # char_howl "We've been given a room in the Crew Quarters.\nPlease stop by and see us before you leave.\nIt is important for us to learn more about you."
    char_howl "我们在船员舱分到了一个房间。\n出发前请来见我们一面。\n多了解你，对我们很重要。"

# game/script.rpy:77620
translate chinese map147_ca845110:

    # "He bows at me before leaving."
    "他向我鞠了一躬，然后离开。"

# game/script.rpy:77645
translate chinese map147_28844d70:

    # voice "se/z01590.ogg"
    # char_howl "Until then, your highness."
    voice "se/z01590.ogg"
    char_howl "那么，回头见，陛下。"

# game/script.rpy:77667
translate chinese map147_73e82bb1:

    # "He was definitely taking this Monarch thing seriously.{w}\nBut given his culture, and the power within me, it makes sense.{w}\nI take one last look at the War Table before heading out."
    "他显然把“君主”这回事看得很重。{w}\n但考虑到他的文化，以及我体内的力量，这也说得通。{w}\n出门前，我最后看了一眼作战桌。"

# game/script.rpy:77673
translate chinese map147_5ebcebf5:

    # "The War Table is used to track your relationships with each character.{w}\nThe amount of hearts indicates how many Heart-to-Hearts you have completed.{w}\nWhen a character's heart gauge reaches four, you can click them to access a special scene."
    "作战桌用于追踪你与每位角色的关系。{w}\n心形数量代表你已完成多少次心灵对话。{w}\n当某位角色的心形计量达到四颗，点击他们即可进入一场特殊剧情。"

# game/script.rpy:77675
translate chinese map147_41680ab8:

    # "These scenes are required to earn each character's loyalty.{w}\nThe loyalty of your followers affects both Morale, and their fate.{w}\nDo not neglect Heart-to-Heart conversations, or these special \"Loyalty Scenes\"."
    "这些剧情是赢得每位角色忠诚的必要条件。{w}\n追随者的忠诚会影响士气，也影响他们的命运。{w}\n不要忽视心灵对话，以及这些特殊的“忠诚剧情”。"

# game/script.rpy:77677
translate chinese map147_a4f48c91:

    # "When you wish to depart for Alarinthia, return to the Mazeo Docks.{w}\nA new map icon will display by the ship at the front of the shipyard."
    "当你准备启程前往阿拉林西亚时，回到马泽奥码头。{w}\n造船厂前方船只旁会显示一个新的地图图标。"

