# game/script.rpy:78535
translate chinese map234_21d26adc:

    # "Valessa leads me through Mazeo, to some sort of hidden cove area.{w}\nThere's a large ship, and it looks like some sort of dock, with no signs of life.{w}\nStashes of treasure lay about, and it's apparent that this place has been abandoned."
    "瓦莱莎带我穿过马泽奥，来到一处隐秘的湾洞。{w}\n那里停着一艘大船，看起来像是个码头，却毫无生机。{w}\n四处堆放着成堆的财宝，显然这里早已被废弃。"

# game/script.rpy:78560
translate chinese map234_13f01532:

    # voice "se/y01938.ogg"
    voice "se/y01938.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:78562
translate chinese map234_6e76fc27:

    # char_valessa "After we returned, I got talking to the pirates.\nYou know, to pick up any information on our parents.\nIt turns out, this is their base of operations. Their HQ."
    char_valessa "我们回来之后，我和那些海盗聊了聊。\n你知道，是想打听父母的消息。\n结果发现，这里就是他们的行动基地。他们的总部。"

# game/script.rpy:78565
translate chinese map234_39e5ec66:

    # voice "se/y01939.ogg"
    # char_valessa "Kinda funny, isn't it? We both ended up having HQ's in Mazeo.\nBut to be honest, that's where I'd like the similarities to end.\nThe more I learn about them — the more I {i}hate{/i} them..."
    voice "se/y01939.ogg"
    char_valessa "挺讽刺的，不是吗？我们俩最后都在马泽奥有了总部。\n但说实话，我希望相似之处到此为止。\n我越了解他们——就越是{i}恨{/i}他们……"

# game/script.rpy:78579
translate chinese map234_e3002494:

    # voice "se/y01940.ogg"
    # char_valessa "They kept running off to Mazeo, and left us in Salus' hands.\nNow that I think about it, he raised us more than they ever did.\nI guess they were more interested in this life of piracy. It's awful."
    voice "se/y01940.ogg"
    char_valessa "他们总是跑回马泽奥，把我们丢给萨鲁斯照看。\n现在想想，他才是把我们养大的人，远比他们用心。\n我想他们更在意的，是这种海盗生涯。真恶心。"

# game/script.rpy:78594
translate chinese map234_44057f26:

    # "She looks around the cove, taking in the environment."
    "她环顾湾洞，打量着四周的环境。"

# game/script.rpy:78609
translate chinese map234_681b8bd7:

    # voice "se/y01941.ogg"
    # char_valessa "I wanted to come here with you to face the truth.\nOur parents were bad people. There's no denying it.\nThey wanted {i}this{/i} to be their legacy, rather than us..."
    voice "se/y01941.ogg"
    char_valessa "我想和你一起来这里面对真相。\n我们的父母是坏人。这一点无可否认。\n他们想让{i}这些{/i}成为他们的遗产，而不是我们……"

# game/script.rpy:78624
translate chinese map234_cb1cb510:

    # "She starts to walk around the area, and I follow behind her."
    "她开始在这一带走动，我跟在她身后。"

# game/script.rpy:78649
translate chinese map234_4bf0c1e9:

    # voice "se/y01942.ogg"
    # char_valessa "Look at all this junk they valued more than us.\nWeapons, money, more money — and lame scrolls.\nMaps to some far-off treasure and riches, I'm sure."
    voice "se/y01942.ogg"
    char_valessa "看看这些他们看得比我们还重的破烂。\n武器、钱、更多的钱——还有无聊的卷轴。\n我敢肯定，是通往某处远方宝藏和财富的地图。"

# game/script.rpy:78664
translate chinese map234_dfc72824:

    # "Picking up a handful of coins, she throws them into the nearby water."
    "她抓起一把钱币，扔进旁边的水里。"

# game/script.rpy:78689
translate chinese map234_d98e913f:

    # voice "se/y01943.ogg"
    # char_valessa "Sorry for going off like that. It just makes me really angry.\nWe idolized them for so long, thinking the world lost good people.\nBut to realize that maybe the world is better off without them? It's hard."
    voice "se/y01943.ogg"
    char_valessa "抱歉，我刚才失控了。这事就是让我很生气。\n我们崇拜了他们那么久，以为世界失去的是好人。\n可意识到也许没有他们世界会更好？这很难接受。"

# game/script.rpy:78706
translate chinese map234_bee9b57b:

    # voice "se/y01944.ogg"
    # char_valessa "Anyway, thanks for coming along with me.\nI just thought it would be good to do this together.\nI don't know how Fortaime would handle it, if I'm honest."
    voice "se/y01944.ogg"
    char_valessa "总之，谢谢你陪我一起来。\n我只是觉得，一起来会好一些。\n说实话，我不知道福泰姆能不能承受得住。"

# game/script.rpy:78721
translate chinese map234_1aacd82b:

    # "She turns to face me, with a hint of a smile on her face."
    "她转身面对我，脸上带着一丝微笑。"

# game/script.rpy:78749
translate chinese map234_69737036:

    # voice "se/y01945.ogg"
    # char_valessa "You know, I realized I'm different from all of these rebels.\nThey've been living oppressed, in the shadow of The Triumvirate.\nBut it was never The Triumvirate that held me back — it was always myself."
    voice "se/y01945.ogg"
    char_valessa "你知道，我意识到自己和这些反抗军都不一样。\n他们一直活在三人执政团的阴影下，受着压迫。\n但束缚我的从来都不是三人执政团——一直是我自己。"

# game/script.rpy:78753
translate chinese map234_9edefa5a:

    # voice "se/y01946.ogg"
    # char_valessa "I wanted to be a person who could make my parents proud.\nI wanted to do what society demanded of me. I wanted to be {i}perfect{/i}.\nBut this is a real wake up call. {i}Nobody{/i} is perfect. We're all flawed at heart."
    voice "se/y01946.ogg"
    char_valessa "我想成为一个能让父母骄傲的人。\n我想做社会要求我做的事。我想变得{i}完美{/i}。\n但这次真的把我敲醒了。{i}没有人{/i}是完美的。我们内心都有缺陷。"

# game/script.rpy:78757
translate chinese map234_fc5c1705:

    # voice "se/y01947.ogg"
    # char_valessa "To realize that, and embrace it? I think that's all I needed to do.\nI feel like now, I can be who I want — and not who other people want me to be.\nIt feels like such a small thing, but a different perspective can change a lot, you know?"
    voice "se/y01947.ogg"
    char_valessa "明白这一点，并接纳它？我想这就是我需要做的全部。\n我觉得现在，我可以做我想做的人——而不是别人希望我成为的人。\n这听起来微不足道，但换个视角能改变很多，你懂吗？"

# game/script.rpy:78772
translate chinese map234_8ce61eb8:

    # "I nod."
    "我点点头。"

# game/script.rpy:78797
translate chinese map234_df4ea1f1:

    # voice "se/y01948.ogg"
    # char_valessa "Well then, want to take a look around?\nIf we can find anything to help us in Balteus, then it's not a total loss.\nI'm sure there's something around here that we can take along with us."
    voice "se/y01948.ogg"
    char_valessa "那么，想四处看看吗？\n如果能找到什么在巴尔泰乌斯派得上用场的东西，就不算白来。\n我相信这附近总有我们能带走的东西。"

# game/script.rpy:78812
translate chinese map234_bd712bac:

    # "She starts rummaging through various crates and sacks.{w}\nI do the same as her, but find nothing of note — except money.{w}\nIt could help after the war, but right now we needed something more."
    "她开始翻找各种箱子和麻袋。{w}\n我也跟着翻，却一无所获——除了钱。{w}\n战后或许用得上，但眼下我们需要的是别的东西。"

# game/script.rpy:78827
translate chinese map234_1edbb4fb:

    # voice "se/y01949.ogg"
    # char_valessa "Hey, look what I found!"
    voice "se/y01949.ogg"
    char_valessa "嘿，看我发现了什么！"

# game/script.rpy:78842
translate chinese map234_bac38d26:

    # "She pulls out a pair of daggers, and starts inspecting them."
    "她掏出一对匕首，仔细端详。"

# game/script.rpy:78867
translate chinese map234_356398be:

    # voice "se/y01950.ogg"
    # char_valessa "I think I remember these. \nBack when I was a kid, I swear I saw them.\nThat means they must've belonged to my parents."
    voice "se/y01950.ogg"
    char_valessa "我想我记得这些。 \n我还是孩子的时候，发誓见过它们。\n那说明它们一定属于我的父母。"

# game/script.rpy:78871
translate chinese map234_81d6a52f:

    # voice "se/y01951.ogg"
    # char_valessa "Or my Mother, to be exact.\nJust an intuition — so I can't say for sure.\nBut I'd be willing to bet that my hunch is correct."
    voice "se/y01951.ogg"
    char_valessa "准确地说，是我母亲。\n只是直觉——所以我不能确定。\n但我愿意打赌，我的预感没错。"

# game/script.rpy:78875
translate chinese map234_aee8d33a:

    # voice "se/y01952.ogg"
    # char_valessa "Did you find anything good, [firstname]?"
    voice "se/y01952.ogg"
    char_valessa "你找到什么好东西了吗，[firstname]？"

# game/script.rpy:78890
translate chinese map234_94295db5:

    # "I shake my head. There wasn't anything of note.{w}\nAside from those daggers, none of it was helpful."
    "我摇了摇头。没什么值得一提的。{w}\n除了那对匕首，其余都派不上用场。"

# game/script.rpy:78915
translate chinese map234_d0244651:

    # voice "se/y01953.ogg"
    # char_valessa "What do you say? Should I keep them...?\nMight come in handy when we attack Balteus."
    voice "se/y01953.ogg"
    char_valessa "你说呢？我该留下它们吗……？\n进攻巴尔泰乌斯时也许能派上用场。"

# game/script.rpy:78930
translate chinese map234_8bf4d395:

    # "Well, that was a good question, actually.{w}\nShe came here to move on from her parents.{w}\nTaking their stuff could just be a constant reminder."
    "嗯，这问题其实问得好。{w}\n她来这里是为了放下父母。{w}\n带走他们的东西，也许只会时时勾起回忆。"

# game/script.rpy:78932
translate chinese map234_3ab185ad:

    # "On the other hand, however, maybe she could make them her own.{w}\nIt was hard to tell whether or not this would help or hinder her in the future.{w}\nBut with our final battle almost upon us, I'm afraid that I couldn't afford a mistake."
    "但另一方面，也许她能让它们真正属于自己。{w}\n很难说这会在将来帮她还是拖累她。{w}\n可最终决战近在眼前，我怕自己承担不起一次失误。"

# game/script.rpy:78970
translate chinese map234_ba07711c:

    # voice "se/y01954.ogg"
    # char_valessa "Make them my own, huh?\nI think I like the sound of that."
    voice "se/y01954.ogg"
    char_valessa "让它们属于我自己，是吗？\n我喜欢这说法。"

# game/script.rpy:78973
translate chinese map234_8bd39541:

    # "She puts the daggers in the leather straps on her back.{w}\nReturning with a smile, it seems like she's ready to head home."
    "她把匕首插进背后的皮带上。{w}\n她带着微笑走回来，似乎已经准备好回家了。"

# game/script.rpy:79000
translate chinese map234_39a6b066:

    # voice "se/y01955.ogg"
    # char_valessa "You know what? You're right.\nThis is pretty much grave-robbing."
    voice "se/y01955.ogg"
    char_valessa "你知道吗？你说得对。\n这基本上就是盗墓。"

# game/script.rpy:79003
translate chinese map234_2c41b1c1:

    # "She places the daggers back where she found them.{w}\nTurning back to me with a smile, it seems like her visit is over."
    "她把匕首放回原处。{w}\n她转身朝我微笑，看来此行已经结束。"

# game/script.rpy:79017
translate chinese map234_9a9bd55f:

    # voice "se/y01956.ogg"
    voice "se/y01956.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:79019
translate chinese map234_9d9cc203:

    # char_valessa "Well, I guess now I need to focus on the important stuff.\nWhat kind of person do I want to be — after this war is over?\nI'm no longer held back by anything, so I guess my dreams are the limit."
    char_valessa "好吧，我想现在我该专注于重要的事了。\n这场战争结束后——我想成为什么样的人？\n再也没有什么束缚我了，所以我想，梦想没有上限。"

# game/script.rpy:79036
translate chinese map234_6cccd682:

    # "She smiles, and blushes softly."
    "她微微一笑，脸颊泛起红晕。"

# game/script.rpy:79061
translate chinese map234_1f25f50b:

    # voice "se/y01957.ogg"
    # char_valessa "And as long as we're talking about dreams..."
    voice "se/y01957.ogg"
    char_valessa "既然说到了梦想……"

# game/script.rpy:79076
translate chinese map234_c8501d18:

    # "Taking a step forward, she places her hands in mine.{w}\nI smile at her, and give them a soft squeeze, which she returns."
    "她上前一步，把双手放进我的手中。{w}\n我朝她微笑，轻轻握了握，她也回握。"

# game/script.rpy:79101
translate chinese map234_9eabb48f:

    # voice "se/y01958.ogg"
    # char_valessa "I never would've dreamed that we'd become this close.\nWe've gone through so much together, and become so strong.\nYou're part of the reason I was brave enough to face my past like this."
    voice "se/y01958.ogg"
    char_valessa "我从没想过我们会变得这么亲密。\n我们一起经历了那么多，变得如此坚强。\n我能鼓起勇气这样面对过去，你也是原因之一。"

# game/script.rpy:79105
translate chinese map234_87c0c51f:

    # voice "se/y01959.ogg"
    # char_valessa "But with my past taken care of, I'd like to look toward the future.\nAnd if there's one thing I want the most — it's for you to be a part of it.\nYou know, I keep thinking back to that dance we had. I felt so special."
    voice "se/y01959.ogg"
    char_valessa "但既然过去已经了结，我想展望未来。\n如果说我最想要的一样东西——那就是让你成为其中一部分。\n你知道，我总回想起我们共舞的那次。我感觉自己如此特别。"

# game/script.rpy:79109
translate chinese map234_a36d4f6e:

    # voice "se/y01960.ogg"
    # char_valessa "There were so many eyes on us though, I felt kind of restricted.\nI mean, I wanted to kiss you — that's what you're supposed to do, right?\nAt the end of a dance, of course. I think it's tradition, or something like that."
    voice "se/y01960.ogg"
    char_valessa "可当时那么多双眼睛盯着我们，我有点放不开。\n我是说，我想吻你——本来就该这么做，对吧？\n当然，是在舞曲结束时。我想那是传统，或者类似的东西。"

# game/script.rpy:79113
translate chinese map234_1a7e550e:

    # voice "se/y01961.ogg"
    # char_valessa "It's just that—"
    voice "se/y01961.ogg"
    char_valessa "只是——"

# game/script.rpy:79128
translate chinese map234_012d282a:

    # "Before she can finish, I step forward, and slowly move my face toward hers.{w}\nI stop halfway, and wait for her to close the distance. Her face is bright red.{w}\nWhen our lips touch together, it feels as if the world has stopped moving."
    "她还没说完，我便上前一步，脸缓缓凑近她。{w}\n我在半途停住，等她缩短剩下的距离。她的脸涨得通红。{w}\n当我们的唇相触时，仿佛整个世界都静止了。"

# game/script.rpy:79130
translate chinese map234_e05aa4b6:

    # "This was our moment. Just for the two of us."
    "这是属于我们的时刻。只属于我们两人。"

# game/script.rpy:79132
translate chinese map234_d0142584:

    # "I move my head back, but let my hands find their way to her sides.{w}\nShe stammers, and looks around the cove, clearly embarrassed and shy."
    "我把头稍稍后仰，双手却自然而然地落到她的腰侧。{w}\n她结结巴巴，环顾着湾洞，满脸羞涩。"

# game/script.rpy:79157
translate chinese map234_cc3b264a:

    # voice "se/y01962.ogg"
    # char_valessa "I guess that does it, then...\nAll this time, and I only had to ask.\nI'm glad to finally know how you feel, for sure."
    voice "se/y01962.ogg"
    char_valessa "那这事就这么定了……\n这么久以来，原来我只要开口就行。\n我很高兴终于确切地知道了你的心意。"

# game/script.rpy:79177
translate chinese map234_7bd0d347:

    # "She takes a deep breath of relief, as if a massive weight was now gone.{w}\nI totally understand. This was a big deal for her — and for me, as well."
    "她如释重负地深吸一口气，仿佛卸下了千斤重担。{w}\n我完全理解。这对她意义重大——对我也是。"

# game/script.rpy:79210
translate chinese map234_5bd14ce9:

    # voice "se/y01963.ogg"
    voice "se/y01963.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:79212
translate chinese map234_aba9cd34:

    # char_valessa "Should we head back then...?\nI guess you have other things to tend to.\nTruth be told — I needed this. Thank you."
    char_valessa "那我们该回去了吗……？\n你大概还有别的事要处理。\n说实话——我需要这趟行程。谢谢你。"

# game/script.rpy:79233
translate chinese map234_c9eef1d0:

    # "With that, we're on our way out of the cove.{w}\nShe faced her past in that moment, and came out ever stronger.{w}\nI have no doubt that she'd continue to grow into an amazing woman."
    "于是，我们踏上离开湾洞的路。{w}\n她在那一刻直面了过往，也变得更坚强。{w}\n我毫不怀疑，她会继续成长为一个了不起的女人。"

# game/script.rpy:79235
translate chinese map234_8ff214cb:

    # "Before we leave for good, I turn back and look around once more.{w}\nThis was where our parents conducted most of their business...?{w}\nThat means this is the closest I've been to them in decades."
    "在彻底离开前，我回头又看了一眼。{w}\n这里就是父母做大部分生意的地方……？{w}\n也就是说，这是我几十年来离他们最近的一次。"

# game/script.rpy:79241
translate chinese map234_ed0af11c:

    # "Goodbye..."
    "再见了……"

# game/script.rpy:79271
translate chinese map237_4cc997ed:

    # "Fortaime takes me back to Valinorth, and we look at The Grand Tree.{w}\nIt makes sense that he'd want to accomplish his lifelong dream before the final battle.{w}\nWith those metallic claws he'd found in Mazeo, I think he could finally achieve what he wanted."
    "福泰姆带我回到瓦利诺斯，我们望着巨树。{w}\n他想在最终决战前实现毕生的梦想，这很合理。{w}\n有了他在马泽奥找到的那些金属爪，我想他终于能得偿所愿了。"

# game/script.rpy:79273
translate chinese map237_8cd1f1b6:

    # "And of course, he wanted me to achieve it with him.{w}\nI'm grateful that he chose me, but I'm also a little worried.{w}\nIs this really something I could pull off, even with those tools?"
    "当然，他希望我和他一起完成。{w}\n我很感激他选择了我，但也有点担心。{w}\n就算有那些工具，这事我真能做到吗？"

# game/script.rpy:79298
translate chinese map237_ab44508e:

    # voice "se/y01964.ogg"
    voice "se/y01964.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:79300
translate chinese map237_ec8e7255:

    # char_fortaime "Well, I guess this is it.\nI can't leave for Balteus with any regrets.\nSo I'm finally going to do it — I'll climb The Grand Tree."
    char_fortaime "好吧，我想就是现在了。\n我不能带着遗憾前往巴尔泰乌斯。\n所以我终于要动手了——我要爬上巨树。"

# game/script.rpy:79313
translate chinese map237_4e07b221:

    # voice "se/y01965.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "And with someone like you, no less.\nThink they'll talk about this in the history books?\nI mean, I don't think anybody else has done this before."
    voice "se/y01965.ogg"
    char_fortaime "而且还是和你这样的人一起。\n你觉得历史书里会记载这件事吗？\n我是说，我觉得以前从没人做到过。"

# game/script.rpy:79328
translate chinese map237_af9275fe:

    # "We're going to be the first."
    "我们将是第一个。"

# game/script.rpy:79343
translate chinese map237_0ddeebfb:

    # voice "se/y01966.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "Here, you need to put these on like gloves.\nThere's another pair that goes on your feet as well.\nAfter that, we just climb. We don't need to find footholds."
    voice "se/y01966.ogg"
    char_fortaime "来，你得把这些像手套一样戴上。\n还有一副是套在脚上的。\n之后，我们只管往上爬。不用找落脚点。"

# game/script.rpy:79357
translate chinese map237_0e6541de:

    # voice "se/y01967.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "Being able to create them ourselves? Now that's a good invention.\nI gotta give credit where credit is due. Mazeans know what they're doing.\nDon't tell anybody though — these might very well be under the trade ban."
    voice "se/y01967.ogg"
    char_fortaime "能自己造出来？这才是好发明。\n该夸就得夸。马泽奥人确实有两下子。\n不过别跟别人说——这东西很可能在贸易禁令之列。"

# game/script.rpy:79372
translate chinese map237_ca90da17:

    # "He gives me a quick wink.{w}\nIt's alright though, I won't tell anybody."
    "他朝我飞快地眨了下眼。{w}\n不过没关系，我不会说出去的。"

# game/script.rpy:79397
translate chinese map237_48243608:

    # voice "se/y01968.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "It looks way taller than I remember.\nI'd try to give you some advice, but I don't have any.\nWith those tools, this should be pretty easy. At least, I hope."
    voice "se/y01968.ogg"
    char_fortaime "它看起来比我记忆中高多了。\n我本想给你点建议，可我也没有。\n有这些工具，应该挺容易的。至少我希望如此。"

# game/script.rpy:79401
translate chinese map237_d985300a:

    # voice "se/y01969.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "Just don't fall, [firstname].\nI don't know if you could survive something like that.\nI've fallen from way shorter trees and been in pain for months."
    voice "se/y01969.ogg"
    char_fortaime "千万别摔下去，[firstname]。\n我不知道你摔下来还能不能活。\n我从矮得多的树上摔下来，都疼了好几个月。"

# game/script.rpy:79416
translate chinese map237_2d9b8bd9:

    # "He sure is great at instilling confidence..."
    "他可真是擅长给人打气……"

# game/script.rpy:79441
translate chinese map237_2ac3d36d:

    # voice "se/y01970.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "Well then — got everything ready?\nLet's find a good starting point, and do this."
    voice "se/y01970.ogg"
    char_fortaime "那么——都准备好了吗？\n我们找个好的起点，开始吧。"

# game/script.rpy:79457
translate chinese map237_af8aa413:

    # voice "se/y01971.ogg"
    voice "se/y01971.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:79459
translate chinese map237_45154206:

    # char_fortaime "And don't forget that there's a kiss on the line!\nSo let's consider this a race. Are you ready...?"
    char_fortaime "别忘了，赌注可是一个吻！\n那就把它当成一场比赛吧。你准备好了吗……？"

# game/script.rpy:79464
translate chinese map237_20772f7c:

    # voice "se/y01972.ogg"
    voice "se/y01972.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:79466
translate chinese map237_6cfbbf43:

    # char_fortaime "But remember it's a race, so no holding back...!\nI want to make sure that we both give it our all. No regrets."
    char_fortaime "但记住这是比赛，所以别留手……！\n我要确保我们都全力以赴。不留遗憾。"

# game/script.rpy:79482
translate chinese map237_4f7c606a:

    # "He enters a stance that implies he's ready to begin.{w}\nI nod to let him know that I'm ready, and assume the same stance.{w}\nWe make our way to the base of The Grand Tree, and look up."
    "他摆出准备开始的架势。{w}\n我点头示意自己准备好了，也摆出同样的姿势。{w}\n我们走到巨树脚下，抬头仰望。"

# game/script.rpy:79484
translate chinese map237_42272a79:

    # "This is the first time I realize how tall it actually is.{w}\nWould we really be able to make it to the top...?{w}\nA doubt wells up within me, but I don't voice it."
    "这是我第一次意识到它究竟有多高。{w}\n我们真能爬到顶端吗……？{w}\n一丝疑虑在心头涌起，但我没有说出口。"

# game/script.rpy:79509
translate chinese map237_953b599e:

    # voice "se/y01973.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "I bet I'll be the first one there!"
    voice "se/y01973.ogg"
    char_fortaime "我赌我会第一个到顶！"

# game/script.rpy:79524
translate chinese map237_c2cfd90d:

    # "With that said, he digs his claws into the tree and starts to climb.{w}\nI watch him for a few moments before replicating his actions to a tee.{w}\nAfter a few minutes of doing this, we're extremely far from the surface."
    "说完，他把爪子扎进树干，开始攀爬。{w}\n我观察了他一会儿，然后分毫不差地照做。{w}\n这样爬了几分钟后，我们离地面已经极高。"

# game/script.rpy:79549
translate chinese map237_a14bf350:

    # voice "se/y01984.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "Scared of heights? Make sure not to look down!\nI for one, love the view. This is part of why I do it."
    voice "se/y01984.ogg"
    char_fortaime "怕高吗？千万别看下面！\n我倒很喜欢这景色。这也是我这么做的原因之一。"

# game/script.rpy:79563
translate chinese map237_e15a27f0:

    # voice "se/y01985.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "Hey, no fair! I was taking a breather...!\nDidn't think you'd be the type to play dirty!"
    voice "se/y01985.ogg"
    char_fortaime "嘿，不公平！我刚才只是在歇口气……！\n没想到你是会耍手段的那种人！"

# game/script.rpy:79578
translate chinese map237_c0505a8c:

    # "He laughs we scale the tree at almost the same rate.{w}\nI can't imagine doing this without those claw-like tools.{w}\nIn fact, they make this pretty easy. There's no risk of falling."
    "他笑了，我们以几乎相同的速度攀爬。{w}\n我无法想象没有这些爪状工具该怎么做。{w}\n事实上，它们让攀爬变得相当轻松。完全没有坠落的风险。"

# game/script.rpy:79580
translate chinese map237_39fcbb4e:

    # "It allows me to take a step back and admire Fortaime's skill.{w}\nHe was climbing trees for his entire life without this kind of aid.{w}\nI suddenly appreciate his every stumble and fall — his every bruise."
    "这让我能腾出心思，欣赏福泰姆的技艺。{w}\n他这一辈子都在没有这种助力的情况下爬树。{w}\n我忽然懂得了他每一次踉跄跌倒——每一处淤青的分量。"

# game/script.rpy:79582
translate chinese map237_d3e063c9:

    # "As we get higher and higher, we start to get enveloped in a canopy of leaves.{w}\nWe aren't quite high enough that they've become red, but it's still an impressive sight.{w}\nIt blocks us from seeing the village below us, but it's beautiful to look at, regardless. "
    "我们越爬越高，渐渐被一片树冠包裹。{w}\n我们还没高到让叶子变红，但那景象依然壮观。{w}\n它遮住了下方的村庄，但无论怎样，看上去都很美。"

# game/script.rpy:79584
translate chinese map237_058898e1:

    # "It really helps solidify just where we are. We're scaling The Grand Tree.{w}\nNobody has done this before, and it's been his dream for decades, now.{w}\nHowever, due to his challenge, the competitive spirit starts appearing within me."
    "这让我真切地意识到自己的所在。我们正在攀登巨树。{w}\n从没人做到过，而这已是他的梦想几十年了。{w}\n然而，因为他的挑战，我心中也升起了好胜心。"

# game/script.rpy:79586
translate chinese map237_88b752d5:

    # "At the rate we're going, I could very well beat him to the top.{w}\nIn fact, if it was a race — that would pretty much be the point.{w}\nBut this was still his dream, and he might deserve the moment."
    "照这个速度，我很可能比他先到顶。{w}\n事实上，既然是比赛——那不就是重点吗。{w}\n但这终究是他的梦想，也许这一时刻该属于他。"

# game/script.rpy:79601
translate chinese map237_864c9734:

    # "I decide to intentionally throw my progress.{w}\nFortaime deserves to win. I feel like it's only fair.{w}\nAs we get higher, we reach the bloodleaves on high."
    "我决定故意放慢速度。{w}\n福泰姆应该赢。我觉得这样才公平。{w}\n随着我们越爬越高，我们到了高处的血叶层。"

# game/script.rpy:79603
translate chinese map237_ceacb87e:

    # "When we reach the final stretch, I fake a small stumble.{w}\nNothing to put myself in danger, just enough to cause a slight delay.{w}\nAfter Fortaime has gotten far enough up, I get myself back on track."
    "到了最后一段，我假装踉跄了一下。{w}\n不会让自己陷入危险，只够造成一点延迟。{w}\n等福泰姆爬得足够远后，我才重新跟上。"

# game/script.rpy:79605
translate chinese map237_8951dd7b:

    # "It's not much longer before we reach the top, but he's clearly victorious.{w}\nHe laughs as he sits on a massive branch. Big enough to support both our weight.{w}\nI follow him up there and sit beside him, taking a huge sigh of relief. We did it...!"
    "没过多久我们就到了顶部，但他显然胜出。{w}\n他笑着坐到一根巨大的树枝上。大到足以承受我们两人的重量。{w}\n我跟着爬上去，坐到他身边，长长舒了口气。我们做到了……！"

# game/script.rpy:79630
translate chinese map237_fdb5f899:

    # voice "se/y01986.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "I can't believe we did it, [firstname]...!\nAnd of course, I had a feeling that I'd win.\nNever think you can rise above the master!"
    voice "se/y01986.ogg"
    char_fortaime "真不敢相信我们做到了，[firstname]……！\n当然，我就感觉自己会赢。\n别以为你能超越师傅！"

# game/script.rpy:79635
translate chinese map237_6ca8376c:

    # "I decide to fully commit to the idea of a race.{w}\nUsing all of my strength, I push myself as much as I can.{w}\nAs we get higher, we reach the bloodleaves near the top."
    "我决定全心投入这场比赛。{w}\n我用尽全力，拼命向上。{w}\n随着我们越爬越高，我们到了靠近顶端的血叶层。"

# game/script.rpy:79637
translate chinese map237_edcece5e:

    # "This is it...! The final stretch.{w}\nI use all of my effort, in an attempt to defeat Fortaime.{w}\nAnd soon enough — I do — we reach the top, and sit on a massive branch."
    "就是现在……！最后一段。{w}\n我拼尽全力，想击败福泰姆。{w}\n很快——我做到了——我们到达顶部，坐到一根巨大的树枝上。"

# game/script.rpy:79662
translate chinese map237_f1c8c9e5:

    # voice "se/y01987.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "Wow, I can't believe we did it...!\nAnd actually — I can't believe you won!\nI guess you're just a natural at everything, huh?"
    voice "se/y01987.ogg"
    char_fortaime "哇，真不敢相信我们做到了……！\n而且——真不敢相信你赢了！\n看来你做什么都天生在行，是吧？"

# game/script.rpy:79682
translate chinese map237_d938cfa4:

    # "He smiles, and inches a bit closer toward me as we sit on the branch."
    "他微笑着，坐在树枝上，一点点向我靠过来。"

# game/script.rpy:79710
translate chinese map237_570ecafd:

    # voice "se/y01988.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "Look at that view...\nI know we can't see the village, but these leaves...?\nI never thought I'd get to see them up close like this before."
    voice "se/y01988.ogg"
    char_fortaime "看看那景色……\n我知道我们看不到村庄，但这些叶子……？\n我从没想过有生之年能这样近距离看到它们。"

# game/script.rpy:79714
translate chinese map237_ad4cb231:

    # voice "se/y01989.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "I've only ever seen them when they wilt and fall off.\nBut being up here, and seeing them fresh? Wow...\nI wish I could take some with me, but I know I can't."
    voice "se/y01989.ogg"
    char_fortaime "我以前只在它们枯萎飘落时见过。\n可在这里，看到它们鲜活的样子？哇……\n真希望能带一些走，但我知道不行。"

# game/script.rpy:79729
translate chinese map237_8488011b:

    # "He runs his hands through some of the bloodleaves, clearly in awe."
    "他伸手拂过一些血叶，满脸惊叹。"

# game/script.rpy:79754
translate chinese map237_25edaa7b:

    # voice "se/y01990.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "You know, this doesn't feel like I thought it would.\nI thought it'd feel amazing, like I'd become a different person.\nBut I feel just like I did before. I guess that's how things go, huh...?"
    voice "se/y01990.ogg"
    char_fortaime "你知道，这感觉和我想的不一样。\n我以为会很奇妙，像变成了另一个人。\n可我感觉和从前一样。我想事情就是这样吧……？"

# game/script.rpy:79768
translate chinese map237_48abbc7d:

    # voice "se/y01991.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "Oh well — at least that's one more thing I can cross off my list.\nA bit anticlimactic, but I don't really know what I was expecting.\nMaybe it's like Eastcrown. Just — the allure of the unreachable. "
    voice "se/y01991.ogg"
    char_fortaime "算了——至少我又能从清单上划掉一项。\n有点虎头蛇尾，但我自己也说不清在期待什么。\n也许就像东冠一样。只是——那份遥不可及的诱惑。"

# game/script.rpy:79786
translate chinese map237_db04639e:

    # "He inches a bit closer to me, and rests his head on my shoulder.{w}\nI can't see his face, but I can just tell that he's wearing the widest smile."
    "他又向我靠近了些，把头靠在我的肩上。{w}\n我看不到他的脸，但我能断定他正咧着嘴笑。"

# game/script.rpy:79811
translate chinese map237_af931699:

    # voice "se/y01992.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "You know, this is a bit different than that back alley in Mazeo.\nI'm glad that we have more privacy, and that we could do this together.\nWhen we first left Valinorth, I had no idea we'd become this close to each other."
    voice "se/y01992.ogg"
    char_fortaime "你知道，这跟马泽奥那条后巷不太一样。\n我很高兴这里更私密，而且我们能一起做这件事。\n我们刚离开瓦利诺斯时，我完全没想到我们会变得这么亲密。"

# game/script.rpy:79825
translate chinese map237_999ba4d2:

    # voice "se/y01993.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "Not that it's an unwelcome change. Trust me, I always thought about this.\nBut back then — a scribe-in-training dating someone like you was frowned upon.\nLook how much has changed. The entire world is nothing like we thought it was."
    voice "se/y01993.ogg"
    char_fortaime "也不是说这变化不好。相信我，我一直都在想这件事。\n但那时候——一个见习书记官和你这样的人交往，是会遭人非议的。\n看看变化有多大。整个世界都和我们以为的截然不同。"

# game/script.rpy:79829
translate chinese map237_318c4cd6:

    # voice "se/y01994.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "You know, I used to come to this tree, and listen for the spirits.\nI thought that if I listened closely, they might talk to me, you know...?\nBut they didn't. And now I know what that silence truly meant."
    voice "se/y01994.ogg"
    char_fortaime "你知道，我以前常来这棵树，聆听灵的声音。\n我以为只要仔细听，它们也许会跟我说话，你懂吗……？\n但它们没有。现在我知道那份沉默真正意味着什么了。"

# game/script.rpy:79833
translate chinese map237_44cef4f4:

    # voice "se/y01995.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "All of us were held back by The Triumvirate.\nBut now we're strong, and unified in purpose.\nI know that together, there's nothing we can't do."
    voice "se/y01995.ogg"
    char_fortaime "我们所有人都被三人执政团束缚着。\n但现在我们变得强大，目标一致。\n我知道，只要我们同心协力，就没有做不到的事。"

# game/script.rpy:79849
translate chinese map237_1fab8766:

    # voice "se/y01996.ogg"
    voice "se/y01996.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:79851
translate chinese map237_42513ed0:

    # char_fortaime "And it's all the more special because I have you by my side.\nYou're the man that I love — and there's nothing that can change that.\nI'm following you to the ends of the world, to the highest reaches of the skies."
    char_fortaime "而因为我身边有你，这一切才更加特别。\n你是我爱的男人——没有什么能改变这一点。\n我会追随你到天涯海角，直至苍穹之巅。"

# game/script.rpy:79866
translate chinese map237_c01b6d2b:

    # voice "se/y01997.ogg"
    voice "se/y01997.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:79868
translate chinese map237_ef490c13:

    # char_fortaime "And it's all the more special because I have you by my side.\nYou're the woman I love — and there's nothing that can change that.\nI'm following you to the ends of the world, to the highest reaches of the skies."
    char_fortaime "而因为我身边有你，这一切才更加特别。\n你是我爱的女人——没有什么能改变这一点。\n我会追随你到天涯海角，直至苍穹之巅。"

# game/script.rpy:79882
translate chinese map237_cb478ba2:

    # voice "se/y01998.ogg"
    voice "se/y01998.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:79884
translate chinese map237_21096cdb:

    # char_fortaime "And I'll have your hand the entire time..."
    char_fortaime "而这一路上，我都会握着你的手……"

# game/script.rpy:79898
translate chinese map237_e487ba99:

    # "He slowly reaches down to my hand, and intertwines his fingers with mine.{w}\nThen he brings my hand up to his face, and gives the top a soft kiss."
    "他缓缓伸手握住我的手，与我十指相扣。{w}\n然后他把我的手举到面前，在手背上轻轻一吻。"

# game/script.rpy:79923
translate chinese map237_d55362a2:

    # voice "se/y01999.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "I wish this moment could last forever...\nBut that would be selfish of me. We have stuff to do.\nThankfully, we'll always have this memory. It's perfect."
    voice "se/y01999.ogg"
    char_fortaime "真希望这一刻能永远持续下去……\n但那样就太自私了。我们还有事要做。\n幸好，我们会永远拥有这段回忆。它完美无缺。"

# game/script.rpy:79940
translate chinese map237_b7b6fe67:

    # "He looks around the area one last time, admiring a view he may never see again."
    "他最后环顾四周，欣赏着也许再也见不到的景色。"

# game/script.rpy:79965
translate chinese map237_19923803:

    # voice "se/y02000.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "Well, should we get back down to the surface?\nI don't want to waste much time up here. We're busy, and all that.\nIt means a lot to me that we could share this moment. I'll never forget it."
    voice "se/y02000.ogg"
    char_fortaime "好吧，我们该回到地面去了吗？\n我不想在这儿浪费太多时间。我们很忙，之类的。\n能与你共享这一刻，对我意义重大。我永远不会忘记。"

# game/script.rpy:79980
translate chinese map237_df934ba0:

    # "With that, he starts to climb back down.{w}\nI follow after him, and make our way to the surface.{w}\nIt feels weird to be down here, after being so high up."
    "说完，他开始往下爬。{w}\n我跟着他，一路回到地面。{w}\n在那么高的地方待过之后，回到这里感觉怪怪的。"

# game/script.rpy:80005
translate chinese map237_7fc4cf72:

    # voice "se/y02001.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "So, what's next on the agenda...?\nYou know what? Never mind. You do you.\nI'll be around if you need me for any reason at all."
    voice "se/y02001.ogg"
    char_fortaime "那么，接下来还有什么安排……？\n算了。不问了。你做你的事吧。\n如果你有任何需要，我都在。"

# game/script.rpy:80034
translate chinese map237_503f0bb8:

    # "He walks away with a big smile on his face.{w}\nI guess a dream of his came true on that day.{w}\nWhen we got to Balteus, he'd have no regrets."
    "他脸上挂着大大的笑容走开了。{w}\n我想那天他实现了一个梦想。{w}\n等我们到巴尔泰乌斯时，他将毫无遗憾。"

# game/script.rpy:80064
translate chinese map239_70bdb99b:

    # "Pro leads me to Mazeo's town square, without saying much.{w}\nI'm not sure what's going on, but he seems happier than usual.{w}\nThings must be going well for him. I hope it's something good."
    "普洛没多说什么，带我来到马泽奥的城镇广场。{w}\n我不确定发生了什么，但他似乎比平时更开心。{w}\n他一定是碰上好事了。希望是件好事。"

# game/script.rpy:80066
translate chinese map239_c68f8188:

    # "After a while, he rests his back against a nearby house.{w}\nTapping his foot, it looks like he's waiting for something."
    "过了一会儿，他把背靠在旁边的一栋房子上。{w}\n他轻点着脚尖，似乎在等什么。"

# game/script.rpy:80091
translate chinese map239_b8392a07:

    # voice "se/y02032.ogg"
    voice "se/y02032.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:80094
translate chinese map239_3b1c8f21:

    # char_pro "Okay, [firstname]. You're not going to believe this!\nI got some information about my parents the other day.\nAfter pulling a few strings, I was able to set up a meeting."
    char_pro "好了，[firstname]。你肯定不敢相信！\n前几天我得到了关于我父母的消息。\n托了些关系之后，我安排了一次见面。"

# game/script.rpy:80108
translate chinese map239_22eebc71:

    # "That is actually a huge deal! I'm really happy for him."
    "这可真是件大事！我真为他高兴。"

# game/script.rpy:80133
translate chinese map239_1a96703a:

    # voice "se/y02033.ogg"
    # char_pro "As far as I know, it's just my Dad.\nI think my Mom was under the weather or something.\nBut at this point, I'll take whatever I can get. I'm so excited...!"
    voice "se/y02033.ogg"
    char_pro "据我所知，只有我父亲会来。\n我想我母亲身体不太舒服之类的。\n但事到如今，能见到谁我都愿意。我太激动了……！"

# game/script.rpy:80137
translate chinese map239_9976672a:

    # voice "se/y02034.ogg"
    # char_pro "I'll finally get to ask him what happened.\nDo you think I have any brothers or sisters?\nWait — don't answer that. I'll keep my hopes low."
    voice "se/y02034.ogg"
    char_pro "我终于能问他当年发生了什么。\n你觉得我有没有兄弟姐妹？\n等等——别回答。我还是别抱太大希望。"

# game/script.rpy:80152
translate chinese map239_b1327dba:

    # "He has a huge smile on his face, and I can understand why.{w}\nThis is something he's been looking forward to for his entire life.{w}\nThe ability to meet his parents, and find out why they abandoned him."
    "他脸上挂着大大的笑容，我理解为什么。{w}\n这是他一生都在期盼的事。{w}\n能够见到父母，弄清他们为何抛弃他。"

# game/script.rpy:80177
translate chinese map239_af445cf8:

    # voice "se/y02035.ogg"
    # char_pro "I almost don't believe this is happening.\nFor the last decade, I've had eyes and ears everywhere.\nPeople run around Mazeo, gathering information for me to sell."
    voice "se/y02035.ogg"
    char_pro "我几乎不敢相信这是真的。\n过去十年里，我到处都有眼线。\n人们在马泽奥四处奔走，为我搜集情报去贩卖。"

# game/script.rpy:80181
translate chinese map239_62b12e4a:

    # voice "se/y02036.ogg"
    # char_pro "I prefer to do all the work myself, but anything extra is a huge benefit.\nI'm good at selling, so they provide the info, and then we share the profit.\nWhen we got back from Alarinthia, one of them had a bunch of stuff to share."
    voice "se/y02036.ogg"
    char_pro "我更愿意凡事亲力亲为，但额外的收获也大有好处。\n我擅长兜售，所以他们提供情报，我们分成。\n我们从阿拉林西亚回来后，其中一人有一堆东西要告诉我。"

# game/script.rpy:80195
translate chinese map239_d3109e48:

    # voice "se/y02037.ogg"
    # char_pro "And one of them was the one piece of information I've been waiting to hear.\nMy parents were alive — and living in Mazeo. All those years, and they were so close.\nI bought the information from him myself. I paid more than I have for anything else in my life."
    voice "se/y02037.ogg"
    char_pro "其中一条正是我一直等着听到的消息。\n我的父母还活着——而且就住在马泽奥。这么多年，他们竟离我这么近。\n我亲自从他手里买下了这条情报。我付出的价钱比我此生买任何东西都多。"

# game/script.rpy:80199
translate chinese map239_227185ab:

    # voice "se/y02038.ogg"
    # char_pro "But you can't put a price on this kind of stuff, you know?\nMy future, and my heart is on the line. This is a {i}big{/i} deal.\nI hope we don't have to wait too much longer. I'm nervous."
    voice "se/y02038.ogg"
    char_pro "但这种事是无法用价钱衡量的，你懂吗？\n我的未来、我的心都悬在这里。这可是{i}天大的{/i}事。\n希望我们不用再等太久。我好紧张。"

# game/script.rpy:80214
translate chinese map239_8e51786f:

    # "That much was made evident by his constant rambling.{w}\nI press my back against the wall with him, and we wait together.{w}\nWe talk about random subjects — anything to pass the time, for now."
    "他不停地絮叨，已经说明了这一点。{w}\n我和他一起靠在墙上，一起等待。{w}\n我们聊些无关紧要的话题——眼下只要能打发时间就好。"

# game/script.rpy:80216
translate chinese map239_533e4e28:

    # "But after a while, finding topics to discuss becomes a little harder.{w}\nThat's not because our bond is weak, but because we've run out of topics.{w}\nThe time of the meeting approached, and then faded away. Nobody arrived."
    "但过了一会儿，找话题就变得有些困难了。{w}\n并非因为我们的情谊淡了，而是话题用光了。{w}\n约定的时间临近，又悄然过去。没有人来。"

# game/script.rpy:80241
translate chinese map239_8033aa62:

    # voice "se/y02039.ogg"
    # char_pro "I guess he's running a bit late...\nIt happens. I can't hold it against him."
    voice "se/y02039.ogg"
    char_pro "我想他是迟到了吧……\n这种事难免。我不能怪他。"

# game/script.rpy:80256
translate chinese map239_671f37a6:

    # "He smiles, and it's an incredibly nervous smile.{w}\nHe knows deep down inside that his words may not be true.{w}\nA couple more hours pass, but I don't abandon his side. Not even once."
    "他笑了，那笑容紧张得不行。{w}\n他内心深处知道，自己的话也许并不属实。{w}\n又过了几个小时，但我不曾离开他身边。一次也没有。"

# game/script.rpy:80281
translate chinese map239_2075b284:

    # voice "se/y02040.ogg"
    # char_pro "Any moment, now..."
    voice "se/y02040.ogg"
    char_pro "随时都会来了……"

# game/script.rpy:80296
translate chinese map239_d4ae97dd:

    # "After a while, we slump down and sit on the ground.{w}\nHis naive hope starts to dissipate into a harsh realization.{w}\nBut I can tell he doesn't want to admit it. So we continue to sit."
    "过了一会儿，我们颓然坐到地上。{w}\n他天真的希望开始消散，化为残酷的现实。{w}\n但我看得出他不愿承认。于是我们继续坐着。"

# game/script.rpy:80298
translate chinese map239_586ebe02:

    # "As the sun sets, people start to retreat to their homes.{w}\nI can tell that he's tired, and so am I. I close my eyes for a few moments.{w}\nIt wouldn't hurt to doze off for a little bit. I just need to make sure I don't leave him."
    "夕阳西下，人们开始各自回家。{w}\n我看得出他累了，我也是。我闭上眼休息了片刻。{w}\n打个盹也无妨。我只需确保自己不离开他。"

# game/script.rpy:80305
translate chinese map239_070dc1c0:

    # "I awaken a while later, unsure of the time.{w}\nBut it's dark — it must be the dead of night.{w}\nPro snores softly, with his head resting on my shoulder."
    "不知过了多久，我醒了过来，分不清时辰。{w}\n但天已经黑了——一定是深夜。{w}\n普洛轻轻打着鼾，头靠在我的肩上。"

# game/script.rpy:80310
translate chinese map239_0754e567:

    # "I awaken a while later, unsure of the time.{w}\nBut it's dark — it must be the dead of night.{w}\nPro rests beside me, snoring softly. Asleep."
    "不知过了多久，我醒了过来，分不清时辰。{w}\n但天已经黑了——一定是深夜。{w}\n普洛躺在我身旁，轻轻打着鼾。睡着了。"

# game/script.rpy:80314
translate chinese map239_747072bd:

    # "I know that in his slumber, he doesn't have to face the facts.{w}\nHis Dad never came. But why? Was he too afraid to follow through?{w}\nPro has a smile on his face. I can tell that he's still hopeful, even in sleep."
    "我知道，在睡梦中，他不必面对事实。{w}\n他父亲始终没来。可为什么？是他临阵退缩，不敢来了吗？{w}\n普洛脸上带着微笑。我看得出，即便在睡梦中，他依然抱有希望。"

# game/script.rpy:80316
translate chinese map239_da79d083:

    # "But he can't sleep forever. He needs to wake up and face this.{w}\nGiving him a soft nudge, he wakes up. But then, my heart is broken.{w}\nHe thinks I woke him up because his Dad arrived. He looks around, ecstatic."
    "但他不能永远睡下去。他需要醒来面对现实。{w}\n我轻轻推了推他，他醒了。可随即，我的心碎了。{w}\n他以为我叫醒他是因为他父亲来了。他环顾四周，欣喜若狂。"

# game/script.rpy:80318
translate chinese map239_869205ec:

    # "But then he realizes that it's just me and him.{w}\nHis ears fold back, and he laughs. Almost like he's not surprised.{w}\nI knew that this would be hard for him to face. But he was abandoned again."
    "但他随即意识到，只有我和他。{w}\n他的耳朵耷拉下来，笑了。几乎是毫不意外的样子。{w}\n我知道这会让他难以面对。可他再一次被抛弃了。"

# game/script.rpy:80343
translate chinese map239_3ae69b02:

    # voice "se/y02041.ogg"
    # char_pro "I guess I should've expected this."
    voice "se/y02041.ogg"
    char_pro "我想我本该料到的。"

# game/script.rpy:80358
translate chinese map239_9b0c691e:

    # "He sighs, and crosses his arms."
    "他叹了口气，双臂交叉。"

# game/script.rpy:80383
translate chinese map239_88bfab0f:

    # voice "se/y02041b.ogg"
    # char_pro "You know, I thought I'd give them the option.\nThey could come meet me when they were ready and willing.\nOther than that, my only option was to just march into their home."
    voice "se/y02041b.ogg"
    char_pro "你知道，我本想给他们一个选择。\n等他们准备好、愿意的时候，可以来见我。\n除此之外，我唯一的选择就是直接闯进他们家。"

# game/script.rpy:80390
translate chinese map239_14fe7739:

    # voice "se/y02042.ogg"
    # char_pro "Of course my courtesy just ends up stabbing me in the back.\nHe said he'd be here, [firstname]. He said he would, and I trusted him!"
    voice "se/y02042.ogg"
    char_pro "结果我的体谅反倒捅了我一刀。\n他说过会来的，[firstname]。他说过会来，我信了他！"

# game/script.rpy:80405
translate chinese map239_02a83cf5:

    # "He growls, and punches the nearby wall in a fit of rage."
    "他低吼一声，愤怒地一拳砸向旁边的墙。"

# game/script.rpy:80433
translate chinese map239_804c9303:

    # voice "se/y02043.ogg"
    # char_pro "It's not fair...!"
    voice "se/y02043.ogg"
    char_pro "这不公平……！"

# game/script.rpy:80448
translate chinese map239_eb09eb0f:

    # "He grunts in pain, and stands there, panting.{w}\nA few tears start to stream from his eyes."
    "他痛得闷哼一声，站在原地喘着气。{w}\n几滴泪水开始从他眼中滑落。"

# game/script.rpy:80473
translate chinese map239_46086084:

    # voice "se/y02044.ogg"
    # char_pro "Why don't they love me...?"
    voice "se/y02044.ogg"
    char_pro "他们为什么不爱我……？"

# game/script.rpy:80491
translate chinese map239_8a7caa68:

    # "I step forward, and wrap my arms around him.{w}\nHe starts crying more, and rests his head against my body."
    "我上前一步，张开双臂抱住他。{w}\n他哭得更厉害了，把头靠在我身上。"

# game/script.rpy:80496
translate chinese map239_d843e0cd:

    # "I step forward, and place a comforting arm on his shoulder.{w}\nHe starts crying a bit more, but I let him know that I'm here for him."
    "我上前一步，把手搭在他肩上安慰他。{w}\n他哭得又厉害了些，但我让他知道，我陪着他。"

# game/script.rpy:80512
translate chinese map239_6f5ea78b:

    # voice "se/y02045.ogg"
    voice "se/y02045.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:80514
translate chinese map239_ed15b895:

    # char_pro "I just wanted a family...\nMore than anything, I want to belong.\nIt hurts so much that they don't want me."
    char_pro "我只是想要一个家……\n我最想要的，就是有个归属。\n他们不要我，这太让人伤心了。"

# game/script.rpy:80517
translate chinese map239_03457766:

    # voice "se/y02046.ogg"
    # char_pro "I want to know why they threw me away.\nIt's all I've ever wanted to know. That's why I do what I do.\nI don't know if I can live the rest of my life without knowing the truth."
    voice "se/y02046.ogg"
    char_pro "我想知道他们为什么把我丢掉。\n这是我一直唯一想知道的。这就是我干这一行的原因。\n我不知道自己能不能在不知真相的情况下过完余生。"

# game/script.rpy:80532
translate chinese map239_a8d3d5ac:

    # "He starts to calm down, and soon enough, the tears fade.{w}\nI can tell he's super conflicted. He really wants to meet his parents.{w}\nBut if they don't want to meet him, there's really nothing he can do."
    "他开始平静下来，很快，泪水也止住了。{w}\n我看得出他内心极度矛盾。他真的很想见到父母。{w}\n但如果他们不想见他，他也实在无能为力。"

# game/script.rpy:80534
translate chinese map239_f34d55a5:

    # "It was cruel to schedule a meeting and then not follow through.{w}\nHis Dad must've gotten cold feet. Or maybe his Mother needed attention.{w}\n\"Under the weather\" could have any number of meanings. Not many of them good."
    "约好了见面却又不来，这太残忍了。{w}\n他父亲一定是临阵退缩了。又或者他母亲需要人照顾。{w}\n“身体不舒服”可以有很多种解释。多数都不太好。"

# game/script.rpy:80536
translate chinese map239_08af4c10:

    # "Either way, it's evident that this pursuit of the truth is causing him more harm than not.{w}\nIf he wasn't meant to know the truth — then perhaps he should focus on moving forward.{w}\nAfter all, he had a loving family in The Rebellion. We would never abandon him like this."
    "无论如何，很显然，追寻真相带给他的伤害比不去追更大。{w}\n如果他注定不该知道真相——那也许他该专注于向前看。{w}\n毕竟，他在反抗军里有爱他的家人。我们绝不会这样抛弃他。"

# game/script.rpy:80551
translate chinese map239_1037665c:

    # voice "se/y02047.ogg"
    # char_pro "I just don't know what I should do..." nointeract
    voice "se/y02047.ogg"
    char_pro "我只是不知道该怎么办才好……" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:80577
translate chinese map239_1be6ed61:

    # "I tell him to let go of his parents. He has a true family in all of his allies.{w}\nBlood isn't what makes you family. It's love, acceptance, and understanding.{w}\nIf his parents wouldn't give him that, then perhaps he should be abandoning them."
    "我告诉他，放下他的父母。他的所有战友就是他真正的家人。{w}\n血缘并不能决定谁是家人。爱、接纳与理解才能。{w}\n如果他的父母给不了这些，那也许该是他抛弃他们。"

# game/script.rpy:80602
translate chinese map239_35be6b8b:

    # voice "se/y02048.ogg"
    # char_pro "Let them go...? "
    voice "se/y02048.ogg"
    char_pro "放下他们……？"

# game/script.rpy:80617
translate chinese map239_1d866b50:

    # "He seems surprised, like nobody has suggested this to him before."
    "他似乎很惊讶，仿佛从没有人向他提过这个建议。"

# game/script.rpy:80642
translate chinese map239_757e91a7:

    # voice "se/y02049.ogg"
    # char_pro "I know you're right. I've tried, but it's really hard.\nWhat happened here today might change things, though.\nAfter everything I've tried, maybe this is the wake up call I needed."
    voice "se/y02049.ogg"
    char_pro "我知道你说得对。我试过，可真的很难。\n不过，今天在这里发生的事也许会改变一些东西。\n在试过一切之后，也许这正是我需要的当头棒喝。"

# game/script.rpy:80646
translate chinese map239_b0b0045f:

    # voice "se/y02050.ogg"
    # char_pro "Thanks, [firstname]."
    voice "se/y02050.ogg"
    char_pro "谢谢你，[firstname]。"

# game/script.rpy:80663
translate chinese map239_a8201a08:

    # "I tell him not to give up. If he could gain more info, he could pursue his parents.{w}\nHe's on the right track right now, so he shouldn't give up. He's so close.{w}\nEven if it doesn't end well — at least he'd finally know the truth."
    "我告诉他别放弃。如果能得到更多情报，他就能去追寻父母。{w}\n他现在走对了路，所以不该放弃。他就快成功了。{w}\n就算结局不好——至少他终于能知道真相。"

# game/script.rpy:80688
translate chinese map239_59deed4b:

    # voice "se/y02051.ogg"
    # char_pro "I never even considered giving up.\nAlthough, I came close just a moment ago.\nThis \"meeting\" was definitely a wake up call."
    voice "se/y02051.ogg"
    char_pro "我从没想过放弃。\n不过，就在刚才，我差点就放弃了。\n这次“见面”绝对是一记当头棒喝。"

# game/script.rpy:80692
translate chinese map239_e08c34d2:

    # voice "se/y02052.ogg"
    # char_pro "If they won't come to me, then I'll go to them.\nIt might not end well, but at least I'd get some answers.\nOr maybe I can send one of my men to ask them a few questions."
    voice "se/y02052.ogg"
    char_pro "如果他们不肯来见我，那我就去找他们。\n可能结局不好，但至少我能得到一些答案。\n或者，我可以派一个手下去问几个问题。"

# game/script.rpy:80696
translate chinese map239_ffcb68cf:

    # voice "se/y02053.ogg"
    # char_pro "Thanks, [firstname]."
    voice "se/y02053.ogg"
    char_pro "谢谢你，[firstname]。"

# game/script.rpy:80716
translate chinese map239_c71d4017:

    # "He smiles at me. I'm glad I could help him — even if it's only a little bit."
    "他朝我微笑。我很高兴能帮到他——哪怕只是一点点。"

# game/script.rpy:80741
translate chinese map239_9e907685:

    # voice "se/y02054.ogg"
    # char_pro "So, should we get going then?\nI guess you have a lot of things to do.\nGiven that, I'm really glad that you came with me."
    voice "se/y02054.ogg"
    char_pro "那么，我们该走了吗？\n我想你有很多事要忙。\n正因如此，我真的很高兴你陪我来了。"

# game/script.rpy:80755
translate chinese map239_28c706d2:

    # voice "se/y02055.ogg"
    # char_pro "I don't know how I would've handled this alone.\nHaving you by my side — it makes me stronger.\nAnd if there's anything I need right now, it's strength."
    voice "se/y02055.ogg"
    char_pro "我不知道独自一人该怎么面对。\n有你在身边——让我更坚强。\n如果说我现在需要什么，那就是力量。"

# game/script.rpy:80784
translate chinese map239_fdc1b876:

    # "With that, we start to walk away from the town square.{w}\nIt pained me to see him go through this. Nobody should feel abandoned.{w}\nBut at the end of the day, he had people like me to stand by his side and help."
    "说完，我们开始离开城镇广场。{w}\n看到他经历这些，我很心痛。谁都不该有被抛弃的感觉。{w}\n但归根结底，他还有像我这样的人站在他身边帮他。"

# game/script.rpy:80790
translate chinese map239_35fa26df:

    # "So no matter what happened — he'd never be alone."
    "所以无论发生什么——他都不会孤单。"

# game/script.rpy:80820
translate chinese map238_e63223d5:

    # "I stand alone in my room, swinging the blade from side to side.{w}\nEverything feels different than it did back at the start of my journey.{w}\nWhen I first touched the blade, I could barely even hold on to it."
    "我独自站在房间里，左右挥动着那把剑。{w}\n一切都与旅程开始时不同了。{w}\n我第一次触碰这把剑时，几乎连握都握不住。"

# game/script.rpy:80822
translate chinese map238_5952f661:

    # "But now, I'm starting to master it. I'm able to make it my own.{w}\nHowever, just as I think that — the blade disappears from my hand.{w}\nUlric laughs, and I turn around. I didn't even notice him come in."
    "但现在，我开始驾驭它了。我能让它为我所用。{w}\n然而，就在我这么想时——剑从我手中消失了。{w}\n乌尔里克笑起来，我转过身。我甚至没注意到他进来。"

# game/script.rpy:80847
translate chinese map238_a045959b:

    # voice "se/y02002.ogg"
    voice "se/y02002.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:80849
translate chinese map238_33b948a9:

    # char_ulric "Sorry. It's just an old prank I used to pull on Sovy.\nI'd take the blade from him when he least expected it.\nI guess it has a time and place. Sorry if I startled you."
    char_ulric "抱歉。这只是我以前常对索维使的老把戏。\n我会在他最意想不到的时候把剑拿走。\n我想这得分场合。如果我吓到你了，抱歉。"

# game/script.rpy:80863
translate chinese map238_8973b146:

    # "He swings the blade a few times, before handing it back to me.{w}\nI shake my head. He didn't startle me. It was actually kind of funny."
    "他挥了几下剑，然后递还给我。{w}\n我摇摇头。他没吓到我。其实还挺好笑的。"

# game/script.rpy:80888
translate chinese map238_75b589d0:

    # voice "se/y02003.ogg"
    # char_ulric "I came here because I assume you wanted answers.\nLearning I was The Grand Inquisitor must've been a shock.\nI'm glad you have a clear head. You could tell that I've changed."
    voice "se/y02003.ogg"
    char_ulric "我来这儿是因为我猜你想要答案。\n得知我曾是大审判官，一定让你很震惊。\n我很高兴你头脑清醒。你能看出我变了。"

# game/script.rpy:80903
translate chinese map238_8ce61eb8:

    # "I nod."
    "我点点头。"

# game/script.rpy:80918
translate chinese map238_ba094ff1:

    # voice "se/y02004.ogg"
    # char_ulric "But you deserve to know what I was like before I changed.\nIn order to hide from my past, I haven't exactly been honest.\nBut I wasn't lying to you. It was more like I was lying to myself."
    voice "se/y02004.ogg"
    char_ulric "但你应该知道我改变之前是什么样子。\n为了逃避过去，我算不上诚实。\n但我没有骗你。更像是在骗我自己。"

# game/script.rpy:80933
translate chinese map238_8fc12e60:

    # "In a way, it sort of makes sense. I just decide to let him talk.{w}\nHe approaches me, and sits down on the bed. I sit beside him."
    "某种意义上，这说得通。我决定让他说下去。{w}\n他走近我，在床边坐下。我坐到他身旁。"

# game/script.rpy:80958
translate chinese map238_5dc6ea7b:

    # voice "se/y02005.ogg"
    # char_ulric "There was a man named Ulric in Alarinthian legend.\nHe pledged to change the nation, just like I always have.\nThe barbaric way of running things was too much for him to bear."
    voice "se/y02005.ogg"
    char_ulric "阿拉林西亚的传说中有个叫乌尔里克的人。\n他发誓要改变这个国家，就像我一直想做的那样。\n那野蛮的统治方式令他无法忍受。"

# game/script.rpy:80962
translate chinese map238_f01f5df0:

    # voice "se/y02006.ogg"
    # char_ulric "A lot of the specific details have been lost to time, but it goes like this:\nHe was young, and his parents wanted the same thing. So they fought for it.\nThey died in the arena, and Ulric couldn't handle it. He ran away from the nation."
    voice "se/y02006.ogg"
    char_ulric "许多具体细节已湮没于岁月，但故事是这样的：\n他年少时，他的父母也怀着同样的愿望。于是他们为之抗争。\n他们死在竞技场里，乌尔里克无法承受。他逃离了这个国家。"

# game/script.rpy:80966
translate chinese map238_613a58e7:

    # voice "se/y02007.ogg"
    # char_ulric "But he pledged to return one day, and change Alarinthia for good.\nThe ideals passed on to him by his parents still live on to this day.\nThat's likely what inspired Vivien to launch his own insurrection."
    voice "se/y02007.ogg"
    char_ulric "但他发誓有朝一日要回来，彻底改变阿拉林西亚。\n父母传给他的理想，至今仍在延续。\n这很可能就是激励薇薇安发动叛乱的原因。"

# game/script.rpy:80980
translate chinese map238_2f55d2fd:

    # voice "se/y02008.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Of course, the story that's handed down is never really the truth.\nTo put it bluntly — I'm the same Ulric. It's been so long, it's hard to believe.\nI'm sure you had your suspicions, so I just came here to confirm them for you."
    voice "se/y02008.ogg"
    char_ulric "当然，流传下来的故事从来都不是真相。\n直说吧——我就是那个乌尔里克。过了这么久，实在难以置信。\n我确信你有过怀疑，所以我来这里替你证实。"

# game/script.rpy:80995
translate chinese map238_b3dea9da:

    # "It actually is a bit hard to believe, but I let him continue."
    "这确实有点难以置信，但我让他继续说。"

# game/script.rpy:81010
translate chinese map238_00eb700d:

    # voice "se/y02009.ogg"
    # char_ulric "My parents hated the way the nation was run.\nThey passed that hatred down on to me as I grew up. But they got older.\nBefore too long, they were decrepit. They could never change anything."
    voice "se/y02009.ogg"
    char_ulric "我父母痛恨这个国家的统治方式。\n我成长的过程中，他们把那份憎恨传给了我。但他们也在老去。\n没过多久，他们便年老体衰。他们再也改变不了什么。"

# game/script.rpy:81014
translate chinese map238_485cc00f:

    # voice "se/y02010.ogg"
    # char_ulric "So the burden was passed on to me, a rising star in the coliseum.\nI never fought for leadership. Just regular tournaments — but I never lost.\nOne day, I guess The Triumvirate noticed how strong I was. They approached me."
    voice "se/y02010.ogg"
    char_ulric "于是重担落到了我身上——竞技场里一颗冉冉升起的新星。\n我从不为领袖之位而战。只是参加普通比赛——但我从未输过。\n有一天，三人执政团大概是注意到了我有多强。他们找上了我。"

# game/script.rpy:81028
translate chinese map238_40cdd7a9:

    # voice "se/y02011.ogg"
    # char_ulric "They told me that if I left Alarinthia behind, they'd train me.\nThey'd give me the power to return one day, and change everything.\nI was young and naive. I agreed without hesitation. I wanted to serve our \"Gods\"."
    voice "se/y02011.ogg"
    char_ulric "他们告诉我，只要我抛下阿拉林西亚，他们就训练我。\n他们会赐我力量，让我有朝一日能回来，改变一切。\n我年轻又天真。毫不犹豫就答应了。我想侍奉我们的“神明”。"

# game/script.rpy:81032
translate chinese map238_64c7a3e9:

    # voice "se/y02012.ogg"
    # char_ulric "But before they accepted me, I had to prove that I was truly ready.\nServing them would involve leaving everything behind. It'd be a fresh start.\nThey devised a test for me. To make sure that I was truly ready to devote myself."
    voice "se/y02012.ogg"
    char_ulric "但在接纳我之前，我必须证明自己真的准备好了。\n侍奉他们意味着抛下一切。那将是全新的开始。\n他们为我设计了一场考验。以确保我真的准备好奉献自己。"

# game/script.rpy:81046
translate chinese map238_dd80ab4b:

    # voice "se/y02013.ogg"
    # char_ulric "They..."
    voice "se/y02013.ogg"
    char_ulric "他们……"

# game/script.rpy:81061
translate chinese map238_f9e60ee3:

    # "He gulps, like he's afraid to tell me what happens next."
    "他咽了口唾沫，似乎不敢告诉我接下来发生了什么。"

# game/script.rpy:81076
translate chinese map238_828f5340:

    # voice "se/y02014.ogg"
    # char_ulric "They made me kill my parents."
    voice "se/y02014.ogg"
    char_ulric "他们逼我杀了我的父母。"

# game/script.rpy:81091
translate chinese map238_93e4b5cb:

    # "He looks down at the floor."
    "他低头看着地面。"

# game/script.rpy:81116
translate chinese map238_84a1967a:

    # voice "se/y02015.ogg"
    # char_ulric "In their eyes, it told them that I was truly ready to leave my old life behind.\nBecause I was young, and stupid — it made a twisted kind of sense in my head.\nI did that they told me to. But as they died, I told them I was making their dream a reality."
    voice "se/y02015.ogg"
    char_ulric "在他们看来，这证明我真的准备好抛下旧日人生。\n因为我又年轻又愚蠢——这在我脑子里竟然扭曲地讲得通。\n我照他们说的做了。但在他们死去时，我告诉他们，我正在让他们的梦想成真。"

# game/script.rpy:81120
translate chinese map238_e0d3f717:

    # voice "se/y02016.ogg"
    # char_ulric "I was caught, and exiled into the desert. That's how I became a \"sixer\".\nI survived the trials — was branded with this tattoo — and showed my worth.\nTheir test was over. They took me over to Balteus and made me their servant."
    voice "se/y02016.ogg"
    char_ulric "我被抓住，流放到沙漠。我就是这样成了“六人众”的一员。\n我熬过了试炼——被烙上这个刺青——证明了自己的价值。\n他们的考验结束了。他们把我带到巴尔泰乌斯，让我做他们的仆从。"

# game/script.rpy:81134
translate chinese map238_073526ac:

    # voice "se/y02017.ogg"
    # char_ulric "I served them by weeding out insurrections and ensuring they remained in power.\nAfter what seemed like an eternity, they came up with the idea of giving me an Apprentice.\nThat's when I met Sovy. They preyed on his weakness and naivety much like they did mine."
    voice "se/y02017.ogg"
    char_ulric "我为他们效力，铲除叛乱，确保他们大权在握。\n在仿佛过了永恒之后，他们想出了给我派一个学徒的主意。\n我就是那时遇见索维的。他们利用他的软弱和天真，就像当初对我一样。"

# game/script.rpy:81138
translate chinese map238_5ebdb577:

    # voice "se/y02018.ogg"
    # char_ulric "We worked together, travelling the world, and killing The Triumvirate's enemies.\nEventually I realized that they weren't good people. I defected, and joined The Rebellion.\nIf the timeline seems confusing, it's because it is. We're talking about millennia here."
    voice "se/y02018.ogg"
    char_ulric "我们并肩行动，走遍世界，诛杀三人执政团的敌人。\n最终我意识到他们不是好人。我叛逃了，加入了反抗军。\n如果这时间线让人困惑，那是因为它本就如此。我们说的是数千年。"

# game/script.rpy:81153
translate chinese map238_3a67014f:

    # "He's lived for millennia...?"
    "他活了数千年……？"

# game/script.rpy:81178
translate chinese map238_34abd48d:

    # voice "se/y02019.ogg"
    # char_ulric "They gave us the \"gift\" of immortality. Well, they called it a gift.\nWe would never succumb to old age. And mortal wounds would easily fade.\nI felt unstoppable, like I was the king of the world. Nothing could get in my way."
    voice "se/y02019.ogg"
    char_ulric "他们赐予我们“永生”这份“礼物”。嗯，他们称它为礼物。\n我们永远不会因衰老而死。致命的伤口也会轻易愈合。\n我感觉自己势不可挡，仿佛是世界之王。没有什么能阻挡我。"

# game/script.rpy:81193
translate chinese map238_4e62ca5e:

    # "He shrugs, clearly embarrassed at admitting such a fact."
    "他耸耸肩，显然为承认这样的事实而难堪。"

# game/script.rpy:81208
translate chinese map238_0e06fb96:

    # voice "se/y02020.ogg"
    # char_ulric "But after a while, I realized it was a curse.\nIt's crazy how much your perspective can shift so fast.\nTaking the dream of immortality into real life — it became a nightmare."
    voice "se/y02020.ogg"
    char_ulric "但过了一段时间，我意识到那是个诅咒。\n人的看法竟能如此迅速地转变，真是不可思议。\n把永生的美梦带进现实——它变成了噩梦。"

# game/script.rpy:81223
translate chinese map238_48623ba5:

    # "With a slight scoff, he stands up and turns around to face me."
    "他轻蔑地哼了一声，站起身转过来面对我。"

# game/script.rpy:81238
translate chinese map238_ae4e8484:

    # voice "se/y02021.ogg"
    # char_ulric "They knew what they were doing. They were creating slaves.\nUsing that blade, they gave us what they deemed eternal life.\nI know we can use the blade, too — but we can't reverse it."
    voice "se/y02021.ogg"
    char_ulric "他们清楚自己在做什么。他们在制造奴隶。\n用那把剑，他们赐予我们所认为的永生。\n我知道我们也能使用那把剑——但我们无法逆转它。"

# game/script.rpy:81252
translate chinese map238_acba4f45:

    # voice "se/y02022.ogg"
    # char_ulric "That should've been the first sign.\nI thought we did this willingly, but we really had no choice.\nIt was all or nothing. An ultimatum. The biggest red flag."
    voice "se/y02022.ogg"
    char_ulric "那本该是第一个警示。\n我以为我们是自愿的，可其实我们别无选择。\n要么全盘接受，要么一无所有。最后通牒。最大的危险信号。"

# game/script.rpy:81256
translate chinese map238_5def6f87:

    # voice "se/y02023.ogg"
    # char_ulric "I've had this curse for far too long. It's made me a bad person.\nI no longer seek love, because everybody I love is just lost to time.\nI no longer seek happiness, because it's never permanent. Never."
    voice "se/y02023.ogg"
    char_ulric "这个诅咒缠着我太久了。它把我变成了一个坏人。\n我不再追寻爱，因为我所爱的每个人都消逝于时光。\n我不再追寻幸福，因为它从不长久。从不。"

# game/script.rpy:81270
translate chinese map238_f41b4b52:

    # voice "se/y02024.ogg"
    # char_ulric "These fleeting emotions may mean a lot to you — but not me.\nIt's an endless cycle of building myself up, only to be cut back down.\nI thought I'd be like this until the world rotted away. Until I met you, that is."
    voice "se/y02024.ogg"
    char_ulric "这些转瞬即逝的情感对你或许意义重大——但对我不是。\n这是无尽的循环：把自己建起，又被击倒。\n我以为我会这样直到世界腐朽。直到我遇见了你。"

# game/script.rpy:81288
translate chinese map238_123d3b46:

    # "He reaches out and holds my hands, squeezing them softly."
    "他伸出手握住我的手，轻轻捏了捏。"

# game/script.rpy:81313
translate chinese map238_80aef58b:

    # voice "se/y02025.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Someone who can use the blade. Someone who can lift the curse.\nAnd — after all we've been through — even someone I can grow old with.\nPlease use that blade, and give me my life back. I don't want to belong to them."
    voice "se/y02025.ogg"
    char_ulric "一个能用那把剑的人。一个能解除诅咒的人。\n而且——经历了这一切之后——还是一个能与我白头偕老的人。\n请用那把剑，把我的生命还给我。我不想再属于他们。"

# game/script.rpy:81317
translate chinese map238_6a2e5d27:

    # voice "se/y02026.ogg"
    # char_ulric "I think I want to belong to you..."
    voice "se/y02026.ogg"
    char_ulric "我想，我愿属于你……"

# game/script.rpy:81335
translate chinese map238_994b12eb:

    # "He smiles."
    "他笑了。"

# game/script.rpy:81360
translate chinese map238_22cc1836:

    # voice "se/y02027.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Now there's somebody else who can use the blade.\nSomebody to lift this curse, and give me my life back.\nMy life belongs to your cause, [firstname]. Not theirs."
    voice "se/y02027.ogg"
    char_ulric "现在有了另一个能用那把剑的人。\n一个能解除这诅咒，把我的生命还给我的人。\n我这条命属于你的事业，[firstname]。不属于他们。"

# game/script.rpy:81364
translate chinese map238_6399030b:

    # voice "se/y02028.ogg"
    # char_ulric "So please — give me that life.\nThen, after that, I can give it to you."
    voice "se/y02028.ogg"
    char_ulric "所以求你——把那条命给我。\n然后，在那之后，我可以把它交给你。"

# game/script.rpy:81381
translate chinese map238_04049d17:

    # "I could remove the curse The Triumvirate put on him...?{w}\nThat would be good, but then he'd be weak and vulnerable.{w}\nNo doubt the source of his strength is partly due to his \"immortality\"."
    "我能解除三人执政团加在他身上的诅咒……？{w}\n那固然好，但那样他会变得虚弱而脆弱。{w}\n毫无疑问，他的力量有一部分正是源自那份“永生”。"

# game/script.rpy:81383
translate chinese map238_e75846a7:

    # "If I remove it, he could perish during our attack on Balteus — and easily.{w}\nIt would be removing his biggest advantage, and I'm not sure what to do.{w}\nHe looks at me, awaiting my response. I don't know what to say next."
    "如果我解除它，他可能在我们进攻巴尔泰乌斯时丧命——而且是轻而易举地。{w}\n那等于夺走他最大的优势，我拿不定主意。{w}\n他看着我，等我的答复。我不知道接下来该说什么。"

# game/script.rpy:81398
translate chinese map238_5a2f95bb:

    # "I tell him I'll remove the curse.{w}\nHis face lights up like I've never seen before."
    "我告诉他，我会解除诅咒。{w}\n他的脸亮了起来，我从未见过他那样。"

# game/script.rpy:81403
translate chinese map238_e74065f2:

    # "He takes a few steps forward and plants a soft kiss on my cheek."
    "他上前几步，在我脸颊上轻轻一吻。"

# game/script.rpy:81419
translate chinese map238_51e07763:

    # voice "se/y02029.ogg"
    voice "se/y02029.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:81421
translate chinese map238_27e2b831:

    # char_ulric "Thank you so much..."
    char_ulric "太感谢你了……"

# game/script.rpy:81442
translate chinese map238_ef55839c:

    # "I grab the blade, and try to figure out what to do.{w}\nOne thing was for sure — he'd soon have his life back.{w}\nHe would have the freedom to grow old, and finally find peace."
    "我握起那把剑，试着弄清该怎么做。{w}\n有一点可以肯定——他很快就能取回自己的生命。{w}\n他将拥有衰老的自由，并终于得到安宁。"

# game/script.rpy:81455
translate chinese map238_fe03f90e:

    # "And before he leaves my room, I make sure that his dream becomes a reality."
    "在他离开我房间之前，我确保他的梦想成为现实。"

# game/script.rpy:81459
translate chinese map238_9235e70b:

    # "I tell him that I can't do it, and I apologize.{w}\nGoing into Balteus, it would likely become a death sentence.{w}\nI couldn't put a friend in a situation where they'd likely lose their life."
    "我告诉他我做不到，并向他道歉。{w}\n进入巴尔泰乌斯，这多半会变成一道死刑判决。{w}\n我不能把朋友置于很可能丧命的境地。"

# game/script.rpy:81461
translate chinese map238_e2bfd005:

    # "He crosses his arms, and I can tell that he's frustrated."
    "他双臂交叉，我看得出他很沮丧。"

# game/script.rpy:81486
translate chinese map238_1e7654f5:

    # voice "se/y02030.ogg"
    # char_ulric "You're lucky that I respect you.\nBut I'm not going to drop this — you have my word.\nThis is something I want for myself more than anything."
    voice "se/y02030.ogg"
    char_ulric "你很幸运，我敬重你。\n但我不会就此作罢——我向你保证。\n这是我最渴望为自己争取的东西，胜过一切。"

# game/script.rpy:81490
translate chinese map238_ca94c9a1:

    # voice "se/y02031.ogg"
    # char_ulric "And I plan to get it, some way or another."
    voice "se/y02031.ogg"
    char_ulric "而我打算得到它，无论如何。"

# game/script.rpy:81512
translate chinese map238_0df2969c:

    # "With that, he walks out of the room.{w}\nEven if that didn't end well, he still opened up to me.{w}\nI know that I had his trust and respect leading into the final battle."
    "说完，他走出了房间。{w}\n即便结局不算好，他仍然向我敞开了心扉。{w}\n我知道，在走向最终决战之前，我拥有他的信任与敬重。"

# game/script.rpy:81518
translate chinese map238_1770936c:

    # "But was that enough...? I guess I'd have to wait and find out."
    "但这就够了吗……？我想，只能等时间来揭晓。"

# game/script.rpy:81548
translate chinese map240_2e89f8bb:

    # "Damek leads me to the town square of Mazeo.{w}\nBecause of our recent conversations, I know what's going on.{w}\nHe's taking me to the spot where he lost his Mother during the occupation."
    "达梅克带我来到马泽奥的城镇广场。{w}\n因为我们近来的谈话，我知道这是怎么回事。{w}\n他要带我去占领期间他失去母亲的地方。"

# game/script.rpy:81550
translate chinese map240_5e2e9f70:

    # "It must be hard on him. I can see him shaking as we walk through the town.{w}\nBut if facing this painful memory helped him move on, it was my duty to assist him.{w}\nIn the coming storm, he needed to be resolute. Helping him would help all of us."
    "这对他来说一定很难受。穿过城镇时，我能看到他在发抖。{w}\n但如果直面这段痛苦的回忆能帮他走出来，那协助他就是我的责任。{w}\n在即将到来的风暴中，他必须坚定。帮他，就是帮我们所有人。"

# game/script.rpy:81575
translate chinese map240_6e912765:

    # voice "se/y02056.ogg"
    voice "se/y02056.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:81577
translate chinese map240_60c8ac65:

    # char_damek "I can't thank you enough for coming with me, [firstname].\nThere's not many people I trust this much. I'm really glad I have you.\nUntil today, I've only had dreams about doing this. But now, I'm strong enough."
    char_damek "你陪我一起来，我感激不尽，[firstname]。\n能让我如此信任的人不多。我真的很庆幸有你在。\n直到今天，我只能梦见做这件事。但现在，我足够坚强了。"

# game/script.rpy:81590
translate chinese map240_7899369e:

    # voice "se/y02057.ogg"
    # char_damek "And honestly, it's all because of you.\nI give a little credit to my near-death experience, but not all of it.\nYou've grown into a capable leader, and led us all down the right path."
    voice "se/y02057.ogg"
    char_damek "说实话，这都多亏了你。\n我把功劳分一点给我的濒死经历，但不是全部。\n你已成长为一个有能力的领袖，带领我们所有人走上了正确的道路。"

# game/script.rpy:81605
translate chinese map240_7db98e28:

    # "He smiles, and I smile back at him.{w}\nIt was nice to receive some support after all we've been through.{w}\nBeing the Monarch wasn't very easy. But it's a weight I had to carry."
    "他笑了，我也朝他笑了笑。{w}\n经历了这一切之后，能得到一些支持真好。{w}\n当君主并不轻松。但这是我必须背负的重量。"

# game/script.rpy:81607
translate chinese map240_fa30f0d8:

    # "We walk through the town square, taking back alleys for occasional shortcuts.{w}\nAfter a while, we end up at a large open area. I'm surprised they haven't built shops here."
    "我们穿过城镇广场，偶尔走后巷抄近路。{w}\n走了一阵，我们来到一片开阔的大空地。我很意外他们没在这里建商铺。"

# game/script.rpy:81632
translate chinese map240_9ac0800f:

    # voice "se/y02058.ogg"
    # char_damek "This is where town meetings are held.\nThey don't happen very often, but they need a big open space.\nThere's a lot of people in Mazeo, so everyone deserves a chance to attend."
    voice "se/y02058.ogg"
    char_damek "这里是举行镇民集会的地方。\n集会不常开，但需要一大片开阔场地。\n马泽奥人很多，所以每个人都该有机会参加。"

# game/script.rpy:81650
translate chinese map240_6527869e:

    # "Soon after that, however, his tone becomes more serious."
    "但没过多久，他的语气变得严肃起来。"

# game/script.rpy:81675
translate chinese map240_f0ef562c:

    # voice "se/y02059.ogg"
    # char_damek "A lot of bodies in one place...\nThat's just what they needed during the occupation.\nThis is where it happened, [firstname]. The stuff with my Mother."
    voice "se/y02059.ogg"
    char_damek "一大堆人聚在一处……\n那正是占领期间他们所需要的。\n就是在这里发生的，[firstname]。关于我母亲的那些事。"

# game/script.rpy:81690
translate chinese map240_38b7b36b:

    # "I nod at him as we take steps closer toward the center."
    "我们朝中心走去，我朝他点了点头。"

# game/script.rpy:81718
translate chinese map240_d6346f87:

    # voice "se/y02060.ogg"
    # char_damek "You may notice a crimson tint on the ground here.\nThis is where they piled the bodies during the attack.\nSo much blood — so much carnage. Permanently stained."
    voice "se/y02060.ogg"
    char_damek "你也许注意到这里的地面透着暗红。\n袭击时他们就把尸体堆在这里。\n那么多的血——那么多的杀戮。永远地渗进了地面。"

# game/script.rpy:81722
translate chinese map240_6fd3a0d4:

    # voice "se/y02061.ogg"
    # char_damek "Just like the memories in my head.\nAs hard as I try, I can't just scrub those off, either.\nEvery other night, I wake up in a cold sweat — crying."
    voice "se/y02061.ogg"
    char_damek "就像我脑海里的记忆一样。\n无论我怎么努力，也无法把它们擦掉。\n每隔一晚，我都会一身冷汗地惊醒——哭着醒来。"

# game/script.rpy:81726
translate chinese map240_a95f055e:

    # voice "se/y02062.ogg"
    # char_damek "I feel the lingering touch of her hand against mine.\nThen, the moment she goes away, it makes me feel empty inside.\nThere's nothing to feel, except all those corpses pressed against me."
    voice "se/y02062.ogg"
    char_damek "我能感觉到她的手留在我手上的余温。\n然后，在她消失的那一刻，我内心一片空虚。\n除了那些紧贴着我的尸体，什么都感觉不到。"

# game/script.rpy:81730
translate chinese map240_9f3bd19b:

    # voice "se/y02063.ogg"
    # char_damek "A warmth that slowly dissipates, leaving me cold and alone.\nI had to stay under them until things died down. Almost a whole day.\nThe moment I could — I got out — and took her pendent along with me."
    voice "se/y02063.ogg"
    char_damek "那份温暖缓缓消散，留我独自冰冷。\n我不得不躲在它们下面，直到外面平息。几乎整整一天。\n一有机会——我就爬了出来——并带走了她的吊坠。"

# game/script.rpy:81744
translate chinese map240_f183fb18:

    # voice "se/y02064.ogg"
    # char_damek "It's all I have to remember her by. But perhaps, that's why I can't let go.\nHow can you move on from something when you remind yourself of it every day?\nJust a thought, of course. But after all I've been through, at least it's a thought with merit."
    voice "se/y02064.ogg"
    char_damek "那是我纪念她的唯一物件。但也许，正因如此我才无法释怀。\n当你每天都提醒自己想起某件事时，又怎能放下它？\n当然，这只是我的想法。但经历了这一切，至少这想法有几分道理。"

# game/script.rpy:81759
translate chinese map240_e3630dd6:

    # "He holds up his hand, and shows me the pendent he's holding.{w}\nI've seen that a few times, now. He seems to carry it with him everywhere.{w}\nOf course, as he suggested, that also means he carries the memory along as well."
    "他抬起手，让我看他手里的吊坠。{w}\n到现在，我已见过几次了。他似乎走到哪儿都带着它。{w}\n当然，正如他所说，那也意味着他同时带着那份记忆。"

# game/script.rpy:81784
translate chinese map240_3bd7d119:

    # voice "se/y02065.ogg"
    # char_damek "Let's keep moving.\nI'll show you exactly where it happened.\nJust — stay close to me okay? This is hard."
    voice "se/y02065.ogg"
    char_damek "我们继续走吧。\n我会带你去看它确切发生的地方。\n只是——跟紧我，好吗？这很难受。"

# game/script.rpy:81799
translate chinese map240_daec8d50:

    # "I nod, and start to follow him as we venture deeper into the open area.{w}\nA podium rests at the center. Likely where they'd hold these meetings from.{w}\nSoon, I picture what this place would look like during the occupation. I cringe."
    "我点点头，跟着他深入那片空地。{w}\n中央立着一座讲台。多半就是他们开会时站的地方。{w}\n很快，我想象出占领期间这里会是什么模样。我不由得缩了缩身子。"

# game/script.rpy:81801
translate chinese map240_c584f880:

    # "After a while, Damek stops dead in his tracks, and looks down at the ground.{w}\nHis body language and reaction tells me that this is exactly where his trauma happened.{w}\nI position myself right beside him, and wait for him to speak. I couldn't rush him, now."
    "过了一会儿，达梅克猛地停住脚步，低头看着地面。{w}\n他的肢体语言和反应告诉我，这里正是他创伤发生的地方。{w}\n我站到他身边，等他开口。此刻我不能催他。"

# game/script.rpy:81826
translate chinese map240_ab021bae:

    # voice "se/y02066.ogg"
    # char_damek "Well, this is it..."
    voice "se/y02066.ogg"
    char_damek "好了，就是这里……"

# game/script.rpy:81841
translate chinese map240_d2c8a924:

    # "He clutches the pendent close to his chest."
    "他把吊坠紧紧贴在胸前。"

# game/script.rpy:81866
translate chinese map240_c85dd972:

    # voice "se/y02067.ogg"
    # char_damek "Would you sit with me, [firstname]?\nWe might be here for a while, after all."
    voice "se/y02067.ogg"
    char_damek "你愿意陪我坐一会儿吗，[firstname]？\n毕竟，我们可能要在这里待上一阵子。"

# game/script.rpy:81881
translate chinese map240_1ee64159:

    # "He sits down on the ground, attracting stares from a few passers-by.{w}\nI join him, caring more for his well-being than the judgment of those around us.{w}\nLooking down at the ground, he places the pendent down, and moves it around slightly."
    "他在地上坐下，引来几个路人的注视。{w}\n我在他身旁坐下，比起旁人的眼光，我更在意他的身心。{w}\n他低头看着地面，把吊坠放下，又轻轻拨弄了几下。"

# game/script.rpy:81906
translate chinese map240_40fe3e57:

    # voice "se/y02068.ogg"
    # char_damek "It was... right here, I think.\nYou never really forget, you know?\nI hope it's not weird to sit here with me."
    voice "se/y02068.ogg"
    char_damek "就是……这里吧，我想。\n有些事你永远不会真的忘记，你知道吗？\n希望陪我坐在这儿不会让你觉得奇怪。"

# game/script.rpy:81921
translate chinese map240_2f75bc8d:

    # "I shake my head, and let him do what he needs to do."
    "我摇了摇头，让他去做他需要做的事。"

# game/script.rpy:81936
translate chinese map240_2dd1949b:

    # voice "se/y02069.ogg"
    # char_damek "Coming here, to face what happened — I needed to do this.\nBut now I'm not sure what to do next. I mean, with the pendent.\nDo I leave it behind...? Just like my memories? Or do I hold on?"
    voice "se/y02069.ogg"
    char_damek "回到这里，去面对发生过的事——这是我必须做的。\n但事到如今，我不确定接下来该怎么做。我是说，这枚吊坠。\n我该把它留下吗……？就像我的记忆一样？还是该继续留着？"

# game/script.rpy:81951
translate chinese map240_db37cb9f:

    # "That was a good question, and I can tell it's bothering him."
    "这是个好问题，我看得出它正困扰着他。"

# game/script.rpy:81966
translate chinese map240_8f1ce67f:

    # voice "se/y02070.ogg"
    # char_damek "I'm sure someone will just come around and steal it, anyway.\nBut maybe that's for the best. It can be somebody else's burden.\nI think I've grown tired of carrying it around for my entire life."
    voice "se/y02070.ogg"
    char_damek "反正总会有人路过把它偷走的。\n但也许那样最好。让它成为别人的负担吧。\n我想，我已经厌倦了一辈子都带着它。"

# game/script.rpy:81970
translate chinese map240_a7a88a6e:

    # voice "se/y02071.ogg"
    # char_damek "However, I also don't want to regret doing this.\nI could be acting rashly in the face of our final battle.\nIt wouldn't be the first time somebody has done that, you know?"
    voice "se/y02071.ogg"
    char_damek "可是，我也不想为这件事后悔。\n面对最后的决战，我可能是在冲动行事。\n这种傻事，别人也不是第一次干了，你懂吗？"

# game/script.rpy:81985
translate chinese map240_89f7083a:

    # "I nod, and let him speak. "
    "我点点头，让他继续说下去。"

# game/script.rpy:82010
translate chinese map240_b89c46f2:

    # voice "se/y02072.ogg"
    # char_damek "Look at me. The world is at stake, and I'm worried about {i}this{/i}.\nYou know what? With everything you've done for us — I trust you.\nWhat do you think I should do, [firstname]? Take it, or leave it...?"
    voice "se/y02072.ogg"
    char_damek "看看我。世界都危在旦夕了，我却在为{i}这个{/i}发愁。\n你知道吗？看在你为我们做的一切份上——我信你。\n你觉得我该怎么做，[firstname]？带走，还是留下……？"

# game/script.rpy:82014
translate chinese map240_e3825fb8:

    # voice "se/y02073.ogg"
    # char_damek "Besides, I'm a bit biased here in almost every regard.\nYour head is more clear than mine, so it's worth a shot.\nWhat do you think I should do here? What's the right choice?" nointeract
    voice "se/y02073.ogg"
    char_damek "再说，这件事我几乎在各方面都夹带着私心。\n你比我头脑清醒，所以值得一试。\n你觉得我该怎么做？什么才是正确的选择？" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:82030
translate chinese map240_4dd3be53:

    # voice "se/y02074.ogg"
    # char_damek "You're probably right; and I don't want to make a mistake.\nPerhaps just coming here after all those years was enough.\nYou have no idea how much this means to me, [firstname]."
    voice "se/y02074.ogg"
    char_damek "你说得大概没错；我不想犯错。\n也许隔了这么多年，光是回到这里就已经足够了。\n你根本不知道这对我来说意味着什么，[firstname]。"

# game/script.rpy:82045
translate chinese map240_37a2292a:

    # "He picks the pendent up off the ground, and clutches it in his hand.{w}\nWe both stand up, and turn back in the direction we came from."
    "他把吊坠从地上拾起，攥在手心。{w}\n我们双双站起，转身朝来时的方向走去。"

# game/script.rpy:82069
translate chinese map240_6fe4e376:

    # voice "se/y02075.ogg"
    # char_damek "You're right. I think this is something I need to do.\nIt'll be hard, but I need to move on. I can't hold myself back.\nWe're fighting to liberate our world, and push forward, right?"
    voice "se/y02075.ogg"
    char_damek "你说得对。我想这件事我必须去做。\n会很难，但我得向前看。我不能拖住自己。\n我们是在为解放这个世界而战，要一路向前，对吧？"

# game/script.rpy:82073
translate chinese map240_9215ec03:

    # voice "se/y02076.ogg"
    # char_damek "It's a bit hypocritical for me to do the opposite to myself.\nI hope whoever picks it up goes on to take good care of it.\nIt means a lot to me, and I hope it can do that for others, too."
    voice "se/y02076.ogg"
    char_damek "要是我对自己做相反的事，那就有点虚伪了。\n希望捡到它的人能好好珍惜。\n它对我来说意义重大，也希望它能为别人带来同样的意义。"

# game/script.rpy:82088
translate chinese map240_577fff9e:

    # "He places his hand on the pendent, touching it one last time."
    "他把手覆在吊坠上，最后一次触碰它。"

# game/script.rpy:82113
translate chinese map240_b5433931:

    # voice "se/y02077.ogg"
    # char_damek "It's time for me to let go, Mother.\nThis was always yours. I was just... holding on to it for a while.\nI'll miss you, always. But your sacrifice for me will {i}never{/i} be forgotten."
    voice "se/y02077.ogg"
    char_damek "是时候放手了，母亲。\n它一直都是你的。我只是……替你保管了一阵子。\n我会永远想念你。但你为我所做的牺牲，{i}永远{/i}不会被遗忘。"

# game/script.rpy:82128
translate chinese map240_a67335a3:

    # "He smiles, and lets go of the pendent. It shimmers in the sun.{w}\nWe both stand up, and turn back in the direction we came from."
    "他笑了笑，松开了吊坠。它在阳光下微微闪光。{w}\n我们双双站起，转身朝来时的方向走去。"

# game/script.rpy:82154
translate chinese map240_7082f13b:

    # voice "se/y02078.ogg"
    voice "se/y02078.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:82156
translate chinese map240_d10412c1:

    # char_damek "Well then, should we get going?"
    char_damek "那么，我们该走了吗？"

# game/script.rpy:82184
translate chinese map240_20eadd97:

    # "I nod, and we start walking back the way we came.{w}\nBut Damek looks much happier and content than he did earlier.{w}\nPerhaps the events of today would give him a clear mind in the future."
    "我点点头，我们沿着来路往回走。{w}\n但达梅克看起来比刚才开心、满足了许多。{w}\n也许今天的事，会让他在将来保持清醒的头脑。"

# game/script.rpy:82190
translate chinese map240_9fc348f5:

    # "As our final battle was imminent — we would find out sooner rather than later."
    "最后的决战近在眼前——答案很快就会揭晓。"

# game/script.rpy:82220
translate chinese map242_41895481:

    # "Howl enters my quarters, carrying an aura of purpose with him.{w}\nAfter Eastcrown, I know that something big has been on his mind.{w}\nWe were so close to the final battle. It was probably time for us to talk."
    "豪尔走进我的房间，带着一股心意已决的气场。{w}\n经历了东冠之后，我知道他心里一直压着一件大事。{w}\n决战已近在咫尺。也许我们该谈谈了。"

# game/script.rpy:82245
translate chinese map242_fd28f713:

    # voice "se/y02105.ogg"
    voice "se/y02105.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:82248
translate chinese map242_b19c6c65:

    # char_howl "Monarch? We must speak with you.\nIt's about our upcoming attack on Balteus.\nAt least, we think it is. Things have been complicated." nointeract
    char_howl "君主？我们必须和您谈谈。\n是关于即将对巴尔泰乌斯发动的进攻。\n至少，我们觉得是。事情一直很复杂。" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:82265
translate chinese map242_36095cdd:

    # voice "se/y02106.ogg"
    voice "se/y02106.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:82268
translate chinese map242_2d84d18c:

    # char_howl "We may be walking into a trap.\nThis may all be part of The Triumvirate's plan." nointeract
    char_howl "我们可能正走进一个陷阱。\n这一切也许都在三人执政团的计划之中。" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:82275
translate chinese map242_cf3f95e6:

    # voice "se/y02107.ogg"
    voice "se/y02107.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:82278
translate chinese map242_dc9167c8:

    # char_howl "Take their blade, feed it power, and then bring it back.\nThis may be what they've wanted all along. We've seen it.\nEverything we've done has only made their weapon stronger." nointeract
    char_howl "夺走他们的剑，喂养它力量，再把它送回去。\n这也许正是他们一直想要的。我们看出来了。\n我们所做的一切，只是让他们的武器变得更强。" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:82295
translate chinese map242_6fa75bb1:

    # voice "se/y02108.ogg"
    voice "se/y02108.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:82297
translate chinese map242_06d75811:

    # char_howl "They let us steal their blade. They wanted it to happen.\nThey knew we'd bring it here, feed it death, and tap into the idol.\nBut not only that — we're bringing it right back to them, stronger than ever."
    char_howl "他们是故意让我们偷走那把剑的。这正是他们想要的。\n他们知道我们会把它带到这里，以死亡喂养它，并汲取灵像的力量。\n不仅如此——我们还会把它原样带回他们面前，比以往任何时候都更强。"

# game/script.rpy:82300
translate chinese map242_80d7a659:

    # voice "se/y02109.ogg"
    # char_howl "You may think we are wrong — that this is just a foolish theory.\nBut we must only look into the visions to realize the truth.\nThat, combined with some of your actions. Like clockwork." nointeract
    voice "se/y02109.ogg"
    char_howl "你可能觉得我们错了——觉得这不过是无稽之谈。\n但只要我们去看那些幻象，就能明白真相。\n再加上你的一些举动。就像上了发条一样，分毫不差。" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:82308
translate chinese map242_897fcadb:

    # voice "se/y02110.ogg"
    voice "se/y02110.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:82310
translate chinese map242_d76cd034:

    # char_howl "It's almost like sometimes, you have no other choice.\nYou say or do things that push us down a certain path.\nBut more often than not, that path leads us to death."
    char_howl "有时候，你几乎像是别无选择。\n你说出或做出的事，会把我们推上某条道路。\n而那条路，往往通往死亡。"

# game/script.rpy:82323
translate chinese map242_a9d5400c:

    # voice "se/y02111.ogg"
    # char_howl "How convenient then, that the blade feeds off of death.\nIn your hands, it has gotten more powerful than ever before.\nBut what force — what invisible hand — guides us down this path...?"
    voice "se/y02111.ogg"
    char_howl "那么，这把剑以死亡为食，又是多么方便啊。\n在你手中，它变得比以往任何时候都要强大。\n可究竟是什么力量——什么无形之手——在引导我们走上这条路……？"

# game/script.rpy:82327
translate chinese map242_95347649:

    # voice "se/y02112.ogg"
    # char_howl "It's quite simple, but we were always looking at it the wrong way.\nVenturing into Eastcrown, and seeing that ship, made us realize that.\nWhen we approached things from a different angle, it all made sense." nointeract
    voice "se/y02112.ogg"
    char_howl "其实很简单，只是我们一直看错了方向。\n深入东冠，看到那艘船，让我们明白了这一点。\n当我们换个角度看问题时，一切就都说得通了。" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:82335
translate chinese map242_c8c0b0cf:

    # voice "se/y02113.ogg"
    voice "se/y02113.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:82337
translate chinese map242_a5f57715:

    # char_howl "We've been struggling with visions of these “different” pasts.\nThey seemed to come out of nowhere, and complicate things.\nUntil recently, we only had to process visions of the future."
    char_howl "我们一直苦苦挣扎于那些“不同”过去的幻象。\n它们似乎凭空出现，把事情搅得一团乱。\n直到最近，我们要处理的还只是未来的幻象。"

# game/script.rpy:82351
translate chinese map242_975230b3:

    # "He crosses his arms."
    "他抱起了双臂。"

# game/script.rpy:82376
translate chinese map242_887abc3f:

    # voice "se/y02114.ogg"
    # char_howl "At least, that's what we thought."
    voice "se/y02114.ogg"
    char_howl "至少，我们当时是这么想的。"

# game/script.rpy:82391
translate chinese map242_144d7e34:

    # "I take a step forward, interested to see where he's going with this."
    "我上前一步，想知道他到底想说什么。"

# game/script.rpy:82406
translate chinese map242_efafda1e:

    # voice "se/y02115.ogg"
    # char_howl "But now we realize — we've never seen the future at all.\nIt's impossible to see what has not yet been written.\nBut it is easy to see what has already happened."
    voice "se/y02115.ogg"
    char_howl "但现在我们明白了——我们从未见过未来。\n看见尚未被书写之物是不可能的。\n但看见已经发生的事，却很容易。"

# game/script.rpy:82421
translate chinese map242_fc65aa26:

    # "Now he's lost me."
    "这下我听不懂了。"

# game/script.rpy:82446
translate chinese map242_f4e4f145:

    # voice "se/y02116.ogg"
    # char_howl "These visions of different pasts aren't as out of place as we thought.\nYou were told you had visions of the future, and chose to believe that fact.\nBut they are not visions of the future. They too, are simply different pasts."
    voice "se/y02116.ogg"
    char_howl "这些不同过去的幻象，并不像我们想的那么格格不入。\n有人告诉你那是未来的幻象，而你选择相信了这个说法。\n但它们不是未来的幻象。它们同样只是不同的过去。"

# game/script.rpy:82461
translate chinese map242_c7d659a4:

    # "What...?"
    "什么……？"

# game/script.rpy:82476
translate chinese map242_8033a67e:

    # voice "se/y02117.ogg"
    # char_howl "The key to all of this is The Blade of Exodus. It's a constant in every vision.\nBut the power within it varies, even when it shouldn't. There are... inconsistencies.\nEven if we have a vision of the same situation, the power inside the blade is different."
    voice "se/y02117.ogg"
    char_howl "这一切的关键是放逐之刃。它在每个幻象中都是恒定的。\n但它蕴含的力量却会变化，哪怕本不该如此。存在着……矛盾之处。\n即便我们看到的是同一个情景的幻象，剑中的力量也不一样。"

# game/script.rpy:82480
translate chinese map242_7f425699:

    # voice "se/y02118.ogg"
    # char_howl "The Triumvirate has some sort of dominion over time. That much is clear.\nThey possess the ability to grant their subjects eternal life. Like Ulrilc, and Sovy.\nWe need to operate under the assumption that this ability can be used in other ways."
    voice "se/y02118.ogg"
    char_howl "三人执政团对时间有某种掌控力。这一点很清楚。\n他们拥有赐予臣属永恒生命的能力。比如乌尔里克，还有索维。\n我们必须假设这种能力还可以用在别的方面。"

# game/script.rpy:82495
translate chinese map242_b8fb1c59:

    # "He eyes the blade on my back."
    "他盯着我背上的剑。"

# game/script.rpy:82520
translate chinese map242_d7bc5048:

    # voice "se/y02119.ogg"
    # char_howl "Mainly, in a way that could be used to strengthen The Blade of Exodus.\nThey could create a cycle — full of death and despair — that we are unable to break.\nWhen the cycle reaches an end, they could revert time, and gather that power all over again."
    voice "se/y02119.ogg"
    char_howl "主要是，用来强化放逐之刃。\n他们可以制造一个轮回——充满死亡与绝望——让我们无法打破。\n当轮回走到尽头，他们便能逆转时间，将那份力量再次收集起来。"

# game/script.rpy:82524
translate chinese map242_55c757ff:

    # voice "se/y02120.ogg"
    # char_howl "The visions of the future you thought you were having? They aren't what you thought.\nWe believe they are visions of cycles in the past. Perhaps cycles where we have perished.\nDid your visions of the “future” involve your death in any way? Think about this, Monarch."
    voice "se/y02120.ogg"
    char_howl "您以为您看到的那些未来幻象？它们并非您所想的那样。\n我们相信那是过去轮回的幻象。也许是我们在其中覆灭的轮回。\n您那些“未来”的幻象里，有没有以任何方式出现过您的死亡？好好想想，君主。"

# game/script.rpy:82539
translate chinese map242_52e1b695:

    # "Now that he mentions it, they did. I was stabbed by Sovy in the vision that started all of this.{w}\nAnd after touching the blade, my series of visions ended with me getting stabbed. That's odd.{w}\nI tell him these stories, and he smirks. It seems I'm only confirming his outlandish theories."
    "经他这么一提，确实有。在一切开始的那场幻象里，我被索维刺了一剑。{w}\n而触碰那把剑之后，我那一连串的幻象也以我被刺中告终。这很奇怪。{w}\n我把这些告诉他，他勾起嘴角。看来我只是在印证他那些荒诞的推论。"

# game/script.rpy:82564
translate chinese map242_e3fde0d7:

    # voice "se/y02121.ogg"
    # char_howl "Those were visions of past cycles, Monarch. Cycles where we failed.\nWhen we look at it like this, these different pasts make perfect sense.\nWe've been looking at them all wrong. That is — until just recently."
    voice "se/y02121.ogg"
    char_howl "那些是过去轮回的幻象，君主。我们失败的轮回。\n这么一想，那些不同的过去就完全说得通了。\n我们一直看错了它们。直到——最近才明白。"

# game/script.rpy:82568
translate chinese map242_f0fcc09a:

    # voice "se/y02122.ogg"
    # char_howl "It seems that we retain some prior knowledge from these cycles.\nPerhaps that is why we act in certain ways, as if we have no options.\nIn the back of our mind, we're pushing ourselves in the same direction." nointeract
    voice "se/y02122.ogg"
    char_howl "看来我们保留了一些来自那些轮回的旧有认知。\n也许正因如此，我们才会以某些方式行事，仿佛别无选择。\n在心底深处，我们一直把自己推向同一个方向。" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:82586
translate chinese map242_e6aed033:

    # voice "se/y02123.ogg"
    voice "se/y02123.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:82588
translate chinese map242_4fb29b36:

    # char_howl "We think The Triumvirate is manipulating time.\nThey are doing this in order to make the blade even stronger.\nThe Occupation, the formation of The Rebellion, and the attack in the tunnels?"
    char_howl "我们认为三人执政团在操纵时间。\n他们这么做，是为了让那把剑变得更强。\n占领、反抗军的成立，还有隧道里的那场袭击？"

# game/script.rpy:82591
translate chinese map242_b4c67989:

    # voice "se/y02124.ogg"
    # char_howl "All of those casualties simply served to give the blade more power.\nWe have no doubt that many will perish when we assault Balteus, as well.\nBut when the time comes, they can simply make it happen all over again."
    voice "se/y02124.ogg"
    char_howl "那些伤亡，不过是用来给那把剑增添力量。\n我们毫不怀疑，进攻巴尔泰乌斯时也会有许多人丧命。\n但当那一刻到来，他们只需让一切重新来过。"

# game/script.rpy:82606
translate chinese map242_01255f38:

    # "This is almost too much to comprehend."
    "这几乎让人难以理解。"

# game/script.rpy:82631
translate chinese map242_4877b591:

    # voice "se/y02125.ogg"
    # char_howl "It makes sense, when you think about it. Especially with these tunnels.\nThose suits of armor knew exactly how to fortify this place for your army.\nThey must've retained their knowledge, and adapted each and every time."
    voice "se/y02125.ogg"
    char_howl "仔细一想，确实有道理。尤其是这些隧道。\n那些空甲清楚地知道该如何为你的军队加固这个地方。\n他们必定保留了记忆，每一次都做出了调整。"

# game/script.rpy:82635
translate chinese map242_0bdff221:

    # voice "se/y02126.ogg"
    # char_howl "But only one question remains unanswered — why?\nWhy do they want to make this blade even stronger?\nWhat is their endgame? What do they desire...?"
    voice "se/y02126.ogg"
    char_howl "但只有一个问题还没有答案——为什么？\n他们为什么要让这把剑变得更强？\n他们的最终目的是什么？他们到底想要什么……？"

# game/script.rpy:82639
translate chinese map242_cba3fe1e:

    # voice "se/y02127.ogg"
    # char_howl "It is very possible that we are walking into a trap.\nThat is, unless, the blade has enough power to defeat them.\nTheir plan — if it's as I expect — is a double-edged sword." nointeract
    voice "se/y02127.ogg"
    char_howl "我们很可能正走进一个陷阱。\n除非，这把剑拥有足以击败他们的力量。\n他们的计划——如果真如我所料——是一把双刃剑。" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:82657
translate chinese map242_88c880ce:

    # voice "se/y02128.ogg"
    voice "se/y02128.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:82659
translate chinese map242_8381a568:

    # char_howl "An infinite cycle, created specifically to power the blade.\nThere must be a cycle — a “prime” cycle — where {i}we{/i} have the power to defeat them.\nA point where the blade is strong enough for us to win, but not yet strong enough for them."
    char_howl "一个无限的轮回，专门为给那把剑注入力量而被创造出来。\n必定存在一个轮回——一个“原初”轮回——在那里，{i}我们{/i}拥有击败他们的力量。\n一个剑的力量已足以让我们取胜，却还未强到足以让他们得逞的节点。"

# game/script.rpy:82662
translate chinese map242_4ae7a8f0:

    # voice "se/y02129.ogg"
    # char_howl "All we can do is hope that we've reached that cycle.\nThe power in that blade is immense, but is it enough...?\nHopefully you understand what we are trying to say."
    voice "se/y02129.ogg"
    char_howl "我们能做的，只有希望我们已经抵达了那个轮回。\n那把剑中的力量无比巨大，但是否足够……？\n希望你能明白我们想说什么。"

# game/script.rpy:82677
translate chinese map242_1f912022:

    # "He's trying to tell me that we're trapped in some sort of time loop?{w}\nA loop that The Triumvirate fashioned in order to give the blade power...?{w}\nAnd not only that, but I never saw the future. I only saw failed past endeavors."
    "他是想告诉我，我们被困在某种时间循环里？{w}\n一个由三人执政团精心设计、用来给那把剑注入力量的循环……？{w}\n不仅如此，我从未看见过未来。我看到的只是过去失败的尝试。"

# game/script.rpy:82679
translate chinese map242_84cc0db0:

    # "It's hard to believe, but death has definitely followed me and my allies.{w}\nIf their goal was to feed the blade with power, then they have certainly succeeded.{w}\nBut how far back does this cycle go? Could it reach as far back as The Occupation...?"
    "很难相信，但死亡确实一直追随着我和我的同伴们。{w}\n如果他们的目的是以力量喂养那把剑，那他们无疑是成功了。{w}\n但这个轮回上溯到多久以前？会不会一直追到占领时期……？"

# game/script.rpy:82681
translate chinese map242_2ebc67ad:

    # "Wait a minute."
    "等等。"

# game/script.rpy:82683
translate chinese map242_4ca1be0a:

    # "Attack Mazeo, kill innocents, and incite a rebellion.{w}\nAttack that rebellion, provoke them into attacking your home, and then destroy them.{w}\nWith what Howl said — it almost does seem likely that we're walking into a trap. This can't be."
    "袭击马泽奥，杀害无辜者，挑起一场叛乱。{w}\n袭击那场叛乱，激他们进攻你的家园，然后将他们摧毁。{w}\n结合豪尔所说的话——我们似乎真的要走进一个陷阱了。这不可能。"

# game/script.rpy:82708
translate chinese map242_0b0b1f3c:

    # voice "se/y02130.ogg"
    # char_howl "The reason we see these things is because of the energy within us.\nIt makes us sensitive, in a way that others are not. We are both special.\nBut I don't think visions are the only benefit of this power. There is more."
    voice "se/y02130.ogg"
    char_howl "我们能看见这些东西，是因为我们体内的能量。\n它让我们以一种旁人没有的方式变得敏锐。我们两个都很特别。\n但我认为幻象并非这份力量唯一的好处。还有更多。"

# game/script.rpy:82712
translate chinese map242_9fd6721b:

    # voice "se/y02131.ogg"
    # char_howl "Perhaps you see a flash of events that are happening elsewhere.\nPerhaps you can relive a conversation that has already happened.\nThese echoes of past cycles manifest themselves in many ways."
    voice "se/y02131.ogg"
    char_howl "也许你会瞥见别处正在发生的事件。\n也许你能重温一段已经发生过的对话。\n过去轮回的这些回响，会以许多种方式显现。"

# game/script.rpy:82726
translate chinese map242_6616f904:

    # voice "se/y02132.ogg"
    # char_howl "But when we look at it this way, everything makes sense.\nEverything has an explanation, and nothing is left up in the air.\nThe only question is — do you believe us? Do you think we are correct?" nointeract
    voice "se/y02132.ogg"
    char_howl "但这样看来，一切都说得通了。\n一切都有了解释，再没有悬而未决的事。\n唯一的问题是——你相信我们吗？你觉得我们说的对吗？" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:82742
translate chinese map242_3b4ecaf3:

    # voice "se/y02133.ogg"
    # char_howl "Very well. It was enough to get this off our chest.\nWe only ask that you keep it in mind in the future.\nWhen we get to Balteus, things may become clear."
    voice "se/y02133.ogg"
    char_howl "很好。能把这件事说出来，对我们来说就够了。\n我们只希望你在将来把它记在心里。\n等我们到了巴尔泰乌斯，事情或许会明朗起来。"

# game/script.rpy:82767
translate chinese map242_269b6d2c:

    # voice "se/y02134.ogg"
    # char_howl "Good. We knew you would see the truth of things.\nThis was an impossible matter to discuss with anybody else.\nWe are special, and now we finally understand the reason why."
    voice "se/y02134.ogg"
    char_howl "很好。我们就知道你会看清事情的真相。\n这件事无法和任何其他人谈论。\n我们很特别，而现在我们终于明白原因了。"

# game/script.rpy:82784
translate chinese map242_a973a301:

    # "He turns to leave, but tilts his head back to address me one more time.{w}\nI guess he wanted to leave no stone unturned before our attack on Balteus."
    "他转身要走，却又回过头来，再一次对我开口。{w}\n我猜，他想在进攻巴尔泰乌斯之前把事情彻查清楚，不留死角。"

# game/script.rpy:82809
translate chinese map242_fb8e1c2d:

    # voice "se/y02135.ogg"
    # char_howl "The Triumvirate is up to something — that much is clear.\nIf it aligns with our theory, at least you will be able to act.\nGetting caught off guard would damage us beyond repair."
    voice "se/y02135.ogg"
    char_howl "三人执政团在谋划着什么——这一点很清楚。\n如果这与我们的推论吻合，至少你还能做出应对。\n被打个措手不及，会给我们造成无法挽回的损失。"

# game/script.rpy:82813
translate chinese map242_979ae38a:

    # voice "se/y02136.ogg"
    # char_howl "That is not something we want our Monarch to endure.\nBe prepared for anything, for the enemy will stop at nothing.\nIf you can do this, then perhaps our victory will be more likely."
    voice "se/y02136.ogg"
    char_howl "那不是我们希望君主承受的事。\n做好万全准备，因为敌人会不择手段。\n如果您能做到这一点，也许我们获胜的希望就会更大。"

# game/script.rpy:82842
translate chinese map242_085a2ead:

    # "With that said, he sees himself out of my room.{w}\nThat all came out of nowhere, and I'm not sure how to react.{w}\nBut one thing was clear — there was so much we didn't know."
    "说完这些，他便自行离开了我房间。{w}\n这一切来得毫无预兆，我不知该如何反应。{w}\n但有一件事很清楚——我们不知道的事情太多了。"

# game/script.rpy:82848
translate chinese map242_e8a5552a:

    # "But would we learn the truth in Balteus?{w}\nOr would we even make it that far? I don't know.{w}\nI start to feel uneasy, even with all this new knowledge."
    "但我们能在巴尔泰乌斯得知真相吗？{w}\n还是说，我们根本撑不到那里？我不知道。{w}\n即便知道了这些新东西，我仍开始感到不安。"

# game/script.rpy:82854
translate chinese map242_8263a45e:

    # "Could we really have been fundamentally wrong about everything?{w}\nAs I go about my business, it's impossible to shake that thought out of my head."
    "我们对一切的理解，难道真的从根本上就错了？{w}\n在我处理日常事务时，这个念头始终挥之不去。"

# game/script.rpy:82886
translate chinese map148_a30cdc7d:

    # "Sovy and his crew quickly made their way back to the docks.{w}\nHiding in the alleyway, much like before, they gathered their bearings.{w}\nThings hadn't gone according to plan — their true mission was a failure."
    "索维和他的手下迅速返回了码头。{w}\n他们像之前一样躲在巷子里，重新定了定神。{w}\n事情没有按计划发展——他们真正的任务失败了。"

