    voice "se/x00353.ogg"
    char_sovy "那是他永远得不到的机会。\n他毫不犹豫地把你送去送死，记得吗？\n没必要给他一份他从未给过{i}你{/i}的体面。"

# game/script.rpy:83565
translate chinese map148_9359c6cd:

    # voice "se/x00354.ogg"
    voice "se/x00354.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:83567
translate chinese map148_c69b6f26:

    # char_sovy "Offering that olive branch is a good way to get yourself killed.\nThere's no going back now, Shane. You're one of us.\nAfter what you did, you're their enemy. For good."
    char_sovy "递出那根橄榄枝，只会让你送命。\n现在没有回头路了，肖恩。你是我们的人了。\n在你做了那些事之后，你就是他们的敌人。永远都是。"

# game/script.rpy:83592
translate chinese map148_a358badf:

    # voice "se/ShaneGen07.ogg"
    voice "se/ShaneGen07.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:83594
translate chinese map148_18723648:

    # char_shane "Hmm...?"
    char_shane "嗯……？"

# game/script.rpy:83619
translate chinese map148_81511ea1:

    # voice "se/x00356.ogg"
    voice "se/x00356.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:83621
translate chinese map148_fc5636bf:

    # char_sovy "Yes, but you are no longer an enemy of The Triumvirate.\nThey will sing your praise, and give you your every desire.\nThe victory of our battle was all thanks to you, Shane."
    char_sovy "没错，但你不再是三人执政团的敌人了。\n他们会歌颂你，满足你的每一个愿望。\n我们这场战斗的胜利，全靠你，肖恩。"

# game/script.rpy:83646
translate chinese map148_05babc9e:

    # voice "se/x00357.ogg"
    voice "se/x00357.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:83648
translate chinese map148_b010ae57:

    # char_shane "I'm not sure how to feel..."
    char_shane "我不知道该怎么想……"

# game/script.rpy:83673
translate chinese map148_2192a72c:

    # voice "se/x00358.ogg"
    voice "se/x00358.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:83675
translate chinese map148_38c11f45:

    # char_sovy "Sometimes you need to act, rather than react.\nPush those feelings aside, and focus on survival.\nThere are many rebels who will seek you out for revenge."
    char_sovy "有时候你需要主动行动，而不是被动反应。\n把那些感受抛到一边，专注于活下去。\n会有很多反抗军的人来找你报仇。"

# game/script.rpy:83700
translate chinese map148_cb8ca9e3:

    # voice "se/x00359.ogg"
    voice "se/x00359.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:83702
translate chinese map148_a5b47f66:

    # char_sovy "And I expect you to show all of them the {i}same{/i} treatment.\nWelcome to The Inquisition, Shane. The {i}right{/i} side of history."
    char_sovy "我希望你对他们所有人{i}一视同仁{/i}。\n欢迎加入审判庭，肖恩。站在历史{i}正确{/i}的一边。"

# game/script.rpy:83733
translate chinese map241_0e59336e:

    # "Sovy leads me to a boat, and takes me on a short voyage.{w}\nI have no idea where we're going, and our destination surprises me.{w}\nIt's not a place I've seen on any map, and looks unlike anything I've seen before."
    "索维带我上了船，走了一段短短的航程。{w}\n我完全不知道我们要去哪里，而目的地让我大吃一惊。{w}\n那是个我从未在任何地图上见过的地方，看起来也跟我以往见过的一切都不同。"

# game/script.rpy:83735
translate chinese map241_2fde8ea1:

    # "I follow behind him, unsure of where we'll even end up.{w}\nAfter a while, he turns to face me. I ask him for an explanation.{w}\nI trusted him enough to follow him here, but I had my limits."
    "我跟在他身后，连我们会到哪儿都心里没底。{w}\n过了一会儿，他转过身来面向我。我向他讨个说法。{w}\n我信任他，才跟到了这里，但我的信任也有限度。"

# game/script.rpy:83760
translate chinese map241_05e24496:

    # voice "se/y02079.ogg"
    voice "se/y02079.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:83762
translate chinese map241_68245211:

    # char_sovy "I know that we're almost at the end, [firstname].\nIt won't be much longer before we arrive on Baltean soil.\nSo it only makes sense that I show you where everything began."
    char_sovy "我知道我们快到终点了，[firstname]。\n再过不久，我们就要踏上巴尔泰乌斯的土地了。\n所以，带你去看看一切开始的地方，也是顺理成章。"

# game/script.rpy:83776
translate chinese map241_c07fb0f4:

    # "He gestures broadly at everything behind him."
    "他朝身后的一切大手一挥。"

# game/script.rpy:83791
translate chinese map241_c308e8ee:

    # voice "se/y02080.ogg"
    # char_sovy "I come from this backwater town. Born and raised.\nIt was wiped off the map after all the villagers were murdered.\nGiven time, it might have even become the fifth nation of Alestia."
    voice "se/y02080.ogg"
    char_sovy "我出生在这个穷乡僻壤。生于此，长于此。\n在村民全被杀光之后，它就从地图上被抹去了。\n假以时日，它甚至可能成为阿莱斯蒂亚的第五个国家。"

# game/script.rpy:83805
translate chinese map241_7c99a6e9:

    # voice "se/y02081.ogg"
    # char_sovy "But that was long ago, and nobody remembers this place.\nMy parents were in charge of the area. They were incredibly wealthy.\nThey had a force of men working the mines. Cheap labor — and big profits."
    voice "se/y02081.ogg"
    char_sovy "但那是很久以前的事了，没人记得这个地方。\n我的父母掌管着这片地区。他们富可敌国。\n他们有一批人在矿场干活。廉价的劳力——和丰厚的利润。"

# game/script.rpy:83820
translate chinese map241_b5a5376c:

    # "It seems like Sovy was finally opening up to me.{w}\nThat was important. I needed to know that he could be trusted.{w}\nAnd if things went well, his loyalty to our cause would be confirmed."
    "看来索维终于对我敞开心扉了。{w}\n这很重要。我需要确定他是可以信任的。{w}\n如果一切顺利，他对我们事业的忠诚就能得到证实。"

# game/script.rpy:83848
translate chinese map241_921b259e:

    # voice "se/y02082.ogg"
    # char_sovy "As their son, they had me oversee all of this labor.\nIt was my job to make sure everybody hit their goals.\nI performed admirably, and put my foot down when needed."
    voice "se/y02082.ogg"
    char_sovy "作为他们的儿子，他们让我监管所有这些劳作。\n我的职责就是确保每个人都达成目标。\n我干得很出色，必要时也绝不手软。"

# game/script.rpy:83863
translate chinese map241_aa10e238:

    # "He walks toward a nearby house, and puts his hand on it.{w}\nTaking a loud breath, I can tell he's reliving unpleasant memories."
    "他走向附近的一栋房子，把手搭在上面。{w}\n他重重地吸了口气，我看得出他正在重温那些不快的记忆。"

# game/script.rpy:83891
translate chinese map241_0ec7d68b:

    # voice "se/y02083.ogg"
    # char_sovy "Everything was going well, until the truth came out.\nThe people who raised me weren't my parents. Not even close.\nThey killed my parents while I was an infant, and took over this town."
    voice "se/y02083.ogg"
    char_sovy "一切都进展顺利，直到真相大白。\n养育我的人并不是我的父母。差得远了。\n在我还是个婴儿的时候，他们杀了我的父母，霸占了这座小镇。"

# game/script.rpy:83895
translate chinese map241_735c869c:

    # voice "se/y02084.ogg"
    # char_sovy "Raising me as their own, our relationship was built on a lie.\nI was serving killers, and usurpers. When I found out, I felt nothing but rage.\nThey stole this land — and the lives of its rightful rulers. Such an injustice."
    voice "se/y02084.ogg"
    char_sovy "他们把我当作亲生的养大，我们的关系却建立在谎言之上。\n我一直在侍奉凶手和篡位者。得知真相时，我心中只有愤怒。\n他们偷走了这片土地——还有它合法统治者们的性命。如此不公。"

# game/script.rpy:83910
translate chinese map241_aa4035b3:

    # "The hand he was resting on the house slowly turns into a clenched fist."
    "他搭在房子上的那只手，慢慢握成了拳。"

# game/script.rpy:83925
translate chinese map241_94c20e40:

    # voice "se/y02085.ogg"
    # char_sovy "I don't know what came over me, to be honest.\nI killed everybody. My so-called parents, and all the workers.\nI was lied to, by those who swore they loved me. I couldn't take it."
    voice "se/y02085.ogg"
    char_sovy "说实话，我不知道自己当时是怎么了。\n我把所有人都杀了。我所谓的父母，还有所有的工人。\n我被那些信誓旦旦说爱我的人欺骗了。我受不了。"

# game/script.rpy:83939
translate chinese map241_77e7e1c4:

    # voice "se/y02086.ogg"
    # char_sovy "By rule of inheritance, in that moment — this town became mine.\nBut there was nobody else, and I was all by myself. I no longer wanted to live.\nI took myself to the cliff's edge, and thought about throwing myself into the ocean."
    voice "se/y02086.ogg"
    char_sovy "依照继承的规矩，就在那一刻——这座小镇归我了。\n但再无他人，只剩我孤身一人。我不想再活下去了。\n我走到悬崖边，想着纵身跳进大海。"

# game/script.rpy:83954
translate chinese map241_6b876e32:

    # "He turns back to face me, and I can see how sad he really is."
    "他转回身面对我，我看得出他究竟有多悲伤。"

# game/script.rpy:83979
translate chinese map241_ca6fdd81:

    # voice "se/y02087.ogg"
    # char_sovy "That's when Ulric found me. He made sure I didn't do anything stupid.\nI don't know how he came across me when he did. I thought it could be providence.\nBut he saved me, and I told him everything. Instead of scolding me, he praised me."
    voice "se/y02087.ogg"
    char_sovy "就在这时，乌尔里克找到了我。他确保我没做出什么傻事。\n我不知道他怎么会那么巧遇上我。我以为那是天意。\n但他救了我，我把一切都告诉了他。他没有责备我，反而称赞了我。"

# game/script.rpy:83983
translate chinese map241_602df030:

    # voice "se/y02088.ogg"
    # char_sovy "I was shocked. I expected to be dragged to the nearest prison.\nBut he took me right to The Triumvirate, and told them my story.\nThat's when they wanted me to become his Apprentice. I accepted."
    voice "se/y02088.ogg"
    char_sovy "我很震惊。我以为自己会被拖进最近的监狱。\n但他直接把我带到了三人执政团面前，讲了我的故事。\n就在那时，他们希望我成为他的学徒。我答应了。"

# game/script.rpy:83987
translate chinese map241_7a28f84a:

    # voice "se/y02089.ogg"
    # char_sovy "My desire for justice was something they wanted on their side.\nBut I no longer fought for my home village. I fought for all of Alestia.\nI swore an oath to them — that I would always fight for the rulers of this world."
    voice "se/y02089.ogg"
    char_sovy "他们想让我这份对正义的追求为他们所用。\n但我不再为我的家乡而战。我为整个阿莱斯蒂亚而战。\n我向他们立下誓言——永远为这个世界的统治者而战。"

# game/script.rpy:84001
translate chinese map241_6e149920:

    # voice "se/y02090.ogg"
    # char_sovy "At the time, I believed it was them.\nBut learning the truth of The Monarchy? It just opened old wounds.\nI saw The Triumvirate in a new light — much like I saw my so-called parents."
    voice "se/y02090.ogg"
    char_sovy "当时，我相信统治者就是他们。\n但得知王室的真相？那只是揭开了旧伤。\n我用全新的眼光看待三人执政团——就像我看待我所谓的父母一样。"

# game/script.rpy:84005
translate chinese map241_39f32e21:

    # voice "se/y02091.ogg"
    # char_sovy "Once more, the desire for justice rose to the forefront of my mind.\nYou may think my allegiance changed, and that it was a sudden shift — but it's not true.\nI've always fought for the same thing. It's just that sometimes, the tables need a little turning."
    voice "se/y02091.ogg"
    char_sovy "对正义的渴望，又一次涌上我心头。\n你可能觉得我的效忠变了，而且变得很突然——但事实并非如此。\n我一直都在为同一件事而战。只是有时候，形势需要一点扭转。"

# game/script.rpy:84020
translate chinese map241_d0e7373d:

    # "He crosses his arms, and seems to be done talking for now.{w}\nHe leads me further into the village, and I follow — trusting him more.{w}\nWe eventually end up at a large building. One that served as the town hall."
    "他抱起双臂，看来暂时说完了。{w}\n他带我往村子深处走去，我跟在后面——对他多了几分信任。{w}\n我们最终来到一栋大建筑前。那是昔日的镇政厅。"

# game/script.rpy:84045
translate chinese map241_937b3a6e:

    # voice "se/y02092.ogg"
    # char_sovy "You may notice the bloodstains. \nBut don't worry. I threw all the bodies off a cliff with Ulric.\nYou won't be seeing anything gruesome, I can assure you."
    voice "se/y02092.ogg"
    char_sovy "你可能注意到了那些血迹。\n但别担心。我和乌尔里克把所有尸体都扔下悬崖了。\n我向你保证，你不会看到任何血腥的东西。"

# game/script.rpy:84060
translate chinese map241_a84c6137:

    # "What an odd way to put my mind at ease."
    "这安慰人的方式可真够奇怪的。"

# game/script.rpy:84075
translate chinese map241_b3b44b67:

    # voice "se/y02093.ogg"
    # char_sovy "This is where my parents lived. I was never really allowed in.\nI guess I should stop calling them my parents. They were more like captors.\nI longed to see the world, but I obeyed them out of a feeling of loyalty. I slaved away."
    voice "se/y02093.ogg"
    char_sovy "这是我父母住过的地方。我从没真正被允许进去过。\n我想我该别再叫他们父母了。他们更像是把我关起来的人。\n我渴望看看外面的世界，却出于一种忠诚感服从他们。我像奴隶一样干活。"

# game/script.rpy:84089
translate chinese map241_cb75624b:

    # voice "se/y02094.ogg"
    # char_sovy "Sometimes I'd sneak into my Father's office and peel the stamps off of his letters.\nThey were incoming letters, so it's not like they had any use. I started to collect them.\nI stuck them to my bedroom wall and told myself that one day, I'd go and see those places."
    voice "se/y02094.ogg"
    char_sovy "有时我会溜进父亲的办公室，把他信件上的邮票揭下来。\n那些都是寄来的信，所以邮票本来也没什么用处。我开始收集它们。\n我把它们贴在我卧室的墙上，告诉自己总有一天要去看看那些地方。"

# game/script.rpy:84093
translate chinese map241_ad4c8d14:

    # voice "se/y02095.ogg"
    # char_sovy "One day, I wanted to be free..."
    voice "se/y02095.ogg"
    char_sovy "有一天，我渴望自由……"

# game/script.rpy:84108
translate chinese map241_64432e71:

    # "He lets out a loud sigh."
    "他长叹一声。"

# game/script.rpy:84133
translate chinese map241_a75feed6:

    # voice "se/y02096.ogg"
    # char_sovy "I thought I was free when The Triumvirate took me in.\nBut it turns out I just traded one form of bondage for another.\nShackles moved from my wrists, to my heart. I don't know which is worse."
    voice "se/y02096.ogg"
    char_sovy "三人执政团收留我时，我以为自己自由了。\n但结果我只是用一种束缚换来了另一种束缚。\n镣铐从我的手腕移到了我的心上。我不知道哪一种更糟。"

# game/script.rpy:84148
translate chinese map241_f4e9e590:

    # "He holds a hand close to his heart."
    "他把一只手贴近心口。"

# game/script.rpy:84173
translate chinese map241_d5f10d76:

    # voice "se/y02097.ogg"
    # char_sovy "They pressed the blade against my chest, and gave me some of its power.\nIt allowed me to use it as my own, and gave me what they deemed “eternal life”.\nUlric grew to see this as an awful curse, but I embraced it; and to this day, I still do."
    voice "se/y02097.ogg"
    char_sovy "他们把剑按在我的胸口，给了我一部分它的力量。\n那让我能将它当作自己的武器使用，还给了我他们所谓的“永恒生命”。\n乌尔里克渐渐把这视为可怕的诅咒，我却欣然接受；直到今天，我依然如此。"

# game/script.rpy:84177
translate chinese map241_1ba7061e:

    # voice "se/y02098.ogg"
    # char_sovy "I see myself as a defender. I want to protect the reign of Alestia's true rulers.\nIf The Monarchy is restored to power, I will protect you, — and all of your descendants.\nYou have my word, and you know why I served the enemy. My virtue was simply misplaced."
    voice "se/y02098.ogg"
    char_sovy "我把自己看作一名守护者。我想守护阿莱斯蒂亚真正统治者的王权。\n如果王室重掌权力，我会保护你——以及你所有的后代。\n我说到做到，你也明白我为何曾为敌人效力。我的德行只是用错了地方。"

# game/script.rpy:84191
translate chinese map241_5a89621f:

    # voice "se/y02099.ogg"
    # char_sovy "But now it rests with you. The true heir to the throne of Alestia.\nAnd that is where it shall remain, as long as I've proven my loyalty to you.\nKnowing everything that you do — do you trust me to protect you in battle?" nointeract
    voice "se/y02099.ogg"
    char_sovy "但现在，它落在你身上。阿莱斯蒂亚王位的真正继承人。\n只要我向你证明了我的忠诚，它就会一直留在这里。\n既然你知道了这一切——你信得过我在战斗中保护你吗？" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:84216
translate chinese map241_02b651d2:

    # voice "se/y02100.ogg"
    # char_sovy "Thank you very much, Monarch.\nI knew I picked the right way to tell you the truth.\nIf we did this anywhere else, it might've fallen flat."
    voice "se/y02100.ogg"
    char_sovy "非常感谢你，君主。\n我就知道，我选对了告诉你真相的方式。\n要是换个地方说，可能就毫无效果了。"

# game/script.rpy:84231
translate chinese map241_93920e39:

    # "He smiles, and I can tell he's extremely relieved."
    "他笑了，我看得出他如释重负。"

# game/script.rpy:84256
translate chinese map241_1ea9e71e:

    # voice "se/y02101.ogg"
    # char_sovy "I needed to get this off my chest before our attack on Balteus.\nNot knowing whether I had your trust — it was too much.\nWe're comrades now, though; and I'm no longer worried."
    voice "se/y02101.ogg"
    char_sovy "我需要在进攻巴尔泰乌斯之前把这件事说出来。\n不知道是否得到了你的信任——这让我难以承受。\n不过现在我们已是同伴了；我不再担心。"

# game/script.rpy:84271
translate chinese map241_93a3c18d:

    # "With that, it seems like our business here is done.{w}\nThe choice to trust me with his past, and confide in me, meant a lot.{w}\nNone of my comrades had to carry their burdens alone. We were in this together."
    "就这样，我们在这里的事似乎结束了。{w}\n他选择信任我、把过去托付给我，这对我意义重大。{w}\n我的同伴们没有人需要独自背负重担。我们同舟共济。"

# game/script.rpy:84286
translate chinese map241_25c97417:

    # voice "se/y02102.ogg"
    # char_sovy "Very well. I respect your choice, Monarch.\nAs wrong as it is — it is your mistake to make.\nI can't say I didn't try to win you over. I really did."
    voice "se/y02102.ogg"
    char_sovy "好吧。我尊重你的选择，君主。\n无论这有多么错误——那也是你该犯的错。\n我不能说自己没有试着争取过你。我确实试过。"

# game/script.rpy:84301
translate chinese map241_98564de0:

    # "He lets out a loud sigh, and his shoulders slump down."
    "他长叹一声，肩膀垂了下来。"

# game/script.rpy:84326
translate chinese map241_2412d014:

    # voice "se/y02103.ogg"
    # char_sovy "Promise that you'll keep this between us.\nI wouldn't want anybody to... start talking.\nJust do that — and I promise to keep to myself."
    voice "se/y02103.ogg"
    char_sovy "答应我，这件事只留在我们之间。\n我不想让任何人……开始议论。\n你只要这么做——我就答应管好自己。"

# game/script.rpy:84341
translate chinese map241_26876d07:

    # "I nod, agreeing.{w}\nHe confided in me, and I respected that.{w}\nBut as far as trust went, I was still skeptical."
    "我点头应允。{w}\n他向我吐露了心事，我尊重这一点。{w}\n但说到信任，我仍持怀疑态度。"

# game/script.rpy:84367
translate chinese map241_67c6d1ce:

    # voice "se/y02104.ogg"
    voice "se/y02104.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:84369
translate chinese map241_70e2bff9:

    # char_sovy "Let's get back to Mazeo, alright?\nI'm sure there's lots to do before the end.\nThanks for joining me, but I think we need to leave."
    char_sovy "我们回马泽奥吧，好吗？\n我相信在终局之前还有很多事要做。\n谢谢你陪我来这一趟，但我想我们该走了。"

# game/script.rpy:84397
translate chinese map241_142a00f9:

    # "We start walking back the way we came, and head to our boat.{w}\nThis place was wiped off the map — I had no idea that it existed.{w}\nIt makes me wonder just what else this world could be hiding."
    "我们沿着来路往回走，朝我们的船去。{w}\n这个地方从地图上被抹去了——我根本不知道它还存在。{w}\n这让我不禁去想，这个世界还藏着多少别的东西。"

# game/script.rpy:84399
translate chinese map241_3195dfd2:

    # "Before we get on the boat, I look back at the town, one last time.{w}\nAfter the war was over, maybe we could rebuid this place, and grow it.{w}\nA new nation, with new rules. If we had the opportunity, we should seize it."
    "上船之前，我最后回头看了一眼那座小镇。{w}\n等战争结束后，也许我们可以重建这里，让它发展壮大。{w}\n一个全新的国家，全新的规则。如果我们有机会，就该抓住它。"

# game/script.rpy:84401
translate chinese map241_998bab37:

    # "We start to sail away, and leave this place behind us for now.{w}\nBut I know Sovy better than I did before, and that could only bring good."
    "我们启航离去，暂时把这里抛在身后。{w}\n但我比以前更了解索维了，这只会是好事。"

# game/script.rpy:84407
translate chinese map241_5afb1741:

    # "He was carrying a weight on his shoulders, and it was no longer there."
    "他肩上曾背负着沉重的负担，如今已不复存在。"

# game/script.rpy:84667
translate chinese map177_7bf5b77b:

    # "As soon as we enter the town square, Ulric motions for all of us to stay close.{w}\nPeople run amok, while others try to peddle their wares, waving us over.{w}\nIt almost seems just like Mazeo, but the products must be different."
    "我们一走进城镇广场，乌尔里克就打手势让我们都跟紧些。{w}\n人们四处奔走，另一些人则兜售着货物，朝我们挥手招呼。{w}\n这里几乎跟马泽奥一模一样，只是货物想必不同。"

# game/script.rpy:84692
translate chinese map177_43873c23:

    # voice "se/z01738.ogg"
    voice "se/z01738.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:84694
translate chinese map177_a2e41af6:

    # char_ulric "Good, the tavern is in the same place.\nIt's just over there, so we'll make it on time."
    char_ulric "很好，酒馆还在老地方。\n就在那边，我们能准时赶到。"

# game/script.rpy:84708
translate chinese map177_a0200586:

    # "He crosses his arms, and looks around the town square.{w}\nThen, he rubs his arm in a way that almost hides his tattoo.{w}\nBut it's too late. I can already see the townspeople staring."
    "他抱起双臂，环顾着城镇广场。{w}\n接着，他揉着手臂，动作几乎遮住了他的纹身。{w}\n但已经太迟了。我已经看到镇民们在盯着看。"

# game/script.rpy:84710
translate chinese map177_824c2a0d:

    # "Ulric was definitely hiding something from all of us.{w}\nI'd hate to say he's losing our trust, but he's definitely suspicious.{w}\nNothing he's told me adds up with what the Alarinthians have said."
    "乌尔里克肯定对我们所有人隐瞒了什么。{w}\n我不想说他在失去我们的信任，但他确实很可疑。{w}\n他告诉我的话，和阿拉林西亚人所说的完全对不上。"

# game/script.rpy:84712
translate chinese map177_b97ecb8d:

    # "Almost out of fear, it seems that the townspeople avoid us.{w}\nEye contact is as far as we go, leaving us lots of room to maneuver.{w}\nI guess that helps. It'd suck if they all invaded our personal bubble."
    "镇民们似乎在恐惧之下躲着我们。{w}\n最多只是对视一眼，给我们留出了充足的活动空间。{w}\n我想这样也好。要是他们全挤进我们的私人空间，那才叫难受。"

# game/script.rpy:84737
translate chinese map177_960b9349:

    # voice "se/z01739.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Let's not waste too much time out here, alright?\nI think we only have a few hours until the ball begins.\nI'll stay here, but feel free to look around for a bit."
    voice "se/z01739.ogg"
    char_ulric "我们别在外面浪费太多时间，好吗？\n我想距离舞会开始只剩几个小时了。\n我会待在这儿，不过你们可以随便逛逛。"

# game/script.rpy:84759
translate chinese map177_d0dd23cc:

    # "Honestly, I expected Alarinthia to be different.{w}\nBut it looks like I'm staring at an alternate version of Mazeo.{w}\nThe only thing that stands out is the architecture, and the heat."
    "说实话，我本以为阿拉林西亚会不一样。{w}\n但看来我盯着的不过是另一个版本的马泽奥。{w}\n唯一突出的东西是建筑风格，还有那股热浪。"

# game/script.rpy:84761
translate chinese map177_7cd55299:

    # "That heat..."
    "那股热浪……"

# game/script.rpy:84763
translate chinese map177_2602063e:

    # "It didn't change one bit when we got to the city.{w}\nHowever, the natives seem used to it, walking around with ease.{w}\nMost of them aren't fully clothed, wearing a getup much like Ulric's."
    "进了城之后，它一点也没减弱。{w}\n不过当地人似乎习以为常，走起路来从容自在。{w}\n他们大多穿得不多，打扮和乌尔里克差不多。"

# game/script.rpy:84765
translate chinese map177_7c2bdfac:

    # "I guess it's my fault for expecting something different out of this place.{w}\nBefore we head to the tavern, I decide to look around for a few minutes.{w}\nMaybe it would be a good idea to talk to Ulric as well. He's acting strange."
    "我猜是我自己不对，不该指望这地方能有什么不同。{w}\n去酒馆之前，我决定先四处看看几分钟。{w}\n也许顺便和乌尔里克谈谈是个好主意。他举止很反常。"

# game/script.rpy:85295
translate chinese click_map178_6_EV006_44be7415:

    # "It's a book about Sixers — criminals in Alarinthia's past."
    "这是一本关于“六人帮”的书——阿拉林西亚历史上的罪犯。"

# game/script.rpy:85354
translate chinese click_map178_6_EV006_6cffd2b2:

    # "I look through the market stalls. There's a few books on display.{w}\nThere's one about \"Sixers\", so I figure I should give it a read.{w}\nThat term has been thrown around recently, and I wanted to learn more."
    "我翻了翻市场摊位。上面摆着几本书。{w}\n其中一本是关于“六人帮”的，我想我该读一读。{w}\n这个词最近常被提起，我想多了解一些。"

# game/script.rpy:85416
translate chinese click_map178_7_EV007_09b76bfd:

    # "It's a book about Draycu's reign over Alarinthia."
    "这是一本关于德雷库统治阿拉林西亚的书。"

# game/script.rpy:85477
translate chinese click_map178_7_EV007_05879e16:

    # "On top of the crates, rests a book about Draycu's reign.{w}\nPerhaps some young Alarinthians were reading up on him before the ball.{w}\nIt definitely paints a grim picture of the nation. Draycu must be very strong."
    "箱子上放着一本关于德雷库统治的书。{w}\n也许有些年轻的阿拉林西亚人在舞会前研读他。{w}\n它确实把这个国家描绘得一派阴森。德雷库一定非常强大。"

# game/script.rpy:85552
translate chinese Ulric1_map178_62_0_bf5fce45:

    # char_ulric "Hey." nointeract
    char_ulric "嘿。" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:85569
translate chinese Ulric1_map178_62_0_c974864b:

    # voice "se/y01322.ogg"
    # char_ulric "I have no idea, but it doesn't really matter.\nI'm pretty sure that we could handle whatever they throw at us.\nBut if he truly {i}does{/i} work for Vivien, then we have some good luck."
    voice "se/y01322.ogg"
    char_ulric "我不知道，但那也不重要。\n我很确定，不管他们扔给我们什么，我们都能应付。\n但如果他{i}真的{/i}为薇薇安效力，那我们的运气还不错。"

# game/script.rpy:85573
translate chinese Ulric1_map178_62_0_7d549ff8:

    # voice "se/y01323.ogg"
    # char_ulric "We could use some of that, couldn't we?\nSo for now, I'm going to believe Drakeor. But only for now.\nIf anything seems suspicious at the tavern, I'll tip you off."
    voice "se/y01323.ogg"
    char_ulric "我们正需要点好运，不是吗？\n所以眼下，我打算相信德雷克。但只是眼下。\n如果在酒馆里发现任何可疑之处，我会给你通风报信。"

# game/script.rpy:85587
translate chinese Ulric1_map178_62_0_b864e659:

    # voice "se/y01324.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Although, the prospect of a tavern brawl does sound appealing.\nYou haven't seen true fighting until you've seen it in Alarinthia.\nJust thinking about it gets my blood boiling. It's been too long."
    voice "se/y01324.ogg"
    char_ulric "不过，酒馆斗殴这种事听起来倒是挺诱人的。\n你只有在阿拉林西亚见过打斗，才算见识过真正的战斗。\n光是想想就让我热血沸腾。已经太久了。"

# game/script.rpy:85601
translate chinese Ulric1_map178_62_0_1d172e02:

    # voice "se/y01325.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Of course, I'll try my best to keep our visit a peaceful one.\nI don't want to end up fighting for our freedom in the coliseum.\nTheir methods of punishing prisoners are still pretty harsh."
    voice "se/y01325.ogg"
    char_ulric "当然，我会尽力让我们这趟行程平安无事。\n我可不想最后在竞技场里为自由而战。\n他们惩罚囚犯的手段还是相当残酷。"

# game/script.rpy:85621
translate chinese Ulric1_map178_62_0_3aabeee9:

    # voice "se/y01326.ogg"
    # char_ulric "I hate to talk about this, so I'll try making it quick.\nVivien obviously isn't the first person to rebel against Alarinthia's laws.\nThe first one, at least in recorded history, was named Ulric — like me."
    voice "se/y01326.ogg"
    char_ulric "我不喜欢谈这个，所以尽量长话短说。\n薇薇安显然不是第一个反抗阿拉林西亚法律的人。\n至少在有记载的历史上，第一个反抗的人叫乌尔里克——和我同名。"

# game/script.rpy:85625
translate chinese Ulric1_map178_62_0_4b3714f2:

    # voice "se/y01327.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Many people followed after his ideals, including my parents.\nSo much so, that they decided to name me after him. I don't like it.\nThat's all it is, really. My name is a silly little tribute."
    voice "se/y01327.ogg"
    char_ulric "许多人追随他的理想，包括我的父母。\n他们甚至因此决定用他的名字给我命名。我不喜欢这样。\n真的就是这么回事。我的名字不过是种傻气的致敬。"

# game/script.rpy:85639
translate chinese Ulric1_map178_62_0_a1fcf827:

    # voice "se/y01328.ogg"
    # char_ulric "I guess it doesn't help that I also actually look like him.\nOr at least, all artistic and textual descriptions of him.\nA pretty cool coincidence, but that's all it is."
    voice "se/y01328.ogg"
    char_ulric "我想，我自己还真长得像他，这也让事情更糟。\n或者至少，像所有关于他的绘画和文字描述。\n很酷的巧合，但也仅此而已。"

# game/script.rpy:85643
translate chinese Ulric1_map178_62_0_57092d86:

    # voice "se/y01329.ogg"
    # char_ulric "I knew this stuff would come up as soon as we got here.\nJust remember, you've known me long before this trip.\nDon't come to judge me by the things these people say."
    voice "se/y01329.ogg"
    char_ulric "我就知道一到这儿，这些事就会被翻出来。\n记住，你在这趟旅程之前早就认识我了。\n别因为这些人的话就来评判我。"

# game/script.rpy:85663
translate chinese Ulric1_map178_62_0_a9de247b:

    # voice "se/y01330.ogg"
    # char_ulric "I'd rather not talk about that, right now.\nBut I have a feeling you'll find out soon enough.\nIt's complicated, and we're really short on time."
    voice "se/y01330.ogg"
    char_ulric "我现在不太想谈这个。\n但我觉得你很快就会知道的。\n事情很复杂，而且我们时间真的不多。"

# game/script.rpy:85677
translate chinese Ulric1_map178_62_0_b9b47bf0:

    # voice "se/y01331.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Just trust me, alright? It's nothing bad.\nI earned these — they weren't ripped off.\nLet's grab a drink in the tavern and chat."
    voice "se/y01331.ogg"
    char_ulric "相信我就好，行吗？不是什么坏事。\n这些是我挣来的——不是抢来的。\n我们去酒馆喝一杯，聊一聊。"

# game/script.rpy:85697
translate chinese Ulric1_map178_62_0_c4392726:

    # voice "se/y01332.ogg"
    # char_ulric "That's none of your business. Not yet.\nAgain, just trust me, okay...? Please.\nThere's lots going on that you don't know."
    voice "se/y01332.ogg"
    char_ulric "那不关你的事。至少现在还不关。\n再说一次，相信我就好，行吗……？拜托。\n有很多事你都不知道。"

# game/script.rpy:85711
translate chinese Ulric1_map178_62_0_a8df275c:

    # voice "se/y01333.ogg"
    # char_ulric "That's not to say that you'll never know it.\nJust sit back and wait until the time is right.\nI promise that everything will make sense soon."
    voice "se/y01333.ogg"
    char_ulric "我不是说你永远不会知道。\n你只管安心等着，等到时机合适。\n我保证，很快一切就都会说得通了。"

# game/script.rpy:85731
translate chinese Ulric1_map178_62_0_3de6719d:

    # voice "se/y01334.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Other than the tavern, not really.\nThere's just the market stalls, like Mazeo.\nHowever, there's no laws in place for this stuff."
    voice "se/y01334.ogg"
    char_ulric "除了酒馆，还真没什么。\n只有像马泽奥那样的市场摊位。\n不过，这些东西在这里没有法律管制。"

# game/script.rpy:85735
translate chinese Ulric1_map178_62_0_18e92632:

    # voice "se/y01335.ogg"
    # char_ulric "You can buy whatever you want in Alarinthia.\nPirates make a living bringing illicit goods overseas.\nSo whatever your heart desires, you can probably find."
    voice "se/y01335.ogg"
    char_ulric "在阿拉林西亚，你想买什么都能买到。\n海盗靠把违禁品运到海外为生。\n所以你心里想要的东西，大概都能找到。"

# game/script.rpy:85749
translate chinese Ulric1_map178_62_0_b0eaf261:

    # voice "se/y01336.ogg"
    # char_ulric "But I don't think you're the type of person to want that stuff.\nSo if it's all the same to you, we should probably get to the tavern.\nRemember, we're on a bit of a schedule. Our time is valuable."
    voice "se/y01336.ogg"
    char_ulric "但我觉得你不是会想要那种东西的人。\n所以如果你不介意，我们该去酒馆了。\n记住，我们的行程有点紧。时间宝贵。"

# game/script.rpy:85796
translate chinese click_map178_65_EV065_3b5554ca:

    # "There's tons of vases and jars full of whatever product people are peddling.{w}\nFortaime inspects them with a curiosity that I almost can't describe.{w}\nHowever, Ulric is pretty quick to put that curiosity to an end."
    "那里堆满了花瓶和罐子，装满了人们兜售的各种货品。{w}\n福泰姆带着一种我几乎无法形容的好奇心打量着它们。{w}\n不过，乌尔里克很快就终结了那份好奇。"

# game/script.rpy:85799
translate chinese click_map178_65_EV065_02f0e86e:

    # voice "se/a00289.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Hey, cut that out.\nYou have no idea what's in there.\nIt could be drugs, or illegal weapons."
    voice "se/a00289.ogg"
    char_ulric "嘿，别碰那个。\n你根本不知道里面装着什么。\n可能是毒品，或是非法武器。"

# game/script.rpy:85803
translate chinese click_map178_65_EV065_b1a00173:

    # voice "se/a00290.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "There are illegal weapons...?"
    voice "se/a00290.ogg"
    char_fortaime "还有非法武器……？"

# game/script.rpy:85807
translate chinese click_map178_65_EV065_a125fb86:

    # voice "se/a00291.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Oh, of course. You have to improvise around here.\nYour goal is to always be stronger than everyone else.\nThat requires some creativity, especially in weapon design."
    voice "se/a00291.ogg"
    char_ulric "哦，当然。在这地方你得随机应变。\n你的目标就是永远比所有人都强。\n那需要一些创造力，尤其是在武器设计上。"

# game/script.rpy:85811
translate chinese click_map178_65_EV065_d017d9ef:

    # voice "se/a00292.ogg"
    # char_ulric "The greatsword even originated in Alarinthia.\nYou don't see many people carrying them on the mainland.\nI was raised with it, though — so I can't use anything else."
    voice "se/a00292.ogg"
    char_ulric "巨剑甚至就起源于阿拉林西亚。\n在大陆上，你很少见到有人带着它。\n不过我从小就用它——所以别的武器我都用不惯。"

# game/script.rpy:85815
translate chinese click_map178_65_EV065_80e9a8c1:

    # voice "se/a00293.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "Whoa, that's pretty cool.\nI wonder what I can find, then!"
    voice "se/a00293.ogg"
    char_fortaime "哇，那可真酷。\n不知道我能找到些什么！"

# game/script.rpy:85819
translate chinese click_map178_65_EV065_1c60c57d:

    # voice "se/a00294.ogg"
    # char_ulric "What part of illegal don't you understand?\nThere are laws in place to prevent more inhumane creations.\nBut those laws fail to reach places like the town square markets."
    voice "se/a00294.ogg"
    char_ulric "“非法”两个字你哪部分听不懂？\n是有法律来防止制造更不人道的东西。\n但那些法律管不到像城镇广场集市这样的地方。"

# game/script.rpy:85823
translate chinese click_map178_65_EV065_c44ff3b0:

    # voice "se/a00295.ogg"
    # char_ulric "You could touch something laced with poison, or worse.\nJust keep your hands off of this stuff and stay close to me.\nAlways assume that everything here is out to get you."
    voice "se/a00295.ogg"
    char_ulric "你可能碰到涂了毒的东西，或者更糟的。\n别碰这些东西，跟紧我。\n永远假设这里的一切都想害你。"

# game/script.rpy:85827
translate chinese click_map178_65_EV065_5bb8eb64:

    # voice "se/a00296.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "Wow, you make this place sound so luxurious.\nBut alright. I'll do what you say — for now."
    voice "se/a00296.ogg"
    char_fortaime "哇，你把这里说得可真是奢华。\n不过好吧。我照你说的做——暂时。"

# game/script.rpy:85865
translate chinese click_map178_66_EV066_a667d32c:

    # "People run around the town square, clearly on a mission.{w}\nIt's more chaotic than Mazeo, and that's definitely saying something.{w}\nValessa stands there, watching everybody intently. She seems very interested."
    "人们在城镇广场上四处奔忙，显然各有要事。{w}\n这里比马泽奥还要混乱，这可不是随便说说的。{w}\n瓦莱莎站在那里，专注地看着每一个人。她似乎非常感兴趣。"

# game/script.rpy:85868
translate chinese click_map178_66_EV066_fb24f906:

    # voice "se/a00297.ogg"
    # char_valessa "Is this place always so busy?"
    voice "se/a00297.ogg"
    char_valessa "这地方总是这么忙碌吗？"

# game/script.rpy:85872
translate chinese click_map178_66_EV066_edb4749d:

    # voice "se/a00298.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Yeah. It can even get worse.\nThe busy hours are closer to night time.\nBut not tonight, with the ball and all."
    voice "se/a00298.ogg"
    char_ulric "是啊。有时候还会更糟。\n最忙的时段接近夜晚。\n但今晚不会，毕竟有舞会。"

# game/script.rpy:85876
translate chinese click_map178_66_EV066_1a48402c:

    # voice "se/a00299.ogg"
    # char_valessa "Do people live in their market stalls, like Mazeo?"
    voice "se/a00299.ogg"
    char_valessa "人们像在马泽奥一样，住在自己的摊位里吗？"

# game/script.rpy:85880
translate chinese click_map178_66_EV066_602d48c4:

    # voice "se/a00300.ogg"
    # char_ulric "No, not really. They get enough business to have their own homes.\nIt's actually the opposite here. Running a stall is a sign of wealth."
    voice "se/a00300.ogg"
    char_ulric "不，基本上不是。他们生意够好，都有自己的家。\n在这里其实正相反。经营摊位是财富的象征。"

# game/script.rpy:85884
translate chinese click_map178_66_EV066_72aa3809:

    # voice "se/a00300b.ogg"
    # char_valessa "So the more you work, the more money you make.\nSee, that actually makes sense. Don't you think?"
    voice "se/a00300b.ogg"
    char_valessa "所以你干得越多，赚的钱就越多。\n你看，这其实挺有道理的。你不觉得吗？"

# game/script.rpy:85888
translate chinese click_map178_66_EV066_73176303:

    # voice "se/a00301.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Yeah, but it doesn't make up for the other shortcomings.\nThe markets are busy, and unsafe. People die all the time.\nIt's a cutthroat culture here, so you're always in danger."
    voice "se/a00301.ogg"
    char_ulric "是啊，但这弥补不了其他缺点。\n市场又忙又危险。总是有人丧命。\n这里的风气残酷无情，所以你永远身处险境。"

# game/script.rpy:85892
translate chinese click_map178_66_EV066_fbac58f1:

    # voice "se/a00302.ogg"
    # char_ulric "If I could choose a place to open up shop, I'd choose Mazeo.\nIt might be harder, and less profitable, but it'd be safe.\nYou wouldn't get caught up in other people's fights."
    voice "se/a00302.ogg"
    char_ulric "如果让我选个地方开店，我会选马泽奥。\n可能更难，利润也更少，但至少安全。\n你不会被卷进别人的争斗里。"

# game/script.rpy:85896
translate chinese click_map178_66_EV066_1df07482:

    # voice "se/a00303.ogg"
    # char_valessa "That happens here?"
    voice "se/a00303.ogg"
    char_valessa "这里会发生那种事？"

# game/script.rpy:85900
translate chinese click_map178_66_EV066_8857d9d1:

    # voice "se/a00304.ogg"
    # char_ulric "All the time. It's almost unavoidable.\nYou can't turn around without bumping into anybody here.\nIt gets worse the deeper you go. But we won't go that deep."
    voice "se/a00304.ogg"
    char_ulric "经常发生。几乎无法避免。\n在这儿，你一转身都会撞到人。\n越往深处越糟。不过我们不会去那么深。"

# game/script.rpy:85904
translate chinese click_map178_66_EV066_198218c5:

    # voice "se/a00305.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Of course, the flowing of alcohol doesn't make things easier.\nPeople are always rowdy, looking for some fun, or a fight.\nYou also wouldn't be able to get some peace and quiet."
    voice "se/a00305.ogg"
    char_ulric "当然，酒水畅流也让事情更难办。\n人们总是吵吵嚷嚷，寻欢作乐，或者找架打。\n你也别想得到片刻安宁。"

# game/script.rpy:85908
translate chinese click_map178_66_EV066_c4798f50:

    # voice "se/a00306.ogg"
    # char_valessa "Alright, alright — you win.\nWhy do so many people do it then?\nI mean, set up shop, and put up with that?"
    voice "se/a00306.ogg"
    char_valessa "好吧好吧——你赢了。\n那为什么还有这么多人做这行？\n我是说，开店，还要忍受这些？"

# game/script.rpy:85912
translate chinese click_map178_66_EV066_41b83a73:

    # voice "se/a00307.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Probably because they don't know anything else.\nGetting to the mainland is the last thing on their minds.\nWherever you grow up, that's what \"normal\" is to you."
    voice "se/a00307.ogg"
    char_ulric "大概是因为他们不知道别的生活方式。\n去大陆是他们最不关心的事。\n你在哪里长大，那里对你来说就是“正常”。"

# game/script.rpy:85916
translate chinese click_map178_66_EV066_624bdeb9:

    # voice "se/a00308.ogg"
    # char_valessa "I guess that makes sense.\nValinorth is normal to me, and Mazeo is weird.\nBut I bet it'd be the other way around for Damek."
    voice "se/a00308.ogg"
    char_valessa "我想这说得通。\n瓦利诺斯对我来说是正常的，马泽奥就很古怪。\n但我打赌对达梅克来说正好相反。"

# game/script.rpy:85920
translate chinese click_map178_66_EV066_64625c54:

    # voice "se/a00309.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Exactly."
    voice "se/a00309.ogg"
    char_ulric "正是如此。"

# game/script.rpy:85986
translate chinese map251_5dc44509:

    # "I make my way to the docks, happy to see that almost everybody else has done the same.{w}\nOur forces line the entire area. Dozens of ships are ours to command. We stand a real chance.{w}\nMaking my way down the docks, I notice all of our forces talking amongst themselves."
    "我朝码头走去，很高兴看到几乎其他所有人都已经到了。{w}\n我们的部队排满了整片区域。数十艘船归我们调遣。我们真的有机会。{w}\n一路走过码头，我注意到我们的部队都在彼此交谈。"

# game/script.rpy:85988
translate chinese map251_3f274cac:

    # "This is the unity that our world needed. The unity that we're fighting for.{w}\nThough not everybody saw eye-to-eye, they could all co-exist with one another.{w}\nThere would be no more oppression for those who thought differently than our rulers."
    "这就是我们的世界所需要的团结。我们为之奋斗的团结。{w}\n尽管并非所有人意见一致，他们却能彼此共存。{w}\n再也不会有因为想法与统治者不同而遭受的压迫。"

# game/script.rpy:85990
translate chinese map251_3e38292b:

    # "That is, of course — if we won."
    "当然——前提是我们赢了。"

# game/script.rpy:85992
translate chinese map251_64639cf3:

    # "Mylus is nowhere to be seen, but somehow I'm not surprised.{w}\nHe came to Alarinthia and back, and for that I was grateful.{w}\nIt was time for him to rest, and focus on what to do next."
    "哪里都看不到迈勒斯，但我不知为何并不意外。{w}\n他跟着去了阿拉林西亚又回来，为此我心怀感激。{w}\n该让他休息了，专注于下一步该怎么做。"

# game/script.rpy:85997
translate chinese map251_c74f7bea:

    # "I notice Sovy helping our forces load supplies onto the boats.{w}\nThe gamble of letting him join our side seems to be paying off.{w}\nI'm certain his help would be invaluable as we entered Balteus."
    "我注意到索维在帮我们的部队把物资搬上船。{w}\n让他加入我们这一方的这场赌注，看来正在得到回报。{w}\n我确信，在我们进入巴尔泰乌斯时，他的帮助将无比宝贵。"

# game/script.rpy:86002
translate chinese map251_0da61b66:

    # "Staying true to his word, Sovy was nowhere to be seen.{w}\nIt's probably for the best. Letting him help us was too risky.{w}\nBut part of me wonders if I'd ever see him again after this."
    "索维信守诺言，哪里都见不到他。{w}\n这大概是最好的结果。让他帮我们太冒险了。{w}\n但我心里有一部分在想，这之后我还会不会再见到他。"

# game/script.rpy:86006
translate chinese map251_a38df915:

    # "As I continue down the docks, eyes start to fixate on me.{w}\nNot just me, but the blade upon my back as well. They all knew who I was.{w}\nAt this moment, I feel the weight resting on my shoulders — but I stand strong."
    "我继续沿着码头走着，目光开始聚集在我身上。{w}\n不只是我，还有我背上的那把剑。他们都知道我是谁。{w}\n此刻，我感受到肩上的重担——但我依然挺立。"

# game/script.rpy:86008
translate chinese map251_b4948cb2:

    # "This was a burden that I was ready to carry.{w}\nNo — this was a burden that I was {i}born{/i} to carry.{w}\nI smile at them as I walk by, and they do so in turn."
    "这是我准备好背负的重担。{w}\n不——这是我{i}生来{/i}就要背负的重担。{w}\n走过时我对他们微笑，他们也报以微笑。"

# game/script.rpy:86013
translate chinese map251_8ca10392:

    # "As I walk, I eventually run into Damek.{w}\nHe's overseeing everybody's efforts — making sure it goes smoothly.{w}\nThere was a lot to transport. We'd all need weapons, food, and drink."
    "走着走着，我最终遇到了达梅克。{w}\n他正监督着所有人的工作——确保一切顺利进行。{w}\n要运送的东西很多。我们都需要武器、食物和饮水。"

# game/script.rpy:86038
translate chinese map251_c01b9d43:

    # voice "se/z02213.ogg"
    voice "se/z02213.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:86040
translate chinese map251_5ead830f:

    # char_damek "Quite the army, isn't it?\nSalus would be proud. I know he would.\nForgive me for taking charge, though. You deserve a break."
    char_damek "真是支了不起的军队，不是吗？\n萨卢斯会为你骄傲的。我知道他一定会的。\n不过，原谅我擅自担起了指挥。你该歇一歇了。"

# game/script.rpy:86053
translate chinese map251_db1c83d1:

    # voice "se/z02214.ogg"
    # char_damek "Or at least, a chance to save your energy.\nYou'll need most of it in Balteus — not here.\nWe'll take care of everything until then."
    voice "se/z02214.ogg"
    char_damek "或者至少，是个节省精力的机会。\n你的精力大部分要留到巴尔泰乌斯——不是用在这里。\n在那之前，一切交给我们。"

# game/script.rpy:86068
translate chinese map251_597fb85a:

    # "I nod, thankful that Damek is taking the initiative.{w}\nI'd definitely need to use the voyage as time to prepare.{w}\nMy skill with this blade is limited, but I know I can improve."
    "我点点头，感谢达梅克主动担起这些。{w}\n我肯定需要利用这段航程来做好准备。{w}\n我用这把剑的水平有限，但我知道自己可以进步。"

# game/script.rpy:86093
translate chinese map251_100188e2:

    # voice "se/z02215.ogg"
    # char_damek "I made sure to put us on the same boat as each other.\nEveryone, actually. Howl, Valessa, Fortaime, Ulric, Pro...\nIt's probably best if we're all together for the end of this journey."
    voice "se/z02215.ogg"
    char_damek "我特意把我们安排在了一条船上。\n其实是所有人。豪尔、瓦莱莎、福泰姆、乌尔里克、普洛……\n这段旅程的终点，我们最好都在一起。"

# game/script.rpy:86108
translate chinese map251_1d278cad:

    # "That much was true. I'd need my friends by my side for this.{w}\nWe were about to change the entire world. We'd be slaying \"Gods\".{w}\nPart of me wonders just who they are — and why they do what they've done."
    "这话不假。这件事我需要朋友们在我身边。{w}\n我们即将改变整个世界。我们要弑杀“神明”。{w}\n我心中有一部分在想，他们究竟是谁——又为何要做这些事。"

# game/script.rpy:86110
translate chinese map251_ff0a856c:

    # "There's probably no point in concerning myself with that information.{w}\nNothing about them could excuse what they've done. They need to fall.{w}\nI thank Damek for everything that he's done, and this makes him happy."
    "去纠结这些信息大概也没什么意义。{w}\n他们的一切都无法为他们所做的事开脱。他们必须倒下。{w}\n我感谢达梅克所做的一切，这让他很高兴。"

# game/script.rpy:86125
translate chinese map251_36c35b07:

    # voice "se/z02216.ogg"
    # char_damek "Of course, [firstname]. Anything to help you out.\nBut I think we're almost ready to set sail. Want to get on board?\nMight as well lead by example. A lot of people are just standing around."
    voice "se/z02216.ogg"
    char_damek "当然，[firstname]。只要能帮上你。\n不过我想我们差不多可以启航了。要上船吗？\n不妨以身作则。很多人还只是站在那儿。"

# game/script.rpy:86148
translate chinese map251_648bacbe:

    # "We turn to leave, but we're quickly interrupted.{w}\nIt's the last person I'd expect to see, but I'm not surprised."
    "我们转身要走，却很快被打断了。{w}\n那是我最意想不到会见到的人，但我并不意外。"

# game/script.rpy:86170
translate chinese map251_4d135e2f:

    # voice "se/z02217.ogg"
    voice "se/z02217.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:86176
translate chinese map251_c4368fe8:

    # char_jit_map251_1_0_130 "Leaving without me, Damek?\nI thought you wanted me to come along."
    char_jit_map251_1_0_130 "达梅克，你要丢下我就走？\n我还以为你想让我一起去的。"

# game/script.rpy:86201
translate chinese map251_72bece1a:

    # voice "se/z02218.ogg"
    voice "se/z02218.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:86203
translate chinese map251_2a9a3456:

    # char_damek "Hey Gryz, happy to see you.\nWe weren't leaving — just getting on board.\nHopefully everybody else will take the hint and follow suit."
    char_damek "嘿，格瑞兹，很高兴见到你。\n我们不是要走——只是先上船而已。\n希望其他人也能明白过来，跟着照做。"

# game/script.rpy:86228
translate chinese map251_b263315c:

    # voice "se/z02219.ogg"
    # char_jit_map251_1_0_130 "Fair enough. Hey there, [firstname].\nDamek told me everything when you got back from Alarinthia.\nIt seems like we were looking at things the wrong way all along."
    voice "se/z02219.ogg"
    char_jit_map251_1_0_130 "那倒是。你好啊，[firstname]。\n你们从阿拉林西亚回来时，达梅克把一切都告诉我了。\n看来我们一直都用错了眼光看事情。"

# game/script.rpy:86242
translate chinese map251_89db1a60:

    # voice "se/z02220.ogg"
    # char_jit_map251_1_0_130 "At least, I definitely was.\nI thought that my death in those tunnels would redeem me.\nBut now I know that my fate lies elsewhere — in Balteus."
    voice "se/z02220.ogg"
    char_jit_map251_1_0_130 "至少，我肯定是错了。\n我以为在那些隧道里死去就能赎罪。\n但现在我知道，我的命运在别处——在巴尔泰乌斯。"

# game/script.rpy:86257
translate chinese map251_01c7fc1e:

    # "I'm glad that his outlook has changed.{w}\nI couldn't let him kill himself back in our HQ.{w}\nHe was just lost — and needed some direction."
    "我很高兴他的想法改变了。{w}\n我不能让他在我们总部里自杀。{w}\n他只是迷失了——需要有人给他指个方向。"

# game/script.rpy:86282
translate chinese map251_30ed89ee:

    # voice "se/z02221.ogg"
    # char_jit_map251_1_0_130 "At first, I was furious that you denied me my redemption.\nBut when Damek came to see me, I looked at it differently.\nI was meant to survive those tunnels, and help your final attack."
    voice "se/z02221.ogg"
    char_jit_map251_1_0_130 "起初，你拒绝了我的赎罪，我很愤怒。\n但当达梅克来看我时，我换了个角度看这件事。\n我本就该在那些隧道里活下来，帮你完成最后的进攻。"

# game/script.rpy:86297
translate chinese map251_05f7bd84:

    # "He holds out his hand, awaiting my response."
    "他伸出手，等着我的回应。"

# game/script.rpy:86322
translate chinese map251_58de7f44:

    # voice "se/z02222.ogg"
    # char_jit_map251_1_0_130 "What do you say...? \n\"To The Triumvirate's fall\"?\nMazeo can rest with Lillith for now."
    voice "se/z02222.ogg"
    char_jit_map251_1_0_130 "你觉得呢……？\n“敬三人执政团的覆灭”？\n马泽奥暂且可以和莉莉丝安息了。"

# game/script.rpy:86337
translate chinese map251_0c898e66:

    # "Yeah — to The Triumvirate's fall.{w}\nI shake his hand, and his grip is firm.{w}\nThe support our cause is getting overwhelms me."
    "好——敬三人执政团的覆灭。{w}\n我握住他的手，他的手掌很有力。{w}\n我们的事业得到的支持让我感到心潮澎湃。"

# game/script.rpy:86362
translate chinese map251_af2c4b5e:

    # voice "se/z02223.ogg"
    # char_jit_map251_1_0_130 "Thank you, Monarch. Let's put the past behind us.\nHonestly, I think all of us want to forget about those tunnels.\nI promise that from here on out, I'll maintain a clear mind."
    voice "se/z02223.ogg"
    char_jit_map251_1_0_130 "谢谢你，君主。让我们把过去抛在身后。\n说实话，我想我们所有人都想忘掉那些隧道里的事。\n我保证，从现在起，我会保持清醒的头脑。"

# game/script.rpy:86392
translate chinese map251_3ac13136:

    # "I nod, and we start making our way toward the boat.{w}\nOur vessel is the same one we used to get to Alarinthia.{w}\nIt's a bit bigger than the rest, and would work as a mobile HQ."
    "我点点头，我们开始朝船走去。{w}\n我们的船就是之前去阿拉林西亚时用的那一艘。{w}\n它比其余的稍大一些，可以当作移动的总部。"

# game/script.rpy:86394
translate chinese map251_03f0cd6e:

    # "When I get to the deck, I turn around and look at the docks.{w}\nEveryone is saying their final goodbyes, since we might not make it back.{w}\nI give them all the time they need, and slowly watch as they board our fleet."
    "我走上甲板，回身望向码头。{w}\n每个人都在做着最后的告别，因为我们也许回不来了。{w}\n我给他们留出需要的时间，静静看着他们登上我们的船队。"

# game/script.rpy:86396
translate chinese map251_087b5352:

    # "Actually, I might not make it back either. That thought fills me with fright.{w}\nTaking one last look at Mazean soil, I say goodbye under my breath.{w}\nWhat happened next, would change the course of Alestian history forever."
    "其实，我也许也回不来了。这个念头让我满心恐惧。{w}\n最后望了一眼马泽奥的土地，我低声作了道别。{w}\n接下来发生的事，将永远改变阿莱斯蒂亚历史的走向。"

# game/script.rpy:86417
translate chinese map251_3ac13136_1:

    # "I nod, and we start making our way toward the boat.{w}\nOur vessel is the same one we used to get to Alarinthia.{w}\nIt's a bit bigger than the rest, and would work as a mobile HQ."
    "我点点头，我们开始朝船走去。{w}\n我们的船就是之前去阿拉林西亚时用的那一艘。{w}\n它比其余的稍大一些，可以当作移动的总部。"

# game/script.rpy:86419
translate chinese map251_03f0cd6e_1:

    # "When I get to the deck, I turn around and look at the docks.{w}\nEveryone is saying their final goodbyes, since we might not make it back.{w}\nI give them all the time they need, and slowly watch as they board our fleet."
    "我走上甲板，回身望向码头。{w}\n每个人都在做着最后的告别，因为我们也许回不来了。{w}\n我给他们留出需要的时间，静静看着他们登上我们的船队。"

# game/script.rpy:86421
translate chinese map251_5da65c59:

    # "I might not make it back, either. That thought fills me with fright.{w}\nTaking one last look at Mazean soil, I say goodbye under my breath.{w}\nWhat happened next, would change the course of Alestian history forever."
    "我也许也回不来了。这个念头让我满心恐惧。{w}\n最后望了一眼马泽奥的土地，我低声作了道别。{w}\n接下来发生的事，将永远改变阿莱斯蒂亚历史的走向。"

# game/script.rpy:86429
translate chinese map251_bd91147d:

    # "As I walk, I eventually run into Howl.{w}\nHe's overseeing everybody's efforts — making sure it goes smoothly.{w}\nThere was a lot to transport. We'd all need weapons, food, and drink."
    "走着走着，我最终遇到了豪尔。{w}\n他正监督着所有人的工作——确保一切顺利进行。{w}\n要运送的东西很多。我们都需要武器、食物和饮水。"

# game/script.rpy:86454
translate chinese map251_b9bd87c6:

    # voice "se/z02224.ogg"
    voice "se/z02224.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:86457
translate chinese map251_7d4789dc:

    # char_howl "We find this army quite impressive.\nSo many people are willing to fight for our cause.\nLet us hope that the rest of the world accepts your rule."
    char_howl "我们觉得这支军队相当了不起。\n这么多人都愿意为我们的事业而战。\n但愿世界的其他地方也能接受你的统治。"

# game/script.rpy:86471
translate chinese map251_99c09058:

    # "I nod. That would be our next challenge.{w}\nThey wouldn't just bow to new rulers overnight.{w}\nIt'd take serious effort, coordination, and planning."
    "我点点头。那将是我们接下来的挑战。{w}\n他们不会一夜之间就向新统治者臣服。{w}\n那需要付出巨大的努力、协调与谋划。"

# game/script.rpy:86496
translate chinese map251_31e4b588:

    # voice "se/z02225.ogg"
    # char_howl "We thought you deserved a break, so we took action.\nYour energy is best conserved until we reach Balteus.\nYou needn't worry about stocking or manning the ships."
    voice "se/z02225.ogg"
    char_howl "我们觉得你该歇一歇，所以就动手了。\n你的精力最好留到我们抵达巴尔泰乌斯时再用。\n你不必操心物资补给或船上的人手。"

# game/script.rpy:86511
translate chinese map251_2bb2b65c:

    # "I smile, thankful that Howl is taking the initiative.{w}\nI'd definitely need to use the voyage as time to prepare.{w}\nI wasn't as skilled with this blade as I could be. I needed to practice."
    "我笑了，感谢豪尔主动担起这些。{w}\n我肯定需要利用这段航程来做好准备。{w}\n我用这把剑的技艺还不到家。我需要练习。"

# game/script.rpy:86536
translate chinese map251_9e35dc84:

    # voice "se/z02226.ogg"
    # char_howl "By the way, we made sure that we're all on the same boat.\nYou and your cloest comrades, together in these final moments.\nWe thought it fitting, since this is the end of our long journey."
    voice "se/z02226.ogg"
    char_howl "顺便一提，我们确保大家都在这同一条船上。\n你和最亲密的同伴们，在这最后的时刻聚在一起。\n我们觉得这样很合适，毕竟这是我们漫长旅程的终点。"

# game/script.rpy:86551
translate chinese map251_e79bef21:

    # "Yeah, having my friends close by would be a big help.{w}\nThis was a stressful time, and my comrades gave me a sense of comfort.{w}\nThere's no other group of people I'd rather have by my side as we reached the end."
    "是啊，有朋友们在身边会是很大的帮助。{w}\n这段时间压力很大，我的同伴们给了我一种安慰。{w}\n在走到终点时，我身边最想有的就是他们。"

# game/script.rpy:86576
translate chinese map251_72708c79:

    # voice "se/z02227.ogg"
    # char_howl "We think it may be time to board the ship, [firstname].\nLeading by example is a good idea. Too many people just standing around.\nIf we show that we're ready to leave — they might take it as a sign to hurry up."
    voice "se/z02227.ogg"
    char_howl "我们觉得也许该上船了，[firstname]。\n以身作则是好主意。太多人只是站在那儿。\n如果我们表明已经准备好了——他们也许就会当作该抓紧的信号。"

# game/script.rpy:86599
translate chinese map251_648bacbe_1:

    # "We turn to leave, but we're quickly interrupted.{w}\nIt's the last person I'd expect to see, but I'm not surprised."
    "我们转身要走，却很快被打断了。{w}\n那是我最意想不到会见到的人，但我并不意外。"

# game/script.rpy:86621
translate chinese map251_641c4f61:

    # voice "se/z02228.ogg"
    voice "se/z02228.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:86627
translate chinese map251_4f0ed970:

    # char_jit_map251_1_0_398 "Hey, now — don't leave without me.\nOr at least, let me say a few words before you do.\nI've been thinking a lot since we last met in those tunnels."
    char_jit_map251_1_0_398 "嘿，等等——别丢下我就走。\n或者至少，在你们走之前让我说几句。\n自从我们在那些隧道里最后一次见面后，我想了很多。"

# game/script.rpy:86641
translate chinese map251_e528d23e:

    # "Gryz stands before us with a smile on his face.{w}\nIt's good to see him again. I was curious about what happened to him.{w}\nI figured he ran away, since he almost disappeared — but I'm glad that he's back."
    "格瑞兹面带微笑站在我们面前。{w}\n很高兴再见到他。我一直好奇他后来怎么样了。{w}\n我以为他逃走了，因为他几乎消失了——但我很高兴他回来了。"

# game/script.rpy:86666
translate chinese map251_c833780d:

    # voice "se/z02229.ogg"
    voice "se/z02229.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:86668
translate chinese map251_d64027e4:

    # char_howl "We know this one. He was there by the idol.\nBlinded by his quest for redemption, if we're not mistaken.\nIt is unlikely that he knows the truth of what's going on, here."
    char_howl "我们认识这个人。他当时就在灵像旁。\n如果我们没记错，他被赎罪的执念蒙蔽了双眼。\n他不太可能知道这里正在发生的真相。"

# game/script.rpy:86693
translate chinese map251_37373923:

    # voice "se/z02230.ogg"
    # char_jit_map251_1_0_398 "Of course I do. I know about The Monarchy, as well. \nDamek told me everything when you got back from Alarinthia.\nIt turns out that we were all looking at things the wrong way."
    voice "se/z02230.ogg"
    char_jit_map251_1_0_398 "我当然知道。我也知道王室的事。\n你们从阿拉林西亚回来时，达梅克把一切都告诉我了。\n原来我们一直都看错了事情。"

# game/script.rpy:86697
translate chinese map251_18f578d2:

    # voice "se/z02231.ogg"
    # char_jit_map251_1_0_398 "At least, I know that I certainly was.\nI thought that my death in those tunnels would redeem me.\nBut now I know that my fate lies elsewhere — in Balteus."
    voice "se/z02231.ogg"
    char_jit_map251_1_0_398 "至少，我知道我肯定错了。\n我以为在那些隧道里死去就能赎罪。\n但现在我知道，我的命运在别处——在巴尔泰乌斯。"

# game/script.rpy:86712
translate chinese map251_01c7fc1e_1:

    # "I'm glad that his outlook has changed.{w}\nI couldn't let him kill himself back in our HQ.{w}\nHe was just lost — and needed some direction."
    "我很高兴他的想法改变了。{w}\n我不能让他在我们总部里自杀。{w}\n他只是迷失了——需要有人给他指个方向。"

# game/script.rpy:86737
translate chinese map251_e44f0a86:

    # voice "se/z02232.ogg"
    # char_jit_map251_1_0_398 "At first, I was furious that you denied me my redemption.\nBut when Damek came to see me, I looked at it differently.\nI was meant to survive those tunnels, and help your final attack."
    voice "se/z02232.ogg"
    char_jit_map251_1_0_398 "起初，你拒绝了我的赎罪，我很愤怒。\n但当达梅克来看我时，我换了个角度看这件事。\n我本就该在那些隧道里活下来，帮你完成最后的进攻。"

# game/script.rpy:86752
translate chinese map251_05f7bd84_1:

    # "He holds out his hand, awaiting my response."
    "他伸出手，等着我的回应。"

# game/script.rpy:86777
translate chinese map251_a262ff7a:

    # voice "se/z02233.ogg"
    # char_jit_map251_1_0_398 "What do you say...? \n\"To The Triumvirate's fall\"?\nMazeo can rest with Lillith for now."
    voice "se/z02233.ogg"
    char_jit_map251_1_0_398 "你觉得呢……？\n“敬三人执政团的覆灭”？\n马泽奥暂且可以和莉莉丝安息了。"

# game/script.rpy:86792
translate chinese map251_0c898e66_1:

    # "Yeah — to The Triumvirate's fall.{w}\nI shake his hand, and his grip is firm.{w}\nThe support our cause is getting overwhelms me."
    "好——敬三人执政团的覆灭。{w}\n我握住他的手，他的手掌很有力。{w}\n我们的事业得到的支持让我感到心潮澎湃。"

# game/script.rpy:86817
translate chinese map251_b12cd9fe:

    # voice "se/z02234.ogg"
    # char_jit_map251_1_0_398 "Thank you, [firstname]. Let's put the past behind us.\nHonestly, I think all of us want to forget about those tunnels.\nI promise that from here on out, I'll maintain a clear mind."
    voice "se/z02234.ogg"
    char_jit_map251_1_0_398 "谢谢你，[firstname]。让我们把过去抛在身后。\n说实话，我想我们所有人都想忘掉那些隧道里的事。\n我保证，从现在起，我会保持清醒的头脑。"

# game/script.rpy:86847
translate chinese map251_3ac13136_2:

    # "I nod, and we start making our way toward the boat.{w}\nOur vessel is the same one we used to get to Alarinthia.{w}\nIt's a bit bigger than the rest, and would work as a mobile HQ."
    "我点点头，我们开始朝船走去。{w}\n我们的船就是之前去阿拉林西亚时用的那一艘。{w}\n它比其余的稍大一些，可以当作移动的总部。"

# game/script.rpy:86849
translate chinese map251_03f0cd6e_2:

    # "When I get to the deck, I turn around and look at the docks.{w}\nEveryone is saying their final goodbyes, since we might not make it back.{w}\nI give them all the time they need, and slowly watch as they board our fleet."
    "我走上甲板，回身望向码头。{w}\n每个人都在做着最后的告别，因为我们也许回不来了。{w}\n我给他们留出需要的时间，静静看着他们登上我们的船队。"

# game/script.rpy:86851
translate chinese map251_087b5352_1:

    # "Actually, I might not make it back either. That thought fills me with fright.{w}\nTaking one last look at Mazean soil, I say goodbye under my breath.{w}\nWhat happened next, would change the course of Alestian history forever."
    "其实，我也许也回不来了。这个念头让我满心恐惧。{w}\n最后望了一眼马泽奥的土地，我低声作了道别。{w}\n接下来发生的事，将永远改变阿莱斯蒂亚历史的走向。"

# game/script.rpy:86872
translate chinese map251_3ac13136_3:

    # "I nod, and we start making our way toward the boat.{w}\nOur vessel is the same one we used to get to Alarinthia.{w}\nIt's a bit bigger than the rest, and would work as a mobile HQ."
    "我点点头，我们开始朝船走去。{w}\n我们的船就是之前去阿拉林西亚时用的那一艘。{w}\n它比其余的稍大一些，可以当作移动的总部。"

# game/script.rpy:86874
translate chinese map251_03f0cd6e_3:

    # "When I get to the deck, I turn around and look at the docks.{w}\nEveryone is saying their final goodbyes, since we might not make it back.{w}\nI give them all the time they need, and slowly watch as they board our fleet."
    "我走上甲板，回身望向码头。{w}\n每个人都在做着最后的告别，因为我们也许回不来了。{w}\n我给他们留出需要的时间，静静看着他们登上我们的船队。"

# game/script.rpy:86876
translate chinese map251_087b5352_2:

    # "Actually, I might not make it back either. That thought fills me with fright.{w}\nTaking one last look at Mazean soil, I say goodbye under my breath.{w}\nWhat happened next, would change the course of Alestian history forever."
    "其实，我也许也回不来了。这个念头让我满心恐惧。{w}\n最后望了一眼马泽奥的土地，我低声作了道别。{w}\n接下来发生的事，将永远改变阿莱斯蒂亚历史的走向。"

# game/script.rpy:86896
translate chinese map252_ea56a752:

    # "Turning around to face the deck, I notice that Sovy is waving me over.{w}\nI walk toward him, wondering what it could be about. This seems important.{w}\nAs I make my way across the ship, I notice all my comrades scurrying about."
    "我转身面向甲板，注意到索维在朝我招手。{w}\n我朝他走去，想知道是为了什么。这事似乎很重要。{w}\n我穿过船只时，注意到我的同伴们都在匆匆忙忙地走动。"

# game/script.rpy:86921
translate chinese map252_5885e11e:

    # voice "se/sovy1.ogg"
    voice "se/sovy1.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:86923
translate chinese map252_a2152ff3:

    # char_sovy "I'm glad that they put us all on the same boat.\nI must say — I've gotten used to you and your friends.\nBeing placed anywhere else would be pretty uncomfortable."
    char_sovy "我很高兴他们把我们安排在同一条船上。\n不得不说——我已经习惯了你和你的朋友们。\n被安排到别处会让我很不自在。"

# game/script.rpy:86938
translate chinese map252_ce24e0f7:

    # voice "se/sovy2.ogg"
    voice "se/sovy2.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:86940
translate chinese map252_92c71c7f:

    # char_sovy "I just wanted to tell you that I gave Damek some information.\nHe's forming a plan of attack as we speak, so it definitely helped.\nWhen it comes to Balteus and The Triumvirate, I know more than anybody."
    char_sovy "我只是想告诉你，我给了达梅克一些情报。\n他此刻正在制定进攻计划，所以这肯定帮上了忙。\n说到巴尔泰乌斯和三人执政团，我比任何人都了解。"

# game/script.rpy:86943
translate chinese map252_6be55e06:

    # voice "se/sovy3.ogg"
    # char_sovy "I'm sorry for what we did to him during our attack, by the way.\nI ordered Shane to stab him, so it's technically my fault.\nHe seems fine though — so no hard feelings...?"
    voice "se/sovy3.ogg"
    char_sovy "顺便说，我为我们在袭击中对他做的事感到抱歉。\n是我下令让肖恩刺他的，所以严格来说是我的错。\n不过他看起来没事——那就别记恨我了……？"

# game/script.rpy:86958
translate chinese map252_c73d2b88:

    # "I shrug, uncertain of how to respond.{w}\nIf it happened any differently, he'd be dead for sure.{w}\nIt feels a bit beyond coincidence, but I don't stop to question it."
    "我耸耸肩，不知道该如何回应。{w}\n要是稍有不同，他肯定就死了。{w}\n这感觉有点不像是巧合，但我没停下来深究。"

# game/script.rpy:86983
translate chinese map252_3730098d:

    # voice "se/sovy4.ogg"
    # char_sovy "They might not tell your allies that I gave them this information, though.\nNot everybody trusts me, so it would probably just cause more harm than good.\nI'm not here to cause harm, so we all agreed it was best to \"omit\" a few facts."
    voice "se/sovy4.ogg"
    char_sovy "不过，他们可能不会告诉你的盟友这情报是我给的。\n不是每个人都信任我，说了大概只会弊大于利。\n我不是来惹麻烦的，所以我们都同意，最好“省略”一些事实。"

# game/script.rpy:86998
translate chinese map252_e906439f:

    # "It makes sense, so I understand where they're coming from.{w}\nFighting amongst ourselves is the last thing we need before the final battle.{w}\nIt was a time to stand strong, and united. A time to trust one another unconditionally."
    "这说得通，所以我理解他们的顾虑。{w}\n在最终决战之前，我们最不需要的就是内斗。{w}\n现在是坚强、团结的时候。是彼此无条件信任的时候。"

# game/script.rpy:87023
translate chinese map252_e347a6be:

    # voice "se/sovy5.ogg"
    # char_sovy "That's it, really. I just thought you deserved to know it came from me.\nI {i}did{/i} promise information that would help your final attack, after all.\nIf anything else comes to mind, I'll make sure to bring it to attention."
    voice "se/sovy5.ogg"
    char_sovy "就这样，真的。我只是觉得你应该知道这情报是我提供的。\n毕竟我{i}确实{/i}承诺过会提供有助于你们最后进攻的情报。\n如果我还想到别的，一定会提出来。"

# game/script.rpy:87045
translate chinese map252_fe0a6421:

    # "He's definitely going to great lengths to make himself seem genuine.{w}\nThat's good. There was a lot of doubt in the air surrounding this alliance.{w}\nThe people may not know he tipped us off, but they didn't really have to."
    "他确实费尽心思让自己显得诚恳。{w}\n这是好事。围绕这次结盟的疑虑一直很多。{w}\n人们也许不知道是他给我们通风报信，但他们其实也没必要知道。"

# game/script.rpy:87047
translate chinese map252_64f6e76e:

    # "He turns away from me, and stares into the distance. I guess this talk is over.{w}\nI decide to make my way to Damek and Howl to see what information he gave them.{w}\nBut before I can get there, I'm interrupted by my comrades. They seem really excited."
    "他转身背对我，望向远方。看来这次谈话结束了。{w}\n我决定去找达梅克和豪尔，看看他给了他们什么情报。{w}\n但我还没走到，就被同伴们打断了。他们看起来非常兴奋。"

# game/script.rpy:87049
translate chinese map252_3c5bcfe1:

    # "We exchange hugs and pleasantries for a few moments.{w}\nAre they really happy? Or are they just putting on an act?{w}\nIt's hard to tell — since this is the calm before the storm."
    "我们拥抱寒暄了一阵。{w}\n他们是真的开心吗？还是只是在演戏？{w}\n很难分辨——毕竟这是暴风雨前的平静。"

# game/script.rpy:87057
translate chinese map252_0036d85b:

    # voice "se/sovy6.ogg"
    voice "se/sovy6.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:87059
translate chinese map252_30d74ed5:

    # char_sovy "I just wanted to tell you that I gave Howl some information.\nHe's forming a plan of attack as we speak, so it definitely helped.\nWhen it comes to Balteus and The Triumvirate, I know more than anybody."
    char_sovy "我只是想告诉你，我给了豪尔一些情报。\n他此刻正在制定进攻计划，所以这肯定帮上了忙。\n说到巴尔泰乌斯和三人执政团，我比任何人都了解。"

# game/script.rpy:87072
translate chinese map252_36dc99e0:

    # voice "se/sovy7.ogg"
    # char_sovy "But I guess he knows a bit about Balteus as well.\nI find it hard to believe that there's a legion of spirits inside of him.\nCrazier things have happened, I guess. It's just — really interesting."
    voice "se/sovy7.ogg"
    char_sovy "不过我猜他对巴尔泰乌斯也有些了解。\n我很难相信他体内寄居着一整支灵军团。\n更离奇的事也发生过，我想。只是——真的很有意思。"

# game/script.rpy:87086
translate chinese map252_d172a01e:

    # voice "se/sovy8.ogg"
    # char_sovy "If he survives the war, I'd love to learn more about The Monarchy.\nYou should study them as well — since you're next in line for the throne.\nIt might be helpful to know what legacy you're carrying on, right...?"
    voice "se/sovy8.ogg"
    char_sovy "如果他能活过这场战争，我很想多了解一些王室的事。\n你也该研究研究他们——毕竟你是王位的下一任继承人。\n知道自己在继承什么样的遗产，也许会有帮助，对吧……？"

# game/script.rpy:87101
translate chinese map252_1210ec46:

    # "That's true — but there would be a better time and place.{w}\nRight now my main focus was taking down The Triumvirate.{w}\nUntil the throne was mine, all of that should be off the table."
    "这话不假——但会有更好的时间和场合。{w}\n眼下我的主要目标是打倒三人执政团。{w}\n在王位归我之前，那些事都该先搁置。"

# game/script.rpy:87103
translate chinese map252_19395f78:

    # "Sovy nods, and decides to change the subject.{w}\nIt's remarkable how easy it was to get along with him.{w}\nUntil just recently, he seemed like such a cold, heartless killer."
    "索维点点头，决定换个话题。{w}\n跟他相处竟然如此轻松，真令人意外。{w}\n直到不久之前，他还像个冷酷无情的杀手。"

# game/script.rpy:87128
translate chinese map252_6c8fea11:

    # voice "se/sovy9.ogg"
    # char_sovy "They might not tell your allies that I gave them this information, though.\nNot everybody trusts me, so it would probably just cause more harm than good.\nI'm not here to cause harm, so we all agreed it was best to \"omit\" a few facts."
    voice "se/sovy9.ogg"
    char_sovy "不过，他们可能不会告诉你的盟友这情报是我给的。\n不是每个人都信任我，说了大概只会弊大于利。\n我不是来惹麻烦的，所以我们都同意，最好“省略”一些事实。"

