translate chinese map252_a8ef674e:

    # voice "se/sovy10.ogg"
    # char_sovy "That's it, really. I just thought you deserved to know it came from me.\nI {i}did{/i} promise information that would help your final attack, after all.\nIf anything else comes to mind, I'll make sure to bring it to attention."
