# game/script.rpy:90298
translate chinese map259_98351194:

    # "That was an impressive sight to see.{w}\nHowever, seeing Damek think on his feet was equally impressive.{w}\nWith a sigh and a smile, confidence overtakes the panic from moments before."
    "那景象着实令人叹为观止。{w}\n不过，看着达梅克临机应变，同样令人钦佩。{w}\n随着一声叹息和一抹微笑，信心压过了片刻前的惊慌。"

# game/script.rpy:90323
