# game/script.rpy:90325
translate chinese map259_eb16eb69:

    # char_howl "Damek. We must say, that was pretty impressive.\nHopefully now you realize that visions only hold you back."
    char_howl "达梅克。我们得说，那相当了得。\n但愿你现在明白，预知只会束缚你。"

# game/script.rpy:90350
translate chinese map259_28ce8f80:

    # voice "se/z02344.ogg"
    # char_damek "Huh...?"
    voice "se/z02344.ogg"
    char_damek "嗯……？"

# game/script.rpy:90376
translate chinese map259_08c1ba11:

    # voice "se/z02345.ogg"
    # char_howl "Look at what happened back in the Rebel HQ.\nYou relied on a vision. You tried to fulfill some prophecy.\nIn a way, that is limiting. You plan your strategy around certainties."
    voice "se/z02345.ogg"
    char_howl "想想在反抗军总部发生的事。\n你依赖预知，试图实现某个预言。\n某种程度上，那是一种束缚。你围绕着确定之事来制定策略。"

# game/script.rpy:90390
translate chinese map259_3511b779:

    # voice "se/z02346.ogg"
    # char_howl "But there are no certainties in war.\nAssume that the enemy has a counter for your every action.\nIn this case — we should also plan for a scenario where the enemy prevails."
    voice "se/z02346.ogg"
    char_howl "但战争中没有什么确定之事。\n要假设敌人对你们的每个行动都有应对之策。\n就这次而言——我们也该为敌人获胜的情形做好准备。"

# game/script.rpy:90405
translate chinese map259_3b7f1d8b:

    # "Damek shakes his head."
    "达梅克摇了摇头。"

# game/script.rpy:90430
translate chinese map259_85009a89:

    # voice "se/z02347b.ogg"
    # char_damek "They won't. Simply because we can't afford it.\nAny losses at this point would mean the end of our cause.\nTrust in the Pirates, Howl. Trust in all of us. We can do this."
    voice "se/z02347b.ogg"
    char_damek "他们不会赢。只因为我们输不起。\n此刻任何损失都意味着我们事业的终结。\n相信海盗们，豪尔。相信我们所有人。我们能行。"

# game/script.rpy:90460
translate chinese map259_e7f2e16e:

    # "Howl simply nods. Moments later, the pirates launch their assault.{w}\nWe all lose our balance as our ship takes a sharp turn, moving in a new direction.{w}\nThis was a risky plan, but like Damek requested, I chose to place my trust in him."
    "豪尔只是点了点头。片刻之后，海盗们发起了进攻。{w}\n船猛地一转，驶向新的方向，我们全都失去了平衡。{w}\n这是个冒险的计划，但正如达梅克所请，我选择相信他。"

# game/script.rpy:90462
translate chinese map259_37d66426:

    # "If trust wouldn't carry us to victory, then it would be our strength and resolve.{w}\nI hold on to the side of the ship as our speed increases. Everybody braces themselves.{w}\nThey're not sure what's going on, so Damek draws his sword and raises it into the air."
    "如果信任不能带我们走向胜利，那就靠我们的力量与决心。{w}\n船速渐增，我紧紧抓住船舷。所有人都绷紧了身体。{w}\n他们不清楚发生了什么，于是达梅克拔出剑，高高举向空中。"

# game/script.rpy:90502
translate chinese map260_17e93b7d:

    # voice "se/z02348b.ogg"
    voice "se/z02348b.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:90504
translate chinese map260_e6342abe:

    # char_damek "Everybody, listen up! The final hour is upon us.\nOur Pirate army will be charging against the enemy fleet.\nWhile they're distracted, we'll slip in and hijack one of their ships."
    char_damek "各位，听好！最后的时刻到了。\n我们的海盗大军将向敌方舰队发起冲锋。\n在他们被牵制时，我们就溜进去，夺下他们的一艘船。"

# game/script.rpy:90517
translate chinese map260_26d3d198:

    # voice "se/z02349.ogg"
    # char_damek "That means we'll be sacrificing this vessel.\nSo don't be alarmed if they deal us a fatal blow.\nAs we're sinking, we'll jump over and board the enemy."
    voice "se/z02349.ogg"
    char_damek "也就是说，我们要牺牲这艘船。\n所以就算他们给我们致命一击，也不要惊慌。\n船下沉时，我们就跳过去登上敌舰。"

# game/script.rpy:90521
translate chinese map260_25dc590c:

    # voice "se/z02350b.ogg"
    # char_damek "Their ships are equipped with projectile weaponry.\nUsing their own ship, we will turn their weapons against them.\nThey won't know where to focus, and we'll use the chaos to our advantage."
    voice "se/z02350b.ogg"
    char_damek "他们的船上装备了投射武器。\n用他们自己的船，我们要让他们的武器反过来对付他们。\n他们会不知道该把火力集中在哪里，我们就利用这场混乱占得上风。"

# game/script.rpy:90536
translate chinese map260_c83aa4b0:

    # "He starts to talk a bit louder as our ship picks up speed.{w}\nWe move away from the main fleet, preparing to approach from the flank.{w}\nI notice the soldiers nod, accepting Damek's orders and plan without hesitation."
    "随着船速加快，他提高了嗓门。{w}\n我们驶离主舰队，准备从侧翼逼近。{w}\n我注意到士兵们纷纷点头，毫不犹豫地接受了达梅克的命令和计划。"

# game/script.rpy:90563
translate chinese map260_1ef6734e:

    # voice "se/z02351.ogg"
    voice "se/z02351.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:90565
translate chinese map260_3a14540e:

    # char_damek "If things go south, I need all of you to protect [firstname]. \nWithout him, we will lose not only this battle, but the war as well.\nHis life, and the blade that he carries, should be our top priority."
    char_damek "如果情况不妙，我需要你们所有人保护[firstname]。\n没有他，我们不仅会输掉这场战斗，还会输掉整场战争。\n他的性命，以及他携带的那把剑，必须是我们最优先保护的东西。"

# game/script.rpy:90570
translate chinese map260_42664a26:

    # voice "se/z02352b.ogg"
    voice "se/z02352b.ogg"

