    # char_damek "If things go south, I need all of you to protect [firstname].\nWithout her, we will lose not only this battle, but the war as well.\nHer life, and the blade that she carries, should be our top priority."
    char_damek "如果情况不妙，我需要你们所有人保护[firstname]。\n没有她，我们不仅会输掉这场战斗，还会输掉整场战争。\n她的性命，以及她携带的那把剑，必须是我们最优先保护的东西。"

# game/script.rpy:90589
translate chinese map260_6d959469:

    # voice "se/z02353.ogg"
    voice "se/z02353.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:90591
translate chinese map260_ed605b80:

    # char_damek "Do I make myself clear!?"
    char_damek "我说清楚了吗！？"

# game/script.rpy:90612
translate chinese map260_f67a7bf9:

    # "Everybody cheers in approval, and raises their sword like Damek.{w}\nThen, we all stand and watch the bulk of our fleet as the battle begins.{w}\nWe slowly move away from the action, and I can tell that some are relieved."
    "众人齐声欢呼赞同，像达梅克那样举起了剑。{w}\n随后，战斗打响，我们全都站着望向舰队主力。{w}\n我们缓缓驶离战场，我能看出有些人松了口气。"

# game/script.rpy:90617
translate chinese map260_ebeb83b6:

    # "As soon as the pirates get close enough, The Honor Guard retaliates.{w}\nThey launch heavy projectiles from catapults, and shoot harpoons from wooden structures.{w}\nThe pirates, with their sailing expertise, are mostly able to counter by altering their trajectory."
    "海盗们刚一靠近，荣誉卫队就展开了反击。{w}\n他们用投石机发射沉重的弹丸，从木制结构上射出鱼叉。{w}\n海盗们凭借精湛的航海本领，大多能通过改变航向来应对。"

# game/script.rpy:90619
translate chinese map260_900b7713:

    # "However, not all of them can do so. I witness several ships get torn apart and start to sink.{w}\nMy heart sinks with them, knowing that they were willing to sacrifice themselves for {i}me{/i}.{w}\nIt seems that the battle is on in full force. They get closer, and start to board each other."
    "然而，并非所有人都能做到。我眼看着好几艘船被撕裂，开始下沉。{w}\n我的心也随之沉了下去，因为我知道他们甘愿为{i}我{/i}牺牲。{w}\n战斗似乎已全面展开。双方越靠越近，开始互相登船厮杀。"

# game/script.rpy:90621
translate chinese map260_0c0a1ba8:

    # "I can hear swords clashing as The Honor Guard tries to defend against the pirates' charge.{w}\nShips on both sides start to sink, and soon enough, it's almost impossible to see what's happening.{w}\nFrom this distance, it's too chaotic. But if enemy ships are sinking, we must've seized some weapons."
    "伴随着荣誉卫队抵抗海盗冲锋的厮杀声，我能听见剑刃相交。{w}\n双方的船只都开始下沉，很快，几乎看不出战况如何。{w}\n从这个距离看，一切太过混乱。但既然敌舰在沉没，我们一定已经夺下了一些武器。"

# game/script.rpy:90623
translate chinese map260_7a6d17cb:

    # "That means the tables have started to turn. But it's up to us to play our part, as well.{w}\nI turn back and look at where we're headed. We're dangerously close to some enemy ships.{w}\nDamek calls out to everybody, shifting their attention away from the distant battle."
    "这意味着局势开始逆转。但也得靠我们演好自己这一出。{w}\n我回头看了看我们前进的方向。我们已危险地逼近几艘敌舰。{w}\n达梅克高声呼喊众人，把他们的注意力从远处的战斗上拉了回来。"

# game/script.rpy:90648
translate chinese map260_1eacc81d:

    # voice "se/z02354c.ogg"
    voice "se/z02354c.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:90650
translate chinese map260_7f079c88:

    # char_damek "This is it. There is {i}no{/i} turning back...!\nEverybody brace yourselves to charge!"
    char_damek "就是现在。已经{i}没有{/i}回头路了……！\n所有人做好准备，准备冲锋！"

# game/script.rpy:90664
translate chinese map260_2189a88a:

    # "I can see The Honor Guard prepare their weapons.{w}\nWhen I scan my surroundings, I can see our forces prepare as well.{w}\nA line of archers forms, ready to attack the enemies at a moment's notice."
    "我能看到荣誉卫队在准备武器。{w}\n环顾四周，我看到我们的部队也在准备。{w}\n一排弓箭手列好阵型，随时准备向敌人发动攻击。"

# game/script.rpy:90679
translate chinese map260_2a5123f5:

    # voice "se/z02355.ogg"
    # char_damek "Hold...!"
    voice "se/z02355.ogg"
    char_damek "稳住……！"

# game/script.rpy:90694
translate chinese map260_95fea8f8:

    # "He places a fist in the air. An intense silence follows.{w}\nBoth sides are armed. The question is, who attacks first...?{w}\nI take a deep breath, and pull out The Blade of Exodus."
    "他把拳头举向空中。随之而来的是死一般的寂静。{w}\n双方都已持械。问题是，谁会先出手……？{w}\n我深吸一口气，拔出了放逐之刃。"

# game/script.rpy:90709
translate chinese map260_bc3bc0b1:

    # voice "se/z02356.ogg"
    # char_damek "Hold...!"
    voice "se/z02356.ogg"
    char_damek "稳住……！"

# game/script.rpy:90727
translate chinese map260_4cc9d8f3:

    # "I look over at the ships we've left behind. The numbers are easily halved.{w}\nBut this goes for the enemy as well. This was clearly the turning point.{w}\nWhat happened next would decide the fate of our entire cause."
    "我望向我们身后的那些船。数量显然已减半。{w}\n但敌人也一样。这显然就是转折点。{w}\n接下来发生的事，将决定我们整个事业的命运。"

# game/script.rpy:90729
translate chinese map260_1325cda3:

    # "And it began with a barrage of projectile weaponry.{w}\nThe enemy attacked our ship with everything they had.{w}\nI can feel the hull get torn apart, and everything starts shaking."
    "而它始于一场投射武器的齐射。{w}\n敌人倾尽所有攻击我们的船。{w}\n我能感觉到船体被撕裂，一切都开始晃动。"

# game/script.rpy:90757
translate chinese map260_16bfee37:

    # voice "se/z02357.ogg"
    # char_damek "Fire...!"
    voice "se/z02357.ogg"
    char_damek "开火……！"

# game/script.rpy:90775
translate chinese map260_6152e01e:

    # "The archers return fire, knocking out the suits of armor manning the weapons.{w}\nI look back at the wheel of the ship, and Alex spins it, turning us toward the enemy vessels."
    "弓箭手们还击，击倒了操作武器的空甲。{w}\n我回头看向船舵，亚历克斯转动舵轮，让船转向敌舰。"

# game/script.rpy:90800
translate chinese map260_56793858:

    # voice "se/z02358.ogg"
    voice "se/z02358.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:90806
translate chinese map260_fa4e0702:

    # char_jit_map260_1_0_192 "I hope you're ready to jump...!"
    char_jit_map260_1_0_192 "希望你准备好跳了……！"

# game/script.rpy:90811
translate chinese map260_b9402d6e:

    # "The archers return fire, knocking out the suits of armor manning the weapons.{w}\nI look back at the wheel of the ship, and Nada spins it, turning us toward the enemy vessels."
    "弓箭手们还击，击倒了操作武器的空甲。{w}\n我回头看向船舵，娜达转动舵轮，让船转向敌舰。"

# game/script.rpy:90836
translate chinese map260_0aec0852:

    # voice "se/z02359a.ogg"
    voice "se/z02359a.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:90842
translate chinese map260_fafe8c51:

    # char_jit_map260_1_0_207 "This is it. Get ready to jump...!"
    char_jit_map260_1_0_207 "就是现在。准备跳……！"

# game/script.rpy:90875
translate chinese map261_26bd7fa7:

    # "Damek nods, and then a moment later, everything erupts into chaos.{w}\nOur forces jump to the enemy ship, after a long running start.{w}\nThey land safely, and start decimating The Honor Guard."
    "达梅克点了点头，片刻之后，一切都陷入了混乱。{w}\n我们的部队经过长距离助跑，跳上了敌舰。{w}\n他们安全落地，开始大肆屠戮荣誉卫队。"

# game/script.rpy:90900
translate chinese map261_5bbc5242:

    # voice "se/z02360b.ogg"
    # char_damek "See you on the other side, [firstname]."
    voice "se/z02360b.ogg"
    char_damek "另一边见，[firstname]。"

# game/script.rpy:90927
translate chinese map261_be2fdf0d:

    # "With a smirk, he follows our soldiers, jumping across to the enemy ship.{w}\nLanding with a roll, he immediately starts fighting, displaying impressive skill.{w}\nI didn't get to see him fight in our HQ {i}or{/i} in Alarinthia. It's quite the sight."
    "他咧嘴一笑，跟着我们的士兵跳向敌舰。{w}\n他就地一滚落地，立刻投入战斗，展现出惊人的身手。{w}\n我在总部{i}和{/i}阿拉林西亚都没机会看他出手。这景象真是难得。"

# game/script.rpy:90929
translate chinese map261_a813ec85:

    # "He dodges the enemy attacks with ease, and retaliates with expertise.{w}\nTaking out multiple suits of armor with a single swing, he clearly holds his own.{w}\nI turn around, and order the remaining soldiers to charge. I save myself for last."
    "他轻松闪避敌人的攻击，以娴熟的技巧还击。{w}\n一挥剑就击倒好几架空甲，显然游刃有余。{w}\n我转过身，命令剩下的士兵冲锋。我把自己留到最后。"

# game/script.rpy:90934
translate chinese map261_58306748:

    # "But before I jump, I notice that Alex is still at the wheel.{w}\nI shout his name, and tell him to get across as soon as possible.{w}\nThe ship has already started to sink — and water rises at my feet."
    "但在我起跳之前，我注意到亚历克斯还在舵轮旁。{w}\n我大喊他的名字，让他尽快过去。{w}\n船已经开始下沉——水漫到了我的脚边。"

# game/script.rpy:90959
translate chinese map261_01438063:

    # voice "se/z02361.ogg"
    voice "se/z02361.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:90965
translate chinese map261_b975a1ee:

    # char_jit_map261_1_0_49 "You know — any good Captain is supposed to go down with their ship.\nBut I guess there's no point living my life by an outdated code of honor.\nThanks to the treaty, there'll be a new life waiting for me after all of this."
    char_jit_map261_1_0_49 "你知道——好船长本该与自己的船一同沉没。\n但我想，按过时的荣誉准则过日子也没什么意义。\n多亏了那份条约，这一切结束后，会有新生活在等着我。"

# game/script.rpy:90979
translate chinese map261_bf0d82cd:

    # "He leaves the wheel behind, and places a hand on my shoulder."
    "他离开舵轮，把手搭在我的肩上。"

# game/script.rpy:91004
translate chinese map261_7b904f5c:

    # voice "se/z02362.ogg"
    # char_jit_map261_1_0_49 "And honestly, it's all thanks to you.\nLet's make this jump together, [firstname].\nWe're a team until the end. No matter what."
    voice "se/z02362.ogg"
    char_jit_map261_1_0_49 "说实话，这全都要感谢你。\n我们一起跳吧，[firstname]。\n我们是同生共死的伙伴。无论如何。"

# game/script.rpy:91019
translate chinese map261_e332c4af:

    # "No matter what."
    "无论如何。"

# game/script.rpy:91024
translate chinese map261_8fb4283b:

    # "We move to the opposite side of the ship, putting distance between us and the enemy vessel.{w}\nI notice that most of The Honor Guard has fallen, and our soldiers are manning the weaponry.{w}\nThat's a good sign. With a feeling that victory is ours, Alex and I start to sprint toward the enemy."
    "我们移动到船的另一侧，与敌舰拉开距离。{w}\n我注意到荣誉卫队大多已经倒下，我们的士兵正在操作武器。{w}\n这是个好兆头。怀着胜利在望的感觉，我和亚历克斯开始向敌人冲刺。"

# game/script.rpy:91033
translate chinese map261_8b3d1d34:

    # "He makes it there first, jumping up on the railing of our ship and lauching himself across the gap.{w}\nI'm not too far behind, and I jump up on the railing moments after. However, I make it no further.{w}\nAn arrow pierces through my shoulder, and I fall back onto our ship, in a pool of freezing water."
    "他先到了那里，跳上我们船的栏杆，腾身越过空隙。{w}\n我紧随其后，片刻后也跳上栏杆。然而，我再也无法向前。{w}\n一支箭射穿了我的肩膀，我跌回自己的船上，落在冰冷的水洼里。"

# game/script.rpy:91038
translate chinese map261_2fc056d4:

    # "But before I jump, I notice that Nada is still at the wheel.{w}\nI shout her name, and tell her to get across as soon as possible.{w}\nThe ship has already started to sink — and water rises at my feet."
    "但在我起跳之前，我注意到娜达还在舵轮旁。{w}\n我大喊她的名字，让她尽快过去。{w}\n船已经开始下沉——水漫到了我的脚边。"

# game/script.rpy:91063
translate chinese map261_41f4ffb1:

    # voice "se/z02364a.ogg"
    voice "se/z02364a.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:91069
translate chinese map261_5357c1e2:

    # char_jit_map261_1_0_106 "You know, the code of honor states that a Captain should go down with her ship.\nIf it weren't for that treaty, I'd be ready to let myself die right here and now.\nI think my new nation will change things up a bit. No more stupid sacrifices."
    char_jit_map261_1_0_106 "你知道，荣誉准则规定船长应当与自己的船一同沉没。\n要不是那份条约，我此刻就甘愿死在这里。\n我想我的新国家会有所改变。不再有愚蠢的牺牲。"

# game/script.rpy:91083
translate chinese map261_6967c7a6:

    # "She leaves the wheel behind, and places a hand on my shoulder."
    "她离开舵轮，把手搭在我的肩上。"

# game/script.rpy:91108
translate chinese map261_b2803f98:

    # voice "se/z02365a.ogg"
    # char_jit_map261_1_0_106 "I have to thank you for what you've done, [firstname].\nNow let's make this jump — there's still so much left to do."
    voice "se/z02365a.ogg"
    char_jit_map261_1_0_106 "我得谢谢你做的一切，[firstname]。\n现在我们一起跳吧——还有很多事要做。"

# game/script.rpy:91123
translate chinese map261_fd6d3a09:

    # "A sly smirk appears on her face."
    "她脸上浮现出一抹狡黠的笑。"

# game/script.rpy:91148
translate chinese map261_70e18ec8:

    # voice "se/z02366a.ogg"
    # char_jit_map261_1_0_106 "Hey — first one there gets more suits to kill. \nDon't want to keep them waiting, right?"
    voice "se/z02366a.ogg"
    char_jit_map261_1_0_106 "嘿——先到的人能多杀几具铠甲。\n可别让他们等太久，对吧？"

# game/script.rpy:91166
translate chinese map261_f4d1a0ea:

    # "We move to the opposite side of the ship, putting distance between us and the enemy vessel.{w}\nI notice that most of The Honor Guard has fallen, and our soldiers are manning the weaponry.{w}\nThat's a good sign. With a feeling that victory is ours, Nada and I start to sprint toward the enemy."
    "我们移动到船的另一侧，与敌舰拉开距离。{w}\n我注意到荣誉卫队大多已经倒下，我们的士兵正在操作武器。{w}\n这是个好兆头。怀着胜利在望的感觉，我和娜达开始向敌人冲刺。"

# game/script.rpy:91175
translate chinese map261_3d805706:

    # "She makes it there first, jumping up on the railing of our ship and lauching himself across the gap.{w}\nI'm not too far behind, and I jump up on the railing moments after. However, I make it no further.{w}\nAn arrow pierces through my shoulder, and I fall back onto our ship, in a pool of freezing water."
    "她先到了那里，跳上我们船的栏杆，腾身越过空隙。{w}\n我紧随其后，片刻后也跳上栏杆。然而，我再也无法向前。{w}\n一支箭射穿了我的肩膀，我跌回自己的船上，落在冰冷的水洼里。"

# game/script.rpy:91182
translate chinese map261_f73da70c:

    # "I pull out the arrow with a grunt. Blood oozes from the wound, but it's nothing major.{w}\nWe could patch it up as soon as the enemy ships were taken care of. I rise to my feet.{w}\nLooking up, I immediately notice the source of the arrow. It wasn't The Honor Guard."
    "我闷哼一声拔出了箭。血从伤口渗出，但不算严重。{w}\n等解决完敌舰，就能马上包扎。我站起身来。{w}\n抬头一看，我立刻注意到箭是从哪来的。那不是荣誉卫队。"

# game/script.rpy:91184
translate chinese map261_d7798246:

    # "It was Shane."
    "是肖恩。"

# game/script.rpy:91186
translate chinese map261_f586da13:

    # "With an evil smirk, he jumps across, boarding our ship. It's still sinking, but I have time.{w}\nIf I can take care of him fast enough, then I'd be able to carry out my plan as originally intended.{w}\nInstead of coming for me, he runs toward the wheel, steering our ship away from the chaos."
    "他带着邪恶的笑意跳了过来，登上了我们的船。船还在下沉，但我还有时间。{w}\n只要我能足够快地解决他，就能按原计划行事。{w}\n他没有朝我来，而是跑向舵轮，把我们的船驶离混乱。"

# game/script.rpy:91188
translate chinese map261_cf2546fa:

    # "That wasn't good. My time was limited if we were both sinking and making the distance greater.{w}\nHe must know exactly what he's doing. Part of me wonders if we played into some sort of trap.{w}\nI look at my allies, and they seem to be doing a good enough job as they enact our plan."
    "这可不妙。如果双方都在下沉，距离又越来越远，我的时间就有限了。{w}\n他一定清楚自己在做什么。我有些怀疑我们是不是落入了某种陷阱。{w}\n我看向同伴们，他们执行计划时似乎做得还不错。"

# game/script.rpy:91190
translate chinese map261_0805524f:

    # "My fist shakes as I grip The Blade of Exodus. Shane scoffs as he watches.{w}\nI shout at him in anger and despair. I call him a traitor, and condemn him.{w}\nHe almost killed Damek. He caused irreparable damage to my family...!"
    "我紧握着放逐之刃，拳头在颤抖。肖恩看着，嗤笑了一声。{w}\n我带着愤怒与绝望对他大喊，骂他是叛徒，谴责他。{w}\n他差点杀了达梅克。他给我的家人造成了无法弥补的伤害……！"

# game/script.rpy:91227
translate chinese map262_a2eba11d:

    # voice "se/z02367.ogg"
    voice "se/z02367.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:91229
translate chinese map262_33f07981:

    # char_shane "A traitor...!? Not from where I'm standing.\nDamek abandoned {i}me{/i}, and it's all because of you!\nHe's a selfish fool. All he cares about is that stupid sword...!"
    char_shane "叛徒……！？在我眼里可不是这样。\n达梅克抛弃了{i}我{/i}，全都是因为你！\n他是个自私的蠢货。他在乎的只有那把破剑……！"

# game/script.rpy:91243
translate chinese map262_d6f88c4e:

    # "I keep walking toward him, and the ship shakes violently.{w}\nWater keeps spilling on the deck, and I'm standing almost ankle-deep."
    "我继续朝他走去，船剧烈地摇晃着。{w}\n水不断涌上甲板，我站着时水几乎没过了脚踝。"

# game/script.rpy:91268
translate chinese map262_84a1736e:

    # voice "se/z02368.ogg"
    # char_shane "I had a plan. {i}We{/i} had a plan...! And he threw it all away.\nThe moment you walked through that door, he let you replace me.\nHe left me to rot in The Triumvirate's prison because you were more convenient."
    voice "se/z02368.ogg"
    char_shane "我有个计划。{i}我们{/i}有个计划……！而他把它全扔了。\n你走进那扇门的那一刻，他就让你取代了我。\n他把我丢在三人执政团的监狱里烂掉，因为用你更方便。"

# game/script.rpy:91283
translate chinese map262_608c4bcd:

    # "That's not true! I try and reason with Shane, but to no avail."
    "不是那样的！我试着跟肖恩讲理，但毫无作用。"

# game/script.rpy:91308
translate chinese map262_2110a3bf:

    # voice "se/z02369.ogg"
    # char_shane "You saw how many people died in your HQ during that little attack.\nIf you couldn't wield that sword, you'd be buried down there with the rest of them!\nDamek didn't care about you, or your friends. He only cared about your power."
    voice "se/z02369.ogg"
    char_shane "你看到了那次小规模袭击中，你的总部死了多少人。\n要是你握不了那把剑，你早就和他们一起埋在那里了！\n达梅克根本不在乎你，也不在乎你的朋友。他只在乎你的力量。"

# game/script.rpy:91323
translate chinese map262_59eb4414:

    # "Again, that's not true! He's clearly been converted by The Triumvirate."
    "再说一次，不是那样的！他显然已经被三人执政团策反了。"

# game/script.rpy:91338
translate chinese map262_add9ea85:

    # voice "se/z02370.ogg"
    # char_shane "I was thinking long and hard about what I should do.\nYou know — what was my place in all of this...?"
    voice "se/z02370.ogg"
    char_shane "我一直在苦苦思索自己该怎么做。\n你知道——我在这一切之中，究竟算什么……？"

# game/script.rpy:91353
translate chinese map262_2bb39fd3:

    # "Much to my surprise, he throws both of his daggers on the ground."
    "让我意外的是，他把两把匕首都扔在了地上。"

# game/script.rpy:91381
translate chinese map262_7fc72502:

    # voice "se/z02371.ogg"
    # char_shane "And I realized that if I served The Triumvirate, I'd receive the same power.\nIt seemed fitting. End Damek's rebellion with the same thing he was relying on."
    voice "se/z02371.ogg"
    char_shane "然后我意识到，如果我效忠三人执政团，就能获得同样的力量。\n这似乎很合适。用达梅克所依赖的同一件东西，终结他的叛乱。"

# game/script.rpy:91396
translate chinese map262_b4bd6b9d:

    # "He smirks, and I can tell that the man Damek cared about was already dead."
    "他笑了笑，我明白达梅克所珍视的那个人，早已不在了。"

# game/script.rpy:91411
translate chinese map262_344018b6:

    # voice "se/z02372.ogg"
    # char_shane "I wish he could be here to see this.\nBut you'll tell him the story — won't you?"
    voice "se/z02372.ogg"
    char_shane "真希望他能在这儿亲眼看看。\n但你会把这段故事讲给他听的——对吧？"

# game/script.rpy:91429
translate chinese map262_747bec22:

    # "A moment later, he charges at me, unarmed.{w}\nBut in almost the blink of an eye, the blade appears in his hands.{w}\nRobbed from mine, I have no choice but to jump out of the way."
    "片刻之后，他赤手空拳地朝我冲来。{w}\n但几乎就在眨眼之间，那把剑出现在了他手中。{w}\n我的剑被夺走，别无选择，只能闪身避开。"

# game/script.rpy:91431
translate chinese map262_f9c0f07e:

    # "I run to the opposite side of the ship, where he threw his pair of daggers.{w}\nPicking them up, I assume a fighting stance, and wait for him to charge again."
    "我跑到船的另一侧，也就是他扔掉那对匕首的地方。{w}\n我捡起匕首，摆出战斗姿态，等着他再次冲来。"

# game/script.rpy:91456
translate chinese map262_7302ad0f:

    # voice "se/z02373.ogg"
    # char_shane "Not strong enough to take it back by willpower alone...?\nThought so. You're weak. See, I was blessed by The Triumvirate.\nAll you got was worthless energy from the realm of spirits. Out of pity, too."
    voice "se/z02373.ogg"
    char_shane "光靠意志力没本事把它夺回去……？\n我就知道。你很弱。看吧，我得到了三人执政团的赐福。\n你得到的只是来自灵界的一文不值的能量。而且还是出于怜悯。"

# game/script.rpy:91471
translate chinese map262_0d1b1397:

    # "He doesn't seem to know about the Monarchy, or the true nature of the power within me.{w}\nBig surprise. The Triumvirate lost Sovy when he found out. I should use this to my advantage.{w}\nAs he charges, I maintain the facade that I'm weak and unable to summon back the blade."
    "他似乎并不知道君主国的事，也不了解我体内力量的真正本质。{w}\n毫不意外。索维发现真相后，三人执政团就失去了他。我该利用这一点。{w}\n他冲来时，我继续装作软弱无力，无法唤回那把剑。"

# game/script.rpy:91473
translate chinese map262_7deb6b5e:

    # "I dodge to the side once more, but slice into Shane's arm with one of his own daggers.{w}\nHe winces and grunts. His arm starts to bleed, but it doesn't seem to affect his performance.{w}\nHe charges again, and I dodge to the other side. With a roll, I slice into his leg. He stumbles."
    "我再次侧身闪避，用他自己的一把匕首划伤了肖恩的手臂。{w}\n他皱起脸，闷哼一声。手臂开始流血，但似乎没影响他的动作。{w}\n他又冲了过来，我向另一侧闪避。一个翻滚，我划中了他的腿。他脚步踉跄。"

# game/script.rpy:91475
translate chinese map262_71534f29:

    # "I have speed and agility, while he relies on slow, brute strength.{w}\nIt's easy to tell that he's never fought with such a weapon before.{w}\nFrom what I've seen, he can really only use arrows and daggers."
    "我速度快、身手灵，而他只靠迟缓的蛮力。{w}\n很容易看出，他从没用过这种武器作战。{w}\n据我所见，他真正会使的只有弓箭和匕首。"

# game/script.rpy:91500
translate chinese map262_adc9a2c7:

    # voice "se/z02374.ogg"
    # char_shane "Is that all you've got...? "
    voice "se/z02374.ogg"
    char_shane "你就这点本事……？"

# game/script.rpy:91515
translate chinese map262_0d542357:

    # "I won't be able to keep up the same strategy forever.{w}\nI'd need to change it up while I think of how to end this.{w}\nHe charges once more, but this time, I meet him head on."
    "我不可能一直用同样的策略。{w}\n我得换个打法，同时想想怎么结束这一切。{w}\n他又一次冲来，但这一次，我正面迎了上去。"

# game/script.rpy:91517
translate chinese map262_b5fdb453:

    # "Holding out the daggers in a cross formation, I stop the blade from going any further.{w}\nWe struggle, both at almost equal strength, trembling as we try to overpower the other.{w}\nI tell Shane that Damek is still alive. The spirits willed it because his cause was righteous."
    "我交叉举起匕首，架住了那把剑，让它无法再进一步。{w}\n我们较着力，力量几乎不相上下，都颤抖着想压过对方。{w}\n我告诉肖恩，达梅克还活着。因为他的事业是正义的，所以灵界让他活了下来。"

# game/script.rpy:91532
translate chinese map262_eedb134f:

    # voice "se/z02375.ogg"
    # char_shane "Impossible...!"
    voice "se/z02375.ogg"
    char_shane "不可能……！"

# game/script.rpy:91547
translate chinese map262_a50720be:

    # "He'd never comply if I told him to look for himself, so there's no way I can prove it.{w}\nHowever, he seems to let up a little bit, and I'm able to overpower him some more.{w}\nI push him away, and tell him that it's all true. He's on the wrong side of this war."
    "就算我叫他自己去看，他也绝不会照做，所以我根本无法证明。{w}\n然而，他似乎稍微松懈了些，我得以再占几分上风。{w}\n我把他推开，告诉他这都是真的。他站错了这场战争的边。"

# game/script.rpy:91562
translate chinese map262_936d00b3:

    # voice "se/z02376.ogg"
    # char_shane "No! You're the one on the wrong side!\nThe Rebellion is small and insignificant...!\nHundreds, standing in a world of millions."
    voice "se/z02376.ogg"
    char_shane "不！站错边的人是你！\n反抗军又小又不值一提……！\n几百人，对抗一个数百万人的世界。"

# game/script.rpy:91566
translate chinese map262_16b3a8a4:

    # voice "se/z02377.ogg"
    # char_shane "Even if you win, they won't respect your power!\nThey're {i}happy{/i} living under The Triumvirate's rule.\nRevenge won't solve anything. Just back down...!"
    voice "se/z02377.ogg"
    char_shane "就算你赢了，他们也不会敬畏你的力量！\n他们{i}心甘情愿{/i}活在三人执政团的统治下。\n复仇解决不了任何问题。退让吧……！"

# game/script.rpy:91581
translate chinese map262_ab70f929:

    # "We circle around each other, both holding out our weapons."
    "我们举着武器，绕着彼此转圈。"

# game/script.rpy:91596
translate chinese map262_db35600a:

    # voice "se/z02378.ogg"
    # char_shane "I was hurt by The Occupation, and I wanted to fight.\nBut I realized I was being greedy; and there was no point.\nIt's not my happiness — my satisfaction, that matters. It's the world's."
    voice "se/z02378.ogg"
    char_shane "我曾因占领而受伤，我想战斗。\n但我意识到那只是我的贪念，毫无意义。\n重要的不是我的幸福或满足，而是这个世界的幸福与满足。"

# game/script.rpy:91611
translate chinese map262_2e0b53c1:

    # "It seems we've reached a stalemate — both trying to talk each other down.{w}\nBut I wouldn't yield, and something told me that he wouldn't either.{w}\nHis views have been twisted; and he thinks mine have as well."
    "看来我们陷入了僵局——都想说服对方放弃。{w}\n但我不会让步，而我有种感觉，他也不会。{w}\n他的观念已被扭曲；而他认为我的也是。"

# game/script.rpy:91613
translate chinese map262_6ba3dcb7:

    # "We charge at each other, and meet in the middle once more.{w}\nThe water rises, and I can tell that time is minimal. We're sinking fast.{w}\nReturning to the same deadlock as before, I'd need to do {i}something{/i}."
    "我们互相冲去，再次在中央相遇。{w}\n水在上涨，我明白时间不多了。船下沉得很快。{w}\n又回到了和之前一样的僵持，我必须做点{i}什么{/i}。"

# game/script.rpy:91618
translate chinese map262_17a25e68:

    # "I'd need to summon the blade back when he least expects it.{w}\nMy time is limited, and it honestly seems like Shane is beyond saving.{w}\nBut the question is — what do I do when it's back in my grasp...?"
    "我得在他最意想不到的时候把剑召回来。{w}\n我的时间有限，而且说实话，肖恩似乎已经无可救药。{w}\n但问题是——当剑回到我手中，我该怎么做……？"

# game/script.rpy:91642
translate chinese map263_1da12707:

    # "I have to kill him. It's the only way.{w}\nOtherwise, he'd continue to be a thorn in our side.{w}\nWe couldn't afford any potential disruptions. Not anymore."
    "我必须杀了他。这是唯一的办法。{w}\n否则，他会继续成为我们的眼中钉。{w}\n我们再也经不起任何潜在的干扰了。不能再有了。"

# game/script.rpy:91660
translate chinese map263_5c76fe09:

    # voice "se/z02379.ogg"
    # char_shane "You took everything from me...!"
    voice "se/z02379.ogg"
    char_shane "你夺走了我的一切……！"

# game/script.rpy:91675
translate chinese map263_3847b6a6:

    # "As his anger and rage empowers him, I start to tremble even more.{w}\nIt takes a lot to resist the strength of a man wielding The Blade of Exodus."
    "随着愤怒与狂暴为他注入力量，我开始颤抖得更厉害。{w}\n要抵挡一个手握放逐之刃之人的力量，需要极大的力气。"

# game/script.rpy:91678
translate chinese map263_6033c4f7:

    # voice "se/z02380.ogg"
    # char_shane "You were born with everything I worked so hard to achieve...!\nThey were my family — my friends! And you took them all away!"
    voice "se/z02380.ogg"
    char_shane "你生来就拥有我拼命奋斗才得到的一切……！\n他们是我的家人——我的朋友！而你把他们全都夺走了！"

# game/script.rpy:91681
translate chinese map263_2e5bfdd7:

    # "As he starts to get more desperate and angry, I decide to take action.{w}\nI let him overpower me, and I step to the side, dodging his next swing."
    "随着他越发绝望和愤怒，我决定采取行动。{w}\n我让他压过我，然后侧身一闪，避开了他接下来的挥砍。"

# game/script.rpy:91696
translate chinese map263_e34fd380:

    # voice "se/z02381.ogg"
    # char_shane "I hate you...!"
    voice "se/z02381.ogg"
    char_shane "我恨你……！"

# game/script.rpy:91711
translate chinese map263_9e19149c:

    # "But immediately after, and much to his surprise, I phase the blade back into my hands.{w}\nTurning back toward him, I thrust the blade through his abdomen, and push him back.{w}\nHe lets out a scream as I pull it back out, and he stumbles back, clutching the wound."
    "但紧接着，出乎他意料的是，我将剑相位转移回手中。{w}\n我转向他，将剑刺入他的腹部，把他推了回去。{w}\n我拔出剑时，他发出一声惨叫，踉跄后退，捂住伤口。"

# game/script.rpy:91720
translate chinese map263_6800b623:

    # "He realizes I was lying, and fooled him. He says nothing, and drops to his knees.{w}\nI watch as he seems to fade in and out of consciousness, wobbling back and forth.{w}\nMuttering his final words as he slumps back, he lands in a pool of water that soon tints red."
    "他意识到我骗了他，耍了他。他什么也没说，跪倒在地。{w}\n我看着他似乎在清醒与昏迷之间浮沉，身子前后摇晃。{w}\n他瘫倒下去，喃喃着最后的话，倒进一汪水洼，那水很快染上了红色。"

# game/script.rpy:91723
translate chinese map263_d79465f4:

    # voice "se/z02382.ogg"
    # char_shane "Damek..."
    voice "se/z02382.ogg"
    char_shane "达梅克……"

# game/script.rpy:91726
translate chinese map263_a9aacd79:

    # "I had to get moving, and fast...!{w}\nThis encounter was enough of a distraction.{w}\nI give him a moment of silence before making my escape."
    "我得走了，而且要快……！{w}\n这场遭遇已经拖得够久了。{w}\n我为他默哀片刻，然后逃离了那里。"

# game/script.rpy:91735
translate chinese map263_d5af37a9:

    # "He didn't deserve to die, that much was clear.{w}\nThere had to be a chance that he'd see reason in the future.{w}\nIf I went on to win this war, maybe he'd see things differently."
    "他不该死，这一点很明确。{w}\n将来总该有一丝可能，让他明白道理。{w}\n如果我能赢得这场战争，也许他会换个角度看事情。"

# game/script.rpy:91753
translate chinese map263_6f1378e6:

    # voice "se/z02383.ogg"
    # char_shane "You took everything from me...!"
    voice "se/z02383.ogg"
    char_shane "你夺走了我的一切……！"

# game/script.rpy:91768
translate chinese map263_20679120:

    # "As his anger and rage empowers him, I start to tremble even more.{w}\nIt takes a lot to resist the strength of a man wielding The Blade of Exodus.{w}\nI do my best to buy time until I find the right opportunity. I contest Shane's words."
    "随着愤怒与狂暴为他注入力量，我开始颤抖得更厉害。{w}\n要抵挡一个手握放逐之刃之人的力量，需要极大的力气。{w}\n我尽力拖延时间，等待合适的时机。我反驳肖恩的话。"

# game/script.rpy:91783
translate chinese map263_4969c1ab:

    # voice "se/z02384.ogg"
    # char_shane "You were born with everything I worked so hard to achieve...!\nThey were my family — my friends! And you took them all away!"
    voice "se/z02384.ogg"
    char_shane "你生来就拥有我拼命奋斗才得到的一切……！\n他们是我的家人——我的朋友！而你把他们全都夺走了！"

# game/script.rpy:91798
translate chinese map263_2e5bfdd7_1:

    # "As he starts to get more desperate and angry, I decide to take action.{w}\nI let him overpower me, and I step to the side, dodging his next swing."
    "随着他越发绝望和愤怒，我决定采取行动。{w}\n我让他压过我，然后侧身一闪，避开了他接下来的挥砍。"

# game/script.rpy:91813
translate chinese map263_55215fe4:

    # voice "se/z02385.ogg"
    # char_shane "I hate you...!"
    voice "se/z02385.ogg"
    char_shane "我恨你……！"

# game/script.rpy:91828
translate chinese map263_eba62ba0:

    # "But immediately after, and much to his surprise, I phase the blade back into my hands.{w}\nWhile he's caught off guard, I raise the blade in the air, and smash the base against his head.{w}\nHe screams and stumbles back, knocked into a daze. I step forward, and do the same thing again."
    "但紧接着，出乎他意料的是，我将剑相位转移回手中。{w}\n趁他猝不及防，我举起剑，用剑柄砸向他的头。{w}\n他惨叫着踉跄后退，被打得头晕眼花。我上前一步，又做了同样的事。"

# game/script.rpy:91837
translate chinese map263_2810d031:

    # "I'm careful not to go too far, and I stop the moment I find enough time to make my escape.{w}\nHe slumps down on the ground, almost knocked unconscious. I can hear him cry and whimper.{w}\nThere was no way to know if he'd make it out of this alive, but at least the had a chance."
    "我小心不做得太过，一找到足够逃脱的时机就停了手。{w}\n他瘫倒在地上，几乎失去意识。我能听见他哭泣和呜咽。{w}\n无法确定他能否活着挺过去，但至少他还有机会。"

# game/script.rpy:91840
translate chinese map263_cfeb20ed:

    # voice "se/z02386.ogg"
    # char_shane "Damek..."
    voice "se/z02386.ogg"
    char_shane "达梅克……"

# game/script.rpy:91843
translate chinese map263_902f3df9:

    # "This was enough of a distraction. I had to get moving!{w}\nLooking back at Shane, it's crushing how far he seems to have fallen.{w}\nWhen I saw Damek again, it might be wise not to even tell him what happened."
    "这已经拖得够久了。我得走了！{w}\n回头看向肖恩，他堕落得如此之深，令人心碎。{w}\n等我再见到达梅克时，也许最好连发生了什么都别告诉他。"

# game/script.rpy:91849
translate chinese map263_71afc9a0:

    # "I jump in the water, and immediately start swimming toward the ship my comrades are on.{w}\nBut soon after jumping in, the freezing water makes my limbs feel stiff, and my chest heavy.{w}\nFighting it for as long as I can, I keep swimming. I know I can do this...! This is {i}no{/i} time to give up!"
    "我跳进水里，立刻朝同伴们所在的船游去。{w}\n但入水不久，冰冷的水让我的四肢变得僵硬，胸口沉重。{w}\n我拼命抵抗着，不停向前游。我知道我能做到……！这{i}绝不是{/i}放弃的时候！"

# game/script.rpy:91882
translate chinese map264_6c1e701f:

    # "When my vision fades back in, I can feel that I'm being dragged. What happened?{w}\nMy body is covered in snow, and I'm shivering. I must've passed out back in the water.{w}\nI shake my head, and whoever is carrying me seems to notice. They put me down and sigh."
    "当我恢复视觉时，我能感觉到自己正被拖行。发生了什么？{w}\n我浑身是雪，瑟瑟发抖。我一定是在水里昏了过去。{w}\n我摇了摇头，背着我的人似乎察觉到了。他把我放下，叹了口气。"

# game/script.rpy:91911
translate chinese map264_b4e6bc74:

    # voice "se/z02387.ogg"
    voice "se/z02387.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:91913
translate chinese map264_56abc644:

    # char_damek "You're awake. Thank goodness.\nWhen I found you in the water, I was starting to worry.\nWhat happened back there, anyway? You were so far behind us."
    char_damek "你醒了。谢天谢地。\n我在水里发现你的时候，都开始担心了。\n到底发生了什么？你落后我们那么远。"

# game/script.rpy:91927
translate chinese map264_f4f1b3cf:

    # "I shake my head, telling him that I can't remember much. A necessary lie.{w}\nIf he knew what Shane tried to do, and how lost he was — it would damage his morale.{w}\nHe needed to see my survival as a triumph. We couldn't afford any damaged morale."
    "我摇摇头，告诉他我记不太清了。这是个必要的谎言。{w}\n如果他知道肖恩想做什么，以及他迷失得有多深——那会打击他的士气。{w}\n他需要把我的生还看作一场胜利。我们经不起士气受损。"

# game/script.rpy:91952
translate chinese map264_db389cf4:

    # voice "se/z02388.ogg"
    # char_damek "Oh, I see. Can you stand on your own?\nWe're resting in a shack that's not too far away.\nIt's nothing fancy — but it'll give us the privacy we need."
    voice "se/z02388.ogg"
    char_damek "哦，我明白了。你能自己站起来吗？\n我们就在不远处的一间小屋里歇脚。\n不算讲究——但能给我们需要的那份清静。"

# game/script.rpy:91967
translate chinese map264_10e80f31:

    # "Nodding, I get up on my feet.{w}\nI stumble a bit, but Damek can tell I'm still fine."
    "我点点头，站了起来。{w}\n我踉跄了一下，但达梅克看得出我没事。"

# game/script.rpy:91992
translate chinese map264_3e8c15af:

    # voice "se/z02389.ogg"
    # char_damek "Just follow me, alright?\nI'll give you an update once we arrive.\nA {i}lot{/i} of stuff happened while you were out."
    voice "se/z02389.ogg"
    char_damek "跟着我就好，行吗？\n到了之后我会把情况告诉你。\n你昏迷的时候发生了{i}很多{/i}事。"

# game/script.rpy:92014
translate chinese map264_86379e8d:

    # "Normally a statement like that, under these circumstances, would fill me with fear.{w}\nBut Damek says it with such a calm demeanor, that I'm led to believe everybody is fine.{w}\nHolding that optimism in my head, I smile as we make our way toward the shack he mentioned."
    "通常在这种情形下，这样的话会让我满心恐惧。{w}\n但达梅克说得那样平静，让我不禁相信大家都平安无事。{w}\n怀着这份乐观，我们朝他说的小屋走去，我微微一笑。"

# game/script.rpy:92040
translate chinese map264_26003d0b:

    # voice "se/z02390b.ogg"
    voice "se/z02390b.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:92042
translate chinese map264_ad49161b:

    # char_howl "Oh, you're awake. This is good.\nWhen we found you in the water, we were starting to worry.\nWe must ask — what happened? Last we checked, you were right behind us."
    char_howl "哦，你醒了。这很好。\n我们在水里找到你时，已经开始担心了。\n我们得问一句——发生了什么？我们最后看你时，你就在我们身后。"

# game/script.rpy:92056
translate chinese map264_3753c69e:

    # "I tell Howl exactly what happened. However, I tell him to keep it a secret.{w}\nI wouldn't want Damek to find out about Shane. He'd been hurt enough."
    "我把发生的事原原本本告诉了豪尔。不过，我让他保守秘密。{w}\n我不想让达梅克知道肖恩的事。他已经受够伤了。"

# game/script.rpy:92081
translate chinese map264_6642ac18:

    # voice "se/z02391b.ogg"
    # char_howl "Interesting. Do not worry, we will keep your secret.\nIt is unfortunate how strong The Triumvirate's thrall can be.\nIf we win, at least no more good men will fall under their command."
    voice "se/z02391b.ogg"
    char_howl "有意思。别担心，我们会替你保守秘密。\n三人执政团的蛊惑竟能如此强大，实在不幸。\n如果我们赢了，至少不会再有好人沦为他们麾下。"

# game/script.rpy:92095
translate chinese map264_6cd167c6:

    # voice "se/z02392.ogg"
    # char_howl "We've set up camp at a nearby shack. Follow us, please.\nI'll make sure to give you an update on everything once we're safe.\nA lot has happened while you were out, so there is much to talk about."
    voice "se/z02392.ogg"
    char_howl "我们在附近的小屋扎了营。请跟我们来。\n等我们安全了，我一定把一切都告诉你。\n你昏迷时发生了很多事，有很多要谈。"

# game/script.rpy:92117
translate chinese map264_b7034d54:

    # "Normally a statement like that would fill me with fear, under these circumstances.{w}\nBut Howl says it with such a calm demeanor, that I'm led to believe everybody is fine.{w}\nHolding that optimism in my head, I smile as we make our way toward the shack he mentioned."
    "通常在这种情形下，这样的话会让我满心恐惧。{w}\n但豪尔说得那样平静，让我不禁相信大家都平安无事。{w}\n怀着这份乐观，我们朝他提到的那间小屋走去，我微微一笑。"

# game/script.rpy:92136
translate chinese map265_f644f333:

    # "As soon as we arrive, I make my way to the shack, and lean against it.{w}\nWe barely even arrived in Balteus, and everything was already chaotic.{w}\nI don't know what I was expecting, so it's not exactly a surprise, either."
    "我们一到，我就走向小屋，靠在墙上。{w}\n我们才刚到巴尔泰乌斯，一切就已经乱成一团。{w}\n我不知道自己原本在期待什么，所以这也不算太意外。"

# game/script.rpy:92138
translate chinese map265_fea75c08:

    # "All of my comrades are scattered about, talking amongst themselves.{w}\nI'm glad that they survived. I try to account for them one by one as I look around.{w}\nAfter a few moments, something strikes me. I can't see either Fortaime or Valessa."
    "我的同伴们散落在各处，三三两两地交谈着。{w}\n我很高兴他们都活了下来。我环顾四周，试着一个个清点人数。{w}\n过了片刻，我忽然意识到一件事。福泰姆和瓦莱莎都不见踪影。"

# game/script.rpy:92143
translate chinese map265_44249589:

    # "Howl approaches me, and he lets out a sigh of relief.{w}\nI can imagine that my momentary disapperance stressed everybody out."
    "豪尔走近我，松了口气。{w}\n我能想象，我短暂的失踪让所有人都紧张不已。"

# game/script.rpy:92168
translate chinese map265_7c9630b9:

    # voice "se/z02393.ogg"
    voice "se/z02393.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:92170
translate chinese map265_d787095b:

    # char_howl "Good to see you, Monarch. We were worried.\nIt seems that almost everybody is accounted for."
    char_howl "见到您真好，君主。我们很担心。\n看来几乎所有人都平安归队了。"

# game/script.rpy:92184
translate chinese map265_e03a1f82:

    # "I ask him where Valessa and Fortaime are.{w}\nHis demeanor quickly changes to that of sadness."
    "我问他瓦莱莎和福泰姆在哪里。{w}\n他的神情立刻变得悲伤。"

# game/script.rpy:92209
translate chinese map265_f9898b35:

    # voice "se/z02394.ogg"
    # char_howl "They are some of the few we have yet to find.\nBut we are certain that they live. We haven't found their bodies.\nMany of them washed ashore — casualties of the battle at sea."
    voice "se/z02394.ogg"
    char_howl "他们是我们少数还没找到的人之一。\n但我们确信他们还活着。我们没找到他们的遗体。\n许多人被冲上岸——都是海战的伤亡者。"

# game/script.rpy:92213
translate chinese map265_2e104721:

    # voice "se/z02395.ogg"
    # char_howl "We are relieved to know that you are not one of those casualties.\nThe plan is to wait in and around the shack until everybody shows up.\nThis might be a good time for you to get some more rest. Please relax."
    voice "se/z02395.ogg"
    char_howl "得知你不是那些伤亡者之一，我们松了口气。\n计划是在小屋里和小屋附近等待，直到所有人都出现。\n也许现在正好适合你多休息一会儿。请放松些。"

# game/script.rpy:92228
translate chinese map265_57c4c4a0:

    # "Relax while my best friends are missing...?{w}\nThat was a tall order. I tell Howl that I might not be able to."
    "最好的朋友还下落不明，让我放松……？{w}\n这要求未免太高了。我告诉豪尔，我恐怕做不到。"

# game/script.rpy:92253
translate chinese map265_3d227619:

    # voice "se/z02396.ogg"
    # char_howl "Please do not resort to worst case scenario thinking.\nThis is a time to be hopeful. We stand on the precipice of victory.\nWe will go and look for them personally. You deserve some rest."
    voice "se/z02396.ogg"
    char_howl "请不要往最坏处想。\n现在是该抱有希望的时候。我们正站在胜利的边缘。\n我们会亲自去找他们。你该歇一歇了。"

# game/script.rpy:92259
translate chinese map265_c4cd8ff2:

    # "Damek approcahes me, and he lets out a sigh of relief.{w}\nI can imagine that my momentary disappearance stressed everybody out."
    "达梅克走近我，松了口气。{w}\n我能想象，我短暂的失踪让所有人都紧张不已。"

# game/script.rpy:92284
translate chinese map265_51c57691:

    # voice "se/z02397b.ogg"
    voice "se/z02397b.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:92286
translate chinese map265_8901042e:

    # char_damek "Good to see you, Monarch. I was worried!\nAt least now, almost everybody is accounted for."
    char_damek "见到你真好，君主。我一直很担心！\n至少现在，几乎所有人都平安归队了。"

# game/script.rpy:92300
translate chinese map265_73d84f03:

    # "Almost everybody...? That worries me.{w}\nI ask him where Valessa and Fortaime are."
    "几乎所有人……？这让我担心起来。{w}\n我问他瓦莱莎和福泰姆在哪里。"

# game/script.rpy:92325
translate chinese map265_91887676:

    # voice "se/z02398b.ogg"
    # char_damek "They're out there somewhere. We just can't find them.\nDon't worry. They're not dead. We haven't found their bodies.\nAnd trust me, we would have. A ton of them washed ashore..."
    voice "se/z02398b.ogg"
    char_damek "他们就在外面某处。只是我们找不到。\n别担心。他们没死。我们没找到他们的遗体。\n相信我，要是他们死了，我们肯定找得到。好多人被冲上了岸……"

# game/script.rpy:92339
translate chinese map265_6034698b:

    # voice "se/z02399.ogg"
    # char_damek "I'm just thankful that you didn't fall during the battle at sea.\nWe're just going to wait around this shack until everybody turns up.\nYou should probably use this time to relax. I know you couldn't before."
    voice "se/z02399.ogg"
    char_damek "我只是庆幸你没有在海战中倒下。\n我们就守在这小屋附近，等所有人都出现。\n你大概该趁这时间放松一下。我知道你之前一直做不到。"

# game/script.rpy:92354
translate chinese map265_48eab182:

    # "Relax while my best friends are missing...?{w}\nThat was a tall order. I tell Damek that I might not be able to."
    "最好的朋友还下落不明，让我放松……？{w}\n这要求未免太高了。我告诉达梅克，我恐怕做不到。"

# game/script.rpy:92379
translate chinese map265_d4ef5e54:

    # voice "se/z02400.ogg"
    # char_damek "Look, it's not a good idea to resort to negative thinking.\nWe stand on the verge of victory. This is a time to be hopeful.\nI'll go and look for them personally, okay? You should go and relax."
    voice "se/z02400.ogg"
    char_damek "听着，往坏处想可不是好主意。\n我们正站在胜利的边缘。现在是该抱有希望的时候。\n我会亲自去找他们，好吗？你该去歇一歇。"

# game/script.rpy:92401
translate chinese map265_cd4e0f0e:

    # "I nod, and thank him as I turn away.{w}\nScanning the area once more, I see who I can find.{w}\nA few of the comrades I can find slowly gather around me."
    "我点点头，道了谢，转身走开。{w}\n我又扫视了一圈，看看能找到谁。{w}\n我能找到的几位同伴慢慢聚到了我身边。"

# game/script.rpy:92426
translate chinese map265_041f121e:

    # voice "se/pro4.ogg"
    voice "se/pro4.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:92428
translate chinese map265_47402a93:

    # char_pro "Hey! Good to see that you're still among the living.\nThat was pretty intense, wasn't it? Sure scared me, at least.\nI'm not one for sailing, or fighting. So combining both? Yikes."
    char_pro "嘿！很高兴看到你还活着。\n那可真够刺激的，对吧？至少把我吓得不轻。\n我既不擅长航海，也不擅长打仗。两者凑一块儿？哎呀。"

# game/script.rpy:92453
translate chinese map265_f47eaffe:

    # voice "se/z02402.ogg"
    voice "se/z02402.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:92455
translate chinese map265_387dde8b:

    # char_ulric "Yeah, Pro was scared. Thankfully, I have strength for two.\nHe cowered in the corner while I did all of the hard work."
    char_ulric "是啊，普洛吓坏了。幸好，我的力气能顶两个人。\n我干着所有苦活的时候，他缩在角落里。"

# game/script.rpy:92480
translate chinese map265_171f8ee5:

    # voice "se/pro5.ogg"
    # char_pro "Did not...!"
    voice "se/pro5.ogg"
    char_pro "才没有……！"

# game/script.rpy:92506
translate chinese map265_0797145c:

    # voice "se/z02404.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Sure."
    voice "se/z02404.ogg"
    char_ulric "是啊。"

# game/script.rpy:92521
translate chinese map265_ffc614ef:

    # "They share a quick laugh.{w}\nBut soon after that, I can tell that something is wrong.{w}\nIs there something that I'm not being told about all of this...?"
    "他们相视一笑。{w}\n但很快，我就看出有什么不对劲。{w}\n是不是有什么事他们瞒着我……？"

# game/script.rpy:92553
translate chinese map265_6b0964b7:

    # voice "se/z02405.ogg"
    voice "se/z02405.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:92555
translate chinese map265_bf0f6476:

    # char_ulric "It's about Alex, [firstname].\nHe's resting in the shack, in critical condition.\nI think we can nurse him back to health, but I'm not sure."
    char_ulric "是关于亚历克斯，[firstname]。\n他正在小屋里休息，情况危急。\n我想我们能把他照料好，但我不确定。"

# game/script.rpy:92569
translate chinese map265_ba38badf:

    # "Oh, no..."
    "哦，不……"

# game/script.rpy:92594
translate chinese map265_aef27335:

    # voice "se/pro6.ogg"
    # char_pro "Look, it's probably best not to think about it too much.\nHe's in good hands. We just need to forge on as a team.\nIf it weren't for him, we'd all be dead at sea. This is a victory."
    voice "se/pro6.ogg"
    char_pro "听着，最好别想太多。\n他有人照顾。我们只需要一起继续前进。\n要不是他，我们早就葬身大海了。这是一场胜利。"

# game/script.rpy:92609
translate chinese map265_2fe293b4:

    # "I guess that's true."
    "我想这倒是真的。"

# game/script.rpy:92634
translate chinese map265_a2e2bf22:

    # voice "se/z02406b.ogg"
    # char_ulric "It was just important that we gave you a status report.\nI think once everybody gets here, we'll hold another meeting.\nOur strategy may need some adapting after these losses."
    voice "se/z02406b.ogg"
    char_ulric "我们只是觉得该向你汇报一下情况。\n我想等所有人都到齐，我们会再开一次会。\n经历这些损失后，我们的策略也许需要做些调整。"

# game/script.rpy:92660
translate chinese map265_cbc3da23:

    # voice "se/pro7.ogg"
    # char_pro "Yeah, go take a breather — you deserve it.\nRight now, our options are pretty limited."
    voice "se/pro7.ogg"
    char_pro "是啊，去歇会儿吧——你应得的。\n目前，我们的选择相当有限。"

# game/script.rpy:92686
translate chinese map265_f006e946:

    # voice "se/z02406c.ogg"
    # char_ulric "It's not ideal, but he's right. \nAll we can do right now is wait.\nThanks for the chat, [firstname]."
    voice "se/z02406c.ogg"
    char_ulric "这并不理想，但他说得对。\n我们现在能做的只有等待。\n谢谢你陪我们聊这些，[firstname]。"

