# game/script.rpy:93204
translate chinese map265_120dc270:

    # "I guess there wasn't much left for me to do.{w}\nI make my way to the shack, hopefully, to relax.{w}\nBut I was chasing an impossibility. I'd find no rest here."
    "我想我也没什么能做的了。{w}\n我朝小屋走去，希望能歇一歇。{w}\n但我追寻的只是一个不可能。在这里，我得不到安宁。"

# game/script.rpy:93206
translate chinese map265_6eb73df2:

    # "Not until everything was over.{w}\nAnd that would mean we'd either win, or die.{w}\nAs I enter the shack, I pray that it's the former."
    "除非一切都结束。{w}\n而那意味着我们要么赢，要么死。{w}\n我走进小屋，祈祷会是前者。"

# game/script.rpy:93225
translate chinese map266_a248f4c5:

    # "As soon as I'm inside, I let out a huge sigh.{w}\nThe emotions behind it are almost undiscernable.{w}\nThere was so much going on, my mind was overwhelmed."
    "一进屋，我就长长地叹了口气。{w}\n这声叹息背后的情绪几乎难以分辨。{w}\n发生的事情太多，我的脑子不堪重负。"

# game/script.rpy:93231
translate chinese map266_a28e6b20:

    # "I guess I should take care of the important stuff first.{w}\nThe Pirate forces suffered heavy casualties, and Nada was almost lost.{w}\nI can see her resting on a small bed that sits in the corner of the shack."
    "我想我该先处理要紧的事。{w}\n海盗部队伤亡惨重，娜达也险些丧命。{w}\n我能看见她躺在那张摆在屋角的小床上。"

# game/script.rpy:93233
translate chinese map266_941a2ff5:

    # "She notices me, and waves me over.{w}\nIt's a soft motion, and I can tell she's in pain."
    "她注意到了我，招手让我过去。{w}\n那动作很轻，我能看出她在忍痛。"

# game/script.rpy:93258
translate chinese map266_669ec65e:

    # voice "se/z02422a.ogg"
    voice "se/z02422a.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:93264
translate chinese map266_5358a3c5:

    # char_jit_map266_1_0_20 "Hey. How're you holding up?"
    char_jit_map266_1_0_20 "嘿。你还好吗？"

# game/script.rpy:93278
translate chinese map266_02ac6a2f:

    # "I tell her that I'm doing alright."
    "我告诉她我没事。"

# game/script.rpy:93303
translate chinese map266_51c0fee8:

    # voice "se/z02423a.ogg"
    # char_jit_map266_1_0_20 "At least that makes one of us.\nI almost died, but one of my men shielded me.\nThat's the weight of power, I guess. Watching them die."
    voice "se/z02423a.ogg"
    char_jit_map266_1_0_20 "至少我们之中还有一个人没事。\n我差点死了，但我的一名手下替我挡了下来。\n我想，这就是权力的重担吧。眼睁睁看着他们死去。"

# game/script.rpy:93318
translate chinese map266_db8e1e89:

    # "She winces in pain, and I see a wound on her abdomen."
    "她痛得皱起脸，我看到她腹部有一道伤口。"

# game/script.rpy:93343
translate chinese map266_66d6a021:

    # voice "se/z02424a.ogg"
    # char_jit_map266_1_0_20 "It never gets any easier, though.\nHey, can you promise me {i}one{/i} thing?"
    voice "se/z02424a.ogg"
    char_jit_map266_1_0_20 "可这从来都不会变得容易些。\n嘿，你能答应我{i}一件{/i}事吗？"

# game/script.rpy:93358
translate chinese map266_9d13a767:

    # "I nod, and she waves me even closer, as her voice weakens.{w}\nShe holds out her hand, and I shake it with a firm grip."
    "我点点头，她的声音渐渐虚弱，招手让我再靠近些。{w}\n她伸出手，我紧紧握住。"

# game/script.rpy:93383
translate chinese map266_db04efea:

    # voice "se/z02425a.ogg"
    # char_jit_map266_1_0_20 "Give them {i}hell{/i} for me, [firstname].\nIf I die, I want to die knowing that we've won.\nShow them no quarter. They don't deserve it."
    voice "se/z02425a.ogg"
    char_jit_map266_1_0_20 "替我好好{i}收拾{/i}他们，[firstname]。\n如果我死了，我想知道自己死时我们已经赢了。\n别对他们手下留情。他们不配。"

# game/script.rpy:93405
translate chinese map266_36ae7513:

    # "I nod, and then release the grip on her hand.{w}\nShe dozes off into slumber, and I decide to leave her be.{w}\nRest would be important right now. She shouldn't force anything."
    "我点点头，然后松开了她的手。{w}\n她打起了盹，我决定不去打扰她。{w}\n此刻休息很重要。她不该勉强自己。"

# game/script.rpy:93407
translate chinese map266_958d2f83:

    # "After standing up, I look down at her.{w}\nIf it weren't for her, we wouldn't even be here right now.{w}\nI smile, and silently thank her for all that she's done."
    "站起身后，我低头看着她。{w}\n要不是她，我们现在根本不会在这里。{w}\n我微微一笑，默默感谢她所做的一切。"

# game/script.rpy:93412
translate chinese map266_8c21edf8:

    # "I guess I should take care of the important stuff first.{w}\nThe Pirate forces suffered heavy casualties, and Alex was almost lost.{w}\nI can see him, resting on a small bed that sits in the corner of the shack."
    "我想我该先处理要紧的事。{w}\n海盗部队伤亡惨重，亚历克斯也险些丧命。{w}\n我能看见他躺在那张摆在屋角的小床上。"

# game/script.rpy:93414
translate chinese map266_99e0fbe6:

    # "He notices me, and waves me over.{w}\nIt's a soft motion, and I can tell he's in pain."
    "他注意到了我，招手让我过去。{w}\n那动作很轻，我能看出他在忍痛。"

# game/script.rpy:93439
translate chinese map266_25d30c3f:

    # voice "se/z02426.ogg"
    voice "se/z02426.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:93445
translate chinese map266_b1308585:

    # char_jit_map266_1_0_121 "Hey. How're you holding up?"
    char_jit_map266_1_0_121 "嘿。你还好吗？"

# game/script.rpy:93459
translate chinese map266_a4f21fdd:

    # "I tell him that I'm doing alright."
    "我告诉他我没事。"

# game/script.rpy:93484
translate chinese map266_53f08ef1:

    # voice "se/z02427b.ogg"
    # char_jit_map266_1_0_121 "At least that makes one of us.\nI almost died, but one of my men shielded me.\nThat's the weight of power, I guess. Watching them die."
    voice "se/z02427b.ogg"
    char_jit_map266_1_0_121 "至少我们之中还有一个人没事。\n我差点死了，但我的一名手下替我挡了下来。\n我想，这就是权力的重担吧。眼睁睁看着他们死去。"

# game/script.rpy:93499
translate chinese map266_35bae70d:

    # "He winces in pain, and I see a wound on his abdomen."
    "他痛得皱起脸，我看到他腹部有一道伤口。"

# game/script.rpy:93524
translate chinese map266_05d4a6fc:

    # voice "se/z02428.ogg"
    # char_jit_map266_1_0_121 "It never gets any easier, though.\nHey, can you promise me {i}one{/i} thing?"
    voice "se/z02428.ogg"
    char_jit_map266_1_0_121 "可这从来都不会变得容易些。\n嘿，你能答应我{i}一件{/i}事吗？"

# game/script.rpy:93539
translate chinese map266_516f2c77:

    # "I nod, and he waves me even closer, as his voice weakens.{w}\nHe holds out his hand, and I shake it with a firm grip."
    "我点点头，他的声音渐渐虚弱，招手让我再靠近些。{w}\n他伸出手，我紧紧握住。"

# game/script.rpy:93564
translate chinese map266_b9aae79a:

    # voice "se/z02429.ogg"
    # char_jit_map266_1_0_121 "Give them {i}hell{/i} for me, [firstname].\nIf I die, I want to die knowing that we've won.\nShow them no quarter. They don't deserve it."
    voice "se/z02429.ogg"
    char_jit_map266_1_0_121 "替我好好{i}收拾{/i}他们，[firstname]。\n如果我死了，我想知道自己死时我们已经赢了。\n别对他们手下留情。他们不配。"

# game/script.rpy:93586
translate chinese map266_463f0144:

    # "I nod, and then release the grip on his hand.{w}\nHe dozes off into slumber, and I decide to leave him be.{w}\nRest would be important right now. He shouldn't force anything."
    "我点点头，然后松开了他的手。{w}\n他打起了盹，我决定不去打扰他。{w}\n此刻休息很重要。他不该勉强自己。"

# game/script.rpy:93588
translate chinese map266_5f540dea:

    # "After standing up, I look down at him.{w}\nIf it weren't for him, we wouldn't even be here right now.{w}\nI smile, and silently thank him for all that he's done."
    "站起身后，我低头看着他。{w}\n要不是他，我们现在根本不会在这里。{w}\n我微微一笑，默默感谢他所做的一切。"

# game/script.rpy:93594
translate chinese map266_9b6f37a3:

    # "I can't believe that Nada fell during the battle.{w}\nI wanted to stop and mourn — but I knew that wasn't possible.{w}\nThese people deserved better, but the war dictated otherwise."
    "我无法相信娜达在战斗中倒下了。{w}\n我想停下来哀悼——但我知道那不可能。{w}\n这些人本该有更好的结局，但战争不由人。"

# game/script.rpy:93596
translate chinese map266_22eef212:

    # "Perhaps after everything settled down, we could have a memorial.{w}\nNot just for Nada, but for everybody that was lost to this senseless war.{w}\nEspecially those lost in The Occupation. Everybody deserved a proper sendoff."
    "也许等一切平息之后，我们可以办一场追悼会。{w}\n不只是为娜达，而是为所有在这场无意义战争中逝去的人。{w}\n尤其是那些在占领中丧生的人。每个人都该有个体面的告别。"

# game/script.rpy:93598
translate chinese map266_69a984cc:

    # "I can't let this loss bring me down. I need to keep moving forward.{w}\nI promise myself that after this battle, I'll set aside time to grieve them all.{w}\nIt's just that right now, stopping to do that would likely end in my death."
    "我不能让这份失去击垮我。我得继续向前。{w}\n我向自己承诺，这场战斗之后，我会留出时间来哀悼他们所有人。{w}\n只是现在，停下来做这些很可能会让我丧命。"

# game/script.rpy:93603
translate chinese map266_38b62066:

    # "I can't believe that Alex fell during the battle.{w}\nI wanted to stop and mourn — but I knew that wasn't possible.{w}\nThese people deserved better, but the war dictated otherwise."
    "我无法相信亚历克斯在战斗中倒下了。{w}\n我想停下来哀悼——但我知道那不可能。{w}\n这些人本该有更好的结局，但战争不由人。"

# game/script.rpy:93605
translate chinese map266_8c8c5599:

    # "Perhaps after everything settled down, we could have a memorial.{w}\nNot just for Alex, but for everybody that was lost to this senseless war.{w}\nEspecially those lost in The Occupation. Everybody deserved a proper sendoff."
    "也许等一切平息之后，我们可以办一场追悼会。{w}\n不只是为亚历克斯，而是为所有在这场无意义战争中逝去的人。{w}\n尤其是那些在占领中丧生的人。每个人都该有个体面的告别。"

# game/script.rpy:93607
translate chinese map266_69a984cc_1:

    # "I can't let this loss bring me down. I need to keep moving forward.{w}\nI promise myself that after this battle, I'll set aside time to grieve them all.{w}\nIt's just that right now, stopping to do that would likely end in my death."
    "我不能让这份失去击垮我。我得继续向前。{w}\n我向自己承诺，这场战斗之后，我会留出时间来哀悼他们所有人。{w}\n只是现在，停下来做这些很可能会让我丧命。"

# game/script.rpy:93612
translate chinese map266_f0cfa8ed:

    # "The door to the shack swings open, startling me.{w}\nI turn around to see Gryz look around, oblivious to my presence.{w}\nAfter a few moments, he notices me, and lets out a nervous laugh."
    "小屋的门猛地被推开，吓了我一跳。{w}\n我转过身，看见格瑞兹四处张望，完全没注意到我。{w}\n过了一会儿，他看见了我，紧张地笑了一声。"

# game/script.rpy:93637
translate chinese map266_875b7043:

    # voice "se/z02430b.ogg"
    voice "se/z02430b.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:93639
translate chinese map266_2e54a629:

    # char_jit_map251_1_0_130 "I never thought I'd see this place again.\nThis is where I used to live — before I joined The Triumvirate.\nA simple shepherd, that's all I was. They said they saw greatness in me."
    char_jit_map251_1_0_130 "我从没想过还能再见到这个地方。\n这里是我从前住的地方——在我加入三人执政团之前。\n我只是个普通的牧羊人。他们却说在我身上看到了不凡。"

# game/script.rpy:93652
translate chinese map266_81f6a3af:

    # voice "se/z02431.ogg"
    # char_jit_map251_1_0_130 "But now I know that all they saw was a naive man, ready to serve.\nThey prey on the weak. On those whose minds can be warped.\nI'm a different man, now. But perhaps my change came too late."
    voice "se/z02431.ogg"
    char_jit_map251_1_0_130 "但现在我知道，他们看到的只是一个天真、随时准备效忠的人。\n他们专挑弱者下手。专挑那些心智可以被扭曲的人。\n我现在已经不是从前那个人了。但也许我的转变来得太迟了。"

# game/script.rpy:93667
translate chinese map266_7186ea51:

    # "He steps forward and places his hands on the table."
    "他上前一步，双手按在桌上。"

# game/script.rpy:93682
translate chinese map266_ea205c3b:

    # voice "se/z02432.ogg"
    # char_jit_map251_1_0_130 "I don't know if this is important or not, but Balteus has changed.\nIt used to be a beautiful place — but now, it's almost like it's dying.\nI can't put my finger on it, but something bad is happening here."
    voice "se/z02432.ogg"
    char_jit_map251_1_0_130 "我不知道这重不重要，但巴尔泰乌斯变了。\n这里曾经是个美丽的地方——可现在，简直像在死去。\n我说不上来是怎么回事，但这里正发生着不好的事。"

# game/script.rpy:93696
translate chinese map266_70f86d4b:

    # voice "se/z02433.ogg"
    # char_jit_map251_1_0_130 "So be careful, alright? We can't lose you, [firstname].\nBut if its within your power, I'd like to see Balteus restored.\nPlacing your throne here, and settling down, would be a good idea."
    voice "se/z02433.ogg"
    char_jit_map251_1_0_130 "所以小心点，好吗？我们不能失去你，[firstname]。\n但如果这是你力所能及的，我希望能看到巴尔泰乌斯恢复旧貌。\n把你的王座设在这里，安顿下来，会是个好主意。"

# game/script.rpy:93711
translate chinese map266_573a6a8f:

    # "I agree, even though I'm not entirely sure what he's talking about.{w}\nBalteus had changed? It's dying? I'm not sure how that works.{w}\nBut he's not one to lie, so I just let him continue talking."
    "我表示同意，尽管我不太明白他在说什么。{w}\n巴尔泰乌斯变了？它在死去？我不懂这怎么会。{w}\n但他不是个会撒谎的人，于是我由着他继续说下去。"

# game/script.rpy:93736
translate chinese map266_6c5a8edb:

    # voice "se/z02434.ogg"
    # char_jit_map251_1_0_130 "They made me kill my flock of sheep before joining them.\nThey said it symbolized the death of my old life, and the start of my new one.\nI felt awful, but I still chose to comply. I wasn't the smartest when I was younger."
    voice "se/z02434.ogg"
    char_jit_map251_1_0_130 "加入他们之前，他们逼我杀光了我的羊群。\n他们说，这象征着我旧日生命的终结，和新生命的开始。\n我难受极了，却还是选择了顺从。我年轻时并不聪明。"

# game/script.rpy:93750
translate chinese map266_ccac8e8f:

    # voice "se/z02435.ogg"
    # char_jit_map251_1_0_130 "That's why I wear the skin of my favorite sheep. I called him Lassiter.\nI wore him as a tribute, but he slowly turned into a symbol of my resentment.\nSeeing him every day — that constant reminder — was part of why I defected."
    voice "se/z02435.ogg"
    char_jit_map251_1_0_130 "所以我才披着我最爱的那只羊的皮。我叫他拉西特。\n我披着他是为了纪念，可他却渐渐变成了我怨恨的象征。\n每天看到他——那个不断的提醒——也是我叛离的原因之一。"

# game/script.rpy:93764
translate chinese map266_b4d7c372:

    # voice "se/z02346b.ogg"
    # char_jit_map251_1_0_130 "I couldn't live with what I did, so I sought redemption.\nOf course, you know the rest — so I won't bore you.\nThank you for listening to an old man's ramblings."
    voice "se/z02346b.ogg"
    char_jit_map251_1_0_130 "我无法带着自己做过的事活下去，于是寻求救赎。\n当然，后面的事你都知道——我就不啰嗦了。\n谢谢你听一个老头子絮叨。"

# game/script.rpy:93779
translate chinese map266_02bec1ab:

    # "I give him my sympathy. That was an awful thing to experience.{w}\nThey used their status as \"Gods\" to manipulate young and impressionable people.{w}\nI can imagine that abandoning your moral code is easier if it's to impress \"Gods\" like them."
    "我向他表达了同情。那是段可怕的经历。{w}\n他们利用自己“神明”的身份，操纵年轻而易受影响的人。{w}\n我能想象，如果是为了讨好他们那样的“神明”，抛弃自己的道德准则会更容易些。"

# game/script.rpy:93781
translate chinese map266_bcac2a8a:

    # "I'm glad that he survived those tunnels, and chose to assist us in the final battle.{w}\nI make sure to tell him that, and he gives me a wide smile in exchange."
    "我很高兴他熬过了那些地道，并选择在最后的战斗中帮助我们。{w}\n我特意把这话告诉了他，他回赠给我一个大大的笑容。"

# game/script.rpy:93806
translate chinese map266_42718be1:

    # voice "se/z02347.ogg"
    # char_jit_map251_1_0_130 "That means a lot. It really does.\nI want to see The Triumvirate fall, even if it means losing my life.\nGiving everybody out there a happy future? Now that would let me rest easy."
    voice "se/z02347.ogg"
    char_jit_map251_1_0_130 "这对我意义重大。真的。\n我想看到三人执政团覆灭，哪怕要付出我的性命。\n给外面所有人一个幸福的未来？那才能让我安心。"

# game/script.rpy:93820
translate chinese map266_56296c55:

    # voice "se/z02348.ogg"
    # char_jit_map251_1_0_130 "Of course, my survival would be preferable.\nI promise not to do anything too reckless. You have my word.\nThat's all I can really give you for now. I hope that it's enough."
    voice "se/z02348.ogg"
    char_jit_map251_1_0_130 "当然，我更希望能活下来。\n我保证不会做太鲁莽的事。我向你保证。\n目前我能给你的也只有这些了。希望这就够了。"

# game/script.rpy:93842
translate chinese map266_285a53d5:

    # "He starts walking around the shack, inspecting things.{w}\nThere must be a lot of memories here, if this is where he used to live.{w}\nIt's probably best to leave him to himself, given the current circumstances."
    "他开始在小屋里走动，打量四周。{w}\n如果这里是他从前住的地方，那一定承载着许多回忆。{w}\n考虑到目前的情形，最好还是让他一个人待着。"

# game/script.rpy:93846
translate chinese map266_bf285a84:

    # "There isn't much left to do but rest, I suppose."
    "我想，除了休息，也没别的可做了。"

# game/script.rpy:93848
translate chinese map266_20f5a764:

    # "I move to the corner and press my back against the wall once more.{w}\nHopefully they're all able to find Valessa and Fortaime. I can't lose them now.{w}\nI'll rest in here for a while, and gather my bearings. This is not a time for freaking out."
    "我走到角落，再次把背靠在墙上。{w}\n但愿他们都能找到瓦莱莎和福泰姆。我现在不能失去他们。{w}\n我要在这里歇一会儿，理清思绪。现在不是惊慌失措的时候。"

# game/script.rpy:93854
translate chinese map266_1ddd10cf:

    # "[[You can continue the story when you're ready by clicking the arrow in the top-right corner.]"
    "[[当你准备好了，点击右上角的箭头即可继续故事。]"

# game/script.rpy:93967
translate chinese map269_69a1d868:

    # "After a few hours of waiting, I almost can't handle it anymore.{w}\nIt's impossible for me to rest when my friends could be in danger.{w}\nMaking my way to the exit, I cross my fingers, hoping that things are okay."
    "等了几个小时后，我几乎再也受不了了。{w}\n朋友们可能身陷险境，我根本无法休息。{w}\n我朝出口走去，暗暗祈祷一切平安。"

# game/script.rpy:93973
translate chinese map269_25d76f48:

    # "Just as I'm about to leave, the door is swung open, catching me off guard.{w}\nI take a few steps back to avoid getting hit, letting out a sigh of relief afterwards.{w}\nIt's Ulric — but that's not all. A few moments after he enters, Valessa and Fortaime follow."
    "我正要离开，门突然被推开，让我猝不及防。{w}\n我后退几步以免被撞到，随后松了口气。{w}\n是乌尔里克——但不只他一个。他进来片刻之后，瓦莱莎和福泰姆也跟了进来。"

# game/script.rpy:93979
translate chinese map269_0b12eba5:

    # "They're alive...!{w}\nWhat a huge relief this was!{w}\nAll the worry had taken its toll."
    "他们还活着……！{w}\n这真是让人大大松了口气！{w}\n之前的担忧早已让我身心俱疲。"

# game/script.rpy:93984
translate chinese map269_c600c408:

    # "We hug each other, with big smiles on our faces.{w}\nFor a while there, I was scared of what might've happened.{w}\nThankfully, they're okay. I could rest easy as we move forward with everything."
    "我们露出大大的笑容，互相拥抱。{w}\n有一阵子，我很害怕可能出了什么事。{w}\n幸好他们没事。接下来的事，我也能安心些了。"

# game/script.rpy:94009
translate chinese map269_cdb71d2f:

    # voice "se/z02349b.ogg"
    voice "se/z02349b.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:94011
translate chinese map269_fc6e4bf4:

    # char_fortaime "Sorry for taking a bit longer than you thought.\nWe've never been here before, so we got lost."
    char_fortaime "抱歉，比你想的久了一点。\n我们从没来过这里，所以迷路了。"

# game/script.rpy:94036
translate chinese map269_848b2c9d:

    # voice "se/z02350.ogg"
    voice "se/z02350.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:94038
translate chinese map269_4325af28:

    # char_valessa "Yeah, and it was even harder because you're keeping quiet.\nIt's hard to find people who don't want to be found, you know?"
    char_valessa "是啊，而且你还瞒着我们，就更难了。\n不想被人找到的人，可不好找，你知道吗？"

# game/script.rpy:94052
translate chinese map269_b64623e6:

    # "I release the hug, and tell them that everything is fine.{w}\nI was worried — but I knew that they were capable of surviving."
    "我松开拥抱，告诉他们一切都好。{w}\n我担心过——但我知道他们有能力活下来。"

# game/script.rpy:94077
translate chinese map269_d6228c8d:

    # voice "se/z02351b.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "I can't believe how cold this place is.\nIt looks so uninviting, too. Scary, almost."
    voice "se/z02351b.ogg"
    char_fortaime "真不敢相信这地方这么冷。\n看起来也这么不友好。简直有点吓人。"

# game/script.rpy:94103
translate chinese map269_17dbba9e:

    # voice "se/z02352.ogg"
    # char_valessa "Yeah — hopefully we can change that.\nThe Triumvirate seems neglectful. But why...?"
    voice "se/z02352.ogg"
    char_valessa "是啊——但愿我们能改变它。\n三人执政团似乎疏于治理。可为什么呢……？"

# game/script.rpy:94133
translate chinese map269_47bd2d25:

    # "I shrug, unsure of how to answer that question.{w}\nWe're here to kill The Triumvirate, not reason with them.{w}\nI have a feeling this, among other questions, would remain unanswered."
    "我耸耸肩，不知该如何回答这个问题。{w}\n我们来这里是为了杀掉三人执政团，而不是跟他们讲道理。{w}\n我有种感觉，这个问题，还有许多其他问题，都会没有答案。"

# game/script.rpy:94135
translate chinese map269_4b4b8ba5:

    # "Damek and Howl soon enter the shack.{w}\nFollowed by more of our comrades, we quickly fill the room.{w}\nGathering around the table, it's clear that it was time to plan."
    "达梅克和豪尔很快也进了小屋。{w}\n更多同伴紧随其后，房间里很快挤满了人。{w}\n大家围到桌旁，显然，是时候制定计划了。"

# game/script.rpy:94164
translate chinese map269_c662f8b9:

    # voice "se/z02353b.ogg"
    voice "se/z02353b.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:94166
translate chinese map269_3142bb6b:

    # char_damek "Alright, we need to talk about what happens next.\nUntil now, we've been pretty vague, since time was short.\nBut there's no more delaying. This is everything we've got."
