    voice "se/z02391.ogg"
    char_valessa "是啊，我们能行——没问题。"

# game/script.rpy:94803
translate chinese map272_2252c705:

    # voice "se/z02392b.ogg"
    # char_damek "Glad to hear it. "
    voice "se/z02392b.ogg"
    char_damek "听你这么说我很高兴。"

# game/script.rpy:94853
translate chinese map273_7174a500:

    # voice "se/z02393b.ogg"
    voice "se/z02393b.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:94855
translate chinese map273_ee6ddda4:

    # char_howl "That is all we've come up with.\nDoes everybody find it acceptable...?"
    char_howl "这就是我们想出的全部方案。\n大家都觉得可以接受吗……？"

# game/script.rpy:94869
translate chinese map273_f9964a8f:

    # "Everybody nods, knowing their part.{w}\nIt seemed like they had almost thought of it all.{w}\nWith a strategy like that, victory seems almost certain."
    "每个人都点头，清楚自己的角色。{w}\n他们似乎几乎把一切都想到了。{w}\n有这样的策略，胜利几乎已是板上钉钉。"

# game/script.rpy:94871
translate chinese map273_13be882c:

    # "As long as I could defeat The Triumvirate and that idol.{w}\nEven if everybody plays their part — the end is still all on me.{w}\nI'd do my best not to let them down. But part of me is filled with fright."
    "只要我能击败三人执政团和那尊灵像。{w}\n即使每个人都各司其职——最后的成败仍全在我身上。{w}\n我会尽全力不让他们失望。但我心里有一部分充满了恐惧。"

# game/script.rpy:94896
translate chinese map273_d4aba483:

    # voice "se/z02394b.ogg"
    voice "se/z02394b.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:94898
translate chinese map273_4534613e:

    # char_damek "Alright, let's go outside.\nWe'll head to The Grand Library as a group.\nIf we can get in there without trouble, the rest will be easy."
    char_damek "好，我们出去吧。\n我们全队一起前往大图书馆。\n只要能顺利进去，剩下的就简单了。"

# game/script.rpy:94925
translate chinese map273_9dd8dd06:

    # "The Monarch Vessels should make it pretty easy for us.{w}\nThey'll lure The Honor Guard away from the Town Square.{w}\nIf they can do that, then we can slip in pretty much undetected."
    "君主容器应该能让我们轻松不少。{w}\n他们会把荣誉卫队引离城镇广场。{w}\n只要做到这点，我们就能神不知鬼不觉地溜进去。"

# game/script.rpy:94930
translate chinese map273_d9a21684:

    # "The Created Seers should make is pretty easy for us.{w}\nThey'll lure The Honor Guard away from the Town Square.{w}\nIf they can do that, then we can slip in pretty much undetected."
    "人造先知应该能让我们轻松不少。{w}\n他们会把荣誉卫队引离城镇广场。{w}\n只要做到这点，我们就能神不知鬼不觉地溜进去。"

# game/script.rpy:94937
translate chinese map273_63a0675c:

    # "Hopefully they could survive the task.{w}\nThis operation would be divided into two phases, then.{w}\nTake The Grand Library. Then Take The Triumvirate's Castle."
    "但愿他们能在这场任务中活下来。{w}\n那么，这次行动将分为两个阶段。{w}\n拿下大图书馆。再拿下三人执政团的城堡。"

# game/script.rpy:94939
translate chinese map273_32af169b:

    # "With everything planned, and out in the open, we exit the shack.{w}\nHope fills the air, for the first time in a while. We could do this.{w}\nI smile at my comrades as we head outside, one by one."
    "一切已筹划妥当，也和盘托出，我们走出了小屋。{w}\n久违地，空气中充满了希望。我们能行。{w}\n我们一个接一个地走出去，我对同伴们笑了笑。"

# game/script.rpy:94958
translate chinese map274_b14c0d39:

    # "The cold, uninviting air assaults me as soon as I exit the shack.{w}\nIt's like Eastcrown. I'm not sure how people could survive in this place.{w}\nWell, not that there's many people here. It's mainly those suits of armor."
    "一出小屋，寒冷而不友好的空气就扑面而来。{w}\n就像东冠一样。我不知道人们怎么能在这地方活下来。{w}\n不过，这里本来也没多少人。主要都是那些空甲。"

# game/script.rpy:94960
translate chinese map274_f2b0a4aa:

    # "I can hear everybody talking — going over the roles they were assigned.{w}\nIf everybody did what they were supposed to do, then we'd win this for sure.{w}\nOf course, as long as I could destroy The Triumvirate and that idol they're housing."
    "我能听见大家在交谈——复述各自被分配的任务。{w}\n如果每个人都做好分内之事，那我们一定能赢。{w}\n当然，前提是我能摧毁三人执政团和他们供奉的那尊灵像。"

# game/script.rpy:94985
translate chinese map274_8cf0e686:

    # voice "se/pro15.ogg"
    voice "se/pro15.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:94987
translate chinese map274_29ace959:

    # char_pro "Sneak into the castle — and lure everybody away from the main atrium.\nSeems pretty easy to me. [firstname] will have no resistance at all."
    char_pro "潜入城堡——把所有人从主中庭引开。\n在我看来挺简单的。[firstname]将不会遇到任何抵抗。"

# game/script.rpy:95012
translate chinese map274_34cb111b:

    # voice "se/z02396b.ogg"
    voice "se/z02396b.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:95014
translate chinese map274_edab6b94:

    # char_fortaime "And if I can ring that bell, then everybody will be safe...!\nAll those years of climbing has finally paid off. This is gonna be great."
    char_fortaime "只要我能敲响那口钟，大家就都安全了……！\n这么多年爬来爬去，总算派上用场了。这一定会很棒。"

# game/script.rpy:95040
translate chinese map274_6fd0902d:

    # "Ulric is quick to interject, putting any arrogance to rest before it can blossom."
    "乌尔里克立刻插话，把任何可能滋生的自满都扼杀在萌芽中。"

# game/script.rpy:95065
translate chinese map274_c8597eb6:

    # voice "se/z02397.ogg"
    voice "se/z02397.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:95067
translate chinese map274_862cc62c:

    # char_ulric "Look — none of that is going to happen if we can't take The Grand Library.\nWe need to establish a foothold. A safe place to retreat to if things go south."
    char_ulric "听着——如果我们拿不下大图书馆，那些都不会发生。\n我们需要建立据点。一个万一情况不妙时能撤退的安全之处。"

# game/script.rpy:95088
translate chinese map274_39752059:

    # "They all nod, and stop the discussion they were having.{w}\nIt's true, though. Without haven, we're out in the open, completely unsafe.{w}\nAt least the first phase of our plan wasn't too complicated. I know we'd seize the library."
    "他们都点点头，停止了刚才的讨论。{w}\n不过，这是事实。没有避难所，我们就暴露在外，毫无安全可言。{w}\n至少计划的第一阶段不算太复杂。我知道我们能拿下图书馆。"

# game/script.rpy:95094
translate chinese map274_62a80f7d:

    # "I notice that one of our comrades is carrying Alex.{w}\nThat's good. The Library would be the best place for him to get rest.{w}\nHe's fast asleep, which is pretty surprising. He must be a heavy sleeper."
    "我注意到一名同伴正背着亚历克斯。{w}\n这很好。图书馆会是让他休息的最佳之处。{w}\n他睡得很沉，这挺让人意外的。他一定睡得很死。"

# game/script.rpy:95099
translate chinese map274_1571b5a6:

    # "I notice that one of our comrades is carrying Nada.{w}\nThat's good. The Library would be the best place for her to get rest.{w}\nShe's fast asleep, which is pretty surprising. She must be a heavy sleeper."
    "我注意到一名同伴正背着娜达。{w}\n这很好。图书馆会是让她休息的最佳之处。{w}\n她睡得很沉，这挺让人意外的。她一定睡得很死。"

# game/script.rpy:95124
translate chinese map274_1cebe6ba:

    # voice "se/z02398.ogg"
    voice "se/z02398.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:95126
translate chinese map274_a4e72e15:

    # char_howl "The city should only be a couple of hours away.\nWe trust that you can all handle the cold...?"
    char_howl "离城里应该只有几个小时的路程了。\n我们相信你们都能扛得住这寒冷……？"

# game/script.rpy:95151
translate chinese map274_702b4e5f:

    # voice "se/z02399b.ogg"
    voice "se/z02399b.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:95153
translate chinese map274_07645c51:

    # char_damek "We don't really have much of a choice, Howl.\nLet's get going. I think our goal is pretty clear."
    char_damek "我们其实没什么选择，豪尔。\n走吧。我想我们的目标已经很清楚了。"

# game/script.rpy:95179
translate chinese map274_c81a9ee3:

    # "Upon hearing that, we all start walking toward the city.{w}\nI can see the impressive wall that surrounds everything. It's beautiful.{w}\nHowever, I can't see anything past it. I have no idea what Balteus looks like."
    "听到这话，我们全都朝城里走去。{w}\n我能看见环绕着一切的宏伟城墙。很美。{w}\n然而，墙后什么也看不见。我完全不知道巴尔泰乌斯是什么样子。"

# game/script.rpy:95184
translate chinese map274_d7a2ce38:

    # "We walk through thick layers of snow, and my legs start to tire out.{w}\nBut I'm not in a position where I have any choice. Pushing forward is mandatory.{w}\nAfter what feels like a small eternity, we finally arrive at the gates leading into Balteus."
    "我们穿过厚厚的积雪，我的双腿开始酸痛。{w}\n但我没有选择的余地。必须向前。{w}\n仿佛过了漫长的一个世纪，我们终于到达了通往巴尔泰乌斯的城门。"

# game/script.rpy:95203
translate chinese map275_199bf831:

    # "The town gates, and the wall, are an amazing sight.{w}\nIntricate details are carved into the stone. It's a work of art.{w}\nSomething told me The Monarchy made this. Not The Triumvirate."
    "城门和城墙，景象令人叹为观止。{w}\n石头上雕刻着繁复的纹样。这是一件艺术品。{w}\n我隐约觉得这是君主国所建。不是三人执政团。"

# game/script.rpy:95228
translate chinese map275_8e5fdcd3:

    # voice "se/z02400b.ogg"
    voice "se/z02400b.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:95230
translate chinese map275_9ac1091e:

    # char_fortaime "This looks amazing...!\nThis must be a remnant of The Monarchy, right?\nThe Triumvirate can't be {i}this{/i} artistic. I know it."
    char_fortaime "这看起来太惊人了……！\n这一定是君主国留下的遗迹，对吧？\n三人执政团可没{i}这么{/i}有艺术品味。我知道。"

# game/script.rpy:95255
translate chinese map275_59874c2f:

    # voice "se/z02401.ogg"
    voice "se/z02401.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:95257
translate chinese map275_5c55463e:

    # char_howl "Correct. This looks just as we remember it.\nHowever, Balteus wasn't always this cold.\nSomething bad has happened to the nation."
    char_howl "没错。这和我们记忆中的一模一样。\n然而，巴尔泰乌斯并非一直这么寒冷。\n这个国家发生了不好的事。"

# game/script.rpy:95282
translate chinese map275_85ba9713:

    # voice "se/z02402b.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "Oh, I see. \nLike what?"
    voice "se/z02402b.ogg"
    char_fortaime "哦，我明白了。\n比如什么？"

# game/script.rpy:95308
translate chinese map275_4669797d:

    # voice "se/z02403.ogg"
    # char_howl "We're not sure.\nHowever, it is probably due to The Triumvirate.\nIt pains us to see how much they've defiled our former home."
    voice "se/z02403.ogg"
    char_howl "我们也不确定。\n不过，这大概要归咎于三人执政团。\n看到他们如此玷污我们昔日的家园，我们很痛心。"

# game/script.rpy:95322
translate chinese map275_bd9e7598:

    # voice "se/z02404b.ogg"
    # char_howl "We used to live in Balteus. It housed the throne, and our ruler.\nTo see it reduced to a frozen wasteland? It is almost too much to bear.\nLet us head inside. We need to see what else has changed over the years."
    voice "se/z02404b.ogg"
    char_howl "我们曾在巴尔泰乌斯生活。那里安放着王座，还有我们的统治者。\n看着它沦为一片冰封的荒原？这几乎让人无法承受。\n我们进去吧。我们得看看这些年来还有什么变了。"

# game/script.rpy:95349
translate chinese map275_b9a9bdba:

    # "It reminds me of what we thought would happen to Valinorth.{w}\nWithout the spirit idol, it'd wither away and freeze over like Eastcrown.{w}\nWe have since learned that was false — but what's happened to Balteus, then?"
    "这让我想起我们曾以为瓦利诺斯会遭遇的事。{w}\n没有灵像，它就会像东冠一样凋敝、冰封。{w}\n后来我们知道那是错的——那巴尔泰乌斯究竟出了什么事？"

# game/script.rpy:95351
translate chinese map275_61287c85:

    # "As we all start to make our way inside the city, Damek stops us.{w}\nHe looks a bit worried, and I can tell that he's lost in deep thought."
    "我们正要进城，达梅克叫住了我们。{w}\n他看起来有些担忧，我能看出他正陷入沉思。"

# game/script.rpy:95377
translate chinese map275_6ed51888:

    # voice "se/z02405b.ogg"
    voice "se/z02405b.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:95379
translate chinese map275_efa9c717:

    # char_damek "Seers...? Please come forth."
    char_damek "先知们……？请上前来。"

# game/script.rpy:95393
translate chinese map275_cd89b203:

    # "A few moments later, a group of our Seers step forward."
    "片刻之后，一群先知走上前来。"

# game/script.rpy:95418
translate chinese map275_65bb30d4:

    # voice "se/z02406.ogg"
    # char_damek "We don't have much time to waste.\nAs soon as we get inside, you need to get to work.\nLure The Honor Guard away from our path. Understood?"
    voice "se/z02406.ogg"
    char_damek "我们没多少时间可浪费。\n我们一进去，你们就得开始行动。\n把荣誉卫队从我们的路线上引开。明白吗？"

# game/script.rpy:95444
translate chinese map275_5e099821:

    # voice "se/z02407.ogg"
    voice "se/z02407.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:95450
translate chinese map275_5b389a95:

    # char_jit_map275_1_0_128 "Of course. Your path to the Library will be clear.\nAfter the fighting dies down, we will come and join you.\nIt should be easy, so don't expect us to be too far behind."
    char_jit_map275_1_0_128 "当然。通往图书馆的路会为你们清空。\n战斗平息之后，我们会来与你们会合。\n这应该不难，所以别指望我们落在后面太久。"

# game/script.rpy:95475
translate chinese map275_05229fea:

    # voice "se/z02408.ogg"
    # char_damek "Yes, of course. Thank you very much.\nLet's see — is there anything else to cover?"
    voice "se/z02408.ogg"
    char_damek "好，当然。非常感谢。\n让我看看——还有什么要交代的吗？"

# game/script.rpy:95481
translate chinese map275_19c5dec2:

    # voice "se/z02409b.ogg"
    voice "se/z02409b.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:95483
translate chinese map275_9d486491:

    # char_damek "Monarch Vessels...? Where are you?"
    char_damek "君主容器……？你们在哪儿？"

# game/script.rpy:95497
translate chinese map275_dfea4bbe:

    # "A few moments later, a group of our Monarch Vessels step forward."
    "片刻之后，一群君主容器走上前来。"

# game/script.rpy:95522
translate chinese map275_94fd80ed:

    # voice "se/z02410.ogg"
    # char_damek "We don't have much time to waste.\nAs soon as we get inside, you need to get to work.\nLure The Honor Guard away from our path. Understood?"
    voice "se/z02410.ogg"
    char_damek "我们没多少时间可浪费。\n我们一进去，你们就得开始行动。\n把荣誉卫队从我们的路线上引开。明白吗？"

# game/script.rpy:95548
translate chinese map275_63e82dcf:

    # voice "se/z02411.ogg"
    voice "se/z02411.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:95554
translate chinese map275_20810030:

    # char_jit_map275_1_0_185 "Yes, of course. Your path to the Library will be clear.\nAs soon as the fighting dies down, we will come and join you.\nThis should be easy, so don't expect us to be too far behind."
    char_jit_map275_1_0_185 "是的，当然。通往图书馆的路会为你们清空。\n战斗一平息，我们就来与你们会合。\n这应该不难，所以别指望我们落在后面太久。"

# game/script.rpy:95579
translate chinese map275_affbff29:

    # voice "se/z02412b.ogg"
    # char_damek "Yes, of course. Thank you very much.\nLet's see — is there anything else to cover?"
    voice "se/z02412b.ogg"
    char_damek "好，当然。非常感谢。\n让我看看——还有什么要交代的吗？"

# game/script.rpy:95601
translate chinese map275_1475b12c:

    # "He turns back to face the rest of the group.{w}\nGulping, it's clear that he's fraught with anxiety."
    "他转过身，面向其余的人。{w}\n他咽了口唾沫，显然满心焦虑。"

# game/script.rpy:95626
translate chinese map275_2608eba9:

    # voice "se/z02413.ogg"
    # char_damek "Look. We're about to do something that's never been done before.\nWe're seizing territory from The Triumvirate, right under their noses.\nMuch like they did to Mazeo — we're about to occupy Balteus."
    voice "se/z02413.ogg"
    char_damek "听着。我们即将做一件前所未有的事。\n我们要在三人执政团的眼皮底下夺取他们的地盘。\n就像他们当初对马泽奥所做的那样——我们即将占领巴尔泰乌斯。"

# game/script.rpy:95640
translate chinese map275_3e8edf8a:

    # voice "se/z02414b.ogg"
    # char_damek "But that does {i}not{/i} mean we are like them.\nWe do what we do, in order to gain our freedom.\nThey occupied Mazeo, wanting to oppress us even further."
    voice "se/z02414b.ogg"
    char_damek "但这{i}绝不{/i}意味着我们和他们一样。\n我们这么做，是为了赢得自由。\n他们占领马泽奥，是想进一步压迫我们。"

# game/script.rpy:95655
translate chinese map275_431ef599:

    # "We all exchange glances, and nod at one another."
    "我们彼此交换眼神，互相点头。"

# game/script.rpy:95680
translate chinese map275_c21f05a0:

    # voice "se/z02415.ogg"
    # char_damek "I want you to all remember that as we press forward:\nWar can blur the lines between good and evil — but I know where we stand.\nIf you know that too, then there's nothing that can stop you. You are heroes."
    voice "se/z02415.ogg"
    char_damek "我希望你们在前进时都记住这一点：\n战争会模糊善恶的界限——但我知道我们站在哪一边。\n如果你们也清楚，那就没有什么能阻挡你们。你们是英雄。"

# game/script.rpy:95702
translate chinese map275_a068135e:

    # "With nothing left to say, we slowly make our way into the city.{w}\nI can tell that due to Damek's encouraging words, everybody is happy.{w}\nHowever, as we enter, nothing prepares us for the sight that awaits us."
    "再没什么可说的了，我们缓缓走进城中。{w}\n我能看出，因为达梅克那番鼓舞人心的话，大家都很振奋。{w}\n然而，当我们进城时，眼前的景象让我们毫无准备。"

# game/script.rpy:95721
translate chinese map276_e7655718:

    # "Howl immediately steps forward, taking in the sight before him.{w}\nBalteus looks almost uninhabitable. It's in a state of decay, and death.{w}\nI know The Honor Guard doesn't need a paradise — but this is crazy."
    "豪尔立刻上前一步，打量着眼前的景象。{w}\n巴尔泰乌斯看上去几乎已不适合居住。一片衰败、死寂的景象。{w}\n我知道荣誉卫队不需要天堂——但这太离谱了。"

# game/script.rpy:95746
translate chinese map276_41c0601f:

    # voice "se/z02416b.ogg"
    voice "se/z02416b.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:95748
translate chinese map276_de5db121:

    # char_howl "What have they done...?"
    char_howl "他们都干了什么……？"

# game/script.rpy:95762
translate chinese map276_bce53ed1:

    # "It's clear that Howl is hurt. This used to be The Monarchy's home, after all.{w}\nHopefully there would be a way to reverse all of this. It isn't right."
    "显然豪尔很受伤。毕竟这里曾是君主国的家园。{w}\n但愿有办法逆转这一切。这不对。"

# game/script.rpy:95787
translate chinese map276_9d011892:

    # voice "se/z02417.ogg"
    voice "se/z02417.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:95789
translate chinese map276_50b18dfd:

    # char_damek "This is... Well, I certainly didn't expect this.\nI'm guessing it didn't look like this in your time?"
    char_damek "这……嗯，我确实没料到会这样。\n我猜在你们的时代，它可不是这个样子？"

# game/script.rpy:95814
translate chinese map276_83f48907:

    # voice "se/z02418.ogg"
    # char_howl "No. Balteus was a paradise.\nThis is unacceptable, Damek.\nWe must find a way to fix it."
    voice "se/z02418.ogg"
    char_howl "不是。巴尔泰乌斯曾是一座天堂。\n这不可接受，达梅克。\n我们必须找到办法修复它。"

# game/script.rpy:95840
translate chinese map276_f6991fbb:

    # voice "se/z02419b.ogg"
    # char_damek "Of course. There's no way I'll let this stand.\nIt's a bit of a shock, but our plan remains unchanged.\nSecure The Grand Library, then kill The Triumvirate."
    voice "se/z02419b.ogg"
    char_damek "当然。我绝不会坐视不管。\n这确实令人震惊，但我们的计划不变。\n拿下大图书馆，然后杀掉三人执政团。"

# game/script.rpy:95867
translate chinese map276_0bc34fdf:

    # "After he's done talking, we see a horde of Honor Guard suits walk by.{w}\nWe quickly run off to the side and hide behind a nearby building.{w}\nI've never seen anything like this. The building is pitch black."
    "他说完后，我们看到一大群荣誉卫队铠甲兵走过。{w}\n我们赶紧跑到一旁，躲进附近一栋建筑后面。{w}\n我从没见过这样的东西。那建筑漆黑一片。"

# game/script.rpy:95869
translate chinese map276_d5380d8f:

    # "Pieces of it crumble off, almost like it's been burnt or charred.{w}\nBut it hasn't. I know a building can't die, but there's no other way to put it.{w}\nLike its source of life has been cut off, it appears to be living on borrowed time."
    "碎片不断剥落，就像被烧焦或炭化过一样。{w}\n但其实没有。我知道建筑不会死，但实在没有别的说法。{w}\n仿佛生命的源头被切断，它像是在苟延残喘。"

# game/script.rpy:95894
translate chinese map276_450e1c9b:

    # voice "se/z02420.ogg"
    voice "se/z02420.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:95896
translate chinese map276_b0c4a042:

    # char_valessa "What's going on, here...?"
    char_valessa "这里到底怎么了……？"

# game/script.rpy:95921
translate chinese map276_d9dcd3ac:

    # voice "se/z02421b.ogg"
    voice "se/z02421b.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:95923
translate chinese map276_dd564f1a:

    # char_fortaime "This is disgusting. Look."
    char_fortaime "这真恶心。你看。"

# game/script.rpy:95949
translate chinese map276_1236707b:

    # "He looks down, and we all look at his feet.{w}\nWe're no longer standing in snow, but ash and \"soot\".{w}\nI start to wonder if it was ever really snowing at all."
    "他低下头，我们也看向他的脚下。{w}\n我们踩的不再是雪，而是灰烬和“煤烟”。{w}\n我开始怀疑，之前究竟有没有下过雪。"

# game/script.rpy:95974
translate chinese map276_c081f195:

    # voice "se/z02422.ogg"
    voice "se/z02422.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:95976
translate chinese map276_534574b3:

    # char_damek "This is Alestia's fate, if we leave it in their hands.\nThey don't care about the land. They only care about themselves.\nThis is proof enough that we're on the right side of history."
    char_damek "如果我们把事情交给他们，这就是阿莱斯蒂亚的命运。\n他们不在乎这片土地。他们只在乎自己。\n这足以证明，我们站在历史正确的一边。"

# game/script.rpy:95990
translate chinese map276_e6fa45a5:

    # "Howl turns to me, and places a hand on my shoulder."
    "豪尔转向我，把手搭在我的肩上。"

# game/script.rpy:96015
translate chinese map276_7db02cc1:

    # voice "se/z02423.ogg"
    voice "se/z02423.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:96017
translate chinese map276_4a0caf1d:

    # char_howl "We suspect that this may be related to their \"dark idol\".\nMonarch, above all else, please prioritize its destruction."
    char_howl "我们怀疑这可能与他们的“黑暗灵像”有关。\n君主，无论如何，请务必优先摧毁它。"

# game/script.rpy:96043
translate chinese map276_7f4ee655:

    # "I nod, as previous visions start to repeat themselves in my mind.{w}\nI was facing that idol, with the blade. Everything is coming to pass.{w}\nAfter our short talk, our attention is directed back toward The Honor Guard."
    "我点点头，过往的幻象开始在脑海中重现。{w}\n我手持那把剑，面对着那尊灵像。一切都在应验。{w}\n简短交谈之后，我们的注意力又转回了荣誉卫队身上。"

# game/script.rpy:96069
translate chinese map276_6c8b9a74:

    # voice "se/z02424.ogg"
    voice "se/z02424.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:96071
translate chinese map276_b6c8966a:

    # char_damek "Monarch Vessels? Come here.\nI think this is our best chance to take action.\nIf that group is gone, our path to the Library is clear."
    char_damek "君主容器？过来。\n我想这是我们行动的最好机会。\n只要那群人离开，我们通往图书馆的路就畅通了。"

# game/script.rpy:96085
translate chinese map276_3ade0a9d:

    # "Upon hearing this, they quickly group up in front of Damek.{w}\nOur goal of seizing The Grand Library seems pretty attainable."
    "听到这话，他们迅速在达梅克面前集合。{w}\n我们夺取大图书馆的目标看来相当可行。"

# game/script.rpy:96110
translate chinese map276_0bf8198e:

    # voice "se/z02425.ogg"
    voice "se/z02425.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:96116
translate chinese map276_15b766cb:

    # char_jit_map276_1_0_176 "Yes, sir. It should be easy enough to take them down.\nAfter they're dealt with, we'll meet you all in the Library."
    char_jit_map276_1_0_176 "是，长官。解决他们应该不难。\n处理完他们，我们就在图书馆与你们会合。"

# game/script.rpy:96141
translate chinese map276_a6977455:

    # voice "se/z02426b.ogg"
    # char_damek "Good. Go around this building and attack from the other side.\nThey'll be focusing on you, so we'll head in the opposite direction."
    voice "se/z02426b.ogg"
    char_damek "好。绕过这栋建筑，从另一侧发动攻击。\n他们会把注意力放在你们身上，我们就往相反的方向去。"

# game/script.rpy:96167
translate chinese map276_4a22b077:

    # voice "se/z02427.ogg"
    voice "se/z02427.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:96172
translate chinese map276_2cb26d98:

    # char_jit_map276_1_0_208 "Perfect. Then see you at the Library.\nIf we don't make it — it's been an honor."
    char_jit_map276_1_0_208 "太好了。那就在图书馆见。\n如果我们没能到——能与你们并肩，是我的荣幸。"

# game/script.rpy:96193
translate chinese map276_ee0f2ac1:

    # "After exchanging a nod, both groups part ways.{w}\nThe Monarch Vessels prepare to distract The Honor Guard.{w}\nDamek points to a nearby road, signalling where we should run."
    "互相点头之后，两队人马分道扬镳。{w}\n君主容器准备去引开荣誉卫队。{w}\n达梅克指向附近一条路，示意我们该往那里跑。"

# game/script.rpy:96218
translate chinese map276_1f55db21:

    # voice "se/z02428b.ogg"
    # char_damek "The Grand Library is right over there.\nWe'll run on my mark, so just hold on."
    voice "se/z02428b.ogg"
    char_damek "大图书馆就在那边。\n听我口令就跑，先稳住。"

# game/script.rpy:96233
translate chinese map276_b0e70637:

    # "After speaking, he immediately places a finger against his mouth.{w}\nIt's clear that we need to remain silent while the Vessels carry out their goal.{w}\nWe wait there in an intense silence, waiting to hear the clashing of swords."
    "说完，他立刻把一根手指按在唇上。{w}\n显然，在君主容器们执行任务时，我们必须保持安静。{w}\n我们在死一般的寂静中等待着，等着听见剑刃相交的声音。"

# game/script.rpy:96235
translate chinese map276_0d68fddc:

    # "We all stare at each other, in unease.{w}\nWe know that when they start to fight, some of them may die.{w}\nIt pains me that sacrifice was necessary in order to attain our goal."
    "我们不安地互相望着。{w}\n我们知道，一旦他们开战，其中一些人可能会死。{w}\n为了实现目标竟必须牺牲，这让我很痛心。"

# game/script.rpy:96252
translate chinese map276_001ce076:

    # voice "se/z02429b.ogg"
    voice "se/z02429b.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:96254
translate chinese map276_9e14df1a:

    # char_damek "Seers? Come here.\nI think this is our best chance to take action.\nWith that group gone, our path to the Library is clear."
    char_damek "先知们？过来。\n我想这是我们行动的最好机会。\n那群人一走，我们通往图书馆的路就畅通了。"

# game/script.rpy:96268
translate chinese map276_3ade0a9d_1:

    # "Upon hearing this, they quickly group up in front of Damek.{w}\nOur goal of seizing The Grand Library seems pretty attainable."
    "听到这话，他们迅速在达梅克面前集合。{w}\n我们夺取大图书馆的目标看来相当可行。"

# game/script.rpy:96293
translate chinese map276_37da60d6:

    # voice "se/z02430.ogg"
    voice "se/z02430.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:96299
translate chinese map276_f26c2079:

    # char_jit_map276_1_0_275 "Yes, sir. It should be easy enough to take them down.\nAfter they're dealt with, we'll meet you all in the library."
    char_jit_map276_1_0_275 "是，长官。解决他们应该不难。\n处理完他们，我们就在图书馆与你们会合。"

# game/script.rpy:96324
translate chinese map276_2765d8d5:

    # voice "se/z02431b.ogg"
    # char_damek "Good. Go around this building and attack from the other side.\nThey'll be focusing on you, so we'll head in the opposite direction."
    voice "se/z02431b.ogg"
    char_damek "好。绕过这栋建筑，从另一侧发动攻击。\n他们会把注意力放在你们身上，我们就往相反的方向去。"

# game/script.rpy:96350
translate chinese map276_ae651e7d:

    # voice "se/z02432b.ogg"
    voice "se/z02432b.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:96355
translate chinese map276_accfb085:

    # char_jit_map276_1_0_307 "Perfect. Then we'll meet up at the Library.\nIf we don't make it, though — it's been an honor."
    char_jit_map276_1_0_307 "太好了。那我们就在图书馆碰头。\n不过，如果我们没能到——能与你们并肩，是我的荣幸。"

# game/script.rpy:96376
translate chinese map276_b40bf604:

    # "After exchanging a nod, both groups part ways.{w}\nThe Created Seers prepare to distract The Honor Guard.{w}\nDamek points to a nearby road, signalling where we should run."
    "互相点头之后，两队人马分道扬镳。{w}\n人造先知准备去引开荣誉卫队。{w}\n达梅克指向附近一条路，示意我们该往那里跑。"

# game/script.rpy:96401
translate chinese map276_54403f71:

    # voice "se/z02433b.ogg"
    # char_damek "The Grand Library is right over there.\nWe'll run on my mark, so just hold on."
    voice "se/z02433b.ogg"
    char_damek "大图书馆就在那边。\n听我口令就跑，先稳住。"

# game/script.rpy:96416
translate chinese map276_ae38c808:

    # "After speaking, he immediately places a finger against his mouth.{w}\nIt's clear that we need to remain silent while the Seers carry out their goal.{w}\nWe wait there in an intense silence, waiting to hear the clashing of swords."
    "说完，他立刻把一根手指按在唇上。{w}\n显然，在先知们执行任务时，我们必须保持安静。{w}\n我们在死一般的寂静中等待着，等着听见剑刃相交的声音。"

# game/script.rpy:96418
translate chinese map276_0d68fddc_1:

    # "We all stare at each other, in unease.{w}\nWe know that when they start to fight, some of them may die.{w}\nIt pains me that sacrifice was necessary in order to attain our goal."
    "我们不安地互相望着。{w}\n我们知道，一旦他们开战，其中一些人可能会死。{w}\n为了实现目标竟必须牺牲，这让我很痛心。"

# game/script.rpy:96425
translate chinese map276_ffc774e4:

    # "But I know that their sacrifice would never be forgotten.{w}\nMy heart sinks as soon as I hear them start to fight.{w}\nI hear screaming, and steel against steel."
    "但我知道，他们的牺牲绝不会被遗忘。{w}\n一听见他们开打，我的心就沉了下去。{w}\n我听见尖叫，还有钢铁相击的声音。"

# game/script.rpy:96427
translate chinese map276_0c7d2a50:

    # "My instinct tells me to run immediately, but Damek has yet to move.{w}\nI can see him wince every time the skirmish gets a little louder.{w}\nBut soon enough, he makes the call, and we're all running."
    "本能让我立刻就跑，但达梅克还没有动。{w}\n每当那边的交锋声稍微变大，我都能看到他皱眉。{w}\n但很快，他下达了号令，我们全都跑了起来。"

# game/script.rpy:96455
translate chinese map276_1a925121:

    # voice "se/z02434b.ogg"
    # char_damek "Now...! Go!"
    voice "se/z02434b.ogg"
    char_damek "现在……！快走！"

# game/script.rpy:96477
translate chinese map276_444339f7:

    # "In our haste, we still make sure to be as silent as possible.{w}\nThe Grand Library isn't too far away. In fact, I can see it now.{w}\nIt stands tall, and seems to be the one building that's not falling apart."
    "尽管行色匆忙，我们仍尽量不发出声响。{w}\n大图书馆离这里不远了。事实上，我现在已经能看见它了。{w}\n它高高矗立，似乎是唯一一座没有坍塌的建筑。"

# game/script.rpy:96493
translate chinese map277_572f640f:

    # "As soon as we arrive there, we all let out a big sigh of relief.{w}\nWe can still hear the fighting, but it's more distant than before.{w}\nThrough the screams, it's impossible to tell which side is winning."
    "一到那里，我们都长长地松了口气。{w}\n我们仍能听见战斗声，但比之前远了。{w}\n透过那些惨叫，根本听不出哪一方占着上风。"

# game/script.rpy:96518
translate chinese map277_29948659:

    # voice "se/pro16.ogg"
    voice "se/pro16.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:96520
translate chinese map277_6828f8c1:

    # char_pro "What's going on back there...?"
    char_pro "后面到底怎么回事……？"

# game/script.rpy:96545
translate chinese map277_3afc9761:

    # voice "se/z02436.ogg"
    voice "se/z02436.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:96547
translate chinese map277_df7c632c:

    # char_damek "I don't know. Let's just hope it's going well."
    char_damek "不知道。只能盼着一切顺利。"

# game/script.rpy:96572
translate chinese map277_096cf70a:

    # voice "se/pro17.ogg"
    # char_pro "Doesn't sound that way."
    voice "se/pro17.ogg"
    char_pro "听起来可不像。"

# game/script.rpy:96598
translate chinese map277_1aa7d835:

    # voice "se/z02438.ogg"
    # char_damek "For The Honor Guard, maybe.\nHurry up — we need to get inside."
    voice "se/z02438.ogg"
    char_damek "也许是对荣誉卫队而言吧。\n快点——我们得进去。"

# game/script.rpy:96626
translate chinese map277_4eff3a2c:

    # voice "se/pro18.ogg"
    voice "se/pro18.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:96628
translate chinese map277_1e0fca80:

    # char_pro "Shouldn't we wait for The Monarch Vessels?\nAt this rate, it might not be much longer."
    char_pro "我们不用等君主容器吗？\n照这情形，也许要不了多久了。"

# game/script.rpy:96633
translate chinese map277_b7c441c7:

    # voice "se/pro19.ogg"
    voice "se/pro19.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:96635
translate chinese map277_985a6ca7:

    # char_pro "Shouldn't we wait for The Seers?\nAt this rate, it might not be much longer."
    char_pro "我们不用等先知们吗？\n照这情形，也许要不了多久了。"

# game/script.rpy:96661
translate chinese map277_d166373d:

    # voice "se/z02441.ogg"
    voice "se/z02441.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:96663
translate chinese map277_55cc0202:

    # char_damek "No, they can meet us inside.\nWe can't risk running into more suits.\nThat was just one group. I'm sure there's more."
    char_damek "不，他们可以进去和我们会合。\n我们不能冒险再撞上更多盔甲。\n那只是一队而已。肯定还有更多。"

# game/script.rpy:96688
translate chinese map277_40bd8d10:

    # voice "se/pro20.ogg"
    # char_pro "Right."
    voice "se/pro20.ogg"
    char_pro "好吧。"

# game/script.rpy:96715
translate chinese map277_a6513ef4:

    # "They start to ascend the stairs, but Howl stops them."
    "他们开始登上台阶，但豪尔拦住了他们。"

# game/script.rpy:96740
translate chinese map277_49812f4b:

    # voice "se/z02443.ogg"
    voice "se/z02443.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:96742
translate chinese map277_89834144:

    # char_howl "Wait. The Library seems fine.\nWhy does it not decay like the rest?"
    char_howl "等等。图书馆看起来完好无损。\n为什么它不像其他地方那样腐朽？"

# game/script.rpy:96756
translate chinese map277_e87eabf6:

    # "Everybody turns to face him. But nobody knows.{w}\nDamek takes the stairs back down, and faces Howl."
    "所有人都转头看向他。但没人知道答案。{w}\n达梅克走回台阶下，面对着豪尔。"

# game/script.rpy:96781
translate chinese map277_5611e607:

    # voice "se/z02444.ogg"
    voice "se/z02444.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:96783
translate chinese map277_f04e47b3:

    # char_damek "I don't know — but I think this is a good sign.\nIt means we can control or limit what's happening.\nKnowing this, we might be able to fix Balteus."
    char_damek "我不知道——但我觉得这是个好兆头。\n这说明我们能够控制或限制正在发生的事。\n明白这一点，也许我们就能修复巴尔泰乌斯。"

# game/script.rpy:96808
translate chinese map277_d45298ab:

    # voice "se/z02445.ogg"
    # char_howl "Or perhaps it's a bad sign, Damek.\nMaybe our enemy has the power to harm Alestia itself.\nHow do you think we can stand up against such a foe?"
    voice "se/z02445.ogg"
    char_howl "又或者这是个坏兆头，达梅克。\n也许我们的敌人有能力伤害阿莱斯蒂亚本身。\n你觉得我们要怎么对抗这样的对手？"

# game/script.rpy:96823
translate chinese map277_4aa479c0:

    # "Everybody exchanges worried glances.{w}\nBut then, their eyes find their way to the blade on my back.{w}\nIt's apparent that conventional means wouldn't be enough to win."
    "大家忧心忡忡地交换着眼神。{w}\n但随后，他们的目光都落到了我背上的那把剑上。{w}\n显然，常规手段不足以取胜。"

# game/script.rpy:96828
translate chinese map277_e3d78765:

    # "Nobody knows how to answer Howl, and an awkward silence follows.{w}\nBut then we realize that it is, indeed, a silence. This is concerning.{w}\nThe earlier fight is over — but did The Monarch Vessels prevail?"
    "没人知道该如何回应豪尔，随之而来的是尴尬的沉默。{w}\n但接着我们意识到，那确实是一片沉寂。这令人不安。{w}\n先前的战斗结束了——可君主容器赢了吗？"

# game/script.rpy:96833
translate chinese map277_7f8c8eac:

    # "Nobody knows how to answer Howl, and an awkward silence follows.{w}\nBut then we realize that it is, indeed, a silence. This is concerning.{w}\nThe earlier fight is over — but did The Created Seers prevail?"
    "没人知道该如何回应豪尔，随之而来的是尴尬的沉默。{w}\n但接着我们意识到，那确实是一片沉寂。这令人不安。{w}\n先前的战斗结束了——可人造先知们赢了吗？"

# game/script.rpy:96859
translate chinese map277_8d1e501a:

    # voice "se/z02446.ogg"
    voice "se/z02446.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:96861
translate chinese map277_241ca79b:

    # char_damek "Hey, uh, let's get inside, alright?\nMaybe the Librarian knows more about this.\nWe shouldn't stand around in the open out here."
    char_damek "嘿，呃，我们进去吧，好吗？\n也许图书管理员知道得更多。\n我们不该这样站在外面空地上。"

# game/script.rpy:96890
translate chinese map277_f7ac123f:

    # "Having successfully changed the subject, we start heading inside.{w}\nHowl made a good point, but none of us were able to counter it.{w}\nI doubt that the Librarian would want to talk to invaders like us."
    "成功转移了话题后，我们开始往里走。{w}\n豪尔说得有道理，但我们谁都没能反驳他。{w}\n我怀疑图书管理员不会愿意跟我们这样的入侵者说话。"

# game/script.rpy:96892
translate chinese map277_895704ba:

    # "It makes me worry about how we might get them to talk.{w}\nThere was so much uncertainty and worry in the air right now.{w}\nAs we enter the Library, I hope that our forces lived through their fight."
    "这让我担心要怎样才能让他们开口。{w}\n此刻空气中弥漫着太多的不确定与忧虑。{w}\n走进图书馆时，我祈祷我们的部队能活过那场战斗。"

# game/script.rpy:96911
translate chinese map278_b6e8073b:

    # "When we enter the Library, I'm taken aback by what I see.{w}\nDust fills the air, and it seems like this place has seen better days.{w}\nThe only sign that somebody has been here, is that the books remain clean."
    "走进图书馆时，眼前的景象让我吃了一惊。{w}\n空气里满是灰尘，这地方看来曾经辉煌过。{w}\n唯一能证明有人来过的迹象，就是那些书依旧一尘不染。"

# game/script.rpy:96913
translate chinese map278_c2be0aae:

    # "Whoever has been taking care of this place only cares about the literature.{w}\nI guess that's acceptable, since that would be the main job of a Librarian.{w}\nBut it just seems odd. All the time in the world, and it's still quite dirty."
    "打理这里的人只在乎那些书籍。{w}\n我想这也能理解，毕竟那本该是图书管理员的主要职责。{w}\n但总觉得有些奇怪。有的是时间，这里却还是这么脏。"

# game/script.rpy:96915
translate chinese map278_c01044b1:

    # "There's some kind of weird apparatus in the back of the Library.{w}\nI've never seen anything like it before. It's almost awe-inspiring.{w}\nMy comrades all look around, sharing that same look of awe."
    "图书馆深处有个奇怪的装置。{w}\n我从没见过那样的东西。简直令人惊叹。{w}\n我的同伴们四下张望，都带着同样的敬畏神情。"

# game/script.rpy:96940
translate chinese map278_c9d24694:

    # voice "se/z02447.ogg"
    voice "se/z02447.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:96942
translate chinese map278_e444ecd3:

    # char_fortaime "This is amazing...!"
    char_fortaime "太惊人了……！"

# game/script.rpy:96967
translate chinese map278_386284b1:

    # voice "se/z02448.ogg"
    voice "se/z02448.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:96969
translate chinese map278_6476a103:

    # char_damek "I've never seen so many books in one place before.\nI wonder what they're all about. Should we take a look?"
    char_damek "我从没见过一个地方有这么多书。\n不知道它们都讲些什么。我们要不要看看？"

# game/script.rpy:96994
translate chinese map278_9f04548f:

    # voice "se/z02449.ogg"
    # char_valessa "Maybe not. We're here for a reason, remember?\nLet's find the owner, and see what they can tell us."
    voice "se/z02449.ogg"
    char_valessa "还是别了。我们来这儿是有目的的，还记得吗？\n先找到这里的主人，看看他能告诉我们什么。"

# game/script.rpy:97021
translate chinese map278_ae03f524:

    # "Howl steps forward, objecting before anyone else can speak."
    "豪尔上前一步，抢在其他人开口前提出异议。"

# game/script.rpy:97046
translate chinese map278_4bab937a:

    # voice "se/z02450.ogg"
    voice "se/z02450.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:97048
translate chinese map278_3186f6cf:

    # char_howl "Actually, there's a chance that the books could tell us even more.\nThe Triumvirate must keep them away from the mainland for a reason."
    char_howl "其实，这些书说不定能告诉我们更多。\n三人执政团把它们隔绝于大陆之外，一定有原因。"

# game/script.rpy:97073
translate chinese map278_f2857013:

    # voice "se/z02451.ogg"
    voice "se/z02451.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:97075
translate chinese map278_a5d72242:

    # char_fortaime "What do you mean...?"
    char_fortaime "你是什么意思……？"

# game/script.rpy:97100
translate chinese map278_179a70b6:

    # voice "se/z02452.ogg"
    # char_howl "The Monarchy vanished in the blink of an eye. This, we know for sure.\nPeople can be erased — but not culture. Signs of our time here would've remained."
    voice "se/z02452.ogg"
    char_howl "王朝在眨眼间就消失了。这一点我们确信无疑。\n人可以抹去——但文化不能。我们那个时代的痕迹本该留存下来。"

# game/script.rpy:97126
translate chinese map278_91319346:

    # voice "se/z02453.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "So you're saying—"
    voice "se/z02453.ogg"
    char_fortaime "所以你是说——"

# game/script.rpy:97153
translate chinese map278_a3909716:

    # "Before he can continue, we hear a noise come from down the hall.{w}\nWe know The Honor Guard can't enter — so it must be the proprieter.{w}\nKnowing that we need to take them hostage, we assume hostile stances."
    "没等他说完，走廊那头传来一阵响动。{w}\n我们知道荣誉卫队进不来——所以那一定是这里的主人。{w}\n想到需要把他挟持为人质，我们摆出了敌对的架势。"

# game/script.rpy:97178
translate chinese map278_08c6527c:

    # voice "se/z02454.ogg"
    voice "se/z02454.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:97184
translate chinese map278_35be1b8b:

    # char_jit_map278_1_0_126 "Looking into the past is one of the best ways to learn.\nIf we don't become better people, then we'll repeat the same mistakes.\nHow fitting then, that The Old Monarchy would focus only on the future."
    char_jit_map278_1_0_126 "审视过去是最好的学习方式之一。\n如果我们不成为更好的人，就会重蹈覆辙。\n所以旧王室只盯着未来，还真是讽刺。"

# game/script.rpy:97198
translate chinese map278_c977909e:

    # "We all exchange glances, slightly confused."
    "我们面面相觑，有些困惑。"

# game/script.rpy:97223
translate chinese map278_9f6887b0:

    # voice "se/z02455.ogg"
    # char_jit_map278_1_0_126 "They wanted to guide themselves to the “perfect future”.\nIf it was possible to get there, then no cost would be too high.\nIn the name of a better world, they embraced corruption."
    voice "se/z02455.ogg"
    char_jit_map278_1_0_126 "他们想引导自己走向“完美的未来”。\n如果能抵达那里，任何代价都不算高。\n以更美好世界的名义，他们拥抱了腐败。"

# game/script.rpy:97238
translate chinese map278_c782f535:

    # "After a few steps forward, the mysterious man comes into view."
    "又走了几步，那个神秘的男人出现在视野中。"

# game/script.rpy:97263
translate chinese map278_677deaef:

    # voice "se/z02456.ogg"
    # char_jit_map278_1_0_126 "Too often do we condemn others in our self-serving journeys.\nA bright future for The Monarchy would've meant death for other innocent worlds.\nThe Triumvirate chose to step in, as they have countless times before, to maintain balance."
    voice "se/z02456.ogg"
    char_jit_map278_1_0_126 "在我们自私的旅途中，我们太常谴责他人。\n王朝光明的未来，意味着其他无辜世界的灭亡。\n三人执政团选择介入，正如他们此前无数次所做的那样，以维持平衡。"

# game/script.rpy:97278
translate chinese map278_42269f4d:

    # "Damek interjects, with a look on his face that I can only describe as the onset of anger."
    "达梅克插话，脸上的神情我只能形容为怒火初起。"

# game/script.rpy:97303
translate chinese map278_14735314:

    # voice "se/z02457.ogg"
    voice "se/z02457.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:97305
translate chinese map278_8b2b3dcc:

    # char_damek "We know what The Triumvirate did to The Monarchy. Howl told us.\nBut like you said — mistakes are how we learn, and grow. It's how we become {i}better{/i}.\nIf the option of failure is taken away from us, we can no longer call ourselves people."
    char_damek "我们知道三人执政团对王朝做了什么。豪尔告诉过我们。\n但就像你说的——错误是我们学习和成长的方式。是我们变得{i}更好{/i}的方式。\n如果失败的可能性被夺走，我们就再也不能称自己为人了。"

# game/script.rpy:97318
translate chinese map278_93f1ccd0:

    # voice "se/z02458.ogg"
    # char_damek "They can hide behind whatever reason they want — but they're wrong to control us.\nThe ability to make these mistakes is our {i}right{/i}, and I will not stand by while it is taken away.\nCorruption? Death? Nobody wants these, but without them, we might as well not exist at all!"
    voice "se/z02458.ogg"
    char_damek "他们可以躲在任何理由背后——但他们控制我们是错的。\n犯下这些错误的能力是我们的{i}权利{/i}，我不会袖手旁观，任由它被夺走。\n腐败？死亡？没人想要这些，但没有它们，我们干脆就不该存在！"

# game/script.rpy:97333
translate chinese map278_17d186d6:

    # "Everybody nods and cheers Damek on.{w}\nThe mystery man shrugs, and keeps walking forward."
    "众人点头，为达梅克喝彩。{w}\n神秘男子耸耸肩，继续向前走。"

# game/script.rpy:97358
translate chinese map278_7517a3a0:

    # voice "se/z02459.ogg"
    # char_damek "Restrain this man."
    voice "se/z02459.ogg"
    char_damek "制住这个人。"

# game/script.rpy:97373
translate chinese map278_237c76fc:

    # "I expect to see the man put up a fight, but he doesn't."
    "我以为这人会反抗，但他没有。"

# game/script.rpy:97398
translate chinese map278_829fc957:

    # voice "se/z02460.ogg"
    # char_jit_map278_1_0_126 "You will experience no resistance from me.\nBut on the other hand, you'll find no help, either.\nDo what you must, but keep the Library intact."
    voice "se/z02460.ogg"
    char_jit_map278_1_0_126 "我不会给你们制造任何阻力。\n但另一方面，你们也得不到任何帮助。\n你们该做什么就做什么，但别弄坏了图书馆。"

# game/script.rpy:97425
translate chinese map278_44a487ca:

    # "He gets on his knees, and holds out his wrists.{w}\nHowl makes quick work of restraining him."
    "他跪了下来，伸出双手。{w}\n豪尔麻利地把他捆了起来。"

# game/script.rpy:97450
translate chinese map278_b943452a:

    # voice "se/z02461.ogg"
    voice "se/z02461.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:97452
translate chinese map278_cad6c8d4:

    # char_howl "Who {i}are{/i} you...?\nYou know far more than most."
    char_howl "你到底是{i}谁{/i}……？\n你知道的远比大多数人多。"

# game/script.rpy:97466
translate chinese map278_f44a4ac1:

    # "The man shakes his head."
    "那人摇了摇头。"

# game/script.rpy:97491
translate chinese map278_c36fd4e5:

    # voice "se/z02462.ogg"
    voice "se/z02462.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:97493
translate chinese map278_a446ce99:

    # char_jit_map278_1_0_126 "Just a hoarder of knowledge.\nA man who preserves the past, rather than erasing it.\nIn exchange, The Triumvirate gives me life, and shelter."
    char_jit_map278_1_0_126 "不过是个囤积知识的人。\n一个保存过去、而非抹去过去的人。\n作为交换，三人执政团给了我生命和庇护。"

# game/script.rpy:97518
translate chinese map278_41d1b464:

    # voice "se/z02463.ogg"
    # char_howl "Another one of their victims, you mean.\nEternal life in exchange for servitude. Despicable.\nWhat atrocities did you commit in their name?"
    voice "se/z02463.ogg"
    char_howl "你是说，又一个他们的受害者。\n以奴役换取永生。可鄙。\n你曾以他们的名义犯下过什么暴行？"

# game/script.rpy:97544
translate chinese map278_084d39a9:

    # voice "se/z02464.ogg"
    # char_jit_map278_1_0_126 "I created this Library. A glimpse into the past.\nEverything The Monarchy ever wrote, is on these shelves.\nThat was my job. Preserve the old history, while creating a new one."
    voice "se/z02464.ogg"
    char_jit_map278_1_0_126 "我创建了这座图书馆。一个窥视过去的窗口。\n王朝写过的一切，都在这书架之上。\n那就是我的职责。在创造新历史的同时，保存旧历史。"

# game/script.rpy:97570
translate chinese map278_eadb1b17:

    # voice "se/z02465.ogg"
    # char_howl "And what new history did you create?"
    voice "se/z02465.ogg"
    char_howl "那你创造了什么新历史？"

# game/script.rpy:97596
translate chinese map278_01ceb20f:

    # voice "se/z02466.ogg"
    # char_jit_map278_1_0_126 "I wrote about The Triumvirate, and spread it everywhere.\nI made them seem like Gods. Like they were the creators of this world.\nAs new life began on Alestia, they found my writing, and believed every word."
    voice "se/z02466.ogg"
    char_jit_map278_1_0_126 "我写下关于三人执政团的文字，并四处传播。\n我让他们看起来像神。仿佛他们是这个世界的创造者。\n当新的生命在阿莱斯蒂亚诞生时，他们发现了我的文字，对每一个字都深信不疑。"

# game/script.rpy:97623
translate chinese map278_3ac888db:

    # "Howl scoffs, as anger boils within him.{w}\nBut before he can do anything, Pro interrupts."
    "豪尔嗤笑一声，怒火在胸中翻涌。{w}\n但他还没来得及做什么，普洛就打断了他。"

# game/script.rpy:97648
translate chinese map278_4930fd7f:

    # voice "se/pro21.ogg"
    voice "se/pro21.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:97650
translate chinese map278_5ddfaf96:

    # char_pro "Algus Veilleur..."
    char_pro "阿尔古斯·维勒尔……"

# game/script.rpy:97664
translate chinese map278_7da3d293:

    # "The man's ears perk up, in a way that reveals he was reacting to his name."
    "那人竖起了耳朵，那反应说明他是在对自己的名字有所触动。"

# game/script.rpy:97692
translate chinese map278_a49e5787:

    # voice "se/z02468.ogg"
    voice "se/z02468.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:97695
translate chinese map278_eb606ce7:

    # char_jit_map278_1_0_126 "That is the moniker I assumed, yes.\nI'm happy to know that the name is still remembered."
    char_jit_map278_1_0_126 "那正是我用的名号，没错。\n我很高兴这个名字仍被人记得。"

# game/script.rpy:97712
translate chinese map278_c9abf2b8:

    # "Algus Veilleur...{w}\nThe man revered as the greatest historian.{w}\nI can't believe that he too, was a tool of The Triumvirate."
    "阿尔古斯·维勒尔……{w}\n那个被尊为史上最伟大的历史学家的人。{w}\n我简直不敢相信，他也是三人执政团的工具。"

# game/script.rpy:97717
translate chinese map278_c17416c7:

    # "I'm a bit confused, since I'm unfamiliar with the name.{w}\nBut Valinorth was very independent, so I'm not surprised.{w}\nEverybody seems a bit shocked at learning his true name."
    "我有些困惑，因为我对这个名字很陌生。{w}\n但瓦利诺斯一向很独立，所以我并不意外。{w}\n得知他的真名，大家似乎都有些震惊。"

# game/script.rpy:97733
translate chinese map278_0d6cee00:

    # voice "se/pro22.ogg"
    voice "se/pro22.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:97735
translate chinese map278_a7d4ea2d:

    # char_pro "So everything the people believe is a lie that you created?\nWhy would you need to go to such extremes...? This is insane."
    char_pro "所以人民所信奉的一切，都是你编造的谎言？\n你何必做到这种地步……？这太疯狂了。"

# game/script.rpy:97760
translate chinese map278_9380c195:

    # voice "se/z02470.ogg"
    # char_jit_map278_1_0_126 "Look at how you and your friends reacted to learning the truth.\nIt brought you here, prepared to kill those who gave you life.\nThe people must never know the true cost of their creation."
    voice "se/z02470.ogg"
    char_jit_map278_1_0_126 "看看你和你朋友得知真相后的反应吧。\n它把你们引到了这里，准备好去杀死那些赋予你们生命的人。\n人民绝不能知道他们被创造出来的真正代价。"

# game/script.rpy:97786
translate chinese map278_6964bea1:

    # voice "se/pro23.ogg"
    # char_pro "I don't believe this.\nHowl, get him out of our sight."
    voice "se/pro23.ogg"
    char_pro "我不信。\n豪尔，把他带下去，别让他出现在我们眼前。"

# game/script.rpy:97813
translate chinese map278_c0ec8536:

    # "Howl drags Algus away, as the rest of us group together."
    "豪尔把阿尔古斯拖走，我们其余人则聚到一起。"

# game/script.rpy:97838
translate chinese map278_d0e3b936:

    # voice "se/z02472.ogg"
    voice "se/z02472.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:97840
translate chinese map278_6b864313:

    # char_damek "Well, at least he didn't put up much of a fight.\nI'd like to say that I'm shocked — but I don't feel surprised at all.\nThis journey has been full of revelations. This is just another for the pile."
    char_damek "至少他没怎么抵抗。\n我真想说我很震惊——可我一点都不觉得意外。\n这趟旅程充满了真相。这不过是又一个而已。"

# game/script.rpy:97843
translate chinese map278_bac44560:

    # voice "se/z02473.ogg"
    # char_damek "It doesn't really change much at all. We still have a plan.\nBut it'd be stupid to attack the enemy in the middle of the night.\nLet's rest until the break of dawn, and meet in front of the Library."
    voice "se/z02473.ogg"
    char_damek "这其实改变不了什么。我们仍然有计划。\n但半夜去袭击敌人是愚蠢的。\n我们休息到破晓，然后在图书馆前会合。"

# game/script.rpy:97857
translate chinese map278_17be434a:

    # voice "se/z02474.ogg"
    # char_damek "Remember that we're safe as long as we stay in here.\nHopefully the rest of our forces aren't too far behind.\nYou're all dismissed. See you in the morning, okay?"
    voice "se/z02474.ogg"
    char_damek "记住，只要待在这里面，我们就是安全的。\n希望我们其余的部队也别落后太多。\n解散吧。早上见，好吗？"

# game/script.rpy:97883
translate chinese map278_2d2b6ffa:

    # voice "se/z02475.ogg"
    voice "se/z02475.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:97885
translate chinese map278_9ffaff2b:

    # char_fortaime "Where are we supposed to rest...?"
    char_fortaime "我们该在哪儿休息……？"

# game/script.rpy:97910
translate chinese map278_6af15f9b:

    # voice "se/z02476.ogg"
    # char_damek "I'm sure there's Private Quarters around here somewhere.\nAnd if you can't sleep, at least there's a lot of books to read.\nAfter the war, we should give this knowledge back to the people."
    voice "se/z02476.ogg"
    char_damek "这附近肯定有私人寝室。\n就算睡不着，至少还有那么多书可读。\n战争结束后，我们应该把这些知识还给人民。"

# game/script.rpy:97936
translate chinese map278_e0572953:

    # voice "se/z02477.ogg"
    # char_valessa "Yeah, I agree. The Triumvirate can't hide this stuff forever.\nWe finally have proof that nobody can deny. This is amazing.\nIf we show them this, they'll accept our rule without question."
    voice "se/z02477.ogg"
    char_valessa "是啊，我同意。三人执政团不可能永远藏住这些东西。\n我们终于有了无人能否认的证据。太棒了。\n只要给他们看这个，他们就会毫无异议地接受我们的统治。"

# game/script.rpy:97951
translate chinese map278_e8b7e608:

    # "Damek smiles, his spirits seemingly lifted."
    "达梅克笑了，精神似乎振作了起来。"

# game/script.rpy:97976
translate chinese map278_e7c7b812:

    # voice "se/z02478.ogg"
    # char_damek "Yeah. Let's hope you're right.\nHave a good night. All of you."
    voice "se/z02478.ogg"
    char_damek "是啊。但愿你说得对。\n晚安。你们所有人。"

# game/script.rpy:98006
translate chinese map278_e2445fd1:

    # "With that, we're all left on our own.{w}\nPeople scatter about, reading books and exploring the Library.{w}\nI decide to look for a private room, so I can relax and gather my bearings."
    "说完这些，我们就各自散了。{w}\n人们四处散开，读书、探索图书馆。{w}\n我决定去找间私人房间，好放松下来，理清思路。"

# game/script.rpy:98036
translate chinese map279_b0ffce49:

    # "Halin returns to the chambers of The Triumvirate.{w}\nNoticing the absence of Shane, they're a bit confused.{w}\nThey don't assume the worst, and ask Halin to brief them."
    "哈林回到三人执政团的议事厅。{w}\n发现肖恩不在，他们有些困惑。{w}\n他们没有往最坏处想，而是让哈林向他们汇报。"

# game/script.rpy:98061
translate chinese map279_e1f20b85:

    # voice "se/z02479.ogg"
    voice "se/z02479.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:98063
translate chinese map279_02270179:

    # char_halin "Shane stayed behind to lead the naval attack.\nHe plans to trim their forces as much as possible.\nLike you anticipated — they're arriving by sea."
    char_halin "肖恩留下来指挥海上进攻。\n他打算尽可能地削减他们的兵力。\n正如你所预料的——他们是从海路来的。"

# game/script.rpy:98088
translate chinese map279_a4a629fb:

    # voice "se/z02480.ogg"
    voice "se/z02480.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:98090
translate chinese map279_6567fbcf:

    # char_the_triumvirate "Good. Then things are going according to plan.\nWe'll have you wait in the atrium for their arrival.\nThis means that you'll be our last line of defense."
    char_the_triumvirate "很好。那么一切正按计划进行。\n我们会让你在中庭等候他们的到来。\n也就是说，你将是我们的最后一道防线。"

# game/script.rpy:98115
translate chinese map279_dd5d1fc2:

    # voice "se/z02481.ogg"
    # char_halin "I consider it an honor.\nBut I have to say — I'm worried for Shane.\nHis chances of survival are pretty slim out there."
    voice "se/z02481.ogg"
    char_halin "我视此为荣耀。\n但我得说——我很担心肖恩。\n他在外面的生还几率相当渺茫。"

# game/script.rpy:98141
translate chinese map279_5a1fe09a:

    # voice "se/z02482.ogg"
    # char_the_triumvirate "He knew what he was signing up for.\nIf he killed even one of the rebels, then he was successful.\nFocus on protecting this castle, Halin. That's more important."
    voice "se/z02482.ogg"
    char_the_triumvirate "他很清楚自己承担的是什么。\n哪怕他只杀了一个反抗军，那就算成功了。\n专心守住这座城堡，哈林。那才更重要。"

# game/script.rpy:98167
translate chinese map279_bf1f1217:

    # voice "se/z02483.ogg"
    # char_halin "Yes, of course.\nI'll make sure no one passes the atrium.\nIf they try, they'll fall as quickly as they enter."
    voice "se/z02483.ogg"
    char_halin "是，当然。\n我保证没人能通过中庭。\n他们若敢尝试，一进来就会倒下。"

# game/script.rpy:98193
translate chinese map279_d166d7dc:

    # voice "se/z02484.ogg"
    # char_the_triumvirate "Thank you, Halin.\nIt's important that they have a false sense of security.\nDon't give them too much resistance until it's absolutely necessary."
    voice "se/z02484.ogg"
    char_the_triumvirate "谢谢你，哈林。\n重要的是让他们产生虚假的安全感。\n在绝对必要之前，不要给他们太多阻力。"

# game/script.rpy:98197
translate chinese map279_1646b185:

    # voice "se/z02485.ogg"
    # char_the_triumvirate "If they think they're going to win, they're more prone to slipping up.\nIt's up to you to figure out when that moment is, and take advantage of it.\nEven if it takes your life, you are to prevent them from entering our chambers."
    voice "se/z02485.ogg"
    char_the_triumvirate "如果他们以为自己会赢，就更容易露出破绽。\n什么时候是那个时机，要由你来判断并加以利用。\n哪怕要付出你的性命，你也必须阻止他们进入我们的议事厅。"

# game/script.rpy:98212
translate chinese map279_3abdf38c:

    # "Halin kneels, complying without hesitation."
    "哈林跪下，毫不犹豫地服从了。"

# game/script.rpy:98237
translate chinese map279_e99c4841:

    # voice "se/z02486.ogg"
    # char_halin "Yes, of course. My life for The Triumvirate.\nI'll fortify straight away, and wait for their arrival."
    voice "se/z02486.ogg"
    char_halin "是，当然。我的命属于三人执政团。\n我这就去加固防备，等候他们的到来。"

# game/script.rpy:98259
translate chinese map279_bdddf932:

    # "Halin strides out of their chambers, with a sense of purpose.{w}\nAfter he leaves, they turn to each other, displaying soft smiles."
    "哈林带着一股决然之意，大步走出议事厅。{w}\n他离开后，他们转向彼此，露出淡淡的微笑。"

# game/script.rpy:98284
translate chinese map279_1ee8786b:

    # voice "se/z02487.ogg"
    # char_the_triumvirate "Hopefully this time, things will be different."
    voice "se/z02487.ogg"
    char_the_triumvirate "但愿这一次，事情会有所不同。"

# game/script.rpy:98332
translate chinese map280_06f00278:

    # "After finding a private room, I pace around it in circles.{w}\nI've had nothing but bad luck when it came to getting rest.{w}\nEver since we left Mazeo, I've been too worried to fall asleep."
    "找到一间私人房间后，我在里面来回踱步。{w}\n说到休息，我最近就没走过好运。{w}\n自从离开马泽奥以来，我一直忧心忡忡，无法入睡。"

# game/script.rpy:98334
translate chinese map280_86a76914:

    # "I try reading books, but none of them are able to capture my interest.{w}\nPacing the room, I basically succumb to the anxiety assaulting my mind.{w}\nHowever — and thankfully — a knock at my door soon returns me to lucidity."
    "我试着读书，但没有一本能引起我的兴趣。{w}\n在房间里踱着步，我几乎被侵袭心头的焦虑压垮。{w}\n然而——幸好——一阵敲门声很快让我回过神来。"

# game/script.rpy:98339
translate chinese map280_c50b3753:

    # "As soon as I open it, Howl enters.{w}\nHe takes a deep breath, sounding both annoyed and relieved.{w}\nI don't blame him, he's gone through so much in such a short time."
    "我一开门，豪尔就走了进来。{w}\n他深吸一口气，听起来既烦恼又宽慰。{w}\n我不怪他，这么短的时间里他经历了太多。"

# game/script.rpy:98364
translate chinese map280_0494350f:

    # voice "se/z02488.ogg"
    voice "se/z02488.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:98366
translate chinese map280_d91e4bb2:

    # char_howl "We finally put the Librarian to rest.\nAlgus, right? He certainly likes to talk a lot.\nAnswers in the form of riddles. He simply stalls for time."
    char_howl "我们终于把那个图书管理员安置好了。\n阿尔古斯，对吧？他确实话很多。\n答案都是谜语。他只是在拖延时间。"

# game/script.rpy:98369
translate chinese map280_bef2e4de:

    # voice "se/z02488b.ogg"
    # char_howl "It is rather peculiar however, that he didn't resist.\nHe won't help us kill The Triumvirate, but he won't stop us, either.\nAs we locked him up, he mentioned his true allegiance was to history."
    voice "se/z02488b.ogg"
    char_howl "不过，奇怪的是他没有抵抗。\n他不会帮我们杀三人执政团，但也不会阻止我们。\n我们把他关起来时，他说自己真正的效忠对象是历史。"

# game/script.rpy:98383
translate chinese map280_df0052df:

    # voice "se/z02489.ogg"
    # char_howl "Whether we win or lose, it will still be his job to write about the aftermath.\nSo no matter what happens, there will be a new history to record.\nAn interesting habit. Living through others, rather than yourself."
    voice "se/z02489.ogg"
    char_howl "无论我们输赢，书写余波仍然是他的职责。\n所以不管发生什么，都会有一段新的历史需要记载。\n有趣的癖好。活在他人之中，而非自己之中。"

# game/script.rpy:98398
translate chinese map280_35c94b01:

    # "He looks around the room, a hint of sadness on his face."
    "他环顾房间，脸上带着一丝悲伤。"

# game/script.rpy:98423
translate chinese map280_615c3133:

    # voice "se/z02490.ogg"
    # char_howl "There must not be much else to do, in such a lonely place.\nWe feel sorry for him, but there is really nothing we can do.\nHe gave us shelter, in exchange for silence."
    voice "se/z02490.ogg"
    char_howl "在这样寂寞的地方，想必也没什么别的事可做。\n我们为他感到难过，但实在无能为力。\n他给了我们栖身之所，换取我们的沉默。"

# game/script.rpy:98438
translate chinese map280_27fcb752:

    # "I ask Howl how we know if we can trust him or not."
    "我问豪尔，我们怎么知道能不能信任他。"

# game/script.rpy:98463
translate chinese map280_39290aea:

    # voice "se/z02491.ogg"
    # char_howl "We don't, but it does not matter.\nHe is locked up, and unable to contact anybody outside.\nAny chance he had to intervene has already passed on."
    voice "se/z02491.ogg"
    char_howl "我们不知道，但这无关紧要。\n他被关起来了，无法与外界任何人联络。\n他任何介入的机会都已经过去了。"

# game/script.rpy:98467
translate chinese map280_234f0bb6:

    # voice "se/z02492.ogg"
    # char_howl "Our foothold is established.\nWe've successfully taken Baltean soil, [firstname].\nWhile not our main goal, this is a major victory for all of us."
    voice "se/z02492.ogg"
    char_howl "我们的据点已经建立。\n我们成功踏上了巴尔泰的土地，[firstname]。\n虽然这不是我们的主要目标，但这对我们所有人来说都是一场重大的胜利。"

# game/script.rpy:98482
translate chinese map280_284de01f:

    # "I nod. He's right — nobody else in history has gotten this far.{w}\nWe stood a real chance at winning here, and it felt amazing.{w}\nI thank him for the status report, and for checking up on me."
    "我点头。他说得对——历史上从没有别人走到这一步。{w}\n我们真的有获胜的机会，那感觉太棒了。{w}\n我感谢他的情况汇报，也感谢他来看望我。"

# game/script.rpy:98507
translate chinese map280_43a8a976:

    # voice "se/z02493.ogg"
    # char_howl "Of course. We wanted to make sure you were comfortable.\nWe can imagine that rest is hard to find under these circumstances.\nMight we suggest spending some time with your friends before the dawn?"
    voice "se/z02493.ogg"
    char_howl "当然。我们想确认你一切安好。\n在这种情形下，想必很难得到休息。\n是否建议你在黎明前和朋友们待一会儿？"

# game/script.rpy:98513
translate chinese map280_3c7aa786:

    # "As soon as I open it, Damek enters.{w}\nHe takes a deep breath, sounding both annoyed and relieved.{w}\nI don't blame him, he's gone through so much in such a short time."
    "我一开门，达梅克就走了进来。{w}\n他深吸一口气，听起来既烦恼又宽慰。{w}\n我不怪他，这么短的时间里他经历了太多。"

# game/script.rpy:98538
translate chinese map280_0183f39e:

    # voice "se/z02494.ogg"
    voice "se/z02494.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:98540
translate chinese map280_5edd5138:

    # char_damek "We finally put the Librarian to rest.\nHe sure likes to talk a lot — and about nothing at all.\nLots of answers in the form of riddles. Boring stuff."
    char_damek "我们终于把那个图书管理员安置好了。\n他确实很爱说话——而且尽说些没用的。\n很多答案都是谜语。无聊得很。"

# game/script.rpy:98553
translate chinese map280_eb402681:

    # voice "se/z02495.ogg"
    # char_damek "It's pretty interesting that he didn't resist, though.\nHe said he won't help us, but he won't stop us either.\nHis true allegiance is to history. That's what he kept saying."
    voice "se/z02495.ogg"
    char_damek "不过，他没抵抗倒是挺有意思的。\n他说不会帮我们，但也不会阻止我们。\n他真正的效忠对象是历史。他一直这么说。"

# game/script.rpy:98557
translate chinese map280_f1249794:

    # voice "se/z02496.ogg"
    # char_damek "Doesn't make much sense, since he faked so much history in the past.\nBut no matter what happens next, he'll have a lot to write about.\nIf we win, he'll record it. If we lose, then he'll record that too."
    voice "se/z02496.ogg"
    char_damek "这说不太通，毕竟他过去伪造了那么多历史。\n但无论接下来发生什么，他都有很多可写。\n我们赢了，他会记下来。我们输了，他也会记下来。"

# game/script.rpy:98572
translate chinese map280_33792f3d:

    # "I guess his stance makes more sense if you look at it that way.{w}\nNo matter what happens next, somebody would need to write about it."
    "这么一想，他的立场倒更说得通了。{w}\n无论接下来发生什么，总得有人把它写下来。"

# game/script.rpy:98597
translate chinese map280_996a5ce4:

    # voice "se/z02497.ogg"
    # char_damek "His main condition was that we don't harm the Library.\nPretty good terms, especially in exchange for a foothold.\nWe may not have won yet, but we've seized Baltean soil."
    voice "se/z02497.ogg"
    char_damek "他的主要条件是我们不破坏图书馆。\n条件相当不错，尤其是用在一个据点上。\n我们也许还没赢，但我们已经夺取了巴尔泰的土地。"

# game/script.rpy:98612
translate chinese map280_70ef74cd:

    # "That's true. Nobody else has ever gotten this far.{w}\nI can tell that we stand a chance at winning, and it feels amazing.{w}\nBut I have to ask, how do we know that this Algus can be trusted?"
    "没错。从没有别人走到这一步。{w}\n我能感觉到我们有机会赢，那感觉太棒了。{w}\n但我不得不问，我们怎么知道这个阿尔古斯可以信任？"

# game/script.rpy:98637
translate chinese map280_41c6c533:

    # voice "se/z02498.ogg"
    # char_damek "We don't. But he can't do much if he's locked up.\nAny chance he had at intervening is long gone, by now.\nHe can try when we leave, but we'll be prepared to fight by then."
    voice "se/z02498.ogg"
    char_damek "我们不知道。但他被关着，也做不了什么。\n他任何介入的机会现在早就没了。\n我们离开时他大可以试试，但到那时我们已经做好战斗准备了。"

# game/script.rpy:98652
translate chinese map280_3268e628:

    # "I nod, thanking Damek for the update on what's going on."
    "我点头，感谢达梅克告知近况。"

# game/script.rpy:98677
translate chinese map280_7b96a637:

    # voice "se/z02499.ogg"
    # char_damek "Of course. I just wanted to make sure you were alright.\nIt must be hard to sleep right now, given all the weight on your shoulders.\nThe others aren't sleeping either. Maybe you should spend some time with them?"
    voice "se/z02499.ogg"
    char_damek "当然。我只是想确认你没事。\n如今你肩上担子这么重，肯定很难入睡。\n其他人也都没睡。也许你该去陪陪他们？"

# game/script.rpy:98699
translate chinese map280_72457d4d:

    # "He's right. If I can't sleep, then that's probably the next best idea.{w}\nBut I wonder if our bonds are strong enough to warrant some time together.{w}\nThis could be our last night alive, after all. They might be more protective of their time."
    "他说得对。既然睡不着，那大概就是下一个最好的选择。{w}\n但我不知道我们的情谊是否深厚到值得共度时光。{w}\n毕竟，这可能是我们活着的最后一晚。他们也许更珍惜自己的时间。"

# game/script.rpy:98701
translate chinese map280_9b177d6d:

    # "I guess there was no harm in checking. I see him out of my room, with a new goal in mind.{w}\nTurning back to face the vast emptiness of this private room, I wonder who I could invite over.{w}\nThis would be a good night to make some final memories. Just in case the worst came to pass."
    "去问问也无妨。我送他出了房间，心里有了新的打算。{w}\n回过头，面对这间空荡荡的私人房间，我琢磨着能邀请谁过来。{w}\n今晚是个留下最后回忆的好机会。以防最坏的情况发生。"

# game/script.rpy:98707
translate chinese map280_ef254c8a:

    # "[[You can spend final one-on-one time with every {i}loyal{/i} comrade.]\n[[Click the arrow in the top-right corner when you're ready to proceed with the story.]\n[[Note that doing so will begin the final battle, and lead to the ending of the game.]"
    "[[你可以与每一位{i}忠诚{/i}的同伴共度最后的独处时光。]]\n[[准备好推进剧情时，点击右上角的箭头。]]\n[[请注意，这样做将开始最终决战，并导向游戏的结局。]]"

# game/script.rpy:98949
translate chinese click_map281_4_EV004_3e723383:

    # "You've already spent time with Valessa."
    "你已经和瓦莱莎共处过了。"

# game/script.rpy:98979
translate chinese click_map281_7_EV007_03272f4e:

    # "You've already spent time with Fortaime."
    "你已经和福泰姆共处过了。"

# game/script.rpy:99009
translate chinese click_map281_8_EV008_2c9e3885:

    # "You've already spent time with Pro."
    "你已经和普洛共处过了。"

# game/script.rpy:99039
translate chinese click_map281_10_EV010_5ef5ad8b:

    # "You've already spent time with Ulric."
    "你已经和乌尔里克共处过了。"

# game/script.rpy:99069
translate chinese click_map281_12_EV012_385fa56f:

    # "You've already spent time with Damek."
    "你已经和达梅克共处过了。"

# game/script.rpy:99099
translate chinese click_map281_14_EV014_f7edf9ae:

    # "You've already spent time with Howl."
    "你已经和豪尔共处过了。"

# game/script.rpy:99129
translate chinese click_map281_16_EV016_5f529c6c:

    # "You've already spent time with Sovy."
    "你已经和索维共处过了。"

# game/script.rpy:99177
translate chinese map291_455f73a8:

    # "I descend the stairs of The Grand Library, the crisp Baltean air assaulting me.{w}\nI shiver, and stand in disbelief at how uninviting this city seems to be.{w}\nIf this is where I'd sit in the throne, we'd need to change a lot."
    "我走下大图书馆的台阶，清冷的巴尔泰空气扑面而来。{w}\n我打了个寒颤，难以置信这座城市竟如此拒人于千里之外。{w}\n如果我将来要坐上这里的王座，我们得改变很多。"

# game/script.rpy:99179
translate chinese map291_aa755f39:

    # "Looking around the area, It appears that everybody is here.{w}\nI try to take a head count, just to make sure that's correct.{w}\nThis was the final attack. We needed all of our might."
    "环顾四周，看来所有人都到了。{w}\n我试着清点人数，确认一下没错。{w}\n这是最后的进攻。我们需要倾尽全力。"

# game/script.rpy:99189
translate chinese map291_f75d4c20:

    # "I see Damek shaking hands with the Created Seers.{w}\nGood. They helped us secure the library — and survived.{w}\nThey would be a valuable asset in holding the Town Square."
    "我看见达梅克在和那些人造先知握手。{w}\n很好。他们帮我们拿下了图书馆——而且活了下来。{w}\n守住城镇广场，他们会是宝贵的战力。"

# game/script.rpy:99191
translate chinese map291_7b6f4ea8:

    # "It was nice to see their full potential finally realized.{w}\nUsing their visions, they outsmarted an entire horde of enemies.{w}\nIt was in this exact moment — that I knew I made the right choice."
    "看到他们的全部潜能终于得以发挥，真是太好了。{w}\n他们凭借预视，智胜了整整一大群敌人。{w}\n就在这一刻——我知道自己做出了正确的选择。"

# game/script.rpy:99200
translate chinese map291_09aa2bd3:

    # "One fact stands out to me. The Created Seers are nowhere to be seen.{w}\nThey weren't inside the building either. This means that they had fallen.{w}\nTheir sacrifice led us to safety in The Library, though. They had won."
    "有一点格外刺眼。人造先知们不见踪影。{w}\n他们也不在建筑里面。这意味着他们倒下了。{w}\n不过，是他们的牺牲让我们安全抵达了图书馆。他们赢了。"

# game/script.rpy:99202
translate chinese map291_003ab065:

    # "I find myself frightened by the thought. The Seers could see almost all outcomes.{w}\nPerhaps The Triumvirate's desires for \"quantity\" ended up in their favor, after all.{w}\nIf there were enough soldiers, then not even a Seer could cover every angle."
    "这个念头让我感到恐惧。先知们几乎能看见所有结果。{w}\n也许三人执政团对“数量”的执念终究还是起了作用。{w}\n只要有足够多的士兵，就连先知也无法面面俱到。"

# game/script.rpy:99212
translate chinese map291_c414bae7:

    # "I see Damek shaking hands with the Monarch Vessels.{w}\nGood. They helped us secure victory — and survived.{w}\nThey would be a valuable asset in holding the Town Square."
    "我看见达梅克在和君主容器们握手。{w}\n很好。他们帮我们赢得了胜利——而且活了下来。{w}\n守住城镇广场，他们会是宝贵的战力。"

# game/script.rpy:99214
translate chinese map291_2b2f71a3:

    # "It was nice to see their full potential finally realized.{w}\nWith their incredible resilience, they outsmarted an enemy horde.{w}\nIt was in this exact moment — that I knew I made the right choice."
    "看到他们的全部潜能终于得以发挥，真是太好了。{w}\n凭着惊人的韧性，他们智胜了一整群敌人。{w}\n就在这一刻——我知道自己做出了正确的选择。"

# game/script.rpy:99223
translate chinese map291_67136b85:

    # "One fact stands out to me. The Monarch Vessels are nowhere to be seen.{w}\nThey weren't inside the building either. This means that they had fallen.{w}\nTheir sacrifice led us to safety in The Library, though. They had won."
    "有一点格外刺眼。君主容器们不见踪影。{w}\n他们也不在建筑里面。这意味着他们倒下了。{w}\n不过，是他们的牺牲让我们安全抵达了图书馆。他们赢了。"

# game/script.rpy:99225
translate chinese map291_d1e5f89b:

    # "A bit of anxiety wells up within me though. How could they have died?{w}\nIt's a frightening thought — that The Honor Guard could kill near-immortals.{w}\nMaybe The Triumvirate's desires for \"quantity\" actually ended in their favor."
    "不过，一丝焦虑在我心中涌起。他们怎么会死？{w}\n这是个可怕的念头——荣誉卫队竟能杀死近乎不死的存在。{w}\n也许三人执政团对“数量”的执念真的奏效了。"

# game/script.rpy:99229
translate chinese map291_6d77dd5e:

    # "When I make it to the bottom of the stairs, Damek waves me over.{w}\nOur forces run around, seemingly taking on an infinite number of tasks.{w}\nEverybody is doing something. It made everything seem more \"final\"."
    "我走到台阶底部时，达梅克朝我招手。{w}\n我们的部队四处奔走，仿佛有永远做不完的事。{w}\n每个人都在忙。这让一切都显得更加“最终”。"

# game/script.rpy:99231
translate chinese map291_4e23f1c8:

    # "I could tell that this was the last time I'd see a lot of these people.{w}\nThere was no way we'd make it through this without any casualties.{w}\nTrying to tune out the final preparations, I make my way to Damek."
    "我能看出，这会是很多人我最后一次见到他们。{w}\n我们不可能毫发无伤地挺过这一切。{w}\n我努力不去理会最后的准备，走向达梅克。"

# game/script.rpy:99256
translate chinese map291_07580285:

    # voice "se/z02683.ogg"
    voice "se/z02683.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:99258
translate chinese map291_73cc91df:

    # char_damek "Good to see you, [firstname].\nI'm afraid there isn't much time to talk.\nWe can't deny it. The attack has begun."
    char_damek "见到你真好，[firstname]。\n恐怕没多少时间说话了。\n我们无法否认。进攻已经开始了。"

# game/script.rpy:99271
translate chinese map291_0dd80221:

    # voice "se/z02684.ogg"
    # char_damek "The Honor Guard should realize that we're here momentarily.\nAfter that, this area, and the Town Square, will be a war zone.\nAnybody who has an objective elsewhere, should be leaving."
    voice "se/z02684.ogg"
    char_damek "荣誉卫队很快就会察觉到我们在这里。\n之后，这一带和城镇广场都会变成战场。\n有别的任务在身的人，该出发了。"

# game/script.rpy:99286
translate chinese map291_dedb1765:

    # "Just as he says that, Pro walks by.{w}\nDamek calls out his name, and he quickly runs over.{w}\nThat's right. He was tasked with causing a distraction in the castle."
    "他话音刚落，普洛正好走过。{w}\n达梅克喊了他的名字，他很快跑了过来。{w}\n对了。他的任务是在城堡里制造混乱。"

# game/script.rpy:99311
translate chinese map291_da5d2890:

    # voice "se/pro49.ogg"
    voice "se/pro49.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:99313
translate chinese map291_594f80ae:

    # char_pro "Hey Damek, I was just about to leave."
    char_pro "嘿，达梅克，我正要走了。"

# game/script.rpy:99340
translate chinese map291_847a831d:

    # voice "se/z02686.ogg"
    voice "se/z02686.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:99342
translate chinese map291_ca6a1ee5:

    # char_damek "With Gryz too, I presume?"
    char_damek "我猜格瑞兹也一起？"

# game/script.rpy:99347
translate chinese map291_81890aad:

    # voice "se/z02687.ogg"
    voice "se/z02687.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:99349
translate chinese map291_cabfb15e:

    # char_damek "And you have everything you need?"
    char_damek "你需要的东西都齐了吗？"

# game/script.rpy:99375
translate chinese map291_e9e7153c:

    # voice "se/pro50.ogg"
    voice "se/pro50.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:99377
translate chinese map291_d5c29cb8:

    # char_pro "Yes, of course!\nYou know me — I'd never forget anything.\nYou're in for the distraction of a lifetime, [firstname]."
    char_pro "当然！\n你了解我——我从不落下任何东西。\n你将看到一生难忘的精彩混乱，[firstname]。"

# game/script.rpy:99391
translate chinese map291_3dfbcd98:

    # "He smirks at me. A confident, cocky smirk.{w}\nIf he followed through, then I'd find no resistance.{w}\nIt should be smooth sailing when we get to the castle."
    "他朝我得意地一笑。那是一种自信而张狂的坏笑。{w}\n只要他做到，我就不会遇到什么阻力。{w}\n我们到城堡时应该会一帆风顺。"

# game/script.rpy:99416
translate chinese map291_60d08547:

    # voice "se/z02689.ogg"
    # char_damek "Hey, Pro.\nBefore you go..."
    voice "se/z02689.ogg"
    char_damek "嘿，普洛。\n在你走之前……"

# game/script.rpy:99431
translate chinese map291_59925478:

    # "He holds out his hand, and it trembles softly."
    "他伸出手，手微微颤抖着。"

# game/script.rpy:99456
translate chinese map291_42011fc6:

    # voice "se/z02690.ogg"
    # char_damek "It's been an honor serving with you.\nI hope I see you again after this is over."
    voice "se/z02690.ogg"
    char_damek "能与你并肩作战是我的荣幸。\n希望这一切结束后我还能再见到你。"

# game/script.rpy:99471
translate chinese map291_11de8a43:

    # "He shakes Damek's hand, with a firm grip."
    "他握住达梅克的手，握得很紧。"

# game/script.rpy:99496
translate chinese map291_7a8fb897:

    # voice "se/pro51.ogg"
    # char_pro "Trust me — the pleasure has been all mine.\nAnd I don't plan on dying. Too much writing to do."
    voice "se/pro51.ogg"
    char_pro "相信我——是我的荣幸才对。\n而且我可没打算死。还有太多东西要写。"

# game/script.rpy:99518
translate chinese map291_964f6011:

    # "The handshake is broken, and they give each other uneasy smiles.{w}\nThe kind of smile that acknowledges they may never see each other again.{w}\nAnd soon after that, Pro is on his way. Off to face his fate directly, and unafraid."
    "两人松开手，彼此露出不安的微笑。{w}\n那种承认彼此也许再也见不到面的笑。{w}\n不久之后，普洛就上路了。径直去面对自己的命运，毫无畏惧。"

# game/script.rpy:99546
translate chinese map291_2fc4d2e8:

    # voice "se/z02692.ogg"
    voice "se/z02692.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:99548
translate chinese map291_f71ddf51:

    # char_damek "I guess you should get going too, [firstname].\nDon't worry, I have more protection than I'll ever need.\nOur Rebel Forces, the Created Seers, {i}and{/i} the Draconic Army."
    char_damek "我想你也该出发了，[firstname]。\n别担心，我有的保护远超所需。\n我们的反抗军、人造先知，{i}还有{/i}龙族军队。"

# game/script.rpy:99551
translate chinese map291_93e23e31:

    # voice "se/z02693.ogg"
    # char_damek "No matter what they throw at us, we'll be able to handle it.\nThe true deciding factor in all of this — is you, and that blade.\nBe careful, rely on your comrades, and you'll win this for sure."
    voice "se/z02693.ogg"
    char_damek "无论他们向我们抛出什么，我们都能应付。\n这一切真正的决定因素——是你，和那把剑。\n小心行事，依靠你的同伴，你一定能赢。"

# game/script.rpy:99557
translate chinese map291_9d465696:

    # voice "se/z02694.ogg"
    voice "se/z02694.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:99559
translate chinese map291_6be5d501:

    # char_damek "I guess you should get going too, [firstname].\nDon't worry, I have more protection than I'll ever need.\nAll of our Rebel forces, {i}and{/i} the might of the Draconic Army."
    char_damek "我想你也该出发了，[firstname]。\n别担心，我有的保护远超所需。\n我们所有的反抗军，{i}还有{/i}龙族军队的威势。"

# game/script.rpy:99562
translate chinese map291_a50c4808:

    # voice "se/z02695.ogg"
    # char_damek "No matter what they throw at us, we'll be able to handle it.\nThe true deciding factor in all of this — is you, and that blade.\nBe careful, rely on your comrades, and you'll win this for sure."
    voice "se/z02695.ogg"
    char_damek "无论他们向我们抛出什么，我们都能应付。\n这一切真正的决定因素——是你，和那把剑。\n小心行事，依靠你的同伴，你一定能赢。"

# game/script.rpy:99569
translate chinese map291_96287b86:

    # voice "se/z02696.ogg"
    voice "se/z02696.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:99571
translate chinese map291_9e7cf8a8:

    # char_damek "I guess you should get going too, [firstname].\nDon't worry, I have more protection than I'll ever need.\nOur Rebel Forces, the Monarch Vessels, {i}and{/i} the Draconic Army."
    char_damek "我想你也该出发了，[firstname]。\n别担心，我有的保护远超所需。\n我们的反抗军、君主容器，{i}还有{/i}龙族军队。"

# game/script.rpy:99574
translate chinese map291_53997c77:

    # voice "se/z02697.ogg"
    # char_damek "No matter what they throw at us, we'll be able to handle it.\nThe true deciding factor in all of this — is you, and that blade.\nBe careful, rely on your comrades, and you'll win this for sure."
    voice "se/z02697.ogg"
    char_damek "无论他们向我们抛出什么，我们都能应付。\n这一切真正的决定因素——是你，和那把剑。\n小心行事，依靠你的同伴，你一定能赢。"

# game/script.rpy:99580
translate chinese map291_1449139c:

    # voice "se/z02698.ogg"
    voice "se/z02698.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:99582
translate chinese map291_6be5d501_1:

    # char_damek "I guess you should get going too, [firstname].\nDon't worry, I have more protection than I'll ever need.\nAll of our Rebel forces, {i}and{/i} the might of the Draconic Army."
    char_damek "我想你也该出发了，[firstname]。\n别担心，我有的保护远超所需。\n我们所有的反抗军，{i}还有{/i}龙族军队的威势。"

# game/script.rpy:99585
translate chinese map291_5d88db5f:

    # voice "se/z02699.ogg"
    # char_damek "No matter what they throw at us, we'll be able to handle it.\nThe true deciding factor in all of this — is you, and that blade.\nBe careful, rely on your comrades, and you'll win this for sure."
    voice "se/z02699.ogg"
    char_damek "无论他们向我们抛出什么，我们都能应付。\n这一切真正的决定因素——是你，和那把剑。\n小心行事，依靠你的同伴，你一定能赢。"

# game/script.rpy:99602
translate chinese map291_ffbfa139:

    # "He places a hand on my shoulder."
    "他把一只手搭在我肩上。"

# game/script.rpy:99627
translate chinese map291_a2c5b133:

    # voice "se/z02700.ogg"
    # char_damek "I know you can do this.\nNow, we just need to cause a distraction.\nAll of those suits should be focusing on {i}me{/i}."
    voice "se/z02700.ogg"
    char_damek "我知道你能做到。\n现在，我们只需要制造混乱。\n那些盔甲全都该把注意力放在{i}我{/i}身上。"

# game/script.rpy:99631
translate chinese map291_7dc37ffd:

    # voice "se/z02701.ogg"
    # char_damek "If all goes as planned, you should find minimal resistance.\nSave your strength for The Triumvirate. I think you'll need it.\nAnyway — don't worry about me, I'll have Howl by my side."
    voice "se/z02701.ogg"
    char_damek "如果一切按计划进行，你应该不会遇到多少阻力。\n把力气留给三人执政团。我觉得你会用得上的。\n总之——别担心我，豪尔会在我身边。"

# game/script.rpy:99646
translate chinese map291_06a5f669:

    # "He looks around, confusion worn on his face."
    "他环顾四周，脸上写满困惑。"

# game/script.rpy:99671
translate chinese map291_5ff2cb1d:

    # voice "se/z02702.ogg"
    # char_damek "Speaking of which — where {i}is{/i} he...?\nHe should've been out here ages ago."
    voice "se/z02702.ogg"
    char_damek "说到这个——他{i}人{/i}呢……？\n他早该出来了。"

# game/script.rpy:99696
translate chinese map291_e86ef67c:

    # "Before I can even respond, I hear a loud cracking noise.{w}\nTurning to see the source, I see the door to the Library smashed open.{w}\nAlgus is shoved through, landing face-first on the stone, still tied up."
    "我还没来得及回答，就听见一声巨响的破裂声。{w}\n转头看去，只见图书馆的大门被撞开了。{w}\n阿尔古斯被推了出来，脸朝下摔在石地上，仍被捆着。"

# game/script.rpy:99712
translate chinese map292_cb5ae876:

    # "Smoke billows out of the open door as Howl exits The Library.{w}\nAlgus struggles on the ground, squirming like some sort of insect.{w}\nA blaze, as bright as the sun itself, makes Howl look like a silhouette."
    "豪尔走出图书馆时，浓烟从敞开的门里翻涌而出。{w}\n阿尔古斯在地上挣扎，像只虫子一样扭动。{w}\n一团亮如太阳的火焰，让豪尔看起来如同一道剪影。"

# game/script.rpy:99740
translate chinese map292_84952d5d:

    # voice "se/z02703.ogg"
    voice "se/z02703.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:99742
translate chinese map292_9f45692b:

    # char_damek "Howl...? What are you doing!?"
    char_damek "豪尔……？你在干什么！？"

# game/script.rpy:99756
translate chinese map292_804e5f72:

    # "Upon hearing Damek, he steps forward, and grips Algus by the hair.{w}\nRaising him to his knees, he looks down in horror at our massive army.{w}\nIt was almost, as if, in that moment — he knew he was on the wrong side."
    "听到达梅克的声音，他上前一步，抓住阿尔古斯的头发。{w}\n把他拽得跪起来，让他惊恐地俯视我们庞大的军队。{w}\n那一刻，他几乎像是——明白了自己站错了边。"

# game/script.rpy:99781
translate chinese map292_b2589268:

    # voice "se/z02704.ogg"
    voice "se/z02704.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:99783
translate chinese map292_f397d68a:

    # char_howl "We've come here to destroy The Triumvirate, and all that they stand for.\nDon't tell us you're backing down, now that the moment is upon us...?"
    char_howl "我们来这里，是为了摧毁三人执政团，以及他们所代表的一切。\n你不会是想说，到了这一刻你反而要退缩吧……？"

# game/script.rpy:99800
translate chinese map292_f69fc2e1:

    # "We all stare in awe as Howl pulls out a dagger, holding it in his free hand.{w}\nThe smoke, and the bright illumination reveal to us one frightening fact.{w}\nHowl had torched the inside, burning the books — and his culture."
    "我们全都惊愕地看着豪尔抽出一把匕首，握在空着的那只手里。{w}\n浓烟与明亮的火光向我们揭示了一个可怕的事实。{w}\n豪尔点燃了图书馆内部，烧掉了那些书——以及他的文化。"

# game/script.rpy:99825
translate chinese map292_85a1d6b9:

    # voice "se/z02705.ogg"
    # char_damek "No — of course not...!\nI would never give up when we're so close.\nCome down here Howl. Explain yourself!"
    voice "se/z02705.ogg"
    char_damek "不——当然不是……！\n我们如此接近，我绝不会放弃。\n下来，豪尔。给我解释清楚！"

# game/script.rpy:99840
translate chinese map292_ca6858a1:

    # "Howl shakes his head, disobeying Damek's order.{w}\nRunning the dagger along Algus' throat, he then kicks him down the stairs.{w}\nA trail of blood follows him all the way down, steaming against the cold snow."
    "豪尔摇了摇头，违抗了达梅克的命令。{w}\n他用匕首划过阿尔古斯的喉咙，然后一脚把他踹下台阶。{w}\n一道血迹一路尾随他向下，在冰冷的雪地上冒着热气。"

# game/script.rpy:99865
translate chinese map292_3fa2b398:

    # voice "se/z02706.ogg"
    # char_howl "The Monarchy is dead, Damek.\nDo not cling to memories like us. "
    voice "se/z02706.ogg"
    char_howl "王朝已经死了，达梅克。\n别像我们这样抓着回忆不放。"

# game/script.rpy:99880
translate chinese map292_50d442fd:

    # "He slowly descends the stairs, the crimson dagger dripping blood.{w}\nAs the flames shoot out the front door, Howl's face is finally lit up.{w}\nIt appears devoid of all feeling, even after what he had done."
    "他缓缓走下台阶，那把绯红的匕首滴着血。{w}\n火焰从前门喷涌而出，豪尔的脸终于被照亮。{w}\n即便刚做了那样的事，那张脸上却毫无表情。"

# game/script.rpy:99898
translate chinese map292_8a3fe0e1:

    # voice "se/z02707.ogg"
    # char_damek "Howl — stand down...!"
    voice "se/z02707.ogg"
    char_damek "豪尔——住手……！"

# game/script.rpy:99913
translate chinese map292_683b8056:

    # "Damek immediately draws his sword, holding it toward Howl."
    "达梅克立刻拔剑，指向豪尔。"

# game/script.rpy:99938
translate chinese map292_dcb4cf2e:

    # voice "se/z02708.ogg"
    # char_howl "Stand down? All we've done is carry out our orders.\nKill The Triumvirate, and their supporters, correct?\nAs their servant, Algus deserves the same fate."
    voice "se/z02708.ogg"
    char_howl "住手？我们所做的不过是执行命令。\n杀掉三人执政团，以及他们的支持者，对吧？\n作为他们的仆从，阿尔古斯活该有同样的下场。"

# game/script.rpy:99953
translate chinese map292_359d81d3:

    # "Damek's arm trembles, realizing Howl was right."
    "达梅克的手臂颤抖着，意识到豪尔说得没错。"

# game/script.rpy:99978
translate chinese map292_82fbc6aa:

    # voice "se/z02709b.ogg"
    # char_howl "And we needed a beacon to lure The Honor Guard to the square.\nA beacon — that no matter how hard they try — they cannot put out.\nBurning The Library made sense. They are not permitted inside."
    voice "se/z02709b.ogg"
    char_howl "而且我们需要一个灯塔，把荣誉卫队引到广场来。\n一个灯塔——无论他们怎么努力，都无法扑灭。\n烧掉图书馆是合理的。他们不被允许进入里面。"

# game/script.rpy:99992
translate chinese map292_24845ef2:

    # voice "se/z02710.ogg"
    # char_howl "Do not mourn for what has already been lost, Damek.\nThe Honor Guard will be here in just a few moments.\nPreparing your army would be a much better action."
    voice "se/z02710.ogg"
    char_howl "别为已经失去的东西哀悼，达梅克。\n荣誉卫队马上就会到了。\n去准备好你的军队才是更该做的事。"

# game/script.rpy:100007
translate chinese map292_81ba2fb6:

    # "Howl throws the dagger onto the ground."
    "豪尔把匕首扔到地上。"

# game/script.rpy:100032
translate chinese map292_b2bc6d36:

    # voice "se/z02711.ogg"
    # char_howl "The battle for Alestia has begun."
    voice "se/z02711.ogg"
    char_howl "阿莱斯蒂亚之战已经打响。"

# game/script.rpy:100050
translate chinese map292_cd1664c9:

    # "Damek lowers his sword, letting out a loud sigh.{w}\nHowl was right. Algus served the enemy — making him an enemy.{w}\nAnd the beacon was paramount to our success. It could {i}not{/i} be put out."
    "达梅克放下剑，长叹一声。{w}\n豪尔说得对。阿尔古斯为敌人效力——那他就是敌人。{w}\n而那座灯塔对我们的成功至关重要。它{i}绝不能{/i}被扑灭。"

# game/script.rpy:100075
translate chinese map292_9aee8302:

    # voice "se/z02712.ogg"
    # char_damek "I don't believe this..."
    voice "se/z02712.ogg"
    char_damek "我真不敢相信……"

# game/script.rpy:100090
translate chinese map292_cf79caed:

    # "Howl finally makes it to our location, and stands beside us.{w}\nHe shrugs — almost like this isn't a big deal at all."
    "豪尔终于来到我们所在的位置，站在我们身旁。{w}\n他耸耸肩——仿佛这根本算不了什么。"

# game/script.rpy:100118
translate chinese map292_cbd8d222:

    # voice "se/z02713.ogg"
    # char_howl "Drastic measures must be taken in order to ensure our victory.\nThe writing of a long dead culture is a small price to pay.\nYou should be on your way, [firstname]. The time is now."
    voice "se/z02713.ogg"
    char_howl "为了确保胜利，必须采取极端手段。\n一个早已消亡的文化的文字，只是小小的代价。\n你该出发了，[firstname]。就是现在。"

# game/script.rpy:100133
translate chinese map292_f1643cf6:

    # "He's right. I had to make my way to the castle.{w}\nIf I used the Mountain Pass, I should find little resistance.{w}\nEvery suit of armor would soon be on their way to The Library."
    "他说得对。我得赶往城堡。{w}\n如果我走山道，应该不会遇到多少阻力。{w}\n所有盔甲很快就会赶去图书馆。"

# game/script.rpy:100160
translate chinese map292_e9681242:

    # voice "se/z02714.ogg"
    voice "se/z02714.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:100162
translate chinese map292_4c06fb09:

    # char_howl "Do not forget Sovy, either.\nHe volunteered to accompany your group.\nMake use of the knowledge he has on Balteus."
    char_howl "也别忘记索维。\n他自愿随你们这一组同行。\n好好利用他对巴尔泰乌斯的了解。"

# game/script.rpy:100167
translate chinese map292_8b1ddfda:

    # voice "se/z02715.ogg"
    voice "se/z02715.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:100169
translate chinese map292_4e5d9b0d:

    # char_howl "Do not forget your comrades, either.\nThe success of your group will determine everything.\nDo not waver. Do not falter. Your rule hangs in the balance."
    char_howl "也别忘记你的同伴们。\n你们这一组的成败将决定一切。\n不要动摇。不要迟疑。你的统治悬于一线。"

# game/script.rpy:100190
translate chinese map292_fd04b648:

    # "I nod. This was happening so fast, but I could waste no time.{w}\nWe knew this was coming. We knew we'd have to take action.{w}\nI start to walk away, but Damek calls out to me a moment later."
    "我点头。这一切发生得太快，但我一刻也不能浪费。{w}\n我们知道这终将到来。我们知道必须采取行动。{w}\n我转身要走，但片刻后达梅克叫住了我。"

# game/script.rpy:100215
translate chinese map292_76e8124b:

    # voice "se/z02716.ogg"
    # char_damek "Hey — be careful, okay...?\nI want to see you there when we regroup in the atrium.\nAnd if all goes as planned, you'll be seeing {i}me{/i} there, too."
    voice "se/z02716.ogg"
    char_damek "嘿——小心点，好吗……？\n等我们在中庭会合时，我想看到你也在那儿。\n如果一切顺利，你也会在那儿见到{i}我{/i}。"

# game/script.rpy:100238
translate chinese map292_f094dc28:

    # "I smile, and nod. That would have to suffice as a goodbye.{w}\nAfter I gather up Valessa, Ulric, Fortaime and Sovy, we head out.{w}\nIf we hurried, we could get through the Town Square before the suits came."
    "我笑着点头。这就当作告别吧。{w}\n我召集了瓦莱莎、乌尔里克、福泰姆和索维，我们一起出发。{w}\n如果抓紧时间，我们能在那些盔甲赶来前穿过城镇广场。"

# game/script.rpy:100243
translate chinese map292_50d169b5:

    # "I smile, and nod. That would have to suffice as a goodbye.{w}\nAfter I gather up Valessa, Ulric and Fortaime — we decide to head out.{w}\nIf we hurried, we could get through the Town Square before the suits came."
    "我笑着点头。这就当作告别吧。{w}\n我召集了瓦莱莎、乌尔里克和福泰姆——我们决定出发。{w}\n如果抓紧时间，我们能在那些盔甲赶来前穿过城镇广场。"

# game/script.rpy:100247
translate chinese map292_fa2d5187:

    # "In our haste, we say almost no words to one another.{w}\nThere was a silent agreement that the task at hand was more important.{w}\nIn knowing that any word could be our last — silence seemed more appropriate."
    "匆匆之间，我们几乎谁也没对谁说话。{w}\n彼此心照不宣：眼前的要紧事更重要。{w}\n知道任何一句话都可能是最后一句话——沉默反而更合适。"

# game/script.rpy:100280
translate chinese map293_0d893a0d:

    # "Halin knelt before his Masters, more eager to serve than he had ever been before.{w}\nHe looked up at them, awaiting their orders. Perhaps the final orders they'd give.{w}\nIt would be up to him to lead The Honor Guard, and ensure their victory today."
    "哈林跪在主人面前，从没有像此刻这样渴望效命。{w}\n他抬头望向他们，等待命令。也许是他们下的最后命令。{w}\n指挥荣誉卫队、确保他们今日取胜的重任，将落在他肩上。"

# game/script.rpy:100305
translate chinese map293_8baf0e64:

    # voice "se/z02717.ogg"
    voice "se/z02717.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:100307
translate chinese map293_1ff362ca:

    # char_the_triumvirate "Rise, Halin.\nIt seems they seek to deceive us.\nBut it's nothing we haven't seen before."
    char_the_triumvirate "起来吧，哈林。\n看来他们想欺骗我们。\n但这我们见多了。"

# game/script.rpy:100332
translate chinese map293_04133592:

    # voice "se/z02718b.ogg"
    voice "se/z02718b.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:100334
translate chinese map293_a701636b:

    # char_halin "Deception...?\nThat seems to be their strength.\nWhat will you have me do, Masters?"
    char_halin "欺骗……？\n那似乎正是他们的强项。\n主人，您要我怎么做？"

# game/script.rpy:100359
translate chinese map293_af71700d:

    # voice "se/z02719.ogg"
    # char_the_triumvirate "Man the atrium. Stay in the castle.\nWe shall let them exhaust their forces for now.\nWhen they come here, you can finish them off."
    voice "se/z02719.ogg"
    char_the_triumvirate "守住中庭。留在城堡里。\n暂且让他们耗尽兵力。\n等他们来到这里，你就可以将他们一网打尽。"

# game/script.rpy:100385
translate chinese map293_1c8471be:

    # voice "se/z02720b.ogg"
    # char_halin "You mean to fall into their trap...?"
    voice "se/z02720b.ogg"
    char_halin "您是说，要落入他们的陷阱……？"

# game/script.rpy:100411
translate chinese map293_1a195d78:

    # voice "se/z02721.ogg"
    # char_the_triumvirate "Doing so would make it {i}our{/i} trap, Halin.\nBesides, their deaths will feed the blade even more.\nWe need it as strong as possible when it is brought back to us."
    voice "se/z02721.ogg"
    char_the_triumvirate "那样一来，那就会变成{i}我们的{/i}陷阱，哈林。\n再说，他们的死会让那把剑变得更加强大。\n当它被带回我们手中时，我们需要它尽可能地强。"

# game/script.rpy:100437
translate chinese map293_923087b0:

    # voice "se/z02722b.ogg"
    # char_halin "For what reason?"
    voice "se/z02722b.ogg"
    char_halin "为了什么？"

# game/script.rpy:100463
translate chinese map293_04cea722:

    # voice "se/z02723.ogg"
    # char_the_triumvirate "Do you doubt us...?"
    voice "se/z02723.ogg"
    char_the_triumvirate "你在怀疑我们……？"

# game/script.rpy:100489
translate chinese map293_1e364220:

    # voice "se/z02724.ogg"
    # char_halin "No, of course not.\nI was merely curious — that's all."
    voice "se/z02724.ogg"
    char_halin "不，当然不是。\n我只是好奇——仅此而已。"

# game/script.rpy:100515
translate chinese map293_6568ff57:

    # voice "se/z02725.ogg"
    # char_the_triumvirate "Then your curiosity will have to linger.\nYou have your orders, Halin. Now see them out.\nIn a few hours, everything should be over for good."
    voice "se/z02725.ogg"
    char_the_triumvirate "那你的好奇心就只能搁着了。\n命令已经下达，哈林。去执行吧。\n几个小时后，一切都该彻底结束了。"

# game/script.rpy:100530
translate chinese map293_eb423525:

    # "Halin wondered — but for what side...?"
    "哈林心中暗自揣测——可究竟是哪一方会终结呢……？"

# game/script.rpy:100555
translate chinese map293_fc54571b:

    # voice "se/z02726.ogg"
    # char_halin "Yes — whatever you say.\nWhen they arrive in the atrium? Consider them dead.\nI will paint the walls with their blood, or else besmirch them with my own."
    voice "se/z02726.ogg"
    char_halin "是——您怎么说都行。\n等他们来到中庭？就当他们已经死了。\n我要用他们的血涂满墙壁，否则就用我自己的血来玷污它。"

# game/script.rpy:100581
translate chinese map293_6002daee:

    # voice "se/z02727.ogg"
    # char_the_triumvirate "Thank you Halin. Now be on your way.\nWe will send The Honor Guard to the Town Square to weaken them.\nThere is no time to waste. The end of everything is upon us."
    voice "se/z02727.ogg"
    char_the_triumvirate "谢谢你，哈林。现在就出发吧。\n我们会派荣誉卫队去城镇广场削弱他们。\n没时间可浪费了。万物的终局已经降临。"

# game/script.rpy:100603
translate chinese map293_0612377b:

    # "Without a word, Halin is off on his way.{w}\nIn this moment, he truly became The Grand Inquisitor.{w}\nLast line of defense between The Triumvirate and a weak insurrection."
    "哈林一言不发地上路了。{w}\n在这一刻，他真正成为了大审判官。{w}\n三人执政团与一场微弱叛乱之间的最后一道防线。"

# game/script.rpy:100628
translate chinese map293_9189447c:

    # voice "se/z02728.ogg"
    # char_the_triumvirate "The end? Or perhaps, another new beginning...\nSteel yourselves, brothers. You know what's coming."
    voice "se/z02728.ogg"
    char_the_triumvirate "终结？又或者，是另一个新的开始……\n振作起来，兄弟们。你们知道即将到来的是什么。"

# game/script.rpy:100650
translate chinese map293_01d3c112:

    # "They all look at each other, and nod.{w}\nFor the first time in ages, doubt fills their chambers.{w}\nThankfully, nobody was there to witness such a fault."
    "他们彼此对视，点了点头。{w}\n许久以来第一次，疑虑充满了他们的议事厅。{w}\n幸好，无人目睹这样的破绽。"

# game/script.rpy:100684
translate chinese map294_d7e613ba:

    # "Pro and Gryz enter The Triumvirate's castle, careful not to attract attention.{w}\nThe staircase in the middle is the one that led to their chambers, for sure.{w}\nThis meant they'd have to lure The Honor Guard off to the left or right side."
    "普洛和格瑞兹进入三人执政团的城堡，小心不引人注意。{w}\n中间那道楼梯无疑是通往他们议事厅的。{w}\n这就意味着他们得把荣誉卫队引到左侧或右侧去。"

# game/script.rpy:100686
translate chinese map294_c8231412:

    # "Paths on either side of the stairs lead to other sections of the castle.{w}\nIf Pro had to guess, he'd say that they led to living quarters, or practice rooms.{w}\nMuch to their luck, a horde of Honor Guard was gathered at the base of the stairs."
    "楼梯两侧的通道通往城堡的其他区域。{w}\n如果让普洛猜，他会说那些是通往起居室或练武场的。{w}\n幸运的是，楼梯底部聚集着一大群荣誉卫队。"

# game/script.rpy:100711
translate chinese map294_95024c5a:

    # voice "se/pro52.ogg"
    voice "se/pro52.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:100713
translate chinese map294_166d1820:

    # char_pro "Alright, alright.\nHow can we lure them away...?\nThink Pro, think. You can do this!"
    char_pro "好，好。\n我们怎样才能把他们引开……？\n想想，普洛，想想。你能行！"

# game/script.rpy:100738
translate chinese map294_492d6486:

    # voice "se/z02730.ogg"
    voice "se/z02730.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:100740
translate chinese map294_1ab365c8:

    # char_jit_map251_1_0_130 "Not so loud, Pro.\nWe need a plan {i}before{/i} they find us.\nLet's look for something we can use as a distraction."
    char_jit_map251_1_0_130 "小声点，普洛。\n我们得在被他们发现{i}之前{/i}想好计划。\n找找有什么能用来制造混乱的东西。"

# game/script.rpy:100754
translate chinese map294_006c19f8:

    # "Pro examines the area, noticing large metallic stands holding lit candles.{w}\nThat would be sure to cause a distraction. But how would he use it...?{w}\nHis eyes are drawn to large stained-glass windows lining the hall."
    "普洛打量着这一带，注意到几个托着点燃蜡烛的大型金属烛台。{w}\n那肯定能制造混乱。但他要怎么利用呢……？{w}\n他的目光被走廊两旁巨大的彩绘玻璃窗吸引过去。"

# game/script.rpy:100779
translate chinese map294_89f2075a:

    # voice "se/pro53.ogg"
    # char_pro "Hmm. That'll have to do.\nCome on Gryz, let's do this already.\nHopefully [firstname] isn't too far behind."
    voice "se/pro53.ogg"
    char_pro "嗯。只能这样了。\n来吧格瑞兹，我们动手吧。\n希望[firstname]别落后太多。"

# game/script.rpy:100794
translate chinese map294_0cb773bf:

    # "He starts moving toward the candleholders, but Gryz grabs his shoulder."
    "他朝烛台走去，但格瑞兹抓住了他的肩膀。"

# game/script.rpy:100819
translate chinese map294_1c7c4b03:

    # voice "se/z02732.ogg"
    # char_jit_map251_1_0_130 "No — not that side.\nIt leads to the dining hall, and a dead end.\nYou'd only be signing your own death warrant."
    voice "se/z02732.ogg"
    char_jit_map251_1_0_130 "不——不是那边。\n那边通往餐厅，是条死路。\n你那是给自己签死亡判决书。"

# game/script.rpy:100834
translate chinese map294_e49a72fe:

    # "Pro nods without a word, and they make their way to the other side of the room.{w}\nThey both grab one of the stands, and shake off the candle on the other end.{w}\nIt hits the ground, and the wax shatters in almost every possible direction."
    "普洛一言不发地点头，两人走向房间的另一侧。{w}\n他们各抓住一个烛台，把另一端的蜡烛抖落。{w}\n蜡烛落地，蜡几乎朝四面八方碎裂飞散。"

# game/script.rpy:100859
translate chinese map294_d622cf9c:

    # voice "se/pro54.ogg"
    # char_pro "Hey — over here...!"
    voice "se/pro54.ogg"
    char_pro "嘿——这边……！"

# game/script.rpy:100874
translate chinese map294_83f4af67:

    # "In unison, both Pro and Gryz start breaking the windows with their \"weapons\".{w}\nThe Honor Guard takes notice immediately, and starts sauntering over.{w}\nPro grins, laughing softly at how easily it was to distract the suits."
    "普洛和格瑞兹同时用他们的“武器”开始砸窗。{w}\n荣誉卫队立刻注意到了，开始慢悠悠地走过来。{w}\n普洛咧嘴一笑，轻声笑着——引开那些盔甲竟这么容易。"

# game/script.rpy:100899
translate chinese map294_7904e616:

    # voice "se/pro55.ogg"
    # char_pro "Perfect. Now we just need to make a trail.\nCome on! Don't let us get away...!"
    voice "se/pro55.ogg"
    char_pro "完美。现在我们只需要留下一道痕迹。\n来啊！别让我们跑了……！"

# game/script.rpy:100926
translate chinese map294_fabb11a9:

    # "They run down the hallway, shattering window after window.{w}\nA trail of broken glass is left behind for the suits to follow after.{w}\nHowever, they move slow on purpose, keeping an eye on the horde."
    "他们沿着走廊奔跑，砸碎一扇又一扇窗户。{w}\n身后留下一道碎玻璃的痕迹，供那些盔甲循迹追来。{w}\n不过他们故意放慢脚步，留意着那群追兵。"

# game/script.rpy:100931
translate chinese map294_caa5dc11:

    # "Pro enters The Triumvirate's castle, careful not to gather unwanted attention.{w}\nThe staircase in the middle is the one that led up to their chambers, for sure.{w}\nThis meant he'd have to lure The Honor Guard off to the left or right side."
    "普洛进入三人执政团的城堡，小心不引来不必要的注意。{w}\n中间那道楼梯无疑是通往他们议事厅的。{w}\n这就意味着他得把荣誉卫队引到左侧或右侧去。"

# game/script.rpy:100933
translate chinese map294_ac30e105:

    # "Paths on either side of the stairs lead to other sections of the castle.{w}\nIf he had to guess, he'd say that they led to living quarters, or practice rooms.{w}\nMuch to his luck, a horde of Honor Guard was gathered at the base of the stairs."
    "楼梯两侧的通道通往城堡的其他区域。{w}\n如果让他猜，他会说那些是通往起居室或练武场的。{w}\n幸运的是，楼梯底部聚集着一大群荣誉卫队。"

# game/script.rpy:100958
translate chinese map294_442b32e2:

    # voice "se/pro56.ogg"
    voice "se/pro56.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:100960
translate chinese map294_d1bf71dc:

    # char_pro "Alright, alright.\nHow can I lure them away...?\nThink Pro, think. You can do this."
    char_pro "好，好。\n我怎样才能把他们引开……？\n想想，普洛，想想。你能行。"

# game/script.rpy:100974
translate chinese map294_48d4996d:

    # "He examines the area, noticing large metallic stands holding lit candles.{w}\nThat would be sure to cause a distraction. But how would he use it...?{w}\nHis eyes are drawn to large stained-glass windows lining the hall."
    "他打量着这一带，注意到几个托着点燃蜡烛的大型金属烛台。{w}\n那肯定能制造混乱。但他要怎么利用呢……？{w}\n他的目光被走廊两旁巨大的彩绘玻璃窗吸引过去。"

# game/script.rpy:100989
translate chinese map294_1a0fa7c1:

    # voice "se/pro57.ogg"
    # char_pro "Hmm. That'll have to do.\nHopefully [firstname] isn't too far away.\nI won't be able to keep them occupied forever."
    voice "se/pro57.ogg"
    char_pro "嗯。只能这样了。\n希望[firstname]别离得太远。\n我可没法永远拖住他们。"

# game/script.rpy:101004
translate chinese map294_11eb704d:

    # "Pro grabs one of the metallic stands, and shakes off the candle.{w}\nIt falls to the ground, the wax shattering in almost every direction.{w}\nWasting no time, he causes as big of a commotion as he can."
    "普洛抓起一个金属烛台，抖落蜡烛。{w}\n蜡烛落到地上，蜡几乎朝四面八方碎裂飞散。{w}\n他一刻也不耽搁，尽可能闹出最大的动静。"

# game/script.rpy:101029
translate chinese map294_a46a194e:

    # voice "se/pro58.ogg"
    # char_pro "Hey, over here...!"
    voice "se/pro58.ogg"
    char_pro "嘿，这边……！"

# game/script.rpy:101044
translate chinese map294_7c1edd9b:

    # "He shatters one of the windows by thrusting the candleholder through it.{w}\nThe Honor Guard looks over and immediately begins walking toward Pro.{w}\nWith a quick smirk, he laughs at how easily he was able to carry out his goal."
    "他把烛台狠狠捅进一扇窗户，将其砸碎。{w}\n荣誉卫队看过来，立刻开始朝普洛走去。{w}\n他嘴角一挑，笑着——目标达成得竟如此轻而易举。"

# game/script.rpy:101069
translate chinese map294_ba75d669:

    # voice "se/pro59.ogg"
    # char_pro "Perfect. Now, just to make a trail.\nCome on! Don't let me get away...!"
    voice "se/pro59.ogg"
    char_pro "完美。现在，只要留下痕迹就行。\n来啊！别让我跑了……！"

# game/script.rpy:101091
translate chinese map294_40b60f0a:

    # "He runs down the hallway, shattering window after window.{w}\nA trail of broken glass is left behind for the suits to follow after.{w}\nHowever, he moves slow on purpose, keeping an eye on the horde."
    "他沿着走廊奔跑，砸碎一扇又一扇窗户。{w}\n身后留下一道碎玻璃的痕迹，供那些盔甲循迹追来。{w}\n不过他是故意放慢脚步，留意着那群追兵。"

# game/script.rpy:101124
translate chinese map295_2d3a7408:

    # "Howl and Damek stand side by side in the Town Square of Balteus.{w}\nThey can hear the sound of The Honor Guard marching to their location.{w}\nEchoes of steel grating against steel assault their ears as they wait."
    "豪尔和达梅克并肩站在巴尔泰乌斯的城镇广场上。{w}\n他们能听见荣誉卫队朝他们所在之处行进的脚步声。{w}\n等候之际，钢铁与钢铁摩擦的回响刺痛着他们的耳朵。"

# game/script.rpy:101149
translate chinese map295_4aee7a5e:

    # voice "se/z02739b.ogg"
    voice "se/z02739b.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:101151
translate chinese map295_d6df71e8:

    # char_damek "How many do you think there are?"
    char_damek "你觉得有多少？"

# game/script.rpy:101176
translate chinese map295_a4cf9db6:

    # voice "se/z02740b.ogg"
    voice "se/z02740b.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:101178
translate chinese map295_a05288f0:

    # char_howl "Not enough."
    char_howl "不够多。"

# game/script.rpy:101203
translate chinese map295_62d2cd03:

    # voice "se/z02741b.ogg"
    # char_damek "Well, at least you're confident."
    voice "se/z02741b.ogg"
    char_damek "好吧，至少你很有自信。"

# game/script.rpy:101230
translate chinese map295_52d7e253:

    # "Damek brushes some ash off of his shoulder.{w}\nRemnants of the books from the library filled the air.{w}\nFrom behind, one of their allies steps forward."
    "达梅克拂去肩上的灰烬。{w}\n图书馆那些书的残灰弥漫在空气中。{w}\n一名盟友从他们身后走上前来。"

# game/script.rpy:101256
translate chinese map295_01ea7608:

    # voice "se/z02742.ogg"
    voice "se/z02742.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:101262
translate chinese map295_413fa4c2:

    # char_jit_map295_1_0_58 "They're getting close. Be on your guard, Damek.\nI'll have my men protect you and Howl."
    char_jit_map295_1_0_58 "他们快到了。提高警惕，达梅克。\n我会让我的部下保护你和豪尔。"

# game/script.rpy:101276
translate chinese map295_c71d017b:

    # voice "se/z02743.ogg"
    voice "se/z02743.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:101282
translate chinese map295_07397915:

    # char_jit_map295_1_0_67 "They're almost here — I can tell.\nBe on your guard. I'll have my men protect you."
    char_jit_map295_1_0_67 "他们快到了——我能感觉到。\n提高警惕。我会让我的部下保护你。"

# game/script.rpy:101307
translate chinese map295_f8a10d04:

    # voice "se/z02744b.ogg"
    voice "se/z02744b.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:101309
translate chinese map295_467dbab5:

    # char_damek "Yes, of course. I appreciate it.\nI'll be watching their backs as well."
    char_damek "好，当然。多谢。\n我也会替他们留意背后。"

# game/script.rpy:101335
translate chinese map295_dd2b63dd:

    # "Now, all three of them were standing side by side.{w}\nThe footsteps of The Honor Guard got louder and louder.{w}\nThey stepped in unison, sounding like a heart that beat too fast."
    "现在，他们三人都并肩站在一起。{w}\n荣誉卫队的脚步声越来越响。{w}\n他们步伐一致，听起来像一颗跳动过快的心。"

# game/script.rpy:101361
translate chinese map295_25152bc6:

    # voice "se/z02745.ogg"
    voice "se/z02745.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:101367
translate chinese map295_49b375cd:

    # char_jit_map295_1_0_102 "It reminds me of the drums in the coliseum.\nBefore every fight, they'd put on quite a show.\nNothing got my blood pumping more. Trust me."
    char_jit_map295_1_0_102 "这让我想起竞技场里的鼓声。\n每场战斗前，他们都会上演一番好戏。\n再没有比这更让我热血沸腾的了。相信我。"

# game/script.rpy:101392
translate chinese map295_3423147e:

    # voice "se/z02746.ogg"
    voice "se/z02746.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:101394
translate chinese map295_b1a76d05:

    # char_howl "Then we trust that you'll perform admirably.\nShow us that siding with you was the right choice.\nEvery step we've ever taken — has led us to this moment."
    char_howl "那我们相信你会表现出色。\n向我们证明，与你结盟是正确的选择。\n我们迈出的每一步——都将我们引向这一刻。"

# game/script.rpy:101408
translate chinese map295_cd450c65:

    # "Draycu smirks."
    "德雷库得意地一笑。"

# game/script.rpy:101433
translate chinese map295_6c645566:

    # voice "se/z02747.ogg"
    # char_jit_map295_1_0_102 "We'll give the world something to sing about.\nTrust me, they'll tell tales of this battle."
    voice "se/z02747.ogg"
    char_jit_map295_1_0_102 "我们要给这世界一些值得传唱的东西。\n相信我，他们会传颂这场战斗的。"

# game/script.rpy:101460
translate chinese map295_eb1d103f:

    # voice "se/z02748b.ogg"
    voice "se/z02748b.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:101466
translate chinese map295_8c8ebf36:

    # char_jit_map295_1_0_150 "Reminds me of those drums in the coliseum.\nEvery time they played, I knew that death would follow.\nLet's hope that it does — but not for any of us."
    char_jit_map295_1_0_150 "让我想起竞技场里的那些鼓声。\n每次鼓声响起，我就知道死亡会随之而来。\n但愿这次也一样——但不是冲着我们任何人。"

# game/script.rpy:101491
translate chinese map295_c88a88bb:

    # voice "se/z02749.ogg"
    voice "se/z02749.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:101493
translate chinese map295_00d6a389:

    # char_howl "If we are in danger, do not come to our aid.\nEspecially if it would endanger the lives of others.\nRemember — by all accounts, we are already dead."
    char_howl "如果我们陷入危险，不要来救我们。\n尤其是当这会危及他人性命的时候。\n记住——从各方面来说，我们已经死了。"

# game/script.rpy:101507
translate chinese map295_e462c067:

    # "Vivien shakes his head."
    "薇薇安摇了摇头。"

# game/script.rpy:101532
translate chinese map295_c9b8923e:

    # voice "se/z02750b.ogg"
    # char_jit_map295_1_0_150 "No matter what you say, you're an ally.\nAnd believe it or not — I prefer to keep those alive.\nAs long as you breathe? You're living, and of use."
    voice "se/z02750b.ogg"
    char_jit_map295_1_0_150 "不管你怎么说，你是盟友。\n信不信由你——我更喜欢让盟友活着。\n只要你还在呼吸？你就是活着的，就有用。"

# game/script.rpy:101559
translate chinese map295_28dd6bc8:

    # "As they talk, the first of The Honor Guard comes into view.{w}\nOne stood in front of the rest, as if assigning themselves the role of leader.{w}\nIt was odd, they all thought, that such mindless suits had a sense of hierarchy."
    "他们交谈间，荣誉卫队的第一个成员出现在视野中。{w}\n有一个站在其余成员前面，仿佛给自己安上了首领的角色。{w}\n他们心想，这些没脑子的盔甲居然还有等级意识，真是奇怪。"

# game/script.rpy:101561
translate chinese map295_c9a21c2a:

    # "However, there was no time to think about such trivial things.{w}\nMere moments later, the rest of the suits gather behind their \"leader\".{w}\nOn the other side of the town square, it seemed like thousands had arrived."
    "然而，已经没时间想这些琐碎的事了。{w}\n只过了片刻，其余盔甲便聚集在他们的“首领”身后。{w}\n城镇广场的另一头，仿佛来了成千上万个。"

# game/script.rpy:101586
translate chinese map295_c6402fa1:

    # voice "se/z02751b.ogg"
    voice "se/z02751b.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:101588
translate chinese map295_d23fa00e:

    # char_damek "It appears that we may be outnumbered.\nBut remember, those things aren't known for their smarts.\nEach one of us could easily take down a hundred or more."
    char_damek "看来我们寡不敌众。\n但记住，那些东西可不以聪明著称。\n我们每个人都能轻松撂倒一百个甚至更多。"

# game/script.rpy:101613
translate chinese map295_89b57355:

    # voice "se/z02752.ogg"
    voice "se/z02752.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:101615
translate chinese map295_b7ef9a1a:

    # char_howl "Let's hope that you're correct."
    char_howl "但愿你说得对。"

# game/script.rpy:101629
translate chinese map295_167a80ab:

    # "Damek gulps and draws his sword.{w}\nEverybody behind him does the same, and the sound fills the Town Square.{w}\nEven from the opposing side — all they can hear is the unsheathing of blades."
    "达梅克咽了口唾沫，拔出剑。{w}\n他身后的每个人也都照做，拔剑声充满了城镇广场。{w}\n就连对面——他们能听到的也只有拔剑声。"

# game/script.rpy:101631
translate chinese map295_191ed1cf:

    # "But when everybody is armed, nothing happens.{w}\nThey stand on opposite sides, both forces staring at each other.{w}\nDamek looks left, and right, to his allies, before speaking out."
    "但当所有人都拿起武器后，却什么都没发生。{w}\n他们分立两侧，两军对望。{w}\n达梅克左右看了看自己的盟友，然后开口。"

# game/script.rpy:101656
translate chinese map295_b48f9732:

    # voice "se/z02753b.ogg"
    # char_damek "It appears they want us to make the first move.\nProbably so they can counter. That makes it easier.\nJust anticipate it, and come up with a counter of your own."
    voice "se/z02753b.ogg"
    char_damek "看来他们想让我们先动手。\n多半是为了好反击。反倒更容易了。\n只要预判它，想出自己的反制就行。"

# game/script.rpy:101671
translate chinese map295_e5fd8be9:

    # "Even after his instruction, nobody makes a move.{w}\nThe ash in the air thickens — remnants of The Monarchy showering over them.{w}\nDamek takes a few steps forward, and holds his sword up in the air."
    "即便他下了指示，仍无人行动。{w}\n空气中的灰烬更浓了——王朝的残烬如雨般洒落在他们身上。{w}\n达梅克向前走了几步，把剑高举在空中。"

# game/script.rpy:101696
translate chinese map295_ebadd6a6:

    # voice "se/z02754b.ogg"
    # char_damek "We fight to liberate those stuck under The Triumvirate's thumb.\nIn the name of all those who have fallen, and all those who will come.\nA new future will dawn here today — one of happiness and peace for all."
    voice "se/z02754b.ogg"
    char_damek "我们战斗，是为了解放那些受三人执政团压迫的人。\n以所有已逝者、以及所有将来者的名义。\n今天，一个崭新的未来将在这里破晓——一个属于所有人、充满幸福与和平的未来。"

# game/script.rpy:101711
translate chinese map295_e918d343:

    # "The soldiers cheer, holding their swords up in the air as well.{w}\nBut soon after, they fall back down — resting in a fighting position.{w}\nDamek says nothing, simply holding his sword toward the enemy."
    "士兵们欢呼着，也把剑高举在空中。{w}\n但很快，剑又落下——摆出战斗的架势。{w}\n达梅克没有作声，只是把剑指向敌人。"

# game/script.rpy:101713
translate chinese map295_a400e545:

    # "And that was enough to spring the army into action.{w}\nCharging toward The Honor Guard, steel soon clashes against steel.{w}\nScreams fill the Town Square as both sides meet and clash in the middle."
    "这就足以让整支军队行动起来。{w}\n他们冲向荣誉卫队，钢铁很快碰撞在一起。{w}\n双方在中央交锋，城镇广场上充斥着惨叫。"

# game/script.rpy:101715
translate chinese map295_9053403c:

    # "Damek and Howl remain behind everybody, watching the initial charge.{w}\nThey'd wait for an ample opening, and join their army at the right time.{w}\nHowl places a hand on Damek's shoulder, and gives him a soft nod."
    "达梅克和豪尔留在所有人身后，注视着最初的冲锋。{w}\n他们要等待充足的战机，在合适的时机加入军队。{w}\n豪尔把手搭在达梅克肩上，轻轻点了点头。"

# game/script.rpy:101740
translate chinese map295_95a953cf:

    # voice "se/z02755.ogg"
    # char_howl "Damek — it is time."
    voice "se/z02755.ogg"
    char_howl "达梅克——时候到了。"

# game/script.rpy:101755
translate chinese map295_6842a131:

    # "In response, he gulps, and looks up at Howl."
    "他咽了口唾沫，抬头望向豪尔。"

# game/script.rpy:101780
translate chinese map295_afccaff2:

    # voice "se/z02756b.ogg"
    # char_damek "Yeah. This is it."
    voice "se/z02756b.ogg"
    char_damek "是啊。就是现在。"

# game/script.rpy:101795
translate chinese map295_df776783:

    # "He catches a bunch of falling ash in his hand.{w}\nAfter looking at it for a moment, he crushes it in a fist."
    "他伸手接住一把飘落的灰烬。{w}\n看了一会儿后，他把它攥进拳里。"

# game/script.rpy:101820
translate chinese map295_8912715b:

    # voice "se/z02757b.ogg"
    # char_damek "Charge!"
    voice "se/z02757b.ogg"
    char_damek "冲锋！"

# game/script.rpy:101847
translate chinese map295_f76ecf3e:

    # "And mere seconds later — they were lost in the crowd."
    "仅仅几秒后——他们就消失在人群中。"

# game/script.rpy:101880
translate chinese map296_fe880054:

    # "We arrive at what seems to be the summit of the Mountain Pass.{w}\nThough we took the long way around, I could still hear fighting in Balteus.{w}\nSwords clashing against swords, and the screaming of agony found only in war."
    "我们抵达了似乎是山道的最高处。{w}\n虽然我们绕了远路，我仍能听见巴尔泰乌斯那边的厮杀。{w}\n剑与剑的碰撞，还有唯有战争中才有的痛苦惨叫。"

# game/script.rpy:101885
translate chinese map296_13e9afae:

    # "We all spread out as soon as we arrive in the same spot.{w}\nI was a bit ahead of everyone else, so I let them catch up.{w}\nWhen they do, Sovy decides to approach me for a chat."
    "一到同一处，我们就四下散开。{w}\n我比其他人稍稍靠前，便让他们赶上来。{w}\n等他们跟上，索维决定过来找我聊聊。"

# game/script.rpy:101910
translate chinese map296_e402d188:

    # voice "se/sovy35.ogg"
    voice "se/sovy35.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:101912
translate chinese map296_66211b28:

    # char_sovy "We're almost there. It won't be much longer.\nAs soon as we turn the next corner, you'll see the castle.\nThis is probably the best place for Fortaime to leave our side."
    char_sovy "我们就快到了。不会太久了。\n一转过下一个拐角，你就能看到城堡。\n这里大概就是福泰姆离队的最佳地点。"

# game/script.rpy:101925
translate chinese map296_3aa0277b:

    # voice "se/sovy36.ogg"
    # char_sovy "I know his task is dangerous, but I'm sure he'll be fine.\nI've heard nothing but good things about his ability to climb.\nI'm more worried about what will happen to us in the castle."
    voice "se/sovy36.ogg"
    char_sovy "我知道他的任务很危险，但我相信他会没事的。\n关于他的攀爬本领，我听到的全是好话。\n我更担心的是我们进了城堡后会怎样。"

# game/script.rpy:101940
translate chinese map296_07375e19:

    # "I shrug. There was really no way to know.{w}\nHopefully, Pro was able to cause his distraction."
    "我耸耸肩。实在无从得知。{w}\n但愿普洛成功制造了混乱。"

# game/script.rpy:101965
translate chinese map296_7b846521:

    # voice "se/sovy37.ogg"
    # char_sovy "I normally hate relying on others, you know.\nIn a bind, I can only really count on my own skills.\nBut you and your friends have started to change my mind."
    voice "se/sovy37.ogg"
    char_sovy "你知道，我平时很讨厌依赖别人。\n陷入困境时，我真正能依靠的只有自己的本事。\n但你和你朋友开始改变我的想法。"

# game/script.rpy:101979
translate chinese map296_00edcb42:

    # voice "se/sovy38.ogg"
    # char_sovy "We're pressed for time, so I won't draw this out any longer.\nJust know that I'll have your back in there, as I'm sure you'll have mine.\nIf we make it through this unscathed, I'll know it was a team effort."
    voice "se/sovy38.ogg"
    char_sovy "我们时间紧迫，所以我就不多说了。\n你只要知道，到里面我会护着你的后背，我相信你也会护着我。\n如果我们能毫发无伤地挺过这一关，我就知道这是大家齐心协力的结果。"

# game/script.rpy:102001
translate chinese map296_438d3876:

    # "I nod, as Sovy turns away and starts to look around the area.{w}\nIt appears like he's been here before, and finds great comfort in it.{w}\nA few seconds later, my attention is diverted toward an ecstatic Fortaime."
    "我点头，索维转过身，开始打量这一带。{w}\n看来他以前来过这里，并在这里找到了极大的慰藉。{w}\n几秒后，我的注意力被欣喜若狂的福泰姆吸引过去。"

# game/script.rpy:102006
translate chinese map296_35da0e1b:

    # "We all spread out as soon as we arrive in the same spot.{w}\nI was a bit ahead of everyone else, so I let them catch up.{w}\nWhen they do, Fortaime seems lost in awe at everything."
    "一到同一处，我们就四下散开。{w}\n我比其他人稍稍靠前，便让他们赶上来。{w}\n等他们跟上，福泰姆似乎看什么都惊叹不已。"

# game/script.rpy:102031
translate chinese map296_9fe8507a:

    # voice "se/z02762.ogg"
    voice "se/z02762.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:102033
translate chinese map296_93616d09:

    # char_fortaime "Whoa, this is so cool!\nThat statue — I've never seen anything like it.\nUlric, what is it? Do you have any idea?"
    char_fortaime "哇，这太酷了！\n那座雕像——我从没见过那样的东西。\n乌尔里克，那是什么？你知道吗？"

# game/script.rpy:102047
translate chinese map296_b9ad4b3d:

    # "Ulric turns to face the large, intimidating statue."
    "乌尔里克转头看向那座巨大而令人生畏的雕像。"

# game/script.rpy:102072
translate chinese map296_0093cf2c:

    # voice "se/z02763.ogg"
    voice "se/z02763.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:102074
translate chinese map296_b8b363b6:

    # char_ulric "Yeah. Alestia wasn't always fully mapped out.\nThis is an artist's depiction of the draconic people.\nAt least, a depiction made in fright, during first contact."
    char_ulric "知道。阿莱斯蒂亚并非一直都有完整的地图。\n这是艺术家对龙族的描画。\n至少，是初次接触时出于恐惧所作的描画。"

# game/script.rpy:102099
translate chinese map296_2cc34504:

    # voice "se/z02764b.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "First contact...?"
    voice "se/z02764b.ogg"
    char_fortaime "初次接触……？"

# game/script.rpy:102125
translate chinese map296_846494c6:

    # voice "se/z02765.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Imagine being the first mainlander to arrive in Alarinthia.\nThe people there reacted with hostility, attacking almost instantly.\nHe was an unlucky man, and he fled almost as quickly as he got there."
    voice "se/z02765.ogg"
    char_ulric "想象一下，作为第一个抵达阿拉林西亚的大陆人。\n那里的人反应充满敌意，几乎立刻就发动了攻击。\n他是个倒霉的人，刚一到就几乎立刻逃走了。"

# game/script.rpy:102151
translate chinese map296_816583d5:

    # voice "se/z02765b.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "That sounds awful."
    voice "se/z02765b.ogg"
    char_fortaime "听起来太糟了。"

# game/script.rpy:102177
translate chinese map296_d97c9aef:

    # voice "se/z02766.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Yeah. When he got back to Mazeo, he told everyone his story.\nBut his account wasn't right. Fear can warp anything you see.\nEven when he was proven wrong, the design still stuck."
    voice "se/z02766.ogg"
    char_ulric "是啊。他回到马泽奥后，把自己的经历讲给所有人听。\n但他的叙述并不准确。恐惧会扭曲你所看到的一切。\n即便后来证明他错了，那个形象仍然流传了下来。"

# game/script.rpy:102181
translate chinese map296_c9b05026:

    # voice "se/z02767.ogg"
    # char_ulric "They're often used to scare away potential visitors.\nSo it makes perfect sense that there'd be one in a place like this.\nIt's guarding a shortcut that leads right to The Triumvirate's home."
    voice "se/z02767.ogg"
    char_ulric "它们常被用来吓退潜在的访客。\n所以在这样的地方有一座，也就完全说得通了。\n它守着的是一条直通三人执政团居所的捷径。"

# game/script.rpy:102207
translate chinese map296_91f78917:

    # voice "se/z02768.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "Well, it's not gonna scare {i}me{/i} away.\nI have the most important task of all."
    voice "se/z02768.ogg"
    char_fortaime "好吧，它可吓不走{i}我{/i}。\n我肩负着最重要的任务呢。"

# game/script.rpy:102234
translate chinese map296_7890a622:

    # "Ulric nods, as Fortaime quickly walks over toward me.{w}\nI can tell that he's frightened, but he looks hopeful as well."
    "乌尔里克点头，福泰姆很快朝我走来。{w}\n我能看出他害怕，但同时也满怀希望。"

# game/script.rpy:102260
translate chinese map296_b363a51c:

    # voice "se/z02769b.ogg"
    voice "se/z02769b.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:102262
translate chinese map296_31977705:

    # char_fortaime "I promise you — I'll make it through this!\nYou better be in that atrium waiting for me.\nNo way we're failing {i}now{/i}. This is the end."
    char_fortaime "我向你保证——我一定能挺过这一关！\n你最好在中庭等着我。\n我们绝不可能{i}现在{/i}失败。这是终局了。"

# game/script.rpy:102276
translate chinese map296_b5881e09:

    # "I nod, and a moment later, we're locked in a tight embrace."
    "我点头，片刻后，我们紧紧相拥。"

# game/script.rpy:102301
translate chinese map296_fbdc3942:

    # voice "se/z02770b.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "Never forget that I love you, [firstname].\nEven if all else seems lost — that will never change.\nWhatever happens next, we'll handle it as a team."
    voice "se/z02770b.ogg"
    char_fortaime "永远别忘了，我爱你，[firstname]。\n就算一切都似乎失去了——这一点也永远不会变。\n接下来无论发生什么，我们都一起面对。"

# game/script.rpy:102316
translate chinese map296_2d5d9f5b:

    # "We kiss, perhaps, for the last time."
    "我们亲吻，也许，这是最后一次。"

# game/script.rpy:102321
translate chinese map296_b363a51c_1:

    # voice "se/z02769b.ogg"
    voice "se/z02769b.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:102323
translate chinese map296_31977705_1:

    # char_fortaime "I promise you — I'll make it through this!\nYou better be in that atrium waiting for me.\nNo way we're failing {i}now{/i}. This is the end."
    char_fortaime "我向你保证——我一定能挺过这一关！\n你最好在中庭等着我。\n我们绝不可能{i}现在{/i}失败。这是终局了。"

# game/script.rpy:102337
translate chinese map296_73567d6d:

    # "We give each other a quick hug. Perhaps our last hug.{w}\nHe looks around, and shakes his head with a loud sigh."
    "我们匆匆拥抱了一下。也许是我们最后一次拥抱。{w}\n他环顾四周，摇了摇头，长叹一声。"

# game/script.rpy:102363
translate chinese map296_01103614:

    # voice "se/z02772b.ogg"
    voice "se/z02772b.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:102365
translate chinese map296_22dc7193:

    # char_fortaime "Well, I guess I should get going.\nI need to take a different path than the rest of you.\nI'm not used to being on my own, but I'll manage."
    char_fortaime "好吧，我想我该走了。\n我得走一条和你们其他人不同的路。\n我不习惯独自一人，但我会应付得来。"

# game/script.rpy:102386
translate chinese map296_7e84315b:

    # "Before he heads out, he hugs Valessa.{w}\nThey share a few words together, and then he's off on his way.{w}\nHis path would lead to the tower, while ours would lead directly inside."
    "出发前，他拥抱了瓦莱莎。{w}\n他们一起说了几句话，然后他就上路了。{w}\n他的路通向那座塔楼，而我们的则直通城堡内部。"

# game/script.rpy:102411
translate chinese map296_52520564:

    # voice "se/z02773b.ogg"
    voice "se/z02773b.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:102413
translate chinese map296_de77a7c7:

    # char_valessa "I guess we should go, too.\nThe sound of all that fighting is really scaring me.\nOne side has to be winning — but which one is it...?"
    char_valessa "我想我们也该走了。\n那一片厮杀声真让我害怕。\n总有一方在赢——可到底是哪一方……？"

# game/script.rpy:102438
translate chinese map296_80635c58:

    # voice "se/z02774.ogg"
    voice "se/z02774.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:102440
translate chinese map296_15a119d1:

    # char_ulric "It's best not to pay it any mind. \nWe have our own task, Valessa."
    char_ulric "最好别去理会它。\n我们有我们自己的任务，瓦莱莎。"

# game/script.rpy:102465
translate chinese map296_39c56201:

    # voice "se/z02775b.ogg"
    # char_valessa "Right, of course.\nWant to lead the way?"
    voice "se/z02775b.ogg"
    char_valessa "对，当然。\n要带路吗？"

# game/script.rpy:102487
translate chinese map296_3e20cd51:

    # "He nods, and then starts walking away from us.{w}\nWe gather together, and follow him close behind."
    "他点头，然后开始从我们身边走开。{w}\n我们聚到一起，紧跟在他身后。"

# game/script.rpy:102514
translate chinese map296_ff97b06c:

    # voice "se/z02777b.ogg"
    voice "se/z02777b.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:102516
translate chinese map296_8638fc5a:

    # char_valessa "We're going to win this — I can feel it."
    char_valessa "我们会赢的——我能感觉到。"

# game/script.rpy:102530
translate chinese map296_574a46c9:

    # "She smiles, and offers me her hand.{w}\nI grab it, and hold it as we follow Ulric."
    "她微笑着，向我伸出手。{w}\n我握住她的手，跟着乌尔里克前行。"

# game/script.rpy:102535
translate chinese map296_ff97b06c_1:

    # voice "se/z02777b.ogg"
    voice "se/z02777b.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:102537
translate chinese map296_8638fc5a_1:

    # char_valessa "We're going to win this — I can feel it."
    char_valessa "我们会赢的——我能感觉到。"

# game/script.rpy:102558
translate chinese map296_2b614326:

    # "I pray, with every fiber of my being, that she's right.{w}\nAfter what seems like an eternity, The Triumvirate's castle comes into view.{w}\nI've never been more terrified in my life. The end was finally within reach."
    "我发自肺腑地祈祷她是对的。{w}\n仿佛过了永恒那么久，三人执政团的城堡出现在视野中。{w}\n我一生中从未如此恐惧。终局终于近在眼前。"

# game/script.rpy:102591
translate chinese map297_f4dba696:

    # "The castle looks just as corrupt and decaying as everything else.{w}\nAlmost even moreso — like it could be the source of all this death.{w}\nAs we get closer, I look all over the exterior. Then, I see Fortaime."
    "那座城堡看起来和其他一切一样腐败、破败。{w}\n甚至更甚——仿佛它正是这一切死亡的源头。{w}\n走近时，我打量着城堡的外墙。然后，我看见了福泰姆。"

# game/script.rpy:102593
translate chinese map297_c9149629:

    # "He's climbing the tower, just as directed. It's a sight to behold.{w}\nIf he could get to that belltower, then the war would surely be ours.{w}\nBut I see him struggling. This castle was clearly his hardest climb."
    "他正按指示攀爬那座塔。那景象令人叹为观止。{w}\n只要他能到达那座钟楼，这场战争就必定是我们的。{w}\n但我看到他挣扎着。这座城堡显然是他最难爬的一座。"

# game/script.rpy:102595
translate chinese map297_db703bae:

    # "With no safety nets, any slip up would be fatal.{w}\nI try not to think about it as we arrive at the bridge to the castle.{w}\nMuch to our dismay — the bridge is completely covered in suits of armor."
    "没有任何安全防护，任何失足都会致命。{w}\n我们抵达通往城堡的桥时，我尽量不去想这件事。{w}\n令我们沮丧的是——桥上密密麻麻全是盔甲。"

# game/script.rpy:102600
translate chinese map297_d06ec53b:

    # "They turn to face us as soon as we approach.{w}\nA few seconds later, they start to march toward us.{w}\nThey're slow. Our presence took some time to register."
    "我们一靠近，它们就转过头来面向我们。{w}\n几秒后，它们开始朝我们行进。{w}\n它们很慢。它们花了一点时间才察觉到我们的存在。"

# game/script.rpy:102602
translate chinese map297_c5f1c3b7:

    # "Normally, I'd be confident. These things are easy to slay.{w}\nBut this was a veritable horde. Hundreds, maybe even a thousand.{w}\nIt must've been another group en route to the burning Grand Library."
    "平时我会很自信。这些东西很容易斩杀。{w}\n但这可是一支名副其实的大军。数百，甚至上千。{w}\n这一定是另一队正赶往燃烧的大图书馆的。"

# game/script.rpy:102630
translate chinese map297_1f468771:

    # voice "se/z02778.ogg"
    voice "se/z02778.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:102632
translate chinese map297_5a0d1373:

    # char_ulric "Stay behind me. We can use this bridge to our benefit.\nThey can't get around us, or sneak up from behind.\nIt's almost like a funnel. This should be easy."
    char_ulric "待在我身后。我们可以利用这座桥。\n它们没法绕过我们，也没法从背后偷袭。\n这几乎就像一个漏斗。应该很容易。"

# game/script.rpy:102649
translate chinese map297_9856d3f3:

    # "Me and Valessa give Ulric a firm nod. Sovy stands by his side.{w}\nA moment later, in perfect unison, they both charge into the crowd.{w}\nThe Honor Guard stood no chance. Not against two former Grand Inquisitors."
    "我和瓦莱莎坚定地向乌尔里克点头。索维站在他身旁。{w}\n片刻后，两人默契十足地冲进人群。{w}\n荣誉卫队毫无胜算。对手可是两位前大审判官。"

# game/script.rpy:102651
translate chinese map297_868c201c:

    # "The suits start to crumble and fall as they fight across the bridge.{w}\nUlric's greatsword, and Sovy's fists kill almost ten or more each second.{w}\nHowever, as I look to the back — I notice a bunch of suits have bows."
    "他们一路杀过桥去，那些盔甲开始碎裂倒下。{w}\n乌尔里克的巨剑和索维的拳头每秒都能杀死将近十个甚至更多。{w}\n然而，当我望向后方——我注意到有一群盔甲拿着弓。"

# game/script.rpy:102653
translate chinese map297_342ff2ee:

    # "I shout out to Ulric and Sovy, letting them know of the danger."
    "我朝乌尔里克和索维大喊，提醒他们危险。"

# game/script.rpy:102658
translate chinese map297_ead8c50c:

    # "Me and Valessa give Ulric a firm nod.{w}\nA moment later, he charges into the crowd.{w}\nThey stood no chance. Ulric was too good at this."
    "我和瓦莱莎坚定地向乌尔里克点头。{w}\n片刻后，他冲进人群。{w}\n它们毫无胜算。乌尔里克太擅长这个了。"

# game/script.rpy:102660
translate chinese map297_49f0eecb:

    # "The suits start to crumble and fall apart as he crosses the bridge.{w}\nWide swings of his greatsword take out almost ten at a time.{w}\nBut I notice a large portion of the horde at the back has bows."
    "他穿过桥时，那些盔甲开始碎裂、崩塌。{w}\n他巨剑一挥横扫，一次就能撂倒将近十个。{w}\n但我注意到后方很大一部分追兵拿着弓。"

# game/script.rpy:102662
translate chinese map297_4e1e2840:

    # "I shout out to him, letting him know of the danger."
    "我朝他大喊，提醒他危险。"

# game/script.rpy:102688
translate chinese map297_35618fce:

    # voice "se/z02779.ogg"
    voice "se/z02779.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:102690
translate chinese map297_a40d54dd:

    # char_ulric "I know — but don't worry, these things have bad aim.\nJust grab one of those suits and use them as a shield.\nThey'll wear out their numbers by killing their own."
    char_ulric "我知道——但别担心，这些东西准头很差。\n抓一个那些盔甲当盾牌就行。\n它们会用自己的命来消耗自己的数量。"

# game/script.rpy:102707
translate chinese map297_b592b7b2:

    # "I suppose that's a good strategy.{w}\nAfter I unsheathe The Blade of Exodus, I step forward.{w}\nMy goal is to find a good opening, so I can hop in and assist them."
    "这策略倒是不错。{w}\n我拔出放逐之刃后，向前迈步。{w}\n我的目标是找机会，好插进去支援他们。"

# game/script.rpy:102709
translate chinese map297_4f33ad1c:

    # "But no such opening comes. They slay with unmatched expertise.{w}\nThe two fight side by side, as if they're one entity. Perfect synergy.{w}\nMe and Valessa notice the archers at the back prepare to shoot."
    "但并没有这样的机会出现。他们以无与伦比的技艺斩杀着。{w}\n两人并肩作战，仿佛浑然一体。配合天衣无缝。{w}\n我和瓦莱莎注意到后方的弓箭手准备射击。"

# game/script.rpy:102714
translate chinese map297_d90bfdd0:

    # "I suppose that's a good strategy.{w}\nAfter I unsheathe The Blade of Exodus, I step forward.{w}\nMy goal is to find a good opening, so I can hop in and assist Ulric."
    "这策略倒是不错。{w}\n我拔出放逐之刃后，向前迈步。{w}\n我的目标是找机会，好插进去支援乌尔里克。"

# game/script.rpy:102716
translate chinese map297_47aa8e83:

    # "But no such opening comes. He's slaying them with unseen expertise.{w}\nMe and Valessa notice the archers at the back prepare to shoot."
    "但并没有这样的机会出现。他正以惊人的技艺斩杀着它们。{w}\n我和瓦莱莎注意到后方的弓箭手准备射击。"

# game/script.rpy:102741
translate chinese map297_6bd21551:

    # voice "se/z02780b.ogg"
    voice "se/z02780b.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:102743
translate chinese map297_3cc8c4c8:

    # char_valessa "Quick — grab one...!"
    char_valessa "快——抓一个……！"

# game/script.rpy:102757
translate chinese map297_7ad75674:

    # "We both rush forward, and each disarm one of the enemies.{w}\nWith no means to fight us back, we hold them in place.{w}\nAny arrows coming our way would hit them first."
    "我们两人一起冲上前，各自缴了一个敌人的械。{w}\n它们无法反击，被我们制在原地。{w}\n任何射向我们的箭都会先射中它们。"

# game/script.rpy:102759
translate chinese map297_4d156b84:

    # "A perfect plan — if that's actually what the archers were planning.{w}\nMuch to our shock, as the chaos on the bridge unfolds, they turn around.{w}\nThey're no longer aiming in our direction. They're aiming straight for Fortaime!"
    "完美的计划——如果那真是弓箭手们的打算的话。{w}\n令我们震惊的是，当桥上的混乱展开时，它们转过身去。{w}\n它们不再瞄准我们这个方向。它们径直瞄准了福泰姆！"

# game/script.rpy:102774
translate chinese map297_c9b2d3d8:

    # voice "se/z02781.ogg"
    # char_valessa "Fortaime! Look out!"
    voice "se/z02781.ogg"
    char_valessa "福泰姆！小心！"

# game/script.rpy:102789
translate chinese map297_72e8d0db:

    # "Her calls fall upon deaf ears. He was too far away to hear.{w}\nThere was no way for any of us to prevent what happened next.{w}\nThey let their arrows fly. Some miss, but one pierces Fortaime's side."
    "她的呼喊落进了聋子的耳朵。他离得太远，听不见。{w}\n我们谁也无法阻止接下来发生的事。{w}\n它们放箭了。有些射偏了，但有一支射穿了福泰姆的侧身。"

# game/script.rpy:102791
translate chinese map297_daba06b5:

    # "He immediately starts to lose his grip, and it appears that he may fall off.{w}\nThere's nothing we could do. We can't call out to him, or get up there to help.{w}\nI have to do something quickly! They're preparing to shoot at him again...!"
    "他立刻开始抓不稳，看来可能会摔下来。{w}\n我们无能为力。我们既喊不到他，也上不去帮他。{w}\n我得赶快做点什么！它们正准备再次朝他射箭……！"

# game/script.rpy:102806
translate chinese map297_748f221e:

    # voice "se/z02782b.ogg"
    # char_valessa "Quick — run along the side of the bridge!\nIt should be wide enough to use as a path.\nGet back there, and take out those archers!"
    voice "se/z02782b.ogg"
    char_valessa "快——沿着桥的侧面跑过去！\n那里应该够宽，能当路走。\n绕到后面去，干掉那些弓箭手！"

# game/script.rpy:102824
translate chinese map297_a721f75d:

    # "I don't take her suggestion to heart. I have my own idea.{w}\nRunning forward, and pushing Ulric and Sovy out of the way, I ready my sword.{w}\nThey'd pay for hurting my friend. Every single one of them would pay...!"
    "我没把她的建议放在心上。我有自己的主意。{w}\n我冲上前去，把乌尔里克和索维推开，举起我的剑。{w}\n它们伤害我的朋友，必须付出代价。它们每一个都得付出代价……！"

# game/script.rpy:102829
translate chinese map297_df9052f8:

    # "I don't take her suggestion to heart. I have my own idea.{w}\nRunning forward, and pushing Ulric out of the way, I ready my sword.{w}\nThey'd pay for hurting my friend. Every single one of them would pay...!"
    "我没把她的建议放在心上。我有自己的主意。{w}\n我冲上前去，把乌尔里克推开，举起我的剑。{w}\n它们伤害我的朋友，必须付出代价。它们每一个都得付出代价……！"

# game/script.rpy:102833
translate chinese map297_e57f0456:

    # "I thrust the blade through one of the suits, then look over at Fortaime.{w}\nHe looks so weak, and delirious. Moments later, he falls from the tower.{w}\nThat sight alone is enough to fill me with more rage than I've ever felt before."
    "我把剑刺穿其中一具盔甲，然后望向福泰姆。{w}\n他看起来那么虚弱、神志不清。片刻后，他从塔上坠落。{w}\n仅这一幕，就足以让我心中充满前所未有的怒火。"

# game/script.rpy:102835
translate chinese map297_313e664a:

    # "Activating the blade, that familiar flash of white light blinds all of us.{w}\nI can hear my allies struggling, as if they're still fighting while blinded.{w}\nBut a few seconds later, I hear nothing but the shattering of every suit of armor."
    "激活剑的力量，那道熟悉的白光刺得我们都睁不开眼。{w}\n我能听见同伴们在挣扎，仿佛他们仍在目不能视的情况下战斗。{w}\n但几秒后，我听到的只有每一具盔甲碎裂的声音。"

# game/script.rpy:102837
translate chinese map297_728b8740:

    # "As the light subsides, we're greeted to the sight of victory.{w}\nEvery member of The Honor Guard on the bridge was dead.{w}\nI absorbed them into the blade — making it even stronger."
    "光芒消退，迎接我们的是胜利的景象。{w}\n桥上每一个荣誉卫队成员都死了。{w}\n我把它们吸入了剑中——让它变得更加强大。"

# game/script.rpy:102862
translate chinese map297_d10214bf:

    # voice "se/z02775.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Huh...?"
    voice "se/z02775.ogg"
    char_ulric "咦……？"

# game/script.rpy:102888
translate chinese map297_166b14c3:

    # voice "se/z02784.ogg"
    # char_valessa "[firstname]...? Did you do that?"
    voice "se/z02784.ogg"
    char_valessa "[firstname]……？是你干的吗？"

# game/script.rpy:102903
translate chinese map297_a1245a35:

    # "I nod. I tell them I used the emotion inside of me as a catalyst.{w}\nThe emotion from seeing Fortaime fall, perhaps to his death.{w}\nAs we glance over to the tower though — I see that I was wrong."
    "我点头。我告诉他们，我把自己内心的情绪当作催化剂。{w}\n那是看到福泰姆坠落、也许就此丧命时产生的情绪。{w}\n然而当我们望向塔楼时——我发现我错了。"

# game/script.rpy:102905
translate chinese map297_e285aa6d:

    # "He holds on to the edge of a window, and struggles to climb inside.{w}\nSo he {i}wanted{/i} to drop. To fall to a window, and get inside to safety.{w}\nI can see that his clothes are covered in blood from the arrow wound."
    "他抓住一扇窗户的边缘，挣扎着爬进去。{w}\n所以他{i}是故意{/i}跳下来的。跳到一扇窗边，然后爬进里面安全的地方。{w}\n我能看到，他衣服上沾满了箭伤流出的血。"

# game/script.rpy:102907
translate chinese map297_dcce55ff:

    # "Eventually, he makes it inside, and we're all relieved.{w}\nFor a few seconds there, it seemed like all hope was lost."
    "最终，他成功进去了，我们都松了口气。{w}\n那几秒钟里，仿佛一切希望都破灭了。"

# game/script.rpy:102932
translate chinese map297_23e4f0de:

    # voice "se/z02785.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Thanks for stepping in like that.\nMy sword arm was starting to get a little tired.\nCome on, let's get going. We don't have much time."
    voice "se/z02785.ogg"
    char_ulric "谢谢你那样出手相助。\n我这条使剑的手臂都有点累了。\n来吧，我们走。时间不多了。"

# game/script.rpy:102950
translate chinese map297_7ab8e60a:

    # "Me, Sovy, and Ulric smile at one another.{w}\nValessa however, has a look of shock on her face."
    "我、索维和乌尔里克相视而笑。{w}\n然而瓦莱莎脸上却是一副震惊的神情。"

# game/script.rpy:102955
translate chinese map297_384f5910:

    # "Ulric and I smile at one another.{w}\nValessa however, has a look of shock on her face."
    "我和乌尔里克相视而笑。{w}\n然而瓦莱莎脸上却是一副震惊的神情。"

# game/script.rpy:102981
translate chinese map297_9a992544:

    # voice "se/z02786b.ogg"
    voice "se/z02786b.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:102983
translate chinese map297_b63a755d:

    # char_valessa "Oh no..."
    char_valessa "哦不……"

# game/script.rpy:103007
translate chinese map297_5e6a5454:

    # "We turn to face the same direction as her.{w}\nShe's looking back, toward the Town Square, and the bulk of the battle.{w}\nAnother horde is marching in our direction, likely attracted by the light."
    "我们朝她望的方向转过头去。{w}\n她正回望着城镇广场，以及战斗最激烈的地方。{w}\n又一大群追兵正朝我们行进，多半是被那道光吸引来的。"

# game/script.rpy:103032
translate chinese map297_becc1574:

    # voice "se/z02787.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Just our luck."
    voice "se/z02787.ogg"
    char_ulric "真是我们的运气。"

# game/script.rpy:103055
translate chinese map297_0ab23234:

    # "We all ready our weapons."
    "我们都准备好了武器。"

# game/script.rpy:103060
translate chinese map297_da0fe877:

    # "Ulric readies his sword."
    "乌尔里克准备好了他的剑。"

# game/script.rpy:103079
translate chinese map298_ca573237:

    # "We watch them walk toward us in unison.{w}\nAn unease fills the air. I doubt I could deactivate {i}all{/i} of them.{w}\nI only did that thanks to the surge of emotion from seeing Fortaime shot."
    "我们看着它们步伐一致地朝我们走来。{w}\n空气中弥漫着不安。我怀疑自己无法让{i}所有{/i}它们都停下。{w}\n我之所以能做到，只是靠看到福泰姆中箭时那股情绪爆发而已。"

# game/script.rpy:103081
translate chinese map298_e5d44d71:

    # "It wouldn't be right for me to rely on something like that yet again.{w}\nPart of me wonders if we should flee inside and fight them off in the castle.{w}\nBut we had no idea what awaited us inside, or if Pro was even successful."
    "我不该再一次依赖那样的东西。{w}\n我有一部分在想，我们是否该躲进去，在城堡里击退它们。{w}\n但我们不知道里面等着我们的是什么，也不知道普洛是否成功了。"

# game/script.rpy:103083
translate chinese map298_8b93d242:

    # "Valessa steps forward, standing in front of us.{w}\nShe trembles, perhaps terrified of what's to come."
    "瓦莱莎上前一步，站在我们面前。{w}\n她颤抖着，也许是害怕即将到来的一切。"

# game/script.rpy:103108
translate chinese map298_ddfd7a28:

    # voice "se/z02788b.ogg"
    voice "se/z02788b.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:103110
translate chinese map298_2ed86f53:

    # char_valessa "You need to go."
    char_valessa "你们得走。"

# game/script.rpy:103136
translate chinese map298_209f1786:

    # voice "se/sovy39.ogg"
    voice "se/sovy39.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:103138
translate chinese map298_4f3ce9eb:

    # char_sovy "What are you talking about...?"
    char_sovy "你在说什么……？"

# game/script.rpy:103163
translate chinese map298_8d8a11cc:

    # voice "se/z02790b.ogg"
    # char_valessa "I said you need to go. Get inside the castle!\nHelp Fortaime, kill The Triumvirate — just do it!\nLet me keep them occupied. I'll fight them off."
    voice "se/z02790b.ogg"
    char_valessa "我说了你们得走。进城堡里去！\n去帮福泰姆，去杀三人执政团——快去做！\n让我拖住它们。我来击退它们。"

# game/script.rpy:103189
translate chinese map298_f711403e:

    # voice "se/sovy40.ogg"
    # char_sovy "Valessa, that's suicide."
    voice "se/sovy40.ogg"
    char_sovy "瓦莱莎，那是自杀。"

# game/script.rpy:103215
translate chinese map298_959775b3:

    # voice "se/z02792b.ogg"
    # char_valessa "We don't have any other option.\n[firstname] {i}needs{/i} you and Ulric."
    voice "se/z02792b.ogg"
    char_valessa "我们别无选择。\n[firstname]{i}需要{/i}你和乌尔里克。"

# game/script.rpy:103241
translate chinese map298_82029017:

    # voice "se/sovy41.ogg"
    # char_sovy "No — {i}I'll{/i} stay and fight.\nI know how those things work."
    voice "se/sovy41.ogg"
    char_sovy "不——{i}我{/i}留下来打。\n我知道那些东西是怎么回事。"

# game/script.rpy:103267
translate chinese map298_11268e66:

    # voice "se/z02794b.ogg"
    # char_valessa "This isn't up for debate.\nYou need to go. Now."
    voice "se/z02794b.ogg"
    char_valessa "这没得商量。\n你们得走。马上。"

# game/script.rpy:103282
translate chinese map298_653bc4a2:

    # "Sovy backs down, realizing there's no point.{w}\nEach second needed to be filled with action, not inaction.{w}\nIf we wasted time, we'd just hand victory over to the enemy."
    "索维退让了，意识到争论没有意义。{w}\n每一秒都必须用行动来填充，而不是空耗。{w}\n如果我们浪费时间，就等于把胜利拱手让给敌人。"

# game/script.rpy:103308
translate chinese map298_f0b5d12f:

    # voice "se/z02795.ogg"
    voice "se/z02795.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:103310
translate chinese map298_6590f77d:

    # char_ulric "What are you talking about...?"
    char_ulric "你在说什么……？"

# game/script.rpy:103335
translate chinese map298_8d8a11cc_1:

    # voice "se/z02790b.ogg"
    # char_valessa "I said you need to go. Get inside the castle!\nHelp Fortaime, kill The Triumvirate — just do it!\nLet me keep them occupied. I'll fight them off."
    voice "se/z02790b.ogg"
    char_valessa "我说了你们得走。进城堡里去！\n去帮福泰姆，去杀三人执政团——快去做！\n让我拖住它们。我来击退它们。"

# game/script.rpy:103361
translate chinese map298_4b41615c:

    # voice "se/z02797.ogg"
    # char_ulric "I can't let you throw your life away, Valessa."
    voice "se/z02797.ogg"
    char_ulric "我不能让你白白送命，瓦莱莎。"

# game/script.rpy:103387
translate chinese map298_5c2b5812:

    # voice "se/z02798b.ogg"
    # char_valessa "We don't have any other option.\n[firstname] needs you in there, Ulric.\nRight now — I'm the only expendable one."
    voice "se/z02798b.ogg"
    char_valessa "我们别无选择。\n[firstname]需要你在里面，乌尔里克。\n眼下——只有我是可以被牺牲的那个。"

# game/script.rpy:103413
translate chinese map298_188d4aa9:

    # voice "se/z02799.ogg"
    # char_ulric "No. You're not expendable. We need you.\nLet me stay and fight, I know how those things work.\nIf you give me some time, I can take them all down."
    voice "se/z02799.ogg"
    char_ulric "不。你不是可以被牺牲的。我们需要你。\n让我留下来打，我知道那些东西是怎么回事。\n给我点时间，我能把它们全都解决。"

# game/script.rpy:103439
translate chinese map298_45829364:

    # voice "se/z02800b.ogg"
    # char_valessa "This isn't up for debate. Sorry.\nYou need to go — and fast."
    voice "se/z02800b.ogg"
    char_valessa "这没得商量。抱歉。\n你们得走——而且要快。"

# game/script.rpy:103454
translate chinese map298_b8f9cc63:

    # "Ulric backs down, realizing there's no point.{w}\nEach second needed to be filled with action, not inaction.{w}\nIf we wasted time, we'd just hand victory over to the enemy."
    "乌尔里克退让了，意识到争论没有意义。{w}\n每一秒都必须用行动来填充，而不是空耗。{w}\n如果我们浪费时间，就等于把胜利拱手让给敌人。"

# game/script.rpy:103464
translate chinese map298_75690df0:

    # "Valessa pulls out her Mother's daggers with a gulp.{w}\nI guess taking them from Mazeo was a good idea after all.{w}\nMy mind tells me to talk her out of this, but I say nothing."
    "瓦莱莎咽了口唾沫，拔出她母亲的匕首。{w}\n看来从马泽奥把它们带出来，终究是个好主意。{w}\n我理智上想劝她别这样，却什么也没说。"

# game/script.rpy:103469
translate chinese map298_23707f7f:

    # "Valessa crouches down and picks up an enemy's sword.{w}\nShe swings it a few times, testing its weight, and then nods.{w}\nMy mind tells me to talk her out of this, but I say nothing."
    "瓦莱莎蹲下，捡起一把敌人的剑。{w}\n她挥舞了几下，试试分量，然后点点头。{w}\n我理智上想劝她别这样，却什么也没说。"

# game/script.rpy:103473
translate chinese map298_00db59f7:

    # "If she fought hard enough, she'd be able to survive.{w}\nThose suits are weak, and mindless. I feel like she'd be okay.{w}\nI justify her choice in my mind, perhaps because I know it's inevitable."
    "只要她拼得够狠，就能活下来。{w}\n那些盔甲既弱又没脑子。我觉得她会没事的。{w}\n我在心里为她的选择找理由，也许是因为我知道这已无法避免。"

# game/script.rpy:103481
translate chinese map298_62a77c32:

    # "She wraps her arms around me and gives me a tight hug.{w}\nI return it, and then she looks up at me, and kisses my lips.{w}\nAfter teling her that I love her, I tell her to stay safe, and survive."
    "她张开双臂，紧紧抱住我。{w}\n我也回抱她，然后她抬头看着我，吻上我的唇。{w}\n我告诉她我爱她，然后让她注意安全，活下去。"

# game/script.rpy:103506
translate chinese map298_3fa7214d:

    # voice "se/z02801b.ogg"
    # char_valessa "Is that an order...?"
    voice "se/z02801b.ogg"
    char_valessa "这是命令吗……？"

# game/script.rpy:103521
translate chinese map298_b631dada:

    # "Yeah."
    "是啊。"

# game/script.rpy:103546
translate chinese map298_72cccf33:

    # voice "se/z02802b.ogg"
    # char_valessa "Then I guess I have no choice.\nI love you, [firstname]. Never forget that.\nI'll see you in the atrium when this is all over."
    voice "se/z02802b.ogg"
    char_valessa "那我大概别无选择了。\n我爱你，[firstname]。永远别忘了。\n等这一切结束后，我们在中庭见。"

# game/script.rpy:103552
translate chinese map298_7f2e273f:

    # "She wraps her arms around me, and gives me a tight hug.{w}\nI know that this may be the last time we see each other, and it hurts.{w}\nWe've come so far since our time in Valinorth; and changed so much."
    "她张开双臂，紧紧抱住我。{w}\n我知道这也许是我们最后一次相见，这让我心痛。{w}\n自瓦利诺斯那段时光以来，我们走了这么远，也改变了这么多。"

# game/script.rpy:103577
translate chinese map298_ca239d6e:

    # voice "se/z02803b.ogg"
    # char_valessa "Thanks for everything you've done, [firstname]."
    voice "se/z02803b.ogg"
    char_valessa "谢谢你做的一切，[firstname]。"

# game/script.rpy:103592
translate chinese map298_f508867c:

    # "I tell her to stay safe, and survive.{w}\nA moment later, the tight hug is broken."
    "我让她注意安全，活下去。{w}\n片刻后，那个紧紧的拥抱松开了。"

# game/script.rpy:103617
translate chinese map298_1618c04b:

    # voice "se/z02805b.ogg"
    # char_valessa "Oh? Is that an order?"
    voice "se/z02805b.ogg"
    char_valessa "哦？这是命令吗？"

# game/script.rpy:103632
translate chinese map298_b631dada_1:

    # "Yeah."
    "是啊。"

# game/script.rpy:103657
translate chinese map298_04249319:

    # voice "se/z02806b.ogg"
    # char_valessa "Then I guess I have no choice.\nI've never disobeyed, and I'm not about to start.\nI'll meet you in the atrium after Fortaime rings that bell."
    voice "se/z02806b.ogg"
    char_valessa "那我大概别无选择了。\n我从未违抗过，也不打算现在开始。\n等福泰姆敲响那口钟后，我们在中庭见。"

# game/script.rpy:103677
translate chinese map298_f73f9c87:

    # "And a moment later, we're both off in opposite directions.{w}\nBut as we head toward the castle, I can't help but look back.{w}\nI'm both worried, and hopeful, and both sides are at war."
    "片刻后，我们各自朝着相反的方向离去。{w}\n但当我们朝城堡走去时，我忍不住回头望。{w}\n我既担忧又满怀希望，两种心情在心里交战。"

# game/script.rpy:103686
translate chinese map298_3c351d8e:

    # "I see her charge into the crowd, holding out her daggers.{w}\nThe sound of her stabbing the suits soon fills the air.{w}\nThey fall apart, and hit the ground with loud thuds."
    "我看见她举着匕首冲进人群。{w}\n她刺击那些盔甲的声音很快充斥空气。{w}\n它们崩解开来，重重地砸在地上。"

# game/script.rpy:103711
translate chinese map298_be6f8a7a:

    # voice "se/z02808b.ogg"
    # char_valessa "Come on — I could do this all day...!"
    voice "se/z02808b.ogg"
    char_valessa "来吧——我能这样打一整天……！"

# game/script.rpy:103733
translate chinese map298_c0fe0561:

    # "With a smirk on my face, I realize her victory is clear.{w}\nWe retreat into the castle, and the sight makes my jaw drop.{w}\nThe castle is hauntingly beautiful. Like nothing I've seen before."
    "我嘴角一扬，明白她的胜利已成定局。{w}\n我们退入城堡，眼前的景象让我目瞪口呆。{w}\n这座城堡美得摄人心魄。是我从未见过的样子。"

# game/script.rpy:103735
translate chinese map298_791e0c89:

    # "As we venture forward, I can only hope that Pro was successful.{w}\nThe bell hasn't rung yet, but I have the utmost faith in Fortaime's ability.{w}\nI let out a deep sigh of relief. I'm here, in their castle. This is the end."
    "我们向前深入时，我只能希望普洛成功了。{w}\n钟还没响，但我对福泰姆的能力有十足的信心。{w}\n我如释重负地长舒一口气。我到了，就在他们的城堡里。这就是终局。"

# game/script.rpy:103744
translate chinese map298_bd96676b:

    # "I see her charge into the crowd, holding out the sword.{w}\nShe starts swinging it, taking out a ton of suits with her strength.{w}\nThey fall apart, and hit the ground with loud thuds. She was doing this...!"
    "我看见她举着剑冲进人群。{w}\n她开始挥舞，凭着蛮力撂倒一大片盔甲。{w}\n它们崩解开来，重重地砸在地上。她真的做到了……！"

# game/script.rpy:103769
translate chinese map298_be6f8a7a_1:

    # voice "se/z02808b.ogg"
    # char_valessa "Come on — I could do this all day...!"
    voice "se/z02808b.ogg"
    char_valessa "来吧——我能这样打一整天……！"

# game/script.rpy:103784
translate chinese map298_af985d74:

    # "With a smirk on my face, I realize that her victory is clear.{w}\nHowever — a moment later — I'm shocked at my arrogance.{w}\nMuch like before, the rear of the horde readies some bows."
    "我嘴角一扬，明白她的胜利已成定局。{w}\n然而——片刻之后——我为自己的傲慢感到震惊。{w}\n和之前一样，那群追兵的后方架起了几把弓。"

# game/script.rpy:103786
translate chinese map298_075f7593:

    # "I had to warn her...!{w}\nI shout out, and start to run toward her.{w}\nHowever, Ulric grabs my arm, stopping me."
    "我必须提醒她……！{w}\n我大喊着，开始朝她跑去。{w}\n然而乌尔里克抓住我的手臂，拦住了我。"

# game/script.rpy:103811
translate chinese map298_eaedf973:

    # voice "se/z02709.ogg"
    voice "se/z02709.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:103813
translate chinese map298_451ce424:

    # char_ulric "We need to get inside, [firstname].\nThere's no time to waste. You have to trust her.\nShe volunteered for this. She knows what she's doing."
    char_ulric "我们得进去，[firstname]。\n没时间可浪费了。你得相信她。\n这是她自愿的。她清楚自己在做什么。"

# game/script.rpy:103839
translate chinese map298_86d873ad:

    # "I struggle some more, but his grip is far too strong.{w}\nI yield, and follow Ulric into the castle, still looking back.{w}\nThe next thing I see, will forever be etched into my mind."
    "我又挣扎了几下，但他的力气太大。{w}\n我屈服了，跟着乌尔里克进了城堡，仍不停地回头望。{w}\n接下来我看到的景象，将永远刻在我脑海里。"

# game/script.rpy:103841
translate chinese map298_f4ad42ee:

    # "The archers let their arrows loose, and several hit Valessa.{w}\nShe screams, and stumbles back, blood marring her outfit.{w}\nBut she doesn't give up. She keeps fighting, with all of her might."
    "弓箭手放出了箭，好几支射中了瓦莱莎。{w}\n她尖叫着，踉跄后退，鲜血玷污了她的衣裳。{w}\n但她没有放弃。她拼尽全力，继续战斗。"

# game/script.rpy:103843
translate chinese map298_ba5b0a35:

    # "They let their arrows loose again, and she's pierced even further.{w}\nNobody would survive such blows, but she fights on with determination.{w}\nA pool of blood gathers beneath her; and that's the last thing I see."
    "它们再次放箭，她被射得更深。{w}\n没人能挨得住这样的伤，她却仍带着决心战斗下去。{w}\n她身下积起一滩血；那是我看到的最后景象。"

# game/script.rpy:103845
translate chinese map298_82a93fd0:

    # "She may continue fighting, and buying time, but those wounds were fatal.{w}\nWe retreat fully into the castle, and the gruesome scene is soon out of view.{w}\nAnger wells up within me. Whoever opposed me next? I surely pitied them."
    "她或许还在继续战斗、争取时间，但那些伤是致命的。{w}\n我们完全退入城堡，那惨烈的一幕很快离开了视野。{w}\n怒火在我心中涌起。下一个挡在我面前的人？我肯定会为他感到可怜。"

# game/script.rpy:103877
translate chinese map300_7de70f7e:

    # "Eventually, Pro and Gryz's path lead them to a large hallway.{w}\nPlenty of open space to fight, and destroy the horde in pursuit of them.{w}\nThe distraction worked perfectly. Now they just had to deal with the company."
    "最终，普洛和格瑞兹的路把他们引到一条宽阔的走廊。{w}\n有足够的开阔空间战斗，消灭追赶他们的那群追兵。{w}\n诱敌之计完美奏效。现在他们只需应付这些“客人”了。"

# game/script.rpy:103902
translate chinese map300_d3daf776:

    # voice "se/z02718.ogg"
    voice "se/z02718.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:103904
translate chinese map300_6038874d:

    # char_jit_map251_1_0_130 "Pro — what weapons do you have...?"
    char_jit_map251_1_0_130 "普洛——你有什么武器……？"

# game/script.rpy:103918
translate chinese map300_2c7c9c61:

    # "Gryz readies his large warhammer."
    "格瑞兹举起他那把巨大的战锤。"

# game/script.rpy:103943
translate chinese map300_77aec76a:

    # voice "se/pro68.ogg"
    voice "se/pro68.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:103945
translate chinese map300_025258fb:

    # char_pro "Daggers — my favorite.\nUp close and personal."
    char_pro "匕首——我的最爱。\n近距离，面对面。"

# game/script.rpy:103959
translate chinese map300_1eb81467:

    # "He draws them, and stands beside Gryz."
    "他抽出匕首，站到格瑞兹身旁。"

# game/script.rpy:103984
translate chinese map300_7d7bdd2a:

    # voice "se/z02720.ogg"
    # char_jit_map251_1_0_130 "So, you've fought these things before?"
    voice "se/z02720.ogg"
    char_jit_map251_1_0_130 "那么，你以前和这些东西打过？"

# game/script.rpy:104010
translate chinese map300_80aab09f:

    # voice "se/pro69.ogg"
    # char_pro "Yeah — plenty of times.\nIt'll be a piece of cake. Trust me."
    voice "se/pro69.ogg"
    char_pro "是啊——打过很多次。\n小事一桩。相信我。"

# game/script.rpy:104026
translate chinese map300_37148c2c:

    # voice "se/z02722.ogg"
    # char_jit_map251_1_0_130 "Right."
    voice "se/z02722.ogg"
    char_jit_map251_1_0_130 "好吧。"

# game/script.rpy:104041
translate chinese map300_5bb525e9:

    # "A few moments pass, and The Honor Guard finally catches up with them.{w}\nThe horde seems to have tripled in size. Everything was going their way.{w}\nAt this rate, The Monarch should have almost no opposition at all."
    "过了片刻，荣誉卫队终于追上了他们。{w}\n那群追兵似乎扩大了三倍。一切都在按他们的计划发展。{w}\n照这势头，君主那边应该几乎不会遇到什么抵抗。"

# game/script.rpy:104066
translate chinese map300_e453cce0:

    # voice "se/z02723b.ogg"
    # char_jit_map251_1_0_130 "Be mindful of where you stand, Pro.\nIf this hammer is good at anything, it's crowd control.\nI don't want to hit you while I'm fighting off the enemy."
    voice "se/z02723b.ogg"
    char_jit_map251_1_0_130 "注意你站的位置，普洛。\n要说这锤子擅长什么，那就是对付成群的敌人。\n我不想在对付敌人时误伤到你。"

# game/script.rpy:104092
translate chinese map300_e36d4e02:

    # voice "se/pro70.ogg"
    # char_pro "Yeah — got it.\nI'll stay low, and out of your way."
    voice "se/pro70.ogg"
    char_pro "是啊——明白。\n我会压低身子，不挡你的路。"

# game/script.rpy:104107
translate chinese map300_1505fdbd:

    # "Gryz nods, and they stand side by side as enemies fill the room."
    "格瑞兹点头，敌人涌满房间时，两人并肩而立。"

# game/script.rpy:104132
translate chinese map300_6804b194:

    # voice "se/z02725b.ogg"
    # char_jit_map251_1_0_130 "Ready...?"
    voice "se/z02725b.ogg"
    char_jit_map251_1_0_130 "准备好了吗……？"

# game/script.rpy:104147
translate chinese map300_3c780d6e:

    # "Pro gulps."
    "普洛咽了口唾沫。"

# game/script.rpy:104172
translate chinese map300_4a17921b:

    # voice "se/pro71.ogg"
    # char_pro "Let's do this."
    voice "se/pro71.ogg"
    char_pro "动手吧。"

# game/script.rpy:104187
translate chinese map300_da63f03a:

    # "They charge into the crowd, and the fight begins.{w}\nPro makes sure to stay below shoulder height as Gryz swings his hammer.{w}\nHe takes out about ten or more suits with every swing of that mighty weapon."
    "他们冲进人群，战斗开始了。{w}\n格瑞兹挥锤时，普洛刻意保持在肩膀以下的高度。{w}\n那件威力惊人的武器每一挥，都能撂倒十个甚至更多的盔甲。"

# game/script.rpy:104189
translate chinese map300_09764c04:

    # "Pro rolls on the floor, taking them out with precise stabs to the abdomen.{w}\nShattering like glass, the suits are falling at a rate that guarantees their victory.{w}\nBoth men pant from exertion as they fight what was hopefully their last fight."
    "普洛在地上翻滚，精准地刺向它们的腹部，将其一一解决。{w}\n盔甲像玻璃般碎裂，倒下的速度快得足以保证他们的胜利。{w}\n两人气喘吁吁，奋力搏杀——但愿这是他们最后一场战斗。"

# game/script.rpy:104194
translate chinese map300_2259a750:

    # "For peace in all of Alestia, all they had to do was prevail.{w}\nAs the crowd thins out, they press their backs against one another.{w}\nThe enemies may be swinging their swords, but they landed no hits."
    "为了全阿莱斯蒂亚的和平，他们只需取胜便可。{w}\n人群渐渐稀疏，他们背靠着背，彼此支撑。{w}\n敌人或许挥剑猛砍，却一剑未中。"

# game/script.rpy:104222
translate chinese map300_baad589e:

    # voice "se/z02727b.ogg"
    # char_jit_map251_1_0_130 "So {i}this{/i} is what I was meant to do..."
    voice "se/z02727b.ogg"
    char_jit_map251_1_0_130 "原来{i}这{/i}就是我的使命……"

# game/script.rpy:104248
translate chinese map300_0e8c60aa:

    # voice "se/pro72.ogg"
    # char_pro "Huh...?"
    voice "se/pro72.ogg"
    char_pro "嗯……？"

# game/script.rpy:104263
translate chinese map300_5d0fa3df:

    # "Gryz swings his hammer, taking out ten more.{w}\nThen, seconds later, they're back to back once again."
    "格瑞兹挥动战锤，又干掉了十个。{w}\n几秒后，他们再度背靠着背。"

# game/script.rpy:104288
translate chinese map300_ea603d19:

    # voice "se/z02729.ogg"
    # char_jit_map251_1_0_130 "Back in Mazeo, I was ready to throw my life away.\nYou know, to atone for what I did in The Triumvirate's name?\nI'm glad that I didn't — I was meant to end {i}them{/i}, not myself."
    voice "se/z02729.ogg"
    char_jit_map251_1_0_130 "当初在马泽奥，我已准备好舍弃自己的性命。\n你知道的，为以三人执政团之名所做的事赎罪吧？\n幸好我没有——我注定要终结{i}他们{/i}，而不是我自己。"

# game/script.rpy:104303
translate chinese map300_a3040e3d:

    # "Pro smiles at his ally."
    "普洛对战友露出微笑。"

# game/script.rpy:104328
translate chinese map300_797efe5f:

    # voice "se/pro73.ogg"
    # char_pro "I'm glad you made the right choice, then."
    voice "se/pro73.ogg"
    char_pro "那我很高兴你做出了正确的选择。"

# game/script.rpy:104343
translate chinese map300_6ea84306:

    # "He lunges forward, continuing to kill the suits of armor.{w}\nGryz scoffs, a wide smile appearing on his face as he fights."
    "他向前猛冲，继续斩杀那些空甲。{w}\n格瑞兹嗤笑一声，战斗的脸上绽开大大的笑容。"

# game/script.rpy:104368
translate chinese map300_b0041241:

    # voice "se/z02731.ogg"
    # char_jit_map251_1_0_130 "No — not me.\nIt's all thanks to [firstname]."
    voice "se/z02731.ogg"
    char_jit_map251_1_0_130 "不——不是我。\n这全靠[firstname]。"

# game/script.rpy:104383
translate chinese map300_e27c348e:

    # "The battle continues, but the enemy stood no chance.{w}\nThey were killing the suits faster than they entered the room.{w}\nAnd after what seemed like an eternity, they entered no more."
    "战斗仍在继续，但敌人毫无胜算。{w}\n他们斩杀空甲的速度，比敌人涌入房间还快。{w}\n仿佛过了永恒那么久，终于再无空甲进来了。"

# game/script.rpy:104385
translate chinese map300_68364767:

    # "Pro falls to his knees, struggling to catch his breath.{w}\nEven Gryz seems winded, as well. What a thrilling dance that was.{w}\nHowever, as they learn moments later, it's not yet come to an end."
    "普洛双膝跪地，拼命喘着气。{w}\n连格瑞兹似乎也气喘吁吁。真是一场惊心动魄的共舞。{w}\n然而，片刻之后他们才明白，这一切尚未结束。"

# game/script.rpy:104387
translate chinese map300_681eebb0:

    # "Another group of hordes starts making its way into the large hallway.{w}\nThey laugh. Of course this wouldn't be as easy as they thought.{w}\nCharging into the crowd again, the fight continues, almost endless."
    "又一群敌潮开始涌入宽阔的走廊。{w}\n他们笑了。这事当然不会如他们想的那么轻松。{w}\n他们再次冲入人群，战斗继续，仿佛永无止境。"

# game/script.rpy:104412
translate chinese map300_aed17737:

    # voice "se/pro74.ogg"
    # char_pro "There's too many of them...!\nWe need to do something, and fast!"
    voice "se/pro74.ogg"
    char_pro "他们人太多了……！\n我们必须做点什么，而且要快！"

# game/script.rpy:104438
translate chinese map300_ce4850a7:

    # voice "se/z02733.ogg"
    # char_jit_map251_1_0_130 "There's nothing we can do!\nJust stand your ground. Keep fighting!"
    voice "se/z02733.ogg"
    char_jit_map251_1_0_130 "我们别无他法！\n就守住阵地。继续战斗！"

# game/script.rpy:104465
translate chinese map300_a70b93d3:

    # "The swings and stabs become weaker with each passing moment.{w}\nWhat was once a certain victory is now falling apart in the face of exertion.{w}\nBut they don't give up. \"Never accept defeat, not until the very end.\""
    "每一次挥砍与突刺，都随着时间流逝愈发无力。{w}\n曾笃定的胜利，如今在疲惫面前土崩瓦解。{w}\n但他们不肯放弃。“永不认输，直到最后一刻。”"

# game/script.rpy:104467
translate chinese map300_c08f471f:

    # "That was the first rule of any good gambler.{w}\nAnd with their lives as chips on the table, they continued to play;{w}\nThe floor becoming a sea of white and gold in the wake of their rage."
    "这是任何好赌徒的第一条准则。{w}\n他们把性命当作桌上的筹码，继续赌下去；{w}\n在他们的怒火之后，地面化作一片白金之海。"

# game/script.rpy:104475
translate chinese map300_7188c0d3:

    # "All they had to do was pray that they didn't drown in it.{w}\nAs their strength dwindled, they kept fighting, never giving up.{w}\nThat determination saw them through, right to the bitter end."
    "他们所能做的，只是祈祷自己不会溺毙其中。{w}\n气力渐渐耗尽，他们仍战斗不休，绝不放弃。{w}\n正是这份决心支撑他们挺到最后，直到苦痛的终点。"

# game/script.rpy:104502
translate chinese map299_be97b474:

    # "Eventually, Pro's path leads him to a massive dining hall.{w}\nHowever, much to his surprise, it also doubles as a dead-end.{w}\nHe examines his surroundings, looking for somewhere to escape."
    "最终，普洛的路通向一间巨大的宴会厅。{w}\n然而令他大感意外的是，这里同时也是条死路。{w}\n他打量四周，寻找可以逃脱的地方。"

# game/script.rpy:104527
translate chinese map299_65ed3cbb:

    # voice "se/pro60.ogg"
    voice "se/pro60.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:104529
translate chinese map299_864c3c3a:

    # char_pro "Damn it! There's nowhere to go."
    char_pro "该死！无路可逃了。"

# game/script.rpy:104543
translate chinese map299_14d27412:

    # "With each passing second, The Honor Guard grows closer.{w}\nIn a panic, Pro grabs a couple knives from the table. Daggers.{w}\nHe hadn't planned to fight, but it appears that he had no choice."
    "每一秒过去，荣誉卫队都越来越近。{w}\n惊慌之中，普洛从桌上抓起几把刀。是匕首。{w}\n他本没打算战斗，但看来已别无选择。"

# game/script.rpy:104545
translate chinese map299_74ca1720:

    # "The windows here were iron bars, rather than stained glass.{w}\nIt almost makes it seem as if this room is a prison. How fitting.{w}\nHe takes a deep breath, and waits for the suits to enter the room."
    "这里的窗户装着铁栅，而非彩绘玻璃。{w}\n这几乎让房间显得像座牢房。倒也贴切。{w}\n他深吸一口气，等待空甲进入房间。"

# game/script.rpy:104547
translate chinese map299_66c54bfa:

    # "But when they do, he's shocked. There's far more than before.{w}\nAs if they gathered up several hordes to follow him in pursuit.{w}\nBoth a bad sign, and a good sign. His distraction really worked."
    "可当它们进来时，他震惊了。数量远胜从前。{w}\n仿佛它们聚拢了好几群敌潮来追捕他。{w}\n这既是坏兆头，也是好兆头。他的牵制确实奏效了。"

# game/script.rpy:104572
translate chinese map299_25b30bb5:

    # voice "se/pro61.ogg"
    # char_pro "Heh — is that all you could bring...?\nI thought you'd be giving me a challenge."
    voice "se/pro61.ogg"
    char_pro "呵——你们就只带得来这些……？\n我还以为你们能给我点挑战。"

# game/script.rpy:104587
translate chinese map299_3dcbbb11:

    # "He jumps ontop of the table, giving him a height advantage.{w}\nAs The Honor Guard starts to climb up, he picks them off one by one.{w}\nIt was no problem. He'd just keep this up until all of them were dead."
    "他跳上桌面，占据了高度优势。{w}\n荣誉卫队开始攀爬，他便将它们逐个击破。{w}\n这不成问题。只要一直这样，直到把它们全部杀光。"

# game/script.rpy:104589
translate chinese map299_5232eeab:

    # "But they keep pouring into the room, and armor covers the table and floor.{w}\nThey're coming too fast — he can no longer fight them off one by one.{w}\nThey climb the table, and he suddenly fights three at the same time."
    "但它们不断涌入房间，桌上地上堆满了甲胄。{w}\n它们来得太快——他再也无法逐个应付。{w}\n它们爬上桌子，他骤然间要同时面对三个。"

# game/script.rpy:104591
translate chinese map299_24b22767:

    # "He starts to tire, his limbs growing weak from all the fighting.{w}\nBut still, he doesn't stop. He never gave up without winning.{w}\nDon't accept defeat until the very end. Every gambler's rule."
    "他开始疲惫，四肢因连番厮杀而发软。{w}\n但他仍未停下。没赢之前，他从不放弃。{w}\n不到最后一刻绝不认输。这是每个赌徒的准则。"

# game/script.rpy:104593
translate chinese map299_9ec04131:

    # "As agile as he was dextrous, fighting with daggers was second nature.{w}\nBut he'd need more than that, at this rate. He needed some range.{w}\nAs the suits fall, he grabs one of their longswords to use."
    "他身手灵巧又敏捷，用匕首作战如同本能。{w}\n但照这势头，这还不够。他需要些攻击距离。{w}\n趁空甲倒下，他抓起一把它们的长剑来用。"

# game/script.rpy:104618
translate chinese map299_9520c18c:

    # voice "se/pro62.ogg"
    # char_pro "Come on, give up already! It's over!"
    voice "se/pro62.ogg"
    char_pro "来吧，快认输吧！结束了！"

# game/script.rpy:104633
translate chinese map299_1dcf6d6d:

    # "It seems that they too, followed the rule of never accepting defeat.{w}\nSwords clash, as Pro is soon accosted from every possible angle.{w}\nA blade grazes his shoulder, and blood drips down his clothing."
    "看来它们也奉行着那绝不认输的准则。{w}\n剑刃相交，普洛很快遭到四面八方的围攻。{w}\n一柄剑擦过他的肩膀，鲜血顺着衣物滴落。"

# game/script.rpy:104635
translate chinese map299_fcc134f1:

    # "This just urges him to fight on even further.{w}\nHowever, the horde never seems to go down in numbers.{w}\nThey run into the dining hall faster than he can take them out."
    "这反而激励他更加奋力厮杀。{w}\n然而，敌潮的数量似乎从未减少。{w}\n它们冲进宴会厅的速度，比他斩杀得还快。"

# game/script.rpy:104637
translate chinese map299_547c677b:

    # "Soon enough, there's absolutely nowhere to go.{w}\nBut even as hope starts to dissipate, Pro doesn't give up.{w}\nHe continues fighting, until the floor is a sea, full of pieces of armor."
    "很快，便再无一处可退。{w}\n但即便希望开始消散，普洛也没有放弃。{w}\n他继续战斗，直到地面化作一片满是碎甲的海洋。"

# game/script.rpy:104652
translate chinese map299_808a0628:

    # voice "se/pro63.ogg"
    # char_pro "If I'm going down, then I'm taking all of you with me!\nLet's give those historians something to write about!"
    voice "se/pro63.ogg"
    char_pro "既然我要倒下，那我也要拉上你们所有人！\n让那些史官有东西可写吧！"

# game/script.rpy:104667
translate chinese map299_775cf9af:

    # "A sword is plunged through his shoulder, and he stumbles back, crying.{w}\nGritting his teeth, he pulls it out, and starts using two swords simultaneously.{w}\nAs if they were an extension of his body, he fights with immense grace."
    "一柄剑刺穿他的肩膀，他踉跄后退，痛呼出声。{w}\n他咬紧牙关，将剑拔出，开始双剑并用。{w}\n仿佛那是他身体的延伸，他战斗的姿态优雅至极。"

# game/script.rpy:104672
translate chinese map299_427319fe:

    # "The wound is pouring blood, and he starts to get lightheaded.{w}\nShaking his head, he tries to snap himself back into cognition.{w}\nBut a moment later, a sword is violently thrust through his side."
    "伤口血流如注，他开始头晕目眩。{w}\n他摇摇头，试图让自己恢复清醒。{w}\n但片刻之后，一柄剑狠狠刺穿了他的侧腹。"

# game/script.rpy:104674
translate chinese map299_5d50e8f7:

    # "He lets out a loud battle cry, a sort of scream, and keeps fighting on.{w}\nBut as made evident by his weaker swings — his time was limited."
    "他发出一声响亮的战吼，近乎嘶喊，继续奋战。{w}\n但愈发无力的挥砍已昭示——他的时间不多了。"

# game/script.rpy:104702
translate chinese map299_4e7cb4d0:

    # voice "se/pro64.ogg"
    # char_pro "Don't... accept... defeat..."
    voice "se/pro64.ogg"
    char_pro "不要……认……输……"

# game/script.rpy:104717
translate chinese map299_37dcea90:

    # "He fights, almost delirious from blood loss.{w}\nIn a last ditch effort to survive, he jumps off the table.{w}\nIf he could just fight his way to the exit — he'd survive...!"
    "他仍在战斗，因失血而几近神志不清。{w}\n为了求生做最后一搏，他跳下桌子。{w}\n只要能杀出一条血路到出口——他就能活下来……！"

# game/script.rpy:104719
translate chinese map299_a51630ef:

    # "A fantasy brought on by his deluded state, no doubt.{w}\nIt wouldn't have worked before, and it wouldn't work now.{w}\nThe white suits of armor on the ground are crimson with his blood."
    "这无疑是痴妄状态催生的幻想。{w}\n从前行不通，现在也行不通。{w}\n地上那些白色甲胄，已被他的鲜血染成深红。"

# game/script.rpy:104721
translate chinese map299_937c0752:

    # "Moments later, something surprising happens.{w}\nThe Honor Guard spreads out, almost like they're retreating.{w}\nHe falls to his knees, curious as to what's going on in their minds."
    "片刻之后，意想不到的事发生了。{w}\n荣誉卫队散开，几乎像是在撤退。{w}\n他跪倒在地，好奇它们脑中在想些什么。"

# game/script.rpy:104723
translate chinese map299_f9e521b2:

    # "They sheathe their blades, as Pro kneels in a puddle of his own blood.{w}\nSo that's what it was. An admission of victory — and their opponent's death.{w}\nHe cries, and tries to repeat himself once more, as if its a sort of mantra."
    "普洛跪在自己的一滩血中，它们却收剑入鞘。{w}\n原来如此。那是对胜利的宣告——以及对手之死的确认。{w}\n他哭着，再次试着重复那句话，仿佛某种咒语。"

# game/script.rpy:104738
translate chinese map299_0a1ca8fe:

    # voice "se/pro65.ogg"
    # char_pro "Don't... accept..."
    voice "se/pro65.ogg"
    char_pro "不要……认……"

# game/script.rpy:104753
translate chinese map299_4de8b578:

    # "He falls down on his side, crying and bleeding out on the floor.{w}\nDon't accept defeat. At least, not until the very end.{w}\nUnfortunately, for him — it seemed like this was it."
    "他侧身倒下，哭着，在地板上流尽鲜血。{w}\n不要认输。至少，不到最后一刻绝不认输。{w}\n遗憾的是，对他而言——这似乎就是终点了。"

# game/script.rpy:104770
translate chinese map299_b6b75185:

    # voice "se/pro66.ogg"
    voice "se/pro66.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:104772
translate chinese map299_32271d92:

    # char_pro "[firstname]... I'm sorry..."
    char_pro "[firstname]……对不起……"

# game/script.rpy:104777
translate chinese map299_d36a6e5f:

    # voice "se/pro67.ogg"
    voice "se/pro67.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:104779
translate chinese map299_75cb8924:

    # char_pro "My luck... had to run out... sometime..."
    char_pro "我的运气……总有……用尽的时候……"

# game/script.rpy:104804
translate chinese map299_62de0dae:

    # "In his final moments, he comforts himself with warm thoughts.{w}\nThoughts as warm as the pool of blood that now covered the floor.{w}\nHe passes on with a smile, finding happiness in the success of his task."
    "在最后的时刻，他用温暖的思绪安慰自己。{w}\n那思绪和此刻覆盖地面的血泊一样温热。{w}\n他带着微笑离世，为自己的任务得以完成而感到幸福。"

# game/script.rpy:104831
translate chinese map301_bd343d3e:

    # "Howl is completely surrounded, fighting to the best of his efforts.{w}\nA one-on-one fight would be no problem, but this was too much.{w}\nIn total, there must be tens of thousands of Honor Guard here."
    "豪尔被彻底包围，竭尽全力地战斗。{w}\n一对一的话毫无问题，但这样的数量实在太多。{w}\n这里总共恐怕有上万名荣誉卫队。"

# game/script.rpy:104833
translate chinese map301_8d2e7428:

    # "Fighting with his fists, he punches the suits of armor into pieces.{w}\nHe preferred to use his own body as a weapon, rather than anything else.{w}\nOther people fought with extensions of their body, but he needed none of that."
    "他赤手空拳地战斗，把空甲一拳拳砸成碎片。{w}\n比起其他任何东西，他更愿意把自己的身体当作武器。{w}\n别人靠身体的延伸物作战，他则全不需要。"

# game/script.rpy:104838
translate chinese map301_c2591a4c:

    # "One thing was for sure — he couldn't keep this up forever.{w}\nWith the power The Monarch absorbed, he was mortal, and vulnerable.{w}\nHowever, he used the sense of dread in order to fight with more determination."
    "有一点可以肯定——他不可能永远这样撑下去。{w}\n君主吸收了那股力量后，他已是凡人，会受伤、会死。{w}\n然而，他正是用这份恐惧感，让自己打得更决绝。"

# game/script.rpy:104843
translate chinese map301_490dc7a5:

    # "In this moment, Howl was thankful that all of his power remained intact.{w}\nHad The Monarch heeded his request, he would surely be close to death.{w}\nThankful for that fact, he fought on with an ever increasing sense of determination."
    "此刻，豪尔庆幸自己的力量完好无损。{w}\n倘若君主当时应了他的请求，他必定早已濒死。{w}\n正因为心怀感激，他战斗的决心愈发坚定。"

# game/script.rpy:104847
translate chinese map301_b031261f:

    # "Damek was nowhere to be seen, but Howl hoped that he was still alive.{w}\nThere were so many suits of armor, that it was impossible to keep track.{w}\nOne stray arrow, one thrown dagger, or one sneak attack — and it was over."
    "达梅克不见踪影，但豪尔希望他还活着。{w}\n空甲太多，根本无法一一留意。{w}\n一支流矢、一把掷来的匕首，或一次偷袭——就完了。"

# game/script.rpy:104849
translate chinese map301_b9f0f8e9:

    # "As he punched through the suits of armor, he finally saw an ally.{w}\nChanging the direction of his assault, he fought his way toward them.{w}\nGreeting him with a smile, it was a relief to see a friendly face once again."
    "在击穿空甲之际，他终于看见一位战友。{w}\n他改变进攻方向，朝那人一路杀去。{w}\n对方笑着迎接他，再次见到熟悉的面孔，让他如释重负。"

# game/script.rpy:104875
translate chinese map301_9c6958c1:

    # voice "se/z02734.ogg"
    voice "se/z02734.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:104881
translate chinese map301_60705394:

    # char_jit_map301_1_0_38 "Howl — watch out!"
    char_jit_map301_1_0_38 "豪尔——小心！"

# game/script.rpy:104895
translate chinese map301_2746630a:

    # "Vivien jumps behind Howl, taking out a suit that was sneaking up on him.{w}\nThanking his ally, Howl responded by doing the same — but behind Vivien.{w}\nNo matter where they stood, there was always an enemy in pursuit."
    "薇薇安跳到豪尔身后，解决掉一架正偷袭他的空甲。{w}\n豪尔向战友道谢，也以同样的方式回应——守住了薇薇安的后背。{w}\n无论他们站在何处，总有敌人穷追不舍。"

# game/script.rpy:104897
translate chinese map301_1477814c:

    # "Arrows fly overhead every few seconds. The enemy archers were skilled.{w}\nHowl couldn't see, but he knew that those arrows hit home on his allies.{w}\nWith his back pressed against Vivien, their rears are finally protected."
    "每隔几秒就有箭矢从头顶飞过。敌方的弓箭手技艺精湛。{w}\n豪尔看不见，但他知道那些箭正射中他的战友。{w}\n他和薇薇安背靠着背，后背终于有了掩护。"

# game/script.rpy:104922
translate chinese map301_e9d88028:

    # voice "se/z02735.ogg"
    voice "se/z02735.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:104924
translate chinese map301_dc3cb466:

    # char_howl "Vivien — status report.\nHow are you men doing?"
    char_howl "薇薇安——汇报情况。\n你手下的人怎么样了？"

# game/script.rpy:104949
translate chinese map301_e43ecfab:

    # voice "se/z02736.ogg"
    # char_jit_map301_1_0_38 "Not good, last time I checked.\nThere's just too many of them, Howl.\nAll we can do is wait for that bell to ring."
    voice "se/z02736.ogg"
    char_jit_map301_1_0_38 "上次查看时不太妙。\n它们实在太多了，豪尔。\n我们能做的只有等那口钟敲响。"

# game/script.rpy:104975
translate chinese map301_fef86e48:

    # voice "se/z02737.ogg"
    # char_howl "And if it doesn't...?"
    voice "se/z02737.ogg"
    char_howl "要是它不响呢……？"

# game/script.rpy:104990
translate chinese map301_399cc729:

    # "Vivien lunges forward, taking out several suits of armor.{w}\nThen, a moment later, he presses his back against Howl again."
    "薇薇安向前猛冲，解决掉几架空甲。{w}\n片刻之后，他再次把后背贴上豪尔。"

# game/script.rpy:105015
translate chinese map301_1b30aa24:

    # voice "se/z02738.ogg"
    # char_jit_map301_1_0_38 "Then this is it for us."
    voice "se/z02738.ogg"
    char_jit_map301_1_0_38 "那我们就到此为止了。"

# game/script.rpy:105030
translate chinese map301_d70b7a75:

    # "The despair in his voice was clear.{w}\nThey could keep fighting, but things were looking bad.{w}\nEven if each man killed a hundred suits, they'd still be outnumbered."
    "他声音里的绝望清晰可闻。{w}\n他们可以继续战斗，但形势不妙。{w}\n就算每人杀上一百架空甲，他们依旧寡不敌众。"

# game/script.rpy:105032
translate chinese map301_a00abc20:

    # "Howl shakes his head, freeing himself from the onslaught of ash.{w}\nThe library, still ablaze, rained remnants of The Monarchy upon them.{w}\nThe Honor Guard seemed unimpeded by this, but not The Rebellion."
    "豪尔摇摇头，甩去扑面而来的灰烬。{w}\n仍在燃烧的藏书阁，将王室的残骸如雨般洒落在他们身上。{w}\n荣誉卫队似乎毫不受阻，反抗军却不然。"

# game/script.rpy:105034
translate chinese map301_7ff9e9a2:

    # "It was almost as if, when the suits fought together, they shared one mind.{w}\nThis caused them to be weak on their own, but formidable as a group.{w}\nHowever, it meant that the more they killed, the weaker their enemy became."
    "几乎可以说，那些空甲并肩作战时，共享着同一个意志。{w}\n这使它们单独时孱弱，成群时却极其可怖。{w}\n不过，这也意味着他们杀得越多，敌人就越虚弱。"

# game/script.rpy:105059
translate chinese map301_aa556275:

    # voice "se/z02739.ogg"
    # char_howl "Vivien, do not give up so easily.\nYou are set to rule the strongest nation in the world.\nWe cannot have you return home with stories of lost hope."
    voice "se/z02739.ogg"
    char_howl "薇薇安，别这么轻易放弃。\n你注定要统治世上最强的国度。\n我们不能让你带着绝望的故事回家。"

# game/script.rpy:105062
translate chinese map301_9e7923df:

    # "As they talk, they keep fighting. The enemy never lets up for a second."
    "他们一边交谈，一边继续战斗。敌人一秒钟也不肯松懈。"

# game/script.rpy:105087
translate chinese map301_bfef225b:

    # voice "se/z02740.ogg"
    # char_jit_map301_1_0_38 "Then we better find it again, and fast."
    voice "se/z02740.ogg"
    char_jit_map301_1_0_38 "那我们最好快点把它找回来。"

# game/script.rpy:105102
translate chinese map301_0904ec22:

    # "Arrows fly through the air once more, and screams fill the air.{w}\nThey knew their forces were dying. The suits had no need to scream.{w}\nHowl wasn't even sure if they felt pain, or feared their own demise."
    "箭矢再度破空而过，惨叫声响彻四周。{w}\n他们知道自己的部下正在死去。那些空甲无需惨叫。{w}\n豪尔甚至不确定它们是否会感到疼痛，或恐惧自己的消亡。"

# game/script.rpy:105107
translate chinese map301_1b4bab04:

    # "And he wondered if those things would be a weakness, or a strength.{w}\nHis knuckles become bloody, and cracked, as they fight for their lives.{w}\nThey continued to protect each other, fighting as if they were one body."
    "他思忖着，这些究竟是弱点，还是优势。{w}\n在他们拼死搏杀之际，他的指节渐渐染血、开裂。{w}\n他们继续互相掩护，如同同一个躯体般战斗。"

# game/script.rpy:105132
translate chinese map301_03a4ba19:

    # voice "se/z02741.ogg"
    # char_howl "We need to change up our strategy.\nIf we don't, then they'll outsmart us."
    voice "se/z02741.ogg"
    char_howl "我们得改变策略。\n不然的话，它们会比我们更胜一筹。"

# game/script.rpy:105147
translate chinese map301_614d30e2:

    # "Vivien didn't respond."
    "薇薇安没有回应。"

# game/script.rpy:105181
translate chinese map301_86b0feb5:

    # voice "se/z02742b.ogg"
    voice "se/z02742b.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:105183
translate chinese map301_1183ea51:

    # char_howl "Vivien...?"
    char_howl "薇薇安……？"

# game/script.rpy:105197
translate chinese map301_f50e6eb2:

    # "Vivien shakes his head, panting heavily."
    "薇薇安摇摇头，剧烈地喘着气。"

# game/script.rpy:105222
translate chinese map301_18755fcb:

    # voice "se/z02743b.ogg"
    # char_jit_map301_1_0_38 "Sorry — it's just taking a lot out of me.\nI think I need to get back to the library."
    voice "se/z02743b.ogg"
    char_jit_map301_1_0_38 "抱歉——这实在太消耗我了。\n我想我得回藏书阁去了。"

# game/script.rpy:105248
translate chinese map301_1361f00e:

    # voice "se/z02744.ogg"
    # char_howl "Will you be okay on your own?"
    voice "se/z02744.ogg"
    char_howl "你一个人没问题吗？"

# game/script.rpy:105274
translate chinese map301_db694379:

    # voice "se/z02745b.ogg"
    # char_jit_map301_1_0_38 "Yeah, I'll be fine. Will you?"
    voice "se/z02745b.ogg"
    char_jit_map301_1_0_38 "嗯，我没事。你呢？"

# game/script.rpy:105300
translate chinese map301_8982f3aa:

    # voice "se/z02746b.ogg"
    # char_howl "Yeah. Go now, while you have an opening.\nWe will continue to fight them off."
    voice "se/z02746b.ogg"
    char_howl "没事。趁现在有空隙，快走吧。\n我们会继续挡住它们。"

# game/script.rpy:105322
translate chinese map301_853aa788:

    # "Vivien nods, and then runs off toward the library.{w}\nSoon enough, he disappears into the crowd of suits.{w}\nHowl's back is vulnerable once more, but he still fights."
    "薇薇安点点头，朝藏书阁跑去。{w}\n很快，他便消失在空甲的浪潮中。{w}\n豪尔的后背再度暴露，但他依然战斗着。"

# game/script.rpy:105358
translate chinese map301_d234f26d:

    # voice "se/z02747b.ogg"
    voice "se/z02747b.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:105360
translate chinese map301_1183ea51_1:

    # char_howl "Vivien...?"
    char_howl "薇薇安……？"

# game/script.rpy:105374
translate chinese map301_8366878c:

    # "Howl turns around to look, and Vivien falls limp to the ground.{w}\nA small legion of arrows found their home in his body.{w}\nThere's nothing he can do. The shots were fatal."
    "豪尔转身去看，薇薇安却软软地倒在地上。{w}\n一小群箭矢扎进了他的身体。{w}\n他无能为力。那些箭是致命的。"

# game/script.rpy:105376
translate chinese map301_98135390:

    # "With unseen archers targeting his location, he needed to run.{w}\nHe's vulnerable from every angle, and he had no choice but to fight.{w}\nHe looks around frantically to find the archers, but it's no use."
    "看不见的弓箭手瞄准了他的位置，他必须跑起来。{w}\n他四面八方都暴露无遗，却只能继续战斗。{w}\n他狂乱地环顾，想找出那些弓箭手，却毫无用处。"

# game/script.rpy:105402
translate chinese map301_e6f15292:

    # voice "se/z02748.ogg"
    voice "se/z02748.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:105408
