# game/script.rpy:105801
translate chinese map301_ef9d0b86:

    # voice "se/z02757.ogg"
    # char_howl "I'm afraid that we must part ways, though.\nThe same strategy is only effective for so long."
    voice "se/z02757.ogg"
    char_howl "不过，恐怕我们得分头行动了。\n同一套策略的有效时间终究有限。"

# game/script.rpy:105827
translate chinese map301_7fed84c6:

    # voice "se/z02758.ogg"
    # char_jit_map301_1_0_342 "Yes, of course.\nThat same tactic won me many coliseum battles.\nGood luck, Howl — and take a few out for me."
    voice "se/z02758.ogg"
    char_jit_map301_1_0_342 "是啊，当然。\n同样的战术曾让我赢下许多场竞技场之战。\n祝你好运，豪尔——替我多干掉几个。"

# game/script.rpy:105849
translate chinese map301_8acef680:

    # "With a smile, Draycu runs, and disappears into a crowd of suits.{w}\nHowl wouldn't have had time to say goodbye, even if he wanted to.{w}\nHe stands there, alone once more, with nothing else to do but fight."
    "德雷库笑着跑去，消失在空甲的浪潮中。{w}\n就算豪尔想道别，也没时间了。{w}\n他站在原地，再度孤身一人，除了战斗别无他事可做。"

# game/script.rpy:105885
translate chinese map301_df67f575:

    # voice "se/z02759.ogg"
    voice "se/z02759.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:105887
translate chinese map301_da5e58e9_1:

    # char_howl "Draycu...?"
    char_howl "德雷库……？"

# game/script.rpy:105901
translate chinese map301_75b536b2:

    # "Howl turns around to look, and Draycu falls limp to the ground.{w}\nA small legion of arrows found their home in his body.{w}\nThere's nothing he can do. The shots were fatal."
    "豪尔转身去看，德雷库却软软地倒在地上。{w}\n一小群箭矢扎进了他的身体。{w}\n他无能为力。那些箭是致命的。"

# game/script.rpy:105903
translate chinese map301_98135390_1:

    # "With unseen archers targeting his location, he needed to run.{w}\nHe's vulnerable from every angle, and he had no choice but to fight.{w}\nHe looks around frantically to find the archers, but it's no use."
    "看不见的弓箭手瞄准了他的位置，他必须跑起来。{w}\n他四面八方都暴露无遗，却只能继续战斗。{w}\n他狂乱地环顾，想找出那些弓箭手，却毫无用处。"

# game/script.rpy:105912
translate chinese map301_0084ac3d:

    # "All he can do is face the enemy, and his fate, head on.{w}\nCharging into the crowd with a scream, rage wells up within him.{w}\nThere are no allies to be seen. Just target after target waiting to be killed."
    "他所能做的，只有直面敌人与自己的命运。{w}\n他嘶吼着冲入人群，怒火在胸中翻涌。{w}\n再也看不到任何战友。只有一个个等着被杀的靶子。"

# game/script.rpy:105914
translate chinese map301_8ff2453a:

    # "And that's what happens next. He shatters the enemies like weak glass.{w}\nThey fall to the ground, leaving a trail of carnage in his wake.{w}\nHe had killed more than his fair share, and still went on."
    "接下来便是如此。他像击碎脆弱玻璃般粉碎敌人。{w}\n它们倒在地上，在他身后留下一路残骸。{w}\n他早已杀得远超本分，却仍在继续。"

# game/script.rpy:105923
translate chinese map301_f3daa944:

    # "Eventually, a barrage of arrows assaults him.{w}\nPiercing through his torso, it causes him to grunt in immense pain.{w}\nHe does his best to shake it off, but it's almost too much to bear."
    "最终，一阵箭雨向他袭来。{w}\n箭矢穿透他的躯干，剧痛令他闷哼出声。{w}\n他竭力想撑住，却几乎无法承受。"

# game/script.rpy:105925
translate chinese map301_f7fe8ad6:

    # "Now that the excess spirits were removed from his body, he was mortal.{w}\nBecause of that, he lets the arrows stay inside of his body.{w}\nPulling them out would be nothing short of a death sentence."
    "既然体内多余的灵体已被剥离，他便成了凡人。{w}\n正因如此，他任由箭矢留在体内。{w}\n把它们拔出，无异于宣判死刑。"

# game/script.rpy:105927
translate chinese map301_6b504cd9:

    # "But so too, was rushing headfirst into a horde of those suits.{w}\nAll of a sudden, it's harder for him to keep track of everything happening.{w}\nConfusion sets in, and he starts longing for his ally to return and help him."
    "可一头扎进那群空甲之中，同样也是死路。{w}\n突然间，他越来越难以掌握周遭的一切。{w}\n困惑袭来，他开始盼着战友回来帮他。"

# game/script.rpy:105929
translate chinese map301_6b5cb57d:

    # "But even if they did come back, they would arrive a moment too late.{w}\nHe turns around, looking for more enemies — and one is {i}right{/i} there.{w}\nThey thrust their longsword deep in his gut, and he stumbles back."
    "但就算他们真回来了，也只会慢上一步。{w}\n他转身寻找更多敌人——而那一个{i}就{/i}在眼前。{w}\n那架空甲把长剑深深刺进他的腹部，他踉跄后退。"

# game/script.rpy:105931
translate chinese map301_a87487b9:

    # "But then he quickly lunges forward, destroying the suit with a harsh punch.{w}\nMore suits crumble down around him, and miraculously, he's still fighting.{w}\nIt was miraculous that he was still standing. He fought on with fervor."
    "但他随即猛冲上前，一记重拳将那架空甲击碎。{w}\n更多空甲在他周围崩落，而他奇迹般地仍在战斗。{w}\n他还能站着，本身便是奇迹。他带着狂热继续厮杀。"

# game/script.rpy:105933
translate chinese map301_f5e42d38:

    # "However, the archers from before were preparing another shot.{w}\nMoments later, his back is full of arrows, as they hit their target.{w}\nHis body starts to feel numb, and he falls to his knees with a cry."
    "然而，先前的弓箭手正在准备又一轮射击。{w}\n片刻之后，箭矢命中目标，他的后背插满了箭。{w}\n他的身体开始发麻，惨叫着跪倒在地。"

# game/script.rpy:105935
translate chinese map301_915063d3:

    # "The Honor Guard surrounds him, and he's too weak to fight back.{w}\nIn his current state, all he could do was stand his ground and seek mercy.{w}\nYet he chooses not to. He'd never accept defeat without putting up a fight."
    "荣誉卫队将他团团围住，他已虚弱得无力反抗。{w}\n以他现在的状态，所能做的只有驻足原地、乞求怜悯。{w}\n但他偏不。不战而降，他绝不接受。"

# game/script.rpy:105937
translate chinese map301_e0f7d5a0:

    # "He takes out a few more suits before they start to fight back.{w}\nPerhaps they were giving him a chance to surrender, and accept death.{w}\nHowever, such opportunity has passed, and swords soon assault him."
    "在它们开始反击前，他又干掉了好几架空甲。{w}\n或许它们是在给他机会投降，接受死亡。{w}\n然而，这机会已然错过，剑很快向他袭来。"

# game/script.rpy:105939
translate chinese map301_d072b889:

    # "They work quick, covering Howl's entire body with wounds.{w}\nHe falls down on the ground, trembling from the intense pain.{w}\nBlood pools around him, spilling until there's nothing left to spill."
    "它们动作麻利，在豪尔全身留下累累伤口。{w}\n他倒在地上，因剧痛而浑身颤抖。{w}\n鲜血在他周围积成水洼，一直流到再无可流。"

# game/script.rpy:105941
translate chinese map301_19bba624:

    # "Then, The Honor Guard walks away, realizing they had won.{w}\nHowl lays there, looking up at the sky, and the steadily falling ash.{w}\nIt covers him, and he becomes one with the remnants of his people."
    "随后，荣誉卫队意识到自己已经获胜，转身离去。{w}\n豪尔躺在那里，仰望着天空与不断飘落的灰烬。{w}\n灰烬覆盖了他，他与族人的残骸融为一体。"

# game/script.rpy:105950
translate chinese map301_cbf445fd:

    # "Eventually a barrage of arrows assaults him.{w}\nPiercing through his torso, he grunts in immense pain.{w}\nHowever, the pain was minimal compared to the pain he normally felt."
    "最终，一阵箭雨向他袭来。{w}\n箭矢穿透他的躯干，剧痛令他闷哼出声。{w}\n然而，与他惯常承受的痛楚相比，这根本微不足道。"

# game/script.rpy:105952
translate chinese map301_d6514b72:

    # "He pulls out the arrows, and throws them down on the ground.{w}\nBlood spills from the wounds, but he shows no signs of pain.{w}\nSuch wounds would do nothing to a body powered by The Monarchy."
    "他拔出箭矢，扔在地上。{w}\n鲜血从伤口涌出，他却毫无痛楚之色。{w}\n这样的伤，对一具由王室之力驱动的躯体毫无作用。"

# game/script.rpy:105954
translate chinese map301_31f966f0:

    # "All he had to do was fight until the bell was rung.{w}\nBut that was the question on everybody's minds right now.{w}\nWith such an immense task before him, would Fortaime succeed?"
    "他所要做的，只是战斗到钟声敲响。{w}\n但这正是此刻所有人心中悬着的问题。{w}\n面对如此艰巨的任务，福泰姆能成功吗？"

# game/script.rpy:105956
translate chinese map301_2399916e:

    # "It seemed — that right now — almost everything lay in his hands.{w}\nHowl fought ruthlessly, hoping to hear the bell, and find relief.{w}\nBut with each passing second, the hope within him dwindled."
    "现在看来——此刻——几乎一切都系于他一人之手。{w}\n豪尔无情地厮杀，盼着听见钟声，得到解脱。{w}\n但每过一秒，他心中的希望便黯淡一分。"

# game/script.rpy:105989
translate chinese map302_39d25595:

    # "Fortaime pants heavily, panicking with an arrow in his side.{w}\nHe knew that if he pulled it out, things would only get worse.{w}\nIt would be best to keep it inside, until he could find some help."
    "福泰姆剧烈喘息，侧腹中箭令他惊慌失措。{w}\n他知道一旦拔出，情况只会更糟。{w}\n最好先让它留在体内，直到找到人帮忙。"

# game/script.rpy:105991
translate chinese map302_cf88c958:

    # "It wouldn't be fatal, so that gave him great relief on its own.{w}\nHiding in a spare room he found, he needed to take a breather.{w}\nIt was perfect timing, as suits started to scurry around outside."
    "这伤不致命，单是这点就让他大大松了口气。{w}\n他躲进一间找到的空房，需要喘口气。{w}\n时机正好，外面的空甲开始四处乱窜。"

# game/script.rpy:106016
translate chinese map302_df6649fa:

    # voice "se/z02760.ogg"
    voice "se/z02760.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:106018
translate chinese map302_649a8a16:

    # char_fortaime "It can't be too far away.\nHow high up does this castle even go...?"
    char_fortaime "应该不会太远了。\n这座城堡到底有多高……？"

# game/script.rpy:106039
translate chinese map302_464d671f:

    # "He shakes his head, realizing there was only one way to find out.{w}\nBut as he goes to sneak out of the room, he bumps into a table.{w}\nA bottle of wine falls off the side, and shatters with an echo."
    "他摇摇头，意识到只有一个办法能知道答案。{w}\n但当他正要溜出房间时，撞到了一张桌子。{w}\n一瓶葡萄酒从边上掉落，碎裂声回荡开来。"

# game/script.rpy:106041
translate chinese map302_fd5c8491:

    # "His entire body tenses up as he hears The Honor Guard stop moving.{w}\nHe runs to the other side of the room, and hides behind a curtain.{w}\nIt would've been easy to sneak around them, if not for the wine."
    "听到荣誉卫队停下脚步，他全身都绷紧了。{w}\n他跑到房间另一头，躲到窗帘后。{w}\n若不是那瓶酒，绕过它们本会很容易。"

# game/script.rpy:106043
translate chinese map302_97859177:

    # "Now, every single suit of armor in that hallway would know he's here.{w}\nHe remains as still as possible as one of them enters the room to scout.{w}\nThe suit kneels down to inspect the broken glass. Then looks over to the curtain."
    "现在，那条走廊里每一架空甲都会知道他在此处。{w}\n其中一架进屋搜查时，他尽可能一动不动。{w}\n那架空甲蹲下查看碎玻璃，随后朝窗帘望来。"

# game/script.rpy:106045
translate chinese map302_9554a0f7:

    # "His cover was blown. He made a small trail of wine with his footsteps.{w}\nHe holds his breath as the suit of armor makes its way to his location.{w}\nThen, a few moments later, it plunges its sword right in the curtain."
    "他的掩护暴露了。他的脚印拖出一道小小的酒渍。{w}\n那架空甲朝他所在的位置走来，他屏住呼吸。{w}\n片刻之后，它把剑径直刺进窗帘。"

# game/script.rpy:106047
translate chinese map302_e6ead8f1:

    # "Fortaime dodges to the left, then rips the curtain down from the wall.{w}\nWrapping it around the suit of armor, he has it in a strong chokehold.{w}\nHe hesitates for a few moments, and then snaps his enemy's neck."
    "福泰姆向左闪避，随即把窗帘从墙上扯下。{w}\n他用窗帘缠住那架空甲，牢牢勒住它的脖颈。{w}\n他犹豫了片刻，然后拧断了敌人的脖子。"

# game/script.rpy:106049
translate chinese map302_c1ae007c:

    # "The suit crumbles, but has nowhere to fall, being held together by the curtain.{w}\nHe slowly rests it on the ground. This was his first real fight. His first kill.{w}\nIf he survived to ring that bell, he knew he would never be the same."
    "空甲崩解，却被窗帘兜住，无处坠落。{w}\n他缓缓将它放到地上。这是他第一场真正的战斗。他第一次杀人。{w}\n如果他能活下来敲响那口钟，他知道自己将再也不是从前的自己。"

# game/script.rpy:106051
translate chinese map302_64e6556a:

    # "He slowly unravels the curtain, and grabs the sword belonging to the suit.{w}\nAs soon as he does, more of them enter the room, to check up on their ally.{w}\nFortaime wondered if they felt emotion. If they'd mourn the suit he killed."
    "他慢慢解开窗帘，抓起那架空甲的长剑。{w}\n他刚拿到手，更多空甲便进屋查看同伴。{w}\n福泰姆想知道它们是否有情感。是否会为他杀掉的这架空甲哀悼。"

# game/script.rpy:106053
translate chinese map302_60c03f80:

    # "They drew their swords, but Fortaime wasn't sure what prompted it.{w}\nAnger at their dead ally — or perhaps blind loyalty to The Triumvirate.{w}\nHe'd never know, and in that moment, he realized it was for the best."
    "它们拔出了剑，但福泰姆不确定是何缘故。{w}\n是为死去的同伴愤怒——还是出于对三人执政团的盲目忠诚。{w}\n他永远不会知道，而在那一刻，他意识到这样也好。"

# game/script.rpy:106055
translate chinese map302_f9cafe28:

    # "Sword clashed against sword, as he fought for his life.{w}\nBut not just his. Almost everybody else's lives were at stake, too.{w}\nThey were relying on him to ring that bell; and he couldn't let them down!"
    "剑刃相交，他为自己的性命而战。{w}\n但不只是他自己的。几乎所有人的性命都悬于一线。{w}\n他们都指望他去敲响那口钟；他不能让他们失望！"

# game/script.rpy:106061
translate chinese map302_9bbb27b8:

    # "All he had to do was survive..."
    "他所要做的，只是活下来……"

# game/script.rpy:106095
translate chinese map303_68fa8c8f:

    # "When we get inside the castle, I notice that it's completely empty.{w}\nPro must've been successful. Otherwise, this place would be full.{w}\nI'm thankful, but unable to find happiness. Not after losing Valessa."
    "我们进入城堡时，我发现里面空无一人。{w}\n普洛一定成功了。否则，这里本该挤满了人。{w}\n我很感激，却无法感到快乐。失去瓦莱莎之后，我做不到。"

# game/script.rpy:106097
translate chinese map303_c9f33e7e:

    # "Sure, I didn't see her final moments, but she was dead.{w}\nThere's no way somebody could survive an attack like that.{w}\nMy friend. One of my first friends. I'm in complete disbelief."
    "的确，我没看到她最后的时刻，但她死了。{w}\n没人能在那样的攻击下活下来。{w}\n我的朋友。我最早的朋友之一。我完全无法相信。"

# game/script.rpy:106122
translate chinese map303_325fc40e:

    # voice "se/z02761.ogg"
    voice "se/z02761.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:106124
translate chinese map303_2c580e90:

    # char_ulric "Hey, snap out of it. We need you in good shape.\nI know what you saw out there, but she could still be alive.\nIf we just stand here moping, then we might as well surrender."
    char_ulric "嘿，振作起来。我们需要你保持良好状态。\n我知道你在外面看到了什么，但她也许还活着。\n要是我们杵在这儿自怨自艾，那还不如直接投降。"

# game/script.rpy:106138
translate chinese map303_5f71f44a:

    # "I shake my head. He was wrong, and I knew it.{w}\nValessa was dead, and I had to learn to accept that.{w}\nI start walking toward the stairs, wanting nothing but revenge."
    "我摇摇头。他错了，我清楚这一点。{w}\n瓦莱莎已经死了，我必须学会接受。{w}\n我朝楼梯走去，心中只有复仇。"

# game/script.rpy:106143
translate chinese map303_350c5ef7:

    # "When we get inside the castle, I notice that it's completely empty.{w}\nI'm filled with hope. Pro must've been successful with his distraction.{w}\nOtherwise, this place would be teeming with those suits of armor."
    "我们进入城堡时，我发现里面空无一人。{w}\n我心中充满希望。普洛的牵制一定成功了。{w}\n否则，这里本该挤满了那些空甲。"

# game/script.rpy:106145
translate chinese map303_8ffb5d31:

    # "All we had to do was make our way to the top, and take them down.{w}\nWith The Triumvirate dead, and that bell rung — victory was ours.{w}\nI cross my fingers, hoping that Fortaime's travels are going well."
    "我们所要做的，就是一路登上顶层，将他们拿下。{w}\n只要三人执政团一死，钟声一响——胜利便属于我们。{w}\n我暗自祈祷，希望福泰姆的行程一切顺利。"

# game/script.rpy:106170
translate chinese map303_b2478e78:

    # voice "se/z02763b.ogg"
    voice "se/z02763b.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:106172
translate chinese map303_4b5d63a2:

    # char_ulric "Wow, I haven't been to this place in ages.\nIt doesn't look any different, though. Just as uninviting.\nWe want to go right up those stairs, [firstname]. This is it."
    char_ulric "哇，我好多年没来过这地方了。\n不过看起来毫无变化。依旧让人望而生畏。\n我们要直接上那些楼梯，[firstname]。就是现在。"

# game/script.rpy:106186
translate chinese map303_18f17dc5:

    # "I nod. He was right — this was the end of our journey.{w}\nAfter everything I've been through, I was finally in their castle.{w}\nI start walking toward the stairs. My next actions were clear."
    "我点点头。他说得对——这是我们旅途的终点。{w}\n历经千辛万苦，我终于来到了他们的城堡。{w}\n我朝楼梯走去。接下来的行动已然清晰。"

# game/script.rpy:106212
translate chinese map303_0954aebe:

    # voice "se/z02764.ogg"
    voice "se/z02764.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:106214
translate chinese map303_5a915289:

    # char_ulric "Hey, not so fast. You should let {i}me{/i} take point.\nI know the layout of this castle, and where to go.\nIt gets a bit confusing up there. Trust me on that."
    char_ulric "嘿，别急。该让{i}我{/i}来打头阵。\n我熟悉这座城堡的布局，也知道该往哪走。\n上面有点容易迷路。这点你信我。"

# game/script.rpy:106228
translate chinese map303_c9f54b9f:

    # "Confusing...? How so?"
    "容易迷路……？怎么说？"

# game/script.rpy:106255
translate chinese map303_44930715:

    # voice "se/sovy42.ogg"
    voice "se/sovy42.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:106257
translate chinese map303_7394fc0f:

    # char_sovy "Lots of stairs. I hope you're okay with that.\nAnd be careful, we don't want to fall into a trap.\nThis place is massive. It would be easy to ambush us."
    char_sovy "楼梯多得很。希望你受得了。\n还有，小心点，我们可不想中埋伏。\n这地方巨大无比。很容易被伏击。"

# game/script.rpy:106272
translate chinese map303_8bdbc03e:

    # voice "se/z02766b.ogg"
    voice "se/z02766b.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:106274
translate chinese map303_272437ff:

    # char_ulric "Let's just say there's lots of stairs coming up.\nAnd be careful, alright? We don't want to fall into a trap.\nWe're in their territory now. An ambush would be child's play."
    char_ulric "这么说吧，接下来有一大堆楼梯。\n小心点，好吗？我们可不想中埋伏。\n我们现在在他们的地盘上。设伏对他们来说易如反掌。"

# game/script.rpy:106293
translate chinese map303_314920ce:

    # "Not a second later, somebody enters the room from the opposite side.{w}\nIt's that man from our HQ. The one with Sovy, clad in white and gold.{w}\nHe descends the stairs, laughing at us. A horde of suits follows."
    "不出片刻，有人从对面走进了房间。{w}\n是我们总部见过的那个人。和索维在一起、身披白金装束的那个。{w}\n他走下楼梯，冲着我们大笑。一群空甲紧随其后。"

# game/script.rpy:106321
translate chinese map303_ab4347fe:

    # voice "se/z02767b.ogg"
    voice "se/z02767b.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:106323
translate chinese map303_5652f83f:

    # char_halin "Ambush...? No, I don't play cheap. Not like Sovy.\nI'd merely like to call this a \"welcoming party\" of sorts.\nAn ambush is unexpected. Surely, you {i}knew{/i} I'd be here."
    char_halin "埋伏……？不，我不玩这种下三滥。我可不像索维。\n我更愿意把这场面叫做某种“欢迎会”。\n埋伏是出其不意的。你们{i}早该知道{/i}我会在这儿。"

# game/script.rpy:106340
translate chinese map303_cf6dc66a:

    # "I unsheathe my blade, and hold it out toward our enemy.{w}\nThere was no time to argue semantics with the likes of him.{w}\nBut, as if to guard me, Ulric and Sovy step forward, getting in the way."
    "我拔出剑，指向我们的敌人。{w}\n没时间跟他这种人抠字眼。{w}\n但乌尔里克和索维像是要护住我，上前挡在了中间。"

# game/script.rpy:106365
translate chinese map303_166886f9:

    # voice "se/sovy43.ogg"
    # char_sovy "Halin, don't you think it's time you gave up...?\nYou've been bound to their will, following orders for so long.\nLet us remove that curse. We can give you your freedom back!"
    voice "se/sovy43.ogg"
    char_sovy "哈林，你不觉得是时候放弃了吗……？\n你被他们的意志束缚，听命行事太久了。\n让我们解除那道诅咒。我们能还你自由！"

# game/script.rpy:106380
translate chinese map303_ecbd706b:

    # "Clearly an act. Sovy wanted Halin dead.{w}\nThat, and he could never agree. He was under their thrall.{w}\nA moment later, Halin disappears into the crowd of suits."
    "显然是在做戏。索维想要哈林的命。{w}\n况且，哈林绝不可能答应。他被他们的意志所控制。{w}\n片刻之后，哈林消失在空甲的浪潮中。"

# game/script.rpy:106405
translate chinese map303_2eca3785:

    # voice "se/z02769.ogg"
    # char_halin "Freedom...? I don't need freedom.\nI exist to serve The Triumvirate, and that is final.\nYou did too — but you threw it away in your folly. "
    voice "se/z02769.ogg"
    char_halin "自由……？我不需要自由。\n我存在的意义就是效忠三人执政团，这一点无可更改。\n你曾经也是——可你愚蠢地把它抛弃了。"

# game/script.rpy:106411
translate chinese map303_aacef994:

    # "I unsheathe my blade, and hold it out toward our enemy.{w}\nThere was no time to argue semantics with the likes of him.{w}\nBut, as if to guard me, Ulric steps forward, getting in the way."
    "我拔出剑，指向我们的敌人。{w}\n没时间跟他这种人抠字眼。{w}\n但乌尔里克像是要护住我，上前挡在了中间。"

# game/script.rpy:106436
translate chinese map303_5fe48005:

    # voice "se/z02770.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Look — we don't need to fight you.\nI know what you are. A slave to The Triumvirate.\nWe can fix that, Halin. We can remove the curse."
    voice "se/z02770.ogg"
    char_ulric "听着——我们不必与你为敌。\n我知道你是什么。三人执政团的奴隶。\n我们能改变这一点，哈林。我们能解除那道诅咒。"

# game/script.rpy:106451
translate chinese map303_38fe572c:

    # "It would never work. Halin was under their thrall.{w}\nEven considering this offer would be an act of defiance.{w}\nInstead of responding, Halin disappears into the crowd of suits."
    "这永远不会奏效。哈林被他们的意志所控制。{w}\n哪怕考虑这个提议，都算是一种违抗。{w}\n哈林没有回应，而是消失在空甲的浪潮中。"

# game/script.rpy:106476
translate chinese map303_f7126878:

    # voice "se/z02771.ogg"
    # char_halin "Curse...? You call this a curse?\nI embody The Triumvirate's will, and command their army.\nYou are the cursed ones. You fight for the dream of a fool."
    voice "se/z02771.ogg"
    char_halin "诅咒……？你把这叫做诅咒？\n我是三人执政团意志的化身，统率他们的军队。\n你们才是被诅咒的人。你们为一个蠢货的梦想而战。"

# game/script.rpy:106498
translate chinese map303_1308585d:

    # "The suits of armor reach the bottom of the stairs.{w}\nBut Halin is nowhere to be seen. We just hear his voice.{w}\nHe must've used the confusion of the crowd to escape."
    "空甲抵达楼梯底部。{w}\n但哈林已不见踪影。我们只听见他的声音。{w}\n他一定是借着人群的混乱逃走了。"

# game/script.rpy:106501
translate chinese map303_0b9e220e:

    # voice "se/z02772.ogg"
    # char_halin "You stand in the realm of Gods, now.\nIt is time that you spoke with your resolve.\nIf it is strong enough, then you will find me."
    voice "se/z02772.ogg"
    char_halin "你们此刻站在神明的领域。\n是时候用你们的决心来说话了。\n若它足够坚定，你们便能找到我。"

# game/script.rpy:106507
translate chinese map303_421da540:

    # "The Honor Guard draws their swords, as Halin's laughter fills the room."
    "哈林的笑声响彻房间，荣誉卫队拔出了剑。"

# game/script.rpy:106510
translate chinese map303_5c84c191:

    # voice "se/z02773.ogg"
    # char_halin "And if it is not — then you will perish.\nSo do it. Show me the determination of your Rebellion.\nSpeak against your Gods, and see how they answer!"
    voice "se/z02773.ogg"
    char_halin "若是不够——你们便会灭亡。\n那就来吧。让我看看你们反抗军的决心。\n开口反抗你们的神明，看看它们如何回应！"

# game/script.rpy:106524
translate chinese map303_516c453a:

    # "At Halin's command, The Honor Guard charges in our direction.{w}\nSovy and Ulric are the first to fight, making sure that I'm protected.{w}\nBut I make sure to play my part. I take them down with similar ease."
    "随着哈林一声令下，荣誉卫队朝我们冲来。{w}\n索维和乌尔里克率先迎战，确保我受到保护。{w}\n但我也尽好自己的本分，同样轻松地将它们击倒。"

# game/script.rpy:106526
translate chinese map303_78aca40d:

    # "The suits of armor stand no chance against The Blade of Exodus.{w}\nThe same could be said of Ulric's greatsword, and Sovy's fists.{w}\nI'm confident in our victory, but I try not to get too cocky."
    "空甲在放逐之刃面前毫无胜算。{w}\n乌尔里克的巨剑与索维的双拳也是如此。{w}\n我对胜利充满信心，但尽量不让自己太过自负。"

# game/script.rpy:106528
translate chinese map303_5e6dfd26:

    # "It seemed like there were almost a thousand suits of armor here.{w}\nThough we were doing good now, our bodies could easily weaken.{w}\nA viable tactic. Wear out your enemy with excessive numbers."
    "这里似乎有将近一千架空甲。{w}\n虽然我们眼下占优，但体力很容易耗尽。{w}\n这是个可行的战术。用压倒性的数量拖垮敌人。"

# game/script.rpy:106530
translate chinese map303_8be3a2c5:

    # "As we fight, we find ourselves surrounded more and more.{w}\nThe Honor Guard seems to have almost \"herded\" us to a specific location.{w}\nI stand back to back with Sovy and Ulric, and we're all panting heavily."
    "战斗之中，我们发现自己被越围越紧。{w}\n荣誉卫队似乎几乎把我们“驱赶”到了某个特定位置。{w}\n我和索维、乌尔里克背靠着背，全都剧烈喘息。"

# game/script.rpy:106555
translate chinese map303_15d45f0c:

    # voice "se/sovy44.ogg"
    voice "se/sovy44.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:106557
translate chinese map303_d44c812b:

    # char_sovy "Ulric, put away your sword."
    char_sovy "乌尔里克，把剑收起来。"

# game/script.rpy:106582
translate chinese map303_9095f257:

    # voice "se/z02775.ogg"
    voice "se/z02775.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:106584
translate chinese map303_f7c8325e:

    # char_ulric "Huh...?"
    char_ulric "嗯……？"

# game/script.rpy:106609
translate chinese map303_5f075cb0:

    # voice "se/sovy45.ogg"
    # char_sovy "Don't you remember...?"
    voice "se/sovy45.ogg"
    char_sovy "你不记得了吗……？"

# game/script.rpy:106624
translate chinese map303_35a4e97d:

    # "They both look at me."
    "他们两人都看向我。"

# game/script.rpy:106649
translate chinese map303_e2e209bf:

    # voice "se/z02777.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Yeah, of course."
    voice "se/z02777.ogg"
    char_ulric "嗯，当然。"

# game/script.rpy:106664
translate chinese map303_aa5eeb0f:

    # "He sheathes his massive blade as the suits close in on us."
    "空甲向我们逼近，他收起那把巨剑。"

# game/script.rpy:106689
translate chinese map303_17753692:

    # voice "se/sovy46.ogg"
    # char_sovy "[firstname], open your mind to us.\nTreat us as extensions of your body."
    voice "se/sovy46.ogg"
    char_sovy "[firstname]，向我们敞开心灵。\n把我们当作你身体的延伸。"

# game/script.rpy:106704
translate chinese map303_9058c202:

    # "I'm confused, but I nod.{w}\nWe need to take action — and now.{w}\nI lunge forward, and destroy one of the suits."
    "我虽困惑，还是点了点头。{w}\n我们必须行动——立刻。{w}\n我向前猛冲，摧毁了一架空甲。"

# game/script.rpy:106729
translate chinese map303_dc220920:

    # voice "se/sovy47.ogg"
    # char_sovy "Good. Now it's my turn."
    voice "se/sovy47.ogg"
    char_sovy "很好。现在轮到我了。"

# game/script.rpy:106744
translate chinese map303_67a6a8ce:

    # "Then, the blade moves from my hands, to Sovy's.{w}\nHe does the same as me, and destroys several suits.{w}\nAs if passing a baton, Ulric is up next, swinging the blade."
    "随后，剑从我的手中移到了索维手中。{w}\n他如我一般，摧毁了好几架空甲。{w}\n如同传递接力棒，接下来轮到乌尔里克挥动剑。"

# game/script.rpy:106769
translate chinese map303_3e5b08c5:

    # voice "se/z02780.ogg"
    # char_ulric "It's been too long, Sovy."
    voice "se/z02780.ogg"
    char_ulric "太久没这样了，索维。"

# game/script.rpy:106784
translate chinese map303_78a1b832:

    # "Then, almost instantaneously, it's back in my hands. I keep fighting.{w}\nWe're pressed back to back, exchanging the blade with our power.{w}\nPhasing it from person to person as needed, we're almost one mind."
    "紧接着，几乎在一瞬间，它又回到我手中。我继续战斗。{w}\n我们背贴着背，用力量传递着剑。{w}\n按需在彼此之间相位转移，我们几乎心意相通。"

# game/script.rpy:106809
translate chinese map303_e3e50db0:

    # voice "se/sovy48.ogg"
    # char_sovy "Yes. Really gets my blood boiling."
    voice "se/sovy48.ogg"
    char_sovy "是啊。真让我热血沸腾。"

# game/script.rpy:106824
translate chinese map303_6e7da7a6:

    # "As if it's an intricately choreographed dance, we continue to fight.{w}\nIn this moment, we really did command the blade. We were its owners.{w}\nI feel unstoppable. But then I realize, could The Triumvirate do this as well...?"
    "我们继续战斗，仿佛一支编排精妙的舞蹈。{w}\n这一刻，我们真正掌控了剑。我们是它的主人。{w}\n我感到势不可挡。但随即我意识到，三人执政团是否也能做到……？"

# game/script.rpy:106826
translate chinese map303_f3c20183:

    # "If they could, then we're in for a difficult fight."
    "如果他们也能，那这场仗就难打了。"

# game/script.rpy:106851
translate chinese map303_098e507d:

    # voice "se/z02782.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Over here...!"
    voice "se/z02782.ogg"
    char_ulric "这边……！"

# game/script.rpy:106866
translate chinese map303_d9db2735:

    # "I let Ulric take the blade, and we continue passing it around.{w}\nIt isn't much longer until the horde is thinned out. We're winning...!{w}\nThis is true teamwork. Unlike anything I've seen in my entire life."
    "我让乌尔里克接过剑，我们继续轮流传递。{w}\n没过多久，敌潮便被削减殆尽。我们要赢了……！{w}\n这才是真正的并肩作战。这种默契，我一生中从未见过。"

# game/script.rpy:106891
translate chinese map303_22b0e4d0:

    # voice "se/sovy49.ogg"
    # char_sovy "[firstname], look out!"
    voice "se/sovy49.ogg"
    char_sovy "[firstname]，小心！"

# game/script.rpy:106906
translate chinese map303_94533098:

    # "I take back the blade, and destroy the suits in front of me.{w}\nTheir numbers have easily halved in just a few short minutes.{w}\nAt this rate, we'd be free to take those stairs at any second."
    "我收回剑，摧毁面前的空甲。{w}\n短短几分钟内，它们的数量就轻松减半。{w}\n照这速度，我们随时都能腾出身来登上那些楼梯。"

# game/script.rpy:106931
translate chinese map303_26b188ea:

    # voice "se/sovy50.ogg"
    # char_sovy "They mean to kill us with mindless slaves.\nI wish they had the courage to meet us face to face."
    voice "se/sovy50.ogg"
    char_sovy "他们想用没有心智的奴隶来杀死我们。\n我倒希望他们有胆量与我们正面相见。"

# game/script.rpy:106946
translate chinese map303_d6602768:

    # "The Triumvirate must've been scared. I could feel it.{w}\nIn the end, all tyrants have left to do is cower in fright.{w}\nWhatever game they were playing, it would soon be over."
    "三人执政团一定是怕了。我能感觉到。{w}\n到头来，暴君们只剩下瑟瑟发抖的份。{w}\n无论他们在玩什么把戏，很快就要结束了。"

# game/script.rpy:106951
translate chinese map303_3c271503:

    # "We continue our dance, until the last suit of armor has fallen.{w}\nThough we're reduced to exhausted messes — we had won.{w}\nTaking deep breaths, we try and regain our composure."
    "我们的共舞持续到最后一架空甲倒下。{w}\n尽管我们已累得不成样子——但我们赢了。{w}\n我们深吸着气，努力平复心神。"

# game/script.rpy:106976
translate chinese map303_27eed72c:

    # voice "se/sovy51.ogg"
    # char_sovy "So — up we go?"
    voice "se/sovy51.ogg"
    char_sovy "那么——我们上去吗？"

# game/script.rpy:107002
translate chinese map303_90c9ab6d:

    # voice "se/z02786.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Yeah. "
    voice "se/z02786.ogg"
    char_ulric "嗯。"

# game/script.rpy:107029
translate chinese map303_ba4f228e:

    # "I phase the blade back into my hands, and sheathe it.{w}\nLooking toward the stairs, it seems our next goal is clear.{w}\nWhen we got up there, we'd make him regret taunting us."
    "我将剑相位转移回手中，收入鞘内。{w}\n望向楼梯，我们接下来的目标已然明确。{w}\n等我们上去，就让他为嘲弄我们而后悔。"

# game/script.rpy:107034
translate chinese map303_54f435c5:

    # "At Halin's command, The Honor Guard charges in our direction.{w}\nUlric is the first to fight, using that massive greatsword to protect me.{w}\nBut I make sure to play my part. I take them down with similar ease."
    "随着哈林一声令下，荣誉卫队朝我们冲来。{w}\n乌尔里克率先迎战，用那把巨剑护住我。{w}\n但我也尽好自己的本分，同样轻松地将它们击倒。"

# game/script.rpy:107036
translate chinese map303_c230ad60:

    # "The suits of armor stood no chance against The Blade of Exodus.{w}\nBut in this case — they also stood no chance against Ulric.{w}\nI'm confident in our victory, but I try not to get cocky."
    "空甲在放逐之刃面前毫无胜算。{w}\n但这一次——它们在乌尔里克面前同样毫无胜算。{w}\n我对胜利充满信心，但尽量不让自己太过自负。"

# game/script.rpy:107038
translate chinese map303_5e6dfd26_1:

    # "It seemed like there were almost a thousand suits of armor here.{w}\nThough we were doing good now, our bodies could easily weaken.{w}\nA viable tactic. Wear out your enemy with excessive numbers."
    "这里似乎有将近一千架空甲。{w}\n虽然我们眼下占优，但体力很容易耗尽。{w}\n这是个可行的战术。用压倒性的数量拖垮敌人。"

# game/script.rpy:107040
translate chinese map303_45ba8096:

    # "As we fight, we find ourselves surrounded more and more.{w}\nThe Honor Guard seems to have \"herded\" us into a specific location.{w}\nStanding back to back with Ulric, we pant heavily, a panic rising within us."
    "战斗之中，我们发现自己被越围越紧。{w}\n荣誉卫队似乎把我们“驱赶”到了某个特定位置。{w}\n我和乌尔里克背靠着背，剧烈喘息，心中升起一阵恐慌。"

# game/script.rpy:107065
translate chinese map303_00e78523:

    # voice "se/z02787b.ogg"
    voice "se/z02787b.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:107067
translate chinese map303_39542cdc:

    # char_ulric "I have an idea, [firstname]."
    char_ulric "我有个主意，[firstname]。"

# game/script.rpy:107081
translate chinese map303_b0731411:

    # "I tilt my head toward Ulric, to signal that I'm listening.{w}\nMuch to my surprise, he sheathes his greatsword."
    "我朝乌尔里克偏了偏头，示意我在听。{w}\n让我大为意外的是，他收起了巨剑。"

# game/script.rpy:107106
translate chinese map303_e1809d79:

    # voice "se/z02788.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Think of me as an extension of your body.\nOpen your mind — and trust me."
    voice "se/z02788.ogg"
    char_ulric "把我当作你身体的延伸。\n敞开心灵——相信我。"

# game/script.rpy:107121
translate chinese map303_a3ee3bcf:

    # "I'm confused, but I nod.{w}\nThere's no time to talk, they're closing in on us.{w}\nI lunge forward, and destroy one of the suits."
    "我虽困惑，还是点了点头。{w}\n没时间多说了，它们正逼近我们。{w}\n我向前猛冲，摧毁了一架空甲。"

# game/script.rpy:107146
translate chinese map303_1e408a80:

    # voice "se/z02789.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Now it's my turn."
    voice "se/z02789.ogg"
    char_ulric "现在轮到我了。"

# game/script.rpy:107161
translate chinese map303_8c5d448b:

    # "The blade disappears from my hands, and appears in Ulric's.{w}\nHe uses it to slice through the suits that were closing in on him.{w}\nAs if passing a baton, the blade phases back into my hands."
    "剑从我手中消失，出现在乌尔里克手中。{w}\n他用它劈开逼近自己的空甲。{w}\n如同传递接力棒，剑又相位转移回我手中。"

# game/script.rpy:107176
translate chinese map303_b172395b:

    # voice "se/z02790.ogg"
    # char_ulric "I haven't fought like this in ages.\nReally gets your blood boiling, doesn't it?"
    voice "se/z02790.ogg"
    char_ulric "我好多年没这样战斗过了。\n真让人热血沸腾，对吧？"

# game/script.rpy:107191
translate chinese map303_ab740be8:

    # "We're pressed back to back, and we keep exchanging the blade.{w}\nPhasing it from person to person as needed, we're almost one mind.{w}\nLike an intricately choreographed dance, we continue to fight."
    "我们紧贴着背，不断交换剑。{w}\n按需在彼此之间相位转移，我们几乎心意相通。{w}\n如同一支编排精妙的舞蹈，我们继续战斗。"

# game/script.rpy:107216
translate chinese map303_a375113c:

    # voice "se/z02791.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Takes me back to my time with Sovy.\nPerfect teamwork; almost unstoppable."
    voice "se/z02791.ogg"
    char_ulric "让我想起和索维并肩的时光。\n完美的配合；几乎无人可挡。"

# game/script.rpy:107231
translate chinese map303_9f49a740:

    # "With each passing second, we thin out the horde.{w}\nTheir numbers easily half, then they do so again, and again.{w}\nI let Ulric take the blade again, and we keep passing it back and forth."
    "每一秒过去，我们都在削减敌潮。{w}\n它们的数量轻松减半，接着又减半，一再减半。{w}\n我让乌尔里克再次接过剑，我们继续来回传递。"

# game/script.rpy:107256
translate chinese map303_71a47332:

    # voice "se/z02792.ogg"
    # char_ulric "I wish they had the courage to face us in person.\nAll they can do is hide behind their mindless slaves."
    voice "se/z02792.ogg"
    char_ulric "我倒希望他们有胆量亲自与我们交手。\n他们所能做的，只是躲在没有心智的奴隶背后。"

# game/script.rpy:107271
translate chinese map303_ffb997f1:

    # "I could feel it. The Triumvirate was scared of us.{w}\nIn the end, all tyrants could do is cower in fright.{w}\nThey knew they had lost, and mean to buy time."
    "我能感觉到。三人执政团怕我们。{w}\n到头来，暴君们所能做的只有瑟瑟发抖。{w}\n他们知道自己败了，只想拖延时间。"

# game/script.rpy:107273
translate chinese map303_73c4080d:

    # "But that wasn't a luxury we were selling.\nAs the last suit of armor falls, we too, fall to our knees.{w}\nPanting heavily, we realize just how much of a fight we put up."
    "但这份奢侈，我们可不卖。\n最后一架空甲倒下时，我们也跪倒在地。{w}\n剧烈喘息间，我们才意识到自己打了多么艰苦的一仗。"

# game/script.rpy:107275
translate chinese map303_26122fc4:

    # "I'll never forget this moment. Not for the rest of my life.{w}\nFighting side by side with another Exodus wielder...?{w}\nIf I were The Triumvirate, I'd be very, very afraid."
    "我永远不会忘记这一刻。余生都不会。{w}\n与另一位放逐之刃的持有者并肩作战……？{w}\n我要是三人执政团，肯定会非常、非常害怕。"

# game/script.rpy:107277
translate chinese map303_ca6ecc4f:

    # "It feels like an eternity before I can rise to my feet again.{w}\nBut when I do, I sheathe the blade, and look over at Ulric.{w}\nHe was staring at the stairs. Our next objective."
    "仿佛过了永恒那么久，我才重新站起身。{w}\n起身后，我收起剑，望向乌尔里克。{w}\n他正盯着楼梯。那是我们的下一个目标。"

# game/script.rpy:107302
translate chinese map303_ab495a61:

    # voice "se/z02793.ogg"
    # char_ulric "If we get into a bind, let's just do the same thing.\nThat blade, and our connection, is our greatest weapon."
    voice "se/z02793.ogg"
    char_ulric "要是陷入困境，我们就再来一次。\n那把剑，以及我们之间的联结，就是我们最强的武器。"

# game/script.rpy:107317
translate chinese map303_8ce61eb8:

    # "I nod."
    "我点点头。"

# game/script.rpy:107342
translate chinese map303_96198bcc:

    # voice "se/z02794.ogg"
    # char_ulric "And something tells me we'll be needing it when we face Halin.\nAre you ready to go upstairs...? He's all that stands in our way."
    voice "se/z02794.ogg"
    char_ulric "我有种预感，面对哈林时我们会用上它。\n你准备好上楼了吗……？他是唯一挡在我们面前的人。"

# game/script.rpy:107357
translate chinese map303_45d368e3:

    # "I nod once more."
    "我再次点点头。"

# game/script.rpy:107382
translate chinese map303_a5e43adc:

    # voice "se/z02795b.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Good. Then let's go.\nRemember, if you get the chance — save him.\nI understand if you can't, but he {i}deserves{/i} freedom."
    voice "se/z02795b.ogg"
    char_ulric "很好。那我们走吧。\n记住，如果有机会——救他。\n你做不到我也理解，但他{i}理应{/i}得到自由。"

# game/script.rpy:107407
translate chinese map303_8dfa9e0a:

    # "It's true. Everybody deserved to be free from The Triumvirate.{w}\nBut Halin wasn't willing. We'd have to force him somehow.{w}\nAnd if we couldn't, then unfortunately, I'd have to kill him."
    "的确如此。每个人都该从三人执政团手中获得自由。{w}\n但哈林不愿。我们得想个办法强迫他。{w}\n要是做不到，那很遗憾，我只能杀了他。"

# game/script.rpy:107411
translate chinese map303_f842481c:

    # "We make our way upstairs, in pursuit of Halin.{w}\nAfter what just happened — I was certain we'd win this.{w}\nWith our strength combined, nothing could stand in our way."
    "我们上楼，追赶哈林。{w}\n经历了刚才的事——我确信我们会赢。{w}\n我们的力量合而为一，再无任何东西能阻挡我们。"

# game/script.rpy:107441
translate chinese map304_765de795:

    # "The first thing I see is stairs. Lots of stairs.{w}\nThey lead upwards, and in every conceivable direction.{w}\nI know I was told there'd be lots of stairs. But this is insane."
    "我首先看到的是楼梯。数不清的楼梯。{w}\n它们向上延伸，通向四面八方。{w}\n我知道有人告诉过我楼梯很多。但这也太夸张了。"

# game/script.rpy:107443
translate chinese map304_8b7aa209:

    # "The second thing I notice, is the complete lack of Halin.{w}\nHad he fleed up those staircases? Where could he be?{w}\nActually, I'm starting to wonder how he disappeared like that."
    "我注意到的第二件事，就是哈林完全不见了踪影。{w}\n他是沿着那些楼梯逃上去了吗？他能在哪儿？{w}\n其实，我开始好奇他是怎么那样凭空消失的。"

# game/script.rpy:107445
translate chinese map304_c892ab4a:

    # "If he was made from the blade, could he phase around as well?{w}\nI hope that's not the case. That would prove far too tricky.{w}\nHowever, due to his loyalty, I know we'd be in for a fight."
    "如果他是剑所造，那是否也能相位转移？{w}\n希望不是如此。那会棘手得多。{w}\n不过，鉴于他的忠诚，我知道这一战在所难免。"

# game/script.rpy:107447
translate chinese map304_740df668:

    # "Destroyed suits of armor, and their swords, line the floor.{w}\nThis must've been the remnant of a previous fight.{w}\nPerhaps Fortaime or Pro came here before us."
    "地上散落着毁坏的空甲与它们的剑。{w}\n这一定是先前某场战斗留下的残迹。{w}\n也许福泰姆或普洛比我们先到过这里。"

# game/script.rpy:107473
translate chinese map304_4a361ee7:

    # voice "se/sovy52.ogg"
    voice "se/sovy52.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:107475
translate chinese map304_b2b3a7fc:

    # char_sovy "Be careful, [firstname].\nTry not to let Halin steal the blade from you.\nRemember, we all possess the same ability."
    char_sovy "小心，[firstname]。\n别让哈林把剑从你手中夺走。\n记住，我们都拥有相同的能力。"

# game/script.rpy:107500
translate chinese map304_87bdd7bf:

    # voice "se/z02797b.ogg"
    voice "se/z02797b.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:107502
translate chinese map304_d9829dec:

    # char_ulric "Yeah — make sure to be on your guard.\nWe killed his suits, so he's probably scared.\nI wouldn't be surprised if he resorts to trickery."
    char_ulric "是啊——务必保持警惕。\n我们杀了他的空甲，他大概怕了。\n他要是耍什么诡计，我一点也不意外。"

# game/script.rpy:107528
translate chinese map304_b6aee705:

    # voice "se/z02798.ogg"
    voice "se/z02798.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:107530
translate chinese map304_bc039c2b:

    # char_ulric "Be careful, [firstname]. This could be tricky.\nRemember that Halin can wield the blade, just like us.\nIn fact, since he was made from it, his affinity could be stronger."
    char_ulric "小心，[firstname]。这可能很棘手。\n记住哈林能像我们一样驾驭那把剑。\n事实上，既然他是剑所造，他与剑的契合度或许更强。"

# game/script.rpy:107543
translate chinese map304_beeb2470:

    # voice "se/z02799b.ogg"
    # char_ulric "He's backed into a corner, so we don't know how he'll react.\nI wouldn't be surprised if he resorted to some sort of trap.\nA cornered man is always desperate in his final moments."
    voice "se/z02799b.ogg"
    char_ulric "他被逼入绝境，我们不知道他会作何反应。\n他要是设下什么陷阱，我一点也不意外。\n走投无路的人，在最后时刻总会拼命。"

# game/script.rpy:107570
translate chinese map304_72b2c025:

    # "I nod. That was good advice.{w}\nI take it to heart, as we walk toward the stairs.{w}\nWe hear Halin's voice, but can't see him at all."
    "我点点头。那是很好的忠告。{w}\n我们朝楼梯走去，我把这话记在心上。{w}\n我们听见哈林的声音，却完全看不见他。"

# game/script.rpy:107595
translate chinese map304_307a8a0b:

    # voice "se/z02800.ogg"
    voice "se/z02800.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:107597
translate chinese map304_0edb94ef:

    # char_halin "Well then, perhaps you're stronger than I thought.\nNo matter, though — I've been waiting for a worthy opponent.\nI'll savor killing you, \"Monarch\". Every. Single. Moment."
    char_halin "那么，或许你们比我以为的更强。\n不过无妨——我一直在等一个配得上我的对手。\n我会细细品味杀死你的过程，“君主”。每。一。刻。"

# game/script.rpy:107611
translate chinese map304_4b1b73e9:

    # "That's when I finally see him. On one of the many flights of stairs.{w}\nHe's slowly making his way down, almost as if he's buying some time.{w}\nI move to meet him halfway, but suddenly, there's no need to move at all."
    "就在这时，我终于看见了他。在许多段楼梯中的一段上。{w}\n他缓缓走下来，几乎像是在拖延时间。{w}\n我正要上前与他会合，却突然发现根本不必移动。"

# game/script.rpy:107636
translate chinese map304_1eece997:

    # voice "se/z02801.ogg"
    voice "se/z02801.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:107638
translate chinese map304_c7d617c5:

    # char_ulric "[firstname]! Look out...!"
    char_ulric "[firstname]！小心……！"

# game/script.rpy:107655
translate chinese map304_ff12d059:

    # "Almost instinctively, I lower myself as close to the ground as possible.{w}\nFrom behind, a massive sword is swung. It came close to removing my head.{w}\nI turn around, greeted to the sight of Halin. So he {i}can{/i} move around like that."
    "几乎出于本能，我尽可能压低身体。{w}\n一把巨剑从身后挥来。险些削掉我的脑袋。{w}\n我转过身，映入眼帘的是哈林。原来他{i}真的{/i}能那样四处移动。"

# game/script.rpy:107683
translate chinese map304_0486159d:

    # voice "se/z02802.ogg"
    # char_halin "Saved by your friends, as always.\nI wonder how you'd handle things on your own.\nWhat do you say — want to put that to the test...?"
    voice "se/z02802.ogg"
    char_halin "一如既往，被朋友们救了。\n我倒想知道你独自一人时会怎么应对。\n怎么样——想试试看吗……？"

# game/script.rpy:107698
translate chinese map304_60293995:

    # "Ulric steps forward, interrupting before I can respond."
    "我还没来得及回答，乌尔里克便上前打断。"

# game/script.rpy:107723
translate chinese map304_bcd245bf:

    # voice "se/z02803.ogg"
    # char_ulric "We don't have time for your games, Halin.\nWe'll give you one chance. Surrender, or die."
    voice "se/z02803.ogg"
    char_ulric "我们没时间陪你玩把戏，哈林。\n我们给你一次机会。投降，或者死。"

# game/script.rpy:107749
translate chinese map304_b6dde4a2:

    # voice "se/z02804.ogg"
    # char_halin "And who says {i}you{/i} get to call the shots?\nRemember, I exist to manifest The Triumvirate's will.\nAnd right now — what they want — is to see you all dead."
    voice "se/z02804.ogg"
    char_halin "谁说{i}你们{/i}能发号施令？\n记住，我存在的意义就是彰显三人执政团的意志。\n而此刻——他们所愿的——就是看你们全都死掉。"

# game/script.rpy:107764
translate chinese map304_d4c62dec:

    # "Halin draws another sword, holding out two large blades."
    "哈林又拔出一把剑，手持两柄巨剑。"

# game/script.rpy:107789
translate chinese map304_68f81179:

    # voice "se/z02805.ogg"
    # char_halin "I've never let them down, and I don't plan on starting.\nYou think you're special? That you're here to seize your destiny?\nNo. You're nothing more than another insect for me to crush."
    voice "se/z02805.ogg"
    char_halin "我从未让他们失望过，也不打算破例。\n你以为自己很特别？以为你来这是为了夺取天命？\n不。你不过是我又要碾死的一只虫子。"

# game/script.rpy:107803
translate chinese map304_0c984988:

    # voice "se/z02806.ogg"
    # char_halin "You may have made it farther than most, but it doesn't matter.\nEven atop the highest mountain, an insect is still an insect.\nA being that exists for one purpose — to be exterminated."
    voice "se/z02806.ogg"
    char_halin "你或许比大多数人走得更远，但这无关紧要。\n即便身处最高的山巅，虫子终究是虫子。\n一种只为某个目的而存在的生物——被消灭。"

# game/script.rpy:107830
translate chinese map304_345e4ae7:

    # "He charges toward me, and I do the same.{w}\nPulling out The Blade of Exodus, our swords clash as we meet.{w}\nThey meet again, and again — the echo filling the room as we fight."
    "他朝我冲来，我也迎了上去。{w}\n我拔出放逐之刃，两剑相接，我们正面交锋。{w}\n剑锋一次次相击——交锋声中，回响充满了整个房间。"

# game/script.rpy:107832
translate chinese map304_2b26bf4e:

    # "His strength is astounding, as well as his speed.{w}\nI've never seen a man fight with two swords quite so gracefully.{w}\nHe tries to trick me, with fake swings, and sudden movements."
    "他的力量和速度都令人惊叹。{w}\n我从未见过有人双手使剑能有这般优雅。{w}\n他试图用虚招和突然的变招来迷惑我。"

# game/script.rpy:107834
translate chinese map304_6cae959e:

    # "But he'll have to try harder than that. I counter him with ease.{w}\nThis dance continues, and we show no signs of tiring out.{w}\nAt this rate, death would come to whoever slipped up first."
    "但他还得再加把劲。我轻松地化解了他的攻势。{w}\n这共舞持续着，我们都没有疲态。{w}\n照这样下去，谁先失手，谁就会死。"

# game/script.rpy:107836
translate chinese map304_4f1be200:

    # "But I can't slip up. I have to win, and take down The Triumvirate.{w}\nThis world belonged to {i}me{/i}. I was the rightful heir to the throne.{w}\nHalin was just a lackey to some power hungry group of three."
    "但我不能失手。我必须赢，必须推翻三人执政团。{w}\n这个世界本就属于{i}我{/i}。我是王位的合法继承人。{w}\n哈林不过是那三个贪权者的走狗。"

# game/script.rpy:107838
translate chinese map304_c53d2a22:

    # "If there was any justice in the world, then I would prevail.{w}\nPerhaps I let that get to my head. This allows Halin to land a blow.{w}\nThrusting his blade into my shoulder, he twists it, then pulls it out."
    "若这世上还有公道，那我必胜。{w}\n也许我因此冲昏了头。这让哈林抓住机会命中一剑。{w}\n他把剑刺进我的肩膀，拧转一下，又拔了出来。"

# game/script.rpy:107840
translate chinese map304_091f5849:

    # "It was a wound that would prove to be harmless, in the long run.{w}\nBut the pain is so intense, all I can do is stand there, stiff and motionless.{w}\nMy blood drips to the floor, and I take a few steps back, losing balance."
    "长远来看，这伤口算不上大碍。{w}\n但疼痛如此剧烈，我只能僵立原地，动弹不得。{w}\n鲜血滴落在地，我踉跄后退几步，失去了平衡。"

# game/script.rpy:107869
translate chinese map304_638b51af:

    # voice "se/sovy53.ogg"
    voice "se/sovy53.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:107871
translate chinese map304_91be6ddd:

    # char_sovy "[firstname]...!"
    char_sovy "[firstname]……！"

# game/script.rpy:107885
translate chinese map304_2219c89a:

    # "Sovy lunges forward, and pushes me to the ground.{w}\nPhasing the blade into his hands, he blocks Halin's next attack.{w}\nI bleed on the floor as I watch Sovy fight his former Apprentice."
    "索维冲上前，把我推倒在地。{w}\n他将剑相位转移到手中，挡下哈林接下来的攻击。{w}\n我躺在地上流血，看着索维与他昔日的学徒交手。"

# game/script.rpy:107913
translate chinese map304_e0e7dad0:

    # voice "se/z02808.ogg"
    voice "se/z02808.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:107915
translate chinese map304_8dabdd70:

    # char_halin "There's something different about you, Sovy.\nWhere was this passion when {i}we{/i} worked together...?"
    char_halin "你有些不一样了，索维。\n{i}我们{/i}并肩行动的时候，这份热情去哪了……？"

# game/script.rpy:107929
translate chinese map304_1446c538:

    # "Swords continue to clash, and Halin is right.{w}\nI've never seen Sovy quite so determined."
    "剑继续相交，哈林说得没错。{w}\n我从未见过索维如此决绝。"

# game/script.rpy:107954
translate chinese map304_e9039750:

    # voice "se/sovy54.ogg"
    # char_sovy "The Triumvirate doesn't allow passion, Halin. They take everything away. \nThey bleed you dry, and offer nothing in return. Nothing but empty words!\nThe Rebellion gave me a place in this world. I belong to them, now!"
    voice "se/sovy54.ogg"
    char_sovy "三人执政团不容许热情，哈林。他们会夺走一切。\n他们榨干你，却什么也不给。只有空话！\n是反抗军给了我在这世上的位置。我现在属于他们！"

# game/script.rpy:107982
translate chinese map304_75f6cdbb:

    # voice "se/z02810.ogg"
    voice "se/z02810.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:107984
translate chinese map304_397d3c42:

    # char_halin "You mean they seduced you with flights of fancy.\nYou honestly believe that {i}he{/i} is our rightful ruler...?"
    char_halin "你是说，他们用那些天花乱坠的幻想诱惑了你。\n你真的相信{i}他{/i}是我们合法的统治者……？"

# game/script.rpy:107989
translate chinese map304_5fd86169:

    # voice "se/z02811.ogg"
    voice "se/z02811.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:107991
translate chinese map304_d6e29617:

    # char_halin "You mean they seduced you with flights of fancy.\nYou honestly believe that {i}she{/i} is our rightful ruler...?"
    char_halin "你是说，他们用那些天花乱坠的幻想诱惑了你。\n你真的相信{i}她{/i}是我们合法的统治者……？"

# game/script.rpy:108007
translate chinese map304_15c46f83:

    # "Sovy nods."
    "索维点点头。"

# game/script.rpy:108032
translate chinese map304_9b7c4d2b:

    # voice "se/sovy55.ogg"
    # char_sovy "Without a doubt. I'd give my {i}life{/i} for [firstname]....\nI know the truth of the Spirit Realm. The Triumvirate told me.\nThis isn't some dream, or fantasy. They told me themselves...!"
    voice "se/sovy55.ogg"
    char_sovy "毫无疑问。我愿为[firstname]献出{i}生命{/i}……\n我知道灵界的真相。是三人执政团亲口告诉我的。\n这不是什么梦，也不是幻想。是他们亲口说的……！"

# game/script.rpy:108047
translate chinese map304_5d43c046:

    # "Halin seems surprised, as if he still trusts Sovy."
    "哈林似乎很惊讶，仿佛他仍然信任着索维。"

# game/script.rpy:108072
translate chinese map304_b7fb1336:

    # voice "se/z02813.ogg"
    # char_halin "You mean...?"
    voice "se/z02813.ogg"
    char_halin "你是说……？"

# game/script.rpy:108098
translate chinese map304_8f137d4d:

    # voice "se/sovy56.ogg"
    # char_sovy "Yes. That's what they told me before we left for Mazeo.\nIt's why I didn't kill The Monarch when I had the chance.\nI told myself I'd never harm those in charge of this world."
    voice "se/sovy56.ogg"
    char_sovy "是的。那是我们出发去马泽奥之前，他们告诉我的。\n所以我才没有在有机会时杀掉君主。\n我告诉自己，绝不伤害执掌这个世界的人。"

# game/script.rpy:108112
translate chinese map304_dbd3dc1e:

    # voice "se/sovy57.ogg"
    # char_sovy "That's what separates the both of us, Halin.\nMy loyalty is to Alestia. {i}Yours{/i} is to The Triumvirate.\nThey made you a slave, with no choice but to obey."
    voice "se/sovy57.ogg"
    char_sovy "这就是我们两人的区别，哈林。\n我忠于阿莱斯蒂亚。{i}你{/i}忠于三人执政团。\n他们把你变成了奴隶，让你别无选择，只能服从。"

# game/script.rpy:108138
translate chinese map304_cee711fa:

    # voice "se/z02816.ogg"
    # char_halin "No. I {i}want{/i} to serve them...!\nYour faith was challenged, and {i}you{/i} gave up.\nI'm not that weak. I stand tall, and remain in line."
    voice "se/z02816.ogg"
    char_halin "不。我{i}想{/i}效忠他们……！\n你的信念受到挑战，于是{i}你{/i}放弃了。\n我没那么软弱。我挺直腰杆，恪守本分。"

# game/script.rpy:108153
translate chinese map304_861ca680:

    # "Sovy lowers the blade, signalling his intent to stop fighting."
    "索维放下剑，示意自己无意再战。"

# game/script.rpy:108178
translate chinese map304_737ab43e:

    # voice "se/sovy58.ogg"
    # char_sovy "Then let [firstname] remove the curse they've put on you.\nIf you still want to serve them, then we can continue to fight.\nAnd if not — then you'll realize that you were wrong all along."
    voice "se/sovy58.ogg"
    char_sovy "那就让[firstname]解除他们加在你身上的诅咒。\n如果你仍想效忠他们，我们就继续打。\n若不然——你就会明白，你一直都错了。"

# game/script.rpy:108193
translate chinese map304_2a579a98:

    # "Halin reacts with anger to that last part, and charges toward Sovy.{w}\nThey're fighting again. Just when things started to turn around."
    "哈林对最后那句话勃然大怒，朝索维冲去。{w}\n他们又打起来了。就在局势刚有转机的时候。"

# game/script.rpy:108218
translate chinese map304_8b0408f7:

    # voice "se/z02818.ogg"
    # char_halin "No — I'm not wrong. I'll never give up, Sovy. Never!\nIf you want to pay with your life, then I'll accept that toll.\nBut know this. It brings me no pleasure to—"
    voice "se/z02818.ogg"
    char_halin "不——我没错。我绝不放弃，索维。绝不！\n既然你想用性命来付账，那我就收下这份代价。\n但你要知道。这并非我所愿——"

# game/script.rpy:108233
translate chinese map304_25e7012c:

    # "And a moment later, Sovy thrusts the blade through Halin's gut.{w}\nSovy looks horrified, as he harms his former Apprentice, and friend.{w}\nNo turning back. This was the exact moment his defection was complete."
    "片刻之后，索维把剑刺进了哈林的腹部。{w}\n伤到自己昔日的学徒兼朋友，索维一脸骇然。{w}\n再无回头路。就在这一刻，他的叛离彻底完成。"

# game/script.rpy:108258
translate chinese map304_91d9fd8e:

    # voice "se/z02819.ogg"
    # char_halin "S-Sovy...?"
    voice "se/z02819.ogg"
    char_halin "索……索维……？"

# game/script.rpy:108280
translate chinese map304_71a5a612:

    # "Halin grunts in pain as Sovy removes the blade.{w}\nA horrific wound, but I don't think it would be enough.{w}\nCreated from the blade, Halin was surely resilient."
    "索维拔出剑，哈林痛得闷哼出声。{w}\n好可怕的伤口，但我觉得这还不够。{w}\n既然由剑所造，哈林一定很顽强。"

# game/script.rpy:108305
translate chinese map304_1f67d867:

    # voice "se/sovy59.ogg"
    # char_sovy "Halin, I'm sorry...\nI — I didn't want it to be this way...!"
    voice "se/sovy59.ogg"
    char_sovy "哈林，对不起……\n我——我不想变成这样……！"

# game/script.rpy:108320
translate chinese map304_d6784917:

    # "I can hear such sadness in his voice. He's conflicted.{w}\nLooking down at the floor, Sovy shakes as he watches Halin bleed out.{w}\nA moment later, he falls forward, and Sovy catches him in his arms."
    "我能听出他声音里的悲伤。他内心挣扎。{w}\n索维低头看着地面，望着哈林流血不止，浑身发颤。{w}\n片刻之后，哈林向前倒下，索维用双臂接住了他。"

# game/script.rpy:108322
translate chinese map304_e28baaae:

    # "On the verge of tears, Sovy turns Halin around.{w}\nLowering him to the ground, he puts him in a strong chokehold.{w}\nHalin struggles, trying to escape, but the wound rendered him too weak."
    "索维几乎要落泪，把哈林转过身来。{w}\n他将哈林放到地上，牢牢勒住他的脖颈。{w}\n哈林挣扎着想挣脱，但伤势让他太过虚弱。"

# game/script.rpy:108347
translate chinese map304_e42871ef:

    # voice "se/sovy60.ogg"
    # char_sovy "[firstname]...! Do something!\nI don't care what it is — just do it!"
    voice "se/sovy60.ogg"
    char_sovy "[firstname]……！做点什么！\n我不管是什么——快动手！"

# game/script.rpy:108369
translate chinese map304_343714da:

    # "I look over at Ulric, and he watches in shock.{w}\nI know that wound wouldn't kill Halin. Just temporarily incapacitate him.{w}\nSovy must've known. But the sight, and what he did, was still too much for him."
    "我看向乌尔里克，他震惊地望着这一切。{w}\n我知道那伤杀不死哈林，只会让他暂时失去行动力。{w}\n索维一定也清楚。但眼前的景象，以及自己所做的，仍让他难以承受。"

# game/script.rpy:108371
translate chinese map304_19202b55:

    # "There's no way Halin could fight back right now.{w}\nI could kill him with no difficulty at all. But I could also save him.{w}\nIf I removed the curse on his mind, maybe he'd serve our cause instead."
    "哈林此刻绝无可能反击。{w}\n我可以毫不费力地杀了他，但也能救他。{w}\n若我解除他脑中的诅咒，或许他会转而为我们的事业效力。"

# game/script.rpy:108373
translate chinese map304_979b2655:

    # "But was that worth the risk...?{w}\nSomething tells me I don't have much time to decide.{w}\nIf Sovy held him like that for too long, he'd be dead for sure."
    "但这值得冒险吗……？{w}\n我有种预感，没多少时间让我犹豫了。{w}\n要是索维那样勒他太久，他必死无疑。"

# game/script.rpy:108402
translate chinese map304_087d18db:

    # voice "se/z02822.ogg"
    voice "se/z02822.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:108404
translate chinese map304_a83226c2:

    # char_ulric "[firstname]...!"
    char_ulric "[firstname]……！"

# game/script.rpy:108418
translate chinese map304_a32241ef:

    # "Ulric lunges forward, and pushes me to the ground.{w}\nPhasing the blade into his hands, he blocks Halin's next attack.{w}\nI bleed on the floor as I watch Ulric fight The Triumvirate's right hand."
    "乌尔里克冲上前，把我推倒在地。{w}\n他将剑相位转移到手中，挡下哈林接下来的攻击。{w}\n我躺在地上流血，看着乌尔里克与三人执政团的右手交手。"

# game/script.rpy:108443
translate chinese map304_0cb6ae72:

    # voice "se/z02823.ogg"
    voice "se/z02823.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:108445
translate chinese map304_c7ae6fef:

    # char_halin "Hmm. You're certainly stronger than Sovy.\nIt's a shame that you defected. I could use you."
    char_halin "唔。你确实比索维强。\n你叛离了，真是可惜。我本可以用你。"

# game/script.rpy:108470
translate chinese map304_2eb6acb2:

    # voice "se/z02824.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Defected? No. I simply chose the right path.\nAnd you can do that too, Halin. It's not too late."
    voice "se/z02824.ogg"
    char_ulric "叛离？不。我只是选择了正确的路。\n你也可以这么做，哈林。还不算晚。"

# game/script.rpy:108485
translate chinese map304_f99e239e:

    # "Halin laughs, and they continue to fight.{w}\nSwords clash, but Ulric clearly has the edge."
    "哈林大笑，两人继续交手。{w}\n剑刃相交，但乌尔里克明显占了上风。"

# game/script.rpy:108510
translate chinese map304_b107e1e7:

    # voice "se/z02825.ogg"
    # char_ulric "There's no passion in serving The Triumvirate.\nThey take everything away. They bleed you dry.\nAnd what's worse, they give nothing in return."
    voice "se/z02825.ogg"
    char_ulric "效忠三人执政团毫无热情可言。\n他们会夺走一切。他们榨干你。\n更糟的是，他们什么回报都不给。"

# game/script.rpy:108514
translate chinese map304_e752c039:

    # voice "se/z02826.ogg"
    # char_ulric "The Rebellion gave me everything I needed.\nA family. A home. A place in this world.\nI belong to them now, and that's final."
    voice "se/z02826.ogg"
    char_ulric "反抗军给了我所需的一切。\n一个家。一个归宿。在这世上的一席之地。\n我现在属于他们，仅此而已。"

# game/script.rpy:108529
translate chinese map304_1d4ec73e:

    # "Halin shakes his head."
    "哈林摇摇头。"

# game/script.rpy:108556
translate chinese map304_c669d758:

    # voice "se/z02827.ogg"
    voice "se/z02827.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:108558
translate chinese map304_b838a350:

    # char_halin "You're a fool. They seduce you with flights of fancy.\nYou ran to the {i}first{/i} group that made you feel a sense of purpose.\nDo you honestly think that {i}he{/i} is the rightful ruler of Alestia...?"
    char_halin "你是个蠢货。他们用天花乱坠的幻想诱惑你。\n你投向了{i}第一个{/i}让你感到有意义的团体。\n你真的相信{i}他{/i}是阿莱斯蒂亚合法的统治者……？"

# game/script.rpy:108563
translate chinese map304_24e04a82:

    # voice "se/z02828.ogg"
    voice "se/z02828.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:108565
translate chinese map304_1852a981:

    # char_halin "You're a fool. They seduce you with flights of fancy.\nYou ran to the first group that made you feel a sense of purpose.\nDo you honestly think that {i}she{/i} is the rightful ruler of Alestia...?"
    char_halin "你是个蠢货。他们用天花乱坠的幻想诱惑你。\n你投向了第一个让你感到有意义的团体。\n你真的相信{i}她{/i}是阿莱斯蒂亚合法的统治者……？"

# game/script.rpy:108581
translate chinese map304_a8ef33a0:

    # "Ulric nods."
    "乌尔里克点点头。"

# game/script.rpy:108606
translate chinese map304_31f9ec83:

    # voice "se/z02829.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Without a doubt. I'd give my life for [firstname].\nThe truth of the Spirit Realm only proves that I'm correct.\nThey told Sovy, and look at what happened. Think, Halin."
    voice "se/z02829.ogg"
    char_ulric "毫无疑问。我愿为[firstname]献出生命。\n灵界的真相恰恰证明我是对的。\n他们告诉过索维，看看结果如何。想一想，哈林。"

# game/script.rpy:108620
translate chinese map304_fc0bb173:

    # voice "se/z02830.ogg"
    # char_ulric "I'm not weak. My loyalty was just different from yours.\nWhile I want to serve Alestia, you want to serve The Triumvirate.\nBut they made you that way. We can change you, if you'll let us."
    voice "se/z02830.ogg"
    char_ulric "我不软弱。我的忠诚只是与你不同。\n我想效忠阿莱斯蒂亚，你却想效忠三人执政团。\n但那是他们把你塑造成这样的。只要你愿意，我们就能改变你。"

# game/script.rpy:108635
translate chinese map304_f60fe7d0:

    # "They continue to fight, as they argue with one another."
    "他们一边争论，一边继续交手。"

# game/script.rpy:108660
translate chinese map304_45b23684:

    # voice "se/z02831.ogg"
    # char_halin "No. I {i}want{/i} to serve them! \nYou run away, while I stand tall, and remain in line.\nHow can you say you're not weak, after what you've done?"
    voice "se/z02831.ogg"
    char_halin "不。我{i}想{/i}效忠他们！\n你只会逃跑，而我仍挺直腰杆，恪守本分。\n做了那些事之后，你怎么还敢说自己不软弱？"

# game/script.rpy:108675
translate chinese map304_95c0377b:

    # "Ulric lowers his sword, signalling his intent to stop fighting."
    "乌尔里克放下剑，示意自己无意再战。"

# game/script.rpy:108700
translate chinese map304_794aab01:

    # voice "se/z02832.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Are you willing to bet on that...?"
    voice "se/z02832.ogg"
    char_ulric "你愿意为此赌一把吗……？"

# game/script.rpy:108726
translate chinese map304_fed46e76:

    # voice "se/z02833.ogg"
    # char_halin "Hmm..."
    voice "se/z02833.ogg"
    char_halin "唔……"

# game/script.rpy:108741
translate chinese map304_3b662b6f:

    # "Halin still holds his swords up, to guard himself."
    "哈林仍举着双剑，警惕地护住自己。"

# game/script.rpy:108766
translate chinese map304_26dd0f06:

    # voice "se/z02834.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Let [firstname] remove the curse that they put on you.\nIf you still want to serve them, then we can continue to fight.\nAnd if not — then you'll realize that you were wrong all along."
    voice "se/z02834.ogg"
    char_ulric "那就让[firstname]解除他们加在你身上的诅咒。\n如果你仍想效忠他们，我们就继续打。\n若不然——你就会明白，你一直都错了。"

# game/script.rpy:108792
translate chinese map304_ee1fe01d:

    # voice "se/z02835.ogg"
    # char_halin "No... I can't..."
    voice "se/z02835.ogg"
    char_halin "不……我做不到……"

# game/script.rpy:108807
translate chinese map304_6c4f45ad:

    # "Halin looks scared, like he's fighting with himself.{w}\nThat moment of hesitation is all that Ulric needs.{w}\nHe uses the pommel of his sword as a weapon."
    "哈林面露恐惧，仿佛在与自己搏斗。{w}\n那一瞬间的犹豫，对乌尔里克来说已然足够。{w}\n他以剑柄为武器。"

# game/script.rpy:108816
translate chinese map304_13a94ff7:

    # "Smashing it into Halin's head, he knocks him into a daze.{w}\nHe falls forward, but Ulric catches him in his arms."
    "剑柄狠狠砸在哈林头上，将他击得神志恍惚。{w}\n他向前倒下，乌尔里克用双臂接住了他。"

# game/script.rpy:108841
translate chinese map304_f539f993:

    # voice "se/z02836.ogg"
    # char_ulric "[firstname], do it now...!\nI don't care what it is — just do it!"
    voice "se/z02836.ogg"
    char_ulric "[firstname]，现在就动手……！\n我不管是什么——快动手！"

# game/script.rpy:108863
translate chinese map304_201f3665:

    # "He turns Halin around, and lowers him to his knees.{w}\nPutting him into a chokehold, he tries to break free, but he's too weak.{w}\nBlood drips down his face. Ulric clearly wasn't holding back."
    "他把哈林转过身，按得他跪在地上。{w}\n他勒住哈林的脖颈，哈林想挣脱，却太虚弱了。{w}\n鲜血顺着他的脸滴落。乌尔里克显然没有留情。"

# game/script.rpy:108865
translate chinese map304_19202b55_1:

    # "There's no way Halin could fight back right now.{w}\nI could kill him with no difficulty at all. But I could also save him.{w}\nIf I removed the curse on his mind, maybe he'd serve our cause instead."
    "哈林此刻绝无可能反击。{w}\n我可以毫不费力地杀了他，但也能救他。{w}\n若我解除他脑中的诅咒，或许他会转而为我们的事业效力。"

# game/script.rpy:108867
translate chinese map304_3ffd88cb:

    # "But was that worth the risk...?{w}\nSomething tells me I don't have much time to decide.{w}\nIf Ulric held him like that for too long, he'd be dead for sure."
    "但这值得冒险吗……？{w}\n我有种预感，没多少时间让我犹豫了。{w}\n要是乌尔里克那样勒他太久，他必死无疑。"

# game/script.rpy:108882
translate chinese map304_1541cc7d:

    # "I have to do it. Killing Halin was the only right choice in this situation.{w}\nWith free will, Halin could act any way he wanted. I know what that would mean.{w}\nIt would just confirm his allegiance to his Masters, and make him even stronger."
    "我必须动手。在这种情况下，杀掉哈林是唯一正确的选择。{w}\n若他拥有自由意志，便能随心所欲地行动。我知道那意味着什么。{w}\n那只会坐实他对主子的忠诚，让他变得更强。"

# game/script.rpy:108884
translate chinese map304_89243dab:

    # "Even if it was born from denial, we couldn't afford it right now.{w}\nWe needed to get to The Triumvirate's chambers, and end this.{w}\nI phase the blade back into my hand, and slowly stand up."
    "即便这念头源于自欺，我们此刻也承担不起。{w}\n我们必须抵达三人执政团的议事厅，了结这一切。{w}\n我将剑相位转移回手中，缓缓站起。"

# game/script.rpy:108889
translate chinese map304_b10c46cc:

    # "I tell Sovy to let go, and move back. He obeys without hesitation.{w}\nHalin is on his knees, crying, and staring over in my direction.{w}\nI will show him no mercy, for it wasn't something he deserved."
    "我叫索维松手后退。他毫不迟疑地照做。{w}\n哈林跪在地上，哭喊着，朝我的方向望来。{w}\n我不会对他施以仁慈，因为他不配。"

# game/script.rpy:108891
translate chinese map304_a830d7de:

    # "I raise my blade in the air, and the suits of armor on the floor start to shake.{w}\nBut that's not what I was after. A moment later, Sovy and Ulric gasp softly.{w}\nAll of their swords slowly rise. Hundreds of them float in the air."
    "我高举剑，地上的空甲开始颤动。{w}\n但那并非我的目标。片刻之后，索维和乌尔里克轻轻倒吸一口气。{w}\n它们所有的剑缓缓升起。数百把剑悬浮在空中。"

# game/script.rpy:108896
translate chinese map304_129a27a2:

    # "I tell Ulric to let go, and move back. He obeys without hesitation.{w}\nHalin is on his knees, crying, and staring over in my direction.{w}\nI will show him no mercy, for it wasn't something he deserved."
    "我叫乌尔里克松手后退。他毫不迟疑地照做。{w}\n哈林跪在地上，哭喊着，朝我的方向望来。{w}\n我不会对他施以仁慈，因为他不配。"

# game/script.rpy:108898
translate chinese map304_7e3787d5:

    # "I raise my blade in the air, and the suits of armor on the floor start to shake.{w}\nBut that's not what I was after. A moment later, Ulric gasps softly.{w}\nAll of their swords slowly rise. Hundreds of them float in the air."
    "我高举剑，地上的空甲开始颤动。{w}\n但那并非我的目标。片刻之后，乌尔里克轻轻倒吸一口气。{w}\n它们所有的剑缓缓升起。数百把剑悬浮在空中。"

# game/script.rpy:108902
translate chinese map304_95920d54:

    # "And I immediately turn them toward Halin.{w}\nHe keeps staring at me. If he had any last words, he chose to stay silent.{w}\nWith a snap of my fingers, every single sword pierces through him at once."
    "我立刻把它们转向哈林。{w}\n他依旧盯着我。若他有任何遗言，他选择沉默。{w}\n我打了个响指，每一把剑同时贯穿了他。"

# game/script.rpy:108904
translate chinese map304_740ec742:

    # "He would've let out a scream, if he was capable. But he's not.{w}\nHis head slumps down, and he stares at the blades in his body.{w}\nTrying to pull them out, he realizes very fast that he's too weak."
    "若他还能，他定会惨叫出声。但他不能。{w}\n他的头垂了下来，盯着插在身上的剑。{w}\n他想把它们拔出，却很快意识到自己太过虚弱。"

# game/script.rpy:108906
translate chinese map304_493cd221:

    # "But this wasn't enough to satisfy me. Halin needed to suffer.{w}\nFor every Rebel he killed, I would make him feel {i}all{/i} of my fury.{w}\nHe was created by the blade, so I use that fact against him."
    "但这还不足以让我满足。哈林必须受苦。{w}\n他每杀一名反抗军，我就要让他感受我{i}全部{/i}的怒火。{w}\n他是剑所造，我便利用这一点来对付他。"

# game/script.rpy:108908
translate chinese map304_0b42b0e7:

    # "If I could control the blade, then I could easily control him as well.{w}\nI hold The Blade of Exodus toward him, and make it enact my will.{w}\nHalin's armor starts to crack, and I use it to crush his body."
    "若我能操控剑，那也能轻易操控他。{w}\n我把放逐之刃指向他，让它执行我的意志。{w}\n哈林的甲胄开始开裂，我用它来挤压他的身体。"

# game/script.rpy:108910
translate chinese map304_352ae1ae:

    # "I make it squeeze so tight around him, that I hear his bones crack.{w}\nThe constriction of his body is so grotesque, but I don't let up until the end.{w}\nWhen I'm done with him, he slumps over, crushed and pierced with swords."
    "我让它紧紧箍住他，紧得我听见他骨骼碎裂的声音。{w}\n那躯体被挤压的模样如此可怖，但我一刻也不松懈。{w}\n等我收手时，他已瘫倒下去，被压碎，被剑刺穿。"

# game/script.rpy:108918
translate chinese map304_7885aaff:

    # "I had to liberate Halin. I had to let him survive, and give him a chance.{w}\nIf he still chose to oppose us, then we could execute him after the war.{w}\nBut as long as his conversion was a possiblity, I had to take a chance."
    "我必须解放哈林。我必须让他活下来，给他一个机会。{w}\n若他仍选择与我们为敌，那我们可以在战后处决他。{w}\n但只要他还有转化的可能，我就必须赌一把。"

# game/script.rpy:108923
translate chinese map304_2ff01765:

    # "I tell Sovy to release the chokehold, but hold Halin in place.{w}\nHe obeys without hesitation, and I slowly make my way over to him.{w}\nPressing the blade against Halin's chest, I ask it to give him his freedom."
    "我叫索维松开锁喉，但按紧哈林。{w}\n他毫不迟疑地照做，我缓缓走向哈林。{w}\n我把剑抵在哈林胸口，请它赐予他自由。"

# game/script.rpy:108928
translate chinese map304_1295df8e:

    # "I tell Ulric to release the chokehold, but hold Halin in place.{w}\nHe obeys without hesitation, and I slowly make my way over to him.{w}\nPressing the blade against Halin's chest, I ask it to give him his freedom."
    "我叫乌尔里克松开锁喉，但按紧哈林。{w}\n他毫不迟疑地照做，我缓缓走向哈林。{w}\n我把剑抵在哈林胸口，请它赐予他自由。"

# game/script.rpy:108932
translate chinese map304_519f9296:

    # "A few seconds later, Halin falls to the ground, unconscious.{w}\nI have him carried over to a safe spot, where he could recover in silence.{w}\nIf, and when, he woke up — I hoped that it would be as a new, smarter man."
    "几秒之后，哈林失去意识，倒在地上。{w}\n我吩咐把他抬到一处安全的地方，好让他静静地恢复。{w}\n若他醒来——我希望那会是一个崭新的、更明智的人。"

# game/script.rpy:108936
translate chinese map304_d49ec163:

    # "With that out of the way, we had to make our way up those stairs.{w}\nWithin a few more minutes, I'd be face to face with our enemy.{w}\nIt was time to rise to the challenge, and change this world."
    "此事既了，我们得继续登上那些楼梯。{w}\n再过几分钟，我就要与我们的敌人正面相对。{w}\n是时候迎接挑战，改变这个世界了。"

# game/script.rpy:108962
translate chinese map304_2d84db7d:

    # voice "se/z02837.ogg"
    voice "se/z02837.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:108964
translate chinese map304_7b2a7c9a:

    # char_ulric "You know what...? I'll stay behind.\nPro and Fortaime should be at the atrium any minute, now.\nI want to make sure I'm there to greet them, and fill them in."
    char_ulric "你知道吗……？我留下来吧。\n普洛和福泰姆随时都该到中庭了。\n我想确保自己在那儿迎接他们，把事情告诉他们。"

# game/script.rpy:108989
translate chinese map304_a6ed7e1f:

    # voice "se/sovy61.ogg"
    voice "se/sovy61.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:108991
translate chinese map304_034d6063:

    # char_sovy "Are you sure...?"
    char_sovy "你确定吗……？"

# game/script.rpy:109016
translate chinese map304_f0ee8ed6:

    # voice "se/z02839.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Yeah. It's not my place to face The Triumvirate. Not again.\nThis fight belongs to the both of you, so go and see it through."
    voice "se/z02839.ogg"
    char_ulric "嗯。面对三人执政团，不该是我。不能再是我。\n这一战属于你们两人，去吧，把它了结。"

# game/script.rpy:109038
translate chinese map304_8ad82ab6:

    # "We both nod at him, as he makes his way back to the atrium.{w}\nOn his way out, he picks a sword up from the ground.{w}\nSovy scoffs, and does the same thing soon after."
    "他朝中庭走去，我们两人都向他点头。{w}\n离开时，他从地上捡起一把剑。{w}\n索维嗤笑一声，随后也照做了。"

# game/script.rpy:109063
translate chinese map304_235c3159:

    # voice "se/sovy62.ogg"
    # char_sovy "A good idea, actually.\nSomething tells me we'll be fighting even more.\nSay — can you do me one favor before we head up?"
    voice "se/sovy62.ogg"
    char_sovy "这主意其实不错。\n我有种预感，接下来还要打更多。\n对了——上去之前，能帮我一个忙吗？"

# game/script.rpy:109078
translate chinese map304_8ce61eb8:

    # "I nod."
    "我点点头。"

# game/script.rpy:109093
translate chinese map304_fc05a105:

    # voice "se/sovy63.ogg"
    # char_sovy "Here. Just trust me."
    voice "se/sovy63.ogg"
    char_sovy "来。相信我便是。"

# game/script.rpy:109111
translate chinese map304_c5c2f88e:

    # "He reaches behind me, and adjusts my scabbard.{w}\nI'm not sure why, but he switches it to the other side.{w}\nI'm left handed, so this would only make things harder."
    "他伸手到我背后，调整我的剑鞘。{w}\n我不明白为什么，但他把它换到了另一侧。{w}\n我是左撇子，这只会让事情更难办。"

# game/script.rpy:109116
translate chinese map304_6d236654:

    # "He reaches behind me, and adjusts my scabbard.{w}\nI'm not sure why, but he switches it to the other side.{w}\nI'm not left handed, so that only made things awkward."
    "他伸手到我背后，调整我的剑鞘。{w}\n我不明白为什么，但他把它换到了另一侧。{w}\n我不是左撇子，这只会让事情变得别扭。"

# game/script.rpy:109120
translate chinese map304_8769894e:

    # "But I choose to trust him."
    "但我选择相信他。"

# game/script.rpy:109135
translate chinese map304_223fac14:

    # voice "se/sovy64.ogg"
    # char_sovy "Thank you."
    voice "se/sovy64.ogg"
    char_sovy "谢谢你。"

# game/script.rpy:109157
translate chinese map304_ced1f2e5:

    # "And a second later, we're making our way up the stairs.{w}\nAll we had to do was dethrone The Triumvirate. Simple enough.{w}\nAfter that, I'd meet my friends in the atrium. At least, the ones that survived."
    "一秒之后，我们开始登上楼梯。{w}\n我们所要做的，就是推翻三人执政团。够简单。{w}\n之后，我会在中庭与朋友们会合。至少，是活下来的那些。"

# game/script.rpy:109183
translate chinese map304_7f5a8b95:

    # voice "se/z02843.ogg"
    voice "se/z02843.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:109185
translate chinese map304_d7ed2612:

    # char_ulric "Hey — before we head up, can you do me a favor?\nAnd don't question it. Just trust me, okay...?"
    char_ulric "嘿——上去之前，能帮我一个忙吗？\n别问为什么。相信我就好，行吗……？"

# game/script.rpy:109199
translate chinese map304_7b89b414:

    # "I nod, without hiding the fact that I'm a bit confused."
    "我点点头，也没掩饰自己有些困惑。"

# game/script.rpy:109224
translate chinese map304_0f72e6e5:

    # voice "se/z02844.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Here."
    voice "se/z02844.ogg"
    char_ulric "给。"

# game/script.rpy:109242
translate chinese map304_c5c2f88e_1:

    # "He reaches behind me, and adjusts my scabbard.{w}\nI'm not sure why, but he switches it to the other side.{w}\nI'm left handed, so this would only make things harder."
    "他伸手到我背后，调整我的剑鞘。{w}\n我不明白为什么，但他把它换到了另一侧。{w}\n我是左撇子，这只会让事情更难办。"

# game/script.rpy:109247
translate chinese map304_6d236654_1:

    # "He reaches behind me, and adjusts my scabbard.{w}\nI'm not sure why, but he switches it to the other side.{w}\nI'm not left handed, so that only made things awkward."
    "他伸手到我背后，调整我的剑鞘。{w}\n我不明白为什么，但他把它换到了另一侧。{w}\n我不是左撇子，这只会让事情变得别扭。"

# game/script.rpy:109251
translate chinese map304_0d56ed75:

    # "But I choose to trust him, as I always have."
    "但我选择相信他，一如我向来所做。"

# game/script.rpy:109266
translate chinese map304_1805f0b5:

    # voice "se/z02845.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Thank you."
    voice "se/z02845.ogg"
    char_ulric "谢谢你。"

# game/script.rpy:109288
translate chinese map304_ced1f2e5_1:

    # "And a second later, we're making our way up the stairs.{w}\nAll we had to do was dethrone The Triumvirate. Simple enough.{w}\nAfter that, I'd meet my friends in the atrium. At least, the ones that survived."
    "一秒之后，我们开始登上楼梯。{w}\n我们所要做的，就是推翻三人执政团。够简单。{w}\n之后，我会在中庭与朋友们会合。至少，是活下来的那些。"

# game/script.rpy:109324
translate chinese map305_4b9c1152:

    # "Damek fights for his life in the Town Square, surrounded by suits of armor.{w}\nHe's lost sight of all of his allies, and is unable to tell if they're even still alive.{w}\nStill, he fights on. He'd never give up. Not when he's this close to the end."
    "达梅克在城镇广场上为性命而战，被空甲团团围住。{w}\n他与所有战友都失去了联系，也无从得知他们是否还活着。{w}\n但他仍在战斗。他绝不放弃。都到这一步了，绝不。"

# game/script.rpy:109326
translate chinese map305_f5413c19:

    # "That bell would surely ring any minute, and bring an end to war.{w}\nIf The Monarch followed through, then this world belonged to them.{w}\nThis is the fact that kept him fighting, even as his hope was lost."
    "那口钟随时都会敲响，终结这场战争。{w}\n只要君主如约完成，这个世界便属于他们。{w}\n正是这个信念支撑他继续战斗，哪怕希望已然渺茫。"

# game/script.rpy:109328
translate chinese map305_b290ff01:

    # "Fatigue started to settle in, making him move slower.{w}\nAs suits of armor fell, so did his strength and resolve.{w}\nHe was surrounded, fighting in every direction."
    "疲惫开始袭来，让他的动作变得迟缓。{w}\n空甲倒下，他的力气与决心也在消磨。{w}\n他被包围着，朝四面八方挥剑。"

# game/script.rpy:109353
translate chinese map305_21b7f374:

    # voice "se/z02846.ogg"
    voice "se/z02846.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:109355
translate chinese map305_53f18ab6:

    # char_damek "Come on Fortaime...!\nWe can't hold the Town Square forever!"
    char_damek "快啊，福泰姆……！\n我们不可能永远守住城镇广场！"

# game/script.rpy:109376
translate chinese map305_037633fb:

    # "And just then, an arrow pierces through his shoulder.{w}\nHe stumbles back, and falls to his knees before pushing it out.{w}\nThis pain was minuscule compared to what he felt back in Mazeo."
    "就在这时，一支箭射穿了他的肩膀。{w}\n他踉跄后退，跪倒在地，随后才把箭拔出来。{w}\n与他在马泽奥所承受的相比，这点痛微不足道。"

# game/script.rpy:109378
translate chinese map305_6274f016:

    # "Rising up, he starts to fight with anger, as well as determination.{w}\nIn a rage, he takes down the suits of armor even faster than before.{w}\nAnother arrow pierces his upper body, but nothing could stop him now."
    "他站起身，带着怒火与决心投入战斗。{w}\n狂怒之中，他击倒空甲的速度比之前更快。{w}\n又一支箭射穿他的上半身，但如今什么也拦不住他。"

# game/script.rpy:109380
translate chinese map305_9366dbd8:

    # "Keeping this arrow in, he grabs another sword that lay on the ground.{w}\nFighting with two of them, he's able to guard himself more efficiently.{w}\nThe suits of armor are arriving faster than he can kill them, however."
    "他任那支箭留在体内，抓起地上另一把剑。{w}\n双剑并用，让他能更有效地护住自己。{w}\n然而，空甲涌来的速度比他能斩杀得还快。"

# game/script.rpy:109382
translate chinese map305_aac9db9c:

    # "Soon enough, he was surrounded by more suits than he could hope to kill.{w}\nWith no allies around him to come to his aid, he knew that things were dire.{w}\nIf Fortaime didn't ring that bell, then this could very well be his final stand."
    "很快，围住他的空甲多到他根本杀不完。{w}\n身边没有战友前来支援，他知道形势已极其严峻。{w}\n要是福泰姆没能敲响那口钟，这里很可能就是他的最后一战。"

# game/script.rpy:109387
translate chinese map305_aa388a8e:

    # "He throws his second sword to the ground, and takes a deep breath.{w}\nHe was prepared to face his death. This somehow made him stronger.{w}\nThe pain from the arrow only served to push him to more extremes."
    "他把第二把剑扔到地上，深吸一口气。{w}\n他已准备好面对死亡。这不知怎地让他更强了。{w}\n箭伤带来的疼痛，反而将他推向更极端的地步。"

# game/script.rpy:109412
translate chinese map305_f3914969:

    # voice "se/z02847.ogg"
    voice "se/z02847.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:109414
translate chinese map305_0727e771:

    # char_damek "I guess it's time..."
    char_damek "看来是时候了……"

# game/script.rpy:109419
translate chinese map305_c86b40c9:

    # "He throws his second sword to the ground, and takes a deep breath.{w}\nReaching into one of his pockets, he pulls out a glimmering pendent.{w}\nHe grips it tight, as if it was more important to him than his weapon."
    "他把第二把剑扔到地上，深吸一口气。{w}\n他伸手探进一个口袋，取出一枚微光闪烁的吊坠。{w}\n他紧紧握住它，仿佛它比他的武器还要重要。"

# game/script.rpy:109444
translate chinese map305_63f3ba67:

    # voice "se/z02848.ogg"
    voice "se/z02848.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:109446
translate chinese map305_ca9b837e:

    # char_damek "I guess this is it..."
    char_damek "看来就是现在了……"

# game/script.rpy:109465
translate chinese map305_5453469c:

    # "His fighting starts to become more desperate, as tears blur his vision.{w}\nThe fact that he couldn't see any of his friends just hurt him even more.{w}\nHe had to assume that everybody around him had fallen during battle."
    "泪水模糊了视线，他的打法开始变得愈发拼命。{w}\n看不见任何一个朋友，这让他更加痛苦。{w}\n他只能假定周围的人都在战斗中倒下了。"

# game/script.rpy:109493
translate chinese map305_64d7cec6:

    # voice "se/z02849.ogg"
    # char_damek "Stay back! I'm warning you!"
    voice "se/z02849.ogg"
    char_damek "退后！我警告你们！"

# game/script.rpy:109508
translate chinese map305_8475bd3b:

    # "He held out his sword, as if to threaten. His hand trembles.{w}\nThe Honor Guard did not heed his warning, and they close in on him.{w}\nHaving no choice but to continue fighting, he lets out labored grunts."
    "他举剑向前，像是在威胁。他的手在颤抖。{w}\n荣誉卫队没有理会他的警告，向他逼近。{w}\n他别无选择，只能继续战斗，发出吃力的闷哼。"

# game/script.rpy:109510
translate chinese map305_aab251c6:

    # "Through his blurred vision, he's almost unable to make out anything.{w}\nHis saving grace is the contrast of the white suits over Balteus' decay.{w}\nUsing that as a guide, he's able to keep taking down his enemies."
    "透过模糊的视线，他几乎什么都辨不清。{w}\n那白色空甲与巴尔泰乌斯衰败景象的对比，成了他的救命稻草。{w}\n以此为指引，他得以继续击倒敌人。"

# game/script.rpy:109512
translate chinese map305_4b7ba5bd:

    # "He tries fighting his way in the direction of the archers.{w}\nThose were more of a threat to him than the suits with swords.{w}\nIn fact, he was certain that those archers had killed quite a few men."
    "他试着朝弓箭手的方向杀出一条路。{w}\n那些人比持剑的空甲更威胁他。{w}\n事实上，他确信那些弓箭手已经射杀了不少人。"

# game/script.rpy:109514
translate chinese map305_88b79306:

    # "And unfortunately, he may be the next one added to their count.{w}\nAn arrow is shot through his gut, and he screams, falling back.{w}\nNot a grievous wound, but he's immediately caught off guard."
    "而遗憾的是，他也许就是下一个被计入其中的人。{w}\n一支箭射穿他的腹部，他惨叫一声，向后倒去。{w}\n伤势并不致命，但他立刻被打了个措手不及。"

# game/script.rpy:109516
translate chinese map305_b010e8aa:

    # "Something smashes into the back of his head, and he collapses.{w}\nTurning around, he sees a suit, holding a rock, covered in his blood.{w}\nAn open wound to the back of his head starts staining the ground."
    "有什么东西重重砸在他的后脑，他倒了下去。{w}\n他转过身，看见一架空甲手里握着块石头，上面沾满了他的血。{w}\n他后脑的开放伤口开始染红地面。"

# game/script.rpy:109541
translate chinese map305_4205c47d:

    # voice "se/z02850.ogg"
    # char_damek "Wh-what...?"
    voice "se/z02850.ogg"
    char_damek "什……什么……？"

# game/script.rpy:109556
translate chinese map305_7e9278ef:

    # "He writhes on the ground, in pain and confusion.{w}\nThe suit kneels down and grabs a sword from the ground.{w}\nIt was the same one that Damek had discarded moments earlier."
    "他在地上痛苦又困惑地扭动。{w}\n那架空甲蹲下，从地上抓起一把剑。{w}\n正是达梅克方才丢下的那一把。"

# game/script.rpy:109558
translate chinese map305_ef60efab:

    # "He's surprised to see that the rest of The Honor Guard stands down.{w}\nAs if they acknowledged this one had deserved to deal the final blow.{w}\nDamek cries, looking up in horror as the suit raises up the sword."
    "他惊讶地发现，其余荣誉卫队都停手退开。{w}\n仿佛它们承认，这一击致命的一剑理应由它来给。{w}\n那架空甲举起剑，达梅克惊骇地仰望着，哭了。"

# game/script.rpy:109570
translate chinese map305_a2568bed:

    # "But before they can follow through with their thrust, something happens.{w}\nAn arrow pierces through the suit of armor, and it crumbles to the ground.{w}\nDamek looks around in confusion. Had an ally finally come to his aid...!?"
    "但就在它刺下去之前，变故发生了。{w}\n一支箭射穿那架空甲，它崩塌倒地。{w}\n达梅克困惑地环顾四周。终于有战友来救他了吗……！？"

# game/script.rpy:109598
translate chinese map305_6ebf015e:

    # voice "se/z02851.ogg"
    voice "se/z02851.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:109600
translate chinese map305_06cac445:

    # char_shane "Damek...! Give me your hand!"
    char_shane "达梅克……！把手给我！"

# game/script.rpy:109614
translate chinese map305_d7c94c04:

    # "Shane...? Damek cries out softly, not sure what's going on.{w}\nLast time he saw Shane, he tried to kill him, and basically succeeded.{w}\nBut here he was now, offering his hand. What was happening?"
    "肖恩……？达梅克轻声喊道，不确定发生了什么。{w}\n上次见到肖恩时，他想杀了自己，而且几乎得手。{w}\n可此刻他却出现在这里，伸出了手。这是怎么回事？"

# game/script.rpy:109629
translate chinese map305_934781db:

    # voice "se/z02852.ogg"
    # char_shane "Damek, quick!\nYou don't have much time!"
    voice "se/z02852.ogg"
    char_shane "达梅克，快点！\n你没多少时间了！"

# game/script.rpy:109644
translate chinese map305_2042e1c7:

    # "Damek shakes his head, but then realizes he has no other option.{w}\nGrabbing Shane's hand, he accepts the help, and rises to his feet.{w}\nHe stumbles forward, almost falling back down. But he doesn't."
    "达梅克摇摇头，随即意识到自己别无选择。{w}\n他抓住肖恩的手，接受帮助，站起身来。{w}\n他踉跄向前，几乎又要倒下。但他没有。"

# game/script.rpy:109646
translate chinese map305_20e4434e:

    # "He presses his back against Shane, still a bit delirious.{w}\nBut his friend supports him, as he draws a set of daggers.{w}\nConfusion assails Damek, as everything was happening so fast."
    "他仍有些神志恍惚，把后背贴上肖恩。{w}\n但这位朋友撑住了他，同时抽出一套匕首。{w}\n一切都发生得太快，困惑向达梅克袭来。"

# game/script.rpy:109671
translate chinese map305_d73ae5aa:

    # voice "se/z02853.ogg"
    # char_shane "There. We're even now."
    voice "se/z02853.ogg"
    char_shane "好了。现在我们两清了。"

# game/script.rpy:109686
translate chinese map305_5ab17f69:

    # "Damek nods."
    "达梅克点点头。"

# game/script.rpy:109701
translate chinese map305_f95c350e:

    # voice "se/z02854.ogg"
    # char_shane "So, what do you say, Damek?\nFight? Just like old times?"
    voice "se/z02854.ogg"
    char_shane "那么，你怎么说，达梅克？\n打一场？就像从前那样？"

# game/script.rpy:109716
translate chinese map305_48021c72:

    # "Damek nods again, and he raises his sword.{w}\nA moment later, they both charge toward the suits of armor.{w}\nLike a team, and like friends — they fight together once more."
    "达梅克再次点头，举起了剑。{w}\n片刻之后，两人一同冲向那些空甲。{w}\n如同一支队伍，也如朋友——他们再次并肩作战。"

# game/script.rpy:109741
translate chinese map305_dd1a09d7:

    # voice "se/z02855.ogg"
    # char_shane "Just keep it up, Damek! \nI'll patch you up as soon as we're safe!"
    voice "se/z02855.ogg"
    char_shane "撑住，达梅克！\n一安全我就给你包扎！"

# game/script.rpy:109767
translate chinese map305_e9a884ab:

    # voice "se/z02856.ogg"
    # char_damek "Shane, talk to me.\nWhy are you doing this...?"
    voice "se/z02856.ogg"
    char_damek "肖恩，跟我说说。\n你为什么要这么做……？"

# game/script.rpy:109785
translate chinese map305_273ee923:

    # "But Shane doesn't answer. At least, not before the bell is rung.{w}\nA loud ringing fills the air, delivering the sound of hope to Damek's ears.{w}\nFortaime had achieved his goal...! That means his allies still lived...!"
    "但肖恩没有回答。至少，在钟声敲响之前没有。{w}\n一声嘹亮的鸣响在空中荡开，把希望的声音送进达梅克耳中。{w}\n福泰姆达成目标了……！这意味着他的战友们还活着……！"

# game/script.rpy:109787
translate chinese map305_f473adb5:

    # "Damek goes to keep fighting, but Shane holds him back."
    "达梅克正要继续战斗，肖恩却拉住了他。"

# game/script.rpy:109812
translate chinese map305_44fbb83d:

    # voice "se/z02857.ogg"
    # char_shane "Damek, no. \nLook — it's over."
    voice "se/z02857.ogg"
    char_shane "达梅克，别。\n你看——结束了。"

# game/script.rpy:109830
translate chinese map305_5b2671b5:

    # "The Honor Guard turns to stare at the source of the ringing.{w}\nThen, they throw their swords to the ground without hesitation.{w}\nStarting to march away, they abandon all their previous efforts."
    "荣誉卫队转头望向钟声传来的方向。{w}\n随后，它们毫不犹豫地把剑扔到地上。{w}\n它们开始列队离去，放弃了此前所有的努力。"

# game/script.rpy:109855
translate chinese map305_67718ac9:

    # voice "se/z02858.ogg"
    # char_damek "We — we did it...\nI can't believe this..."
    voice "se/z02858.ogg"
    char_damek "我们——我们做到了……\n我简直不敢相信……"

# game/script.rpy:109870
translate chinese map305_76eb1852:

    # "Without a word, Shane just stands there along with Damek.{w}\nTogether, as the ash rains down upon them, they watch their foes flee.{w}\nDamek smiles, a few tears running down his face. Was it all really over...?"
    "肖恩一言不发，只是和达梅克一同站在那里。{w}\n灰烬如雨落下，他们一起看着敌人逃散。{w}\n达梅克笑了，几滴泪水顺着脸颊滑落。这一切真的结束了吗……？"

# game/script.rpy:109872
translate chinese map305_f1e38083:

    # "No, that wasn't the right way of looking at it.{w}\nThings had just begun. The Monarch had to finish it all.{w}\nDamek looked in the direction of the castle, as hope rises within him."
    "不，不该这么想。{w}\n一切才刚刚开始。君主必须做个了结。{w}\n达梅克望向城堡的方向，希望在心中升腾。"

# game/script.rpy:109897
translate chinese map305_b435c36c:

    # voice "se/z02859.ogg"
    # char_damek "[firstname]... Good luck...\nWe're all counting on you."
    voice "se/z02859.ogg"
    char_damek "[firstname]……祝你好运……\n我们都指望你了。"

# game/script.rpy:109924
translate chinese map305_98915f84:

    # "The Town Square is soon devoid of all foes.{w}\nBut now, without obstructed vision, Damek can see all of his allies.{w}\nThey raise their swords in the air, and start cheering. Balteus was theirs."
    "城镇广场很快便再无一个敌人。{w}\n而此刻，视野不再受阻，达梅克能看见他所有的战友。{w}\n他们举剑向天，开始欢呼。巴尔泰乌斯是他们的了。"

# game/script.rpy:109926
translate chinese map305_0f76af02:

    # "And soon, the lives of The Triumvirate would be theirs as well.{w}\nThey cheer The Monarch's name, and then, that's all Damek can hear.{w}\nBut that's all he needed to hear. For the name of The Monarch, meant hope."
    "很快，三人执政团的性命也将落入他们手中。{w}\n他们高呼着君主的名字，随后，达梅克耳中便只剩下这声音。{w}\n但这已足够。因为君主之名，意味着希望。"

# game/script.rpy:109941
translate chinese map305_27fac800:

    # "He holds out his sword once more, as if to guard himself.{w}\nBut a moment later, he drops it, as the suit thrusts their sword into his chest.{w}\nHe screams in agonizing pain as he starts to bleed even more."
    "他再次举剑，像是要护住自己。{w}\n但片刻之后，空甲把剑刺进他的胸膛，剑便脱手落地。{w}\n他发出痛苦的惨叫，流血愈发不止。"

# game/script.rpy:109943
translate chinese map305_64da7bbb:

    # "This was the end for him, and he knew it.{w}\nThe suit pulls out the sword, causing him to bleed even more.{w}\nHe knew his luck had run out. He wouldn't come back from this one."
    "这是他的终点，他心里清楚。{w}\n空甲拔出剑，令他失血更多。{w}\n他知道自己的运气已经用尽。这一次，他回不来了。"

# game/script.rpy:109946
translate chinese map305_e1ff37bc:

    # voice "se/z02860.ogg"
    # char_damek "M-Mother..."
    voice "se/z02860.ogg"
    char_damek "母……母亲……"

# game/script.rpy:109961
translate chinese map305_45360ed7:

    # "He cries, and brings both of his hands to his chest.{w}\nBlood is pouring out from where the arrow found its home.{w}\nIt stings softly, as flakes of ash from the air rain down upon it."
    "他哭着，双手捂住胸口。{w}\n鲜血从箭矢扎入之处涌出。{w}\n空中飘落的灰烬洒在伤口上，带来轻微的刺痛。"

# game/script.rpy:109963
translate chinese map305_8cfd5790:

    # "The pain is so intense, that his vision fades, and his ears ring.{w}\nThe Honor Guard stands down, leaving him to bleed to death on his own.{w}\nOnly, a moment later, he realizes that's not exactly the case. That ringing..."
    "疼痛如此剧烈，他的视线渐渐模糊，耳中嗡鸣。{w}\n荣誉卫队停手退开，任他独自流血而死。{w}\n只是片刻之后，他意识到事情并非如此。那嗡鸣声……"

# game/script.rpy:109965
translate chinese map305_a7b62ea5:

    # "Fortaime had succeeeded...! That was the bell of retreat.{w}\nA moment too late, though. At least for him. This causes him to cry more.{w}\nBut alongside his tears, a smile forms. His allies were living, and they had won."
    "福泰姆成功了……！那是撤退的钟声。{w}\n不过，来得晚了片刻。至少对他而言如此。这让他哭得更凶。{w}\n但在泪水之中，一抹笑容浮现。他的战友们还活着，他们赢了。"

# game/script.rpy:109967
translate chinese map305_c3f51329:

    # "The Honor Guard turns to the source of the noise, and they drop their weapons.{w}\nDamek lays there, hearing the bell. A sound of hope, beckoning to all.{w}\nHe passes with a smile on his face, as he's slowly covered by ash."
    "荣誉卫队转向声响传来的方向，丢下了武器。{w}\n达梅克躺在那里，听着钟声。那是希望之声，向所有人召唤。{w}\n他带着微笑离世，身体渐渐被灰烬覆盖。"

# game/script.rpy:109969
translate chinese map305_286cd202:

    # "Everything had gone according to plan.{w}\nNow, it all rested in the hands of The Monarch."
    "一切都照计划进行。{w}\n如今，一切皆系于君主之手。"

# game/script.rpy:109979
translate chinese map305_d03b2c30:

    # "Damek raises the pendent, and holds it close to his heart.{w}\nHe wished with all of his heart that Fortaime would ring that bell.{w}\nAny second now, and perhaps he'd be able to make it out alive."
    "达梅克举起吊坠，紧贴心口。{w}\n他全心全意地祈愿福泰姆能敲响那口钟。{w}\n也许就在下一秒，他就能活着出去。"

# game/script.rpy:109981
translate chinese map305_30849bd1:

    # "But he found no such luck. The suit thrusts the sword into his chest.{w}\nWith an agonizing scream, the pendent is shattered into tiny pieces.{w}\nSeeing that, hurt Damek more than any wound inflicted ever could."
    "但他没有这样的运气。空甲把剑刺进他的胸膛。{w}\n随着一声痛苦的惨叫，吊坠碎成了细小的碎片。{w}\n看到这一幕，比任何伤口都更让他心痛。"

# game/script.rpy:109983
translate chinese map305_58ad9e8f:

    # "He knows the wound is fatal, but he refuses to give up.{w}\nPicking up the pieces of the pendent, he tries to fix it, trembling.{w}\nAs he struggles to put it back together, he only watches it fall apart again."
    "他知道这伤致命，却不肯放弃。{w}\n他颤抖着捡起吊坠的碎片，试着把它修好。{w}\n他拼力想把它重新拼合，却只能眼看它再次散开。"

# game/script.rpy:109986
translate chinese map305_9098f84b:

    # voice "se/z02861.ogg"
    # char_damek "M-Mother..."
    voice "se/z02861.ogg"
    char_damek "母……母亲……"

# game/script.rpy:109989
translate chinese map305_917e7087:

    # "He hears a loud ringing in his ears, as everything slowly fades away.{w}\nHolding the biggest remaining piece of the pendent close, he cries.{w}\nBut then, a moment later, he realizes the ringing wasn't just in his ears."
    "一切渐渐远去，他耳中响起一阵嘹亮的鸣声。{w}\n他握着吊坠残存的最大一块碎片，哭了。{w}\n但片刻之后，他意识到那鸣声并不只是在耳中。"

# game/script.rpy:109991
translate chinese map305_6921312e:

    # "The retreat bell had started to ring. Fortaime accomplished his goal!{w}\nA moment too late, he thought. At least, for him. This causes him to cry more.{w}\nBut alongside his tears, a smile forms. His allies were living, and they had won."
    "撤退的钟声开始敲响。福泰姆达成目标了！{w}\n他心想，来得晚了片刻。至少对他而言如此。这让他哭得更凶。{w}\n但在泪水之中，一抹笑容浮现。他的战友们还活着，他们赢了。"

# game/script.rpy:109993
translate chinese map305_3ee3296d:

    # "The Honor Guard turns to the source of the noise, and drops their weapons.{w}\nDamek lays there, hearing the bell. A sound of hope, beckoning to all.{w}\nHe passes with a smile on his face, as he's slowly covered by ash."
    "荣誉卫队转向声响传来的方向，丢下了武器。{w}\n达梅克躺在那里，听着钟声。那是希望之声，向所有人召唤。{w}\n他带着微笑离世，身体渐渐被灰烬覆盖。"

# game/script.rpy:109995
translate chinese map305_286cd202_1:

    # "Everything had gone according to plan.{w}\nNow, it all rested in the hands of The Monarch."
    "一切都照计划进行。{w}\n如今，一切皆系于君主之手。"

# game/script.rpy:110033
translate chinese map307_5f92c9cf:

    # "The ringing of the bell echoes in my ears. It's almost deafening.{w}\nI'm relieved to know that Fortaime survived, and succeeded.{w}\nMe and Sovy stand in darkness, and it's hard to see."
    "钟声在我耳中回荡。几乎震耳欲聋。{w}\n得知福泰姆活了下来并成功，我松了口气。{w}\n我和索维站在黑暗中，难以视物。"

# game/script.rpy:110058
translate chinese map307_baff8ef0:

    # voice "se/sovy65.ogg"
    voice "se/sovy65.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:110060
translate chinese map307_15993675:

    # char_sovy "Here, you'll be needing this."
    char_sovy "给，你会需要这个。"

# game/script.rpy:110074
translate chinese map307_3a18b6fe:

    # "He hands me a torch that was hung against the wall."
    "他递给我一支原本挂在墙上的火把。"

# game/script.rpy:110099
translate chinese map307_bd4a9e0c:

    # voice "se/sovy66.ogg"
    # char_sovy "And watch your step as we go up those stairs.\nIf you fall off the edge — well, you know how high we are."
    voice "se/sovy66.ogg"
    char_sovy "上那些楼梯时小心脚下。\n要是从边缘掉下去——嗯，你知道我们有多高。"

# game/script.rpy:110114
translate chinese map307_76e71f28:

    # "I nod. The thought filled me with fright.{w}\nI hold out the torch, and see the bizarre sight before me.{w}\nThe walls are lined with gears, just like those on the blade."
    "我点点头。这个念头让我满心恐惧。{w}\n我举起火把，看到了眼前离奇的景象。{w}\n墙上排满了齿轮，就像剑上的那些一样。"

# game/script.rpy:110116
translate chinese map307_78b62e55:

    # "They spin, and rotate, in directions that they shouldn't.{w}\nIt makes no sense to me. But then again, neither does the blade.{w}\nThe gear on the blade spun in a way that was physically impossible."
    "它们以不该有的方向旋转、转动。{w}\n我完全无法理解。不过，那把剑也是一样。{w}\n剑上的齿轮，以一种物理上不可能的方式转动着。"

# game/script.rpy:110118
translate chinese map307_4f128004:

    # "Fog lines the stairs leading up to The Triumvirate's chambers.{w}\nI was confident a moment ago, but this sight fills me with unease.{w}\nI've never seen anything like it, and it's very concerning to me."
    "浓雾弥漫在通往三人执政团议事厅的阶梯上。{w}\n方才我还满怀信心，可这景象却让我心神不宁。{w}\n我从未见过这样的东西，这让我深感忧虑。"

# game/script.rpy:110120
translate chinese map307_a357856e:

    # "I couldn't see off the edges of the stairs, and there was no railing.{w}\nThe slightest stumble could send me back down to the atrium.{w}\nI do need to go back there. But — that's not the way I'd do it."
    "我看不清阶梯的边缘，也没有任何护栏。{w}\n稍有失足，我就会一路摔回中庭。{w}\n我确实得回去一趟。但——绝不是以这种方式。"

# game/script.rpy:110145
translate chinese map307_3a9708ca:

    # voice "se/sovy67.ogg"
    # char_sovy "I have one piece of advice for you, [firstname].\nDon't let them talk to you. Just kill them, with no question.\nAll they'll do is try to justify their actions, and earn your sympathy."
    voice "se/sovy67.ogg"
    char_sovy "我有一句忠告给你，[firstname]。\n别让他们开口跟你说话。什么都别问，直接杀了他们。\n他们只会试图为自己的所作所为辩解，好博取你的同情。"

# game/script.rpy:110149
translate chinese map307_2fcf0061:

    # voice "se/sovy68.ogg"
    # char_sovy "They prey on the minds of the weak. Of those that they can mould.\nI know you're strong, but they just have this way of convincing you.\nI'd hate to see that happen to you. So remember. Kill them all."
    voice "se/sovy68.ogg"
    char_sovy "他们专挑心智软弱、能被他们塑造的人下手。\n我知道你很坚强，可他们就是有办法说服你。\n我不愿看到你变成那样。所以记住，把他们全部杀掉。"

# game/script.rpy:110164
translate chinese map307_e6463694:

    # "I tell him that I don't care what they say to me. I'm here to kill them.{w}\nThey could speak to me all they wished. They'd accomplish nothing.{w}\nAn easy goal to have in mind. But in practice — I guess I had no idea."
    "我告诉他，我不在乎他们对我说什么。我来这里就是为了杀他们。{w}\n他们尽可以对我畅所欲言，也改变不了什么。{w}\n这话说着容易。可真正面对时——我想我根本没有料到。"

# game/script.rpy:110169
translate chinese map307_4e8db737:

    # "I'd have to find out however. Someone steps out of the room ahead of us.{w}\nAs they move toward us, I can see the white and gold of their cloak.{w}\nOne of them left their chambers...? I thought they didn't do that."
    "可我终究得弄清楚。这时，有人从我们前方的房间里走了出来。{w}\n当他们朝我们走来时，我看清了那件白金相间的斗篷。{w}\n他们中的一人离开了议事厅……？我还以为他们从不这样做。"

# game/script.rpy:110197
translate chinese map307_e0f6c46b:

    # voice "se/z02866.ogg"
    voice "se/z02866.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:110200
translate chinese map307_2bc6b6aa:

    # char_the_triumvirate "Sovy — you've returned.\nWere we not clear enough...?\nA permanent exile is non-negotiable."
    char_the_triumvirate "索维——你回来了。\n难道我们说得还不够清楚吗……？\n永久流放，没有商量的余地。"

# game/script.rpy:110225
translate chinese map307_c4c3e0db:

    # voice "se/sovy69.ogg"
    # char_sovy "But you said—!"
    voice "se/sovy69.ogg"
    char_sovy "可你明明说过——！"

# game/script.rpy:110240
translate chinese map307_46ed5d59:

    # "He turns to them, and motions as if he's pleading."
    "他转身面向他们，比划着，像是在哀求。"

# game/script.rpy:110265
translate chinese map307_2f5f5b17:

    # voice "se/sovy70.ogg"
    # char_sovy "You said I could come back if I brought the blade!\nIs this not what you wanted? Was it not a test...?"
    voice "se/sovy70.ogg"
    char_sovy "你说过，只要我带回那把剑，我就能回来！\n这不正是你想要的吗？难道这不是一场考验吗……？"

# game/script.rpy:110280
translate chinese map307_0b0e0a48:

    # "The Triumvir looks down at both of us, and sighs."
    "执政官俯视着我们两人，叹了口气。"

# game/script.rpy:110305
translate chinese map307_3063bc7f:

    # voice "se/z02869.ogg"
    # char_the_triumvirate "You think that you can fool us so easily?\nWe know where your allegiance lies, Sovy.\nThere is nothing in this world we cannot see."
    voice "se/z02869.ogg"
    char_the_triumvirate "你以为能这么轻易骗过我们吗？\n我们知道你忠于谁，索维。\n这世上没有任何东西能逃过我们的眼睛。"

# game/script.rpy:110320
translate chinese map307_cb04d6ea:

    # "Sovy gritted his teeth. I could tell that he was angry.{w}\nI'm confused, but I trust him. I knew he was on my side.{w}\nAt least, that's what I thought. Everything changes in an instant."
    "索维咬紧了牙关。我能看出他动了怒。{w}\n我很困惑，但我信任他。我知道他站在我这边。{w}\n至少，我是这么以为的。而一切都在瞬间改变了。"

# game/script.rpy:110345
translate chinese map307_bacdbcac:

    # voice "se/sovy71.ogg"
    # char_sovy "Everything I did, I did for you...!\nWere you really too foolish to realize that!?\nMy attempt to help The Rebellion was only an act!"
    voice "se/sovy71.ogg"
    char_sovy "我所做的一切，都是为了你们……！\n你们真的蠢到看不出来吗！？\n我帮助反抗军，不过是在演戏！"

# game/script.rpy:110360
translate chinese map307_ee686c9e:

    # "What..?"
    "什么……？"

# game/script.rpy:110385
translate chinese map307_e1e7c30d:

    # voice "se/sovy72.ogg"
    # char_sovy "I've brought the enemy, and the blade, to your doorstep.\nEven after this, you deny me my redemption!?"
    voice "se/sovy72.ogg"
    char_sovy "我把敌人和那把剑都送到了你们门前。\n即便如此，你们还是不肯给我赎罪的机会吗！？"

# game/script.rpy:110403
translate chinese map307_d313daa4:

    # "I immediately try to run, but Sovy grabs my right arm.{w}\nAs much as I struggle, it's no use. He's too strong.{w}\nI'm filled with fright. How could he do this...!?"
    "我立刻想逃，可索维抓住了我的右臂。{w}\n无论我怎么挣扎都无济于事。他太强了。{w}\n我满心恐惧。他怎么能做出这种事……！？"

# game/script.rpy:110408
translate chinese map307_76d755f7:

    # "I immediately try to run, but Sovy grabs my left arm.{w}\nAs much as I struggle, it's no use. He's too strong.{w}\nI'm filled with fright. How could he do this...!?"
    "我立刻想逃，可索维抓住了我的左臂。{w}\n无论我怎么挣扎都无济于事。他太强了。{w}\n我满心恐惧。他怎么能做出这种事……！？"

# game/script.rpy:110434
translate chinese map307_ea329919:

    # voice "se/z02872.ogg"
    voice "se/z02872.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:110436
translate chinese map307_156340d0:

    # char_the_triumvirate "You've done nothing but bring an armed enemy into our home.\nYour judgment is clouded, Sovy. We decline your offer."
    char_the_triumvirate "你所做的不过是把一名全副武装的敌人带进了我们的家。\n你的判断被蒙蔽了，索维。我们拒绝你的提议。"

# game/script.rpy:110461
translate chinese map307_5a51c62a:

    # voice "se/sovy73.ogg"
    # char_sovy "No...!"
    voice "se/sovy73.ogg"
    char_sovy "不……！"

# game/script.rpy:110479
translate chinese map307_a6ff3836:

    # "A second after, Sovy phases the blade into his hands.{w}\nThen, much to my regret, he slices through my arm with ease.{w}\nI scream, and then from the elbow down, almost nothing remains."
    "一秒之后，索维将剑相位转移到手中。{w}\n紧接着，令我悔恨不已的是，他轻而易举地斩断了我的手臂。{w}\n我放声尖叫，而从手肘往下，几乎什么也没剩下。"

# game/script.rpy:110497
translate chinese map307_359c41d9:

    # voice "se/sovy74.ogg"
    # char_sovy "Then take {i}this{/i} as an offering...!\nThat arm will never again be used against you.\nBefore all of us, [firstname] is defenseless."
    voice "se/sovy74.ogg"
    char_sovy "那就把{i}这个{/i}当作献礼吧……！\n那条手臂再也不可能被用来对付你们了。\n在我们所有人面前，[firstname]已毫无防备。"

# game/script.rpy:110512
translate chinese map307_bbc472e3:

    # "I don't feel anything, almost as if my body numbs itself from the trauma.{w}\nBut the sight is all too real. My lower arm, limp, and dead on the floor.{w}\nBlood spurts from the wound, and I look at Sovy in disbelief."
    "我什么都感觉不到，仿佛身体因创伤而麻木了。{w}\n可眼前的景象却无比真实。我的小臂软弱无力地瘫死在地上。{w}\n鲜血从伤口喷涌而出，我难以置信地看向索维。"

# game/script.rpy:110514
translate chinese map307_e66bcc2f:

    # "He makes direct eye contact with me, and then looks at the torch.{w}\nI'm still gripping it tightly, and that's when things make sense.{w}\nWas he trying to fool them? I still have use of my good arm."
    "他直视着我的眼睛，随后看向那支火把。{w}\n我仍旧紧紧握着它，就在那时，我明白了一切。{w}\n他是在骗他们吗？我那条完好的手臂还能用。"

# game/script.rpy:110516
translate chinese map307_f7b595b4:

    # "I slump against the wall, and use the torch to burn the wound shut.{w}\nA disgusting smell fills the air, and I can hear cracking and sizzling.{w}\nThis is all I can do, while I watch Sovy ascend the stairs with the blade."
    "我瘫靠在墙上，用火把将伤口烧灼封住。{w}\n一股恶臭弥漫在空气中，我能听见噼啪的灼烧声。{w}\n眼看着索维带着那把剑登上阶梯，我能做的也只有这些了。"

# game/script.rpy:110541
translate chinese map307_1ca9c7e3:

    # voice "se/z02875.ogg"
    # char_the_triumvirate "You continue to surprise us, Sovy.\nVery well. Let us talk."
    voice "se/z02875.ogg"
    char_the_triumvirate "你总是让我们意外，索维。\n好吧。那我们就谈谈。"

# game/script.rpy:110556
translate chinese map307_521a0048:

    # "The Triumvir looks down at my scabbard.{w}\nThey definitely believe Sovy removed my dominant arm.{w}\nI don't know why any of this is happening, but I let it all unfold."
    "执政官低头看了看我的剑鞘。{w}\n他们显然相信索维斩断的是我的惯用手臂。{w}\n我不知道这一切为何会发生，但我任由它发展下去。"

# game/script.rpy:110558
translate chinese map307_b687600a:

    # "I trust him."
    "我相信他。"

# game/script.rpy:110583
translate chinese map307_d48d2ac4:

    # voice "se/sovy75.ogg"
    # char_sovy "Thank you, Master.\nI am sorry for letting you down in the past.\nI can only hope that this offering is enough to please you."
    voice "se/sovy75.ogg"
    char_sovy "谢谢您，主人。\n过去让您失望了，我很抱歉。\n我只希望这份献礼足以让您满意。"

# game/script.rpy:110601
translate chinese map307_f8a1b6f2:

    # "He continues to walk up the stairs, slowly, as if somewhat scared.{w}\nIf I were him, I wouldn't want to make any sudden movements, either.{w}\nThe Triumvirate has the advantage here. All we could do was try our best."
    "他继续缓缓走上阶梯，仿佛有些害怕。{w}\n如果我是他，我也不会想做出任何突然的动作。{w}\n在这里，占上风的是三人执政团。我们能做的只有尽力而为。"

# game/script.rpy:110629
translate chinese map307_780f9df7:

    # voice "se/sovy76.ogg"
    # char_sovy "Remove threats, to ensure the continued reign of Alestia's leaders.\nIs that not what you wanted..? Is that not the role of The Grand Inquisitor?"
    voice "se/sovy76.ogg"
    char_sovy "清除威胁，以确保阿莱斯蒂亚的统治者能长久掌权。\n这不正是您想要的吗……？这不正是大审判官的职责吗？"

# game/script.rpy:110644
translate chinese map307_ecce2254:

    # "As he speaks, he reaches the top of the stairs, and faces his Master.{w}\nThe Triumvir lets out another loud sigh, and proceeds to nod a few times.{w}\nBy now, I'm almost coherent again, and the wound bleeds no more. Burnt shut."
    "他说着，走到了阶梯顶端，面对着他的主人。{w}\n执政官又重重叹了口气，接着点了几下头。{w}\n此时，我几乎恢复了清醒，伤口也不再流血了。已经被灼烧封住。"

# game/script.rpy:110671
translate chinese map307_22bea83a:

    # voice "se/z02878.ogg"
    voice "se/z02878.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:110673
translate chinese map307_495a6b31:

    # char_the_triumvirate "You are right. Kneel, Sovy, and pledge your loyalty.\nThen, turn that blade on The Monarch, and take his soul.\nThat's all we need. The blade, and the power inside him."
    char_the_triumvirate "你说得对。跪下吧，索维，宣誓效忠。\n然后，把那把剑转向君主，取走他的灵魂。\n我们要的就这些。那把剑，以及他体内的力量。"

# game/script.rpy:110678
translate chinese map307_875fe7ef:

    # voice "se/z02879.ogg"
    voice "se/z02879.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:110680
translate chinese map307_0770da87:

    # char_the_triumvirate "You are right. Kneel, Sovy, and pledge your loyalty.\nThen, turn that blade on The Monarch, and take her soul.\nThat's all we need. The blade, and the power inside her."
    char_the_triumvirate "你说得对。跪下吧，索维，宣誓效忠。\n然后，把那把剑转向君主，取走她的灵魂。\n我们要的就这些。那把剑，以及她体内的力量。"

# game/script.rpy:110696
translate chinese map307_f1465336:

    # "Sovy immediately drops the blade to his side, and kneels down.{w}\nIt hits the ground with a loud metallic clang, then rests there, motionless."
    "索维立刻将剑垂到身侧，跪了下来。{w}\n剑落在地上，发出一声铿锵的金属巨响，随后静止不动地躺在那里。"

# game/script.rpy:110721
translate chinese map307_0f960d9b:

    # voice "se/sovy77.ogg"
    # char_sovy "Yes, whatever you say. I will continue to serve.\nAs The Grand Inquisitor, I have only one goal.\nRemoving threats to the throne of Alestia."
    voice "se/sovy77.ogg"
    char_sovy "是，一切都听您的。我会继续效力。\n作为大审判官，我只有一个目标。\n清除对阿莱斯蒂亚王座的威胁。"

# game/script.rpy:110736
translate chinese map307_84a41d24:

    # "He trembles, frightened, as The Triumvir nods."
    "执政官点了点头，他则害怕地颤抖着。"

# game/script.rpy:110761
translate chinese map307_1b01aeb1:

    # voice "se/sovy78.ogg"
    # char_sovy "And I shall start with you..."
    voice "se/sovy78.ogg"
    char_sovy "那么，就从你们开始吧……"

# game/script.rpy:110779
translate chinese map307_613f238e:

    # "A moment later, the blade disappears from the ground.{w}\nBut it doesn't return to Sovy's hands, or even mine.{w}\nIt phases directly through the chest of The Triumvir."
    "片刻之后，地上的剑消失了。{w}\n但它没有回到索维手中，也没有回到我的手中。{w}\n它径直穿过了那位执政官的胸膛。"

# game/script.rpy:110807
translate chinese map307_89e4b442:

    # voice "se/z02882.ogg"
    # char_the_triumvirate "S-Sovy...!?"
    voice "se/z02882.ogg"
    char_the_triumvirate "索、索维……！？"

# game/script.rpy:110822
translate chinese map307_40029689:

    # "He rises to his feet, and grips the handle of the blade.{w}\nI can see tears streaming from his eyes. Sad at what he's done.{w}\nHe's shaking, as if he almost refuses to believe that this is real."
    "他站起身来，握住剑柄。{w}\n我能看见泪水从他眼中涌出。他是为自己的所作所为而悲伤。{w}\n他浑身发抖，仿佛几乎不愿相信这是真的。"

# game/script.rpy:110847
translate chinese map307_01c9b25e:

    # voice "se/sovy79.ogg"
    # char_sovy "I hate that you're making me do this...\nI hate the man that you've made me become..."
    voice "se/sovy79.ogg"
    char_sovy "我恨你们逼我做出这种事……\n我恨你们把我变成了这样的人……"

# game/script.rpy:110873
translate chinese map307_1e74e8eb:

    # voice "se/z02884.ogg"
    # char_the_triumvirate "S-Sovy..."
    voice "se/z02884.ogg"
    char_the_triumvirate "索、索维……"

# game/script.rpy:110895
translate chinese map307_5288c1c2:

    # "And a moment later, he pulls out the blade.{w}\nThen, with a harsh kick, The Triumvir flies off the edge.{w}\nI can hear them scream as they fall, and then, the screams fade."
    "片刻之后，他拔出了剑。{w}\n接着，一脚狠狠踢出，那位执政官飞出了阶梯边缘。{w}\n我能听见他们坠落时的惨叫，随后，那叫声渐渐消散。"

# game/script.rpy:110897
translate chinese map307_a24f25db:

    # "Sovy drops the blade, and then drops back down to his knees.{w}\nI start walking up the stairs, shocked at what I just saw.{w}\nOne of them was dead...? Now, only two more remain."
    "索维丢下剑，又颓然跪倒在地。{w}\n我震惊于方才所见，开始向阶梯上走去。{w}\n他们中的一个死了……？现在，只剩下两个了。"

# game/script.rpy:110918
translate chinese map307_bc0f1ce6:

    # voice "se/sovy80.ogg"
    voice "se/sovy80.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:110920
translate chinese map307_714d1141:

    # char_sovy "[firstname]...\nTake the blade and go.\nEnd this foolish war. Please..."
    char_sovy "[firstname]……\n带上那把剑，走吧。\n终结这场愚蠢的战争。求你了……"

# game/script.rpy:110934
translate chinese map307_f59d8a5f:

    # "I summon the blade back into my hand, and walk up the stairs.{w}\nI stop, as I arrive beside him. But he simply shakes his head.{w}\nI consider placing my hand on his shoulder, but it's no use."
    "我将剑召回手中，走上阶梯。{w}\n走到他身边时，我停下脚步。可他只是摇了摇头。{w}\n我想把手搭在他肩上，却毫无意义。"

# game/script.rpy:110949
translate chinese map307_7d7ba634:

    # voice "se/sovy81.ogg"
    # char_sovy "Just go..."
    voice "se/sovy81.ogg"
    char_sovy "走吧……"

# game/script.rpy:110971
translate chinese map307_83e9f35f:

    # "With a sigh of regret, I realize that there's nothing I can do.{w}\nI wouldn't even have time to chastise him. I decide to enter their chambers.{w}\nHis cries fill my ears, and dissipate with each step I take toward the end."
    "我遗憾地叹了口气，意识到自己什么也做不了。{w}\n我甚至没有时间责备他。我决定走进他们的议事厅。{w}\n他的哭声灌满我的耳朵，随着我一步步走向终点而渐渐消散。"

# game/script.rpy:110973
translate chinese map307_dab72341:

    # "Either the end of The Triumvirate, or the end of myself..."
    "要么是三人执政团的终结，要么是我自己的终结……"

# game/script.rpy:110994
translate chinese map307_bed1197c:

    # voice "se/sovy82.ogg"
    voice "se/sovy82.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:110996
translate chinese map307_37996d32:

    # char_sovy "[firstname], I'm sorry...\nI think this is the end for me.\nHonestly, it {i}has{/i} been for a long time."
    char_sovy "[firstname]，对不起……\n我想这就是我的终点了。\n说实话，它{i}早就{/i}是了。"

# game/script.rpy:111010
translate chinese map307_dfe01307:

    # "I summon the blade back into my hand.{w}\nIt was clear that he needed some consolation.{w}\nBut, a second later, I realize I'd never get the chance."
    "我将剑召回手中。{w}\n他显然需要一些安慰。{w}\n可一秒之后，我意识到自己再也没有这个机会了。"

# game/script.rpy:111019
translate chinese map307_2dd9a686:

    # "With tears in his eyes, he throws himself off the edge of the stairs.{w}\nI start to run up the stairs, but it's no use. It's far too late when I get to the top.{w}\nHe falls, but lets out no scream. He faces his end with courage, unlike his Master."
    "他眼含泪水，纵身跃出了阶梯边缘。{w}\n我拔腿向阶梯上奔去，却无济于事。等我赶到顶端时，早已太迟了。{w}\n他坠落了，却没有发出一声叫喊。他勇敢地面对了自己的结局，不像他的主人。"

# game/script.rpy:111021
translate chinese map307_2e7dec67:

    # "There was nothing I could do. {w}\nI couldn't waste a second now that I was here.{w}\nMourning him, or crying, would only result in death."
    "我无能为力。{w}\n既然已经来到这里，我一秒也不能浪费。{w}\n为他哀悼，或是哭泣，只会招来死亡。"

# game/script.rpy:111023
translate chinese map307_16676ee3:

    # "I'm full of regret. How could I save the world, if I couldn't even save {i}him{/i}?{w}\nThat worry rises within me as I slowly enter The Triumvirate's chambers.{w}\nI have no idea what awaited me, but I knew that it would be the end."
    "我满心悔恨。如果连{i}他{/i}都救不了，我又怎么能拯救这个世界？{w}\n当我缓缓走进三人执政团的议事厅时，这份忧虑在心中升起。{w}\n我不知道前方等待我的是什么，但我知道，那将是终点。"

# game/script.rpy:111025
translate chinese map307_dab72341_1:

    # "Either the end of The Triumvirate, or the end of myself..."
    "要么是三人执政团的终结，要么是我自己的终结……"

# game/script.rpy:111058
translate chinese map306_2be4ffc8:

    # "The ringing of the bell echoes in my ears. It's almost deafening.{w}\nI'm relieved to know that Fortaime survived, and succeeded.{w}\nMe and Ulric stand in the darkness, and it's hard to see."
    "钟声在耳中回荡，几乎震耳欲聋。{w}\n得知福泰姆活了下来，并且成功了，我松了口气。{w}\n我和乌尔里克站在黑暗中，四周几乎什么都看不清。"

# game/script.rpy:111083
translate chinese map306_2522390c:

    # voice "se/z02888.ogg"
    voice "se/z02888.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:111085
translate chinese map306_dae4fd2b:

    # char_ulric "Here, you'll be needing this."
    char_ulric "给，你会需要这个。"

# game/script.rpy:111099
translate chinese map306_3a18b6fe:

    # "He hands me a torch that was hung against the wall."
    "他递给我一支原本挂在墙上的火把。"

# game/script.rpy:111124
translate chinese map306_549bf867:

    # voice "se/z02889.ogg"
    # char_ulric "And watch your step as we go up those stairs.\nIf you fall off the edge — well, you know how high we are."
    voice "se/z02889.ogg"
    char_ulric "上楼的时候小心脚下。\n要是从边缘摔下去——你也知道我们有多高。"

# game/script.rpy:111139
translate chinese map306_76e71f28:

    # "I nod. The thought filled me with fright.{w}\nI hold out the torch, and see the bizarre sight before me.{w}\nThe walls are lined with gears, just like those on the blade."
    "我点点头。这个念头让我满心恐惧。{w}\n我举起火把，看到了眼前离奇的景象。{w}\n墙上排满了齿轮，就像剑上的那些一样。"

# game/script.rpy:111141
translate chinese map306_807566a2:

    # "They spin, and rotate in directions that they shouldn't.{w}\nIt makes no sense to me. But then again, neither does the blade.{w}\nThe gear on the base spun in a way that was impossible, too."
    "它们旋转着，朝着本不该转动的方向。{w}\n我完全无法理解。不过话说回来，那把剑也一样让我费解。{w}\n底座上的齿轮当初也是以不可能的方式转动的。"

# game/script.rpy:111143
translate chinese map306_4f128004:

    # "Fog lines the stairs leading up to The Triumvirate's chambers.{w}\nI was confident a moment ago, but this sight fills me with unease.{w}\nI've never seen anything like it, and it's very concerning to me."
    "浓雾弥漫在通往三人执政团议事厅的阶梯上。{w}\n方才我还满怀信心，可这景象却让我心神不宁。{w}\n我从未见过这样的东西，这让我深感忧虑。"

# game/script.rpy:111145
translate chinese map306_42881de4:

    # "I couldn't see off the edges of the stairs, and there was no railing.{w}\nThe slightest stumble could send me right back down to the atrium.{w}\nI do need to go back there. But — that's not the way I'd like to do it."
    "我看不清阶梯的边缘，也没有任何护栏。{w}\n稍有失足，我就会一路摔回中庭。{w}\n我确实得回去一趟。但——绝不是以我想要的方式。"

# game/script.rpy:111170
translate chinese map306_2affec96:

    # voice "se/z02890.ogg"
    # char_ulric "I have a piece of advice for you, [firstname].\nDon't let them talk to you. Just kill them, without question.\nAll they'll do is try to justify their actions, and earn your sympathy."
    voice "se/z02890.ogg"
    char_ulric "我有一句忠告给你，[firstname]。\n别让他们开口跟你说话。什么都别问，直接杀了他们。\n他们只会试图为自己的所作所为辩解，好博取你的同情。"

# game/script.rpy:111184
translate chinese map306_ca6dee7c:

    # voice "se/z02891.ogg"
    # char_ulric "They prey on the minds of the weak. Of those that they can mould.\nI know you're strong, but they just have this way of convincing you.\nI'd hate to see that happen to you. So remember. Kill them all."
    voice "se/z02891.ogg"
    char_ulric "他们专挑心智软弱、能被他们塑造的人下手。\n我知道你很坚强，可他们就是有办法说服你。\n我不愿看到你变成那样。所以记住，把他们全部杀掉。"

# game/script.rpy:111199
translate chinese map306_e6463694:

    # "I tell him that I don't care what they say to me. I'm here to kill them.{w}\nThey could speak to me all they wished. They'd accomplish nothing.{w}\nAn easy goal to have in mind. But in practice — I guess I had no idea."
    "我告诉他，我不在乎他们对我说什么。我来这里就是为了杀他们。{w}\n他们尽可以对我畅所欲言，也改变不了什么。{w}\n这话说着容易。可真正面对时——我想我根本没有料到。"

# game/script.rpy:111204
translate chinese map306_575b3493:

    # "I'd have to find out, however. Someone steps out of the room ahead of us.{w}\nAs they move toward us, I can see the white and goal of their cloak.{w}\nOne of them left their chambers...? I thought they didn't do that."
    "可我终究得弄清楚。这时，有人从我们前方的房间里走了出来。{w}\n当他们朝我们走来时，我看清了那件白金相间的斗篷。{w}\n他们中的一人离开了议事厅……？我还以为他们从不这样做。"

# game/script.rpy:111232
translate chinese map306_654ab95a:

    # voice "se/z02892.ogg"
    voice "se/z02892.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:111235
translate chinese map306_983a3315:

    # char_the_triumvirate "Ulric — this is quite a surprise.\nIt's been ages since we've seen your face.\nHave you come to grovel in the face of your defeat?"
    char_the_triumvirate "乌尔里克——真是意外。\n我们已经很久没见过你的脸了。\n你是来面对败局摇尾乞怜的吗？"

# game/script.rpy:111262
translate chinese map306_6db69fb6:

    # voice "se/z02893.ogg"
    voice "se/z02893.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:111264
translate chinese map306_70610b44:

    # char_ulric "I've come here to end this war.\nI bring an offering. The blade, and [firstname].\nDo with him what you will, but I ask for your surrender."
    char_ulric "我来此是为了终结这场战争。\n我带来了一份献礼。那把剑，还有[firstname]。\n你们想怎么处置他都行，但我请求你们投降。"

# game/script.rpy:111269
translate chinese map306_95360343:

    # voice "se/z02894.ogg"
    voice "se/z02894.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:111271
translate chinese map306_4640895c:

    # char_ulric "I've come here to end this war.\nI bring an offering. The blade, and [firstname].\nDo with her what you will, but I ask for your surrender."
    char_ulric "我来此是为了终结这场战争。\n我带来了一份献礼。那把剑，还有[firstname]。\n你们想怎么处置她都行，但我请求你们投降。"

# game/script.rpy:111285
translate chinese map306_878087cd:

    # voice "se/z02895.ogg"
    voice "se/z02895.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:111287
translate chinese map306_cafdb254:

    # char_ulric "Leave this world, and never return.\nLive your lives in peace, somewhere far away.\nJust stay out or our business, and leave us alone."
    char_ulric "离开这个世界，永远别再回来。\n去远方平静地生活吧。\n别再来干涉我们的事，让我们清静。"

# game/script.rpy:111304
translate chinese map306_bd4636f9:

    # "What...!? Ulric was selling me out...!?{w}\nI turn and try to run, but he immediately grabs my right arm.{w}\nI'm filled with fright. I'm not strong enough to break free from his grip."
    "什么……！？乌尔里克把我出卖了……！？{w}\n我转身想逃，可他立刻抓住了我的右臂。{w}\n我满心恐惧，力气不足以挣脱他的钳制。"

# game/script.rpy:111309
translate chinese map306_094aaa38:

    # "What...!? Ulric was selling me out...!?{w}\nI turn and try to run, but he immediately grabs my left arm.{w}\nI'm filled with fright, but I'm not strong enough to break free from his grip."
    "什么……！？乌尔里克把我出卖了……！？{w}\n我转身想逃，可他立刻抓住了我的左臂。{w}\n我满心恐惧，力气不足以挣脱他的钳制。"

# game/script.rpy:111338
translate chinese map306_a20e503a:

    # voice "se/z02896.ogg"
    voice "se/z02896.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:111340
translate chinese map306_2361a075:

    # char_the_triumvirate "You've done nothing but bring an armed enemy into our home.\nWhat makes you think we can trust you? This is surely a trap.\nAs long as The Monarch can wield that blade, they are a threat."
    char_the_triumvirate "你所做的不过是把一名全副武装的敌人带进了我们的家。\n你凭什么认为我们能信任你？这必定是个陷阱。\n只要君主还能使用那把剑，他们就是威胁。"

# game/script.rpy:111354
translate chinese map306_07a0d880:

    # "Ulric scoffs."
    "乌尔里克嗤笑一声。"

# game/script.rpy:111379
translate chinese map306_8211ce99:

    # voice "se/z02897.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Then let me fix that."
    voice "se/z02897.ogg"
    char_ulric "那就让我来解决这个问题。"

# game/script.rpy:111397
translate chinese map306_17ee3b74:

    # "A second after, Ulric phases the blade into his hands.{w}\nThen, much to my regret, he slices through my arm with ease.{w}\nI scream, and then from the elbow down, almost nothing remains."
    "一秒之后，乌尔里克将剑相位转移到手中。{w}\n紧接着，令我悔恨不已的是，他轻而易举地斩断了我的手臂。{w}\n我放声尖叫，而从手肘往下，几乎什么也没剩下。"

# game/script.rpy:111422
translate chinese map306_41cba8dc:

    # voice "se/z02898.ogg"
    # char_ulric "There. Look how easy that was.\nNever again can that blade be used against you.\nNow do what I said. Surrender, and leave this world."
    voice "se/z02898.ogg"
    char_ulric "好了。看，多简单。\n那把剑再也不可能被用来对付你们了。\n现在照我说的做。投降，然后离开这个世界。"

# game/script.rpy:111437
translate chinese map306_3a70c6f2:

    # "I don't feel anything, almost as if my body numbs itself from the trauma.{w}\nBut the sight is all too real. My lower arm, limp, and dead on the floor.{w}\nBlood spurts from the wound, and I look at Ulric in disbelief."
    "我什么都感觉不到，仿佛身体因创伤而麻木了。{w}\n可眼前的景象却无比真实。我的小臂软弱无力地瘫死在地上。{w}\n鲜血从伤口喷涌而出，我难以置信地看向乌尔里克。"

# game/script.rpy:111439
translate chinese map306_e66bcc2f:

    # "He makes direct eye contact with me, and then looks at the torch.{w}\nI'm still gripping it tightly, and that's when things make sense.{w}\nWas he trying to fool them? I still have use of my good arm."
    "他直视着我的眼睛，随后看向那支火把。{w}\n我仍旧紧紧握着它，就在那时，我明白了一切。{w}\n他是在骗他们吗？我那条完好的手臂还能用。"

# game/script.rpy:111441
translate chinese map306_5b714000:

    # "I slump against the wall, and use the torch to burn the wound shut.{w}\nA disgusting smell fills the air, and I can hear cracking and sizzling.{w}\nThis is all I can do, while I watch Ulric ascend the stairs with the blade."
    "我瘫靠在墙上，用火把将伤口烧灼封住。{w}\n一股恶臭弥漫在空气中，我能听见噼啪的灼烧声。{w}\n眼看着乌尔里克带着那把剑登上阶梯，我能做的也只有这些了。"

# game/script.rpy:111466
translate chinese map306_d288af9a:

    # voice "se/z02899.ogg"
    # char_the_triumvirate "How surprising. You've changed, Ulric.\nWe thought your allegiance to The Rebellion was absolute."
    voice "se/z02899.ogg"
    char_the_triumvirate "真令人意外。你变了，乌尔里克。\n我们以为你对反抗军的忠诚是绝对的。"

# game/script.rpy:111492
translate chinese map306_2e392d30:

    # voice "se/z02900.ogg"
    # char_ulric "No. It's my allegiance to Alestia that takes priority.\nThis senseless war will only end up destroying the world.\nOne life means nothing to me if it allows this land to flourish."
    voice "se/z02900.ogg"
    char_ulric "不。我优先效忠的是阿莱斯蒂亚。\n这场毫无意义的战争只会毁掉这个世界。\n若能换来这片土地的繁荣，一条性命对我而言算不了什么。"

# game/script.rpy:111507
translate chinese map306_78957178:

    # "The Triumvir looks down at my scabbard.{w}\nThey definitely believe Ulric removed my dominant arm.{w}\nI don't know why any of this is happening, but I let it all unfold."
    "执政官低头看了看我的剑鞘。{w}\n他们显然相信乌尔里克斩断的是我的惯用手臂。{w}\n我不知道这一切为何会发生，但我任由它发展下去。"

# game/script.rpy:111509
translate chinese map306_6eeaefaf:

    # "I trust Ulric, and I know he's doing this for a reason."
    "我信任乌尔里克，我知道他这么做自有理由。"

# game/script.rpy:111537
translate chinese map306_1d942efa:

    # voice "se/z02901.ogg"
    # char_the_triumvirate "A generous offer, but one we cannot accept.\nSurely you know the truth now, after everything you've seen.\nThe Monarchy, and those that follow their path, lead worlds to ruin."
    voice "se/z02901.ogg"
    char_the_triumvirate "一份慷慨的提议，但我们无法接受。\n见过这一切之后，你现在总该知道真相了。\n王室，以及所有追随其道路的人，只会将世界引向毁灭。"

# game/script.rpy:111552
translate chinese map306_2386c437:

    # "Ulric continues up the stairs, gripping the blade as tight as he can."
    "乌尔里克继续向阶梯上走去，尽可能紧地握着那把剑。"

# game/script.rpy:111580
translate chinese map306_ef7e9454:

    # voice "se/z02902.ogg"
    # char_the_triumvirate "We request that you join us once more, Ulric.\nIt would appear that Halin, Shane, and Sovy have let us down.\nYou can make the right choice. Join our ranks, and save the world."
    voice "se/z02902.ogg"
    char_the_triumvirate "我们请求你再次加入我们，乌尔里克。\n看来哈林、肖恩和索维都让我们失望了。\n你可以做出正确的选择。加入我们的行列，拯救这个世界。"

# game/script.rpy:111595
translate chinese map306_8f0357c5:

    # "Ulric lets out a loud sigh, like he's considering their offer."
    "乌尔里克重重叹了口气，像是在考虑他们的提议。"

# game/script.rpy:111620
translate chinese map306_d48fc59b:

    # voice "se/z02903.ogg"
    # char_ulric "And what would you have me do...?"
    voice "se/z02903.ogg"
    char_ulric "那你们想让我做什么……？"

# game/script.rpy:111635
translate chinese map306_7f1d3fc3:

    # "As he speaks, he reaches the top of the stairs, and faces The Triumvir.{w}\nBy now, I'm almost coherent again, and the wound bleeds no more. Burnt shut.{w}\nI watch the two of them converse, wondering what exactly is going to happen."
    "他说着，走到了阶梯顶端，面对着那位执政官。{w}\n此时，我几乎恢复了清醒，伤口也不再流血了。已经被灼烧封住。{w}\n我看着他们两人交谈，心里琢磨着究竟会发生什么。"

# game/script.rpy:111662
translate chinese map306_3b74432c:

    # voice "se/z02904.ogg"
    voice "se/z02904.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:111664
translate chinese map306_4350cc05:

    # char_the_triumvirate "Kneel, and pledge your loyalty to our cause.\nThen, turn that blade on The Monarch, and take his soul.\nThere's a reason we need both his power, and that blade."
    char_the_triumvirate "跪下，宣誓效忠我们的事业。\n然后，把那把剑转向君主，取走他的灵魂。\n我们需要他的力量，也需要那把剑，这是有原因的。"

# game/script.rpy:111667
translate chinese map306_2d732ec4:

    # voice "se/z02905.ogg"
    # char_the_triumvirate "If you can do that, then all will be forgiven. \nYou see, Ulric — [firstname] is key to saving us all.\nHe would waste his power, while we plan to harness it correctly."
    voice "se/z02905.ogg"
    char_the_triumvirate "如果你能做到，那么一切都既往不咎。\n你看，乌尔里克——[firstname]是拯救我们所有人的关键。\n他会浪费自己的力量，而我们则打算正确地驾驭它。"

# game/script.rpy:111673
translate chinese map306_0bdb4b04:

    # voice "se/z02906.ogg"
    voice "se/z02906.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:111675
translate chinese map306_6bf705b6:

    # char_the_triumvirate "Kneel, and pledge your loyalty to our cause.\nThen, turn that blade on The Monarch, and take her soul.\nThere's a reason we need both her power, and that blade."
    char_the_triumvirate "跪下，宣誓效忠我们的事业。\n然后，把那把剑转向君主，取走她的灵魂。\n我们需要她的力量，也需要那把剑，这是有原因的。"

# game/script.rpy:111678
translate chinese map306_58408a03:

    # voice "se/z02907.ogg"
    # char_the_triumvirate "If you can do that, then all will be forgiven.\nYou see, Ulric — [firstname] is key to saving us all.\nShe would waste her power, while we plan to harness it correctly."
    voice "se/z02907.ogg"
    char_the_triumvirate "如果你能做到，那么一切都既往不咎。\n你看，乌尔里克——[firstname]是拯救我们所有人的关键。\n她会浪费自己的力量，而我们则打算正确地驾驭它。"

# game/script.rpy:111705
translate chinese map306_95000550:

    # voice "se/z02908.ogg"
    voice "se/z02908.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:111707
translate chinese map306_0cad2030:

    # char_ulric "What do you mean?"
    char_ulric "你这话是什么意思？"

# game/script.rpy:111732
translate chinese map306_9e7a1910:

    # voice "se/z02909.ogg"
    # char_the_triumvirate "Do as we say, and we will tell you everything.\nEven the things we could not tell you in the past."
    voice "se/z02909.ogg"
    char_the_triumvirate "照我们说的做，我们就会把一切都告诉你。\n甚至是那些过去我们无法告诉你的事。"

# game/script.rpy:111747
translate chinese map306_97d0820f:

    # "Ulric immediately drops the blade to his side, and kneels down.{w}\nIt hits the ground with a loud metallic clang, then rests there, motionless."
    "乌尔里克立刻将剑垂到身侧，跪了下来。{w}\n剑落在地上，发出一声铿锵的金属巨响，随后静止不动地躺在那里。"

# game/script.rpy:111775
translate chinese map306_222f1683:

    # voice "se/z02910.ogg"
    # char_the_triumvirate "Good. We are glad that you realized the error of your ways.\nSiding with The Rebellion is foolish. It is a waste of your talent.\nWith us, you will finally be back on the right side of history."
    voice "se/z02910.ogg"
    char_the_triumvirate "很好。我们很高兴你认识到了自己的错误。\n站在反抗军那一边是愚蠢的。那是在浪费你的才能。\n和我们一起，你终将重新站到历史的正确一方。"

# game/script.rpy:111801
translate chinese map306_7ae15390:

    # voice "se/z02911.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Yes, Master. Of course. My loyalty is forever yours.\nAs The Grand Inquisitor, I have only one goal.\nTo remove any threat that faces the throne."
    voice "se/z02911.ogg"
    char_ulric "是，主人。当然。我的忠诚永远属于您。\n作为大审判官，我只有一个目标。\n清除任何威胁王座的存在。"

# game/script.rpy:111816
translate chinese map306_d08ab531:

    # "Ulric grins as he says those words."
    "乌尔里克说这话时咧嘴一笑。"

# game/script.rpy:111844
translate chinese map306_5ba44e89:

    # voice "se/z02912.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Starting with you..."
    voice "se/z02912.ogg"
    char_ulric "就从你们开始……"

# game/script.rpy:111859
translate chinese map306_e0b7fe8a:

    # "A moment later, the blade disappears from the ground.{w}\nBut it doesn't return to Ulric's hands, or even mine.{w}\nIt phases directly through the chest of The Triumvir."
    "片刻之后，地上的剑消失了。{w}\n但它没有回到乌尔里克手中，也没有回到我的手中。{w}\n它径直穿过了那位执政官的胸膛。"

# game/script.rpy:111884
translate chinese map306_de5de910:

    # voice "se/z02913.ogg"
    # char_the_triumvirate "U-Ulric...!?"
    voice "se/z02913.ogg"
    char_the_triumvirate "乌、乌尔里克……！？"

# game/script.rpy:111899
translate chinese map306_c5aebb44:

    # "He rises to his feet, and grips the handle of the blade.{w}\nI knew I could trust him. I knew he had a plan...!{w}\nI'm so thankful that he wasn't betraying me."
    "他站起身来，握住剑柄。{w}\n我就知道我可以信任他。我就知道他自有打算……！{w}\n我多么庆幸他并不是在背叛我。"

# game/script.rpy:111914
translate chinese map306_05a044e1:

    # voice "se/z02914.ogg"
    # char_ulric "You think I believed you...? Foolish, as always.\nYou let your guard down at the first sign of obedience.\nThe right side of history? Don't make me laugh."
    voice "se/z02914.ogg"
    char_ulric "你以为我相信了你……？还和从前一样愚蠢。\n一见到顺从的迹象，你们就放松了警惕。\n历史的正确一方？别逗我笑了。"

# game/script.rpy:111940
translate chinese map306_67c04f9d:

    # voice "se/z02915.ogg"
    # char_the_triumvirate "Ulric..."
    voice "se/z02915.ogg"
    char_the_triumvirate "乌尔里克……"

# game/script.rpy:111968
translate chinese map306_9ba3937d:

    # voice "se/z02916.ogg"
    voice "se/z02916.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:111970
translate chinese map306_34c7e49b:

    # char_ulric "You used a powerful blade in order to play God.\nBut now it's in the hands of [firstname]. A righteous man.\nHe will undo all that you've done — and {i}liberate{/i} Alestia."
    char_ulric "你们利用一把强大的剑来扮演神明。\n可现在它握在[firstname]手中。一个正直的人。\n他会推翻你们所做的一切——并{i}解放{/i}阿莱斯蒂亚。"

# game/script.rpy:111975
translate chinese map306_0c81f96c:

    # voice "se/z02917.ogg"
    voice "se/z02917.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:111977
translate chinese map306_a0eca7e0:

    # char_ulric "You used a powerful blade in order to play God.\nBut now it's in the hands of The Monarch. A righteous woman.\nShe will undo all that you've done — and {i}liberate{/i} Alestia."
    char_ulric "你们利用一把强大的剑来扮演神明。\n可现在它握在君主手中。一个正直的女子。\n她会推翻你们所做的一切——并{i}解放{/i}阿莱斯蒂亚。"

# game/script.rpy:111993
translate chinese map306_d14d4d0c:

    # "A moment later, he pulls out the blade."
    "片刻之后，他拔出了剑。"

# game/script.rpy:112018
translate chinese map306_ba57f21a:

    # voice "se/z02918.ogg"
    # char_ulric "You've held the world in chains for far too long.\nAnd now — it's finally time that they were broken."
    voice "se/z02918.ogg"
    char_ulric "你们用锁链束缚这个世界已经太久了。\n而现在——终于到了砸碎锁链的时候。"

# game/script.rpy:112040
translate chinese map306_15fdb104:

    # "Then, with a harsh kick, The Triumvir flies off the edge.{w}\nI can hear them scream as they fall, and then, the screams fade.{w}\nI'm in complete disbelief. He killed one of them? Was it truly that easy?"
    "接着，一脚狠狠踢出，那位执政官飞出了边缘。{w}\n我能听见他们坠落时的惨叫，随后，那叫声渐渐消散。{w}\n我完全无法相信。他杀掉了他们中的一个？真有这么容易吗？"

# game/script.rpy:112042
translate chinese map306_f5269edd:

    # "Ulric drops the blade to the ground, and I summon it back into my grip.{w}\nAs I make my way up the stairs, my anger toward him is very clear."
    "乌尔里克把剑丢在地上，我将它召回手中。{w}\n当我向阶梯上走去时，我对他的怒气毫不掩饰。"

# game/script.rpy:112067
translate chinese map306_7d95619a:

    # voice "se/z02919.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Look, I had to do it. A direct attack would've been suicide.\nWe had to make them lower their guard, and think that they were winning.\nAn act of betrayal, and a pledge of fealty? It's all I could think of doing."
    voice "se/z02919.ogg"
    char_ulric "听着，我不得不那么做。正面进攻无异于自杀。\n我们得让他们放松警惕，以为胜券在握。\n假意背叛，再宣誓效忠？这是我能想到的唯一办法。"

# game/script.rpy:112082
translate chinese map306_32e34bf8:

    # "I start to speak, but he cuts me off immediately."
    "我刚要开口，就被他立刻打断了。"

# game/script.rpy:112107
translate chinese map306_16cd8862:

    # voice "se/z02920.ogg"
    # char_ulric "I don't care what you have to say. Not right now.\nGet in those chambers, and finish this once and for all.\nThere's still two left, and you're only giving them time to prepare."
    voice "se/z02920.ogg"
    char_ulric "我不在乎你想说什么。现在不想听。\n进议事厅去，把这桩事彻底了结。\n还剩两个，你只是在给他们时间准备。"

# game/script.rpy:112129
translate chinese map306_69cadae3:

    # "With a sigh of regret, I realize that there's nothing I can do.{w}\nI sheathe the blade, and slowly enter The Triumvirate's chambers.{w}\nWe'd have plenty of time to talk later. I had to see this through to the end."
    "我遗憾地叹了口气，意识到自己什么也做不了。{w}\n我收起剑，缓缓走进三人执政团的议事厅。{w}\n我们以后有的是时间谈。我必须把这件事坚持到底。"

# game/script.rpy:112131
translate chinese map306_dab72341:

    # "Either the end of The Triumvirate, or the end of myself..."
    "要么是三人执政团的终结，要么是我自己的终结……"

# game/script.rpy:112161
translate chinese map308_a2703b75:

    # "When I enter their chambers, it looks just like I remember it.{w}\nI've been here before. I've had visions of standing in this very spot.{w}\nIn those visions, I remember walking toward the idol in the back."
    "当我走进他们的议事厅时，这里和我记忆中的一模一样。{w}\n我来过这里。我曾有过站在这个位置的幻象。{w}\n在那些幻象里，我记得自己走向后方的灵像。"

# game/script.rpy:112163
translate chinese map308_d9b79b7a:

    # "I can feel the blade respond to this room, but I'm not sure why.{w}\nIt's not moving or anything — it's just a feeling deep in my gut.{w}\nAs I go to grab the blade, I hear a loud voice call out to me."
    "我能感觉到那把剑对这个房间起了反应，却不知为何。{w}\n它并没有动——只是我内心深处的一种直觉。{w}\n正当我要去握那把剑时，我听见一个响亮的声音朝我呼喊。"

# game/script.rpy:112166
translate chinese map308_98790deb:

    # voice "se/z02921.ogg"
    voice "se/z02921.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:112171
translate chinese map308_7fbd2814:

    # char_jit_map308_1_0_10 "Stop."
    char_jit_map308_1_0_10 "住手。"

# game/script.rpy:112173
translate chinese map308_6f999a7d:

    # "Then, out of nowhere, I see two cloaks appear by the idol.{w}\nOne of them stays in place, and the other walks toward me.{w}\nThe one at the back was surely my target, and their leader."
    "紧接着，不知从哪里冒出两件斗篷，出现在灵像旁。{w}\n其中一个留在原地，另一个朝我走来。{w}\n后面那个无疑是我的目标，也是他们的首领。"

# game/script.rpy:112201
translate chinese map308_0fa6e1f9:

    # voice "se/z02922.ogg"
    voice "se/z02922.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:112203
translate chinese map308_6ef3f033:

    # char_the_triumvirate "Do not draw that blade unless you intend to use it.\nThat idol will respond to your aggression, and fight back.\nWe will not harm you. We brought you here for another reason."
    char_the_triumvirate "除非你打算动手，否则别拔出那把剑。\n那尊灵像会对你的敌意作出反应，并且反击。\n我们不会伤害你。我们把你带到这里，另有原因。"

# game/script.rpy:112217
translate chinese map308_26e6edc4:

    # "Another reason...? What could it be?{w}\nI know I was told not to let them speak, but I'm curious.{w}\nAssuming a neutral stance, I ask them to explain themselves."
    "另有原因……？会是什么呢？{w}\n我知道有人告诫过我别让他们开口，可我很好奇。{w}\n我摆出中立的姿态，让他们解释清楚。"

# game/script.rpy:112242
translate chinese map308_b5fafdc2:

    # voice "se/z02923.ogg"
    # char_the_triumvirate "That is a tall order, Monarch."
    voice "se/z02923.ogg"
    char_the_triumvirate "这要求可不小，君主。"

# game/script.rpy:112257
translate chinese map308_09886dee:

    # "I notice they use my proper title.{w}\nIn this moment, there was no room left for doubt.{w}\nEverything Howl told us about The Triumvirate was true."
    "我注意到他们用了我的正式头衔。{w}\n这一刻，再没有任何怀疑的余地。{w}\n豪尔告诉我们的关于三人执政团的一切都是真的。"

# game/script.rpy:112259
translate chinese map308_fef3cbc4:

    # "They don't speak, they just stand there in silence.{w}\nIf I had anything to ask them, I guess now would be the time to do it.{w}\nHowever, earlier warnings echo in my ears. Warnings against letting them speak."
    "他们没有开口，只是沉默地站在那里。{w}\n如果我有想问的，我想现在正是时候。{w}\n然而，先前的告诫在我耳中回响。那是别让他们开口的告诫。"

# game/script.rpy:112274
translate chinese Tri1_map308_1_0_0488efdf:

    # char_the_triumvirate "..." nointeract
    char_the_triumvirate "……" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:112289
translate chinese Tri1_map308_1_0_ac142a31:

    # voice "se/z02925.ogg"
    # char_the_triumvirate "We are nobody, and yet we are everyone.\nWe are the same, and yet we are different.\nThere is really no way to answer that question."
    voice "se/z02925.ogg"
    char_the_triumvirate "我们谁都不是，却又无所不是。\n我们彼此相同，却又各不相同。\n那个问题，实在无从回答。"

# game/script.rpy:112293
translate chinese Tri1_map308_1_0_97c3b63d:

    # voice "se/z02926.ogg"
    # char_the_triumvirate "Like you, we are simply beings capable of wielding that blade.\nWhen the sun sets on this era, and rises again, we will be forgotten.\nReduced to cosmic dust, we will become even less than a memory."
    voice "se/z02926.ogg"
    char_the_triumvirate "和你一样，我们不过是能够驾驭那把剑的存在。\n当这个时代的太阳落下又升起时，我们就会被遗忘。\n化为宇宙的尘埃，我们将连记忆都算不上。"

# game/script.rpy:112307
translate chinese Tri1_map308_1_0_9c9cab75:

    # voice "se/z02927.ogg"
    # char_the_triumvirate "It matters not how the cycle ends. Only how the cycle began.\nThe ones who created that blade could never comprehend what they started.\nAn endless war of life against death — of purity against corruption."
    voice "se/z02927.ogg"
    char_the_triumvirate "这个循环如何终结并不重要。重要的是它如何开始。\n创造那把剑的人永远无法理解自己启动了怎样的东西。\n一场生与死、纯洁与腐化之间无休无止的战争。"

# game/script.rpy:112311
translate chinese Tri1_map308_1_0_2fbaaccd:

    # voice "se/z02928.ogg"
    # char_the_triumvirate "As long as that blade exists, there will be beings capable of wielding it.\nAnd as long as those beings exist, they will inevitably meet, just like us.\nA catalyst for the clashing of ideals. It exists only to create disorder."
    voice "se/z02928.ogg"
    char_the_triumvirate "只要那把剑存在，就会有能够驾驭它的存在。\n而只要那些存在存在，他们就终将相遇，就像我们一样。\n它是理念冲突的催化剂。它存在的意义，就是制造混乱。"

# game/script.rpy:112329
translate chinese Tri1_map308_1_0_e03c02a5:

    # voice "se/z02929.ogg"
    # char_the_triumvirate "Long ago, a group of three, faced an almost insurmountable foe.\nThey were able to prevail, and they thought that they had won peace.\nAll of the worlds, once closed off, became united in one large universe."
    voice "se/z02929.ogg"
    char_the_triumvirate "很久以前，三个人面对着一个几乎无法战胜的敌人。\n他们取得了胜利，以为赢得了和平。\n所有彼此隔绝的世界，从此连成了一个庞大的宇宙。"

# game/script.rpy:112333
translate chinese Tri1_map308_1_0_328c01a3:

    # voice "se/z02930.ogg"
    # char_the_triumvirate "You see, that blade was created from the clashing of conflicting ideals.\nLife against death, purity against corruption. It feeds off of that imbalance.\nWhat they held after the battle, was only a portend of more strife to come."
    voice "se/z02930.ogg"
    char_the_triumvirate "你看，那把剑诞生于相互冲突的理念的碰撞。\n生与死，纯洁与腐化。它靠那种失衡为食。\n战后他们手中所持的，不过是更多纷争将至的预兆。"

# game/script.rpy:112347
translate chinese Tri1_map308_1_0_3971a151:

    # voice "se/z02931.ogg"
    # char_the_triumvirate "We do look fondly on those who created the blade, but we also hate them.\nWere it not for them, neither of us would be standing here right now.\nBut because of them, we stand here at odds, instead of peace."
    voice "se/z02931.ogg"
    char_the_triumvirate "我们对创造那把剑的人既怀有眷恋，也心怀憎恨。\n若不是他们，我们双方此刻都不会站在这里。\n可正因为他们，我们才站在这里彼此为敌，而非共享和平。"

# game/script.rpy:112361
translate chinese Tri1_map308_1_0_07147b5a:

    # voice "se/z02932.ogg"
    # char_the_triumvirate "Memories of their exploits linger through the core of that blade.\nBut no matter how strong they were, one fact remained.\nThey were nothing but foolish men."
    voice "se/z02932.ogg"
    char_the_triumvirate "他们事迹的记忆仍萦绕在那把剑的核心之中。\n但无论他们多么强大，有一个事实始终不变。\n他们不过是些愚蠢的人。"

# game/script.rpy:112387
translate chinese Tri1_map308_1_0_024d1933:

    # voice "se/z02933.ogg"
    voice "se/z02933.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:112389
translate chinese Tri1_map308_1_0_432bba59:

    # char_the_triumvirate "Men who thought themselves worthy of delivering justice."
    char_the_triumvirate "自以为有资格施行正义的人。"

# game/script.rpy:112402
translate chinese Tri1_map308_1_0_cfc87d29:

    # voice "se/z02934.ogg"
    # char_the_triumvirate "Men, who with all the power in the world, still remained short-sighted."
    voice "se/z02934.ogg"
    char_the_triumvirate "手握世间一切力量，却依旧目光短浅的人。"

# game/script.rpy:112424
translate chinese Tri1_map308_1_0_e7d19444:

    # voice "se/z02935.ogg"
    voice "se/z02935.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:112426
translate chinese Tri1_map308_1_0_2a3c1a9c:

    # char_the_triumvirate "They knew not what they trifled with, Monarch. \nThey thought that the blade was a symbol of victory, but no.\nAfter what you've been through, we both know what it truly means."
    char_the_triumvirate "他们不知道自己玩弄的是什么，君主。\n他们以为那把剑是胜利的象征，但并非如此。\n经历过这一切之后，你我都清楚它真正的含义。"

# game/script.rpy:112439
translate chinese Tri1_map308_1_0_93befaf7:

    # voice "se/z02936.ogg"
    # char_the_triumvirate "War, and death..."
    voice "se/z02936.ogg"
    char_the_triumvirate "战争，与死亡……"

# game/script.rpy:112457
translate chinese Tri1_map308_1_0_7ff41eb4:

    # voice "se/z02937.ogg"
    # char_the_triumvirate "Well, true evil can almost never be fully defeated.\nThough heroes of the past stood victorious over evil, it was temporary.\nIn the future, sometimes even millions of years ahead — the evil returned."
    voice "se/z02937.ogg"
    char_the_triumvirate "真正的邪恶，几乎永远无法被彻底消灭。\n尽管昔日的英雄曾战胜邪恶，那也只是暂时的。\n在未来，有时甚至是在数百万年之后——邪恶卷土重来。"

# game/script.rpy:112461
translate chinese Tri1_map308_1_0_85d805ff:

    # voice "se/z02938.ogg"
    # char_the_triumvirate "And now it stands before you, corrupting the very heart of Alestia.\nBut this is not the first world it has harmed; and it plans to keep moving.\nWe follow it, with that blade, and save innocent worlds from its wrath."
    voice "se/z02938.ogg"
    char_the_triumvirate "如今它就在你面前，侵蚀着阿莱斯蒂亚的心脏。\n但它祸害过的世界不止这一个，它还打算继续前行。\n我们带着那把剑追随它，从它的怒火中拯救无辜的世界。"

# game/script.rpy:112475
translate chinese Tri1_map308_1_0_ffa67b77:

    # voice "se/z02939.ogg"
    # char_the_triumvirate "Look at the dying Balteus. It would deliver that fate to every single world.\nRather than temporarily cast the idol away, we decided to settle down on this planet.\nOur goal was to find a way to destroy both the idol, and the blade, for good."
    voice "se/z02939.ogg"
    char_the_triumvirate "看看正在衰亡的巴尔泰乌斯。它会把同样的命运带给每一个世界。\n与其暂时驱走那尊灵像，我们决定在这个星球定居下来。\n我们的目标是找到一种办法，将灵像和那把剑一并永久摧毁。"

# game/script.rpy:112479
translate chinese Tri1_map308_1_0_cc263c90:

    # voice "se/z02940.ogg"
    # char_the_triumvirate "Doing so would liberate the universe from this eternal war.\nBut we did not hold the power required to destroy the idol. Not yet.\nIf we could make the blade stronger, though, then we might stand a chance."
    voice "se/z02940.ogg"
    char_the_triumvirate "这样做便能让宇宙从这场永恒的战争中解脱。\n但我们并不拥有摧毁那尊灵像所需的力量。至少当时还没有。\n可如果我们能让那把剑变得更强，或许就有一线希望。"

# game/script.rpy:112493
translate chinese Tri1_map308_1_0_a2f64c81:

    # voice "se/z02941.ogg"
    # char_the_triumvirate "If it could match the strength of the idol, then that could be it.\nThe energy unleashed in such a moment, would destroy both for sure.\nSince the blade fed on life — we would have to start relying on others."
    voice "se/z02941.ogg"
    char_the_triumvirate "如果它能与灵像的力量匹敌，那或许就能成事。\n那一刻释放的能量，必定会将两者一同摧毁。\n既然那把剑以生命为食——我们就不得不开始依靠他人。"

# game/script.rpy:112511
translate chinese Tri1_map308_1_0_56563357:

    # voice "se/z02942.ogg"
    # char_the_triumvirate "They had planned to use this idol as a source of power.\nPerhaps to aid in their conquest of other worlds.\nThe universe belonged to them, they thought."
    voice "se/z02942.ogg"
    char_the_triumvirate "他们本打算把这尊灵像当作力量的来源。\n或许是为了助他们征服其他世界。\n在他们看来，宇宙本就属于他们。"

# game/script.rpy:112515
translate chinese Tri1_map308_1_0_cc79129d:

    # voice "se/z02943.ogg"
    # char_the_triumvirate "But wielding the power of evil incarnate would only lead to ruin.\nWe couldn't let them continue down a path as dangerous as that.\nSo we cast them aside, in an astral prison, using that blade."
    voice "se/z02943.ogg"
    char_the_triumvirate "可掌控邪恶化身的只会招致毁灭。\n我们不能让他们继续走在那样危险的道路上。\n于是我们用那把剑，将他们放逐进了一座星界牢狱。"

# game/script.rpy:112529
translate chinese Tri1_map308_1_0_1188da72:

    # voice "se/z02944.ogg"
    # char_the_triumvirate "And as we did, we created new life on Alestia.\nA new, pure species, that would keep on reproducing.\nA breeding ground of power for that blade to harvest."
    voice "se/z02944.ogg"
    char_the_triumvirate "与此同时，我们在阿莱斯蒂亚创造了新的生命。\n一个全新的、纯洁的种族，会不断繁衍。\n一片为那把剑提供力量的培育之地。"

# game/script.rpy:112533
translate chinese Tri1_map308_1_0_1d4f98ae:

    # voice "se/z02945.ogg"
    # char_the_triumvirate "If we could make that blade strong enough, then we'd win.\nBut even then, we couldn't gather power fast enough.\nThe idol started corrupting, and killing Balteus."
    voice "se/z02945.ogg"
    char_the_triumvirate "如果我们能让那把剑足够强大，我们就能取胜。\n可即便如此，我们聚集力量的速度还是太慢。\n那尊灵像开始腐化，并夺走巴尔泰乌斯的生机。"

# game/script.rpy:112547
translate chinese Tri1_map308_1_0_37dae0da:

    # voice "se/z02946.ogg"
    # char_the_triumvirate "We had to think of something, and fast.\nIt led us down a path that we did not want to walk.\nBut in order to create peace — it was necessary."
    voice "se/z02946.ogg"
    char_the_triumvirate "我们必须尽快想出办法。\n它把我们引上了一条我们并不想走的路。\n可为了缔造和平——这是必须的。"

# game/script.rpy:112565
translate chinese Tri1_map308_1_0_accb5790:

    # voice "se/z02947.ogg"
    # char_the_triumvirate "We are not surprised, given our method of harvesting power.\nYou see, this is not the first time you have stood in our chambers.\nHopefully, it is the last. But to be honest, we've seen you many times."
    voice "se/z02947.ogg"
    char_the_triumvirate "考虑到我们收集力量的方式，我们并不感到意外。\n你看，这并非你第一次站在我们的议事厅里。\n但愿这是最后一次。但说实话，我们已见过你许多次了。"

# game/script.rpy:112569
translate chinese Tri1_map308_1_0_9f1392cb:

    # voice "se/z02948.ogg"
    # char_the_triumvirate "That blade exists unbound from the restraints of time and space.\nEvery death along your journey has only served to power it further.\nWhen you got here, if it was not strong enough, we sent you back."
    voice "se/z02948.ogg"
    char_the_triumvirate "那把剑不受时间与空间的束缚。\n你旅途中的每一次死亡，都只是让它变得更强。\n当你来到这里，如果它还不够强大，我们就把你送回去。"

# game/script.rpy:112583
translate chinese Tri1_map308_1_0_88f15319:

    # voice "se/z02949.ogg"
    # char_the_triumvirate "When we did so, the blade remained unchanged.\nThe cycle started anew, giving that weapon even more strength.\nYou stand here, the result of millions of years worth of trial and error."
    voice "se/z02949.ogg"
    char_the_triumvirate "我们那样做时，那把剑依旧如故。\n循环重新开始，让那件武器获得了更强的力量。\n你站在这里，是数百万年无数次试错的成果。"

# game/script.rpy:112587
translate chinese Tri1_map308_1_0_49b435e4:

    # voice "se/z02950.ogg"
    # char_the_triumvirate "The Occupation, The Rebellion, and even your attack on Balteus...\nWe created a period of time in your history filled with nothing but death.\nOver, and over, you and your friends have lived it. Only to power that blade."
    voice "se/z02950.ogg"
    char_the_triumvirate "那场占领，那场反抗，甚至是你对巴尔泰乌斯的进攻……\n我们在你们的历史中制造了一段只有死亡的时期。\n你和你的朋友们一遍又一遍地经历它。只为给那把剑注入力量。"

# game/script.rpy:112601
translate chinese Tri1_map308_1_0_62ba4325:

    # voice "se/z02951.ogg"
    # char_the_triumvirate "When the final cycle came along, we would have you carry out your goal.\nThe destruction of both the idol, and the sword, is what you were meant for.\nYou may have come to kill us, but your virtues are simply misplaced."
    voice "se/z02951.ogg"
    char_the_triumvirate "当最后的循环到来时，我们便会让你去完成你的使命。\n摧毁灵像和那把剑，正是你存在的意义。\n你也许是来杀我们的，但你的一身美德只是用错了地方。"

# game/script.rpy:112622
translate chinese Tri2_map308_1_0_2b8c9d70:

    # voice "se/z02952.ogg"
    # char_the_triumvirate "Nothing does. Well at least, not at first.\nOriginally, we hoped that our champion would come from Alarinthia.\nThat's why we kept that nation separate, and focused on strength."
    voice "se/z02952.ogg"
    char_the_triumvirate "什么都算不上。至少一开始是这样。\n最初，我们希望我们的斗士会出自阿拉林西亚。\n所以我们让那个国家保持独立，并专注于力量。"

# game/script.rpy:112626
translate chinese Tri2_map308_1_0_13df8f19:

    # voice "se/z02953.ogg"
    # char_the_triumvirate "If each ruler was stronger then the last...?\nWell, as time passed, we might find someone strong enough.\nSomeone with the will, {i}and{/i} power required to wield that blade."
    voice "se/z02953.ogg"
    char_the_triumvirate "如果每一位统治者都比前一位更强……？\n那么随着时间流逝，我们或许能找到足够强大的人。\n一个既有意志、{i}又{/i}有驾驭那把剑所需力量的人。"

# game/script.rpy:112630
translate chinese Tri2_map308_1_0_037fc6a4:

    # voice "se/z02954.ogg"
    # char_the_triumvirate "Of course, it became clear that this would never work.\nJust as we started to give up hope, those idols appeared.\nThe Monarchy was somehow able to reach out of their prison."
    voice "se/z02954.ogg"
    char_the_triumvirate "当然，事实证明这永远行不通。\n就在我们开始放弃希望时，那些灵像出现了。\n王室不知用什么方法从牢狱中伸出了手。"

# game/script.rpy:112644
translate chinese Tri2_map308_1_0_b3f3e3c8:

    # voice "se/z02955.ogg"
    # char_the_triumvirate "The growing nation of Valinorth developed their culture around this.\nAnd as a reward for reverence, the concept of The Seer was created.\nA special citizen of Valinorth, with the power of The Monarchy inside of them."
    voice "se/z02955.ogg"
    char_the_triumvirate "日益壮大的瓦利诺斯围绕着这一点发展出了自己的文化。\n而作为虔诚的奖赏，先知这一概念被创造了出来。\n一位瓦利诺斯的特殊公民，体内寄宿着王室的力量。"

# game/script.rpy:112648
translate chinese Tri2_map308_1_0_a0ac15fa:

    # voice "se/z02956.ogg"
    # char_the_triumvirate "Even then, none of these Seers were as strong as we needed.\nUntil you. The Monarchy gave you everything they had.\nWe assume that they did this so you would kill us."
    voice "se/z02956.ogg"
    char_the_triumvirate "即便如此，这些先知中没有一个强大到我们需要的程度。\n直到你出现。王室把他们的一切都给了你。\n我们猜想，他们这样做是为了让你来杀死我们。"

# game/script.rpy:112662
translate chinese Tri2_map308_1_0_5ddd5943:

    # voice "se/z02957.ogg"
    # char_the_triumvirate "But it would seem that they played right into our hands.\nYou were led down a path that only gave you more and more power.\nIn all of the universe, you are the only one who can use that blade effectively."
    voice "se/z02957.ogg"
    char_the_triumvirate "但看来他们恰好落入了我们的算计。\n你被引上了一条只会让你愈发强大的道路。\n在整个宇宙中，你是唯一能够有效使用那把剑的人。"

# game/script.rpy:112666
translate chinese Tri2_map308_1_0_ac36546f:

    # voice "se/z02958.ogg"
    # char_the_triumvirate "You house not just your own will, but the will of billions of spirits.\nSpirits that want nothing more than to see their homeworld freed.\nThere was no other choice, really. You are our champion, Monarch."
    voice "se/z02958.ogg"
    char_the_triumvirate "你体内承载的不只是你自己的意志，还有数十亿灵的意志。\n那些灵只想看到自己的故土获得自由。\n实在没有别的选择。你就是我们的斗士，君主。"

# game/script.rpy:112684
translate chinese Tri2_map308_1_0_96e91201:

    # voice "se/z02959.ogg"
    # char_the_triumvirate "No. You are our creation, and you must do as we say.\nBut your actions, will ensure peace and happiness for trillions.\nIt is a small price to pay, and we know that you would agree."
    voice "se/z02959.ogg"
    char_the_triumvirate "不。你是我们的造物，你必须照我们说的做。\n而你的行动，将确保数万亿生灵的和平与幸福。\n这是微不足道的代价，我们知道你也会同意。"

# game/script.rpy:112702
translate chinese Tri2_map308_1_0_4f9b1f52:

    # voice "se/z02959b.ogg"
    # char_the_triumvirate "We wish to end a cycle that has plagued the universe for eternities.\nIn fact, it could be even longer. It is impossible to know for sure.\nBecause of that, we believe that no price is too high to pay."
    voice "se/z02959b.ogg"
    char_the_triumvirate "我们想终结一个困扰宇宙无数纪元的循环。\n事实上，它可能还要更久。根本无法确知。\n正因如此，我们相信任何代价都不算高。"

# game/script.rpy:112706
translate chinese Tri2_map308_1_0_726d6a55:

    # voice "se/z02960.ogg"
    # char_the_triumvirate "We will never be remembered. Nobody will ever know our sacrifice.\nBut there shall never be another world marred by that corrupt idol.\nAnd no men will ever again be seduced by the power of that blade."
    voice "se/z02960.ogg"
    char_the_triumvirate "我们永远不会被记住。没有人会知道我们的牺牲。\n但再也不会有世界被那尊腐化的灵像所摧残。\n也再不会有人被那把剑的力量所蛊惑。"

# game/script.rpy:112720
translate chinese Tri2_map308_1_0_a691385f:

    # voice "se/z02961.ogg"
    # char_the_triumvirate "The best course of action for the universe is to destroy them both.\nTheir existence will always lead to those who believe they control fate.\nThey will always lead to a clash of ideals, and will always lead to {i}this{/i}."
    voice "se/z02961.ogg"
    char_the_triumvirate "对宇宙而言，最好的做法就是将两者一同摧毁。\n它们的存在总会催生出妄图掌控命运之人。\n它们总会引发理念的冲突，总会导向{i}这般{/i}结局。"

# game/script.rpy:112746
translate chinese Tri2_map308_1_0_dcc1f558:

    # "That was enough talk. I came here to kill them, and that's what I'd do.{w}\nNo matter what they had to say, they couldn't talk themselves free.{w}\nThey hurt my world, and my friends. I would make them suffer."
    "说得够多了。我来这里就是为了杀他们，我就要这么做。{w}\n无论他们有什么话要说，都别想靠嘴皮子逃过一劫。{w}\n他们伤害了我的世界，我的朋友们。我要让他们痛苦。"

# game/script.rpy:112771
translate chinese Tri2_map308_1_0_40c3069d:

    # voice "se/z02963.ogg"
    # char_the_triumvirate "The mind can suffer when stuck in the same time and place.\nHistory repeating itself can be far more than maddening.\nWe try to break free from the cycle, but only perish."
    voice "se/z02963.ogg"
    char_the_triumvirate "当心智被困在同一个时间与地点时，是会受苦的。\n历史不断重演，足以令人发疯。\n我们试图挣脱这个循环，却只会一次次消亡。"

# game/script.rpy:112786
translate chinese Tri2_map308_1_0_3bccca75:

    # "This member of The Triumvirate is talking so differently.{w}\nThe one back in the previous room had almost a completely different story.{w}\nIf being caught in a cycle could drive them mad, I had to wonder {i}which{/i} one was mad."
    "这位三人执政团的成员说话的方式截然不同。{w}\n上一个房间里那位讲的故事几乎完全不一样。{w}\n如果困在循环中会让人发疯，那我不得不琢磨{i}哪一个{/i}才是疯的。"

# game/script.rpy:112801
translate chinese Tri2_map308_1_0_a2ce78e4:

    # voice "se/z02964.ogg"
    # char_the_triumvirate "This is why we will not stop you if you wish to kill us.\nThat blade has kept us alive long enough to see things through.\nOur final rest, would only be a sign that we have finally won."
    voice "se/z02964.ogg"
    char_the_triumvirate "这就是为什么你若想杀我们，我们不会阻拦。\n那把剑让我们活了下来，久到足以把一切看到最后。\n我们的长眠，只会是我们终于获胜的标志。"

# game/script.rpy:112815
translate chinese Tri2_map308_1_0_de44518f:

    # voice "se/z02965.ogg"
    # char_the_triumvirate "So go ahead. Kill me, and kill my Master.\nTurn that blade on the idol, and see what happens.\nSee if you can finally free everybody from its wrath."
    voice "se/z02965.ogg"
    char_the_triumvirate "所以，动手吧。杀了我，再杀了我的主人。\n把那把剑转向灵像，看看会发生什么。\n看看你是否终于能让所有人从它的怒火中解脱。"

# game/script.rpy:112819
translate chinese Tri2_map308_1_0_cf6e8294:

    # voice "se/z02966.ogg"
    # char_the_triumvirate "Not just us, or Alestia. But all worlds, and all people.\nIf you are not strong enough, then the cycle will just start anew.\nBefore you know it, you may be facing us here once more."
    voice "se/z02966.ogg"
    char_the_triumvirate "不只是我们，也不只是阿莱斯蒂亚。而是所有的世界，所有的生灵。\n如果你不够强大，那么循环只会重新开始。\n不知不觉间，你或许又会在这里与我们相见。"

# game/script.rpy:112836
translate chinese Tri2_map308_1_0_69cc2b7d:

    # voice "se/z02967.ogg"
    # char_the_triumvirate "But know that we are not your enemy.\nAll we've done, we've done to—"
    voice "se/z02967.ogg"
    char_the_triumvirate "但你要知道，我们并非你的敌人。\n我们所做的一切，都是为了——"

# game/script.rpy:112851
translate chinese Tri2_map308_1_0_261cc1fc:

    # "I'm sick of hearing it. I'm sick of this weak justification.{w}\nI phase the blade into my hand, and thrust it through their chest.{w}\nBut like I was warned before, the idol responds to my aggression."
    "我听腻了。我听腻了这种苍白的辩解。{w}\n我将剑相位转移到手中，刺穿了他们的胸膛。{w}\n但正如先前有人警告我的那样，那尊灵像回应了我的敌意。"

# game/script.rpy:112872
translate chinese Tri2_map308_1_0_3062f48f:

    # "The room is engulfed in a blinding darkness.{w}\nIt must be the idol. The blade usually causes a {i}white{/i} light.{w}\nI feel immense warmth around me, and hear the crackling of flames."
    "房间被一片令人目眩的黑暗吞没。{w}\n一定是那尊灵像。那把剑通常会迸发出{i}白色{/i}的光芒。{w}\n我感到周围涌来巨大的热浪，听见火焰噼啪作响。"

# game/script.rpy:112896
translate chinese map309_f848c852:

    # "The darkness fades, and the entire room is engulfed in fire.{w}\nThe Triumvir stands before me, bleeding, and crying.{w}\nThese were no Gods. Just weak, arrogant people."
    "黑暗褪去，整个房间被烈火吞没。{w}\n那位执政官站在我面前，流着血，哭泣着。{w}\n他们根本不是神。只是一群软弱又傲慢的人。"

# game/script.rpy:112921
translate chinese map309_520d63e9:

    # voice "se/z02968.ogg"
    voice "se/z02968.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:112923
translate chinese map309_b84c03c8:

    # char_the_triumvirate "V-very well..."
    char_the_triumvirate "很、很好……"

# game/script.rpy:112944
translate chinese map309_b342208d:

    # "I turn left, and face the flames, forcefully taking them with me.{w}\nI hold them there, with the blade, tempted to absorb their soul.{w}\nBut no, they don't deserve it. They don't deserve the satisfaction."
    "我转向左边，面朝火焰，强行将他们一起拖了过去。{w}\n我用剑把他们按在那里，一时动了吸走他们灵魂的念头。{w}\n但不。他们不配。他们不配得到这种满足。"

# game/script.rpy:112946
translate chinese map309_7ebce372:

    # "I pull the blade out, and watch as the wound oozes blood.{w}\nThen, I grab them by the cloak, and pull them close to me.{w}\nIn their final moments, I curse them, and condemn them."
    "我拔出剑，看着伤口渗出血来。{w}\n接着，我抓住他们的斗篷，把他们拉近身前。{w}\n在他们生命的最后时刻，我诅咒他们，斥责他们。"

# game/script.rpy:112948
translate chinese map309_cf6a395a:

    # "And then I push them back into the idol's flames.{w}\nI hear them scream, and writhe as they're slowly burned alive.{w}\nIn my opinion, they deserved a punishment far worse than that."
    "然后我把他们推回灵像的火焰中。{w}\n我听见他们的惨叫与挣扎，被活活慢慢烧死。{w}\n在我看来，他们配得上的惩罚要远比这更重。"

# game/script.rpy:112950
translate chinese map309_557b1c45:

    # "Now — just one more to go..."
    "现在——只剩最后一个了……"

# game/script.rpy:112952
translate chinese map309_f67418e1:

    # "As I turn back to face the idol, the final triumvir stands before me.{w}\nI hold out the blade toward them, showing my intent to kill.{w}\nThat was my goal. Kill The Triumvirate. Destroy the idol."
    "当我转身再次面向灵像时，最后一位执政官站在了我面前。{w}\n我举剑指向他们，表明我的杀意。{w}\n那就是我的目标。杀死三人执政团。摧毁灵像。"

# game/script.rpy:112977
translate chinese map309_7abf9475:

    # voice "se/z02969.ogg"
    voice "se/z02969.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:112979
translate chinese map309_9d5609ba:

    # char_the_triumvirate "Stop...! Think about what you're doing!\nEverything we've done, we've done in the name of freedom!"
    char_the_triumvirate "住手……！想想你在做什么！\n我们所做的一切，都是以自由之名！"

# game/script.rpy:112993
translate chinese map309_18fec340:

    # "They get down on their knees, and look up at me."
    "他们跪了下来，抬头看着我。"

# game/script.rpy:113008
translate chinese map309_16d011ec:

    # voice "se/z02970.ogg"
    # char_the_triumvirate "Normally, I'd send you back to start the cycle anew.\nBut now — your strength surpasses mine. This {i}must{/i} be the end.\nI beg for your mercy. Let me live to see what I've fought for...!"
    voice "se/z02970.ogg"
    char_the_triumvirate "换作平常，我会把你送回去，让循环重新开始。\n但现在——你的力量已超越了我。这{i}一定{/i}就是终局了。\n我求你开恩。让我活着看到我为之奋斗的一切……！"

# game/script.rpy:113033
translate chinese map309_975bf22b:

    # "Without hesitation, I swing the blade, and cut off their head.{w}\nThey fall to the ground, and blood stains the white of their cloak.{w}\nI'm not sure what to believe, as they all had something different to say."
    "我毫不犹豫地挥剑，斩下了他们的头颅。{w}\n他们倒在地上，鲜血染红了他们洁白的斗篷。{w}\n我不知道该相信什么，因为他们每个人说的都不一样。"

# game/script.rpy:113035
translate chinese map309_a389c135:

    # "Perhaps they meant to use that doubt as a weapon when I got here.{w}\nI throw away that nonsense, and stick to the goal I originally had.{w}\nWith them out of the way, it was time to destroy that idol for good."
    "也许他们本就打算在我来到这里时，把这份疑虑当作武器。{w}\n我抛开这些无稽之谈，坚持我最初的目标。{w}\n既然他们已不成阻碍，是时候将那尊灵像彻底摧毁了。"

# game/script.rpy:113037
translate chinese map309_0ef62f59:

    # "I take a step forward, and my body is assaulted with pain.{w}\nI can tell that the idol is fighting back, and I fall to my knees.{w}\nThe flames are so hot that I feel as if I'm melting away, too."
    "我向前迈出一步，剧痛便侵袭了我的身体。{w}\n我能感觉到那尊灵像在反击，我跪倒在地。{w}\n火焰炽热得让我觉得自己也快要熔化了。"

# game/script.rpy:113042
translate chinese map309_d4d2e8e0:

    # "But no, something else is happening. It's not just the flames.{w}\nThe idol is trying to kill me — but I'm not the only one here.{w}\nInside of me is The Monarchy. Billions of spirits, wanting to help."
    "但不，还有别的事情在发生。不只是火焰。{w}\n那尊灵像想要杀我——可在这里的不止我一个。{w}\n我的体内是王室。数十亿渴望相助的灵。"

# game/script.rpy:113044
translate chinese map309_7d12119d:

    # "It's almost as if they're shielding me. Sacrificing themselves for me.{w}\nI stand up, and take another step forward. The pain is even worse.{w}\nI fall to my hands and knees, and cry in agony. It's too much...!"
    "仿佛他们在为我遮挡。为我牺牲自己。{w}\n我站起身来，又向前迈出一步。疼痛更加剧烈。{w}\n我四肢着地倒了下去，痛苦地哀嚎。太过了……！"

# game/script.rpy:113046
translate chinese map309_c6abb352:

    # "My vision blurs, but after a while, things return to normal.{w}\nThough the pain has gone away, I start to feel weaker and weaker.{w}\nI know that the souls inside of me are giving their lives for this."
    "我的视线模糊了，但过了一阵，一切又恢复正常。{w}\n尽管疼痛已经消退，我却开始感到越来越虚弱。{w}\n我知道，我体内的灵魂正为此献出生命。"

# game/script.rpy:113048
translate chinese map309_65c97d84:

    # "If I could get to the idol, and attack it, I might be able to win.{w}\nThat was a big maybe. But there was {i}one{/i} thing I knew for sure.{w}\nI might not live through this, and there was no other option."
    "如果我能靠近那尊灵像并攻击它，或许就能赢。{w}\n那是个很大的“或许”。但有{i}一件事{/i}我确定无疑。{w}\n我可能活不过这一遭，而除此之外别无选择。"

# game/script.rpy:113050
translate chinese map309_7394b103:

    # "Every step I took — could easily be my last."
    "我迈出的每一步——都可能成为最后一步。"

# game/script.rpy:113728
translate chinese click_map313_2_EV002_fa20d383:

    # "I take one more step, and ready the blade.{w}\nAs soon as I thrust it into that idol, things would be over.{w}\nBut as the power within me dwindled, I realized one thing."
    "我又迈出一步，握紧了剑。{w}\n一旦我将它刺入那尊灵像，一切就都结束了。{w}\n可随着我体内的力量逐渐枯竭，我意识到了一件事。"

# game/script.rpy:113730
translate chinese click_map313_2_EV002_7e4d5900:

    # "No matter what happened next, the blade would be destroyed.{w}\nBut if I wanted to get rid of the idol for good — then I would perish as well.{w}\nIn order to live, and see another day, I'd have to hold back — just a bit."
    "无论接下来发生什么，那把剑都会被摧毁。{w}\n可若我想彻底铲除那尊灵像——那我也将随之消亡。{w}\n若想活下来，看到明天的太阳，我就得留手——只需一点点。"

# game/script.rpy:113732
translate chinese click_map313_2_EV002_627ab245:

    # "But if I did that, then there's a chance the idol might not be fully defeated.{w}\nIt could come back in the future, to corrupt and decay other innocent worlds.{w}\nWas keeping my life worth condemning other worlds to suffer like {i}we{/i} did...?"
    "可如果我那样做，那尊灵像就有可能无法被彻底消灭。{w}\n它可能在未来卷土重来，腐蚀并摧毁其他无辜的世界。{w}\n为了保住我的性命，就要让别的世界承受{i}我们{/i}那样的苦难，值得吗……？"

# game/script.rpy:113748
translate chinese click_map313_2_EV002_5dd5c044:

    # "I thrust the blade into the idol, and activate it. The blinding white light follows.{w}\nThis was the end. The blade, in mere moments, would enact my final will.{w}\nI just have to ask myself, what would that final will be...?"
    "我将剑刺入那尊灵像，并激活了它。随即亮起令人目眩的白光。{w}\n这就是终局。那把剑将在片刻之后，执行我最终的意志。{w}\n我不禁自问，那最终的意志会是什么……？"

# game/script.rpy:113758
translate chinese click_map313_2_EV002_5f90a411:

    # "I had a world to rule. I couldn't just let myself die.{w}\nI was The Monarch, and I needed to live up to that role.{w}\nIf I died during this war, the world could be thrown into disarray."
    "我还有一整个世界要治理。我不能就这样让自己死去。{w}\n我是君主，我必须配得上这个身份。{w}\n如果我在这场战争中死去，世界可能会陷入混乱。"

# game/script.rpy:113760
translate chinese click_map313_2_EV002_b9ab5be9:

    # "At least, that's the justification that I give to myself.{w}\nI just know, that deep down inside, I deserve to see the world I fought for.{w}\nThat Triumvir wanted the same, but I denied them. What gave {i}me{/i} the right?"
    "至少，这是我给自己找的借口。{w}\n我只知道，在内心深处，我值得看到我为之奋战的世界。{w}\n那位执政官也曾想要同样的东西，却是我拒绝了他。{i}我{/i}又凭什么这么做？"

# game/script.rpy:113762
translate chinese click_map313_2_EV002_b059b8ae:

    # "I guess it didn't matter, now. I can feel myself fading away.{w}\nAfter I command the blade to conserve power, and save me, I close my eyes.{w}\nNo matter what happened to me, I could rest knowing one simple fact."
    "我想，现在这些都不重要了。我能感觉到自己正在消散。{w}\n在命令那把剑节省力量、保住我自己之后，我闭上了眼睛。{w}\n无论我会遭遇什么，我都能安心歇息，只需明白一个简单的事实。"

# game/script.rpy:113768
translate chinese click_map313_2_EV002_420e16ee:

    # "I couldn't spare myself if it meant that other worlds could be hurt.{w}\nIt would be selfish. Even though I wanted to live, I knew I couldn't.{w}\nAs soon as we set sail, I knew that this could be the end for me."
    "如果保全自己就意味着别的世界可能遭殃，那我做不到。{w}\n那太自私了。尽管我想活下去，但我知道我不能。{w}\n从我们起航的那一刻起，我就知道这可能就是我自己的终点。"

# game/script.rpy:113770
translate chinese click_map313_2_EV002_f10b5cc2:

    # "But even though I knew it was a possibility, I still didn't want to believe it.{w}\nI was only fooling myself, thinking that I could live to see what I fought for.{w}\nI denied The Triumvir that right, and now I would deny it to myself as well."
    "可即便知道这是一种可能，我依然不愿相信。{w}\n我一直在自欺欺人，以为自己能活着看到我为之奋战的一切。{w}\n我剥夺了那位执政官的这个权利，如今我也要剥夺自己的。"

# game/script.rpy:113772
translate chinese click_map313_2_EV002_49bc46f5:

    # "I guess it didn't matter, now. I can feel myself fading away.{w}\nI command the blade to use all the power it can. Including that of my life.{w}\nNo matter what happened to me, I could rest knowing one simple fact."
    "我想，现在这些都不重要了。我能感觉到自己正在消散。{w}\n我命令那把剑用尽它所能用的一切力量。包括我的生命。{w}\n无论我会遭遇什么，我都能安心歇息，只需明白一个简单的事实。"

# game/script.rpy:113788
translate chinese click_map313_2_EV002_64f33faf:

    # "Alestia had been given the future that it deserved...{w}\nIn the hands of the people, they were free to live as they pleased.{w}\nAs everything fades away, I wonder what that future might bring my allies."
    "阿莱斯蒂亚已经得到了它应得的未来……{w}\n交到人民手中，他们得以自由地如愿生活。{w}\n当一切都渐渐消散，我思索着那个未来会给同伴们带来什么。"

# game/script.rpy:113815
translate chinese click_map313_2_EV002_f0bca84b:

    # "I smile — a stark contrast to the tears streaming down my face.{w}\nWith another step, I'm almost facing the idol. I couldn't do this alone.{w}\nThe voices of my comrades, and the souls inside of me carry me forward."
    "我笑了——与脸上奔流而下的泪水形成鲜明对比。{w}\n再迈一步，我几乎正对着那尊灵像了。我一个人做不到这些。{w}\n同伴们的声音，以及我体内的灵魂，支撑着我向前。"

# game/script.rpy:113818
translate chinese click_map313_2_EV002_15b1124f:

    # voice "se/z02976.ogg"
    # char_howl "So, everything has led to this.\nThe Monarchy is no more, but you can still live.\nMake it through this — and give Alestia the future it deserves."
    voice "se/z02976.ogg"
    char_howl "所以，一切都走到了这一步。\n王室已经不在了，但你还活着。\n挺过这一关——把阿莱斯蒂亚应得的未来交给它。"

# game/script.rpy:113840
translate chinese click_map313_2_EV002_64e2c1a5:

    # "I use the blade for support, and try to rise to my feet.{w}\nThis is taking so much out of me. Would I have enough power in the end?{w}\nHoping with every fiber of my being that I do — I take another step forward."
    "我拄着剑支撑身体，试图站起来。{w}\n这耗尽了我的力气。到最后我还会有足够的力量吗？{w}\n我倾尽全部身心祈祷自己还有，然后向前又迈出一步。"

# game/script.rpy:113843
translate chinese click_map313_2_EV002_ebcb15eb:

    # voice "se/z02975.ogg"
    # char_damek "I knew there was something special about you. Ever since the start.\nYou brought us all together — and unified us. You made us a family."
    voice "se/z02975.ogg"
    char_damek "我就知道你很特别。从一开始就知道。\n你把我们聚在了一起——让我们团结一心。你让我们成了一家人。"

# game/script.rpy:113865
translate chinese click_map313_2_EV002_8c586b96:

    # "With another step, I fall right to the ground.{w}\nI lay there, crying, and squirming in pain.{w}\nMy grip on the blade tightens as I shake."
    "再迈一步，我径直摔倒在地。{w}\n我躺在那里，哭喊着，痛苦地扭动。{w}\n我浑身颤抖，握剑的手却更紧了。"

# game/script.rpy:113868
translate chinese click_map313_2_EV002_179b6dc5:

    # voice "se/pro75.ogg"
    # char_pro "Is {i}this{/i} really how you want your story to be told...?\nGet up, [firstname]. Get up and finish what you started!"
    voice "se/pro75.ogg"
    char_pro "你{i}真的{/i}想让你的故事以这种方式被讲述吗……？\n站起来，[firstname]。站起来，把你开始的事做完！"

# game/script.rpy:113890
translate chinese click_map313_2_EV002_5c2809a1:

    # "As the souls exit my body to shield me, I get noticeably weaker.{w}\nI tremble with every step, trying as hard as I can to keep myself standing.{w}\nMy comrades call out to me, and urge me to keep moving. I start to cry."
    "随着灵魂离开我的身体去为我遮挡，我明显地越来越虚弱。{w}\n我每走一步都在颤抖，拼尽全力让自己站住。{w}\n同伴们向我呼喊，催促我继续前行。我开始哭了起来。"

# game/script.rpy:113893
translate chinese click_map313_2_EV002_21102a4f:

    # voice "se/z02973.ogg"
    # char_ulric "I guess I'm no longer the strongest member of The Rebellion.\nI'm proud of you, [firstname]. You saw this through to the bitter end."
    voice "se/z02973.ogg"
    char_ulric "看来我不再是反抗军中最强的人了。\n我为你骄傲，[firstname]。你把这桩事坚持到了苦涩的尽头。"

# game/script.rpy:113915
translate chinese click_map313_2_EV002_91cd57b5:

    # "I'm not sure what I just heard, since nobody is actually around me.{w}\nIn these chambers, it would seem that time and space act abnormally.{w}\nWith another step, I grit my teeth. It feels like I'm being torn apart...!"
    "我不确定自己刚才听见了什么，因为我身边其实空无一人。{w}\n在这间议事厅里，时间与空间似乎都失常了。{w}\n再迈一步，我咬紧牙关。感觉自己正被撕成碎片……！"

# game/script.rpy:113918
translate chinese click_map313_2_EV002_8a6a4a47:

    # voice "se/z02972.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "Keep on moving! We didn't come this far just to lose now!"
    voice "se/z02972.ogg"
    char_fortaime "继续走！我们走了这么远，可不是为了在此刻认输！"

# game/script.rpy:113940
translate chinese click_map313_2_EV002_15c2b056:

    # "Determination rises within me, and I take another step forward.{w}\nMy body is racked with pain, and it's almost impossible to walk.{w}\nI use the blade as a makeshift cane, as a voice sounds in my head."
    "决心在我心中升起，我又向前迈出一步。{w}\n剧痛折磨着我的身体，几乎寸步难行。{w}\n我把剑当作临时的拐杖，这时一个声音在我脑海中响起。"

# game/script.rpy:113943
translate chinese click_map313_2_EV002_c6f84c36:

    # voice "se/z02971.ogg"
    # char_valessa "You can do this, [firstname]...! Don't give up!"
    voice "se/z02971.ogg"
    char_valessa "你能做到的，[firstname]……！别放弃！"

# game/script.rpy:114007
translate chinese map311_b073e54a:

    # voice "se/z02985.ogg"
    voice "se/z02985.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:114009
translate chinese map311_b31c3cab:

    # "Valessa returned to Valinorth, accepting her mantle as Elder.\nLeading Valinorth in a way that respected its tradition, the nation flourished.\nBorders became less strict, and Valinorth was popular with tourists in the future."
    "瓦莱莎回到了瓦利诺斯，接受了长老的重任。\n她以尊重传统的方式领导瓦利诺斯，让这个国家繁荣兴旺。\n边境管制逐渐放宽，日后瓦利诺斯深受游客喜爱。"

# game/script.rpy:114012
translate chinese map311_009aa88f:

    # voice "se/z02986.ogg"
    # "Because of her wishes, and style of leadership — Valinorth retained its culture.\nForests were left intact, the idol was left standing, and everything was just as it was.\nGoing down in history as one of the most revered Elders, all future rulers respected her wishes."
    voice "se/z02986.ogg"
    "由于她的意愿与领导风格——瓦利诺斯保留了自己的文化。\n森林保持原样，灵像依旧矗立，一切都如从前一般。\n她作为最受敬重的长老之一载入史册，此后的所有统治者都尊重她的遗愿。"

# game/script.rpy:114019
translate chinese map311_1952ffa6:

    # voice "se/z02993.ogg"
    voice "se/z02993.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:114021
translate chinese map311_39bb2019:

    # "Though the distance between you was immense, your love flourished.\nFrequent visits going both ways ensured that your bond never weakened.\nFor when the love in one's heart is strong enough — nothing can stand in its way."
    "尽管你们相隔万里，你们的爱却愈发茁壮。\n频繁的相互探访让你们的情谊从未淡薄。\n因为当心中的爱足够坚定——任何事物都无法阻挡。"

# game/script.rpy:114024
translate chinese map311_04fc415c:

    # voice "se/z02994.ogg"
    # "That is, of course, except for the unforgiving flow of time.\nThough death would part the two of you, legends would speak of your near-eternal love.\nShe lived a long, full life. A wonderful reward for her duty and sacrifice, as most would say."
    voice "se/z02994.ogg"
    "当然，除了那无情流逝的时光。\n尽管死亡终将把你们分开，传说仍会讲述你们近乎永恒的爱。\n她度过了漫长而充实的一生。正如大多数人所说，这是对她尽责与牺牲的美好回报。"

# game/script.rpy:114030
translate chinese map311_2bc9e400:

    # voice "se/z02991.ogg"
    voice "se/z02991.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:114032
translate chinese map311_cbb2a36f:

    # "Valessa would stay in close contact with you throughout her lifetime.\nThough the distance between you was large, your bond was forever strong.\nVisits, as infrequent as they were — played out as if no time was lost at all."
    "瓦莱莎一生都与你保持着密切联系。\n尽管你们相隔遥远，你们的情谊却始终坚固。\n相聚虽不常有——却仿佛从未错过任何时光。"

# game/script.rpy:114035
translate chinese map311_8194ad7b:

    # voice "se/z02992.ogg"
    # "But as dictated by time, all reigns must come to an end.\nValessa passed away peacefully, surrounded by friends and family.\nShe lived a long, full life. A wonderful reward for her former duty and sacrifice."
    voice "se/z02992.ogg"
    "但正如时间所注定，一切统治终有尽头。\n瓦莱莎在亲友的环绕中安详离世。\n她度过了漫长而充实的一生。这是对她昔日尽责与牺牲的美好回报。"

# game/script.rpy:114042
translate chinese map311_19db39fa:

    # voice "se/z02989.ogg"
    voice "se/z02989.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:114044
translate chinese map311_8cc4a1e1:

    # "Valessa started a new tradition to remember your love, and keep it alive.\nOnce a year, gifts and well wishes would be left at Sauleberg's idol.\nThis was to thank the idol that empowered you, and saved all of Alestia."
    "瓦莱莎开创了一项新的传统，以铭记并延续你们的爱。\n每年一次，人们会在索尔伯格的灵像前留下礼物与祝福。\n这是为了感谢那尊赋予你力量、拯救了整个阿莱斯蒂亚的灵像。"

# game/script.rpy:114047
translate chinese map311_a0fc35e6:

    # voice "se/z02990.ogg"
    # "For as long as she lived, she attended every year.\nKnown as a strong ruler, this was the only time she shed a tear.\nYour legacy, and your sacrifice, was honored by Valinorth forever."
    voice "se/z02990.ogg"
    "只要她活着，每年都会到场。\n作为以坚强著称的统治者，这是她唯一落泪的时刻。\n你的遗志与牺牲，被瓦利诺斯永远铭记。"

# game/script.rpy:114053
translate chinese map311_1a8738a6:

    # voice "se/z02987.ogg"
    voice "se/z02987.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:114055
translate chinese map311_c2bc912b:

    # "Valessa started a new tradition in your honor.\nOnce a year, gifts and well wishes would be left at Sauleberg's idol.\nThis was to thank the idol that empowered you, and saved all of Alestia."
    "瓦莱莎为纪念你开创了一项新的传统。\n每年一次，人们会在索尔伯格的灵像前留下礼物与祝福。\n这是为了感谢那尊赋予你力量、拯救了整个阿莱斯蒂亚的灵像。"

# game/script.rpy:114058
translate chinese map311_7d8ba9e9:

    # voice "se/z02988.ogg"
    # "For as long as she lived, she attended every year.\nKnown as a strong ruler, this was the only time she shed a tear.\nYour legacy, and your sacrifice, was honored by Valinorth forever."
    voice "se/z02988.ogg"
    "只要她活着，每年都会到场。\n作为以坚强著称的统治者，这是她唯一落泪的时刻。\n你的遗志与牺牲，被瓦利诺斯永远铭记。"

# game/script.rpy:114064
translate chinese map311_656319b7:

    # voice "se/z02995.ogg"
    voice "se/z02995.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:114066
translate chinese map311_e74a01c0:

    # "After the war, Valessa dedicated her life to philanthropy.\nShe helped the people of Mazeo move on from The Triumvirate.\nUndoing some of the damage her parents had done was her new calling."
    "战后，瓦莱莎投身于慈善事业。\n她帮助马泽奥的人民走出三人执政团的阴影。\n弥补她父母造成的部分伤害，成了她新的使命。"

# game/script.rpy:114069
translate chinese map311_947a689c:

    # voice "se/z02996.ogg"
    # "As Pirates, they inflicted wounds upon the culture and people of Mazeo.\nBeing their daughter, she felt qualified to try and make up for what they did.\nAnd so, she would go down in history as one of Mazeo's greatest public figures."
    voice "se/z02996.ogg"
    "身为海盗，他们给马泽奥的文化与人民留下了创伤。\n作为他们的女儿，她觉得自己有责任尽力弥补他们所做的一切。\n于是，她作为马泽奥最伟大的公众人物之一载入史册。"

# game/script.rpy:114073
translate chinese map311_4afa104e:

    # voice "se/z02997.ogg"
    # "She didn't ignore Valinorth, however, and still paid frequent visits.\nTrusting Fortaime to take care of her home, she did the same for Mazeo.\nTogether, they helped ensure that both nations lived strong, and in harmony."
    voice "se/z02997.ogg"
    "不过，她并没有忽视瓦利诺斯，依然频繁回去。\n她信任福泰姆照看她的家乡，自己则为马泽奥做同样的事。\n他们携手让两个国家都强盛而和睦地延续下去。"

# game/script.rpy:114080
translate chinese map311_3df503d1:

    # voice "se/z03004.ogg"
    voice "se/z03004.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:114082
translate chinese map311_a3c46525:

    # "Though the distance between you and Valessa was great, your love never faded.\nFrequent visits to her new home in Mazeo kept things alive as time passed by.\nFor when love is strong enough, nothing can stand in the face of that passion."
    "尽管你和瓦莱莎相隔遥远，你们的爱却从未褪色。\n随着时光流逝，频繁前往她在马泽奥的新家探访，让这份感情始终鲜活。\n因为当爱足够坚定，任何事物都无法抵挡这份热忱。"

# game/script.rpy:114085
translate chinese map311_1f7ca8eb:

    # voice "se/z03005.ogg"
    # "That is, except for time. However, she passed away surrounded by friends and family.\nHer goal of creating a changed, happy world, was finally accomplished. She was content.\nThe damage done by The Triumvirate, and her parents, was finally undone. There was peace."
    voice "se/z03005.ogg"
    "除了时间。然而，她是在亲友的环绕中离世的。\n她创造一个焕然一新、幸福世界的目标终于实现了。她心满意足。\n三人执政团和她父母造成的伤害终于得以弥补。天下太平。"

# game/script.rpy:114091
translate chinese map311_999dcd40:

    # voice "se/z03002.ogg"
    voice "se/z03002.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:114093
translate chinese map311_efc0c5ee:

    # "You maintained a close relationship with Valessa from your throne.\nPaying frequent visits to Mazeo, you ensured that your bond never weakened.\nAiding her efforts to repair a fractured Mazeo, the wounds of The Occupation soon healed."
    "你身居王座，仍与瓦莱莎保持着亲密的关系。\n你频繁前往马泽奥探访，让你们的情谊从未淡薄。\n你协助她修复破碎的马泽奥，占领时期留下的创伤很快愈合。"

# game/script.rpy:114096
translate chinese map311_04cf1d49:

    # voice "se/z03003.ogg"
    # "And so too, did any wounds her family inflicted on the innocent nation.\nBy the time she passed away, she had achieved her lifelong goal of reparation.\nHer gifts to society, and the world — far outweighed her parents heinous crimes."
    voice "se/z03003.ogg"
    "她家人带给这个无辜国度的创伤，也随之愈合。\n到她离世时，她已实现了毕生弥补的心愿。\n她回馈社会与世界的贡献——远远超过了她父母犯下的滔天罪行。"

# game/script.rpy:114103
translate chinese map311_035ec5ae:

    # voice "se/z03000.ogg"
    voice "se/z03000.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:114105
translate chinese map311_6f879778:

    # "Each year, she'd place flowers on Sauleberg's Spirit Idol.\nThis was to remember you, and the idol that empowered you.\nYou were never forgotten. Not by her, or by the world you served."
    "每年，她都会在索尔伯格的灵像前献上鲜花。\n这是为了缅怀你，以及那尊赋予你力量的灵像。\n你从未被遗忘。无论是她，还是你所守护的这个世界。"

# game/script.rpy:114108
translate chinese map311_c0d444a8:

    # voice "se/z03001.ogg"
    # "For as long as she lived, she did this every year, her love unwavering.\nKnown as a strong woman, this was the only time she shed a tear.\nTales of her dedication to your love would live on after her passing."
    voice "se/z03001.ogg"
    "只要她活着，她每年都会这么做，她的爱坚定不移。\n作为以坚强著称的女子，这是她唯一落泪的时刻。\n她对你这份爱的执着，在身后仍被传颂。"

# game/script.rpy:114114
translate chinese map311_44ac679e:

    # voice "se/z02998.ogg"
    voice "se/z02998.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:114116
translate chinese map311_6f879778_1:

    # "Each year, she'd place flowers on Sauleberg's Spirit Idol.\nThis was to remember you, and the idol that empowered you.\nYou were never forgotten. Not by her, or by the world you served."
    "每年，她都会在索尔伯格的灵像前献上鲜花。\n这是为了缅怀你，以及那尊赋予你力量的灵像。\n你从未被遗忘。无论是她，还是你所守护的这个世界。"

# game/script.rpy:114119
translate chinese map311_374bcb19:

    # voice "se/z02999.ogg"
    # "For as long as she lived, she did this every year.\nKnown as a strong woman, this was the only time she shed a tear.\nTales of her dedication to your memory would live on after her passing."
    voice "se/z02999.ogg"
    "只要她活着，她每年都会这么做。\n作为以坚强著称的女子，这是她唯一落泪的时刻。\n她对你这份追忆的执着，在身后仍被传颂。"

# game/script.rpy:114124
translate chinese map311_91e72da1:

    # voice "se/z03006.ogg"
    voice "se/z03006.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:114126
translate chinese map311_79a78d97:

    # "Because of your efforts and choices, Valessa survived.\nWhen the whole world stood against her, she faced it, and prevailed.\nYou gave her a gift of a happy, peaceful life. One not lost to senseless war."
    "因为你的努力与抉择，瓦莱莎活了下来。\n当整个世界与她为敌时，她直面一切，并且胜出。\n你给了她一份幸福安宁的生活。一份没有被无谓战争夺走的人生。"

# game/script.rpy:114147
translate chinese map315_2be59dd4:

    # voice "se/z03007.ogg"
    voice "se/z03007.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:114149
translate chinese map315_95b2b6f3:

    # "Fortaime returned to Valinorth, and took on the role of Elder.\nHe stayed true to his word, and united his nation with the rest of Alestia.\nAt the loss of some culture, Valinorth merged with The Monarchy for good."
    "福泰姆回到了瓦利诺斯，担起了长老的职责。\n他信守承诺，将自己的国家与阿莱斯蒂亚其余部分联合起来。\n瓦利诺斯以失去部分文化为代价，彻底与王室合并。"

# game/script.rpy:114152
translate chinese map315_c29bf772:

    # voice "se/z03008.ogg"
    # "A small price to pay, many would say. Valinorth let go of its dead beliefs.\nNo more Spirit Realm. No more Seers. Valinorth was just like every other nation.\nTrade routes were opened, and Valinorth was no longer closed off to outsiders."
    voice "se/z03008.ogg"
    "许多人会说，这代价微不足道。瓦利诺斯抛弃了它陈腐的信仰。\n不再有灵界。不再有先知。瓦利诺斯和其他每个国家一样。\n贸易路线开通了，瓦利诺斯不再对外人封闭。"

# game/script.rpy:114156
translate chinese map315_cd6249f5:

    # voice "se/z03009.ogg"
    # "In a way, his nation became almost an extension of Mazeo.\nUpon his passing, he left behind the world he dreamed of creating.\nA unified Alestia. Each nation resting on another for strength and purpose."
    voice "se/z03009.ogg"
    "某种意义上，他的国家几乎成了马泽奥的延伸。\n他离世时，留下了他梦想创造的那个世界。\n一个统一的阿莱斯蒂亚。每个国家都倚靠彼此获得力量与意义。"

# game/script.rpy:114163
translate chinese map315_2a948fa5:

    # voice "se/z03012.ogg"
    voice "se/z03012.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:114165
translate chinese map315_50a8d7ae:

    # "He never got over the loss of his lover, however.\nThe day of your death became a day of festivities for Valinorth.\nThey celebrated the gift of life that you gave to the rest of Alestia."
    "然而，他始终没能走出失去爱人的痛苦。\n你离世的那天，成了瓦利诺斯的节庆之日。\n他们庆祝你赠予阿莱斯蒂亚其余部分的这份生命之礼。"

# game/script.rpy:114168
translate chinese map315_fe32dc62:

    # voice "se/z03013.ogg"
    # "On this day, many flowers would line the streets to your home.\nFortaime always kept good on his word of visiting you every day.\nThough you were no longer there, he never stopped honoring your memory."
    voice "se/z03013.ogg"
    "这一天，通往你家的街道两旁会摆满鲜花。\n福泰姆始终信守着每天来看望你的诺言。\n尽管你已不在，他从未停止对你的缅怀。"

# game/script.rpy:114174
translate chinese map315_e126195d:

    # voice "se/z03010.ogg"
    voice "se/z03010.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:114176
translate chinese map315_9d117c33:

    # "He never got over the loss of his best friend, however.\nThe day of your death became a day of festivities for Valinorth.\nThey celebrated the gift of life that you gave to the rest of Alestia."
    "然而，他始终没能走出失去挚友的痛苦。\n你离世的那天，成了瓦利诺斯的节庆之日。\n他们庆祝你赠予阿莱斯蒂亚其余部分的这份生命之礼。"

# game/script.rpy:114179
translate chinese map315_72d6bd72:

    # voice "se/z03011.ogg"
    # "On this day, many flowers would line the streets to your home.\nFortaime still came over every day, keeping your house in tip-top shape.\nHe says it's what you would've wanted. He never stopped honoring your memory."
    voice "se/z03011.ogg"
    "这一天，通往你家的街道两旁会摆满鲜花。\n福泰姆依然每天过来，把你的房子打理得一尘不染。\n他说这是你希望看到的。他从未停止对你的缅怀。"

# game/script.rpy:114186
translate chinese map315_471106f9:

    # voice "se/z03016.ogg"
    voice "se/z03016.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:114188
translate chinese map315_89c225a7:

    # "You stayed in close contact with Fortaime during your reign.\nAfter merging with The Monarchy, Valinorth was under your jurisdiction.\nHowever, honoring Fortaime's wishes, you let him direct the nation in his own way."
    "你在位期间与福泰姆保持着密切联系。\n与王室合并后，瓦利诺斯归你管辖。\n但你尊重福泰姆的意愿，让他按自己的方式治理这个国家。"

# game/script.rpy:114191
translate chinese map315_5fd80093:

    # voice "se/z03017.ogg"
    # "Your love never waned, despite the distance between you.\nA small ceremony was held to solidify your bond, and have it last forever.\nFrequent visits ensured that things stayed afloat. This lasted until the end of his days."
    voice "se/z03017.ogg"
    "尽管你们相隔两地，你们的爱从未消减。\n一场小小的仪式举行了，以巩固你们的羁绊，让它天长地久。\n频繁的探访让这份感情得以维系。直到他生命的尽头。"

# game/script.rpy:114195
translate chinese map315_e8ce3c6c:

    # voice "se/z03018.ogg"
    # "But he left behind a legacy of love, and happiness.\nA statue of him was erected in Valinorth, to honor his memory.\nBecause of him — the nation entered a new era of peace and prosperity."
    voice "se/z03018.ogg"
    "但他留下了爱与幸福的遗产。\n瓦利诺斯为他立起雕像，以纪念他。\n因为他——这个国家步入了和平与繁荣的新时代。"

# game/script.rpy:114201
translate chinese map315_817c9ed5:

    # voice "se/z03014.ogg"
    voice "se/z03014.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:114203
translate chinese map315_89c225a7_1:

    # "You stayed in close contact with Fortaime during your reign.\nAfter merging with The Monarchy, Valinorth was under your jurisdiction.\nHowever, honoring Fortaime's wishes, you let him direct the nation in his own way."
    "你在位期间与福泰姆保持着密切联系。\n与王室合并后，瓦利诺斯归你管辖。\n但你尊重福泰姆的意愿，让他按自己的方式治理这个国家。"

# game/script.rpy:114206
translate chinese map315_4283581d:

    # voice "se/z03015.ogg"
    # "Your friendship never waned, despite the new distance between you.\nYou passed off visits to Valinorth as official Monarch business.\nHowever, all you really wanted was to visit Fortaime once more."
    voice "se/z03015.ogg"
    "尽管你们之间有了新的距离，你们的友谊从未消减。\n你把前往瓦利诺斯的探访当作君主的公务。\n其实你真正想要的，不过是再见福泰姆一面。"

# game/script.rpy:114211
translate chinese map315_6d2eed42:

    # voice "se/z03033.ogg"
    voice "se/z03033.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:114213
translate chinese map315_9d0450d9:

    # "Fortaime survived the war, despite all odds.\nHis strong love for everything around him kept him afloat.\nWhen all hope was lost, he stood up, and challenged death in the face."
    "福泰姆排除万难，活过了那场战争。\n他对周遭一切深切的爱支撑着他。\n当所有希望都已破灭，他挺身而出，当面挑战死亡。"

# game/script.rpy:114216
translate chinese map315_35b3cbce:

    # voice "se/z03034.ogg"
    # "And for that, he was never forgotten.\nLiving a long and full life, he was happy.\nAlestia was forever better because of him."
    voice "se/z03034.ogg"
    "正因如此，他从未被遗忘。\n他度过了漫长而充实的一生，幸福快乐。\n因为有了他，阿莱斯蒂亚永远变得更好。"

# game/script.rpy:114238
translate chinese map317_9a1b3e97:

    # voice "se/z03035.ogg"
    voice "se/z03035.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:114240
translate chinese map317_0e5bcd6b:

    # "After the war, Pro settled down in Mazeo, and started to write.\nHe wanted to chronicle everything about the major players of the war.\nWorking with any rebel survivors, he pledged that their story would never be lost."
    "战后，普洛在马泽奥安顿下来，开始写作。\n他想把这场战争中所有重要人物的故事都记录下来。\n他与幸存的反抗军成员合作，立誓绝不让他们的故事被埋没。"

# game/script.rpy:114243
translate chinese map317_500ed7e0:

    # voice "se/z03036.ogg"
    # "His works would go down in history as the most detailed records of wartime.\nPeople would aspire to write like him — but to this date — none have come close.\nConsidered one of the greatest historians in Alestia, he retired and lived a peaceful life."
    voice "se/z03036.ogg"
    "他的著作作为最详尽的战时记录载入史册。\n人们都渴望能像他那样写作——但直到今天——无人能及。\n他被视为阿莱斯蒂亚最伟大的史学家之一，退休后过上了平静的生活。"

# game/script.rpy:114250
translate chinese map317_40766ef8:

    # voice "se/z03043.ogg"
    voice "se/z03043.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:114252
translate chinese map317_ea1900b3:

    # "He knew that his writings could influence the people's perception in a large way.\nTo this end — he constantly wrote you letters — to ensure he had your approval.\nHowever, the real reason he wrote, was to keep the love between you alive."
    "他知道自己的文字能在很大程度上影响民众的看法。\n为此——他不断给你写信——以确保得到你的认可。\n然而，他写信的真正原因，是想让你们之间的爱延续下去。"

# game/script.rpy:114255
translate chinese map317_d30805db:

    # voice "se/z03044.ogg"
    # "Almost operating as a team, you ensured that only the true history was written down.\nAs the victor, you could've told the people anything — but you were a just and honest ruler.\nA ceremony was held in Mazeo to pledge your love to one another, until the end of your days."
    voice "se/z03044.ogg"
    "你们几乎如同一人般配合，确保只有真实的历史被记录下来。\n作为胜利者，你本可以随意告知民众任何事——但你是一位公正诚实的统治者。\n一场仪式在马泽奥举行，你们彼此立誓相爱，直到生命尽头。"

# game/script.rpy:114261
translate chinese map317_08314da4:

    # voice "se/z03041.ogg"
    voice "se/z03041.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:114263
translate chinese map317_1974cda5:

    # "He knew that his writings could influence the people's perception in a large way.\nTo this end — he constantly wrote you letters — to ensure he had your approval.\nThese Monarch approved writings were the highest seal of quality to Alestians."
    "他知道自己的文字能在很大程度上影响民众的看法。\n为此——他不断给你写信——以确保得到你的认可。\n这些经君主认可的文字，在阿莱斯蒂亚人眼中是最高品质的保证。"

# game/script.rpy:114266
translate chinese map317_6cbef05d:

    # voice "se/z03042.ogg"
    # "Almost operating as a team, you ensured that only the true history was written down.\nAs the victor, you could've told the people anything — but you were a just and honest ruler.\nYou helped Pro achieve his dream of using information for good. He never harmed with it again."
    voice "se/z03042.ogg"
    "你们几乎如同一人般配合，确保只有真实的历史被记录下来。\n作为胜利者，你本可以随意告知民众任何事——但你是一位公正诚实的统治者。\n你帮助普洛实现了他用信息行善的梦想。他再未用它伤人。"

# game/script.rpy:114273
translate chinese map317_f90fa5a0:

    # voice "se/z03039.ogg"
    voice "se/z03039.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:114275
translate chinese map317_5933c8d9:

    # "He wrote about you and your sacrifice in vivid detail; along with your shared love.\nIn his mind, it was more important to write about you as a person instead of a hero.\nLegends should be grounded in reality. At least that's how he chose to write about you."
    "他生动细致地写下了你与你的牺牲，还有你们共有的爱。\n在他看来，把你当作一个“人”而非英雄来写，更为重要。\n传奇应当扎根于现实。至少，他选择这样书写你。"

# game/script.rpy:114278
translate chinese map317_e11bba01:

    # voice "se/z03040.ogg"
    # "But he never forgot about the relationship that formed between the two of you.\nA lover, a fighter, a hero. Alestia would remember you in many ways in the years to come.\nBut most importantly — thanks to Pro's writing — you would be a symbol of hope to all."
    voice "se/z03040.ogg"
    "但他从未忘记你们两人之间建立的那段情谊。\n爱人、战士、英雄。在往后的岁月里，阿莱斯蒂亚会以许多方式记住你。\n但最重要的是——多亏普洛的书写——你成了所有人希望的象征。"

# game/script.rpy:114284
translate chinese map317_5162ab9c:

    # voice "se/z03037.ogg"
    voice "se/z03037.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:114286
translate chinese map317_458a7621:

    # "He wrote about you and your sacrifice in vivid detail.\nIn his mind, the most important asset in the war should be remembered.\nBut true to his methods, he wrote about your day-to-day life as well."
    "他生动细致地写下了你与你的牺牲。\n在他看来，这场战争中最重要的人物理应被铭记。\n但他一贯的做法，也让他写下了你日常生活的点滴。"

# game/script.rpy:114289
translate chinese map317_8087f60c:

    # voice "se/z03038.ogg"
    # "Legends should be grounded in reality. At least, that's what he thought.\nIt was important for people to realize you were a person first, and a hero second.\nThis empowered generations to come with the idea that {i}anybody{/i} could be a hero."
    voice "se/z03038.ogg"
    "传奇应当扎根于现实。至少，他是这么认为的。\n让人们明白你首先是一个“人”，其次才是英雄，这很重要。\n这让后世之人明白，{i}任何人{/i}都可以成为英雄。"

# game/script.rpy:114294
translate chinese map317_97c2e1ff:

    # voice "se/z03055.ogg"
    voice "se/z03055.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:114296
translate chinese map317_9241d088:

    # "Pro's identity as the mole within The Rebellion never came to light.\nHowever, even if it did — he had done enough to make up for his actions.\nMany aspired to write like him, but none could achieve such prowess."
    "普洛作为反抗军内部间谍的身份从未曝光。\n然而，即便曝光了——他所做的已足以弥补他的过往。\n许多人渴望像他那样写作，却无人能达到如此造诣。"

# game/script.rpy:114317
translate chinese map319_ca366f33:

    # voice "se/z03056.ogg"
    voice "se/z03056.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:114319
translate chinese map319_ae4d9ab0:

    # "After the war, Ulric did his best to assist the throne and serve The Monarchy.\nThere was lots to take care of, and things were chaotic after the fog of war settled.\nBut he was up to the task, and he did everything in his power to make the world a better place."
    "战后，乌尔里克竭尽全力辅佐王座，为王室效力。\n要处理的事情很多，战火平息后一切都混乱不堪。\n但他担得起这份重任，竭尽所能让这个世界变得更好。"

# game/script.rpy:114324
translate chinese map319_bc544170:

    # voice "se/z03059.ogg"
    voice "se/z03059.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:114326
translate chinese map319_afdc5a62:

    # "Ulric, protesting against your decision in Alarinthia, never visited his home nation again.\nDraycu remained in power, and Ulric set his sights on serving The Monarchy instead.\nBecause everybody remained in peace — this was not seen as a loss of any kind."
    "乌尔里克因抗议你在阿拉林西亚的裁决，此后再未踏足故国。\n德雷库依旧掌权，乌尔里克便把目光投向为王室效力。\n因为所有人都安然无恙——这并不被视为任何损失。"

# game/script.rpy:114331
translate chinese map319_9cb7e2b0:

    # voice "se/z03060.ogg"
    voice "se/z03060.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:114333
translate chinese map319_790f6d35:

    # "Draycu's death threw Alarinthia into a state of disarray.\nThough their ways remain unchanged, Ulric never gave up on his dream.\nPerhaps, if he fought hard enough, he'd find another opportunity to change his home."
    "德雷库之死让阿拉林西亚陷入混乱。\n尽管他们的做法依旧未变，乌尔里克从未放弃自己的梦想。\n或许，只要他足够努力，就能找到另一个改变故乡的机会。"

# game/script.rpy:114349
translate chinese map320_ca366f33:

    # voice "se/z03056.ogg"
    voice "se/z03056.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:114351
translate chinese map320_cc5cd432:

    # "After the war, Ulric did his best to assist the throne and serve The Monarchy.\nThere was much to take care of, and things were chaotic after the fog of war settled.\nBut he was up to the task, and he did everything in his power to make the world a better place."
    "战后，乌尔里克竭尽全力辅佐王座，为王室效力。\n要处理的事情很多，战火平息后一切都混乱不堪。\n但他担得起这份重任，竭尽所能让这个世界变得更好。"

# game/script.rpy:114356
translate chinese map320_97ccdb95:

    # voice "se/z03057.ogg"
    voice "se/z03057.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:114358
translate chinese map320_c32f3ee1:

    # "In his spare time, he would visit New Alarinthia and assist Vivien as well.\nHaving achieved his dream of a changed nation, it made sense to help out.\nIt would take a while before every Alarinthian adjusted to this new lifestyle."
    "闲暇时，他会前往新阿拉林西亚，协助薇薇安。\n既然改变了国家的梦想已然实现，帮忙也是理所当然。\n要让每一位阿拉林西亚人都适应这种新生活，还需要一些时日。"

# game/script.rpy:114363
translate chinese map320_d14e9448:

    # voice "se/z03058.ogg"
    voice "se/z03058.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:114365
translate chinese map320_49822603:

    # "Having lost Vivien in the war, Ulric stood up and took his place as ruler of Alarinthia.\nBecause he was Vivien's Champion, and survived, he did have a claim of leadership.\nBalancing his new duties in Balteus and Alarinthia, his life was busy, and impactful."
    "战争中失去了薇薇安后，乌尔里克挺身而出，接替他成为阿拉林西亚的统治者。\n因为他是薇薇安的斗士，且活了下来，确实有继位的资格。\n他在巴尔泰乌斯与阿拉林西亚的新职责之间奔忙，生活忙碌而卓有影响。"

# game/script.rpy:114381
translate chinese map318_7179d124:

    # voice "se/z03045.ogg"
    voice "se/z03045.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:114383
translate chinese map318_8b06f772:

    # "Though Pro was lost during the war, his writing endured, and created a legacy.\nHe had the most detailed records of The Rebellion, and wrote about almost everybody.\nEverything you could possibly want to know, down to the smallest detail, had been written."
    "尽管普洛在战争中殒命，他的文字留存了下来，铸就了一份遗产。\n他拥有关于反抗军最详尽的记录，几乎写到了每一个人。\n你可能想知道的一切，哪怕是最细微的细节，都被记录了下来。"

# game/script.rpy:114386
translate chinese map318_fb39c541:

    # voice "se/z03046.ogg"
    # "His work went down in history as one of the most detailed records of wartime.\nEvery soldier — their likes and dislikes — their daily routines; he had written it all.\nGrieving friends would use these texts to keep the memories of their loved ones alive."
    voice "se/z03046.ogg"
    "他的著作作为最详尽的战时记录之一载入史册。\n每个士兵——他们的好恶——他们的日常作息；他全都写了下来。\n悲痛的友人会借这些文字让挚爱之人的记忆延续。"

# game/script.rpy:114390
translate chinese map318_c0f05bc7:

    # voice "se/z03047.ogg"
    # "It was reported that a man and woman resembling Pro were seen at his memorial.\nHowever, they disappeared as quickly as they had come — never to be seen again."
    voice "se/z03047.ogg"
    "据传，在普洛的追悼会上，有人看见一对男女，容貌与普洛十分相似。\n然而，他们来去匆匆——此后再未现身。"

# game/script.rpy:114397
translate chinese map318_18d81143:

    # voice "se/z03054.ogg"
    voice "se/z03054.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:114399
translate chinese map318_5d9a461a:

    # "You did your best to keep Pro's memory alive, and had all of his writing copied.\nNo matter how small the details, you wanted his work to live on as long as it could.\nAs you went through it all, you shed a tear. He wrote fondly of the love you two shared."
    "你竭尽全力让普洛的记忆延续，把他所有的文字都抄录了一份。\n无论细节多么微小，你都希望他的作品能尽可能长久地流传。\n当你翻阅这一切时，你落下了泪水。他深情地写下了你们两人共有的爱。"

# game/script.rpy:114404
translate chinese map318_89872d0b:

    # voice "se/z03052.ogg"
    voice "se/z03052.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:114406
translate chinese map318_2ec8f0d4:

    # "You did your best to keep Pro's memory alive, and has all of his writing copied.\nNo matter how small the details, you wanted his work to live on as long as it could.\nAs you read it all, you looked back on fond memories, and saw how far you'd come."
    "你竭尽全力让普洛的记忆延续，把他所有的文字都抄录了一份。\n无论细节多么微小，你都希望他的作品能尽可能长久地流传。\n当你读完这一切时，你回想着往昔的美好记忆，看到了自己一路走来的历程。"

# game/script.rpy:114409
translate chinese map318_053fd246:

    # voice "se/z03053.ogg"
    # "Though he couldn't enjoy this victory with you, you knew he'd be proud.\nTales of your bond during the war ended up outliving the both of you.\nIt showed how friendship and camaraderie can flourish even in war."
    voice "se/z03053.ogg"
    "尽管他无法与你共享这份胜利，你知道他会为你骄傲。\n你们战时情谊的传说，比你们两人都活得更久。\n它证明了友谊与袍泽之情即使在战争中也能绽放。"

# game/script.rpy:114416
translate chinese map318_a690f20b:

    # voice "se/z03050.ogg"
    voice "se/z03050.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:114418
translate chinese map318_2de99aeb:

    # "But the most popular of his writings was about you, his love.\nThe world would remember you for an eternity, and the sacrifice you made.\nYour name became a symbol of hope, giving light to anyone in dark times."
    "但他最受欢迎的作品，是关于你——他的爱人。\n世界会永远铭记你，以及你所做的牺牲。\n你的名字成了希望的象征，为身处黑暗之人带来光明。"

# game/script.rpy:114421
translate chinese map318_92d84b7d:

    # voice "se/z03051.ogg"
    # "To Pro, it was important that you were remembered as a person first, and a hero second.\nTo this end, he stayed true to his methods — choosing to write about your day-to-day life.\nThough you were remembered as a hero, people realized at heart, that you were the same."
    voice "se/z03051.ogg"
    "对普洛而言，让你首先被当作一个“人”、其次才是英雄来铭记，很重要。\n为此，他一贯坚持自己的方式——选择书写你日常生活的点滴。\n尽管你被当作英雄铭记，人们心底也明白，你其实和他们一样。"

# game/script.rpy:114427
translate chinese map318_14f3e9bc:

    # voice "se/z03048.ogg"
    voice "se/z03048.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:114429
translate chinese map318_007ccb67:

    # "But the most popular of his writings, was about you — The Monarch.\nThe world would remember you for an eternity, and the sacrifice you made.\nYour name became a symbol of hope, giving light to anyone in dark times."
    "但他最受欢迎的作品，是关于你——君主。\n世界会永远铭记你，以及你所做的牺牲。\n你的名字成了希望的象征，为身处黑暗之人带来光明。"

# game/script.rpy:114432
translate chinese map318_2cf60204:

    # voice "se/z03049.ogg"
    # "To Pro, it was important that you were remembered as a person first, and a hero second.\nTo this end, he stayed true to his methods — choosing to write about your day-to-day life.\nThough you were remembered as a hero, people realized at heart, that you were the same."
    voice "se/z03049.ogg"
    "对普洛而言，让你首先被当作一个“人”、其次才是英雄来铭记，很重要。\n为此，他一贯坚持自己的方式——选择书写你日常生活的点滴。\n尽管你被当作英雄铭记，人们心底也明白，你其实和他们一样。"

# game/script.rpy:114437
translate chinese map318_97c2e1ff:

    # voice "se/z03055.ogg"
    voice "se/z03055.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:114439
translate chinese map318_9241d088:

    # "Pro's identity as the mole within The Rebellion never came to light.\nHowever, even if it did — he had done enough to make up for his actions.\nMany aspired to write like him, but none could achieve such prowess."
    "普洛作为反抗军内部间谍的身份从未曝光。\n然而，即便曝光了——他所做的已足以弥补他的过往。\n许多人渴望像他那样写作，却无人能达到如此造诣。"

# game/script.rpy:114460
translate chinese map316_b073000f:

    # voice "se/z03019.ogg"
    voice "se/z03019.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:114462
translate chinese map316_98c5a633:

    # "Fortaime chose to settle in Mazeo after the war.\nHelping the nation's people adjust to the new world was his goal.\nHowever, this was to make up for the truth of learning that his parents were Pirates."
    "福泰姆选择在战后定居马泽奥。\n帮助这个国家的人民适应新世界，是他的目标。\n而他这样做，也是因为得知自己的父母曾是海盗，想为此作出弥补。"

# game/script.rpy:114465
translate chinese map316_f18ed94f:

    # voice "se/z03020.ogg"
    # "Undoing the damage they had done to the nation was his top priority.\nSoon after that, the wounds of Mazeo were healed. Everybody was safe and happy.\nTales of The Occupation and The Triumvirate's wrath soon faded into history, and legend."
    voice "se/z03020.ogg"
    "弥补他们给这个国家造成的伤害，是他的首要之务。\n不久之后，马泽奥的创伤便愈合了。人人都安全而幸福。\n占领时期与三人执政团暴政的传说，很快淡入历史与传说之中。"

# game/script.rpy:114469
translate chinese map316_0804d562:

    # voice "se/z03021.ogg"
    # "In his eyes, he had made up for any harm his parents had caused the nation.\nWhen he passed away, he was known as one of Mazeo's greatest public figures.\nWithout his help and direction, many say the nation would've never recovered at all."
    voice "se/z03021.ogg"
    "在他眼中，他已弥补了父母给这个国家带来的所有伤害。\n他离世时，被誉为马泽奥最伟大的公众人物之一。\n许多人说，若没有他的帮助与指引，这个国家根本不可能恢复。"

# game/script.rpy:114475
translate chinese map316_f19566a9:

    # voice "se/z03022.ogg"
    voice "se/z03022.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:114477
translate chinese map316_ef4ca823:

    # "However, due to Valessa's death, his work became almost doubled.\nHe couldn't become The Elder in her absence, so he arranged an election.\nIt was only fair that Valinorth be taken in the direction that the people wanted next."
    "然而，由于瓦莱莎的离世，他的工作几乎加倍。\n在她缺席的情况下他无法继任长老，于是他安排了一场选举。\n让瓦利诺斯接下来由人民决定方向，才算公平。"

# game/script.rpy:114483
translate chinese map316_0dca1423:

    # voice "se/z03029.ogg"
    voice "se/z03029.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:114485
translate chinese map316_8209a0b6:

    # "During all of this, he kept in close contact with you.\nFrequent visits to the throne ensured that your love never waned.\nA small ceremony was held back in Valinorth to solidify your eternal love."
    "在这一切之中，他与你保持着密切联系。\n他频繁前来王座探访，让你们之间的爱从未消减。\n一场小小的仪式在瓦利诺斯举行，以巩固你们永恒的爱。"

# game/script.rpy:114488
translate chinese map316_655cb0ff:

    # voice "se/z03030.ogg"
    # "From your new home in Balteus, you helped Fortaime heal a wounded Mazeo.\nHowever, history would remember {i}his{/i} efforts — as your legacy lay elsewhere.\nYou were considered a team, and tales of your love endured both of your passing."
    voice "se/z03030.ogg"
    "从你在巴尔泰乌斯的新家，你协助福泰姆治愈了伤痕累累的马泽奥。\n然而，历史铭记的会是{i}他{/i}的付出——因为你的功业在别处。\n你们被视为一个整体，你们爱情的传说比你们两人都活得更久。"

# game/script.rpy:114494
translate chinese map316_5c3e773c:

    # voice "se/z03027.ogg"
    voice "se/z03027.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:114496
translate chinese map316_38bee5cb:

    # "During all of this, he kept in close contact with you.\nFrequent visits to the throne kept your bond alive forever.\nFrom your new home in Balteus, you assisted his efforts in Mazeo."
    "在这一切之中，他与你保持着密切联系。\n频繁前来王座探访，让你们的情谊永远鲜活。\n从你在巴尔泰乌斯的新家，你协助他在马泽奥的工作。"

# game/script.rpy:114499
translate chinese map316_0fd76201:

    # voice "se/z03028.ogg"
    # "Though it was a joint effort, history remembered Fortaime's efforts.\nYou would be remembered for other endeavors, but that was fine.\nHe deserved most of the credit for helping to heal Mazeo's wounds."
    voice "se/z03028.ogg"
    "尽管这是共同努力，历史铭记的却是福泰姆的付出。\n你会因其他功业被铭记，但那也无妨。\n在治愈马泽奥创伤一事上，大部分功劳都该归于他。"

# game/script.rpy:114506
translate chinese map316_8cd3e834:

    # voice "se/z03025.ogg"
    voice "se/z03025.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:114508
translate chinese map316_64d81523:

    # "During all of this, he never forgot your sacrifice.\nThough your time as lovers was short, he never got over the loss.\nHe kept your memory alive by telling stories about you to everyone he could."
    "在这一切之中，他从未忘记你的牺牲。\n尽管你们作为爱人的时光短暂，他始终未能走出这份失去。\n他逢人便讲你的故事，让你的记忆得以延续。"

# game/script.rpy:114511
translate chinese map316_e32a7a67:

    # voice "se/z03026.ogg"
    # "He focused on the little things, rather than your grand destiny.\nFor example, how your life as children in Valinorth went on.\nThe tale of your love endured, even after your passing."
    voice "se/z03026.ogg"
    "他关注的是那些小事，而非你宏大的命运。\n比如，你们在瓦利诺斯的童年生活是如何度过的。\n你们爱情的传说历久不衰，即便在你离世之后。"

# game/script.rpy:114517
translate chinese map316_356ed70b:

    # voice "se/z03023.ogg"
    voice "se/z03023.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:114519
translate chinese map316_9c81dbe5:

    # "During all of this, he never forgot your sacrifice.\nHe considered it a necessity to keep your memory alive.\nAlmost never keeping quiet, he told stories of you for his entire life."
    "在这一切之中，他从未忘记你的牺牲。\n他认为让你的记忆延续下去是一种责任。\n他几乎从不沉默，终其一生都在讲述你的故事。"

# game/script.rpy:114522
translate chinese map316_ba5d2645:

    # voice "se/z03024.ogg"
    # "He focused on the little things, rather than your grand destiny.\nFor example, how your life as children in Valinorth went on.\nHe thought it important to pass on the idea of humble beginnings."
    voice "se/z03024.ogg"
    "他关注的是那些小事，而非你宏大的命运。\n比如，你们在瓦利诺斯的童年生活是如何度过的。\n他认为把“出身平凡”这一理念传承下去很重要。"

# game/script.rpy:114528
translate chinese map316_2e57db61:

    # voice "se/z03031.ogg"
    voice "se/z03031.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:114530
translate chinese map316_ce9f8050:

    # "It wasn't very long until word of Fortaime's other endeavors came to light.\nHaving been the first person to climb The Grand Tree — he was a legend.\nAnd just like he had wished, it soon became a tradition for climbers to scale the tree."
    "没过多久，福泰姆其他事迹的消息便传开了。\n作为第一个攀上巨树的人——他本身就是一段传奇。\n正如他所愿，攀爬巨树很快成了一种传统。"

# game/script.rpy:114533
translate chinese map316_572525ae:

    # voice "se/z03032.ogg"
    # "This continued for almost an eternity after his passing.\nClimbers would leave notes for him at the top of the tree, close to the heavens.\nThey thought that maybe, somehow, he could read them. They thanked him for all he had done."
    voice "se/z03032.ogg"
    "在他离世之后，这一传统延续了近乎永恒。\n攀登者会在靠近天际的树顶为他留下字条。\n他们想着，或许、不知怎的，他能读到这些字条。他们感谢他所做的一切。"

# game/script.rpy:114538
translate chinese map316_6d2eed42:

    # voice "se/z03033.ogg"
    voice "se/z03033.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:114540
translate chinese map316_9d0450d9:

    # "Fortaime survived the war, despite all odds.\nHis strong love for everything around him kept him afloat.\nWhen all hope was lost, he stood up, and challenged death in the face."
    "福泰姆排除万难，活过了那场战争。\n他对周遭一切深切的爱支撑着他。\n当所有希望都已破灭，他挺身而出，当面挑战死亡。"

# game/script.rpy:114543
translate chinese map316_35b3cbce:

    # voice "se/z03034.ogg"
    # "And for that, he was never forgotten.\nLiving a long and full life, he was happy.\nAlestia was forever better because of him."
    voice "se/z03034.ogg"
    "正因如此，他从未被遗忘。\n他度过了漫长而充实的一生，幸福快乐。\n因为有了他，阿莱斯蒂亚永远变得更好。"

# game/script.rpy:114565
translate chinese map312_b92e3260:

    # voice "se/z02977.ogg"
    voice "se/z02977.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:114567
translate chinese map312_79151ffa:

    # "Valessa perished during the final assault on Balteus.\nA memorial was erected near Valinorth, and she would never be forgotten.\nHer bravery, sacrifice, and loving nature — empowered many for years to come."
    "瓦莱莎在对巴尔泰乌斯的最后进攻中牺牲了。\n瓦利诺斯附近立起了一座纪念碑，她永远不会被遗忘。\n她的勇敢、牺牲与仁爱——激励了此后许多年的人们。"

# game/script.rpy:114572
translate chinese map312_d258498c:

    # voice "se/z02978.ogg"
    voice "se/z02978.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:114574
translate chinese map312_bbb2e534:

    # "In the wake of her death, a formal election was held for Valinorth's next Elder.\nHowever, to honor her wishes and views, Valinorth remained independent.\nIt stayed this way for as long as time could tell, honoring her sacrifice."
    "她去世后，瓦利诺斯为选出下一任长老举行了正式的选举。\n然而，为了尊重她的意愿与主张，瓦利诺斯保持独立。\n在漫长的岁月里，它一直如此，以纪念她的牺牲。"

# game/script.rpy:114579
translate chinese map312_ac4e80c5:

    # voice "se/z02979.ogg"
    voice "se/z02979.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:114581
translate chinese map312_f2b1a045:

    # "Fortaime, as the Elder of Valinorth, would go on to write about her.\nThese books would eventually be lost to time, and become legends.\nEverybody knew Valessa by name, and aspired to her greatness."
    "身为瓦利诺斯长老的福泰姆，后来写下了关于她的文字。\n这些书最终湮没于时光，化为了传说。\n人人都知道瓦莱莎的名字，都向往她的伟大。"

# game/script.rpy:114587
translate chinese map312_88a8c8d5:

    # voice "se/z02980.ogg"
    voice "se/z02980.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:114589
translate chinese map312_99f65359:

    # "Though your time as lovers was short, you never forgot about Valessa.\nReturning to Valinorth each year, you pay your respects by resting flowers at her home.\nFortaime keeps it in immaculate condition, saying it's what she would have wanted."
    "尽管你们作为爱人的时光短暂，你从未忘记瓦莱莎。\n每年回到瓦利诺斯，你都在她故居前献上鲜花，以表敬意。\n福泰姆把那里打理得一尘不染，说这是她希望看到的。"

# game/script.rpy:114594
translate chinese map312_2e2c0f85:

    # voice "se/z02981.ogg"
    voice "se/z02981.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:114596
translate chinese map312_393e0fc4:

    # "You would return to Valinorth once a year, on the eve of her death.\nLaying flowers in front of her home, you pay your respects, and mourn.\nFortaime keeps the house in immaculate condition, saying it's what she'd want."
    "你每年都会回瓦利诺斯一次，就在她忌日的前夕。\n在她故居前摆上鲜花，你表达敬意，寄托哀思。\n福泰姆把房子打理得一尘不染，说这是她希望看到的。"

# game/script.rpy:114602
translate chinese map312_93cad488:

    # voice "se/z02983.ogg"
    voice "se/z02983.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:114604
translate chinese map312_96c7ee3d:

    # "Though your time in this world was both short, tales of your love endured.\nOn the anniversary of your deaths, flowers would litter the streets near your homes.\nThis became a tradition, never lost to time — and your exploits were always honored."
    "尽管你们在这世上的时光都很短暂，你们爱情的传说却流传了下来。\n在你们离世的周年纪念日，你们故居附近的街道上会撒满鲜花。\n这成了一项传统，从未被时光磨灭——你们的事迹始终被铭记。"

# game/script.rpy:114609
translate chinese map312_88fc3ab9:

    # voice "se/z02982.ogg"
    voice "se/z02982.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:114611
translate chinese map312_a5d121c4:

    # "Though your time in this world was both short, tales of your bond endured.\nOn the anniversary of your deaths, flowers would litter the streets near your homes.\nThis became a tradition, never lost to time — and your exploits were always honored."
    "尽管你们在这世上的时光都很短暂，你们情谊的传说却流传了下来。\n在你们离世的周年纪念日，你们故居附近的街道上会撒满鲜花。\n这成了一项传统，从未被时光磨灭——你们的事迹始终被铭记。"

# game/script.rpy:114615
translate chinese map312_699046f5:

    # voice "se/z02984.ogg"
    voice "se/z02984.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:114617
translate chinese map312_f380c5ae:

    # "She was gone, but never forgotten."
    "她虽已离去，却从未被遗忘。"

# game/script.rpy:114640
translate chinese map321_a29f2e84:

    # voice "se/z03066.ogg"
    voice "se/z03066.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:114642
translate chinese map321_9f73faa6:

    # "During your reign, you had never known a more loyal ally.\nThough his past was with The Inquisition, his future was with you.\nYour love was strong, and ruling together was a joy. The world was at peace."
    "在你统治期间，你从未有过比他更忠诚的盟友。\n尽管他的过去属于审判庭，他的未来却属于你。\n你们的爱坚定深厚，共同执政是一种喜悦。天下太平。"

# game/script.rpy:114645
translate chinese map321_cb9fc11d:

    # voice "se/z03067.ogg"
    # "He took on the job of helping the world adjust to the new status quo.\nSpreading the news of The Triumvirate's fall, he helped people understand.\nIt was a task as monumental as it was long to complete — but he did complete it."
    voice "se/z03067.ogg"
    "他承担起了帮助世界适应新秩序的重任。\n他传播三人执政团覆灭的消息，帮助人们理解这一切。\n这项任务既艰巨又漫长——但他确实完成了它。"

# game/script.rpy:114649
translate chinese map321_61456702:

    # voice "se/z03068.ogg"
    # "The world embraced your rule, and Alestia was forever better because of it.\nInsurrections were rare, and insignificant. Things were peaceful, all thanks to you.\nAs your right hand — and lover — Ulric did everything in his power to keep it that way."
    voice "se/z03068.ogg"
    "世界接受了你的统治，阿莱斯蒂亚因此永远变得更好。\n叛乱稀少而微不足道。一切安宁，皆因有你。\n作为你的左右手——也是你的爱人——乌尔里克竭尽所能维持这份安宁。"

# game/script.rpy:114655
translate chinese map321_7ee1c34b:

    # voice "se/z03069.ogg"
    voice "se/z03069.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:114657
translate chinese map321_6449938a:

    # "Thanks to your efforts in lifting his curse, Ulric was finally able to grow old.\nThough death was now capable of taking him, he seemed happier than ever before.\nEspecially now that he had somebody like you by his side to grow old with him."
    "多亏你努力解除了他的诅咒，乌尔里克终于能够老去了。\n尽管死亡如今能够带走他，他却似乎比以往任何时候都更幸福。\n尤其是现在，有像你这样的人陪伴在侧，与他一同老去。"

# game/script.rpy:114662
translate chinese map321_4b8fdf31:

    # voice "se/z03070.ogg"
    voice "se/z03070.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:114664
translate chinese map321_374ab039:

    # "With Ulric's curse of immortality still in effect, he outlived every survivor.\nHe eventually came to terms with this, and started to enjoy his eternal life.\nAt least now, the world was a beautiful place to live in. He no longer desired death."
    "由于乌尔里克的永生诅咒依然存在，他比所有幸存者都活得更久。\n他最终接受了这一点，并开始享受自己永恒的生命。\n至少如今，这个世界已是个美丽的栖身之所。他不再渴求死亡。"

# game/script.rpy:114669
translate chinese map321_85bff211:

    # voice "se/z03061.ogg"
    voice "se/z03061.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:114671
translate chinese map321_f6e67888:

    # "During your reign, you had never known a more loyal ally.\nThough his past was with The Inquisition, his future was with The Monarchy.\nYou were seen as the best of friends — and that made working together a joy."
    "在你统治期间，你从未有过比他更忠诚的盟友。\n尽管他的过去属于审判庭，他的未来却属于王室。\n你们被视为最好的朋友——这也让你们一同治理成为一种喜悦。"

# game/script.rpy:114674
translate chinese map321_3a32fff2:

    # voice "se/z03062.ogg"
    # "It was his job to help the world adjust to your leadership.\nHe spread the news of The Triumvirate's fall, and helped people understand.\nIt was a task as monumental as it was long to complete — but he did complete it."
    voice "se/z03062.ogg"
    "帮助世界适应你的领导是他的职责。\n他传播三人执政团覆灭的消息，帮助人们理解这一切。\n这项任务既艰巨又漫长——但他确实完成了它。"

# game/script.rpy:114678
translate chinese map321_ac95ebe9:

    # voice "se/z03063.ogg"
    # "The world embraced your rule, and Alestia was forever better because of it.\nInsurrections were rare, and insignificant. The world was at peace, all thanks to you.\nAs your right hand — Ulric did everything in his power to help keep it that way."
    voice "se/z03063.ogg"
    "世界接受了你的统治，阿莱斯蒂亚因此永远变得更好。\n叛乱稀少而微不足道。天下太平，皆因有你。\n作为你的左右手——乌尔里克竭尽所能协助维持这份安宁。"

# game/script.rpy:114684
translate chinese map321_7bbefdda:

    # voice "se/z03064.ogg"
    voice "se/z03064.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:114686
translate chinese map321_c863baee:

    # "Thanks to your efforts in lifting his curse, Ulric was finally able to grow old.\nThough death was now capable of taking him, he seemed happier than ever before.\nPerhaps because he knew he'd leave behind a changed world — happy and peaceful."
    "多亏你努力解除了他的诅咒，乌尔里克终于能够老去了。\n尽管死亡如今能够带走他，他却似乎比以往任何时候都更幸福。\n或许是因为他知道，自己将留下一个焕然一新、幸福安宁的世界。"

# game/script.rpy:114691
translate chinese map321_b6011b41:

    # voice "se/z03065.ogg"
    voice "se/z03065.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:114693
translate chinese map321_374ab039_1:

    # "With Ulric's curse of immortality still in effect, he outlived every survivor.\nHe eventually came to terms with this, and started to enjoy his eternal life.\nAt least now, the world was a beautiful place to live in. He no longer desired death."
    "由于乌尔里克的永生诅咒依然存在，他比所有幸存者都活得更久。\n他最终接受了这一点，并开始享受自己永恒的生命。\n至少如今，这个世界已是个美丽的栖身之所。他不再渴求死亡。"

# game/script.rpy:114699
translate chinese map321_0d58733c:

    # voice "se/z03077.ogg"
    voice "se/z03077.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:114701
translate chinese map321_1b518fe8:

    # "With your sacrifice, there was nobody left to lead Alestia.\nUlric, stepping up, took on the role of First King of The Monarchy.\nHis goal was clear — to educate the world on the new status quo."
    "由于你的牺牲，再没有人来领导阿莱斯蒂亚。\n乌尔里克挺身而出，担起了王室首位国王的角色。\n他的目标很明确——让世界了解新的秩序。"

# game/script.rpy:114704
translate chinese map321_8463b9f2:

    # voice "se/z03078.ogg"
    # "People slowly learned and adjusted to news of The Triumvirate's fall.\nBut with many years of hard work, they had come to enjoy Ulric's rule.\nAlestians lived in peace, never fearing what their rulers may do to them."
    voice "se/z03078.ogg"
    "人们慢慢了解并适应了三人执政团覆灭的消息。\n经过多年的努力，他们终于乐于接受乌尔里克的统治。\n阿莱斯蒂亚人安居乐业，从不担心统治者会对自己做什么。"

# game/script.rpy:114708
translate chinese map321_ccac259f:

    # voice "se/z03079.ogg"
    # "He never forgot the romance that blossomed along your journey.\nEven though you were lost, he still stayed loyal to you and your memories.\nThough people thought he refused to move on — he knew this wasn't true."
    voice "se/z03079.ogg"
    "他从未忘记你们旅途中萌生的那段恋情。\n即便你已逝去，他依然忠于你，忠于对你的回忆。\n尽管人们以为他不愿走出来——他知道事实并非如此。"

# game/script.rpy:114714
translate chinese map321_eddfaa2b:

    # voice "se/z03080.ogg"
    voice "se/z03080.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:114716
translate chinese map321_87a0f5bd:

    # "With his curse lifted, he was no longer afraid of dying.\nHe knew that if he did, he might see his love again in the afterlife.\nThis thought is what kept him going when things as a ruler got rough."
    "诅咒解除后，他不再畏惧死亡。\n他知道，若自己死去，或许能在来世与爱人重逢。\n正是这个念头，支撑他度过身为统治者时的艰难时刻。"

# game/script.rpy:114721
translate chinese map321_8d863ade:

    # voice "se/z03081.ogg"
    voice "se/z03081.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:114723
translate chinese map321_34a499e3:

    # "He served Alestia for an eternity because of the curse of immortality upon him.\nOver time, he became known as The Immortal King of Alestia. An interesting title.\nThe people didn't complain about this, however. He was seen as a great ruler."
    "由于身上永生的诅咒，他为阿莱斯蒂亚效力了永恒之久。\n久而久之，他被称为阿莱斯蒂亚的不朽之王。一个有趣的头衔。\n不过，民众对此并无怨言。他被视为一位伟大的统治者。"

# game/script.rpy:114726
translate chinese map321_4db624fd:

    # voice "se/z03082.ogg"
    # "He started to enjoy life, and he was no longer seeking to have the curse lifted.\nHe still had thoughts of wanting to die — perhaps to see his love in the afterlife.\nBut these were fleeting, and the memories of your time together were more than enough."
    voice "se/z03082.ogg"
    "他开始享受生活，不再寻求解除诅咒。\n他偶尔仍会冒出想死的念头——或许是想到来世与爱人重逢。\n但这些念头转瞬即逝，你们共度时光的回忆已足以慰藉。"

# game/script.rpy:114732
translate chinese map321_73cd9053:

    # voice "se/z03071.ogg"
    voice "se/z03071.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:114734
translate chinese map321_59997504:

    # "With your sacrifice, there was nobody left to lead Alestia.\nUlric, stepping up, took on the role of first King of The Monarchy.\nHis goal was clear — to educate the world on the new status quo."
    "由于你的牺牲，再没有人来领导阿莱斯蒂亚。\n乌尔里克挺身而出，担起了王室首位国王的角色。\n他的目标很明确——让世界了解新的秩序。"

# game/script.rpy:114737
translate chinese map321_2395a529:

    # voice "se/z03072.ogg"
    # "People slowly learned and adjusted to news of The Triumvirate's fall.\nBut with many years of hard work, they had come to enjoy Ulric's rule.\nAlestians lived in peace, never fearing what their rulers may do to them."
    voice "se/z03072.ogg"
    "人们慢慢了解并适应了三人执政团覆灭的消息。\n经过多年的努力，他们终于乐于接受乌尔里克的统治。\n阿莱斯蒂亚人安居乐业，从不担心统治者会对自己做什么。"

# game/script.rpy:114741
translate chinese map321_abf4f214:

    # voice "se/z03073.ogg"
    # "He had a statue of you erected in the Town Square of Balteus.\nYou would forever be remembered as The First Monarch. A hero.\nEvery ruler in the future would owe their power to you and your sacrifice."
    voice "se/z03073.ogg"
    "他在巴尔泰乌斯的城镇广场为你立起了一座雕像。\n你会永远被铭记为第一位君主。一位英雄。\n未来每一位统治者的权柄，都要归功于你和你的牺牲。"

# game/script.rpy:114747
translate chinese map321_d4f28314:

    # voice "se/z03074.ogg"
    voice "se/z03074.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:114749
translate chinese map321_74f9bb97:

    # "With his curse lifted, he was no longer afraid of dying.\nHe served Alestia until he was lost to old age, passing away happilly.\nThough new rulers came and went, he was always remembered as the best."
    "诅咒解除后，他不再畏惧死亡。\n他为阿莱斯蒂亚效力，直到因年迈而离世，安然辞世。\n尽管新统治者来来去去，他始终被铭记为最好的那一位。"

# game/script.rpy:114754
translate chinese map321_57b07e17:

    # voice "se/z03075.ogg"
    voice "se/z03075.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:114756
translate chinese map321_34a499e3_1:

    # "He served Alestia for an eternity because of the curse of immortality upon him.\nOver time, he became known as The Immortal King of Alestia. An interesting title.\nThe people didn't complain about this, however. He was seen as a great ruler."
    "由于身上永生的诅咒，他为阿莱斯蒂亚效力了永恒之久。\n久而久之，他被称为阿莱斯蒂亚的不朽之王。一个有趣的头衔。\n不过，民众对此并无怨言。他被视为一位伟大的统治者。"

# game/script.rpy:114759
translate chinese map321_cc53fc2d:

    # voice "se/z03076.ogg"
    # "He started to enjoy life, and no longer sought to have his curse removed."
    voice "se/z03076.ogg"
    "他开始享受生活，不再寻求解除自己的诅咒。"

# game/script.rpy:114764
translate chinese map321_3e0e78c2:

    # voice "se/z03083.ogg"
    voice "se/z03083.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:114766
translate chinese map321_fc40cbea:

    # "Thanks to your efforts, Ulric was able to live a happy life, free from The Triumvirate.\nThe shadows of his past soon dissipated, and he turned into a new man — truly loved by the people.\nThough his secrets never came to light, he had certainly done enough work to make up for them."
    "多亏你的努力，乌尔里克得以过上幸福的生活，摆脱了三人执政团。\n他过往的阴影很快消散，他蜕变成了一个全新的人——深受人民爱戴。\n尽管他的秘密从未曝光，他所做的一切已足以弥补。"

# game/script.rpy:114787
translate chinese map322_cb2b93cb:

    # voice "se/z03084.ogg"
    voice "se/z03084.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:114789
translate chinese map322_cedb1e7f:

    # "After the battle for Alestia, Damek had a lot of work to do.\nGoing from a member of The Rebellion, to a leader in The Monarchy was a huge change.\nHe was no longer part of a small army — his actions affected the entire world."
    "阿莱斯蒂亚之战后，达梅克有许多工作要做。\n从反抗军的一员，变成王室的领导者，是巨大的转变。\n他不再是一支小军队中的一员——他的行动影响着整个世界。"

# game/script.rpy:114795
translate chinese map322_05a92f94:

    # voice "se/z03086.ogg"
    voice "se/z03086.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:114797
translate chinese map322_ccf74e74:

    # "He remained a loyal servant to the throne of Alestia, carrying out your every order.\nBeing originally in charge of The Rebellion, it made no sense to back down after victory.\nYour love grew ever stronger — held together by an unbreakable bond formed in strife."
    "他始终效忠阿莱斯蒂亚王座，执行你的每一条命令。\n他本就是反抗军的负责人，胜利之后没有退缩的道理。\n你们的爱愈发深厚——由患难中结成的牢不可破的羁绊维系着。"

# game/script.rpy:114802
translate chinese map322_1b68efa2:

    # voice "se/z03085.ogg"
    voice "se/z03085.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:114804
translate chinese map322_e614f0b3:

    # "He remained a loyal servant to the throne of Alestia, carrying out your every order.\nBeing originally in charge of The Rebellion, it made no sense to back down after victory.\nYour friendship grew ever stronger — held together by an unbreakable bond formed in strife."
    "他始终效忠阿莱斯蒂亚王座，执行你的每一条命令。\n他本就是反抗军的负责人，胜利之后没有退缩的道理。\n你们的友谊愈发深厚——由患难中结成的牢不可破的羁绊维系着。"

# game/script.rpy:114809
translate chinese map322_c2406518:

    # voice "se/z03087.ogg"
    voice "se/z03087.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:114811
translate chinese map322_08e71eff:

    # "As your closest advisor, you spent almost every waking moment together.\nThe war did not win you rest, for in your victory, the work had only just begun.\nUniting a confused world, and winning over their love as ruler was a daunting task."
    "作为你最亲近的顾问，你们几乎醒着的每一刻都在一起。\n战争并未给你们带来安宁，因为胜利之后，工作才刚刚开始。\n团结一个迷茫的世界，并作为统治者赢得民众的爱戴，是一项艰巨的任务。"

# game/script.rpy:114814
translate chinese map322_a7276220:

    # voice "se/z03088.ogg"
    # "But it was a task that you two completed, side by side.\nDamek was just as important to history as you, and he was never forgotten.\nThe tale of his growth from orphan child to world leader inspired generations to come."
    voice "se/z03088.ogg"
    "但你们两人并肩完成了这项任务。\n达梅克对历史的重要性不亚于你，他从未被遗忘。\n他从孤儿成长为世界领袖的故事，激励了后世之人。"

# game/script.rpy:114820
translate chinese map322_0a625532:

    # voice "se/z03089.ogg"
    voice "se/z03089.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:114822
translate chinese map322_1ffe36c2:

    # "As you didn't appoint him as your advisor, you made him a General instead.\nIt was his job to gather and train an army, like Salus had done before him.\nWith his leadership and strategy, any future insurrections would surely fall."
    "由于你没有任命他为顾问，你转而让他当上了将军。\n他的职责是招募并训练军队，就像他之前的萨鲁斯那样。\n凭他的领导与谋略，未来任何叛乱都必将被平定。"

# game/script.rpy:114825
translate chinese map322_770f1e30:

    # voice "se/z03090.ogg"
    # "Under his command, your might soon became unparalleled.\nBut as your rule was accepted almost universally, war and battle were rare.\nPeople would compare his new role to that of The Triumvirate's old Inquisition."
    voice "se/z03090.ogg"
    "在他的统领下，你的武力很快变得无可匹敌。\n但由于你的统治几乎被普遍接受，战争与战斗十分罕见。\n人们会把他这一新角色与三人执政团昔日的审判庭相提并论。"

# game/script.rpy:114829
translate chinese map322_b7b1c50d:

    # voice "se/z03091.ogg"
    # "However, in this case — the amount of honor to guard was plentiful."
    voice "se/z03091.ogg"
    "不过，这一回——值得守护的荣誉可谓数不胜数。"

# game/script.rpy:114835
translate chinese map322_8f4c6a5e:

    # voice "se/z03100.ogg"
    voice "se/z03100.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:114837
translate chinese map322_487d79f0:

    # "Damek eventually got over all of the fears that controlled him.\nHe paid visits to the spot where he lost his Mother, but it held no power over him.\nSpeaking as if she were there with him, he told her stories of everything that happened."
    "达梅克最终克服了所有支配着他的恐惧。\n他去过失去母亲的那个地方，但那里再也无法左右他。\n他像对着在场的她说话一样，把发生的一切都讲给她听。"

# game/script.rpy:114840
translate chinese map322_9cf8959e:

    # voice "se/z03101.ogg"
    # "And he was able to leave without feeling sad. Instead, he was happy.\nHe knew that if she were really there — she would be proud of him.\nThat was enough to keep him going when times got tough."
    voice "se/z03101.ogg"
    "他离开时不再感到悲伤。相反，他感到幸福。\n他知道，如果她真的在那里——她会为他骄傲。\n在艰难时刻，这就足够支撑他走下去。"

# game/script.rpy:114847
translate chinese map322_bb5cfd50:

    # voice "se/z03096.ogg"
    voice "se/z03096.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:114849
translate chinese map322_660a53ec:

    # "Because of your sacrifice, the surviving forces were in a state of disarray.\nHowever, this was put to rest when Ulric stood up and assumed the role of King.\nDamek immediately pledged loyalty to his childhood friend, and served his new King."
    "由于你的牺牲，残存的队伍陷入混乱。\n然而，当乌尔里克挺身而出担起国王之位时，一切便平息了。\n达梅克立刻向他儿时的朋友宣誓效忠，为新国王效力。"

# game/script.rpy:114852
translate chinese map322_af77575c:

    # voice "se/z03097.ogg"
    # "But he never forgot about you, and what you did in order to secure victory.\nHe used you as a guide on what to do, and was known as kind, and honorable.\nThat was his way of honoring your growing love. Using your ideals as inspiration."
    voice "se/z03097.ogg"
    "但他从未忘记你，以及你为夺取胜利所做的一切。\n他以你为行事准则，以仁慈、正直著称。\n那是他纪念你们日渐深厚之爱的方式。以你的理念为指引。"

# game/script.rpy:114858
translate chinese map322_58896fc6:

    # voice "se/z03094.ogg"
    voice "se/z03094.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:114860
translate chinese map322_660a53ec_1:

    # "Because of your sacrifice, the surviving forces were in a state of disarray.\nHowever, this was put to rest when Ulric stood up and assumed the role of King.\nDamek immediately pledged loyalty to his childhood friend, and served his new King."
    "由于你的牺牲，残存的队伍陷入混乱。\n然而，当乌尔里克挺身而出担起国王之位时，一切便平息了。\n达梅克立刻向他儿时的朋友宣誓效忠，为新国王效力。"

# game/script.rpy:114863
translate chinese map322_52ec27d9:

    # voice "se/z03095.ogg"
    # "But he never forgot about you, and what you did in order to secure victory.\nHe used you as a guide on what to do, and was known as kind, and honorable.\nThat was his way of honoring your friendship. Using your ideals as inspiration."
    voice "se/z03095.ogg"
    "但他从未忘记你，以及你为夺取胜利所做的一切。\n他以你为行事准则，以仁慈、正直著称。\n那是他纪念你们友谊的方式。以你的理念为指引。"

# game/script.rpy:114869
translate chinese map322_12714f62:

    # voice "se/z03098.ogg"
    voice "se/z03098.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:114871
translate chinese map322_2907e286:

    # "He remained in his role as Advisor, just under Ulric's leadership instead.\nHonoring your appointment, he served in this capacity until the end of his days.\nHis bond with Ulric stayed as strong as ever, and they always saw eye-to-eye."
    "他继续担任顾问一职，只是改为在乌尔里克的领导之下。\n为不负你的任命，他以此身份效力直到生命的尽头。\n他与乌尔里克的情谊始终如故，两人总是心意相通。"

# game/script.rpy:114876
translate chinese map322_0fc378ab:

    # voice "se/z03099.ogg"
    voice "se/z03099.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:114878
translate chinese map322_2065dacb:

    # "As you didn't appoint Damek as your advisor, Ulric made him a General instead.\nHe was in charge of recruiting and training an army — just like Salus was before him.\nHis efficiency in doing so, and his masterful strategizing ensured that Ulric's reign was secure."
    "由于你没有任命达梅克为顾问，乌尔里克转而让他当上了将军。\n他负责招募并训练军队——就像他之前的萨鲁斯那样。\n他做事高效，谋略出众，确保了乌尔里克的统治稳固。"

# game/script.rpy:114883
translate chinese map322_8f4c6a5e_1:

    # voice "se/z03100.ogg"
    voice "se/z03100.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:114885
translate chinese map322_487d79f0_1:

    # "Damek eventually got over all of the fears that controlled him.\nHe paid visits to the spot where he lost his Mother, but it held no power over him.\nSpeaking as if she were there with him, he told her stories of everything that happened."
    "达梅克最终克服了所有支配着他的恐惧。\n他去过失去母亲的那个地方，但那里再也无法左右他。\n他像对着在场的她说话一样，把发生的一切都讲给她听。"

# game/script.rpy:114888
translate chinese map322_9cf8959e_1:

    # voice "se/z03101.ogg"
    # "And he was able to leave without feeling sad. Instead, he was happy.\nHe knew that if she were really there — she would be proud of him.\nThat was enough to keep him going when times got tough."
    voice "se/z03101.ogg"
    "他离开时不再感到悲伤。相反，他感到幸福。\n他知道，如果她真的在那里——她会为他骄傲。\n在艰难时刻，这就足够支撑他走下去。"

# game/script.rpy:114893
translate chinese map322_12a30b08:

    # voice "se/z03102.ogg"
    voice "se/z03102.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:114895
translate chinese map322_b179210d:

    # "Thanks to your efforts, Damek was able to live a long, happy life.\nHe served the throne for the rest of his life, remaining forever loyal.\nThe tale of how far he'd come would go down in history, and become legend."
    "多亏你的努力，达梅克得以度过漫长而幸福的一生。\n他余生都为王座效力，始终忠诚不渝。\n他一路走来的故事将载入史册，成为传说。"

# game/script.rpy:114917
translate chinese map324_12101ab2:

    # voice "se/z03113.ogg"
    voice "se/z03113.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:114919
translate chinese map324_ebbad2b6:

    # "Sovy's past crimes were pardoned after his exceptional performance in Balteus.\nHis defection from The Triumvirate, and his advice regarding them were seen as invaluable.\nWere it not for his actions, and his change of heart — the war would've been lost."
    "索维在巴尔泰乌斯的卓越表现，使他的旧罪得到赦免。\n他脱离三人执政团，以及关于他们的建言，被视为无价之宝。\n若非他的行动与幡然醒悟——这场战争早已失败。"

# game/script.rpy:114922
translate chinese map324_8b053e65:

    # voice "se/z03114.ogg"
    # "True to his word, he used his eternal life to serve The Monarchy.\nHe was able to tell stories of your battles, and keep your legacy alive.\nEvery ruler in the future would know exactly who gave them their power."
    voice "se/z03114.ogg"
    "他信守承诺，用自己永恒的生命为王室效力。\n他得以讲述你们战斗的故事，让你的遗志延续。\n未来每一位统治者都会清楚知道，是谁赋予了他们权力。"

# game/script.rpy:114929
translate chinese map324_8735d672:

    # voice "se/z03116.ogg"
    voice "se/z03116.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:114931
translate chinese map324_685768f2:

    # "You never forgot what he did, and your love grew ever stronger.\nThough you started out on shaky ground — things only got better.\nUsing his immortality, he protected your legacy indefinitely. "
    "你从未忘记他所做的一切，你们的爱愈发深厚。\n尽管你们起初关系不稳——但一切都只会越来越好。\n他借自己的永生，永远守护着你的遗志。"

# game/script.rpy:114936
translate chinese map324_681c57b3:

    # voice "se/z03115.ogg"
    voice "se/z03115.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:114938
translate chinese map324_b25f1a5c:

    # "You never forgot what he did, and your bond grew ever stronger.\nThe man who started out as your enemy became your closest ally.\nAn immortal guardian for everybody who would follow your rule."
    "你从未忘记他所做的一切，你们的情谊愈发深厚。\n那个起初是你敌人的人，成了你最亲密的盟友。\n一位不朽的守护者，守护着所有追随你统治的人。"

# game/script.rpy:114943
translate chinese map324_24f42908:

    # voice "se/z03117.ogg"
    voice "se/z03117.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:114945
translate chinese map324_c77f027d:

    # "Sovy's past crimes were pardoned posthumously, and he was labeled as a hero.\nHis defection from The Triumvirate, and his advice regarding them were seen as invaluable.\nWere it not for his actions, and his change of heart, the war would've been lost."
    "索维的旧罪在他身后得到赦免，他被冠以英雄之名。\n他脱离三人执政团，以及关于他们的建言，被视为无价之宝。\n若非他的行动与幡然醒悟，这场战争早已失败。"

# game/script.rpy:114948
translate chinese map324_fd5b4464:

    # voice "se/z03118.ogg"
    # "A memorial service was held, and almost every surviving member of The Rebellion attended.\nEven Ulric showed up. He was happy, knowing that his friend had finally redeemed himself.\nHis story would go down in history, teaching people that nobody is beyond a second chance."
    voice "se/z03118.ogg"
    "一场追悼会举行了，几乎所有尚存的反抗军成员都到场了。\n连乌尔里克也来了。得知朋友终于赎清了自己，他感到欣慰。\n他的故事将载入史册，告诉世人没有人不配得到第二次机会。"

# game/script.rpy:114955
translate chinese map324_0b5494f0:

    # voice "se/z03121.ogg"
    voice "se/z03121.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:114957
translate chinese map324_463a4dcc:

    # "You never forgot what he did for you and your cause.\nHad he not perished, you're certain that your love would've grown into something special.\nBut you'd never know for sure — and this was always something stuck in the back of your mind."
    "你从未忘记他为你和你的事业所做的一切。\n若他没有殒命，你确信你们的爱会成长为某种特别的东西。\n可你永远无法确知——这始终是你心头挥之不去的一个念头。"

# game/script.rpy:114962
translate chinese map324_a60eb6d7:

    # voice "se/z03119.ogg"
    voice "se/z03119.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:114964
translate chinese map324_c891369e:

    # "You saw to it that his mentions in the history books didn't paint him as a villain.\nHe was more of a misguided young man, who eventually came to his senses.\nA victim — molded and twisted to suit his former Master's heinous needs."
    "你设法确保史书对他的记载不会把他描绘成恶人。\n他更像是一个误入歧途的年轻人，最终幡然醒悟。\n一个受害者——被前主人骇人的需求所塑造、扭曲。"

# game/script.rpy:114967
translate chinese map324_eca829e9:

    # voice "se/z03120.ogg"
    # "You never forgot what he did for you and your cause.\nHad he not perished, you're certain you would've become close friends.\nBut you'd never know for sure — and that was always a thought in the back of your mind."
    voice "se/z03120.ogg"
    "你从未忘记他为你和你的事业所做的一切。\n若他没有殒命，你确信你们本会成为挚友。\n可你永远无法确知——这始终是你心头挥之不去的一个念头。"

# game/script.rpy:114989
translate chinese map326_1645545e:

    # voice "se/z03124.ogg"
    voice "se/z03124.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:114991
translate chinese map326_095aa03c:

    # "Howl survived the war, despite several grievous wounds.\nHis body mended them with ease, and his life continued as normal.\nHe dedicated his life to assisting the throne, and recording history."
    "豪尔身负数处重伤，却活过了那场战争。\n他的身体轻易便愈合了伤口，生活照常继续。\n他毕生致力于辅佐王座，并记录历史。"

# game/script.rpy:114994
translate chinese map326_52989f27:

    # voice "se/z03125.ogg"
    # "But not current history. He wrote about The Old Monarchy, and their ways.\nIt was almost as if the spirits inside of him felt regret at their actions.\nNobody knew why Howl had this change of heart — but it was for the better."
    voice "se/z03125.ogg"
    "但不是当代的历史。他书写旧王室，以及他们的行事之道。\n仿佛他体内的灵对自己的所作所为感到了悔恨。\n没人知道豪尔为何会有这样的转变——但这是好事。"

# game/script.rpy:115001
translate chinese map326_6b117772:

    # voice "se/z03126.ogg"
    voice "se/z03126.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:115003
translate chinese map326_a5ac5e4c:

    # "Howl was easily able to balance his writing duties with those of being your advisor.\nBecause of all the spirits inside of him, he was known as a man of great wisdom.\nAnd that wisdom, over time, helped guide Alestia into an age of prosperity."
    "豪尔轻松地在写作职责与顾问职责之间取得平衡。\n由于体内寄宿着众多灵，他被视为极富智慧之人。\n而这份智慧，随着时间推移，引领阿莱斯蒂亚步入了繁荣的时代。"

# game/script.rpy:115008
translate chinese map326_9be56318:

    # voice "se/z03127.ogg"
    voice "se/z03127.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:115010
translate chinese map326_70ea6d25:

    # "As he wasn't appointed as your advisor, he had plenty of time to complete that task.\nHis writings would be placed in The Grand Library, and go on to be read by almost everybody.\nIt helped solidify that The Rebellion was correct. The Triumvirate did {i}not{/i} deserve to rule Alestia."
    "由于他未被任命为你的顾问，他有充裕的时间完成那项工作。\n他的著作被收藏进大图书馆，后来几乎人人都会读到。\n它帮助巩固了反抗军是正确的这一认知。三人执政团{i}不{/i}配统治阿莱斯蒂亚。"

# game/script.rpy:115016
translate chinese map326_f356786a:

    # voice "se/z03128.ogg"
    voice "se/z03128.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:115018
translate chinese map326_c644ece6:

    # "With your sacrifice, Howl ended up being Ulric's advisor instead.\nThe two seemed to see eye-to-eye on most issues, and ruled with harmony.\nHowl ensured that he wrote about you as well. You were just as important to him."
    "由于你的牺牲，豪尔最终转而成了乌尔里克的顾问。\n两人在多数问题上似乎心意相通，执政和睦。\n豪尔也确保写下关于你的文字。你对他同样重要。"

# game/script.rpy:115023
translate chinese map326_05bc6c67:

    # voice "se/z03129.ogg"
    voice "se/z03129.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:115025
translate chinese map326_a1598aaf:

    # "However, he chose to write about you and your sacrifice as well.\nIn his eyes, you were an extension of his kind as well — and very important.\nHe called you the bridge between worlds, and attributed victory almost entirely to you."
    "然而，他也选择书写你与你的牺牲。\n在他眼中，你也是他族类的延伸——而且至关重要。\n他称你为世界之间的桥梁，并把胜利几乎完全归功于你。"

# game/script.rpy:115029
translate chinese map326_39ca60ac:

    # voice "se/z03130.ogg"
    voice "se/z03130.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:115031
translate chinese map326_4aea8b48:

    # "Thanks to your efforts, Howl was able to live a happy life.\nHe was rarely seen outside of the castle, and mostly stuck to writing.\nBut to him, it was worth it in order to teach the world more about his kind."
    "多亏你的努力，豪尔得以过上幸福的生活。\n他很少在城堡外露面，大多时间都埋头写作。\n但对他而言，只要能让世界更多了解他的族类，这一切都值得。"

# game/script.rpy:115047
translate chinese map327_7d4260a2:

    # voice "se/z03131.ogg"
    voice "se/z03131.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:115049
translate chinese map327_04dc0e4a:

    # "Giving Howl his independence came at the cost of his life.\nHowever, he knew the chances of dying were high when he asked.\nPeople would say that you made the right choice by granting him his wish."
    "给予豪尔自由，代价是他的生命。\n然而，他提出请求时就知道生还的机会渺茫。\n人们会说，你成全他的心愿是正确的选择。"

# game/script.rpy:115055
translate chinese map327_2abf403d:

    # voice "se/z03132.ogg"
    voice "se/z03132.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:115057
translate chinese map327_c88ef395:

    # "But since you appointed him as your advisor, there was now a gap to fill.\nFor a while, your work was stressful and incredibly overwhelming.\nIt was thanks to the help of your friends that you prevailed."
    "但由于你任命他为顾问，如今空出了一个位置需要填补。\n有一段时间，你的工作压力巨大，令人不堪重负。\n多亏朋友们的帮助，你才挺了过来。"

# game/script.rpy:115062
translate chinese map327_6076cf86:

    # voice "se/z03133.ogg"
    voice "se/z03133.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:115064
translate chinese map327_34975a16:

    # "The loss of Howl meant the loss of one of your key allies.\nFor a while, your work was stressful and incredibly overwhelming.\nIt was thanks to the help of your friends that you prevailed."
    "失去豪尔，意味着失去了一位关键的盟友。\n有一段时间，你的工作压力巨大，令人不堪重负。\n多亏朋友们的帮助，你才挺了过来。"

# game/script.rpy:115068
translate chinese map327_8dc3a91a:

    # voice "se/z03134.ogg"
    voice "se/z03134.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:115070
translate chinese map327_6b5faf45:

    # "Many mourned the loss of Howl in the battle for Alestia.\nHis wealth of knowledge about The Monarchy would've filled books.\nHowever, his kind is now all but extinct — a casualty of this ruthless war."
    "许多人为豪尔在阿莱斯蒂亚之战中的牺牲而哀悼。\n他关于王室的渊博知识本足以写满许多书。\n然而，他的族类如今几乎灭绝——这场残酷战争的牺牲品。"

# game/script.rpy:115086
translate chinese map325_fc147131:

    # voice "se/z03122.ogg"
    voice "se/z03122.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:115088
translate chinese map325_d81fcc80:

    # "True to his word, Sovy was never seen again after the trip back to Mazeo.\nSeemingly lost to history, nobody was able to confirm what had happened to him.\nHowever, for almost an eternity — sightings of a man resembling him had been reported."
    "他信守承诺，在返回马泽奥的旅途之后，索维再未现身。\n他似乎湮没于历史之中，无人能证实他究竟遭遇了什么。\n然而，在近乎永恒的时间里——不断有人报告见到一名与他相似的男子。"

# game/script.rpy:115091
translate chinese map325_ff4b0152:

    # voice "se/z03123.ogg"
    # "This man had always fought enemies of The Monarchy, ensuring your legacy continued.\nIf it truly {i}was{/i} Sovy, then perhaps his claims of defecting from The Triumvirate were true.\nBut as nobody could prove his true identity, this was simply a matter of conjecture and debate."
    voice "se/z03123.ogg"
    "这名男子始终与王室的敌人作战，确保你的遗志得以延续。\n如果他{i}真的{/i}是索维，那或许他脱离三人执政团的说法就是真的。\n但由于无人能证实他的真实身份，这终究只是猜测与争论。"

# game/script.rpy:115113
translate chinese map323_a5833ef1:

    # voice "se/z03103.ogg"
    voice "se/z03103.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:115115
translate chinese map323_19f425a5:

    # "Damek fell during the battle in Balteus, and it was a tragic loss.\nA massive blow to morale made your victory seem somewhat hollow.\nAfter all, were it not for Damek, things would've never gotten this far."
    "达梅克在巴尔泰乌斯之战中阵亡，这是惨痛的损失。\n士气的重创让你的胜利显得有些空洞。\n毕竟，若不是达梅克，一切根本走不到这一步。"

# game/script.rpy:115118
translate chinese map323_07564b21:

    # voice "se/z03104.ogg"
    # "He was remembered posthumously for his strategical genius.\nIt was incredible how he led The Rebellion after Salus' passing.\nA memorial service was held, and almost every soldier showed up."
    voice "se/z03104.ogg"
    "他身后因战略天赋而被铭记。\n萨鲁斯离世后，他领导反抗军的方式令人惊叹。\n一场追悼会举行了，几乎每位士兵都到场了。"

# game/script.rpy:115125
translate chinese map323_c13c5172:

    # voice "se/z03106.ogg"
    voice "se/z03106.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:115127
translate chinese map323_72659caf:

    # "You were crushed at the loss of Damek. Your closest ally, and lover.\nThough your time together was short, you never got over the loss of your relationship.\nIt was beautiful though, how even in a time of war, love could prevail as much as it did."
    "达梅克的牺牲让你痛彻心扉。你最亲密的盟友，也是你的爱人。\n尽管你们相处的时间短暂，你始终未能走出这段感情带来的失落。\n但也美得动人——即便在战争年代，爱仍能如此顽强地绽放。"

# game/script.rpy:115132
translate chinese map323_f4358a29:

    # voice "se/z03105.ogg"
    voice "se/z03105.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:115134
translate chinese map323_56bed9a5:

    # "You were crushed at the loss of Damek, one of your closest allies.\nThough your time together was short, you formed an intense bond.\nEven during a time of war, friendships were able to form and blossom."
    "达梅克的牺牲让你痛彻心扉。你最亲密的盟友之一。\n尽管你们相处的时间短暂，却结下了深厚的情谊。\n即便在战争年代，友谊也能萌发、绽放。"

# game/script.rpy:115140
translate chinese map323_a384785a:

    # voice "se/z03109.ogg"
    voice "se/z03109.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:115142
translate chinese map323_e6f5cbd0:

    # "Everybody was shocked at losing both you and Damek during the war.\nTwo of the key players were no longer alive to enjoy their hard-fought victory.\nUlric took over as the King in your absence, but never forgot his closest friends."
    "战争中同时失去你和达梅克，让所有人震惊。\n两位关键人物已无法活着享受苦战得来的胜利。\n乌尔里克在你缺席时接任国王，但从未忘记他最亲密的朋友们。"

# game/script.rpy:115145
translate chinese map323_a79d0b08:

    # voice "se/z03110.ogg"
    # "The love that you formed with Damek during the war would go down in history.\nA testament to how bonds can flourish even in the darkest of times. A true legend.\nIt was a shame, many thought, that neither of your survived to grow that love even further."
    voice "se/z03110.ogg"
    "你在战争中与达梅克结下的爱，将载入史册。\n它见证了羁绊如何在最黑暗的时刻依然绽放。一段真正的传奇。\n许多人认为，可惜你们两人都没能活下来，让这份爱更进一步。"

# game/script.rpy:115151
translate chinese map323_336c0a1c:

    # voice "se/z03107.ogg"
    voice "se/z03107.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:115153
translate chinese map323_e6f5cbd0_1:

    # "Everybody was shocked at losing both you and Damek during the war.\nTwo of the key players were no longer alive to enjoy their hard-fought victory.\nUlric took over as the King in your absence, but never forgot his closest friends."
    "战争中同时失去你和达梅克，让所有人震惊。\n两位关键人物已无法活着享受苦战得来的胜利。\n乌尔里克在你缺席时接任国王，但从未忘记他最亲密的朋友们。"

# game/script.rpy:115156
translate chinese map323_0d0c51d2:

    # voice "se/z03108.ogg"
    # "The friendship you formed with Damek during the war would go down in history.\nA testament to how bonds can flourish even in the darkest of times. A true legend.\nIt was a shame, many thought, that neither of your survived to grow that bond even further."
    voice "se/z03108.ogg"
    "你在战争中与达梅克结下的友谊，将载入史册。\n它见证了羁绊如何在最黑暗的时刻依然绽放。一段真正的传奇。\n许多人认为，可惜你们两人都没能活下来，让这份情谊更进一步。"

# game/script.rpy:115161
translate chinese map323_e5a59dfd:

    # voice "se/z03111.ogg"
    voice "se/z03111.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:115163
translate chinese map323_c9082759:

    # "Though Damek was lost to the war, his actions were never forgotten.\nHis job of leading The Rebellion after Salus' passing became a legend.\nWere it not for his coordination, things never would've happened as they did."
    "尽管达梅克在战争中牺牲，他的事迹从未被遗忘。\n萨鲁斯离世后他领导反抗军的作为，成了一段传奇。\n若不是他的协调调度，一切绝不会如此发展。"

# game/script.rpy:115166
translate chinese map323_5fea9fa9:

    # voice "se/z03112.ogg"
    # "After his death, all claims that he was responsible for the attack in Mazeo were dropped.\nHe was respected after his passing, and left behind a legacy of trained men and women.\nBecause of what he taught them, The Monarchy would have unparalleled military might."
    voice "se/z03112.ogg"
    "他死后，所有称他应对马泽奥袭击负责的指控都被撤销。\n他身后备受敬重，留下了训练有素的男女战士这份遗产。\n正因他的教导，王室拥有了无可匹敌的军力。"

# game/script.rpy:115189
translate chinese map328_39a6fe59:

    # voice "se/z03136.ogg"
    voice "se/z03136.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:115191
translate chinese map328_ad99f929:

    # "Airen personally oversaw the transition of his home from a tavern to a barracks.\nHe wanted to ensure that during the switch, things still met his standards and regulations.\nPeregrino became a source of immeasurable military might, and Airen oversaw all of it."
    "艾琳亲自监督自己的酒馆转为兵营的改造。\n他想确保在改建过程中，一切仍符合他的标准与规矩。\n佩雷格里诺成了一股不可估量的军事力量之源，而这一切都由艾琳监管。"

# game/script.rpy:115194
translate chinese map328_c48d368c:

    # voice "se/z03137.ogg"
    # "Though conflict was rare, Peregrino remained as the first line of defense to protect Valinorth.\nAiren realized that he hadn't lost his home at all. For home was where he and his friends resided.\nHe lived the rest of his days in this new barracks — a proud servant of The New Monarchy."
    voice "se/z03137.ogg"
    "尽管冲突罕见，佩雷格里诺依然是保卫瓦利诺斯的第一道防线。\n艾琳意识到自己根本没有失去家。因为家就在他和朋友们所在之处。\n他在这座新兵营里度过了余生——新王权骄傲的一员。"

# game/script.rpy:115200
translate chinese map328_9649218b:

    # voice "se/z03135.ogg"
    voice "se/z03135.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:115202
translate chinese map328_924540ca:

    # "Airen's tavern went on to boom in popularity, being near the birthplace of The Monarch.\nHe was forever thankful that he didn't have to give up his home like Damek had wanted.\nAs a tribute to you, he would rename the tavern in the future. His way of saying thanks."
    "艾琳的酒馆因靠近君主的出生地而日渐兴隆。\n他永远感激自己不必像达梅克当初希望的那样放弃自己的家。\n为了向你致敬，日后他将酒馆改了名。那是他表达谢意的方式。"

# game/script.rpy:115206
translate chinese map328_7f7e34c5:

    # voice "se/z03138.ogg"
    voice "se/z03138.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:115208
translate chinese map328_a42b23a4:

    # "This is where Mylus settled down, unable to decide between Mazeo and Valinorth.\nHe lived a happy and peaceful life, choosing how his remaining days played out.\nBeing free to choose what happened to him — he was never bound by duty again."
    "迈勒斯就在这里定居下来，他无法在马泽奥和瓦利诺斯之间做出选择。\n他过着幸福安宁的生活，自己决定余下的日子如何度过。\n能够自由选择自己的命运——他再也不被职责所束缚。"

# game/script.rpy:115230
translate chinese map329_e90a1b32:

    # voice "se/z03139.ogg"
    voice "se/z03139.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:115232
translate chinese map329_47327a62:

    # "After the chaos dwindled, Alex returned to Mazeo, and started a new life.\nHis treaty was honored, and pirates were forgiven for all they had done.\nAll bans were lifted, and pirates were officially employed as traders."
    "混乱平息后，亚历克斯回到马泽奥，开始了新的生活。\n他的条约得到了履行，海盗们的所作所为得到了宽恕。\n所有禁令解除，海盗被正式聘为商人。"

# game/script.rpy:115237
translate chinese map329_cee639b1:

    # voice "se/z03140.ogg"
    voice "se/z03140.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:115239
translate chinese map329_c1fb4ae1:

    # "Though Alex perished in Balteus, his treaty was posthumously honored.\nAll trade bans were lifted, and pirates were officially employed by the nation.\nThe Mazean Shipping Company, along with Mazeo, entered a new age of prosperity."
    "尽管亚历克斯在巴尔泰乌斯牺牲，他的条约仍在他身后得到履行。\n所有贸易禁令解除，海盗被国家正式聘用。\n马泽奥航运公司与马泽奥一同步入了繁荣的新时代。"

# game/script.rpy:115242
translate chinese map329_50b7e439:

    # voice "se/z03141.ogg"
    # "All criminal records were lifted, and every pirate was free to enter society as an equal.\nImprisoned pirates were released, as well — uniting families that had been torn apart.\nThis would go down in history as one of the biggest, and greatest changes to Alestia."
    voice "se/z03141.ogg"
    "所有犯罪记录被撤销，每个海盗都能以平等身份自由融入社会。\n被监押的海盗也获释了——让支离破碎的家庭得以团聚。\n这将成为阿莱斯蒂亚历史上最大、最伟大的变革之一。"

# game/script.rpy:115247
translate chinese map329_660821ba:

    # voice "se/z03142.ogg"
    voice "se/z03142.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:115249
translate chinese map329_25c90fe9:

    # "Nada was never seen again. It was assumed that she didn't agree with these changes.\nOr perhaps she was spiteful that you didn't choose to align with her demands.\nEither way, Alestia would forever remember her as a ruthless pirate lord."
    "娜达再未现身。人们推测她不认同这些变革。\n又或许，她因你没有选择迎合她的要求而心怀怨恨。\n无论如何，阿莱斯蒂亚会永远记住她这个冷酷无情的大海盗。"

# game/script.rpy:115266
translate chinese map331_e8151a01:

    # voice "se/z03148.ogg"
    voice "se/z03148.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:115268
translate chinese map331_985e67c0:

    # "After finding himself fully redeemed, Gryz returned to his office as Mayor.\nHonoring the pirate treaty he had coordinated, he helped Mazeo adjust to every change.\nHe had long since been forgiven by the people — but it was only now that he forgave himself."
    "在彻底赎清自己之后，格瑞兹重返市长之位。\n他履行自己促成的那份海盗条约，帮助马泽奥适应每一项变革。\n人民早已宽恕了他——但直到此刻，他才宽恕了自己。"

# game/script.rpy:115273
translate chinese map331_70ddf439:

    # voice "se/z03149.ogg"
    voice "se/z03149.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:115275
translate chinese map331_8f8cbb85:

    # "Gryz was a casualty of this ruthless war, but his legacy lived on.\nStepping up as Mayor of Mazeo, Lillith continued what he started.\nShe honored the pirate treaty, and helped Mazeo adjust to every change."
    "格瑞兹是这场残酷战争的牺牲品，但他的遗志延续了下来。\n莉莉丝接任马泽奥市长，继续他未竟的事业。\n她履行那份海盗条约，帮助马泽奥适应每一项变革。"

# game/script.rpy:115297
translate chinese map332_ca5c79e6:

    # voice "se/z03150.ogg"
    voice "se/z03150.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:115299
translate chinese map332_9d73bca9:

    # "The Monarch Vessels were affected by your attack on the dark idol.\nAs if offering their strength when needed the most, the excess spirits vanished.\nWhen the fog of war settled, they were left as individuals — free of pain and despair."
    "君主容器们受到了你对黑暗灵像那记攻击的影响。\n仿佛在最需要的时候献出了自己的力量，多余的灵消散了。\n当战火平息，他们作为独立的个体留存下来——摆脱了痛苦与绝望。"

# game/script.rpy:115304
translate chinese map332_4e4f0c56:

    # voice "se/z03151.ogg"
    voice "se/z03151.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:115306
translate chinese map332_193bbafd:

    # "A small ceremony was held to mourn and honor the sacrifice of your Monarch Vessels.\nThough their life on Alestia was short — they had completed enough to be known as heroes.\nBut many wondered what would've happened if they survived. Could a cure to their pain be found?"
    "人们举行了一场小小的仪式，哀悼并致敬君主容器们的牺牲。\n尽管他们在阿莱斯蒂亚的生命短暂——他们所做的一切已足以被称为英雄。\n但许多人不禁想，若他们活下来会怎样。能否找到治愈他们痛苦的办法？"

# game/script.rpy:115328
translate chinese map334_a9cd0534:

    # voice "se/z03154.ogg"
    voice "se/z03154.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:115330
translate chinese map334_e164e78e:

    # "Vivien returned to Alarinthia and led it into a new age.\nNo longer was the fate of the nation in the hands of the strong.\nAlarinthia existed in unity with The New Monarchy, and it flourished."
    "薇薇安回到了阿拉林西亚，引领它步入新的时代。\n这个国家的命运不再掌握在强者手中。\n阿拉林西亚与新王权同心共存，繁荣昌盛。"

# game/script.rpy:115333
translate chinese map334_3affde2b:

    # voice "se/z03155.ogg"
    # "Trade routes were introduced, and its ports were open to everybody.\nThe strict security and immigration process had been abolished permanently.\nHolding a ball every year, Vivien kept up the tradition of giving to the people."
    voice "se/z03155.ogg"
    "贸易路线开通了，港口向所有人敞开。\n严苛的安保与入境审查被永久废除。\n薇薇安每年举办一场舞会，延续着回馈民众的传统。"

# game/script.rpy:115337
translate chinese map334_77cc6060:

    # voice "se/z03156.ogg"
    # "One thing was for sure — Alarinthia would never be in the hands of the strong again.\nVivien lived out a long and happy life in the nation he had always dreamed of creating."
    voice "se/z03156.ogg"
    "有一点可以肯定——阿拉林西亚再也不会落入强者之手。\n薇薇安在他一直梦想缔造的国度里，度过了漫长而幸福的一生。"

# game/script.rpy:115343
translate chinese map334_375d1620:

    # voice "se/z03157.ogg"
    voice "se/z03157.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:115345
translate chinese map334_9c4f7c58:

    # "Because Vivien had perished, Ulric stood up as his Champion.\nHe helped ensure that Alarinthia remained on the path of the victorious party.\nSoon enough, it changed its ways, and existed in unity with The New Monarchy."
    "由于薇薇安牺牲，乌尔里克以他的斗士身份挺身而出。\n他帮助确保阿拉林西亚始终站在胜利一方。\n很快，它便改弦更张，与新王权同心共存。"

# game/script.rpy:115348
translate chinese map334_f6d5292b:

    # voice "se/z03158.ogg"
    # "Trade routes were introduced, and its ports were open to everybody.\nA representative of The Monarchy was elected to lead the nation into a new age.\nHolding a ball every year, Alarinthia kept up its tradition of giving back to the people."
    voice "se/z03158.ogg"
    "贸易路线开通了，港口向所有人敞开。\n一位王室的代表被推选出来，引领这个国家步入新的时代。\n阿拉林西亚每年举办一场舞会，延续着回馈民众的传统。"

# game/script.rpy:115352
translate chinese map334_152f05e3:

    # voice "se/z03159.ogg"
    # "One thing was for sure — Alarinthia would never be in the hands of the strong again.\nThough Vivien wasn't alive to enjoy this new nation, his story would live on for an eternity."
    voice "se/z03159.ogg"
    "有一点可以肯定——阿拉林西亚再也不会落入强者之手。\n尽管薇薇安未能活着看到这个新国家，他的故事将永远流传。"

# game/script.rpy:115370
translate chinese map335_5b26aedf:

    # voice "se/z03160.ogg"
    voice "se/z03160.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:115372
translate chinese map335_836cebdc:

    # "Draycu returned to Alarinthia and continued to rule it with his iron grip.\nChallengers came and went, but Draycu was always victorious in the coliseum.\nHe was known as the first ruler of Alarinthia who succumbed to old age, and natural causes."
    "德雷库回到阿拉林西亚，继续以铁腕统治。\n挑战者来来去去，德雷库却始终在竞技场中胜出。\n他被称为阿拉林西亚第一位因年迈与自然原因而离世的统治者。"

# game/script.rpy:115375
translate chinese map335_50b02c3b:

    # voice "se/z03161.ogg"
    # "After his passing, a grand tournament was held, and anybody was capable of entering.\nBecause nobody challenged Draycu, the nation would have to start with a clean slate.\nA new ruler emerged, and Alarinthia stayed largely the same for the rest of history."
    voice "se/z03161.ogg"
    "他去世后，一场盛大的锦标赛举行了，任何人都可以参加。\n因为无人挑战德雷库，这个国家只能从零开始。\n一位新的统治者产生了，此后的历史中，阿拉林西亚大体保持原样。"

# game/script.rpy:115381
translate chinese map335_50c52e98:

    # voice "se/z03162.ogg"
    voice "se/z03162.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:115383
translate chinese map335_870ffbfb:

    # "With the loss of Draycu, Alarinthia had experienced something entirely new.\nThis was the first time that a ruler had not fallen to a challenger in the coliseum.\nA new, grand tournament was held in order to find the strongest in the nation."
    "失去德雷库，让阿拉林西亚经历了全然新鲜的事。\n这是第一次有统治者没有在竞技场中败给挑战者。\n一场新的盛大锦标赛举行了，以找出全国最强之人。"

# game/script.rpy:115386
translate chinese map335_e007e21d:

    # voice "se/z03163.ogg"
    # "After a long and bloody series of matches, a new leader was appointed.\nAlarinthia remained unchanged — always in the hands of the mighty.\nIt would stay that way, until somebody else got the courage to rise up."
    voice "se/z03163.ogg"
    "经过漫长而血腥的连番较量，新的领袖被推选出来。\n阿拉林西亚依旧如故——始终掌握在强者手中。\n这种局面会一直持续下去，直到有人鼓起勇气揭竿而起。"

# game/script.rpy:115404
translate chinese map333_4bccf3da:

    # voice "se/z03152.ogg"
    voice "se/z03152.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:115406
translate chinese map333_e197b548:

    # "The Created Seers seemed to be affected by your attack on the dark idol.\nAs if offering their strength when needed the most, the energy within them vanished.\nWhen the fog of war settled, they were no longer plagued with visions. They had healthy minds."
    "你袭击黑暗灵像的举动，似乎影响到了那些人造先知。\n仿佛在最需要的时刻献出了自己的力量，他们体内的能量就此消散。\n当战火平息，他们不再被幻象折磨，心智恢复了健全。"

# game/script.rpy:115411
translate chinese map333_cf5e5c14:

    # voice "se/z03153.ogg"
    voice "se/z03153.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:115413
translate chinese map333_b8ed78ac:

    # "A small ceremony was held to mourn and honor the sacrifice of your Created Seers.\nThough their life on Alestia was short — they had completed enough to be known as heroes.\nBut many wondered what would've happened if they survived. Could their minds have been saved?"
    "人们举行了一场小小的仪式，悼念并致敬你那些人造先知的牺牲。\n尽管他们在阿莱斯蒂亚的生命很短暂——但他们的成就已足以被誉为英雄。\n但许多人不禁想，若他们活下来会怎样。他们的心智还能被拯救吗？"

# game/script.rpy:115435
translate chinese map330_8402e9de:

    # voice "se/z03143.ogg"
    voice "se/z03143.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:115437
translate chinese map330_94c51a33:

    # "After the chaos dwindled, Nada returned to Mazeo to retrieve her end of the bargain.\nEvery pirate was forgiven for their crimes, and followed Nada to her new, powerful nation.\nWith trade bans lifted, her new nation quickly became more powerful than Mazeo."
    "混乱平息后，娜达回到马泽奥，索取她应得的那份报酬。\n每一名海盗的罪行都被赦免，他们追随娜达，投奔了她那崭新的强国。\n随着贸易禁令解除，她的新国家迅速变得比马泽奥更为强大。"

# game/script.rpy:115440
translate chinese map330_d17be67a:

    # voice "se/z03144.ogg"
    # "The Mazean Shipping Company simply couldn't compete with such skilled individuals.\nThe discretion and speed associated with working a life of crime gave her team the advantage.\nShe eventually amassed enough to purchase the company, and she dominated the industry."
    voice "se/z03144.ogg"
    "马泽奥航运公司根本无法与这些身怀绝技的人抗衡。\n游走于犯罪生涯所练就的谨慎与迅捷，让她的人马占尽优势。\n她最终积攒下足够的财富买下了这家公司，从此独霸整个行业。"

# game/script.rpy:115446
translate chinese map330_bd48028a:

    # voice "se/z03145.ogg"
    voice "se/z03145.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:115448
translate chinese map330_b56db620:

    # "Though Nada perished in Balteus, her end of the treaty was posthumously honored.\nA new nation was created, splitting Mazeo in half. A nation where pirates could live in freedom.\nTheir criminal records were expunged, and they began a new life, all thanks to Nada's efforts."
    "尽管娜达殒命于巴尔泰乌斯，但她那部分条约仍被追认履行。\n一个崭新的国家就此诞生，将马泽奥一分为二。那是一个海盗得以自由生活的国度。\n他们的犯罪记录被抹去，从此开启新的人生——这一切都要归功于娜达的努力。"

# game/script.rpy:115451
translate chinese map330_ccac8b35:

    # voice "se/z03146.ogg"
    # "With their expertise and knowledge on secret routes, they quickly became the new masters.\nOverpowering The Mazean Shipping company, all trading was now under their watchful eyes.\nLifted trade bans and clean criminal records combined to help them dominate the industry."
    voice "se/z03146.ogg"
    "凭着一身本领和对秘密航路的了解，他们很快成为新的霸主。\n他们压倒了马泽奥航运公司，所有贸易如今都在他们的监视之下。\n贸易禁令的解除与清白的档案，共同助他们称霸了整个行业。"

# game/script.rpy:115456
translate chinese map330_5f71e358:

    # voice "se/z03147.ogg"
    voice "se/z03147.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:115458
translate chinese map330_0e4a586a:

    # "Alex didn't seem interested in this new pirate utopia, however.\nWith his criminal record erased, he started to enjoy life like everybody else.\nEventually offering to serve The New Monarchy's naval army, he became a general."
    "不过，亚历克斯似乎对这个新的海盗乌托邦毫无兴趣。\n犯罪记录被抹去后，他开始像其他人一样享受生活。\n最终，他主动请缨效力于新王权的海军，成为了一名将军。"

# game/script.rpy:115475
translate chinese map336_ce9b2ac0:

    # voice "se/z03164.ogg"
    voice "se/z03164.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:115477
translate chinese map336_83ad6685:

    # "Shane was never seen again after that fateful encounter in Balteus.\nHe is presumed dead, and many refuse to speak about his betrayal.\nIf he survived, he went to great lengths to remain hidden from the world."
    "自巴尔泰乌斯那场命中注定的遭遇之后，肖恩便再未现身。\n人们推定他已死，许多人也不愿再提起他的背叛。\n如果他活了下来，那他必定费尽心机，隐匿于世。"

# game/script.rpy:115482
translate chinese map336_50084660:

    # voice "se/z03165.ogg"
    voice "se/z03165.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:115484
translate chinese map336_9f2ebc2d:

    # "Shane was killed in action during the final assault on Balteus.\nMany members of The New Monarchy refused to speak about his betrayal.\nThe wounds he inflicted in your cause were grievous, and his justice was served."
    "肖恩在攻打巴尔泰乌斯的最后一场战斗中阵亡。\n新王权的许多成员都不愿再提起他的背叛。\n他给你们的事业造成的创伤极其沉重，而他已得到应有的审判。"

# game/script.rpy:115501
translate chinese map337_2b82db74:

    # voice "se/z03166.ogg"
    voice "se/z03166.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:115503
translate chinese map337_b0bb809f:

    # "When the chaos and confusion settled down, Halin seemed like a new man.\nHe likened his existence to that of a spectator watching a performance.\nNo matter what he wanted to do, his body could not defy his Masters."
    "当混乱与困惑平息下来，哈林仿佛变成了另一个人。\n他将自己的存在比作一名观看表演的旁观者。\n无论他想做什么，他的身体都无法违抗他的主人们。"

# game/script.rpy:115506
translate chinese map337_8242b832:

    # voice "se/z03167.ogg"
    # "He decided to atone for what he had done, and joined The New Monarchy.\nOf course, many people were apprehensive about accepting his aid.\nOver time, they learned to accept him and his desires as genuine."
    voice "se/z03167.ogg"
    "他决定为自己所做的一切赎罪，并加入了新王权。\n当然，许多人都对接受他的帮助心存疑虑。\n随着时间推移，他们渐渐学会接受他，也相信他的心意是真诚的。"

# game/script.rpy:115510
translate chinese map337_e9c2c0f8:

    # voice "se/z03168.ogg"
    # "His job stayed largely the same — ensuring that Alestia's rulers remained in power.\nBut with new masters, and even new friends, he took pride in being on the right side."
    voice "se/z03168.ogg"
    "他的职责大体上没变——确保阿莱斯蒂亚的统治者们稳坐权位。\n但有了新的主人，甚至新的朋友，他为自己站在正确的一边而自豪。"

# game/script.rpy:115516
translate chinese map337_05cd03eb:

    # voice "se/z03169.ogg"
    voice "se/z03169.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:115518
translate chinese map337_329b53e2:

    # "Halin fell during the final assault on Balteus — by your hands.\nWhen his true nature came to light, many wondered if you made the right choice.\nCould he have been liberated? And if so, could he ever be trusted? Nobody knew."
    "哈林在攻打巴尔泰乌斯的最后一场战斗中倒下——死于你手。\n当他的真实身份浮出水面，许多人开始怀疑你是否做对了选择。\n他本可以被解放吗？若能，他又是否值得信任？没人知道。"

# game/script.rpy:115521
translate chinese map337_5eae313e:

    # voice "se/z03170.ogg"
    # "But some would say that this was for the best, and the public moved on to believe it.\nWith a history of moles and defectors in this war — risks were too dangerous.\nDifficult choices needed to be made. You were all too familiar with that fact."
    voice "se/z03170.ogg"
    "但有人会说这样对大家都好，民众也渐渐接受了这种说法。\n这场战争中向来不乏内奸与叛徒——风险实在太过危险。\n必须做出艰难的抉择。你对这个事实再清楚不过了。"

# game/script.rpy:115538
translate chinese map338_dbbeeee1:

    # voice "se/z03171.ogg"
    voice "se/z03171.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:115540
translate chinese map338_59ebfba3:

    # "With the dark idol gone from Balteus, the corruption slowly waned.\nOver the next several decades, it made a complete transformation.\nMany would call it the most beautiful place in all of Alestian history."
    "黑暗灵像从巴尔泰乌斯消失后，腐化之力渐渐消退。\n在接下来的数十年里，它完成了彻底的蜕变。\n许多人称它为阿莱斯蒂亚历史上最美的地方。"

# game/script.rpy:115543
translate chinese map338_918c57d5:

    # voice "se/z03172.ogg"
    # "Its name was changed to \"New Balteus\", and left behind its old roots.\nNo longer would it be known as the seat of the tyrannical Triumvirate.\nPeople would see it as the place where Alestia was changed forever."
    voice "se/z03172.ogg"
    "它被更名为“新巴尔泰乌斯”，彻底告别了它的旧日根基。\n它不再是那个暴虐的三人执政团盘踞之地。\n在人们心中，这里是阿莱斯蒂亚被彻底改变的地方。"

# game/script.rpy:115547
translate chinese map338_882af28d:

    # voice "se/z03173.ogg"
    # "People would come from all over the world to see the home of The New Monarchy.\nIt became a symbol of new beginnings — teaching people that change is always possible.\nAs the corruption slowly disappeared, people settled down and turned it into a prosperous nation."
    voice "se/z03173.ogg"
    "人们从世界各地前来，只为一睹新王权的家园。\n它成了新生的象征——教导人们，改变永远都是可能的。\n随着腐化渐渐褪去，人们在此安顿下来，将它变成了一片繁荣的国土。"

# game/script.rpy:115553
translate chinese map338_ffa75fe6:

    # voice "se/z03174.ogg"
    voice "se/z03174.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:115555
translate chinese map338_d5661701:

    # "You were loved by all of your subjects, and led the world into a new age.\nBut guiding everybody to the bright future you secured would be a journey of its own.\nAnd knowing that fact made one thing clear — your work had only just begun."
    "你深受所有子民的爱戴，引领世界迈入了一个崭新的时代。\n但引导所有人走向你所开创的光明未来，本身也是一段漫长的旅程。\n明白这一点，有一件事便再清楚不过——你的工作才刚刚开始。"

# game/script.rpy:115560
translate chinese map338_d458cef9:

    # voice "se/z03175.ogg"
    voice "se/z03175.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:115562
translate chinese map338_7cce56c7:

    # "You were successful in your aspirations. You left behind an entirely changed world.\nThe members of The Rebellion that survived had a new, even bigger journey before them.\nIt was time to lead the world into the bright future you secured. For them, work had only just begun."
    "你的抱负都已实现。你留下了一个彻底改变的世界。\n幸存下来的反抗军成员，面前还有一段更宏大、更艰巨的旅程。\n是时候引领世界走向你开创的光明未来了。对他们来说，工作才刚刚开始。"

# game/script.rpy:115566
translate chinese map338_92f74e40:

    # voice "se/z03176.ogg"
    voice "se/z03176.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:115568
translate chinese map338_f0bb177c:

    # "Thank you for your service, Monarch.\nFor everything you've done, you will never be forgotten."
    "感谢你的付出，君主。\n你所做的一切，将永远被人铭记。"

# game/script.rpy:115611
translate chinese map340_cd4d4744:

    # "I stumble down the stairs, making my way to the atrium.{w}\nHolding the destroyed Blade of Exodus, I use it for support.{w}\nIt would never jeopardize the future of other innocent worlds."
    "我踉跄着走下楼梯，朝中庭走去。{w}\n我握着已被毁去的放逐之刃，靠它支撑着身体。{w}\n它再也不会危及其他无辜世界的未来。"

# game/script.rpy:115613
translate chinese map340_9937fc09:

    # "But I start to wonder if I may have made the wrong decision.{w}\nI used the blade to temporarily destroy that idol. It wasn't gone for good.{w}\nWherever it ended up in the future, how would {i}they{/i} fight it off...?"
    "但我开始怀疑，自己是不是做错了决定。{w}\n我用那把剑暂时摧毁了那尊灵像。它并未就此彻底消失。{w}\n无论它将来流落到哪里，{i}他们{/i}又该如何抵御它……？"

# game/script.rpy:115615
translate chinese map340_4ddbbb5f:

    # "Or maybe, not having to rely on the Blade of Exodus was a good thing.{w}\nMaybe the next world it plagued could create another means to destroy it.{w}\nAll I knew for sure, was that the blade was destroyed, and Alestia was safe."
    "又或者，不必再依赖放逐之刃，反而是件好事。{w}\n也许它将要祸害的下一个世界，能创造别的办法来摧毁它。{w}\n我唯一确定的是，剑已毁去，而阿莱斯蒂亚安全了。"

# game/script.rpy:115617
translate chinese map340_f25287c5:

    # "As I move, I see flashes. Almost like I'm having visions.{w}\nI know I couldn't see the future, but for a moment, it felt like I did.{w}\nI can't explain it, but it felt like I knew what became of our lives."
    "我一边前行，一边看到闪烁的画面。几乎像是在看见幻象。{w}\n我知道自己无法预见未来，但那一刻，感觉就像真的看见了。{w}\n我无法解释，但我感觉自己知道我们的人生后来变成了什么样。"

# game/script.rpy:115619
translate chinese map340_d2518a05:

    # "At least, those that survived.{w}\nIf it {i}was{/i} a vision, then I take it as one final gift."
    "至少，是那些活下来的人。{w}\n如果这{i}真的{/i}是幻象，那我就把它当作最后的礼物。"

# game/script.rpy:115621
translate chinese map340_1f8e5093:

    # "When I arrive back at the entrance, I see exactly who I expected.{w}\nJust as we had planned, everybody made their way here after the battle.{w}\nIt takes a few seconds before they notice me, but they all quickly approach me."
    "当我回到入口时，看到的人正是我所预料的那些。{w}\n正如我们事先计划的那样，战后所有人都来到了这里。{w}\n过了几秒他们才发现我，但很快就都围了上来。"

# game/script.rpy:115649
translate chinese map340_31a3a713:

    # voice "se/z03185.ogg"
    voice "se/z03185.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:115651
translate chinese map340_10f7775b:

    # char_fortaime "[firstname]! I'm so glad you made it.\nWhen the castle started shaking, I feared for the worst.\nI'm just glad I got to ring that bell. I saved {i}so{/i} many lives!"
    char_fortaime "[firstname]！我真高兴你平安回来了。\n城堡开始摇晃的时候，我还以为最坏的情况要发生了。\n我真庆幸自己敲响了那口钟。我救了{i}那么{/i}多条命！"

# game/script.rpy:115666
translate chinese map340_cb90c590:

    # voice "se/z03186.ogg"
    voice "se/z03186.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:115668
translate chinese map340_c2113a9f:

    # char_valessa "I'll admit, I was starting to worry as well.\nSorry if you were scared when we parted ways earlier.\nBut thanks to those daggers, they didn't stand a chance."
    char_valessa "我承认，我也开始担心了。\n之前我们分开的时候，要是让你害怕了，我很抱歉。\n但多亏了那些匕首，他们根本不堪一击。"

# game/script.rpy:115683
translate chinese map340_4651d715:

    # voice "se/pro76.ogg"
    voice "se/pro76.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:115685
translate chinese map340_95aafe0e:

    # char_pro "I'm not gonna lie, I was almost dead meat.\nIf it weren't for Gryz, I would've been a goner for sure.\nAnd here I thought that I preferred sneaking alone. Heh."
    char_pro "不骗你，我差点就没命了。\n要不是格瑞兹，我肯定就完蛋了。\n我还一直以为自己更喜欢独自潜行呢。呵。"

# game/script.rpy:115700
translate chinese map340_a34e22d0:

    # voice "se/sovy83.ogg"
    voice "se/sovy83.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:115702
translate chinese map340_067c8c21:

    # char_sovy "I'm glad that you saw it through to the end, [firstname].\nSomething told me that helping you was the right thing to do.\nAfter today, I can rest easy knowing that I made the right choice."
    char_sovy "我很高兴你坚持到了最后，[firstname]。\n我总觉得，帮你是个正确的决定。\n过了今天，我就能安心地知道自己选对了。"

# game/script.rpy:115723
translate chinese map340_55e3d241:

    # "Then, I see Ulric approach me from the other side.{w}\nIt was good to see him alive. I can tell that he's super happy.{w}\nAll the stress and worry seemed to melt away from the room when I arrived."
    "这时，我看见乌尔里克从另一边朝我走来。{w}\n看到他还活着真好。看得出他特别开心。{w}\n我一到场，房间里所有的紧张与担忧仿佛都烟消云散了。"

# game/script.rpy:115748
translate chinese map340_ee4897a3:

    # voice "se/z03189.ogg"
    voice "se/z03189.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:115750
translate chinese map340_4f3aafd0:

    # char_ulric "Everything went as planned?\nI bet you have some pretty interesting stories to tell.\nSave it for later though, there's a lot of work to do."
    char_ulric "一切按计划进行吗？\n我敢打赌，你肯定有不少有趣的故事要讲。\n不过还是留到以后吧，我们还有很多事要做。"

# game/script.rpy:115765
translate chinese map340_7d58b415:

    # voice "se/z03190.ogg"
    voice "se/z03190.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:115767
translate chinese map340_9f23e540:

    # char_howl "Seeing you again is certainly a welcome surprise, [firstname].\nYou hold the honor of being the one who took down The Triumvirate.\nWear that badge with pride. You've guided the world to a perfect future."
    char_howl "能再次见到你，真是个意外的惊喜，[firstname]。\n你肩负着扳倒三人执政团的那份荣耀。\n带着这份勋章骄傲地活下去吧。你引领世界走向了完美的未来。"

# game/script.rpy:115782
translate chinese map340_759501c4:

    # voice "se/z03191.ogg"
    voice "se/z03191.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:115784
translate chinese map340_503f67e0:

    # char_damek "You'll never guess what happened, [firstname]!\nJust as I was about to fall in battle, Shane came to my rescue.\nI'm not sure where he is now, but I've sent out a search party."
    char_damek "你绝对猜不到发生了什么，[firstname]！\n就在我快要战死的时候，肖恩赶来救了我。\n我不知道他现在在哪，但我已经派出搜救队了。"

# game/script.rpy:115805
translate chinese map340_d2a21a07:

    # "Everybody gathers around me, looking at the broken blade.{w}\nI guess there was no point in holding onto it anymore.{w}\nI throw it to the ground. I'd never use it again."
    "众人围拢到我身边，注视着那把断裂的剑。{w}\n我想，再留着它也没什么意义了。{w}\n我把它扔在地上。我永远不会再用它。"

# game/script.rpy:115807
translate chinese map340_0a3ed319:

    # "But I consider it a blessing that I'd never {i}need{/i} to.{w}\nI survived, and The Blade of Exodus was no more."
    "但我庆幸自己永远不必{i}需要{/i}它。{w}\n我活了下来，而放逐之刃已不复存在。"

# game/script.rpy:115809
translate chinese map340_f675ae1c:

    # "Nobody would ever again be tempted and seduced by its power.{w}\nI did my part, and for that, it was time that I got some rest."
    "再也不会有人被它的力量所诱惑、所蛊惑。{w}\n我已尽了自己的本分，现在，是时候歇一歇了。"

# game/script.rpy:115834
translate chinese map340_c2250826:

    # voice "se/z03192.ogg"
    voice "se/z03192.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:115836
translate chinese map340_eb28e92e:

    # char_fortaime "Wait. Rest...?\nYou know there won't be any time for that, right?\nYou're the ruler of this world, now. There's still so much left to do."
    char_fortaime "等等。歇一歇……？\n你知道根本没时间让你歇吧？\n你现在是这个世界的主宰。还有太多事要做。"

# game/script.rpy:115861
translate chinese map340_c34cc0b8:

    # voice "se/z03193.ogg"
    voice "se/z03193.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:115863
translate chinese map340_364dd129:

    # char_ulric "He's right. Taking down The Triumvirate was just the first step.\nWe need to tell the people what happened, and earn their loyalty."
    char_ulric "他说得对。扳倒三人执政团只是第一步。\n我们得告诉民众发生了什么，并赢得他们的忠诚。"

# game/script.rpy:115888
translate chinese map340_74555940:

    # voice "se/z03194.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "But it won't be all bad, right...?\nI mean, we'll have your back the entire time."
    voice "se/z03194.ogg"
    char_fortaime "但也不会全是坏事，对吧……？\n我是说，我们会一直支持你的。"

# game/script.rpy:115903
translate chinese map340_165dcf77:

    # "I let out a soft laugh, but then stumble over.{w}\nFortaime and Ulric grab onto me, and support me.{w}\nI guess I wasn't holding up as well as I thought."
    "我轻笑了一声，却忽然踉跄了一下。{w}\n福泰姆和乌尔里克扶住我，把我撑了起来。{w}\n看来我并没有自己以为的那样撑得住。"

# game/script.rpy:115931
translate chinese map340_79f7822c:

    # voice "se/z03195.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Whoa – watch your step, [firstname].\nHere, let's find you a place to sit down."
    voice "se/z03195.ogg"
    char_ulric "哇——当心脚下，[firstname]。\n来，我们给你找个地方坐下。"

# game/script.rpy:115957
translate chinese map340_6180bac3:

    # voice "se/z03196.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "Yeah, then we can talk about what happens next.\nRemember, this isn't the end. It's just the beginning."
    voice "se/z03196.ogg"
    char_fortaime "对，然后我们再商量接下来怎么办。\n记住，这不是结束。这只是开始。"

# game/script.rpy:115984
translate chinese map340_0d497c36:

    # "I smile, as I remain in the arms of my comrades.{w}\nThey didn't know what happened next, but I still felt like I did.{w}\nAnd Fortaime was right. It was a new beginning – for every Alestian."
    "我微笑着，依偎在同伴们的臂弯里。{w}\n他们不知道接下来会发生什么，但我依然觉得自己知道。{w}\n福泰姆说得对。这是一个新的开始——属于每一个阿莱斯蒂亚人。"

# game/script.rpy:116017
translate chinese map341_5e074e32:

    # "My vision fades in, and I feel incredibly confused.{w}\nWith everything that just happened, I should definitely be dead.{w}\nActually, maybe I was. Far be it from me to decide what death brought."
    "我的视线渐渐清晰，心中满是困惑。{w}\n经历了刚刚的一切，我按理说肯定已经死了。{w}\n其实，也许我确实死了。死亡带来什么，也轮不到我来断定。"

# game/script.rpy:116019
translate chinese map341_cca773ef:

    # "I know that I'm in my house. That much is easily discernible.{w}\nAfter rising up to a sitting position, though, I notice something shocking.{w}\nThe lower half of my arm is still missing. Could I have survived...?"
    "我认得出来自己在家里。这一点很容易分辨。{w}\n可当我撑起身子坐起来后，却注意到一件令人震惊的事。{w}\n我手臂的下半截依然不见踪影。难道我活下来了……？"

# game/script.rpy:116021
translate chinese map341_606b9bcd:

    # "No. That was impossible. So what's going on, exactly...?{w}\nAs my mind starts to fill with possibilities, there's a knock at my door.{w}\nI'm filled with fright. But then, a moment later, I hear a familiar voice."
    "不。那不可能。那到底是怎么回事……？{w}\n当各种猜测开始在我脑中涌现，门外传来了敲门声。{w}\n我满是恐惧。但片刻之后，我听到了一个熟悉的声音。"

# game/script.rpy:116027
translate chinese map341_2251597f:

    # voice "se/z03177.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "Hey – open up!"
    voice "se/z03177.ogg"
    char_fortaime "嘿——开门！"

# game/script.rpy:116030
translate chinese map341_d03d472e:

    # "I rush to the door, and Fortaime steps inside of my house.{w}\nMy heart is beating so fast. Then, joy overtakes me.{w}\nI give Fortaime a big hug, and he seems surprised."
    "我冲向门口，福泰姆走进了我的家。{w}\n我的心跳得飞快。紧接着，喜悦淹没了我。{w}\n我给了福泰姆一个大大的拥抱，他看上去有些惊讶。"

# game/script.rpy:116055
translate chinese map341_fbe33b2f:

    # voice "se/z03178.ogg"
    voice "se/z03178.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:116057
translate chinese map341_2dbf8fcd:

    # char_fortaime "Did you just wake up...!?\nOh jeeze, I hope we won't be late.\nDon't tell me you forgot what day it is!"
    char_fortaime "你才刚醒吗……！？\n哦天哪，希望我们不会迟到。\n别告诉我你忘了今天是什么日子！"

# game/script.rpy:116071
translate chinese map341_bff7b2a9:

    # "Huh...?"
    "嗯……？"

# game/script.rpy:116096
translate chinese map341_043fd32a:

    # voice "se/z03179.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "It's the anniversary of your induction!\nIf we don't hurry to the Town Square, we'll be late.\nSalus is already under {i}enough{/i} stress, having to train Mylus."
    voice "se/z03179.ogg"
    char_fortaime "是你受封的周年纪念日！\n要是我们不快点赶到城镇广场，就要迟到了。\n萨卢斯光是训练迈勒斯，就已经够{i}头疼{/i}了。"

# game/script.rpy:116111
translate chinese map341_123dfa59:

    # "Salus is alive...?"
    "萨鲁斯还活着……？"

# game/script.rpy:116138
translate chinese map341_edbb5468:

    # voice "se/z03180.ogg"
    voice "se/z03180.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:116140
translate chinese map341_2a61360f:

    # char_fortaime "So come on, we need to get going.\nYour parents are counting on me, [firstname].\nI told them to give me ten minutes, tops!"
    char_fortaime "所以快走吧，我们得出发了。\n你父母都指望我呢，[firstname]。\n我跟他们说了，最多给我十分钟！"

# game/script.rpy:116145
translate chinese map341_35b7cc93:

    # voice "se/z03181.ogg"
    voice "se/z03181.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:116147
translate chinese map341_2a61360f_1:

    # char_fortaime "So come on, we need to get going.\nYour parents are counting on me, [firstname].\nI told them to give me ten minutes, tops!"
    char_fortaime "所以快走吧，我们得出发了。\n你父母都指望我呢，[firstname]。\n我跟他们说了，最多给我十分钟！"

# game/script.rpy:116163
translate chinese map341_51af8a97:

    # "My... parents...?{w}\nI'm in complete shock, and I stand there, dumbfounded.{w}\nA small eternity passes, before Fortaime breaks the silence."
    "我……的父母……？{w}\n我完全惊呆了，呆呆地站在原地。{w}\n仿佛过了漫长的一瞬，福泰姆才打破沉默。"

# game/script.rpy:116188
translate chinese map341_6b9be806:

    # voice "se/z03182.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "Well don't just stand there! You need to get ready!\nAt this rate, you'll be greeting the townspeople in your underwear.\nI mean, you can if you want to. But I {i}really{/i} don't recommend that."
    voice "se/z03182.ogg"
    char_fortaime "别光站在那儿啊！你得去准备一下！\n再这样下去，你就要穿着内衣去迎接镇上的居民了。\n我是说，你想那样也行。但我{i}真的{/i}不建议。"

# game/script.rpy:116203
translate chinese map341_f78383f7:

    # "I don't know what's going on. Am I in a new reality...?{w}\nThe Elder is alive, as well as my parents; {i}and{/i} I've been inducted?{w}\nThis means that The Rebellion was never formed. There was no occupation."
    "我不知道发生了什么。我是不是身处一个新的现实……？{w}\n长老还活着，我的父母也是；{i}而且{/i}我还受了封？{w}\n这意味着反抗军从未成立。也从未有过占领。"

# game/script.rpy:116205
translate chinese map341_73d0ca28:

    # "Tears start streaming from my eyes, and I give Fortaime a bigger hug.{w}\nI don't know what happened, exactly, but I'm not about to question it.{w}\nIf this was the reward for my journey, and sacrifice, then it was worth it."
    "泪水开始从我眼中涌出，我给了福泰姆一个更紧的拥抱。{w}\n我搞不清到底发生了什么，但我不打算去质疑它。{w}\n如果这是我一路旅程与牺牲换来的回报，那就值得。"

# game/script.rpy:116230
translate chinese map341_4f632298:

    # voice "se/z03183.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "Whoa – hey! Calm down."
    voice "se/z03183.ogg"
    char_fortaime "哇——嘿！冷静点。"

# game/script.rpy:116245
translate chinese map341_e6f95915:

    # "I cry even harder, and Fortaime can't help but show worry."
    "我哭得更厉害了，福泰姆忍不住露出担忧的神色。"

# game/script.rpy:116273
translate chinese map341_58943ab2:

    # voice "se/z03184.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "Hey, wait, are you okay...?"
    voice "se/z03184.ogg"
    char_fortaime "嘿，等等，你还好吗……？"

# game/script.rpy:116295
translate chinese map341_b1d8fd2c:

    # "I nod, and tell him that everything is fine.{w}\nAnd this time, something tells me it will stay that way."
    "我点点头，告诉他一切都好。{w}\n而这一次，我有种预感，一切都会一直好下去。"

# game/script.rpy:116841
translate chinese map283_48e8c76b:

    # "I invite Valessa into my room, since she seems unable to get to sleep.{w}\nThat seems to be the case with almost everybody. We were too worried to sleep.{w}\nShe scans the room, taking in all the sights. It really was an impressive place to behold."
    "我邀请瓦莱莎进我的房间，因为她似乎怎么也睡不着。{w}\n几乎所有人都这样。我们太过担忧，难以入眠。{w}\n她环视房间，把每一处都看了个遍。这里确实是个令人叹为观止的地方。"

# game/script.rpy:116866
translate chinese map283_6faaa3bc:

    # voice "se/z02500.ogg"
    voice "se/z02500.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:116868
translate chinese map283_5f7c6c00:

    # char_valessa "This room is pretty cool, [firstname].\nIt makes sense that you'd get it, too.\nMust feel good, being royalty and all."
    char_valessa "这房间挺酷的，[firstname]。\n你会分到它也是理所当然。\n当王室成员的感觉一定不错吧。"

# game/script.rpy:116881
translate chinese map283_45e8435a:

    # voice "se/z02501.ogg"
    # char_valessa "I'm pretty confident after hearing Damek's plan.\nI get to follow you to the castle too, so that makes me happy.\nYou can trust me to have your back if anything bad happens."
    voice "se/z02501.ogg"
    char_valessa "听完达梅克的计划，我相当有信心。\n我还能跟着你一起进城堡，这让我很开心。\n要是出了什么坏事，你尽管放心，有我在你身后。"

# game/script.rpy:116896
translate chinese map283_a94715df:

    # "Let's hope it doesn't come to that."
    "但愿不会到那一步。"

# game/script.rpy:116921
translate chinese map283_7a02a805:

    # voice "se/z02502.ogg"
    # char_valessa "I've been practicing with those daggers I got from Mazeo, actually.\nThey took some getting used to, but I think I can hold my own.\nNot that those suits of armor require much to take down."
    voice "se/z02502.ogg"
    char_valessa "其实我一直在拿从马泽奥弄来的那些匕首练习。\n用起来花了我些时间才习惯，但我觉得我能应付。\n倒不是说那些铠甲有多难对付。"

# game/script.rpy:116936
translate chinese map283_e0ace492:

    # "It's true. They were pretty weak.{w}\nThe Triumvirate focused on quantity, not quality.{w}\nHopefully that would be their downfall as we proceeded."
    "没错。它们确实很弱。{w}\n三人执政团注重的是数量，而非质量。{w}\n但愿随着我们推进，这会是他们的致命弱点。"

# game/script.rpy:116961
translate chinese map283_bfdd3afd:

    # voice "se/z02503.ogg"
    # char_valessa "To be honest, I'm really scared that we might not survive.\nI mean, victory usually comes at a cost. But what will we pay...?\nIf I make it out of this without my friends, I'll just feel so hollow."
    voice "se/z02503.ogg"
    char_valessa "老实说，我真的很怕我们可能活不下来。\n我是说，胜利通常都要付出代价。可我们要付出什么呢……？\n如果活下来的我却失去了朋友们，那我只会觉得空落落的。"

# game/script.rpy:116967
translate chinese map283_be701a1e:

    # voice "se/z02504.ogg"
    voice "se/z02504.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:116969
translate chinese map283_a0b03f5c:

    # char_valessa "Especially since I'm expected to lead Valinorth after all of this is over.\nWithout you and Fortaime, I'd just feel so lost in this world.\nYou give me strength; and I'll be needing that strength."
    char_valessa "尤其是等这一切结束后，我还得去领导瓦利诺斯。\n没有你和福泰姆，我只会觉得在这世上迷失了方向。\n你给我力量；而我正需要这份力量。"

# game/script.rpy:116983
translate chinese map283_9029d1db:

    # "I tell her that I'm not planning on going anywhere.{w}\nWhatever comes next, we'd handle it as a team.{w}\nWe didn't come this far just to perish in the end."
    "我告诉她，我没打算去任何地方。{w}\n无论接下来发生什么，我们都会共同面对。{w}\n我们走了这么远，不是为了在最后殒命。"

# game/script.rpy:116988
translate chinese map283_bf7f702b:

    # voice "se/z02505.ogg"
    voice "se/z02505.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:116990
translate chinese map283_d21179e6:

    # char_valessa "I want to help fix Mazeo, but I don't want to do it alone.\nIt's up to us to help undo the damage inflicted by our parents.\nWith you in the throne, I think we could do it pretty easily."
    char_valessa "我想帮忙修复马泽奥，但我不想独自去做。\n弥补我们父辈造成的伤害，是我们义不容辞的责任。\n有你在王座上，我想我们能轻轻松松做到。"

# game/script.rpy:117004
translate chinese map283_5280c363:

    # "She seems really fixated on helping Mazeo. Almost obligated, even.{w}\nIt makes sense, since she feels that our families are responsible for a lot.{w}\nWhen I took the throne, I'm sure I'd be able to help her out. It's a good cause."
    "她似乎一心想着帮助马泽奥。甚至像是觉得责无旁贷。{w}\n这说得通，因为在她看来，我们的家族要负很大责任。{w}\n等我登上王座，我一定能帮她一把。这是件好事。"

# game/script.rpy:117030
translate chinese map283_a21a0ddf:

    # voice "se/z02506.ogg"
    voice "se/z02506.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:117032
translate chinese map283_88468acc:

    # char_valessa "I really need to stop thinking so far ahead.\nThis is the eve of our final battle. I should focus on that.\nGetting lost in thought on the battlefield would be the death of me."
    char_valessa "我真的不能再想得那么远了。\n这是我们决战的前夜。我该把心思放在眼前。\n在战场上走神，会要了我的命。"

# game/script.rpy:117045
translate chinese map283_7c6e7ac2:

    # voice "se/z02507.ogg"
    # char_valessa "So let's just enjoy this moment, shall we?\nThis might be the last time we're able to hang out.\nI'd hate to tarnish it by freaking out and acting stupid."
    voice "se/z02507.ogg"
    char_valessa "所以，我们就好好享受此刻，好吗？\n这也许是我们最后一次能这样相处了。\n我可不想因为自己抓狂犯傻，把这一刻毁了。"

# game/script.rpy:117060
translate chinese map283_df8fdca5:

    # "I tell her that it's fine — I enjoy her company regardless.{w}\nBesides, I'm sharing a lot of the same worry. We're in this together.{w}\nWhen we met up to launch the attack, we'd have no idea what came next."
    "我告诉她没关系——无论如何，我都很享受有她相伴。{w}\n况且，我也怀着一模一样的担忧。我们同在一条船上。{w}\n等我们集结发起进攻时，谁也不知道接下来会发生什么。"

# game/script.rpy:117085
translate chinese map283_07aaa9d9:

    # voice "se/z02508.ogg"
    # char_valessa "Well, at least I don't feel so alone anymore.\nFortaime is always so carefree, no matter what happens.\nTalking to him, you'd never guess that we could all die here."
    voice "se/z02508.ogg"
    char_valessa "至少我不再觉得那么孤单了。\n福泰姆无论发生什么，总是那么漫不经心。\n和他聊天，你根本想不到我们都可能死在这里。"

# game/script.rpy:117099
translate chinese map283_87447d28:

    # voice "se/z02509.ogg"
    # char_valessa "Before I stop being so gloomy, can you promise me one thing?\nIt'll make me feel a lot better — and morale is what we need right now."
    voice "se/z02509.ogg"
    char_valessa "在我停止这么消沉之前，你能答应我一件事吗？\n这会让我的心情好很多——而此刻我们正需要士气。"

# game/script.rpy:117114
translate chinese map283_4b79382f:

    # "I nod — but it's really dependent on what the favor entails."
    "我点点头——但这其实取决于她要求的是什么。"

# game/script.rpy:117141
translate chinese map283_9ab5b142:

    # voice "se/z02510.ogg"
    voice "se/z02510.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:117143
translate chinese map283_d33f16d0:

    # char_valessa "If I do end up dying out there, I just want Valinorth to be okay.\nCan you promise me that you'll find a capable Elder to replace me?\nThey don't have to share my views. I just want our home to prosper."
    char_valessa "如果我真的死在外面，我只希望瓦利诺斯安然无恙。\n你能答应我，会找一位能干的继任者来接替我当长老吗？\n对方不必和我见解一致。我只希望我们的家园能够兴旺。"

# game/script.rpy:117157
translate chinese map283_d714c34d:

    # "I nod. That's definitely something I could do for her.{w}\nThat is — if I survived. But I don't display such doubt right now.{w}\nIt's best that I try to look strong and resolute for all of my allies."
    "我点点头。这绝对是我能为她做的事。{w}\n前提是——我能活下来。但此刻我不能流露出这种疑虑。{w}\n对所有盟友，我最好都表现出坚强与坚定。"

# game/script.rpy:117184
translate chinese map283_11fa2b83:

    # voice "se/z02511.ogg"
    voice "se/z02511.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:117186
translate chinese map283_4240d495:

    # char_valessa "If I do end up dying out there, can you help repair Mazeo?\nI just want to see a happy nation. It's gone through so much.\nOur parents hurt it — so we should be the ones who mend it."
    char_valessa "如果我真的死在外面，你能帮忙修复马泽奥吗？\n我只想看到一个幸福的国度。它已经承受了太多。\n我们的父辈伤害了它——所以我们该是抚平它的人。"

# game/script.rpy:117200
translate chinese map283_d714c34d_1:

    # "I nod. That's definitely something I could do for her.{w}\nThat is — if I survived. But I don't display such doubt right now.{w}\nIt's best that I try to look strong and resolute for all of my allies."
    "我点点头。这绝对是我能为她做的事。{w}\n前提是——我能活下来。但此刻我不能流露出这种疑虑。{w}\n对所有盟友，我最好都表现出坚强与坚定。"

# game/script.rpy:117229
translate chinese map283_c945ebb5:

    # voice "se/z02512.ogg"
    voice "se/z02512.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:117231
translate chinese map283_6f132dcb:

    # char_valessa "Good. Then we can move on to better things.\nYou know, I've been thinking about how far we've come.\nI've seen so much, and I feel like a totally different person."
    char_valessa "那就好。这样我们就能继续做更重要的事了。\n你知道吗，我一直在想我们走了多远。\n我见识了太多，觉得自己已经彻底变了个人。"

# game/script.rpy:117234
translate chinese map283_68c126d2:

    # voice "se/z02513.ogg"
    # char_valessa "I wonder what would've happened if things were different.\nWhat if your induction ceremony wasn't cancelled? \nWhat if you never got that deceiving vision...?"
    voice "se/z02513.ogg"
    char_valessa "我在想，如果一切不同，会是什么样子。\n如果你的受封仪式没有被取消呢？\n如果你从未看到那个骗人的幻象呢……？"

# game/script.rpy:117255
translate chinese map283_b29d979d:

    # "She steps forward and places her hands in mine."
    "她上前一步，把双手放进我的掌心。"

# game/script.rpy:117280
translate chinese map283_85320370:

    # voice "se/z02514.ogg"
    # char_valessa "Would we still be as close as we are right now?\nYou know, that moment we shared in Mazeo was so special.\nGiven time — I want this bond to grow even stronger. Do you?"
    voice "se/z02514.ogg"
    char_valessa "我们还会像现在这样亲密吗？\n你知道吗，我们在马泽奥共度的那段时光，是那么特别。\n假以时日——我希望这份羁绊能变得更加深厚。你呢？"

# game/script.rpy:117295
translate chinese map283_4f11821f:

    # "I nod. I made the choice to pursue this relationship, after all.{w}\nBut she's right. We might not be this close if not for all the hardships.{w}\nAt least it's proof that even in war, beautiful things can still happen."
    "我点点头。毕竟，是我选择了去追求这段感情。{w}\n但她说得对。若不是经历了那些磨难，我们或许不会这般亲密。{w}\n至少这证明了，即便在战争中，美好的事依然可能发生。"

# game/script.rpy:117320
translate chinese map283_300481c2:

    # voice "se/z02515.ogg"
    # char_valessa "I don't want to rush this and do something stupid.\nPart of me wants to, given the circumstances — but we shouldn't.\nLet's just make a vow. We'll both survive, and take things slow."
    voice "se/z02515.ogg"
    char_valessa "我不想操之过急，做出什么蠢事。\n在这样的处境下，我有一半的心思很想——但我们不该那样。\n我们就立个誓吧。我们都要活下来，然后慢慢来。"

# game/script.rpy:117335
translate chinese map283_f66bfd90:

    # "With a smile, she squeezes my hands, and I do so in return.{w}\nTaking a step forward, she places a soft kiss on my cheek.{w}\nI smile back, and wrap my arms around her as tight as I can."
    "她微笑着捏了捏我的手，我也回握了她。{w}\n她上前一步，在我脸颊上轻轻落下一吻。{w}\n我笑着回应，尽我所能地紧紧抱住她。"

# game/script.rpy:117360
translate chinese map283_9898f826:

    # voice "se/z02516.ogg"
    # char_valessa "I really hope we make it through this..."
    voice "se/z02516.ogg"
    char_valessa "我真心希望我们能挺过这一关……"

# game/script.rpy:117375
translate chinese map283_3c927521:

    # "I try not to get sad, but my eyes tear up ever so slightly.{w}\nHugging her tighter, I rub my hands up and down her back.{w}\nWe've come too far to lose each other. That's what I tell her."
    "我努力不让自己难过，眼眶却还是微微泛红。{w}\n我把她抱得更紧，双手在她背上来回轻抚。{w}\n我们走到今天不容易，绝不能失去彼此。我就是这么告诉她。"

# game/script.rpy:117390
translate chinese map283_32e5e712:

    # voice "se/z02517.ogg"
    # char_valessa "Thank you..."
    voice "se/z02517.ogg"
    char_valessa "谢谢你……"

# game/script.rpy:117408
translate chinese map283_53fb8450:

    # "A few moments later, we break the hug.{w}\nBut when I do, I feel closer than we ever have before."
    "片刻之后，我们松开了拥抱。{w}\n但松开的那一刻，我却觉得我们比以往任何时候都更亲近。"

# game/script.rpy:117423
translate chinese map283_9aacdc4b:

    # voice "se/z02518.ogg"
    voice "se/z02518.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:117425
translate chinese map283_9bb4a6b3:

    # char_valessa "Who would we be — if not for all that's happened so far?\nI mean, we were simple residents of Valinorth just a while back.\nBut now, we stand in Balteus, ready to fight the rulers of the world."
    char_valessa "若不是经历了迄今为止的一切，我们会是什么样的人？\n我是说，不久前我们还只是瓦利诺斯普通的居民。\n可如今，我们站在巴尔泰乌斯，准备对抗这个世界的统治者。"

# game/script.rpy:117428
translate chinese map283_a4c0ab10:

    # voice "se/z02519.ogg"
    # char_valessa "I wouldn't believe it if I didn't see it unfold right in front of me.\nBut you know, I'm not sure which version of myself I'd rather be.\nIt's not an easy thing — knowing how twisted the world truly is."
    voice "se/z02519.ogg"
    char_valessa "若不是亲眼看着它在我眼前展开，我绝不会相信。\n但你知道吗，我也说不清自己更愿意做哪一个版本的我。\n得知这个世界究竟有多扭曲——这并不容易接受。"

# game/script.rpy:117443
translate chinese map283_bd9a2033:

    # "That's a tough call. I don't know which version of myself I'd rather be, either.{w}\nIt makes me think back on where I started, and where I am right now.{w}\nPutting the whole journey into perspective, I realize how I've changed."
    "这确实很难说。我也说不清自己更愿意做哪一个版本的我。{w}\n这让我回想起自己从哪里出发，又身处何方。{w}\n把整个旅程放在一起看，我才意识到自己改变了多少。"

# game/script.rpy:117468
translate chinese map283_37b9756d:

    # voice "se/z02520.ogg"
    # char_valessa "Obviously we can't go back and change anything...\nBut it's just weird to think about; and it was all out of our control.\nLet's hope that after this, we can take things in the direction {i}we{/i} want."
    voice "se/z02520.ogg"
    char_valessa "显然我们无法回到过去改变什么……\n但光是想想就很奇怪；而且这一切都不在我们的掌控之中。\n但愿经历了这些之后，我们能朝着{i}自己{/i}想要的方向前进。"

# game/script.rpy:117482
translate chinese map283_d7f750b7:

    # voice "se/z02521.ogg"
    # char_valessa "The people will be free to live as they please.\nThey'll never have to lose their homes, or comply with tyrants.\nIf that's the end goal here — then I'd say our changing was worth it."
    voice "se/z02521.ogg"
    char_valessa "人们将自由地按自己的意愿生活。\n他们再也不必失去家园，或屈从于暴君。\n如果这就是最终的目标——那我会说，我们的改变是值得的。"

# game/script.rpy:117497
translate chinese map283_3b5e31ab:

    # "Thinking of it that way, I agree. I'm just glad we haven't changed {i}too{/i} much.{w}\nWith how grey things can get during war — some people commit atrocities.{w}\nI'd to my best to be a just ruler, even if I wouldn't be able to please everybody."
    "这么一想，我表示同意。我只是庆幸我们还没有变得{i}太过{/i}不同。{w}\n考虑到战争中事情会变得多么黑白难辨——有些人会犯下暴行。{w}\n我会尽力做一个公正的统治者，即便我无法让所有人都满意。"

# game/script.rpy:117526
translate chinese map283_2ecb91ca:

    # voice "se/z02522.ogg"
    voice "se/z02522.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:117528
translate chinese map283_b2ac8c11:

    # char_valessa "Thank you so much for inviting me over, [firstname].\nI feel a lot better than I did just a few minutes ago.\nI guess I'll see you when we gather to launch the attack?"
    char_valessa "非常感谢你邀请我过来，[firstname]。\n我感觉比几分钟前好多了。\n那我们集合发起进攻的时候再见？"

# game/script.rpy:117549
translate chinese map283_e940401d:

    # "I nod. That time was fast approaching.{w}\nI see her out of the room, and let out a huge sigh.{w}\nTalking to my friends — for maybe the last time? It's crushing me."
    "我点点头。那个时刻正迅速逼近。{w}\n我送她出了房间，长长地叹了口气。{w}\n和朋友们交谈——也许是最后一次？这让我心碎。"

# game/script.rpy:117551
translate chinese map283_18063776:

    # "But if I didn't, and they perished — I'd regret it forever.{w}\nThat's the excuse I give myself for enduring this pain.{w}\nTurning to face the big open room, I wonder what's next."
    "但如果我不这么做，而他们却死了——我会后悔一辈子。{w}\n这就是我用来忍受这份痛苦的理由。{w}\n转身面对这间空旷的大屋，我不知道接下来会怎样。"

# game/script.rpy:117574
translate chinese map284_5e47b18a:

    # "A knock sounds at my door, and I open it without hesitation.{w}\nFortaime is there. He looks a bit upset, so I invite him inside.{w}\nLooking around the room, he lets out a loud and anxious sigh."
    "门外传来敲门声，我毫不犹豫地打开了门。{w}\n福泰姆站在那里。他看上去有些不安，我便请他进来。{w}\n他环顾房间，发出了一声响亮而焦虑的叹息。"

# game/script.rpy:117599
translate chinese map284_5bd0bdf8:

    # voice "se/z02523.ogg"
    voice "se/z02523.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:117601
translate chinese map284_ea18ddca:

    # char_fortaime "I'm gonna be honest, [firstname].\nI'm scared. Terrified. I don't know what's gonna happen.\nI mean, climbing The Triumvirate's castle? That's insane."
    char_fortaime "老实跟你说，[firstname]。\n我害怕。我怕得要命。我不知道会发生什么。\n我是说，去爬三人执政团的城堡？那简直疯了。"

# game/script.rpy:117604
translate chinese map284_770a1025:

    # voice "se/z02524.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "Not to mention that the entire battle hinges on my success.\nI have those metallic claws, but I don't know how much that'll help.\nTheir castle is probably made of stone — like this library is."
    voice "se/z02524.ogg"
    char_fortaime "更别说整场战斗都取决于我的成败。\n我有那些金属爪，但我不知道能有多大用。\n他们的城堡多半是石头砌的——就像这座图书馆一样。"

# game/script.rpy:117619
translate chinese map284_c108e0c3:

    # "He starts pacing around the room, with extreme worry."
    "他开始在房间里踱来踱去，满脸极度的忧虑。"

# game/script.rpy:117644
translate chinese map284_7de14dba:

    # voice "se/z02525.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "What if I fall? What if I get shot by an arrow?\nIf anything gets in the way, I might not be able to do this.\nI require extreme focus, you know. This is too much."
    voice "se/z02525.ogg"
    char_fortaime "要是我掉下去怎么办？要是我中箭怎么办？\n只要有任何东西挡道，我可能就做不到了。\n要知道，我需要极度专注。这太难了。"

# game/script.rpy:117659
translate chinese map284_860452d7:

    # "I can imagine that climbing during a battle is hard.{w}\nNormally, the only danger he'd have to worry about is falling off.{w}\nBut during this, he'd be a huge target for any archers nearby. "
    "我能想象，在战斗中攀爬有多难。{w}\n平时他唯一要担心的危险，就是从上面摔下来。{w}\n可在这场战斗里，他会成为附近任何弓箭手的巨大靶子。"

# game/script.rpy:117684
translate chinese map284_da32f05e:

    # voice "se/z02526.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "Sorry to come here and panic like this.\nIt {i}could{/i} end up being our last night together, after all.\nThere are probably way better ways to spend it than this."
    voice "se/z02526.ogg"
    char_fortaime "抱歉跑来跟你这样惊慌失措。\n毕竟，这{i}可能{/i}会是我们共度的最后一晚。\n本该有远比这更好的方式来度过。"

# game/script.rpy:117699
translate chinese map284_708fe1ea:

    # "He stops pacing around, and stops right in front of me.{w}\nTaking slow breaths, I can tell he's trying to calm down.{w}\nI let him have his time, and he's back to normal pretty fast."
    "他停下踱步，正好停在我面前。{w}\n缓缓地呼吸着，我看得出他在努力平静下来。{w}\n我任由他自己调整，他很快就恢复了常态。"

# game/script.rpy:117729
translate chinese map284_cc643ba6:

    # voice "se/z02527.ogg"
    voice "se/z02527.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:117731
translate chinese map284_a074303a:

    # char_fortaime "Okay Fortaime, you got this.\nYou're gonna climb the tower, and ring the bell of retreat.\nYou'll help win the battle, and return to Valinorth as a hero."
    char_fortaime "好了福泰姆，你能行的。\n你要爬上那座塔，敲响撤退的钟。\n你会帮我们打赢这场仗，然后作为英雄回到瓦利诺斯。"

# game/script.rpy:117734
translate chinese map284_7624e7fa:

    # voice "se/z02528.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "Trust me, I never forgot that you appointed me as The Elder.\nI'll do my best to lead Valinorth in the right direction, I promise.\nBut if I don't make it, you'll have to find someone else to lead."
    voice "se/z02528.ogg"
    char_fortaime "相信我，我从未忘记是你任命我为长老的。\n我保证，会尽力引领瓦利诺斯走上正确的方向。\n但如果我没能活下来，你就得另找一个人来领导了。"

# game/script.rpy:117748
translate chinese map284_36e07e5a:

    # voice "se/z02529.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "I know you're gonna tell me not to worry.\nI know you're going to say that everything will be fine.\nBut that's not true. We all need to be realistic here."
    voice "se/z02529.ogg"
    char_fortaime "我知道你会叫我别担心。\n我知道你会说一切都会好起来。\n但那不是真的。我们在这里都得现实一点。"

# game/script.rpy:117769
translate chinese map284_f968324e:

    # voice "se/z02530.ogg"
    voice "se/z02530.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:117771
translate chinese map284_e7f9bf92:

    # char_fortaime "You know, I've been thinking about what I should do after the war.\nAnd I think I want to move to Mazeo. I want to help the nation reform.\nIt's been hurt so much, even by our parents. It deserves happiness."
    char_fortaime "你知道吗，我一直在想战后该做什么。\n我想我可能会搬去马泽奥。我想帮那个国家重整旗鼓。\n它受的伤太重了，连我们的父辈都伤害过它。它理应得到幸福。"

# game/script.rpy:117774
translate chinese map284_ec71d31b:

    # voice "se/z02531.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "Valessa has her calling as the next Elder of Valinorth.\nI'd be your Scribe, if visions weren't becoming a thing of the past.\nAt the end of the day, it seems like the smartest choice for me to make."
    voice "se/z02531.ogg"
    char_fortaime "瓦莱莎有自己的使命，要做瓦利诺斯的下一任长老。\n如果预言不再有用，我本可以做你的书记官。\n说到底，这似乎是我能做出的最明智的选择。"

# game/script.rpy:117788
translate chinese map284_506da3a4:

    # voice "se/z02532.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "That is, if I don't die during the battle tomorrow.\nI know what you're going to say. \"Don't worry — you'll be fine.\"\nI wish that were true, but it's not. We need to be realistic here."
    voice "se/z02532.ogg"
    char_fortaime "前提是，我明天不会战死。\n我知道你要说什么。“别担心——你会没事的。”\n我也希望那是真的，可它不是。我们得现实一点。"

# game/script.rpy:117803
translate chinese map284_97cc0b75:

    # voice "se/z02533.ogg"
    voice "se/z02533.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:117805
translate chinese map284_9823a84f:

    # char_fortaime "There's a chance that we could lose this war tomorrow.\nThere's a chance that all of us could die. A really big chance.\nWe're not immortal. We need to face the facts, not live in denial."
    char_fortaime "我们明天有可能输掉这场战争。\n我们所有人都有可能死去。而且可能性很大。\n我们并非不死之身。得直面事实，而不是活在否认之中。"

# game/script.rpy:117808
translate chinese map284_fcd5d178:

    # voice "se/z02534.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "They're all out there in the atrium with so much confidence.\nBut I know that deep down inside, they're scared too.\nWe all have something we're afraid of, you know?"
    voice "se/z02534.ogg"
    char_fortaime "他们都在中庭里，个个信心满满。\n但我知道，他们内心深处也同样害怕。\n我们都有害怕的东西，你知道吗？"

# game/script.rpy:117829
translate chinese map284_ea237f35:

    # "He steps forward and wraps his arms around me.{w}\nI can feel him tremble. I return the hug with a tight squeeze."
    "他上前一步，张开双臂抱住了我。{w}\n我能感觉到他在发抖。我紧紧地回抱了他。"

# game/script.rpy:117844
translate chinese map284_a19bdc8a:

    # voice "se/z02535.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "You know — it's not death that scares me, [firstname].\nIt's the thought of never seeing you again that pains my heart.\nI don't want to lose you. I've never been so scared in my life."
    voice "se/z02535.ogg"
    char_fortaime "你知道吗——让我害怕的不是死亡，[firstname]。\n而是想到再也见不到你，才让我心痛。\n我不想失去你。我这一生从没这么害怕过。"

# game/script.rpy:117859
translate chinese map284_7b69db4a:

    # "I tell him that I'm not planning on going anywhere.{w}\nAfter the war, we can settle down together, and be happy."
    "我告诉他，我没打算去任何地方。{w}\n战争结束后，我们可以一起安顿下来，幸福地生活。"

# game/script.rpy:117874
translate chinese map284_92b794ac:

    # voice "se/z02536.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "You can't be certain of that, though...\nJust like I can't be certain that {i}I'll{/i} survive.\nAll we can do is try — and hope for the best."
    voice "se/z02536.ogg"
    char_fortaime "可你没法确定这一点……\n就像我也无法确定{i}自己{/i}一定能活下来。\n我们能做的只是尽力而为——然后祈求最好的结果。"

# game/script.rpy:117888
translate chinese map284_bb6aca47:

    # voice "se/z02537.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "So promise me {i}one{/i} thing. No heroics, okay?\nNo grand acts of sacrifice. No trading your life.\nThis world needs you after the war. {i}I{/i} need you."
    voice "se/z02537.ogg"
    char_fortaime "所以答应我{i}一件{/i}事。别逞英雄，好吗？\n不要什么壮烈的牺牲。不要拿自己的命去换。\n战后这个世界需要你。{i}我{/i}需要你。"

# game/script.rpy:117903
translate chinese map284_7852d480:

    # "He starts shaking less, and we break the hug.{w}\nBut I agree, and tell him I'll try my best to comply."
    "他的颤抖渐渐平息，我们松开了拥抱。{w}\n但我答应了，并告诉他我会尽力做到。"

# game/script.rpy:117928
translate chinese map284_d65c37ae:

    # voice "se/z02538.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "The thought of a world without you is almost too much to bear.\nI love you. I'll {i}always{/i} love you. I just hope we get a happy ending.\nAfter all we've been through, I think we deserve it — don't you?"
    voice "se/z02538.ogg"
    char_fortaime "一想到没有你的世界，我几乎就无法承受。\n我爱你。我会{i}永远{/i}爱你。我只希望我们能有幸福的结局。\n经历了这一切之后，我觉得我们值得拥有——你不觉得吗？"

# game/script.rpy:117946
translate chinese map284_fdcd63cc:

    # "I nod, and tell him that I love him too.{w}\nA smile appears on his face, and he immediately calms down.{w}\nI don't want to lose him either — I'm filled with all of the same frights."
    "我点点头，告诉他我也爱他。{w}\n他脸上露出笑容，立刻平静了下来。{w}\n我也不想失去他——我满心都是同样的恐惧。"

# game/script.rpy:117963
translate chinese map284_2d9dcefd:

    # "He steps forward and gives me a quick hug.{w}\nReturning it, I squeeze him before the hug is broken."
    "他上前一步，飞快地抱了我一下。{w}\n我回抱过去，在松开前用力搂了搂他。"

# game/script.rpy:117978
translate chinese map284_58ebf081:

    # voice "se/z02539.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "You know — it's not death that scares me, [firstname].\nIt's the thought of never seeing my friends again that hurts me.\nI don't want to lose anybody. I've never been this scared in my life."
    voice "se/z02539.ogg"
    char_fortaime "你知道吗——让我害怕的不是死亡，[firstname]。\n而是想到再也见不到我的朋友们，才让我心痛。\n我不想失去任何人。我这一生从没这么害怕过。"

# game/script.rpy:117993
translate chinese map284_a30527c6:

    # "I tell him that I'm not planning on going anywhere.{w}\nAfter the war, we'll all be together, living peacefully."
    "我告诉他，我没打算去任何地方。{w}\n战争结束后，我们会全都在一起，平静地生活。"

# game/script.rpy:118008
translate chinese map284_ec0d8127:

    # voice "se/z02540.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "You can't be certain of that, though.\nJust like I can't be certain that {i}I'll{/i} survive.\nAll we can do is try — and hope for the best."
    voice "se/z02540.ogg"
    char_fortaime "可你没法确定这一点。\n就像我也无法确定{i}自己{/i}一定能活下来。\n我们能做的只是尽力而为——然后祈求最好的结果。"

# game/script.rpy:118022
translate chinese map284_4e627856:

    # voice "se/z02541.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "So promise me {i}one{/i} thing. No heroics, okay?\nNo grand acts of sacrifice. No trading your life.\nThis world needs you after the war. We all need you."
    voice "se/z02541.ogg"
    char_fortaime "所以答应我{i}一件{/i}事。别逞英雄，好吗？\n不要什么壮烈的牺牲。不要拿自己的命去换。\n战后这个世界需要你。我们都需要你。"

# game/script.rpy:118037
translate chinese map284_90aee2e3:

    # "I agree, and tell him that I'll try my best to comply.{w}\nWe're almost at the end. It feels surreal to me."
    "我答应了，并告诉他我会尽力做到。{w}\n我们快到终点了。这一切让我觉得恍如梦境。"

# game/script.rpy:118066
translate chinese map284_8dcad224:

    # voice "se/z02542.ogg"
    voice "se/z02542.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:118068
translate chinese map284_52b3e3dc:

    # char_fortaime "I guess we'll find all of this out in a few hours anyway, right?\nIt's almost sunrise, and the battle shouldn't be too long.\nLet's change the subject. I've worried enough."
    char_fortaime "反正再过几个小时，我们就会知道这一切的结果了，对吧？\n天快亮了，这场仗应该不会打太久。\n换个话题吧。我已经担心够了。"

# game/script.rpy:118082
translate chinese map284_4c8a8077:

    # "He strikes a thinking pose, and remains silent for a few moments."
    "他摆出一副冥思的姿态，沉默了好一会儿。"

# game/script.rpy:118110
translate chinese map284_3639deb8:

    # voice "se/z02543.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "Oh, here we go! If we win, we'll have a huge party.\nA party that the world will talk about forever!\nWe can give everybody Mazean apples!"
    voice "se/z02543.ogg"
    char_fortaime "哦，有了！要是我们赢了，就办一场盛大的派对。\n一场全世界都会永远传颂的派对！\n我们可以给所有人发马泽奥苹果！"

# game/script.rpy:118125
translate chinese map284_7a0e9921:

    # "I smile — being happy that he's happy.{w}\nI tell him that we will have the biggest party the world has ever seen.{w}\nAnd if we try our best, and work together, we'll win this battle with ease."
    "我笑了——为他开心而开心。{w}\n我告诉他，我们会办一场全世界前所未见的盛大派对。{w}\n只要我们竭尽全力、齐心协力，就能轻松赢下这场战斗。"

# game/script.rpy:118150
translate chinese map284_9ae58f60:

    # voice "se/z02544.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "Sweet! Then I can't wait!\nI'll let you get back to what you were doing, [firstname].\nThis isn't goodbye, after all. We'll be seeing each other again for sure."
    voice "se/z02544.ogg"
    char_fortaime "太好了！那我可等不及了！\n我就不打扰你忙你的事了，[firstname]。\n毕竟这又不是永别。我们肯定还会再见面的。"

# game/script.rpy:118172
translate chinese map284_dc11ebf0:

    # "He leaves my room with a smile. A direct counterpoint to how he entered.{w}\nThat brings me a sense of ease. We needed to have a clear head right now.{w}\nIt's almost time for the attack. I should make wise use of the time I have left."
    "他带着笑容离开了我的房间。和他进来时的神情截然相反。{w}\n这让我感到一丝宽慰。此刻我们需要保持清醒的头脑。{w}\n进攻的时刻快到了。我该好好利用剩下的时间。"

# game/script.rpy:118195
translate chinese map286_226c3724:

    # "I invite Pro over to my room to spend some final time together.{w}\nHe has the dangerous task of infiltrating The Triumvirate's castle.{w}\nThere's no telling what would happen, and I can tell that he's scared."
    "我邀请普洛来我的房间，共度最后一段时光。{w}\n他肩负着潜入三人执政团城堡的危险任务。{w}\n谁也不知道会发生什么，我看得出他很害怕。"

# game/script.rpy:118220
translate chinese map286_1a4c7488:

    # voice "se/pro24.ogg"
    voice "se/pro24.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:118222
translate chinese map286_7a9acd0e:

    # char_pro "So, I guess this is it, huh...?\nYou know, I always thought that I'd be ready.\nBut now that we're here, I feel such apprehension."
    char_pro "那么，我猜就是现在了，是吧……？\n你知道吗，我一直以为自己会做好准备。\n可如今真到了这一步，我却感到如此忐忑。"

# game/script.rpy:118225
translate chinese map286_aadeb99d:

    # voice "se/pro25.ogg"
    # char_pro "I know the layout of their castle based on past reconnaissance. \nBut when we stole The Blade of Exodus, they weren't expecting us.\nThey know we're here, now. For us, this will be a purely uphill battle."
    voice "se/pro25.ogg"
    char_pro "根据过去的侦察，我了解他们城堡的布局。\n可当初我们偷走放逐之刃时，他们毫无防备。\n现在他们知道我们来了。对我们来说，这将是场纯粹的硬仗。"

# game/script.rpy:118240
translate chinese map286_d7d00814:

    # "He's right. We could no longer use the element of surprise.{w}\nWe had our strength, and our smarts. But would it be enough?"
    "他说得对。我们再也无法利用奇袭的优势了。{w}\n我们有力量，也有智慧。但这够吗？"

# game/script.rpy:118265
translate chinese map286_ccf9367b:

    # voice "se/pro26.ogg"
    # char_pro "Look at me, freaking out. I don't mean to bring down your morale.\nLet's change the subject, alright? Is there any wine in this place?"
    voice "se/pro26.ogg"
    char_pro "看看我，慌成这样。我不是有意打击你的士气。\n换个话题吧，好吗？这地方有酒吗？"

# game/script.rpy:118280
translate chinese map286_3340c9f5:

    # "He looks around the room, and is quickly let down."
    "他环顾房间，很快便失望了。"

# game/script.rpy:118305
translate chinese map286_cdc0d077:

    # voice "se/pro27.ogg"
    # char_pro "Of course there isn't. You know, I thought it'd be a given.\nAlgus is all alone, with nothing but his books, and imagination.\nIf there's any type of person who'd live off of wine, it'd be him."
    voice "se/pro27.ogg"
    char_pro "当然没有。你知道吗，我本以为这是理所当然的。\n阿尔古斯孤身一人，只有书和想象相伴。\n要说哪种人会靠酒过活，那肯定是他。"

# game/script.rpy:118309
translate chinese map286_602f9fbc:

    # voice "se/pro28.ogg"
    # char_pro "It's a lonely life, being a writer. It really is.\nYou pour so much emotion into it, that you almost run out.\nEveryone thinks you're giving them the cold shoulder, but you're not."
    voice "se/pro28.ogg"
    char_pro "当个作家，是种孤独的日子。真的是这样。\n你投入了太多情感，以至于几乎耗尽了自己。\n所有人都以为你在给他们冷脸，可你并没有。"

# game/script.rpy:118323
translate chinese map286_71d523af:

    # voice "se/pro29.ogg"
    # char_pro "Writing is art. Nobody questions the secluded painter, you know?\nBut the second you close yourself off to write — you're troubled.\nSo many people see it as a \"joke\" of a career choice."
    voice "se/pro29.ogg"
    char_pro "写作是门艺术。没人会去质疑一个离群索居的画家，你知道吗？\n可你一闭关写作——就成了有毛病的人。\n太多人把这种职业选择当成一个“笑话”。"

# game/script.rpy:118327
translate chinese map286_558e2cff:

    # voice "se/pro30.ogg"
    # char_pro "I almost let that get me down when I was younger.\nThey told me that a writer could never make a decent living.\nI could've easily given up. But instead, I created a legacy."
    voice "se/pro30.ogg"
    char_pro "我年轻时差点被这话击垮。\n他们告诉我，作家永远无法体面地谋生。\n我本可以轻易放弃。但我没有，反而创下了一份传世之作。"

# game/script.rpy:118342
translate chinese map286_64432e71:

    # "He lets out a loud sigh."
    "他长叹了一声。"

# game/script.rpy:118367
translate chinese map286_90d75f58:

    # voice "se/pro31.ogg"
    # char_pro "And that's what scares me.\nEven when I give up the swindling life, that won't be enough.\nEveryone will remember me for who I was — not who I am."
    voice "se/pro31.ogg"
    char_pro "而这正是我害怕的。\n即便我放弃行骗的生活，那也还不够。\n所有人都会记住过去的我——而不是现在的我。"

# game/script.rpy:118371
translate chinese map286_e7136327:

    # voice "se/pro32.ogg"
    # char_pro "And let's be honest. I'm not one of the good guys.\nI stole secrets, sold them, and ruined people's lives.\nLook at what I did to The Rebellion. That's unforgivable."
    voice "se/pro32.ogg"
    char_pro "而且老实说，我算不上什么好人。\n我偷取秘密，再转手贩卖，毁了别人的人生。\n看看我对反抗军做过的事。那是不可原谅的。"

# game/script.rpy:118386
translate chinese map286_3da64c67:

    # "He looks away from me, and shakes his head."
    "他把目光从我身上移开，摇了摇头。"

# game/script.rpy:118411
translate chinese map286_01b3b7b1:

    # voice "se/pro33.ogg"
    # char_pro "I think I might die during the attack, [firstname].\nThere's no place for me in your new, peaceful world.\nEven if I change — the harm I did will always haunt me."
    voice "se/pro33.ogg"
    char_pro "我觉得我可能会死在这场进攻中，[firstname]。\n在你那个和平的新世界里，没有我的位置。\n即便我改变了——我造成的伤害也会永远缠着我。"

# game/script.rpy:118429
translate chinese map286_9c4c95b6:

    # "He steps forward, and wraps his arms around me."
    "他上前一步，张开双臂抱住了我。"

# game/script.rpy:118454
translate chinese map286_bc86621a:

    # voice "se/pro34.ogg"
    # char_pro "I know we want to be together, but it's difficult.\nYou don't understand how many people I've wronged in the past.\nIf they seek revenge, they might just target the people I love."
    voice "se/pro34.ogg"
    char_pro "我知道我们想要在一起，但这很难。\n你不明白我过去得罪过多少人。\n如果他们来寻仇，可能会把矛头对准我爱的人。"

# game/script.rpy:118458
translate chinese map286_e664bf7f:

    # voice "se/pro35.ogg"
    # char_pro "And I don't want you to get hurt just because I was a bad person.\nI could turn a new leaf, but that doesn't mean my enemies will, too.\nIf we're together, you might always be a target. It makes me scared."
    voice "se/pro35.ogg"
    char_pro "我不想你因为我是个坏人而受到伤害。\n我可以改过自新，但这并不意味着我的仇敌也会。\n如果我们在一起，你可能永远都是目标。这让我害怕。"

# game/script.rpy:118473
translate chinese map286_d9e1636a:

    # "I smile, and return the hug. So what if Pro's enemies would give us hell?{w}\nIf the rulers of the world can't take us down — how could anyone else?{w}\nI know he's panicking, so I softly run my hands through his hair."
    "我微笑着回抱住他。普洛的仇敌会让我们日子难过又怎样？{w}\n如果这个世界的统治者都扳不倒我们——还有谁能？{w}\n我知道他正惊慌失措，便轻轻用手抚过他的头发。"

# game/script.rpy:118475
translate chinese map286_6b04174b:

    # "We're in this together. We don't run away when things get difficult.{w}\nWe'll stand strong, and handle it as a team. That's what I truly want."
    "我们同在一条船上。遇到困难，我们不会逃避。{w}\n我们会坚强地并肩而立，共同应对。这才是我真正想要的。"

# game/script.rpy:118500
translate chinese map286_0ee40c03:

    # voice "se/pro36.ogg"
    # char_pro "Together...?"
    voice "se/pro36.ogg"
    char_pro "一起……？"

# game/script.rpy:118515
translate chinese map286_a553a45c:

    # "Yeah, until the end."
    "对，直到最后。"

# game/script.rpy:118540
translate chinese map286_54988a7a:

    # voice "se/pro37.ogg"
    # char_pro "I just fear that the end is closer than we think.\nIf this could be our last night together — what do I do?\nHow do I press forward knowing that we might lose each other?"
    voice "se/pro37.ogg"
    char_pro "我只是怕这终点比我们以为的更近。\n如果这可能是我们共度的最后一晚——我该怎么办？\n明知我们可能失去彼此，我又该如何继续前行？"

# game/script.rpy:118555
translate chinese map286_6ad4455d:

    # "If this could be our last moment together, then we make it count.{w}\nI step forward, and gently push Pro against the wall behind him.{w}\nHe blushes, and looks around the room, embarrassed."
    "如果这可能是我们共度的最后一刻，那就让它有意义吧。{w}\n我上前一步，轻轻把普洛按在他身后的墙上。{w}\n他脸红了，尴尬地环顾着房间。"

# game/script.rpy:118570
translate chinese map286_4162b9e9:

    # voice "se/pro38.ogg"
    # char_pro "A-are you sure...?\nI mean, I don't want to rush anything.\nI've never really done this with anyone before."
    voice "se/pro38.ogg"
    char_pro "你、你确定吗……？\n我是说，我不想操之过急。\n我以前从没和任何人做过这种事。"

# game/script.rpy:118585
translate chinese map286_64531e54:

    # "I don't think it's rushing. It's seizing the moment.{w}\nEspecially given the fact that this could be the end.{w}\nNow, more than ever, we should do what we want."
    "我不觉得这是操之过急。这是把握当下。{w}\n尤其考虑到这可能是终局。{w}\n此刻，我们比任何时候都更该去做自己想做的事。"

# game/script.rpy:118610
translate chinese map286_c263a658:

    # voice "se/pro39.ogg"
    # char_pro "You're right. I want this."
    voice "se/pro39.ogg"
    char_pro "你说得对。我想要这个。"

# game/script.rpy:118625
translate chinese map286_682cc923:

    # "He gulps, nervous."
    "他咽了口唾沫，很紧张。"

# game/script.rpy:118650
translate chinese map286_379845f9:

    # voice "se/pro40.ogg"
    # char_pro "And if we both survive, you'll still want {i}me{/i}?\nWe can put the past behind us, and tackle the future?\nI've done a lot, you know. So your forgiveness means—"
    voice "se/pro40.ogg"
    char_pro "那如果我们都活下来，你还会想要{i}我{/i}吗？\n我们能放下过去，一起面对未来吗？\n要知道，我做过很多事。所以你的原谅意味着——"

# game/script.rpy:118675
translate chinese map286_55447fec:

    # "After a quick nod, I press my lips against his.{w}\nKeeping him pressed against the wall, we continue to kiss.{w}\nAfter pledging myself to him — we gave each other a night to remember."
    "我迅速点了点头，然后把唇贴上了他的。{w}\n我将他抵在墙上，我们继续亲吻。{w}\n在向他许下承诺之后——我们给了彼此一个难忘的夜晚。"

# game/script.rpy:118680
translate chinese map286_dc4d23e9:

    # "He turns away, and I see him tremble a little in fright."
    "他转过身去，我看见他有些害怕地微微发抖。"

# game/script.rpy:118705
translate chinese map286_fab4c5b7:

    # voice "se/pro41.ogg"
    # char_pro "I want to help you make this world a better place, [firstname].\nBut you don't understand how many people I've wronged in the past.\nIf they seek revenge, they might just target you and all of my friends."
    voice "se/pro41.ogg"
    char_pro "我想帮你把这个世界变得更美好，[firstname]。\n但你不明白我过去得罪过多少人。\n如果他们来寻仇，可能会把矛头对准你和我的所有朋友。"

# game/script.rpy:118719
translate chinese map286_bf6e26b4:

    # voice "se/pro42.ogg"
    # char_pro "And I don't want anybody to get hurt because I was a bad person.\nI could turn a new leaf, sure — but that doesn't mean my enemies will.\nIf I stay by your side, you and all of our friends will always be targets."
    voice "se/pro42.ogg"
    char_pro "我不想任何人因为我是个坏人而受到伤害。\n我确实可以改过自新——但这并不意味着我的仇敌也会。\n如果我留在你身边，你和我们所有朋友都会永远成为靶子。"

# game/script.rpy:118734
translate chinese map286_40d3bc66:

    # "I put a hand on his shoulder, and help him turn around.{w}\nSo what if his enemies tries to give us hell? We could handle it.{w}\nIf the rulers of the world can't take us down, how could anyone else?"
    "我把一只手搭在他肩上，帮他转过身来。{w}\n他的仇敌想让我们日子难过又如何？我们能应付。{w}\n如果这个世界的统治者都扳不倒我们，还有谁能？"

# game/script.rpy:118759
translate chinese map286_b7d9fd9a:

    # voice "se/pro43.ogg"
    # char_pro "You're right..."
    voice "se/pro43.ogg"
    char_pro "你说得对……"

# game/script.rpy:118774
translate chinese map286_11ebfbaa:

    # "We're all one big family. In this together, until the end."
    "我们就像一个大家庭。同舟共济，直到最后。"

# game/script.rpy:118789
translate chinese map286_bad71a11:

    # voice "se/pro44.ogg"
    # char_pro "I just fear that the end is closer than we think.\nI don't know what I'd do if I lost any of you during the final battle.\nI lost my family once. How can I expect to handle that again?"
    voice "se/pro44.ogg"
    char_pro "我只是怕这终点比我们以为的更近。\n如果在最后的战斗中我失去了你们中的任何一个，我不知道该怎么办。\n我曾经失去过一次家人。我怎么能指望自己再承受一次？"

# game/script.rpy:118804
translate chinese map286_96ce3c27:

    # "I tell him not to worry, and that everything would be fine.{w}\nWe have a solid battle plan, and I have The Blade of Exodus.{w}\nThere wasn't anything we could do to stand a better chance at winning."
    "我告诉他别担心，一切都会好起来的。{w}\n我们有周密的作战计划，而我有放逐之刃。{w}\n我们已没有别的办法能让自己胜算更大。"

# game/script.rpy:118829
translate chinese map286_7d3bcc6c:

    # voice "se/pro45.ogg"
    # char_pro "I guess that's true. Sorry, I was just freaking out.\nThat seems to be a running theme out there in the atrium.\nIt's impossible to look death in the face, and have no regrets."
    voice "se/pro45.ogg"
    char_pro "我想也是。抱歉，我刚刚就是有点慌。\n中庭那边似乎也弥漫着这种情绪。\n直面死亡时，不可能毫无遗憾。"

# game/script.rpy:118833
translate chinese map286_1d3b39ac:

    # voice "se/pro46.ogg"
    # char_pro "But, if you want me to help you rule after this war — I will.\nAnything you need, I'll always be there to serve you, [firstname].\nHopefully I can earn a pardon for all the laws I've broken in the past."
    voice "se/pro46.ogg"
    char_pro "不过，如果战后你想让我帮你治理——我愿意。\n无论你需要什么，我都会随时为你效力，[firstname]。\n但愿我能为自己过去犯下的所有罪行求得赦免。"

# game/script.rpy:118848
translate chinese map286_894d7e82:

    # "That would be easy. He's already done a lot to help us.{w}\nHe was responsible for our Alarinthian alliance, hands down.{w}\nHe's done his best to atone, and in my opinion, he succeeded."
    "那很容易。他已经帮了我们很多。{w}\n毫无疑问，阿拉林西亚的联盟正是他促成的。{w}\n他已尽力赎罪，在我看来，他成功了。"

# game/script.rpy:118850
translate chinese map286_9795c785:

    # "So I pardon him right here and now.{w}\nOn the dawn of our final battle, he'd become a new man.{w}\nNo longer a swindler, but a trusted servant of The New Monarchy."
    "所以我此刻就赦免他。{w}\n在决战黎明到来之际，他已成为一个全新的人。{w}\n不再是骗子，而是新王权值得信赖的臣仆。"

# game/script.rpy:118875
translate chinese map286_c4405278:

    # voice "se/pro47.ogg"
    # char_pro "[firstname]...?"
    voice "se/pro47.ogg"
    char_pro "[firstname]……？"

# game/script.rpy:118890
translate chinese map286_aa06b074:

    # "He looks shocked, almost in disbelief.{w}\nBut rather than question it, he nods, smiling."
    "他看上去很震惊，几乎难以置信。{w}\n但他没有再追问，只是微笑着点了点头。"

# game/script.rpy:118915
translate chinese map286_8800b13e:

    # voice "se/pro48.ogg"
    # char_pro "Thank you..."
    voice "se/pro48.ogg"
    char_pro "谢谢你……"

# game/script.rpy:118937
translate chinese map286_d94357dd:

    # "I send him off, but not before telling him one important fact.{w}\nAny enemy of him, is an enemy of The Monarchy, and will be dealt with.{w}\nHe thanks me yet again, and leaves with a resolve stronger than ever before."
    "我送他离开，但在此之前，我告诉了他一件重要的事。{w}\n任何与他为敌的人，就是与王权为敌，必将受到处置。{w}\n他再次向我道谢，带着前所未有的坚定离开了。"

# game/script.rpy:118960
translate chinese map285_90ff1d07:

    # "As I'm lost in thought, a knock at the door jolts me awake.{w}\nWithout hesitation, I open it up, and Ulric steps inside.{w}\nHe seems calm. He's seen tons of battle in his lifetime."
    "正当我陷入沉思，门外的敲门声把我惊醒。{w}\n我毫不犹豫地打开门，乌尔里克走了进来。{w}\n他看上去很平静。他这一生经历过无数战斗。"

# game/script.rpy:118985
translate chinese map285_d5d8ce36:

    # voice "se/z02570.ogg"
    voice "se/z02570.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:118987
translate chinese map285_7ef0700d:

    # char_ulric "Hey, [firstname]. I just wanted to come see you.\nWe won't be getting much sleep tonight, after all."
    char_ulric "嘿，[firstname]。我只是想来看看你。\n毕竟今晚我们都不会睡得太安稳。"

# game/script.rpy:119001
translate chinese map285_eb51d2a6:

    # "It's true; and I don't blame anybody for it.{w}\nEspecially Ulric. We were fighting his former masters.{w}\nThis would be harder on him than it would be for us."
    "确实如此；我谁都不怪。{w}\n尤其是乌尔里克。我们要对抗的，是他曾经的主人。{w}\n这对他来说，比对我们要艰难得多。"

# game/script.rpy:119026
translate chinese map285_069bd4cc:

    # voice "se/z02571.ogg"
    # char_ulric "I can't stop thinking about our visit to Alarinthia.\nYou know, I broke your nose, and I feel awful about that.\nBut I couldn't let you get in the way, and compromise our plan."
    voice "se/z02571.ogg"
    char_ulric "我一直在想我们去阿拉林西亚的那次拜访。\n你知道吗，我打碎了你的鼻子，我为此很难受。\n但我不能让你挡道，破坏我们的计划。"

# game/script.rpy:119030
translate chinese map285_024645cd:

    # voice "se/z02572.ogg"
    # char_ulric "It {i}needed{/i} to come down to just Pro and myself.\nIt was the only way that we could guarantee our victory.\nI guess I came here seeking your forgiveness. I feel foolish, though."
    voice "se/z02572.ogg"
    char_ulric "那件事{i}必须{/i}只由普洛和我两个人来做。\n那是我们确保胜利的唯一办法。\n我想，我来这里是想求得你的原谅。可我这样显得很傻。"

# game/script.rpy:119044
translate chinese map285_f435ee77:

    # voice "se/z02573.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Your forgiveness was implied when you removed that curse from me.\nI mean, you wouldn't do something like that if you resented me, right?\nBut still — having it implied? It's not the same as hearing you say it."
    voice "se/z02573.ogg"
    char_ulric "当你为我解除了那道诅咒，其实就已经表明了你的原谅。\n我是说，如果你怨恨我，是不会那样做的，对吧？\n但即便如此——仅仅是被默认？那和亲耳听到你说出口终究不同。"

# game/script.rpy:119059
translate chinese map285_8d6cba4f:

    # "I can tell what he's after, so I tell him that he's forgiven.{w}\nTo be honest, it's the last thing on my mind right now.{w}\nIf it secured us our Draconic Alliance, it was worth it."
    "我明白他想要什么，便告诉他，我原谅他了。{w}\n说实话，这是我此刻最不放在心上的一件事。{w}\n如果它为我们换来了巨龙同盟，那就值得。"

# game/script.rpy:119084
translate chinese map285_688608d4:

    # voice "se/z02574.ogg"
    # char_ulric "That's the thing, though. Forgiveness shouldn't come so easy.\nWhen you're on the throne, you'll need to learn how to punish.\nI lied to you. I hurt you. I shouldn't deserve your forgiveness."
    voice "se/z02574.ogg"
    char_ulric "可问题就在这儿。原谅不该来得这么轻易。\n等你坐上王座，你得学会如何惩罚。\n我对你撒了谎。我伤害了你。我不配得到你的原谅。"

# game/script.rpy:119099
translate chinese map285_29d40894:

    # "Then why did he come here asking for it...?{w}\nI tell him that he deserves forgiveness because he meant no ill will.{w}\nHe did what he did out of necessity. To help further our cause, and win."
    "那他又为什么来这里求它……？{w}\n我告诉他，他值得原谅，因为他并无恶意。{w}\n他所做的一切都是出于必要。是为了推进我们的事业，赢得胜利。"

# game/script.rpy:119114
translate chinese map285_abbbb962:

    # voice "se/z02575.ogg"
    # char_ulric "I guess what I'm trying to say is — you're lucky it was just your nose.\nIn that moment, I would've done whatever I deemed necessary, [firstname].\nAnd given the opportunity, I would do it again. I would go as far as I needed."
    voice "se/z02575.ogg"
    char_ulric "我想说的是——你只是鼻梁断了，已经算走运了。\n那一刻，我会做出我认为必要的一切，[firstname]。\n若有需要，我还会再做一次。我会尽全力去做。"

# game/script.rpy:119128
translate chinese map285_cc142d0f:

    # voice "se/z02576.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Do you still think I'm worthy of your forgiveness?\nWho knows what I might have to do during the final battle.\nThe fate of the world is in the balance. I can't hold back."
    voice "se/z02576.ogg"
    char_ulric "你现在还觉得我配得上你的原谅吗？\n谁知道在最后的战斗里我会做出什么。\n世界的命运悬于一线。我不能有所保留。"

# game/script.rpy:119143
translate chinese map285_09538278:

    # "What's gotten into him all of a sudden...?{w}\nHe's acting odd, but I try not to bring it to his attention.{w}\nFor all I know, he's just anxious about the upcoming battle."
    "他这是突然怎么了……？{w}\n他行为古怪，但我尽量不点破。{w}\n据我所知，他只是为即将到来的战斗感到焦虑。"

# game/script.rpy:119145
translate chinese map285_58b25bd6:

    # "But still, I tell him that he's forgiven.{w}\nI can't hold him accountable for things he hasn't done.{w}\nWhat he {i}has{/i} done, however, he's more than made up for."
    "但即便如此，我还是告诉他，我原谅他了。{w}\n我不能为他还没做过的事追究他。{w}\n而他所{i}做{/i}过的事，早已将功补过。"

# game/script.rpy:119170
translate chinese map285_04f14af6:

    # voice "se/z02577.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Alright. As long as we're both on the same page.\nI expect the same from you. Don't hold back in any way.\nIf I'm in danger, don't stop to help me. You have your goal."
    voice "se/z02577.ogg"
    char_ulric "好吧。只要我们的想法一致就行。\n我也期望你同样如此。任何方面都不要有所保留。\n如果我陷入危险，别停下来救我。你有你的目标。"

# game/script.rpy:119185
translate chinese map285_0e5205c6:

    # "He wants me to just leave him for dead...?"
    "他想让我就这么丢下他等死……？"

# game/script.rpy:119210
translate chinese map285_380856f3:

    # voice "se/z02578.ogg"
    # char_ulric "I know what I was getting into when you removed my curse.\nI'm vulnerable — for the first time in thousands of years.\nBut while I'm vulnerable, I also feel {i}alive{/i}, [firstname]."
    voice "se/z02578.ogg"
    char_ulric "你解除我诅咒的时候，我就知道自己在做什么。\n我很脆弱——这是几千年来第一次。\n但在我脆弱的同时，我也觉得自己{i}活着{/i}，[firstname]。"

# game/script.rpy:119224
translate chinese map285_525ac5be:

    # voice "se/z02579.ogg"
    # char_ulric "It's amazing how much the possibility of death can motivate us.\nIn some ways, that's what drives us to accomplish our goals.\nWithout some sort of end, there's no time for us to seize."
    voice "se/z02579.ogg"
    char_ulric "死亡的可能性竟能如此激励我们，真是不可思议。\n从某种角度说，正是它驱使我们去实现目标。\n若没有某种终局，就没有值得我们去把握的时光。"

# game/script.rpy:119239
translate chinese map285_1e21f276:

    # "He would know better than me.{w}\nI don't think even he knows how old he is.{w}\nAt that point, the years would start to blur together."
    "这一点他比我更清楚。{w}\n我想连他自己都不知道自己活了多久。{w}\n到了那个份上，岁月大概早已模糊成一片。"

# game/script.rpy:119241
translate chinese map285_59480d30:

    # "His demeanor makes sense, now that he's facing his mortality.{w}\nHis actions have consequences that could affect the rest of his life.{w}\nIn the past, no matter what he did, he could just outlive repercussion."
    "他如今要面对自己的死亡，这样的态度也说得通了。{w}\n他的行为会带来可能影响他余生的后果。{w}\n过去，无论他做什么，他都能熬过任何后果。"

# game/script.rpy:119243
translate chinese map285_300d194c:

    # "I tell him I'll do it. I'll leave him behind, only if it's necessary.{w}\nI do have my goal — but part of that is ensuring my comrades stay alive.{w}\nThe pledge seems to satisfy him enough, and he changes the subject."
    "我告诉他我会照做。只会在必要的时候丢下他。{w}\n我确实有我的目标——但其中也包括确保同伴们活下来。{w}\n这个承诺似乎让他足够满意，于是他换了话题。"

# game/script.rpy:119258
translate chinese map285_0bfcc08d:

    # voice "se/z02580.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Thank you, [firstname].\nI knew you'd be strong enough to make the tough decisions.\nSince we met, I've seen nothing but a capable ruler in you."
    voice "se/z02580.ogg"
    char_ulric "谢谢你，[firstname]。\n我就知道你足够坚强，能做出艰难的抉择。\n从我们相识起，我在你身上看到的只有一位能干的统治者。"

# game/script.rpy:119272
translate chinese map285_7bf6e612:

    # voice "se/z02581.ogg"
    # char_ulric "And that was before the attack on the Rebel HQ.\nRemember back in Valinorth, when we were at Peregrino?\nYou've been leading this world for much longer than you think."
    voice "se/z02581.ogg"
    char_ulric "而那还是在袭击反抗军总部之前。\n还记得在瓦利诺斯，我们在佩雷格里诺的时候吗？\n你领导这个世界的时间，比你想象的要久得多。"

# game/script.rpy:119288
translate chinese map285_c08be5a8:

    # voice "se/z02582.ogg"
    voice "se/z02582.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:119290
translate chinese map285_e1145a1e:

    # char_ulric "And I have to say, I agree with your choices.\nKeeping Peregrino as a tavern? I thought about that for a while.\nAnybody who values alcohol that much is good in {i}my{/i} books."
    char_ulric "我得说，我赞同你的选择。\n把佩雷格里诺保留为酒馆？我想了很久。\n任何如此看重酒的人，在{i}我{/i}看来都不错。"

# game/script.rpy:119305
translate chinese map285_a2bda0b7:

    # voice "se/z02583.ogg"
    voice "se/z02583.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:119307
translate chinese map285_d0bb948d:

    # char_ulric "And I have to say, I agree with your choices.\nTurning Peregrino into a barracks to protect your homeland?\nAnybody who cares about their people that much is a great leader."
    char_ulric "我得说，我赞同你的选择。\n把佩雷格里诺改成兵营来保卫你的家园？\n任何如此关心自己人民的人，都是了不起的领袖。"

# game/script.rpy:119323
translate chinese map285_7075bf3a:

    # "He smiles at me, and places a hand on my shoulder."
    "他冲我笑了笑，一只手搭在我肩上。"

# game/script.rpy:119350
translate chinese map285_4163a63a:

    # voice "se/z02584.ogg"
    voice "se/z02584.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:119352
translate chinese map285_1ed88395:

    # char_ulric "When I look back on times like that, I realize how far we've come.\nComplete strangers — to lovers. And it all happened so fast.\nI wasn't expecting it, but that's how I know it's real."
    char_ulric "回首那样的时刻，我才意识到我们走了多远。\n从素不相识——到相爱。一切都发生得那么快。\n我未曾料到，但正因如此，我才知道这是真的。"

# game/script.rpy:119355
translate chinese map285_d29a24af:

    # voice "se/z02585.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Some people pursue love, like it'll make them whole.\nBut it's not right to place a burden like that on somebody else.\nI think you can only really enjoy love, when you love yourself first."
    voice "se/z02585.ogg"
    char_ulric "有些人追寻爱情，仿佛它能让自己变得完整。\n但把这样的重担加在别人身上是不对的。\n我觉得，只有当先学会爱自己，你才能真正享受爱情。"

# game/script.rpy:119369
translate chinese map285_48e0d62c:

    # voice "se/z02586.ogg"
    # char_ulric "And that's what you helped me do, [firstname].\nIt's like — the more I know about you, the more I know about myself.\nAnd I don't want to stop learning. I want it for the rest of my life."
    voice "se/z02586.ogg"
    char_ulric "而这正是你帮我做到的，[firstname]。\n就像——我越了解你，就越了解自己。\n我不想停下这份学习。我想要它伴我一生。"

# game/script.rpy:119373
translate chinese map285_102f006d:

    # voice "se/z02587.ogg"
    # char_ulric "I'm just grateful that now, it's a life I deem worth living.\nIf I don't lose it on the battlefield, then I want to spend it with {i}you{/i}.\nBeing able to grow old, and say goodbye? It's an odd thing to desire."
    voice "se/z02587.ogg"
    char_ulric "我只感激，如今我认定这是值得一活的人生。\n如果我能在战场上保住它，那我愿意和你{i}一起{/i}度过。\n能够慢慢变老，然后道别？渴望这种事有些古怪。"

# game/script.rpy:119387
translate chinese map285_e17c85d3:

    # voice "se/z02588.ogg"
    # char_ulric "But when you lose the ability to die, you start to miss it.\nIn fact, you can almost forget what it's like to feel alive.\nI did — at least until I first laid eyes on you."
    voice "se/z02588.ogg"
    char_ulric "可当你失去了死亡的能力，就会开始怀念它。\n事实上，你几乎会忘记活着是什么感觉。\n我就是如此——至少，直到我第一次看见你。"

# game/script.rpy:119402
translate chinese map285_05d2c414:

    # "He takes the hand off of my shoulder, and laughs."
    "他把手从我肩上移开，笑了起来。"

# game/script.rpy:119427
translate chinese map285_fada6bd4:

    # voice "se/z02589.ogg"
    # char_ulric "I'm going to quit while I'm ahead.\nDon't want to give away my wedding vows.\nThis is actually some prime material, now that I think about it."
    voice "se/z02589.ogg"
    char_ulric "我还是见好就收吧。\n可不想把自己的婚礼誓词提前说光。\n仔细想想，这些可都是绝佳的素材。"

# game/script.rpy:119445
translate chinese map285_fa97d8c8:

    # "Pulling me into a hug, he places a kiss on the top of my head."
    "他把我拉进怀里，在我头顶落下一吻。"

# game/script.rpy:119460
translate chinese map285_83a848a5:

    # voice "se/z02590.ogg"
    voice "se/z02590.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:119462
translate chinese map285_f6c47244:

    # char_ulric "When I look back on times like that, I realize how far we've come.\nComplete strangers — to loyal comrades, ready to kill false Gods.\nI never would've expected this, but it's not an unwelcome change."
    char_ulric "回首那样的时刻，我才意识到我们走了多远。\n从素不相识——到忠诚的同伴，随时准备弑杀伪神。\n我从未料想到会这样，但这并非不受欢迎的改变。"

# game/script.rpy:119465
translate chinese map285_d9044921:

    # voice "se/z02591.ogg"
    # char_ulric "I always pledged myself to Damek, but the tables have shifted.\nThe sword arm meant for him, now belongs to you, [firstname].\nI will protect you, and do my best to help you liberate this world."
    voice "se/z02591.ogg"
    char_ulric "我一直向达梅克宣誓效忠，但如今局势已经变了。\n原本为他挥剑的手臂，如今属于你了，[firstname]。\n我会保护你，尽力帮你解放这个世界。"

# game/script.rpy:119479
translate chinese map285_6711bb15:

    # voice "se/z02592.ogg"
    # char_ulric "It's the least I can do, after all. You removed this curse from me.\nNow that I can die, it's almost as if — I know what it's like to be alive.\nTo live, {i}without{/i} feeling alive? I wouldn't wish that on my worst enemy."
    voice "se/z02592.ogg"
    char_ulric "毕竟，这只是我起码该做的。你为我解除了那道诅咒。\n既然如今我能死去，那几乎就像——我知道了活着是什么感觉。\n活着，却{i}感受不到{/i}活着？我不愿把这诅咒加诸最恨的敌人。"

# game/script.rpy:119483
translate chinese map285_6882ace6:

    # voice "se/z02593.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Yet, The Triumvirate hands it out so freely.\nThey disguise the tightest shackles as the path to freedom.\nAnd in our blindness, we accept it without hesitation."
    voice "se/z02593.ogg"
    char_ulric "然而，三人执政团却如此随意地将它施予他人。\n他们把最紧的枷锁伪装成通往自由的道路。\n而我们在盲目之中，毫不犹豫地接受了它。"

# game/script.rpy:119498
translate chinese map285_74fcae53:

    # "He shakes his head, as if throwing away thoughts of the enemy.{w}\nA moment later, the hand on my shoulder is removed."
    "他摇了摇头，仿佛要把对敌人的念头甩开。{w}\n片刻之后，他搭在我肩上的手移开了。"

# game/script.rpy:119523
translate chinese map285_5ca18485:

    # voice "se/z02594.ogg"
    # char_ulric "The Rebellion, however, strives for {i}true{/i} freedom.\nSalus, and Damek? We have them to thank for everything.\nEven you wouldn't have realized your full potential without them."
    voice "se/z02594.ogg"
    char_ulric "然而反抗军追求的，是{i}真正{/i}的自由。\n萨卢斯，还有达梅克？这一切都要感谢他们。\n若不是他们，连你也不会意识到自己真正的潜力。"

# game/script.rpy:119538
translate chinese map285_18ef6bd5:

    # "That's true. It was Salus who broke Valinorth's non-partisan stance.{w}\nHe helped seize the blade, and deliver it to me. He knew about my power.{w}\nHe may not have known about The Monarchy, but he knew enough."
    "确实如此。正是萨鲁斯打破了瓦利诺斯不结盟的立场。{w}\n他帮忙夺下剑，又把它交给了我。他知道我的力量。{w}\n他或许不知道王权的存在，但他知道的已经够多了。"

# game/script.rpy:119563
translate chinese map285_fcf8ec57:

    # voice "se/z02595.ogg"
    # char_ulric "It feels weird saying this, but you might be my first real friend.\nThose are hard to come by when you're serving The Triumvirate.\nAnd harder still, to come by, when you close yourself off to the world."
    voice "se/z02595.ogg"
    char_ulric "说这话感觉有点怪，但你可能是我第一个真正的朋友。\n在效力三人执政团的时候，这种人很难遇到。\n而当你把自己封闭起来时，就更难遇到了。"

# game/script.rpy:119567
translate chinese map285_e73f142c:

    # voice "se/z02596.ogg"
    # char_ulric "I'm not used to friends. I'm used to people who take advantage of me.\nWhether it's my strength, or my sense of honor. They've all been used.\nWhen people learn who you are, they might try and use you too, [firstname]."
    voice "se/z02596.ogg"
    char_ulric "我不习惯有朋友。我习惯的是那些利用我的人。\n无论是我的力量，还是我的荣誉感。它们都被利用过。\n当人们弄清你的身份，他们可能也会想利用你，[firstname]。"

# game/script.rpy:119581
translate chinese map285_bccb2852:

    # voice "se/z02597.ogg"
    # char_ulric "But when it comes to you, I know that my strength and honor {i}aren't{/i} misguided.\nYou can trust me to have your back, in the final battle, and beyond. I promise.\nFor once, I've found a cause I'd be happy to both live, {i}and{/i} die for."
    voice "se/z02597.ogg"
    char_ulric "但对你，我知道我的力量与荣誉{i}没有{/i}用错地方。\n你可以相信我会在最后的战斗以及那之后，始终守在你身后。我保证。\n这一次，我终于找到了一个我既愿意为之生、{i}也{/i}愿意为之死的目标。"

# game/script.rpy:119596
translate chinese map285_ce8c16db:

    # "He smiles, a real, genuine smile."
    "他笑了，一个真实、真诚的笑容。"

# game/script.rpy:119622
translate chinese map285_0df28c8d:

    # voice "se/z02598.ogg"
    voice "se/z02598.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:119624
translate chinese map285_9833f9d5:

    # char_ulric "Let's continue this after the battle, alright?\nUnfinished business is just one more reason to survive.\nIn times like these, we need as many of those as we can get."
    char_ulric "我们等战后再接着聊，好吗？\n未了的事，本身就是多一个活下去的理由。\n在这样的时刻，这样的理由越多越好。"

# game/script.rpy:119645
translate chinese map285_873a3f80:

    # "I nod, and see him out of my room.{w}\nHe seems a bit different, but I don't blame him.{w}\nAnybody would change when given the ability to die."
    "我点点头，送他出了房间。{w}\n他看起来有些不一样了，但我不怪他。{w}\n任何人在获得死亡的能力后，都会改变。"

# game/script.rpy:119647
translate chinese map285_71f8df8e:

    # "I'm just thankful that he's staying optimistic about it.{w}\nIt makes me realize that he really wanted it. It wasn't a hasty decision.{w}\nAnd with that optimism, I know he'd survive, and live a long, happy life."
    "我只是庆幸他对此依然保持乐观。{w}\n这让我意识到，他是真心想要的。这不是草率的决定。{w}\n带着这份乐观，我知道他会活下来，并度过漫长而幸福的一生。"

# game/script.rpy:119671
translate chinese map287_ef954c70:

    # "I invite Damek over to my private room, and he looks around, astonished.{w}\nEven though he's seen it before, he acts as if it's the first time.{w}\nI don't blame him. This room surely is a sight to behold."
    "我邀请达梅克来我私人的房间，他环顾四周，惊叹不已。{w}\n尽管他以前见过，却表现得像是头一回。{w}\n我不怪他。这房间确实令人叹为观止。"

# game/script.rpy:119676
translate chinese map287_b9559a92:

    # "I invite Damek over to my private room, and he looks around, astonished.{w}\nIt's almost like he's never seen anything so fancy before.{w}\nOr maybe, didn't expect such beauty out of Balteus."
    "我邀请达梅克来我私人的房间，他环顾四周，惊叹不已。{w}\n他几乎像是从没见过这么华丽的场面。{w}\n又或许，是没想到巴尔泰乌斯会有这般美景。"

# game/script.rpy:119701
translate chinese map287_68109597:

    # voice "se/z02599.ogg"
    voice "se/z02599.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:119703
translate chinese map287_210e53e0:

    # char_damek "What a sight, [firstname].\nI assume this is where Algus would normally sleep.\nBut he's not going anywhere in his current state."
    char_damek "真是好景致，[firstname]。\n我猜这里原本是阿尔古斯睡觉的地方。\n但以他现在的状况，他哪儿也去不了。"

# game/script.rpy:119706
translate chinese map287_89131e80:

    # voice "se/z02600.ogg"
    # char_damek "I talked to him for a while, and he seems... unstable.\nYears of serving The Triumvirate will do that to you, I guess.\nEven after I told him what Howl was, he still lives in ignorance."
    voice "se/z02600.ogg"
    char_damek "我和他聊了一会儿，他看起来……很不稳定。\n我猜，多年效命于三人执政团，会把人变成这样。\n即便我告诉他豪尔是什么，他仍选择活在无知之中。"

# game/script.rpy:119720
translate chinese map287_16b3a597:

    # voice "se/z02601.ogg"
    # char_damek "Well, maybe ignorance isn't the right word.\nHe knows what The Triumvirate is, and still chooses to serve them.\nYou know, I wonder how the people will react when they find out."
    voice "se/z02601.ogg"
    char_damek "好吧，也许“无知”这词用得不对。\n他知道三人执政团是什么，却依然选择效忠他们。\n你知道吗，我在想，民众得知真相后会作何反应。"

# game/script.rpy:119724
translate chinese map287_9090ea1b:

    # voice "se/z02602.ogg"
    # char_damek "Algus knows, and chose not to rebel, {i}or{/i} fight back.\nMaybe our victory here will just be the start of another battle.\nNot literally, of course. But we'll fight to show everyone the truth."
    voice "se/z02602.ogg"
    char_damek "阿尔古斯知道，却既没有反抗，{i}也{/i}没有还击。\n也许我们在这里的胜利，只是另一场战斗的开始。\n当然，不是字面意义上的战斗。但我们会奋力让所有人看清真相。"

# game/script.rpy:119739
translate chinese map287_325a75f2:

    # "He shifts, almost like he's feeling a bit uncomfortable."
    "他动了动身子，仿佛有些不自在。"

# game/script.rpy:119764
translate chinese map287_6c34f202:

    # voice "se/z02603.ogg"
    # char_damek "I have to ask you something, though.\nIf the people don't respect your rule, what will you do?\nWill you work hard to earn it? Or will you demand it through fear?" nointeract
    voice "se/z02603.ogg"
    char_damek "不过，我得问你一件事。\n如果民众不尊重你的统治，你会怎么做？\n你会努力去赢得它？还是用恐惧去索取它？" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:119780
translate chinese map287_32f1254f:

    # voice "se/z02604.ogg"
    # char_damek "Good. That's what I like to hear.\nWe can't resort to methods used by our enemy.\nIf we did that, then nothing would change in the end."
    voice "se/z02604.ogg"
    char_damek "很好。这正是我想听到的。\n我们不能用敌人用过的手段。\n如果我们那样做，那到头来什么都不会改变。"

# game/script.rpy:119784
translate chinese map287_c29a708d:

    # voice "se/z02605.ogg"
    # char_damek "Just — don't go down in history as a pushover.\nEven the best ruler needs to put their foot down, you know?\nTrying to give everybody what they want would just drive you mad."
    voice "se/z02605.ogg"
    char_damek "只是——别在历史上留下个软柿子的名声。\n再好的统治者有时也得强势起来，你知道吗？\n试图满足所有人的要求，只会把你逼疯。"

# game/script.rpy:119800
translate chinese map287_fead54c1:

    # voice "se/z02606.ogg"
    # char_damek "I suppose you're right. \nBut don't lean too heavily on the side of fear.\nYou don't want to become the enemy we're taking down."
    voice "se/z02606.ogg"
    char_damek "我想你说得对。\n但别过度偏向恐惧那一边。\n你不会想变成我们正在扳倒的那种敌人。"

# game/script.rpy:119814
translate chinese map287_20b72350:

    # voice "se/z02607.ogg"
    # char_damek "They definitely rule though fear, [firstname].\nBut The Rebellion isn't afraid to speak up, and shut them down.\nSometimes using fear just inspires others to contest your rule."
    voice "se/z02607.ogg"
    char_damek "他们确实是靠恐惧统治的，[firstname]。\n但反抗军不怕站出来，也不怕将他们推翻。\n有时用恐惧，反而会激起更多人反抗你的统治。"

# game/script.rpy:119830
translate chinese map287_9272049b:

    # voice "se/z02608.ogg"
    # char_damek "I don't know about that, [firstname].\nAt that point, what makes you different than The Triumvirate?\nKeep an open mind, and let's tackle this together after we win."
    voice "se/z02608.ogg"
    char_damek "这我可说不准，[firstname]。\n真到那一步，你和三人执政团又有什么分别？\n保持开放的心态，等我们赢了再一起解决这事。"

# game/script.rpy:119844
translate chinese map287_29b96b62:

    # voice "se/z02609.ogg"
    # char_damek "You know, we need to be {i}very{/i} careful with what we do next.\nOur actions will echo, and we can't display {i}any{/i} bad intentions.\nIf we do, then those echoes could just inspire more rebellion."
    voice "se/z02609.ogg"
    char_damek "你知道吗，接下来的所作所为，我们必须{i}非常{/i}谨慎。\n我们的行为会激起回响，我们不能流露出{i}任何{/i}恶意。\n否则，那些回响只会激起更多的反叛。"

# game/script.rpy:119861
translate chinese map287_faa43c65:

    # "He shrugs, realizing it's probably a good idea to change the subject.{w}\nWe need to {i}secure{/i} victory before deciding what we'd do with it.{w}\nIt's clear that he wants to avoid talking about the upcoming battle."
    "他耸耸肩，意识到换个话题大概是个好主意。{w}\n我们得先{i}确保{/i}胜利，再决定要怎么用它。{w}\n显然，他想避开谈论即将到来的战斗。"

# game/script.rpy:119886
translate chinese map287_a306c773:

    # voice "se/z02610.ogg"
    # char_damek "It just makes me wonder who The Triumvirate really is.\nThey aren't Gods — and I doubt that they made The Blade of Exodus.\nThere's a chance that they're just like us. Using power to achieve their goals."
    voice "se/z02610.ogg"
    char_damek "这让我不禁想，三人执政团究竟是什么来头。\n他们不是神——我也怀疑放逐之刃是他们造的。\n有可能，他们和我们一样。用力量来达成自己的目标。"

# game/script.rpy:119890
translate chinese map287_f0000409:

    # voice "se/z02611.ogg"
    # char_damek "And they say that power corrupts. You've heard that, right?\nWhat if they were just like us in the past? What'll happen next?\nWill we just go on to become tyrants that the people despise?"
    voice "se/z02611.ogg"
    char_damek "人们说权力会腐蚀人心。你听说过吧？\n如果他们过去也和我们一样呢？接下来又会怎样？\n我们会不会也变成被民众唾弃的暴君？"

# game/script.rpy:119905
translate chinese map287_5535d9ae:

    # "I shake my head. We wouldn't stoop so low."
    "我摇了摇头。我们不会堕落到那种地步。"

# game/script.rpy:119930
translate chinese map287_d738de5d:

    # voice "se/z02612.ogg"
    # char_damek "Nobody starts their journey at the peak power, [firstname].\nThe Triumvirate wasn't born into this role. They fought for it.\nIt's even likely that they took down foes of their own, too."
    voice "se/z02612.ogg"
    char_damek "没有谁一开始就站在权力的顶峰，[firstname]。\n三人执政团并非生来就担此角色。他们是靠拼杀争来的。\n甚至很可能，他们也扳倒过自己的敌人。"

# game/script.rpy:119934
translate chinese map287_86046428:

    # voice "se/z02613.ogg"
    # char_damek "But what foe would that be? And what was their goal...?\nWhat I'm trying to say is — I think the blade should be destroyed.\nOnce we achieve our goal, we have no use for it anymore — right?"
    voice "se/z02613.ogg"
    char_damek "但那会是什么样的敌人？他们的目标又是什么……？\n我想说的是——我认为这把剑应当被毁掉。\n一旦达成目标，它就再无用武之地了——对吧？"

# game/script.rpy:119948
translate chinese map287_cb1d7dfc:

    # voice "se/z02614.ogg"
    # char_damek "If you keep it, you risk relying on its power.\nAnd I don't want to see what that does to you, [firstname].\nNot if it's even {i}anything{/i} close to what it's done to our enemies."
    voice "se/z02614.ogg"
    char_damek "如果你留着它，就得承担依赖它力量的风险。\n我不想看到那会把你变成什么样，[firstname]。\n尤其是，如果那股力量会{i}像影响我们的敌人那样{/i}影响你。"

# game/script.rpy:119962
translate chinese map287_ec3cc773:

    # voice "se/z02615.ogg"
    # char_damek "I don't see any reason to keep it around after the war is over.\nSo tell me — if you get the chance to destroy it, will you?" nointeract
    voice "se/z02615.ogg"
    char_damek "我想不出战事结束后还有什么理由留着它。\n所以告诉我——若你有机会毁掉它，你会吗？" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:119978
translate chinese map287_6cc0dc49:

    # voice "se/z02616.ogg"
    # char_damek "Good. There's no place for a weapon like that in this world.\nI feel like whoever wields it, will be led down a dark path.\nI'd just hate to see that happen to you. I really would."
    voice "se/z02616.ogg"
    char_damek "很好。这世上容不下那样的武器。\n我觉得，无论谁挥舞它，都会被引向一条黑暗的道路。\n我只是不愿看到那样的事发生在你身上。真的不愿。"

# game/script.rpy:119994
translate chinese map287_0490caba:

    # voice "se/z02617.ogg"
    # char_damek "I don't know if that's a good idea, [firstname].\nWhoever wields that blade will be led down a dark path.\nThat's not a path I'd like to see you walk. I couldn't bear it."
    voice "se/z02617.ogg"
    char_damek "我不确定那是不是个好主意，[firstname]。\n无论谁挥舞那把剑，都会被引向一条黑暗的道路。\n那不是我愿你走的路。我无法承受。"

# game/script.rpy:120011
translate chinese map287_2841e3fd:

    # "He looks away from me, sad."
    "他把目光从我身上移开，神情悲伤。"

# game/script.rpy:120039
translate chinese map287_5ca96938:

    # voice "se/z02618.ogg"
    # char_damek "I just want to know what kind of hands the world will be left in.\nI'm just asking you these questions because I'm scared, you know.\nI might not survive the battle. I might not live to see your reign."
    voice "se/z02618.ogg"
    char_damek "我只是想知道，这个世界最终会落入怎样的人手中。\n我问你这些，只是因为我在害怕，你知道吗。\n我可能活不过这场战斗。我可能活不到看见你统治的那一天。"

# game/script.rpy:120054
translate chinese map287_f382f309:

    # "That much was true. Even my survival wasn't guaranteed."
    "这倒属实。连我能否活下来都毫无保证。"

# game/script.rpy:120084
translate chinese map287_281b206b:

    # voice "se/z02619.ogg"
    voice "se/z02619.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:120086
translate chinese map287_ba554b84:

    # char_damek "I'd hate to lose each other, after how far we've come.\nBut we're about to fight The Triumvirate — so it's a real possibility.\nAll we really can do, is launch the final attack with no regrets at all."
    char_damek "我们走了这么远，我可不愿失去彼此。\n但我们即将对抗三人执政团——所以这确实是有可能的。\n我们真正能做的，就是毫无遗憾地发起最后的进攻。"

# game/script.rpy:120089
translate chinese map287_102cc60d:

    # voice "se/z02620.ogg"
    # char_damek "Now I have my fair share of regrets — that much is certain.\nBut with your help, I'd like to put some of them to rest.\nI wanted to do so back in Alarinthia, but I was scared."
    voice "se/z02620.ogg"
    char_damek "说起来，我也有自己的一份遗憾——这一点毋庸置疑。\n但有你相助，我想了却其中的一些。\n我早在阿拉林西亚就想这么做，可我当时害怕。"

# game/script.rpy:120104
translate chinese map287_b7da7f81:

    # "Back in Alarinthia...? What does he mean?"
    "早在阿拉林西亚……？他是什么意思？"

# game/script.rpy:120129
translate chinese map287_fb95bfae:

    # voice "se/z02621.ogg"
    # char_damek "You know that I have this fear of physical contact.\nWhen I saw everybody on the dance floor, I got jealous.\nIt seemed so easy, so natural for them. Why couldn't {i}I{/i} do that?"
    voice "se/z02621.ogg"
    char_damek "你知道的，我有这种惧怕身体接触的毛病。\n当我看到舞池里的所有人，我嫉妒了。\n对他们来说，一切似乎都那么轻松、那么自然。为什么{i}我{/i}做不到？"

# game/script.rpy:120133
translate chinese map287_81e82408:

    # voice "se/z02622.ogg"
    # char_damek "They all looked so happy together. It was simply magical.\nAnd here I am, scared. I'm denying myself the pleasure of that magic.\nIf I keep doing that — I told myself — I'd die before I got the chance to feel it."
    voice "se/z02622.ogg"
    char_damek "他们在一起时看上去那么快乐。那简直是种魔力。\n而我却在这里害怕。我在剥夺自己享受那份魔力的权利。\n我告诉自己——若我一直这样，我会在有机会感受之前就死去。"

# game/script.rpy:120147
translate chinese map287_fcfd561a:

    # voice "se/z02623.ogg"
    # char_damek "But I want to feel it, Monarch. I want it more than anything.\nWhy does the simple thought of it make me shake in fear...?\nWhat did I do to deserve this? Why can't I be happy like them?"
    voice "se/z02623.ogg"
    char_damek "但我想感受它，君主。我想它胜过一切。\n为什么光是想想就让我恐惧得发抖……？\n我做了什么才落得如此？为什么我不能像他们那样快乐？"

# game/script.rpy:120162
translate chinese map287_57fe6731:

    # "I tell him that he can. He just needs to be brave enough.{w}\nThere may not be any music here, but I hold out my hands.{w}\nI ask him if he's willing to try. Just once, before the end of it all."
    "我告诉他他可以。他只需要鼓起勇气。{w}\n这里也许没有音乐，但我伸出了双手。{w}\n我问他是否愿意试一试。就在一切结束之前，试一次。"

# game/script.rpy:120164
translate chinese map287_e83512ce:

    # "He looks down at his own hands, and I see them tremble.{w}\nI know he's scared, but I tell him that I'm terrified as well.{w}\nWe could die, without ever knowing each other's touch."
    "他低头看着自己的手，我看见它们颤抖。{w}\n我知道他害怕，但我告诉他，我也同样恐惧。{w}\n我们可能会在从未知晓彼此温度的情况下死去。"

# game/script.rpy:120189
translate chinese map287_42ef06df:

    # voice "se/z02624.ogg"
    # char_damek "You're right. I could never live with myself if that happened.\nI want to know what it feels like, just in case I never get the chance again.\nSo — here we are — back in Alarinthia, that music playing in our ears."
    voice "se/z02624.ogg"
    char_damek "你说得对。若真如此，我永远无法原谅自己。\n我想知道那是什么感觉，以防我再也没有机会。\n所以——你看——我们又回到了阿拉林西亚，那音乐在耳边回荡。"

# game/script.rpy:120204
translate chinese map287_10946097:

    # "I smile, with a nod, as he places his hands in mine.{w}\nHe's shaking, and scared. His eyes tear up, but he's smiling.{w}\nWithout saying a word, I pull him close, and hold him tight."
    "我微笑着点点头，他把双手放进了我的掌心。{w}\n他在发抖，很害怕。他眼眶湿润，却带着笑容。{w}\n我一言未发，将他拉近，紧紧抱住。"

# game/script.rpy:120206
translate chinese map287_1ec41cc5:

    # "I let him tame his emotions on his own.{w}\nIt takes a while, but his shaking slowly subsides.{w}\nHe's crying — but I can tell that it's not out of fright."
    "我任由他自己平复情绪。{w}\n过了好一会儿，他的颤抖才渐渐平息。{w}\n他在哭——但我看得出，那不是出于恐惧。"

# game/script.rpy:120208
translate chinese map287_5442e38d:

    # "We sway from side to side, as if we were dancing.{w}\nOur bodies are in sync with a melody that neither of us can hear.{w}\nIt's a beautiful moment, and it belongs to the two of us, as it will forever."
    "我们轻轻左右摇摆，仿佛在跳舞。{w}\n我们的身体与一段彼此都听不见的旋律同步律动。{w}\n这是美好的时刻，它属于我们两个人，也将永远如此。"

# game/script.rpy:120233
translate chinese map287_86edfa4e:

    # voice "se/z02625.ogg"
    # char_damek "I love you..."
    voice "se/z02625.ogg"
    char_damek "我爱你……"

# game/script.rpy:120258
translate chinese map287_6d1f9252:

    # "Damek sniffles, and rests his head against my shoulder.{w}\nI say that I love him too, and hold him even closer to my body."
    "达梅克抽了抽鼻子，把头靠在我的肩上。{w}\n我说我也爱他，把他抱得更紧。"

# game/script.rpy:120263
translate chinese map287_aba68caa:

    # "We stay like this until he's ready to leave. I've never seen him so happy.{w}\nIf he survives, then we'd spend our lives together in a similar happiness.{w}\nThis is the pledge I make to him as I see him off to prepare for the end."
    "我们就这样待着，直到他准备离开。我从没见过他这么开心。{w}\n若他能活下来，我们便会以同样的幸福共度一生。{w}\n这是我送他去为终局做准备时，向他许下的诺言。"

# game/script.rpy:120281
translate chinese map287_98e661c7:

    # voice "se/z02626.ogg"
    voice "se/z02626.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:120283
translate chinese map287_5e630ddd:

    # char_damek "I'd hate for us to die, especially after how far we've come.\nBut we're about to fight The Triumvirate. It's a real possibility.\nAll we can really do, is ensure that we fight with no regrets."
    char_damek "我们走了这么远，我可不愿我们死去。\n但我们即将对抗三人执政团。这确实是有可能的。\n我们真正能做的，就是确保战斗时毫无遗憾。"

# game/script.rpy:120296
translate chinese map287_460acf87:

    # voice "se/z02627.ogg"
    # char_damek "Now I have my fair share of regrets — that much is certain.\nBut with your help, I'd like to put some of them to rest.\nI've been wanting to for a while, but I'm just scared."
    voice "se/z02627.ogg"
    char_damek "说起来，我也有自己的一份遗憾——这一点毋庸置疑。\n但有你相助，我想了却其中的一些。\n我想这么做已经有一阵子了，只是我一直害怕。"

# game/script.rpy:120311
translate chinese map287_d7aac97b:

    # "Scared...? I think I know what he's getting at."
    "害怕……？我想我明白他的意思了。"

# game/script.rpy:120336
translate chinese map287_eb083342:

    # voice "se/z02628.ogg"
    # char_damek "You know, shaking a hand is such a simple thing.\nYet I cower in fear whenever somebody offers it to me.\nEven the thought of it is enough to fill me with anxiety."
    voice "se/z02628.ogg"
    char_damek "你知道吗，握手是件再简单不过的事。\n可每当有人向我伸出手，我都会恐惧地退缩。\n光是想到它，就足以让我焦虑不安。"

# game/script.rpy:120350
translate chinese map287_3905edd9:

    # voice "se/z02629.ogg"
    # char_damek "But you know what? So does fighting The Triumvirate.\nDespite that fact, I'm standing strong, and ready to fight.\nSo what do you say? To the fall of The Triumvirate...?"
    voice "se/z02629.ogg"
    char_damek "但你知道吗？对抗三人执政团也是如此。\n尽管如此，我依然坚强地站着，准备好去战斗。\n所以你说呢？为三人执政团的倒台……？"

# game/script.rpy:120365
translate chinese map287_e9200651:

    # "He holds out his hand, and I can see it shaking.{w}\nI ask him if he's sure. This is a big deal, after all."
    "他伸出手，我能看见它在颤抖。{w}\n我问他是否确定。毕竟，这可不是小事。"

# game/script.rpy:120390
translate chinese map287_2b1201d3:

    # voice "se/z02630.ogg"
    # char_damek "Of course I'm sure. It's time to get over this silly fear.\nYou know, we'll be dealing with a lot of people after this is over.\nNot being able to shake the hands of our subjects? That's not good."
    voice "se/z02630.ogg"
    char_damek "我当然确定。是时候克服这种傻气的恐惧了。\n你知道，等这一切结束后，我们要和很多人打交道。\n连自己子民的手都握不了？那可不行。"

# game/script.rpy:120394
translate chinese map287_97adb2bb:

    # voice "se/z02631.ogg"
    # char_damek "After all we've been through? I just think {i}you{/i} deserve the honors.\nAnd I can think of no better toast, than a toast to the fall of our enemies.\nSo like I said — let's do this — and move forward as stronger people."
    voice "se/z02631.ogg"
    char_damek "经历了这一切之后？我只是觉得{i}你{/i}该享有这份殊荣。\n而我想不出比为我们敌人的倒台干杯更好的祝酒词了。\n所以就像我说的——来吧——让我们作为更坚强的人向前迈进。"

# game/script.rpy:120409
translate chinese map287_269e7c96:

    # "Yeah — as stronger people.{w}\nI shake his hand with a firm grip.{w}\nIf he was scared, he doesn't show it."
    "好——作为更坚强的人。{w}\n我稳稳地握住了他的手。{w}\n就算他曾经害怕，他也没有表现出来。"

# game/script.rpy:120434
translate chinese map287_0e845252:

    # voice "se/z02632.ogg"
    # char_damek "This is all thanks to you, Monarch. It really is.\nYou told me to leave behind those memories of my past.\nAt first I thought it would dishonor the memory of my mother."
    voice "se/z02632.ogg"
    char_damek "这一切都要感谢你，君主。真的。\n是你叫我放下那些过去的回忆。\n起初我以为，那会辜负我母亲的记忆。"

# game/script.rpy:120448
translate chinese map287_d4b6e885:

    # voice "se/z02633.ogg"
    # char_damek "But I'm not forgetting about her. I could never do that.\nI'm just forgetting about the pain I felt on that fateful day.\nAnd with that gone — I can handle anything that comes my way."
    voice "se/z02633.ogg"
    char_damek "但我并不是要忘记她。我永远做不到。\n我只是想忘掉在那命运攸关的一天所感受到的痛苦。\n一旦放下它——我就能应对任何向我袭来的事。"

# game/script.rpy:120473
translate chinese map287_99641da1:

    # "He leaves the room with the biggest smile on his face.{w}\nI know that this was a big step for him, and he's incredibly proud.{w}"
    "他脸上挂着最灿烂的笑容，离开了房间。{w}\n我知道这对他而言是巨大的一步，他无比自豪。{w}"

# game/script.rpy:120475
translate chinese map287_65d53ce0:

    # "If he used that pride on the battlefield, then our enemies stood no chance.{w}\nJust like he said — The Triumvirate would fall — and we would be victorious."
    "如果他把这份自豪带到战场上，那我们的敌人就毫无胜算。{w}\n正如他所说——三人执政团会倒台——而我们将获得胜利。"

# game/script.rpy:120498
translate chinese map288_3d46e1b8:

    # "As I'm browsing random books, I hear a knock on my door.{w}\nIt's Howl. I let him in, and ask him how things are going.{w}\nI don't know why I asked. It's clear what the answer was."
    "正当我随手翻看书架上的书，门外传来了敲门声。{w}\n是豪尔。我让他进来，问他情况如何。{w}\n我不知道自己为什么要问。答案显而易见。"

# game/script.rpy:120523
translate chinese map288_69eea326:

    # voice "se/z02634.ogg"
    voice "se/z02634.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:120525
translate chinese map288_a2eb698b:

    # char_howl "They all worry. They fear that death will come for them.\nAn understandable fear, however. This is the end of our journey.\nWe will face more danger than ever before as we move forward."
    char_howl "他们都在担忧。他们害怕死亡会降临到自己头上。\n不过，这种恐惧可以理解。这是我们旅程的终点。\n随着我们继续前进，我们将面临前所未有的危险。"

# game/script.rpy:120528
translate chinese map288_d1e45866:

    # voice "se/z02635.ogg"
    # char_howl "Algus, however, isn't making things any easier.\nHe plants seeds of doubt in many of our soldiers, [firstname].\nWords are a writer's greatest weapon. A gag would be effective."
    voice "se/z02635.ogg"
    char_howl "然而，阿尔古斯并没有让事情好过一点。\n他在我们许多士兵心中播下怀疑的种子，[firstname]。\n言语是作家最强大的武器。堵上他的嘴或许会有效。"

# game/script.rpy:120543
translate chinese map288_19b43a6c:

    # "It's unclear if this is a joke, but it gets a smile from me regardless."
    "不清楚这是不是玩笑，但无论如何，它让我笑了。"

# game/script.rpy:120568
translate chinese map288_0001b4fc:

    # voice "se/z02636.ogg"
    # char_howl "He says that we are the true enemy. The Monarchy.\nHe says that if you knew the truth of our people, you would run.\nYou would no longer fight for us — as we endangered innocent worlds."
    voice "se/z02636.ogg"
    char_howl "他说我们才是真正的敌人。王权才是。\n他说，如果你知道我们族群的真相，你就会逃走。\n你将不再为我们而战——因为我们会危及无辜的世界。"

# game/script.rpy:120572
translate chinese map288_a42acd4f:

    # voice "se/z02637.ogg"
    # char_howl "It is not true, however. His mind has been twisted beyond repair.\nBut many soldiers are starting to doubt. What if he is telling the truth?\nCould they save their lives by switching sides in the final moments?"
    voice "se/z02637.ogg"
    char_howl "然而，这不是真的。他的心智已被扭曲得无法修复。\n但许多士兵开始动摇了。万一他说的是真的呢？\n他们能否在最后关头倒戈，以此保住自己的性命？"

# game/script.rpy:120587
translate chinese map288_2cd59114:

    # "That is unacceptable. We couldn't afford any turncoats."
    "这绝不可接受。我们承受不起任何叛徒。"

# game/script.rpy:120602
translate chinese map288_9e15d0ee:

    # voice "se/z02638.ogg"
    # char_howl "The Monarchy made mistakes, as any group of people do.\nLike Damek said — mistakes are how we learn, and grow.\nBad choices, while bad, are our right as people to make."
    voice "se/z02638.ogg"
    char_howl "王权犯过错，就像任何一群人都会犯错一样。\n正如达梅克所说——错误是我们学习和成长的方式。\n糟糕的选择虽然糟糕，却是我们作为人的权利。"

# game/script.rpy:120616
translate chinese map288_cc84959e:

    # voice "se/z02639.ogg"
    # char_howl "They cast us aside in a prison, taking away our ability to choose.\nAnd in doing so, they took away our ability to live in freedom.\nNo matter our crimes, this punishment is far too severe."
    voice "se/z02639.ogg"
    char_howl "他们把我们丢进监狱，剥夺了我们选择的能力。\n如此，他们也就夺走了我们自由生活的权利。\n无论我们犯下什么罪，这惩罚都太过严酷。"

# game/script.rpy:120631
translate chinese map288_43139ab0:

    # "I agree, and I could never be turned against The Monarchy.{w}\nThe Triumvirate imprisoned them because they endangered worlds?{w}\nA hypocritical thing to say, as they hurt Alestia at the very same time."
    "我表示同意，我绝不会被策反去对抗王权。{w}\n三人执政团因为王权危及世界就囚禁了他们？{w}\n这话何其虚伪，因为他们同时也在伤害阿莱斯蒂亚。"

# game/script.rpy:120656
translate chinese map288_b3786f45:

    # voice "se/z02640.ogg"
    # char_howl "But, we must say — it was a battle that we lost fair and square.\nWe were so focused on our own future, that we lost sight of everyone else's.\nIt doesn't surprise us, that our \"perfect\" future came at the expense of others."
    voice "se/z02640.ogg"
    char_howl "但我们必须承认——那是一场我们输得心服口服的战斗。\n我们太过专注于自己的未来，以至于忽视了其他人的未来。\n我们那“完美”的未来是建立在别人的代价之上，这并不令我们意外。"

# game/script.rpy:120660
translate chinese map288_0eb35aae:

    # voice "se/z02641.ogg"
    # char_howl "If it leads to happiness in the end, how can you decide what cost is too high?\nThis is the line that all tyrants seem to walk in the early days of their rule.\nMany have fallen to the wrong side, [firstname]. We trust that you will not."
    voice "se/z02641.ogg"
    char_howl "如果最终能带来幸福，你又如何判定什么代价算太高？\n这正是所有暴君在统治初期似乎都走过的那条界线。\n许多人失足跌向了错误的一侧，[firstname]。我们相信你不会。"

# game/script.rpy:120675
translate chinese map288_5ff77c14:

    # "I nod. I don't see myself stooping to the level of the enemy anytime soon."
    "我点了点头。我看不出自己会有很快堕落到敌人那种地步。"

# game/script.rpy:120700
translate chinese map288_b824ef51:

    # voice "se/z02642.ogg"
    # char_howl "We know that Damek wishes to gift all this knowledge to the people.\nThese books capture almost the entire history of The Monarchy.\nThis may not be a good idea. They may read of our \"mistakes\"."
    voice "se/z02642.ogg"
    char_howl "我们知道达梅克想把这些知识全部送给民众。\n这些书记载了王权几乎全部的历史。\n这也许不是个好主意。他们可能会读到我们的“错误”。"

# game/script.rpy:120704
translate chinese map288_71f2e176:

    # voice "se/z02643.ogg"
    # char_howl "And those mistakes may just inspire future insurrections.\nWe think it may be best to destroy The Monarchy entirely.\nBurn these books, and remove the spirits from this body."
    voice "se/z02643.ogg"
    char_howl "而那些错误，也许恰恰会激起未来的叛乱。\n我们认为，最好的做法或许是彻底抹除王权。\n烧掉这些书，把这些灵从这具躯体中移除。"

# game/script.rpy:120719
translate chinese map288_e54b0e53:

    # "Wait, what...?{w}\nThat was certainly extreme."
    "等等，什么……？{w}\n这确实太极端了。"

# game/script.rpy:120744
translate chinese map288_5ae79b5b:

    # voice "se/z02644.ogg"
    # char_howl "These books shouldn't exist at all, [firstname].\nWe don't know why The Triumvirate keeps them lying around.\nIf our oppression was their goal, then they should've destroyed them."
    voice "se/z02644.ogg"
    char_howl "这些书根本就不该存在，[firstname]。\n我们不明白三人执政团为什么把它们留在这里。\n如果他们的目的是压迫我们，那就该毁掉它们。"

# game/script.rpy:120748
translate chinese map288_0db97c42:

    # voice "se/z02645.ogg"
    # char_howl "Right now, they exist as a testament to our imprisonment.\nAs long as they remain intact, they will be only a harmful memory.\nThey should be destroyed. Allow my people, and our history, to rest."
    voice "se/z02645.ogg"
    char_howl "如今，它们的存在是我们被囚禁的证明。\n只要它们完好无损，就只会是一段有害的记忆。\n它们应当被毁掉。让我的族人，和我们的历史，得以安息。"

# game/script.rpy:120763
translate chinese map288_39dad632:

    # "This is all coming out of nowhere, but it makes sense.{w}\nHe is The Monarchy embodied. This must be a horrific sight for him.{w}\nHis entire culture, stolen. Imprisoned just like him and his people."
    "这一切来得毫无征兆，但说得通。{w}\n他就是王权的化身。这景象对他一定无比可怖。{w}\n他的整个文化被夺走。就像他和他的族人一样，被囚禁于此。"

# game/script.rpy:120788
translate chinese map288_e81505d2:

    # voice "se/z02646.ogg"
    # char_howl "This is why we ask that you look toward the future, [firstname].\nDo not concern yourself with who we were, or what we were like.\nOrder this library to be destroyed. Live life on your own terms."
    voice "se/z02646.ogg"
    char_howl "这就是我们请求你放眼未来的原因，[firstname]。\n别再挂念我们曾经是谁，或我们曾是什么样子。\n下令毁掉这座图书馆。按照你自己的方式生活。"

# game/script.rpy:120803
translate chinese map288_ac9e9eed:

    # "I don't know what to say, so I just stare at him in silence."
    "我不知道该说什么，只能默默地注视着他。"

# game/script.rpy:120828
translate chinese map288_85ca9338:

    # voice "se/z02647.ogg"
    # char_howl "This started back during our journey into Eastcrown.\nThis body could not survive the cold. The spirits inside helped.\nBut in doing so, they died. We are weaker than we were back then."
    voice "se/z02647.ogg"
    char_howl "这一切始于我们前往东冠的旅程。\n这具躯体无法在严寒中存活。体内的灵帮了忙。\n但正因如此，他们死了。我们比那时弱了许多。"

# game/script.rpy:120832
translate chinese map288_a5d3f59b:

    # voice "se/z02648.ogg"
    # char_howl "Weaker, but more in tune with everything around us.\nAlmost like a weight was lifted from our shoulders.\nWe would like you to lift this weight even further."
    voice "se/z02648.ogg"
    char_howl "更弱了，但与周围的一切更加契合。\n仿佛有一副重担从我们的肩上卸下。\n我们希望你把这副重担卸得更彻底。"

# game/script.rpy:120846
translate chinese map288_410abe5d:

    # voice "se/z02649.ogg"
    # char_howl "Please, use that blade. Absorb the souls inside of us.\nLeave one behind — and let us feel what it is like to be alive.\nAfter the weight is gone from our shoulders, lift it from the world."
    voice "se/z02649.ogg"
    char_howl "求你，用那把剑。吸取我们体内的灵魂。\n只留下一个——让我们感受活着是什么滋味。\n等这重担从我们肩上卸下后，再把它从这世上移去。"

# game/script.rpy:120861
translate chinese map288_eb1bbb7d:

    # "He looks around the room, to the various books scattered about."
    "他环顾房间，看着散落各处的那些书。"

# game/script.rpy:120876
translate chinese map288_41e878e8:

    # voice "se/z02650.ogg"
    # char_howl "You must absorb these souls, and destroy the books.\nOnly then, will The Monarchy be truly removed from history.\nAs our mind will be better for it — so too, will the world itself."
    voice "se/z02650.ogg"
    char_howl "你必须吸取这些灵魂，并毁掉这些书。\n唯有如此，王权才会真正从历史中被抹去。\n我们的心智会因此变得更好——这世界本身也一样。"

# game/script.rpy:120891
translate chinese map288_03004c59:

    # "I don't know how to respond to what he's asking of me.{w}\nHe wants me to commit mass genocide against The Monarchy?{w}\nThis is all happening so fast, I'm unsure of how I should respond."
    "我不知道该如何回应他对我的请求。{w}\n他想让我将王权一族彻底灭绝？{w}\n这一切发生得太快，我不确定该如何回应。"

# game/script.rpy:120916
translate chinese map288_fb51b787:

    # voice "se/z02651.ogg"
    # char_howl "You would not be killing us. We have long since been dead.\nIt would be an act of mercy upon a group of oppressed people.\nWe can no longer live. The Triumvirate stole that right from us."
    voice "se/z02651.ogg"
    char_howl "你不会是在杀我们。我们早已死去。\n这会是施予一群受压迫者的仁慈之举。\n我们再也无法活下去了。是三人执政团夺走了我们这份权利。"

# game/script.rpy:120920
translate chinese map288_7e3451c2:

    # voice "se/z02652.ogg"
    # char_howl "But if you can take our spirits, and use it to power the blade?\nMaybe it will give you the edge you need to win this yourselves.\nWe may have lost — but that doesn't mean you need to, as well."
    voice "se/z02652.ogg"
    char_howl "但如果你能取走我们的灵，用它来强化那把剑呢？\n也许它能给你们制胜所需的优势。\n我们也许输了——但这不意味着你们也会。"

# game/script.rpy:120934
translate chinese map288_325e7a7e:

    # voice "se/z02653.ogg"
    # char_howl "These spirits may linger, and the books may remain.\nBut the truth of it is — we're dead. We need to be buried.\nOur very existence is born from a denial of that death."
    voice "se/z02653.ogg"
    char_howl "这些灵也许会徘徊，这些书也许会留存。\n但事实是——我们已经死了。我们需要被埋葬。\n我们的存在，本就建立在对那死亡的否认之上。"

# game/script.rpy:120948
translate chinese map288_3cbfca3a:

    # voice "se/z02654.ogg"
    # char_howl "If you leave one soul, we will use this body to fight for you.\nWe may fall in combat, but nothing of value would be lost.\nWe cannot help our own people, so we must help yours."
    voice "se/z02654.ogg"
    char_howl "如果你留下一个灵魂，我们就会用这具躯体为你而战。\n我们也许会在战斗中倒下，但不会有任何有价值的东西随之失去。\n我们帮不了自己的族人，那就必须帮你们的。"

# game/script.rpy:120963
translate chinese map288_f1ff50e4:

    # "I knew that eventually we'd have to tackle the nature of his existence.{w}\nBut I didn't expect to be confronted with it on the eve of the final battle.{w}\nHe wants to accept defeat. Have the souls removed, and books destroyed."
    "我知道，我们迟早要直面他存在的本质。{w}\n但我没料到会在决战前夜被摆到面前。{w}\n他想接受失败。让灵魂被移除，让书被毁掉。"

# game/script.rpy:120965
translate chinese map288_6fe3cfa6:

    # "If I did that — there'd be no physical remains of The Monarchy.{w}\nI had spirits inside of me, but I was still my own person, able to live free.{w}\nWe're talking about the extinction of an entire group of people. I don't know."
    "如果我那样做——王权就不会留下任何实质的痕迹。{w}\n我体内曾有灵，但我仍是独立的个体，能够自由地活。{w}\n我们谈的是一整个族群的灭绝。我不知道。"

# game/script.rpy:120990
translate chinese map288_286d49da:

    # voice "se/z02655.ogg"
    # char_howl "We understand if this is too much to ask, [firstname].\nBut we think this is the right course of action for everybody.\nDon't be scared to hurt us. You cannot harm what is already dead."
    voice "se/z02655.ogg"
    char_howl "如果这要求太过分，我们能够理解，[firstname]。\n但我们认为，这对所有人来说都是正确的做法。\n别怕伤害我们。你无法伤害已经死去的东西。"

# game/script.rpy:121004
translate chinese map288_9a0b8753:

    # voice "se/z02656.ogg"
    # char_howl "The spirits would be more useful in the blade, than this body.\nBut like we said, one can remain, to aid you in fighting.\nWhat do you say, [firstname]...? What will you do...?" nointeract
    voice "se/z02656.ogg"
    char_howl "这些灵在剑中，比在这具躯体里更有用。\n但正如我们所说，可以留下一个，助你战斗。\n你意下如何，[firstname]……？你会怎么做……？" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:121023
translate chinese map288_25b77938:

    # "I agree to grant him his request.{w}\nI need this blade as strong as possible for the coming battle.{w}\nHis people may be lost, but they can still help us win this war."
    "我同意满足他的请求。{w}\n为了即将到来的战斗，我需要这把剑尽可能强大。{w}\n他的族人或许已经消逝，但他们仍能助我们赢下这场战争。"

# game/script.rpy:121048
translate chinese map288_47affe9e:

    # voice "se/z02657.ogg"
    # char_howl "Thank you, [firstname].\nDo not worry about the books, we will talk to Damek.\nBut know that you made the right choice, and rest easy."
    voice "se/z02657.ogg"
    char_howl "谢谢你，[firstname]。\n不必担心那些书，我们会去和达梅克谈。\n但你要知道你做了正确的选择，安心吧。"

# game/script.rpy:121063
translate chinese map288_867dd234:

    # "With a nod, I take out the blade, and hold it to his chest.{w}\nIt responds to my will, so I do my best to envision Howl's request.{w}\nLeave one soul to inhabit the body — and use the rest to power the blade."
    "我点点头，取出剑，抵在他的胸口。{w}\n它会回应我的意志，所以我尽力去构想豪尔的请求。{w}\n留下一个灵魂留在这具躯体里——用其余的来强化这把剑。"

# game/script.rpy:121065
translate chinese map288_3830779e:

    # "I close my eyes, and try my hardest to make his dream a reality.{w}\nAfter a while, he takes a deep breath, and he seems a bit different.{w}\nThe blade didn't seem to \"activate\", but I guess I did what I needed to."
    "我闭上双眼，竭尽全力让他的愿望成真。{w}\n过了一会儿，他深吸一口气，看起来有些不一样了。{w}\n那把剑似乎并未“启动”，但我想我做了该做的事。"

# game/script.rpy:121090
translate chinese map288_dcc46e9d:

    # voice "se/z02658.ogg"
    # char_howl "Thank you. You did the right thing.\nIf you'll excuse us, we have more to take care of.\nThe final battle looms. There is much for all of us to do."
    voice "se/z02658.ogg"
    char_howl "谢谢你。你做了正确的选择。\n恕我们先行告退，我们还有更多事要处理。\n决战临近。我们所有人都还有很多事要做。"

# game/script.rpy:121112
translate chinese map288_82e8a3fc:

    # "I nod, and see him out of my room.{w}\nI didn't expect to settle this one-on-one.{w}\nMaybe part of me wanted the input of others?"
    "我点点头，送他出了房间。{w}\n我没料到会这样一对一地了结此事。{w}\n也许我内心有一部分想要别人的意见？"

# game/script.rpy:121114
translate chinese map288_80d2f667:

    # "However, I think things turned out for the best.{w}\nIf we maintained this secrecy, nobody would ever know.{w}\nI helped him — and he helped me. I was stronger than ever before."
    "不过，我觉得结果算是好的。{w}\n如果我们守住这个秘密，就永远不会有人知道。{w}\n我帮了他——他也帮了我。我变得比以往任何时候都强大。"

# game/script.rpy:121132
translate chinese map288_67644940:

    # "I couldn't do it. I couldn't be responsible for their extinction.{w}\nEven if they were already \"dead\". I couldn't be the one to end it.{w}\nI let him know that fact, and I can tell that he's immediately upset."
    "我做不到。我无法为他们的灭绝负责。{w}\n即便他们早已“死去”。我也不能成为终结这一切的人。{w}\n我把这一事实告诉了他，我看得出他立刻就沮丧起来。"

# game/script.rpy:121157
translate chinese map288_6a9eeba6:

    # voice "se/z02659.ogg"
    # char_howl "Very well, [firstname].\nIt is a mistake, but it is your mistake to make.\nAfter all, you still live — free to make your own choices."
    voice "se/z02659.ogg"
    char_howl "好吧，[firstname]。\n这是个错误，但这是你该犯的错误。\n毕竟，你还活着——自由地做出自己的选择。"

# game/script.rpy:121179
translate chinese map288_cebc32db:

    # "With a stern look on his face, he storms out of the room.{w}\nI can tell that I let him down, but I think I made the right choice.{w}\nAs I turn back to face the room, I keep telling myself that fact."
    "他脸色一沉，怒冲冲地走出了房间。{w}\n我看得出我让他失望了，但我认为我做了正确的选择。{w}\n当我转身再次面对房间时，我不断对自己重复着这一点。"

# game/script.rpy:121202
translate chinese map289_abbbe460:

    # "There's a knock at my door, more urgent sounding than I anticipated.{w}\nIt couldn't possibly be time to launch the attack. It must be something else.{w}\nAs soon as I open it, Sovy steps into the room, a look of anxiety on his face."
    "门外传来敲门声，比我预想的更加急促。{w}\n不可能是进攻的时候到了。一定是别的事。{w}\n我一开门，索维就走进房间，脸上带着焦虑的神色。"

# game/script.rpy:121227
translate chinese map289_c8a5b207:

    # voice "se/sovy12.ogg"
    voice "se/sovy12.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:121229
translate chinese map289_d7f5c17c:

    # char_sovy "Sorry, I just needed to get away from that atrium, [firstname].\nEverybody keeps telling me what to do, and it's getting on my nerves.\nI have no problem helping out your cause. But it's {i}my{/i} choice to do so."
    char_sovy "抱歉，我只是需要从中庭躲开一下，[firstname]。\n所有人都没完没了地告诉我该做什么，这快把我逼疯了。\n帮助你的事业我毫无意见。但那是{i}我自己{/i}的选择。"

# game/script.rpy:121242
translate chinese map289_0d2bdebe:

    # voice "se/sovy13.ogg"
    # char_sovy "I followed enough orders while I was under The Triumvirate's control.\nJoining you and your army — I thought I'd finally be a free man.\nI mean, I guess I am. Ignore me, I'm just complaining."
    voice "se/sovy13.ogg"
    char_sovy "我在三人执政团控制下的时候，已经听够了命令。\n加入你和你的军队——我以为我终于能做个自由人了。\n我是说，我想我现在是吧。别管我，我只是在抱怨。"

# game/script.rpy:121257
translate chinese map289_038ae5bb:

    # "He shrugs, and starts wandering around the room.{w}\nI tell him that it's okay. He shouldn't have to follow orders here.{w}\nI give him free reign to do whatever he sees as the most useful."
    "他耸耸肩，开始在房间里踱步。{w}\n我告诉他没关系。在这里他不该被迫服从命令。{w}\n我让他全权决定做什么，只要他自己觉得最有用。"

# game/script.rpy:121282
translate chinese map289_7ef2e891:

    # voice "se/sovy14.ogg"
    # char_sovy "You know, that's why I like you.\nYou're the only person who lets me do what I want.\nEverybody else keeps me at arm's length, commanding me."
    voice "se/sovy14.ogg"
    char_sovy "你知道吗，这就是我喜欢你的原因。\n你是唯一一个让我随心所欲的人。\n其他人都跟我保持距离，对我发号施令。"

# game/script.rpy:121286
translate chinese map289_d97c048b:

    # voice "se/sovy15.ogg"
    # char_sovy "After all I've been through, I think I want to be the commander.\nI always thought I've been meant for more than what I was given.\nWhen I met you, and you accepted my offer — I knew I was right."
    voice "se/sovy15.ogg"
    char_sovy "经历了这一切之后，我想当那个发号施令的人。\n我一直觉得，我生来就该得到比现有更多的东西。\n当我遇见你，你接受了我的提议——我就知道我没想错。"

# game/script.rpy:121300
translate chinese map289_aaec8197:

    # voice "se/sovy16.ogg"
    # char_sovy "At first, I only planned to help you until we took down Halin.\nBut we've grown so close, and your comrades are so accepting.\nI've never felt such a sense of belonging. A sense, perhaps, of family."
    voice "se/sovy16.ogg"
    char_sovy "起初，我只打算帮你到扳倒哈林为止。\n但我们已经变得如此亲近，你的同伴又是如此包容。\n我从未有过这样的归属感。或许，是一种家的感觉。"

# game/script.rpy:121315
translate chinese map289_b00fa9f7:

    # "With a smile, he takes a book from the shelf, and opens it up."
    "他微笑着，从书架上取下一本书，翻开。"

# game/script.rpy:121340
translate chinese map289_7dedadc6:

    # voice "se/sovy17.ogg"
    # char_sovy "You know, I've been reading about The Monarchy.\nThey seem to be more similar to The Triumvirate than we thought.\nThe Triumvirate demands perfection. The Monarchy sought the perfect future."
    voice "se/sovy17.ogg"
    char_sovy "你知道吗，我一直在读关于王权的书。\n他们似乎和三人执政团比我们以为的更相似。\n三人执政团要求完美。王权追寻完美的未来。"

# game/script.rpy:121344
translate chinese map289_aac0d6bb:

    # voice "se/sovy18.ogg"
    # char_sovy "And it seems like neither group cared about what cost they paid.\nBut it's impossible to pinpoint the moment The Monarchy was imprisoned.\nMany of these books are dated with a system I'm unable to decipher."
    voice "se/sovy18.ogg"
    char_sovy "而且看来，两个群体都不在乎自己付出了什么代价。\n但无法确定王权究竟是在何时被囚禁的。\n这些书大多采用一种我无法解读的纪年方式。"

# game/script.rpy:121358
translate chinese map289_47ec7565:

    # voice "se/sovy19.ogg"
    # char_sovy "So how advanced was The Monarchy when The Triumvirate took action?\nWere they silencing a real threat, or perhaps a potential threat...?\nOne is more acceptable than the other, but neither are just."
    voice "se/sovy19.ogg"
    char_sovy "那么，当三人执政团出手时，王权有多先进？\n他们是在扼杀一个真实的威胁，还是潜在的威胁……？\n前者比后者更说得过去，但两者都不公正。"

# game/script.rpy:121362
translate chinese map289_fbbaf643:

    # voice "se/sovy20.ogg"
    # char_sovy "I find myself wondering what would happen if someone opposed The Monarchy.\nWhat if somebody got in the way of them and their perfect future?\nWould they be killed, just like enemies of The Triumvirate?"
    voice "se/sovy20.ogg"
    char_sovy "我不禁想，如果当初有人反对王权会怎样。\n如果有人挡在他们和他们的完美未来之间呢？\n他们会被杀掉，就像三人执政团的敌人一样吗？"

# game/script.rpy:121376
translate chinese map289_a25f91d8:

    # voice "se/sovy21.ogg"
    # char_sovy "And furthermore, how did they possess foresight to begin with?\nYou inherited it from them. But where did they get it from?\nSorry for rambling. There's just so many questions."
    voice "se/sovy21.ogg"
    char_sovy "再者，他们究竟是怎么拥有预知能力的？\n你从他们那里继承了它。但他们又是从哪儿得来的？\n抱歉我絮絮叨叨。只是问题实在太多了。"

# game/script.rpy:121390
translate chinese map289_a0eda9f2:

    # voice "se/sovy22.ogg"
    # char_sovy "It might be best to just forget The Monarchy ever existed.\nStart over, from scratch, under the banner of The Rebellion.\nWhy reclaim a world for someone who would be your enemy?"
    voice "se/sovy22.ogg"
    char_sovy "也许，最好的做法就是忘了王权曾经存在。\n从零开始，以反抗军的旗帜重建一切。\n何必为了一群会成为你敌人的人，去夺回一个世界？"

# game/script.rpy:121394
translate chinese map289_b5912d0a:

    # voice "se/sovy23.ogg"
    # char_sovy "The Triumvirate controls us, in an attempt to keep everything pure.\nThe Monarchy too, controlled their subjects. Just for a different reason.\nWe want to live free, right? Free to do what we want, and live how we want?"
    voice "se/sovy23.ogg"
    char_sovy "三人执政团控制我们，是为了保持一切纯净。\n王权也控制着他们的子民。只是出于不同的理由。\n我们想要自由地活着，对吧？自由地做想做的事，按想要的方式生活？"

# game/script.rpy:121409
translate chinese map289_8ce61eb8:

    # "I nod."
    "我点了点头。"

# game/script.rpy:121434
translate chinese map289_801ad3f3:

    # voice "se/sovy24.ogg"
    # char_sovy "Why settle for the lesser of two evils?\nForget The Triumvirate. Forget The Monarchy.\nCarve your own path. Follow none tread by others."
    voice "se/sovy24.ogg"
    char_sovy "为什么要退而求其次，在两个恶中选较轻的那个？\n忘掉三人执政团。忘掉王权。\n开辟你自己的道路。别循着任何人走过的足迹。"

# game/script.rpy:121449
translate chinese map289_7700029d:

    # "I shake my head, unsure of how to react.{w}\nThis world didn't belong to The Triumvirate. But not to us, either.{w}\nWe were simply their creation, given free will by The Monarchy."
    "我摇了摇头，不知该如何回应。{w}\n这个世界不属于三人执政团。但也不属于我们。{w}\n我们不过是他们的造物，是王权赋予了自由意志。"

# game/script.rpy:121451
translate chinese map289_727a1a6f:

    # "This seems to have been a conquest meant to reclaim their world.{w}\nThey may not be alive to see it happen, but we should rule it like they did.{w}\nI have the blade, too, and I was from Valinorth. I always looked toward the future."
    "这似乎是一场旨在夺回他们世界的征伐。{w}\n他们或许无法活着看到这一天，但我们应该像他们那样统治它。{w}\n我也有那把剑，我也出自瓦利诺斯。我一向放眼未来。"

# game/script.rpy:121453
translate chinese map289_aa3f8696:

    # "All of those things considered, I was uniquely qualified to rule in their stead.{w}\nI couldn't just use everything they gave me, and then throw away their ideals."
    "考虑到这一切，我格外有资格代替他们来统治。{w}\n我不能白白利用他们给我的一切，然后抛弃他们的理想。"

# game/script.rpy:121478
translate chinese map289_f3bda4e9:

    # voice "se/sovy25.ogg"
    # char_sovy "You don't understand...!"
    voice "se/sovy25.ogg"
    char_sovy "你不明白……！"

# game/script.rpy:121493
translate chinese map289_5878d65a:

    # "He throws the book aside, and pins me back against the wall.{w}\nI stand strong, meeting his gaze — almost as if issuing a direct challenge.{w}\nHis grip is strong, and I can tell he's really passionate about this subject."
    "他把书丢到一边，将我摁在墙上。{w}\n我站得笔直，迎上他的目光——几乎像是在直接挑衅。{w}\n他抓得很紧，看得出他对此事真的很有激情。"

# game/script.rpy:121511
translate chinese map289_9935c791:

    # voice "se/sovy26.ogg"
    # char_sovy "If you let them control your actions, then you'll never truly be free.\nNo matter who you align with, you'll inherit ideals that harm like poison.\nYou need to look to the past, not the future. Avoid the mistakes they made."
    voice "se/sovy26.ogg"
    char_sovy "如果你任由他们掌控你的行为，那你就永远不会真正自由。\n无论你与谁结盟，你都会继承像毒药一样有害的理想。\n你需要回望过去，而不是展望未来。避开他们犯下的错误。"

# game/script.rpy:121530
translate chinese map289_40f454aa:

    # voice "se/sovy27.ogg"
    voice "se/sovy27.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:121532
translate chinese map289_43df4166:

    # char_sovy "That's what I did, and look where it brought me.\nStanding before you, able to think of little else.\nI just don't want to see you fall. You're {i}better{/i}."
    char_sovy "我就是这么做的，看看它把我带到了哪里。\n站在你面前，除了你几乎什么都想不了。\n我只是不想看到你倒下。你{i}更好{/i}。"

# game/script.rpy:121545
translate chinese map289_dd348d5e:

    # voice "se/sovy28.ogg"
    # char_sovy "Better than The Triumvirate. Better than The Monarchy.\nYou're the only person that's ever treated me like I mattered.\nI'm not a slave to you. I'm not just some \"means to an end\"."
    voice "se/sovy28.ogg"
    char_sovy "比三人执政团更好。比王权更好。\n你是唯一一个把我当回事的人。\n我不是你的奴隶。我不只是个“达成目的的手段”。"

# game/script.rpy:121560
translate chinese map289_e3c9353a:

    # "He still has me pinned against the wall, and I feel him tremble.{w}\nA few moments later, he lets go of me. But I pull him back in.{w}\nHe looks away from me, and I can feel his breath against my neck."
    "他仍旧把我摁在墙上，我感觉到他在发抖。{w}\n片刻之后，他松开了我。但我又把他拉了回来。{w}\n他把目光移开，我能感觉到他的呼吸拂过我的颈项。"

# game/script.rpy:121585
translate chinese map289_28f85172:

    # voice "se/sovy29.ogg"
    # char_sovy "I kept telling myself that you weren't giving me any special treatment.\nI wanted to believe that you'd extend the same courtesies to anybody.\nBut then you got me those writing utensils, and I became so confused."
    voice "se/sovy29.ogg"
    char_sovy "我不断告诉自己，你并没有给我什么特殊待遇。\n我想相信，你对任何人都会给予同样的礼遇。\n可后来你送我那些书写工具，我就彻底困惑了。"

# game/script.rpy:121600
translate chinese map289_17252c13:

    # "I can feel a rage well up within him as he speaks.{w}\nWithout warning, he punches the wall beside me with a loud grunt.{w}\nHowever, one of his hands still rests gently at my side. He's conflicted."
    "他开口时，我能感觉到他体内涌起一股怒火。{w}\n毫无预兆地，他低吼一声，一拳砸在我身旁的墙上。{w}\n然而，他的另一只手仍轻轻搭在我身侧。他内心在挣扎。"

# game/script.rpy:121625
translate chinese map289_ff67ce9c:

    # voice "se/sovy30.ogg"
    # char_sovy "I hate that I can't stop thinking about you.\nI hate that I care more about your future than my own!"
    voice "se/sovy30.ogg"
    char_sovy "我恨自己无法停止想你。\n我恨自己在意你的未来胜过在意自己的！"

# game/script.rpy:121640
translate chinese map289_a3dea69d:

    # "He strikes the wall once more, and then looks me dead in the eyes.{w}\nHis second hand returns to my side, and he pins me against the wall again."
    "他又砸了一下墙，然后死死地盯住我的眼睛。{w}\n他第二只手也回到我身侧，再次把我摁在墙上。"

# game/script.rpy:121665
translate chinese map289_eade06de:

    # voice "se/sovy31.ogg"
    # char_sovy "I hate you..."
    voice "se/sovy31.ogg"
    char_sovy "我恨你……"

# game/script.rpy:121693
translate chinese map289_eeae3cf6:

    # "And a moment later, our lips press together.{w}\nI rest my hands on his sides, and then quickly turn the tables.{w}\nSpinning both of us around, I press him against the wall as we continue to kiss."
    "片刻之后，我们的唇贴在了一起。{w}\n我双手放在他身侧，随即迅速扭转局面。{w}\n我把我们两人转了个身，将他压在墙上，继续亲吻。"

# game/script.rpy:121695
translate chinese map289_637ab1ec:

    # "As we take it further, Sovy emits noises that enforce his confusion and anger.{w}\nWe move to different surfaces — the table, and then the bed — as we continue.{w}\nIt felt as natural as it did abrupt, and this is how we spent the rest of our time together."
    "随着我们更进一步，索维发出种种声音，印证着他的困惑与愤怒。{w}\n我们换了几处地方——先是桌子，然后是床——继续着一切。{w}\n这一切既自然而然又来得突然，我们就这样度过了余下的时光。"

# game/script.rpy:121712
translate chinese map289_e7bca9be:

    # "After a few moments of silence, he releases his grip on my body.{w}\nHe turns around, and looks away, as if he's ashamed at his actions."
    "沉默片刻之后，他松开了对我的钳制。{w}\n他转过身去，把目光移开，仿佛为自己的行为感到羞愧。"

# game/script.rpy:121740
translate chinese map289_1f89de9b:

    # voice "se/sovy32.ogg"
    # char_sovy "I apologize, [firstname].\nI let my emotions get the better of me.\nAround you, I feel almost free to express them."
    voice "se/sovy32.ogg"
    char_sovy "我道歉，[firstname]。\n我让情绪占了上风。\n在你身边，我几乎能自由地表达它们。"

# game/script.rpy:121755
translate chinese map289_1a7e7679:

    # "I tell him not to worry, and I accept his apology.{w}\nHis allegiance, at its core, has always been to the world.{w}\nHe just wanted me to take care of it when it was in my hands."
    "我告诉他别担心，并接受了他的道歉。{w}\n他内心深处的忠诚，始终是献给这个世界的。{w}\n他只是希望我在世界交到我手中时，能好好照顾它。"

# game/script.rpy:121780
translate chinese map289_4904bea8:

    # voice "se/sovy33.ogg"
    # char_sovy "It's probably best if we forget this ever happened.\nI'll get back to what I was doing, and see you in the atrium.\nAfter all, we don't have much time left. We've come to the end."
    voice "se/sovy33.ogg"
    char_sovy "我们最好就当这一切从未发生过。\n我要回去忙我的事了，中庭见。\n毕竟，我们剩下的时间不多了。我们已经走到尽头了。"

# game/script.rpy:121795
translate chinese map289_8ec52f61:

    # "Before he leaves, I make sure to tell him that he made a good point.{w}\nIn the future, if his views ever differ, I request that he feel free to speak up.{w}\nA ruler needs some people to help them walk the right path — myself included."
    "在他离开之前，我特意告诉他，他说得很有道理。{w}\n将来，如果他的看法不同，我希望他能畅所欲言。{w}\n一位统治者需要有人帮他们走在正道上——包括我自己。"

# game/script.rpy:121820
translate chinese map289_34b18860:

    # voice "se/sovy34.ogg"
    # char_sovy "Very well."
    voice "se/sovy34.ogg"
    char_sovy "很好。"

# game/script.rpy:121845
translate chinese map289_695692f4:

    # "With a nod, he leaves the room.{w}\nI pick up the book he threw, and put it back on the shelf.{w}\nAs time goes by, I feel the weight of the world rest upon my shoulders."
    "他点点头，离开了房间。{w}\n我捡起他丢下的书，放回书架。{w}\n随着时间流逝，我感到整个世界都压在了我的肩上。"

# game/script.rpy:121847
translate chinese map289_aa9d7142:

    # "After we won — if we won — the real work would begin.{w}\nWe had to win the people over, and figure out how we'd handle Alestia.{w}\nBecause of Sovy, I'm now filled with doubt. Was there any {i}right{/i} way to rule the world?"
    "等我们赢了——如果我们赢了——真正的工作才会开始。{w}\n我们必须赢得民心，并想清楚该如何治理阿莱斯蒂亚。{w}\n因为索维，我如今满是疑虑。统治这个世界真的存在{i}正确{/i}的方式吗？"

# game/script.rpy:121849
translate chinese map289_d34417c0:

    # "I don't know. I really don't.{w}\nAll we can do is avoid mistakes of the past.{w}\nBut that only paves the way for us to make {i}new{/i} mistakes."
    "我不知道。我真的不知道。{w}\n我们能做的，只是避开过去的错误。{w}\n但那只会为我们犯下{i}新{/i}错误铺平道路。"

# game/script.rpy:121851
translate chinese map289_53ad1adb:

    # "All I could do, was hope that these new mistakes didn't harm the world.{w}\nI meant well — but at the end of the day — that doesn't really count for much.{w}\nThe Triumvirate and The Monarchy both went well; and look at what happened."
    "我唯一能做的，就是希望这些新错误不会伤害这个世界。{w}\n我本意是好的——但归根结底——那其实算不上什么。{w}\n三人执政团和王权的本意也都是好的；看看后来发生了什么。"

# game/script.rpy:121876
translate chinese map179_2043960a:

    # "We enter the tavern, and make sure to stick close together.{w}\nIt was packed, noisy, and the patrons seemed pretty rowdy.{w}\nI make sure to stick by Ulric in case something breaks out."
    "我们走进酒馆，紧紧挨在一起。{w}\n这里人满为患，吵吵嚷嚷，顾客们似乎相当喧闹。{w}\n我紧跟着乌尔里克，以防出什么事。"

# game/script.rpy:121898
translate chinese map179_4cde0007:

    # voice "se/z01740.ogg"
    voice "se/z01740.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:121900
translate chinese map179_3a633e07:

    # char_ulric "It looks just like I remember it.\nAll these years — and nothing has changed.\nI guess there's no use trying to change perfection."
    char_ulric "它看起来就和我记忆里一模一样。\n这么多年过去了——什么都没变。\n我想，试图改变完美的东西是没用的。"

# game/script.rpy:121925
translate chinese map179_dfe66fe8:

    # voice "se/z01741.ogg"
    voice "se/z01741.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:121928
translate chinese map179_1114bed6:

    # char_howl "Yes. It looks much like it did in our time, as well.\nIf memory serves, Alarinthia is home to a unique wine.\n[firstname]. If you have a drink, we would suggest that."
    char_howl "没错。它和我们那个年代的样子也差不多。\n如果我没记错，阿拉林西亚出产一种独特的酒。\n[firstname]。如果你要喝点什么，我们推荐那个。"

# game/script.rpy:121953
translate chinese map179_9e4adbdf:

    # voice "se/z01742.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Wow, he actually knows what he's talking about.\nI'm buying a few bottles to bring back to the mainland.\nThe climate of Alarinthia affects the taste of everything."
    voice "se/z01742.ogg"
    char_ulric "哇，他居然真知道自己在说什么。\n我要买几瓶带回大陆去。\n阿拉林西亚的气候影响着一切事物的味道。"

# game/script.rpy:121957
translate chinese map179_dd1c2d9c:

    # voice "se/z01743.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Some in a good way, and some in a bad way.\nI won't bore you with the details, but the wine is great.\nLet's find Vivien and get everything started, shall we?"
    voice "se/z01743.ogg"
    char_ulric "有些是好的影响，有些是坏的。\n我就不拿细节烦你了，但那酒确实很棒。\n我们去找薇薇安，把一切办起来吧？"

# game/script.rpy:121984
translate chinese map179_0ae1803f:

    # "We all nod to one another, and venture deeper into the tavern.{w}\nIt's an open place, with no doors. I can see right outside to the market.{w}\nIt makes things noisy — almost unbearably so — but I'll have to deal with it."
    "我们互相点了点头，往酒馆深处走去。{w}\n这是个敞开的地方，没有门。我能直接看到外面的集市。{w}\n这让这里很吵闹——几乎吵得让人受不了——但我只好忍着。"

# game/script.rpy:121986
translate chinese map179_d814af62:

    # "We approach the bar. I assume Ulric is going to ask after Vivien.{w}\nI can't even see Drakeor. I look around and notice a bunch of eyes on us.{w}\nPart of me starts to wonder if this {i}was{/i} a trap. Something feels odd."
    "我们走近吧台。我以为乌尔里克会去打听薇薇安。{w}\n我连德雷克的人影都没看到。我环顾四周，注意到许多目光落在我们身上。{w}\n我内心开始怀疑，这{i}是不是{/i}个陷阱。总觉得有些不对劲。"

# game/script.rpy:121988
translate chinese map179_757d6fb9:

    # "A man sneaks up from behind us, and stands between me and Ulric.{w}\nHe has a drink in his hand, and he slams it down on the table.{w}\nSome of it spills on the bar. This man must be intoxicated."
    "一个男人从我们身后悄悄靠近，站到我和乌尔里克之间。{w}\n他手里端着一杯酒，重重地把它砸在桌上。{w}\n有些酒溅到了吧台上。这人一定是喝醉了。"

# game/script.rpy:122013
translate chinese map179_860db2a9:

    # voice "se/z01744.ogg"
    voice "se/z01744.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:122019
translate chinese map179_17dae9fc:

    # char_jit_map179_1_0_78 "Hey, would you let me buy you a drink?\nSomething tells me you're not from around here.\nI know a lot about this place, if you need a tour guide."
    char_jit_map179_1_0_78 "嘿，能让我请你喝一杯吗？\n我总觉得你不是本地人。\n如果你需要向导，我对这地方知道得可多了。"

# game/script.rpy:122033
translate chinese map179_00eadc52:

    # "Before I can answer, Ulric gently pushes them away."
    "还没等我回答，乌尔里克就轻轻地把他推开了。"

# game/script.rpy:122058
translate chinese map179_21ea14df:

    # voice "se/z01745.ogg"
    voice "se/z01745.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:122060
translate chinese map179_94cea4a0:

    # char_ulric "Look, we don't have time for any antics.\nBut if you know where Vivien is, we could use some help.\nYou're right about us being foreigners. We've come a long way."
    char_ulric "听着，我们没时间陪你胡闹。\n但如果你知道薇薇安在哪，我们倒需要些帮忙。\n你说对了，我们是外地人。我们走了很远的路。"

# game/script.rpy:122085
translate chinese map179_3ecd0082:

    # voice "se/z01746.ogg"
    # char_jit_map179_1_0_78 "Oh, you're looking for Vivien...?\nWhy didn't you say so? Follow me."
    voice "se/z01746.ogg"
    char_jit_map179_1_0_78 "哦，你们在找薇薇安……？\n怎么不早说？跟我来。"

# game/script.rpy:122100
translate chinese map179_5cbbbde1:

    # "Ulric and I stare at each other, at unease."
    "我和乌尔里克不安地对视了一眼。"

# game/script.rpy:122125
translate chinese map179_dfcb69dc:

    # voice "se/z01747.ogg"
    # char_ulric "We'd rather stay here, if you don't mind.\nFollowing strangers isn't the best idea."
    voice "se/z01747.ogg"
    char_ulric "如果你不介意，我们宁愿留在这儿。\n跟着陌生人走可不是什么好主意。"

# game/script.rpy:122151
translate chinese map179_7d5ef762:

    # voice "se/z01748.ogg"
    # char_jit_map179_1_0_78 "Alright, alright. I'll be right back.\nNormally, I wouldn't do this. But I trust you.\nHave I seen you before...? You look familiar."
    voice "se/z01748.ogg"
    char_jit_map179_1_0_78 "好吧，好吧。我马上回来。\n一般情况下我不会这么做。但我信得过你们。\n我以前见过你吗……？你看起来很眼熟。"

# game/script.rpy:122177
translate chinese map179_c7b45023:

    # voice "se/z01749.ogg"
    # char_ulric "No. Now please leave us be.\nDon't bother us again unless you have Vivien.\nI'll ask the barkeep in the meantime. Maybe they know."
    voice "se/z01749.ogg"
    char_ulric "没有。现在请你别打扰我们了。\n除非你带着薇薇安，否则别再烦我们。\n我先去问问酒保。也许他们知道。"

# game/script.rpy:122199
translate chinese map179_0664a07e:

    # "The mystery man nods and walks away from us.{w}\nI doubt he'd be coming back. He was probably a scammer.{w}\nIs there something about us that marks us as easy targets...?"
    "那个神秘的男人点点头，走开了。{w}\n我怀疑他不会回来了。他多半是个骗子。{w}\n我们身上有什么东西让我们看起来像好骗的目标吗……？"

# game/script.rpy:122224
translate chinese map179_914149d2:

    # voice "se/z01750.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Now, I guess I'll start—"
    voice "se/z01750.ogg"
    char_ulric "那么，我想我该开始——"

# game/script.rpy:122239
translate chinese map179_6bf8899d:

    # "Before he can continue, Drakeor sneaks up behind us."
    "还没等他说下去，德雷克从我们身后悄悄出现。"

# game/script.rpy:122264
translate chinese map179_8383716f:

    # voice "se/z01751.ogg"
    voice "se/z01751.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:122270
translate chinese map179_84bf7d85:

    # char_jit_map179_1_0_210 "Your manners could use some work, Ulric."
    char_jit_map179_1_0_210 "你的礼貌还有待改进，乌尔里克。"

# game/script.rpy:122295
translate chinese map179_b5b0a5b8:

    # voice "se/z01752.ogg"
    # char_ulric "I use my manners on worthwhile people."
    voice "se/z01752.ogg"
    char_ulric "我只对值得的人讲礼貌。"

# game/script.rpy:122321
translate chinese map179_427c215d:

    # voice "se/z01753.ogg"
    # char_jit_map179_1_0_210 "And Vivien isn't one of them...?\nI saw how you just shoved him away."
    voice "se/z01753.ogg"
    char_jit_map179_1_0_210 "薇薇安不算是其中之一……？\n我看见你刚才是怎么把他推开的。"

# game/script.rpy:122347
translate chinese map179_2790b1fc:

    # voice "se/z01754.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Wait, what...?\nVivien is a man?"
    voice "se/z01754.ogg"
    char_ulric "等等，什么……？\n薇薇安是个男人？"

# game/script.rpy:122373
translate chinese map179_8587002e:

    # voice "se/z01755.ogg"
    # char_jit_map179_1_0_210 "And an honorable one, at that.\nHe deserves to be treated with respect."
    voice "se/z01755.ogg"
    char_jit_map179_1_0_210 "而且还是个可敬的人。\n他值得受人尊重。"

# game/script.rpy:122399
translate chinese map179_2be91278:

    # voice "se/z01756.ogg"
    # char_ulric "I don't believe you."
    voice "se/z01756.ogg"
    char_ulric "我不信你。"

# game/script.rpy:122425
translate chinese map179_9c4ce64d:

    # voice "se/z01757.ogg"
    # char_jit_map179_1_0_210 "Most people don't. His parents chose the name.\nIf anything, it keeps the assassins looking for the wrong person.\nTry and tell me you weren't looking for a female when you entered."
    voice "se/z01757.ogg"
    char_jit_map179_1_0_210 "大多数人都不会信。这名字是他父母取的。\n真要说的话，这倒能让刺客们找错目标。\n你敢说，你刚进来的时候不是在找一个女人？"

# game/script.rpy:122440
translate chinese map179_ab05e3d7:

    # "Ulric shrugs. Drakeor had a point, though."
    "乌尔里克耸了耸肩。不过德雷克说得有道理。"

# game/script.rpy:122465
translate chinese map179_77e2393d:

    # voice "se/z01758.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Let's get this over with, then.\nWe need to talk about securing an alliance.\nThen, we'll do the same with Draycu, and take the best deal."
    voice "se/z01758.ogg"
    char_ulric "那就赶紧把这事办了吧。\n我们得先谈谈结盟的事。\n然后再去找德雷库谈同样的条件，选更好的那笔交易。"

# game/script.rpy:122487
translate chinese map179_327edb52:

    # "Vivien approaches us, and stands beside Drakeor."
    "薇薇安朝我们走来，站到了德雷克身旁。"

# game/script.rpy:122512
translate chinese map179_ece30cfb:

    # voice "se/z01759.ogg"
    voice "se/z01759.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:122515
translate chinese map179_3514472d:

    # char_jit_map179_1_0_78 "You told them? I was having fun, Drakeor.\nThat's in short supply these days. Thanks a lot."
    char_jit_map179_1_0_78 "你都告诉他们了？我正玩得开心呢，德雷克。\n这种乐子最近可不多见。真是多谢你了。"

# game/script.rpy:122528
translate chinese map179_5c634fe7:

    # voice "se/z01760.ogg"
    # char_jit_map179_1_0_210 "They're on a strict schedule, Vivien.\nThe ball opens up in a matter of hours.\nRemember, you still have a move to make."
    voice "se/z01760.ogg"
    char_jit_map179_1_0_210 "他们的行程排得很紧，薇薇安。\n再过几个小时，舞会就要开始了。\n记住，你还有一步棋要走。"

# game/script.rpy:122542
translate chinese map179_644dd8c7:

    # voice "se/z01761.ogg"
    # char_jit_map179_1_0_78 "Right, right. A challenge at the ball.\nMove aside, I'll explain our plan to Ulric.\nIf he has any sense, he'll aid our cause."
    voice "se/z01761.ogg"
    char_jit_map179_1_0_78 "对，对。在舞会上发起挑战。\n让开，我来跟乌尔里克解释我们的计划。\n他要是有点头脑，就会助我们一臂之力。"

# game/script.rpy:122564
translate chinese map179_f27f063c:

    # "Drakeor nods, and steps aside.{w}\nOur comrades gather around, having realized what's going on."
    "德雷克点点头，退到一旁。{w}\n我们的同伴意识到发生了什么事，纷纷围了过来。"

# game/script.rpy:122589
translate chinese map179_3b9e455e:

    # voice "se/z01762.ogg"
    voice "se/z01762.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:122591
translate chinese map179_96450e63:

    # char_fortaime "So Vivien is a guy...?"
    char_fortaime "所以薇薇安是个男的……？"

# game/script.rpy:122604
translate chinese map179_80a8198b:

    # voice "se/z01763.ogg"
    # char_valessa "I guess so. But don't say that too loud.\nSomething tells me it's not common knowledge."
    voice "se/z01763.ogg"
    char_valessa "好像是吧。不过别说得太大声。\n我总觉得，这可不是人尽都知的事。"

# game/script.rpy:122618
translate chinese map179_397175e0:

    # voice "se/z01764.ogg"
    voice "se/z01764.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:122620
translate chinese map179_0fca0166:

    # char_pro "Very smart. Helps you stay incognito.\nWe were all looking for a girl, weren't we?"
    char_pro "很聪明。这样更容易隐姓埋名。\n我们之前不都在找一个女孩吗？"

# game/script.rpy:122633
translate chinese map179_f91aba38:

    # voice "se/z01765.ogg"
    # char_damek "Yeah, something like that.\nEither way, I'm glad this worked out.\nWe should probably talk terms with him."
    voice "se/z01765.ogg"
    char_damek "是啊，差不多吧。\n不管怎么说，我很高兴事情有了着落。\n我们大概该跟他谈谈条件了。"

# game/script.rpy:122649
translate chinese map179_e8ac5d7e:

    # voice "se/z01766.ogg"
    voice "se/z01766.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:122651
translate chinese map179_a0253809:

    # char_jit_map179_1_0_78 "You have a nice group of comrades, Ulric.\nStart by telling me about {i}him{/i}, though."
    char_jit_map179_1_0_78 "你这群同伴不错，乌尔里克。\n不过，先跟我讲讲{i}他{/i}吧。"

# game/script.rpy:122656
translate chinese map179_57806f13:

    # voice "se/z01767.ogg"
    voice "se/z01767.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:122658
translate chinese map179_2d4d3e4f:

    # char_jit_map179_1_0_78 "You have a nice group of comrades, Ulric.\nStart by telling me about {i}her{/i}, though."
    char_jit_map179_1_0_78 "你这群同伴不错，乌尔里克。\n不过，先跟我讲讲{i}她{/i}吧。"

# game/script.rpy:122674
translate chinese map179_4a65b744:

    # "Vivien stares at me. That was a reasonable request.{w}\nMy position beside Ulric implied we were closer than the rest."
    "薇薇安盯着我。这要求合情合理。{w}\n我站在乌尔里克身边，暗示着我们的关系比其他人更近。"

# game/script.rpy:122701
translate chinese map179_c5ddb961:

    # voice "se/z01768.ogg"
    voice "se/z01768.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:122703
translate chinese map179_eebb0662:

    # char_ulric "This is The Monarch. Heir to the throne of Alestia.\nAfter we take down The Triumvirate, this is his world.\nA crazy claim, I know — but we have proof of everything."
    char_ulric "这位是君主。阿莱斯蒂亚王位的继承人。\n等我们扳倒三人执政团，这个世界就是他的。\n我知道这说法听起来很疯狂——但每件事我们都有证据。"

# game/script.rpy:122708
translate chinese map179_c5899eb6:

    # voice "se/z01769.ogg"
    voice "se/z01769.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:122710
translate chinese map179_faf340de:

    # char_ulric "This is The Monarch. Heir to the throne of Alestia.\nAfter we take down The Triumvirate, this is her world.\nA crazy claim, I know — but we have proof of everything."
    char_ulric "这位是君主。阿莱斯蒂亚王位的继承人。\n等我们扳倒三人执政团，这个世界就是她的。\n我知道这说法听起来很疯狂——但每件事我们都有证据。"

# game/script.rpy:122726
translate chinese map179_47c266f1:

    # "Vivien blinks a few times, clearly confused."
    "薇薇安眨了几下眼，显然一头雾水。"

# game/script.rpy:122751
translate chinese map179_546332ec:

    # voice "se/z01770.ogg"
    # char_jit_map179_1_0_78 "Let's continue under the assumption that I understand.\nAt the end of the day, you want my army to aid you, right?"
    voice "se/z01770.ogg"
    char_jit_map179_1_0_78 "那就假设我听懂了，我们继续吧。\n说到底，你是想让我出兵帮你们，对吧？"

# game/script.rpy:122777
translate chinese map179_5db4e033:

    # voice "se/z01771.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Right."
    voice "se/z01771.ogg"
    char_ulric "没错。"

# game/script.rpy:122803
translate chinese map179_e41bcf54:

    # voice "se/z01772.ogg"
    # char_jit_map179_1_0_78 "Well, this is where it gets a bit weird.\nI want your army just as much as you want mine.\nMaybe we can come to some sort of conclusion...?"
    voice "se/z01772.ogg"
    char_jit_map179_1_0_78 "嗯，这里就有点奇妙了。\n我需要你的军队，就像你需要我的一样。\n也许我们能谈出个结果来……？"

# game/script.rpy:122819
translate chinese map179_7818a6f8:

    # voice "se/z01773.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Go on."
    voice "se/z01773.ogg"
    char_ulric "继续说。"

# game/script.rpy:122845
translate chinese map179_5e216110:

    # voice "se/z01774.ogg"
    # char_jit_map179_1_0_78 "I'm going to Draycu's ball and challenging him.\nTomorrow, I plan to be fighting for the throne.\nWe'll do it right. One last fight in the coliseum."
    voice "se/z01774.ogg"
    char_jit_map179_1_0_78 "我要去德雷库的舞会，向他发起挑战。\n明天，我打算为争夺王位而战。\n我们会按规矩来。在竞技场上打最后一场。"

# game/script.rpy:122859
translate chinese map179_c170d853:

    # voice "se/z01775.ogg"
    # char_jit_map179_1_0_78 "I had Drakeor stay at the docks to watch the new arrivals.\nIf he found a group that looked strong enough, he'd tell me.\nYou fit the bill, better than anyone else, so he spied on you."
    voice "se/z01775.ogg"
    char_jit_map179_1_0_78 "我让德雷克守在码头，留意新来的人。\n要是他发现一支看起来够强的队伍，就会告诉我。\n你们比谁都符合条件，所以他盯上了你们。"

# game/script.rpy:122863
translate chinese map179_4182b7b8:

    # voice "se/z01776.ogg"
    # char_jit_map179_1_0_78 "He heard your group talking about a Rebellion, and a big army.\nThat's when I knew we hit the jackpot. Our new target was clear.\nBut to know you came here just for me? That's pretty flattering."
    voice "se/z01776.ogg"
    char_jit_map179_1_0_78 "他听到你们这群人在谈论反抗军，还有一支庞大的军队。\n那时我就知道，我们中大奖了。新目标已经明确。\n不过，知道你们是专程为我而来？这还真让人受宠若惊。"

# game/script.rpy:122877
translate chinese map179_8b801e9a:

    # voice "se/z01777.ogg"
    # char_jit_map179_1_0_78 "If you help me take down Draycu in the coliseum, I'll help {i}you{/i}.\nI can offer a few hundred men, and maybe more from my throne.\nWho knows how many people I can rally up if I take over this nation."
    voice "se/z01777.ogg"
    char_jit_map179_1_0_78 "如果你们帮我在竞技场上扳倒德雷库，我就会帮{i}你们{/i}。\n我能提供几百人，等我登上王位，也许还能更多。\n要是我接管了这个国家，谁知道我能召集起多少人。"

# game/script.rpy:122903
translate chinese map179_90233d36:

    # voice "se/z01778.ogg"
    # char_ulric "But you don't just care about power, right?\nYou plan to change this nation for the better."
    voice "se/z01778.ogg"
    char_ulric "但你并不只在乎权力，对吧？\n你打算让这个国家变得更好。"

# game/script.rpy:122929
translate chinese map179_b6fbbe79:

    # voice "se/z01779.ogg"
    # char_jit_map179_1_0_78 "Yes. I plan to model ourselves like the mainland.\nElections, voters, stuff like that. No more “tournaments”.\nWe've lost too many amazing people to barbaric, outdated laws."
    voice "se/z01779.ogg"
    char_jit_map179_1_0_78 "没错。我打算让我们效仿大陆。\n选举、投票，诸如此类。再也不搞什么“锦标赛”。\n那些野蛮过时的律法，已经让我们失去太多优秀的人了。"

# game/script.rpy:122955
translate chinese map179_8924a874:

    # voice "se/z01780.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Vivien, I'll be honest with you here. I want to support you.\nBut the final choice rests with [firstname], after the ball.\nWe need to talk with Draycu first, and weigh out our options."
    voice "se/z01780.ogg"
    char_ulric "薇薇安，我就跟你直说了。我想支持你。\n但最终的决定权在[firstname]手上，要等舞会之后。\n我们得先跟德雷库谈谈，权衡一下选择。"

# game/script.rpy:122981
translate chinese map179_00e437a3:

    # voice "se/z01781.ogg"
    # char_jit_map179_1_0_78 "Understandable. But be warned, that's when I'm making my move.\nIf he accepts my challenge, we'll be fighting in the morning.\nYou better hurry. That ball is known for huge lines."
    voice "se/z01781.ogg"
    char_jit_map179_1_0_78 "可以理解。但提醒你，那时候我就要动手了。\n要是他接受我的挑战，我们明早就得开打。\n你们最好快点。那场舞会可是出了名的大排长龙。"

# game/script.rpy:122996
translate chinese map179_9fd9a07a:

    # "Ulric looks over at Pro, and they nod to each other."
    "乌尔里克望向普洛，两人互相点了点头。"

# game/script.rpy:123021
translate chinese map179_fed2c18f:

    # voice "se/z01782.ogg"
    # char_ulric "[firstname], I need to tell you something.\nThis is my homeland, and I've always wanted to change it.\nI have to fight alongside Vivien, even if you ally with Draycu."
    voice "se/z01782.ogg"
    char_ulric "[firstname]，我得跟你说件事。\n这里是我的故乡，我一直想改变它。\n就算你与德雷库结盟，我也必须和薇薇安并肩作战。"

# game/script.rpy:123025
translate chinese map179_a66ef11b:

    # voice "se/z01783.ogg"
    # char_ulric "And if Draycu's terms involve destroying Vivien's insurrection...?\nWell, then I think we'll be fighting each other in the coliseum.\nRemember that these are fights to the death. I have no other choice."
    voice "se/z01783.ogg"
    char_ulric "那如果德雷库的条件是铲除薇薇安的起义……？\n那我想，我们就要在竞技场上兵戎相见了。\n记住，这是生死决斗。我别无选择。"

# game/script.rpy:123040
translate chinese map179_936dd4c7:

    # "Fighting Ulric...? There's no way I could do that."
    "和乌尔里克战斗……？我绝不可能做得到。"

# game/script.rpy:123065
translate chinese map179_31565305:

    # voice "se/z01784.ogg"
    # char_jit_map179_1_0_78 "I'll choose Ulric as my champion, then."
    voice "se/z01784.ogg"
    char_jit_map179_1_0_78 "那我就选乌尔里克当我的斗士。"

# game/script.rpy:123080
translate chinese map179_f6b07ba8:

    # "Champion...?"
    "斗士……？"

# game/script.rpy:123105
translate chinese map179_83d31e67:

    # voice "se/z01785.ogg"
    # char_jit_map179_1_0_78 "Each side gets to choose a champion to fight with them.\nAside from that, they get to choose twenty to thirty fighters.\nEverybody that didn't make the cut for champion, as an example."
    voice "se/z01785.ogg"
    char_jit_map179_1_0_78 "每一方都可以选一名斗士与自己并肩作战。\n除此之外，还能挑选二三十名战士。\n比如说，那些没被选为斗士的人。"

# game/script.rpy:123109
translate chinese map179_f016aa25:

    # voice "se/z01786.ogg"
    # char_jit_map179_1_0_78 "This means that myself, Ulric, and my army would fight in the coliseum.\nThe battle ends when either the champion, or the leader, has fallen.\nNow, I know for a fact that Draycu doesn't like to lose his own men."
    voice "se/z01786.ogg"
    char_jit_map179_1_0_78 "这意味着，我、乌尔里克，还有我的军队会在竞技场上作战。\n只要斗士或领袖倒下，战斗就结束。\n而我很清楚，德雷库不喜欢折损自己的人。"

# game/script.rpy:123123
translate chinese map179_5ecb6f1e:

    # voice "se/z01787.ogg"
    # char_jit_map179_1_0_78 "So if I challenge him at the ball, after you ask him for his support...?\nI bet he'll make you fight me for it. You know, use {i}your{/i} men instead.\nHe's predictable, but you can use that to your advantage, [firstname]."
    voice "se/z01787.ogg"
    char_jit_map179_1_0_78 "所以，要是我在舞会上向他发起挑战，就在你向他求援之后……？\n我敢打赌，他会让你们替他出战。你懂的，改用{i}你们{/i}的人。\n他很好预测，而这正是你能利用的优势，[firstname]。"

# game/script.rpy:123149
translate chinese map179_a5436113:

    # voice "se/z01788.ogg"
    # char_ulric "I hope it doesn't come down to fighting each other.\nBut for the future of this nation, I will do what I must.\nNow let's get to that ball and see what Draycu wants."
    voice "se/z01788.ogg"
    char_ulric "我希望事情不要演变成我们互相厮杀。\n但为了这个国家的未来，我会做我必须做的事。\n现在，我们去舞会吧，看看德雷库想要什么。"

# game/script.rpy:123175
translate chinese map179_64cf55db:

    # voice "se/z01789.ogg"
    # char_jit_map179_1_0_78 "He's probably expecting you.\nIf Drakeor scoped you out, I'm betting Westy did, too.\nThat's Draycu's right hand. Just be careful out there."
    voice "se/z01789.ogg"
    char_jit_map179_1_0_78 "他多半在等着你们。\n既然德雷克盯上了你们，我猜韦斯蒂也一样。\n那是德雷库的得力助手。出去之后小心点。"

# game/script.rpy:123179
translate chinese map179_761017fa:

    # voice "se/z01790.ogg"
    # char_jit_map179_1_0_78 "I'll be making my move right after he addresses his people.\nMake sure you're there. That happens in the throne room.\nJust, don't make the wrong choice, [firstname]. Go with me."
    voice "se/z01790.ogg"
    char_jit_map179_1_0_78 "等他向民众致辞后，我就会动手。\n你们务必到场。那会在王座厅举行。\n只是，别做错选择，[firstname]。站到我这边来。"

# game/script.rpy:123206
translate chinese map179_462b7319:

    # "He smiles before walking away with Drakeor in tow.{w}\nSo he needed us just as much as we needed him...?{w}\nI guess, in this case, that worked in our favor."
    "他笑了笑，带着德雷克转身离去。{w}\n所以他需要我们，就像我们需要他一样……？{w}\n我想，这一次，这对我们有利。"

# game/script.rpy:123208
translate chinese map179_a66fe35c:

    # "I didn't expect Ulric to side with Vivien, though.{w}\nI thought he'd wait for my choice, and fight alongside me.{w}\nTo know we could be enemies in the coliseum? That's terrifying."
    "不过，我没想到乌尔里克会站到薇薇安那边。{w}\n我以为他会等我的选择，再与我并肩作战。{w}\n一想到我们可能在竞技场上成为敌人？太可怕了。"

# game/script.rpy:123210
translate chinese map179_60c86cd7:

    # "But it seems like a real possibility with each passing second.{w}\nIt'd make sense for Draycu to use expendable foreigners as his supporting fighters.{w}\nAt the end of the day, it really only mattered who the leader and the champion were."
    "可每过一秒，这可能性就变得更真切。{w}\n德雷库拿我们这些可有可无的外乡人当辅助战力，也说得通。{w}\n说到底，真正重要的只有领袖和斗士是谁。"

# game/script.rpy:123212
translate chinese map179_c28b87fd:

    # "Vivien and Ulric...{w}\nDraycu and who...?{w}\nI guess we'd find out."
    "薇薇安和乌尔里克……{w}\n德雷库和谁……？{w}\n我想，我们很快就会知道。"

# game/script.rpy:123214
translate chinese map179_01f02c23:

    # "We stay in the tavern for a while before leaving.{w}\nHowever, our next destination was clear. The castle.{w}\nHopefully the line for the ball wasn't horribly long."
    "我们在酒馆里又待了一阵子才离开。{w}\n不过，下一个目的地很明确。城堡。{w}\n但愿舞会门口的队伍别排得太离谱。"

# game/script.rpy:123516
translate chinese click_map180_6_EV006_e7b93957:

    # "Cannot access content at this time.\nIf there is an X, you must complete preceding Heart-to-Hearts.\nIf there is a checkmark, you must move on to the next Heart-to-Heart."
    "目前无法访问此内容。\n若显示叉号，你必须先完成前置的心灵对话。\n若显示对勾，你必须前往下一个心灵对话。"

# game/script.rpy:123539
translate chinese click_map180_9_EV009_cf145c57:

    # "It's odd — no matter where I go, taverns are all the same.{w}\nThere was Peregrino, the tavern in Mazeo, and now this.{w}\nI guess no matter where you are, some things never change."
    "真奇怪——不管我走到哪儿，酒馆都是一个样。{w}\n有佩雷格里诺，马泽奥的那家酒馆，现在又到了这里。{w}\n我想，不管你身在何处，有些东西永远不会变。"

# game/script.rpy:123576
translate chinese click_map180_10_EV010_d997ae70:

    # "There are paintings here. I'm not sure who they're supposed to be.{w}\nOn closer inspection, one of them looks like Ulric — the legendary one.{w}\nDoes Draycu not care that paintings of his enemies are out in the open?"
    "这里有画。我说不准画的是谁。{w}\n仔细一看，其中一幅长得像乌尔里克——传说里的那个乌尔里克。{w}\n德雷库就不介意自己敌人的画像公然挂在这里吗？"

# game/script.rpy:123613
translate chinese click_map180_11_EV011_1962f320:

    # "The tavern is open, and I can see back outside.{w}\nBeing connected to the marketplace is a genius idea.{w}\nPeople enter and leave like it's a normal part of their day."
    "酒馆敞开着，我能看到外面的景象。{w}\n和集市连在一起，这主意真是太妙了。{w}\n人们进进出出，就像这是日常生活的一部分。"

