    # "Sovy knelt before his masters, with Halin and Shane behind him.{w}\nThe time had finally come to tell them what happened in Mazeo.{w}\nHaving Halin's support, however, meant they wouldn't learn the full truth."
    "索维跪在他的主人们面前，哈林和肖恩站在他身后。{w}\n终于到了该向他们禀报马泽奥之事的时刻。{w}\n然而，有哈林站在他这边，就意味着他们无法得知全部真相。"

