    # "Sovy's loud cry echoes through The Triumvirate's chambers.{w}\nHis masters shake their heads, clearly displeased at this news."
    "索维的怒吼在三人执政团的议事厅里回荡。{w}\n他的主人们摇了摇头，显然对这消息很不满。"

# game/script.rpy:124848
translate chinese map204_79336c61:

    # voice "se/x00396.ogg"
    # char_halin "He planned to deceive you all along.\nIn fact, he had me promise to lie as well.\nI did, but I planned to tell you regardless."
    voice "se/x00396.ogg"
    char_halin "他从一开始就打算欺骗你们。\n事实上，他还让我答应一起撒谎。\n我确实答应了，但我本来就打算无论如何都要告诉你们。"

# game/script.rpy:124863
translate chinese map204_2151823c:

    # "Halin kneels down, swearing fealty."
    "哈林跪下，宣誓效忠。"

# game/script.rpy:124878
translate chinese map204_f158caef:

    # voice "se/x00397.ogg"
    # char_halin "I am unable to lie to you, Masters.\nYou gave me life, and for that I am grateful.\nShane and myself can carry out the next mission."
    voice "se/x00397.ogg"
    char_halin "我无法对你们撒谎，主人们。\n是你们给了我生命，我对此心怀感激。\n下一次任务，我和肖恩可以完成。"

# game/script.rpy:124882
translate chinese map204_13fbc8cf:

    # voice "se/x00398.ogg"
    # char_halin "At this time, Sovy is unfit for duty.\nIt pains me to say, but it is the truth."
    voice "se/x00398.ogg"
    char_halin "眼下，索维不适合再执行任务。\n这话说出来让我难受，但这是事实。"

