translate chinese map204_6465f002:

    # "The Triumvirate pauses, thinking for a few minutes.{w}\nAn eerie silence fills the room before they speak again.{w}\nSovy and Halin, both kneeling, look up at their masters."
    "三人执政团沉默下来，思索了几分钟。{w}\n在他们再次开口前，一股诡异的寂静充斥着整个房间。{w}\n跪着的索维和哈林都抬起头，望向他们的主人们。"

