# game/script.rpy:130532
translate chinese map191_26ab1e28:

    # "When I enter the ballroom, I notice my comrades scattered about.{w}\nThey're all enjoying themselves, and having the time of their lives.{w}\nDraycu spared no expense. This was fancier than anything I've ever seen."
    "我走进舞厅时，注意到同伴们散落在各处。{w}\n他们都很尽兴，享受着人生中最快乐的时光。{w}\n德雷库不惜血本。这比我见过的任何场面都要奢华。"

# game/script.rpy:130534
translate chinese map191_46359cf8:

    # "There's a live band, playing music that's pleasant to the ear.{w}\nCouples sway about on the dance floor, while others feast on a buffet.{w}\nAn open bar attracts many patrons. There's something for everyone here."
    "有现场乐队演奏着悦耳的音乐。{w}\n舞池里成双成对的人轻轻摇摆，其他人则在自助餐台前大快朵颐。{w}\n开放式酒吧吸引了许多宾客。这里人人都能找到所爱。"

# game/script.rpy:130536
translate chinese map191_15c6496e:

    # "My comrades notice me, and give me smiles as they enjoy the party.{w}\nAs I'm about to step forward, somebody bumps into me from behind.{w}\nIt was clearly on purpose, to grab my attention. I quickly turn around."
    "同伴们注意到了我，一边享受宴会一边朝我微笑。{w}\n我正要迈步向前，身后有人撞了我一下。{w}\n那显然是故意的，为了引起我的注意。我迅速转过身。"

