    # voice "se/z01861.ogg"
    # char_jit_map191_1_0_38 "I'm glad to hear it. \nThank you for your cooperation.\nWith that said, I have a ball to enjoy."
    voice "se/z01861.ogg"
    char_jit_map191_1_0_38 "听你这么说我很高兴。\n谢谢你的配合。\n话虽如此，我还有舞会要享受。"

# game/script.rpy:130674
translate chinese map191_445f17ce:

    # voice "se/z01862.ogg"
    # char_jit_map191_1_0_38 "You're not the first to try and charm your way out of this.\nBacking out of a fight would be abandoning your honor.\nIn Alarinthia, without honor, you have little else to show."
    voice "se/z01862.ogg"
    char_jit_map191_1_0_38 "你不是第一个想靠花言巧语脱身的人。\n临阵退缩就等于抛弃荣誉。\n在阿拉林西亚，没有荣誉，你就几乎一无所有。"

# game/script.rpy:130678
translate chinese map191_3c36e4df:

    # voice "se/z01863.ogg"
    # char_jit_map191_1_0_38 "With that said, I have a ball to enjoy.\nIf you'll excuse me, I have some subjects to appease.\nHopefully it keeps them happy until next year's party."
    voice "se/z01863.ogg"
    char_jit_map191_1_0_38 "话虽如此，我还有舞会要享受。\n恕我失陪，我还有子民要安抚。\n希望这能让他们开心到明年的宴会。"

# game/script.rpy:130694
translate chinese map191_6855da77:

    # voice "se/z01864.ogg"
    # char_jit_map191_1_0_38 "Prisoners...? At a party this grand?\nIf that's a complaint, you're grasping at straws.\nI have a party to enjoy. I suggest you do the same."
    voice "se/z01864.ogg"
    char_jit_map191_1_0_38 "囚犯……？在这么盛大的宴会上？\n如果这算抱怨，那你就是没事找事。\n我有宴会要享受。建议你也一样。"

# game/script.rpy:130710
translate chinese map191_564f446e:

    # voice "se/z01865.ogg"
    # char_jit_map191_1_0_38 "You accept your fate. That is admirable.\nI wish you best of luck in the future, [firstname].\nIf you'll excuse me, I believe we have a party to enjoy."
    voice "se/z01865.ogg"
    char_jit_map191_1_0_38 "你接受了自己的命运。这令人钦佩。\n祝你好运，[firstname]。\n恕我失陪，我想我们有宴会要享受。"

# game/script.rpy:130732
translate chinese map191_67a088dd:

    # "He walks into the ballroom, and is quickly crowded by people.{w}\nGreeting every single one, he ensures that they're all happy.{w}\nHe's very charismatic. Everyone painted him as a savage man."
    "他走进舞厅，很快就被人群围住。{w}\n他一一问候每一个人，确保他们都尽兴。{w}\n他极有魅力。所有人都把他描绘成野蛮人。"

# game/script.rpy:130734
translate chinese map191_5dce0748:

    # "I notice Damek and Valessa standing off to the side.{w}\nThey don't seem overly interested in joining the party.{w}\nI didn't get their input yet, so maybe I should approach them."
    "我注意到达梅克和瓦莱莎站在一旁。{w}\n他们似乎不太有兴趣加入宴会。{w}\n我还没听他们的意见，也许我该过去找他们。"

# game/script.rpy:130736
translate chinese map191_a4512ba9:

    # "I take a few steps forward, as to not block the entrance of the ballroom.{w}\nThe music gets louder, and the reverberation fills the grand room.{w}\nThe sight and sound combine to make an utterly beautiful experience."
    "我向前走了几步，以免挡住舞厅的入口。{w}\n音乐变得更响，回响充满了这间宏伟的大厅。{w}\n景象与声音交织，营造出无比美妙的体验。"

# game/script.rpy:130738
translate chinese map191_5d16a242:

    # "I'd try my best to enjoy this before retiring to my private quarters.{w}\nWhen I was ready to sleep, and then fight, that's where I'd go.{w}\nI couldn't delay it forever, but I could occupy myself for a bit."
    "我会尽力享受这一切，然后再回我的私人居室。{w}\n等我准备好睡觉、然后是战斗时，我就会去那里。{w}\n我无法永远拖延，但至少能让自己消磨一会儿。"

# game/script.rpy:130981
translate chinese click_map192_4_EV004_c4b1db4d:

    # "The dance floor is full of people swaying from side to side.{w}\nWatching them celebrate with big smiles helps me relax.{w}\nEven in this awful time, there could still be happiness."
    "舞池里满是左右摇摆的人。{w}\n看着他们带着灿烂的笑容庆祝，让我放松下来。{w}\n即便在这样糟糕的时刻，依然能有快乐。"

