# game/script.rpy:131948
translate chinese map206_552dfe6d:

    # "While the bodies swayed on the dance floor, Halin and Shane did a dance of their own.{w}\nWeapons clashing, they sparred. It was time for Halin to put his new Apprentice to the test.{w}\nSo far, it seems like their skill was equally matched. A deadlock of the best variety."
    "当人群在舞池中摇摆时，哈林和肖恩跳着属于他们自己的舞。{w}\n兵刃相交，他们切磋起来。是时候让哈林考验他的新学徒了。{w}\n到目前为止，两人的技艺似乎不相上下。最精彩的那种僵局。"

# game/script.rpy:131970
translate chinese map206_27827e85:

    # voice "se/x00423.ogg"
    voice "se/x00423.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:131972
translate chinese map206_dd293af2:

    # char_halin "You put up more of a fight than Sovy ever did.\nWhere did you learn techniques like that, Shane?\nIt almost feels like you're the teacher in this scenario."
    char_halin "你比索维难对付多了。\n你从哪儿学来那种招式的，肖恩？\n这情景里，几乎像是你在当老师了。"

# game/script.rpy:131997
translate chinese map206_acf33a68:

    # voice "se/x00424.ogg"
    voice "se/x00424.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:131999
translate chinese map206_79a21f3f:

    # char_shane "You pick up a lot of stuff on the streets of Mazeo.\nBack when I was younger, it was either fight or die.\nA lot of the Rebels are just like me, so get used to it."
    char_shane "在马泽奥的街头，你能学到不少东西。\n我年轻的时候，要么打，要么死。\n很多反抗军都跟我一样，所以你习惯就好。"

# game/script.rpy:132024
translate chinese map206_0a2c10b0:

    # voice "se/x00425.ogg"
    voice "se/x00425.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:132026
translate chinese map206_926e404e:

    # char_halin "Let me guess, you all banded together after The Occupation.\nThat means if I learn your weaknesses — I learn theirs.\nA weak strategy — all sharing the same fighting style."
    char_halin "让我猜猜，你们都是在占领之后聚到一起的。\n也就是说，我摸清你的弱点——就等于摸清了他们的。\n很弱的策略——所有人共用同一种战斗风格。"

# game/script.rpy:132051
translate chinese map206_938d2e6f:

    # voice "se/x00426.ogg"
    voice "se/x00426.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:132053
translate chinese map206_21e5aef9:

    # char_shane "Well now I know why you wanted to spar so soon.\nAnd here I thought you might be warming up to me."
    char_shane "现在我知道你为什么这么快就想切磋了。\n我还以为你开始对我有好感了呢。"

# game/script.rpy:132078
translate chinese map206_53e86e31:

    # voice "se/x00427.ogg"
    voice "se/x00427.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:132080
translate chinese map206_77c3aa50:

    # char_halin "Don't flatter yourself, Shane."
    char_halin "别自作多情了，肖恩。"

# game/script.rpy:132105
translate chinese map206_bf26ffc8:

    # voice "se/x00428.ogg"
    voice "se/x00428.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:132107
translate chinese map206_f5f084f5:

    # char_shane "Then stop giving me reasons to."
    char_shane "那就别再给我自作多情的理由。"

# game/script.rpy:132121
translate chinese map206_28688314:

    # "Their weapons clash again. Halin's sword with Shane's daggers.{w}\nHe had no problem being Halin's match with such small weapons.{w}\nHis agility and quick thinking was more than enough to counter raw strength."
    "他们的兵器再次相交。哈林的剑对上肖恩的匕首。{w}\n用这么小的武器与哈林匹敌，他毫不费力。{w}\n他的敏捷与机敏足以抵消纯粹的力量。"

# game/script.rpy:132136
translate chinese map206_d94752ee:

    # voice "se/x00429.ogg"
    # char_shane "I guess Sovy wasn't much of a fighter?"
    voice "se/x00429.ogg"
    char_shane "我猜索维算不上什么战士？"

# game/script.rpy:132162
translate chinese map206_8fe3c569:

    # voice "se/x00430.ogg"
    voice "se/x00430.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:132164
translate chinese map206_66d52530:

    # char_halin "He used to be, but I could tell he always held back.\nThere was doubt in his mind, and it clouded his judgment.\nI trusted it would go away, but you know what happened next."
    char_halin "他以前是，但我看得出他总是有所保留。\n他心里有疑虑，那蒙蔽了他的判断。\n我以为那会消失，但你也知道后来发生了什么。"

# game/script.rpy:132189
translate chinese map206_4f0c4ecb:

    # voice "se/x00431.ogg"
    voice "se/x00431.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:132191
translate chinese map206_5c25b616:

    # char_shane "Yeah, and he's paying for his mistakes.\nBut you can trust me, Halin. I won't let you down.\nRemember what {i}I{/i} did when we were in Mazeo."
    char_shane "是啊，他正在为自己的错误付出代价。\n但你可以相信我，哈林。我不会让你失望的。\n记得我们在马泽奥时{i}我{/i}做了什么吗。"

# game/script.rpy:132216
translate chinese map206_313424bc:

    # voice "se/x00432.ogg"
    voice "se/x00432.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:132218
translate chinese map206_e80b3955:

    # char_halin "You killed your former leader. Your best friend.\nI don't need anything else from you, Shane.\nThat proves your loyalty almost tenfold."
    char_halin "你杀了你的前首领。你最好的朋友。\n我不需要你再证明什么了，肖恩。\n那几乎十倍地证明了你的忠诚。"

# game/script.rpy:132243
translate chinese map206_01bdcafc:

    # voice "se/x00433.ogg"
    voice "se/x00433.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:132245
