    # char_shane "Good. "
    char_shane "很好。"

# game/script.rpy:132259
translate chinese map206_e1c25e25:

    # "Shane sheathes his daggers, done with the sparring."
    "肖恩收起匕首，切磋结束了。"

# game/script.rpy:132284
translate chinese map206_8077ca37:

    # voice "se/x00434.ogg"
    voice "se/x00434.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:132286
translate chinese map206_4f3f9843:

    # char_shane "So what do you think Sovy will do next?\nI mean, he's no longer welcome in Balteus, right?"
    char_shane "那你觉得索维接下来会做什么？\n我是说，他已经不受巴尔泰乌斯欢迎了，对吧？"

# game/script.rpy:132311
translate chinese map206_d776f3c0:

    # voice "se/x00435.ogg"
    voice "se/x00435.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:132313
translate chinese map206_78aa4aa3:

    # char_halin "I saw him wandering the halls before he left.\nIt's funny. He might actually try to seek out the blade.\nHe was saying something about Alarinthia over and over."
    char_halin "他离开前我看到他在走廊里游荡。\n说来好笑。他也许真的会去寻找那把剑。\n他一遍又一遍地念叨着阿拉林西亚什么。"

# game/script.rpy:132338
translate chinese map206_e4257a39:

    # voice "se/x00436.ogg"
    voice "se/x00436.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:132340
translate chinese map206_4628868b:

    # char_shane "What makes him think it'll be in Alarinthia?"
    char_shane "他凭什么觉得那会在阿拉林西亚？"

# game/script.rpy:132365
translate chinese map206_a0303f5a:

    # voice "se/x00437.ogg"
    voice "se/x00437.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:132367
translate chinese map206_740eeadc:

    # char_halin "Well, The Rebellion will try its hardest to survive.\nAfter what we did, it makes sense that that'd flee the mainland.\nThey can't come here, so the only other option is Alarinthia."
    char_halin "嗯，反抗军会竭尽全力求生。\n在我们做了那些事之后，他们逃离大陆是合情合理的。\n他们来不了这里，所以唯一的选择就是阿拉林西亚。"

# game/script.rpy:132392
translate chinese map206_cc7566be:

    # voice "se/x00438.ogg"
    voice "se/x00438.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:132394
translate chinese map206_e2de4140:

    # char_shane "Makes sense when you put it that way.\nMaybe he can regain his honor after all.\nBut I have to ask, why aren't {i}we{/i} going...?"
    char_shane "这么说确实说得通。\n也许他终究能重拾荣誉。\n但我得问一句，为什么{i}我们{/i}不去……？"

# game/script.rpy:132419
translate chinese map206_d3121034:

    # voice "se/x00439.ogg"
    voice "se/x00439.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:132421
translate chinese map206_00c09c40:

    # char_halin "The Rebellion will come here eventually.\nWe have the home advantage if we sit and wait.\nThere's no way they can overpower our army."
    char_halin "反抗军迟早会来这里。\n如果我们按兵不动，就拥有主场优势。\n他们绝无可能压过我们的军队。"

# game/script.rpy:132446
translate chinese map206_f7720ce3:

    # voice "se/x00440.ogg"
    voice "se/x00440.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:132448
translate chinese map206_f25a0112:

    # char_shane "That's smart.\nSo we're really doing this.\nWe're going to end The Rebellion."
    char_shane "这很聪明。\n所以我们是认真的。\n我们要终结反抗军。"

# game/script.rpy:132473
translate chinese map206_b1544000:

    # voice "se/x00441.ogg"
    voice "se/x00441.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:132475
translate chinese map206_36879616:

    # char_halin "And any more that may come.\nI sense a bright future for us, Shane.\nAnd we'll do it all — for The Triumvirate."
    char_halin "还有之后可能出现的任何人。\n我感觉我们前途光明，肖恩。\n而这一切——都是为了三人执政团。"

# game/script.rpy:132500
translate chinese map206_05348a37:

    # voice "se/x00442.ogg"
    voice "se/x00442.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:132502
translate chinese map206_cf01e162:

    # char_shane "Yeah. For The Triumvirate."
    char_shane "是啊。为了三人执政团。"

# game/script.rpy:132535
translate chinese map207_11b164b5:

    # "I walk over to Damek, as he's standing alone in the corner of the ballroom.{w}\nHe looks a bit awkward, like he knows he doesn't fit in. But I don't blame him.{w}\nWith the story he told me last time, I knew a crowded ballroom floor would frighten him."
    "我走向达梅克，他独自站在舞厅的角落。{w}\n他看起来有点局促，像是知道自己格格不入。但我不怪他。{w}\n想起他上次告诉我的故事，我就知道拥挤的舞池会让他害怕。"

# game/script.rpy:132560
translate chinese map207_6c69edd7:

    # voice "se/y01398.ogg"
    voice "se/y01398.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:132562
translate chinese map207_211de828:

    # char_damek "Hey there, [firstname].\nI hope you're having a good time.\nI mean, given the circumstances, of course."
    char_damek "嘿，[firstname]。\n希望你玩得开心。\n当然，我是指在这种情况下。"

# game/script.rpy:132565
translate chinese map207_67650e32:

    # voice "se/y01399.ogg"
    # char_damek "I can imagine it's hard to have fun when you know what's coming.\nActually — forget I said that. I don't want to ruin your experience.\nI'm just airing my own grievances. Forgive my venting."
    voice "se/y01399.ogg"
    char_damek "我能想象，明知接下来会发生什么，很难玩得开心。\n其实——当我没说。我不想破坏你的兴致。\n我只是在发泄自己的不满。原谅我发牢骚。"

# game/script.rpy:132580
translate chinese map207_972d02b2:

    # "I tell him it's fine, and then stand beside him.{w}\nTogether, we watch the patrons dance in the center of the room.{w}\nThey look like they're having the time of their lives, while we just stand here."
    "我告诉他没关系，然后站到他身旁。{w}\n我们一起看着宾客们在房间中央起舞。{w}\n他们看起来正享受着人生最快乐的时光，而我们只是站在这里。"

# game/script.rpy:132605
translate chinese map207_eccca33b:

    # voice "se/y01400.ogg"
    # char_damek "You know, I've been thinking.\nI faced death back in Mazeo, and I'll face it tomorrow.\nAfter that, I'll just go on to face it again when we attack Balteus."
    voice "se/y01400.ogg"
    char_damek "你知道，我一直在想。\n我在马泽奥面对过死亡，明天还要再面对一次。\n之后，等我们攻打巴尔泰乌斯时，我还要再面对一次。"

# game/script.rpy:132609
translate chinese map207_df7ede49:

    # voice "se/y01401.ogg"
    # char_damek "I could die tomorrow, or the next day, or the day after.\nSo I keep asking myself, what should I do before I die?\nA lot comes to mind, but a few are very important to me."
    voice "se/y01401.ogg"
    char_damek "我可能明天就死，或者后天，或者大后天。\n所以我不断问自己，死之前我该做些什么？\n想到很多，其中有几件对我非常重要。"

# game/script.rpy:132623
translate chinese map207_1adcf5ba:

    # voice "se/y01402.ogg"
    # char_damek "I want to go back to where it happened, [firstname].\nBack to the place where I spent the last moments with my Mother.\nI've never been back there since I grabbed that pendant. I was scared."
    voice "se/y01402.ogg"
    char_damek "我想回到事情发生的地方，[firstname]。\n回到我与母亲共度最后时光的地方。\n自从抓起那条吊坠后，我就再没回去过。我害怕。"

# game/script.rpy:132627
translate chinese map207_d8d3c851:

    # voice "se/y01403.ogg"
    # char_damek "Just {i}thinking{/i} about that place made it seem like it was happening all over again.\nI can't even imagine what would happen if I went back there for real, you know?\nIt's easy to avoid, since the town square is quite large. But I'm done avoiding things."
    voice "se/y01403.ogg"
    char_damek "光是{i}想到{/i}那个地方，就仿佛一切又重演了一遍。\n我甚至无法想象如果真的回到那里会怎样，你懂吗？\n要避开很容易，因为镇广场相当大。但我受够逃避了。"

# game/script.rpy:132641
translate chinese map207_9a214310:

    # voice "se/y01404.ogg"
    # char_damek "I could've died back in those tunnels, [firstname].\nSomething like that really puts things into perspective.\nIf I die — I want to make sure I've lived life to the fullest."
    voice "se/y01404.ogg"
    char_damek "我在那些隧道里本可能死掉，[firstname]。\n那种事真的会让人重新看待一切。\n如果我死了——我想确保自己已活得淋漓尽致。"

# game/script.rpy:132645
translate chinese map207_0f033a18:

    # voice "se/y01405.ogg"
    # char_damek "So that means there's a few things I'd like to do.\nMost importantly, I'd like to go back to where I lost my Mother.\nI don't want that place to hold power over me. {i}I{/i} want the power."
    voice "se/y01405.ogg"
    char_damek "所以这意味着有几件事我想去做。\n最重要的是，我想回到我失去母亲的地方。\n我不想让那个地方控制我。{i}我{/i}想要掌握主动权。"

# game/script.rpy:132659
translate chinese map207_77628011:

    # voice "se/y01406.ogg"
    # char_damek "You already know about some of my other fears, too.\nBut it'd be ill-mannered of me to request your help for those.\nSo, about Mazeo. I'd just like a good friend to be by my side."
    voice "se/y01406.ogg"
    char_damek "你也已经知道我其他的一些恐惧了。\n但为那些事求你帮忙，未免太失礼了。\n所以，关于马泽奥。我只希望有个好朋友陪在我身边。"

# game/script.rpy:132674
translate chinese map207_25001b6c:

    # "He blushes, and shuffles in place.{w}\nIt was clear that he meant his fear of physical contact.{w}\nI could help him with his Mazeo trip, but I stop to think about the rest."
    "他脸红了，脚在原地蹭来蹭去。{w}\n显然他指的是对肢体接触的恐惧。{w}\n马泽奥之行我可以帮他，但我停下来思考其余的事。"

# game/script.rpy:132699
translate chinese map207_303cfc32:

    # voice "se/y01407.ogg"
    # char_damek "Can you say something, Monarch?\nI don't know if I can handle such an awkward silence." nointeract
    voice "se/y01407.ogg"
    char_damek "你能说点什么吗，君主？\n我不知道自己能不能忍受这么尴尬的沉默。" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:132715
translate chinese map207_7870d4ca:

    # voice "se/y01408.ogg"
    # char_damek "Really...? I can't thank you enough, [firstname].\nI just know that I wouldn't be able to do this myself.\nHaving someone by my side makes me that much stronger."
    voice "se/y01408.ogg"
    char_damek "真的……？我怎么谢你都不够，[firstname]。\n我知道自己一个人做不到这件事。\n有人陪在身边，让我变得坚强得多。"

# game/script.rpy:132733
translate chinese map207_153fc43f:

    # voice "se/y01409.ogg"
    # char_damek "All of them...? Then that means—\nYou know what, I'll let you take the lead on that one.\nWe're a long way from Mazeo, after all. I can be patient."
    voice "se/y01409.ogg"
    char_damek "全部……？那也就是说——\n算了，那件事就由你来主导吧。\n毕竟我们离马泽奥还远着呢。我可以耐心等。"

# game/script.rpy:132749
translate chinese map207_1855b8a9:

    # voice "se/y01410.ogg"
    # char_damek "Well, then I'll stop trying to fill the gaps so much.\nBut I'd expect a lot of silence if you help me out in Mazeo.\nOnce I go back to that spot, I have no idea how I'll react."
    voice "se/y01410.ogg"
    char_damek "那好，我就不再那么拼命找话填补冷场了。\n不过如果你在马泽奥帮我，恐怕会有很多沉默。\n一旦回到那个地方，我不知道自己会有什么反应。"

# game/script.rpy:132766
translate chinese map207_2baae0a4:

    # "He smiles, almost like a weight was lifted from his shoulders.{w}\nIt would be important for him to enter the final battle with a clear mind.{w}\nWhen we got back to the mainland, there was no reason {i}not{/i} to help him."
    "他笑了，仿佛肩上的重担被卸下。{w}\n能头脑清明地迎接决战，对他很重要。{w}\n等我们回到大陆，就{i}没有{/i}理由不帮他。"

# game/script.rpy:132791
translate chinese map207_921b7d8d:

    # voice "se/y01411.ogg"
    voice "se/y01411.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:132794
translate chinese map207_2d7b0244:

    # char_damek "Well, that's pretty much all I had to say.\nI'll let you get back to whatever you were doing.\nUnless there's anything else you had to say before you go?" nointeract
    char_damek "嗯，我想说的差不多就是这些了。\n你去忙你的事吧。\n除非你走之前还有什么想说的？" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:132809
translate chinese map207_54788b33:

    # voice "se/y01412.ogg"
    # char_damek "Of course. It was nice to chat with you.\nCome see me when we get back to the mainland.\nHopefully we'll have time for some final errands."
    voice "se/y01412.ogg"
    char_damek "当然。和你聊天很愉快。\n等我们回到大陆，来找我。\n希望我们还有时间办些最后的琐事。"

# game/script.rpy:132813
translate chinese map207_24395270:

    # voice "se/y01413.ogg"
    # char_damek "I'd hate to go right from here to Balteus.\nWe need a final reprieve before we end all of this.\nNo regrets — just in case we don't survive the war."
    voice "se/y01413.ogg"
    char_damek "我可不想从这里直接就去巴尔泰乌斯。\n在结束这一切之前，我们需要最后的喘息。\n不留遗憾——以防我们没能活过这场战争。"

# game/script.rpy:132828
translate chinese map207_49a52a45:

    # "He smiles. It was a grim thought, but a realistic one.{w}\nIf we made it to Balteus, we might not make it back home.{w}\nI'd need to be content with everything I did up until that point."
    "他笑了。这想法很沉重，却很现实。{w}\n如果我们到了巴尔泰乌斯，也许就回不了家了。{w}\n到那时，我得对在此之前所做的一切都感到满足。"

# game/script.rpy:132837
translate chinese map207_4170fdf4:

    # "I leave his side and wander back into the center of the ballroom.{w}\nThe hours were slowly passing by, I couldn't delay tomorrow's battle forever.{w}\nThat thought weighs heavy on my mind as I contemplate what to do next."
    "我离开他身旁，踱回舞厅中央。{w}\n时间慢慢流逝，我无法永远拖延明天的战斗。{w}\n我思考接下来该做什么时，这个念头沉沉压在心头。"

# game/script.rpy:132861
translate chinese map207_c42d8f53:

    # voice "se/y01414.ogg"
    # char_damek "Oh, really? Did my talk about seizing the day inspire you?\nI mean, I guess I could keep you company. I don't have any other plans.\nAnd just in case it goes badly tomorrow, you deserve a really good night."
    voice "se/y01414.ogg"
    char_damek "哦，真的？我那番把握当下的话激励到你了吗？\n我是说，我可以陪着你。我也没有别的安排。\n而且万一明天出了岔子，你也该有个美好的夜晚。"

# game/script.rpy:132876
translate chinese map207_ae8e9632:

    # "He smiles and we walk around the ballroom together.{w}\nWe stop at the buffet table, and inspect our potential options."
    "他笑了笑，我们一起在舞厅里走动。{w}\n我们停在自助餐台前，打量有什么可选的。"

# game/script.rpy:132901
translate chinese map207_b16e41bd:

    # voice "se/y01415.ogg"
    # char_damek "Alarinthian pastries...? Are these any good?\nIf you're seizing the day, then I guess I should too."
    voice "se/y01415.ogg"
    char_damek "阿拉林西亚的糕点……？这些好吃吗？\n既然你要把握当下，那我想我也该这样。"

# game/script.rpy:132916
translate chinese map207_80b6149a:

    # "He grabs one of them, and starts to eat it.{w}\nAfter a few bites, he starts to cough and his eyes open wide.{w}\nHe wipes away crumbs that fall on his attire, and blushes, embarrased."
    "他拿起一块，开始吃起来。{w}\n吃了几口，他咳了起来，眼睛睁得老大。{w}\n他擦掉落在衣服上的碎屑，窘得脸都红了。"

# game/script.rpy:132941
translate chinese map207_8f967dba:

    # voice "se/y01416.ogg"
    # char_damek "Of course they're infused with alcohol. Somehow...\nEverything in this nation has some sort of twist to it.\nYou can never just “get what you want” in Alarinthia."
    voice "se/y01416.ogg"
    char_damek "果然掺了酒。不知怎么……\n这个国家的一切都带着某种花样。\n在阿拉林西亚，你永远别想“要什么就得到什么”。"

# game/script.rpy:132945
translate chinese map207_3241b8b2:

    # voice "se/y01417.ogg"
    # char_damek "Well, unless, of course, I'm talking about {i}you{/i}.\nA fine place to have our first date, despite the circumstances.\nWhen you forget about the coliseum nonsense, this isn't too bad."
    voice "se/y01417.ogg"
    char_damek "嗯，当然，除非我说的是{i}你{/i}。\n抛开眼下的处境，这倒是个初次约会的好地方。\n只要忘了竞技场那档子事，这里还不算太糟。"

# game/script.rpy:132959
translate chinese map207_4e36b781:

    # voice "se/y01418.ogg"
    # char_damek "If things go well, then maybe we can come back next year.\nPeople do that stuff, right? I mean — celebrate anniversaries?\nWhen you take the throne, you can travel wherever you want."
    voice "se/y01418.ogg"
    char_damek "如果一切顺利，也许明年我们还能再来。\n人们会这么做的，对吧？我是说——庆祝周年纪念？\n等你登上王位，想去哪儿就能去哪儿。"

# game/script.rpy:132966
translate chinese map207_78816cf0:

    # voice "se/y01419.ogg"
    # char_damek "And I'd be honored if you let me stand by your side.\nYou know, I was always too scared to flirt, or bond with anybody.\nBut I guess a changed perspective is one benefit of a near-death experience."
    voice "se/y01419.ogg"
    char_damek "如果你让我站在你身边，我会感到荣幸。\n你知道，我以前总是太害怕，不敢跟人调情，也不敢与人亲近。\n但我想，心态的转变大概是濒死体验带来的一个好处。"

# game/script.rpy:132983
translate chinese map207_3edfd7d5:

    # voice "se/y01420.ogg"
    # char_damek "If you could even call it “near”. I'm pretty sure I {i}did{/i} die.\nAnd you want to know what scared me the most? Nothing happened.\nWhen I was younger, they said I'd see my Mother again in the afterlife."
    voice "se/y01420.ogg"
    char_damek "如果那还能叫“濒死”的话。我很确定我{i}确实{/i}死了。\n你想知道最让我害怕的是什么吗？什么也没发生。\n我小的时候，他们说我死后就能再见到母亲。"

# game/script.rpy:132987
translate chinese map207_23f6f86e:

    # voice "se/y01421.ogg"
    # char_damek "That's kind of what kept me going. That thought made me happy.\nIn fact, I even smiled in my final moments. I'd finally see her again.\nThe world is a cruel place, though — and of course, nothing happened."
    voice "se/y01421.ogg"
    char_damek "那算是支撑我活下去的念头。那个想法让我感到快乐。\n事实上，我在最后的时刻甚至笑了。我终于能再见到她了。\n可这世界是残酷的——当然，什么也没发生。"

# game/script.rpy:133001
translate chinese map207_46ee4a0f:

    # voice "se/y01422.ogg"
    # char_damek "Until I opened my eyes again, and saw you and Howl.\nThat changed something inside of me. My priorities shifted.\nThe thought of seeing my Mother again had completely disappeared."
    voice "se/y01422.ogg"
    char_damek "直到我再次睁开眼，看到了你和豪尔。\n那改变了我内心的某些东西。我真正看重的东西变了。\n想再见到母亲的念头彻底消失了。"

# game/script.rpy:133015
translate chinese map207_7d966951:

    # voice "se/y01423.ogg"
    # char_damek "If I chased the future, I'd never enjoy the present.\nThat's part of why I agreed to join you on this date, actually.\nI just wish I was able to realize this sooner. Before the attack."
    voice "se/y01423.ogg"
    char_damek "如果我追逐未来，就永远无法享受当下。\n其实，这也是我答应陪你共度这次约会的原因之一。\n我只希望自己能早些明白这一点。在那场袭击之前。"

# game/script.rpy:133029
translate chinese map207_5b46fd5a:

    # voice "se/y01424.ogg"
    # char_damek "The Monarchy saved me by using their power to heal me.\nI'll never waste the second chance they gave me. Never.\nI'll embrace it, and savor every moment — until the end."
    voice "se/y01424.ogg"
    char_damek "王朝用他们的力量治好我，救了我。\n我绝不会浪费他们给我的第二次机会。绝不。\n我会拥抱它，珍惜每一刻——直到尽头。"

# game/script.rpy:133051
translate chinese map207_ef7d52b1:

    # "We continue chatting, and spending time with one another.{w}\nThe events in the Rebel HQ definitely made him a changed man.{w}\nAnd it was a good change, too — he's “seizing the day”, as it were."
    "我们继续闲聊，彼此相伴。{w}\n反抗军总部的事件无疑让他脱胎换骨。{w}\n而且是好的转变——可以说，他正在“把握当下”。"

# game/script.rpy:133056
translate chinese map207_d76cf0cb:

    # "When we returned to Mazeo, I'd take him back to that fateful spot.{w}\nBut with me by his side, I think he'd be able to overcome his past.{w}\nAnd when that happened — we'd build a new, happy future — together."
    "等我们回到马泽奥，我会带他回到那个命运攸关的地方。{w}\n但有我在他身边，我想他能克服过去。{w}\n而当那一刻到来——我们会一起构筑崭新而幸福的未来。"

# game/script.rpy:133062
translate chinese map207_45e395de:

    # "Damek's loyalty scene has been unlocked.{w}\nLoyalty scenes will be unlocked at the end of Act Four.{w}\nThey can be initiated from the War Table in the Rebel HQ."
    "达梅克的忠诚剧情已解锁。{w}\n忠诚剧情将在第四幕结束时解锁。{w}\n可以在反抗军总部的作战桌上开启。"

# game/script.rpy:133092
translate chinese map208_cad142b5:

    # "I approach Valessa, and watch her inspect the buffet table.{w}\nIt looks like she's having a hard time deciding what to eat.{w}\nIt's all free though, so I'd have some of everything."
    "我走向瓦莱莎，看着她打量自助餐台。{w}\n她似乎正为难该吃什么。{w}\n反正都是免费的，换我就每样都尝一点。"

# game/script.rpy:133117
translate chinese map208_5ec2cd7a:

    # voice "se/y01425.ogg"
    voice "se/y01425.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:133119
translate chinese map208_67bcee83:

    # char_valessa "Why do they need to put alcohol in everything...?\nThese pastries would be fine on their own, you know.\nJust because you can, doesn't mean that you {i}should{/i}."
    char_valessa "他们为什么非得往所有东西里加酒……？\n你知道，这些糕点本身就很好吃。\n能做不代表{i}就该{/i}做。"

# game/script.rpy:133133
translate chinese map208_ce13b058:

    # "She fills a plate with a few random sweets.{w}\nIt appears that they're all alcoholic in nature.{w}\nThat sounds fancy, but they're all just doused."
    "她随手往盘子里装了几样甜点。{w}\n看来那些本质上都是含酒的。{w}\n听起来很高级，其实不过是浇了酒而已。"

# game/script.rpy:133148
translate chinese map208_2cb8341d:

    # voice "se/y01426.ogg"
    # char_valessa "The locals are sure eating this stuff up, though.\nCall me old fashioned, but food and drink should stay separate.\nIf this is a delicacy around here, then Alarinthia isn't really my place."
    voice "se/y01426.ogg"
    char_valessa "不过当地人确实吃得津津有味。\n说我老派也好，但食物和酒就该分开。\n如果这算是这里的珍馐，那阿拉林西亚真不是我的归属。"

# game/script.rpy:133163
translate chinese map208_4142534b:

    # "She smiles, as she continues filling her plate."
    "她一边继续往盘子里装，一边微笑。"

# game/script.rpy:133188
translate chinese map208_b26cf966:

    # voice "se/y01427.ogg"
    # char_valessa "But you gotta eat, right?\nThis isn't the kind of place you want to go hungry.\nI never thought I'd miss some of the food back in Valinorth."
    voice "se/y01427.ogg"
    char_valessa "但总得吃点东西，对吧？\n这种地方可不适合饿着肚子。\n我从没想过自己会怀念瓦利诺斯的一些食物。"

# game/script.rpy:133192
translate chinese map208_68a82d7f:

    # voice "se/y01426b.ogg"
    # char_valessa "But enough about that.\nAre you having a good time, [firstname]?\nAside from the whole coliseum business, of course." nointeract
    voice "se/y01426b.ogg"
    char_valessa "不过这些就不说了。\n你玩得开心吗，[firstname]？\n当然，竞技场那档子事除外。" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:133208
translate chinese map208_5cf0cc42:

    # voice "se/y01427b.ogg"
    # char_valessa "That's for sure. Everybody seems so happy.\nIt almost makes you forget where we are.\nI never pictured Alarinthia as “peaceful”."
    voice "se/y01427b.ogg"
    char_valessa "那倒是。每个人看上去都那么开心。\n几乎让人忘了我们身在何处。\n我从没把阿拉林西亚想象成“安宁之地”。"

# game/script.rpy:133226
translate chinese map208_75ada459:

    # voice "se/y01428.ogg"
    # char_valessa "Oh stop it, [firstname], you're embarrassing me.\nThere's far more interesting people here than me.\nTry mingling with the locals. I'll {i}always{/i} be around."
    voice "se/y01428.ogg"
    char_valessa "哦，别说了，[firstname]，你让我不好意思了。\n这里比我有趣的人多的是。\n去和当地人交际交际吧。我{i}永远{/i}都在。"

# game/script.rpy:133242
translate chinese map208_e3767c97:

    # voice "se/y01429.ogg"
    # char_valessa "I see your quick wit doesn't cave under stress.\nThat's good. We need some more optimism around here.\nIf only that's all it took to win wars, though. We'd be set."
    voice "se/y01429.ogg"
    char_valessa "看来你的机敏在压力下也不会垮。\n这很好。我们这儿需要更多乐观。\n不过要是光靠这个就能打赢战争就好了。那我们早就赢定了。"

# game/script.rpy:133258
translate chinese map208_81f3640b:

    # voice "se/y01430.ogg"
    # char_valessa "I kind of agree, but it's nice in this castle.\nHe could've thrown us in some prison cells, right?\nI guess we picked the perfect time to come pay him a visit."
    voice "se/y01430.ogg"
    char_valessa "我有点同意，不过这城堡确实不错。\n他本可以把我们丢进牢房，对吧？\n看来我们挑了个绝佳的时机来拜访他。"

# game/script.rpy:133274
translate chinese map208_8c18d7a9:

    # voice "se/y01431.ogg"
    # char_valessa "I guess so. Could be better, could be worse.\nI wonder if your coronation ceremony would've been like this.\nIt's supposed to be the party of a lifetime. I'm sad we had to cancel it."
    voice "se/y01431.ogg"
    char_valessa "我想是吧。可能更好，也可能更糟。\n我在想你的加冕典礼会不会也是这样。\n那本该是一生一次的宴会。可惜我们不得不取消。"

# game/script.rpy:133291
translate chinese map208_f8fc9d21:

    # "She smiles softly while eating the pastries on her plate.{w}\nIt isn't much longer until they're all gone. She must've been starving.{w}\nI don't blame her. The journey here was taxing in every possible way."
    "她一边吃盘里的糕点，一边温柔地笑着。{w}\n没过多久就吃光了。她一定是饿坏了。{w}\n我不怪她。这一路的旅程在各方面都耗人心力。"

# game/script.rpy:133318
translate chinese map208_5b608f6d:

    # voice "se/y01432.ogg"
    voice "se/y01432.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:133320
translate chinese map208_fb891140:

    # char_valessa "Oh, I forgot to tell you.\nI talked to Alex a little more on the way here.\nYou know, to learn a little bit more about our parents."
    char_valessa "哦，我忘了告诉你。\n来这儿的路上，我又和亚历克斯聊了聊。\n你知道，想多了解一点我们父母的事。"

# game/script.rpy:133325
translate chinese map208_cad12fef:

    # voice "se/y01433.ogg"
    voice "se/y01433.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:133327
translate chinese map208_899a1d67:

    # char_valessa "Oh, I forgot to tell you.\nI talked to Nada a little more on the way here.\nYou know, to learn a little bit more about our parents."
    char_valessa "哦，我忘了告诉你。\n来这儿的路上，我又和娜达聊了聊。\n你知道，想多了解一点我们父母的事。"

# game/script.rpy:133341
translate chinese map208_01e6b241:

    # voice "se/y01434.ogg"
    voice "se/y01434.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:133343
translate chinese map208_5ef4f02b:

    # char_valessa "Part of me was hoping to hear something positive.\nYou know, like they were paragons of virtue or something.\nI thought maybe — just maybe — they were good people."
    char_valessa "我内心有一部分希望能听到些正面的东西。\n你知道，比如他们是美德的典范之类的。\n我以为也许——只是也许——他们是好人。"

# game/script.rpy:133357
translate chinese map208_7615b1ee:

    # "As she talks, the live band starts to play a bit louder.{w}\nPeople flood to the dance floor with their partners.{w}\nValessa watches all of the couples with a wide smile."
    "她说话时，现场乐队演奏得更响了些。{w}\n人们带着伴侣涌向舞池。{w}\n瓦莱莎笑眯眯地看着一对对伴侣。"

# game/script.rpy:133359
translate chinese map208_ebd290a8:

    # "She places her empty plate back on the table."
    "她把空盘子放回桌上。"

# game/script.rpy:133384
translate chinese map208_f6c606e4:

    # voice "se/y01435.ogg"
    voice "se/y01435.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:133387
translate chinese map208_13525107:

    # char_valessa "Sorry, the music kind of cut me off.\nRight — I was talking about our parents.\nI learnt so much about them on the trip here." nointeract
    char_valessa "抱歉，音乐声把我打断了。\n对——我刚才在说我们父母的事。\n这趟旅程让我了解到他们很多事。" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:133403
translate chinese map208_30d1e4e4:

    # "She nods and smiles."
    "她点头微笑。"

# game/script.rpy:133429
translate chinese map208_168b2c71:

    # voice "se/y01436.ogg"
    # char_valessa "Wait, what...?\n[firstname], I don't know how to dance!\nI'd just end up embarrassing the both of us!"
    voice "se/y01436.ogg"
    char_valessa "等等，什么……？\n[firstname]，我不会跳舞！\n我只会让我们俩都丢脸！"

# game/script.rpy:133444
translate chinese map208_fde2a35e:

    # "I shake my head, and grab her hand.{w}\nSlowly leading her to the dance floor, I take the initiative.{w}\nI tell her that nobody here really knows how to dance. It's just fun."
    "我摇摇头，牵起她的手。{w}\n我主动迈出步子，慢慢带她走向舞池。{w}\n我告诉她，这里没人真的会跳舞。只是图个开心。"

# game/script.rpy:133469
translate chinese map208_089a5338:

    # voice "se/y01437.ogg"
    # char_valessa "Fun...? Well don't say I didn't warn you.\nThey'll be teasing us about this for years to come.\nI can endure some teasing for you, though. You're worth it."
    voice "se/y01437.ogg"
    char_valessa "开心……？别说我没警告过你。\n往后好几年他们都会拿这事打趣我们。\n不过为了你，我受得了被人打趣。你值得。"

# game/script.rpy:133484
translate chinese map208_25fbdf1e:

    # "She blushes, and I slowly guide our hands to the right position.{w}\nOne of my hands rests on her back, holding her close to my body.{w}\nThe other grips her hand, and holds it outward, our fingers intertwined."
    "她脸红了，我慢慢引导我们摆好手的位置。{w}\n我一只手搭在她背上，把她搂近怀里。{w}\n另一只手握着她的手向外抬起，十指交缠。"

# game/script.rpy:133486
translate chinese map208_f5752d7d:

    # "We sway side to side, in time with the music, and she laughs, embarrassed.{w}\nAs if to hide her blushing face, she presses her head firmly against my body"
    "我们随着音乐左右摇摆，她不好意思地笑了。{w}\n仿佛要藏起泛红的脸，她把头紧紧贴在我身上。"

# game/script.rpy:133511
translate chinese map208_e610e66e:

    # voice "se/y01438.ogg"
    # char_valessa "I guess this isn't so bad.\nSo you wanted to hear about our parents...?"
    voice "se/y01438.ogg"
    char_valessa "我想这也没那么糟。\n所以你想听听我们父母的事……？"

# game/script.rpy:133526
translate chinese map208_405c689b:

    # "I nod, as we continue to dance. I really have no idea what I'm doing.{w}\nLooking at everybody else, I notice they all display the same footwork.{w}\nIt's carefully calculated, so nobody bumps into each other as they dance."
    "我点点头，我们继续跳着。其实我完全不知道该怎么做。{w}\n看看其他人，我发现他们脚下都是同样的步法。{w}\n那是精心算计过的，这样跳舞时谁也不会撞到谁。"

# game/script.rpy:133528
translate chinese map208_e56915d8:

    # "I mimic that, while I wait for Valessa to speak."
    "我一边等瓦莱莎开口，一边照着做。"

# game/script.rpy:133554
translate chinese map208_49bc67a3:

    # voice "se/y01439.ogg"
    voice "se/y01439.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:133556
translate chinese map208_35d4e9d6:

    # char_valessa "Just a quick warning, it's not the best atmosphere for this story.\nI mean, talking about Pirates doesn't exactly fill one with joy.\nBut I think it's important to know more about our families."
    char_valessa "先提醒你一句，这故事不太适合在这种气氛里讲。\n我是说，聊海盗可不会让人开心。\n但我觉得多了解自己的家人很重要。"

# game/script.rpy:133559
translate chinese map208_0e456976:

    # voice "se/y01440.ogg"
    # char_valessa "Like I said, I was hoping to hear some good news.\nI always pictured our parents as these perfect, heroic people.\nBut it turns out, they really weren't. They were bad people, [firstname]."
    voice "se/y01440.ogg"
    char_valessa "就像我说的，我本希望能听到些好消息。\n我一直把我们的父母想象成完美、英勇的人。\n可事实证明，他们根本不是。他们是坏人，[firstname]。"

# game/script.rpy:133573
translate chinese map208_0acea8b3:

    # voice "se/y01441.ogg"
    # char_valessa "I know that pirates get involved in shady things, but they embraced it.\nKilling, stealing, smuggling, you name it. They were {i}legends{/i} in Mazeo.\nThey had a whole network operating for them while they were back home."
    voice "se/y01441.ogg"
    char_valessa "我知道海盗会涉足见不得光的勾当，可他们乐在其中。\n杀人、偷盗、走私，什么都干。他们在马泽奥是{i}传奇{/i}。\n他们在家乡时，有一整张关系网为他们运作。"

# game/script.rpy:133577
translate chinese map208_18630d8a:

    # voice "se/y01442.ogg"
    # char_valessa "That's how they managed to have a presence in both nations at once.\nThey went to Mazeo every month or so to inspect their operations in person.\nExplains how they managed to raise us, and balance their double lives."
    voice "se/y01442.ogg"
    char_valessa "他们就是这样得以同时在两个国家都留下势力的。\n他们每个月左右去一趟马泽奥，亲自检查他们的生意。\n这也解释了他们怎么能在抚养我们的同时维持双重生活。"

# game/script.rpy:133595
translate chinese map208_a9edcac1:

    # "We continue to dance, and I listen intently.{w}\nHer grip on my hand becomes tighter, and her body moves closer.{w}\nI can tell she's getting more relaxed, as confidence appears in her movements."
    "我们继续跳舞，我专注地听着。{w}\n她握我的手更紧了，身体也靠得更近。{w}\n看得出她越来越放松，动作里透出了自信。"

# game/script.rpy:133621
translate chinese map208_30947349:

    # voice "se/y01443.ogg"
    voice "se/y01443.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:133623
translate chinese map208_140d1cd0:

    # char_valessa "Maybe it's for the best that they passed on when they did...\nThe village, and Salus, raised us. They gave us our sense of morals.\nI can't say I'd be too happy if I inherited the morals of our parents."
    char_valessa "也许他们在那个时候去世反而是好事……\n是村子，还有萨鲁斯，把我们养大。是他们给了我们是非观。\n要是继承了父母的品性，我可不敢说自己会高兴。"

# game/script.rpy:133626
translate chinese map208_8f729d44:

    # voice "se/y01444.ogg"
    # char_valessa "They could've dragged us into the life of piracy as we grew up, too.\nThat would be dangerous. We could've died years ago, you know?\nIf {i}you{/i} died, then right now, the world would have no hope at all."
    voice "se/y01444.ogg"
    char_valessa "他们也本可能在我们成长的过程中把我们拖进海盗的生活。\n那很危险。我们可能几年前就死了，你知道吗？\n如果{i}你{/i}死了，那如今这世界就一点希望都没有了。"

# game/script.rpy:133640
translate chinese map208_cfe3da92:

    # voice "se/y01445.ogg"
    # char_valessa "So maybe The Occupation was meant to happen.\nIt's guided us to where we are now — shaped us into who we've become.\nIf we let {i}them{/i} shape us, then I have no idea where we'd be right now."
    voice "se/y01445.ogg"
    char_valessa "所以也许占领是注定要发生的。\n它把我们引到如今的境地——把我们塑造成现在的样子。\n如果我们任由{i}他们{/i}塑造，那我不知道我们现在会在哪里。"

# game/script.rpy:133644
translate chinese map208_4f0400bc:

    # voice "se/y01446.ogg"
    # char_valessa "It's so weird, since children usually aspire to be like their parents.\nBut right now, I'm using them as a roadmap on what {i}not{/i} to do.\nAll I can do, is dedicate my life to being better people than them."
    voice "se/y01446.ogg"
    char_valessa "这很奇怪，因为孩子通常都渴望成为父母那样的人。\n但现在，我把他们当作一张“{i}不要{/i}这么做”的路线图。\n我唯一能做的，就是把一生献给成为比他们更好的人。"

# game/script.rpy:133658
translate chinese map208_9c4fb9d4:

    # voice "se/y01447.ogg"
    # char_valessa "Maybe that can undo some of the damage they've done.\nBecause I know they tore families apart. They killed, and robbed.\nSome would say that in the end, being murdered was their justice."
    voice "se/y01447.ogg"
    char_valessa "也许这样能弥补一些他们造成的伤害。\n因为我知道他们拆散过家庭。他们杀人，也抢劫。\n有人会说，最后被人杀死就是他们的报应。"

# game/script.rpy:133662
translate chinese map208_86551689:

    # voice "se/y01448.ogg"
    # char_valessa "But I don't think death is a good form of justice.\nThey should've gotten the chance to make up for their crimes.\nWith them gone, I feel like it's our job to do what they couldn't."
    voice "se/y01448.ogg"
    char_valessa "但我不认为死亡是伸张正义的好方式。\n他们本该有机会弥补自己的罪行。\n既然他们不在了，我觉得替他们做那些做不到的事，就是我们的责任。"

# game/script.rpy:133676
translate chinese map208_5a8d0d6c:

    # voice "se/y01449.ogg"
    # char_valessa "So that's something else I'm going to fight for.\nI'll make up for the damage our parents inflicted.\nI'll give the world peace, so no one has to feel pain."
    voice "se/y01449.ogg"
    char_valessa "所以这也是我要为之奋斗的另一件事。\n我会弥补我们父母造成的伤害。\n我会给这个世界带来和平，让谁都不必再感受痛苦。"

# game/script.rpy:133680
translate chinese map208_b270b7cd:

    # voice "se/y01450.ogg"
    # char_valessa "We'll make a world that doesn't {i}need{/i} people like our parents.\nA world that treats everyone with unconditional love, and equality.\nNo one will have to live in poverty, or turn to a life of crime."
    voice "se/y01450.ogg"
    char_valessa "我们要造出一个{i}不需要{/i}我们父母那种人的世界。\n一个以无条件的爱与平等对待所有人的世界。\n没有人需要活在贫困中，也没有人需要走上犯罪的道路。"

# game/script.rpy:133694
translate chinese map208_67477d70:

    # voice "se/y01451.ogg"
    # char_valessa "Nobody deserves to be a victim of circumstance.\nTo have their life determined by the world around them.\nNo, that's not it at all. {i}We{/i} shape the world, not the other way around."
    voice "se/y01451.ogg"
    char_valessa "没人活该成为环境的牺牲品。\n没人活该被周遭的世界决定自己的一生。\n不，根本不是那样。是{i}我们{/i}塑造世界，而不是反过来。"

# game/script.rpy:133712
translate chinese map208_d06bb08a:

    # "She pulls her head back, and looks up in my eyes as we sway."
    "她抬起头，在摇摆中望进我的眼睛。"

# game/script.rpy:133717
translate chinese map208_7f15fbef:

    # "She looks in my eyes, with overwhelming determination."
    "她看着我，眼中满是不可动摇的决心。"

# game/script.rpy:133743
translate chinese map208_387dad49:

    # voice "se/y01452.ogg"
    voice "se/y01452.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:133745
translate chinese map208_878224b1:

    # char_valessa "So let's shape it into something beautiful.\nA place where no one has to resort to being evil.\nI'm sure our parents were introduced to it somehow."
    char_valessa "所以让我们把它塑造成美好的东西吧。\n一个没人需要走向邪恶的地方。\n我相信我们的父母当年也是被引上那条路的。"

# game/script.rpy:133748
translate chinese map208_0c5fb321:

    # voice "se/y01453.ogg"
    # char_valessa "It's not like they woke up one day just wanting to be pirates.\nMaybe it was their parents before them, or some close friends.\nI guess it doesn't matter, does it? We'll make the cycle end with {i}us{/i}."
    voice "se/y01453.ogg"
    char_valessa "他们又不是某天醒来就突然想当海盗。\n也许是他们的父母，或者某些密友。\n我想那不重要，对吧？我们要让这个循环终结在{i}我们{/i}身上。"

# game/script.rpy:133762
translate chinese map208_6735ad69:

    # voice "se/y01454.ogg"
    # char_valessa "And we'll start a new cycle.\nOne of peace, happiness, and prosperity.\nOne where our children can live full, happy lives."
    voice "se/y01454.ogg"
    char_valessa "然后我们会开启新的循环。\n一个和平、幸福、繁荣的循环。\n一个让我们的孩子能过上充实快乐人生的循环。"

# game/script.rpy:133780
translate chinese map208_76ef1ceb:

    # "I smile at her, and dip her low as the music comes to an end.{w}\nI hold that pose for as long as I can, enjoying the sense of togetherness.{w}\nShortly after, I raise her back up, and we leave the dance floor amongst the crowd."
    "我朝她微笑，在音乐结束时带她做了一个下腰动作。{w}\n我尽可能久地保持着那个姿势，享受这份相依的感觉。{w}\n不久后，我扶她起身，我们随着人群离开了舞池。"

# game/script.rpy:133785
translate chinese map208_caf17d19:

    # "The music slowly comes to an end, and everybody leaves the dance floor.{w}\nValessa watches for a while before speaking again, enjoying the moment."
    "音乐缓缓结束，所有人都离开了舞池。{w}\n瓦莱莎享受了一会儿这一刻，才再次开口。"

# game/script.rpy:133811
translate chinese map208_ba2e12ce:

    # voice "se/y01455.ogg"
    voice "se/y01455.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:133813
translate chinese map208_c3ffb6e4:

    # char_valessa "When we get back to Mazeo, I want to see their old hideout.\nAnd I'd really like it if you came with me, [firstname].\nIt'll give me a sense of closure, and let me move on."
    char_valessa "等我们回到马泽奥，我想去看看他们以前的藏身处。\n我真的很希望你能陪我去，[firstname]。\n那会让我有个了结，好继续往前走。"

# game/script.rpy:133816
translate chinese map208_835765e4:

    # voice "se/y01456.ogg"
    # char_valessa "I never thought I'd learn more about our parents on this journey.\nAnd I'm even more surprised that it's a truth I never expected.\nBut if I could go back, and never learn it? Well, I wouldn't."
    voice "se/y01456.ogg"
    char_valessa "我从没想过会在这趟旅程中了解更多父母的事。\n更让我意外的是，那是我完全没料到的真相。\n但如果能回到过去，让我永远不知道？嗯，我不会的。"

# game/script.rpy:133830
translate chinese map208_5622d45d:

    # voice "se/y01457.ogg"
    # char_valessa "It gives me the drive to become a better person.\nAnd it really makes me appreciate everything I have.\nIncluding you, [firstname]. I could never do this alone."
    voice "se/y01457.ogg"
    char_valessa "它给了我成为更好的人的动力。\n也让我真心珍惜自己所拥有的一切。\n包括你，[firstname]。我一个人绝对做不到。"

# game/script.rpy:133848
translate chinese map208_dc70e879:

    # "She grabs both of my hands, and looks deep into my eyes."
    "她握住我的双手，深深望进我的眼睛。"

# game/script.rpy:133873
translate chinese map208_af9ff5b4:

    # voice "se/y01458.ogg"
    # char_valessa "Thank you for asking me to dance, by the way.\nI guess Draycu's grand ball is a good spot for a first date.\nBut maybe next time, we can go somewhere with better food."
    voice "se/y01458.ogg"
    char_valessa "顺便说一句，谢谢你邀请我跳舞。\n我想德雷库的盛大舞会倒是个初次约会的好地方。\n不过下次，也许我们可以去个食物更好的地方。"

# game/script.rpy:133895
translate chinese map208_5155207e:

    # "She smiles and then runs off, doing her own thing.{w}\nI'm sure almost everybody saw us dance. There was no hiding it.{w}\nBut I'm glad that we did. I want to be with her, no matter the circumstances."
    "她笑了笑，然后跑开去忙自己的事了。{w}\n我敢说几乎所有人都看到我们跳舞了。根本藏不住。{w}\n但我很高兴我们跳了。无论如何，我都想和她在一起。"

# game/script.rpy:133900
translate chinese map208_161665d3:

    # "She smiles, and then examines the room."
    "她笑了笑，然后环视房间。"

# game/script.rpy:133925
translate chinese map208_985f730b:

    # voice "se/y01459.ogg"
    # char_valessa "I'll let you go and tend to some business, [firstname].\nI should probably talk to Fortaime about this stuff, too.\nHe deserves to know about his parents just as much as us."
    voice "se/y01459.ogg"
    char_valessa "我放你去处理些事务吧，[firstname]。\n我也该跟福泰姆聊聊这些事。\n他和我们一样有权知道自己父母的事。"

# game/script.rpy:133947
translate chinese map208_eba682b9:

    # "I nod, and watch her as she slowly walks away.{w}\nOnly {i}she{/i} could turn a horrible truth into such contagious optimism.{w}\nBut she was right. We'd create a better world, where no one had to be hurt."
    "我点点头，看着她慢慢走开。{w}\n只有{i}她{/i}能把一个骇人的真相变成如此有感染力的乐观。{w}\n但她说得对。我们会创造出一个更好的世界，一个谁都不必受伤的世界。"

# game/script.rpy:133953
translate chinese map208_095af49e:

    # "Valessa's loyalty scene has been unlocked.{w}\nIt will be available after the completion of Act Four.{w}\nLoyalty scenes can be initiated from the Rebel HQ War Table."
    "瓦莱莎的忠诚剧情已解锁。{w}\n它将在第四幕完成后开放。{w}\n忠诚剧情可以从反抗军总部的作战桌开启。"

# game/script.rpy:133985
translate chinese map194_92dc043a:

    # "As soon as I get to my private quarters, I rest the blade beside the bed.{w}\nIt feels good to get that weight off my shoulders. Too bad the relief would be ephemeral.{w}\nI sit down in the bed, and think about what would be coming in the next few days."
    "一到我的私人居室，我就把剑靠在床边。{w}\n卸下那份重担的感觉真好。可惜这份轻松转瞬即逝。{w}\n我在床上坐下，想着接下来几天会发生什么。"

# game/script.rpy:133987
translate chinese map194_ea9d20fa:

    # "A tournament to decide the fate of Alarinthia. An alliance to help us attack Balteus.{w}\nNot even a day or two after the coliseum battle, we'd be sailing into the final battle.{w}\nWould we win...? Or would we perish? The blade showed me nothing when I asked."
    "一场决定阿拉林西亚命运的锦标赛。一个帮我们攻打巴尔泰乌斯的同盟。{w}\n竞技场之战后不到一两天，我们就要启航奔赴决战。{w}\n我们会赢吗……？还是会灭亡？我问那把剑时，它什么也没显示。"

# game/script.rpy:133989
translate chinese map194_0282c205:

    # "I sit down on the bed, and decide not to try using the blade again.{w}\nThe anxiety of not being able to know almost wasn't worth it.{w}\nIt was supposed to do what I wanted. Was I not strong enough?"
    "我在床上坐下，决定不再尝试使用那把剑。{w}\n无法得知答案的焦虑几乎让人难以承受。{w}\n它本该如我所愿。是我不够强吗？"

# game/script.rpy:133991
translate chinese map194_b646688b:

    # "The blade was so mysterious, I'd probably never know.{w}\nI lie down, having had enough of today's events. Things were crazy.{w}\nJust when I think we get to relax, we're pushed into more conflict."
    "那把剑太神秘了，我大概永远也不会明白。{w}\n我躺下，今天的事已经够多了。一切都疯狂得很。{w}\n每当我以为能松口气，我们又被推入新的冲突。"

# game/script.rpy:133993
translate chinese map194_ee847a12:

    # "But this conflict has clearly proven divisive among our team.{w}\nPro and Ulric against each other? Vivien and Draycu, too.{w}\nPerhaps this is a lesson that casualties are unavoidable."
    "但这场冲突显然在我们队里造成了分裂。{w}\n普洛和乌尔里克互相对立？薇薇安和德雷库也是。{w}\n也许这是给我们的一课：伤亡无法避免。"

# game/script.rpy:134004
translate chinese map194_f6de4dd9:

    # "I close my eyes, and hold onto a firm resolve in my heart.{w}\nNo. None of my comrades would die tomorrow. They'd survive.{w}\nWe were all survivors, and that's what we'd continue to do. Forever."
    "我闭上眼，心中抱定坚定的决心。{w}\n不。我的同伴们明天谁都不会死。他们都会活下来。{w}\n我们都是幸存者，而且我们会一直如此。永远。"

# game/script.rpy:134028
translate chinese map209_06c9aff2:

    # "Instead of falling asleep, however, I find myself someplace familiar.{w}\nIt's the same locale I found myself in after falling asleep in Peregrino.{w}\nThis wasn't just some random dream. I had to be here for a purpose."
    "然而，我并未入睡，而是发现自己来到一个熟悉的地方。{w}\n这和我当初在佩雷格里诺入睡后抵达的地方一样。{w}\n这绝不是随机的梦。我来这里一定有目的。"

# game/script.rpy:134030
translate chinese map209_8c22d7e7:

    # "All I knew is that this was The Triumvirate's chambers.{w}\nThere was no doubt in my mind. But why was I here...?{w}\nNot only once, but twice? There needed to be a reason."
    "我只知道这里是三人执政团的议事厅。{w}\n我心中毫无怀疑。可我为什么会在这里……？{w}\n不止一次，而是两次？一定有原因。"

# game/script.rpy:134032
translate chinese map209_5a1f189c:

    # "The blade weighs heavy on my back, and I slowly pull it out.{w}\nI can sense that it's pulsating with energy — reacting to something.{w}\nI notice the idol at the back of their chambers. That's what it was."
    "背上的剑沉甸甸的，我缓缓将它拔出。{w}\n我能感觉到它涌动着能量——正在对什么作出反应。{w}\n我注意到他们议事厅后方的那尊灵像。原来就是它。"

# game/script.rpy:134034
translate chinese map209_2115562d:

    # "But why was the blade reacting to something like that...?{w}\nIt doesn't look like any spirit idol I've ever seen. What is it...?{w}\nI feel a strong pull. Almost like I have no choice but to approach it."
    "可那把剑为什么会对那种东西有反应……？{w}\n它不像我见过的任何灵像。那到底是什么……？{w}\n我感到一股强烈的牵引。几乎像是别无选择，只能靠近它。"

# game/script.rpy:134192
translate chinese click_map211_1_EV001_aa4397df:

    # "I take slow, heavy steps toward the idol, and I feel eyes upon me.{w}\nNot just one or two pairs. It's almost like all of Alestia is watching me.{w}\nI can sense my comrades at my back, almost as if they're encouraging me."
    "我朝灵像迈出缓慢而沉重的步子，感觉有目光落在我身上。{w}\n不止一两双。几乎像是整个阿莱斯蒂亚都在注视着我。{w}\n我能感觉到同伴们就在我身后，仿佛在鼓励我。"

# game/script.rpy:134194
translate chinese click_map211_1_EV001_d4c0c4aa:

    # "It helps me push forward, as I feel resistance emanate from the idol.{w}\nWhy would I feel such a strong pull to something that doesn't want me...?{w}\nI push through, in spite of that resistance, and continue to act instinctually."
    "这助我向前，尽管我感觉到灵像散发出的抗拒。{w}\n为什么我会对不想接纳我的东西感到如此强烈的牵引……？{w}\n不顾那份抗拒，我硬撑过去，继续凭本能行动。"

# game/script.rpy:134197
translate chinese click_map211_1_EV001_c318e281:

    # voice "se/z01866.ogg"
    # char_the_triumvirate "Yes. Fulfill your purpose. \nDo what you were meant to do."
    voice "se/z01866.ogg"
    char_the_triumvirate "好。履行你的使命。\n做你注定要做的事。"

# game/script.rpy:134200
translate chinese click_map211_1_EV001_d0d73d5d:

    # "That's The Triumvirate's voice.{w}\nI remember it from last time I was here.{w}\nBut I have no idea what they mean by my \"purpose\"."
    "那是三人执政团的声音。{w}\n上次来这里时我就记得。{w}\n但我完全不明白他们说的“使命”是什么意思。"

# game/script.rpy:134202
translate chinese click_map211_1_EV001_00f098c4:

    # "Still, I can't deny my instinct, and I keep pressing forward.{w}\nIt isn't much longer before I'm standing in front of the idol.{w}\nIt radiates pure malice, and pure evil. It fills me with fright."
    "但我无法否认自己的本能，继续向前。{w}\n没过多久，我就站在了灵像前。{w}\n它散发着纯粹的恶意与纯粹的邪恶。让我满心恐惧。"

# game/script.rpy:134216
translate chinese click_map211_1_EV001_1f39deb1:

    # "I look down at my blade. Was I meant to destroy this...?{w}\nI'm confused as to why I'm doing what The Triumvirate tells me to.{w}\nIt's that conflict that causes this \"dream\" to end, and jolt me awake."
    "我低头看着自己的剑。我是注定要毁掉它吗……？{w}\n我困惑于自己为何要照三人执政团的吩咐去做。{w}\n正是这份矛盾，让这场“梦”结束，把我猛地惊醒。"

# game/script.rpy:134245
translate chinese map210_01372a12:

    # "I rise up in fright, gripping my chest, and panting heavily.{w}\nI look over at the blade resting on my bedside. What happened...?{w}\nIt feels as if no time passed at all, but it's already the next morning."
    "我惊恐地坐起，捂着胸口，大口喘气。{w}\n我望向靠在床边的剑。发生了什么……？{w}\n感觉像一点时间都没过去，可已经是第二天早晨。"

# game/script.rpy:134247
translate chinese map210_fb314ba2:

    # "Just what I needed. No rest before a massive battle.{w}\nThe fates were playing cruel tricks on me during this journey.{w}\nBut I had to keep going. I couldn't give in. It would be over soon."
    "真是我需要的。大战前一点休息都没有。{w}\n这趟旅程中，命运一直在残酷地戏弄我。{w}\n但我必须继续走。我不能屈服。很快就结束了。"

# game/script.rpy:134249
translate chinese map210_9465ff65:

    # "I stand up, and strap the blade to my back.{w}\nAs if on a cue, I hear a knock at the door, before it's opened.{w}\nDraycu steps in, not seeming to care if I was receptive of him."
    "我起身，把剑绑到背上。{w}\n仿佛掐准了时机，我听到敲门声，接着门就被推开了。{w}\n德雷库走进来，似乎并不在意我是否愿意见他。"

# game/script.rpy:134274
translate chinese map210_1307b1cf:

    # voice "se/z01867.ogg"
    voice "se/z01867.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:134280
translate chinese map210_f5e095af:

    # char_jit_map210_1_0_19 "It's your turn, [firstname]."
    char_jit_map210_1_0_19 "轮到你了，[firstname]。"

# game/script.rpy:134294
translate chinese map210_b161aa8a:

    # "My turn...?"
    "轮到我了……？"

# game/script.rpy:134319
translate chinese map210_bc5a56a3:

    # voice "se/z01868.ogg"
    # char_jit_map210_1_0_19 "We're transporting you to the coliseum one by one.\nThat way, you're less inclined to try and escape us.\nYou'll be the last one, so it's almost time to fight."
    voice "se/z01868.ogg"
    char_jit_map210_1_0_19 "我们正把你们一个一个送往竞技场。\n这样你们就不太会想从我们手里逃跑。\n你是最后一个，所以差不多该开打了。"

# game/script.rpy:134334
translate chinese map210_58172d13:

    # " I nod. It all makes sense."
    "我点了点头。全都说得通。"

# game/script.rpy:134359
translate chinese map210_468023b2:

    # voice "se/z01869.ogg"
    # char_jit_map210_1_0_19 "I'd advise not wasting much time.\nBut head to the coliseum when you're ready.\nYou'll be followed by myself and a few guards."
    voice "se/z01869.ogg"
    char_jit_map210_1_0_19 "我建议你别浪费太多时间。\n但准备好之后就去竞技场吧。\n我和几名卫兵会跟着你。"

# game/script.rpy:134373
translate chinese map210_435d28fe:

    # voice "se/z01870.ogg"
    # char_jit_map210_1_0_19 "Oh, and good luck. You'll need it.\nThe entire nation will be watching, and cheering.\nBut whether it's for your victory, or demise, remains to be seen."
    voice "se/z01870.ogg"
    char_jit_map210_1_0_19 "哦，还有，祝你好运。你会需要的。\n整个国家都会看着，为你欢呼。\n但是为你的胜利还是为你的死亡，还不好说。"

# game/script.rpy:134395
translate chinese map210_6be7ba52:

    # "He rests his back against the wall, and crosses his arms.{w}\nThis is really happening. A battle to decide the nation's fate.{w}\nI guess I'd head to the coliseum when I was ready to fight."
    "他背靠墙壁，双臂交叉。{w}\n这一切真的在发生。一场决定国家命运的战斗。{w}\n我想等我准备好战斗时，就去竞技场。"

# game/script.rpy:134730
translate chinese click_map195_4_EV004_4b17a139:

    # "Heat pours in through the windows, and makes it almost unbearable.{w}\nIt wasn't too bad last night, but now it's morning, and I can feel the extreme heat.{w}\nI'm glad that we won't be in this nation for much longer. I could never handle it."
    "热气透过窗户灌进来，几乎让人无法忍受。{w}\n昨晚还不算太糟，但现在是早晨，我能感受到那种酷热。{w}\n很高兴我们不会在这个国家待太久了。我可永远受不了这地方。"

# game/script.rpy:134767
translate chinese click_map195_5_EV005_a34eb45f:

    # "These look comfortable, but unfortunately, I have no time to waste.{w}\nI need to get to the coliseum as soon as possible for the tournament.{w}"
    "这些看起来很舒服，可惜我没时间可浪费。{w}\n我得尽快赶到竞技场参加锦标赛。{w}"

# game/script.rpy:134804
translate chinese click_map195_6_EV006_59a1856b:

    # "I'd go back to bed if it weren't so hot in this room.{w}\nOh, and I guess we also have a tournament to fight in."
    "要不是这房间这么热，我就回去睡了。{w}\n哦，还有，我想我们还有场锦标赛要打。"

# game/script.rpy:134842
translate chinese click_map195_7_EV007_30649bc7:

    # "It's a book about leadership-deciding coliseum battles."
    "那是一本关于决定领袖归属的竞技场战斗的书。"

# game/script.rpy:134903
translate chinese click_map195_7_EV007_8a26aa7e:

    # "A book rests on the nightstand.{w}\nIt appears to be about coliseum battles.{w}\nNot regular ones, though. The leadership ones."
    "床头柜上放着一本书。{w}\n看起来是关于竞技场战斗的。{w}\n不过不是普通的战斗。是决定领袖归属的那种。"

# game/script.rpy:134905
translate chinese click_map195_7_EV007_de86ca3e:

    # "The kind of battle I'd be fighting in today.{w}\nI wonder if it was placed here on purpose.{w}\nWe did play into Draycu's hand, after all."
    "正是我今天要参加的那种战斗。{w}\n我在想这是不是故意放在这里的。{w}\n毕竟我们确实是中了德雷库的算计。"

# game/script.rpy:135302
translate chinese map196_88f7ae93:

    # "I make my way to the coliseum alongside Draycu and some of his soldiers.{w}\nIt's a massive, towering structure, almost putting the castle to shame.{w}\nIt makes sense that it'd be bigger. Alarinthia was all about fighting."
    "我和德雷库以及他的一些士兵一起前往竞技场。{w}\n那是一座庞大高耸的建筑，几乎让城堡都相形见绌。{w}\n它更宏伟也说得通。阿拉林西亚的一切都与战斗有关。"

# game/script.rpy:135327
translate chinese map196_9411200c:

    # voice "se/z01871.ogg"
    voice "se/z01871.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:135333
translate chinese map196_3300cbc9:

    # char_jit_map196_1_0_13 "Well, here we are.\nIf you head on inside, you'll find your allies.\nAfter that, you'll all be escorted to a private room."
    char_jit_map196_1_0_13 "好了，我们到了。\n你进去就会找到你的同伴。\n之后，你们都会被带到一间私人房间。"

# game/script.rpy:135346
translate chinese map196_5210f51b:

    # voice "se/z01872.ogg"
    # char_jit_map196_1_0_13 "You'll have a few moments to prepare once you're in there.\nBut I'd say within the next hour or two, the battle will be over.\nThey don't last very long if both sides have prepared enough."
    voice "se/z01872.ogg"
    char_jit_map196_1_0_13 "进去之后，你们会有片刻时间做准备。\n但我说，接下来一两个小时内，战斗就会结束。\n如果双方都准备充分，这种战斗不会持续太久。"

# game/script.rpy:135361
translate chinese map196_67d5c36e:

    # "He crosses his arms, looks at me dismissively."
    "他双臂交叉，轻蔑地看着我。"

# game/script.rpy:135388
translate chinese map196_5699946b:

    # voice "se/z01873.ogg"
    voice "se/z01873.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:135390
translate chinese map196_d261b652:

    # char_jit_map196_1_0_13 "You may wonder why I'm doing this even though you sided against me.\nThe answer to that is, it's in my nature to show my enemy some kindness.\nI do not kill in cold blood. I will mourn you, and honor your memory, [firstname]."
    char_jit_map196_1_0_13 "你也许想知道，既然你站在我的对立面，我为何还要这么做。\n答案是，向敌人施予善意是我的天性。\n我不会冷血地杀人。我会哀悼你，并尊崇你的记忆，[firstname]。"

# game/script.rpy:135403
translate chinese map196_6ca34701:

    # voice "se/z01874.ogg"
    # char_jit_map196_1_0_13 "It is a noble thing, to die for your beliefs.\nPerhaps your memory will inspire future generations.\nGenerations that can go on to be killed, just like you."
    voice "se/z01874.ogg"
    char_jit_map196_1_0_13 "为自己的信念而死，是高尚的。\n也许你的记忆会激励后世的人。\n那些后人，也会像你一样被杀死。"

# game/script.rpy:135418
translate chinese map196_1fb77af0:

    # "He steps forward, looking me dead in the eye."
    "他上前一步，直勾勾地盯着我的眼睛。"

# game/script.rpy:135433
translate chinese map196_b20475bb:

    # voice "se/z01875.ogg"
    # char_jit_map196_1_0_13 "I do not expect to lose to Vivien.\nI've killed far stronger men than him.\nSome would call you foolish for your choice."
    voice "se/z01875.ogg"
    char_jit_map196_1_0_13 "我不认为自己会输给薇薇安。\n我杀过比他强得多的人。\n有人会说你的选择很愚蠢。"

# game/script.rpy:135448
translate chinese map196_0349b4ed:

    # "With a smile, he lets out a soft laugh."
    "他微微一笑，轻声笑了出来。"

# game/script.rpy:135473
translate chinese map196_6203a89e:

    # voice "se/z01876.ogg"
    # char_jit_map196_1_0_13 "But I am not one of those people.\nAs I said, I treat my enemies with kindness.\nYou may have realized it, but that's why I held the ball."
    voice "se/z01876.ogg"
    char_jit_map196_1_0_13 "但我不是那种人。\n就像我说的，我以善意对待敌人。\n你也许已经明白了，这正是我举办舞会的原因。"

# game/script.rpy:135487
translate chinese map196_de28035d:

    # voice "se/z01877.ogg"
    # char_jit_map196_1_0_13 "But the ball is over, so I must find another way to be kind.\nAnd that is showing you a swift, painless end in the coliseum.\nYou wish to die for your beliefs. It would be my honor to aid you."
    voice "se/z01877.ogg"
    char_jit_map196_1_0_13 "但舞会结束了，所以我必须另寻方式表达善意。\n那就是在竞技场给你一个迅速、无痛的结局。\n你愿为信念而死。能助你如愿，是我的荣幸。"

# game/script.rpy:135502
translate chinese map196_842dba45:

    # "After saying these harsh words, he enters the coliseum.{w}\nI have no choice but to follow him, as the guards block any avenue of escape.{w}\nThere was no way we'd lose. We have Ulric on our side. He's a match for Draycu."
    "说完这些刻薄的话，他走进了竞技场。{w}\n卫兵封住了所有退路，我别无选择，只能跟上。{w}\n我们绝不可能会输。我们有乌尔里克。他能与德雷库匹敌。"

# game/script.rpy:135507
translate chinese map196_15af16d3:

    # voice "se/z01878.ogg"
    voice "se/z01878.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:135509
translate chinese map196_f5f9f0e4:

    # char_jit_map196_1_0_13 "I must thank you again for offering me your allegiance, [firstname].\nUlric may seem strong, but we will win this battle — I know it.\nI could do it blindfolded. I've bested stronger men than him."
    char_jit_map196_1_0_13 "我必须再次感谢你向我效忠，[firstname]。\n乌尔里克看似很强，但我们会赢下这场战斗——我知道。\n我蒙着眼都能做到。我击败过比他更强的人。"

# game/script.rpy:135512
translate chinese map196_191b456e:

    # voice "se/z01879.ogg"
    # char_jit_map196_1_0_13 "We must make sure that we show them kindness, however.\nThey wish to die for their cause, so we are granting them a gift.\nDo not kill in cold blood. You must mourn them, and never forget."
    voice "se/z01879.ogg"
    char_jit_map196_1_0_13 "不过，我们必须确保对他们施以善意。\n他们愿为自己的事业而死，所以我们是在赐予他们礼物。\n不要冷血地杀戮。你必须哀悼他们，永远不忘。"

# game/script.rpy:135526
translate chinese map196_0d171ff9:

    # voice "se/z01880.ogg"
    # char_jit_map196_1_0_13 "These battles are not senseless killing. There is honor in them.\nVivien may think of us barbaric, but that is far from the truth.\nWe only want our nation to be in the hands of the strong."
    voice "se/z01880.ogg"
    char_jit_map196_1_0_13 "这些战斗不是无谓的杀戮。其中自有荣誉。\n薇薇安也许觉得我们野蛮，但那与事实相去甚远。\n我们只是希望国家掌握在强者手中。"

# game/script.rpy:135540
translate chinese map196_e5bd428c:

    # voice "se/z01881.ogg"
    # char_jit_map196_1_0_13 "Perhaps that is why The Triumvirate has not subjugated us yet.\nIf this nation became like the mainland, I couldn't say the same.\nIdeals only get you so far. Strength must guide you from there."
    voice "se/z01881.ogg"
    char_jit_map196_1_0_13 "也许这就是三人执政团至今未能征服我们的原因。\n如果这个国家变得像大陆一样，我就不敢这么说了。\n理想只能带你走到一定程度。之后必须靠力量引领。"

# game/script.rpy:135555
translate chinese map196_f2e9e8b7:

    # "He smiles at me, a look of confidence on his face."
    "他朝我微笑，脸上是自信的神情。"

# game/script.rpy:135580
translate chinese map196_6e15f92d:

    # voice "se/z01882.ogg"
    # char_jit_map196_1_0_13 "And it is strength that we have.\nI'll see you inside, [firstname]."
    voice "se/z01882.ogg"
    char_jit_map196_1_0_13 "而我们拥有力量。\n里面见，[firstname]。"

# game/script.rpy:135595
translate chinese map196_08a67854:

    # "He enters the coliseum after saying those words.{w}\nI have no choice but to follow him, as the guards block any avenue of escape.{w}\nThere was no way we'd lose. Draycu was undefeated. We'd earn his allegiance."
    "说完那些话，他走进了竞技场。{w}\n卫兵封住了所有退路，我别无选择，只能跟上。{w}\n我们绝不可能会输。德雷库未尝败绩。我们会赢得他的效忠。"

# game/script.rpy:135854
translate chinese click_map197_6_EV006_8520bee9:

    # "The coliseum towers above me. It must fit thousands of spectators.{w}\nFrom everything I've heard, every seat would be full when we started.{w}\nI'm filled with anxiety and fright. Could I really perform under such scrutiny?"
    "竞技场高耸在我面前。它一定能容纳数千名观众。{w}\n据我听到的一切，开战时每个座位都会坐满。{w}\n我满心焦虑与恐惧。我真的能在如此众目睽睽之下发挥好吗？"

# game/script.rpy:135916
translate chinese map213_d6a238ee:

    # "Sovy looks on at the ocean, watching the ripples and waves.{w}\nHe remains silent, attracting the suspicion of the Captain.{w}\nApproaching Sovy, he attempts to converse to pass the time."
    "索维望着大海，看着泛起的涟漪与波浪。{w}\n他保持沉默，引起了船长的疑心。{w}\n船长走向索维，想聊聊天打发时间。"

# game/script.rpy:135938
translate chinese map213_8d19704a:

    # voice "se/x00443.ogg"
    voice "se/x00443.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:135944
translate chinese map213_f8e43f1e:

    # char_jit_map213_1_0_12 "It shouldn't be longer than a few more hours.\nBut I have to ask — what brings you to Alarinthia?"
    char_jit_map213_1_0_12 "应该不会超过几个钟头了。\n但我得问一句——你去阿拉林西亚做什么？"

# game/script.rpy:135969
translate chinese map213_cb87b568:

    # voice "se/x00444.ogg"
    voice "se/x00444.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:135971
translate chinese map213_890b6a78:

    # char_sovy "It's probably better for you not to know.\nI don't want to involve people in my problems."
    char_sovy "你不知道大概对你更好。\n我不想把别人卷进我的麻烦里。"

# game/script.rpy:135996
translate chinese map213_2c8981d7:

    # voice "se/x00445.ogg"
    # char_jit_map213_1_0_12 "Involve away. What else are we going to do...?\nYou paid me tenfold to take {i}you{/i}, and you alone.\nHow can you expect me not to question that?"
    voice "se/x00445.ogg"
    char_jit_map213_1_0_12 "卷进来吧。我们还能做什么……？\n你付了我十倍的价钱，只载{i}你{/i}一个人。\n你怎么能指望我不起疑？"

# game/script.rpy:136022
translate chinese map213_f0015195:

    # voice "se/x00446.ogg"
    # char_sovy "I expect you to do the job you're paid for.\nAnything else is unnecessary, don't you agree?"
    voice "se/x00446.ogg"
    char_sovy "我指望你做你拿了钱该做的事。\n其他都是多余的，你不觉得吗？"

# game/script.rpy:136048
translate chinese map213_bc1d3244:

    # voice "se/x00447.ogg"
    # char_jit_map213_1_0_12 "Look. The way I see it, we're friends here.\nIf you need a ferryman back, I'd love to help you out.\nTreat me with the cold shoulder, and you could get stranded."
    voice "se/x00447.ogg"
    char_jit_map213_1_0_12 "听着。在我看来，我们算是朋友。\n如果你回来时还需要摆渡人，我很乐意帮忙。\n要是你对我冷冰冰的，你可能会被困在那边。"

# game/script.rpy:136074
translate chinese map213_138eac81:

    # voice "se/x00448.ogg"
    # char_sovy "Is that a threat...?"
    voice "se/x00448.ogg"
    char_sovy "那是在威胁我吗……？"

# game/script.rpy:136100
translate chinese map213_e27c276b:

    # voice "se/x00449.ogg"
    # char_jit_map213_1_0_12 "Of course not. I'm just curious.\nHere, let's start with the basics.\nWhat kind of work do you do...?"
    voice "se/x00449.ogg"
    char_jit_map213_1_0_12 "当然不是。我只是好奇。\n这样吧，我们从最基础的开始。\n你是做什么工作的……？"

# game/script.rpy:136104
translate chinese map213_8891773c:

    # voice "se/x00450.ogg"
    # char_jit_map213_1_0_12 "You already know what I do for a living.\nDon't you think I deserve to know — as a courtesy?\nI don't care if you're breaking the law, or anything like that."
    voice "se/x00450.ogg"
    char_jit_map213_1_0_12 "你已经知道我是靠什么谋生的。\n你不觉得作为礼尚往来，我也该知道吗？\n就算你在违法什么的，我也不在乎。"

# game/script.rpy:136130
translate chinese map213_be55d5c3:

    # voice "se/x00451.ogg"
    # char_sovy "No, I'm not breaking the law.\nBut honestly, I don't know how to answer your question.\nI guess you could say that I'm “between things” right now."
    voice "se/x00451.ogg"
    char_sovy "不，我没违法。\n但老实说，我不知道该怎么回答你。\n大概可以说，我现在“没活儿干”。"

# game/script.rpy:136156
translate chinese map213_6ee17c8d:

    # voice "se/x00452.ogg"
    # char_jit_map213_1_0_12 "And why is that...?"
    voice "se/x00452.ogg"
    char_jit_map213_1_0_12 "那是为什么呢……？"

# game/script.rpy:136182
translate chinese map213_dad1c7ae:

    # voice "se/x00453.ogg"
    # char_sovy "I thought it was time to seek out better opportunities."
    voice "se/x00453.ogg"
    char_sovy "我觉得是时候去找更好的机会了。"

# game/script.rpy:136208
translate chinese map213_f0bc2781:

    # voice "se/x00454.ogg"
    # char_jit_map213_1_0_12 "In Alarinthia...?"
    voice "se/x00454.ogg"
    char_jit_map213_1_0_12 "去阿拉林西亚……？"

# game/script.rpy:136234
translate chinese map213_1574c348:

    # voice "se/x00455.ogg"
    # char_sovy "To be honest, I have no idea.\nI just know some people who might be there.\nTalking to them should get things on the right track."
    voice "se/x00455.ogg"
    char_sovy "老实说，我也不知道。\n我只是认识一些可能在那里的人。\n跟他们谈谈，应该能让事情走上正轨。"

# game/script.rpy:136260
translate chinese map213_bd783792:

    # voice "se/x00456.ogg"
    # char_jit_map213_1_0_12 "And what line of work are you in?"
    voice "se/x00456.ogg"
    char_jit_map213_1_0_12 "那你是干哪一行的？"

# game/script.rpy:136286
translate chinese map213_8b372aee:

    # voice "se/x00457.ogg"
    # char_sovy "I guess you could say I seek out information.\nNothing pleases me greater than learning the truth.\nBut the people I worked for were far less than honest."
    voice "se/x00457.ogg"
    char_sovy "你可以说我是找情报的。\n没什么比得知真相更让我满足。\n但我效力的那些人却远谈不上诚实。"

# game/script.rpy:136312
translate chinese map213_f970b24d:

    # voice "se/x00458.ogg"
    # char_jit_map213_1_0_12 "Lied to by your bosses? Join the club.\nThey'll do anything to save face and get their way.\nThat's part of why I work on my own, now. I get you."
    voice "se/x00458.ogg"
    char_jit_map213_1_0_12 "被上司骗了？欢迎加入。\n为了保全面子和达成目的，他们什么都干得出来。\n这也是我现在单干的原因之一。我懂你。"

# game/script.rpy:136327
translate chinese map213_f3637cec:

    # "The Captain scoffs, surprised at Sovy's earlier hesitance."
    "船长嗤笑一声，对索维先前的犹豫感到意外。"

# game/script.rpy:136352
translate chinese map213_c2eee7d6:

    # voice "se/x00459.ogg"
    # char_jit_map213_1_0_12 "Is that what you were so worried to open up about?\nTrust me, almost everybody knows what that's like.\nI hope your next opportunity is more fruitful."
    voice "se/x00459.ogg"
    char_jit_map213_1_0_12 "你之前那么不敢开口，就是因为这个？\n相信我，几乎人人都懂那种滋味。\n希望你的下一个机会更有收获。"

# game/script.rpy:136378
translate chinese map213_36fa3eee:

    # voice "se/x00460.ogg"
    # char_sovy "I can only hope."
    voice "se/x00460.ogg"
    char_sovy "我只能这么希望。"

# game/script.rpy:136404
translate chinese map213_b9fa0c10:

    # voice "se/x00461.ogg"
    # char_jit_map213_1_0_12 "So what did they lie to you about?"
    voice "se/x00461.ogg"
    char_jit_map213_1_0_12 "那他们对你撒了什么谎？"

# game/script.rpy:136420
translate chinese map213_e9e040db:

    # voice "se/x00462.ogg"
    # char_sovy "Everything."
    voice "se/x00462.ogg"
    char_sovy "一切。"

# game/script.rpy:136446
translate chinese map213_b2dc9463:

    # voice "se/x00463.ogg"
    # char_jit_map213_1_0_12 "Then I can see why you'd run away."
    voice "se/x00463.ogg"
    char_jit_map213_1_0_12 "那我能理解你为什么逃走了。"

# game/script.rpy:136472
translate chinese map213_b4e613d8:

    # voice "se/x00464.ogg"
    # char_sovy "Excuse me...?"
    voice "se/x00464.ogg"
    char_sovy "你说什么……？"

# game/script.rpy:136498
translate chinese map213_8b115221:

    # voice "se/x00465.ogg"
    # char_jit_map213_1_0_12 "I just mean — it's totally understandable."
    voice "se/x00465.ogg"
    char_jit_map213_1_0_12 "我只是说——这完全可以理解。"

# game/script.rpy:136513
translate chinese map213_44e5c004:

    # "Sovy steps toward the Captain clenching his fists.{w}\nHe brings himself face to face, as if trying to intimidate."
    "索维握紧拳头，朝船长迈步上前。{w}\n他凑到对方脸前，像是想威慑他。"

# game/script.rpy:136538
translate chinese map213_0b123ee5:

    # voice "se/x00466.ogg"
    # char_sovy "I'm not running away. I'm doing what's right."
    voice "se/x00466.ogg"
    char_sovy "我不是在逃。我在做正确的事。"

# game/script.rpy:136553
translate chinese map213_68120746:

    # "The Captain matches his gaze, taking one step forward.{w}\nHe didn't give in to Sovy's intimidation. He was an even match."
    "船长迎上他的目光，向前迈了一步。{w}\n他没有被索维的威吓压服。两人势均力敌。"

# game/script.rpy:136578
translate chinese map213_72e47305:

    # voice "se/x00467.ogg"
    # char_jit_map213_1_0_12 "Sometimes running away {i}is{/i} the right thing to do."
    voice "se/x00467.ogg"
    char_jit_map213_1_0_12 "有时候逃跑{i}确实{/i}是正确的选择。"

# game/script.rpy:136593
translate chinese map213_6e18a66c:

    # "They stare at each other, until Sovy backs away.{w}\nSomething was different. Normally, he would stand his ground.{w}\nBut he no longer served The Triumvirate. He had nothing to prove."
    "他们对视着，直到索维退开。{w}\n有什么不一样了。换作平时，他会寸步不让。{w}\n但他已不再为三人执政团效力。他没什么需要证明的了。"

# game/script.rpy:136618
translate chinese map213_e582d96a:

    # voice "se/x00468.ogg"
    # char_sovy "I'm sorry, you're right.\nI didn't mean to start something on your boat.\nOnce we get to Alarinthia, you'll never see me again."
    voice "se/x00468.ogg"
    char_sovy "抱歉，你说得对。\n我不是有意在你的船上惹事。\n等我们到了阿拉林西亚，你就再也见不到我了。"

# game/script.rpy:136644
translate chinese map213_56878756:

    # voice "se/x00469.ogg"
    # char_jit_map213_1_0_12 "There's no need to go that far.\nDon't misunderstand me. I've got your back.\nYou're not the only man who's run away, you know."
    voice "se/x00469.ogg"
    char_jit_map213_1_0_12 "没必要说到那种地步。\n别误解我。我是站你这边的。\n你知道，你不是唯一一个逃过的人。"

# game/script.rpy:136648
translate chinese map213_6fcf1f63:

    # voice "se/x00470.ogg"
    # char_jit_map213_1_0_12 "Why else do you think I live at sea?\nSometimes I don't set foot on land for {i}weeks{/i} at a time.\nI prefer to be out here, where I live on my own terms. I'm free."
    voice "se/x00470.ogg"
    char_jit_map213_1_0_12 "你以为我为什么住在海上？\n有时候我一连{i}好几周{/i}都不踏上陆地。\n我更喜欢待在这里，按自己的方式生活。我是自由的。"

# game/script.rpy:136674
translate chinese map213_0ee45f85:

    # voice "se/x00471.ogg"
    # char_sovy "Free, hmm...?"
    voice "se/x00471.ogg"
    char_sovy "自由，嗯……？"

# game/script.rpy:136700
translate chinese map213_c31887bb:

    # voice "se/x00472.ogg"
    # char_jit_map213_1_0_12 "Yeah, there's no better way to live.\nImagine not being shackled by higher-ups.\nYou're fully capable of making your own decisions."
    voice "se/x00472.ogg"
    char_jit_map213_1_0_12 "是啊，没有比这更好的活法了。\n想象一下不受上级束缚。\n你完全可以自己做决定。"

# game/script.rpy:136715
translate chinese map213_31f56363:

    # "Sovy sighs, and looks down at the ground.{w}\nIt was his own decision that got him into this mess to begin with.{w}\nBut even though The Triumvirate wasn't pleased, he stood by his actions."
    "索维叹了口气，低头看着地面。{w}\n一开始把他拖进这摊麻烦的，正是他自己的决定。{w}\n尽管三人执政团并不满意，他仍坚持自己的作为。"

# game/script.rpy:136728
translate chinese map213_1f2fdc11:

    # voice "se/x00473.ogg"
    # char_sovy "That would be wonderful...\nI've been a subordinate for my entire life.\nI think it's finally time that I carved my own path."
    voice "se/x00473.ogg"
    char_sovy "那会很好……\n我这辈子一直是个下属。\n我想是时候开辟属于自己的路了。"

# game/script.rpy:136764
translate chinese map198_886eafb4:

    # "I enter the coliseum, and quickly scan the area for my friends.{w}\nA massive flame burns in the center of the room, making the heat even worse.{w}\nI wonder why they'd do something like that. This place confuses me sometimes."
    "我走进竞技场，迅速扫视四周寻找我的朋友。{w}\n房间中央燃着巨大的火焰，让热气更加难耐。{w}\n我在想他们为什么要这么做。这地方有时真让我费解。"

# game/script.rpy:136766
translate chinese map198_97c97c49:

    # "Draycu is nowhere to be seen. Perhaps he's already in the private room."
    "德雷库不见踪影。也许他已经进了私人房间。"

# game/script.rpy:136768
translate chinese map198_dd3d80a7:

    # "I notice Valessa, Fortaime, and Howl standing far away from the flame.{w}\nNo sign of anybody else though. I decide to approach them and ask what's up.{w}\nThey turn to me and smile, while Howl shows the face of complete indifference."
    "我注意到瓦莱莎、福泰姆和豪尔站在离火焰很远的地方。{w}\n却不见其他人的踪影。我决定走过去问问情况。{w}\n他们转向我微笑，而豪尔则是一脸完全的漠然。"

# game/script.rpy:136793
translate chinese map198_8f26ff04:

    # voice "se/z01883.ogg"
    voice "se/z01883.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:136795
translate chinese map198_39236d9c:

    # char_fortaime "I can't believe how cool this place is.\nToo bad I can't actually enjoy it. I'm super stressed.\nI'm really worried that we might lose somebody today."
    char_fortaime "真不敢相信这地方这么酷。\n可惜我根本没法享受。我紧张死了。\n我真的很担心我们今天会失去某个人。"

# game/script.rpy:136817
translate chinese map198_ec4e0640:

    # voice "se/z01884.ogg"
    voice "se/z01884.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:136819
translate chinese map198_a8363e13:

    # char_valessa "Have we actually worked out who's fighting?\nI mean, which of our members are joining Draycu's reserve forces?\nThe Leader and the Champion, we know. But what about everyone else?"
    char_valessa "我们真的确定谁上场了吗？\n我是说，我们有哪些人要加入德雷库的后备队？\n首领和斗士，这我们知道。但其他人呢？"

# game/script.rpy:136833
translate chinese map198_ce6f283f:

    # "Howl steps forward."
    "豪尔上前一步。"

# game/script.rpy:136858
translate chinese map198_a3328cd2:

    # voice "se/z01885.ogg"
    voice "se/z01885.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:136860
translate chinese map198_f0e24d96:

    # char_howl "Ulric fights with Vivien. Pro fights with Draycu.\nVivien's reserve forces are part of his own army.\nDraycu's reserve forces will borrow from our army."
    char_howl "乌尔里克与薇薇安并肩作战。普洛与德雷库并肩作战。\n薇薇安的后备队来自他自己的军队。\n德雷库的后备队则会从我们的军队里借调。"

# game/script.rpy:136875
translate chinese map198_ef495f36:

    # voice "se/z01886.ogg"
    voice "se/z01886.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:136877
translate chinese map198_15f932a6:

    # char_howl "We believe using the Monarch Vessels would be the best idea.\nWe wouldn't want to put any more of our main forces at risk.\nIf we win, our allegiance will make this sacrifice worthwhile."
    char_howl "我们认为使用君主容器是最好的办法。\n我们不想再让主力部队涉险。\n如果我们赢了，我们的效忠会让这份牺牲变得值得。"

# game/script.rpy:136882
translate chinese map198_22030566:

    # voice "se/z01887.ogg"
    voice "se/z01887.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:136884
translate chinese map198_bd1b7e97:

    # char_howl "We believe using our Created Seers will be the best idea.\nWe wouldn't want to put any of our main members at risk.\nIf we win, our allegiance will make this sacrifice worthwhile."
    char_howl "我们认为使用我们的人造先知是最好的办法。\n我们不想让任何核心成员涉险。\n如果我们赢了，我们的效忠会让这份牺牲变得值得。"

# game/script.rpy:136889
translate chinese map198_e0f8a470:

    # voice "se/z01888.ogg"
    voice "se/z01888.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:136891
translate chinese map198_525ff0c5:

    # char_howl "It is unfortunate that we will have to kill our own.\nBut we cannot change what Pro has set in motion.\nAll we can do is try to focus on taking Draycu's life."
    char_howl "我们不得不杀死自己人，这很不幸。\n但我们无法改变普洛已经启动的事。\n我们唯一能做的，就是集中精力取德雷库的性命。"

# game/script.rpy:136896
translate chinese map198_8cc38764:

    # voice "se/z01889.ogg"
    voice "se/z01889.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:136898
translate chinese map198_38280b23:

    # char_howl "This will also give Draycu's side an incredible boost in strength.\nWe will need every advantage possible if we want to win this battle.\nBut we should avoid killing our own. Focus on Vivien's life, [firstname]."
    char_howl "这也会让德雷库一方的力量大幅增强。\n如果我们想赢下这场战斗，就需要尽可能多的优势。\n但我们应该避免杀死自己人。把目标放在薇薇安的性命上，[firstname]。"

# game/script.rpy:136914
translate chinese map198_6cc60c45:

    # "He looks at me."
    "他看着我。"

# game/script.rpy:136941
translate chinese map198_7434e513:

    # voice "se/z01891.ogg"
    voice "se/z01891.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:136943
translate chinese map198_b1710796:

    # char_howl "As for Valessa's question, [firstname] will fight among Vivien's reserve forces.\nIt is important for a leader to fight for their beliefs. No delegation at times like this.\nThis means that several of our key members will be put in harm's way."
    char_howl "至于瓦莱莎的问题，[firstname]将在薇薇安的后备队中作战。\n领袖为自己的信念而战很重要。这种时候不能推给别人。\n这意味着我们的几位核心成员将身陷险境。"

# game/script.rpy:136948
translate chinese map198_bf725aef:

    # voice "se/z01891b.ogg"
    voice "se/z01891b.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:136950
translate chinese map198_52fb6ba5:

    # char_howl "As for Valessa's question, [firstname] will fight among Draycu's reserve forces.\nIt is important for a leader to fight for their beliefs. No delegation at times like this.\nThis means that several of our key members will be put in harm's way."
    char_howl "至于瓦莱莎的问题，[firstname]将在德雷库的后备队中作战。\n领袖为自己的信念而战很重要。这种时候不能推给别人。\n这意味着我们的几位核心成员将身陷险境。"

# game/script.rpy:136954
translate chinese map198_c29751c9:

    # voice "se/z01892.ogg"
    voice "se/z01892.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:136956
translate chinese map198_ed30b3d0:

    # char_howl "It may be impossible for us to avoid the loss of our reserve forces.\nBut we may be able to win without losing any of our comrades.\nWe must simply focus on the lives of Vivien and Draycu."
    char_howl "我们也许无法避免后备队的损失。\n但也许我们能不折损任何同伴就取胜。\n我们只需把目标集中在薇薇安和德雷库的性命上。"

# game/script.rpy:136970
translate chinese map198_0012243d:

    # "He crosses his arms, speaking sternly.{w}\nIt was more of a demand, than a request."
    "他双臂交叉，语气严厉地开口。{w}\n那与其说是请求，不如说是命令。"

# game/script.rpy:136997
translate chinese map198_fde71af7:

    # voice "se/z01893.ogg"
    voice "se/z01893.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:136999
translate chinese map198_cbdc519f:

    # char_howl "Do your best to kill Draycu before any harm can come to Pro or Ulric.\nWe have the option to mitigate our losses, so we must take it."
    char_howl "尽力在普洛或乌尔里克受到伤害之前杀掉德雷库。\n我们有办法减轻损失，所以必须这么做。"

# game/script.rpy:137004
translate chinese map198_537a167c:

    # voice "se/z01894.ogg"
    voice "se/z01894.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:137006
translate chinese map198_aa97cc3f:

    # char_howl "Do your best to kill Vivien before any harm can come to Pro or Ulric.\nWe have the option to mitigate our losses, so we must take it."
    char_howl "尽力在普洛或乌尔里克受到伤害之前杀掉薇薇安。\n我们有办法减轻损失，所以必须这么做。"

# game/script.rpy:137022
translate chinese map198_c10a077f:

    # "No pressure, or anything like that."
    "完全没有压力，绝对没有。"

# game/script.rpy:137047
translate chinese map198_4c95f849:

    # voice "se/z01895.ogg"
    # char_valessa "So you'll be safe, Howl?\nAlong with myself and Fortaime?\nWhat about Damek? He ran off with Pro and Ulric."
    voice "se/z01895.ogg"
    char_valessa "那你会安全喽，豪尔？\n还有我和福泰姆？\n那达梅克呢？他跟普洛和乌尔里克跑走了。"

# game/script.rpy:137073
translate chinese map198_273c2ebc:

    # voice "se/z01898.ogg"
    # char_howl "I suppose we'll find out.\nWe should head to the private room and prepare.\nThe battle will be starting in a matter of minutes."
    voice "se/z01898.ogg"
    char_howl "我想我们很快就会知道。\n我们该去私人房间准备了。\n战斗几分钟后就要开始。"

# game/script.rpy:137088
translate chinese map198_4863046e:

    # "Damek ran off with both of the Champions? That's odd.{w}\nI guess they've been close friends for a long time, though.{w}\nPerhaps he just wants a chance to say goodbye to them."
    "达梅克跟两位斗士都跑走了？真奇怪。{w}\n不过我想他们已经是多年的挚友了。{w}\n也许他只是想找个机会跟他们道别。"

# game/script.rpy:137090
translate chinese map198_53a255ab:

    # "The odds of survival for everybody involved were less than stellar.{w}\nBut there was nothing we could do. Everything was put into place."
    "所有涉事者的生还几率都不算高。{w}\n但我们无能为力。一切都已安排妥当。"

# game/script.rpy:137115
