# game/script.rpy:138199
translate chinese click_map199_15_EV015_ff617598:

    # "This door leads to the private rooms where we're supposed to prepare.{w}\nBut we wouldn't have much time to prepare, so we'd be fighting pretty soon.{w}\nCould I use The Blade of Exodus in combat? Do they even know what it is...?"
    "这扇门通往我们该去准备的私人房间。{w}\n但我们不会有很多准备时间，所以很快就会开打。{w}\n我能在战斗中使用放逐之刃吗？他们甚至知道那是什么吗……？"

# game/script.rpy:138236
translate chinese click_map199_16_EV016_104ebf5b:

    # "The flame burns super bright, and heat fills the entire room.{w}\nI notice a bunch of paper burning in the base of the fire.{w}\nA few people who walk by throw some more paper in."
    "火焰烧得极亮，热气充满了整个房间。{w}\n我注意到火堆底部有一堆纸在燃烧。{w}\n几个路过的人又往里扔了些纸。"

# game/script.rpy:138239
translate chinese click_map199_16_EV016_51845a82:

    # voice "se/a00331.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "What are they doing...?"
    voice "se/a00331.ogg"
    char_fortaime "他们在做什么……？"

# game/script.rpy:138243
translate chinese click_map199_16_EV016_f72f5d0c:

    # voice "se/a00332.ogg"
    voice "se/a00332.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:138245
translate chinese click_map199_16_EV016_c4b10af2:

    # char_howl "Oh yes, we read about this in a book.\nThey write who they support on a piece of parchment.\nWhen they throw it in, the flame continues to burn."
    char_howl "哦是的，我们在一本书里读到过这个。\n他们把支持谁写在一张羊皮纸上。\n把它扔进去，火焰就会继续燃烧。"

# game/script.rpy:138248
translate chinese click_map199_16_EV016_d2fcc026:

    # voice "se/a00333.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "So the flame is only burning during matches?"
    voice "se/a00333.ogg"
    char_fortaime "所以火焰只在比赛期间燃烧？"

# game/script.rpy:138252
translate chinese click_map199_16_EV016_7b355967:

    # voice "se/a00334.ogg"
    # char_howl "Yes. Their desire for change is the catalyst.\nThey light these flames with their hope for the future.\nIt is anonymous too, so you can support whoever you wish."
    voice "se/a00334.ogg"
    char_howl "是的。他们求变的渴望就是触媒。\n他们用对未来的希望点燃这些火焰。\n而且这是匿名的，所以你可以支持任何你想支持的人。"

# game/script.rpy:138256
translate chinese click_map199_16_EV016_07d34e77:

    # voice "se/a00335.ogg"
    # char_howl "After the battle ends, the flame dwindles, and turns to ash.\nA clean slate for the victor — that is what this symbolizes."
    voice "se/a00335.ogg"
    char_howl "战斗结束后，火焰会熄灭，化为灰烬。\n为胜者留一片白纸——这就是它所象征的。"

# game/script.rpy:138260
translate chinese click_map199_16_EV016_f71f5f70:

    # voice "se/a00336.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "That's pretty cool...!\nWant to get some parchment, Howl?"
    voice "se/a00336.ogg"
    char_fortaime "那挺酷的……！\n要去拿点羊皮纸吗，豪尔？"

# game/script.rpy:138264
translate chinese click_map199_16_EV016_49eaf2b6:

    # voice "se/a00337.ogg"
    # char_howl "Sure, if you would like to partake.\nWe can see if the victor lines up with our wishes."
    voice "se/a00337.ogg"
    char_howl "好啊，如果你愿意参与的话。\n我们可以看看胜者是否与我们的愿望相符。"

# game/script.rpy:138268
translate chinese click_map199_16_EV016_c8c72090:

    # voice "se/a00338.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "I sure hope so!"
    voice "se/a00338.ogg"
    char_fortaime "我真心希望如此！"

# game/script.rpy:138331
translate chinese map212_aef85f4b:

    # "Howl stands in the middle of the coliseum lobby.{w}\nStaring deep in the flames, it looks like he's lost in thought.{w}\nHe's whispering to himself, but I'm unable to discern his words."
    "豪尔站在竞技场大厅中央。{w}\n他凝视着火焰深处，看起来陷入了沉思。{w}\n他在自言自语，但我听不清他说的话。"

# game/script.rpy:138333
translate chinese map212_7b591050:

    # "I take slow, cautious steps toward him, curious as to what he's doing.{w}\nBut, like always, he reacts before I can initiate the conversation."
    "我好奇他在做什么，缓缓谨慎地朝他走去。{w}\n但和往常一样，我还没来得及开口，他就先有了反应。"

# game/script.rpy:138358
translate chinese map212_61709a4c:

    # voice "se/y01460.ogg"
    voice "se/y01460.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:138360
translate chinese map212_734923b7:

    # char_howl "We knew you'd be there, [firstname]."
    char_howl "我们知道你会来，[firstname]。"

# game/script.rpy:138374
translate chinese map212_a95387c3:

    # "I take a few steps back, and cross my arms.{w}\nHe turns to face me, and looks into my eyes."
    "我退后几步，双臂交叉。{w}\n他转身面对我，望进我的眼睛。"

# game/script.rpy:138399
translate chinese map212_33617a83:

    # voice "se/y01461.ogg"
    # char_howl "A few steps backward, as always.\nBut away from what? Do you fear us...?\nNo, you mustn't. You still choose to talk with us."
    voice "se/y01461.ogg"
    char_howl "和往常一样，总要后退几步。\n可是在躲什么？你怕我们吗……？\n不，你不必。你仍然选择与我们交谈。"

# game/script.rpy:138413
translate chinese map212_1deea2d3:

    # voice "se/y01462.ogg"
    # char_howl "Join us, and we shall look into the flames together.\nLike our vision, it is always changing. Never the same.\nWe've thought about this a lot since we talked on the boat."
    voice "se/y01462.ogg"
    char_howl "加入我们，一起凝视这火焰吧。\n就像我们的预见，它总在变化。从不相同。\n自从在船上谈过之后，我们思考了很多。"

# game/script.rpy:138428
translate chinese map212_cd475784:

    # "He turns back to face the flames, and I stand by his side.{w}\nTogether, we look into the flames, with the heat assailing us.{w}\nIt feels almost unbearable at first, but I soon get used to it."
    "他转回去面对火焰，我站到他身旁。{w}\n我们一起凝视火焰，热气扑打在身上。{w}\n起初几乎难以忍受，但我很快习惯了。"

# game/script.rpy:138453
translate chinese map212_d7e973b2:

    # voice "se/y01463.ogg"
    # char_howl "I know what you're feeling, [firstname].\nWe felt the same when our vision first went astray.\nBut now we find ourselves asking, is it {i}actually{/i} astray...?"
    voice "se/y01463.ogg"
    char_howl "我知道你的感受，[firstname]。\n我们的预见最初偏离轨道时，我们也有同样的感受。\n但现在我们不禁要问，它{i}真的{/i}偏离了吗……？"

# game/script.rpy:138457
translate chinese map212_a0ac48f7:

    # voice "se/y01464.ogg"
    # char_howl "Seeing both the future and the past — is it really bad?\nFor example, we see Draycu win the battle, but also Vivien.\nWe see Pro fall, and Ulric fall. We even see a future where {i}you{/i} fall."
    voice "se/y01464.ogg"
    char_howl "同时看见未来与过去——这真的很糟吗？\n比如，我们看到德雷库赢得战斗，也看到薇薇安赢。\n我们看到普洛倒下，乌尔里克倒下。甚至看到{i}你{/i}倒下的未来。"

# game/script.rpy:138471
translate chinese map212_7b681ae2:

    # voice "se/y01465.ogg"
    # char_howl "Instead of seeing only ahead, we see in every direction.\nIt is almost like a natural evolution of the power we hold.\nIf we can learn to control this, it would be a tremendous boon."
    voice "se/y01465.ogg"
    char_howl "我们不再只看见前方，而是看见四面八方。\n这几乎就像我们所持力量的自然进化。\n如果我们能学会控制它，将是极大的助益。"

# game/script.rpy:138475
translate chinese map212_07c6ca46:

    # voice "se/y01466.ogg"
    # char_howl "The same goes for the visions of the past.\nDifferent outcomes. Different information. Secrets revealed.\nWhat if we could search these alternate pasts for information...?"
    voice "se/y01466.ogg"
    char_howl "对过去的幻象也是如此。\n不同的结果。不同的信息。被揭开的秘密。\n如果我们能在这些不同的过去中搜寻信息呢……？"

# game/script.rpy:138489
translate chinese map212_a71dddf0:

    # voice "se/y01467.ogg"
    # char_howl "Let us look at the attack on the Rebel HQ in Mazeo.\nPerhaps a past exists where Damek found out about it.\nNot useful now, but I think you see what we're suggesting."
    voice "se/y01467.ogg"
    char_howl "让我们看看马泽奥反抗军总部遭袭的事。\n也许存在一个达梅克提前得知此事的过去。\n现在没用，但我想你明白我们在暗示什么。"

# game/script.rpy:138504
translate chinese map212_a922933e:

    # "It makes sense. He's seeing alternate versions of the past.{w}\nPerhaps versions exist where information comes to light early.{w}\nIf he could learn to control this power, it would help us tremendously."
    "这说得通。他看到的是过去的其他版本。{w}\n也许存在信息更早曝光的版本。{w}\n如果他能学会控制这种力量，会极大地帮助我们。"

# game/script.rpy:138506
translate chinese map212_7f3e986e:

    # "For example, what if a past exists where we didn't bother with Alarinthia?{w}\nHe could search through memories of our attack on Balteus, and glean information.{w}\nPerhaps we've even made it far enough to learn The Triumvirate's true identity."
    "比如，如果存在一个我们没去管阿拉林西亚的过去呢？{w}\n他就能翻查我们攻打巴尔泰乌斯的记忆，搜集情报。{w}\n也许我们甚至走得够远，能得知三人执政团的真实身份。"

# game/script.rpy:138508
translate chinese map212_63d274eb:

    # "But unless he could control this power, it would be useless to speculate.{w}\nIt hurts my head just to think about, but I've seen alternate futures firsthand.{w}\nI have to consider the possibility of alternate pasts as well. It stands to reason."
    "但除非他能控制这种力量，否则空想也无用。{w}\n光是想想就让我头疼，可我亲身见过不同的未来。{w}\n我也必须考虑不同过去的可能性。这合乎情理。"

# game/script.rpy:138510
translate chinese map212_0869fe38:

    # "There was no real explanation for either, so both were oddities.{w}\nThe Old Monarchy had the power of visions, but where did they come from?{w}\nHowl turns to face me, the flames illuminating his differently colored eyes."
    "两者都没有真正的解释，所以都算是怪事。{w}\n旧王室拥有预见之力，可那力量从何而来？{w}\n豪尔转身面对我，火焰照亮了他异色的双瞳。"

# game/script.rpy:138535
translate chinese map212_7adde478:

    # voice "se/y01468.ogg"
    # char_howl "We wish to try and master this ability before the final battle.\nIf we can gain any useful information, it would aid our attack on Balteus.\nEspecially if it can help us uncover any traitors within our ranks."
    voice "se/y01468.ogg"
    char_howl "我们希望在决战前试着掌握这种能力。\n如果能获得任何有用的情报，都会有助于我们攻打巴尔泰乌斯。\n尤其是如果它能帮我们揪出队伍里的叛徒。"

# game/script.rpy:138550
translate chinese map212_6b3b4ee2:

    # "Traitors...?"
    "叛徒……？"

# game/script.rpy:138575
translate chinese map212_6ced3661:

    # voice "se/y01469.ogg"
    # char_howl "The more we think about it, the more it makes sense.\nIn the Rebel HQ, you were as lambs to the slaughter.\nThe Triumvirate must've been tipped off somehow."
    voice "se/y01469.ogg"
    char_howl "我们越想，越觉得合理。\n在反抗军总部，你们就像待宰的羔羊。\n三人执政团一定是收到了什么风声。"

# game/script.rpy:138579
translate chinese map212_3911ebc1:

    # voice "se/y01470.ogg"
    # char_howl "Rest assured that if there is a traitor, we will find them.\nAfter that — their fate, and punishment, is yours to decide.\nIt is unlikely that Shane is the only turncoat among you."
    voice "se/y01470.ogg"
    char_howl "请放心，如果有叛徒，我们会找出来。\n之后——他们的命运与惩罚，由你来决定。\n肖恩不太可能是你们当中唯一的变节者。"

# game/script.rpy:138594
translate chinese map212_550f9dfd:

    # "The thought fills me with fright."
    "这个念头让我满心恐惧。"

# game/script.rpy:138619
translate chinese map212_f0e2e547:

    # voice "se/y01471.ogg"
    # char_howl "Pro even walks along the path of disloyalty.\nSiding with Draycu, and making things more complicated.\nWe will keep a closer eye on him. He is most suspicious."
    voice "se/y01471.ogg"
    char_howl "就连普洛也走上了不忠之路。\n站到德雷库那边，把事情弄得更复杂。\n我们会更密切地留意他。他最为可疑。"

# game/script.rpy:138634
translate chinese map212_4ce2f359:

    # "I must admit, Pro's actions did confuse me.{w}\nIn fact, everybody in Alarinthia confused me.{w}\nThey treat this coliseum business like afternoon tea."
    "我必须承认，普洛的举动确实让我困惑。{w}\n事实上，阿拉林西亚的每个人都让我困惑。{w}\n他们把竞技场这档子事当下午茶一样对待。"

# game/script.rpy:138636
translate chinese map212_cd0851a3:

    # "Like all of this death is just a daily occurrence for them.{w}\nAt least it kept them introverted. The Triumvirate would like that.{w}\nThose focused on fighting themselves would be less inclined to rebel."
    "仿佛所有这些死亡对他们来说只是日常。{w}\n至少这让他们只顾内斗。三人执政团会喜欢这样。{w}\n那些专注于内斗的人，就不太会去反抗。"

# game/script.rpy:138661
translate chinese map212_03cc18a7:

    # voice "se/y01472.ogg"
    # char_howl "There is more to this story than we know.\nWe hope that in the end, an Alliance is formed.\nWe would prefer to leave this nation as soon as possible."
    voice "se/y01472.ogg"
    char_howl "这件事背后还有我们不知道的隐情。\n我们希望最终能结成同盟。\n我们更希望尽快离开这个国家。"

# game/script.rpy:138665
translate chinese map212_597cc156:

    # voice "se/y01473.ogg"
    # char_howl "An endless cycle of death, creating strength.\nEach leader falls to someone stronger than themselves.\nThrough death, and sacrifice, Alarinthia gains power."
    voice "se/y01473.ogg"
    char_howl "一个无尽的死亡循环，造就力量。\n每一位领袖都倒在比自己更强的人手下。\n借由死亡与牺牲，阿拉林西亚获得力量。"

# game/script.rpy:138679
translate chinese map212_5ad18de9:

    # voice "se/y01474.ogg"
    # char_howl "We would prefer to gain power through other means.\nWhen you rule the world, [firstname], please consider this.\nDo not walk down a path similar to The Triumvirate."
    voice "se/y01474.ogg"
    char_howl "我们更愿通过其他途径获得力量。\n当你统治世界时，[firstname]，请考虑这一点。\n不要走上与三人执政团相似的路。"

# game/script.rpy:138683
translate chinese map212_c7572576:

    # voice "se/y01475.ogg"
    # char_howl "The Occupation was a prime example of their nature.\nThey kill others to gain strength. To ensure they rule.\nIt would pain us to see you become like that, it truly would."
    voice "se/y01475.ogg"
    char_howl "占领就是他们本性的典型例证。\n他们杀死他人以获取力量。以确保自己的统治。\n看到你变成那样，会让我们痛心，真的会。"

# game/script.rpy:138698
translate chinese map212_fd0bc8c5:

    # "He stares at the sword on my back."
    "他盯着我背上的剑。"

# game/script.rpy:138723
translate chinese map212_417a804e:

    # voice "se/y01476.ogg"
    # char_howl "Because you may follow after them without even knowing it.\nFor now, that is all we have to say. There are no other concerns.\nNext time we talk, perhaps more will have come to light. At least, we hope."
    voice "se/y01476.ogg"
    char_howl "因为你可能在不知不觉中追随他们的脚步。\n目前，我们要说的就这些。没有其他顾虑了。\n下次我们交谈时，也许会有更多真相浮现。至少，我们希望如此。"

# game/script.rpy:138745
translate chinese map212_fb1b05eb:

    # "I step away, taking his hint.{w}\nI can see how mastering his new visions would be helpful.{w}\nBut if any traitors are revealed, that would be devastating."
    "我领会他的暗示，转身走开。{w}\n我能看出掌握他那些新的幻象会很有帮助。{w}\n但如果有叛徒被揭露，那将是毁灭性的打击。"

# game/script.rpy:138747
translate chinese map212_40ba4aa9:

    # "These were alternate pasts, he said so himself.{w}\nWhat if someone is a traitor only in some far-off past?{w}\nWe could end up punishing somebody innocent and loyal."
    "他说过，那些都是平行的过去。{w}\n如果某人只是在某个遥远的过去里成了叛徒呢？{w}\n我们最终可能会惩罚一个无辜又忠诚的人。"

# game/script.rpy:138749
translate chinese map212_790c517e:

    # "His words were as cryptic as always, especially about cycles.{w}\nI know I wield The Triumvirate's blade, but I am {i}not{/i} like them.{w}\nThis cycle of death, and tyranny, would end by my hand alone."
    "他的话一如既往地晦涩，尤其是关于轮回的部分。{w}\n我知道我握着三人执政团的剑，但我{i}不{/i}像他们。{w}\n这死亡与暴政的轮回，将由我一人之手终结。"

# game/script.rpy:138751
translate chinese map212_6bc22ea7:

    # "I look back over my shoulder, and he's still staring into the flames.{w}\nEvery time I talk to him, he tells me something new about his powers.{w}\nAs we approach our final battle however, he'd be more rushed than ever."
    "我回头望去，他仍凝视着火焰。{w}\n每次和他交谈，他都会告诉我一些关于他力量的新东西。{w}\n然而随着最终决战临近，他会比以往更加匆忙。"

# game/script.rpy:138753
translate chinese map212_3d47105a:

    # "If there were any secrets to be learned, I trust that he could do it.{w}\nBut, as always, a few major questions find themselves at the top of my list.{w}\nWho was The Triumvirate? Why did they require purity? Are there any traitors...?"
    "若有什么秘密可探，我相信他能做到。{w}\n但一如既往，几个重大问题始终占据我心头首位。{w}\n三人执政团是谁？他们为何要求纯净？可曾有叛徒……？"

# game/script.rpy:138755
translate chinese map212_012259ed:

    # "It seemed that Howl would be the key to solving all of these mysteries, and more.{w}\nThe power that he saw as a curse, was now turning into a bountiful source of hope."
    "看来豪尔将是解开这一切谜团乃至更多的关键。{w}\n那被他视为诅咒的力量，如今正化为丰沛的希望之源。"

# game/script.rpy:138757
translate chinese map212_fd105607:

    # "That was the miracle of changing views. Your curses, and your faults, — become strengths.{w}\nAnd if there's anything that would carry us to victory, it would be finding that inner strength."
    "那便是观念转变的奇迹。你的诅咒与缺陷——都会化为力量。{w}\n而若有什么能带我们走向胜利，那便是寻得那份内在之力。"

# game/script.rpy:138787
translate chinese map200_4aa5a672:

    # "The private room is small, and cozy.{w}\nOne lone window provides a view of the arena.{w}\nWe're all able to fit inside without too much discomfort."
    "这间私人房间小而舒适。{w}\n一扇孤零零的窗子可以看到竞技场。{w}\n我们所有人都能挤进来，还不算太难受。"

# game/script.rpy:138789
translate chinese map200_0a9124f7:

    # "Damek seems to be mediating an argument between Ulric and Pro.{w}\nThey look in my direction as I enter, but quickly get back to business.{w}\nGiven the circumstances, it made sense that Ulric and Pro were at odds."
    "达梅克似乎在调解乌尔里克和普洛之间的争执。{w}\n我进门时他们朝我这边看了看，但很快又回到正题。{w}\n在这种情况下，乌尔里克和普洛起冲突也在情理之中。"

# game/script.rpy:138814
translate chinese map200_e18723a1:

    # voice "se/z01903.ogg"
    voice "se/z01903.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:138817
translate chinese map200_4c671ea7:

    # char_pro "Stop being so stubborn, Ulric!\nWe can do this without killing each other.\nJust focus on the leader, that's all you need to do."
    char_pro "别这么固执了，乌尔里克！\n我们不杀死对方也能做到的。\n只要集中对付首领就行，你只需要做这个。"

# game/script.rpy:138839
translate chinese map200_0444d0fb:

    # voice "se/z01904.ogg"
    voice "se/z01904.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:138841
translate chinese map200_1350476c:

    # char_ulric "I don't think you heard me the first time.\nThere's {i}nothing{/i} I won't do to secure victory."
    char_ulric "我想你第一次没听清。\n为取得胜利，{i}没有什么{/i}是我不会做的。"

# game/script.rpy:138855
translate chinese map200_62c78f4a:

    # "He takes heavy steps toward Pro, backing him up against the wall."
    "他沉重地朝普洛迈步，把他逼到墙边。"

# game/script.rpy:138880
translate chinese map200_38b06f0b:

    # voice "se/z01905.ogg"
    # char_ulric "That means if I have to kill you — I will.\nAnd there's no way you're going to convince me otherwise.\nThe future of my nation is at stake. Your life means nothing to me."
    voice "se/z01905.ogg"
    char_ulric "那就是说，如果我必须杀了你——我会的。\n你也绝无可能说服我改变主意。\n我国家的未来危在旦夕。你的命对我毫无意义。"

# game/script.rpy:138907
translate chinese map200_550d8432:

    # "He steps away, having made his point.{w}\nDamek interferes, getting in the way of Ulric."
    "他把话说清楚了，便退开一步。{w}\n达梅克上前阻拦，挡在乌尔里克面前。"

# game/script.rpy:138932
translate chinese map200_a40971cb:

    # voice "se/z01906.ogg"
    voice "se/z01906.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:138934
translate chinese map200_fdbc5664:

    # char_damek "Look, we can figure something out!\nThere's no need for {i}either{/i} of you to die.\nI'll be fighting down there too, so—"
    char_damek "听着，我们总能想出办法的！\n你们{i}两个{/i}都没必要去死。\n我也会在下面战斗，所以——"

# game/script.rpy:138948
translate chinese map200_c5673b54:

    # "Ulric quickly cuts him off."
    "乌尔里克迅速打断了他。"

# game/script.rpy:138973
translate chinese map200_5967710b:

    # voice "se/z01907.ogg"
    voice "se/z01907.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:138975
translate chinese map200_2a4f4dd1:

    # char_ulric "Stop controlling everything, Damek.\nThis isn't even your army anymore.\nYou need to start acting that way."
    char_ulric "别什么都想管，达梅克。\n这已经不是你的军队了。\n你该开始有点自知之明。"

# game/script.rpy:139000
translate chinese map200_ea0408a9:

    # voice "se/z01908b.ogg"
    # char_damek "But..."
    voice "se/z01908b.ogg"
    char_damek "可是……"

# game/script.rpy:139028
translate chinese map200_d31a1d13:

    # voice "se/z01908.ogg"
    voice "se/z01908.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:139030
translate chinese map200_5adbe2a2:

    # char_ulric "No. This army belongs to [firstname].\nHe's the one that will be fighting down there.\nBesides, planning like that is against the rules."
    char_ulric "不。这支军队属于[firstname]。\n下去战斗的人是他。\n再说，那样谋划是违反规矩的。"

# game/script.rpy:139035
translate chinese map200_e51b2ab6:

    # voice "se/z01909.ogg"
    voice "se/z01909.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:139037
translate chinese map200_81511f3b:

    # char_ulric "No. This army belongs to [firstname].\nShe's the one that will be fighting down there.\nBesides, planning like that is against the rules."
    char_ulric "不。这支军队属于[firstname]。\n下去战斗的人是她。\n再说，那样谋划是违反规矩的。"

# game/script.rpy:139051
translate chinese map200_8350db12:

    # voice "se/z01910.ogg"
    voice "se/z01910.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:139053
translate chinese map200_bb929ebd:

    # char_ulric "It's a fight to the death, no matter what.\nConspiring to prevent that displays a lack of honor.\nI may want to overthrow this tradition, but I {i}won't{/i} mock it."
    char_ulric "无论如何，这都是生死之战。\n合谋阻止它，是毫无荣誉可言的表现。\n我或许想推翻这个传统，但我{i}不会{/i}去嘲弄它。"

# game/script.rpy:139074
translate chinese map200_248ef63e:

    # "He tilts his head toward Draycu, who stands in the corner of the room."
    "他朝站在房间角落的德雷库偏了偏头。"

# game/script.rpy:139099
translate chinese map200_e33c11a7:

    # voice "se/z01911.ogg"
    voice "se/z01911.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:139105
translate chinese map200_4c43e613:

    # char_jit_map200_1_0_165 "Mutual respect. That wasn't something I expected, Ulric.\nThere's nothing I enjoy more than an honorable opponent.\nIt almost makes up for the attempt at crashing my ball."
    char_jit_map200_1_0_165 "互相尊重。这可不是我预料到的，乌尔里克。\n没有什么比一位可敬的对手更让我享受的了。\n这几乎能弥补你试图搞砸我的舞会那件事。"

# game/script.rpy:139119
translate chinese map200_25ce13a9:

    # "He smirks, a sinister look on his face."
    "他嘴角一扬，脸上露出阴险的神情。"

# game/script.rpy:139144
translate chinese map200_54a6607b:

    # voice "se/z01912.ogg"
    # char_jit_map200_1_0_165 "But it doesn't mean I'll go easy on you.\nWhere is Vivien, by the way? Did he run?"
    voice "se/z01912.ogg"
    char_jit_map200_1_0_165 "但这不代表我会对你手下留情。\n对了，薇薇安在哪儿？他跑了吗？"

# game/script.rpy:139170
translate chinese map200_203e752a:

    # voice "se/z01913.ogg"
    # char_ulric "No. He's in a separate room.\nSomething about meditating before the fight.\nI'd leave him be until it's time to do this."
    voice "se/z01913.ogg"
    char_ulric "不。他在另一个房间里。\n说是要在战斗前冥想。\n在动手之前，我建议别去打扰他。"

# game/script.rpy:139174
translate chinese map200_6e13f2c2:

    # voice "se/z01914.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Speaking of which — may I request some time with my comrades?\nIf the battle is starting soon, then some farewells may be in order."
    voice "se/z01914.ogg"
    char_ulric "说到这个——我能请求和我的战友们单独待一会儿吗？\n如果战斗很快就要开始，或许该做些告别了。"

# game/script.rpy:139189
translate chinese map200_414c82d5:

    # "He looks at Pro, as if his words were some sort of threat."
    "他看向普洛，仿佛他的话是一种威胁。"

# game/script.rpy:139214
translate chinese map200_853efec0:

    # voice "se/z01915.ogg"
    # char_jit_map200_1_0_165 "Of course. I didn't mean to intrude.\nAs soon as you're ready, we will begin.\nI'll be in the lobby while I wait for you all."
    voice "se/z01915.ogg"
    char_jit_map200_1_0_165 "当然。我无意打扰。\n你们一准备好，我们就开始。\n我会在大厅等你们所有人。"

# game/script.rpy:139241
translate chinese map200_b8587388:

    # "Soon after, we're left alone. Just me and my comrades.{w}\nA tense feeling permeates the air. Things were different, now.{w}\nEven if Ulric and Pro survived, a rift had grown among our ranks."
    "不久后，只剩下我们。只有我和我的战友们。{w}\n紧张的气氛弥漫在空气中。如今一切都不同了。{w}\n即便乌尔里克和普洛活下来，我们队伍中也已生出裂痕。"

# game/script.rpy:139243
translate chinese map200_a1b00ae7:

    # "And at this point in time, I'm unsure if we could mend it.{w}\nI gulp, as I wait in silence, and wait for someone to speak.{w}\nIt's Pro. He seems to be acting pretty sensible right now."
    "而此时此刻，我不确定我们能否弥合它。{w}\n我咽了口唾沫，沉默地等待着，等有人开口。{w}\n是普洛。他现在看起来相当理智。"

# game/script.rpy:139271
translate chinese map200_00685790:

    # voice "se/z01916.ogg"
    voice "se/z01916.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:139273
translate chinese map200_dc331845:

    # char_pro "Okay, so let's go over this situation before the fight begins.\nWe need to make sure we understand exactly what's going down.\nThe upcoming alliance will ensure our attack on Balteus hits {i}hard{/i}."
    char_pro "好，那我们在开打之前把局势捋一遍。\n我们得确保自己完全清楚将要发生什么。\n即将结成的同盟将确保我们对巴尔泰乌斯的进攻{i}狠狠{/i}打下去。"

# game/script.rpy:139291
translate chinese map200_9bbc32ad:

    # voice "se/z01917.ogg"
    voice "se/z01917.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:139293
translate chinese map200_b4776347:

    # char_pro "I'm fighting alongside Draycu, as his Champion.\nThe fight is over if either him, or myself, fall in combat.\nOur reserve forces will consist of the Monarch Vessels."
    char_pro "我将作为德雷库的斗士，与他并肩作战。\n只要他或我中有一个倒下，战斗就结束。\n我们的后备力量将由君主容器组成。"

# game/script.rpy:139298
translate chinese map200_6a7fbd73:

    # voice "se/z01918.ogg"
    voice "se/z01918.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:139300
translate chinese map200_8bee436a:

    # char_pro "I'm fighting alongside Draycu, as his Champion.\nThe fight is over if either him, or myself, fall in combat.\nOur reserve forces will consist of the Created Seers."
    char_pro "我将作为德雷库的斗士，与他并肩作战。\n只要他或我中有一个倒下，战斗就结束。\n我们的后备力量将由人造先知组成。"

# game/script.rpy:139315
translate chinese map200_b369031d:

    # voice "se/z01919.ogg"
    voice "se/z01919.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:139317
translate chinese map200_d6785446:

    # char_pro "[firstname] will also be among those reserve forces, too. \nIf he wins, then Draycu will offer us his might to attack Balteus.\nIf he loses, we get nothing. The pledge lies with him alone."
    char_pro "[firstname]也会在那支后备力量之中。\n如果他赢了，德雷库就会把他的力量借给我们去攻打巴尔泰乌斯。\n如果他输了，我们什么也得不到。那誓言只系于他一人。"

# game/script.rpy:139322
translate chinese map200_68a66b49:

    # voice "se/z01920.ogg"
    voice "se/z01920.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:139324
translate chinese map200_6e8d1b68:

    # char_pro "On the other hand, Ulric is fighting alongside Vivien, as his Champion.\n[firstname] will fight in Vivien's reserve forces, alongside his army.\nIt may not be as strong as Draycu's, but Vivien isn't about strength."
    char_pro "另一方面，乌尔里克将作为薇薇安的斗士，与他并肩作战。\n[firstname]将在薇薇安的后备力量中，与他的军队一同战斗。\n那或许不如德雷库的强大，但薇薇安靠的从来不是力量。"

# game/script.rpy:139338
translate chinese map200_1c7e9c0b:

    # voice "se/z01921.ogg"
    voice "se/z01921.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:139340
translate chinese map200_82329e61:

    # char_pro "If Draycu wins, the nation will stay exactly the same.\nBut if Vivien wins, he will lead Alarinthia in a new direction.\nHopefully, one that allies itself with The New Monarchy."
    char_pro "如果德雷库赢了，这个国家将一成不变。\n但如果薇薇安赢了，他会带领阿拉林西亚走向新的方向。\n但愿是一个能与新王权结盟的方向。"

# game/script.rpy:139354
translate chinese map200_1cfbd14a:

    # "Pro crosses his arms."
    "普洛抱起双臂。"

# game/script.rpy:139379
translate chinese map200_229bf3b1:

    # voice "se/z01922.ogg"
    # char_pro "Someone will die here today.\nEither Vivien, Draycu, myself, or Ulric.\nBut these deaths will not be in vain."
    voice "se/z01922.ogg"
    char_pro "今天这里会有人死去。\n要么是薇薇安，要么是德雷库，要么是我，要么是乌尔里克。\n但这些牺牲不会白费。"

# game/script.rpy:139383
translate chinese map200_e9e0b98c:

    # voice "se/z01923.ogg"
    # char_pro "They will give our army incredible strength.\nTheir lives will help us reshape this world.\nOr mine. I'm ready to die for this, too."
    voice "se/z01923.ogg"
    char_pro "他们会赋予我们军队惊人的力量。\n他们的生命将帮助我们重塑这个世界。\n或者我的。我也准备好为此赴死了。"

# game/script.rpy:139397
translate chinese map200_8bdc05e0:

    # voice "se/z01924.ogg"
    # char_pro "We wouldn't stand a chance if we attacked Balteus on our own.\nAn alliance is necessary, and this is the best way we can get it.\nOne life — taken here today — is worth it, to change all of Alestia."
    voice "se/z01924.ogg"
    char_pro "如果仅凭我们自己进攻巴尔泰乌斯，根本毫无胜算。\n同盟是必需的，而这是我们能获得它的最好方式。\n一条今天在此逝去的生命——值得，为了改变整个阿莱斯蒂亚。"

# game/script.rpy:139401
translate chinese map200_44052a0a:

    # voice "se/z01925.ogg"
    # char_pro "To finally take this world back from The Triumvirate.\nWe must simply hope that [firstname] made the right choice.\nIf there even {i}is{/i} a right choice in this type of situation."
    voice "se/z01925.ogg"
    char_pro "为了最终从三人执政团手中夺回这个世界。\n我们只能希望[firstname]做出了正确的选择。\n在这种局面下，如果{i}真{/i}存在什么正确的选择的话。"

# game/script.rpy:139417
translate chinese map200_282bfca5:

    # voice "se/z01926.ogg"
    voice "se/z01926.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:139419
translate chinese map200_b7d87e7b:

    # char_pro "For example, our allegiance with Vivien isn't guaranteed.\nIf Dracyu wins, he won't offer us his men. We sided against him.\nThat's a good possibility, given his reputation in the coliseum."
    char_pro "比如，我们与薇薇安的同盟并非板上钉钉。\n如果德雷库赢了，他不会把他的部下借给我们。我们站到了他的对立面。\n考虑到他在竞技场上的名声，这很有可能。"

# game/script.rpy:139424
translate chinese map200_726e63fb:

    # voice "se/z01926b.ogg"
    voice "se/z01926b.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:139426
translate chinese map200_d71d2dd9:

    # char_pro "For example, our allegiance with Draycu isn't guaranteed.\nIf Vivien wins, he won't offer us his men. We sided against him.\nIt's a real possibility, since Ulric is offering Vivien his strength."
    char_pro "比如，我们与德雷库的同盟并非板上钉钉。\n如果薇薇安赢了，他不会把他的部下借给我们。我们站到了他的对立面。\n这是很有可能的事，因为乌尔里克把力量献给了薇薇安。"

# game/script.rpy:139442
translate chinese map200_e1f948f2:

    # "Pro is really taking charge here. It's impressive."
    "普洛在这里真的挑起了大梁。真令人佩服。"

# game/script.rpy:139467
translate chinese map200_be8e1741:

    # voice "se/z01927.ogg"
    # char_pro "That about sums it up.\nMe, Ulric, and [firstname] need to go to the arena.\nEveryone else will be given seats to watch us fight."
    voice "se/z01927.ogg"
    char_pro "大致就是这样。\n我、乌尔里克和[firstname]需要去竞技场。\n其余人会被安排座位，观看我们战斗。"

# game/script.rpy:139481
translate chinese map200_f2d2810c:

    # voice "se/z01928.ogg"
    # char_pro "If this is the last time I see you all, then goodbye.\nIt was an honor serving you, and fighting for freedom.\nI can only hope that you gain that freedom in the end."
    voice "se/z01928.ogg"
    char_pro "如果这是我最后一次见到你们所有人，那就再见吧。\n能效忠于你们、为自由而战，是我的荣幸。\n我只能希望，你们最终能赢得那份自由。"

# game/script.rpy:139503
translate chinese map200_c785d396:

    # "He stops talking, and stands in the corner of the room, saying nothing.{w}\nValessa and Fortaime are nodding, as they understand the situation.{w}\nI can tell they were confused before, so his explanation definitely helped."
    "他不再说话，站在房间的角落，一言不发。{w}\n瓦莱莎和福泰姆点着头，他们明白了当前的局势。{w}\n看得出他们先前很困惑，所以他的解释显然帮上了忙。"

# game/script.rpy:139528
translate chinese map200_3d43df0f:

    # voice "se/z01929.ogg"
    voice "se/z01929.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:139530
translate chinese map200_d2dde44f:

    # char_ulric "I don't have much to say, I just wanted to get rid of Draycu.\nI'm not very good at farewells, either. So I won't waste your time.\nGood luck in the future. All of you. I hope to see you again."
    char_ulric "我没什么好说的，我只是想除掉德雷库。\n我也不太擅长道别。所以我就不浪费你们的时间了。\n祝你们今后好运。你们所有人。希望还能再见。"

# game/script.rpy:139551
translate chinese map200_545fadcf:

    # "He gives us all a slight bow before retreating into another corner.{w}\nThis leaves me with Howl, Damek, Valessa, and Fortaime."
    "他朝我们所有人微微一鞠躬，然后退到另一个角落。{w}\n这下只剩下我、豪尔、达梅克、瓦莱莎和福泰姆。"

# game/script.rpy:139577
translate chinese map200_8dc5d0ee:

    # voice "se/z01930.ogg"
    voice "se/z01930.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:139579
translate chinese map200_b8769b84:

    # char_damek "The Monarch Vessels are already waiting by the arena.\nI'll take everyone to our seats, so we can watch you fight.\nI guess it's on you now, [firstname]. Head to the arena."
    char_damek "君主容器已经在竞技场旁等候了。\n我带大家去我们的座位，好在现场看你们战斗。\n现在就看你的了，[firstname]。去竞技场吧。"

# game/script.rpy:139584
translate chinese map200_f3af68be:

    # voice "se/z01931.ogg"
    voice "se/z01931.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:139586
translate chinese map200_b47aae3a:

    # char_damek "The Created Seers are already waiting by the arena.\nI'll take everyone to our seats, so we can watch you fight.\nI guess it's on you now, [firstname]. Head to the arena. "
    char_damek "人造先知已经在竞技场旁等候了。\n我带大家去我们的座位，好在现场看你们战斗。\n现在就看你的了，[firstname]。去竞技场吧。"

# game/script.rpy:139611
translate chinese map200_05572626:

    # voice "se/z01932.ogg"
    voice "se/z01932.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:139613
translate chinese map200_3864584f:

    # char_fortaime "Do you really need to rush into it like this?\nCan't you take some time to prepare, and train?"
    char_fortaime "你真的有必要这么急着去吗？\n就不能花点时间准备和训练吗？"

# game/script.rpy:139638
translate chinese map200_13830db0:

    # voice "se/z01933.ogg"
    voice "se/z01933.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:139640
translate chinese map200_8454c7c3:

    # char_howl "That would be impossible.\nAlarinthia takes these battles very seriously.\nDelaying it would insult the honor of all participants."
    char_howl "那不可能。\n阿拉林西亚对这些战斗非常重视。\n拖延会侮辱所有参与者的荣誉。"

# game/script.rpy:139665
translate chinese map200_6813ce28:

    # voice "se/z01934.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "Screw honor, then!\nI'm not ready to say goodbye just yet.\nThere's still so much we need to do...!"
    voice "se/z01934.ogg"
    char_fortaime "荣誉什么的见鬼去吧！\n我还没准备好说再见。\n我们还有很多事要做……！"

# game/script.rpy:139680
translate chinese map200_437fb2b4:

    # "I shake my head. There's no point trying to delay this.{w}\nWhatever happened, happened. I wouldn't be the tipping point.{w}"
    "我摇了摇头。拖延毫无意义。{w}\n发生过的事已经发生了。我也不会成为那个转折点。{w}"

# game/script.rpy:139707
translate chinese map200_a4ff8e23:

    # voice "se/z01935.ogg"
    voice "se/z01935.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:139709
translate chinese map200_9f656f43:

    # char_howl "Then don't say goodbye.\nSimply hope that he survives this battle.\nCheer him on from the sidelines. Support him."
    char_howl "那就别说再见。\n只需希望他能在这场战斗中活下来。\n在场边为他加油。支持他。"

# game/script.rpy:139714
translate chinese map200_9689718a:

    # voice "se/z01936.ogg"
    voice "se/z01936.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:139716
translate chinese map200_492f96ac:

    # char_howl "Then don't say goodbye.\nSimply hope that she survives this battle.\nCheer her on from the sidelines. Support her."
    char_howl "那就别说再见。\n只需希望她能在这场战斗中活下来。\n在场边为她加油。支持她。"

# game/script.rpy:139730
translate chinese map200_b4bf1752:

    # voice "se/z01937.ogg"
    voice "se/z01937.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:139732
translate chinese map200_4d2a17c8:

    # char_valessa "I guess that's all we can really do...\nThings will work out for the best. I know it.\nWe're due for some good luck by now."
    char_valessa "我想我们也只能做这么多了……\n一切都会往好的方向发展。我知道的。\n我们也该转运了。"

# game/script.rpy:139745
translate chinese map200_9cc92244:

    # voice "se/z01938.ogg"
    # char_valessa "Should we go take our seats...?"
    voice "se/z01938.ogg"
    char_valessa "我们是不是该去入座了……？"

# game/script.rpy:139771
translate chinese map200_1f310612:

    # voice "se/z01939.ogg"
    # char_damek "Yeah. We probably should.\nMonarch...? Good luck."
    voice "se/z01939.ogg"
    char_damek "嗯。大概该去了。\n君主……？祝你好运。"

# game/script.rpy:139798
translate chinese map200_28a96989:

    # "He smiles at me before leaving the room.{w}\nI guess not treating this as a goodbye helped them.{w}\nIt made them feel like they'd be seeing us all again."
    "他冲我笑了笑，然后离开了房间。{w}\n我想，不把这当成告别，对他们是有帮助的。{w}\n这让他们觉得还会再见到我们。"

# game/script.rpy:139800
translate chinese map200_bc754b21:

    # "I wish I could guarantee that, I really do.{w}\nValessa, Fortaime, and Howl soon follow suit.{w}\nI'm left here with Ulric and Pro. They're silent."
    "我真希望能保证这一点，真的。{w}\n瓦莱莎、福泰姆和豪尔也很快跟着出去了。{w}\n这里只剩下我、乌尔里克和普洛。他们一言不发。"

# game/script.rpy:139802
translate chinese map200_be99b3a2:

    # "There's no point in bickering at the gates of death.{w}\nPerhaps they've simply accepted what's coming.{w}\nThis battle would start when I went to the arena."
    "在死亡之门前争吵毫无意义。{w}\n也许他们只是接受了即将到来的一切。{w}\n这场战斗会在我前往竞技场时开始。"

# game/script.rpy:139804
translate chinese map200_d09bf4c9:

    # "The battle that decided the fate of a nation.{w}\nAnd by extension, the fate of our entire world.{w}\nThis is the first time I felt the weight of my role."
    "一场决定国家命运的战斗。{w}\n进而，也决定着整个世界的命运。{w}\n这是我第一次感受到自己这个身份的分量。"

# game/script.rpy:139809
translate chinese map200_474583c0:

    # "I'm The Monarch. I'm shaping a world that I'll go on to rule.{w}\nThat is — if I survive the battle in the coliseum, and in Balteus.{w}\nIt was time to take charge. I'd go to the arena, and end this."
    "我是君主。我正在塑造一个我将来要统治的世界。{w}\n前提是——我能在大竞技场和巴尔泰乌斯的战斗中活下来。{w}\n该扛起责任了。我要去竞技场，结束这一切。"

# game/script.rpy:139811
translate chinese map200_8f279bc8:

    # "Whether I lived or died, I'd make my mark upon this world."
    "无论生死，我都要在这个世界留下我的印记。"

# game/script.rpy:140029
translate chinese click_map201_4_EV004_e7b93957:

    # "Cannot access content at this time.\nIf there is an X, you must complete preceding Heart-to-Hearts.\nIf there is a checkmark, you must move on to the next Heart-to-Heart."
    "目前无法访问此内容。\n若显示叉号，你必须先完成前置的心灵对话。\n若显示对勾，你必须前往下一个心灵对话。"

# game/script.rpy:140052
translate chinese click_map201_7_EV007_bde64575:

    # "A window overlooks the entire arena.{w}\nThe seats are all full, and people are talking.{w}\nI can't believe so many people would be watching us."
    "一扇窗俯瞰着整座竞技场。{w}\n座位全满了，人们交谈着。{w}\n真不敢相信会有这么多人来观看我们。"

# game/script.rpy:140090
translate chinese click_map201_10_EV010_66f59d71:

    # "It's a book about The Grand Library in Balteus."
    "这是一本关于巴尔泰乌斯大图书馆的书。"

# game/script.rpy:140151
translate chinese click_map201_10_EV010_41f4f3c9:

    # "There's a book and a sword sitting here.{w}\nBetween the two, a small dagger rests there.{w}\nI go to touch it, but Pro quickly stops me."
    "这里放着一本书和一把剑。{w}\n在两者之间，还搁着一把小小的匕首。{w}\n我伸手去碰，普洛却迅速拦住了我。"

# game/script.rpy:140154
translate chinese click_map201_10_EV010_11cd2270:

    # voice "se/a00339.ogg"
    voice "se/a00339.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:140156
translate chinese click_map201_10_EV010_92fda9f4:

    # char_pro "Hey, don't touch that! It's mine!\nI plan to use it during the upcoming battle.\nNever touch a weapon that's not your own."
    char_pro "嘿，别碰那个！那是我的！\n我打算在接下来的战斗里用它。\n永远别碰不属于你的武器。"

# game/script.rpy:140158
translate chinese click_map201_10_EV010_051b4803:

    # "I apologize, and set my sights to the book.{w}\nIt seems to be about The Grand Library in Balteus.{w}\nWhy was this here? Was somebody studying it...?"
    "我道了歉，把目光转向那本书。{w}\n它似乎讲的是巴尔泰乌斯的大图书馆。{w}\n它为什么会在这里？有人在研究它吗……？"

# game/script.rpy:140280
translate chinese map214_ae210dec:

    # "I approach Pro, who remains standing in the corner of the room.{w}\nIt looks like he's scared, or nervous, but that's understandable.{w}\nIn mere moments, we'd be fighting for the future of our army."
    "我走向仍站在房间角落的普洛。{w}\n他看起来像是害怕，或是紧张，但这可以理解。{w}\n片刻之后，我们就要为我们军队的未来而战。"

# game/script.rpy:140282
translate chinese map214_5bef82c1:

    # "A few moments after my steps come to an end, Pro looks at me.{w}\nSorrow appears on his face, and it looks like he's filled with regret."
    "我停下脚步片刻后，普洛看向我。{w}\n他脸上浮现出悲伤，看起来满心懊悔。"

# game/script.rpy:140307
translate chinese map214_f7bdcfef:

    # voice "se/y01477.ogg"
    voice "se/y01477.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:140310
translate chinese map214_298dfa40:

    # char_pro "Look, I'm sorry for making things complicated.\nI've been getting looks from everybody. They hate me.\nI put my life at risk, and foolishly offered our own army."
    char_pro "听着，很抱歉把事情搞得这么复杂。\n所有人都用那种眼神看我。他们恨我。\n我拿自己的命去冒险，还愚蠢地献出了我们自己的军队。"

# game/script.rpy:140313
translate chinese map214_4d3356d0:

    # voice "se/y01478.ogg"
    # char_pro "We need that army for our final attack on Balteus.\nEverybody thinks I've condemned us to death, but it's not true!\nThis situation is super complicated, and their vision is so narrow."
    voice "se/y01478.ogg"
    char_pro "我们需要那支军队来做对巴尔泰乌斯的最终一击。\n所有人都觉得我把我们送上了死路，但不是那样的！\n这局势超级复杂，而他们的眼光太狭隘了。"

# game/script.rpy:140329
translate chinese map214_edd468a2:

    # voice "se/y01479.ogg"
    voice "se/y01479.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:140331
translate chinese map214_a02f5513:

    # char_pro "I wish this didn't have to happen right now.\nEspecially after that moment we shared on the boat.\nI'm guessing that this is it for us, isn't it, [firstname]...?"
    char_pro "我真希望这事不必现在发生。\n尤其是在我们在船上共度的那一刻之后。\n我猜我们之间就到此为止了，是吗，[firstname]……？"

# game/script.rpy:140336
translate chinese map214_67d65a3e:

    # voice "se/y01480.ogg"
    voice "se/y01480.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:140338
translate chinese map214_6126ef04:

    # char_pro "I wish this didn't have to happen right now.\nEspecially after we've been growing closer as friends.\nI'm guessing that this is it for our friendship, isn't it...?"
    char_pro "我真希望这事不必现在发生。\n尤其是在我们作为朋友越走越近之后。\n我猜我们的友谊就到此为止了，是吗……？"

# game/script.rpy:140362
translate chinese map214_3b7ef1ee:

    # voice "se/y01481.ogg"
    voice "se/y01481.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:140364
translate chinese map214_b73084ab:

    # char_pro "I knew it. You're just like all the rest.\nI'm sorry for doing this, but I wish you trusted me.\nIt's not what you think. I'm not really this reckless."
    char_pro "我就知道。你和其余的人一样。\n很抱歉我这么做，但我希望你能相信我。\n事情不是你想的那样。我其实没那么鲁莽。"

# game/script.rpy:140367
translate chinese map214_5db3cfeb:

    # voice "se/y01482.ogg"
    # char_pro "But I understand why you don't want to deal with me anymore.\nIn the future, I'll keep our interaction to the bare minimum.\nNo need to mix business with pleasure anymore, right?"
    voice "se/y01482.ogg"
    char_pro "但我理解你为什么不想再理我了。\n今后，我会把我们的来往降到最低限度。\n没必要再把公事和私情混在一起了，对吧？"

# game/script.rpy:140382
translate chinese map214_246e8944:

    # "I can tell that he's crushed, but it had to be done.{w}\nHe betrayed our entire cause with his foolish actions.{w}\nThere's no telling how many of our forces would die."
    "我看得出他深受打击，但这是必须的。{w}\n他愚蠢的举动背叛了我们整个事业。{w}\n说不准我们会有多少兵力因此丧命。"

# game/script.rpy:140387
translate chinese map214_ab0e9546:

    # "I know I sided with Draycu, but that was beside the point.{w}\nI would've regardless. Pro played right into Draycu's hand.{w}\nIf he let me handle it, neither him, or our army would be in danger."
    "我知道我站在了德雷库那边，但那不是重点。{w}\n无论如何我都会那么做。普洛正好落入了德雷库的圈套。{w}\n如果他让我来处理，他和我们的军队都不会陷入危险。"

# game/script.rpy:140396
translate chinese map214_cc3657ae:

    # "He walks away from me, visibly upset and angry.{w}\nIt was funny how a friendship could come to an end so easily.{w}\nBut if I was going to rule this world, I had to learn to put my foot down."
    "他离开我身边，显然又伤心又愤怒。{w}\n一段友谊竟能如此轻易地走到尽头，真是可笑。{w}\n但如果我要统治这个世界，我就得学会态度强硬。"

# game/script.rpy:140402
translate chinese map214_0378306d:

    # "Your bond with Pro was irreparably damaged.{w}\nYou will be unable to access his Loyalty Scene in the future.{w}\nThis brings Pro's series of Heart-to-Hearts to an indefinite close."
    "你与普洛的羁绊已遭到无法修复的破坏。{w}\n今后你将无法解锁他的忠诚剧情。{w}\n普洛的一系列“心灵对话”就此无限期搁置。"

# game/script.rpy:140421
translate chinese map214_00a51e27:

    # voice "se/y01483.ogg"
    voice "se/y01483.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:140423
translate chinese map214_1b1667fc:

    # char_pro "Wait, seriously...? Thank you!\nI was so scared you'd cut things off.\nI really value our bond, [firstname]. I swear."
    char_pro "等等，真的吗……？谢谢你！\n我特别怕你会就此断绝关系。\n我真的很珍惜我们的羁绊，[firstname]。我发誓。"

# game/script.rpy:140438
translate chinese map214_9485e07b:

    # voice "se/y01844.ogg"
    voice "se/y01844.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:140440
translate chinese map214_9719a272:

    # char_pro "I knew we'd be able to push through this.\nThe fact that you sided with Draycu convinced me.\nEven in all the confusion, we still see eye to eye."
    char_pro "我就知道我们能挺过这一关。\n你站在德雷库那边这件事让我确信了。\n即便在一切混乱之中，我们依然心意相通。"

# game/script.rpy:140453
translate chinese map214_06357683:

    # voice "se/y01845.ogg"
    # char_pro "We can work together to take down Vivien.\nAnd we'll also work together to keep our forces safe.\nIt was the best possible decision. I know it. You know it."
    voice "se/y01845.ogg"
    char_pro "我们可以联手击败薇薇安。\n我们也会联手保护好我们的军队。\n这是最好的决定。我知道，你也知道。"

# game/script.rpy:140459
translate chinese map214_622403a4:

    # voice "se/y01846.ogg"
    voice "se/y01846.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:140461
translate chinese map214_9842c2b3:

    # char_pro "You sided with Vivien, so this was a total gamble.\nIt's good to know that we can endure a difference in opinion\nUlric wasn't giving me the same courtesy. I think he'd even kill me."
    char_pro "你站在了薇薇安那边，所以这完全是场豪赌。\n很高兴知道我们能容忍意见分歧。\n乌尔里克可没给我同样的礼遇。我觉得他甚至会杀了我。"

# game/script.rpy:140474
translate chinese map214_87c74e09:

    # voice "se/y01847.ogg"
    # char_pro "But I guess I can understand why he'd do that.\nThis isn't just about an alliance to him. This is his home.\nHe wants to change it for the better, like we all do with Alestia."
    voice "se/y01847.ogg"
    char_pro "但我想我能理解他为什么会那样做。\n对他来说，这不仅仅关乎同盟。这是他的家乡。\n他想把它变得更好，就像我们所有人都想改变阿莱斯蒂亚一样。"

# game/script.rpy:140501
translate chinese map214_43993c10:

    # voice "se/y01848.ogg"
    voice "se/y01848.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:140503
translate chinese map214_a46a0ea7:

    # char_pro "I know this whole situation is really confusing.\nTo be honest, I don't even know every little detail.\nBut as long as we all trust each other, it'll work out."
    char_pro "我知道这整个局面确实很让人困惑。\n老实说，我甚至不清楚每一个细节。\n但只要我们彼此信任，一切都会好起来的。"

# game/script.rpy:140517
translate chinese map214_8ac40f82:

    # "He takes a few steps, closing the distance between us.{w}\nHis eyes are filled with hope now, a stark contrast to moments ago."
    "他迈了几步，缩短了我们之间的距离。{w}\n此刻他眼中满是希望，与片刻前判若两人。"

# game/script.rpy:140542
translate chinese map214_520c4a99:

    # voice "se/y01849.ogg"
    # char_pro "Thank you so much, [firstname].\nI know there isn't much time, so we need to get going.\nBut that's all I needed to talk about. I'm good to go."
    voice "se/y01849.ogg"
    char_pro "太谢谢你了，[firstname]。\n我知道时间不多了，我们得动身了。\n但我要说的就这些。我准备好了。"

# game/script.rpy:140560
translate chinese map214_5da3f1de:

    # "He wraps his arms around me, and rests his head against my shoulder."
    "他张开双臂抱住我，把头靠在我的肩上。"

# game/script.rpy:140575
translate chinese map214_a0023ae2:

    # voice "se/y01850.ogg"
    # char_pro "We'll make it through this, I know it.\nYou may not understand, but I promise you will.\nJust give it time. I know I'd happily give you all of mine."
    voice "se/y01850.ogg"
    char_pro "我们会挺过去的，我知道。\n你也许现在不明白，但我保证你会的。\n给点时间就好。我知道我会乐意把我所有的时间都给你。"

# game/script.rpy:140589
translate chinese map214_f3f84e74:

    # voice "se/y01851.ogg"
    # char_pro "After this battle, we'll have a long chat.\nThere's so much I need to tell you, but I just can't right now.\nI promise that at the end of the day, this will all make sense."
    voice "se/y01851.ogg"
    char_pro "这场战斗之后，我们好好长谈一次。\n我有太多事要告诉你，但现在实在不行。\n我保证，到最后这一切都会说得通的。"

# game/script.rpy:140611
translate chinese map214_29ad2ebb:

    # "He smiles, and runs off to the lobby.{w}\nI guess it was time. We'd finally do this.{w}\nI'm thankful that our bond remains intact."
    "他笑了笑，跑向大厅。{w}\n我想时候到了。我们终于要动手了。{w}\n我很感激我们的羁绊依然完好。"

# game/script.rpy:140617
translate chinese map214_7d27cfb9:

    # "Pro's loyalty scene will be available when you return to the mainland.{w}\nAfter the conclusion of Act Four, return to the Rebel HQ War Table."
    "当你回到大陆时，普洛的忠诚剧情将会开放。{w}\n第四幕结束后，回到反抗军总部的作战桌。"

# game/script.rpy:140646
translate chinese map214_f58cc940:

    # voice "se/y01852.ogg"
    voice "se/y01852.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:140648
translate chinese map214_42cee163:

    # char_pro "After this battle, we'll have a long chat.\nThere's so much I need to tell you, but I just can't right now.\nI promise that at the end of the day, this will all make sense."
    char_pro "这场战斗之后，我们好好长谈一次。\n我有太多事要告诉你，但现在实在不行。\n我保证，到最后这一切都会说得通的。"

# game/script.rpy:140669
translate chinese map214_4ece31b0:

    # "He smiles, and makes his way out of the room.{w}\nI guess it was time. The fight would finally begin.{w}\nI'm glad that my bond with Pro could remain intact."
    "他笑了笑，走出了房间。{w}\n我想时候到了。战斗终于要开始了。{w}\n我很高兴我与普洛的羁绊得以完好保留。"

# game/script.rpy:140675
translate chinese map214_7d27cfb9_1:

    # "Pro's loyalty scene will be available when you return to the mainland.{w}\nAfter the conclusion of Act Four, return to the Rebel HQ War Table."
    "当你回到大陆时，普洛的忠诚剧情将会开放。{w}\n第四幕结束后，回到反抗军总部的作战桌。"

# game/script.rpy:140712
translate chinese map203_5bb61854:

    # "I enter the lobby, with Ulric and Pro behind me.{w}\nOur comrades are there, and they immediately turn and stare.{w}\nAn odd aura fills the air. But this definitely {i}is{/i} an odd situation."
    "我走进大厅，乌尔里克和普洛跟在我身后。{w}\n我们的战友们都在那里，他们立刻转头盯着我们。{w}\n一股古怪的气氛弥漫开来。但这确实{i}是{/i}个古怪的局面。"

# game/script.rpy:140717
translate chinese map203_b44211e1:

    # "Draycu stands on one side of the room, and Vivien stands on another.{w}\nPro follows me as I take slow steps toward Draycu, my ally in this battle.{w}\nIf I wanted to win, I'd have to ensure that him and Pro stayed alive."
    "德雷库站在房间的一侧，薇薇安站在另一侧。{w}\n我缓缓朝德雷库——我这场战斗中的盟友——走去，普洛跟在我身后。{w}\n若我想获胜，就必须确保他和普洛都活着。"

# game/script.rpy:140742
translate chinese map203_864adfe5:

    # voice "se/z01940.ogg"
    voice "se/z01940.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:140748
translate chinese map203_2abbb3ae:

    # char_jit_map203_1_0_20 "So, the battle is about to begin.\nBoth teams will enter the coliseum on opposite sides.\nWhen we meet in the middle, chaos will ensue."
    char_jit_map203_1_0_20 "那么，战斗即将开始。\n两支队伍将从对侧进入大竞技场。\n当我们在中央相遇时，混乱就会爆发。"

# game/script.rpy:140761
translate chinese map203_fe88fe18:

    # voice "se/z01941.ogg"
    # char_jit_map203_1_0_20 "This chaos will involve the death of many people.\nI hope that you've said your potential goodbyes, [firstname].\nI'll do my best to support you, but I need to focus on my own safety."
    voice "se/z01941.ogg"
    char_jit_map203_1_0_20 "这场混乱会夺走许多人的性命。\n希望你已经把该道的别都道过了，[firstname]。\n我会尽力支援你，但我也得顾好自己的安危。"

# game/script.rpy:140776
translate chinese map203_28e86383:

    # "I nod, since that's completely understandable."
    "我点了点头，这完全可以理解。"

# game/script.rpy:140801
translate chinese map203_48d811d1:

    # voice "se/z01942.ogg"
    # char_jit_map203_1_0_20 "Besides, I think you'll be fine.\nI've heard rumors of that sword you're carrying.\nIf I get into a pinch, I might even count on your support."
    voice "se/z01942.ogg"
    char_jit_map203_1_0_20 "再说，我觉得你不会有事的。\n我听说过你带着的那把剑的传闻。\n要是我陷入困境，说不定还得指望你来支援。"

# game/script.rpy:140816
translate chinese map203_7ed54f25:

    # "He places his hand on my shoulder, and smiles."
    "他把手搭在我肩上，笑了笑。"

# game/script.rpy:140841
translate chinese map203_d1735b37:

    # voice "se/z01943.ogg"
    # char_jit_map203_1_0_20 "That is, if we even run into each other out there.\nIt's a big arena, and it'll be full of soldiers.\nLet's get going. We're on the other side."
    voice "se/z01943.ogg"
    char_jit_map203_1_0_20 "当然，前提是我们在场上能碰上。\n竞技场很大，而且会挤满士兵。\n走吧。我们在另一边。"

# game/script.rpy:140856
translate chinese map203_9d270c59:

    # "My comrades all make their way to the spectator's area.{w}\nAfter that, both Leaders escort their forces to the waiting area.{w}\nAs soon as the gates were lifted, the battle for Alarinthia would begin."
    "我的战友们纷纷前往观众区。{w}\n之后，两位领袖各自率领部队前往等候区。{w}\n闸门一升起，争夺阿拉林西亚的战斗就将开始。"

# game/script.rpy:140858
translate chinese map203_98328e2d:

    # "I notice the reserve forces we lent Draycu in the corner of my eye.{w}\nThey approach me as we walk, and give me wishes of support."
    "我眼角瞥见我们借给德雷库的后备部队。{w}\n我们走着时他们围了上来，向我表达支持与祝愿。"

# game/script.rpy:140881
translate chinese map203_ef07c6ad:

    # voice "se/z01944.ogg"
    voice "se/z01944.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:140887
translate chinese map203_81c45996:

    # char_jit_map203_1_0_103 "We will use our power to protect you.\nDo not worry, and simply give it your all."
    char_jit_map203_1_0_103 "我们会用我们的力量保护你。\n不必担心，只管全力以赴。"

# game/script.rpy:140900
translate chinese map203_e2c435aa:

    # voice "se/z01945.ogg"
    voice "se/z01945.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:140905
translate chinese map203_66fdb590:

    # char_jit_map203_1_0_115 "However, we haven't exactly mastered this power.\nSo don't rely on us to keep you out of harm's way."
    char_jit_map203_1_0_115 "不过，我们还没有完全掌握这股力量。\n所以别指望我们能让你远离危险。"

# game/script.rpy:140918
translate chinese map203_b177ef7e:

    # voice "se/z01946.ogg"
    voice "se/z01946.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:140923
translate chinese map203_cc1f1a2c:

    # char_jit_map203_1_0_127 "If we survive this, we will continue to grow our gift.\nOur goal is to be of use during the final assault on Balteus."
    char_jit_map203_1_0_127 "如果我们能活下来，我们会继续培育这份天赋。\n我们的目标是在对巴尔泰乌斯的最终进攻中派上用场。"

# game/script.rpy:140937
translate chinese map203_14f36468:

    # "I nod. It's good to know that I have their support.{w}\nBut I wish we didn't have to put them in danger right now.{w}\nTheir power would be more useful in the coming days."
    "我点了点头。知道有他们的支持是好事。{w}\n但我真希望我们不必现在就让他们身陷险境。{w}\n他们的力量在接下来的日子里会更有用。"

# game/script.rpy:140948
translate chinese map203_ea4ac8c6:

    # voice "se/z01947.ogg"
    voice "se/z01947.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:140954
translate chinese map203_8809000e:

    # char_jit_map203_1_0_144 "Do not worry. We will aid you in this battle.\nIf you stay by our side, you will see no harm."
    char_jit_map203_1_0_144 "不必担心。我们会在这场战斗中助你一臂之力。\n只要你待在我们身边，就不会受伤。"

# game/script.rpy:140967
translate chinese map203_d6b2ab94:

    # voice "se/z01948.ogg"
    voice "se/z01948.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:140972
translate chinese map203_aede7776:

    # char_jit_map203_1_0_156 "It is unlikely that these bodies will perish.\nAfter this, we will also protect you in Balteus."
    char_jit_map203_1_0_156 "这些躯体不太可能消亡。\n这之后，我们也会在巴尔泰乌斯保护你。"

# game/script.rpy:140985
translate chinese map203_69412dea:

    # voice "se/z01949.ogg"
    voice "se/z01949.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:140990
translate chinese map203_17458bc6:

    # char_jit_map203_1_0_168 "Allow us this chance to repay you.\nYou gave us life, and now we can be of use."
    char_jit_map203_1_0_168 "请允许我们借此机会报答你。\n你赋予了我们生命，如今我们能派上用场了。"

# game/script.rpy:141004
translate chinese map203_3ac00df8:

    # "I nod. It's good to know that I have their support.{w}\nBut I wish we did't have to put them in danger right now.{w}\nTheir power would be more useful in the coming days."
    "我点了点头。知道有他们的支持是好事。{w}\n但我真希望我们不必现在就让他们身陷险境。{w}\n他们的力量在接下来的日子里会更有用。"

# game/script.rpy:141009
translate chinese map203_b297fc0c:

    # "Vivien stands on one side of the room, and Draycu stands on another.{w}\nUlric follows me as I take slow steps toward Vivien, my ally in this battle.{w}\nIf I wanted to win, I'd have to ensure that him and Ulric stayed alive."
    "薇薇安站在房间的一侧，德雷库站在另一侧。{w}\n我缓缓朝薇薇安——我这场战斗中的盟友——走去，乌尔里克跟在我身后。{w}\n若我想获胜，就必须确保他和乌尔里克都活着。"

# game/script.rpy:141034
translate chinese map203_99a30e49:

    # voice "se/z01950.ogg"
    voice "se/z01950.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:141040
translate chinese map203_500e2ae9:

    # char_jit_map203_1_0_195 "So, it's finally going to happen.\nI've been dreaming about this day for a long time.\nDo your best out there, Monarch. I've got your back."
    char_jit_map203_1_0_195 "那么，终于要开始了。\n我梦想这一天已经很久了。\n在外面尽力而为吧，君主。我会罩着你的。"

# game/script.rpy:141053
translate chinese map203_c3b7547e:

    # voice "se/z01951.ogg"
    # char_jit_map203_1_0_195 "Of course, I {i}have{/i} heard rumors about that blade you're carrying.\nSo if you don't mind — I might choose to lean on you for support, too.\nIf we all take care of each other, then we'll be unstoppable for sure."
    voice "se/z01951.ogg"
    char_jit_map203_1_0_195 "当然，我{i}确实{/i}听说过你带着的那把剑的传闻。\n所以如果你不介意——我或许也会选择倚仗你的支援。\n如果我们都互相照应，那我们肯定无人能挡。"

# game/script.rpy:141068
translate chinese map203_b77f7899:

    # "I nod, since he's right. "
    "我点了点头，因为他说得对。"

# game/script.rpy:141093
translate chinese map203_c07ea4d2:

    # voice "se/z01952.ogg"
    # char_jit_map203_1_0_195 "We need to make our way to the other side of the coliseum.\nBoth groups start on opposite ends, and meet in the middle.\nThat's where all the chaos ensues. It'll be pretty hectic."
    voice "se/z01952.ogg"
    char_jit_map203_1_0_195 "我们得前往大竞技场的另一端。\n两支队伍从两端出发，在中央相遇。\n混乱就在那里爆发。会相当激烈。"

# game/script.rpy:141116
translate chinese map203_20affc27:

    # voice "se/z01953.ogg"
    voice "se/z01953.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:141118
translate chinese map203_ac77af2b:

    # char_ulric "I'm counting on it. It's been ages since I've seen a real battle.\nDo your best to stay out of danger, [firstname]. Leave this to us.\nThere's no need for you to risk your life unless you need to."
    char_ulric "我可就指望这个了。我已经很久没见过真正的战斗了。\n尽量别陷入危险，[firstname]。交给我们。\n除非必要，你没必要拿命去冒险。"

# game/script.rpy:141131
translate chinese map203_41917abd:

    # voice "se/z01954.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Our targets are Draycu and Pro.\nWe should do our best to avoid senseless casualties.\nViven's reign should begin with as little bloodshed as possible."
    voice "se/z01954.ogg"
    char_ulric "我们的目标是德雷库和普洛。\n我们应尽力避免无谓的伤亡。\n薇薇安的统治应当以尽可能少的流血开始。"

# game/script.rpy:141146
translate chinese map203_81bcb615:

    # "I nod, and watch as Vivien and Ulric shake hands."
    "我点了点头，看着薇薇安和乌尔里克握手。"

# game/script.rpy:141171
translate chinese map203_3132b7f0:

    # voice "se/z01955.ogg"
    # char_jit_map203_1_0_195 "It's a bit of a walk, so lets get started.\nThe battle will start in a few minutes, so we need to be there.\nSome leader I'd be if I showed up late to my own fight."
    voice "se/z01955.ogg"
    char_jit_map203_1_0_195 "有一段路要走，所以出发吧。\n战斗几分钟后就开始，我们得赶到那儿。\n要是连自己的战斗都迟到，我还算什么领袖。"

# game/script.rpy:141198
translate chinese map203_211d67c1:

    # "He smiles, and we break our huddle.{w}\nI follow him as we make our way to the gates.{w}\nThe weight on my shoulders is immense, and frightening."
    "他笑了笑，我们结束了围聚。{w}\n我跟在他身后，朝闸门走去。{w}\n我肩上的重担无比巨大，令人恐惧。"

# game/script.rpy:141200
translate chinese map203_6d218931:

    # "I notice Drakeor make his way to my side.{w}\nHe looks me up and down, staring at my blade."
    "我注意到德雷克走到我身边。{w}\n他上下打量着我，目光盯着我的剑。"

# game/script.rpy:141225
translate chinese map203_784dd9cb:

    # voice "se/z01956b.ogg"
    voice "se/z01956b.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:141231
translate chinese map203_65b8c4ee:

    # char_jit_map203_1_0_304 "Look, I don't know if what they told me was true.\nBut if that blade is some sort of ancient relic, don't showboat.\nAnything other than strength and strategy will be seen as cheating."
    char_jit_map203_1_0_304 "听着，我不知道他们告诉我的是不是真的。\n但如果那把剑是什么古代遗物，别炫耀。\n除力量与策略之外的任何东西都会被视作作弊。"

# game/script.rpy:141244
translate chinese map203_e7cd07b6:

    # voice "se/z01957.ogg"
    # char_jit_map203_1_0_304 "That blade may have powers to help you out in Balteus, but not here.\nDo your best to blend in as a regular combatant, alright...?\nI don't want you putting Vivien in jeopardy out there."
    voice "se/z01957.ogg"
    char_jit_map203_1_0_304 "那把剑或许有力量能在巴尔泰乌斯帮你，但在这里不行。\n尽量像个普通战士一样混在里面，行吗……？\n我不想你在场上危及薇薇安。"

# game/script.rpy:141259
translate chinese map203_66a38d08:

    # "I shrug, since I don't really have a say in the matter.{w}\nI suppose the powers of the blade were pretty much cheating.{w}\nA thrown battle would do little to prove Vivien's credibility."
    "我耸了耸肩，毕竟这事我没什么发言权。{w}\n我想那剑的力量确实跟作弊差不多。{w}\n一场放水的战斗对证明薇薇安的信誉毫无帮助。"

# game/script.rpy:141273
translate chinese map203_c50cf557:

    # "After a trek that seems like forever, we're at our gates.{w}\nThey're shut tight, and I can see another set across from this one.{w}\nAt the other end of the arena, our opponents were waiting, just like us."
    "经过仿佛永无止境的跋涉，我们来到了自己的闸门前。{w}\n门紧紧关着，我能看到对面还有另一组闸门。{w}\n在竞技场的另一端，我们的对手正像我们一样等待着。"

# game/script.rpy:141275
translate chinese map203_8ef9d7cf:

    # "I look over at my allies, and gulp.{w}\nThe crowd is roaring with excitement.{w}\nOur lives were simply entertainment to them."
    "我看向我的盟友，咽了口唾沫。{w}\n人群兴奋地吼叫着。{w}\n我们的性命对他们来说不过是娱乐。"

# game/script.rpy:141301
translate chinese map203_c869ed7b:

    # voice "se/z01958.ogg"
    voice "se/z01958.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:141307
translate chinese map203_a8629a07:

    # char_jit_map203_1_0_350 "Don't worry. We can do this.\nWe only have a few more seconds, so get ready.\nIf this is like any other battle, it'll only last a few minutes."
    char_jit_map203_1_0_350 "别担心。我们能行的。\n只剩几秒钟了，准备好吧。\n如果这跟其他战斗一样，只会持续几分钟。"

# game/script.rpy:141332
translate chinese map203_200f3c29:

    # voice "se/z01959.ogg"
    voice "se/z01959.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:141335
translate chinese map203_3faaa895:

    # char_pro "See? I told you we picked the right guy.\nThis'll be over before you know it, and we'll be the winners.\nAfter this, our attack on Balteus will be a cakewalk. I know it."
    char_pro "看吧？我说过我们选对人了。\n转眼就会结束，而我们会是赢家。\n这之后，我们对巴尔泰乌斯的进攻会易如反掌。我确信。"

# game/script.rpy:141349
translate chinese map203_ce8ee04a:

    # voice "se/z01969.ogg"
    voice "se/z01969.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:141355
translate chinese map203_cda36d3c:

    # char_jit_map203_1_0_372 "Remember, we're fighting for a better future.\nOur hopes and dreams will carry us to victory. I know it.\nOf course, Ulric's sword arm will sure be a big help."
    char_jit_map203_1_0_372 "记住，我们是为更美好的未来而战。\n我们的希望与梦想会带我们走向胜利。我确信。\n当然，乌尔里克那身剑术肯定能派上大用场。"

# game/script.rpy:141380
translate chinese map203_23fb91d7:

    # voice "se/z01970.ogg"
    voice "se/z01970.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:141382
translate chinese map203_1e6f52e7:

    # char_ulric "No need to put on the pressure, Vivien.\nBut I know you're right. This is all I've ever wanted.\nAnd with you two by my side, I know I'll never fail."
    char_ulric "不用给我施压，薇薇安。\n但我知道你说得对。这是我一直以来想要的。\n有你们两个在我身边，我知道我绝不会失败。"

# game/script.rpy:141408
translate chinese map203_9e9e6bd4:

    # "He smiles, but that smile is quickly wiped from his face."
    "他笑了，但那笑容很快从他脸上消失。"

# game/script.rpy:141413
translate chinese map203_f2fdf79b:

    # "The gates begin to open, giving us a clear view of the arena."
    "闸门开始打开，让我们清楚地看到竞技场。"

# game/script.rpy:141444
translate chinese map215_8188a5e9:

    # "We take a few steps outside of the gates, and look around.{w}\nThe crowd goes wild, and that's when all hell breaks loose.{w}\nThe reserve forces rush to the center to create a line of defense."
    "我们走出闸门几步，环顾四周。{w}\n人群疯狂起来，就在这时，一切都乱了套。{w}\n后备部队冲往中央，筑起一道防线。"

# game/script.rpy:141473
translate chinese map215_308e46a2:

    # voice "se/z01971.ogg"
    voice "se/z01971.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:141476
translate chinese map215_f8217dc1:

    # char_pro "Stay back, [firstname]!\nLet them get things started...!"
    char_pro "退后，[firstname]！\n让他们先开个头……！"

# game/script.rpy:141501
translate chinese map215_1b36d49a:

    # voice "se/z01972b.ogg"
    voice "se/z01972b.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:141507
translate chinese map215_6b2275bc:

    # char_jit_map215_1_0_26 "No, this is the perfect time to charge!\nThe cover of chaos will help us catch them off guard."
    char_jit_map215_1_0_26 "不，这正是冲锋的最佳时机！\n混乱的掩护能帮我们打他们个措手不及。"

# game/script.rpy:141532
translate chinese map215_5f6bd634:

    # voice "se/z01973.ogg"
    # char_pro "R-right!"
    voice "se/z01973.ogg"
    char_pro "好、好的！"

# game/script.rpy:141547
translate chinese map215_5049eb9e:

    # voice "se/z01974.ogg"
    voice "se/z01974.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:141549
translate chinese map215_64214aee:

    # char_ulric "Stay back, [firstname]!\nLet me and Vivien lead the charge!"
    char_ulric "退后，[firstname]！\n让我和薇薇安带头冲锋！"

# game/script.rpy:141574
translate chinese map215_1515a032:

    # voice "se/z01975b.ogg"
    voice "se/z01975b.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:141580
translate chinese map215_a505a50a:

    # char_jit_map215_1_0_61 "Yeah, just make sure to stay out of danger.\nWe can't have our future ruler falling in battle!"
    char_jit_map215_1_0_61 "对，千万注意别陷入危险。\n我们可不能让我们未来的统治者倒在战场上！"

# game/script.rpy:141595
translate chinese map215_2be30251:

    # voice "se/z01976.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Now...!"
    voice "se/z01976.ogg"
    char_ulric "现在……！"

# game/script.rpy:141622
translate chinese map215_2e8d495c:

    # "I stay back as instructed, and let them lead the charge.{w}\nAfter a few minutes, everybody meets in the center.{w}\nAll I hear is clashing metal, and agonizing screams."
    "我按照吩咐留在后面，让他们带头冲锋。{w}\n几分钟后，所有人都汇聚到了中央。{w}\n我只听到金属的碰撞声和痛苦的惨叫。"

# game/script.rpy:141624
translate chinese map215_bf2c4fb1:

    # "It's an absolute massacre. Just like..."
    "这完全是一场屠杀。就像……"

# game/script.rpy:141650
translate chinese map216_761b0ebf:

    # "I gasp and take a few steps back, anxiety coursing through me.{w}\nIt feels like I'm right back in the Rebel HQ. Everybody is dying...!{w}\nI clutch my chest, and start to panic in the arena, my breath short."
    "我喘了口气，后退了几步，焦虑涌遍全身。{w}\n感觉就像我又回到了反抗军总部。所有人都在死去……！{w}\n我捂住胸口，在竞技场里开始惊慌失措，呼吸困难。"

# game/script.rpy:141652
translate chinese map216_fb3e0610:

    # "What's going on!? This has never happened before...{w}\nI can't escape this. It feels like it's happening all over again.{w}\nI shake my head, but nothing helps. I need it to stop...!"
    "这是怎么回事！？以前从没发生过……{w}\n我逃不开。感觉就像一切又重演了。{w}\n我摇了摇头，但毫无帮助。我需要它停下来……！"

# game/script.rpy:141678
translate chinese map216_419594b2:

    # voice "se/z01967.ogg"
    voice "se/z01967.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:141681
translate chinese map216_48585b0f:

    # char_pro "Hey [firstname], you okay...?"
    char_pro "嘿，[firstname]，你还好吗……？"

# game/script.rpy:141695
translate chinese map216_12bcde2a:

    # "I'm unable to respond, as enemy soldiers close in on me."
    "我无法回应，因为敌兵正朝我逼近。"

# game/script.rpy:141720
translate chinese map216_ade5d56e:

    # voice "se/z01968.ogg"
    # char_pro "[firstname]...!"
    voice "se/z01968.ogg"
    char_pro "[firstname]……！"

# game/script.rpy:141742
translate chinese map216_3f8edf16:

    # "Pro rushes to my side and pushes me on the ground.{w}\nI hit the ground with a loud thud, and I'm knocked back into coherence.{w}\nHowever, this did little else but redirect the attention to him."
    "普洛冲到我身边，把我推倒在地。{w}\n我砰地一声摔在地上，被震得恢复了意识。{w}\n然而，这除了把注意力引到他身上之外，几乎毫无作用。"

# game/script.rpy:141768
translate chinese map216_e15542b4:

    # voice "se/z01970b.ogg"
    voice "se/z01970b.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:141770
translate chinese map216_8ab6c0be:

    # char_ulric "Hey [firstname], are you okay...?"
    char_ulric "嘿，[firstname]，你还好吗……？"

# game/script.rpy:141784
translate chinese map216_6bde9023:

    # "I'm unable to respond as enemy soldiers close in on me.{w}\nDraycu's reserve forces, our own men, are coming to attack me.{w}\nOr were they? I had no idea if they'd actually follow through."
    "我无法回应，因为敌兵正朝我逼近。{w}\n德雷库的后备部队——我们自己的人——正朝我攻来。{w}\n还是说，他们真会动手？我根本不知道他们会不会真的照做。"

# game/script.rpy:141786
translate chinese map216_c1a3b406:

    # "And thanks to a sudden interruption, I'd never find out."
    "而由于一次突如其来的打断，我永远也不会知道了。"

# game/script.rpy:141811
translate chinese map216_ce287a73:

    # voice "se/z01971b.ogg"
    # char_ulric "[firstname]!"
    voice "se/z01971b.ogg"
    char_ulric "[firstname]！"

# game/script.rpy:141833
translate chinese map216_32480696:

    # "Ulric rushes to my side and pushes me on the ground.{w}\nI hit the floor with a loud thud, and I'm knocked back into coherence.{w}\nHowever, this did little else but redirect the attention to him."
    "乌尔里克冲到我身边，把我推倒在地。{w}\n我砰地一声摔在地上，被震得恢复了意识。{w}\n然而，这除了把注意力引到他身上之外，几乎毫无作用。"

# game/script.rpy:141860
translate chinese map217_dedd6f66:

    # "With almost a dozen men charging toward him, he starts to panic.{w}\nLuckily, he's saved by Draycu moments before they can harm him.{w}\nWith a swing of a large greatsword, they're all knocked down."
    "将近十几个人朝他冲来，他开始慌了。{w}\n幸好，就在他们即将伤到他之前，德雷库救下了他。{w}\n一记巨剑挥过，他们全被击倒在地。"

# game/script.rpy:141885
translate chinese map217_e80f6098:

    # voice "se/z01969b.ogg"
    voice "se/z01969b.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:141891
translate chinese map217_7e88a280:

    # char_jit_map217_1_0_13 "Going after my Champion, huh...?\nVivien's men must have a death wish.\nHere [firstname], let me help you up. "
    char_jit_map217_1_0_13 "冲我的斗士下手，是吧……？\n薇薇安的手下想必是活腻了。\n来，[firstname]，我扶你起来。"

# game/script.rpy:141896
translate chinese map217_06474f1e:

    # "With almost a dozen men charging toward him, he stands his ground.{w}\nUnsheathing his sword, he sizes up the oncoming attackers.{w}\nOne single swing later, they're all knocked to the ground."
    "将近十几个人朝他冲来，他岿然不动。{w}\n他拔出剑，打量着冲来的攻击者。{w}\n只一挥，他们全被击倒在地。"

# game/script.rpy:141898
translate chinese map217_51c38617:

    # "It seems he's shown them mercy, as they squirm on the ground, injured."
    "他似乎对他们手下留情了，因为他们只是受了伤，在地上扭动。"

# game/script.rpy:141900
translate chinese map217_c4e47630:

    # "I'm not sure what he was calculating, but that was impressive.{w}\nIt's almost like he knew exactly when to swing for maximum effect.{w}\nIt hurts me to see him harm our own, but there was no other choice."
    "我不确定他在盘算什么，但那确实令人叹服。{w}\n简直就像他精确知道何时挥剑才能达到最大效果。{w}\n看他伤害我们自己的人让我心痛，但别无选择。"

# game/script.rpy:141925
translate chinese map217_5b8c6758:

    # voice "se/z01972.ogg"
    voice "se/z01972.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:141927
translate chinese map217_26ed083e:

    # char_ulric "Forgive me, [firstname].\nIt was either them or you. I had to make a decision.\nGive me your hand, we need to keep things moving."
    char_ulric "原谅我，[firstname]。\n不是他们就是你。我必须做出决定。\n把手给我，我们得继续推进。"

# game/script.rpy:141943
translate chinese map217_2d75188e:

    # "I nod, and grab his hand. He helps me back on my feet.{w}\nI have no idea what just happened. Was that a vision, or something else?{w}\nNo — there was no time to think about that. We had a battle to focus on."
    "我点了点头，抓住他的手。他把我扶了起来。{w}\n我完全不知道刚才发生了什么。那是幻象，还是别的什么？{w}\n不——没时间想这个了。我们还有一场战斗要专心应对。"

# game/script.rpy:141945
translate chinese map217_eafe11f5:

    # "And it was a battle that we were winning."
    "而这是一场我们正在赢下的战斗。"

# game/script.rpy:141954
translate chinese map217_b726a6ee:

    # "We push the opposing forces back toward their side.{w}\nAfter a few minutes of battle, they're almost backed into a corner.{w}\nWe had them right where we wanted them. Or did we...?"
    "我们把敌军逼退回他们那一侧。{w}\n战斗了几分钟后，他们几乎被逼到了角落。{w}\n他们完全落入了我们想要的境地。真的是这样吗……？"

# game/script.rpy:141980
translate chinese map217_f04a683e:

    # voice "se/z01973b.ogg"
    voice "se/z01973b.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:141986
translate chinese map217_6f76f29e:

    # char_jit_map217_1_0_67 "Now...!"
    char_jit_map217_1_0_67 "现在……！"

# game/script.rpy:142007
translate chinese map217_da54e934:

    # "Just when we think we have the upper hand, Vivien plays his trump card.{w}\nHis forces spread out, and quickly run around our flank, surrounding us.{w}\nWe weren't quick enough to react, we were all too close together."
    "就在我们以为占了上风时，薇薇安打出了他的王牌。{w}\n他的部队散开，迅速绕到我们的侧翼，将我们包围。{w}\n我们反应不够快，大家又挤得太近。"

# game/script.rpy:142032
translate chinese map217_1034e648:

    # voice "se/z01974b.ogg"
    voice "se/z01974b.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:142038
translate chinese map217_85d7e36e:

    # char_jit_map217_1_0_86 "Stay close! \nIf we can get through this, then we'll win.\nIt looks like this was his plan all along."
    char_jit_map217_1_0_86 "靠紧点！\n只要我们能挺过这一关，我们就赢了。\n看来这就是他一直以来的计划。"

# game/script.rpy:142052
translate chinese map217_ce6a649a:

    # "They take slow, synchronized steps toward us.{w}\nWe all look for a weakness, but can't find any.{w}\nIn a few minutes, they'd close in on us."
    "他们迈着缓慢而整齐的步伐朝我们逼近。{w}\n我们都在寻找破绽，却一个也找不到。{w}\n再过几分钟，他们就会合围上来。"

# game/script.rpy:142077
translate chinese map217_24e2bcb0:

    # voice "se/z01975.ogg"
    voice "se/z01975.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:142080
translate chinese map217_3101d14e:

    # char_pro "Yeah, this strategy reeks of desperation.\nGet us out of this, [firstname]. Use that blade if you have to.\nThere's no way he has more up his sleeve. Not after this."
    char_pro "是啊，这策略透着一股孤注一掷的味道。\n带我们脱困，[firstname]。不得已就用那把剑。\n他不可能还有后手了。这一招之后不可能。"

# game/script.rpy:142094
translate chinese map217_7369a556:

    # "They raise their blades, and ready themselves to attack.{w}\nThey're still far away, but it's enough to intimidate us.{w}\nI reach for my own weapon in response, and unsheathe it."
    "他们举起剑，准备进攻。{w}\n他们离得还远，但已足以让我们心生畏惧。{w}\n我伸手握住自己的武器作为回应，将它拔出。"

# game/script.rpy:142120
translate chinese map217_5a51d15c:

    # voice "se/z01976b.ogg"
    voice "se/z01976b.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:142126
translate chinese map217_6f815266:

    # char_jit_map217_1_0_128 "Now...!"
    char_jit_map217_1_0_128 "现在……！"

# game/script.rpy:142147
translate chinese map217_1f28d895:

    # "Just when we think we have the upper hand, Draycu plays his trump card.{w}\nHis forces spread out, and quickly run around our flank, surrounding us.{w}\nWe weren't quick enough to react, we were all too close together."
    "就在我们以为占了上风时，德雷库打出了他的王牌。{w}\n他的部队散开，迅速绕到我们的侧翼，将我们包围。{w}\n我们反应不够快，大家又挤得太近。"

# game/script.rpy:142172
translate chinese map217_ae0fe23e:

    # voice "se/z01977.ogg"
    voice "se/z01977.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:142178
translate chinese map217_b3e16a41:

    # char_jit_map217_1_0_147 "Stay close, [firstname]!\nThis must be what Draycu was counting on.\nIf we can break free, then victory is surely ours."
    char_jit_map217_1_0_147 "靠紧点，[firstname]！\n这一定是德雷库所指望的。\n如果我们能突围，胜利就必然属于我们。"

# game/script.rpy:142192
translate chinese map217_ce6a649a_1:

    # "They take slow, synchronized steps toward us.{w}\nWe all look for a weakness, but can't find any.{w}\nIn a few minutes, they'd close in on us."
    "他们迈着缓慢而整齐的步伐朝我们逼近。{w}\n我们都在寻找破绽，却一个也找不到。{w}\n再过几分钟，他们就会合围上来。"

# game/script.rpy:142217
translate chinese map217_9fef9b65:

    # voice "se/z01978.ogg"
    voice "se/z01978.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:142219
translate chinese map217_eba06cad:

    # char_ulric "This strategy, it seems desperate.\nThat means he doesn't have anything else up his sleeve.\nGet us out of this, [firstname]! Use that blade if you have to."
    char_ulric "这策略，看起来是走投无路了。\n那就意味着他没有别的后手了。\n带我们脱困，[firstname]！不得已就用那把剑。"

# game/script.rpy:142233
translate chinese map217_7369a556_1:

    # "They raise their blades, and ready themselves to attack.{w}\nThey're still far away, but it's enough to intimidate us.{w}\nI reach for my own weapon in response, and unsheathe it."
    "他们举起剑，准备进攻。{w}\n他们离得还远，但已足以让我们心生畏惧。{w}\n我伸手握住自己的武器作为回应，将它拔出。"

# game/script.rpy:142247
translate chinese map217_a1033199:

    # "I take slow steps forward, matching their synchronization.{w}\nThey stare at me, confused, and some of them even scoff at me.{w}\nThis was my chance to shine. I had to save us all from this trap."
    "我缓缓向前迈步，配合着他们整齐的节奏。{w}\n他们困惑地盯着我，有些人甚至嗤笑起来。{w}\n这是我发光的机会。我必须把大家从这个陷阱里救出来。"

# game/script.rpy:142249
translate chinese map217_4119c447:

    # "Gripping the blade tightly, I try and figure out how to “activate” it.{w}\nAs if sensing my instinct, the gear on the base starts to spin fervently.{w}\nI raise it up in the air, and demand that the blade assist us in battle."
    "我紧紧握住剑，试图弄明白该如何“激活”它。{w}\n仿佛感应到我的意念，剑柄底部的齿轮开始疯狂转动。{w}\n我将它高举空中，命令剑在战斗中助我们一臂之力。"

# game/script.rpy:142263
translate chinese map217_c31fa549:

    # voice "se/exoduskill.ogg"
    voice "se/exoduskill.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:142265
translate chinese map217_30399620:

    # "Immediately after that, a flash of white light overtakes the arena.{w}\nJust like every other time the Blade has been used. As if that's its call.{w}\nHowever, this flash of white light subsides almost as soon as it began."
    "就在那之后，一道白光席卷了整座竞技场。{w}\n和每一次使用那把剑时一样。仿佛那是它的召唤。{w}\n然而，这道白光几乎刚出现就消退了。"

# game/script.rpy:142274
translate chinese map217_59ff68ef:

    # "It seems to leave everybody in the arena blinded.{w}\nThey stagger back, waving their hands over their eyes, unable to see.{w}\nIn their confusion, they step back, revealing a gap in their formation."
    "它似乎让竞技场里的所有人都陷入了失明。{w}\n他们踉跄后退，双手在眼前挥舞，什么也看不见。{w}\n在一片混乱中，他们后退，露出了阵型中的一个缺口。"

# game/script.rpy:142279
translate chinese map217_fe117545:

    # "And that gap is exactly where Vivien now stands.{w}\nWith my comrades also blinded, it might just be up to me.{w}\nI grip the blade, and watch Vivien panic in his sight-robbed state."
    "而那个缺口正是薇薇安此刻站立的位置。{w}\n我的战友们也同样失明，或许只能靠我了。{w}\n我握紧剑，看着薇薇安在失去视线的状态下惊慌失措。"

# game/script.rpy:142284
translate chinese map217_4b4e8728:

    # "And that gap is exactly where Draycu now stands.\nWith my comrades also blinded, it might just be up to me.{w}\nI grip the blade, and watch Draycu panic in his sight-robbed state."
    "而那个缺口正是德雷库此刻站立的位置。\n我的战友们也同样失明，或许只能靠我了。{w}\n我握紧剑，看着德雷库在失去视线的状态下惊慌失措。"

# game/script.rpy:142288
translate chinese map217_81dde7fe:

    # "The crowd grows silent, almost in awe at what's going on.{w}\nAll eyes are on me. They know I used my blade to do this.{w}\nI gulp, unsure if I should attack, or wait for their sight to return."
    "人群渐渐安静下来，几乎对眼前发生的事感到敬畏。{w}\n所有的目光都集中在我身上。他们知道是我用剑做到了这一切。{w}\n我咽了口唾沫，不确定该进攻，还是等他们的视力恢复。"

# game/script.rpy:142290
translate chinese map217_19ebc04f:

    # "I don't want them to think I'm a coward who needs to disarm their foes.{w}\nWith so many people watching, I need to consider what image I give off.{w}\nI would be in the highest seat of power after this war. I need to think."
    "我不想让他们觉得我是个必须靠让人失明才能取胜的懦夫。{w}\n这么多人看着，我得考虑自己给人留下什么形象。{w}\n这场战争之后我将坐上最高的权位。我得好好想想。"

# game/script.rpy:142296
translate chinese map217_35c27376:

    # "I grab my blade, and guide my body to a battle-ready stance.{w}\nThis is it. I was about to decide the fate of Alarinthia.{w}\nIt would be over, without the death of my comrades."
    "我握紧剑，把身体摆成随时应战的姿势。{w}\n就是现在。我即将决定阿拉林西亚的命运。{w}\n一切都会结束，而不必让我的战友们死去。"

# game/script.rpy:142298
translate chinese map217_30b27256:

    # "I prepare to charge, but then — everything changes.{w}\nI feel a grip on my shoulder, preventing me from moving.{w}\nTurning to face the source of the intrusion, I tremble in fright."
    "我准备冲锋，但就在这时——一切都变了。{w}\n我感觉到一只手抓住我的肩膀，让我动弹不得。{w}\n我转身面对这突如其来的打扰，恐惧得发抖。"

# game/script.rpy:142302
translate chinese map217_360a6797:

    # "No, I couldn't rely on the blade to win this battle. It was cheating.{w}\nBreaking through this attack was enough to put us back on equal ground.{w}\nThat's all we needed to win. We wouldn't get caught off guard again."
    "不，我不能靠那把剑来赢下这场战斗。那是作弊。{w}\n冲破这次攻势，就足以让我们重回同一起跑线。{w}\n那便是我们获胜所需的全部。我们不会再被打个措手不及。"

# game/script.rpy:142304
translate chinese map217_dc5a07a8:

    # "I prepare to sheathe my blade, but then — everything changes.{w}\nI feel a grip on my shoulder, preventing me from moving at all.{w}\nTurning to face the source of the intrusion, I tremble in fright."
    "我准备收回剑，但就在这时——一切都变了。{w}\n我感觉到一只手抓住我的肩膀，让我完全动弹不得。{w}\n我转身面对这突如其来的打扰，恐惧得发抖。"

# game/script.rpy:142308
translate chinese map217_85e8d73e:

    # "It was Ulric."
    "是乌尔里克。"

# game/script.rpy:142333
translate chinese map217_d57e7cce:

    # voice "se/z01980.ogg"
    voice "se/z01980.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:142335
translate chinese map217_878f90a6:

    # char_ulric "Sorry. I can't have you getting in the way.\nI have to do this, [firstname]. Please forgive me."
    char_ulric "抱歉。我不能让你碍事。\n我必须这么做，[firstname]。请原谅我。"

# game/script.rpy:142356
translate chinese map217_625fb0f6:

    # "The grip on my shoulder tightens, into something more crushing.{w}\nHis aggression is clear, and for the first time, I'm frightened by him.{w}\nHe holds up his blade, and re-positions his hand, to use the base as a weapon."
    "抓住我肩膀的手收紧了，变得更像是一种碾压。{w}\n他的敌意显而易见，我第一次对他感到恐惧。{w}\n他举起剑，调整握法，要将剑柄当作武器。"

# game/script.rpy:142358
translate chinese map217_1228ea34:

    # "And he smashes it against my face repeatedly."
    "然后他一次次地把剑柄砸向我的脸。"

# game/script.rpy:142360
translate chinese map217_976caaf9:

    # "I scream and fall to my knees. Blood pours from my nose.{w}\nMy vision gets hazy, and soon, I fall to the ground completely.{w}\nLooking at the gap in the enemy forces, I see Pro step through."
    "我尖叫着跪倒在地。血从鼻子里涌出。{w}\n我的视线变得模糊，很快，我彻底倒在了地上。{w}\n望向敌军阵型中的缺口，我看见普洛从中走出。"

# game/script.rpy:142365
translate chinese map217_04a93603:

    # "He holds a dagger out at Ulric, who holds out his blade in turn.{w}\nThe light still blinds most of the other fighters, making this a one-on-one battle.{w}\nI reach out and try to stop them, but it's no use. They immediately charge at one another."
    "他用匕首指着乌尔里克，乌尔里克也举起了剑。{w}\n那道光仍让大多数其他战斗者失明，使这场战斗变成了一对一。{w}\n我伸手想阻止他们，但毫无用处。他们立刻朝彼此冲了过去。"

# game/script.rpy:142388
translate chinese map218_ed81acd3:

    # "Pain radiates through my entire body, and I'm almost unable to focus.{w}\nTheir weapons clash, again and again, and I finally see Pro fight.{w}\nHe dodges with grace, almost like watching the moves of a dancer."
    "疼痛传遍我全身，我几乎无法集中精神。{w}\n他们的武器一次次碰撞，我终于看到普洛战斗的样子。{w}\n他优雅地闪避，几乎像在欣赏一名舞者的动作。"

# game/script.rpy:142416
translate chinese map218_dc660791:

    # voice "se/z01980b.ogg"
    voice "se/z01980b.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:142418
translate chinese map218_464eda16:

    # char_ulric "Give it up, Pro!\nThis is what I was {i}meant{/i} to do.\nChanging Alarinthia means everything to me."
    char_ulric "放弃吧，普洛！\n这才是我{i}注定{/i}要做的事。\n改变阿拉林西亚对我来说意味着一切。"

# game/script.rpy:142443
translate chinese map218_39f06d24:

    # voice "se/z01981.ogg"
    voice "se/z01981.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:142446
translate chinese map218_f8c87a8b:

    # char_pro "I can't let you win, Ulric!\nWe need Draycu's strength to take down The Triumvirate.\nYou can always come back and change things {i}after{/i} the war...!"
    char_pro "我不能让你赢，乌尔里克！\n我们需要德雷库的力量来击败三人执政团。\n你大可以等战争{i}结束{/i}之后再回来改变一切……！"

# game/script.rpy:142461
translate chinese map218_2d675ccc:

    # voice "se/z01982.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Never...!"
    voice "se/z01982.ogg"
    char_ulric "绝不……！"

# game/script.rpy:142479
translate chinese map218_f5a0df8a:

    # "They continue to fight, ignoring each other's pleas.{w}\nBut they'd have to do something quick. The other soldiers are shaking things off.{w}\nI keep trying to crawl toward them. Their battle was with Vivien and Draycu, not each other!"
    "他们继续厮杀，无视彼此的恳求。{w}\n但他们得赶快做点什么。其他士兵正在缓过神来。{w}\n我一直试图朝他们爬去。他们的对手是薇薇安和德雷库，不是彼此！"

# game/script.rpy:142507
translate chinese map218_f1bf5e8c:

    # voice "se/z01983.ogg"
    # char_pro "Are you really willing to die for this...?\nThink about what Draycu can help us accomplish!"
    voice "se/z01983.ogg"
    char_pro "你真的愿意为此去死吗……？\n想想德雷库能帮我们成就什么！"

# game/script.rpy:142533
translate chinese map218_b7441157:

    # voice "se/z01984.ogg"
    # char_ulric "If the choice is between fighting alongside Draycu, and death...?\nThen yeah, I'm willing to die for this, Pro. But I have to ask.\nAre you willing to kill me in the name of my enemy?"
    voice "se/z01984.ogg"
    char_ulric "如果选择是在与德雷库并肩作战和死亡之间……？\n那么是的，我愿意为此去死，普洛。但我得问一句。\n你愿意以我敌人的名义杀了我吗？"

# game/script.rpy:142559
translate chinese map218_2cb6d409:

    # voice "se/z01985.ogg"
    # char_pro "Y-yes, of course...!"
    voice "se/z01985.ogg"
    char_pro "是、是的，当然……！"

# game/script.rpy:142574
translate chinese map218_cf9076b9:

    # "He looks nervous, like Ulric is calling out a bluff.{w}\nHe takes slow, intimidating steps toward Pro.{w}\nIn response, Pro starts to panic and step back."
    "他看起来很紧张，仿佛乌尔里克戳穿了一个虚张声势的谎言。{w}\n他缓慢而威压地朝普洛迈步。{w}\n作为回应，普洛开始惊慌，向后退去。"

# game/script.rpy:142599
translate chinese map218_abb5ab21:

    # voice "se/z01986.ogg"
    # char_ulric "If you're willing to kill me, then do it!\nShow me that our friendship means {i}nothing{/i} to you!"
    voice "se/z01986.ogg"
    char_ulric "如果你愿意杀了我，那就动手啊！\n让我看看我们的情谊对你来说{i}一文不值{/i}！"

# game/script.rpy:142615
translate chinese map218_26154115:

    # voice "se/z01987.ogg"
    # char_pro "But we're family..."
    voice "se/z01987.ogg"
    char_pro "可我们是家人啊……"

# game/script.rpy:142630
translate chinese map218_6f4f216a:

    # "It looks like Pro is about to cry."
    "普洛看起来快要哭了。"

# game/script.rpy:142655
translate chinese map218_979cf43b:

    # voice "se/z01988.ogg"
    # char_ulric "No, that's just an excuse {i}you{/i} made up."
    voice "se/z01988.ogg"
    char_ulric "不，那只是{i}你{/i}编出来的借口。"

# game/script.rpy:142681
translate chinese map218_fb96a086:

    # voice "se/z01989.ogg"
    # char_pro "W-why are you saying this...?"
    voice "se/z01989.ogg"
    char_pro "你、你为什么说这种话……？"

# game/script.rpy:142707
translate chinese map218_5b79ffa0:

    # voice "se/z01990.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Because I don't believe you're willing to kill me.\nBut I stand here, ready to kill {i}you{/i} at a moment's notice.\nThat need for friends and family, to be loved — that's your weakness."
    voice "se/z01990.ogg"
    char_ulric "因为我不信你下得了手杀我。\n而我站在这里，随时准备好杀了{i}你{/i}。\n对朋友和家人的那份渴求，那份被爱的渴望——那就是你的弱点。"

# game/script.rpy:142721
translate chinese map218_5b9f9947:

    # voice "se/z01991.ogg"
    # char_ulric "All I've ever wanted was to change this nation for the better.\nYou, Damek, [firstname]... You're worth less than pawns to me.\nSo I'll give you {i}one{/i} chance to kill me. Take my life, or lose {i}yours{/i}."
    voice "se/z01991.ogg"
    char_ulric "我想要的从来只有让这个国家变得更好。\n你、达梅克、[firstname]……你们对我还不如棋子有价值。\n所以我给你{i}一次{/i}杀我的机会。取走我的命，或者丢掉{i}你的{/i}。"

# game/script.rpy:142747
translate chinese map218_f2c51962:

    # voice "se/z01992.ogg"
    # char_pro "Ulric, stop...!"
    voice "se/z01992.ogg"
    char_pro "乌尔里克，住手……！"

# game/script.rpy:142762
translate chinese map218_394d7940:

    # "In response, Ulric readies his blade, and steps closer to Pro.{w}\nThere's nothing I can do anymore. I'm practically choking on my own blood.{w}\nAny weak cries I emit would be easily overtaken by the chatter of our audience."
    "作为回应，乌尔里克举起剑，朝普洛逼近。{w}\n我已经无能为力了。我几乎被自己的血呛住。{w}\n我发出的任何微弱呼喊，都会被观众的喧哗轻易盖过。"

# game/script.rpy:142764
translate chinese map218_d128fcc8:

    # "A chatter that soon turns into roaring applause."
    "那喧哗很快就变成了震耳欲聋的掌声。"

# game/script.rpy:142772
translate chinese map218_06c97300:

    # "Pro steps forward, and plunges his dagger into Ulric's gut.{w}\nA look of horror appears on his face as he does so. But he doesn't stop.{w}\nMuch like Shane did to Damek, Pro attacks Ulric, intending to kill."
    "普洛上前一步，把匕首刺进乌尔里克的腹部。{w}\n他这样做时，脸上浮现出惊恐的神情。但他没有停下。{w}\n就像肖恩对达梅克所做的那样，普洛攻击乌尔里克，意图取他性命。"

# game/script.rpy:142774
translate chinese map218_382a4330:

    # "The look of shock on Ulric's face is painful to look at.{w}\nHe was so certain that Pro lacked the resolve to harm him.{w}\nThat bet ended against his favor, and he slowly falls to the ground."
    "乌尔里克脸上震惊的表情让人不忍直视。{w}\n他那么确信普洛没有伤害他的决心。{w}\n那场赌局他输了，他缓缓倒在地上。"

# game/script.rpy:142805
translate chinese map218_87038694:

    # voice "se/z01993.ogg"
    voice "se/z01993.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:142807
translate chinese map218_9c616b05:

    # char_pro "Ulric — I'm sorry..."
    char_pro "乌尔里克——对不起……"

# game/script.rpy:142824
translate chinese map218_5e016a4b:

    # "Pro lunges forward to attack Ulric, but he quickly counters.{w}\nGripping Pro's arm, he quickly seizes the dagger for himself."
    "普洛扑上前去攻击乌尔里克，但他迅速反击。{w}\n他抓住普洛的手臂，迅速夺过匕首据为己有。"

# game/script.rpy:142849
translate chinese map218_ea376496:

    # voice "se/z01994.ogg"
    # char_ulric "So that's the way it is, huh...?\nYou're a fool, Pro. Always were."
    voice "se/z01994.ogg"
    char_ulric "原来是这样啊……？\n你是个蠢货，普洛。一直都是。"

# game/script.rpy:142864
translate chinese map218_4806270d:

    # "Throwing his own greatsword on the ground, he stares in Pro's eyes.{w}\nPro trembles in fear, realizing he played right into Ulric's hand.{w}\nHe'd dodge Pro's erratic attack, rather than launching his own."
    "他把自己的巨剑扔在地上，直视普洛的眼睛。{w}\n普洛恐惧地发抖，意识到自己正好落入了乌尔里克的圈套。{w}\n他会闪避普洛凌乱的攻击，而不是主动出击。"

# game/script.rpy:142889
translate chinese map218_3d5d6fd5:

    # voice "se/z01995.ogg"
    # char_pro "Ulric, let me go...!"
    voice "se/z01995.ogg"
    char_pro "乌尔里克，放开我……！"

# game/script.rpy:142904
translate chinese map218_bf4dc59b:

    # "As he holds Pro firmly in place, he closes his eyes."
    "他牢牢制住普洛，闭上了眼睛。"

# game/script.rpy:142929
translate chinese map218_b96f4573:

    # voice "se/z01996.ogg"
    # char_ulric "I'm sorry it had to come to this.\nBut know that your death will create a better nation.\nAnd hopefully, that will lead us all to a better world."
    voice "se/z01996.ogg"
    char_ulric "很抱歉事情走到了这一步。\n但你要知道，你的死会缔造一个更好的国家。\n但愿那会引领我们所有人走向更好的世界。"

# game/script.rpy:142947
translate chinese map218_14110bc9:

    # "He plunges the dagger into Pro's gut multiple times.{w}\nThe look on their faces reminds me of Shane and Damek.{w}\nBut something tells me that Pro wouldn't be as lucky."
    "他一次次把匕首刺进普洛的腹部。{w}\n他们脸上的神情让我想起肖恩和达梅克。{w}\n但直觉告诉我，普洛不会有那样的好运。"

# game/script.rpy:142956
translate chinese map218_98d928d8:

    # "I can hear him cry and whimper as he falls to the ground."
    "他倒在地上时，我能听见他的哭喊和呜咽。"

# game/script.rpy:142981
translate chinese map218_46c7950a:

    # voice "se/z01997.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Looks like you were finally good for {i}something{/i}."
    voice "se/z01997.ogg"
    char_ulric "看来你终于还有点{i}用处{/i}。"

# game/script.rpy:143008
translate chinese map218_9c41562e:

    # "That's the last thing I can remember.{w}\nSuccumbing to grief, and agony, I slowly pass out.{w}\nThe crowd goes wild, as the soldiers finally overcome their blindness."
    "这是我能记住的最后一件事。{w}\n在悲痛与剧痛中，我渐渐失去了意识。{w}\n士兵们终于摆脱了失明，人群疯狂起来。"

# game/script.rpy:143010
translate chinese map218_d90aede4:

    # "They're greeted to the sight of a victor, but I only see a man who lost.{w}\nAn empty victory, and one we would surely never fully recover from.{w}\nCrying at our loss, my vision fades, as I lie in a puddle of my own blood."
    "他们看到的是一位胜者，而我看到的只是一个失去了一切的人。{w}\n一场空洞的胜利，一场我们必将永远无法完全从中恢复的胜利。{w}\n为我们失去的一切哭泣着，我躺在自己的一滩血里，视线渐渐模糊。"

# game/script.rpy:143050
translate chinese map219_e06f3bb5:

    # "My eyes slowly open, and I find myself back in the coliseum private chambers.{w}\nPain radiates throughout my head, pulsing with my heartbeat. It's almost unbearable.{w}\nI notice some empty vials on the nightstand, and an odd taste in my mouth. Painkillers."
    "我缓缓睁开眼睛，发现自己回到了大竞技场的私人房间。{w}\n疼痛随着我的心跳阵阵传遍整个头部。几乎令人无法忍受。{w}\n我注意到床头柜上有些空药瓶，嘴里还有一股奇怪的味道。止痛药。"

# game/script.rpy:143052
translate chinese map219_f5ff3931:

    # "Valessa and Fortaime sit on chairs beside the bed, watching me intently."
    "瓦莱莎和福泰姆坐在床边的椅子上，专注地看着我。"

# game/script.rpy:143078
translate chinese map219_70064461:

    # voice "se/z01998.ogg"
    voice "se/z01998.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:143080
translate chinese map219_32cd6e87:

    # char_valessa "He's waking up!"
    char_valessa "他醒了！"

# game/script.rpy:143085
translate chinese map219_be64c061:

    # voice "se/z01999.ogg"
    voice "se/z01999.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:143087
translate chinese map219_f2564a6e:

    # char_valessa "She's waking up!"
    char_valessa "她醒了！"

# game/script.rpy:143103
translate chinese map219_7bc4cfd3:

    # "Fortaime immediately rises from his chair, and runs over to me.{w}\nThe worry on his face is clear, but everybody breathes a sigh of relief."
    "福泰姆立刻从椅子上起身，跑到我身边。{w}\n他脸上的担忧显而易见，但所有人都松了一口气。"

# game/script.rpy:143108
translate chinese map219_e4a0e219:

    # "That is, except for Ulric.{w}\nHe stands in the corner of the room, with his arms crossed.{w}\nAfter what he just did, I'm not surprised that he acts distant."
    "只有乌尔里克例外。{w}\n他抱着双臂站在房间的角落。{w}\n经历了刚才的事，他表现得疏离，我一点也不意外。"

# game/script.rpy:143113
translate chinese map219_8dbbcfeb:

    # "That is, except for Pro.{w}\nHe stands in the corner of the room, with his arms crossed.{w}\nAfter what he just did, I'm not surprised that he acts somewhat distant."
    "只有普洛例外。{w}\n他抱着双臂站在房间的角落。{w}\n经历了刚才的事，他表现得有些疏离，我一点也不意外。"

# game/script.rpy:143138
translate chinese map219_ee337f80:

    # voice "se/z02000.ogg"
    voice "se/z02000.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:143140
translate chinese map219_df507bbf:

    # char_fortaime "We were so worried, [firstname]!\nWe didn't know if you'd recover. Ulric did some damage.\nYour nose is broken, but if you give it time, you'll be totally fine."
    char_fortaime "我们担心死了，[firstname]！\n我们不知道你还能不能恢复。乌尔里克下手不轻。\n你的鼻子断了，但只要给它时间，你会完全好起来的。"

# game/script.rpy:143157
translate chinese map219_83a66776:

    # "Upon hearing this, Ulric rolls his eyes.{w}\nI can't believe it, but Pro was dead. Ulric killed him.\nOur alliance with Vivien was secured. But was it worth it...?"
    "听到这话，乌尔里克翻了翻白眼。{w}\n我简直不敢相信，普洛死了。是乌尔里克杀了他。\n我们与薇薇安的同盟确立了。但这值得吗……？"

# game/script.rpy:143162
translate chinese map219_3d1c2562:

    # "Upon hearing this, Pro rolls his eyes.\nI can't believe it, but Ulric was dead. Pro killed him.\nOur alliance with Draycu was secured. But was it worth it...?"
    "听到这话，普洛翻了翻白眼。\n我简直不敢相信，乌尔里克死了。是普洛杀了他。\n我们与德雷库的同盟确立了。但这值得吗……？"

# game/script.rpy:143166
translate chinese map219_f6bb1b3f:

    # "That's not a question I could possibly answer.{w}\nOn one hand, that sacrifice could ensure the safety of millions.{w}\nBut we were comrades. Bonds complicated things during a time of war."
    "这个问题我根本无法回答。{w}\n一方面，那次牺牲或许能确保数百万人的安全。{w}\n但我们是战友。在战争时期，羁绊会让事情变得复杂。"

# game/script.rpy:143168
translate chinese map219_b4fc5fb4:

    # "And there was no time to grieve, either. We needed to prepare for Balteus.{w}\nI let my legs dangle off the bed, and find their place on the warm stone floor.{w}\nI can sense the denial in the air. Nobody wanted to talk about what just happened."
    "而且也没有时间哀悼。我们得为巴尔泰乌斯做准备。{w}\n我把双腿垂下床，让它们落在温暖的石地板上。{w}\n我能感觉到空气中弥漫的逃避。没人愿意谈起刚刚发生的事。"

# game/script.rpy:143193
translate chinese map219_5999aa0e:

    # voice "se/z02001.ogg"
    # char_valessa "So what's the next step...?"
    voice "se/z02001.ogg"
    char_valessa "那下一步怎么办……？"

# game/script.rpy:143215
translate chinese map219_3f084243:

    # "Damek enters the conversation."
    "达梅克加入了谈话。"

# game/script.rpy:143240
translate chinese map219_f1128a16:

    # voice "se/z02002.ogg"
    voice "se/z02002.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:143242
translate chinese map219_a6107a92:

    # char_damek "With our alliance finalized, we need to head back to Mazeo.\nAfter some swift preparation, we'll launch the assault on Balteus.\nThis is it. We've come away from this with more soldiers than ever."
    char_damek "同盟已定，我们得回马泽奥去。\n做些快速准备之后，我们就要对巴尔泰乌斯发动进攻。\n就是现在。经历过这一切，我们带回来的士兵比以往任何时候都多。"

# game/script.rpy:143263
translate chinese map219_9ac6b601:

    # "Howl steps forward, and enters the conversation as well."
    "豪尔上前一步，也加入了谈话。"

# game/script.rpy:143288
translate chinese map219_0efed9cf:

    # voice "se/z02003.ogg"
    voice "se/z02003.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:143291
translate chinese map219_5727999f:

    # char_howl "The Triumvirate would not expect us to recover this quickly.\nBut here we stand, stronger than ever before. We can win this war.\nWe would advise not mulling over this sacrifice. It secured us victory."
    char_howl "三人执政团不会料到我们恢复得这么快。\n但我们站在这里，比以往任何时候都更强大。我们能赢下这场战争。\n我们建议不要为这次牺牲反复纠结。它为我们确保了胜利。"

# game/script.rpy:143318
translate chinese map219_31ac5a2d:

    # voice "se/z02004.ogg"
    voice "se/z02004.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:143320
translate chinese map219_5fc0b482:

    # char_damek "Yeah. Ulric might not have sided with Draycu, but he sided with {i}us{/i}.\nWe're still going to secure the future he was fighting for. Alestia's future.\nHe was a dear friend, and this loss will give me more power — more resolve."
    char_damek "是啊。乌尔里克或许没有站在德雷库那边，但他站在了{i}我们{/i}这边。\n我们仍然会去实现他为之奋斗的未来。阿莱斯蒂亚的未来。\n他是我亲爱的朋友，这份失去会给我更多力量——更多决心。"

# game/script.rpy:143345
translate chinese map219_1b8c4a38:

    # voice "se/z02005.ogg"
    # char_howl "A good outlook. Wasting time to mourn could cost us this entire war.\nWe must make our way to the docks, and meet with Draycu.\nFocus on the things that are within our control, [firstname]."
    voice "se/z02005.ogg"
    char_howl "很好的心态。把时间浪费在哀悼上，可能会让我们输掉整场战争。\n我们必须前往码头，与德雷库会合。\n专注于我们能掌控的事情，[firstname]。"

# game/script.rpy:143351
translate chinese map219_94c706f8:

    # voice "se/z02006.ogg"
    voice "se/z02006.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:143353
translate chinese map219_493a96d9:

    # char_damek "Yeah. Pro may not have sided with Vivien, but he sided with {i}us{/i}.\nWe're still going to secure the future he was fighting for. Alestia's future.\nHe was a dear friend, and this loss will give me more power — more resolve."
    char_damek "是啊。普洛或许没有站在薇薇安那边，但他站在了{i}我们{/i}这边。\n我们仍然会去实现他为之奋斗的未来。阿莱斯蒂亚的未来。\n他是我亲爱的朋友，这份失去会给我更多力量——更多决心。"

# game/script.rpy:143378
translate chinese map219_38d21cdf:

    # voice "se/z02007.ogg"
    # char_howl "A good outlook. Wasting time to mourn could cost us this entire war.\nWe must make our way to the docks, and meet with Vivien.\nFocus on the things that are within our control, [firstname]."
    voice "se/z02007.ogg"
    char_howl "很好的心态。把时间浪费在哀悼上，可能会让我们输掉整场战争。\n我们必须前往码头，与薇薇安会合。\n专注于我们能掌控的事情，[firstname]。"

# game/script.rpy:143395
translate chinese map219_420835df:

    # "I nod. A suggestion born from denial, no doubt.{w}\nHowever, despite its origins, it was a good idea.{w}\nWe still have business to take care of, no matter what."
    "我点了点头。这建议无疑源自逃避。{w}\n然而，尽管它来路如此，这也是个好主意。{w}\n无论如何，我们还有正事要处理。"

# game/script.rpy:143397
translate chinese map219_8fe0689a:

    # "I stand up, getting out of the bed, and everyone looks worried.{w}\nThey brace themselves to catch me, in case I were to fall over.{w}\nI stumble slightly, but I'm fine. I think I was ready to get things moving."
    "我起身下床，所有人都露出担忧的神情。{w}\n他们绷紧身体准备扶住我，以防我跌倒。{w}\n我微微踉跄了一下，但没事。我想我已经准备好推动事情往前走了。"

# game/script.rpy:143422
translate chinese map219_81e14481:

    # voice "se/z02008.ogg"
    # char_damek "So, should we just start walking to the docks?\nLet's make sure to stock up on lots of water.\nThe journey back isn't going to be any easier."
    voice "se/z02008.ogg"
    char_damek "那么，我们是不是该动身去码头了？\n一定要带足大量的水。\n回去的旅程不会轻松多少。"

# game/script.rpy:143449
translate chinese map219_0883c233:

    # "He gets ready to leave, but Fortaime interjects."
    "他准备离开，但福泰姆插了话。"

# game/script.rpy:143474
translate chinese map219_c8f7b270:

    # voice "se/z02009.ogg"
    voice "se/z02009.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:143476
translate chinese map219_9ff459a5:

    # char_fortaime "Whoa, hold on a second here.\nBefore we go, I have a question to ask."
    char_fortaime "等等，先别急着走。\n走之前，我有个问题要问。"

# game/script.rpy:143491
translate chinese map219_c3d0229f:

    # voice "se/z02010.ogg"
    voice "se/z02010.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:143493
translate chinese map219_89a67edb:

    # char_fortaime "Pro, why did you do this...?\nYou could've waited, and went after Vivien!"
    char_fortaime "普洛，你为什么要这么做……？\n你本可以再等等，去对付薇薇安的！"

# game/script.rpy:143507
translate chinese map219_aed305ac:

    # "Everyone looks shocked, but I know it's something we're all thinking.{w}\nWithout a single word, Pro shakes his head, and walks out of the room."
    "所有人都显得震惊，但我知道这是大家心里都在想的。{w}\n普洛一言不发，摇了摇头，走出了房间。"

# game/script.rpy:143532
translate chinese map219_bba9595e:

    # voice "se/z02011.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "Hey, I asked you a question, you coward!"
    voice "se/z02011.ogg"
    char_fortaime "喂，我问你话呢，你这个懦夫！"

# game/script.rpy:143538
translate chinese map219_e1bcffdb:

    # "He looks over at Ulric, who exchanges an awkward glance."
    "他看向乌尔里克，后者与他交换了一个尴尬的眼神。"

# game/script.rpy:143541
translate chinese map219_e0023a03:

    # voice "se/z02011b.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "Ulric, why did you do this?\nYou could've waited, and went after Draycu!"
    voice "se/z02011b.ogg"
    char_fortaime "乌尔里克，你为什么要这么做？\n你本可以再等等，去对付德雷库的！"

# game/script.rpy:143556
translate chinese map219_5ce1d808:

    # "Everyone looks shocked, but I know it's something we're all thinking.{w}\nWithout a single word, Ulric shakes his head, and walks out of the room."
    "所有人都显得震惊，但我知道这是大家心里都在想的。{w}\n乌尔里克一言不发，摇了摇头，走出了房间。"

# game/script.rpy:143581
translate chinese map219_45e16bf9:

    # voice "se/z02012.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "Hey, I asked you a question, you coward...!"
    voice "se/z02012.ogg"
    char_fortaime "喂，我问你话呢，你这个懦夫……！"

# game/script.rpy:143598
translate chinese map219_462838fa:

    # "It's no use. He's already long gone.{w}\nLikely to the docks, as I know he wouldn't abandon us.{w}\nAs bad as his actions were, he still seems to serve our cause."
    "没用。他早就走远了。{w}\n大概是去码头了，因为我知道他不会抛下我们。{w}\n无论他的行为有多糟，他似乎仍在为我们的目标出力。"

# game/script.rpy:143623
translate chinese map219_ad5fdbef:

    # voice "se/z02013.ogg"
    voice "se/z02013.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:143625
translate chinese map219_c3b4c215:

    # char_valessa "Fortaime..."
    char_valessa "福泰姆……"

# game/script.rpy:143650
translate chinese map219_ba032846:

    # voice "se/z02014.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "I know we have an alliance or whatever, but who cares!?\nWe lost one of our friends. Why is nobody even sad...?"
    voice "se/z02014.ogg"
    char_fortaime "我知道我们有什么同盟之类的，但那又怎样！？\n我们失去了一个朋友。为什么连一个伤心的人都没有……？"

# game/script.rpy:143676
translate chinese map219_ecde160b:

    # voice "se/z02014b.ogg"
    # char_valessa "We'll have plenty of time to grieve after this war is over.\nWe've lost plenty, and I'm sure we'll be losing even more.\nBut if we give up and mope around? We'll lose {i}everything{/i}."
    voice "se/z02014b.ogg"
    char_valessa "这场战争结束后，我们有的是时间哀悼。\n我们已经失去了很多，我相信我们还会失去更多。\n但如果我们就此放弃、垂头丧气？我们就会失去{i}一切{/i}。"

# game/script.rpy:143680
translate chinese map219_f3b6aeef:

    # voice "se/z02015.ogg"
    # char_valessa "We're not forgetting about him, Fortaime.\nWe just have more important things to focus on.\nLet's get to the docks. We can talk more on the trip home."
    voice "se/z02015.ogg"
    char_valessa "我们没有忘记他，福泰姆。\n只是我们有更重要的事要专注。\n去码头吧。回程的路上我们可以多聊聊。"

# game/script.rpy:143706
translate chinese map219_530b107f:

    # voice "se/z02016.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "That's part of the problem Valessa. I don't even know what home {i}is{/i} anymore.\nIt was Valinorth, and then Mazeo. But everything around us is getting destroyed!\nThen I thought home was being with our friends. But now {i}they're{/i} dying, Valessa..."
    voice "se/z02016.ogg"
    char_fortaime "这正是问题的一部分，瓦莱莎。我甚至不知道家{i}是{/i}什么了。\n它曾是瓦利诺斯，然后是马泽奥。可我们周围的一切都在被摧毁！\n后来我以为家就是和朋友们在一起。但如今{i}他们{/i}也在死去，瓦莱莎……"

# game/script.rpy:143721
translate chinese map219_5cb0aaaf:

    # "Nobody knows how to respond to Fortaime's words.{w}\nAn awkward silence fills the room, but he gets the idea."
    "没人知道该如何回应福泰姆的话。{w}\n房间里充满尴尬的沉默，但他明白了。"

# game/script.rpy:143746
translate chinese map219_e6e56b4d:

    # voice "se/z02017.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "Fine. Forget I even said anything.\nBut we were betrayed, plain and simple, by one of our own.\nIt may have gotten us an alliance, but it's still a betrayal."
    voice "se/z02017.ogg"
    char_fortaime "算了。就当我什么都没说过。\n但我们被背叛了，就这么简单，被我们自己人背叛了。\n它或许为我们换来了一个同盟，但这终究是背叛。"

# game/script.rpy:143750
translate chinese map219_3fab8ddb:

    # voice "se/z02018.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "And in my books, people like that deserve to be punished.\nSo you can push this aside, or whatever, but I {i}won't{/i}.\nThis is a crime that needs to be answered for."
    voice "se/z02018.ogg"
    char_fortaime "而在我看来，这种人活该受到惩罚。\n所以你们大可以把这事抛到一边，随便怎样，但我{i}不会{/i}。\n这是必须被清算的罪行。"

# game/script.rpy:143777
translate chinese map219_c11cf844:

    # "After saying that, he storms out of the room.{w}\nI suppose he was right, but it's really not that simple.{w}\nThere's no point in arguing, however, so we all start to leave."
    "说完，他怒气冲冲地走出了房间。{w}\n我想他是对的，但事情真的没那么简单。{w}\n不过争论也没意义，于是我们都开始往外走。"

# game/script.rpy:143802
translate chinese map219_6a853244:

    # voice "se/z02019.ogg"
    voice "se/z02019.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:143804
translate chinese map219_82f98198:

    # char_damek "Well, I guess maybe venting like that could help.\nLet's just get it out of the way while we're walking, alright?\nEvery moment we waste, makes our enemy more prepared."
    char_damek "嗯，我想那样发泄一下也许会有帮助。\n我们就边走边把话说开，好吗？\n我们浪费的每一刻，都会让敌人准备得更充分。"

# game/script.rpy:143830
translate chinese map219_93876258:

    # "Everybody seems to agree, and we all shuffle out of the room.{w}\nAnd so begins the long and arduous journey back to the docks.{w}\nHowever, instead of hope, this trek would be filled with a feeling of despair."
    "大家似乎都同意了，我们拖着步子走出房间。{w}\n就这样，返回码头的漫长而艰辛的旅程开始了。{w}\n然而，这段旅程没有希望，只有绝望的气息。"

# game/script.rpy:143867
translate chinese map220_e5dca10d:

    # "Our entire party remains in silence, until we arrive at the oasis.{w}\nHaving gone through all of our water, we needed to fill up immediately.{w}\nWe're all sweating, clearly exerted by our journey through the desert."
    "我们整支队伍一路沉默，直到抵达绿洲。{w}\n水都用完了，我们必须立刻补充。{w}\n我们个个汗流浃背，显然被穿越沙漠的旅途耗尽了力气。"

# game/script.rpy:143892
translate chinese map220_2c5a0eec:

    # voice "se/z02020.ogg"
    voice "se/z02020.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:143894
translate chinese map220_2ebeec6b:

    # char_damek "Well, it's time for a brief break.\nLet's get some water, and then head to the docks.\nIf I remember correctly, this means we're halfway there."
    char_damek "嗯，该短暂休息一下了。\n弄点水喝，然后继续去码头。\n要是我没记错，这意味着我们走了一半了。"

# game/script.rpy:143915
translate chinese map220_b37e9fe4:

    # "We all nod, and start filling up our canteens with water.{w}\nBut while I do, I pay attention to what's going on around me."
    "我们都点了点头，开始往水壶里灌水。{w}\n但我一边灌，一边留意着周围的动静。"

# game/script.rpy:143920
translate chinese map220_9e54e842:

    # "Pro makes sure he's standing beside Fortaime while he fills up on water.{w}\nFortaime notices this, and seems visibly angry. It's totally understandable, though."
    "普洛灌水时特意站到了福泰姆身边。{w}\n福泰姆注意到这一点，显然很生气。不过完全可以理解。"

# game/script.rpy:143945
translate chinese map220_4ad75c36:

    # voice "se/z02021.ogg"
    voice "se/z02021.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:143947
translate chinese map220_4099f2d1:

    # char_fortaime "What do you want...?"
    char_fortaime "你想干什么……？"

# game/script.rpy:143972
translate chinese map220_3bd9e139:

    # voice "se/z02022.ogg"
    voice "se/z02022.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:143974
translate chinese map220_fd9819d1:

    # char_pro "Look, I just wanted to say that I'm sorry.\nYou'll understand one day. I promise."
    char_pro "听着，我只是想说声对不起。\n总有一天你会明白的。我保证。"

# game/script.rpy:143999
translate chinese map220_e8c68e72:

    # voice "se/z02023.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "Trust me, I can tell that you're {i}not{/i} sorry.\nThere was no remorse on your face when you killed him.\nAnd even now, I see no hint of sadness on your face. Forget it."
    voice "se/z02023.ogg"
    char_fortaime "相信我，我看得出你{i}根本{/i}不觉得抱歉。\n你杀他时脸上没有一丝悔意。\n就算现在，我也在你脸上看不到半点悲伤。算了吧。"

# game/script.rpy:144025
translate chinese map220_1d268f73:

    # voice "se/z02024.ogg"
    # char_pro "I'm serious, Fortaime!"
    voice "se/z02024.ogg"
    char_pro "我是认真的，福泰姆！"

# game/script.rpy:144041
translate chinese map220_8c9f5c67:

    # voice "se/z02025.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "So am I...!\nJust leave me alone, Pro.\nWe'd be better off without you."
    voice "se/z02025.ogg"
    char_fortaime "我也是……！\n别烦我了，普洛。\n没有你我们会过得更好。"

# game/script.rpy:144056
translate chinese map220_5014d629:

    # "These words seem to hit Pro like a knife to the heart.{w}\nHis eyes water up, and I can tell that he's on the verge of tears."
    "这些话仿佛一把刀插进普洛的心脏。{w}\n他眼眶湿润，我看得出他快要哭出来了。"

# game/script.rpy:144081
translate chinese map220_5aeeda8b:

    # voice "se/z02026.ogg"
    # char_pro "Fine. You win.\nBut don't say I didn't try."
    voice "se/z02026.ogg"
    char_pro "好。你赢了。\n但别说我没试过。"

# game/script.rpy:144087
translate chinese map220_5a744b04:

    # "Ulric makes sure he's standing beside Fortaime while he fills up on water.{w}\nFortaime notices this, and seems visibly angry. It's totally understandable, though."
    "乌尔里克灌水时特意站到了福泰姆身边。{w}\n福泰姆注意到这一点，显然很生气。不过完全可以理解。"

# game/script.rpy:144112
translate chinese map220_24be1bf2:

    # voice "se/z02027.ogg"
    voice "se/z02027.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:144114
translate chinese map220_4099f2d1_1:

    # char_fortaime "What do you want...?"
    char_fortaime "你想干什么……？"

# game/script.rpy:144139
translate chinese map220_8bb519d2:

    # voice "se/z02028.ogg"
    voice "se/z02028.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:144141
translate chinese map220_3795d714:

    # char_ulric "I just wanted to apologize, Fortaime.\nYou'll understand soon. I had no other choice."
    char_ulric "我只是想道个歉，福泰姆。\n你很快就会明白的。我别无选择。"

# game/script.rpy:144166
translate chinese map220_5fca8284:

    # voice "se/z02029.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "There's no way you're sorry, Ulric.\nI saw no hint of remorse on your face when you killed him.\nAnd even now that you're apologizing, you don't look sad at all!"
    voice "se/z02029.ogg"
    char_fortaime "你绝不可能觉得抱歉，乌尔里克。\n你杀他时，我在你脸上看不到一丝悔意。\n就算现在你在道歉，你也一点也不显得难过！"

# game/script.rpy:144192
translate chinese map220_b1aa1766:

    # voice "se/z02030.ogg"
    # char_ulric "That's not true.\nI'm being serious, here."
    voice "se/z02030.ogg"
    char_ulric "不是那样的。\n我是认真的。"

# game/script.rpy:144208
translate chinese map220_d7bb7193:

    # voice "se/z02031.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "Well so am I...!\nJust leave me alone, Ulric.\nWe'd all be better off without you."
    voice "se/z02031.ogg"
    char_fortaime "我也是……！\n别烦我了，乌尔里克。\n没有你我们大家都会过得更好。"

# game/script.rpy:144223
translate chinese map220_c7c0c9c4:

    # "Ulric takes a step back, hurt by Fortaime's words.{w}\nIf he wasn't sad before, then he definitely is now."
    "乌尔里克后退一步，被福泰姆的话刺伤了。{w}\n如果他之前不难过，那么现在他肯定难过了。"

# game/script.rpy:144248
translate chinese map220_4e569e45:

    # voice "se/z02032.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Fine. "
    voice "se/z02032.ogg"
    char_ulric "好吧。"

# game/script.rpy:144270
translate chinese map220_d5d3900f:

    # "He walks away from Fortaime, considering the conversation over.{w}\nAs harsh as Fortaime was, I think he's saying what's on a lot of our minds.{w}\nAlmost everybody has been treating him with disdain since the battle ended."
    "他离开福泰姆，认为谈话已经结束。{w}\n无论福泰姆说得多么刺耳，我觉得他说出了很多人心里的话。{w}\n战斗结束以来，几乎所有人都对他报以蔑视。"

# game/script.rpy:144272
translate chinese map220_05df4601:

    # "After we're all done gathering water, Fortaime approaches me.{w}\nHe looks so conflicted. After all, he's the only one being vocal about this situation.{w}\nEspecially after his outburst just now. He's starting to wonder if he's being too emotional."
    "我们打完水之后，福泰姆走过来找我。{w}\n他看起来十分纠结。毕竟，他是唯一一个对这事直言不讳的人。{w}\n尤其是刚才发泄过之后。他开始怀疑自己是不是太情绪化了。"

# game/script.rpy:144297
translate chinese map220_a6baad4a:

    # voice "se/z02033.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "Come on, [firstname].\nYou have my back in this, right?\nWhat happened was {i}way{/i} out of line."
    voice "se/z02033.ogg"
    char_fortaime "说句话啊，[firstname]。\n在这件事上你站在我这边，对吧？\n发生的事{i}实在{/i}太过分了。"

# game/script.rpy:144301
translate chinese map220_9086c822:

    # voice "se/z02034.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "I know that everybody is focusing on the war right now.\nBut I can't do that. This is just too much to take in.\nWhat should I do? Are you going to forgive this...?" nointeract
    voice "se/z02034.ogg"
    char_fortaime "我知道现在每个人都在专注于战争。\n但我做不到。这实在让人难以接受。\n我该怎么办？你会原谅这种事吗……？" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:144317
translate chinese map220_417c9b79:

    # voice "se/z02035.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "Do they really, though?\nIf The Triumvirate asked for a second chance, you'd give them one?\nI don't think that's true. It's just harder because we're all friends."
    voice "se/z02035.ogg"
    char_fortaime "真的会吗？\n如果三人执政团请求再给一次机会，你会给吗？\n我不那么认为。只是因为我们都是朋友，所以才更难办。"

# game/script.rpy:144321
translate chinese map220_fc025c17:

    # voice "se/z02036.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "But then why should friends get a free pass to commit atrocities...?\nThis whole thing is just so messed up. It doesn't make any sense.\nHe should be punished, just like any other criminal, shouldn't he?"
    voice "se/z02036.ogg"
    char_fortaime "可那样的话，朋友凭什么就能免于为暴行负责……？\n这整件事都太扭曲了。根本说不通。\n他应该受到惩罚，就像任何其他罪犯一样，不是吗？"

# game/script.rpy:144337
translate chinese map220_a4d8ca0b:

    # voice "se/z02036b.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "Good. Then that means we're on the same page.\nIt's just so hard because of how close we are."
    voice "se/z02036b.ogg"
    char_fortaime "好。那说明我们想法一致。\n只是因为我们关系如此亲近，所以才这么难。"

# game/script.rpy:144341
translate chinese map220_049bae1e:

    # voice "se/z02037.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "But why should a friend get a free pass to commit murder?\nEveryone else seems so lenient. Are they just going to forgive this?\nHe should be punished, just like any other criminal, shouldn't he?"
    voice "se/z02037.ogg"
    char_fortaime "但朋友凭什么就能免于为谋杀负责？\n其他人似乎都太宽容了。他们就要这样原谅这件事吗？\n他应该受到惩罚，就像任何其他罪犯一样，不是吗？"

# game/script.rpy:144357
translate chinese map220_62b961df:

    # voice "se/z02038.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "Maybe I'm just processing this faster than anybody else.\nI know it's hard, because of how close we all are.\nBut a crime is a crime. Plain and simple."
    voice "se/z02038.ogg"
    char_fortaime "也许只是我比其他人消化的速度快一些。\n我知道这很难，因为我们关系那么亲近。\n但罪行就是罪行。就这么简单。"

# game/script.rpy:144361
translate chinese map220_a44ab306:

    # voice "se/z02039.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "Friends shouldn't get a free pass to commit atrocities.\nI don't care if other people forgive him. I never could.\nHe needs to be punished. Like any other criminal."
    voice "se/z02039.ogg"
    char_fortaime "朋友不该免于为暴行负责。\n我不在乎别人是否原谅他。我永远都做不到。\n他必须受到惩罚。就像任何其他罪犯一样。"

# game/script.rpy:144378
translate chinese map220_7a7a4341:

    # "I shrug, unsure of how to respond to that last part.{w}\nHe did kill a comrade, but it secured us a powerful alliance.{w}\nWe have to wonder if such actions cancel each other out."
    "我耸了耸肩，不知该如何回应最后那部分。{w}\n他确实杀了一个战友，但这为我们确保了一个强大的同盟。{w}\n我们不得不去想，这样的行为是否能相互抵消。"

# game/script.rpy:144380
translate chinese map220_4d284c81:

    # "One life gave us all the power we'd need to win this war.{w}\nBut at the same time, is it right to reduce a life to something like that?{w}\nA bargaining chip on some sort of table containing all of our lives?"
    "一条命给了我们赢得这场战争所需的全部力量。{w}\n但与此同时，把一条生命简化成这样的东西，对吗？{w}\n像是一张押上我们所有人性命的赌桌上的筹码？"

# game/script.rpy:144382
translate chinese map220_a0f002bd:

    # "This is something we'd have to talk about as an entire group.{w}\nI may be in charge, but this affected everybody — not just me.{w}\nThat's what I let Fortaime know. It's the only right way to handle this."
    "这件事得由我们所有人一起来谈。{w}\n我或许是负责人，但这件事影响的是所有人——不只是我。{w}\n这就是我让福泰姆明白的。这是处理此事的唯一正确方式。"

# game/script.rpy:144407
translate chinese map220_3b76ef43:

    # voice "se/z02040.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "Alright. But just take my advice.\nDon't do it while everybody is still in shock.\nLet them process these events, and form an opinion."
    voice "se/z02040.ogg"
    char_fortaime "好吧。但听我一句劝。\n别在大家还震惊的时候谈。\n让他们消化这些事，形成自己的想法。"

# game/script.rpy:144429
translate chinese map220_a819a370:

    # "I nod, and it seems like we're all ready to continue.{w}\nSince we're halfway to the docks, we'd have a long time to think.{w}\nBut something tells me no time in the world would let us sort this out."
    "我点了点头，看来我们都准备好继续赶路了。{w}\n既然我们离码头还有一半路程，会有很长时间去思考。{w}\n但直觉告诉我，无论多久，都无法让我们理清这件事。"

# game/script.rpy:144466
translate chinese map221_ad561bf7:

    # "My head throbs, as the painkillers started to wear off around the oasis.{w}\nMy coherence fades in and out, though my body still moves. I'm barely conscious.{w}\nBefore I know it, we're already back at the docks. However, I didn't miss anything of note."
    "头痛阵阵袭来，止痛药在绿洲附近就开始失效了。{w}\n我的意识时断时续，尽管身体还在移动。我几乎失去了知觉。{w}\n等我回过神来，我们已经回到了码头。不过，我没漏掉任何重要的事。"

# game/script.rpy:144468
translate chinese map221_1514daff:

    # "What surely took a portion of the entire day, seemed like mere moments to me.{w}\nOur group scatters out, but not too far. We're all within earshot of each other.{w}\nI notice our new ally is waiting by the ship. Damek quickly approaches him."
    "那肯定花了将近一天中的大半天，对我来说却仿佛只是片刻。{w}\n我们这群人散开了，但没走远。大家都互相能听见。{w}\n我注意到我们的新盟友在船边等着。达梅克迅速朝他走去。"

# game/script.rpy:144494
translate chinese map221_4b07742e:

    # voice "se/z02041.ogg"
    voice "se/z02041.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:144496
translate chinese map221_837326a3:

    # char_damek "Draycu, there you are!\nHappy that you're still in power, I assume?"
    char_damek "德雷库，你在这儿！\n我猜，你还掌权着，挺高兴的吧？"

# game/script.rpy:144521
translate chinese map221_6d2ac5fb:

    # voice "se/z02042.ogg"
    voice "se/z02042.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:144527
translate chinese map221_b9895240:

    # char_jit_map221_1_0_29 "It went exactly as expected.\nWe're ready to aid your attack on Balteus.\nI'll personally lead my army in the name of your Monarch."
    char_jit_map221_1_0_29 "一切都如预期。\n我们已准备好协助你们进攻巴尔泰乌斯。\n我会以你们君主的名义，亲自率领我的军队。"

# game/script.rpy:144552
translate chinese map221_92ce58f9:

    # voice "se/z02043.ogg"
    # char_damek "Wait, you're leaving Alarinthia...?\nWill everything be fine in your absence?"
    voice "se/z02043.ogg"
    char_damek "等等，你要离开阿拉林西亚……？\n你不在，一切都没问题吗？"

# game/script.rpy:144578
translate chinese map221_be3e2598:

    # voice "se/z02044.ogg"
    # char_jit_map221_1_0_29 "Yeah, it'll be fine. I wouldn't worry about it.\nVivien's defeat has made him hide his face in shame.\nI don't think anybody else will challenge the throne anytime soon."
    voice "se/z02044.ogg"
    char_jit_map221_1_0_29 "嗯，会没事的。我不担心。\n薇薇安战败后羞愧得躲了起来。\n我想短期内不会再有人挑战王位了。"

# game/script.rpy:144582
translate chinese map221_1cafc1ad:

    # voice "se/z02045.ogg"
    # char_jit_map221_1_0_29 "At least, not in the next couple days.\nThe attack {i}is{/i} happening soon, isn't it?"
    voice "se/z02045.ogg"
    char_jit_map221_1_0_29 "至少接下来几天不会。\n进攻{i}很快{/i}就要开始，不是吗？"

# game/script.rpy:144608
translate chinese map221_30506f8b:

    # voice "se/z02046.ogg"
    # char_damek "Yeah. Within a day or two.\nAfter we get back to Mazeo, we need to wrap things up.\nWhen we set sail to Balteus, we might not be returning."
    voice "se/z02046.ogg"
    char_damek "是啊。一两天之内。\n回到马泽奥之后，我们得把事情收尾。\n等我们启航前往巴尔泰乌斯，也许就回不来了。"

# game/script.rpy:144634
translate chinese map221_42dd2b53:

    # voice "se/z02047.ogg"
    # char_jit_map221_1_0_29 "Have a little optimism, Damek.\nIf anybody can slay a team of Gods, it's us."
    voice "se/z02047.ogg"
    char_jit_map221_1_0_29 "乐观一点，达梅克。\n要说有谁能杀死一队神明，那就是我们。"

# game/script.rpy:144661
translate chinese map221_e10797c9:

    # voice "se/z02048.ogg"
    voice "se/z02048.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:144663
translate chinese map221_4e8a4284:

    # char_damek "Vivien, there you are!\nHow does it feel to be the one in power?"
    char_damek "薇薇安，你在这儿！\n掌权的滋味如何？"

# game/script.rpy:144688
translate chinese map221_3cec2b9c:

    # voice "se/z02049.ogg"
    voice "se/z02049.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:144694
translate chinese map221_2a2f6de0:

    # char_jit_map221_1_0_125 "It's hard to believe, actually.\nI expect that it'll set in after the upcoming battle.\nI'm a man of my word, so I need to help you out first."
    char_jit_map221_1_0_125 "老实说，还很难相信。\n我想等接下来的战斗结束后才会真切起来。\n我是个言出必行的人，所以我得先帮你们。"

# game/script.rpy:144719
translate chinese map221_d4298740:

    # voice "se/z02050.ogg"
    # char_damek "Wait — don't tell me you're coming with us?\nDon't you have things to take care of over here?"
    voice "se/z02050.ogg"
    char_damek "等等——别告诉我你要跟我们一起去？\n你这里没有事情要处理吗？"

# game/script.rpy:144745
translate chinese map221_df423be4:

    # voice "se/z02051.ogg"
    # char_jit_map221_1_0_125 "It's nothing that can't wait a few days.\nThe attack is happening pretty soon, right?\nI can leave things in the hands of a few friends for now."
    voice "se/z02051.ogg"
    char_jit_map221_1_0_125 "都是些可以等几天的事。\n进攻很快就要开始了，对吧？\n眼下我可以把事情交给几个朋友打理。"

# game/script.rpy:144771
translate chinese map221_91354de2:

    # voice "se/z02052.ogg"
    # char_damek "Fair enough; and yeah, you're right.\nWe plan to launch the attack within a day or two.\nOnce we get to Mazeo, we need to take care of business."
    voice "se/z02052.ogg"
    char_damek "有道理；是啊，你说得对。\n我们计划一两天内发动进攻。\n一到马泽奥，我们就得处理正事。"

# game/script.rpy:144775
translate chinese map221_0cc2f3ec:

    # voice "se/z02053.ogg"
    # char_damek "I mean, final goodbyes, and stuff like that.\nAfter we leave for Balteus, we might never return.\nWe need to make sure that we leave with no regrets."
    voice "se/z02053.ogg"
    char_damek "我是说，最后的告别之类的。\n我们前往巴尔泰乌斯之后，也许就再也回不来了。\n我们必须确保离开时没有遗憾。"

# game/script.rpy:144801
translate chinese map221_56cbab39:

    # voice "se/z02054.ogg"
    # char_jit_map221_1_0_125 "Have a little faith, Damek.\nIf anybody can take down those Gods — it's us.\nWe just overthrew an entire nation, I think that's a good sign."
    voice "se/z02054.ogg"
    char_jit_map221_1_0_125 "有点信心，达梅克。\n要说有谁能扳倒那些神明——那就是我们。\n我们刚刚推翻了一整个国家，我觉得这是个好兆头。"

# game/script.rpy:144831
translate chinese map221_3c0e2975:

    # "At that moment, we're interrupted by the last person I ever thought I'd see."
    "就在那时，我们被一个我做梦都没想到会见到的人打断了。"

# game/script.rpy:144834
translate chinese map221_25ceca88:

    # voice "se/z02055.ogg"
    # char_jit_map042_1_0_288 "Gods? Don't make me laugh.\nYou know just as well as I do that they're weak like us.\nThe true power rests with the one who can wield that blade."
    voice "se/z02055.ogg"
    char_jit_map042_1_0_288 "神明？别逗我笑了。\n你和我一样清楚，他们和我们一样弱小。\n真正的力量属于那个能驾驭那把剑的人。"

# game/script.rpy:144837
translate chinese map221_6c959e0e:

    # "We all stop what we're doing, and look toward the source of the noise."
    "我们都停下了手上的事，朝声音的来源望去。"

# game/script.rpy:144865
translate chinese map221_11edc0c7:

    # voice "se/z02056.ogg"
    voice "se/z02056.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:144867
translate chinese map221_06e518d0:

    # char_sovy "Terribly sorry to intrude, but I need to have a word with [firstname].\nIf you'd be so kind as to give us some privacy, I'd be forever grateful."
    char_sovy "非常抱歉打扰，但我需要和[firstname]谈一谈。\n如果你们行个方便，给我们一点私人空间，我将感激不尽。"

# game/script.rpy:144881
translate chinese map221_543d42d7:

    # "It's Sovy...!{w} \nI immediately assume a battle stance.{w}\nFright quickly overtakes the air. This was bad...!"
    "是索维……！{w}\n我立刻摆出战斗姿态。{w}\n恐惧迅速弥漫开来。这可不妙……！"

# game/script.rpy:144883
translate chinese map221_82fc0601:

    # "I'm not sure who remembers him from the Rebel HQ.{w}\nAnd I'm not sure if all of my comrades have seen him before.{w}\nBut they heed my warning, and assume stances similar to mine."
    "我不确定谁还记得反抗军总部里的他。{w}\n也不确定我的战友们是否都见过他。{w}\n但他们听从了我的警示，摆出了与我相似的姿态。"

# game/script.rpy:144908
translate chinese map221_fea63de8:

    # voice "se/z02057.ogg"
    # char_sovy "A hostile greeting. I don't blame you.\nYou're only treating me the way I treated you."
    voice "se/z02057.ogg"
    char_sovy "充满敌意的问候。我不怪你们。\n你们不过是用我对待你们的方式对待我罢了。"

# game/script.rpy:144923
translate chinese map221_0e918992:

    # "He takes a few steps forward, and I do so as well.{w}\nI notice that he looks at Damek. A man that he thought was dead.{w}\nA hint of emotion shows on his otherwise cold face as he does this."
    "他向前走了几步，我也一样。{w}\n我注意到他看向达梅克。一个他以为已经死了的人。{w}\n就在那时，他向来冰冷的脸上浮现出一丝情绪。"

# game/script.rpy:144948
translate chinese map221_bcb78fd6:

    # voice "se/z02058.ogg"
    # char_sovy "So after this hostility, I expect mercy.\nRemember — if it weren't for me, you'd be dead."
    voice "se/z02058.ogg"
    char_sovy "那么在承受了这番敌意之后，我期待得到宽恕。\n记住——要不是我，你们早就死了。"

# game/script.rpy:144963
translate chinese map221_d84e735f:

    # "He immediately gets on his knees and holds out his wrists."
    "他立刻跪了下来，伸出双腕。"

# game/script.rpy:144978
translate chinese map221_8d4129da:

    # voice "se/z02059.ogg"
    # char_sovy "I submit to your authority. \nRestrain me any way you wish — I only want to talk.\nWhen you get back to Mazeo, we can go our separate ways."
    voice "se/z02059.ogg"
    char_sovy "我服从你们的权威。\n你们想怎么捆我都行——我只想谈谈。\n等你们回到马泽奥，我们就各走各的。"

# game/script.rpy:144993
translate chinese map221_040f27fa:

    # "I'm shocked by his actions. I expected another fight to ensue.{w}\nI look around at my comrades, unsure of what to do in this situation.{w}\nIt was clearly a trap, right? What business would he have with us...?"
    "他的举动让我震惊。我本以为又会打起来。{w}\n我环顾我的战友们，不知这种情况该如何是好。{w}\n这显然是陷阱，对吧？他找我们能有什么事……？"

# game/script.rpy:145019
translate chinese map221_e3c0c810:

    # voice "se/z02060.ogg"
    voice "se/z02060.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:145021
translate chinese map221_b1d37f5d:

    # char_pro "Draycu. Restrain this man immediately.\nTake him to the brig, and make sure he can't escape.\nDo it before he tries to start anything. He's unarmed."
    char_pro "德雷库。立刻把这个人控制起来。\n把他押到禁闭室，确保他逃不掉。\n在他搞出什么名堂之前就动手。他没带武器。"

# game/script.rpy:145035
translate chinese map221_3c1a54be:

    # "Draycu does as instructed, as Pro takes matters into his own hands.{w}\nHe's been doing that a lot lately. Acting without any of our input.{w}\nBut it's probably for the best. Sovy is alone, and seems harmless."
    "德雷库照办了，普洛自己拿起了主意。{w}\n他最近屡屡如此。不问我们的意见就行动。{w}\n但这大概是最好的做法。索维孤身一人，看起来毫无威胁。"

# game/script.rpy:145037
translate chinese map221_37e91985:

    # "Last time he only did damage because of The Honor Guard.{w}\nThat, along with his Apprentice and Shane, was all he needed.{w}\nRight now, he had none of that. For once, he seemed vulnerable."
    "上次他能造成破坏，全靠荣誉卫队。{w}\n有荣誉卫队，再加上他的学徒和肖恩，就是他所需的全部。{w}\n而现在，这些他一样都没有。头一次，他显得脆弱。"

# game/script.rpy:145063
translate chinese map221_5a96da91:

    # voice "se/z02061.ogg"
    voice "se/z02061.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:145065
translate chinese map221_6587a889:

    # char_ulric "Vivien. Restrain this man immediately.\nTake him to the brig, and make sure he can't escape.\nHe's unarmed, and alone — so do it before he starts anything."
    char_ulric "薇薇安。立刻把这个人控制起来。\n把他押到禁闭室，确保他逃不掉。\n他没带武器，还孤身一人——趁他还没搞出什么名堂就动手。"

# game/script.rpy:145079
translate chinese map221_5cce24d5:

    # "Vivien does as instructed, as Ulric takes matters into his own hands.{w}\nIt was probably for the best. He seemed to know Sovy better than any of us.{w}\nSovy had no allies present, and no Honor Guard soldiers. Right now, he was weak."
    "薇薇安照办了，乌尔里克自己拿起了主意。{w}\n这大概是最好的做法。他似乎比我们任何人都更了解索维。{w}\n索维身边没有盟友，也没有荣誉卫队的士兵。此时此刻，他很虚弱。"

# game/script.rpy:145105
translate chinese map221_d8f9232a:

    # voice "se/z02062.ogg"
    voice "se/z02062.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:145107
translate chinese map221_c51f52b7:

    # char_sovy "Once we set sail, come and talk to me, [firstname].\nI have some information that you might want to hear.\nIncluding the true identity of the mole among your forces."
    char_sovy "等我们启航之后，来找我谈谈，[firstname]。\n我有一些你或许想听的消息。\n其中还包括你们队伍里那个内奸的真实身份。"

# game/script.rpy:145136
translate chinese map221_29bcc471:

    # "He's dragged away with what I interpret as a sinister smirk.{w}\nIt's likely that he couldn't be trusted. That's obvious psychological warfare.{w}\nTurn us against our own friends and we destroy each other from the inside."
    "他被拖走了，脸上挂着我理解为阴险的笑容。{w}\n他很可能不可信。这是显而易见的心理战。{w}\n让我们敌视自己的朋友，我们就会从内部自相残杀。"

# game/script.rpy:145138
translate chinese map221_8dede606:

    # "An obvious attempt to sabotage our impending attack on Balteus.{w}\nBut, if we restrained him, and kept watch on him, we had a valuable asset.{w}\nThe Triumvirate's own Grand Inquisitor. That would make a {i}fine{/i} bargaining chip."
    "显然是企图破坏我们即将对巴尔泰乌斯发动的进攻。{w}\n但如果我们控制住他，时刻盯着他，我们就握有一件宝贵的资产。{w}\n三人执政团自己的大审判官。那可是一个{i}绝佳{/i}的筹码。"

# game/script.rpy:145167
translate chinese map221_55827d8b:

    # voice "se/z02063.ogg"
    voice "se/z02063.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:145169
translate chinese map221_2654625f:

    # char_pro "Sorry about that, but we need to get things moving.\nIf we stay here any longer, we might get found out.\nAnd Sovy {i}definitely{/i} can't hear what I need to say."
    char_pro "抱歉，但我们得动身了。\n如果我们在这里再待下去，可能会被发现。\n而且索维{i}绝对{/i}不能听到我要说的话。"

# game/script.rpy:145183
translate chinese map221_ae0bec63:

    # "Found out...? What does he mean?{w}\nHe looks around, worried, which confuses me."
    "被发现……？他是什么意思？{w}\n他担忧地环顾四周，让我更加困惑。"

# game/script.rpy:145208
translate chinese map221_1ded818a:

    # voice "se/z02064.ogg"
    # char_pro "Everybody, come here.\nI've been keeping a secret from all of you.\nWell, not just me — but hold on, you'll see."
    voice "se/z02064.ogg"
    char_pro "大家，过来。\n我一直对你们所有人瞒着一个秘密。\n嗯，不只是我——但别急，你们会明白的。"

# game/script.rpy:145230
translate chinese map221_fcc02d99:

    # "We look around, clueless as to what he's talking about.{w}\nBut following his instruction, we all gather around him.{w}\nHe tilts his head to the side, looking behind one of the nearby trees."
    "我们面面相觑，完全不明白他在说什么。{w}\n但我们照他的话做，都围到了他身边。{w}\n他把头偏向一侧，望向附近的一棵树后面。"

# game/script.rpy:145256
translate chinese map221_31bf2fe3:

    # voice "se/z02065.ogg"
    voice "se/z02065.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:145258
translate chinese map221_401fa053:

    # char_ulric "Sorry about that, but we need to get out of here, and fast.\nIf we stay in Alarinthia any longer, they might figure us out.\nAnd Sovy {i}definitely{/i} can't hear what I'm about to tell you."
    char_ulric "抱歉，但我们得离开这里，而且要快。\n如果我们在阿拉林西亚再待下去，他们可能会看穿我们。\n而且索维{i}绝对{/i}不能听到我即将告诉你们的事。"

# game/script.rpy:145272
translate chinese map221_10f348da:

    # "Figure us out...? What does he mean?{w}\nThere's worry, and paranoia on Ulric's face."
    "看穿我们……？他是什么意思？{w}\n乌尔里克脸上带着担忧和偏执。"

# game/script.rpy:145297
translate chinese map221_2d3c80b1:

    # voice "se/z02066.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Come closer everybody.\nI'm afraid that I've been keeping a secret from all of you.\nBut it's not just me. Hold on a second, you'll see what I mean."
    voice "se/z02066.ogg"
    char_ulric "大家靠近点。\n恐怕我一直对你们所有人瞒着一个秘密。\n但不只是我。等一下，你们就明白我的意思了。"

# game/script.rpy:145319
translate chinese map221_27082bb8:

    # "We look around, clueless as to what he's talking about.{w}\nBut following his instruction, we all inch our way toward him.{w}\nHe tilts his head to the side, looking behind one of the nearby trees."
    "我们面面相觑，完全不明白他在说什么。{w}\n但我们照他的话做，都一点点朝他挪近。{w}\n他把头偏向一侧，望向附近的一棵树后面。"

# game/script.rpy:145342
translate chinese map222_96feff86:

    # "And what happens next, leaves all of us speechless, in utter shock."
    "而接下来发生的事，让我们所有人都目瞪口呆，震惊得说不出话。"

# game/script.rpy:145368
translate chinese map222_755bf0fb:

    # voice "se/z02067.ogg"
    voice "se/z02067.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:145370
translate chinese map222_8695496e:

    # char_pro "Hey, you can come out now..."
    char_pro "嘿，你可以出来了……"

# game/script.rpy:145384
translate chinese map222_12567531:

    # "And then, from behind a group of trees, steps out a man.{w}\nThey have a cloak covering their body, which they slowly drop to the ground."
    "接着，从一丛树木后面，走出一个人。{w}\n那人身上披着斗篷，缓缓将它褪下，落到地上。"

# game/script.rpy:145411
translate chinese map222_2ab1361f:

    # voice "se/z02068.ogg"
    voice "se/z02068.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:145413
translate chinese map222_eda7a44e:

    # char_ulric "It's about time.\nHiding in fright isn't really my style.\nSorry to worry you, everybody. I really am."
    char_ulric "也该出来了。\n因为害怕而躲躲藏藏可不是我的风格。\n抱歉让各位担心了。真的。"

# game/script.rpy:145427
translate chinese map222_b006aaec:

    # "Pro and Ulric high five, and then give each other a tight embrace."
    "普洛和乌尔里克击了个掌，然后紧紧拥抱了彼此。"

# game/script.rpy:145452
translate chinese map222_672f3e26:

    # voice "se/z02069.ogg"
    # char_pro "Yeah, putting on this act was getting hard!\nLet's get on that ship, and tell everybody our secret."
    voice "se/z02069.ogg"
    char_pro "是啊，演这出戏越来越难了！\n我们上船吧，把我们的秘密告诉大家。"

# game/script.rpy:145467
translate chinese map222_835ca158:

    # "Before Ulric can even act, he's bombarded with hugs from our comrades.{w}\nThe man they thought was killed in cold blood, now stands before them.{w}\nI'm shocked, confused, but also a little relieved. What's going on, here...?"
    "乌尔里克还没反应过来，就被战友们的拥抱包围了。{w}\n那个他们以为被冷血杀害的人，此刻就站在他们面前。{w}\n我震惊、困惑，但也稍微松了口气。这到底是怎么回事……？"

# game/script.rpy:145492
translate chinese map222_f1e177ea:

    # voice "se/z02070.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Hey now, cut that out.\nIt's nice to know that you missed me, at least.\nBut we should get going before they know I'm still alive."
    voice "se/z02070.ogg"
    char_ulric "嘿，别这样。\n至少知道你们想我了，这很好。\n但我们得在他们知道我还没死之前赶紧走。"

# game/script.rpy:145518
translate chinese map222_f4da3938:

    # voice "se/z02071.ogg"
    # char_pro "Yeah, if they find out we cheated, they'll invalidate the victory.\nI know you want an explanation, so let's talk about it on the ship.\nWe should set sail right away, so nobody catches on to us."
    voice "se/z02071.ogg"
    char_pro "是啊，要是他们发现我们作弊，就会让这场胜利作废。\n我知道你们想要个解释，那我们就上船再说。\n我们得立刻启航，别让任何人察觉。"

# game/script.rpy:145533
translate chinese map222_afbeea6f:

    # voice "se/z02071b.ogg"
    voice "se/z02071b.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:145535
translate chinese map222_4d90f45f:

    # char_ulric "You can come out now."
    char_ulric "你可以出来了。"

# game/script.rpy:145549
translate chinese map222_12567531_1:

    # "And then, from behind a group of trees, steps out a man.{w}\nThey have a cloak covering their body, which they slowly drop to the ground."
    "接着，从一丛树木后面，走出一个人。{w}\n那人身上披着斗篷，缓缓将它褪下，落到地上。"

# game/script.rpy:145576
translate chinese map222_b6511fea:

    # voice "se/z02072.ogg"
    voice "se/z02072.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:145578
translate chinese map222_909f53b9:

    # char_pro "Oh man, it's about time.\nThere's nothing I hate more than hiding.\nSorry for worrying all of you, but we had to do it."
    char_pro "哎，也该出来了。\n我最讨厌的就是躲藏。\n抱歉让你们所有人都担心了，但我们不得不这么做。"

# game/script.rpy:145592
translate chinese map222_b006aaec_1:

    # "Pro and Ulric high five, and then give each other a tight embrace."
    "普洛和乌尔里克击了个掌，然后紧紧拥抱了彼此。"

# game/script.rpy:145617
translate chinese map222_974d0dc7:

    # voice "se/z02073.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Yeah, I'm not the best actor, you know.\nI think people were starting to see through our lies."
    voice "se/z02073.ogg"
    char_ulric "是啊，你知道的，我可不是什么好演员。\n我觉得人们开始看穿我们的谎言了。"

# game/script.rpy:145632
translate chinese map222_3ae7bb5b:

    # "Before Pro can do anything else, he's bombarded with hugs from our comrades.{w}\nThe man they thought was killed in cold blood, now stands before them.{w}\nI'm shocked, confused, but also a little relieved. What was going on, here?"
    "普洛还没来得及做别的，就被战友们的拥抱包围了。{w}\n那个他们以为被冷血杀害的人，此刻就站在他们面前。{w}\n我震惊、困惑，但也稍微松了口气。这到底是怎么回事？"

# game/script.rpy:145657
translate chinese map222_96497c03:

    # voice "se/z02074.ogg"
    # char_pro "Hey, come on, cut it out...!\nIt's enough to know you missed me.\nBut we really need to get going. Fast."
    voice "se/z02074.ogg"
    char_pro "嘿，行了，别这样……！\n知道你们想我了就够了。\n但我们真的得走了。快点。"

# game/script.rpy:145683
translate chinese map222_c63c8201:

    # voice "se/z02075.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Yeah. If they find out we cheated, we're done for.\nI know you want an explanation, so let's talk about it on the ship.\nWe should set sail right away, so nobody catches on to us."
    voice "se/z02075.ogg"
    char_ulric "是啊。要是他们发现我们作弊，我们就完了。\n我知道你们想要个解释，那我们就上船再说。\n我们得立刻启航，别让任何人察觉。"

# game/script.rpy:145710
translate chinese map222_27fc489c:

    # "They start to walk toward the ship, but Damek stops them."
    "他们开始朝船走去，但达梅克叫住了他们。"

# game/script.rpy:145735
translate chinese map222_45fc2b05:

    # voice "se/z02076.ogg"
    voice "se/z02076.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:145737
translate chinese map222_4acd994d:

    # char_damek "Wait — you cheated...?\nHow are we going to break this news to our new partner?\nIf {i}they{/i} find out, they might just break off our Alliance."
    char_damek "等等——你们作弊了……？\n我们要怎么把这个消息告诉我们的新盟友？\n要是{i}他们{/i}发现了，说不定会直接跟我们断绝同盟。"

# game/script.rpy:145762
translate chinese map222_6ec0eb68:

    # voice "se/z02077.ogg"
    voice "se/z02077.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:145764
translate chinese map222_608a28e4:

    # char_ulric "It worked out in their benefit, so I doubt they'd care.\nLet's get going, we'll explain the story on our way home."
    char_ulric "结果对他们有利，所以我觉得他们不会在意。\n走吧，回程路上我们会把来龙去脉解释清楚。"

# game/script.rpy:145789
translate chinese map222_f5315df3:

    # voice "se/z02078.ogg"
    # char_damek "I'm so confused..."
    voice "se/z02078.ogg"
    char_damek "我完全糊涂了……"

# game/script.rpy:145815
translate chinese map222_eae01949:

    # voice "se/z02079.ogg"
    # char_pro "Don't worry about it, Damek.\nWe made it out of this without any casualties, really.\nA few members of the reserve forces died, but that's it."
    voice "se/z02079.ogg"
    char_pro "别担心，达梅克。\n说真的，我们这次脱身，没有任何伤亡。\n后备部队里有几个人死了，仅此而已。"

# game/script.rpy:145831
translate chinese map222_2d4ccc32:

    # voice "se/z02080.ogg"
    voice "se/z02080.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:145833
translate chinese map222_673b2c91:

    # char_pro "Thankfully, none of our Seers fell in combat.\nWe have more strength than ever before. That's what matters.\nAttacking Balteus will be as easy as the snap of a finger...!"
    char_pro "幸好，我们的先知没有一个战死。\n我们比以往任何时候都更强大。这才是关键。\n进攻巴尔泰乌斯会易如反掌……！"

# game/script.rpy:145838
translate chinese map222_a7b0a121:

    # voice "se/z02081.ogg"
    voice "se/z02081.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:145840
translate chinese map222_3e4d902b:

    # char_pro "Thankfully, none of the Monarch Vessels fell in combat.\nWe have more strength than ever before. That's what matters.\nAttacking Balteus will be as easy as the snap of a finger...!"
    char_pro "幸好，君主容器没有一个战死。\n我们比以往任何时候都更强大。这才是关键。\n进攻巴尔泰乌斯会易如反掌……！"

# game/script.rpy:145866
translate chinese map222_0d77af9e:

    # voice "se/z02082.ogg"
    voice "se/z02082.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:145868
translate chinese map222_d17d2a49:

    # char_damek "Alright, then. I trust you.\nBut you better have a good explanation for this.\nLet's get going, everybody. We have a long voyage home."
    char_damek "那好吧。我相信你们。\n但你们最好有个像样的解释。\n大家走吧。我们回家的航程还很长。"

# game/script.rpy:145894
translate chinese map222_a5a476ab:

    # "Damek, Ulric and Pro all get on the ship.{w}\nI start to walk over with Howl, Valessa, and Fortaime.{w}\nThey seem happy, but just as confused as I am."
    "达梅克、乌尔里克和普洛都上了船。{w}\n我和豪尔、瓦莱莎、福泰姆一起朝船走去。{w}\n他们看起来很高兴，但也和我一样困惑。"

# game/script.rpy:145919
translate chinese map222_04474f0e:

    # voice "se/z02083.ogg"
    voice "se/z02083.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:145921
translate chinese map222_f4f7c661:

    # char_howl "Cheating is not something we agree with.\nSuch tactics are what our current enemy employs.\nThis journey seems to be changing all of your values."
    char_howl "作弊不是我们所认同的。\n这种手段正是我们现在的敌人所用的。\n这趟旅程似乎正在改变你们所有人的价值观。"

# game/script.rpy:145946
translate chinese map222_0af94a21:

    # voice "se/z02084.ogg"
    voice "se/z02084.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:145948
translate chinese map222_75c86291:

    # char_fortaime "But he's still alive...! That's great news.\nI was really freaking out, I didn't know what to do.\nDon't tell me you think it would be better if he was dead..."
    char_fortaime "但他还活着……！这是天大的好消息。\n我当时真的吓坏了，不知道该怎么办。\n别告诉我你觉得他死了会更好……"

# game/script.rpy:145973
translate chinese map222_33e1f9d6:

    # voice "se/z02085.ogg"
    # char_howl "Maybe. Means to an end, we suppose.\nThe enemy likely thinks the same way."
    voice "se/z02085.ogg"
    char_howl "也许吧。我们猜，这算是达到目的的手段。\n敌人多半也是这么想的。"

# game/script.rpy:145995
translate chinese map222_da8c665b:

    # "With that, he walks away and gets on the ship.{w}\nValessa and Fortaime both turn to me, happy."
    "说完，他走开上了船。{w}\n瓦莱莎和福泰姆都转向我，满脸喜悦。"

# game/script.rpy:146020
translate chinese map222_f9029611:

    # voice "se/z02086.ogg"
    voice "se/z02086.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:146022
translate chinese map222_e4de3374:

    # char_valessa "Let's go find out what they have to say.\nI'm also curious about that other man we restrained.\nThere's so much going on right now, I can barely think."
    char_valessa "我们去听听他们怎么说吧。\n我也很好奇我们控制住的那个人。\n现在发生的事太多了，我几乎无法思考。"

# game/script.rpy:146047
translate chinese map222_b9b39ba3:

    # voice "se/z02087b.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "Yeah, I want to figure everything out.\nI was worried we'd be attacking Balteus without all of our friends.\nBut to know he's still alive...? I can't even begin to describe the relief."
    voice "se/z02087b.ogg"
    char_fortaime "是啊，我想把一切都弄清楚。\n我原本担心我们会缺了朋友去进攻巴尔泰乌斯。\n但知道他居然还活着……？那种如释重负的感觉，我简直无法形容。"

# game/script.rpy:146074
translate chinese map222_b5cf0283:

    # "We make our way to the deck of the ship, but Valessa's words stick with me.{w}\nEverything was moving so fast, I almost didn't know what was going on.{w}\nThankfully, we had a long trip home to get everything figured out."
    "我们走向船的甲板，但瓦莱莎的话一直萦绕在我心头。{w}\n一切都发生得太快，我几乎搞不清状况。{w}\n幸好，我们有一段漫长的归程可以把一切弄清楚。"

# game/script.rpy:146076
translate chinese map222_f8d91b2a:

    # "And that was my goal. We'd get back to Mazeo with no questions left unanswered.{w}\nNo matter how shocking the answers were, and whether or not I regretted learning them.{w}\nWe seemed to be running on everybody's agenda but my own. Everybody had their own plans."
    "而这就是我的目标。我们要回到马泽奥，不留下任何未解之谜。{w}\n不管那些答案有多么惊人，也不管我是否会后悔知道它们。{w}\n我们似乎一直在按所有人的计划行事，唯独没有我自己的。每个人都有自己的盘算。"

# game/script.rpy:146081
translate chinese map222_7187768e:

    # "It was time for that to change."
    "是时候改变这一点了。"

# game/script.rpy:146115
translate chinese map223_fb025fae:

    # "When we all get on the ship, it starts to set sail within moments.{w}\nIt seems that Ulric and Pro want to expedite our departure from Alarinthia.{w}\nThey continue to look at us, with smiles on their faces. To themselves, they had succeeded."
    "我们所有人上船后，船片刻间就启航了。{w}\n看来乌尔里克和普洛想让我们尽快离开阿拉林西亚。{w}\n他们脸上挂着笑容，不断看着我们。在他们自己看来，他们已经成功了。"

# game/script.rpy:146117
translate chinese map223_c73a9569:

    # "But in what, exactly...?{w}\nThat's what I demand to know, as I step forward.{w}\nIf I was in charge, I couldn't have them plotting behind my back."
    "但究竟是在什么上成功了……？{w}\n这正是我上前一步，要求弄清楚的。{w}\n既然是我主事，我就不能容忍他们在我背后谋划。"

# game/script.rpy:146119
translate chinese map223_3894b45b:

    # "Everybody gathers around to listen as our ship gently rocks back and forth.{w}\nThough relieved that there were no real casualties, we needed to know what we got into.{w}\nIf they wanted to leave so fast, was it so bad that we could never come back to Alarinthia...?"
    "船轻轻摇晃着，大家聚拢过来倾听。{w}\n尽管为没有真正的伤亡而松了口气，我们仍需要知道我们卷入了什么。{w}\n如果他们想这么快离开，难道真糟到我们再也回不了阿拉林西亚了吗……？"

# game/script.rpy:146144
translate chinese map223_e1f08874:

    # voice "se/z02087.ogg"
    voice "se/z02087.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:146146
translate chinese map223_de0500f4:

    # char_pro "Whoa, it's not that bad. Trust me.\nBut it's definitely the biggest score of my life.\nI mean, swindle an entire nation? Amazing."
    char_pro "哇，没那么严重。相信我。\n但这绝对是我人生中最大的一笔收获。\n我是说，骗过一整个国家？太妙了。"

# game/script.rpy:146160
translate chinese map223_75ab2eeb:

    # "He continues talking — his pride apparent."
    "他继续说着——得意之情溢于言表。"

# game/script.rpy:146185
translate chinese map223_10e0ab41:

    # voice "se/z02088.ogg"
    # char_pro "It all started after the attack on our HQ.\nDamek cheated death, and we rose from the ashes.\nThen, we were going to Alarinthia, where I knew we'd be fighting."
    voice "se/z02088.ogg"
    char_pro "一切都从我们总部遭到袭击之后开始。\n达梅克死里逃生，我们从灰烬中崛起。\n接着，我们要去阿拉林西亚，我知道我们在那里会有一战。"

# game/script.rpy:146199
translate chinese map223_4730639b:

    # voice "se/z02089.ogg"
    # char_pro "So I thought, what if we could cheat death again, but to {i}our{/i} advantage?\nThere was so much room for error, that we stepped in to even the odds.\nI knew that Ulric would side with Vivien regardless, so I went to him."
    voice "se/z02089.ogg"
    char_pro "所以我想，要是我们能再次死里逃生，而且是对{i}我们{/i}有利呢？\n其中有太多变数，于是我们插手进来，把胜算扳平。\n我知道乌尔里克无论如何都会站在薇薇安那边，所以我找上了他。"

# game/script.rpy:146225
translate chinese map223_68e511ae:

    # voice "se/z02090.ogg"
    voice "se/z02090.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:146227
translate chinese map223_d5d1c720:

    # char_ulric "I didn't want to work with Pro at first, it seemed like a plan doomed to failure.\nCould we really cheat an entire nation, right in front of their own eyes...?\nObviously, it sounds impossible. But Pro was pretty insistent."
    char_ulric "一开始我不想和普洛合作，那计划看起来注定失败。\n我们真能在整个国家眼皮底下骗过他们吗……？\n显然，这听起来不可能。但普洛非常坚持。"

# game/script.rpy:146240
translate chinese map223_09fcf571:

    # voice "se/z02091.ogg"
    # char_ulric "He came up with a solid plan. I'd fight with Vivien, and he'd fight with Draycu.\nIf we were both on opposing teams, we could throw the battle in any direction.\nSo that's what we did — we ensured victory for the side [firstname] chose. "
    voice "se/z02091.ogg"
    char_ulric "他想出了一个周密的计划。我和薇薇安并肩作战，他和德雷库并肩作战。\n如果我们分处对立的两队，就能把战局引向任何一方。\n于是我们就这么做了——我们确保了[firstname]所选那一边的胜利。"

# game/script.rpy:146266
translate chinese map223_d37c205a:

    # voice "se/z02092.ogg"
    # char_pro "It was easy enough to manipulate Draycu.\nI mean, he thought he was the one manipulating us.\nBut it was my plan all along to fight by his side."
    voice "se/z02092.ogg"
    char_pro "操控德雷库轻而易举。\n我是说，他还以为是他在操控我们。\n但和他并肩作战本来就是我的计划。"

# game/script.rpy:146270
translate chinese map223_e2c990ba:

    # voice "se/z02093.ogg"
    # char_pro "After that, all we needed was {i}this{/i}."
    voice "se/z02093.ogg"
    char_pro "在那之后，我们只需要{i}这个{/i}。"

# game/script.rpy:146285
translate chinese map223_d4b4eb68:

    # "He holds up a dagger. The same one he used from the coliseum.{w}\nStabbing it through his hand, that's when the true nature of the weapon was revealed.{w}\nRather than piercing his hand, the blade sunk into the handle of the dagger. It was a fake."
    "他举起一把匕首。正是他在竞技场用过的那把。{w}\n他把匕首刺向自己的手，武器的真实本质才显露出来。{w}\n剑没有刺穿他的手，而是缩进了匕首的握柄里。那是把假匕首。"

# game/script.rpy:146310
translate chinese map223_cf41dd57:

    # voice "se/z02094.ogg"
    # char_pro "Along with some chaos, and acting, they'd believe the battle was over.\nThe chaos, of course, was the moment [firstname] used the blade.\nWe pushed you toward using it, so we could have our opportunity."
    voice "se/z02094.ogg"
    char_pro "再加上一些混乱和演技，他们便会相信战斗已经结束。\n那场混乱，当然就是[firstname]使用剑的那一刻。\n我们推着你使用它，为的就是给自己创造机会。"

# game/script.rpy:146336
translate chinese map223_b74bf324:

    # voice "se/z02095.ogg"
    # char_ulric "That's really all there is to it.\nNone of you could know until it was already over.\nIf information was leaked, everything would be for nothing."
    voice "se/z02095.ogg"
    char_ulric "事情其实就是这么简单。\n在一切结束之前，你们谁都不能知道。\n一旦消息泄露，所有努力都会付诸东流。"

# game/script.rpy:146340
translate chinese map223_e79a89db:

    # voice "se/z02096.ogg"
    # char_ulric "You're free to come back to Alarinthia, but we might stay behind.\nIt was just in our best interest to get away before they figured things out.\nSo yeah — a new alliance, minimal casualties, and a great story."
    voice "se/z02096.ogg"
    char_ulric "你们尽可以自由回到阿拉林西亚，但我们也许会留在后面。\n趁他们还没想明白之前脱身，对我们最有利。\n所以没错——新的同盟，最小的伤亡，还有一段精彩的故事。"

# game/script.rpy:146354
translate chinese map223_9bb1e615:

    # voice "se/z02097.ogg"
    # char_ulric "I'd say this was an all around success, wouldn't you?"
    voice "se/z02097.ogg"
    char_ulric "我得说这是一次全面的成功，你不觉得吗？"

# game/script.rpy:146380
translate chinese map223_5dfd9aa1:

    # voice "se/z02098.ogg"
    # char_pro "Yeah! I can't believe we really pulled it off.\nI think this might just be my masterpiece."
    voice "se/z02098.ogg"
    char_pro "是啊！我真不敢相信我们真的办到了。\n我觉得这说不定就是我的杰作。"

# game/script.rpy:146395
translate chinese map223_378c30ff:

    # "They wait in silence for our response.{w}\nBut their faces are beaming with pride."
    "他们沉默地等待着我们的回应。{w}\n但他们的脸上洋溢着自豪。"

# game/script.rpy:146409
translate chinese map223_25514697:

    # "It seemed like a simple enough plan, but it was definitely risky.{w}\nThe moment we set foot in the coliseum, they were in real danger.{w}\nBut that only shows off their resolve. They were willing to die for this."
    "这计划看似简单，却绝对冒险。{w}\n我们踏进竞技场的那一刻，他们就身处真正的危险之中。{w}\n但这恰恰彰显了他们的决心。他们愿意为此赴死。"

# game/script.rpy:146411
translate chinese map223_6e633127:

    # "However, something feels off about this.{w}\nIt's all too perfect, too convenient. I'm not sure."
    "然而，我总觉得有哪里不对劲。{w}\n一切都太完美，太顺理成章了。我说不准。"

# game/script.rpy:146416
translate chinese map223_82b4b710:

    # "Ulric was willing to throw everything away...?{w}\nChanging Alarinthia was his dream — he always said so.{w}\nSiding with Pro, and dismissing his chance to do it, was odd."
    "乌尔里克竟然愿意抛弃一切……？{w}\n改变阿拉林西亚是他的梦想——他一直这么说。{w}\n站在普洛那边，放弃实现梦想的机会，这很奇怪。"

# game/script.rpy:146418
translate chinese map223_1b95abc2:

    # "There was obviously a chance that I'd side with Vivien, but I didn't.{w}\nI'd have to talk to Ulric about it later. There {i}had{/i} to be more to this story."
    "显然我有可能会站在薇薇安那边，但我没有。{w}\n我之后得找乌尔里克谈谈。这个故事{i}肯定{/i}还有内情。"

# game/script.rpy:146423
translate chinese map223_14432112:

    # "Ulric was willing to throw everything away...?{w}\nI mean, I sided with Vivien, but that wasn't a guarantee.{w}\nHad I sided with Draycu, he'd lose his chance to change Alarinthia."
    "乌尔里克竟然愿意抛弃一切……？{w}\n我是说，我确实站在薇薇安那边，但那并非万无一失。{w}\n要是我站在德雷库那边，他就会失去改变阿拉林西亚的机会。"

# game/script.rpy:146425
translate chinese map223_7a201bb1:

    # "There {i}had{/i} to be more to this story. Something they're not telling us.{w}\nI'd have to talk to them in private later on. Maybe they could confide in me."
    "这个故事{i}肯定{/i}还有别的内情。有些事他们没告诉我们。{w}\n我之后得私下跟他们谈谈。也许他们愿意向我吐露。"

# game/script.rpy:146429
translate chinese map223_5d918223:

    # "But as it stood, I didn't really buy their tale.{w}\nWould they really risk their lives for a foreign alliance?{w}\nMy comrades seem to think so, and they shower them with praise."
    "但就目前而言，我并不太相信他们的说辞。{w}\n他们真的会为了一纸异国同盟而冒生命危险吗？{w}\n我的同伴们似乎深信不疑，对他们赞不绝口。"

# game/script.rpy:146454
translate chinese map223_c1d87438:

    # voice "se/z02099.ogg"
    voice "se/z02099.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:146456
translate chinese map223_156a4d4f:

    # char_fortaime "That might be the coolest thing I've ever heard.\nI knew you were a swindler Pro, but this is crazy.\nYou're using your skill to shape Alestia's history."
    char_fortaime "这也许是我听过最酷的事了。\n我知道你是个骗子，普洛，但这太疯狂了。\n你在用自己的本事改写阿莱斯蒂亚的历史。"

# game/script.rpy:146481
translate chinese map223_5d4559a7:

    # voice "se/z02100.ogg"
    voice "se/z02100.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:146483
translate chinese map223_76a08bfb:

    # char_valessa "And Ulric, I never knew you were so good at acting.\nYou really had me sold there. I almost can't believe it.\nIt felt like something was up, but to think it was {i}this{/i}...?"
    char_valessa "还有乌尔里克，我从不知道你这么会演戏。\n你真是把我骗得团团转。我几乎不敢相信。\n我感觉有点不对劲，但没想到居然是{i}这个{/i}……？"

# game/script.rpy:146508
translate chinese map223_f6daf6c9:

    # voice "se/z02101.ogg"
    # char_damek "Almost puts my strategizing to shame, I have to say.\nSo what's the next step...? Is it just smooth sailing, now?\nI imagine our chances of getting caught are pretty low."
    voice "se/z02101.ogg"
    char_damek "不得不说，这几乎让我自愧不如。\n那下一步呢……？现在就一帆风顺了吗？\n我想我们被抓到的几率应该很低。"

# game/script.rpy:146536
translate chinese map223_78be5a8e:

    # voice "se/z02102.ogg"
    voice "se/z02102.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:146538
translate chinese map223_9934433e:

    # char_pro "You should probably tell Draycu what {i}really{/i} went down.\nI doubt he'd mind, and at least he wouldn't find out another way.\nIn the meantime, we need to have a word with our new {i}prisoner{/i}."
    char_pro "你最好告诉德雷库{i}真正{/i}发生了什么。\n我想他不会介意，至少这样他不会从别处得知。\n与此同时，我们得跟我们新的{i}囚犯{/i}谈谈。"

# game/script.rpy:146543
translate chinese map223_05d078ff:

    # voice "se/z02103.ogg"
    voice "se/z02103.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:146545
translate chinese map223_b6136129:

    # char_pro "You should probably tell Vivien what {i}really{/i} went down.\nI doubt he'd mind, and at least he wouldn't find out another way.\nIn the meantime, we need to have a word with our new {i}prisoner{/i}."
    char_pro "你最好告诉薇薇安{i}真正{/i}发生了什么。\n我想她不会介意，至少这样她不会从别处得知。\n与此同时，我们得跟我们新的{i}囚犯{/i}谈谈。"

# game/script.rpy:146571
translate chinese map223_a91710fd:

    # voice "se/z02104.ogg"
    voice "se/z02104.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:146573
translate chinese map223_5f8c5431:

    # char_damek "Right. I'll tell him while you do that, then.\nBut I think we've also earned some much needed rest.\nLet's take the day off, and meet back up here in the morning."
    char_damek "好。那你去谈的时候，我来告诉他。\n不过我觉得我们也该好好休息一下了。\n今天休整一天，明早在这里碰头。"

# game/script.rpy:146576
translate chinese map223_f985c7b8:

    # voice "se/z02105.ogg"
    # char_damek "That is, if it's okay with you, [firstname]?"
    voice "se/z02105.ogg"
    char_damek "如果你没意见的话，[firstname]？"

# game/script.rpy:146603
translate chinese map223_67d86896:

    # "I nod, and tell everybody that they're dismissed.{w}\nEverybody runs off, except for Ulric and Pro.{w}\nThey approach me, and they look anxious."
    "我点点头，告诉大家可以解散了。{w}\n所有人都跑开了，只有乌尔里克和普洛留下。{w}\n他们向我走来，神情焦虑。"

# game/script.rpy:146628
translate chinese map223_941c4deb:

    # voice "se/z02106.ogg"
    voice "se/z02106.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:146630
translate chinese map223_06cc244f:

    # char_ulric "Sovy is in the brig, right...?\nI can't believe he surrendered — just like that."
    char_ulric "索维在禁闭室里，对吧……？\n我简直不敢相信他就这么投降了——就这样。"

# game/script.rpy:146655
translate chinese map223_880ac2dc:

    # voice "se/z02107.ogg"
    voice "se/z02107.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:146657
translate chinese map223_ca10d0a3:

    # char_pro "And I heard him say something about a mole...?\nLet's go talk with him, [firstname]. You deserve some answers."
    char_pro "我好像听到他说了什么内鬼……？\n我们去跟他谈谈吧，[firstname]。你理应得到答案。"

# game/script.rpy:146684
translate chinese map223_ede79bb3:

    # voice "se/z02108.ogg"
    voice "se/z02108.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:146686
translate chinese map223_b16e6693:

    # char_ulric "Yeah. Let Damek pamper Draycu for the time being.\nBut before we head to the brig, look behind us, [firstname].\nIt's starting to look like an impressive army, isn't it...?"
    char_ulric "对。暂时让达梅克去讨好德雷库吧。\n但在我们去禁闭室之前，回头看看，[firstname]。\n这阵容开始像一支了不起的军队了，不是吗……？"

# game/script.rpy:146691
translate chinese map223_e9856504:

    # voice "se/z02109.ogg"
    voice "se/z02109.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:146693
translate chinese map223_a750f91d:

    # char_ulric "Yeah. Let Damek pamper Vivien for the time being.\nBut before we head to the brig, look behind us, [firstname].\nIt's starting to look like an impressive army, isn't it...?"
    char_ulric "对。暂时让达梅克去讨好薇薇安吧。\n但在我们去禁闭室之前，回头看看，[firstname]。\n这阵容开始像一支了不起的军队了，不是吗……？"

# game/script.rpy:146719
translate chinese map223_925b6b64:

    # "I do as instructed, and notice that we're accompanied by at least a dozen ships.{w}\nIf that was the strength of our new Alarinthian army, then I was at a loss for words.{w}\nThat fleet, combined with our own, and my blade, stood a real chance in Balteus."
    "我依言照做，发现至少有十几艘船与我们同行。{w}\n如果这就是我们新阿拉林西亚军队的实力，那我真是无话可说了。{w}\n那支舰队，加上我们自己的船队，还有我的剑，在巴尔泰乌斯确实有一战之力。"

# game/script.rpy:146721
translate chinese map223_20d27556:

    # "But I couldn't lull myself into a false sense of security. There was still so much to do.{w}\nAnd right now, the next step was having a word with Sovy. Just what was he after...?{w}\nThe fact that Ulric and Pro \"volunteered\" to come along was also pretty peculiar."
    "但我不能让自己沉溺于虚假的安全感中。还有太多事要做。{w}\n而眼下，下一步就是跟索维谈谈。他究竟想要什么……？{w}\n乌尔里克和普洛“主动”要跟来这件事，也相当蹊跷。"

# game/script.rpy:146723
translate chinese map223_c38b2af6:

    # "The pieces have started to fall into place, but there's still quite a few gaps.{w}\nMaybe this \"information\" that Sovy promised would help me in some way.{w}\nWe all head down to the brig, and I'm hopeful that I could figure this all out."
    "拼图开始各归其位，但仍有许多空白。{w}\n也许索维承诺的这个“情报”能以某种方式帮到我。{w}\n我们一起下到禁闭室，我希望能把这一切都弄清楚。"

# game/script.rpy:146725
translate chinese map223_9d904e55:

    # "After all, I could leave no question unanswered before attacking Balteus.{w}\nAnd resting in our brig was the one man who knew {i}everything{/i} about our enemy.{w}\nIf we could use him for information, then that would be an incredible boon."
    "毕竟，在进攻巴尔泰乌斯之前，我不能留下任何未解之谜。{w}\n而关在我们禁闭室里的，正是那个对我们敌人{i}无所不知{/i}的人。{w}\n如果我们能从他那里获取情报，那将是莫大的助力。"

# game/script.rpy:146727
translate chinese map223_1055dc79:

    # "As we enter the brig, one fact plays on repeat in my ever-running mind."
    "我们走进禁闭室时，一个念头在我永不停歇的脑海中反复回响。"

# game/script.rpy:146729
translate chinese map223_3834232a:

    # "With everything we just gained? We actually stand a chance at winning this war..."
    "有了我们刚刚得到的一切？我们真的有机会赢得这场战争了……"

# game/script.rpy:146763
translate chinese map224_39a23342:

    # "The brig is dark, and we can't see much at all.{w}\nThat is, until our eyes adjust, and we immediately see Sovy.{w}\nHe's broken free from his binds, and is doing pull-ups from a ceiling beam."
    "禁闭室里一片漆黑，我们几乎什么都看不见。{w}\n直到眼睛适应过来，我们立刻看到了索维。{w}\n他挣脱了束缚，正吊在天花板的横梁上做引体向上。"

# game/script.rpy:146765
translate chinese map224_e409f113:

    # "Grunting with exertion, he lets himself fall to the ground when he notices our entrance.{w}\nTaking a few steps toward us, he's careful not to make any sudden movements.{w}\nPro makes sure the cell door is shut and locked, so he can't escape from us."
    "他吃力地闷哼着，注意到我们进来后便松手落到地上。{w}\n他朝我们走了几步，小心翼翼地不做出任何突然的动作。{w}\n普洛确认牢房门已关好上锁，这样他就无法从我们手里逃走。"

# game/script.rpy:146790
translate chinese map224_f37ec292:

    # voice "se/z02110.ogg"
    voice "se/z02110.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:146792
translate chinese map224_47004a97:

    # char_sovy "My, my. I wasn't expecting an entourage.\nShould I be flattered, or concerned for my safety?"
    char_sovy "哎呀呀。我可没料到会来这么一大群人。\n我该感到受宠若惊，还是该担心自己的安危呢？"

# game/script.rpy:146806
translate chinese map224_c796ee07:

    # "An obvious attempt at humor, but none of us acknowledge this.{w}\nUlric steps forward, demanding swift answers from our captive."
    "这明显是想开个玩笑，但我们谁都没理会。{w}\n乌尔里克上前一步，要求我们的俘虏立刻给出答案。"

# game/script.rpy:146831
translate chinese map224_dd6c3493:

    # voice "se/z02111.ogg"
    voice "se/z02111.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:146833
translate chinese map224_25dbeb72:

    # char_ulric "Explain yourself, Sovy.\nI'm seconds away from throwing you overboard."
    char_ulric "解释清楚，索维。\n我随时都能把你扔下船。"

# game/script.rpy:146858
translate chinese map224_113ee538:

    # voice "se/z02112.ogg"
    # char_sovy "Again with the hostility.\nLook, I don't even really know what I'm doing here.\nIt just felt like the right thing to do, given the circumstances."
    voice "se/z02112.ogg"
    char_sovy "又是这种敌意。\n听着，我其实都不太清楚自己为什么会在这里。\n只是在那种情况下，这么做感觉是对的。"

# game/script.rpy:146884
translate chinese map224_11cb53db:

    # voice "se/z02113.ogg"
    # char_ulric "What circumstances...?"
    voice "se/z02113.ogg"
    char_ulric "什么情况……？"

# game/script.rpy:146899
translate chinese map224_8d630c79:

    # "Sovy looks at me, and shakes his head dismissively."
    "索维看了我一眼，不以为然地摇了摇头。"

# game/script.rpy:146924
translate chinese map224_8a3313bd:

    # voice "se/z02114.ogg"
    # char_sovy "Back when we attacked your HQ in Mazeo?\nMy goal was to kill your friend, and retrieve the blade.\nI failed both objectives, and The Triumvirate punished me."
    voice "se/z02114.ogg"
    char_sovy "还记得我们袭击你们在马泽奥的总部那次吗？\n我的目标是杀了你的朋友，取回剑。\n我两个目标都失败了，三人执政团因此惩罚了我。"

# game/script.rpy:146950
translate chinese map224_d4795823:

    # voice "se/z02115.ogg"
    # char_ulric "I see."
    voice "se/z02115.ogg"
    char_ulric "原来如此。"

# game/script.rpy:146965
translate chinese map224_58c44918:

    # "It's true. Sovy did show me mercy during our brief encounter.{w}\nHe had my life in his hands, but he chose to run away instead.{w}\nHe saw something when he touched the blade — I could tell."
    "这是真的。在那次短暂的交锋中，索维确实对我手下留情了。{w}\n我的命就攥在他手里，可他却选择逃走。{w}\n他触碰剑时看到了什么——我能看出来。"

# game/script.rpy:146967
translate chinese map224_b60bc87d:

    # "And now that I know the truth of the spirit realm, I think I knew what he saw.{w}\nThe Monarchy. He must've seen the same truth that shocked all of us.{w}\nI ask if that's true, almost certain that I'm correct. He then confirms."
    "如今既然我知道了灵界的真相，我想我明白他看到的是什么了。{w}\n君主国。他一定看到了那个震撼我们所有人的真相。{w}\n我问他是不是这样，几乎确信自己是对的。随后他证实了。"

# game/script.rpy:146992
translate chinese map224_a13826ff:

    # voice "se/z02116.ogg"
    # char_sovy "You are correct. I found out that The Triumvirate was lying to me.\nI let you live, because I wasn't sure of what to do next. I'm still uncertain.\nWhen I got back to Balteus, they punished me by placing me in exile."
    voice "se/z02116.ogg"
    char_sovy "你说得对。我发现三人执政团一直在骗我。\n我放你一命，是因为我不确定接下来该怎么做。我至今仍不确定。\n我回到巴尔泰乌斯后，他们把我流放，以此惩罚我。"

# game/script.rpy:147020
translate chinese map224_1d5b8916:

    # voice "se/z02117.ogg"
    voice "se/z02117.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:147022
translate chinese map224_501a129f:

    # char_ulric "You expect us to believe this...?\nSovy, you're nothing but a mindless slave.\nThe Monarch survived because of his strength."
    char_ulric "你以为我们会相信这种鬼话……？\n索维，你不过是个没有思想的奴隶。\n君主能活下来，靠的是他的力量。"

# game/script.rpy:147027
translate chinese map224_fb3c4ebc:

    # voice "se/z02118.ogg"
    voice "se/z02118.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:147029
translate chinese map224_4415a558:

    # char_ulric "You expect us to believe this...?\nSovy, you're nothing but a mindless slave.\nThe Monarch survived because of her strength."
    char_ulric "你以为我们会相信这种鬼话……？\n索维，你不过是个没有思想的奴隶。\n君主能活下来，靠的是她的力量。"

# game/script.rpy:147045
translate chinese map224_60ee1011:

    # "I tell Ulric that Sovy is speaking the truth.{w}\nI explain what happened while we were alone near the idol."
    "我告诉乌尔里克，索维说的是实话。{w}\n我解释了我们在灵像附近独处时发生的事。"

# game/script.rpy:147070
translate chinese map224_4d34ea5e:

    # voice "se/z02119.ogg"
    # char_sovy "See, Ulric? You're always so paranoid.\nListen to your friends before making snap judgments.\nI have a lot to say, so you better learn to trust me again."
    voice "se/z02119.ogg"
    char_sovy "看到了吗，乌尔里克？你总是这么多疑。\n下结论之前先听听朋友的话。\n我有很多话要说，所以你最好学会重新信任我。"

# game/script.rpy:147096
translate chinese map224_45fc816d:

    # voice "se/z02120.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Don't count on it."
    voice "se/z02120.ogg"
    char_ulric "别指望。"

# game/script.rpy:147118
translate chinese map224_9c433b6e:

    # "He walks away and stands in a nearby corner.{w}\nSensing an opportunity, Pro enters the conversation."
    "他走开，站到旁边的角落里。{w}\n普洛察觉到机会，加入了谈话。"

# game/script.rpy:147143
translate chinese map224_4c5deedf:

    # voice "se/z02121.ogg"
    voice "se/z02121.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:147145
translate chinese map224_fbae2e2f:

    # char_pro "So what did you want to tell us...?\nAround here, you need to earn your keep.\nUlric was serious about throwing you overboard."
    char_pro "那你想告诉我们什么……？\n在这里，你得自己挣得立足之地。\n乌尔里克说把你扔下船可不是开玩笑的。"

# game/script.rpy:147170
translate chinese map224_e9c4bfeb:

    # voice "se/z02122.ogg"
    # char_sovy "Well, this is where it gets complicated.\nI still consider myself a servant to The Triumvirate.\nBut Halin...? Well, I want nothing more than to see him fall."
    voice "se/z02122.ogg"
    char_sovy "好吧，事情到这里就复杂了。\n我仍然把自己视为三人执政团的仆人。\n但哈林……？我最大的心愿就是看他倒台。"

# game/script.rpy:147174
translate chinese map224_5c2468c5:

    # voice "se/z02123.ogg"
    # char_sovy "I'm not here to hurt any of you. Not this time.\nAs you can see, even though I broke out of my binds, I am playing nice.\nRight now, all I can offer is information to aid your attack on Balteus."
    voice "se/z02123.ogg"
    char_sovy "我不是来伤害你们任何人的。这次不是。\n如你所见，虽然我挣脱了束缚，但我很守规矩。\n眼下，我能提供的只有协助你们进攻巴尔泰乌斯的情报。"

# game/script.rpy:147200
translate chinese map224_07978947:

    # voice "se/z02124.ogg"
    # char_pro "And why would you want to help us take down The Triumvirate...?"
    voice "se/z02124.ogg"
    char_pro "那你为什么想帮我们扳倒三人执政团……？"

# game/script.rpy:147226
translate chinese map224_6617c667:

    # voice "se/z02125.ogg"
    # char_sovy "Doing so would involve taking down Halin, as well.\nHe sold me out, and got me into this whole mess."
    voice "se/z02125.ogg"
    char_sovy "这么做同时也意味着扳倒哈林。\n是他出卖了我，把我卷进了这摊浑水。"

# game/script.rpy:147252
translate chinese map224_9ed5e9f2:

    # voice "se/z02126.ogg"
    # char_pro "Okay, and let's say we take down Halin. What then?\nYou'd be reinstated as Inquisitor, and just stab us in the back."
    voice "se/z02126.ogg"
    char_pro "好，那就假设我们扳倒了哈林。然后呢？\n你会官复原职当回审判官，然后反手捅我们一刀。"

# game/script.rpy:147278
translate chinese map224_d3ad618d:

    # voice "se/z02127.ogg"
    # char_sovy "You speak as if people aren't capable of playing both sides.\nEither way, I don't know. I'd make my choice when the time comes."
    voice "se/z02127.ogg"
    char_sovy "你说得好像人就不能两面兼顾似的。\n不管怎样，我不知道。等时机到了我自会做出选择。"

# game/script.rpy:147294
translate chinese map224_950f3b3b:

    # voice "se/z02128.ogg"
    # char_pro "And what makes you say that so easily...?\nYou've served The Triumvirate for your entire life."
    voice "se/z02128.ogg"
    char_pro "那你怎么能这么轻松地说出这种话……？\n你为三人执政团效力了一辈子。"

# game/script.rpy:147320
translate chinese map224_6a6f17c4:

    # voice "se/z02129.ogg"
    # char_sovy "No. Not my entire life.\nThey welcomed me with open arms, when I was young, and broken.\nNow here they are, inflicting the same wounds they had promised to heal."
    voice "se/z02129.ogg"
    char_sovy "不。不是一辈子。\n在我年幼又破碎的时候，他们张开双臂接纳了我。\n而如今，他们却在制造那些他们曾承诺要治愈的伤口。"

# game/script.rpy:147346
translate chinese map224_8d0b1653:

    # voice "se/z02130b.ogg"
    # char_pro "Is that supposed to make sense to me?"
    voice "se/z02130b.ogg"
    char_pro "这话我该听懂吗？"

# game/script.rpy:147372
translate chinese map224_8f93337e:

    # voice "se/z02130.ogg"
    # char_sovy "No, because it barely makes sense to {i}me{/i}.\nNow Pro, will you let me say what I have to say?"
    voice "se/z02130.ogg"
    char_sovy "不，因为连{i}我{/i}自己都几乎理不清。\n好了普洛，你能让我把要说的话说完吗？"

# game/script.rpy:147398
translate chinese map224_e69cfbe1:

    # voice "se/z02131b.ogg"
    # char_pro "Sure."
    voice "se/z02131b.ogg"
    char_pro "行。"

# game/script.rpy:147413
translate chinese map224_4a5a1dfe:

    # "Sovy sighs, and crosses his arms."
    "索维叹了口气，抱起双臂。"

# game/script.rpy:147438
translate chinese map224_8a3aba0a:

    # voice "se/z02131.ogg"
    # char_sovy "If you want to take down The Triumvirate, you'll have to enter their chambers.\nI've never seen them leave, and I don't expect that they ever will.\nI always thought they were hiding, but I don't think that's true."
    voice "se/z02131.ogg"
    char_sovy "如果你想扳倒三人执政团，就必须进入他们的内殿。\n我从没见过他们离开那里，也不认为他们会有离开的一天。\n我一直以为他们是在躲藏，但我觉得并非如此。"

# game/script.rpy:147452
translate chinese map224_f098e053:

    # voice "se/z02132.ogg"
    # char_sovy "There's something at the back of their chambers. Something \"off\".\nIt's like a spirit idol, but the very sight of it fills me with fear.\nI'm not sure what it is, but I have a few theories about it."
    voice "se/z02132.ogg"
    char_sovy "他们内殿的深处有样东西。有些“不对劲”。\n它像是灵界灵像，但我光是看到它就满心恐惧。\n我不确定它是什么，但我有几个猜测。"

# game/script.rpy:147467
translate chinese map224_4a72889d:

    # "I'm shocked. He's actually telling the truth.{w}\nI've seen this \"idol\" in my visions of The Triumvirate.{w}\nCould it really be true? Is he doubting his Masters...?"
    "我震惊了。他居然说的是实话。{w}\n我在关于三人执政团的幻象里见过这座“灵像”。{w}\n这难道是真的？他是在怀疑他的主上吗……？"

# game/script.rpy:147492
translate chinese map224_e0bdb789:

    # voice "se/z02133.ogg"
    # char_sovy "I think that maybe it's their source of power.\nBut I'm probably wrong, as that seems to be the trend lately.\nEither way, its destruction should be your top priority."
    voice "se/z02133.ogg"
    char_sovy "我觉得那也许是他们力量的源泉。\n但我大概猜错了，最近似乎总是这样。\n不管怎样，摧毁它应该是你们的头等大事。"

# game/script.rpy:147507
translate chinese map224_ef6ecfe1:

    # "It lines up with what I was told in my visions.{w}\nBut I was unsure if those visions were tricks.{w}\nIn them, I was drawn toward this special \"idol\"."
    "这与我幻象中被告知的内容吻合。{w}\n但我当时不确定那些幻象是不是骗局。{w}\n在幻象里，我被这座特殊的“灵像”所吸引。"

# game/script.rpy:147532
translate chinese map224_e1ea5b26:

    # voice "se/z02134.ogg"
    # char_pro "A spirit idol in their own chambers...?\nBut those are conduits for The Monarchy.\nIt makes no sense that they'd keep one close by."
    voice "se/z02134.ogg"
    char_pro "在他们自己的内殿里放一座灵界灵像……？\n可那些是君主国的媒介。\n他们把它留在身边，这完全说不通。"

# game/script.rpy:147546
translate chinese map224_a3b3d741:

    # voice "se/z02135.ogg"
    # char_pro "Their main goal was to {i}destroy{/i} all of the idols.\nNice try, but I'm not going to believe any of this.\nLet's go, [firstname]. We'll ditch him in Mazeo."
    voice "se/z02135.ogg"
    char_pro "他们的主要目标就是{i}摧毁{/i}所有灵像。\n想得美，这些我一个字都不信。\n我们走，[firstname]。到马泽奥就把他甩掉。"

# game/script.rpy:147568
translate chinese map224_b914389e:

    # "Pro and Ulric start to leave, but I tell them to stop.{w}\nI let them know that Sovy's telling the truth. As odd as it sounded.{w}\nI saw the same idol in some visions I had of The Triumvirate's chambers."
    "普洛和乌尔里克正要离开，但我叫住了他们。{w}\n我告诉他们，索维说的是实话，尽管听起来很古怪。{w}\n在我关于三人执政团内殿的几次幻象中，我见过同一座灵像。"

# game/script.rpy:147593
translate chinese map224_f90ff967:

    # voice "se/z02136.ogg"
    voice "se/z02136.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:147595
translate chinese map224_cf121ce6:

    # char_ulric "Visions of The Triumvirate's chambers...?"
    char_ulric "三人执政团内殿的幻象……？"

# game/script.rpy:147608
translate chinese map224_f614974c:

    # voice "se/z02137.ogg"
    # char_pro "When were you going to tell us about this...?"
    voice "se/z02137.ogg"
    char_pro "你打算什么时候才告诉我们这些……？"

# game/script.rpy:147623
translate chinese map224_54fcb7e6:

    # "Sovy scoffs, clearly amused at their reactions."
    "索维嗤笑一声，显然被他们的反应逗乐了。"

# game/script.rpy:147648
translate chinese map224_e307ef1d:

    # voice "se/z02138.ogg"
    # char_sovy "I'm not finished yet."
    voice "se/z02138.ogg"
    char_sovy "我还没说完。"

# game/script.rpy:147670
translate chinese map224_156ca74e:

    # "Our attention is directed back toward him."
    "我们的注意力又回到了他身上。"

# game/script.rpy:147698
translate chinese map224_eaa0d577:

    # voice "se/z02139.ogg"
    # char_sovy "I suggest that your attack focuses on entering their chambers.\nThere, you could take down both them, and this \"dark idol\".\nHowever, you would have to fight your way through Halin."
    voice "se/z02139.ogg"
    char_sovy "我建议你们的进攻重点放在进入他们的内殿上。\n在那里，你们既能扳倒他们，也能摧毁这座“黑暗灵像”。\n但你们必须一路杀过哈林才行。"

# game/script.rpy:147715
translate chinese map224_cc80cb01:

    # voice "se/z02140.ogg"
    # char_sovy "And that's where my next piece of information comes in.\nHalin may seem just like you and I — but he's not.\nThe Triumvirate created him with that blade."
    voice "se/z02140.ogg"
    char_sovy "而这就是我下一条情报的由来。\n哈林看起来和你我没什么两样——但他不是。\n三人执政团用那把剑创造了他。"

# game/script.rpy:147730
translate chinese map224_c7d659a4:

    # "What...?"
    "什么……？"

# game/script.rpy:147745
translate chinese map224_8119547b:

    # voice "se/z02141.ogg"
    # char_sovy "He was made to be the perfect soldier.\nHe would always serve his Masters, no matter what.\nLittle did I know, that loyalty was stronger than our friendship."
    voice "se/z02141.ogg"
    char_sovy "他被造出来，就是要成为完美的士兵。\n无论发生什么，他都会效忠他的主上。\n我那时候并不知道，那份忠诚比我们的友谊还要牢固。"

# game/script.rpy:147749
translate chinese map224_ac582218:

    # voice "se/z02142.ogg"
    # char_sovy "He promised not to tell them what happened.\nBut the moment we got home, he sold me out immediately.\nHe lives under The Triumvirate's thrall. A {i}true{/i} mindless slave."
    voice "se/z02142.ogg"
    char_sovy "他答应过不告诉他们发生了什么。\n但我们一到家，他就立刻出卖了我。\n他活在三人执政团的奴役之下。一个{i}真正{/i}没有思想的奴隶。"

# game/script.rpy:147763
translate chinese map224_9288fa02:

    # voice "se/z02143.ogg"
    # char_sovy "You must never let them get their hands on that blade again.\nThey aren't limited to suits of armor. They've mastered it enough to create {i}life{/i}.\nOf course, their first test was Halin. They needed someone trustworthy enough to serve them."
    voice "se/z02143.ogg"
    char_sovy "你们绝不能让他们再次拿到那把剑。\n他们的造物不限于盔甲。他们已经精通到足以创造{i}生命{/i}。\n当然，他们的第一个试验品就是哈林。他们需要一个足够可靠的人来服侍他们。"

# game/script.rpy:147767
translate chinese map224_2794820c:

    # voice "se/z02144.ogg"
    # char_sovy "I think they did it to ensure that nobody else ran away.\nMy previous Master, the former Grand Inquisitor, defected.\nI trusted Halin, {i}and{/i} The Triumvirate. They all betrayed me."
    voice "se/z02144.ogg"
    char_sovy "我猜他们这么做，是为了确保再没有别人会逃走。\n我上一任师父，前任大审判官，叛逃了。\n我信任哈林，{i}也{/i}信任三人执政团。他们全都背叛了我。"

# game/script.rpy:147781
translate chinese map224_d2f2706a:

    # voice "se/z02145.ogg"
    # char_sovy "But there's your information. I'm sure it will help you out.\nA possible weakness, and the true nature of Halin.\nWith that blade, you could even give him freedom."
    voice "se/z02145.ogg"
    char_sovy "但这就是我给你们的情报。我相信它会帮上你们的忙。\n一个可能的弱点，以及哈林的真实本质。\n有了那把剑，你们甚至可以赐予他自由。"

# game/script.rpy:147785
translate chinese map224_e661af01:

    # voice "se/z02146.ogg"
    # char_sovy "It would release the spell that The Triumvirate has put on him.\nOf course, that's not how I'd like things to play out."
    voice "se/z02146.ogg"
    char_sovy "那会解除三人执政团施加在他身上的咒术。\n当然，我并不希望事情朝那个方向发展。"

# game/script.rpy:147800
translate chinese map224_fea91079:

    # "He smirks at me, and I can sense what he's about to say."
    "他朝我笑了笑，我能感觉到他接下来要说什么。"

# game/script.rpy:147825
translate chinese map224_f1f7864b:

    # voice "se/z02147.ogg"
    # char_sovy "I would prefer it if you let me kill him, [firstname].\nThat is all I ask for in return. I {i}won't{/i} get in your way.\nIf you grant me this, I would be further in your debt."
    voice "se/z02147.ogg"
    char_sovy "我更希望你能让我杀了他，[firstname]。\n这就是我索要的全部回报。我{i}不会{/i}妨碍你们。\n如果你答应我，我会欠你更多人情。"

# game/script.rpy:147840
translate chinese map224_8e9553ae:

    # "We all look at each other, slightly confused.{w}\nThe Triumvirate created Halin to be a perfect slave?{w}\nI guess it makes sense, especially if they dealt with defection."
    "我们面面相觑，有些困惑。{w}\n三人执政团为了造出完美的奴隶才创造了哈林？{w}\n我想这说得通，尤其是考虑到他们要对付叛逃问题。"

# game/script.rpy:147842
translate chinese map224_e3bc446d:

    # "But just what was this idol at the back of their chambers...?{w}\nAnd was destroying it really the best course of action?{w}\nI guess we wouldn't find out until the very end of things."
    "可他们内殿深处的那座灵像到底是什么……？{w}\n摧毁它真的是最好的做法吗？{w}\n我想我们得等到最后才能揭晓了。"

# game/script.rpy:147867
translate chinese map224_92ad0810:

    # voice "se/z02148.ogg"
    # char_sovy "So, do you trust me...?"
    voice "se/z02148.ogg"
    char_sovy "那么，你们信任我吗……？"

# game/script.rpy:147882
translate chinese map224_8d1a8148:

    # "We all nod reluctantly. These facts weren't revelations, but they helped.{w}\nIf I could free Halin, he might end up being a valuable asset.{w}\nHowever, the idol remained a true wild card in all of this."
    "我们都勉强点了点头。这些事实算不上新发现，但有帮助。{w}\n如果我能解放哈林，他也许会成为一个宝贵的战力。{w}\n然而，那座灵像始终是这一切中真正的变数。"

# game/script.rpy:147884
translate chinese map224_f2825e5b:

    # "If I ever got the chance to talk to The Triumvirate, I'd ask them.{w}\nBut something tells me, if we're face to face, it won't be civil.{w}\nAnd for all I know, it's just a trick. The idol could be a red herring."
    "要是我有机会跟三人执政团谈谈，我会问问他们。{w}\n但直觉告诉我，真到了面对面的时候，可不会是什么文明的对话。{w}\n而且说不定这根本就是个圈套。那座灵像也许只是障眼法。"

# game/script.rpy:147909
translate chinese map224_266367bd:

    # voice "se/z02149.ogg"
    # char_sovy "Good. Because there's {i}two{/i} more things to talk about.\nAnd now that I've earned your trust, you have {i}no{/i} reason to doubt them.\nI saved them for last, because, well — it involves dishonesty among your ranks."
    voice "se/z02149.ogg"
    char_sovy "很好。因为还有{i}两{/i}件事要谈。\n既然我已经赢得了你们的信任，你们就{i}没有{/i}理由怀疑它们了。\n我把它们留到最后，因为，嗯——这涉及到你们队伍里的不诚实行为。"

# game/script.rpy:147924
translate chinese map224_b2055688:

    # "It must be about that mole he mentioned...{w}\nI tell him to quit dancing around the subject, and tell me.{w}\nWe had a lot of planning to do for our final attack, and very little time."
    "一定是他提到过的那个内鬼……{w}\n我叫他别再绕圈子，直接告诉我。{w}\n我们为最后的进攻还有很多要筹划的，时间却很少。"

# game/script.rpy:147960
translate chinese map225_8dd1ead0:

    # voice "se/z02150.ogg"
    voice "se/z02150.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:147962
translate chinese map225_2ac38ac4:

    # char_sovy "Well then. Do {i}you{/i} two want to tell him, or should I...?"
    char_sovy "那好吧。{i}你们{/i}两个想自己告诉他，还是我来……？"

# game/script.rpy:147967
translate chinese map225_8462cd44:

    # voice "se/z02151.ogg"
    voice "se/z02151.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:147969
translate chinese map225_9b26c53b:

    # char_sovy "Well then. Do {i}you{/i} two want to tell her, or should I...?"
    char_sovy "那好吧。{i}你们{/i}两个想自己告诉她，还是我来……？"

# game/script.rpy:147985
translate chinese map225_1af2cb7d:

    # "Pro and Ulric shuffle in silence, clearly in a state of unease.{w}\nWhat was Sovy talking about...? There's no way Ulric and Pro were dishonest.{w}\nThey had served Damek and Salus for decades. They were easily the most trustworthy."
    "普洛和乌尔里克一言不发，局促地挪动着，显然很不安。{w}\n索维在说什么……？乌尔里克和普洛绝不可能不诚实。{w}\n他们为达梅克和萨卢斯效力了几十年。他们无疑是最值得信赖的人。"

# game/script.rpy:148010
translate chinese map225_d46733b3:

    # voice "se/z02152.ogg"
    voice "se/z02152.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:148012
translate chinese map225_152d605e:

    # char_ulric "I guess it's time. I'll go first."
    char_ulric "看来是时候了。我先说。"

# game/script.rpy:148026
translate chinese map225_a7d80a95:

    # "Ulric steps forward, taking a deep breath.{w}\nSovy watches with his signature smirk."
    "乌尔里克上前一步，深吸一口气。{w}\n索维带着他标志性的坏笑看着。"

# game/script.rpy:148041
translate chinese map225_08b8e9e0:

    # voice "se/z02153.ogg"
    # char_ulric "My allegiance is with The Rebellion, I can promise you that.\nBut that wasn't always the case. It's all in the past — ages ago.\nSovy is trying to harm our trust with ancient information, [firstname]."
    voice "se/z02153.ogg"
    char_ulric "我可以向你保证，我效忠的是反抗军。\n但并非一直如此。那都是过去的事了——很久很久以前。\n索维想用陈年旧事来破坏我们的信任，[firstname]。"

# game/script.rpy:148055
translate chinese map225_e4bb13b4:

    # voice "se/z02154.ogg"
    # char_ulric "I knew this was going to happen. \nHe'd earn your trust with a couple interesting facts, then attack.\nThis is subterfuge. My past has no bearing on my current loyalty."
    voice "se/z02154.ogg"
    char_ulric "我就知道会这样。\n他会用几个有趣的事实赢得你的信任，然后发动攻击。\n这是诡计。我的过去与我如今的忠诚毫无关系。"

# game/script.rpy:148059
translate chinese map225_25db1ce7:

    # voice "se/z02155.ogg"
    # char_ulric "But I knew this secret would come out sooner or later.\nThat's the {i}real{/i} reason I sided with Pro to cheat the coliseum.\nYou'd know my loyalty was with you — no matter what."
    voice "se/z02155.ogg"
    char_ulric "但我知道这个秘密迟早会暴露。\n这才是我和普洛联手在竞技场作弊的{i}真正{/i}原因。\n这样你就会知道，无论发生什么，我的忠诚都在你这边。"

# game/script.rpy:148077
translate chinese map225_39a80719:

    # "That much is true. He had no guarantee that I'd side with Vivien.{w}\nHe threw away his beliefs in order to help {i}me{/i} achieve his goal.{w}\nThat was proof enough of his loyalty. But I'm still a bit concerned."
    "这话没错。他无法保证我会站在薇薇安那边。{w}\n为了帮我{i}自己{/i}实现他的目标，他抛弃了自己的信念。{w}\n这已足够证明他的忠诚。但我还是有点担心。"

# game/script.rpy:148082
translate chinese map225_050d62fa:

    # "That much is true. He had no guarantee that I'd side with Vivien.{w}\nHe didn't have to, in the end — but he was willing to abandon his dreams.{w}\nThat was proof enough of his loyalty. But I was still a bit concerned."
    "这话没错。他无法保证我会站在薇薇安那边。{w}\n到头来他本不必如此——但他愿意抛弃自己的梦想。{w}\n这已足够证明他的忠诚。但我还是有点担心。"

# game/script.rpy:148108
translate chinese map225_d789ce6e:

    # voice "se/z02156.ogg"
    voice "se/z02156.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:148110
translate chinese map225_85f586ba:

    # char_sovy "Delaying, as always.\nHe's scared of you, [firstname].\nHe knows you might throw him away."
    char_sovy "一如既往地拖延。\n他怕你，[firstname]。\n他知道你可能会抛弃他。"

# game/script.rpy:148135
translate chinese map225_af14aec7:

    # voice "se/z02157.ogg"
    # char_ulric "No. [firstname] would never do that.\nNot after what I did for our cause in Alarinthia.\nSo go ahead, Sovy, watch your plan crumble and fall."
    voice "se/z02157.ogg"
    char_ulric "不。[firstname]绝不会那么做。\n尤其在我为我们在阿拉林西亚的事业做了那些事之后。\n所以尽管来吧，索维，看着你的计划土崩瓦解。"

# game/script.rpy:148150
translate chinese map225_9a75d0de:

    # "I notice a weight lift itself from my back.{w}\nThe blade disappears from my scabbard. Sovy is doing it again...!{w}\nHowever, much to my surprise — that's not what happens next."
    "我感觉到一股压力从背上卸下。{w}\n剑从我的剑鞘里消失了。索维又要故技重施……！{w}\n然而，出乎我意料的是——接下来发生的并非如此。"

# game/script.rpy:148152
translate chinese map225_cb4ad9e2:

    # "Ulric sighs, in both relief and fright, as the blade appears in his hands.{w}\nI take a few steps back, shocked. How in the world was this possible...!?"
    "剑出现在乌尔里克手中，他松了口气，却又满怀惊惧。{w}\n我震惊地后退了几步。这到底怎么可能……！？"

# game/script.rpy:148177
translate chinese map225_d232885e:

    # voice "se/z02158.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Grand Inquisitor Ulric...\nThat was lifetimes ago. Ancient history.\nHe's using a dead past to try and hurt us, [firstname]."
    voice "se/z02158.ogg"
    char_ulric "大审判官乌尔里克……\n那是好几辈子以前的事了。是古老的历史。\n他想用一个已死的过去来伤害我们，[firstname]。"

# game/script.rpy:148192
translate chinese map225_48f7ae1c:

    # "Ulric was a Grand Inquisitor...?{w}\nThen he must be the defector that Sovy mentioned.{w}\nThe pieces of all of this are starting to fall into place!"
    "乌尔里克曾是大审判官……？{w}\n那他一定就是索维提到的那个叛逃者。{w}\n这一切的拼图开始各归其位了！"

# game/script.rpy:148217
translate chinese map225_75d5db4e:

    # voice "se/z02159.ogg"
    # char_ulric "I realized that The Triumvirate was my true enemy.\nThat's when I decided to join The Rebellion.\nYou really thought this would work, Sovy...?"
    voice "se/z02159.ogg"
    char_ulric "我意识到三人执政团才是我真正的敌人。\n那时我决定加入反抗军。\n你真以为这招会奏效吗，索维……？"

# game/script.rpy:148243
translate chinese map225_f73fd33a:

    # voice "se/z02160.ogg"
    # char_sovy "I never said I was intending to hurt you.\nThis is merely information that might help you in Balteus.\nUlric has inside knowledge, [firstname] — and he can wield the blade."
    voice "se/z02160.ogg"
    char_sovy "我从没说过我打算伤害你。\n这只是一条或许能在巴尔泰乌斯帮到你们的情报。\n乌尔里克掌握着内部情报，[firstname]——而且他能使用剑。"

# game/script.rpy:148247
translate chinese map225_f8065df3:

    # voice "se/z02161.ogg"
    # char_sovy "It's your choice if you let this information hurt you.\nBut in your situation, I would be relieved to know.\nNow, there's no need to keep anymore secrets."
    voice "se/z02161.ogg"
    char_sovy "是否让这条情报伤到你，取决于你。\n但换作是我处在你这种境地，知道这些反而会松一口气。\n现在，没必要再保留任何秘密了。"

# game/script.rpy:148273
translate chinese map225_b91ce82f:

    # voice "se/z02162.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Hmph."
    voice "se/z02162.ogg"
    char_ulric "哼。"

# game/script.rpy:148288
translate chinese map225_7b4f45db:

    # "I'm so confused right now. Was Sovy helping us, or trying to hurt us?{w}\nI can see how he might think that Ulric's past would harm our trust.{w}\nBut I can also see how sharing this information would help us out."
    "我现在糊涂极了。索维是在帮我们，还是想害我们？{w}\n我能理解他为什么会觉得乌尔里克的过去会损害我们的信任。{w}\n但我也能看出，分享这条情报会帮到我们。"

# game/script.rpy:148290
translate chinese map225_6210f7d7:

    # "Furthermore, the way Ulric handled this situation was extremely professional.{w}\nUnder any other circumstances, I might have taken this information badly.{w}\nBut he's right. It's in the past. He's gone on to prove his loyalty to me."
    "而且，乌尔里克把这件事处理得非常沉稳老练。{w}\n换作其他任何情况，我可能会对这条情报反应激烈。{w}\n但他说得对。那都是过去的事了。他已经用行动证明了对我的忠诚。"

# game/script.rpy:148292
translate chinese map225_00104fb5:

    # "The happenings in Alarinthia finally make full sense to me.{w}\nHe was securing my trust for when this secret came to light.{w}\nGenius, really. I'd have to deal with him more later on, though."
    "阿拉林西亚发生的一切终于让我完全明白了。{w}\n他是在为这个秘密曝光的那一天预先赢得我的信任。{w}\n真是天才。不过，我以后得跟他多打交道了。"

# game/script.rpy:148294
translate chinese map225_d1a5d2b4:

    # "This conversation had potential to explode, and I'm glad that it didn't.{w}\nI know Ulric's real plan, but Pro still remains a wild card. What was he after...?{w}\nI turn to face him, and he takes that as a signal that it's his turn to talk."
    "这场谈话本有可能一触即发，幸好没有。{w}\n我明白了乌尔里克的真实打算，但普洛仍是个未知数。他想要什么……？{w}\n我转向他，他把这当作轮到他开口的信号。"

# game/script.rpy:148303
translate chinese map225_c44c90ae:

    # "Ulric passes the blade back to me, and I place it in the scabbard.{w}\nPro looks worried. Perhaps his secret was worse than Ulric's...?"
    "乌尔里克把剑递还给我，我将其插回剑鞘。{w}\n普洛看起来很担忧。也许他的秘密比乌尔里克的更糟糕……？"

# game/script.rpy:148330
translate chinese map225_b05859e1:

    # voice "se/z02163.ogg"
    voice "se/z02163.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:148332
translate chinese map225_a9df88ce:

    # char_sovy "Go on. Tell [firstname], Pro.\nIt's time for him to know, don't you think?"
    char_sovy "说吧。告诉[firstname]，普洛。\n是时候让他知道了，你不觉得吗？"

# game/script.rpy:148337
translate chinese map225_5017af14:

    # voice "se/z02164.ogg"
    voice "se/z02164.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:148339
translate chinese map225_14b95cd2:

    # char_sovy "Go on. Tell [firstname], Pro.\nIt's time for her to know, don't you think?"
    char_sovy "说吧。告诉[firstname]，普洛。\n是时候让她知道了，你不觉得吗？"

# game/script.rpy:148355
translate chinese map225_1d209fa3:

    # "He gulps before speaking."
    "他咽了口唾沫，才开口。"

# game/script.rpy:148380
translate chinese map225_bef9f757:

    # voice "se/z02165.ogg"
    voice "se/z02165.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:148382
translate chinese map225_6b1fd1f8:

    # char_pro "So I guess I'll start from the beginning. My parents abandoned me.\nThey didn't die in the occupation, like I tell everybody.\nI've always wanted to know one thing — \"why\"...?"
    char_pro "那我就从头说起吧。我的父母抛弃了我。\n他们不像我跟所有人说的那样，死在占领时期。\n我一直想知道一件事——“为什么”……？"

# game/script.rpy:148395
translate chinese map225_c444721f:

    # voice "se/z02166.ogg"
    # char_pro "None of my searches gave me any useful information.\nSo, over time, I grew more and more desperate.\nOne day — The Triumvirate reached out to me."
    voice "se/z02166.ogg"
    char_pro "我的所有搜寻都没能给我任何有用的信息。\n于是，随着时间推移，我变得越来越绝望。\n有一天——三人执政团主动联系了我。"

# game/script.rpy:148410
translate chinese map225_ce160442:

    # "He looks down, ashamed."
    "他低下头，满脸羞愧。"

# game/script.rpy:148435
translate chinese map225_596982b3:

    # voice "se/z02167.ogg"
    # char_pro "They said they knew the truth about my parents.\nBut in exchange, they wanted me to give them information.\nDetails about The Rebellion. It seemed like a harmless exchange."
    voice "se/z02167.ogg"
    char_pro "他们说他们知道我父母的事真相。\n但作为交换，他们要我把情报交给他们。\n关于反抗军的细节。这看起来像是一场无害的交易。"

# game/script.rpy:148450
translate chinese map225_27737b48:

    # "Pro was the mole..."
    "普洛就是那个内鬼……"

# game/script.rpy:148475
translate chinese map225_3fcaeae7:

    # voice "se/z02168.ogg"
    # char_pro "But over time, they started to ask for more and more.\nI gave them so many secrets, but got nothing in return.\nIt wasn't much longer before I quit. I had enough of their lies."
    voice "se/z02168.ogg"
    char_pro "但时间一长，他们开始索取越来越多。\n我给了他们那么多秘密，却什么回报都没得到。\n没过多久我就退出了。我受够了他们的谎言。"

# game/script.rpy:148501
translate chinese map225_2995c3cf:

    # voice "se/z02169.ogg"
    # char_sovy "But the damage was already done, wasn't it...?"
    voice "se/z02169.ogg"
    char_sovy "但伤害已经造成了，不是吗……？"

# game/script.rpy:148527
translate chinese map225_87ad5295:

    # voice "se/z02170.ogg"
    # char_pro "Yeah..."
    voice "se/z02170.ogg"
    char_pro "是啊……"

# game/script.rpy:148543
translate chinese map225_44843c8b:

    # voice "se/z02171.ogg"
    # char_sovy "What was the last thing you leaked to them, Pro?"
    voice "se/z02171.ogg"
    char_sovy "你最后泄露给他们的是什么，普洛？"

# game/script.rpy:148569
translate chinese map225_811fb628:

    # voice "se/z02172.ogg"
    # char_pro "The location of our new HQ. The tunnels.\nIt was a good hideout. Right under their noses.\nThey'd never find it, unless somebody told them."
    voice "se/z02172.ogg"
    char_pro "我们新总部的所在地。那些地道。\n那是个很好的藏身处。就在他们眼皮底下。\n除非有人告诉他们，否则他们永远找不到。"

# game/script.rpy:148584
translate chinese map225_d748ea45:

    # "I'm shocked to my core.{w}\nIf Pro leaked our location, then that means..."
    "我震惊到了骨子里。{w}\n如果普洛泄露了我们的位置，那就意味着……"

# game/script.rpy:148609
translate chinese map225_e0d517b5:

    # voice "se/z02173.ogg"
    # char_sovy "That's right. Pro is responsible.\nHis leak enabled us to attack you in Mazeo.\nAll of those lives. The blood is on {i}his{/i} hands."
    voice "se/z02173.ogg"
    char_sovy "没错。普洛难辞其咎。\n正是他的泄露让我们得以在马泽奥袭击你们。\n那些逝去的生命。血都沾在{i}他{/i}手上。"

# game/script.rpy:148625
translate chinese map225_15421b22:

    # voice "se/z02174.ogg"
    # char_pro "No...! Like I said, I quit!\nThey lied to me. They knew {i}nothing{/i} about my parents.\nAll they wanted was somebody gullible enough to serve them."
    voice "se/z02174.ogg"
    char_pro "不……！我说过了，我退出了！\n他们骗了我。他们对我的父母{i}一无所知{/i}。\n他们只是想要一个足够轻信的人来替他们卖命。"

# game/script.rpy:148651
translate chinese map225_96a6756b:

    # voice "se/z02175.ogg"
    # char_sovy "It doesn't change what happened, Pro.\nNow, Monarch — how do you take this...?"
    voice "se/z02175.ogg"
    char_sovy "这改变不了已经发生的事，普洛。\n那么，君主——你对此怎么看……？"

# game/script.rpy:148667
translate chinese map225_13ba4204:

    # voice "se/z02176.ogg"
    # char_pro "Hey, I proved my loyalty — just like Ulric!\nI put my life on the line to serve The Rebellion.\nThere was no guarantee we'd survive the coliseum!"
    voice "se/z02176.ogg"
    char_pro "嘿，我证明了我的忠诚——就像乌尔里克一样！\n我冒着生命危险为反抗军效力。\n我们在竞技场里可没有活下来的保证！"

# game/script.rpy:148682
translate chinese map225_01c8c1de:

    # "That much was true. I knew everything was too good to be true.{w}\nThe {i}real{/i} reasons they did what they did, were all self-serving.{w}\nIt was so they could defend themselves as they were exposed."
    "这话没错。我早就知道一切都好得不像是真的。{w}\n他们那么做的{i}真正{/i}原因，全都是为了自己。{w}\n是为了在真相败露时能为自己辩解。"

# game/script.rpy:148684
translate chinese map225_84bce8dd:

    # "With an ulterior motive like that, were they really trustworthy...?{w}\nUlric's past was easy to forgive. But what Pro did to all of us?{w}\nI have no idea how to react. Sovy was fighting a war on my mind."
    "怀着这样的私心，他们真的值得信赖吗……？{w}\n乌尔里克的过去容易原谅。可普洛对我们所有人做的事呢？{w}\n我完全不知道该如何反应。索维正在我的脑海中打一场仗。"

# game/script.rpy:148709
translate chinese map225_6ca0f110:

    # voice "se/z02177.ogg"
    # char_pro "Look — I made up for what I did...!\nAll those lives we lost? We got them back, and more!\nOur Alarinthian allies will help us win this war. Hands down."
    voice "se/z02177.ogg"
    char_pro "听着——我已经弥补了我做过的事……！\n我们失去的那些人手？如今都补回来了，而且还多了不少！\n我们的阿拉林西亚盟友会帮我们赢得这场战争。毫无疑问。"

# game/script.rpy:148724
translate chinese map225_dfc58a11:

    # "I nod, acknowledging his point.{w}\nBut I need more time to think about this.{w}\nIf they had secrets, did my other comrades, too?"
    "我点点头，承认他说得有道理。{w}\n但我需要更多时间来考虑这件事。{w}\n如果他们都有秘密，那我其他的同伴是不是也一样？"

# game/script.rpy:148726
translate chinese map225_28c6c14d:

    # "I'm starting to doubt the loyalty of everybody around me.{w}\nI need to stop...! That's probably what Sovy wants me to do.{w}\nI'd need to ensure everyone's loyalty before we leave to Balteus."
    "我开始怀疑身边每个人的忠诚。{w}\n我得停下……！这大概正是索维希望我做的。{w}\n在出发去巴尔泰乌斯之前，我得确保每个人的忠诚。"

# game/script.rpy:148728
translate chinese map225_747f0fe5:

    # "Ulric was the previous Grand Inquisitor...?{w}\nPro was a mole, responsible for the attack in Mazeo...?{w}\nHow was I supposed to deal with this, {i}right{/i} before the final battle?"
    "乌尔里克是前任大审判官……？{w}\n普洛是内鬼，该为马泽奥的袭击负责……？{w}\n就在决战{i}前夕{/i}，我该如何应对这一切？"

# game/script.rpy:148730
translate chinese map225_a3fbde10:

    # "I ask Ulric and Pro to leave me alone with Sovy.{w}\nWe'd get some rest, and meet on the deck in the morning.{w}\nOne big gathering before we arrived in Mazeo would help."
    "我让乌尔里克和普洛留我和索维单独待着。{w}\n我们会稍作休息，明早在甲板上碰头。{w}\n在抵达马泽奥之前来一次大聚会会有帮助。"

# game/script.rpy:148739
translate chinese map225_51e902a1:

    # "I can see the worry on their faces. I tell them I'm not \"throwing them away\".{w}\nAs they leave, the worry is still there, however. Their secrets were finally out.{w}\nI don't know if anybody else knew — but I guess I was enough. I'm in charge."
    "我能看到他们脸上的忧虑。我告诉他们，我不会“抛弃他们”。{w}\n然而，他们离开时，忧虑依旧还在。他们的秘密终究是暴露了。{w}\n我不知道还有没有别人知情——但我想，只有我知道就够了。做主的是我。"

# game/script.rpy:148741
translate chinese map225_3924b39f:

    # "I turn back to Sovy, who crosses his arms."
    "我转回索维那边，他抱着双臂。"

# game/script.rpy:148766
translate chinese map225_42cb8e27:

    # voice "se/z02178.ogg"
    # char_sovy "So much dishonesty in the air, wouldn't you agree...?\nI want you to look at your comrades, and then look at me.\nUnlike them — I've been nothing but honest with you."
    voice "se/z02178.ogg"
    char_sovy "空气中弥漫着这么多谎言，你不觉得吗……？\n我要你看看你的同伴们，然后再看看我。\n和他们不同——我对你一直坦诚相待。"

# game/script.rpy:148770
translate chinese map225_ccb383a9:

    # voice "se/z02179.ogg"
    # char_sovy "I would rather have an honest enemy than a cheating friend.\nThat's part of why I wanted to talk with you, [firstname].\nI know that we can be open with one another."
    voice "se/z02179.ogg"
    char_sovy "我宁愿要一个诚实的敌人，也不要一个欺骗人的朋友。\n这也是我想跟你谈谈的原因之一，[firstname]。\n我知道我们之间可以开诚布公。"

# game/script.rpy:148785
translate chinese map225_d96ae171:

    # "I shake my head, unsure of how to respond.{w}\nI tell him that I need some rest. Some time alone.{w}\nSo much was happening all at once. I needed a break."
    "我摇了摇头，不知该如何回应。{w}\n我告诉他我需要休息。需要独处一会儿。{w}\n太多事一下子全都涌来了。我需要喘口气。"

# game/script.rpy:148810
translate chinese map225_e39119b3:

    # voice "se/z02180.ogg"
    # char_sovy "Very well. We're meeting on the deck come morning, then?\nI'll make sure to be on my best behavior. I respect you, Monarch.\nI always told myself that I'd serve the rightful rulers of this world."
    voice "se/z02180.ogg"
    char_sovy "好吧。那我们明早在甲板上见？\n我保证会表现得规规矩矩。我敬重你，君主。\n我一直告诉自己，要效忠于这个世界正当的统治者。"

# game/script.rpy:148814
translate chinese map225_41f32111:

    # voice "se/z02181.ogg"
    # char_sovy "It just seems like I was also lied to by The Triumvirate.\nJust like Ulric. Just like Pro. We're victims here — all of us.\nI may have realized it late, but was it {i}too{/i} late? I guess we'll see."
    voice "se/z02181.ogg"
    char_sovy "看来三人执政团也骗了我。\n就像乌尔里克一样。就像普洛一样。我们都是受害者——我们所有人。\n我或许醒悟得太晚，但会不会{i}太{/i}晚了？我想我们走着瞧吧。"

# game/script.rpy:148829
translate chinese map225_cdf1925d:

    # "His attitude seems to have changed now that we're alone.{w}\nAnd for the first time, I can sympathize with him. He's hurt, and lost.{w}\nJust like all of us. We're just trying to do what we believe is right."
    "既然只剩我们两个，他的态度似乎变了。{w}\n第一次，我对他生出了同情。他受了伤，也迷失了方向。{w}\n就像我们所有人一样。我们都只是在尽力做自己认为正确的事。"

# game/script.rpy:148831
translate chinese map225_0cb93257:

    # "I tell him that he's free to join us at the meeting in the morning.{w}\nBut everybody will be told who he is. It'll be up to them to decide how they take it.{w}\nIf the majority of my comrades want him gone, then we'll have to part ways in Mazeo."
    "我告诉他，他可以自由参加明早的会议。{w}\n但所有人都会知道他是谁。要怎么接受，就由他们自己决定。{w}\n如果我的大多数同伴希望他离开，那我们只能在马泽奥分道扬镳。"

# game/script.rpy:148856
translate chinese map225_83ac42c5:

    # voice "se/z02182.ogg"
    # char_sovy "Very well. It's only fair.\nHave a good rest, Monarch."
    voice "se/z02182.ogg"
    char_sovy "好吧。这才公平。\n好好休息，君主。"

# game/script.rpy:148871
translate chinese map225_603de056:

    # "He bows to me, as I turn to leave the cell.{w}\nI make sure it's locked tight. He'd be let out in the morning.{w}\nFor now, I needed to be alone with my thoughts. I needed to process everything."
    "我转身离开牢房时，他向我鞠了一躬。{w}\n我确认牢门锁得严严实实。明早会放他出来。{w}\n而现在，我需要独自理清思绪。我需要消化这一切。"

# game/script.rpy:148907
translate chinese map226_223178bc:

    # "I make my way back to my bed, and quickly collapse onto it.{w}\nThe weight of recent events weighs me down like a ton of bricks.{w}\nAt the end of the day — I didn't know who I could really trust. It's awful."
    "我回到自己的床边，一下子瘫倒在上面。{w}\n近来发生的事像千斤重担一样压着我。{w}\n说到底——我根本不知道自己能真正信任谁。这感觉糟透了。"

# game/script.rpy:148909
translate chinese map226_5d86b134:

    # "Ulric and Pro, two of our most trusted comrades, had dark secrets.{w}\nIt makes me wonder just what everyone else was hiding. Even Valessa and Fortaime.{w}\nWhen we got back to Mazeo, I'd need to ensure their loyalty before we attacked Balteus."
    "乌尔里克和普洛，我们最信任的两位同伴，竟藏着黑暗的秘密。{w}\n这让我不禁去想，其他所有人又隐藏着什么。连瓦莱莎和福泰姆也不例外。{w}\n等我们回到马泽奥，在进攻巴尔泰乌斯之前，我得确保他们的忠诚。"

# game/script.rpy:148911
translate chinese map226_ebe0c4e7:

    # "We couldn't embark on the biggest part of our journey with unresolved issues.{w}\nEverybody needed to be in tip-top shape. Not held down by anything at all.{w}\nAs big as Ulric and Pro's secrets were, it's information we didn't have before."
    "我们不能带着未解的隐患踏上旅途最重要的征程。{w}\n每个人都需要处于最佳状态。不被任何事情拖累。{w}\n无论乌尔里克和普洛的秘密多么重大，那也是我们此前所没有的情报。"

# game/script.rpy:148913
translate chinese map226_965f6649:

    # "Information we could use against our enemy, and against Balteus.{w}\nWe were too close to our goal to fall apart due to internal politics.{w}\nI drift off to sleep, and make my way to the deck in the morning."
    "可以用来对付我们的敌人、对付巴尔泰乌斯的情报。{w}\n我们离目标太近了，不能因为内部分歧而分崩离析。{w}\n我沉沉睡去，第二天早晨来到了甲板上。"

# game/script.rpy:148915
translate chinese map226_90e6e53a:

    # "It was time for everybody to know about Sovy.{w}\nThen, we'd have a final discussion about what comes next.{w}\nWe were ready to launch our attack. But what should we do...?"
    "是时候让所有人都知道索维的事了。{w}\n之后，我们会就下一步进行最后的讨论。{w}\n我们已经准备好发动进攻。但我们该怎么做呢……？"

# game/script.rpy:148941
translate chinese map227_60a694f0:

    # "Everybody is standing there, as if they were waiting for me to arrive.{w}\nThey all exchange glances with Sovy, and unease fills the air.{w}\nI don't blame them for being reserved right now. Not at all."
    "所有人都站在那里，仿佛在等我到来。{w}\n他们纷纷与索维交换眼神，空气中弥漫着不安。{w}\n我不怪他们此刻的拘谨。一点也不。"

# game/script.rpy:148943
translate chinese map227_feb10d69:

    # "They all turn to face me, so that's when I hand the floor to Sovy.{w}\nIf he wanted to help us out, he had to win over my entire crew.{w}\nThe choice was with me, but all of their input was important."
    "他们全都转向我，于是我把发言权交给了索维。{w}\n如果他想帮我们，就必须赢得我所有手下的认可。{w}\n决定权在我，但所有人的意见都很重要。"

# game/script.rpy:148945
translate chinese map227_67b8a625:

    # "All of us gather around in a sort of \"circle\".{w}\nThis means he can easily address all of us.{w}\nI'm curious what he has to say. A lot is on the line."
    "我们所有人围成某种“圆圈”聚在一起。{w}\n这样他就能方便地对我们所有人讲话。{w}\n我很好奇他要说什么。事关重大。"

# game/script.rpy:148970
translate chinese map227_799e20cc:

    # voice "se/z02183.ogg"
    voice "se/z02183.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:148972
translate chinese map227_49f7cd27:

    # char_sovy "My name is Sovy. I am — or was — The Grand Inquisitor.\nI no longer serve The Triumvirate. I was betrayed by my Apprentice.\nHe sold me out, forcing my Masters to place me in exile. They threw me away."
    char_sovy "我叫索维。我是——或者说曾是——大审判官。\n我不再效忠三人执政团了。我被我的学徒背叛了。\n他出卖了我，逼得我的主上把我流放。他们抛弃了我。"

# game/script.rpy:148985
translate chinese map227_0e65950f:

    # voice "se/z02184.ogg"
    # char_sovy "Everything they ever told me was a lie. I thought they were Alestia's rightful rulers.\nBut then I figured out that this wasn't true. The heir to the throne is [firstname].\nI am a victim of their tyranny. Just as you are. All of you. I hope you understand."
    voice "se/z02184.ogg"
    char_sovy "他们告诉我的一切都是谎言。我本以为他们是阿莱斯蒂亚正当的统治者。\n但后来我明白了，事实并非如此。王位的继承人是[firstname]。\n我是他们暴政的受害者。就像你们一样。你们所有人。希望你们能明白。"

# game/script.rpy:148989
translate chinese map227_184baad2:

    # voice "se/z02185.ogg"
    # char_sovy "I'm still at a loss. I don't really know what to do with myself.\nBut coming here, to meet with you, and [firstname], seemed like a good idea.\nLast night, I also revealed some information that could help your upcoming attack."
    voice "se/z02185.ogg"
    char_sovy "我仍茫然无措。我真不知道拿自己该怎么办。\n但来到这里，与你们和[firstname]见面，似乎是个好主意。\n昨晚，我还透露了一些能帮到你们即将到来的进攻的情报。"

# game/script.rpy:149003
translate chinese map227_3305db3c:

    # voice "se/z02186.ogg"
    # char_sovy "I just need to know that I {i}belong{/i} somewhere.\nAttacking The Triumvirate will involve taking down Halin.\nWe share a common purpose, at least until he's taken care of."
    voice "se/z02186.ogg"
    char_sovy "我只需要知道自己{i}属于{/i}某个地方。\n进攻三人执政团就意味着要扳倒哈林。\n我们有着共同的目标，至少在解决掉他之前是如此。"

# game/script.rpy:149007
translate chinese map227_de8c6d22:

    # voice "se/z02187.ogg"
    # char_sovy "After that? I really don't know.\nI've always pledged my loyalty to the rightful ruler of Alestia.\nLogic would dictate that I now serve The Monarch. But I don't know."
    voice "se/z02187.ogg"
    char_sovy "那之后呢？我真的不知道。\n我一直都向阿莱斯蒂亚正当的统治者宣誓效忠。\n照理说，我现在该效忠君主。但我不知道。"

# game/script.rpy:149021
translate chinese map227_5eb6d943:

    # voice "se/z02188.ogg"
    # char_sovy "The Triumvirate can throw people away at the snap of a finger.\nBut I'm not like that. What they did was hurt me almost beyond repair.\nI will help you attack Balteus, and take down Halin. You have my word."
    voice "se/z02188.ogg"
    char_sovy "三人执政团弹指之间就能抛弃一个人。\n但我不是那样的人。他们的所作所为几乎把我伤得无法复原。\n我会帮你们进攻巴尔泰乌斯，扳倒哈林。我向你们保证。"

# game/script.rpy:149025
translate chinese map227_48b8c47a:

    # voice "se/z02189.ogg"
    # char_sovy "But after that, I don't know what will happen.\nIn that sense, I am both an asset and a liability.\nIf you want me to leave — then that's what I'll do."
    voice "se/z02189.ogg"
    char_sovy "但那之后，我不知道会发生什么。\n从这个意义上说，我既是助力，也是隐患。\n如果你想让我离开——那我就离开。"

# game/script.rpy:149039
translate chinese map227_6d9db470:

    # voice "se/z02190.ogg"
    # char_sovy "When we get to Mazeo, you'll never see me again.\nThat is, unless, you want my help. I can offer valuable intel.\nIt's a gamble, for both you {i}and{/i} me. I don't fully trust you, either."
    voice "se/z02190.ogg"
    char_sovy "等我们到马泽奥，你们就再也见不到我了。\n除非你们想要我的帮助。我能提供有价值的情报。\n这是一场赌博，对你们{i}和{/i}我都是。我也不完全信任你们。"

# game/script.rpy:149055
translate chinese map227_60cd258d:

    # voice "se/z02191.ogg"
    voice "se/z02191.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:149057
translate chinese map227_38e120be:

    # char_sovy "But hopefully I've earned a sliver of trust with [firstname].\nIf he vouches for me, then hopfully you will as well. That is all.\nMy fate is in your hands. I have nothing more to say."
    char_sovy "但希望我已经赢得了[firstname]的一丝信任。\n如果他为我担保，那希望你们也会。就这些。\n我的命运掌握在你们手中。我没有别的要说了。"

# game/script.rpy:149062
translate chinese map227_c627a6aa:

    # voice "se/z02192.ogg"
    voice "se/z02192.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:149064
translate chinese map227_9c0943bf:

    # char_sovy "But hopefully I've earned a sliver of trust with [firstname].\nIf she vouches for me, then hopefully you will as well. That is all.\nMy fate is in your hands. I have nothing more to say."
    char_sovy "但希望我已经赢得了[firstname]的一丝信任。\n如果她为我担保，那希望你们也会。就这些。\n我的命运掌握在你们手中。我没有别的要说了。"

# game/script.rpy:149080
translate chinese map227_d51b42a7:

    # "He crosses his arms, waiting for our reply.{w}\nMy comrades are all shocked and confused, save for Pro and Ulric.{w}\nI ask them to step forward, one by one, and offer their thoughts on this."
    "他抱着双臂，等待我们的答复。{w}\n除了普洛和乌尔里克，我的同伴们都又惊又惑。{w}\n我让他们一个一个上前，说说自己的想法。"

# game/script.rpy:149082
translate chinese map227_0c7a1416:

    # "For once, I have the grasp on an entire situation.{w}\nThis is how things should be. Like Sovy said, I was the rightful ruler.{w}\nI couldn't have people being dishonest, and plotting behind my back."
    "这一次，我终于掌控了整个局面。{w}\n事情本该如此。就像索维说的，我是正当的统治者。{w}\n我不能容忍有人不诚实，在背后算计我。"

# game/script.rpy:149107
translate chinese map227_384afa9e:

    # voice "se/z02193.ogg"
    voice "se/z02193.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:149109
translate chinese map227_73ee6e00:

    # char_damek "I honestly didn't expect this. But nothing has been normal lately.\nI'm willing to give Sovy a chance. I did the same thing with Gryz.\nHis defection marked a turning point for our cause. A big one."
    char_damek "老实说，我没想到会这样。但最近也没什么正常的。\n我愿意给索维一个机会。我当初对格瑞兹也是如此。\n他的倒戈是我们事业的转折点。很重要的一次转折。"

# game/script.rpy:149112
translate chinese map227_695c3754:

    # voice "se/z02194.ogg"
    # char_damek "If he can help us out, then I think we need to accept it.\nAnd if he turns against us, then he's easily outnumbered.\nThe potential benefits outweigh the potential risks."
    voice "se/z02194.ogg"
    char_damek "如果他能帮到我们，那我觉得我们就该接受。\n而如果他背叛我们，他在人数上轻易就能被压制。\n潜在的收益大于潜在的风险。"

# game/script.rpy:149138
translate chinese map227_a205498f:

    # voice "se/z02195.ogg"
    # char_howl "This is clearly a trap. We request that you deny his assistance.\nHe's alone now, but he won't be when we arrive in Balteus.\nIf we give him information, he'll turn on us once we get there."
    voice "se/z02195.ogg"
    char_howl "这显然是个陷阱。我们请求你拒绝他的协助。\n他现在孤身一人，但等我们到巴尔泰乌斯时就不是了。\n如果我们把情报给他，一到那里他就会反咬我们一口。"

# game/script.rpy:149142
translate chinese map227_581be448:

    # voice "se/z02196.ogg"
    # char_howl "Surely we aren't the only one who thinks this way...?\nAn alliance with our enemy mere days before our attack?\nIt's too convenient. Sovy is playing us for a fool."
    voice "se/z02196.ogg"
    char_howl "我们肯定不是唯一这么想的吧……？\n在进攻前几天与敌人结盟？\n太巧了。索维是在把我们当傻子耍。"

# game/script.rpy:149168
translate chinese map227_aa01d9e6:

    # voice "se/z02197.ogg"
    # char_valessa "I'm with Howl on this one. We can't work with the enemy.\nThis is the man that killed you, and burned down Valinorth in your vision.\nI know it was a trick, but the man is the same. He's a trained killer."
    voice "se/z02197.ogg"
    char_valessa "这次我站豪尔这边。我们不能和敌人合作。\n在幻象里，就是这个人杀了你，烧毁了瓦利诺斯。\n我知道那是个骗局，但人还是同一个人。他是个训练有素的杀手。"

# game/script.rpy:149172
translate chinese map227_7dc07010:

    # voice "se/z02198.ogg"
    # char_valessa "For that reason, I can't accept his offer.\nFortaime, you're with me, right...?"
    voice "se/z02198.ogg"
    char_valessa "正因如此，我无法接受他的提议。\n福泰姆，你跟我一伙的，对吧……？"

# game/script.rpy:149198
translate chinese map227_36a4aff2:

    # voice "se/z02199.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "I don't know, Valessa. I think everybody deserves a second chance.\nWe all had that \"moment\" when we turned against The Triumvirate.\nWhy is it so hard to believe that Sovy might have that moment?"
    voice "se/z02199.ogg"
    char_fortaime "我不知道，瓦莱莎。我觉得每个人都该有第二次机会。\n我们都有过与三人执政团反目的那个“时刻”。\n为什么就这么难相信索维也可能有那个时刻呢？"

# game/script.rpy:149202
translate chinese map227_0a15979c:

    # voice "se/z02200.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "He worked so closely with them, he's seen their true nature.\nHe has more knowledge on them than anybody else in our army.\nIt makes sense that he'd come to the same realization as us."
    voice "se/z02200.ogg"
    char_fortaime "他曾与他们共事得如此密切，见识过他们的真正本性。\n他对他们的了解比我们军队里任何人都多。\n他会和我们一样得出相同结论，这很合理。"

# game/script.rpy:149206
translate chinese map227_cee85b9b:

    # voice "se/z02201.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "I mean sure, it took a while longer. But that's because he {i}served{/i} them.\nWhen you remove the excuse of \"loyalty\", it can become pretty clear.\nThat's why he didn't fully realize things until they put him in exile."
    voice "se/z02201.ogg"
    char_fortaime "我是说，确实花了更长时间。但那是因为他曾在{i}效忠{/i}他们。\n当你抛开“忠诚”这个借口，一切就会变得相当清楚。\n所以直到他们把他流放，他才彻底看清了真相。"

# game/script.rpy:149232
translate chinese map227_d343302d:

    # voice "se/z02202.ogg"
    # char_pro "Yeah, I'm with Fortaime...! Everybody deserves a second chance.\nWe've all been there before. We've all made a wrong decision or two.\nAnd there's no better way to make up for it than doing the right thing."
    voice "se/z02202.ogg"
    char_pro "对，我站福泰姆这边……！每个人都该有第二次机会。\n我们都经历过那种时候。我们都做过一两次错误的决定。\n而弥补它的最好方式，莫过于去做正确的事。"

# game/script.rpy:149258
translate chinese map227_de0db6e4:

    # voice "se/z02203.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Sovy isn't concerned with doing the \"right thing\".\nHe's a liar, plain and simple. There's no way we can trust him.\nHe'd turn on us the moment we arrived in Balteus. That's a guarantee."
    voice "se/z02203.ogg"
    char_ulric "索维根本不在乎做“正确的事”。\n他是个骗子，就这么简单。我们绝不可能信任他。\n我们一到巴尔泰乌斯，他就会反咬我们。这是板上钉钉的。"

# game/script.rpy:149262
translate chinese map227_646a0138:

    # voice "se/z02204.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Letting him close to us now would only enable him to gather information.\nIf he knows our strategy, he can counter is with The Inquisition when we arrive.\nIt's a death sentence, [firstname]. Don't be foolish. We've come too far to risk this."
    voice "se/z02204.ogg"
    char_ulric "现在让他靠近我们，只会让他得以收集情报。\n如果他知道我们的战略，等我们抵达时，他就能协同审判庭反制我们。\n这是死路一条，[firstname]。别犯傻。我们走到这一步太不容易，不能冒这个险。"

# game/script.rpy:149291
translate chinese map227_db5bb02a:

    # "It seems like my comrades are divided, but with good reason.{w}\nI was hoping for something more unanimous, in any given direction.{w}\nIt was clear that now the pressure, and final decision, rested on my shoulders."
    "我的同伴们似乎分成了两派，但都有各自的道理。{w}\n我本希望无论哪个方向，大家都能更一致一些。{w}\n显然，现在压力和最终决定都压在了我的肩上。"

# game/script.rpy:149318
translate chinese map227_73ba23d5:

    # voice "se/z02205.ogg"
    voice "se/z02205.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:149321
translate chinese map227_5ff5d204:

    # char_sovy "Well, [firstname]...?" nointeract
    char_sovy "那么，[firstname]……？" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:149344
translate chinese map227_676fb92b:

    # "It was a risk that I was willing to take, for our cause.{w}\nThe information he could offer us would make us so much stronger.{w}\nIf we got suspicious of him before the attack, we could easily outnumber him."
    "为了我们的事业，我愿意冒这个险。{w}\n他能提供的情报会让我们强大得多。{w}\n如果我们在进攻前对他起疑，我们能轻易压制他。"

# game/script.rpy:149367
translate chinese map227_f57a6c05:

    # "There was no way that I could take such a risk.{w}\nIf he turned against us, he could destroy our entire cause.{w}\nIt was too risky. If his exile was even real, he'd be stuck with it."
    "我不可能冒这样的险。{w}\n如果他背叛我们，他可能毁掉我们整个事业。{w}\n太冒险了。就算他的流放是真的，那也只能由他自己承受。"

# game/script.rpy:149383
translate chinese map227_7f625d2f:

    # voice "se/z02206.ogg"
    voice "se/z02206.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:149385
translate chinese map227_05c12b0f:

    # char_sovy "Very well."
    char_sovy "好吧。"

# game/script.rpy:149406
translate chinese map227_c6ad8ec7:

    # "He takes a few steps back, and rests against the edge of the boat.{w}\nA few minutes later, after everything is said and done, we arrive in Mazeo.{w}\nThe docking process is short, since our Pirate allies are masters of the art."
    "他后退几步，靠在船舷上。{w}\n几分钟后，一切尘埃落定，我们抵达了马泽奥。{w}\n靠岸过程很短暂，因为我们的海盗盟友是此道高手。"

# game/script.rpy:149411
translate chinese map227_06d0b051:

    # "Damek steps forward, filling in the silence that overtook our ranks."
    "达梅克上前一步，打破了笼罩在我们队伍中的沉默。"

# game/script.rpy:149436
translate chinese map227_597dd247:

    # voice "se/z02207.ogg"
    voice "se/z02207.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:149438
translate chinese map227_48f6d348:

    # char_damek "Well, this is it — we're ready to attack Balteus.\nEverything we've ever wanted, is finally within our grasp.\nThe voyage will take a day or two, so we can plan on the way."
    char_damek "好了，就是这样——我们准备好进攻巴尔泰乌斯了。\n我们一直渴望的一切，终于近在咫尺。\n航程要一两天，我们可以在路上筹划。"

# game/script.rpy:149441
translate chinese map227_33888d4a:

    # voice "se/z02208.ogg"
    # char_damek "For now, we need ensure that we leave {i}no{/i} stone unturned.\nVisit with your loved ones, say your goodbyes — because this is it.\nOnce we leave for Balteus, our fates are as good as sealed."
    voice "se/z02208.ogg"
    char_damek "眼下，我们要确保{i}不{/i}留下任何遗漏。\n去看看你们所爱的人，道别吧——因为就是现在了。\n一旦我们出发前往巴尔泰乌斯，我们的命运就几乎已成定局。"

# game/script.rpy:149447
translate chinese map227_05d38a34:

    # "Howl steps forward, filling in the silence that overtook our ranks."
    "豪尔上前一步，打破了笼罩在我们队伍中的沉默。"

# game/script.rpy:149472
translate chinese map227_373cd299:

    # voice "se/z02209.ogg"
    voice "se/z02209.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:149474
translate chinese map227_dc59dd01:

    # char_howl "Finally, we're ready to attack Balteus.\nThe liberation of Alestia is at least within our reach.\nBalteus is a few days away by sea, so we can plan on the way."
    char_howl "终于，我们准备好进攻巴尔泰乌斯了。\n阿莱斯蒂亚的解放至少已触手可及。\n走海路到巴尔泰乌斯要几天，我们可以在路上筹划。"

# game/script.rpy:149477
translate chinese map227_440ce4c9:

    # voice "se/z02210.ogg"
    # char_howl "Right now, the preparation you must focus on is that of a goodbye.\nSpend time with your friends, your loved ones — because this is the end.\nOnce we set sail for Balteus, we may never come back. A hard fact to face."
    voice "se/z02210.ogg"
    char_howl "眼下你必须专注准备的，是一场告别。\n去陪陪你的朋友、你爱的人——因为这就是终局了。\n一旦我们起航前往巴尔泰乌斯，或许就再也回不来了。这是难以面对的事实。"

# game/script.rpy:149499
translate chinese map227_c20d7f8a:

    # "His words are true, but fill the air with tension.{w}\nThe dawn of our final battle was here, and we needed to prepare.{w}\nBut planning the attack was easy. Our true task was accepting our possible death."
    "他的话不假，却让空气里充满紧张。{w}\n决战的黎明已经到来，我们必须做好准备。{w}\n但筹划进攻是容易的。真正艰难的任务，是接受自己可能战死。"

# game/script.rpy:149501
translate chinese map227_58ffeb83:

    # "This means saying goodbye, and spending a final day or two with our friends.{w}\nI should use this opportunity to make sure everybody is prepared for the final battle.{w}\nAs the leader, it was my job to ensure that we were all up to the task. No matter what."
    "这意味着道别，意味着和朋友们度过最后的一两天。{w}\n我该利用这个机会，确保每个人都为决战做好了准备。{w}\n作为领袖，我的职责就是确保我们都能胜任这项任务。无论如何。"

# game/script.rpy:149526
translate chinese map227_521f3b50:

    # voice "se/z02211.ogg"
    voice "se/z02211.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:149528
translate chinese map227_55f18d65:

    # char_damek "I don't think there's anything left to say.\nFinish up your business, and we'll set sail when [firstname] demands it.\nAct under the assumption that you only have one or two days before departure."
    char_damek "我想没什么好说的了。\n把你的私事处理完，等[firstname]下令我们就起航。\n请按只剩一两天就要出发来安排。"

# game/script.rpy:149531
translate chinese map227_3bb2403a:

    # voice "se/z02212.ogg"
    # char_damek "I don't want to rush anything as important as a goodbye, but...\nEvery moment we waste is a moment for our enemy to prepare.\nI trust that we'll find a happy medium, and embark without regret."
    voice "se/z02212.ogg"
    char_damek "我不想催促任何像告别这样重要的事，但是……\n我们浪费的每一刻，都是敌人用来准备的一刻。\n我相信我们会找到折中的办法，不留遗憾地启程。"

# game/script.rpy:149546
translate chinese map227_502fca02:

    # "Everybody nods, agreeing with his words.{w}\nI can't believe that the time was finally here.{w}\nUntil now, it seemed like a dream, out of reach."
    "所有人都点头，赞同他的话。{w}\n我不敢相信这一刻终于到来了。{w}\n在那之前，它就像一个遥不可及的梦。"

# game/script.rpy:149558
translate chinese map227_1393127f:

    # "But it's right in front of me. This is it.{w}\nOur journey was in its final hours. I tense up with worry.{w}\nWe make our way off the boat, embracing what little time we had left."
    "但它就在我眼前。就是现在了。{w}\n我们的旅程进入了最后的时刻。我紧张得绷紧了神经。{w}\n我们走下船，拥抱我们所剩无几的时光。"

# game/script.rpy:149566
translate chinese map227_90ad5d77:

    # "Loyalty scenes are now available for the six main party members.{w}\nHowl has a fourth Heart-to-Heart that is hidden in one of the previous areas.{w}\nLoyalty scenes can be accessed by clicking the character icon on the War Table."
    "六名主要队员的忠诚剧情现已开放。{w}\n豪尔还有一场隐藏在前述某个区域里的第四次心灵对话。{w}\n点击作战桌上的角色图标即可进入忠诚剧情。"

# game/script.rpy:149568
translate chinese map227_b1549978:

    # "Fast Travel has now been unlocked, allowing easy navigation through Alestia.{w}\nA new blue icon has appeared in the top left of areas. Click it to move to the World Map.{w}\nThe World Map allows for easy navigation between every other map in the game."
    "快速旅行现已解锁，可轻松穿梭阿莱斯蒂亚。{w}\n各区域左上角出现了新的蓝色图标。点击它即可前往世界地图。{w}\n世界地图可让你在游戏中的其他所有地图间轻松移动。"

# game/script.rpy:149570
translate chinese map227_4e1aae87:

    # "The World Map is also how you will launch your final attack on Balteus.{w}\nClicking the Balteus map icon will give you the choice of entering Act Five.{w}\nHowever, it is best to do this only once you're satisfied with the content you've done."
    "世界地图也是你发动对巴尔泰乌斯最终进攻的方式。{w}\n点击巴尔泰乌斯的地图图标，你将可以选择进入第五幕。{w}\n不过，最好等你对已完成的内容满意之后再这么做。"

# game/script.rpy:149575
translate chinese map227_8b8b03c1:

    # "Sovy has now permanently joined your party.{w}\nA series of Heart-to-Hearts has been hidden all over Alestia.{w}\nA loyalty scene has been added, accessed like normal from the War Table."
    "索维现已永久加入你的队伍。{w}\n一系列心灵对话已隐藏在阿莱斯蒂亚各处。{w}\n新增了一场忠诚剧情，照常从作战桌进入。"

# game/script.rpy:149987
translate chinese Valessa1_map077_3_0_b41c75c8:

    # char_valessa "Hey." nointeract
    char_valessa "嘿。" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:150004
translate chinese Valessa1_map077_3_0_8dda8f37:

    # voice "se/y00834.ogg"
    # char_valessa "It's interesting, to say the least.\nIt's a lot... busier than I thought it would be.\nIt makes Valinorth look dead by comparison."
    voice "se/y00834.ogg"
    char_valessa "至少可以说，这很有趣。\n比我预想的要……热闹得多。\n相比之下，瓦利诺斯简直死气沉沉。"

# game/script.rpy:150018
translate chinese Valessa1_map077_3_0_f939b759:

    # voice "se/y00835.ogg"
    # char_valessa "I'm actually longing for that peace again, though.\nThis place is chaotic, there's so much going on.\nHopefully The Rebel HQ will be a bit like home."
    voice "se/y00835.ogg"
    char_valessa "不过我其实已经开始怀念那份宁静了。\n这地方乱糟糟的，事情太多了。\n希望反抗军总部能有点像家的感觉。"

# game/script.rpy:150038
translate chinese Valessa1_map077_3_0_7863f57a:

    # voice "se/y00836.ogg"
    # char_valessa "He seems to know what he's doing.\nI mean, I had some doubts going into this, actually.\nBut he's proven himself to be a capable leader."
    voice "se/y00836.ogg"
    char_valessa "他似乎很懂自己在做什么。\n我是说，其实一开始我还有些怀疑。\n但他证明了自己是个有能力的领袖。"

# game/script.rpy:150052
translate chinese Valessa1_map077_3_0_cacb69b5:

    # voice "se/y00837.ogg"
    # char_valessa "I like how charismatic he is, you know?\nIt's a lot easier to follow somebody like that.\nSome people demand respect. He {i}earns{/i} it."
    voice "se/y00837.ogg"
    char_valessa "我喜欢他那种魅力，你懂吗？\n追随这样的人容易得多。\n有些人强求尊重。而他是{i}赢得{/i}尊重。"

# game/script.rpy:150072
translate chinese Valessa1_map077_3_0_53ae3c59:

    # voice "se/y00838.ogg"
    # char_valessa "To be honest, I'm actually not sure.\nHe seems nice, but I have my doubts.\nThere's just something about him, you know?"
    voice "se/y00838.ogg"
    char_valessa "说实话，我其实不太确定。\n他看起来人不错，但我有些疑虑。\n他身上就是有点说不清楚的东西，你懂吗？"

# game/script.rpy:150086
translate chinese Valessa1_map077_3_0_313e1710:

    # voice "se/y00839.ogg"
    # char_valessa "It doesn't help that he likes to cheat people.\nThat's probably it. He {i}is{/i} on our side, though.\nSo I doubt we have to worry about him cheating us."
    voice "se/y00839.ogg"
    char_valessa "他还喜欢骗人，这可没帮上忙。\n大概就是这个原因。不过，他{i}确实{/i}站在我们这边。\n所以我想，我们不用担心他骗我们。"

# game/script.rpy:150106
translate chinese Valessa1_map077_3_0_1dc0a1cc:

    # voice "se/y00840.ogg"
    # char_valessa "He's the strongest person I've ever met.\nI'm sure he'll be protecting us a lot in the future.\nI don't really have anything bad to say about him."
    voice "se/y00840.ogg"
    char_valessa "他是我见过最强的人。\n我相信以后他会经常保护我们。\n我实在没什么关于他的坏话可说。"

# game/script.rpy:150120
translate chinese Valessa1_map077_3_0_2b24ad24:

    # voice "se/y00841.ogg"
    # char_valessa "He can be stern, but he has the best intentions.\nI mean, he has no patience for wasting time.\nHim and Fortaime make an interesting combo."
    voice "se/y00841.ogg"
    char_valessa "他可能很严厉，但出发点是好的。\n我是说，他没耐心浪费时间。\n他和福泰姆是很有意思的组合。"

# game/script.rpy:150140
translate chinese Valessa1_map077_3_0_8205b9f7:

    # voice "se/y00842.ogg"
    # char_valessa "Pretty good, actually. I was worried.\nYou know, about some of the choices you had to make.\nWe've never really let them get between us, though."
    voice "se/y00842.ogg"
    char_valessa "其实挺好的。我原本很担心。\n你知道的，担心你不得不做出的一些选择。\n不过我们从来没让它们离间过我们。"

# game/script.rpy:150156
translate chinese Valessa1_map077_3_0_e008cc0a:

    # voice "se/y00843.ogg"
    voice "se/y00843.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:150158
translate chinese Valessa1_map077_3_0_996f6442:

    # char_valessa "Unless there's something he's not telling me. But I doubt it.\nHe's always been fully open with me in the past.\nI wouldn't worry about anything at all, [firstname]."
    char_valessa "除非他有什么事瞒着我。但我不这么认为。\n过去他一直对我完全坦率。\n我一点都不会担心，[firstname]。"

# game/script.rpy:150163
translate chinese Valessa1_map077_3_0_bd02cdea:

    # voice "se/y00844.ogg"
    voice "se/y00844.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:150165
translate chinese Valessa1_map077_3_0_996f6442_1:

    # char_valessa "Unless there's something he's not telling me. But I doubt it.\nHe's always been fully open with me in the past.\nI wouldn't worry about anything at all, [firstname]."
    char_valessa "除非他有什么事瞒着我。但我不这么认为。\n过去他一直对我完全坦率。\n我一点都不会担心，[firstname]。"

# game/script.rpy:150254
translate chinese click_map077_9_EV009_01831f66:

    # "There's a massive ship docked, surrounded by workers.{w}\nThey don't seem to be dressed as pirates though.{w}\nMust be part of the Mazeo Shipping Company."
    "一艘巨船停靠在码头，四周都是工人。{w}\n不过他们看起来并不像海盗打扮。{w}\n一定是马泽奥航运公司的人。"

# game/script.rpy:150257
translate chinese click_map077_9_EV009_f7d80319:

    # voice "se/a00222.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "Wow, that ship is so cool!\nWill our ships be like that, Damek?"
    voice "se/a00222.ogg"
    char_fortaime "哇，那艘船好酷！\n我们的船也会像那样吗，达梅克？"

# game/script.rpy:150261
translate chinese click_map077_9_EV009_c265a13a:

    # voice "se/a00223.ogg"
    # char_damek "Of course.\nWe have only the best.\nActually, ours might be better."
    voice "se/a00223.ogg"
    char_damek "当然。\n我们只用最好的。\n其实，我们的可能还要更好。"

# game/script.rpy:150265
translate chinese click_map077_9_EV009_478b358a:

    # voice "se/a00224.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "Why is that...?"
    voice "se/a00224.ogg"
    char_fortaime "为什么呢……？"

# game/script.rpy:150269
translate chinese click_map077_9_EV009_d9511032:

    # voice "se/a00225.ogg"
    # char_damek "Pirates put more care into their ships.\nThey don't just work on them, they {i}live{/i} on them.\nThe other people have homes to go back to."
    voice "se/a00225.ogg"
    char_damek "海盗对自己的船更用心。\n他们不只是在船上干活，他们{i}生活{/i}在船上。\n其他人还有家可回。"

# game/script.rpy:150273
translate chinese click_map077_9_EV009_00f21098:

    # voice "se/a00226.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "So pirates are homeless...?"
    voice "se/a00226.ogg"
    char_fortaime "所以海盗都无家可归……？"

# game/script.rpy:150277
translate chinese click_map077_9_EV009_ea5d1b00:

    # voice "se/a00227.ogg"
    # char_damek "Well, not exactly.\nA ship still counts as a home.\nThey just share it with their crew."
    voice "se/a00227.ogg"
    char_damek "嗯，也不尽然。\n船也算是一个家。\n只是他们得和船员共享。"

# game/script.rpy:150281
translate chinese click_map077_9_EV009_365392e9:

    # voice "se/a00228.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "Oh, I guess that makes sense.\nSo ours will be even fancier than that...?\nThat's pretty hard to imagine. I'm excited."
    voice "se/a00228.ogg"
    char_fortaime "哦，我想这说得通。\n那我们的船会比那还要气派……？\n那可真是难以想象。我好兴奋。"

# game/script.rpy:150285
translate chinese click_map077_9_EV009_f3c89f40:

    # voice "se/a00229.ogg"
    # char_damek "Yeah, just be {i}very{/i} careful.\nPirates are super protective of their homes.\nIf you broke something, well — let's not think about that."
    voice "se/a00229.ogg"
    char_damek "对，不过要{i}非常{/i}小心。\n海盗对自己的家可是保护得紧。\n要是你弄坏了什么，嗯——还是别想这个了。"

# game/script.rpy:150289
translate chinese click_map077_9_EV009_3cfab9e0:

    # voice "se/a00230.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "Yikes."
    voice "se/a00230.ogg"
    char_fortaime "哎呀。"

# game/script.rpy:150327
translate chinese click_map077_10_EV010_1a6e1cd5:

    # voice "se/a00235.ogg"
    voice "se/a00235.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:150329
translate chinese click_map077_10_EV010_0a8d9dd8:

    # char_valessa "What are these...?"
    char_valessa "这些是什么……？"

# game/script.rpy:150332
translate chinese click_map077_10_EV010_98a4a349:

    # voice "se/a00236.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Traps."
    voice "se/a00236.ogg"
    char_ulric "陷阱。"

# game/script.rpy:150336
translate chinese click_map077_10_EV010_d984b5fc:

    # voice "se/a00237.ogg"
    # char_valessa "Traps for what?"
    voice "se/a00237.ogg"
    char_valessa "抓什么的陷阱？"

# game/script.rpy:150340
translate chinese click_map077_10_EV010_342c7852:

    # voice "se/a00238.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Seafood. "
    voice "se/a00238.ogg"
    char_ulric "海鲜。"

# game/script.rpy:150344
translate chinese click_map077_10_EV010_70dc78fc:

    # voice "se/a00239.ogg"
    # char_valessa "Oh. We don't have that back in Valinorth.\nHow do these things work, exactly?"
    voice "se/a00239.ogg"
    char_valessa "哦。我们在瓦利诺斯没有这种东西。\n这些东西具体是怎么运作的？"

# game/script.rpy:150348
translate chinese click_map077_10_EV010_5e507723:

    # voice "se/a00240.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Well, these ones are mainly for lobster.\nIt traps them inside, and they're emptied out every day.\nOnce a week, they're sold off in the market square for food."
    voice "se/a00240.ogg"
    char_ulric "嗯，这些主要是用来捕龙虾的。\n它们把龙虾困在里面，每天清空一次。\n每周一次，拿到集市广场上卖掉当食物。"

# game/script.rpy:150352
translate chinese click_map077_10_EV010_5d15cf9a:

    # voice "se/a00241.ogg"
    # char_valessa "So you capture them only to eat them...?"
    voice "se/a00241.ogg"
    char_valessa "所以你们抓它们就是为了吃……？"

# game/script.rpy:150356
translate chinese click_map077_10_EV010_43b6e804:

    # voice "se/a00242.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Yeah."
    voice "se/a00242.ogg"
    char_ulric "对。"

# game/script.rpy:150360
translate chinese click_map077_10_EV010_4c3b06ba:

    # voice "se/a00243.ogg"
    # char_valessa "I don't know how I feel about that...\nThey're just minding their own business down there.\nWhy should we snatch them up and kill them just like that?"
    voice "se/a00243.ogg"
    char_valessa "我不知道该怎么看待这件事……\n它们在下面过着自己的日子，又没招惹谁。\n我们凭什么就这样把它们抓上来杀掉？"

# game/script.rpy:150364
translate chinese click_map077_10_EV010_629b35a6:

    # voice "se/a00244.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Because they taste good."
    voice "se/a00244.ogg"
    char_ulric "因为它们好吃。"

# game/script.rpy:150402
translate chinese click_map077_11_EV011_420f168f:

    # "There's a bunch of houses lining the docks. They look fancy.{w}\nWorkers come and go, telling me that it's a place of business.{w}\nNear the back, I notice that the houses are more run down."
    "码头边排着一列房屋，看起来很气派。{w}\n工人们来来往往，说明这里是做生意的地儿。{w}\n靠近后巷的地方，我注意到那些房子破败得多。"

# game/script.rpy:150404
translate chinese click_map077_11_EV011_feb8df80:

    # "Pirates move back and forth between these houses.{w}\nI guess society only left them the scraps to work with.{w}\nHopefully things would be better for them soon."
    "海盗们在这些房屋之间来回穿梭。{w}\n我猜社会只留给他们这些残破的地方。{w}\n希望他们的处境很快就会好起来。"

# game/script.rpy:150441
translate chinese click_map077_12_EV012_78d4f393:

    # "There's a massive bridge on the other side of the docks.{w}\nAccording to Damek, that's the bridge we'd be traversing.{w}\nAt the other end of the bridge, I can see an old building."
    "码头另一侧有一座巨大的桥。{w}\n据达梅克说，那就是我们要走的桥。{w}\n在桥的另一端，我能看见一栋老旧的建筑。"

# game/script.rpy:150444
translate chinese click_map077_12_EV012_c4bd2aa7:

    # voice "se/a00231.ogg"
    # char_damek "Looks pretty impressive, doesn't it?\nMazeo is largely above water, so bridges are common.\nBut there's a couple main bridges. Architectural wonders."
    voice "se/a00231.ogg"
    char_damek "看起来相当壮观，是吧？\n马泽奥大部分都在水面上，所以桥很常见。\n但有几座主桥。堪称建筑奇迹。"

# game/script.rpy:150450
translate chinese click_map077_12_EV012_e25ab419:

    # voice "se/a00232.ogg"
    voice "se/a00232.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:150452
translate chinese click_map077_12_EV012_9be8812f:

    # char_damek "We'll actually be crossing Mazeo's {i}biggest{/i} bridge.\nI hope you're not scared of heights, [firstname]."
    char_damek "我们会走过马泽奥{i}最大的{/i}那座桥。\n希望你不恐高，[firstname]。"

# game/script.rpy:150457
translate chinese click_map077_12_EV012_2fbd5d61:

    # voice "se/a00233.ogg"
    voice "se/a00233.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:150459
translate chinese click_map077_12_EV012_9be8812f_1:

    # char_damek "We'll actually be crossing Mazeo's {i}biggest{/i} bridge.\nI hope you're not scared of heights, [firstname]."
    char_damek "我们会走过马泽奥{i}最大的{/i}那座桥。\n希望你不恐高，[firstname]。"

# game/script.rpy:150463
translate chinese click_map077_12_EV012_1c0d181a:

    # "He smiles and motions toward the very bridge I was inspecting."
    "他微笑着，朝我正在打量的一座桥示意。"

# game/script.rpy:150466
translate chinese click_map077_12_EV012_65734a26:

    # voice "se/a00234.ogg"
    # char_damek "Our church is just on the other side.\nI can't wait for you to see it. It's amazing.\nJust stick close to me. It won't be too long."
    voice "se/a00234.ogg"
    char_damek "我们的教堂就在对岸。\n我迫不及待想让你看看。它非常棒。\n就跟紧我。不会用太久。"

# game/script.rpy:150554
translate chinese map112_f8f55f97:

    # "Sovy and his crew wandered the crowded docks of Mazeo.{w}\nThey stuck close together, to ensure that Shane didn't run away.{w}\nClose to The Rebellion's home, Sovy was sure it crossed his mind."
    "索维和他的手下在拥挤的马泽奥码头漫步。{w}\n他们紧紧靠在一起，确保肖恩没有逃走。{w}\n这里离反抗军的据点很近，索维确信他动过这个念头。"

