    char_sovy "不。一点也没有……"

# game/script.rpy:151074
translate chinese map151_6cd00f8b:

    # "I make my way to the ship, as Damek instructed.{w}\nEveryone is already gathered around. Am I late?{w}\nBefore long, I'm spotted by a few of my friends."
    "我按照达梅克的吩咐前往那艘船。{w}\n所有人都已经聚在周围了。我来晚了吗？{w}\n没过多久，就有几个朋友发现了我。"

# game/script.rpy:151099
translate chinese map151_1bf807f9:

    # voice "se/z01591.ogg"
    voice "se/z01591.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:151101
translate chinese map151_d9f48f43:

    # char_fortaime "Hey there, [firstname]!\nGlad to see you made it on time.\nThey're just about ready to leave Mazeo."
    char_fortaime "嘿，[firstname]！\n很高兴看到你准时赶到了。\n他们马上就要离开马泽奥了。"

# game/script.rpy:151114
translate chinese map151_c6c8ff76:

    # voice "se/z01592.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "I'm so excited to see what Alarinthia is like.\nI mean — except for the heat, of course. Yikes.\nBut I guess there'll be plenty of time to adapt."
    voice "se/z01592.ogg"
    char_fortaime "我太期待看看阿拉林西亚是什么样子了。\n我是说——当然，除了那酷热之外。哎哟。\n不过我想总有足够的时间适应。"

# game/script.rpy:151140
translate chinese map151_c5631629:

    # voice "se/z01593.ogg"
    voice "se/z01593.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:151142
translate chinese map151_da1225a7:

    # char_valessa "Yeah, I don't think our visit there will be a short one.\nIt's kind of a tall order, forming an alliance with Alarinthia.\nThey take their independence seriously. Even more than Valinorth."
    char_valessa "是啊，我觉得我们去那儿不会是短住。\n和阿拉林西亚结盟可是件难事。\n他们很看重独立。甚至比瓦利诺斯更甚。"

# game/script.rpy:151169
translate chinese map151_aa0902b9:

    # voice "se/z01594.ogg"
    voice "se/z01594.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:151171
translate chinese map151_1f187535:

    # char_fortaime "I think that Vivien will be our best shot.\nBut I trust you and Damek to get this done.\nYou're a dream team, so this {i}has{/i} to go well."
    char_fortaime "我觉得薇薇安会是我们最好的突破口。\n但我相信你和达梅克能办成这件事。\n你们是梦幻组合，所以这{i}一定{/i}会顺利。"

# game/script.rpy:151185
translate chinese map151_a02519d7:

    # "Upon hearing his name, Damek's ears perk up.{w}\nHe turns around and runs to face me — excited.{w}\nI'm impressed at how fast he organized this."
    "听到自己的名字，达梅克的耳朵竖了起来。{w}\n他转过身，兴冲冲地跑向我。{w}\n我对他组织得如此之快感到佩服。"

# game/script.rpy:151210
translate chinese map151_b1b0f5b5:

    # voice "se/z01595.ogg"
    voice "se/z01595.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:151212
translate chinese map151_b7dc33bf:

    # char_damek "[firstname]! Perfect timing, as always.\nI was just telling my friends about you.\nHere, let me introduce you to some of them."
    char_damek "[firstname]！一如既往地恰到好处。\n我刚在跟我的朋友们说起你。\n来，让我给你介绍几位。"

# game/script.rpy:151226
translate chinese map151_d0dd3c45:

    # "He starts walking away, leading me to some nearby rebels.{w}\nI've never seen them before, but they're lucky to be alive.{w}\nThe previous attack almost took {i}everybody{/i} from us."
    "他开始走开，领我去见附近的一些反抗军。{w}\n我从没见过他们，但他们能活下来真是幸运。{w}\n上一次袭击差点让我们失去{i}所有人{/i}。"

# game/script.rpy:151251
translate chinese map151_4263d633:

    # voice "se/z01596.ogg"
    # char_damek "As your advisor, I have a few close friends.\nThey'll provide me with counsel when you're busy.\nWe both know that's going to be quite often, [firstname]."
    voice "se/z01596.ogg"
    char_damek "作为你的顾问，我有几个亲近的朋友。\n你忙的时候，他们会为我出谋划策。\n我们都知道你忙的时候会很多，[firstname]。"

# game/script.rpy:151254
translate chinese map151_b2842e7a:

    # "This much was true."
    "这话不假。"

# game/script.rpy:151269
translate chinese map151_87cc9de9:

    # voice "se/z01597.ogg"
    voice "se/z01597.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:151271
translate chinese map151_532332f0:

    # char_damek "Everybody, I'd like to introduce you to The Monarch.\nTreat him as you treated me. He's your new leader, now.\nAnd after this war, he'll be the new ruler of Alestia."
    char_damek "各位，我想向你们介绍君主。\n你们怎么对待我，就怎么对待他。他现在是你们的新领袖。\n这场战争之后，他将成为阿莱斯蒂亚的新统治者。"

# game/script.rpy:151276
translate chinese map151_f61ac9bf:

    # voice "se/z01598.ogg"
    voice "se/z01598.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:151278
translate chinese map151_ffb2675a:

    # char_damek "Everybody, I'd like to introduce you to The Monarch.\nTreat her as you treated me. She's your new leader, now.\nAnd after this war, she'll be the new ruler of Alestia."
    char_damek "各位，我想向你们介绍君主。\n你们怎么对待我，就怎么对待她。她现在是你们的新领袖。\n这场战争之后，她将成为阿莱斯蒂亚的新统治者。"

# game/script.rpy:151282
translate chinese map151_4eb0027f:

    # "That was still overwhelming to think about.{w}\nI guess I'll have to take things as they come. One step at a time.{w}\nDamek's friends take turns stepping forward, seemingly nervous."
    "光是想想这些，依然让人不知所措。{w}\n我想我只能走一步看一步，一步一步来。{w}\n达梅克的朋友们轮流上前，看起来有些紧张。"

# game/script.rpy:151307
translate chinese map151_dfa44ab2:

    # voice "se/z01599.ogg"
    voice "se/z01599.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:151313
translate chinese map151_668ebbfb:

    # char_jit_map151_1_0_140 "I've heard a lot about you, Monarch.\nUntil you arrived, you're all Damek could talk about.\nYou have my allegiance. My sword is yours to command."
    char_jit_map151_1_0_140 "我久仰你的大名，君主。\n你来之前，达梅克满嘴都是你。\n我向你效忠。我的剑听你调遣。"

# game/script.rpy:151326
translate chinese map151_672d3c15:

    # voice "se/z01600.ogg"
    voice "se/z01600.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:151331
translate chinese map151_9714fc24:

    # char_jit_map151_1_0_153 "And mine, too! Trust me [firstname], we got this.\nAfter this is done, Alestia will belong to {i}us{/i}.\nAnd if I'm honest — it's about damn time."
    char_jit_map151_1_0_153 "还有我！相信我，[firstname]，这事我们赢定了。\n等这一切结束，阿莱斯蒂亚就属于{i}我们{/i}了。\n而且说实话——早该如此了。"

# game/script.rpy:151344
translate chinese map151_10bf68bc:

    # voice "se/z01601.ogg"
    voice "se/z01601.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:151349
translate chinese map151_b63ee30d:

    # char_jit_map151_1_0_166 "Yeah, The Triumvirate has ruled over us for far too long.\nA change is overdue — it'll keep things nice and interesting.\nPlease [firstname], come to me if you need any assistance at all."
    char_jit_map151_1_0_166 "是啊，三人执政团统治我们太久了。\n变革早就该来了——这样才能让一切保持新鲜有趣。\n[firstname]，如果你需要任何帮助，尽管来找我。"

# game/script.rpy:151370
translate chinese map151_f4f36ac7:

    # "As if they rehearsed this, they all step back in unison.{w}\nIt was nice to see that Damek had the support of his rebels.{w}\nThey don't seem to hold him accountable, like Howl did."
    "仿佛排练过一样，他们齐刷刷地退后一步。{w}\n很高兴看到达梅克有他的反抗军支持。{w}\n他们似乎不像豪尔那样追究他的责任。"

# game/script.rpy:151397
translate chinese map151_09714a50:

    # voice "se/z01602.ogg"
    voice "se/z01602.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:151399
translate chinese map151_2cbad808:

    # char_damek "Well, I guess that's everything I needed to do.\nThe food and supplies have all been taken aboard.\nAlex took care of it overnight. I guess he couldn't sleep."
    char_damek "嗯，我想我要做的都做完了。\n食物和补给都已经装船了。\n亚历克斯熬了一夜把它们办妥。我猜他没睡着。"

# game/script.rpy:151413
translate chinese map151_6e4c1145:

    # "I don't blame him."
    "我不怪他。"

# game/script.rpy:151438
translate chinese map151_c2ceac77:

    # voice "se/z01603.ogg"
    # char_damek "Should we continue the rest on the ship?\nThere's still a few people you need to meet.\nAfter that, we're in for a long, boring trip."
    voice "se/z01603.ogg"
    char_damek "剩下的要不要到船上再说？\n还有几个人你得见一见。\n之后，我们就要踏上漫长又无聊的旅程了。"

# game/script.rpy:151460
translate chinese map151_fcd219b2:

    # "I nod, and start to follow him aboard.{w}\nEverybody else follows suit, until we're all loaded up.{w}\nThis would be my first time at sea. I hope my body takes it well."
    "我点点头，跟着他上了船。{w}\n其他人也依次跟上，直到我们全部登船。{w}\n这将是我第一次出海。希望我的身体能适应。"

# game/script.rpy:151465
translate chinese map151_dab6cce7:

    # voice "se/z01604.ogg"
    voice "se/z01604.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:151467
translate chinese map151_97effb38:

    # char_damek "Well, I guess that's everything I needed to do.\nThe food and supplies have all been taken aboard.\nNada insisted, I guess she couldn't get any sleep."
    char_damek "嗯，我想我要做的都做完了。\n食物和补给都已经装船了。\n娜达坚持要帮忙，我猜她根本没睡。"

# game/script.rpy:151481
translate chinese map151_3f13fb51:

    # "I don't blame her."
    "我不怪她。"

# game/script.rpy:151506
translate chinese map151_5fa5f3b8:

    # voice "se/z01605.ogg"
    voice "se/z01605.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:151508
translate chinese map151_4be77f10:

    # char_damek "Damek: z01605\nShould we continue the rest on the ship?\nThere's sitll a few people you need to meet.\nAfter that, we're in for a long, boring trip."
    char_damek "剩下的要不要到船上再说？\n还有几个人你得见一见。\n之后，我们就要踏上漫长又无聊的旅程了。"

# game/script.rpy:151529
translate chinese map151_fcd219b2_1:

    # "I nod, and start to follow him aboard.{w}\nEverybody else follows suit, until we're all loaded up.{w}\nThis would be my first time at sea. I hope my body takes it well."
    "我点点头，跟着他上了船。{w}\n其他人也依次跟上，直到我们全部登船。{w}\n这将是我第一次出海。希望我的身体能适应。"

# game/script.rpy:151556
translate chinese map151_6e838ff4:

    # voice "se/z01606.ogg"
    voice "se/z01606.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:151558
translate chinese map151_7a603c72:

    # char_fortaime "I think that Vivien will be our best shot.\nHopefully you and Howl can get along, [firstname].\nIt's a new partnership, but it certainly shows promise."
    char_fortaime "我觉得薇薇安会是我们最好的突破口。\n希望你和豪尔能相处融洽，[firstname]。\n这是段新的合作关系，但显然很有前景。"

# game/script.rpy:151584
translate chinese map151_84d0d22e:

    # "Upon hearing his \"name\", Howl's ears perk up.{w}\nHe walks toward me, ending his previous conversation.{w}\nI can't believe this was all organized so fast, and so efficiently."
    "听到自己的“名字”，豪尔的耳朵竖了起来。{w}\n他结束了先前的谈话，朝我走来。{w}\n我真不敢相信这一切组织得如此之快、如此高效。"

# game/script.rpy:151609
translate chinese map151_9a9d45f0:

    # voice "se/z01607.ogg"
    voice "se/z01607.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:151612
translate chinese map151_4cbc9268:

    # char_howl "[firstname], glad to see that you made it.\nWe were just talking with some new \"supporters\".\nIt appears that our partnership is welcomed by many."
    char_howl "[firstname]，很高兴看到你来了。\n我们刚在和几位新的“支持者”交谈。\n看来我们的结盟受到了许多人的欢迎。"

# game/script.rpy:151625
translate chinese map151_508b0b86:

    # voice "se/z01608.ogg"
    # char_howl "We are not the only ones who hold Damek accountable.\nIf it's okay, we'd like to introduce you to a few of them.\nHopefully, they will solidify your choice as correct."
    voice "se/z01608.ogg"
    char_howl "不是只有我们才追究达梅克的责任。\n如果可以，我们想给你介绍其中几位。\n希望他们能让你更加确信你的选择是正确的。"

# game/script.rpy:151640
translate chinese map151_4b5d0bf2:

    # "I nod, and follow Howl back to where he was before.{w}\nA few rebels stand there, smiling as they see me.{w}\nHowl motions toward them, and I step forward."
    "我点点头，跟着豪尔回到他刚才待的地方。{w}\n几个反抗军站在那里，看到我便露出笑容。{w}\n豪尔朝他们示意，我走上前去。"

# game/script.rpy:151665
translate chinese map151_1e2e0ce2:

    # voice "se/z01609.ogg"
    voice "se/z01609.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:151671
translate chinese map151_e06cbff4:

    # char_jit_map151_1_0_341 "Pleasure to meet you, [firstname].\nI'm glad to see that you survived the attack.\nThanks to Damek, not everybody was so lucky."
    char_jit_map151_1_0_341 "很高兴见到你，[firstname]。\n很高兴你从袭击中活了下来。\n多亏了达梅克，可不是每个人都那么走运。"

# game/script.rpy:151684
translate chinese map151_15c527f5:

    # voice "se/z01610.ogg"
    voice "se/z01610.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:151689
translate chinese map151_bf2fe13a:

    # char_jit_map151_1_0_354 "They told us he was an unparalleled strategist.\nWell, if he is — he lost the chance to prove it to us.\nI gotta say, I'm glad you changed the way things are run."
    char_jit_map151_1_0_354 "他们说他是个无与伦比的战略家。\n嗯，如果真是——那他已经没机会向我们证明了。\n我得说，我很高兴你改变了这里的行事方式。"

# game/script.rpy:151702
translate chinese map151_70c1e0e8:

    # voice "se/z01611.ogg"
    voice "se/z01611.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:151707
translate chinese map151_3ef5ae0d:

    # char_jit_map151_1_0_367 "Yeah. Howl seems like the perfect choice, [firstname].\nIt's good to know that we're in the hands of somebody wise.\nUnder your command — we'll recover from this — and win."
    char_jit_map151_1_0_367 "是啊。豪尔似乎是最合适的人选，[firstname]。\n知道自己掌握在明智之人的手里真好。\n在你的指挥下——我们会恢复过来——然后赢。"

# game/script.rpy:151728
translate chinese map151_fb62ae15:

    # "They all step away, and go about their business.{w}\nSo there {i}are{/i} other rebels who think Damek is responsible.{w}\nThat means there are others that support Damek. I hope this is okay."
    "他们全都退开，各忙各的去了。{w}\n所以{i}确实{/i}有别的反抗军认为达梅克该负责。{w}\n那就意味着也有人支持达梅克。希望这没关系。"

# game/script.rpy:151730
translate chinese map151_c15b8c75:

    # "Conflict is the last thing we need among our own forces.{w}\nIt would definitely hinder our morale in the coming storm.{w}\nI turn back to Howl, who seems happy and relaxed."
    "冲突是我们自己人之间最不需要的东西。{w}\n在即将到来的风暴中，那肯定会打击我们的士气。{w}\n我转回豪尔那边，他看起来愉快又放松。"

# game/script.rpy:151757
translate chinese map151_ba1f430f:

    # voice "se/z01612.ogg"
    voice "se/z01612.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:151759
translate chinese map151_bd46ae0b:

    # char_howl "We should probably get going, [firstname].\nEverything is on the ship, and everybody is here.\nAlex worked overnight to make sure we were ready."
    char_howl "我们大概该动身了，[firstname]。\n东西都在船上了，人也到齐了。\n亚历克斯熬了一夜确保我们准备妥当。"

# game/script.rpy:151773
translate chinese map151_43c9dce8:

    # "Talk about dedication."
    "真是尽职尽责。"

# game/script.rpy:151798
translate chinese map151_135f70bf:

    # voice "se/z01613.ogg"
    # char_howl "Shall we continue the rest of this discussion at sea?\nIf anything, it'll help pass the time. Alarinthia is quite far away.\nWe'll take a shipping route used by our people in ancient times."
    voice "se/z01613.ogg"
    char_howl "剩下的讨论要不要到海上继续？\n至少这样能打发时间。阿拉林西亚可远着呢。\n我们会走我们族人在上古时代用过的航线。"

# game/script.rpy:151813
translate chinese map151_fcd219b2_2:

    # "I nod, and start to follow him aboard.{w}\nEverybody else follows suit, until we're all loaded up.{w}\nThis would be my first time at sea. I hope my body takes it well."
    "我点点头，跟着他上了船。{w}\n其他人也依次跟上，直到我们全部登船。{w}\n这将是我第一次出海。希望我的身体能适应。"

# game/script.rpy:151818
translate chinese map151_4b147a3d:

    # voice "se/z01614.ogg"
    voice "se/z01614.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:151820
translate chinese map151_2ce1e07e:

    # char_howl "We should probably get going, Monarch.\nEverything is on the ship, and everybody is here.\nNada worked overnight to make sure we were ready."
    char_howl "我们大概该动身了，君主。\n东西都在船上了，人也到齐了。\n娜达熬了一夜确保我们准备妥当。"

# game/script.rpy:151834
translate chinese map151_43c9dce8_1:

    # "Talk about dedication."
    "真是尽职尽责。"

# game/script.rpy:151859
translate chinese map151_a0bde4f5:

    # voice "se/z01615.ogg"
    # char_howl "Shall we continue the rest of this discussion at sea?\nIf anything, it'll help pass the time. Alarinthia is quite far away.\nWe'll take a shipping route used by our people in ancient times."
    voice "se/z01615.ogg"
    char_howl "剩下的讨论要不要到海上继续？\n至少这样能打发时间。阿拉林西亚可远着呢。\n我们会走我们族人在上古时代用过的航线。"

# game/script.rpy:151881
translate chinese map151_fcd219b2_3:

    # "I nod, and start to follow him aboard.{w}\nEverybody else follows suit, until we're all loaded up.{w}\nThis would be my first time at sea. I hope my body takes it well."
    "我点点头，跟着他上了船。{w}\n其他人也依次跟上，直到我们全部登船。{w}\n这将是我第一次出海。希望我的身体能适应。"

# game/script.rpy:151904
translate chinese map152_2227015e:

    # "The boat is rather large, and it can easily fit all of us.{w}\nWasting no time, as soon as we're on, they prepare to set sail.{w}\nPirates run about the ship, making last minute preparations."
    "这艘船相当大，轻松容得下我们所有人。{w}\n一刻也不耽误，我们一上船，他们就准备起航了。{w}\n海盗们在船上跑来跑去，做最后的准备。"

# game/script.rpy:151906
translate chinese map152_4d97c3e5:

    # "I even see Mylus aboard, and that slightly surprises me.{w}\nHowever, before I'm able to say anything to him, the pirates take charge.{w}\nTheir leader steps into the middle of the deck, and shouts orders."
    "我甚至看到迈勒斯也在船上，这让我有点意外。{w}\n然而，我还没来得及跟他说上话，海盗们就开始发号施令了。{w}\n他们的首领走到甲板中央，高声下达命令。"

# game/script.rpy:151932
translate chinese map152_9f63c049:

    # voice "se/z01616.ogg"
    voice "se/z01616.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:151938
translate chinese map152_86ca0ccf:

    # char_jit_map152_1_0_17 "Come on everybody! Let's do this!\nThey'll write about this voyage in the history books.\nLet's give them something memorable to read about...!"
    char_jit_map152_1_0_17 "大家来吧！动手干吧！\n他们会在史书里写下这次航行。\n让我们给他们留点值得一读的东西……！"

# game/script.rpy:151952
translate chinese map152_2f201beb:

    # "His crew nod and exchange witty banter as they prepare.{w}\nIt seems like life as a pirate could actually be pretty {i}fun{/i}.{w}\nI feel glad that we chose to support him. He seems nice."
    "他的船员们一边点头，一边打趣地互相调侃着做准备。{w}\n看来做海盗的生活其实可能相当{i}有趣{/i}。{w}\n我很庆幸我们选择了支持他。他看起来人不错。"

# game/script.rpy:151971
translate chinese map152_77636dcd:

    # voice "se/z01617.ogg"
    voice "se/z01617.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:151977
translate chinese map152_1c0c3d2c:

    # char_jit_map152_1_0_36 "Come on, you can all do better than that!{w}\nIf you want my favor in our new nation, then get to work!{w}\nA competent crew would already have us halfway to Alarinthia!"
    char_jit_map152_1_0_36 "来吧，你们都能做得更好！{w}\n想在我们的新国度里得到我的青睐，就给我干活！{w}\n一帮能干的船员早该把我们送到阿拉林西亚半路了！"

# game/script.rpy:151991
translate chinese map152_0abf4865:

    # "Her crew nod and get to work, exactly as instructed.{w}\nIt seems her authority was respected, as harsh as she was.{w}\nIt's understandable that they'd want the favor of their new ruler."
    "她的船员们点点头，照吩咐干起活来。{w}\n看来尽管她态度严厉，她的权威依然受到尊重。{w}\n他们想讨好自己的新统治者，这可以理解。"

# game/script.rpy:152000
translate chinese map152_311c31ee:

    # "I walk to the center of the ship, and slowly inspect my surroundings.{w}\nIt's a bit packed, but that's because nobody went to the crew quarters yet.{w}\nI could tell from the outside that this place has more than enough space."
    "我走到船中央，慢慢打量四周。{w}\n这里有点挤，但那是因为还没人进船员舱。{w}\n从外面我就能看出，这地方的空间绰绰有余。"

# game/script.rpy:152005
translate chinese map152_a87154d0:

    # "As soon as Damek sees me, he runs toward me.{w}\nA few people follow behind him. More introductions?{w}\nI guess it's fair. I hadn't met many of the rebels yet."
    "达梅克一看到我，就朝我跑来。{w}\n有几个人跟在他身后。又要介绍人吗？{w}\n我想这也公平。我还没见过多少反抗军成员。"

# game/script.rpy:152030
translate chinese map152_b1b20dda:

    # voice "se/z01618.ogg"
    voice "se/z01618.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:152032
translate chinese map152_b1b77fe3:

    # char_damek "[firstname]! We're almost ready to set sail.\nHere's the people I wanted to introduce you to.\nIt's important for morale that you get along with our forces."
    char_damek "[firstname]！我们差不多准备起航了。\n这就是我想介绍给你认识的人。\n你和我们的队伍相处融洽，对士气很重要。"

# game/script.rpy:152047
translate chinese map152_7b68de2f:

    # voice "se/z01619.ogg"
    voice "se/z01619.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:152049
translate chinese map152_d6f81263:

    # char_damek "However, these aren't just any rebels.\nThese are the Seers that you created back at our HQ.\nThey're grateful for your gift, and I think they want to meet you."
    char_damek "不过，他们可不是普通的反抗军。\n他们是你在总部创造的那些先知。\n他们感激你的馈赠，我想他们想见见你。"

# game/script.rpy:152052
translate chinese map152_ace8e24c:

    # voice "se/z01620.ogg"
    # char_damek "I'll leave you to it. Come find me if you want to chat while we sail.\nSomething tells me there won't be much else to do. Oh well.\nWorst case scenario, we can get Pro to bring out his cards."
    voice "se/z01620.ogg"
    char_damek "这里就交给你了。航行途中想聊天的话就来找我。\n我总觉得不会有多少别的事可做。唉。\n最坏的情况下，我们可以让普洛把他的牌拿出来。"

# game/script.rpy:152063
translate chinese map152_76b742d9:

    # voice "se/z01621.ogg"
    voice "se/z01621.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:152065
translate chinese map152_b0fc6a2a:

    # char_damek "However, these aren't just any rebels.\nThese are the Monarch Vessels you created back at HQ.\nThey've embraced their new situation, and want to meet you."
    char_damek "不过，他们可不是普通的反抗军。\n他们是你在总部创造的那些君主容器。\n他们接受了自己的新处境，想见见你。"

# game/script.rpy:152068
translate chinese map152_5ffe998d:

    # voice "se/z01622.ogg"
    # char_damek "So I'll leave you to that. Come find me later if you want to chat.\nSomething tells me there won't be much else to do. Oh well.\nWorst case scenario, we can get Pro to bring out his cards."
    voice "se/z01622.ogg"
    char_damek "那就交给你了。之后想聊天就来找我。\n我总觉得不会有多少别的事可做。唉。\n最坏的情况下，我们可以让普洛把他的牌拿出来。"

# game/script.rpy:152090
translate chinese map152_6dd92b8c:

    # "With a smile, he runs off to attend to other business.{w}\nEven though he stepped down, he was still a busy man.{w}\nI wonder if that's the same fate that awaited me. Probably."
    "他笑着跑开，去处理别的事务了。{w}\n尽管已经卸任，他依然是个大忙人。{w}\n不知道等着我的会不会也是同样的命运。大概是吧。"

# game/script.rpy:152092
translate chinese map152_8fcd852e:

    # "I turn to meet these new people, ready to make friends."
    "我转身去见这些新面孔，准备结交朋友。"

# game/script.rpy:152097
translate chinese map152_9c549ef2:

    # "As soon as Howl sees me, he slowly steps toward me.{w}\nA few people follow behind him. More introductions?{w}\nI guess it was better than being lonesome on the voyage."
    "豪尔一看到我，就缓缓朝我走来。{w}\n有几个人跟在他身后。又要介绍人吗？{w}\n我想这总比在航行中独自寂寞要好。"

# game/script.rpy:152122
translate chinese map152_34c5e7f4:

    # voice "se/z01623.ogg"
    voice "se/z01623.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:152125
translate chinese map152_ce762541:

    # char_howl "[firstname]. We're almost ready to set sail.\nHowever, there are people who wish to meet you.\nIt seems that you are the subject of much praise to them."
    char_howl "[firstname]。我们差不多准备起航了。\n不过，有些人想见见你。\n看来你成了他们交口称赞的对象。"

# game/script.rpy:152140
translate chinese map152_f2dee5d6:

    # voice "se/z01624.ogg"
    voice "se/z01624.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:152142
translate chinese map152_d9b8a3f9:

    # char_howl "And it is deserving. You turned them into Seers.\nThis is a gift that only a select few in history has received.\nCome chat with us when we set sail. I'll take my leave until then."
    char_howl "这也理所应当。你把他们变成了先知。\n这是历史上只有极少数人得到过的馈赠。\n起航后来找我们聊聊。在此之前我先告辞了。"

# game/script.rpy:152152
translate chinese map152_1bb9945b:

    # voice "se/z01625.ogg"
    voice "se/z01625.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:152154
translate chinese map152_046b5231:

    # char_howl "And it is deserving. You brought them back from the dead.\nWith a thirst for vengeance, they are ready to follow your every command.\nI'll take my leave until later. Come chat with us when you have the chance."
    char_howl "这也理所应当。你把它们从死亡中带了回来。\n怀着复仇的渴望，它们已准备好听从你的每一道命令。\n我先告辞一会儿。有机会就来找我们聊聊。"

# game/script.rpy:152175
translate chinese map152_f785f4c6:

    # "He steps away from me with loud, heavy steps.{w}\nIt seems that he's still getting used to this new body.{w}\nI turn to meet these new people, ready to make friends."
    "他迈着沉重响亮的步子离开我。{w}\n看来他还在适应这具新身体。{w}\n我转身去见这些新面孔，准备结交朋友。"

# game/script.rpy:152201
translate chinese map152_be3d734a:

    # voice "se/z01626.ogg"
    voice "se/z01626.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:152207
translate chinese map152_e63f7bc5:

    # char_jit_map152_1_0_183 "I must thank you for this gift, [firstname].\nIt was alarming at first, having all these visions.\nBut now we know that they can be used to secure victory."
    char_jit_map152_1_0_183 "我必须为这份馈赠感谢你，[firstname]。\n起初，这些幻象让我惊恐不已。\n但现在我们知道，它们可以用来确保胜利。"

# game/script.rpy:152220
translate chinese map152_8a4730e9:

    # voice "se/z01627.ogg"
    voice "se/z01627.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:152225
translate chinese map152_f90454a7:

    # char_jit_map152_1_0_196 "We know that we may not be able to enjoy this victory, but:\nHonestly, I would give anything to serve somebody like you.\nAll I ask is that you go on to live happy lives after the war."
    char_jit_map152_1_0_196 "我们知道或许无法享受这场胜利，但：\n老实说，我愿意付出一切来侍奉像你这样的人。\n我唯一的请求，就是你们战后能继续过上幸福的生活。"

# game/script.rpy:152238
translate chinese map152_c6234e6b:

    # voice "se/z01628.ogg"
    voice "se/z01628.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:152243
translate chinese map152_34c4b16a:

    # char_jit_map152_1_0_209 "These happy lives may elude us, but we've accepted that.\nTo give our friends a bright future? No price is too high to pay.\nWe are yours to command, [firstname], until we are of no further use."
    char_jit_map152_1_0_209 "这些幸福的生活或许与我们无缘，但我们已经接受了。\n为了让朋友们拥有光明的未来？付出任何代价都不为过。\n我们任由你差遣，[firstname]，直到我们再无用处。"

# game/script.rpy:152264
translate chinese map152_da4d7a85:

    # "I nod, dismissing them. It's good to see that things went well.{w}\nHonestly, creating Seers could've gone horribly wrong, horribly fast.{w}\nTo know that I used the blade effectively gave me great pleasure."
    "我点点头，让他们退下。很高兴事情进展顺利。{w}\n老实说，创造先知可能会以可怕的方式迅速失控。{w}\n知道自己有效地使用了剑，让我感到极大的满足。"

# game/script.rpy:152278
translate chinese map152_c56f9929:

    # voice "se/z01629.ogg"
    voice "se/z01629.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:152284
translate chinese map152_0e0c6db6:

    # char_jit_map152_1_0_228 "We were told that you were the one who gave us life.\nThank you for this chance, [firstname]. We will not waste it.\nThis form requires some adjusting, but we will be fine."
    char_jit_map152_1_0_228 "我们听说，是你赐予了我们生命。\n感谢你给我们这个机会，[firstname]。我们不会浪费它。\n这具形体需要些调整，但我们会没事的。"

# game/script.rpy:152297
translate chinese map152_15062b85:

    # voice "se/z01630.ogg"
    voice "se/z01630.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:152302
translate chinese map152_bdd52aed:

    # char_jit_map152_1_0_241 "The pain may be intense, but it fuels our every move.\nWe will use it to kill The Triumvirate, by your command.\nThat is the wish of {i}every{/i} member of The Monarchy."
    char_jit_map152_1_0_241 "痛苦或许强烈，但它驱动着我们的每一个动作。\n我们将用它来杀死三人执政团，听从你的号令。\n这是君主国{i}每一位{/i}成员的愿望。"

# game/script.rpy:152315
translate chinese map152_8dcb7ed7:

    # voice "se/z01631.ogg"
    voice "se/z01631.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:152320
translate chinese map152_c5b320e8:

    # char_jit_map152_1_0_254 "We trust your judgment, until the end of Alestia.\nAnd after this war, we dedicate our lives to serving you.\nThis second chance you've given us? We will cherish it."
    char_jit_map152_1_0_254 "我们信任你的判断，直到阿莱斯蒂亚的终结。\n这场战争之后，我们将献上此生为你效力。\n你给我们的这第二次机会？我们会珍惜它。"

# game/script.rpy:152341
translate chinese map152_bd118556:

    # "I nod, dismissing them. It's good to see that things went well.{w}\nHonestly, creating Monarch vessels could've gone horribly wrong, and fast.{w}\nTo know that I used the blade effectively gave me great pleasure."
    "我点点头，让他们退下。很高兴事情进展顺利。{w}\n老实说，创造君主容器可能会以可怕的方式迅速失控。{w}\n知道自己有效地使用了剑，让我感到极大的满足。"

# game/script.rpy:152345
translate chinese map152_c195c2f6:

    # "I continue to walk along the ship, taking in everything I see.{w}\nAfter a few steps, I notice Ulric and Pro are lost in conversation."
    "我继续沿着船走着，把看到的一切都收入眼底。{w}\n走了几步，我注意到乌尔里克和普洛正聊得入神。"

# game/script.rpy:152370
translate chinese map152_1a0ea5dc:

    # voice "se/z01632.ogg"
    voice "se/z01632.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:152372
translate chinese map152_974e76e2:

    # char_ulric "Stop whining, Pro.\nThis trip will be over before you know it.\nI have my complaints, too, but there's nothing I can do."
    char_ulric "别抱怨了，普洛。\n这趟旅程转眼就会结束。\n我也有我的牢骚，但我无能为力。"

# game/script.rpy:152397
translate chinese map152_e1929e1e:

    # voice "se/z01633.ogg"
    voice "se/z01633.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:152400
translate chinese map152_9eb6c294:

    # char_pro "But you're not scared of the sea, Ulric.\nThis is going to be like torture, I know it.\nDo you know where I can find some buckets?"
    char_pro "但你才不怕海，乌尔里克。\n这会像酷刑一样，我知道。\n你知道哪里能找到桶吗？"

# game/script.rpy:152425
translate chinese map152_8378be66:

    # voice "se/z01634.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Getting queasy already?\nWe haven't even set sail."
    voice "se/z01634.ogg"
    char_ulric "已经反胃了？\n我们还没起航呢。"

# game/script.rpy:152451
translate chinese map152_afe3f347:

    # voice "se/z01635.ogg"
    # char_pro "Oh man, you're making it worse..."
    voice "se/z01635.ogg"
    char_pro "哦天，你这么说更糟了……"

# game/script.rpy:152478
translate chinese map152_29a0cbcd:

    # "I laugh and continue walking.{w}\nMore of my comrades are talking amongst themselves.{w}\nThat's good. We had a long, and likely boring, voyage ahead."
    "我笑了笑，继续往前走。{w}\n更多的同伴在彼此交谈。{w}\n这很好。我们前方还有一段漫长、很可能无聊的航行。"

# game/script.rpy:152503
translate chinese map152_55491f37:

    # voice "se/z01636.ogg"
    voice "se/z01636.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:152505
translate chinese map152_b9801705:

    # char_fortaime "But that's not Salus, right?\nHe's been dead for a while.\nOh man, I'm worried for Mylus."
    char_fortaime "但那不是萨卢斯，对吧？\n他已经死了好一阵了。\n哦天，我真替迈勒斯担心。"

# game/script.rpy:152530
translate chinese map152_aace5b16:

    # voice "se/z01637.ogg"
    voice "se/z01637.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:152532
translate chinese map152_0fa6fe97:

    # char_valessa "It's weird to see him alive, but I also know it's not {i}really{/i} him."
    char_valessa "看到他活着感觉很奇怪，但我也知道那{i}并非{/i}真正的他。"

# game/script.rpy:152557
translate chinese map152_692797e3:

    # voice "se/z01638.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "Are you even listening to yourself right now?\nI can't believe we can say these things and mean them.\nLike, what's going to happen with no more Spirit Realm?"
    voice "se/z01638.ogg"
    char_fortaime "你听听自己在说什么？\n我真不敢相信我们能说出这些话，而且是认真的。\n比如，没有了灵界会怎么样？"

# game/script.rpy:152583
translate chinese map152_74e0d0bf:

    # voice "se/z01639.ogg"
    # char_valessa "Who knows. Everything we knew was wrong.\nAt the end of the day, maybe Valinorth will be fine.\nI don't see how some \"prison\" could've kept it warm."
    voice "se/z01639.ogg"
    char_valessa "谁知道呢。我们过去知道的一切都是错的。\n说到底，也许瓦利诺斯会安然无恙。\n我看不出一个什么“牢笼”怎么能让那里保持温暖。"

# game/script.rpy:152609
translate chinese map152_7acfa683:

    # voice "se/z01640.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "You're right, and that's amazing.\nLet's push all this weirdness aside, and agree on {i}that{/i}.\nWe'll ask Salus — I mean Howl — for sure, when we get the chance."
    voice "se/z01640.ogg"
    char_fortaime "你说得对，这可太惊人了。\n我们把这些怪事都放一边，至少在{i}这一点{/i}上达成一致吧。\n有机会我们一定要问问萨卢斯——我是说豪尔。"

# game/script.rpy:152635
translate chinese map152_62ba003b:

    # voice "se/z01641.ogg"
    # char_valessa "Of course."
    voice "se/z01641.ogg"
    char_valessa "当然。"

# game/script.rpy:152662
translate chinese map152_ce518489:

    # "It seems that they're still digesting these events.{w}\nI can't blame them, everything is pretty crazy right now.{w}\nThankfully, we'd have plenty of time to continue \"digesting\"."
    "看来他们还在消化这些事。{w}\n我不怪他们，现在一切都太疯狂了。{w}\n幸好，我们有的是时间继续“消化”。"

# game/script.rpy:152664
translate chinese map152_ae52090e:

    # "Alarinthia was almost a day away. At least we'd get to sleep.{w}\nBut until then, I'd better make use of this time to talk to my friends.{w}\nA lot had happened in the last day. I should check up on them."
    "离阿拉林西亚还有将近一天。至少我们能睡上一觉。{w}\n不过在那之前，我最好利用这段时间跟朋友们聊聊。{w}\n过去一天发生了太多事。我该去看看他们。"

# game/script.rpy:152666
translate chinese map152_24ca02af:

    # "The ship shakes slightly, and I lose my balance for a moment.{w}\nI guess we're setting sail? I've never actually been at sea before.{w}\nPirates run amok, as if getting to their designated work stations."
    "船身轻轻一晃，我一时失去了平衡。{w}\n我们是要起航了吗？我还从没真正出过海。{w}\n海盗们四处奔忙，像是赶往各自的岗位。"

# game/script.rpy:152695
translate chinese map152_60f03a3b:

    # voice "se/z01642.ogg"
    voice "se/z01642.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:152701
translate chinese map152_06b3560d:

    # char_jit_map152_1_0_453 "Alright everybody, here we go!\nWe want a smooth voyage, so don't forget your schedules.\nThose of you with the graveyard shift — I'll make it up to you."
    char_jit_map152_1_0_453 "好了各位，出发了！\n我们想要一趟平稳的航行，所以别忘了你们的班次。\n值夜班的人——我会补偿你们的。"

# game/script.rpy:152715
translate chinese map152_a1c47f92:

    # "He climbs up the rope netting on the side of the ship, and looks at the horizon.{w}\nWith a smile on his face, he points toward the vast body of water before us."
    "他爬上船侧的绳网，望向地平线。{w}\n他面带微笑，指向我们面前浩瀚的水域。"

# game/script.rpy:152743
translate chinese map152_74b3a857:

    # voice "se/z01643.ogg"
    # char_jit_map152_1_0_453 "To the seas we go!"
    voice "se/z01643.ogg"
    char_jit_map152_1_0_453 "向着大海，出发！"

# game/script.rpy:152765
translate chinese map152_7c3ab381:

    # "His crew repeats this, as if it were a mantra, before we set sail.{w}\nI guess this was it. We were on our way to secure an Alarinthian alliance."
    "他的船员们像念咒语一样重复着这句话，随后我们起航了。{w}\n我想就是这样了。我们正前往争取阿拉林西亚的结盟。"

# game/script.rpy:152782
translate chinese map152_f5c73ad6:

    # voice "se/z01644.ogg"
    voice "se/z01644.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:152788
translate chinese map152_077eabf2:

    # char_jit_map152_1_0_495 "Alright everybody, here we go!\nDon't forget your schedules, we need a smooth voyage!\nAnybody who slacks off will have no place in my new nation."
    char_jit_map152_1_0_495 "好了各位，出发了！\n别忘了你们的班次，我们需要一趟平稳的航行！\n谁敢偷懒，我的新国度里就没有他的位置。"

# game/script.rpy:152802
translate chinese map152_55043729:

    # "She climbs up the rope netting on the side of the ship, and looks at the horizon.{w}\nWith a smile on her face, she points toward the vast body of water before us."
    "她爬上船侧的绳网，望向地平线。{w}\n她面带微笑，指向我们面前浩瀚的水域。"

# game/script.rpy:152830
translate chinese map152_6c1e5833:

    # voice "se/z01645.ogg"
    # char_jit_map152_1_0_495 "To the seas we go!"
    voice "se/z01645.ogg"
    char_jit_map152_1_0_495 "向着大海，出发！"

# game/script.rpy:152852
translate chinese map152_3de0da7d:

    # "Her crew repeats this, as if it were a mantra, before we set sail.{w}\nI guess this was it. We were on our way to secure an Alarinthian alliance."
    "她的船员们像念咒语一样重复着这句话，随后我们起航了。{w}\n我想就是这样了。我们正前往争取阿拉林西亚的结盟。"

# game/script.rpy:152856
translate chinese map152_f5d694b1:

    # "Clicking the arrow in the top right will continue the story, and the voyage to Alarinthia.{w}\nIt is highly recommended that you complete the series of onboard Heart-to-Hearts."
    "点击右上角的箭头将继续剧情，前往阿拉林西亚的航行。{w}\n强烈建议你完成船上的一系列心灵对话。"

# game/script.rpy:152881
translate chinese map159_46b4ed2b:

    # "When I exit the ship, I notice everybody standing around outside.{w}\nUlric stands strong, and tall, but all of my other comrades look defeated.{w}\nFanning themselves, it's clear that the heat is the source of this exhaustion."
    "我走出船时，注意到所有人都站在外面。{w}\n乌尔里克身姿挺拔，但我的其他同伴都一脸疲惫。{w}\n他们扇着风，显然酷热正是这疲惫的根源。"

# game/script.rpy:152903
translate chinese map159_90b7194b:

    # voice "se/z01646.ogg"
    voice "se/z01646.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:152905
translate chinese map159_0780fa60:

    # char_valessa "Oh jeeze, this is almost unbearable!\nUlric, how do people even live in this heat...?\nIt's only been ten minutes, and I already feel like death."
    char_valessa "哦天哪，这简直难以忍受！\n乌尔里克，这种酷热里人们到底怎么活的……？\n才过了十分钟，我就已经感觉要死了。"

# game/script.rpy:152930
translate chinese map159_68400660:

    # voice "se/z01647.ogg"
    voice "se/z01647.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:152932
translate chinese map159_5010334e:

    # char_ulric "You get used to it. Trust me.\nBesides, a lot of the natives are draconic.\nTheir bodies don't handle the mainland too well."
    char_ulric "你会习惯的。相信我。\n再说，很多本地人都是龙族血统。\n他们的身体不太适应大陆。"

# game/script.rpy:152957
translate chinese map159_9f2a6908:

    # voice "se/z01648.ogg"
    # char_valessa "Oh, I think I read about that.\nHopefully they can adapt just as fast as we can.\nWe'll be marching into Balteus together, after all."
    voice "se/z01648.ogg"
    char_valessa "哦，我好像读到过这个。\n希望他们适应得和我们一样快。\n毕竟我们要一起进军巴尔泰乌斯。"

# game/script.rpy:152983
translate chinese map159_807fa65b:

    # voice "se/z01649.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Yeah, I wouldn't worry about it too much.\nJust make sure to have a drink on you at all times.\nIn these deserts, dehydration is your greatest enemy."
    voice "se/z01649.ogg"
    char_ulric "是啊，我不会太担心这个。\n只要确保随时带着水就行。\n在这种沙漠里，脱水是你最大的敌人。"

# game/script.rpy:153009
translate chinese map159_f48a2d08:

    # voice "se/z01650.ogg"
    # char_valessa "Right!"
    voice "se/z01650.ogg"
    char_valessa "好的！"

# game/script.rpy:153036
translate chinese map159_57971349:

    # "They part ways, and go about their business.{w}\nUlric goes toward Pro, and they start talking in private.{w}\nValessa ends up with Fortaime, so I need to find my own company."
    "他们分头走开，各忙各的。{w}\n乌尔里克朝普洛走去，两人开始私下交谈。{w}\n瓦莱莎和福泰姆凑到了一起，所以我得找自己的伴。"

# game/script.rpy:153038
translate chinese map159_322ebcc0:

    # "Damek and Howl stand together, so I slowly walk toward them.{w}\nHopefully some of the tension had settled after the long voyage.{w}\nIt would be detrimental to have two senior staff constantly at arms."
    "达梅克和豪尔站在一起，我慢慢朝他们走去。{w}\n希望漫长的航行过后，有些紧张气氛已经平息。{w}\n两位重臣一直剑拔弩张，对我们绝无好处。"

# game/script.rpy:153063
translate chinese map159_243ab46b:

    # voice "se/z01651.ogg"
    voice "se/z01651.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:153065
translate chinese map159_515405bf:

    # char_damek "Hello, [firstname]."
    char_damek "你好，[firstname]。"

# game/script.rpy:153090
translate chinese map159_de089677:

    # voice "se/HowlGen36.ogg"
    voice "se/HowlGen36.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:153092
translate chinese map159_d3ec4492:

    # char_howl "Hey."
    char_howl "嘿。"

# game/script.rpy:153117
translate chinese map159_d7eb3acb:

    # voice "se/z01653.ogg"
    # char_damek "I was just about to ask Howl about Alarinthia.\nSurely it looks a lot different than it did back then.\nLegends dictate that it was once lush, and full of green."
    voice "se/z01653.ogg"
    char_damek "我刚要问豪尔关于阿拉林西亚的事。\n那里肯定和当年大不一样了。\n传说它曾郁郁葱葱，遍地翠绿。"

# game/script.rpy:153143
translate chinese map159_7d148c32:

    # voice "se/z01654.ogg"
    # char_howl "Legends that lie."
    voice "se/z01654.ogg"
    char_howl "骗人的传说。"

# game/script.rpy:153169
translate chinese map159_6ce60ee1:

    # voice "se/z01655.ogg"
    # char_damek "Wait, really...? But that can't be true.\nThe destruction of the idol turned it into this desert.\nWithout spiritual energy to nurture the land— Oh, wait..."
    voice "se/z01655.ogg"
    char_damek "等等，真的吗……？但那不可能是真的。\n灵像被毁才把它变成了这片沙漠。\n没有灵能滋养大地——哦，等等……"

# game/script.rpy:153195
translate chinese map159_717a5b3a:

    # voice "se/z01655b.ogg"
    # char_howl "Precisely. Alarinthia has always looked this way.\nThis legend you speak of, is simply a poorly conjured tale.\nWe often create stories to understand what we cannot grasp." nointeract
    voice "se/z01655b.ogg"
    char_howl "正是。阿拉林西亚一直都是这副模样。\n你所说的那个传说，不过是编造得拙劣的故事。\n我们常常编造故事，来解释无法理解的事物。" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:153213
translate chinese map159_cc27feb7:

    # voice "se/z01666.ogg"
    voice "se/z01666.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:153215
translate chinese map159_4821ede3:

    # char_howl "Correct. In our prison, we had no power.\nThere is no logic behind these assumptions of yours.\nAt least, no logic now that you know the truth of our kind."
    char_howl "没错。在我们的牢笼里，我们毫无力量。\n你这些假设毫无逻辑可言。\n至少，在你知道了我们族类的真相之后，就毫无逻辑了。"

# game/script.rpy:153240
translate chinese map159_788db5d3:

    # voice "se/z01667.ogg"
    # char_damek "Well isn't that wonderful news?\nAt least, it narrows our focus a little bit more.\nI could tell that was a source of stress, [firstname]." nointeract
    voice "se/z01667.ogg"
    char_damek "这不就是天大的好消息吗？\n至少，这让我们的关注点更集中了一些。\n我看得出，那一直是你压力的来源，[firstname]。" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:153268
translate chinese map159_913bd8cc:

    # voice "se/z01668.ogg"
    # char_howl "We are happy that we could ease some pain, Monarch.\nThe fear of losing your homeland? We can't even imagine.\nAt least it remained only that — a fear. We were not so lucky."
    voice "se/z01668.ogg"
    char_howl "能减轻一些痛苦，我们很高兴，君主。\n害怕失去家园？我们连想象都做不到。\n至少它只停留在——恐惧本身。我们可没这么幸运。"

# game/script.rpy:153288
translate chinese map159_a3014d1a:

    # voice "se/z01669.ogg"
    # char_howl "Please refrain."
    voice "se/z01669.ogg"
    char_howl "请别说了。"

# game/script.rpy:153316
translate chinese map159_0c6352ee:

    # voice "se/z01670.ogg"
    # char_howl "We imagine this is a big relief, especially for The Elder.\nThe anxiety of ruling a nation doomed to death? That would be too much.\nIf they have any further questions, do not hesitate to direct them our way."
    voice "se/z01670.ogg"
    char_howl "我们想这对你们来说是莫大的宽慰，尤其是对长老而言。\n统治一个注定灭亡的国度的焦虑？那也太沉重了。\n如果他们还有别的问题，尽管让他们来找我们。"

# game/script.rpy:153344
translate chinese map159_4a2388c9:

    # voice "se/z01671.ogg"
    # char_howl "Thank you for your sympathy, Monarch, but it is not needed.\nPlease focus only on the present. Do not cloud your mind.\nIf you do — then the same fate may befall your kind, as well."
    voice "se/z01671.ogg"
    char_howl "感谢您的同情，君主，但这并不必要。\n请只专注于当下。别让您的心蒙上阴云。\n若您如此——同样的命运也许也会降临到您的族类身上。"

# game/script.rpy:153361
translate chinese map159_485fac6b:

    # "He crosses his arms, and looks around the docks.{w}\nI can tell he's wondering why we're still standing around.{w}\nAfter all, we were on a tight schedule with the ball, and all."
    "他抱起双臂，环顾码头。{w}\n我能看出他在纳闷我们为什么还站在这里。{w}\n毕竟，我们还要赶舞会的时间呢。"

# game/script.rpy:153386
translate chinese map159_5918c65d:

    # voice "se/z01672.ogg"
    # char_damek "Normally, there'd be a lengthy immigration process.\nBut due to the ball, this nation is open to everybody.\nIt's a long trek, but we can head straight into the city." nointeract
    voice "se/z01672.ogg"
    char_damek "正常情况下，会有冗长的入境手续。\n但因为舞会，这个国家对所有人开放。\n路很远，但我们可以直接进城。" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:153404
translate chinese map159_56d9c45a:

    # voice "se/z01673.ogg"
    voice "se/z01673.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:153406
translate chinese map159_eb0d001b:

    # char_damek "Look for Vivien, I presume.\nIf we can't find her in time, then we'll head to the ball.\nBut meeting her before then would be a huge advantage."
    char_damek "我猜，是去找薇薇安吧。\n如果没能及时找到她，我们就直接去舞会。\n但在那之前见到她会是个巨大的优势。"

# game/script.rpy:153431
translate chinese map159_83efddc9:

    # voice "se/z01674.ogg"
    # char_howl "We agree with this course of action, [firstname].\nHowever, our knowledge of Alarinthia is not very deep.\nWe'd suggest working closely with Ulric in this endeavor."
    voice "se/z01674.ogg"
    char_howl "我们赞同这个方案，[firstname]。\n不过，我们对阿拉林西亚的了解并不深。\n我们建议在这件事上与乌尔里克紧密合作。"

# game/script.rpy:153458
translate chinese map159_9c45acfb:

    # "I nod, agreeing with what they both have to say.{w}\nAs if that was to dismiss me, they both turn away.{w}\nIt's nice to see that they're getting along, at least."
    "我点点头，赞同他们两人的说法。{w}\n仿佛那就是打发我走的意思，他们双双转过身去。{w}\n至少很高兴看到他们相处融洽。"

# game/script.rpy:153460
translate chinese map159_ce87de42:

    # "Ulric and Pro seem to be done with their conversation, as well.{w}\nMaking my way over to Ulric, I notice something \"odd.\"{w}\nOut of the corner of my eye, someone is staring at me."
    "乌尔里克和普洛似乎也谈完了。{w}\n我朝乌尔里克走去时，注意到一件“怪事”。{w}\n我眼角余光里，有人在盯着我。"

# game/script.rpy:153485
translate chinese map159_d65a66f4:

    # voice "se/z01675.ogg"
    voice "se/z01675.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:153491
translate chinese map159_0f128a8c:

    # char_jit_map159_1_0_363 "Hmm..."
    char_jit_map159_1_0_363 "嗯……"

# game/script.rpy:153512
translate chinese map159_9c5ed87e:

    # "I make eye contact with them, and they quickly run away.{w}\nThat was concerning. Being by Ulric is probably a good idea right now.{w}\nAs I approach him, he smiles at me. Odd. I thought he'd be miserable."
    "我与他们对上视线，他们立刻跑开了。{w}\n这让人不安。此刻待在乌尔里克身边大概是个好主意。{w}\n我走近他时，他朝我笑了笑。奇怪。我还以为他会很痛苦。"

# game/script.rpy:153537
translate chinese map159_809d85bd:

    # voice "se/z01676.ogg"
    voice "se/z01676.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:153539
translate chinese map159_0fa9d8d2:

    # char_ulric "Hey there, [firstname]. Welcome to my homeland.\nForecast calls for excruciating heat, and a chance of death.\nJust a chance, though. Let's hope it stays that way, right?"
    char_ulric "嘿，[firstname]。欢迎来到我的故乡。\n天气预报说会有酷热难耐，以及一定的死亡概率。\n不过只是概率。希望它一直如此，对吧？"

# game/script.rpy:153553
translate chinese map159_e9b7ad8f:

    # "I nod. I guess he's using some humor to cope."
    "我点点头。我猜他是用点幽默来排解。"

# game/script.rpy:153578
translate chinese map159_9ced71e8:

    # voice "se/z01677.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Let me guess, you have a lot of questions?\nI'll try my best to answer, but make it quick.\nWe're on a strict timer here, we can't fail."
    voice "se/z01677.ogg"
    char_ulric "让我猜猜，你有很多问题？\n我会尽力解答，但请快一点。\n我们时间很紧，不能失败。"

# game/script.rpy:153593
translate chinese map159_0083951d:

    # "He motions toward the vast desert before us.{w}\nHonestly, it seems to go on forever. It's crazy."
    "他朝我们面前广袤的沙漠示意。{w}\n老实说，它看起来仿佛无边无际。太疯狂了。"

# game/script.rpy:153618
translate chinese map159_d3946a7f:

    # voice "se/z01678.ogg"
    # char_ulric "The ball starts in around eight hours. Dinnertime.\nIf we don't move fast, we won't be able to make it.\nYou know what's at stake, [firstname]. Let's get going."
    voice "se/z01678.ogg"
    char_ulric "舞会大约八小时后开始。正好是晚餐时间。\n如果我们不快点，就赶不上了。\n你知道赌注是什么，[firstname]。我们走吧。"

# game/script.rpy:153640
translate chinese map159_73ff35d3:

    # "I nod. I guess he {i}does{/i} have the authority here.{w}\nAfter all, none of us know anything about this place.{w}\nIf we're following his lead, I'd better do what he says."
    "我点点头。看来他在这里{i}确实{/i}有权威。{w}\n毕竟，我们对这个地方一无所知。{w}\n既然要跟着他走，我最好照他说的做。"

# game/script.rpy:153642
translate chinese map159_2c965f38:

    # "Of course, I do have a few questions about this place.{w}\nIf I stop to ask him before we leave, I better do it fast.{w}\nMissing that ball could be catastrophic to our cause."
    "当然，关于这个地方我确实有些疑问。{w}\n如果我要在出发前停下来问他，最好快一点。{w}\n错过那场舞会对我们的事业可能是灾难性的。"

# game/script.rpy:154017
translate chinese Ulric1_map160_4_0_bf5fce45:

    # char_ulric "Hey." nointeract
    char_ulric "嘿。" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:154034
translate chinese Ulric1_map160_4_0_31a8bdac:

    # voice "se/y01099.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Well, it's definitely not something Draycu came up with.\nRulers of Alarinthia have been doing it for ages, actually.\nIt's supposed to make your subjects less inclined to rebel."
    voice "se/y01099.ogg"
    char_ulric "嗯，这绝对不是德雷库想出来的。\n其实，阿拉林西亚的统治者们这么做已经很久了。\n据说是为了让臣民不那么容易造反。"

# game/script.rpy:154038
translate chinese Ulric1_map160_4_0_ffd3ed84:

    # voice "se/y01100.ogg"
    # char_ulric "It's not really working, if Vivien exists.\nBut at the end of the day, it's still a nice party.\nAs much food and drink as you could ever want."
    voice "se/y01100.ogg"
    char_ulric "如果薇薇安还存在着，那这招其实不太管用。\n但说到底，那依然是个不错的派对。\n食物和美酒管够，你想要多少有多少。"

# game/script.rpy:154052
translate chinese Ulric1_map160_4_0_c98d2d78:

    # voice "se/y01101.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Don't worry, [firstname]. I won't go overboard.\nI do like to drink, but not while I'm on a mission of any sort.\nI'll be tempted of course — though I'm sure you can keep me in line."
    voice "se/y01101.ogg"
    char_ulric "别担心，[firstname]。我不会太过分的。\n我确实爱喝酒，但绝不会在执行任何任务的时候喝。\n当然我会受到诱惑——不过我确信你能管住我。"

# game/script.rpy:154056
translate chinese Ulric1_map160_4_0_e2a18550:

    # voice "se/y01102.ogg"
    # char_ulric "After the feast, there's a large ball. But it all starts with a speech.\nBasically, Draycu will be bragging about his power and influence.\nIf he shows off how strong he is, he's less inclined to be challenged."
    voice "se/y01102.ogg"
    char_ulric "宴会之后有一场盛大的舞会。不过一切都以一场演讲开始。\n基本上，德雷库会吹嘘自己的权势和影响力。\n只要他展示出自己有多强，就没人敢轻易挑战他。"

# game/script.rpy:154070
translate chinese Ulric1_map160_4_0_91120b5b:

    # voice "se/y01103.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Though if there {i}is{/i} a challenge, they hold a tournament the next day.\nIt rarely happens, unless it's a drunken partygoer trying to play a joke.\nEveryone wakes up, hung over, and goes about their simple lives."
    voice "se/y01103.ogg"
    char_ulric "不过如果{i}真的{/i}有人挑战，他们第二天会举办一场比武大会。\n这种情况很少见，除非是哪个喝醉的宾客想开个玩笑。\n大家醒来，宿醉未消，继续各自平淡的生活。"

# game/script.rpy:154090
translate chinese Ulric1_map160_4_0_7ba14658:

    # voice "se/y01104.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Honestly, I don't know too much about him.\nI've been out of the loop on Alarinthian politics for a while.\nBut to hold the throne of this nation, you need to be fierce."
    voice "se/y01104.ogg"
    char_ulric "老实说，我对他了解不多。\n我已经很久没关注阿拉林西亚的政事了。\n但要想坐稳这个国家的王座，你必须够凶狠。"

# game/script.rpy:154104
translate chinese Ulric1_map160_4_0_10dbb7dd:

    # voice "se/y01105.ogg"
    # char_ulric "So if you think I'm strong, then you know nothing.\nHe'll make me look like a whelp in comparison.\nAnd from what I've heard, he's pretty smart, too."
    voice "se/y01105.ogg"
    char_ulric "所以如果你觉得我算强，那你就是什么都不懂。\n跟他一比，我会显得像只小崽子。\n而且据我所知，他还相当聪明。"

# game/script.rpy:154118
translate chinese Ulric1_map160_4_0_d2e380c5:

    # voice "se/y01106.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Most rulers, from what I've seen, simply bathe in their own riches.\nTo hold a ball and share it with your nation? That's pretty genius.\nIt destroys any motivation to remove him from the throne."
    voice "se/y01106.ogg"
    char_ulric "据我所见，大多数统治者只是沉溺于自己的财富之中。\n举办一场舞会，与全国百姓共享？那真是相当高明。\n这彻底打消了人们把他赶下王座的念头。"

# game/script.rpy:154132
translate chinese Ulric1_map160_4_0_4541d067:

    # voice "se/y01107.ogg"
    # char_ulric "That's why Alarinthia hasn't had a tournament in a long time.\nThe people are either happy, or certain that they'd lose in combat.\nI'm betting on the latter, which makes Draycu even more intimidating."
    voice "se/y01107.ogg"
    char_ulric "这就是为什么阿拉林西亚很久没举办过比武大会了。\n百姓要么心满意足，要么确信自己会在战斗中落败。\n我赌是后者，这让德雷库显得更加令人畏惧。"

# game/script.rpy:154136
translate chinese Ulric1_map160_4_0_a1613914:

    # voice "se/y01108.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Do {i}not{/i} underestimate him, [firstname].\nIf the natives can't dethrone him, what chance do we stand?\nVivien might dream of a changed nation, but it'll stay that. Just a dream."
    voice "se/y01108.ogg"
    char_ulric "{i}千万别{/i}小看他，[firstname]。\n如果本地人都推翻不了他，我们又能有多少胜算？\n薇薇安也许梦想着改变这个国家，但那终究只是梦想。仅此而已。"

# game/script.rpy:154156
translate chinese Ulric1_map160_4_0_7225d142:

    # voice "se/y01109.ogg"
    # char_ulric "The Town Square is a nice place. But it's just like Mazeo.\nA large market, with people all peddling their homemade wares.\nYou won't find anything you need, but you'll find everything you {i}want{/i}."
    voice "se/y01109.ogg"
    char_ulric "城镇广场是个不错的地方。但和马泽奥差不多。\n一个大集市，人们都在兜售自家做的东西。\n你找不到任何你需要的东西，但你能找到所有你{i}想要{/i}的东西。"

# game/script.rpy:154170
translate chinese Ulric1_map160_4_0_2b4663d3:

    # voice "se/y01110.ogg"
    # char_ulric "After that, I'd say to pay the coliseum a visit.\nIt's not just a venue used to battle for Alarinthia's throne.\nThey have large battles every day, and you can place bets."
    voice "se/y01110.ogg"
    char_ulric "之后，我建议去斗兽场看看。\n它不只是用来争夺阿拉林西亚王座的场地。\n那里每天都举行大型战斗，你还可以下注。"

# game/script.rpy:154184
translate chinese Ulric1_map160_4_0_87d2d286:

    # voice "se/y01111.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Of course, my personal pick would be the tavern.\nAlarinthia has a lot of unique drinks, so I'll make sure to stop there.\nIf I get my fill, maybe I'll be lucky enough to forget this entire voyage."
    voice "se/y01111.ogg"
    char_ulric "当然，我个人的首选会是酒馆。\n阿拉林西亚有很多独特的饮品，所以我一定会去那里。\n如果能喝个痛快，也许我还能幸运地忘掉这整趟旅程。"

# game/script.rpy:154204
translate chinese Ulric1_map160_4_0_04c4f98a:

    # voice "se/y01112.ogg"
    # char_ulric "It doesn't feel any different than I thought, if that's what you mean.\nStepping foot on this soil didn't change my mind. It only solidified my hate.\nLet's do everything we can to get out of here as fast possible, [firstname]. Please."
    voice "se/y01112.ogg"
    char_ulric "如果你是这个意思的话，感觉跟我预想的没什么两样。\n踏上这片土地并没有改变我的想法，只是更加深了我的憎恨。\n我们尽可能快点离开这里吧，[firstname]。求你了。"

# game/script.rpy:154224
translate chinese Ulric1_map160_4_0_6cff6da9:

    # voice "se/y01113.ogg"
    # char_ulric "No. I just want to get the job done, and get back home.\nIf you think you can change my outlook on this place, you're wrong.\nI think this conversation is over, [firstname]. We have a long journey ahead."
    voice "se/y01113.ogg"
    char_ulric "不。我只想完成任务，然后回家。\n如果你以为能改变我对这个地方的看法，那你就错了。\n我想这场谈话到此为止了，[firstname]。我们还有很长的路要走。"

# game/script.rpy:154271
translate chinese click_map160_5_EV005_5f47fe93:

    # voice "se/a00258.ogg"
    voice "se/a00258.ogg"

