    # voice "se/x00365.ogg"
    voice "se/x00365.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:154963
translate chinese map168_2ae3b5d8:

    # char_halin "Remember when I first became your Apprentice?\nThey thought you weren't teaching me good enough.\nYou almost went insane when they gave you \"time off\"."
    char_halin "还记得我刚成为你的学徒的时候吗？\n他们觉得你教得不够好。\n他们让你“休假”的时候，你差点疯了。"

# game/script.rpy:154988
translate chinese map168_823dd100:

    # voice "se/x00366.ogg"
    voice "se/x00366.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:154990
translate chinese map168_b108b232:

    # char_sovy "You would too, Halin. Trust me — it's boring.\nBut that's nothing in comparison to what happened.\nWe don't have the blade, and almost everybody escaped."
    char_sovy "你也会的，哈林。相信我——那很无聊。\n但跟发生的事比起来，那根本不算什么。\n我们没拿到那把剑，而且几乎所有人都逃掉了。"

# game/script.rpy:155015
translate chinese map168_c2a702c1:

    # voice "se/x00367.ogg"
    voice "se/x00367.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:155017
translate chinese map168_b57785d6:

    # char_halin "Through no fault of our own, remember?\nI have your back in this. I won't tell them the truth.\nHowever, I need to ask for {i}one{/i} thing in exchange."
    char_halin "那不是我们的错，记得吗？\n这件事我支持你。我不会告诉他们真相。\n不过，作为交换，我要求{i}一{/i}件事。"

# game/script.rpy:155042
translate chinese map168_beef5a51:

    # voice "se/x00368.ogg"
    voice "se/x00368.ogg"

