translate chinese map168_da0ac7c3:

    # voice "se/x00369.ogg"
    voice "se/x00369.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:155071
translate chinese map168_d6df9816:

    # char_halin "Work on your personal issues, Master.\nI don't care what they are. Just get them sorted out.\nRemember, I'm likely to get chastised just as much as you."
    char_halin "处理好你的私人问题，师父。\n我不在乎是什么问题。把它们解决掉就行。\n记住，我很可能和你一样会被斥责。"

# game/script.rpy:155074
translate chinese map168_4d1e9bbc:

    # voice "se/x00370.ogg"
    # char_halin "But we'll save the bad news for last.\nWe dealt a major blow to The Rebellion, Sovy.\nWith the loss of their leader, they'll be in disarray."
    voice "se/x00370.ogg"
    char_halin "但我们会把坏消息留到最后说。\n我们给了反抗军重重一击，索维。\n失去了领袖，他们会陷入混乱。"

# game/script.rpy:155088
translate chinese map168_5d746d00:

    # voice "se/x00371.ogg"
    voice "se/x00371.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:155090
translate chinese map168_39b40acc:

    # char_halin "If The Triumvirate doesn't like that — then it's their problem.\nLike you said, this isn't the last time we'll face them in battle.\nWhether it takes us days or months to win, it shouldn't matter."
    char_halin "如果三人执政团不满意——那是他们的问题。\n就像你说的，这不是我们最后一次在战场上与他们交锋。\n赢下这场仗要花几天还是几个月，都不重要。"

# game/script.rpy:155103
translate chinese map168_c1bfbd1b:

    # voice "se/x00372.ogg"
    voice "se/x00372.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:155105
translate chinese map168_e7d548cb:

    # char_halin "After all, we'll still win.\nWith that said, are we clear?"
    char_halin "毕竟，我们终会赢的。\n话说到这，我们达成一致了吗？"

# game/script.rpy:155119
translate chinese map168_5f6e5cf1:

    # "In this moment, it seemed like Halin was the one giving orders.{w}\nHowever, Sovy had no choice but to obey. He couldn't risk being exposed."
    "这一刻，看起来发号施令的人反而是哈林。{w}\n然而，索维别无选择，只能服从。他不能冒被揭穿的风险。"

# game/script.rpy:155144
translate chinese map168_08ea0154:

    # voice "se/x00373.ogg"
    voice "se/x00373.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:155146
translate chinese map168_82f59092:

    # char_sovy "We're clear. Let's continue walking.\nI'll think of what to tell them as we move along."
    char_sovy "我们达成一致了。继续走吧。\n路上我会想想该怎么跟他们说。"

# game/script.rpy:155167
translate chinese map168_2e5694a0:

    # "They break their huddle, and continue walking toward their HQ.{w}\nShane steps closer, striding in unison with Sovy as they do so."
    "他们结束密谈，继续朝总部走去。{w}\n肖恩走近了些，与索维并肩同行。"

# game/script.rpy:155192
translate chinese map168_29f76332:

    # voice "se/x00374.ogg"
    voice "se/x00374.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:155194
translate chinese map168_ea285698:

    # char_shane "So what was that all about...?\nYou said I was one of you now, right?\nWhen will you start treating me that way?"
    char_shane "那刚才是怎么回事……？\n你说过我现在是你们中的一员，对吧？\n你什么时候才会那样对待我？"

# game/script.rpy:155219
translate chinese map168_5491a45a:

    # voice "se/x00375.ogg"
    voice "se/x00375.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:155221
translate chinese map168_18589eb7:

    # char_sovy "Oh, sorry — force of habit.\nWe were just talking about what we should tell our Masters.\nWhile we did damage The Rebellion, we failed in our objective."
    char_sovy "哦，抱歉——习惯了。\n我们只是在商量该跟几位主上说什么。\n虽然我们确实打击了反抗军，但我们没能达成目标。"

# game/script.rpy:155246
translate chinese map168_fbecf25f:

    # voice "se/x00376.ogg"
    voice "se/x00376.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:155248
