    # char_shane "You mean that blade?"
    char_shane "你是指那把剑？"

# game/script.rpy:155274
translate chinese map168_53d202b3:

    # voice "se/x00377.ogg"
    voice "se/x00377.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:155276
translate chinese map168_a66e52e2:

    # char_sovy "Yes, and The Seer."
    char_sovy "是的，还有先知。"

# game/script.rpy:155281
translate chinese map168_e2d1d723:

    # voice "se/x00378.ogg"
    voice "se/x00378.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:155283
translate chinese map168_90e191de:

    # char_sovy "Yes, and The Seeress."
    char_sovy "是的，还有先知。"

# game/script.rpy:155308
translate chinese map168_ae3f0911:

    # voice "se/x00379.ogg"
    voice "se/x00379.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:155310
translate chinese map168_ebe3d0eb:

    # char_shane "Look, Sovy — you kind of saved my life.\nFor that reason alone, you have my support.\nWhatever you want me to do, just let me know."
    char_shane "听着，索维——你算是救了我的命。\n仅凭这一点，我就支持你。\n不管你想让我做什么，尽管告诉我。"

# game/script.rpy:155324
translate chinese map168_5903c92d:

    # "Sovy smiles, having the support of his comrades.{w}\nAny fears he had of being punished, were quickly put to rest.{w}"
    "索维笑了，他得到了同伴们的支持。{w}\n他之前对被惩罚的种种恐惧，很快就烟消云散了。{w}"

# game/script.rpy:155337
translate chinese map168_8977ab4a:

    # voice "se/x00380.ogg"
    voice "se/x00380.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:155339
translate chinese map168_b68b7a41:

    # char_sovy "Thank you Shane, it means a lot.\nI can tell we're going to get along just fine."
    char_sovy "谢谢你，肖恩，这对我意义重大。\n我看得出来我们会相处得很好。"

# game/script.rpy:155374
translate chinese map161_f87bbe8f:

    # "We take slow, heavy steps through the deserts of Alarinthia.{w}\nHeat assaults us, and the humidity is thick, like sheets in the air.{w}\nUlric seems unfazed, but everyone else is handling it pretty badly."
    "我们迈着缓慢沉重的步伐穿过阿拉林西亚的沙漠。{w}\n热浪袭来，湿气浓重，像一层层帷幕悬在空中。{w}\n乌尔里克似乎毫不在意，但其他人都快撑不住了。"

# game/script.rpy:155396
translate chinese map161_286e8261:

    # voice "se/z01679.ogg"
    voice "se/z01679.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:155398
translate chinese map161_1ecea2c3:

    # char_damek "I can't believe that people actually {i}live{/i} here.\nHow much farther is it, Ulric? This is crazy."
    char_damek "我真不敢相信居然有人{i}住在{/i}这里。\n还有多远，乌尔里克？这太疯狂了。"

# game/script.rpy:155423
translate chinese map161_716382cf:

    # voice "se/z01680.ogg"
    voice "se/z01680.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:155425
translate chinese map161_79d90ca1:

    # char_ulric "I'd say around six to eight hours.\nThere's an oasis halfway there. We can stop.\nI have a feeling you've already exhausted your canteen."
    char_ulric "大概六到八个小时吧。\n半路有个绿洲。我们可以停下来。\n我感觉你的水壶已经喝空了。"

# game/script.rpy:155450
translate chinese map161_9a2cedf2:

    # voice "se/z01681.ogg"
    # char_damek "It was too hard to resist.\nSo, there's an oasis in a few hours?\nThat'll be a good place to rest and relax."
    voice "se/z01681.ogg"
    char_damek "实在太难忍住了。\n那么，几个小时后有个绿洲？\n那是个休息放松的好地方。"

# game/script.rpy:155476
translate chinese map161_6485f759:

    # voice "se/z01682.ogg"
    # char_ulric "We can't waste that kind of time, Damek.\nThere's enough time to fill up on water. That's it.\nIf we take too long, we'll miss both Vivien, and the ball."
    voice "se/z01682.ogg"
    char_ulric "我们不能浪费那么多时间，达梅克。\n只够灌满水。就这样。\n如果我们拖太久，就会错过薇薇安和舞会。"

# game/script.rpy:155502
translate chinese map161_14bd9d2b:

    # voice "se/z01683.ogg"
    # char_damek "Right. Of course."
    voice "se/z01683.ogg"
    char_damek "对。当然。"

# game/script.rpy:155524
translate chinese map161_84abfa5d:

    # "Damek pants, sweat trailing through his fur.{w}\nHe's not alone, though. Almost everybody acts the same.{w}\nHopefully things would cool down once the sun started to set."
    "达梅克喘着粗气，汗水顺着他的毛发流淌。{w}\n不过他不是一个人。几乎每个人都一个样。{w}\n希望太阳落山后能凉快一些。"

# game/script.rpy:155526
translate chinese map161_2be7818e:

    # "I move toward Ulric as we walk through the desert.{w}\nHe was our guide, so I shouldn't let him out of sight.{w}\nI can see the city in the distance, but no oasis at all."
    "穿过沙漠时，我朝乌尔里克走去。{w}\n他是我们的向导，我不该让他离开视线。{w}\n我能看见远处的城市，却根本看不到什么绿洲。"

# game/script.rpy:155551
translate chinese map161_b8de36e4:

    # voice "se/z01684.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Back in the day, they used these deserts as punishment.\nCriminals were sent out here, and they had to prove their worth.\nIf they were strong enough to survive, then they'd be taken back in."
    voice "se/z01684.ogg"
    char_ulric "从前，他们把这些沙漠当作惩罚之地。\n罪犯被流放到这里，必须证明自己的价值。\n如果他们够强，能活下来，就会被重新接纳。"

# game/script.rpy:155565
translate chinese map161_051fcd45:

    # voice "se/z01685.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Most of the time, the criminals would just succumb to the heat.\nThey'd be unable to move, then they'd pass out. Death would come soon after.\nThey called these people \"sixers\", since they usually passed out within six hours."
    voice "se/z01685.ogg"
    char_ulric "大多数时候，罪犯们直接就被酷热击垮了。\n他们会动弹不得，然后昏厥。死亡很快就会降临。\n他们把这种人叫做“六时人”，因为他们通常在六个小时内就会昏倒。"

# game/script.rpy:155580
translate chinese map161_382d4fca:

    # "I'm not sure why he's telling this to me.{w}\nIf he wants to pep me up, he's sure failing.\nWe'd be out here for more than six hours."
    "我不明白他为什么要跟我说这些。{w}\n如果他是想给我打气，那肯定是失败了。\n我们要在这外面待上超过六个小时。"

# game/script.rpy:155605
translate chinese map161_3a63b029:

    # voice "se/z01686.ogg"
    # char_ulric "In addition to that, their bodies lasted six days.\nDon't worry though, we'll be fine. We have water.\nThat isn't a courtesy they wanted to give to criminals."
    voice "se/z01686.ogg"
    char_ulric "除此之外，他们的尸体能撑六天。\n不过别担心，我们会没事的。我们有水。\n那可算不上他们愿意给罪犯的优待。"

# game/script.rpy:155620
translate chinese map161_17c6986a:

    # "Well, at least that makes me feel better."
    "好吧，至少这让我感觉好点了。"

# game/script.rpy:155645
translate chinese map161_47d1727a:

    # voice "se/z01687.ogg"
    # char_ulric "You're probably wondering why I'm telling you this story."
    voice "se/z01687.ogg"
    char_ulric "你大概在想我为什么要给你讲这个故事。"

# game/script.rpy:155660
translate chinese map161_3fdf649f:

    # "He smiles, and holds out his arm.{w}\nRotating it slightly, he shows off his tattoos."
    "他笑了笑，伸出手臂。{w}\n微微转动，展示着他的纹身。"

# game/script.rpy:155685
translate chinese map161_043d0710:

    # voice "se/z01688.ogg"
    # char_ulric "If the \"sixer\" survived, they gave them special markings.\nThey were pardoned, and to be respected for their power.\nA bit of a secret, you know. Just keep it between us, alright?"
    voice "se/z01688.ogg"
    char_ulric "如果“六时人”活了下来，他们就会被赐予特殊的印记。\n他们会被赦免，并因自身的力量而受人尊敬。\n算是个小秘密，你知道的。就我们俩知道，行吗？"

# game/script.rpy:155700
translate chinese map161_a5f85c2b:

    # "Wait, so Ulric is an Alarinthian criminal...?{w}\nOr at least he was, since he appears to have been pardoned.{w}\nI'm glad that he was comfortable enough to tell me this kind of stuff."
    "等等，所以乌尔里克是阿拉林西亚的罪犯……？{w}\n至少曾经是，因为他似乎已经被赦免了。{w}\n我很高兴他能放心地跟我说这些事。"

# game/script.rpy:155725
translate chinese map161_88e77f28:

    # voice "se/z01689.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Besides — they look pretty good, don't they?" nointeract
    voice "se/z01689.ogg"
    char_ulric "再说——它们挺好看的，对吧？" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:155741
translate chinese map161_7570bec5:

    # voice "se/z01690.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Well, they haven't used that method of punishment in a while.\nYou might just need to find a copycat artist, like Salus did.\nIf something looks cool, people always try to rip it off."
    voice "se/z01690.ogg"
    char_ulric "嗯，他们已经有一阵子没用那种惩罚方式了。\n你可能得找个模仿的纹身师，就像萨卢斯那样。\n只要什么东西看起来酷，人们总会想模仿。"

# game/script.rpy:155757
translate chinese map161_5edcd2ae:

    # voice "se/z01691.ogg"
    # char_ulric "You're definitely not the first one to say that.\nI didn't like them at first, but they grew on me.\nIf something makes you look better — embrace it."
    voice "se/z01691.ogg"
    char_ulric "你绝对不是第一个这么说的人。\n我一开始也不喜欢它们，但后来渐渐爱上了。\n只要什么东西能让你更好看——就接受它。"

# game/script.rpy:155773
translate chinese map161_43999d56:

    # voice "se/z01692.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Does this make me a different person somehow?\nThere's plenty you haven't told me about {i}your{/i} past.\nYou're still The Monarch to me, and I'm still your friend."
    voice "se/z01692.ogg"
    char_ulric "这难道就让我变成另一个人了吗？\n关于{i}你{/i}的过去，也有很多你没告诉我的事。\n对我来说你依然是君主，我也依然是你的朋友。"

# game/script.rpy:155789
translate chinese map161_15ad4d67:

    # voice "se/z01693.ogg"
    # char_ulric "I'd say good luck, but they don't do \"sixers\" anymore.\nThey stopped that method of punishment ages ago.\nYou might need to find a copycat on the black market."
    voice "se/z01693.ogg"
    char_ulric "我本想祝你好运，但他们已经不搞“六时人”了。\n他们很久以前就废止了那种惩罚方式。\n你可能得去黑市找个模仿者。"

# game/script.rpy:155805
translate chinese map161_205f6286:

    # voice "se/z01694.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Well, I guess they're not for everybody.\nI think I'd look a bit bland without them, you know?\nWe could all benefit from some \"embellishment\"."
    voice "se/z01694.ogg"
    char_ulric "嗯，我猜它们不是人人都适合。\n我觉得没有它们我会显得有点平淡，你懂吗？\n我们都能从一些“点缀”中受益。"

# game/script.rpy:155820
translate chinese map161_07177474:

    # voice "se/z01695.ogg"
    voice "se/z01695.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:155822
translate chinese map161_80702389:

    # char_ulric "Anyway, I guess that's enough story time for now.\nThe more you know about Alarinthia, the better.\nThat, and it makes the walk go by way faster."
    char_ulric "总之，我想故事时间到此为止吧。\n你对阿拉林西亚了解得越多越好。\n而且，这能让路程走得快得多。"

# game/script.rpy:155835
translate chinese map161_6f8e49ae:

    # voice "se/z01696.ogg"
    # char_ulric "If you'll excuse me, I have some business to take care of.\nWe'll have plenty of time to talk later, [firstname]. Trust me.\nIf you find that you're needing anything, just wave me down."
    voice "se/z01696.ogg"
    char_ulric "恕我失陪，我有些事要处理。\n以后我们有的是时间聊，[firstname]。相信我。\n如果你需要什么，朝我挥挥手就行。"

# game/script.rpy:155857
translate chinese map161_63921b9a:

    # "I nod, before looking back at the rest of my comrades.{w}\nThey look so drained, and fatigued. We need that oasis, and fast."
    "我点点头，然后回头看向其余的同伴。{w}\n他们看起来筋疲力尽，疲惫不堪。我们急需那个绿洲。"

# game/script.rpy:156341
translate chinese Fortaime1_map162_5_0_bda70beb:

    # char_fortaime "Hey." nointeract
    char_fortaime "嘿。" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:156358
translate chinese Fortaime1_map162_5_0_4f6b608a:

    # voice "se/y01142.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "From what I've experienced so far? It's awful.\nI'm holding out on the hope that it's colder in the city.\nBut I know that won't be true. I bet it'll be even worse."
    voice "se/y01142.ogg"
    char_fortaime "就我目前的体验？糟透了。\n我一直盼着城里会凉快点。\n但我知道那不可能。我打赌只会更糟。"

# game/script.rpy:156362
translate chinese Fortaime1_map162_5_0_ee087617:

    # voice "se/y01143.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "If I lived here, I'd definitely be nocturnal.\nI mean, it must get colder at night time, right?\nI'd just sleep the day away — and that's a fact."
    voice "se/y01143.ogg"
    char_fortaime "如果我住在这里，肯定会变成夜行动物。\n我是说，晚上总会凉快点，对吧？\n我就白天睡大觉——这是肯定的。"

# game/script.rpy:156376
translate chinese Fortaime1_map162_5_0_f4b07bb2:

    # voice "se/y01144.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "So I guess not much would change, to be honest.\nThough I haven't been able to get much sleep lately.\nAnyway, yeah — it's basically the worst place in the world."
    voice "se/y01144.ogg"
    char_fortaime "所以老实说，我想也不会有什么改变。\n不过最近我一直睡不好。\n总之，是啊——这基本就是世界上最糟的地方。"

# game/script.rpy:156396
translate chinese Fortaime1_map162_5_0_be4f8de8:

    # voice "se/y01145.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "I sure hope so, otherwise this would be a waste.\nI mean, coming here, and then leaving empty handed?\nThat'd mean we put ourselves through all of this for nothing."
    voice "se/y01145.ogg"
    char_fortaime "我希望如此，否则这趟就白来了。\n我是说，大老远跑来，然后空手而归？\n那意味着我们白受了这么多苦。"

# game/script.rpy:156410
translate chinese Fortaime1_map162_5_0_033dc856:

    # voice "se/y01146.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "That's not my style, you know.\nI don't care if we have to fight in a tournament, even.\nWe're not coming all the way here only to accomplish nothing."
    voice "se/y01146.ogg"
    char_fortaime "那可不是我的风格，你知道的。\n就算要参加比武大会我也无所谓。\n我们大老远跑来，绝不是为了白跑一趟。"

# game/script.rpy:156430
translate chinese Fortaime1_map162_5_0_c1f7ce4e:

    # voice "se/y01147.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "Whoa, putting me on the spot, huh?\nI guess I'd probably side with Vivien.\nUlric hates this place, and I can see why."
    voice "se/y01147.ogg"
    char_fortaime "哇，你这是当众考我啊？\n我想我大概会站在薇薇安这边。\n乌尔里克讨厌这个地方，我明白为什么。"

# game/script.rpy:156444
translate chinese Fortaime1_map162_5_0_31031b12:

    # voice "se/y01148.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "Politics would only make this a million times worse.\nSo I think Alarinthia would be better off like the mainland.\nIt's different, yes. But in my opinion, it's a {i}bad{/i} different."
    voice "se/y01148.ogg"
    char_fortaime "政治只会让这里糟糕一百万倍。\n所以我觉得阿拉林西亚还是像大陆那样比较好。\n是不一样，没错。但在我看来，是{i}糟糕的{/i}不一样。"

# game/script.rpy:156458
translate chinese Fortaime1_map162_5_0_3cdbc3ef:

    # voice "se/y01149.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "Like, Mazeo was different, but it was {i}good{/i}.\nA constant battle to see who is stronger? Yikes.\nSounds like that would get pretty toxic, and fast."
    voice "se/y01149.ogg"
    char_fortaime "比如，马泽奥也不一样，但那是{i}好的{/i}不一样。\n不断地比谁更强？啧。\n听起来很快就会变得相当恶劣。"

# game/script.rpy:156478
translate chinese Fortaime1_map162_5_0_e9b370ab:

    # voice "se/y01150.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "That's a tough choice, but I'd have to say Damek.\nIt's not fair that Howl tried to pin all of this on him.\nNothing that happened at the Rebel HQ was his fault."
    voice "se/y01150.ogg"
    char_fortaime "这选择挺难的，但我得说是达梅克。\n豪尔想把这一切都推到他身上，这太不公平了。\n反抗军总部发生的事没有一件是他的错。"

# game/script.rpy:156492
translate chinese Fortaime1_map162_5_0_7a6dbc78:

    # voice "se/y01151.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "But that doesn't mean I hate Howl. Far from it.\nHe seems so wise, and we could learn a lot from him.\nAn entire ancient culture inside of him? Just think about it."
    voice "se/y01151.ogg"
    char_fortaime "但这不代表我讨厌豪尔。差得远呢。\n他看起来那么有智慧，我们能从他身上学到很多。\n他体内装着整个古老的文化？想想看吧。"

# game/script.rpy:156506
translate chinese Fortaime1_map162_5_0_fd676ba9:

    # voice "se/y01152.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "There's so much we don't know about The Monarchy.\nHe could help us fill dozens and dozens of history books.\nI hope he survives this. He has {i}lots{/i} of info to pass on to us."
    voice "se/y01152.ogg"
    char_fortaime "关于君主国，我们不知道的太多了。\n他能帮我们写满几十本历史书。\n我希望他能活下来。他有{i}很多{/i}信息要传给我们。"

# game/script.rpy:156526
translate chinese Fortaime1_map162_5_0_d713a506:

    # voice "se/y01153.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "No, and I'm slowly melting.\nI went through all my water within the first hours.\nMy fault, I know. I'll make sure to ration it better next time."
    voice "se/y01153.ogg"
    char_fortaime "不，我正慢慢融化呢。\n头几个小时我就把水全喝光了。\n是我的错，我知道。下次我一定好好分配。"

# game/script.rpy:156540
translate chinese Fortaime1_map162_5_0_1a0f0a12:

    # voice "se/y01154.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "If there is a next time, of course.\nI'm starting to think that this oasis was a lie.\nI see mirages, sure, but no {i}real{/i} water."
    voice "se/y01154.ogg"
    char_fortaime "当然了，如果有下次的话。\n我开始觉得这个绿洲是个骗局。\n我确实看到了海市蜃楼，但没有{i}真正的{/i}水。"

# game/script.rpy:156554
translate chinese Fortaime1_map162_5_0_7e6ccef6:

    # voice "se/y01155.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "If you see it, make sure to tell me right away.\nI might even go for a swim if I have the time.\nYou should join me. It'd be pretty awesome."
    voice "se/y01155.ogg"
    char_fortaime "如果你看到了，一定要马上告诉我。\n要是有时间，我甚至可能去游个泳。\n你也一起来吧。那会很棒的。"

# game/script.rpy:156615
translate chinese click_map162_6_EV006_98971d4b:

    # voice "se/w00304.ogg"
    voice "se/w00304.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:156617
translate chinese click_map162_6_EV006_4755bfa2:

    # char_ulric "Hey Pro, can I talk to you for a second?"
    char_ulric "嘿，普洛，我能跟你聊两句吗？"

# game/script.rpy:156630
translate chinese click_map162_6_EV006_5558d73b:

    # voice "se/w00305.ogg"
    voice "se/w00305.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:156633
translate chinese click_map162_6_EV006_04a7435d:

    # char_pro "Of course! What's up?"
    char_pro "当然！怎么了？"

# game/script.rpy:156646
translate chinese click_map162_6_EV006_37b85c41:

    # voice "se/w00306.ogg"
    voice "se/w00306.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:156648
translate chinese click_map162_6_EV006_863e34b7:

    # char_ulric "I can't say in front of everybody else.\nI need to talk to you alone. In {i}secret{/i}."
    char_ulric "我不能当着大家的面说。\n我需要单独跟你谈。{i}秘密{/i}地谈。"

# game/script.rpy:156661
translate chinese click_map162_6_EV006_6295f018:

    # voice "se/w00307.ogg"
    voice "se/w00307.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:156663
translate chinese click_map162_6_EV006_74be89c6:

    # char_pro "Oh, is it about {i}that{/i}?"
    char_pro "哦，是关于{i}那件事{/i}吗？"

# game/script.rpy:156676
translate chinese click_map162_6_EV006_43d291d3:

    # voice "se/w00308.ogg"
    voice "se/w00308.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:156678
translate chinese click_map162_6_EV006_b10b9eba:

    # char_ulric "Pro. Not in front of anybody else.\nFollow me over here, and talk quietly."
    char_ulric "普洛。别当着别人的面。\n跟我到这边来，小声说。"

# game/script.rpy:156691
translate chinese click_map162_6_EV006_fee05096:

    # voice "se/w00309.ogg"
    voice "se/w00309.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:156693
translate chinese click_map162_6_EV006_4a1d8994:

    # char_pro "Right, right. Sorry.\nWell then, what's up?"
    char_pro "好，好。抱歉。\n那么，怎么了？"

# game/script.rpy:156733
translate chinese click_map162_9_EV009_40171f01:

    # "Sand, sand, and more sand.{w}\nWait, what's that? Right. Sand."
    "沙子，沙子，还是沙子。{w}\n等等，那是什么？对。沙子。"

# game/script.rpy:156770
translate chinese click_map162_10_EV010_f5bcf2e1:

    # "These cliffs must act as landmarks.{w}\nWithout those, it would be easy to get lost.{w}\nGetting lost in this desert could easily be deadly."
    "这些悬崖一定充当了地标。{w}\n没有它们，很容易迷路。{w}\n在这片沙漠里迷路，很容易就会送命。"

# game/script.rpy:156807
translate chinese click_map162_11_EV011_b6212a73:

    # "I guess that's Alarinthia, way out there.{w}\nThis is going to be one {i}long{/i} journey.{w}\nHopefully the oasis helps all of us out."
    "我猜那就是阿拉林西亚，在很远的地方。{w}\n这将是一趟{i}漫长{/i}的旅程。{w}\n希望那个绿洲能帮到我们大家。"

# game/script.rpy:156844
translate chinese click_map162_12_EV012_f5bcf2e1:

    # "These cliffs must act as landmarks.{w}\nWithout those, it would be easy to get lost.{w}\nGetting lost in this desert could easily be deadly."
    "这些悬崖一定充当了地标。{w}\n没有它们，很容易迷路。{w}\n在这片沙漠里迷路，很容易就会送命。"

# game/script.rpy:156908
translate chinese map163_b2ec1cf4:

    # "When we arrive at the oasis, everybody immediately runs toward it.{w}\nOpening their canteens, they fill them up, and quickly drink up.{w}\nI do the same, before turning to face my allies in relief."
    "到达绿洲时，所有人立刻朝它跑去。{w}\n他们打开水壶，灌满水，然后一饮而尽。{w}\n我也照做，然后如释重负地转向我的同伴们。"

# game/script.rpy:156910
translate chinese map163_51ca24aa:

    # "I was starting to get parched, and worried about passing out.{w}\nThe placement of an oasis here was awfully convenient.{w}\nI choose not to count our blessings, as I face my friends."
    "我开始口干舌燥，担心会昏倒。{w}\n这里正好有个绿洲，未免也太方便了。{w}\n面对朋友们时，我选择不去细想这份幸运。"

# game/script.rpy:156932
translate chinese map163_7b20459b:

    # voice "se/z01697.ogg"
    voice "se/z01697.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:156934
translate chinese map163_66de5b25:

    # char_fortaime "This is amazing! Just what I needed!\nIf you don't mind, I'm gonna take a swim.\nJust give me a few minutes, alright...?"
    char_fortaime "太棒了！正是我需要的！\n如果你不介意，我要去游个泳。\n就给我几分钟，行吗……？"

# game/script.rpy:156959
translate chinese map163_b3f380e1:

    # voice "se/z01698.ogg"
    voice "se/z01698.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:156961
translate chinese map163_740e03e4:

    # char_valessa "Fortaime, no! That's disgusting.\nPeople drink this water. It's not for swimming."
    char_valessa "福泰姆，不行！那太恶心了。\n人们要喝这水。不是用来游泳的。"

# game/script.rpy:156976
translate chinese map163_0126f749:

    # voice "se/z01699.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "But!"
    voice "se/z01699.ogg"
    char_fortaime "可是！"

# game/script.rpy:156992
translate chinese map163_f7f1cb51:

    # voice "se/z01700.ogg"
    # char_valessa "No!"
    voice "se/z01700.ogg"
    char_valessa "不行！"

# game/script.rpy:157007
translate chinese map163_0694618a:

    # "Fortaime scoffs, and crosses his arms.{w}\nThis is the moment I decide to tell them what Howl told me.{w}\nWithout the power from Sauleberg's idol, Valinorth would be fine."
    "福泰姆嗤了一声，抱起双臂。{w}\n就在这一刻，我决定把豪尔告诉我的事告诉他们。{w}\n没有索尔伯格灵像的力量，瓦利诺斯也会安然无恙。"

# game/script.rpy:157032
translate chinese map163_da99cf23:

    # voice "se/z01701.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "Wait, really!?"
    voice "se/z01701.ogg"
    char_fortaime "等等，真的吗！？"

# game/script.rpy:157058
translate chinese map163_668c61e6:

    # voice "se/z01702.ogg"
    # char_valessa "That's amazing...!\nAnd you're certain about this?"
    voice "se/z01702.ogg"
    char_valessa "太不可思议了……！\n你确定吗？"

# game/script.rpy:157073
translate chinese map163_51f6e968:

    # "I nod. Howl was definitely a reliable source.{w}\nThere was now an upside to all of our shaken faith."
    "我点点头。豪尔绝对是个可靠的消息来源。{w}\n如今，我们那动摇的信仰也算有了个好处。"

# game/script.rpy:157098
translate chinese map163_2eba6bf3:

    # voice "se/z01703.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "I totally needed to hear some good news!\nThis trek through the desert is downright awful.\nWhen we get back, let's all go back to Valinorth!"
    voice "se/z01703.ogg"
    char_fortaime "我太需要听到点好消息了！\n这趟穿越沙漠的跋涉简直糟透了。\n等我们回去，大家一起回瓦利诺斯吧！"

# game/script.rpy:157124
translate chinese map163_ed9bcc36:

    # voice "se/z01704.ogg"
    # char_valessa "Yeah, definitely! It'll feel so good to be back home.\nWith your vision, and that dim idol, my outlook was so grim.\nBut now that attack won't happen, and the idol doesn't matter."
    voice "se/z01704.ogg"
    char_valessa "是啊，当然！回到家的感觉一定很棒。\n再加上你的幻象和那黯淡的灵像，我本来一片悲观。\n但现在那场袭击不会发生了，灵像也无所谓了。"

# game/script.rpy:157150
translate chinese map163_9ff02d66:

    # voice "se/z01705.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "Long live Valinorth...?"
    voice "se/z01705.ogg"
    char_fortaime "瓦利诺斯万岁……？"

# game/script.rpy:157176
translate chinese map163_85315e4d:

    # voice "se/z01706.ogg"
    # char_valessa "Long live Valinorth."
    voice "se/z01706.ogg"
    char_valessa "瓦利诺斯万岁。"

# game/script.rpy:157203
translate chinese map163_cb68db09:

    # "We all smile before parting ways. I look over at Ulric and Pro.{w}\nThey're talking to each other, but very quietly. Almost secretive.{w}\nI choose not to interrupt them and make my way over to Damek."
    "我们相视一笑，然后各自散去。我看向乌尔里克和普洛。{w}\n他们正在交谈，但声音很低。几乎像是在密谋。{w}\n我选择不去打扰他们，径直走向达梅克。"

# game/script.rpy:157228
translate chinese map163_c9547a44:

    # voice "se/z01707.ogg"
    voice "se/z01707.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:157230
translate chinese map163_150e9492:

    # char_damek "Hey, we were just talking about our future options.\nI mean, would we rather side with Vivien or Draycu?\nI think Vivien is the better option, but Howl disagrees."
    char_damek "嘿，我们刚在讨论我们未来的选择。\n我是说，我们该站在薇薇安还是德雷库那边？\n我觉得薇薇安是更好的选择，但豪尔不同意。"

# game/script.rpy:157255
translate chinese map163_9392bae0:

    # voice "se/z01708.ogg"
    voice "se/z01708.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:157257
translate chinese map163_28b98fc2:

    # char_howl "As we seem to do on many matters.\nWe need strength to win the upcoming war, Damek.\nVivien cannot deliver as much strength. Only hope for her nation."
    char_howl "就像我们在许多事上那样。\n我们需要力量来赢下即将到来的战争，达梅克。\n薇薇安提供不了那么多力量。只能给她的人民希望。"

# game/script.rpy:157270
translate chinese map163_fb4ee66c:

    # voice "se/z01709.ogg"
    # char_howl "If hope could win wars, we wouldn't even be here.\nIn times like this, we are glad that you're not in charge.\nWe trust that the Monarch will make the proper decision."
    voice "se/z01709.ogg"
    char_howl "如果希望就能打赢战争，我们根本就不会在这里。\n在这种时候，我们很庆幸掌权的不是您。\n我们相信君主会做出正确的决定。"

# game/script.rpy:157296
translate chinese map163_63daf988:

    # voice "se/z01710.ogg"
    # char_damek "Well, what do you say, Monarch?\nIf you had to choose right now, what would you do?\nJust a hypothetical of course. Nothing set in stone." nointeract
    voice "se/z01710.ogg"
    char_damek "那么，你怎么说，君主？\n如果你现在必须做选择，你会怎么做？\n当然只是假设。没有定论。" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:157312
translate chinese map163_4eb33ac8:

    # voice "se/z01711.ogg"
    # char_damek "There you have it, Howl.\nWe need to think about the future of this world, too.\nIt makes sense to give Alarinthia a new form of leadership."
    voice "se/z01711.ogg"
    char_damek "你也听到了，豪尔。\n我们也得为这个世界的未来着想。\n给阿拉林西亚一种新的领导方式，是合情合理的。"

# game/script.rpy:157328
translate chinese map163_83dc4fe8:

    # voice "se/z01712.ogg"
    # char_damek "Aww, really...? Come on, Monarch.\nI know we need strength, but we need to think about Alestia.\nWe have the chance to reshape an entire nation, here."
    voice "se/z01712.ogg"
    char_damek "啊，真的吗……？拜托，君主。\n我知道我们需要力量，但我们得为阿莱斯蒂亚考虑。\n我们有机会重塑一整个国家。"

# game/script.rpy:157355
translate chinese map163_9a5776fd:

    # voice "se/z01713.ogg"
    voice "se/z01713.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:157357
translate chinese map163_4161dfec:

    # char_howl "There is nothing wrong with the way Alarinthia is run.\nYou cannot change it simply because you do not like it.\nSuch a move would make you no better than The Triumvirate."
    char_howl "阿拉林西亚的统治方式没有任何问题。\n你不能仅仅因为自己不喜欢就去改变它。\n那样做只会让你和三人执政团没什么两样。"

# game/script.rpy:157370
translate chinese map163_51b060c4:

    # voice "se/z01714.ogg"
    # char_howl "We cannot become the enemy we seek to dethrone.\nYour way of thinking requires some reevaluation, Damek.\nYou may say \"means to an end\", but so does The Triumvirate."
    voice "se/z01714.ogg"
    char_howl "我们不能变成我们想要推翻的敌人。"

# game/script.rpy:157396
translate chinese map163_de85ded5:

    # voice "se/z01715.ogg"
    # char_damek "Wow, you paint me as such a villain."
    voice "se/z01715.ogg"
    char_damek "哇，你把我描绘得像个大反派。"

# game/script.rpy:157422
translate chinese map163_43bea938:

    # voice "se/z01716.ogg"
    # char_howl "A change in leadership would require the spilling of blood.\nInnocents would die, much like the occupation of Mazeo.\nThink of what you lost. Do you want to do this to others?"
    voice "se/z01716.ogg"
    char_howl "更换领导层需要流血。\n无辜者会死去，就像马泽奥被占领时那样。\n想想你失去的一切。你想对别人做同样的事吗？"

# game/script.rpy:157437
translate chinese map163_0ba298f6:

    # "Damek seems unable to come up with a response to this.{w}\nPromptly changing the subject, he seems to admit defeat."
    "达梅克似乎无法回应这番话。{w}\n他马上转移了话题，看来是认输了。"

# game/script.rpy:157462
translate chinese map163_348f032b:

    # voice "se/z01717.ogg"
    # char_damek "Well, are you all full up on water...?\nUlric said we're halfway there, and we're making good time.\nI think we'll make it to the city with plenty of time to spare, Monarch."
    voice "se/z01717.ogg"
    char_damek "那么，你们的水都灌满了吗……？\n乌尔里克说我们走了一半了，走得挺快。\n我想我们能提前不少时间赶到城里，君主。"

# game/script.rpy:157477
translate chinese map163_54973b53:

    # "Howl seems unamused at the sudden change in topic."
    "豪尔对这突如其来的话题转变似乎并不买账。"

# game/script.rpy:157502
translate chinese map163_ae2206d9:

    # voice "se/z01718.ogg"
    # char_howl "This body does not work like you would expect.\nWe do not need water, and do not risk passing out.\nWhenever you're ready to continue, we will do so."
    voice "se/z01718.ogg"
    char_howl "这具身体不像你想象的那样运作。\n我们不需要水，也不会昏倒。\n你们准备好继续时，我们就出发。"

# game/script.rpy:157529
translate chinese map163_a97192d9:

    # "After saying that, we all part ways.{w}\nWe shouldn't stay here for too much longer.{w}\nMissing that ball would damage our cause immensely."
    "说完这些，我们各自散开。{w}\n我们不该在这里停留太久。{w}\n错过那场舞会对我们的事业将是巨大的打击。"

# game/script.rpy:157843
translate chinese click_map164_4_EV004_9988734b:

    # voice "se/a00284.ogg"
    voice "se/a00284.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:157845
translate chinese click_map164_4_EV004_566c3a6f:

    # char_fortaime "I could sit here and drink this all day.\nI've never missed water so much in my entire life.\nIn fact, leave me behind. I'll stay here until things are done."
    char_fortaime "我可以坐在这儿，一整天都喝这个。\n我这辈子从没这么想念过水。\n其实，把我留下吧。我会待在这里，直到事情办完。"

# game/script.rpy:157848
translate chinese click_map164_4_EV004_029bed96:

    # voice "se/a00285.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Nice try, but you're not getting out of this {i}that{/i} easy.\nFill up your canteen, Fortaime. We need to get going."
    voice "se/a00285.ogg"
    char_ulric "想得美，可你不会{i}那么{/i}容易就逃掉。\n把水壶灌满，福泰姆。我们得出发了。"

# game/script.rpy:157852
translate chinese click_map164_4_EV004_921db0de:

    # voice "se/a00286.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "Wait, your canteen is so much bigger than mine.\nCan we trade...? You're used to this desert, Ulric."
    voice "se/a00286.ogg"
    char_fortaime "等等，你的水壶比我的大多了。\n我们换一下行吗……？你习惯这片沙漠了，乌尔里克。"

# game/script.rpy:157856
translate chinese click_map164_4_EV004_dff83d22:

    # voice "se/a00287.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Used to it...? I haven't been here for thou—\nYou know what? Fine, you can have it, Fortaime.\nJust fill it up and let's get going, okay?"
    voice "se/a00287.ogg"
    char_ulric "习惯……？我都几千年没来这——\n算了吧。行，给你，福泰姆。\n把它灌满，我们走，行吗？"

# game/script.rpy:157860
translate chinese click_map164_4_EV004_b15a658c:

    # voice "se/a00288.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "Alright. Score!"
    voice "se/a00288.ogg"
    char_fortaime "好吧。赚到了！"

# game/script.rpy:157898
translate chinese click_map164_5_EV005_942a69e4:

    # "Fortaime circles these trees. Clearly, he wants to climb them.{w}\nIt's not very long until Ulric grabs him and takes him away.{w}\nHe's almost become some sort of babysitter at this rate."
    "福泰姆绕着这些树打转。显然，他想爬上去。{w}\n没过多久，乌尔里克就把他抓住带走了。{w}\n照这样下去，他简直快成保姆了。"

# game/script.rpy:157935
translate chinese click_map164_6_EV006_ac85086b:

    # "Still no sign of the city. How much farther could it be...?{w}\nI think Ulric said this was the halfway point, or something.{w}\nHopefully none of us pass out from exhaustion in this place."
    "还是看不到城市的影子。到底还有多远……？{w}\n我记得乌尔里克说这里是半途，还是别的什么。{w}\n希望我们没人会在这地方累昏过去。"

# game/script.rpy:157961
translate chinese click_map164_7_EV007_f81f27ee:

    # "This banter appears because of your choice to create Seers."
    "这段闲聊出现，是因为你选择了创造先知。"

# game/script.rpy:158001
translate chinese click_map164_9_EV009_fa592dd6:

    # voice "se/w00310.ogg"
    voice "se/w00310.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:158003
translate chinese click_map164_9_EV009_3f7e3c35:

    # char_fortaime "So, what's it like to be a Seer...?\nWhat kind of stuff are you starting to see?\nDoes it hurt your head? Are you enjoying it...?"
    char_fortaime "那么，当先知是什么感觉……？\n你开始看到什么样的东西了？\n会头疼吗？你享受这种感觉吗……？"

# game/script.rpy:158016
translate chinese click_map164_9_EV009_6e3fda3c:

    # voice "se/w00311.ogg"
    voice "se/w00311.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:158022
translate chinese click_map164_9_EV009_1a9dc914:

    # char_jit_map164_9_1_19 "It gives me great pleasure to see the future.\nBut right now, it's just little things. Indecipherable.\nPerhaps as we process this, things will become clearer."
    char_jit_map164_9_1_19 "能看到未来让我非常欣喜。\n但眼下只是些小事。难以解读。\n也许随着我们逐渐适应，一切会变得更清晰。"

# game/script.rpy:158035
translate chinese click_map164_9_EV009_0a9fdac5:

    # voice "se/w00312.ogg"
    voice "se/w00312.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:158041
translate chinese click_map164_9_EV009_b4da437a:

    # char_jit_map164_9_1_28 "I see loss in the future. Loss, and tragedy.\nBut for which side of this battle, I cannot say.\nIt seems to be a \"gut feeling\", at the moment."
    char_jit_map164_9_1_28 "我在未来看到了失去。失去，还有悲剧。\n但属于这场战斗的哪一方，我说不上来。\n眼下，这更像是一种“直觉”。"

# game/script.rpy:158054
translate chinese click_map164_9_EV009_c699ba0c:

    # voice "se/w00313.ogg"
    voice "se/w00313.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:158060
translate chinese click_map164_9_EV009_d83f1b6c:

    # char_jit_map164_9_1_37 "Yeah, it's the same for me. Brief flashes.\nBut I see a coliseum, and a big struggle.\nI think you'll all be fighting during your visit."
    char_jit_map164_9_1_37 "是啊，我也一样。短暂的闪念。\n但我看到了一座斗兽场，还有一场激烈的搏斗。\n我想你们此行的期间会有一场战斗。"

# game/script.rpy:158073
translate chinese click_map164_9_EV009_b6fb6663:

    # voice "se/w00314.ogg"
    voice "se/w00314.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:158075
translate chinese click_map164_9_EV009_67fbcab3:

    # char_fortaime "Fighting...? That's no fun.\nHopefully your powers get better over time.\nImagine how strong you'd be in those battles...!"
    char_fortaime "参战……？那可不好玩。\n希望你的力量能随着时间变强。\n想象一下你在那些战斗里会有多强……！"

# game/script.rpy:158088
translate chinese click_map164_9_EV009_ff9871e1:

    # voice "se/w00315.ogg"
    voice "se/w00315.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:158090
translate chinese click_map164_9_EV009_06a78c13:

    # char_fortaime "Able to see every move before the enemy even makes it.\nWith that power, we'd never have to worry about tragedy or loss.\nI can tell you're going to be one of the best assets in this war."
    char_fortaime "能在敌人出手之前就看穿每一个动作。\n有了那种力量，我们就永远不必担心悲剧和失去。\n我敢说你会成为这场战争中最宝贵的战力之一。"

# game/script.rpy:158103
translate chinese click_map164_9_EV009_9c0b5b9d:

    # voice "se/w00316.ogg"
    voice "se/w00316.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:158105
translate chinese click_map164_9_EV009_4173b152:

    # char_jit_map164_9_1_28 "Why thank you. That means a lot.\nI'm happy to serve The Rebellion in any way I can.\nWhat they did back in those tunnels was inexcusable."
    char_jit_map164_9_1_28 "哦，谢谢你。这对我意义重大。\n我很乐意尽我所能为反抗军效力。\n他们在那些隧道里做的事不可饶恕。"

# game/script.rpy:158118
translate chinese click_map164_9_EV009_69b5edc0:

    # voice "se/w00317.ogg"
    voice "se/w00317.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:158120
translate chinese click_map164_9_EV009_283a3a7a:

    # char_jit_map164_9_1_37 "Yeah. I'd say we show them the same treatment.\nWe'll fight for a future that all of you can enjoy.\nEven if we can't join that future ourselves."
    char_jit_map164_9_1_37 "是啊。要我说，我们该以牙还牙。\n我们会为一个你们所有人都能享受的未来而战。\n哪怕我们自己无法进入那个未来。"

# game/script.rpy:158133
translate chinese click_map164_9_EV009_9704584c:

    # voice "se/w00318.ogg"
    voice "se/w00318.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:158135
translate chinese click_map164_9_EV009_92851181:

    # char_jit_map164_9_1_19 "That's certainly a pessimistic view, Ignace.\nThere might be a way to save our minds, you know.\nThis Rebellion has proved that {i}anything{/i} is possible."
    char_jit_map164_9_1_19 "这看法确实挺悲观的，伊格纳斯。\n也许有办法保住我们的心智，你知道的。\n这场反抗已经证明了{i}任何事{/i}都有可能。"

# game/script.rpy:158148
translate chinese click_map164_9_EV009_fa8c2dea:

    # voice "se/w00319.ogg"
    voice "se/w00319.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:158150
translate chinese click_map164_9_EV009_fd3d0669:

    # char_jit_map164_9_1_37 "Yeah, you're right.\nWe'll make it through this."
    char_jit_map164_9_1_37 "是啊，你说得对。\n我们会挺过去的。"

# game/script.rpy:158234
translate chinese Valessa1_map164_138_0_b41c75c8:

    # char_valessa "Hey." nointeract
    char_valessa "嘿。" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:158251
translate chinese Valessa1_map164_138_0_d51d2f30:

    # voice "se/y01303.ogg"
    # char_valessa "I can't believe how hot it is, actually.\nI mean, Ulric told us stories, and I thought he was exaggerating.\nAs soon as we stepped off that ship, I knew he was actually right."
    voice "se/y01303.ogg"
    char_valessa "真不敢相信这里这么热。\n我是说，乌尔里克给我们讲过那些故事，我还以为他在夸张。\n可我们一下船，我就知道他说的都是真的。"

# game/script.rpy:158255
translate chinese Valessa1_map164_138_0_bcee9283:

    # voice "se/y01304.ogg"
    # char_valessa "Of course, he doesn't seem like the type to embellish his stories.\nMaybe some part of me was just hoping it wouldn't be that bad.\nHe painted such a grim picture of this place, you know...?"
    voice "se/y01304.ogg"
    char_valessa "当然，他看起来不像是会添油加醋的那种人。\n也许我心底有一部分只是希望没那么糟。\n他把这地方描述得太可怕了，你知道吧……？"

# game/script.rpy:158275
translate chinese Valessa1_map164_138_0_6ee5058d:

    # voice "se/y01305.ogg"
    # char_valessa "Vivien, hands down. I don't like the way Alarinthia is run.\nRelying on strength alone creates such a toxic atmosphere.\nAnyone with a brilliant mind would simply be pushed aside."
    voice "se/y01305.ogg"
    char_valessa "毫无疑问是薇薇安。我不喜欢阿拉林西亚的统治方式。\n只靠力量维系，会营造出如此恶劣的氛围。\n任何才华横溢的人都会被直接排挤到一边。"

# game/script.rpy:158289
translate chinese Valessa1_map164_138_0_19b0a6a8:

    # voice "se/y01306.ogg"
    # char_valessa "That holds back the progression of society by {i}so{/i} much.\nValinorth embraced new ideas, and nurtured bright minds.\nIf anything, it actually explains why Alarinthia is so primitive."
    voice "se/y01306.ogg"
    char_valessa "这{i}大大{/i}阻碍了社会的进步。\n瓦利诺斯拥抱新思想，培育聪慧的头脑。\n真要说的话，这恰好解释了为什么阿拉林西亚如此原始。"

# game/script.rpy:158309
translate chinese Valessa1_map164_138_0_97b7167d:

    # voice "se/y01307.ogg"
    # char_valessa "It's so weird, seeing our former Elder just walking around.\nBut I need to work on that. I need my mind to {i}know{/i} it's not him.\nSalus is gone, and there's nothing we can do to change that fact."
    voice "se/y01307.ogg"
    char_valessa "看到我们前任长老就这么四处走动，感觉太奇怪了。\n但我得克服这一点。我得让我的脑子{i}明白{/i}那不是他。\n萨卢斯已经走了，我们无法改变这个事实。"

# game/script.rpy:158323
translate chinese Valessa1_map164_138_0_dc4df3a0:

    # voice "se/y01308.ogg"
    # char_valessa "Howl is an interesting guy. He sure has a lot to say.\nHis insight into the past of the world could fill a million books.\nWith all of those souls, he knows almost everything there is to know."
    voice "se/y01308.ogg"
    char_valessa "豪尔是个有意思的人。他确实有很多话要说。\n他对这个世界过去的洞见能写满一百万本书。\n凭着那些灵魂，他几乎无所不知。"

# game/script.rpy:158337
translate chinese Valessa1_map164_138_0_ba49945d:

    # voice "se/y01309.ogg"
    # char_valessa "He told me that society has actually {i}regressed{/i} in Alarinthia.\nIt used to be one with The Monarchy. Their whole world was united.\nI hope we can make a world like that, after this war is finally over."
    voice "se/y01309.ogg"
    char_valessa "他告诉我，阿拉林西亚的社会其实{i}倒退了{/i}。\n它曾经与君主国融为一体。他们的整个世界是统一的。\n希望等这场战争最终结束后，我们能创造那样一个世界。"

# game/script.rpy:158357
translate chinese Valessa1_map164_138_0_95af550a:

    # voice "se/y01310.ogg"
    # char_valessa "Yeah, I want to break the record for most water ever ingested.\nI'll never take something like that for granted ever again, I swear.\nIt makes me miss the water tank from back in Valinorth, actually."
    voice "se/y01310.ogg"
    char_valessa "是啊，我想打破喝水最多的纪录。\n我发誓，我再也不会把这种事当成理所当然了。\n说真的，这让我开始想念瓦利诺斯的水箱了。"

# game/script.rpy:158361
translate chinese Valessa1_map164_138_0_04cc2fb6:

    # voice "se/y01311.ogg"
    # char_valessa "Whenever we needed it, it was right there on demand.\nOne oasis in the entire desert makes water pretty scarce.\nHow do they handle the water situation in their capital...?"
    voice "se/y01311.ogg"
    char_valessa "我们需要的时候，它随时都在。\n整片沙漠只有一处绿洲，水就变得相当稀缺。\n他们的首都是怎么解决用水问题的……？"

# game/script.rpy:158381
translate chinese Valessa1_map164_138_0_d3acd388:

    # voice "se/y01312.ogg"
    # char_valessa "Yeah, I think he'll be fine. It's just a lot to take in.\nHe finally has a chance to change this place for the better.\nApparently that's all he's wanted ever since he was young."
    voice "se/y01312.ogg"
    char_valessa "是啊，我想他不会有事的。只是要接受的太多了。\n他终于有机会把这里变得更好。\n据说那是他打小就唯一想要的东西。"

# game/script.rpy:158395
translate chinese Valessa1_map164_138_0_d88ad631:

    # voice "se/y01313.ogg"
    # char_valessa "I feel like this world will be completely different after we win.\nThat's such a scary thought. Well, scary and exciting.\nWe're leading a revolution. I almost can't believe it."
    voice "se/y01313.ogg"
    char_valessa "我感觉等我们赢了之后，这个世界会彻底不同。\n这想法真让人害怕。嗯，既害怕又兴奋。\n我们正在引领一场革命。我几乎不敢相信。"

# game/script.rpy:158446
translate chinese map165_06540712:

    # "We arrive at the gates to Alarinthia, after an exhausting trek through the desert.{w}\nIt feels like things will change now that we're here, but they probably won't.{w}\nThe city won't be any more inviting. There just might be more water."
    "在经历了穿越沙漠的艰苦跋涉后，我们抵达了阿拉林西亚的城门。{w}\n感觉到了这里，一切都会改变，但大概并不会。{w}\n这座城市不会更友好。只是也许水会多一些。"

# game/script.rpy:158448
translate chinese map165_652d7681:

    # "A lone man stands at the gates, and I recognize him.{w}\nHe's the man I saw watching us back at the docks.{w}\nThis can't be coincidence. He must be after us."
    "城门口站着一个孤身男子，我认出了他。{w}\n他就是我在码头时看到监视我们的那个人。{w}\n这不可能是巧合。他一定是在追我们。"

# game/script.rpy:158450
translate chinese map165_193590e4:

    # "Ulric notices him and starts to walk toward the gate."
    "乌尔里克注意到了他，开始朝城门走去。"

# game/script.rpy:158472
translate chinese map165_70441860:

    # voice "se/z01719.ogg"
    voice "se/z01719.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:158474
translate chinese map165_d38f7f5b:

    # char_ulric "Let me handle this, I've been here before.\nHe probably knows who we are. Info travels fast, here.\nJust stay calm, and I'll have us in the city in no time, alright?"
    char_ulric "让我来处理，我以前来过这里。\n他大概知道我们是谁。在这里消息传得很快。\n都别慌，我很快就能让我们进城，行吗？"

# game/script.rpy:158488
translate chinese map165_dc345a46:

    # "We all nod, leaving Ulric to handle the situation."
    "我们都点点头，让乌尔里克去处理局面。"

# game/script.rpy:158513
translate chinese map165_5e734480:

    # voice "se/z01720.ogg"
    # char_ulric "We seek passage into the city, and nothing more.\nIt's been a long trip from Mazeo, and we need shelter.\nOur business lies with the ones known as Vivien and Draycu."
    voice "se/z01720.ogg"
    char_ulric "我们只求进城，别无所图。\n从马泽奥一路走来路途漫长，我们需要落脚之处。\n我们要找的人是薇薇安和德雷库。"

# game/script.rpy:158528
translate chinese map165_6df2fe61:

    # "The man remains silent for a few moments, before bursting into laughter."
    "那人沉默了片刻，然后突然大笑起来。"

# game/script.rpy:158553
translate chinese map165_fc5a14ef:

    # voice "se/z01721.ogg"
    voice "se/z01721.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:158559
translate chinese map165_2ffed06c:

    # char_jit_map165_1_0_60 "I know exactly who you are, Ulric.\nVivien is waiting for you in the tavern.\nAnd Draycu? Well, you'll have a ball to attend."
    char_jit_map165_1_0_60 "我完全知道你是谁，乌尔里克。\n薇薇安正在酒馆里等你。\n至于德雷库？嗯，你还有场舞会要参加。"

# game/script.rpy:158584
translate chinese map165_5d90f2f5:

    # voice "se/z01722.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Wait, how do you know who I am...?"
    voice "se/z01722.ogg"
    char_ulric "等等，你怎么知道我是谁……？"

# game/script.rpy:158610
translate chinese map165_ac9f5717:

    # voice "se/z01722b.ogg"
    # char_jit_map165_1_0_60 "I followed you all, up until the oasis.\nThat was my chance to get ahead, and tip off Vivien.\nBesides, you stick out like a sore thumb. Nice markings, \"sixer\"."
    voice "se/z01722b.ogg"
    char_jit_map165_1_0_60 "我一路跟着你们，直到绿洲那儿。\n那是我抄近路、给薇薇安通风报信的机会。\n再说，你太扎眼了。不错的印记，“六时人”。"

# game/script.rpy:158636
translate chinese map165_c7f716c7:

    # voice "se/z01723.ogg"
    # char_ulric "I trust that won't be an issue...?"
    voice "se/z01723.ogg"
    char_ulric "我想这不会有什么问题吧……？"

# game/script.rpy:158662
translate chinese map165_7e277d1f:

    # voice "se/z01724.ogg"
    # char_jit_map165_1_0_60 "It shouldn't, but I'm surprised you found somebody to do that.\nRecreating the markings of the ancients is frowned upon.\nThey {i}earned{/i} those markings. You certainly did not."
    voice "se/z01724.ogg"
    char_jit_map165_1_0_60 "应该不会，但我很好奇你居然找到了人给你弄这个。\n重现古人的印记是会遭人唾弃的。\n那些印记是他们{i}挣来的{/i}。你就肯定不是。"

# game/script.rpy:158688
translate chinese map165_d23797d7:

    # voice "se/z01725.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Of course. "
    voice "se/z01725.ogg"
    char_ulric "当然。"

# game/script.rpy:158714
translate chinese map165_633ec083:

    # voice "se/z01726.ogg"
    # char_jit_map165_1_0_60 "Though you do bear a striking resemblance to the Ulric of legend.\nIf anything, that'll make your relationship with Vivien more amicable."
    voice "se/z01726.ogg"
    char_jit_map165_1_0_60 "不过你确实和传说中的乌尔里克长得出奇地像。\n真要说的话，这会让你们和薇薇安的关系更融洽。"

# game/script.rpy:158740
translate chinese map165_3127f572:

    # voice "se/z01727.ogg"
    # char_ulric "I was given this name by my parents.\nThey aligned with his views, and so do I.\nIf that'll be all, we'd like to keep going."
    voice "se/z01727.ogg"
    char_ulric "这个名字是我父母给我起的。\n他们认同他的理念，我也是。\n如果没有别的事，我们想继续走了。"

# game/script.rpy:158766
translate chinese map165_bdcf4914:

    # voice "se/z01727b.ogg"
    # char_jit_map165_1_0_60 "Of course. I wasn't standing here to stop you.\nI merely wished to welcome you back home.\nI hope you and your \"Monarch\" end up useful."
    voice "se/z01727b.ogg"
    char_jit_map165_1_0_60 "当然。我站在这儿不是要拦你们。\n我只是想欢迎你们回家。\n希望你和你的“君主”最后能派上用场。"

# game/script.rpy:158781
translate chinese map165_62807d2d:

    # "He bows to Ulric, as a sign of respect."
    "他向乌尔里克鞠躬，以示敬意。"

# game/script.rpy:158806
translate chinese map165_6f6d0f86:

    # voice "se/z01728.ogg"
    # char_jit_map165_1_0_60 "By the way. Call me Drakeor."
    voice "se/z01728.ogg"
    char_jit_map165_1_0_60 "顺便说一句。叫我德雷克。"

# game/script.rpy:158828
translate chinese map165_22edcf9b:

    # "Ulric nods, before turning back to face us.{w}\nDrakeor enters the city, likely returning to Vivien's side.{w}\nI'm glad that our quest in this land finally has some direction."
    "乌尔里克点点头，然后转身面向我们。{w}\n德雷克进了城，大概是回到薇薇安身边去了。{w}\n我很高兴我们在这片土地上的任务终于有了方向。"

# game/script.rpy:158853
translate chinese map165_5320d9be:

    # voice "se/z01729.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Well, that was easy.\nBecause of the ball, there's almost no security.\nI knew he'd be involved with Vivien. I could just tell."
    voice "se/z01729.ogg"
    char_ulric "嗯，还挺顺利。\n因为舞会的缘故，几乎没有什么守卫。\n我就知道他和薇薇安有牵连。我一眼就看出来了。"

# game/script.rpy:158879
translate chinese map165_ba866880:

    # voice "se/z01730.ogg"
    voice "se/z01730.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:158881
translate chinese map165_ec184c68:

    # char_valessa "So we'll have enough time to meet with her before the ball.\nThat's great, I was worried we'd be on a tight schedule.\nYou can't really rush decisions that change a nation."
    char_valessa "所以我们有足够的时间在舞会前见她。\n太好了，我本来还担心时间会很紧。\n改变一个国家的决定，可急不得。"

# game/script.rpy:158906
translate chinese map165_f68b218e:

    # voice "se/z01731.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Yeah, it was definitely fortuitous.\nWe better make sure it's not a trap.\nThat's the perfect way to catch us off guard."
    voice "se/z01731.ogg"
    char_ulric "是啊，这绝对是个巧合的好运。\n我们最好确定这不是个陷阱。\n那可是让我们措手不及的绝佳方式。"

# game/script.rpy:158932
translate chinese map165_4c5d381f:

    # voice "se/z01732.ogg"
    # char_valessa "Well, he didn't seem disingenuous."
    voice "se/z01732.ogg"
    char_valessa "嗯，他看起来不像是在装假。"

# game/script.rpy:158958
translate chinese map165_83994d4d:

    # voice "se/z01733.ogg"
    # char_ulric "That's the perfect way to catch us off guard."
    voice "se/z01733.ogg"
    char_ulric "那可是让我们措手不及的绝佳方式。"

# game/script.rpy:158984
translate chinese map165_86bf5975:

    # voice "se/z01734.ogg"
    # char_valessa "Right. So what's the next step?"
    voice "se/z01734.ogg"
    char_valessa "对。那下一步是什么？"

# game/script.rpy:159010
translate chinese map165_288907ea:

    # voice "se/z01735.ogg"
    # char_ulric "We head into the town square.\nIf the tavern hasn't moved, it's connected.\nWe'll be seeing Vivien within the hour, for sure."
    voice "se/z01735.ogg"
    char_ulric "我们进城去城镇广场。\n如果酒馆没搬走，它们是相通的。\n一小时内我们肯定能见到薇薇安。"

# game/script.rpy:159036
translate chinese map165_10d6874a:

    # voice "se/z01736.ogg"
    # char_valessa "Alright, sounds good to me.\nIs there more water in the city...?"
    voice "se/z01736.ogg"
    char_valessa "好，听起来不错。\n城里水更多吗……？"

# game/script.rpy:159062
translate chinese map165_baa9b014:

    # voice "se/z01737.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Yeah, but don't ask for water in the tavern.\nIt's seen as a sign of weakness amongst Alarinthians.\nIf you drink anything while we're there, make sure it's ale."
    voice "se/z01737.ogg"
    char_ulric "有，但在酒馆里别要水。\n在阿拉林西亚人看来，那是软弱的表现。\n我们在那儿的时候，你要喝什么，一定得是麦酒。"

# game/script.rpy:159089
translate chinese map165_3195ee4b:

    # "Everybody stands around, seeming to wait for my mark.{w}\nThere's something up with Ulric, I have a strong gut feeling.{w}\nHis secret talks with Pro, and some of the things Drakeor said."
    "大家都站在周围，似乎在等我发号施令。{w}\n我的直觉强烈地告诉我，乌尔里克有事瞒着我们。{w}\n他和普洛的密谈，还有德雷克说的那些话。"

# game/script.rpy:159268
translate chinese Howl1_map166_5_0_7934b34d:

    # char_howl "Hmm." nointeract
    char_howl "嗯。" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:159285
translate chinese Howl1_map166_5_0_2b504b83:

    # voice "se/y01314.ogg"
    # char_howl "No, it is completely different. More primitive.\nAlarinthia existed in unison with The Monarchy.\nIt was one part of a larger whole. It was peaceful."
    voice "se/y01314.ogg"
    char_howl "不，它完全不同。更加原始。\n阿拉林西亚曾与君主国和谐共存。\n它曾是一个更大整体的一部分。那时很和平。"

# game/script.rpy:159289
translate chinese Howl1_map166_5_0_583ba3d4:

    # voice "se/y01315.ogg"
    # char_howl "Being stuck in a constant power struggle sounds awful.\nBut still, it has given us what we need. A strong potential ally.\nDraycu is the result of generations of a savage cycle of growth."
    voice "se/y01315.ogg"
    char_howl "陷在持续不断的权力斗争中，听起来很可怕。\n但尽管如此，它给了我们需要的东西。一个强大的潜在盟友。\n德雷库是世代野蛮成长循环的产物。"

# game/script.rpy:159303
translate chinese Howl1_map166_5_0_7af0baac:

    # voice "se/y01316.ogg"
    # char_howl "Every ruler, stronger than the last.\nFor almost an eternity, they have followed these laws.\nDraycu and his army must be exceptional in their power."
    voice "se/y01316.ogg"
    char_howl "每一任统治者都比上一任更强。\n几乎永恒以来，他们都遵循着这些法则。\n德雷库和他的军队的力量一定非同寻常。"

# game/script.rpy:159323
translate chinese Howl1_map166_5_0_b6c0c673:

    # voice "se/y01317.ogg"
    # char_howl "We have no complaints.\nIt seems to be others who have problems.\nEspecially those close to Salus, like his son."
    voice "se/y01317.ogg"
    char_howl "我们没有怨言。\n似乎有意见的是别人。\n尤其是那些与萨卢斯亲近的人，比如他的儿子。"

# game/script.rpy:159337
translate chinese Howl1_map166_5_0_bc818011:

    # voice "se/y01318.ogg"
    # char_howl "But we will work on that while we travel.\nPerhaps your forces just need time to adjust.\nThis must be a jarring transition, to say the least."
    voice "se/y01318.ogg"
    char_howl "但我们会在旅途中处理这件事。\n也许你的部下只是需要时间适应。\n至少可以说，这一定是个令人不适的转变。"

# game/script.rpy:159357
translate chinese Howl1_map166_5_0_5d3fd077:

    # voice "se/y01319.ogg"
    # char_howl "Yes. We require no sustenance.\nWe may eat and drink with this body, but it is not necessary.\nIf anything, we would do it for pleasure, rather than to survive."
    voice "se/y01319.ogg"
    char_howl "是的。我们不需要进食。\n这具身体可以吃喝，但没有必要。\n真要说的话，我们吃喝是为了享受，而不是为了生存。"

# game/script.rpy:159371
translate chinese Howl1_map166_5_0_999a7c72:

    # voice "se/y01320.ogg"
    # char_howl "But pleasure is not something we require, either.\nSo, because of that, we choose not to eat or drink.\nThere are those who need it more than us, [firstname]."
    voice "se/y01320.ogg"
    char_howl "但享受也不是我们所必需的。\n所以，正因如此，我们选择不吃不喝。\n有人比我们更需要这些，[firstname]。"

# game/script.rpy:159391
translate chinese Howl1_map166_5_0_34fd1521:

    # voice "se/y01321.ogg"
    # char_howl "We are unable to comment on this matter.\nConjecture of that kind will lead nowhere constructive.\nWe must simply increase our chances of winning — and try."
    voice "se/y01321.ogg"
    char_howl "我们无法对这件事发表评论。\n那种猜测不会有任何建设性的结果。\n我们只能想方设法提高胜算——然后尽力而为。"

# game/script.rpy:159427
translate chinese click_map166_8_EV008_530f7f81:

    # "This banter appears because of your choice to create Monarch Vessels."
    "这段闲聊出现，是因为你选择了创造君主容器。"

# game/script.rpy:159467
translate chinese click_map166_10_EV010_9778b5a2:

    # voice "se/w00320.ogg"
    voice "se/w00320.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:159469
translate chinese click_map166_10_EV010_8b9e0626:

    # char_valessa "So what's it like...?\nYou know, being a vessel."
    char_valessa "那么那是什么感觉……？\n你知道的，当一具容器。"

# game/script.rpy:159482
translate chinese click_map166_10_EV010_f3f69387:

    # voice "se/w00321.ogg"
    voice "se/w00321.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:159488
translate chinese click_map166_10_EV010_36b9d10b:

    # char_jit_map166_10_1_18 "It is not much different than when we were alive.\nThere are simply voices in our head. Lots of them.\nThe Monarchy guides our every move."
    char_jit_map166_10_1_18 "跟我们活着的时候没太大区别。\n只是脑海里有声音。很多声音。\n君主国指引着我们的每一个举动。"

# game/script.rpy:159501
translate chinese click_map166_10_EV010_482c931c:

    # voice "se/w00322.ogg"
    voice "se/w00322.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:159507
translate chinese click_map166_10_EV010_6f2557e6:

    # char_jit_map166_10_1_27 "They are fueled by the rage of their imprisonment.\nEverything inside of us tells us to fight, and to kill.\nWhen the time comes, we will fight for this world."
    char_jit_map166_10_1_27 "他们被囚禁的愤怒所驱动。\n我们内心的一切都叫嚣着要战斗，要杀戮。\n时机到来时，我们会为这个世界而战。"

# game/script.rpy:159520
translate chinese click_map166_10_EV010_8671f6af:

    # voice "se/w00323.ogg"
    voice "se/w00323.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:159526
translate chinese click_map166_10_EV010_10d6f34b:

    # char_jit_map166_10_1_36 "The wounds on our bodies hurt us at first.\nBut like white noise, we have phased it out.\nIt only flares up every few minutes, now."
    char_jit_map166_10_1_36 "起初我们身上的伤口会疼。\n但就像白噪音一样，我们已经逐渐屏蔽了它。\n现在只是每隔几分钟发作一次。"

# game/script.rpy:159539
translate chinese click_map166_10_EV010_cfbd7c4f:

    # voice "se/w00324.ogg"
    voice "se/w00324.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:159541
translate chinese click_map166_10_EV010_dd5db85a:

    # char_valessa "And how bad is it...?"
    char_valessa "那有多疼……？"

# game/script.rpy:159554
translate chinese click_map166_10_EV010_1a3b93f0:

    # voice "se/w00325.ogg"
    voice "se/w00325.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:159556
translate chinese click_map166_10_EV010_252b1a29:

    # char_jit_map166_10_1_18 "We feel every wound as if freshly inflicted.\nIt is almost like we exist on the edge of life and death.\nOur body is unable to fully commit to either side of the spectrum."
    char_jit_map166_10_1_18 "每一道伤口我们都感觉像是刚受的伤。\n简直就像我们存在于生与死的边缘。\n我们的身体无法完全归属于任何一端。"

# game/script.rpy:159569
translate chinese click_map166_10_EV010_533c5ef2:

    # voice "se/w00326.ogg"
    voice "se/w00326.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:159571
translate chinese click_map166_10_EV010_940e6203:

    # char_valessa "That sounds horrible..."
    char_valessa "听起来太可怕了……"

# game/script.rpy:159584
translate chinese click_map166_10_EV010_2c8459d6:

    # voice "se/w00327.ogg"
    voice "se/w00327.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:159586
translate chinese click_map166_10_EV010_e97d08de:

    # char_jit_map166_10_1_27 "Horrible, yes. But also necessary.\nWith our aid, The Triumvirate shall fall.\nJustice will finally be given to The Monarchy."
    char_jit_map166_10_1_27 "可怕，是的。但也是必要的。\n有我们的相助，三人执政团必将倒下。\n正义终将还给君主国。"

# game/script.rpy:159599
translate chinese click_map166_10_EV010_d4033c82:

    # voice "se/w00328.ogg"
    voice "se/w00328.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:159601
translate chinese click_map166_10_EV010_f46bd581:

    # char_jit_map166_10_1_36 "When we can deliver that justice, the pain is worth it.\nWe embrace this as a gift, and will honor The Monarch.\nWithout their choice, we would not be alive to fight."
    char_jit_map166_10_1_36 "当我们能带来那份正义时，这痛苦就值得了。\n我们视此为恩赐，并将尊崇君主。\n若不是他们的选择，我们就无法活着战斗。"

# game/script.rpy:159614
translate chinese click_map166_10_EV010_94ee2e94:

    # voice "se/w00329.ogg"
    voice "se/w00329.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:159616
translate chinese click_map166_10_EV010_c85967e6:

    # char_valessa "I just wish there was a way to make the pain go away.\nYou know, after this war, you're still going to suffer."
    char_valessa "我只希望能有办法让痛苦消失。\n你知道的，这场战争之后，你依然会受苦。"

# game/script.rpy:159629
translate chinese click_map166_10_EV010_b056029c:

    # voice "se/w00330.ogg"
    voice "se/w00330.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:159631
translate chinese click_map166_10_EV010_75a33eae:

    # char_jit_map166_10_1_18 "We are not the only ones who will continue to suffer.\nThe wounds endured during this war can also be emotional.\nScars will haunt {i}all{/i} of your forces. We are not the only ones."
    char_jit_map166_10_1_18 "会继续受苦的不只是我们。\n这场战争中承受的创伤也可能是情感上的。\n伤疤会困扰你们{i}所有{/i}的部队。我们并不是唯一。"

# game/script.rpy:159644
translate chinese click_map166_10_EV010_11f5ca4e:

    # voice "se/w00331.ogg"
    voice "se/w00331.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:159646
translate chinese click_map166_10_EV010_fa4db744:

    # char_valessa "Right..."
    char_valessa "对……"

# game/script.rpy:159820
translate chinese map076_f753e08e:

    # "When we arrive at the docks, we finally get an up close view of everything.{w}\nIt's a massive shipyard, with vessels both arriving and departing.{w}\nPeople run in every direction, a mixture of workers and pirates."
    "当我们抵达码头时，终于近距离看到了这一切。{w}\n那是个巨大的船坞，既有船舰进港，也有船舰离港。{w}\n人们朝各个方向奔忙，混着工人和海盗。"

# game/script.rpy:159822
translate chinese map076_bbeabef4:

    # "I suppose they share the same workspace.{w}\nIt's interesting how I can discern a pirate from their clothes and demeanor.{w}\nAfter a few steps into the shipyard, we're surrounded by tons of people."
    "我猜他们共用同一个工作场所。{w}\n有趣的是，我能从衣着和举止分辨出谁是海盗。{w}\n走进船坞没几步，我们就被无数人包围了。"

# game/script.rpy:159844
translate chinese map076_821519ad:

    # voice "se/z01036.ogg"
    voice "se/z01036.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:159846
translate chinese map076_95986b19:

    # char_damek "Hey, stick close to me.\nWouldn't want to get lost, right?"
    char_damek "嘿，紧跟着我。\n可不想走丢，对吧？"

# game/script.rpy:159860
translate chinese map076_4b9282cc:

    # "He inches closer to me, and we make our way through the shipyard.{w}\nIt must be their busy hour or something, because we can barely move.{w}\nPeople bump into us, and apologize before moving on their way."
    "他向我靠近了些，我们穿过船坞。{w}\n一定是赶上他们最忙的时候了，因为我们几乎挪不动。{w}\n人们撞到我们，道个歉又继续赶路。"

# game/script.rpy:159885
translate chinese map076_602eb7d5:

    # voice "se/z01037.ogg"
    voice "se/z01037.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:159887
translate chinese map076_6d1c85f0:

    # char_damek "We're heading to that bridge up there."
    char_damek "我们要去那边那座桥。"

# game/script.rpy:159901
translate chinese map076_760ca1b4:

    # "He points forward, to a bridge in the distance.{w}\nAt this rate, it would take hours to get there.{w}\nFortaime lets out an exasperated sigh."
    "他指着前方远处的一座桥。{w}\n照这个速度，得花上好几个小时才能到。{w}\n福泰姆懊恼地叹了口气。"

# game/script.rpy:159926
translate chinese map076_d5fb8c68:

    # voice "se/z01038.ogg"
    voice "se/z01038.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:159928
translate chinese map076_d181d9ec:

    # char_fortaime "Seriously!?\nHow much longer is this gonna be...?"
    char_fortaime "不是吧！？\n这还要多久啊……？"

# game/script.rpy:159953
translate chinese map076_0093ce74:

    # voice "se/z01039.ogg"
    voice "se/z01039.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:159955
translate chinese map076_7a5606de:

    # char_damek "Oh, don't be so dramatic, Fortaime.\nWe'll be able to rest before you know it.\nEnjoy the journey. Mazeo is beautiful."
    char_damek "哦，别这么夸张，福泰姆。\n不知不觉我们就能休息了。\n享受这趟旅程吧。马泽奥很美。"

# game/script.rpy:159980
translate chinese map076_19ff9868:

    # voice "se/z01040.ogg"
    voice "se/z01040.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:159982
translate chinese map076_0296c154:

    # char_fortaime "Alright..."
    char_fortaime "好吧……"

# game/script.rpy:160003
translate chinese map076_3f071d39:

    # "Fortaime continues walking, defeated.{w}\nAs we inch our way forward, we start to lose hope.{w}\nHowever, it isn't long before that hope is kindled again."
    "福泰姆认命地继续走着。{w}\n我们一点点往前挪，开始失去希望。{w}\n然而没过多久，那份希望又重新燃起。"

# game/script.rpy:160006
translate chinese map076_84486160:

    # voice "se/z01041.ogg"
    voice "se/z01041.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:160011
translate chinese map076_7749a62b:

    # char_jit_map076_1_0_93 "Hey, Damek!"
    char_jit_map076_1_0_93 "嘿，达梅克！"

# game/script.rpy:160013
translate chinese map076_5e159b5e:

    # "A voice shouts from high up, and we turn to look.{w}\nThere's a man at the top of one of the ships, acting as a lookout.{w}\nAfter seeing Damek, he quickly makes his way down to all of us."
    "高处传来一声呼喊，我们转头看去。{w}\n有个人在其中一艘船的顶端，充当瞭望员。{w}\n看到达梅克后，他迅速朝我们这边下来。"

# game/script.rpy:160015
translate chinese map076_0ce1babc:

    # "He slides down a ladder, quickly making his way to the surface.{w}\nStanding on the edge of the ship, he grips the railing tight."
    "他顺着梯子滑下，很快来到地面。{w}\n站在船沿上，他紧紧抓着栏杆。"

# game/script.rpy:160040
translate chinese map076_3d93dc47:

    # voice "se/z01042.ogg"
    voice "se/z01042.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:160042
translate chinese map076_8ead1d48:

    # char_jit_map076_1_0_93 "Where have you been...?\nIt feels like I haven't seen you in ages!"
    char_jit_map076_1_0_93 "你去哪儿了……？\n感觉好久没见到你了！"

# game/script.rpy:160056
translate chinese map076_c6b1563f:

    # "He jumps over the edge of the ship, landing on the ground with style.{w}\nI can tell he's a pirate, and he must be another ally. That was good.{w}\nIn the upcoming battle, we'd need as many allies as possible."
    "他从船沿跃下，潇洒地落在地上。{w}\n我看得出他是个海盗，而且一定是又一个盟友。这很好。{w}\n在即将到来的战斗中，我们需要尽可能多的盟友。"

# game/script.rpy:160081
translate chinese map076_91f3219c:

    # voice "se/z01043.ogg"
    voice "se/z01043.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:160083
translate chinese map076_ea25bf01:

    # char_damek "Grayson! It's good to see you again.\nDon't worry, it's nothing personal. I'm just busy.\nWe've been cooking up something really special."
    char_damek "格雷森！很高兴又见到你。\n别担心，不是针对你。我只是太忙了。\n我们一直在筹划一件非常特别的事。"

# game/script.rpy:160108
translate chinese map076_b2983505:

    # voice "se/z01044.ogg"
    voice "se/z01044.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:160111
translate chinese map076_9ff13a6b:

    # char_jit_map076_1_0_93 "Special, huh...?\nWell, that's all you had to say.\nYou know I've got your back in {i}everything{/i}."
    char_jit_map076_1_0_93 "特别，是吧……？\n嗯，你早这么说不就行了。\n你知道{i}任何事{/i}我都挺你。"

# game/script.rpy:160125
translate chinese map076_3f66857b:

    # "Damek steps closer, and whispers in Grayson's ear.{w}\nNo doubt he's confiding in Grayson about our recent choice."
    "达梅克走近了些，在格雷森耳边低语。{w}\n他一定是在向格雷森吐露我们最近的选择。"

# game/script.rpy:160150
translate chinese map076_8ab21621:

    # voice "se/z01045.ogg"
    voice "se/z01045.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:160152
translate chinese map076_06ef49d0:

    # char_jit_map076_1_0_93 "Oh, an alliance...?\nBeautiful! We'll be working together more, then.\nAnd I must say, you made a fine decision, Damek."
    char_jit_map076_1_0_93 "哦，结盟……？\n太好了！那我们会更多地合作了。\n不得不说，你做了个明智的决定，达梅克。"

# game/script.rpy:160166
translate chinese map076_a06b5179:

    # "He smiles, and makes an interesting signal with his arms.{w}\nA few moments later, a bunch of people in our way quickly move."
    "他笑了笑，用手臂做了个有趣的手势。{w}\n片刻之后，挡在我们路上的一群人迅速让开了。"

# game/script.rpy:160191
translate chinese map076_d57a895c:

    # voice "se/z01046.ogg"
    voice "se/z01046.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:160193
translate chinese map076_b23b5a58:

    # char_jit_map076_1_0_93 "Gotta get back to the church, I'm guessing?\nSorry about my crew. They're good at getting in the way.\nIn fact, I'm not sure what else they're good for these days."
    char_jit_map076_1_0_93 "我猜，你们得回教堂去？\n抱歉我的船员挡了路。他们很擅长挡道。\n其实，我不确定他们如今还有什么别的用处。"

# game/script.rpy:160207
translate chinese map076_fd499e4f:

    # "Between every few words, he glances behind Damek.{w}\nHis eyes shift between Valessa, Fortaime, and myself."
    "每说几句，他就朝达梅克身后瞥一眼。{w}\n他的目光在瓦莱莎、福泰姆和我之间游移。"

# game/script.rpy:160232
translate chinese map076_064b79ea:

    # voice "se/z01047.ogg"
    voice "se/z01047.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:160234
translate chinese map076_1f16b77d:

    # char_valessa "Can I help you with something...?"
    char_valessa "有什么我能帮你的吗……？"

# game/script.rpy:160259
translate chinese map076_661cd10e:

    # voice "se/z01048.ogg"
    voice "se/z01048.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:160261
translate chinese map076_54d192ab:

    # char_jit_map076_1_0_93 "Oh, sorry, not at all!\nYou just looked familiar, that's all.\nLike some pirates Nada used to work with."
    char_jit_map076_1_0_93 "哦，抱歉，没有没有！\n只是你看起来有点眼熟，仅此而已。\n像纳达以前合作过的几个海盗。"

# game/script.rpy:160286
translate chinese map076_83ceb0ae:

    # voice "se/z01049.ogg"
    voice "se/z01049.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:160288
translate chinese map076_20db575c:

    # char_valessa "Familiar...? \nGryz said the same thing, actually.\nJust one of those faces, I guess."
    char_valessa "眼熟……？\n其实格瑞兹也说过同样的话。\n我想只是那种大众脸吧。"

# game/script.rpy:160313
translate chinese map076_52e0b04b:

    # voice "se/z01050.ogg"
    voice "se/z01050.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:160315
translate chinese map076_5513d56e:

    # char_jit_map076_1_0_93 "Not just {i}any{/i} faces, mind you.\nI was taken aback because you looked like legends.\nA few infamous pirates from back in the day, you know?"
    char_jit_map076_1_0_93 "可不是{i}随便{/i}什么脸，你听好了。\n我吃了一惊，是因为你们长得像传说中的人物。\n从前几个臭名昭著的海盗，你知道吗？"

# game/script.rpy:160340
translate chinese map076_ced4a806:

    # voice "se/z01051.ogg"
    voice "se/z01051.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:160342
translate chinese map076_4254561d:

    # char_valessa "Pirates...?\nNo relation, I assure you."
    char_valessa "海盗……？\n我向你保证，毫无关系。"

# game/script.rpy:160356
translate chinese map076_e01b86e4:

    # "She laughs, and Grayson nods."
    "她笑了，格雷森点点头。"

# game/script.rpy:160381
translate chinese map076_860fb6fb:

    # voice "se/z01052.ogg"
    voice "se/z01052.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:160383
translate chinese map076_7b770313:

    # char_jit_map076_1_0_93 "Yeah, just a small world."
    char_jit_map076_1_0_93 "是啊，世界真小。"

# game/script.rpy:160397
translate chinese map076_fcc3fc47:

    # "It seems like he's unsure if that's an insult or not.{w}\nAnd for that matter, so does Valessa. Grayson lets it slide.{w}\nA few moments later, he climbs up a netting on the side of the ship."
    "他似乎不确定那算不算侮辱。{w}\n同样，瓦莱莎也不确定。格雷森没追究。{w}\n片刻之后，他攀上船舷的网缆。"

# game/script.rpy:160411
translate chinese map076_dba5dade:

    # "It isn't much longer until he's back to the top of the mast, looking out.{w}\nHe shouts to his crew, and they move aside, leaving an open trail for us.{w}\nWere all of these pirates his crew? He must be a man of great influence."
    "没过多久，他就回到了桅杆顶端，向外眺望。{w}\n他朝船员们喊了几句，他们让到一边，给我们让出一条路。{w}\n这些海盗都是他的船员吗？他一定是个极有影响力的人物。"

# game/script.rpy:160436
translate chinese map076_de34b8b0:

    # voice "se/z01053.ogg"
    voice "se/z01053.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:160438
translate chinese map076_bfa39772:

    # char_damek "It's always good to have friends in high places."
    char_damek "在高处有朋友总是好的。"

# game/script.rpy:160452
translate chinese map076_394122a9:

    # "There's still people wandering the shipyard, but not as many as before.{w}\nIn fact, we'd be able to continue forward without any issue at all."
    "船坞里还有人四处走动，但没之前那么多了。{w}\n事实上，我们完全可以毫无阻碍地继续前进了。"

# game/script.rpy:160477
translate chinese map076_84956791:

    # voice "se/z01054.ogg"
    voice "se/z01054.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:160479
translate chinese map076_c1f421f2:

    # char_damek "That was Grayson, we go way back.\nHe's a great ally, and he'll have our back no matter what.\nI doubt he cares whether we sided with Alex or Nada."
    char_damek "那是格雷森，我们是老交情了。\n他是个绝佳的盟友，无论如何都会支持我们。\n我怀疑他根本不在乎我们站的是亚历克斯还是纳达。"

# game/script.rpy:160493
translate chinese map076_5dd0ec58:

    # "That was good. His crew seemed massive.{w}\nThe ship as well, was in pristine condition."
    "这很不错。他的船员看起来阵容庞大。{w}\n那艘船也保养得崭新如初。"

# game/script.rpy:160518
translate chinese map076_73fe5a23:

    # voice "se/z01055.ogg"
    voice "se/z01055.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:160520
translate chinese map076_a3fc3945:

    # char_damek "Well then, on we go...?"
    char_damek "那么，我们继续走吧……？"

# game/script.rpy:160541
translate chinese map076_81244781:

    # "As he talks, he motions to the bridge once more.{w}\nWe give each other some space, happy to be moving freely again.{w}\nI guess we could resume our journey without any struggles."
    "他一边说着，一边再次指向那座桥。{w}\n我们彼此拉开些距离，很高兴又能自由行动了。{w}\n看来我们可以毫无阻碍地继续旅程了。"

# game/script.rpy:160566
translate chinese map104_dd222028:

    # "After what feels like ages, we reach the end of the bridge.{w}\nWe all stop and catch our breath, and let our legs relax.{w}\nDamek wipes some sweat from his brow, laughing."
    "仿佛过了很久很久，我们终于走到了桥的另一端。{w}\n我们都停下来喘口气，让双腿放松一下。{w}\n达梅克笑着擦了擦额头的汗。"

# game/script.rpy:160588
translate chinese map104_699aa9f4:

    # voice "se/z01056.ogg"
    voice "se/z01056.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:160590
translate chinese map104_4c73ba84:

    # char_damek "A bit of a workout, isn't it?\nHopefully, the trek was worth it.\nSo — what do you think of our home?"
    char_damek "算是锻炼了一下，对吧？\n希望这趟跋涉是值得的。\n那么——你觉得我们的家怎么样？"

# game/script.rpy:160604
translate chinese map104_cc3c7948:

    # "He stands proud, staring at the nearby church.{w}\nAfter getting our bearings back, we look on in awe."
    "他自豪地站着，凝视着近旁的教堂。{w}\n等我们缓过神来，我们敬畏地望了过去。"

# game/script.rpy:160629
translate chinese map104_bcb0d40a:

    # voice "se/z01057.ogg"
    voice "se/z01057.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:160631
translate chinese map104_3a22848d:

    # char_fortaime "Whoa, this place is crazy!\nI've never seen anything like it before."
    char_fortaime "哇，这地方太疯狂了！\n我以前从没见过这样的东西。"

# game/script.rpy:160656
translate chinese map104_a455b897:

    # voice "se/z01058.ogg"
    voice "se/z01058.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:160658
translate chinese map104_5b6c7232:

    # char_damek "Yeah, it sure stands out, doesn't it?\nDon't worry — that works to our advantage.\nWhen hiding, I find the most obvious spot is the best."
    char_damek "是啊，它确实很显眼，对吧？\n别担心——这对我们有利。\n要藏身的时候，我发现最显眼的地方反而最好。"

# game/script.rpy:160683
translate chinese map104_2f28950e:

    # voice "se/z01059.ogg"
    voice "se/z01059.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:160685
translate chinese map104_a4a84bd0:

    # char_fortaime "I guess they'd never expect their own church.\nBut here's a question: why are there only two statues?\nIt's The Triumvirate, right? Shouldn't there be three?"
    char_fortaime "我猜他们绝不会想到自己的教堂。\n但有个问题：为什么只有两尊雕像？\n那是三人执政团，对吧？不应该有三尊吗？"

# game/script.rpy:160710
translate chinese map104_d5ad9233:

    # voice "se/z01060.ogg"
    voice "se/z01060.ogg"

