    # voice "se/y00845.ogg"
    # char_pro "Not really, to be honest.\nYou've already seen pretty much all it has to offer.\nIt's constantly busy, and it never really stops."
    voice "se/y00845.ogg"
    char_pro "老实说，没什么特别的。\n能看的你基本都看过了。\n它总是那么忙碌，从不停歇。"

# game/script.rpy:161145
translate chinese Valessa1_map110_1_0_e7a97856:

    # voice "se/y00846.ogg"
    # char_pro "I can't even imagine living close to the docks.\nThey work overnight, so it'd be too loud to sleep.\nThe best places are either Gryz's area, or our HQ."
    voice "se/y00846.ogg"
    char_pro "我根本无法想象住在码头附近。\n他们通宵干活，吵得根本睡不着。\n最好的地方要么是格瑞兹那片，要么就是我们的总部。"

# game/script.rpy:161149
translate chinese Valessa1_map110_1_0_3cb1e4da:

    # voice "se/y00847.ogg"
    # char_pro "So maybe we can talk more about that once you see it.\nIt's so silent underground, you can hear almost everything.\nMakes it pretty easy to sleep. If you get the time, that is."
    voice "se/y00847.ogg"
    char_pro "所以等你看到之后，我们也许可以再细聊。\n地下那么安静，简直什么都能听见。\n很容易入睡。前提是你有时间睡的话。"

# game/script.rpy:161169
translate chinese Valessa1_map110_1_0_6a170674:

    # voice "se/y00848.ogg"
    # char_pro "She's pretty cool. Seems to be pretty by-the-book.\nI mean, I don't see her breaking any laws, or anything.\nI don't roll like that. Obviously, I live in a moral gray area."
    voice "se/y00848.ogg"
    char_pro "她挺酷的。看起来是个循规蹈矩的人。\n我是说，我可看不出她会违法乱纪什么的。\n我可不那样。显然，我活在道德的灰色地带。"

# game/script.rpy:161183
translate chinese Valessa1_map110_1_0_97bc7632:

    # voice "se/y00849.ogg"
    # char_pro "That's not to say that she's uninteresting, though.\nI just don't see myself getting too close to her.\nIt's better for me to stick to like-minded people."
    voice "se/y00849.ogg"
    char_pro "不过这不是说她无趣。\n我只是觉得自己不会跟她太亲近。\n我还是跟志同道合的人来往比较好。"

# game/script.rpy:161187
translate chinese Valessa1_map110_1_0_b310d1f4:

    # voice "se/y00850.ogg"
    # char_pro "Who knows, maybe she'll prove me wrong.\nWar has its way of compromising almost everybody.\nI was born into this life, but I'm sure others can adapt to it."
    voice "se/y00850.ogg"
    char_pro "谁知道呢，也许她会证明我错了。\n战争总有办法让几乎所有人都做出妥协。\n我生来就活在这种生活里，但我相信别人也能适应。"

# game/script.rpy:161207
translate chinese Valessa1_map110_1_0_3f49a1f8:

    # voice "se/y00851.ogg"
    # char_pro "Now he's a guy I could see myself getting along with.\nCan't wait to spend some more time with him in our HQ.\nHe speaks his mind, he's energetic, and he's careless."
    voice "se/y00851.ogg"
    char_pro "他倒是那种我觉得能合得来的人。\n等不及在总部跟他多相处一阵了。\n他有什么说什么，精力充沛，而且大大咧咧。"

# game/script.rpy:161221
translate chinese Valessa1_map110_1_0_649978fc:

    # voice "se/y00852.ogg"
    # char_pro "Wait, am I talking about him, or myself right now?\nYeah, you get the idea. We're like peas in a pod.\nI'm sure we'll have no shortage of good times."
    voice "se/y00852.ogg"
    char_pro "等等，我现在说的是他，还是我自己？\n是啊，你懂我的意思。我们简直一个模子里刻出来的。\n我相信我们会有大把开心时光。"

# game/script.rpy:161241
