translate chinese click_map110_13_EV013_b6e80bb8:

    # "This party banter is due to your relationship with Ulric."
    "这段队伍闲聊是因为你与乌尔里克的关系。"

# game/script.rpy:161925
translate chinese click_map110_14_EV014_1b881954:

    # "That's the bridge we used to come here.{w}\nIt was structurally sound, but didn't feel like it.{w}\nPart of me was scared it'd fall apart from under us."
    "那就是我们来时走过的桥。{w}\n结构上很稳固，但感觉不像。{w}\n我有点害怕它会从我们脚下塌掉。"

# game/script.rpy:161927
translate chinese click_map110_14_EV014_432a290e:

    # "Damek showed no signs of worry, however.{w}\nThat put me at ease, since he was a local.{w}\nIf he was scared, I knew I'd be, as well."
    "不过达梅克毫无担忧的迹象。{w}\n这让我安心了，因为他是本地人。{w}\n如果他害怕，我知道我也会怕。"

# game/script.rpy:161964
translate chinese click_map110_15_EV015_92fb84d2:

    # "It's a statue of a cloaked figure.{w}\nBut we're not sure {i}who{/i} it's supposed to be.{w}\nThere's only two of them. It can't be The Triumvirate."
    "那是一尊披斗篷人物的雕像。{w}\n但我们不确定它{i}该是{/i}谁。{w}\n只有两尊。不可能是三人执政团。"

# game/script.rpy:161966
translate chinese click_map110_15_EV015_8ebce1ca:

    # "If it were, then there'd be three statues.{w}\nBut where would the third statue go anyway?{w}\nMaybe it was just a space limitation thing."
    "如果是的话，就该有三尊雕像。{w}\n但第三尊雕像又能放哪儿呢？{w}\n也许只是空间受限吧。"

# game/script.rpy:161968
translate chinese click_map110_15_EV015_43b590c3:

    # "Either way, they look mysterious and brooding.{w}\nIt makes the entire church give off an eerie vibe.{w}\nThe architectural style wasn't helping it, either."
    "不管怎样，它们看起来神秘而阴沉。{w}\n让整座教堂散发出一种诡异的氛围。{w}\n建筑风格也帮不上忙。"

