    # char_damek "This is the spirit idol of Mazeo.\nOr so we thought, until recently."
    char_damek "这是马泽奥的灵像。\n至少我们以前是这么以为的，直到最近。"

# game/script.rpy:162214
translate chinese map109_f3bc2a06:

    # "It remains dust free, unlike the rest of the church.{w}\nHe places a hand on the altar, looking up at the idol."
    "它一尘不染，不像教堂的其他地方。{w}\n他把一只手放在祭坛上，抬头望着灵像。"

# game/script.rpy:162229
translate chinese map109_5400c328:

    # voice "se/z01067.ogg"
    # char_damek "We assumed it was dim, and dying.\nYou know, like the idol back in Valinorth.\nBut that's not the case at all. We were shocked."
    voice "se/z01067.ogg"
    char_damek "我们以为它黯淡无光，正在消亡。\n你知道的，就像瓦利诺斯的那尊灵像。\n但根本不是那么回事。我们都惊呆了。"

# game/script.rpy:162243
translate chinese map109_65ce2973:

    # voice "se/z01068.ogg"
    voice "se/z01068.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:162245
translate chinese map109_d3058179:

    # char_damek "The reason it's dim, is because it's receiving power.\nHowever, the source of power is deep underground.\nThat's what The Triumvirate has been digging for."
    char_damek "它之所以黯淡，是因为它正在接收能量。\n然而，能量的源头在地下深处。\n那正是三人执政团一直在挖掘的东西。"

# game/script.rpy:162248
translate chinese map109_be92cc88:

    # voice "se/z01069.ogg"
    # char_damek "The entire reason for their occupation...\nAnd now it's in the hands of The Rebellion.\nFirst their sword, now the idol they sought."
    voice "se/z01069.ogg"
    char_damek "他们占领此地的全部理由……\n而现在它落到了反抗军手里。\n先是他们的剑，现在是他们苦苦寻找的灵像。"

# game/script.rpy:162263
translate chinese map109_9a084953:

    # "He turns back to face us, a wide smile on his face."
    "他转过身面向我们，脸上挂着灿烂的笑容。"

# game/script.rpy:162288
