    # char_damek "It would seem the tables are turning.\nFeel free to rest for a few minutes.\nThere's still a bit of a walk ahead."
    char_damek "看来局势正在逆转。\n你们随意休息几分钟吧。\n前面还有一段路要走。"

# game/script.rpy:162315
