    char_damek "相信我，你会有一大把时间休息的。\n继续出发前先喘口气吧。"

# game/script.rpy:162365
translate chinese map109_6ec0ad67:

    # "He points to the pews before walking over to a door in the back corner."
    "他指了指长椅，然后走向后角落的一扇门。"

# game/script.rpy:162391
translate chinese map109_3546373c:

    # voice "se/z01073.ogg"
    voice "se/z01073.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:162393
translate chinese map109_a462d7db:

    # char_damek "This door will lead us to the tunnels, [firstname].\nIt's the final stretch, I can promise you that.\nWhenever you're ready, let's head on down."
    char_damek "这扇门会带我们去隧道，[firstname]。\n这是最后一段路了，我可以向你保证。\n你准备好就下去吧。"

# game/script.rpy:162398
translate chinese map109_9282a3a3:

    # voice "se/z01074.ogg"
    voice "se/z01074.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:162400
translate chinese map109_a462d7db_1:

    # char_damek "This door will lead us to the tunnels, [firstname].\nIt's the final stretch, I can promise you that.\nWhenever you're ready, let's head on down."
    char_damek "这扇门会带我们去隧道，[firstname]。\n这是最后一段路了，我可以向你保证。\n你准备好就下去吧。"

# game/script.rpy:162421
translate chinese map109_ac66b6e0:

    # "He presses his back against the wall, and crosses his arms.{w}\nEveryone seems glad that he was offering us a brief reprieve.{w}\nI'd take a few moments to collect myself before we head down."
    "他把背靠在墙上，双臂交叉。{w}\n他似乎给了我们短暂的喘息机会，大家都很高兴。{w}\n下去之前，我要花点时间整理一下自己。"

# game/script.rpy:162781
translate chinese Valessa1_map111_6_0_bda70beb:

    # char_fortaime "Hey." nointeract
    char_fortaime "嘿。" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:162798
translate chinese Valessa1_map111_6_0_34f19252:

    # voice "se/y00860.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "It's crazy! I don't know what to think.\nJust when I'm comfortable, something new is thrown at us.\nThe markets, the residential districts, {i}and{/i} the docks?"
    voice "se/y00860.ogg"
    char_fortaime "太疯狂了！我都不知道该作何感想。\n我刚觉得自在一点，就又冒出些新东西。\n集市、住宅区，{i}还有{/i}码头？"

# game/script.rpy:162802
translate chinese Valessa1_map111_6_0_b7ef27a3:

    # voice "se/y00861.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "Valinorth is pretty much the same no matter where you are.\nTo see things so different? That's a real shocker for me.\nI'm not sure what my favorite part has been, so far."
    voice "se/y00861.ogg"
    char_fortaime "瓦利诺斯不管在哪儿都差不多一个样。\n看到这么不同的景象？对我来说真是大开眼界。\n到目前为止，我还不确定自己最喜欢哪一部分。"

# game/script.rpy:162816
translate chinese Valessa1_map111_6_0_2d5015ad:

    # voice "se/y00862.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "If I had to choose though, I'd say the residential district.\nBeing able to live free from the noise, and free of work?\nThat's like a dream come true. Everywhere is so {i}noisy{/i}."
    voice "se/y00862.ogg"
    char_fortaime "不过如果非要选，我会选住宅区。\n能住在没有噪音、不用干活的地方？\n简直像梦想成真。到处都是那么{i}吵{/i}。"

# game/script.rpy:162830
translate chinese Valessa1_map111_6_0_938e3c42:

    # voice "se/y00863.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "I assume you get used to the noise, but it's still {i}there{/i}.\nYou know what I mean, right? You just learn to ignore it.\nI'd rather not have to do that, it'd make things way easier."
    voice "se/y00863.ogg"
    char_fortaime "我想人是会习惯噪音的，但它依然{i}在那儿{/i}。\n你懂我的意思吧？你只是学会忽略它。\n我倒希望不用这样，那样会轻松得多。"

# game/script.rpy:162850
translate chinese Valessa1_map111_6_0_f8d44677:

    # voice "se/y00864.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "He's so cool! I love being around him.\nI want to learn to be more like him, if I'm honest.\nEverybody respects him, and follows his directions."
    voice "se/y00864.ogg"
    char_fortaime "他好酷！我喜欢待在他身边。\n老实说，我想学着变得更像他。\n大家都尊敬他，听从他的指示。"

# game/script.rpy:162864
translate chinese Valessa1_map111_6_0_8afa8f99:

    # voice "se/y00865.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "He's going to make a fine leader after this is over.\nI actually doubted The Rebellion, but he convinced me.\nThis cause is in perfect hands. We're {i}going{/i} to do this."
    voice "se/y00865.ogg"
    char_fortaime "等这一切结束后，他会成为一位出色的领袖。\n我其实曾怀疑过反抗军，但他说服了我。\n这个事业交到了最合适的人手里。我们{i}一定{/i}能做到。"

# game/script.rpy:162884
translate chinese Valessa1_map111_6_0_c61e4316:

    # voice "se/y00866.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "I didn't trust him at first, but he's growing on me.\nI know he does a lot of shady things, but only out of necessity.\nI have no doubt in my mind that after the war is over, he'll change."
    voice "se/y00866.ogg"
    char_fortaime "我一开始不信任他，但他越来越让我喜欢。\n我知道他做很多见不得光的事，但都是出于不得已。\n我毫不怀疑，战争结束后他会改变的。"

# game/script.rpy:162904
translate chinese Valessa1_map111_6_0_91298fa1:

    # voice "se/y00867.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "Ulric is probably my favorite person, so far.\nI mean — he gave me free money earlier. Free!\nIt's all thanks to him that I got to taste a Mazean apple."
    voice "se/y00867.ogg"
    char_fortaime "到目前为止，乌尔里克大概是我最喜欢的人。\n我是说——他刚才还白给了我钱。白给的！\n全靠他，我才尝到了马泽奥的苹果。"

# game/script.rpy:162908
translate chinese Valessa1_map111_6_0_c28abd65:

    # voice "se/y00868.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "That's the {i}one{/i} thing I was looking forward to.\nHe's been nothing but friendly since we met him.\nSure he seems strong, but he's really gentle."
    voice "se/y00868.ogg"
    char_fortaime "那正是我{i}唯一{/i}期待的东西。\n从认识他以来，他一直都很友善。\n他看上去确实很强，但其实很温柔。"

# game/script.rpy:162922
translate chinese Valessa1_map111_6_0_cc0f2b6d:

    # voice "se/y00869.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "Who would've thought that a guy like him has a soft side?\nEither way, yeah, Ulric has been great. He's teaching me a lot.\nMaybe one day I might even learn how to use a greatsword like him!"
    voice "se/y00869.ogg"
    char_fortaime "谁能想到他这样的人还有温柔的一面？\n不管怎样，是啊，乌尔里克一直很棒。他教了我很多。\n也许有一天我甚至能学会像他那样用巨剑！"

# game/script.rpy:162942
translate chinese Valessa1_map111_6_0_039c338d:

    # voice "se/y00870.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "I feel great. There's not much to say.\nWe have everything we need in order to win.\nI can't wait to see our new HQ. Our new home."
    voice "se/y00870.ogg"
    char_fortaime "我感觉好极了。没什么好说的。\n我们拥有了取胜所需的一切。\n我迫不及待想看到我们的新总部。我们的新家。"

# game/script.rpy:162989
translate chinese click_map111_7_EV007_3475985b:

    # "The sun shines with intensity, illuminating the interior of the church.{w}\nI can see every bit of dust lining the floor and the pews.{w}\nI guess they spent more time dusting underground."
    "阳光强烈地照射进来，照亮了教堂内部。{w}\n我能看清地板和长椅上每一粒灰尘。{w}\n我猜他们把更多时间花在了打扫地下。"

# game/script.rpy:163063
translate chinese click_map111_11_EV011_160546d1:

    # voice "se/w00264.ogg"
    voice "se/w00264.ogg"

