translate chinese click_map111_15_EV015_4c42a0d7:

    # "So this is the \"spirit idol\" of Mazeo.{w}\nAt least, that's what they thought until recently.{w}\nI can see why they'd make that mistake, actually."
    "这就是马泽奥的“灵像”了。{w}\n至少，直到最近他们一直是这么认为的。{w}\n其实我能理解他们为什么会认错。"

# game/script.rpy:163311
translate chinese click_map111_15_EV015_95a909f7:

    # "It sure looks like a spirit idol.{w}\nWell, a dying one, at least."
    "它看起来确实像一尊灵像。{w}\n嗯，至少是一尊濒死的。"

# game/script.rpy:163313
translate chinese click_map111_15_EV015_41409fba:

    # "But to think, the real one is deep underground.{w}\nAnd allegedly, it's massive — and full of energy.{w}\nIt'd be the first time I saw an active spirit idol."
    "可想想吧，真正的那个深埋地下。{w}\n据说它巨大无比——还充满能量。{w}\n那会是我第一次见到活跃的灵像。"

# game/script.rpy:163350
translate chinese click_map111_16_EV016_3a94a586:

    # "Pews line the church, full of dust, and signs of neglect.{w}\nIt was almost a statement that no one cared about The Triumvirate.{w}\nThat was a bit hopeful to see. Now I know why Damek likes this place."
    "教堂里排满长椅，积满灰尘，处处透着荒废。{w}\n这几乎就是在宣告，没人在乎三人执政团。{w}\n看到这让人有点欣慰。现在我明白达梅克为什么喜欢这里了。"

# game/script.rpy:163352
translate chinese click_map111_16_EV016_f093b2a4:

    # "It doesn't look like anybody has been here in ages.{w}\nHowever, a dust-free trail leads to the door at the back.{w}\nIt's clear that only The Rebels have been making use of it."
    "看起来好久没人来过了。{w}\n不过，一条没有灰尘的痕迹通向后门。{w}\n显然只有反抗军一直在使用这里。"

# game/script.rpy:163414
translate chinese map113_5cd9f596:

    # "Continuing their adventure through the docks, Sovy keeps close to Shane.{w}\nLeading everybody into a secluded back alley, he lets out a loud sigh.{w}\nIt was nice to get away from all the noise. Mazeans were obnoxious."
    "他们的冒险在码头继续，索维紧跟在肖恩身边。{w}\n他把大家带进一条僻静的后巷，重重叹了口气。{w}\n能远离那些喧嚣真好。马泽奥人真讨厌。"

