translate chinese map113_163b7e5b:

    # "Sovy takes back the letter while he watches Shane fight back tears.{w}\nIt was a hard thing to accept — being disowned by your family.{w}\nBut it was a pain that Sovy knew all too well. He could relate."
    "索维收回信，看着肖恩强忍泪水。{w}\n被自己的家人抛弃——这是很难接受的事。{w}\n但那种痛，索维再清楚不过。他感同身受。"

# game/script.rpy:164075
translate chinese map113_d236bc48:

    # "He didn't respond just yet. He watched a silent rage build up within Shane.{w}\nThat would be perfect. For rage was an invaluable tool on the battlefield.{w}\nWith a smirk, Sovy finally broke his silence, placing a hand on Shane."
    "他没有立刻回应。他看着无声的怒火在肖恩心中积聚。{w}\n那再好不过了。因为在战场上，愤怒是无价的工具。{w}\n索维微微一笑，终于打破沉默，把手搭在肖恩身上。"

# game/script.rpy:164100
