translate chinese map114_7da408bd:

    # char_jit_map114_1_0_11 "You give me too much credit.\nI'm just a glorified paper pusher.\nYou do all the heavy lifting, you know."
    char_jit_map114_1_0_11 "你太抬举我了。\n我不过是个体面点的文书。\n重活都是你在干，你知道的。"

# game/script.rpy:164279
