    voice "se/x00283.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:164522
translate chinese map114_87a9b2b8:

    # char_jit_map114_1_0_29 "I want to atone for what I've done, Lillith.\nSo many spirits, trapped in those suits of armor.\nAn eternity of mindless servitude to The Triumvirate."
    char_jit_map114_1_0_29 "我想为我做过的事赎罪，莉莉丝。\n那么多灵，被困在那些盔甲里。\n永无止境、毫无意识地侍奉三人执政团。"

# game/script.rpy:164547
translate chinese map114_e3ba6aa5:

    # voice "se/x00284.ogg"
    voice "se/x00284.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:164549
translate chinese map114_fe49d2e8:

    # char_jit_map114_1_0_11 "And you can fix that with the Spirit Idol?"
    char_jit_map114_1_0_11 "而你能用灵像解决这个问题？"

# game/script.rpy:164574
translate chinese map114_0925d068:

    # voice "se/x00285.ogg"
    voice "se/x00285.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:164576
translate chinese map114_14c4e0df:

    # char_jit_map114_1_0_29 "I hope so. Part of me always had some doubt.\nBut today — I realized that this is my destiny.\nI can't doubt it, or hide from it any longer."
    char_jit_map114_1_0_29 "但愿如此。我心里一直有点怀疑。\n但今天——我意识到这就是我的宿命。\n我不能再怀疑它，也不能再逃避。"

# game/script.rpy:164601
translate chinese map114_df028b9b:

    # voice "se/x00286.ogg"
    voice "se/x00286.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:164603
translate chinese map114_61a83f17:

    # char_jit_map114_1_0_11 "Destiny...?\nI'm not sure I buy into that stuff.\nI'd rather call the shots myself, you know."
    char_jit_map114_1_0_11 "宿命……？\n我不太信这套。\n我更愿意自己做主，你知道的。"

# game/script.rpy:164628
translate chinese map114_4cc6c08d:

    # voice "se/x00287.ogg"
    voice "se/x00287.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:164630
translate chinese map114_dcc7cc56:

    # char_jit_map114_1_0_29 "Well, maybe {i}purpose{/i} is a better word.\nAt the end of the day, this is still my choice.\nBut I wasn't certain until today. I saw something..."
    char_jit_map114_1_0_29 "嗯，也许{i}使命{/i}这个词更合适。\n说到底，这仍是我自己的选择。\n但直到今天我都不确定。我看到了些东西……"

# game/script.rpy:164655
translate chinese map114_f5a063ad:

    # voice "se/x00288.ogg"
    voice "se/x00288.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:164657
