    voice "se/x00289.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:164684
translate chinese map114_252c2809:

    # char_jit_map114_1_0_29 "Back during The Occupation...?\nI killed so many innocent people.\nMade orphans out of so many children."
    char_jit_map114_1_0_29 "当年“占领”的时候……？\n我杀了那么多无辜的人。\n让那么多孩子成了孤儿。"

# game/script.rpy:164689
translate chinese map114_6f738651:

    # voice "se/x00290.ogg"
    voice "se/x00290.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:164691
translate chinese map114_8ce9a4a3:

    # char_jit_map114_1_0_29 "I've been facing that for the last twenty years.\nBut today was the first time I've faced it in person.\nIt's [firstname], and those two companions he had with them."
    char_jit_map114_1_0_29 "这二十年我一直在面对这件事。\n但今天是第一次当面面对。\n是[firstname]，还有跟着他的那两个同伴。"

# game/script.rpy:164696
translate chinese map114_4030ad81:

    # voice "se/x00291.ogg"
    voice "se/x00291.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:164698
translate chinese map114_74c1a99b:

    # char_jit_map114_1_0_29 "I've been facing that for the last twenty years.\nBut today was the first time I've faced it in person.\nIt's [firstname], and those two companions she had with them."
    char_jit_map114_1_0_29 "这二十年我一直在面对这件事。\n但今天是第一次当面面对。\n是[firstname]，还有跟着她的那两个同伴。"

# game/script.rpy:164723
translate chinese map114_6eb1cfd3:

    # voice "se/x00292.ogg"
    voice "se/x00292.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:164725
translate chinese map114_318cf88a:

    # char_jit_map114_1_0_11 "You mean Valessa and Fortaime...?"
    char_jit_map114_1_0_11 "你是说瓦莱莎和福泰姆……？"

# game/script.rpy:164750
translate chinese map114_6fa40b48:

    # voice "se/x00293.ogg"
    voice "se/x00293.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:164752
translate chinese map114_b7cdd74b:

    # char_jit_map114_1_0_29 "Yes Lillith, all three of them.\nI couldn't put my finger on why they looked familiar.\nBut I just realized it, and I know I need to take action."
    char_jit_map114_1_0_29 "是的，莉莉丝，他们三个都是。\n我一直说不清他们为什么看着眼熟。\n但我刚刚想起来了，我知道我必须采取行动。"

# game/script.rpy:164766
translate chinese map114_b29ee3b3:

    # "He places his head back in his hands, almost ashamed."
    "他把头重新埋回双手里，几乎是羞愧难当。"

# game/script.rpy:164781
translate chinese map114_1d56564b:

    # voice "se/x00294.ogg"
    # char_jit_map114_1_0_29 "Spitting images of people {i}I{/i} killed during The Occupation.\nI have no doubt in my mind that their parents died by my hand.\nI played a part in condemning them — forcing them into this war."
    voice "se/x00294.ogg"
    char_jit_map114_1_0_29 "活脱脱就是{i}我{/i}在“占领”期间杀掉的那些人的翻版。\n我毫不怀疑，他们的父母死在我手上。\n我也参与了对他们的定罪——把他们逼进了这场战争。"

# game/script.rpy:164796
translate chinese map114_a73d19cc:

    # "He clenches his fists, trembling as he looks up at Lillith."
    "他攥紧拳头，颤抖着抬头看向莉莉丝。"

# game/script.rpy:164809
translate chinese map114_742234eb:

    # voice "se/x00295.ogg"
    voice "se/x00295.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:164811
translate chinese map114_498ef509:

    # char_jit_map114_1_0_29 "And now I must play my part in ending it.\nI'm going to those tunnels. Right now."
    char_jit_map114_1_0_29 "而现在我必须尽我的一份力，结束这一切。\n我要去那些隧道。现在就去。"

# game/script.rpy:164842
translate chinese map172_859718fb:

    # "Damek sits in a bed, staring down at the pendant I saw him hold back at HQ.{w}\nHe had faced death and came out the other side. That would change {i}any{/i} man.{w}\nBut what happened while he was gone...? That's a question that's been on my mind."
    "达梅克坐在床上，低头盯着我在总部见他握过的那个吊坠。{w}\n他曾直面死亡，又从另一边走了出来。那会改变{i}任何{/i}一个人。{w}\n但他不在的那段时间发生了什么……？这个问题一直在我心里。"

# game/script.rpy:164844
translate chinese map172_51a17643:

    # "I approach cautiously, careful not to startle him out of his reverie.{w}\nWhen I get close to him, he looks up at me, making no effort to hide his tears.{w}\nHe finally had time to process everything that happened back in those tunnels."
    "我小心翼翼地走近，不惊扰他的沉思。{w}\n当我靠近时，他抬头看我，毫不掩饰自己的泪水。{w}\n他终于有时间去消化隧道里发生的一切。"

# game/script.rpy:164869
translate chinese map172_20952ff0:

    # voice "se/y01215.ogg"
    voice "se/y01215.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:164871
translate chinese map172_8dea5e81:

    # char_damek "I was such a fool, [firstname].\nShane tricked me — I was careless.\nI should've never let him get close to me."
    char_damek "我真是个傻瓜，[firstname]。\n肖恩骗了我——是我大意了。\n我当初就不该让他靠近我。"

# game/script.rpy:164874
translate chinese map172_01577387:

    # voice "se/y01216.ogg"
    # char_damek "He knew my weakness, and exploited it.\nIt made me so happy to see him again.\nAnd here I thought I was finally ready..."
    voice "se/y01216.ogg"
    char_damek "他知道我的弱点，还利用了它。\n再见到他让我那么高兴。\n我还以为自己终于准备好了……"

# game/script.rpy:164889
translate chinese map172_06d8eea0:

    # "Weakness...? What does he mean?"
    "弱点……？他是什么意思？"

# game/script.rpy:164914
translate chinese map172_a52b7e4a:

    # voice "se/y01217.ogg"
    # char_damek "Will you have a seat with me, [firstname]?\nI guess I should tell you the truth of what happened.\nFrom the sidelines, I must've looked incompetent."
    voice "se/y01217.ogg"
    char_damek "能陪我坐会儿吗，[firstname]？\n我想我该告诉你事情的真相。\n从旁人的角度看，我肯定显得很无能。"

# game/script.rpy:164918
translate chinese map172_3c61d858:

    # voice "se/y01218.ogg"
    # char_damek "I mean, I'm trained in combat, you know.\nI should've been able to avoid Shane's dagger with ease.\nIt's what they're all thinking, even if they won't say anything."
    voice "se/y01218.ogg"
    char_damek "我是说，你懂的，我受过战斗训练。\n我本该轻松避开肖恩的匕首。\n他们心里都是这么想的，只是嘴上不说。"

# game/script.rpy:164933
translate chinese map172_048050bf:

    # "With my interest piqued, I sit down beside Damek.{w}\nHe puts the pendant into one of his pockets, and turns to face me.\nI could tell that his crying spell was over. He was more calm and collected."
    "我起了兴趣，在达梅克身旁坐下。{w}\n他把吊坠塞进口袋，转身面对我。\n我能看出他的哭泣已经停了。他平静镇定多了。"

# game/script.rpy:164958
translate chinese map172_e7141e4d:

    # voice "se/y01219.ogg"
    # char_damek "Back during the occupation, my parents were killed.\nI saw them murder my Father with no hesitation. Blood everywhere.\nAfter that, my Mother took my hand and tried to find us some shelter."
    voice "se/y01219.ogg"
    char_damek "当年“占领”的时候，我父母被杀了。\n我眼睁睁看着他们毫不犹豫地杀了我父亲。到处都是血。\n之后，母亲牵着我的手，想找个地方躲藏。"

# game/script.rpy:164962
translate chinese map172_ac78070d:

    # voice "se/y01220.ogg"
    # char_damek "We didn't make it very far. We saw all the bodies in the town square.\nMountains of them. The ground was full of blood, almost like an ocean.\nIf you look closely, you can still see some of the stains, even today."
    voice "se/y01220.ogg"
    char_damek "我们没走多远。我们看到镇广场上堆满了尸体。\n堆得像山一样。地上全是血，几乎像一片海。\n凑近看的话，即使今天还能看到一些血迹。"

# game/script.rpy:164977
translate chinese map172_5bee2c0c:

    # "This seems unrelated to Shane's attack, but I sit and listen.{w}\nHe told me he'd tell me the \"truth\", so I should see where this goes."
    "这似乎和肖恩的袭击无关，但我坐着听下去。{w}\n他说过要告诉我“真相”，我该看看这会通向哪里。"

# game/script.rpy:164992
translate chinese map172_4ca53362:

    # voice "se/y01221.ogg"
    # char_damek "My Mother made a judgment call, and did something risky.\nWhat's the one place they would never look for survivors...?\nThat's right. Amongst the corpses. Covered, and crushed by them."
    voice "se/y01221.ogg"
    char_damek "母亲做了一个冒险的判断。\n哪里是他们绝不会去找幸存者的地方……？\n没错。就在尸体堆里。被盖住，被压着。"

# game/script.rpy:164996
translate chinese map172_90a6e812:

    # voice "se/y01222.ogg"
    # char_damek "I was crying, but she helped me get underneath a bunch of bodies.\nShe played dead and lay on the outside, holding my hand as tight as she could.\nI remember how she kept telling me that everything would be okay. That soft whisper."
    voice "se/y01222.ogg"
    char_damek "我在哭，但她帮我钻到一堆尸体下面。\n她装死躺在外侧，尽可能紧地握着我的手。\n我记得她一直告诉我一切都会好的。那轻柔的低语。"

# game/script.rpy:165011
translate chinese map172_3ba5b28b:

    # "Wow..."
    "天哪……"

# game/script.rpy:165026
translate chinese map172_1d352025:

    # voice "se/y01223.ogg"
    # char_damek "She didn't make it very long. They found her, and stabbed her over and over.\nI felt her wince every time — the grip on my hand got tighter and tighter.\nThen, after a while, it just let go. I got to feel her final moments."
    voice "se/y01223.ogg"
    char_damek "她没能撑多久。他们发现了她，一刀又一刀地刺她。\n每一次我都感觉到她抽搐——握着我的手越来越紧。\n然后，过了一会儿，那手松开了。我体会到了她最后的时刻。"

# game/script.rpy:165030
translate chinese map172_4e7aee7d:

    # voice "se/y01224.ogg"
    # char_damek "The voice telling me that everything would be okay, soon went silent.\nI was left there, underneath a pile of bodies, covered in blood.\nThe last embrace I remember, the last time I held a hand."
    voice "se/y01224.ogg"
    char_damek "那个告诉我一切都会好的声音，很快就沉默了。\n我被留在那里，压在一堆尸体下面，浑身是血。\n那是我记忆里最后的拥抱，最后一次握住一只手。"

# game/script.rpy:165034
translate chinese map172_20a9a639:

    # voice "se/y01225.ogg"
    # char_damek "It's not something I could ever do again. It just... reminds me of that day.\nNow you understand how Shane made me freeze in fear, and surprise.\nHe was the only other person I told this to. He used that to {i}trick{/i} me."
    voice "se/y01225.ogg"
    char_damek "这种事我再也做不到了。它只会……让我想起那一天。\n现在你明白肖恩是怎么让我因恐惧和惊愕而僵住的了吧。\n他是我唯一告诉过这件事的人。他利用这点来{i}骗{/i}我。"

# game/script.rpy:165048
translate chinese map172_58c3ae26:

    # voice "se/y01226.ogg"
    # char_damek "And he would've killed me too, if it wasn't for you and Howl.\nI was finally ready to get close to somebody again, and then this happens...\nThat's how I know Shane wasn't just acting. He played dirty, and wanted me dead."
    voice "se/y01226.ogg"
    char_damek "要不是你和豪尔，他也会杀了我。\n我终于准备好再次亲近某个人，然后就出了这种事……\n所以我确定肖恩不只是在演戏。他耍了阴招，想要我死。"

# game/script.rpy:165052
translate chinese map172_d4f40454:

    # voice "se/y01227.ogg"
    # char_damek "There was so much running through my mind the moment he stabbed me.\nI thought perhaps he was trying to win over The Triumvirate, so he could get more intel.\nBut then he stabbed me again, and again. I knew that the man I once knew was gone."
    voice "se/y01227.ogg"
    char_damek "他刺中我的那一刻，我脑子里闪过无数念头。\n我以为也许他是想取信于三人执政团，好搜集更多情报。\n但他又刺了我一刀，又一刀。我知道我认识的那个人已经不在了。"

# game/script.rpy:165066
translate chinese map172_7f735abb:

    # voice "se/y01228.ogg"
    # char_damek "They did something to him while he was imprisoned. They won him over.\nI don't know how they did it, but they turned him into a completely different person.\nWe must never let another one of our allies fall under their thrall. Never."
    voice "se/y01228.ogg"
    char_damek "他被囚禁时他们对他做了些什么。他们策反了他。\n我不知道他们是怎么做到的，但他们把他变成了完全另一个人。\n我们绝不能让我方任何一个盟友再落入他们的掌控。绝不能。"

# game/script.rpy:165081
translate chinese map172_939593b9:

    # "I nod, agreeing with Damek.{w}\nBut that was a horrible story.{w}\nGoing through that as a child?"
    "我点头，赞同达梅克。{w}\n但那是个可怕的故事。{w}\n小时候经历那种事？"

# game/script.rpy:165083
translate chinese map172_6db6b2b7:

    # "His aversion to physical contact makes perfect sense, now.{w}\nAnd Shane is an awful person, having taken advantage of that.{w}\nStartling Damek, making him relive those memories, and killing him."
    "现在他排斥身体接触就完全说得通了。{w}\n而肖恩利用这一点，真是个卑鄙的人。{w}\n吓住达梅克，逼他重新经历那些记忆，还想杀了他。"

# game/script.rpy:165085
translate chinese map172_5a0e9af5:

    # "That was despicable."
    "太卑鄙了。"

# game/script.rpy:165110
translate chinese map172_c79f1d72:

    # voice "se/y01229.ogg"
    # char_damek "Sorry for dropping all of that on you, [firstname].\nI just needed to tell somebody. It was eating away at me.\nAnd I trust you — I know you'd never do anything like Shane did."
    voice "se/y01229.ogg"
    char_damek "抱歉把这些一股脑倒给你，[firstname]。\n我只是需要找个人说说。它一直在侵蚀我。\n而且我信任你——我知道你绝不会做出肖恩那种事。"

# game/script.rpy:165125
translate chinese map172_58cc3a3d:

    # "That goes without saying.{w}\nHowever, the room soon falls to silence.{w}\nDamek fidgets awkwardly, clearly nervous."
    "那还用说。{w}\n然而，房间很快陷入沉默。{w}\n达梅克局促不安地动着，显然很紧张。"

# game/script.rpy:165150
translate chinese map172_138dd736:

    # voice "se/y01230.ogg"
    # char_damek "Well, I guess that's enough to kill any conversation.\nLike I said, I'm sorry for dropping all of that on you.\nAnything else you need to say to me while you can?" nointeract
    voice "se/y01230.ogg"
    char_damek "嗯，我想这足以把任何谈话都聊死了。\n就像我说的，抱歉把这些一股脑倒给你。\n趁还有机会，你还有什么想对我说的吗？" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:165166
translate chinese map172_8270e750:

    # voice "se/y01231.ogg"
    # char_damek "It's easy to say that, but it's harder to actually {i}try{/i}.\nEspecially when you've had a track record like I have.\nI want to — but there's just something stopping me, you know?"
    voice "se/y01231.ogg"
    char_damek "说起来容易，但要真正{i}尝试{/i}就难多了。\n尤其当你有我这样一段经历的时候。\n我想去做——但总有某种东西拦着我，你懂吗？"

# game/script.rpy:165170
translate chinese map172_a620a36b:

    # voice "se/y01232.ogg"
    # char_damek "It's nothing against you, or anyone else I consider a friend.\nI just have to put this barrier up for my own benefit.\nI don't want to hurt anybody either, actually."
    voice "se/y01232.ogg"
    char_damek "这不是针对你，也不是针对我当作朋友的任何人。\n我只是为了自己才竖起这道屏障。\n其实我也不想伤害任何人。"

# game/script.rpy:165174
translate chinese map172_cc623a84:

    # voice "se/y01233.ogg"
    # char_damek "This is war. I almost died back in the Rebel HQ.\nIf I did — can you imagine the pain my allies would feel?\nGetting close to somebody in a time like this would be a disaster."
    voice "se/y01233.ogg"
    char_damek "这是战争。我在反抗军总部差点就死了。\n如果我死了——你能想象我的盟友们会有多痛苦吗？\n在这种时候跟人亲近会是一场灾难。"

# game/script.rpy:165191
translate chinese map172_4b01937f:

    # "I say nothing, and offer my hand to Damek.{w}\nIn response, he winces, and moves a few inches away.{w}\nI'm not sure what I expected, but it just felt right in the moment."
    "我什么也没说，向达梅克伸出手。{w}\n他却一缩，往旁边挪开了几寸。{w}\n我不知道自己期待什么，但那一刻只是觉得该这么做。"

# game/script.rpy:165216
translate chinese map172_5cd6c054:

    # voice "se/y01234.ogg"
    # char_damek "I'm sorry, [firstname]...\nI'm just... not ready..."
    voice "se/y01234.ogg"
    char_damek "对不起，[firstname]……\n我只是……还没准备好……"

# game/script.rpy:165231
translate chinese map172_09678901:

    # "He gulps and gives me a nervous smile."
    "他咽了口口水，给了我一个紧张的笑容。"

# game/script.rpy:165256
translate chinese map172_e8aae534:

    # voice "se/y01235.ogg"
    # char_damek "It means a lot though, it really does.\nI just have to put this barrier up for my own benefit.\nI don't want to hurt you either, if that makes any sense."
    voice "se/y01235.ogg"
    char_damek "不过那对我意义重大，真的。\n我只是为了自己才竖起这道屏障。\n我也不想伤害你，如果这话说得通的话。"

# game/script.rpy:165260
translate chinese map172_b20f17bd:

    # voice "se/y01236.ogg"
    # char_damek "This is war. I almost died back in the Rebel HQ.\nIf I did — can you imagine the pain you would feel...?\nGetting close at a time like this could be disastrous."
    voice "se/y01236.ogg"
    char_damek "这是战争。我在反抗军总部差点就死了。\n如果我死了——你能想象你会有多痛苦吗……？\n在这种时候亲近起来可能会是灾难性的。"

# game/script.rpy:165276
translate chinese map172_4607c791:

    # voice "se/y01237.ogg"
    # char_damek "Thank you for understanding, [firstname].\nBut I don't need anything more than that — so no sympathy.\nIt was a long time ago, and I just want you to see things differently."
    voice "se/y01237.ogg"
    char_damek "谢谢你的理解，[firstname]。\n但我不需要更多了——所以别同情我。\n那是很久以前的事，我只希望你能换个角度看事情。"

# game/script.rpy:165290
translate chinese map172_eaa8b40f:

    # voice "se/y01238.ogg"
    # char_damek "There are those that think I'm incompetent because of what happened.\nBut as long as one person truly understands? Well, that's all I ever need.\nI was uncertain at first, but now I'm not. Telling you was a good idea."
    voice "se/y01238.ogg"
    char_damek "有人因为发生的事觉得我无能。\n但只要有一个人真正理解？嗯，那我就别无他求了。\n一开始我还不确定，现在不了。告诉你是个好主意。"

# game/script.rpy:165306
translate chinese map172_29c7bcf6:

    # voice "se/y01239.ogg"
    # char_damek "That's fine, I don't expect you to come up with an entire speech.\nIt's enough to know that you cared to sit through my endless rambling.\nMost people would tell me to shut up, or say that I'm boring them."
    voice "se/y01239.ogg"
    char_damek "没关系，我不指望你能想出一整篇说辞。\n知道你愿意耐着性子听我没完没了地唠叨，就够了。\n大多数人都会叫我闭嘴，或者说我烦到他们了。"

# game/script.rpy:165320
translate chinese map172_2dbab8db:

    # voice "se/y01240.ogg"
    # char_damek "To have the ear of somebody like you? That means a lot.\nNo matter what happens, I hope we can maintain this bond.\nThere's no telling what awaits us in Alarinthia, [firstname]."
    voice "se/y01240.ogg"
    char_damek "能有像你这样的人愿意听我说话？那意义重大。\n无论发生什么，我希望我们能维持这份羁绊。\n阿拉林西亚有什么在等着我们，谁也说不准，[firstname]。"

# game/script.rpy:165337
translate chinese map172_f6385673:

    # "He smiles, and gets out of the bed. I do so as well.{w}\nI could tell that he was ready to end this conversation."
    "他笑了笑，下了床。我也跟着起来。{w}\n我能看出他准备好结束这场谈话了。"

# game/script.rpy:165362
translate chinese map172_78f426d7:

    # voice "se/y01241.ogg"
    # char_damek "Well, shall we call it, then?\nI think this is as good a time as any.\nLet that new information process for a while."
    voice "se/y01241.ogg"
    char_damek "那么，我们就到这儿吧？\n我觉得现在正是时候。\n让那些新信息慢慢消化一阵。"

# game/script.rpy:165366
translate chinese map172_b59a943c:

    # voice "se/y01242.ogg"
    # char_damek "When it comes to my past, that's about it.\nFrom now on, we can look to the future.\nI hope it's just as bright as I picture it."
    voice "se/y01242.ogg"
    char_damek "关于我的过去，大概就这些了。\n从现在起，我们可以向前看了。\n希望未来和我设想的一样光明。"

# game/script.rpy:165388
translate chinese map172_f8918e3b:

    # "With that, he walks away from me, and back up to the deck.{w}\nI was glad that he liked me enough to tell me about his past.{w}\nIt was my duty to never take advantage of that — like Shane did."
    "说完，他离开我，走回甲板。{w}\n我很高兴他喜欢我到愿意告诉我他的过去。{w}\n我有责任绝不利用这一点——像肖恩那样。"

# game/script.rpy:165416
translate chinese map173_f71f6fd0:

    # "Fortaime paces around the deck of the ship, deep in thought.{w}\nEverything changed over the last few days, so this was insane.{w}\nI hope he's handling it well. I better go and see how he's doing."
    "福泰姆在船甲板上踱来踱去，沉思着。{w}\n过去几天一切都变了，这简直疯狂。{w}\n希望他能应对得好。我最好过去看看他怎么样。"

# game/script.rpy:165441
translate chinese map173_3f8bf28f:

    # voice "se/y01243.ogg"
    voice "se/y01243.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:165443
translate chinese map173_3a96d372:

    # char_fortaime "Hey there, [firstname].\nThere's something that's been driving me insane.\nYou know how we were all freaking out about Valinorth?"
    char_fortaime "嘿，[firstname]。\n有件事一直让我快疯了。\n你知道我们之前都为瓦利诺斯急得不行吧？"

# game/script.rpy:165456
translate chinese map173_cf5e1f88:

    # voice "se/y01244.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "Without the heat from the spirits, it'd freeze over and die.\nI mean, we believed it — but right now, it doesn't make any sense.\nThe Spirit Realm was a prison, right? Nothing mystical or beneficial."
    voice "se/y01244.ogg"
    char_fortaime "没有灵带来的热量，它就会冻住、消亡。\n我是说，我们以前相信这个——但现在想想，根本说不通。\n灵界是个监狱，对吧？没什么神秘，也没什么好处。"

# game/script.rpy:165460
translate chinese map173_27c0c95e:

    # voice "se/y01245.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "It matches up with what people outside of Valinorth were saying.\nWe were just superstitious, and lived in a unique location.\nThe Monarchy gave us visions, and nothing more."
    voice "se/y01245.ogg"
    char_fortaime "这和瓦利诺斯之外的人说法一致。\n我们只是迷信，又住在一个特别的地方。\n君主国给我们的只是幻象，仅此而已。"

# game/script.rpy:165464
translate chinese map173_23067cf8:

    # voice "se/y01246.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "We'll have to ask Howl the moment we get the chance.\nIf it's like I think it is, then Valinorth will be fine. No risk at all!\nAs hard as these truths are to believe, they {i}do{/i} have their benefits."
    voice "se/y01246.ogg"
    char_fortaime "一有机会我们得问问豪尔。\n如果真像我想的那样，瓦利诺斯就没事。一点风险都没有！\n这些真相再难相信，它们{i}确实{/i}有好处。"

# game/script.rpy:165479
translate chinese map173_3973d03b:

    # "In talking to me, he's stopped his pacing, and he looks happy.{w}\nIt's true that a lot of our beliefs were shattered, but that's not a {i}bad{/i} thing.{w}\nA new understanding of the world gave us a new angle to tackle our problems from."
    "跟我一说话，他就停下了踱步，看起来很开心。{w}\n我们的许多信念确实破碎了，但那不是件{i}坏{/i}事。{w}\n对世界的新认识给了我们解决问题的全新角度。"

# game/script.rpy:165506
translate chinese map173_ed6b4053:

    # voice "se/y01247.ogg"
    voice "se/y01247.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:165508
translate chinese map173_d7d2d90a:

    # char_fortaime "At least, it'll make my leadership of Valinorth a lot easier.\nThe one major problem I had to take care of — completely eliminated.\nI couldn't ask for anything better. It's almost like one last gift from the spirits."
    char_fortaime "至少，这会让我的瓦利诺斯领导工作轻松许多。\n我必须处理的那个大问题——被彻底消除了。\n再好不过了。简直像是众灵最后的礼物。"

# game/script.rpy:165513
translate chinese map173_47cf2318:

    # voice "se/y01248.ogg"
    voice "se/y01248.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:165515
translate chinese map173_5ac9f025:

    # char_fortaime "At least, it'll make Valessa's job as Elder a lot easier.\nThe one major problem she had to take care of — completely eliminated.\nI know it's stupid to say this now, but it seems like one last gift from the spirits."
    char_fortaime "至少，这会让瓦莱莎作为长老的工作轻松许多。\n她必须处理的那个大问题——被彻底消除了。\n我知道现在说这话很蠢，但它像是众灵最后的礼物。"

# game/script.rpy:165529
translate chinese map173_912125d0:

    # voice "se/y01249.ogg"
    voice "se/y01249.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:165531
translate chinese map173_42e2620e:

    # char_fortaime "Let's just hope we get lucky like that in Alarinthia.\nSecuring an alliance with barbarians sounds super difficult.\nThey're stubborn in their tradition, just like Valinorth is known to be."
    char_fortaime "只希望我们在阿拉林西亚也能这么走运。\n跟蛮族结盟听起来就难如登天。\n他们固守传统，就像瓦利诺斯出了名的那样。"

# game/script.rpy:165534
translate chinese map173_8de23183:

    # voice "se/y01250.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "But their tradition isn't steeped in the spirits like ours was.\nAt the end of the day, will they even care about any of this...?\nThey almost live a world away, untouched by our problems."
    voice "se/y01250.ogg"
    char_fortaime "但他们的传统不像我们那样浸润着灵。\n说到底，他们会在乎这些吗……？\n他们几乎生活在另一个世界，不受我们问题的波及。"

# game/script.rpy:165548
translate chinese map173_8c38df11:

    # voice "se/y01251.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "No point worrying about things out of our control, right?\nMaybe we should talk about something we {i}do{/i} have power over.\nRemember that climbing gear Pro gave me money for? Well, check it out!"
    voice "se/y01251.ogg"
    char_fortaime "担心我们控制不了的事也没用，对吧？\n也许我们该聊聊我们{i}确实{/i}能掌控的事。\n还记得普洛给我钱买的那套攀爬装备吗？看这个！"

# game/script.rpy:165563
translate chinese map173_d9b83226:

    # "He wanders over to a bag on the deck, and reaches inside.{w}\nA few moments later, he produces some clawed, metallic objects.{w}\nIt appears that there's one pair for your feet, and one for your hands."
    "他晃到甲板上的一个包旁，伸手进去。{w}\n过了一会儿，他掏出一些带爪的金属物件。{w}\n看来一对是给脚的，一对是给手的。"

# game/script.rpy:165588
translate chinese map173_602f38f6:

    # voice "se/y01252.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "They're adjustable, so you can wear them no matter what!\nYou don't need to look for a foothold anymore, you make them yourself!\nAs long as you're strong enough, there's nothing you can't climb, Monarch."
    voice "se/y01252.ogg"
    char_fortaime "它们可以调节，所以你怎么都能戴！\n你不用再找落脚点了，落脚点可以自己造出来！\n只要你力气够，没什么是你爬不上去的，君主。"

# game/script.rpy:165592
translate chinese map173_e796ec33:

    # voice "se/y01253.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "I know what I'm doing as soon as we get back.\nI'm heading to Valinorth, and climbing The Grand Tree!\nI want you to join me. It'll be a good place for you to learn."
    voice "se/y01253.ogg"
    char_fortaime "我知道一回去我要做什么。\n我要去瓦利诺斯，爬上巨树！\n我想让你跟我一起。那是个适合你学习的好地方。"

# game/script.rpy:165606
translate chinese map173_48e7f026:

    # voice "se/y01254.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "I know what you're thinking, though.\n\"Why would I learn to climb on something so difficult?\"\nWell, you have gear now. I never did. It's a {i}huge{/i} advantage."
    voice "se/y01254.ogg"
    char_fortaime "不过我知道你在想什么。\n“我为什么要拿这么难爬的东西来练？”\n嗯，你现在有装备了。我以前可没有。那是{i}巨大{/i}的优势。"

# game/script.rpy:165620
translate chinese map173_f870e5a9:

    # voice "se/y01255.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "The only thing holding you back will be your energy.\nBut with everything we've been through, this should be simple.\nI think it'll only take a few hours to climb, if I'm totally honest."
    voice "se/y01255.ogg"
    char_fortaime "唯一会拖你后腿的就是体力。\n但经历了我们经历的一切，这应该很简单。\n说实话，我觉得爬上去只要几个小时。"

# game/script.rpy:165624
translate chinese map173_a39a58ee:

    # voice "se/y01256.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "I'll bring us a backpack with a bunch of water.\nOr maybe we should split that over two backpacks.\nDon't want to make one of us carry too much weight."
    voice "se/y01256.ogg"
    char_fortaime "我会带一个装满水的背包。\n也许我们该分成两个背包。\n不想让我们其中一个背太重。"

# game/script.rpy:165639
translate chinese map173_62f08ca3:

    # "He puts the climbing gear back in the bag, clearly excited.{w}\nIt's a breath of fresh air to hear him talk about this stuff so passionately.{w}\nEverybody else is so concerned about the war. It's nice to just push that aside."
    "他把攀爬装备放回包里，显然很兴奋。{w}\n听他这么充满热情地聊这些，真是耳目一新。{w}\n其他人都那么担心战争。能把这些搁到一边真好。"

# game/script.rpy:165666
translate chinese map173_ff329860:

    # voice "se/y01257.ogg"
    voice "se/y01257.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:165668
translate chinese map173_6b60a898:

    # char_fortaime "Besides, it's a pretty unique date destination, isn't it?\nNot many people can say they've been to the top of The Grand Tree.\nIt's something special. You know, to match how special you are to me."
    char_fortaime "再说，这可是个相当独特的约会地点，不是吗？\n没多少人能说自己到过巨树的顶端。\n这是件特别的事。你懂的，正好配得上你对我有多特别。"

# game/script.rpy:165673
translate chinese map173_d7b206a9:

    # voice "se/y01258.ogg"
    voice "se/y01258.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:165675
translate chinese map173_287bb7a8:

    # char_fortaime "Anyway, it'll be nice to make some history together.\nNot many people can say they've been to the top of The Grand Tree.\nMaybe we'll start a trend. A sort of, \"coming of age\" thing, you know?"
    char_fortaime "总之，能一起创造些历史会很好。\n没多少人能说自己到过巨树的顶端。\n也许我们会掀起一股风潮。一种……“成年礼”之类的，你懂吧？"

# game/script.rpy:165691
translate chinese map173_bb87c19a:

    # "I don't think I've seen him this excited in a long time.{w}\nFor a moment, it feels like all of my worries have simply washed away.{w}\nThey've slipped into the ocean, becoming nothing more than gentle ripples."
    "我想我很久没见他这么兴奋过了。{w}\n有那么一刻，感觉我所有的烦恼都被冲刷掉了。{w}\n它们滑入大海，化作不过是温柔的涟漪。"

# game/script.rpy:165693
translate chinese map173_30d39e6b:

    # "Fortaime starts to walk around the ship again, and stretch his body.{w}\nIt's almost like he was preparing for the marathon of a lifetime.{w}\nOf course, this had been a life long dream of his, after all."
    "福泰姆又开始在船上走动，伸展身体。{w}\n简直像在为一生一次的马拉松做准备。{w}\n当然，毕竟这是他毕生的梦想。"

# game/script.rpy:165718
translate chinese map173_d1491e79:

    # voice "se/y01259.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "I know there's so much danger in our future.\nBut there's happiness too, you know?\nLots to look forward to in the end."
    voice "se/y01259.ogg"
    char_fortaime "我知道我们的未来充满危险。\n但也有快乐，你知道吗？\n到最后，有很多值得期待的东西。"

# game/script.rpy:165722
translate chinese map173_c93c3cb6:

    # voice "se/y01260.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "Besides, I doubt I'll be key to our Alarinthian alliance.\nSo in the meantime, there's not really anything else I can do.\nI've been practicing my climbing on the netting of the ship."
    voice "se/y01260.ogg"
    char_fortaime "再说，我估计在阿拉林西亚结盟这事上我起不了关键作用。\n所以在那之前，我其实也没什么别的能做的。\n我一直在船上的网绳上练习攀爬。"

# game/script.rpy:165736
translate chinese map173_f4fb9e0b:

    # voice "se/y01261.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "People are worried that I'll fall off, but I tell them not to worry.\nIt's very rare that I fall off, and I usually shake it off pretty quickly.\nI saw some of them get together and make some betting pools."
    voice "se/y01261.ogg"
    char_fortaime "大家担心我会摔下来，但我叫他们别担心。\n我很少摔下来，而且通常很快就没事了。\n我看见他们几个人凑在一起开了赌局。"

# game/script.rpy:165740
translate chinese map173_01856d09:

    # voice "se/y01262.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "It's a pretty boring voyage, so they make their own entertainment.\nI suddenly start to know why pirates enjoy fighting and gambling so much.\nWhen you're out at sea, there's just nothing much to do. It's pretty crazy."
    voice "se/y01262.ogg"
    char_fortaime "这趟航行挺无聊的，所以他们就自娱自乐。\n我突然开始明白海盗为什么那么喜欢打架和赌博了。\n在海上，实在没什么事可做。真够疯的。"

# game/script.rpy:165754
translate chinese map173_48dc82be:

    # voice "se/y01263.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "I'd go insane if I were a pirate — I just know it.\nAfter this war, I think I want to settle down on the mainland.\nSailing isn't for me. I can say that with absolute certainty."
    voice "se/y01263.ogg"
    char_fortaime "我要是海盗肯定会疯掉——我敢肯定。\n这场战争之后，我想在大陆上安顿下来。\n航海不适合我。这我可以百分之百肯定。"

# game/script.rpy:165769
translate chinese map173_386cd7d2:

    # "I'm not sure this life is for me, either. It's just different.{w}\nValinorth was a completely different atmosphere than any of this.{w}\nEven Mazeo was a bit of a culture shock to me and my friends."
    "我也不确定这种生活适合我。只是很不一样。{w}\n瓦利诺斯的氛围和这一切截然不同。{w}\n就连马泽奥对我和我朋友来说都有点文化冲击。"

# game/script.rpy:165771
translate chinese map173_98975ffe:

    # "I can't even imagine what Alarinthia and Balteus will be like.{w}\nI look off to the horizon. We must still be pretty far away.{w}\nThere's no sight of land ahead. How much farther to go...?"
    "我甚至想象不出阿拉林西亚和巴尔泰乌斯会是什么样。{w}\n我望向地平线。我们肯定还离得很远。{w}\n前方看不到陆地的影子。还要走多远……？"

# game/script.rpy:165796
translate chinese map173_c8210a84:

    # voice "se/y01264.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "Sorry for rambling on, but yeah, there's nothing else to do.\nI bet the other people will be able to keep your interest longer.\nBut before you go, I have just {i}one{/i} question to ask you."
    voice "se/y01264.ogg"
    char_fortaime "抱歉我一直在唠叨，不过是啊，也没别的事可做。\n我敢打赌其他人能让你更久地提起兴趣。\n但你走之前，我只想问你{i}一个{/i}问题。"

# game/script.rpy:165811
translate chinese map173_b734c503:

    # "He stops stretching and walks right up to me, with a sly smirk."
    "他停止伸展，带着狡黠的坏笑径直走到我面前。"

# game/script.rpy:165836
translate chinese map173_4dc2c7b1:

    # voice "se/y01265.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "Do we make it to the top, or do we fail...?\nWhat's your bet, [firstname]? And {i}no{/i} refusing.\nWe're on a pirate ship, so we need to act like Pirates." nointeract
    voice "se/y01265.ogg"
    char_fortaime "我们登顶，还是失败……？\n你押哪个，[firstname]？而且{i}不许{/i}拒绝。\n我们在海盗船上，就得像海盗一样行事。" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:165854
translate chinese map173_cb5a23eb:

    # voice "se/y01266.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "Optimism? I love it! \nThe other pirates didn't share that trait.\nThey seemed to actually look forward to failure."
    voice "se/y01266.ogg"
    char_fortaime "乐观？我喜欢！\n别的海盗可没这特质。\n他们好像还真盼着我失败。"

# game/script.rpy:165858
translate chinese map173_f6064b73:

    # voice "se/y01267.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "Though I guess that would be fun to watch.\nCan you imagine if I fell off the netting into the sea?\nThey'd probably stand by and laugh, rather than help."
    voice "se/y01267.ogg"
    char_fortaime "不过我猜那看着可能挺有意思。\n你能想象我从网绳上掉进海里吗？\n他们大概会站在一旁笑，而不是来帮忙。"

# game/script.rpy:165876
translate chinese map173_985d9780:

    # voice "se/y01268.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "Realism, huh? I can accept that.\nAt least you didn't bet that we'd fall.\nIf you did, I'd be upset at your confidence."
    voice "se/y01268.ogg"
    char_fortaime "现实主义，是吧？我能接受。\n至少你没押我们会失败。\n如果你真押了，我会对你的“信心”感到不满。"

# game/script.rpy:165880
translate chinese map173_3e337081:

    # voice "se/y01269.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "Remember who your Master is, [firstname].\nYou're an Apprentice to the best, so I bet we'll make it.\nNow we just need to decide what the stakes are."
    voice "se/y01269.ogg"
    char_fortaime "记住你的师父是谁，[firstname]。\n你是最棒的师父的学徒，所以我押我们会成功。\n现在只差定下赌注了。"

# game/script.rpy:165895
translate chinese map173_5d457b95:

    # voice "se/y01270.ogg"
    voice "se/y01270.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:165897
translate chinese map173_4df02a21:

    # char_fortaime "Hmm..."
    char_fortaime "嗯……"

# game/script.rpy:165912
translate chinese map173_4135f2ed:

    # voice "se/y01271.ogg"
    voice "se/y01271.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:165914
translate chinese map173_b2736560:

    # char_fortaime "Oh, I know! A kiss.\nLoser has to kiss the winner.\nAnd yes — I {i}totally{/i} rigged it."
    char_fortaime "哦，有了！一个吻。\n输的人要亲赢的人。\n没错——我{i}绝对{/i}作弊了。"

# game/script.rpy:165917
translate chinese map173_c4c7e341:

    # voice "se/y01272.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "This way — I win no matter what."
    voice "se/y01272.ogg"
    char_fortaime "这样一来——不管怎样都是我赢。"

# game/script.rpy:165933
translate chinese map173_eebc583c:

    # voice "se/y01272b.ogg"
    voice "se/y01272b.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:165935
translate chinese map173_45ab0a0a:

    # char_fortaime "I guess we can figure that out when the time comes.\nWhich, as I'm starting to realize, is pretty darn soon.\nThink of some ideas in your off time, alright?"
    char_fortaime "我想到时候再定也行。\n而我开始意识到，那时候来得还挺快。\n空闲的时候想想点子，好吗？"

# game/script.rpy:165938
translate chinese map173_af2277c4:

    # voice "se/y01273.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "We'll announce the terms before we climb."
    voice "se/y01273.ogg"
    char_fortaime "我们在攀爬前宣布赌注条件。"

# game/script.rpy:165960
translate chinese map173_49f80c02:

    # "With a smirk and a wink, he quickly runs off on his way.{w}\nFull of energy, it seems. Or perhaps he's going stir-crazy.{w}\nI don't blame him, being stuck at sea with nothing else to do."
    "他坏笑一下，眨眨眼，很快跑开去了。{w}\n看来精力充沛。又或者他是关疯了。{w}\n我不怪他，困在海上无事可做。"

# game/script.rpy:165962
translate chinese map173_a57b1383:

    # "I guess our goal was clear. We'd climb The Grand Tree.{w}\nThat is, if we even made it back from Alarinthia in one piece.{w}\nHis ability to focus on the positive stuff during war is admirable."
    "我想我们的目标清楚了。我们要爬上巨树。{w}\n前提是我们能从阿拉林西亚完好无损地回来。{w}\n他在战时还能专注于积极的东西，令人钦佩。"

# game/script.rpy:165964
translate chinese map173_68280444:

    # "Admirable, if not a bit naive. Hopefully I could join in his positivity.{w}\nBut this blade on my back, both literally and figuratively weighs me down.{w}\nI might leave it on the surface when we climb. Yeah, that would make things easier."
    "令人钦佩，哪怕有点天真。希望我也能加入他的乐观。{w}\n但我背上这把剑，无论字面上还是比喻上都压着我。{w}\n攀爬时我或许可以把它留在地面。嗯，那会让事情轻松些。"

# game/script.rpy:165970
translate chinese map173_059716e4:

    # "A lot easier."
    "轻松得多。"

# game/script.rpy:165976
translate chinese map173_6797eb7d:

    # "Fortaime's loyalty scene is now available when you return to the mainland.{w}\nThe game will notify you when you have access to the loyalty scene system.{w}\nLoyalty scenes can be initiated by clicking that character at the War Table."
    "返回大陆后，福泰姆的忠诚剧情将解锁。{w}\n当你可以使用忠诚剧情系统时，游戏会通知你。{w}\n在作战桌上点击该角色即可触发忠诚剧情。"

# game/script.rpy:166004
translate chinese map170_0ccad6fa:

    # "I make my way down to the ship cabin, and see Ulric sitting on a bed.{w}\nAt least, whatever passes for a bed aboard a somewhat cramped ship.{w}\nHe's sharpening his sword, clearly exerting himself as he does so."
    "我下到船舱，看见乌尔里克坐在一张床上。{w}\n至少，是在这艘有点拥挤的船上勉强算床的东西。{w}\n他正在磨剑，动作间显然很用力。"

# game/script.rpy:166029
translate chinese map170_0be7ace8:

    # voice "se/y01156.ogg"
    voice "se/y01156.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:166031
translate chinese map170_9638be73:

    # char_ulric "Hey there, [firstname].\nAs you can see, I'm getting ready for combat.\nI give it two days before we're dragged into conflict."
    char_ulric "嘿，[firstname]。\n如你所见，我在为战斗做准备。\n我估计不出两天我们就会被卷进冲突。"

# game/script.rpy:166044
translate chinese map170_c5988f3f:

    # voice "se/y01157.ogg"
    # char_ulric "They don't use words to resolve things in Alarinthia.\nIt's always a duel, or a tournament. That's all they do.\nWhen we're there, we might as well speak their language."
    voice "se/y01157.ogg"
    char_ulric "在阿拉林西亚，他们不用言语解决问题。\n总是决斗，或者比武大会。他们就干这些。\n到了那儿，我们不妨入乡随俗。"

# game/script.rpy:166059
translate chinese map170_a0380aa4:

    # "He smirks, as if the promise of action is exciting to him.{w}\nHe did hate Alarinthia, but he also loved combat. It was his nature.{w}\nHopefully he'd get to tackle a challenge worthy of his skill while we were there."
    "他坏笑一下，仿佛有仗可打就让他兴奋。{w}\n他确实讨厌阿拉林西亚，但他也热爱战斗。那是他的天性。{w}\n希望我们在那里的时候，他能遇到配得上他身手的挑战。"

# game/script.rpy:166084
translate chinese map170_268858f6:

    # voice "se/y01158.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Gotta make the most of a bad situation, right?\nI'll get to give my sword arm a real challenge.\nWhat about you, [firstname]? Excited for this? " nointeract
    voice "se/y01158.ogg"
    char_ulric "逆境也得尽量利用，对吧？\n我这条舞剑的手臂，可算能迎来一场真正的挑战了。\n你呢，[firstname]？期待吗？" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:166100
translate chinese map170_d0fa8a22:

    # voice "se/y01159.ogg"
    # char_ulric "That's the spirit. We're going to make history.\nI really hope we can help Vivien, and change the nation.\nAs you know, that's been my dream for the longest time."
    voice "se/y01159.ogg"
    char_ulric "这才对。我们要创造历史。\n我真的很希望能帮到薇薇安，改变这个国家。\n如你所知，这是我长久以来的梦想。"

# game/script.rpy:166104
translate chinese map170_a3c33280:

    # voice "se/y01169.ogg"
    # char_ulric "It's nice to know that her movement actually has some traction.\nIf only my parents were so lucky. I bet they'd be proud, [firstname].\nThe foe may seem impossible to beat, but I have a feeling we can do it."
    voice "se/y01169.ogg"
    char_ulric "知道她的运动真的有些进展，真好。\n要是我父母也这么幸运就好了。我打赌他们会骄傲的，[firstname]。\n敌人看似不可战胜，但我有预感我们能做到。"

# game/script.rpy:166118
translate chinese map170_2891083b:

    # voice "se/y01170.ogg"
    # char_ulric "That is, if we even get the opportunity to side with Vivien.\nIf we get stuck with Draycu, I have to admit that I'll be disappointed.\nWe'd get our alliance, but at the end of the day, Alarinthia would be the same."
    voice "se/y01170.ogg"
    char_ulric "前提是我们真有机会站在薇薇安这边。\n如果被迫和德雷库合作，我得承认我会失望。\n我们能拿到盟约，但说到底，阿拉林西亚还是老样子。"

# game/script.rpy:166136
translate chinese map170_cea7f6ab:

    # voice "se/y01171.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Glad to hear. I like that in a partner.\nMaking change {i}together{/i} — now that's amazing.\nNot everybody would be so brave, you know. "
    voice "se/y01171.ogg"
    char_ulric "很高兴听你这么说。我喜欢搭档有这股劲。\n{i}一起{/i}做出改变——那可太棒了。\n不是每个人都有这份勇气，你知道的。"

# game/script.rpy:166150
translate chinese map170_dc059925:

    # voice "se/y01172.ogg"
    # char_ulric "It's almost overwhelming to think about, actually.\nI have the support of The Monarch of Alestia...?\nThere's almost nothing we can't accomplish now."
    voice "se/y01172.ogg"
    char_ulric "说实话，想到这个几乎让人承受不住。\n我有了阿莱斯蒂亚君主的支持……？\n现在几乎没有我们做不到的事。"

# game/script.rpy:166166
translate chinese map170_59cc3fc1:

    # voice "se/y01173.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Reminds me of myself when I was younger.\nJust be careful, [firstname]. Don't make reckless decisions.\nAfter this war is over, you have an entire world to rule over, you know."
    voice "se/y01173.ogg"
    char_ulric "让我想起年轻时的自己。\n小心点，[firstname]。别做鲁莽的决定。\n这场战争结束后，你有一整个世界要统治，你知道的。"

# game/script.rpy:166180
translate chinese map170_5de4eb66:

    # voice "se/y01174.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Not to put any pressure on you, of course. Actually, it's the opposite.\nKnowing your importance should fill you with hope and resolve.\nWith your authority, and that blade — you can do anything."
    voice "se/y01174.ogg"
    char_ulric "当然，不是要给你压力。其实正相反。\n知道自己的重要性应该让你充满希望和决心。\n凭你的权威，还有那把剑——你无所不能。"

# game/script.rpy:166196
translate chinese map170_45a10c8b:

    # voice "se/y01175.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Sometime it's necessary — you can't avoid it.\nEspecially with what happened back at the Rebel HQ.\nDo you think we could've responded with a warm hug...?"
    voice "se/y01175.ogg"
    char_ulric "有时这是必要的——你躲不掉。\n尤其考虑到反抗军总部发生的事。\n你觉得我们能用温暖的拥抱来回应吗……？"

# game/script.rpy:166210
translate chinese map170_812b5a59:

    # voice "se/y01176.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Do you think words could've stopped their assault?\nNo. It's foolish to think that, but it's an admirable dream to have.\nMaybe after this war, in the new world, we can resolve things peacefully."
    voice "se/y01176.ogg"
    char_ulric "你觉得言语能阻止他们的进攻吗？\n不能。这么想很愚蠢，但有这样的梦想令人钦佩。\n也许这场战争之后，在新世界里，我们能和平解决问题。"

# game/script.rpy:166224
translate chinese map170_6dac5414:

    # voice "se/y01177.ogg"
    # char_ulric "But not while we're under The Triumvirate's thumb. Not at all.\nThey only know war. They kill and they steal to get what they want.\nUntil we're in power, all we can do is respond to them in kind."
    voice "se/y01177.ogg"
    char_ulric "但只要我们在三人执政团的压制下就不行。完全不行。\n他们只懂战争。为了得到想要的，他们杀人、抢夺。\n在我们掌权之前，我们能做的只是以牙还牙。"

# game/script.rpy:166240
translate chinese map170_ba355831:

    # voice "se/y01178.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Yeah, I guess this stuff isn't for everybody.\nFor me, though? It's a source of excitement.\nNothing gets my blood pumping faster than a fight."
    voice "se/y01178.ogg"
    char_ulric "是啊，我想这种事不是人人都受得了。\n但对我来说？它是兴奋的来源。\n没什么比一场战斗更能让我热血沸腾了。"

# game/script.rpy:166254
translate chinese map170_04270bf7:

    # voice "se/y01179.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Facing death, and then coming out alive?\nI almost can't describe it. It's truly amazing.\nWe look our end in the eyes, and say \"No\"."
    voice "se/y01179.ogg"
    char_ulric "直面死亡，然后活着走出来？\n我几乎无法形容。那真是不可思议。\n我们直视自己的终结，说“不”。"

# game/script.rpy:166269
translate chinese map170_068a3822:

    # voice "se/y01180.ogg"
    voice "se/y01180.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:166271
translate chinese map170_d0f01aaa:

    # char_ulric "But I'm guessing you didn't come down here for a lecture.\nHave a seat. There's something I'd like to talk to you about."
    char_ulric "不过我猜你下来不是为了听我说教。\n坐吧。有件事我想跟你聊聊。"

# game/script.rpy:166288
translate chinese map170_07ac0ed8:

    # "I nod, and sit down beside him.{w}\nHe slowly rests his hand on top of mine, and holds it.{w}\nSo much had happened since the last time we were together."
    "我点头，在他身旁坐下。{w}\n他慢慢把手覆在我的手上，握住。{w}\n自从上次我们在一起之后，发生了太多事。"

# game/script.rpy:166293
translate chinese map170_7618acae:

    # "I nod, and sit down beside him.{w}\nHe continues sharpening his sword, and I watch.{w}\nIt must've gotten worn out during the battle back at HQ."
    "我点头，在他身旁坐下。{w}\n他继续磨剑，我看着。{w}\n它肯定在总部的战斗中磨损了。"

# game/script.rpy:166319
translate chinese map170_efe419f1:

    # voice "se/y01181.ogg"
    voice "se/y01181.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:166321
translate chinese map170_57fe6ca9:

    # char_ulric "I don't want to scare you, and I'm not really hiding anything.\nBut we're about to go to my homeland. You might... hear things.\nCan you promise me something, Monarch? No matter what happens?"
    char_ulric "我不想吓你，我也没真的隐瞒什么。\n但我们要去我的故乡了。你也许会……听到些事。\n能答应我一件事吗，君主？无论发生什么？"

# game/script.rpy:166334
translate chinese map170_5d71b509:

    # voice "se/y01182.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Remember me for the things I've done for {i}you{/i}, and The Rebellion.\nNo matter what you hear about me, or my past? Please don't judge me.\nI wouldn't judge you based on your past, so I expect the same from you."
    voice "se/y01182.ogg"
    char_ulric "记住我为{i}你{/i}和反抗军做过的事。\n不管你听到关于我或我过去的什么？请别评判我。\n我不会因为你的过去评判你，所以我也期望你能同样对我。"

# game/script.rpy:166349
translate chinese map170_4ea38650:

    # "I nod. I can afford him that courtesy, as long as he's not hiding anything heinous.{w}\nBut he doesn't seem like the type. He's truly devoted his life to the same cause as me."
    "我点头。只要他没有隐瞒什么穷凶极恶的事，这份礼遇我可以给他。{w}\n但他不像是那种人。他确实把一生献给了和我相同的事业。"

# game/script.rpy:166374
translate chinese map170_00aac860:

    # voice "se/y01183.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Good. Then that's pretty much everything I had to say.\nI was really worried. I wasn't sure how to handle that topic.\nSo — rather than overthinking it, I just shot straight. Thank you."
    voice "se/y01183.ogg"
    char_ulric "好。那差不多就是我要说的全部了。\n我一直很担心。我不知道该怎么处理这个话题。\n所以——与其想太多，我干脆直说。谢谢你。"

# game/script.rpy:166390
translate chinese map170_e9288e20:

    # voice "se/y01184.ogg"
    voice "se/y01184.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:166392
translate chinese map170_3647ef8d:

    # char_ulric "It was especially hard since we're kind of \"involved\", now.\nIs that the right word for what we are? I don't really know.\nAfter what we did back in Mazeo, I think it's a safe term."
    char_ulric "尤其难开口，因为我们现在算是“在一起”了。\n这个词形容我们合适吗？我也不太清楚。\n鉴于我们在马泽奥做过的事，我想这说法还算稳妥。"

# game/script.rpy:166395
translate chinese map170_c3951502:

    # voice "se/y01185.ogg"
    # char_ulric "I don't want to complicate things, so I'll just be quiet.\nBut don't think I've forgotten about what happened.\nIf we get the time, I'd like for it to happen again..."
    voice "se/y01185.ogg"
    char_ulric "我不想把事情弄复杂，所以我就闭嘴了。\n但别以为我忘了发生的事。\n如果有机会，我希望还能再来一次……"

# game/script.rpy:166399
translate chinese map170_57651ad5:

    # voice "se/y01186.ogg"
    # char_ulric "But I doubt we'll be able to do that on this ship.\nYou can't even breathe without someone else hearing it.\nI have my ways of keeping quiet, but I wouldn't want to get caught."
    voice "se/y01186.ogg"
    char_ulric "但我估计在这艘船上我们做不了。\n你连喘口气都会被人听见。\n我有办法保持安静，但我不想被抓个正着。"

# game/script.rpy:166415
translate chinese map170_81316c70:

    # voice "se/y01187.ogg"
    voice "se/y01187.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:166417
translate chinese map170_c1838282:

    # char_ulric "It was especially hard, since you're such a powerful figure.\nI'd hate to get on your bad side, so I need to be fully open.\nI have a few secrets, as we all do — but nothing really bad."
    char_ulric "尤其难开口，因为你是这么有权势的人物。\n我可不想惹你不高兴，所以我得完全坦诚。\n我有几个秘密，人人都有——但没什么真正糟糕的。"

# game/script.rpy:166420
translate chinese map170_c69c6bc7:

    # voice "se/y01188.ogg"
    # char_ulric "If you don't find out in Alarinthia, I'll probably tell you myself.\nIn fact, maybe it would mean more if it came directly from me.\nSorry — I must sound stupid. I'm not really good at this kind of stuff."
    voice "se/y01188.ogg"
    char_ulric "如果你在阿拉林西亚没发现，我大概会自己告诉你。\n其实，也许由我亲口说出来会更有意义。\n抱歉——我听起来肯定很蠢。我实在不擅长这些。"

# game/script.rpy:166424
translate chinese map170_8801b92a:

    # voice "se/y01189.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Talking about myself is hard. It definitely helps to get drunk.\nBut ale was something they {i}didn't{/i} think to pack for this voyage.\nMaybe I'll pull some strings so the ride back can be more \"lively\"."
    voice "se/y01189.ogg"
    char_ulric "谈自己很难。喝醉肯定有帮助。\n但这次航行他们{i}没{/i}想着带上麦酒。\n也许我会动用点关系，让回程更“热闹”些。"

# game/script.rpy:166441
translate chinese map170_bbaf2b77:

    # "He gives me another one of those trademark smirks.{w}\nI get the feeling that he really does use alcohol as a social crutch.{w}\nHe's much more open and lively while under the influence. Is that bad?"
    "他又给了我一个标志性的坏笑。{w}\n我感觉他确实把酒精当作社交的拐杖。{w}\n他喝过酒后开放活泼得多。这算坏事吗？"

# game/script.rpy:166443
translate chinese map170_f03ae7c9:

    # "I guess it's not my place to say. As long as it doesn't get in the way of his duty.{w}\nSomething told me that our visit to Alarinthia would put him in the spotlight more than ever.{w}\nI get up from the bed, and turn around to face him. He continues working his sword."
    "我想轮不到我来说。只要不碍他的职责就好。{w}\n我总觉得我们去阿拉林西亚会让他比以往更受瞩目。{w}\n我从床上起身，转身面对他。他继续弄着他的剑。"

# game/script.rpy:166468
translate chinese map170_76d90afc:

    # voice "se/y01190.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Sorry I didn't have much to say. I guess I'm a little shy.\nBut it'll all make sense in time. I can promise you that.\nWhen that time comes — you need to keep your promise."
    voice "se/y01190.ogg"
    char_ulric "抱歉我没多少话说。我想我有点害羞。\n但到时候一切都会明白的。这我可以向你保证。\n到那时候——你得遵守你的承诺。"

# game/script.rpy:166483
translate chinese map170_5fbbcc5a:

    # "He's really pushing this promise thing. Should I be concerned...?{w}\nI'd hate for him to use it as leverage if some horrible secret came to light.{w}\nThankfully, I see Ulric as a good person. He wouldn't hide anything bad from us."
    "他真的很强调这个承诺。我该担心吗……？{w}\n我不想万一有什么可怕的秘密曝光，他拿这个当筹码。{w}\n幸好，我认为乌尔里克是个好人。他不会对我们隐瞒什么坏事。"

# game/script.rpy:166488
translate chinese map170_cce1681e:

    # "Like he said, it'll all make sense in time.{w}\nAll I can really do, is go about my business and wait.{w}\nToo bad there wasn't enough privacy to have some more fun."
    "就像他说的，到时候一切都会明白。{w}\n我真正能做的，就是照常做事，等待。{w}\n可惜不够私密，没法再多找点乐子。"

# game/script.rpy:166497
translate chinese map170_6f7bf223:

    # "Something told me we'd make up for that next time we had the chance."
    "我总觉得下次有机会我们会补回来。"

# game/script.rpy:166502
translate chinese map170_e1dfbef1:

    # "Like he said, it'll all make sense in time.{w}\nAll I can really do, is go about my business and wait.{w}\nSuddenly, I'm more excited about our journey to Alarinthia."
    "就像他说的，到时候一切都会明白。{w}\n我真正能做的，就是照常做事，等待。{w}\n突然间，我对我们前往阿拉林西亚的旅程更期待了。"

# game/script.rpy:166511
translate chinese map170_7de0d676:

    # "Both Alestia, and my comrades, were slowly opening up to me.{w}\nIn the last few days, everything had changed. What else would change?\nThat thought fills me with both excitement and fright at the same time."
    "阿莱斯蒂亚和我的同伴们，都在慢慢向我敞开心扉。{w}\n过去几天，一切都变了。还会有什么改变？\n这个念头让我既兴奋又恐惧。"

# game/script.rpy:166539
translate chinese map169_45a947e1:

    # "I step toward Valessa, who has her hands on the ship's railing.{w}\nShe seems lost in thought, but who wouldn't be after recent events?{w}\nCareful not to startle her, I simply stand beside her, and rest my hands too."
    "我走向瓦莱莎，她双手扶着船舷栏杆。{w}\n她似乎陷入沉思，但最近出了这些事，谁不会呢？{w}\n我小心不惊扰她，只是站到她身旁，也把手搭上去。"

# game/script.rpy:166564
translate chinese map169_c6fb9ffb:

    # voice "se/y01114.ogg"
    voice "se/y01114.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:166566
translate chinese map169_36f23a26:

    # char_valessa "You know, for once, I thought things were going well.\nWe had an army, and it seemed like our objective was clear.\nBut they outsmarted us. They caught us off guard. We were careless."
    char_valessa "你知道吗，难得有一回，我以为事情进展顺利。\n我们有了一支军队，目标似乎也很明确。\n但他们比我们更狡猾。他们打了我们一个措手不及。是我们大意了。"

# game/script.rpy:166579
translate chinese map169_d7007859:

    # voice "se/y01115.ogg"
    voice "se/y01115.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:166581
translate chinese map169_a9f69e14:

    # char_valessa "They always say to be cautious if things are going too well.\nEspecially in war. We got blinded by the victory we thought we secured.\nNobody thought to question our course of action, or Damek's orders."
    char_valessa "人们总说，事情太顺利时就要当心。\n尤其在战争中。我们被自以为到手的胜利蒙蔽了双眼。\n没人想过去质疑我们的行动方针，或者达梅克的命令。"

# game/script.rpy:166595
translate chinese map169_3421b22b:

    # voice "se/y01116.ogg"
    voice "se/y01116.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:166597
translate chinese map169_f6f34c5f:

    # char_valessa "And I'm supposed to be the next Elder of Valinorth...\nFor the safety of our nation, I need to be {i}better{/i} than this.\nI need to plan for every course of action, however unlikely. "
    char_valessa "而我还应该是瓦利诺斯的下一任长老……\n为了我们国家的安全，我必须{i}做得更好{/i}。\n我需要对每一种可能，无论多不可能的走向都做好打算。"

# game/script.rpy:166611
translate chinese map169_e44468fa:

    # voice "se/y01117.ogg"
    voice "se/y01117.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:166613
translate chinese map169_3da08222:

    # char_valessa "And to top it all off, you don't need a Scribe anymore.\nFortaime gets to lead our nation, and I'm left with nothing...?\nThat's hardly fair. Now I have no idea what to do with myself."
    char_valessa "更糟的是，你不再需要书记官了。\n福泰姆将领导我们的国家，而我什么都没剩下……？\n这太不公平了。现在我都不知道自己该做什么。"

# game/script.rpy:166626
translate chinese map169_ca4fbd40:

    # voice "se/y01118.ogg"
    voice "se/y01118.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:166629
translate chinese map169_57f9b181:

    # char_valessa "I just wish things could be clear, like they used to be.\nThough things were difficult, our future was certain.\nWe don't even know if we can secure this alliance." nointeract
    char_valessa "我只是希望事情能像从前那样清楚。\n虽然艰难，但我们的未来是确定的。\n现在我们连能不能拿到这个盟约都不知道。" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:166643
translate chinese map169_8d612755:

    # voice "se/y01119.ogg"
    # char_valessa "I want to believe you, but I'm just not sure.\nWe thought things would work out back at the Rebel HQ.\nLook how that turned out, [firstname]. We were reckless."
    voice "se/y01119.ogg"
    char_valessa "我想相信你，但我就是不确定。\n在反抗军总部时我们也以为事情会顺利。\n看看结果如何，[firstname]。我们太鲁莽了。"

# game/script.rpy:166647
translate chinese map169_85ae807d:

    # voice "se/y01120.ogg"
    # char_valessa "I don't want to sound mean, but I don't share those thoughts.\nIt's important to take a step back, and look at the big picture.\nThat way you don't get blinded, and act based on your ego."
    voice "se/y01120.ogg"
    char_valessa "我不想显得刻薄，但我不认同那些想法。\n退一步看全局很重要。\n这样你才不会蒙蔽，不会凭自尊行事。"

# game/script.rpy:166664
translate chinese map169_7a443237:

    # voice "se/y01121.ogg"
    # char_valessa "Really...? Are you sure about that, [firstname].\nYou have a world to save. You can't just focus on {i}me{/i}.\nAnother mistake would mean the end of our cause — permanently."
    voice "se/y01121.ogg"
    char_valessa "真的……？你确定吗，[firstname]。\n你有一整个世界要拯救。你不能只盯着{i}我{/i}。\n再犯一次错，就意味着我们的事业彻底终结。"

# game/script.rpy:166668
translate chinese map169_1e0e6753:

    # voice "se/y01122.ogg"
    # char_valessa "I mean, that's why I haven't really had time to think about romance.\nWhat good is planning my future, if I might not even be alive next week?\nThat would just lead to heartbreak. Heartbreak could be catastrophic."
    voice "se/y01122.ogg"
    char_valessa "我是说，这就是我一直没时间考虑感情的原因。\n如果我下周可能就死了，规划未来又有什么意义？\n那只会带来心碎。而心碎可能是灾难性的。"

# game/script.rpy:166683
translate chinese map169_63a38bd5:

    # voice "se/y01123.ogg"
    # char_valessa "Normally, hearing you say that would fill me with fright.\nBut right now? It's important to know that I'm not alone.\nI'm not the only one who feels this way. That's good."
    voice "se/y01123.ogg"
    char_valessa "换作平时，听你这么说会让我害怕。\n但现在？知道我不是一个人很重要。\n不是只有我这么想。这很好。"

# game/script.rpy:166687
translate chinese map169_710fbcb7:

    # voice "se/y01124.ogg"
    # char_valessa "It's not easy, having your whole belief system destroyed.\nIf I'm honest, I kind of wish I never got thrust into this mess.\nLiving in ignorance, just like everybody else. What a dream."
    voice "se/y01124.ogg"
    char_valessa "整套信仰体系被摧毁，这可不容易。\n说实话，我有点希望自己从没被扔进这摊烂事里。\n像其他人一样活在无知中。多美好啊。"

# game/script.rpy:166691
translate chinese map169_b8c10047:

    # voice "se/y01125.ogg"
    # char_valessa "After this war is over, we'll have to tell {i}them{/i} the truth, too.\nDo you think they'll even believe the truth of the spirit realm?\nI mean, do {i}I{/i} even believe it? Part of me still feels doubt."
    voice "se/y01125.ogg"
    char_valessa "这场战争结束后，我们也得告诉{i}他们{/i}真相。\n你觉得他们会相信灵界的真相吗？\n我是说，{i}我{/i}自己相信吗？我心里还是有疑虑。"

# game/script.rpy:166706
translate chinese map169_d0356720:

    # voice "se/y01126.ogg"
    # char_valessa "Heh. Still have time for that sense of humor, huh?\nHonestly, that's a little relieving. Thanks for the laugh.\nIt's been so long, I've forgotten what smiling feels like."
    voice "se/y01126.ogg"
    char_valessa "呵。还有工夫开玩笑，是吧？\n说实话，这让人稍微松了口气。谢谢你逗我笑。\n太久了，我都忘了笑是什么感觉。"

# game/script.rpy:166721
translate chinese map169_0837bb7d:

    # voice "se/y01127.ogg"
    # char_valessa "Thanks, [firstname]. It helps to know that. It really does.\nWe always assume that we're alone in our struggles, you know?\nSometimes opening up can do wonders. Especially to you, it seems."
    voice "se/y01127.ogg"
    char_valessa "谢谢，[firstname]。知道这一点很有帮助。真的。\n我们总以为自己的挣扎是孤独的，你知道吗？\n有时候敞开心扉会有奇效。看来对你尤其如此。"

# game/script.rpy:166725
translate chinese map169_3895e325:

    # voice "se/y01128.ogg"
    # char_valessa "I guess it's safe to assume that everybody is shaken up right now.\nMaybe I'll go talk to a few other rebels after this, and cheer them up.\nKnowing you're not alone helps a lot. Maybe they need a quick reminder."
    voice "se/y01128.ogg"
    char_valessa "我想可以肯定，现在每个人都很受震动。\n也许这事之后我去找几个反抗军聊聊，给他们打打气。\n知道你不是一个人很有帮助。也许他们需要有人提醒一下。"

# game/script.rpy:166742
translate chinese map169_70e9f5c2:

    # "She lets out a loud sigh as we stare off into the horizon.{w}\nThe slow rocking of the ship pushes us closer together.{w}\nWith the distance closed, I can hear her more clearly."
    "我们望着地平线，她重重叹了口气。{w}\n船身缓慢的摇晃把我们推得更近。{w}\n距离拉近了，我能更清楚地听见她。"

# game/script.rpy:166744
translate chinese map169_8ff33e28:

    # "There's definitely more on her mind, I can tell.{w}\nBut I can't force her to open up, so I stand there in silence.{w}\nMy ears are open to her, as long as she decides to speak."
    "我能看出她心里肯定还有别的事。{w}\n但我不能逼她开口，所以我默默站着。{w}\n只要她愿意说，我随时都愿意听。"

# game/script.rpy:166770
translate chinese map169_d839ca15:

    # voice "se/y01129.ogg"
    voice "se/y01129.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:166772
translate chinese map169_f815cc55:

    # char_valessa "I was so lost in thought, I couldn't sleep last night.\nI decided to help Alex prepare the ship for our voyage.\nWe got to talking, and he told me something shocking..."
    char_valessa "昨晚我思绪万千，睡不着。\n我决定帮亚历克斯准备出航的船。\n我们聊了起来，他告诉了我一件震惊的事……"

# game/script.rpy:166777
translate chinese map169_6e444d20:

    # voice "se/y01130.ogg"
    voice "se/y01130.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:166779
translate chinese map169_80f953da:

    # char_valessa "I was so lost in thought, I couldn't sleep last night.\nI decided to help Nada prepare the ship for our voyage.\nWe got to talking, and she told me something shocking..."
    char_valessa "昨晚我思绪万千，睡不着。\n我决定帮娜达准备出航的船。\n我们聊了起来，她告诉了我一件震惊的事……"

# game/script.rpy:166792
translate chinese map169_e3e3e1d8:

    # voice "se/y01131.ogg"
    voice "se/y01131.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:166794
translate chinese map169_e1f83613:

    # char_valessa "I'm not even sure if I should tell you this, [firstname].\nBut I guess it's something you deserve to know.\nRemember how those people recognized us?"
    char_valessa "我甚至不确定该不该告诉你这个，[firstname]。\n但我想这是你该知道的事。\n记得那些人认出我们了吗？"

# game/script.rpy:166808
translate chinese map169_e5436837:

    # "She must be talking about Gryz and Grayson.{w}\nThey both recognized us when we first met."
    "她说的肯定是格瑞兹和格雷森。{w}\n我们初次见面时他们都认出了我们。"

# game/script.rpy:166833
translate chinese map169_f361dd36:

    # voice "se/y01132.ogg"
    voice "se/y01132.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:166835
translate chinese map169_a4a7b2af:

    # char_valessa "They recognized us too. Immediately.\nI assumed it's because they knew our parents.\nBut then they told me {i}how{/i} they knew them."
    char_valessa "他们也认出了我们。立刻就认出来了。\n我以为是因为他们认识我们的父母。\n但后来他们告诉了我，他们{i}怎么{/i}认识他们的。"

# game/script.rpy:166849
translate chinese map169_007fff5e:

    # "She closes her eyes, and looks up to the sky."
    "她闭上眼，抬头望向天空。"

# game/script.rpy:166874
translate chinese map169_65e59809:

    # voice "se/y01133.ogg"
    voice "se/y01133.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:166876
translate chinese map169_9e74bcaf:

    # char_valessa "Our parents were pirates, [firstname].\nFeared, hated, {i}legendary{/i} pirates.\nSure explains their \"trips\" to Mazeo."
    char_valessa "我们的父母是海盗，[firstname]。\n令人畏惧、遭人憎恨的{i}传奇{/i}海盗。\n这就解释了他们的马泽奥“旅行”。"

# game/script.rpy:166879
translate chinese map169_68d11dc1:

    # voice "se/y01134.ogg"
    # char_valessa "At first I didn't believe it. I was lost in denial.\nBut they kept telling me more and more, and I had to accept it.\nI always pictured our parents as these perfect, untarnished people."
    voice "se/y01134.ogg"
    char_valessa "一开始我不信。我沉浸在否认中。\n但他们越说越多，我不得不接受。\n我一直把我们的父母想象成完美无瑕的人。"

# game/script.rpy:166883
translate chinese map169_f945feb4:

    # voice "se/y01135.ogg"
    voice "se/y01135.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:166885
translate chinese map169_c225c204:

    # char_valessa "But they were killers. They broke the law. They pillaged.\nThey were part of the reason The Triumvirate launched The Occupation.\nI know what you're going to say. \"They wanted the idol\". Piracy was a cover."
    char_valessa "但他们是杀人犯。他们违法。他们掠夺。\n他们是三人执政团发动“占领”的原因之一。\n我知道你要说什么。“他们想要灵像”。海盗只是幌子。"

# game/script.rpy:166898
translate chinese map169_48b17235:

    # voice "se/y01136.ogg"
    voice "se/y01136.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:166901
translate chinese map169_0e945751:

    # char_valessa "And while you may be right, the excuse was still valid.\nAt the end of the day, piracy was running rampant throughout Mazeo.\nOur parents played a part in giving them this perfect excuse, don't you see?"
    char_valessa "就算你说得对，那个借口依然成立。\n说到底，海盗行为在马泽奥肆虐。\n我们的父母也参与了，给了他们这个完美的借口，你明白吗？"

# game/script.rpy:166904
translate chinese map169_22c92b4d:

    # voice "se/y01137.ogg"
    # char_valessa "And in doing so, they are partly responsible for all of those deaths.\nWe always thought they were innocent victims. But were they really?\nHonestly, I doubt I'll be doing much sleep tonight either, [firstname]."
    voice "se/y01137.ogg"
    char_valessa "也正因如此，他们对那些死亡负有部分责任。\n我们一直以为他们是无辜的受害者。但真的是吗？\n说实话，我估计今晚我也睡不着，[firstname]。"

# game/script.rpy:166919
translate chinese map169_ce54e321:

    # "She lets out another sigh, even more exasperated than the last one."
    "她又叹了口气，比刚才那声更加无奈。"

# game/script.rpy:166944
translate chinese map169_898b6e25:

    # voice "se/y01138.ogg"
    voice "se/y01138.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:166946
translate chinese map169_483841e1:

    # char_valessa "Let's sum it up, shall we?"
    char_valessa "我们来总结一下，好吗？"

# game/script.rpy:166959
translate chinese map169_c54fd0e3:

    # voice "se/y01139.ogg"
    voice "se/y01139.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:166961
translate chinese map169_cabe7132:

    # char_valessa "There's no more spirit realm. Our belief system was shattered.\nAlmost the entire Rebellion was killed in action. We were tricked.\nAnd to top it all off, I'm the daughter of some ruthless pirate killers?"
    char_valessa "灵界没了。我们的信仰体系碎了。\n几乎整个反抗军都阵亡了。我们被骗了。\n更糟的是，我还是几个残暴海盗杀手的女儿？"

# game/script.rpy:166964
translate chinese map169_af313d7e:

    # voice "se/y01140.ogg"
    # char_valessa "How am I supposed to process all of this? How will {i}you{/i}?\nYour parents, my parents, Fortaime's parents... All six of them.\nThey're not the people we thought they were. What do we do...?" nointeract
    voice "se/y01140.ogg"
    char_valessa "我该怎么消化这一切？{i}你{/i}又该怎么消化？\n你的父母，我的父母，福泰姆的父母……六个人。\n他们不是我们以为的那种人。我们该怎么办……？" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:166981
translate chinese map169_1082142c:

    # "She nods, without offering a reply of her own.{w}\nBut I know she understands. This doesn't change much.{w}\nThe goals, and the journey ahead of us, would remain the same."
    "她点点头，没有自己作答。{w}\n但我知道她明白。这改变不了多少。{w}\n目标，还有我们前方的旅程，都不会变。"

# game/script.rpy:166997
translate chinese map169_d64b6b38:

    # "Without saying anything, I step closer, and hold her hand.{w}\nShe grips it tightly, as they both rest on the wooden rails of the ship.{w}\nMoments later, however, she takes a few steps closer to me."
    "我什么也没说，走近一步，握住她的手。{w}\n当两只手都搭在船的木质栏杆上时，她紧紧握住。{w}\n然而片刻之后，她朝我走近了几步。"

# game/script.rpy:166999
translate chinese map169_7fed310c:

    # "Placing her head on my shoulder, she wraps her free arm around mine.{w}\nHugging it tightly, I can feel her tremble, as emotion wells up within her.{w}\nHow she feels is understandable. She's going through so much right now."
    "她把头靠在我肩上，用空着的手臂环住我的胳膊。{w}\n她紧紧抱着，我能感觉到她颤抖，情绪在她心中涌起。{w}\n她的感受可以理解。她现在承受着太多。"

# game/script.rpy:167015
translate chinese map169_74293e76:

    # "She scoffs, not even giving me a reply of her own.{w}\nBut I know she understands. This doesn't change much.\nThe goals, and the journey ahead of us, would remain the same."
    "她嗤笑一声，甚至没有自己作答。{w}\n但我知道她明白。这改变不了多少。\n目标，还有我们前方的旅程，都不会变。"

# game/script.rpy:167031
translate chinese map169_1082142c_1:

    # "She nods, without offering a reply of her own.{w}\nBut I know she understands. This doesn't change much.{w}\nThe goals, and the journey ahead of us, would remain the same."
    "她点点头，没有自己作答。{w}\n但我知道她明白。这改变不了多少。{w}\n目标，还有我们前方的旅程，都不会变。"

# game/script.rpy:167056
translate chinese map169_04485b33:

    # voice "se/y01141.ogg"
    voice "se/y01141.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:167058
translate chinese map169_3807e7d6:

    # char_valessa "I'm just so lost, [firstname]..."
    char_valessa "我只是好迷茫，[firstname]……"

# game/script.rpy:167072
translate chinese map169_3cbd49c1:

    # "Honestly, part of me feels the same way.{w}\nIn that moment, there's nothing left to say.{w}\nWe stare off into the ocean. Together."
    "说实话，我也有点同感。{w}\n那一刻，再没什么可说的了。{w}\n我们望着大海。一起。"

# game/script.rpy:167081
translate chinese map169_f7b23604:

    # "This was a turning point in all of our lives.{w}\nHow we handled things would define who we became.{w}\nOur conversation ends with that thought, bringing both hope and despair."
    "这是我们所有人生命中的一个转折点。{w}\n我们如何处理事情，将决定我们成为什么样的人。{w}\n我们的谈话就在这个念头中结束，既带来希望，也带来绝望。"

# game/script.rpy:167109
translate chinese map174_7229f752:

    # "I see Pro sitting at one of the beds, striking a match.{w}\nHe uses it to light some nearby candles, creating a laid back atmosphere.{w}\nThe candle slowly fills the crew quarters with a sweet aroma. Very relaxing."
    "我看见普洛坐在一张床边，擦燃一根火柴。{w}\n他用它点燃旁边的几支蜡烛，营造出悠闲的氛围。{w}\n蜡烛慢慢让船员舱充满甜美的香气。非常放松。"

# game/script.rpy:167134
translate chinese map174_c2a8f907:

    # voice "se/y01274.ogg"
    voice "se/y01274.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:167137
translate chinese map174_79162ed4:

    # char_pro "Hey there, [firstname].\nPerfect timing, actually.\nI wanted to talk to you."
    char_pro "嘿，[firstname]。\n其实来得正好。\n我正想跟你聊聊。"

# game/script.rpy:167152
translate chinese map174_6197d9eb:

    # voice "se/y01275.ogg"
    voice "se/y01275.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:167154
translate chinese map174_948a89bf:

    # char_pro "We were supposed to have a date, right?\nI mean — we wanted to see if we click, or whatever.\nI'm glad we decided to start slow, without making mistakes."
    char_pro "我们本该约会的，对吧？\n我是说——我们想看看合不合得来，之类的。\n我很高兴我们决定慢慢来，不犯错。"

# game/script.rpy:167159
translate chinese map174_4e272dad:

    # voice "se/y01276.ogg"
    voice "se/y01276.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:167161
translate chinese map174_186dff0c:

    # char_pro "I thought we could get to know each other a little better.\nUnfortunately, our time was cut short back at the Rebel HQ.\nBut this a long voyage, with no need to cut any corners."
    char_pro "我想我们可以多了解一下彼此。\n可惜在反抗军总部时，我们的时间被打断了。\n但这是趟漫长的航行，不必走捷径。"

# game/script.rpy:167175
translate chinese map174_9248bce7:

    # voice "se/y01277.ogg"
    voice "se/y01277.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:167177
translate chinese map174_f8da9ecf:

    # char_pro "So, wanna have a seat? We can get things started.\nThe candles are supposed to be relaxing. Something about aromatherapy.\nI never really looked into it, but I'm scared of water — so I needed help."
    char_pro "那么，想坐下吗？我们可以开始。\n这些蜡烛应该能让人放松。好像是芳香疗法之类的。\n我从没认真研究过，但我怕水——所以我需要点帮助。"

# game/script.rpy:167191
translate chinese map174_16a632f2:

    # "I sit down beside Pro on the bed, already one fact richer.{w}\nSo he was scared of water? He must not be having much fun.{w}\nIt makes me wonder what else I don't know about him. He's a mystery."
    "我在床边普洛身旁坐下，已经多知道了一件事。{w}\n原来他怕水？那他肯定没怎么享受。{w}\n这让我好奇还有多少关于他的事我不知道。他是个谜。"

# game/script.rpy:167216
translate chinese map174_8eddc9bf:

    # voice "se/y01278.ogg"
    # char_pro "You should tell me about yourself, [firstname].\nAnd this is because I'm genuinely interested, I swear.\nWhatever you tell me — I'll never write down in any books."
    voice "se/y01278.ogg"
    char_pro "你该跟我讲讲你自己，[firstname]。\n这是因为我真心感兴趣，我发誓。\n无论你告诉我什么——我都绝不会写进任何书里。"

# game/script.rpy:167220
translate chinese map174_768fcd0a:

    # voice "se/y01279.ogg"
    # char_pro "That's what friends do, right? Confide in each other?\nI know I always talk about writing books, and conducting interviews.\nBut the truth is, this time — I want to keep things between the two of us."
    voice "se/y01279.ogg"
    char_pro "朋友就是这样，对吧？互相倾诉？\n我知道我总是说要写书、做访谈。\n但说实话，这一次——我想让事情只留在我们俩之间。"

# game/script.rpy:167235
translate chinese map174_f1c9f041:

    # "I nod, and tell him a random fact about myself. Nothing harmful, just small.{w}\nHe smiles, and we start to exchange facts about each other. He seems really happy.{w}\nThe pressure not to write any of this down, and treat me like a subject, must be relieving."
    "我点头，告诉他一个关于我的随意小事。无伤大雅，很小的事。{w}\n他笑了，我们开始交换彼此的信息。他看起来真的很开心。{w}\n不必把这些记下来、不必把我当研究对象，这对他来说一定很轻松。"

# game/script.rpy:167260
translate chinese map174_6f09e451:

    # voice "se/y01280.ogg"
    # char_pro "Everyone always treats me with such apprehension, you know?\nLike — anything they tell me — I'll turn around and use it against them.\nThat {i}is{/i} a part of my business, but it's not like I want to do things that way."
    voice "se/y01280.ogg"
    char_pro "大家总是对我提心吊胆，你知道吗？\n就像——他们告诉我的任何事——我都会转头拿来对付他们。\n那{i}确实{/i}是我生意的一部分，但我并不想那样做事。"

# game/script.rpy:167264
translate chinese map174_00fd9e51:

    # voice "se/y01281.ogg"
    # char_pro "I hope people don't treat me that way after the war is over.\nI'm quitting this swindler's life as soon as I get the chance.\nI'll still write, but I won't use information as a weapon. Ever."
    voice "se/y01281.ogg"
    char_pro "我希望战争结束后人们不会那样对我。\n一有机会我就退出这种骗子生涯。\n我还是会写东西，但我不会再把情报当武器。绝不。"

# game/script.rpy:167278
translate chinese map174_43a03fda:

    # voice "se/y01282.ogg"
    # char_pro "Instead, I'll use it to help those in need. \nYou know, I've done it before, and it feels good.\nInformation can either be a sharp knife, or a warm embrace."
    voice "se/y01282.ogg"
    char_pro "相反，我会用它帮助有需要的人。\n你知道，我以前做过，感觉很好。\n情报可以是锋利的刀，也可以是温暖的拥抱。"

# game/script.rpy:167292
translate chinese map174_46bc3141:

    # voice "se/y01283.ogg"
    # char_pro "Weird metaphor, I know, but like I said — I'm no fiction writer.\nI prefer to focus on stuff that's real. Like people, and their actions.\nThey ripple outwards, affecting people in ways they'd never know."
    voice "se/y01283.ogg"
    char_pro "比喻很怪，我知道，但就像我说的——我不是写小说的。\n我更喜欢关注真实的东西。比如人，还有他们的行为。\n它们向外扩散，以当事人永远不知道的方式影响着别人。"

# game/script.rpy:167296
translate chinese map174_2b023e65:

    # voice "se/y01284.ogg"
    # char_pro "Of course, that's something that applies to \"normal\" people.\nThere's nothing normal about you, [firstname]. No offense, of course.\nYou're going to be in charge of the entire world after this war is over."
    voice "se/y01284.ogg"
    char_pro "当然，那是适用于“普通”人的道理。\n你一点都不普通，[firstname]。当然，无意冒犯。\n这场战争结束后，你要掌管整个世界。"

# game/script.rpy:167311
translate chinese map174_1a593175:

    # "Wow, talk about putting the pressure on.{w}\nPro senses this, and changes the subject."
    "哇，这可真是给我压力。{w}\n普洛察觉到这点，换了个话题。"

# game/script.rpy:167336
translate chinese map174_a761be0c:

    # voice "se/y01285.ogg"
    # char_pro "Can I tell you a little secret?\nMaybe it'll make you see things differently.\nYou know — so you won't picture me as a bad person."
    voice "se/y01285.ogg"
    char_pro "我能告诉你一个小秘密吗？\n也许会让你换个角度看事情。\n你知道——这样你就不会把我想成坏人。"

# game/script.rpy:167340
translate chinese map174_3c3fc317:

    # voice "se/y01286.ogg"
    # char_pro "I can tell that a lot of people do, even if they don't say it.\nBut all I'm doing is helping Damek win this war in the best way I can.\nIt's not my fault that I'm like this. All I can do is play with the hand I've been dealt."
    voice "se/y01286.ogg"
    char_pro "我看得出很多人就是这么想的，哪怕他们不说。\n但我所做的只是用我能做到的最好方式帮达梅克赢得这场战争。\n我变成这样不是我的错。我能做的只是打好手里这副牌。"

# game/script.rpy:167358
translate chinese map174_c5d80862:

    # "He smiles, but suddenly a wave of fear overtakes my entire body.{w}\nI shut my eyes tightly as that last phrase echoes through my mind.\nWhere did I hear that before...? Oh, right — during my visions."
    "他笑了笑，但突然一阵恐惧袭遍我全身。{w}\n我紧紧闭上眼，最后一句话在脑海中回响。\n我在哪儿听过这句话……？哦，对了——在我的幻象里。"

# game/script.rpy:167360
translate chinese map174_35635042:

    # "When I first touched The Blade of Exodus, back in Valinorth.{w}\nThe series of visions ended with me getting stabbed by a man.{w}\nA man, that unfortunately, I'm now able to identify as Pro..."
    "在我第一次触碰“放逐之刃”时，就在瓦利诺斯。{w}\n那一系列幻象以我被一个男人刺中而结束。{w}\n很不幸，现在我能认出那个男人是普洛……"

# game/script.rpy:167365
translate chinese map174_63b20368:

    # "He lets out a loud sigh, and slowly rests his hand on top of mine.{w}\nA few moments later, he intertwines his fingers with mine, smiling.{w}\nMy heart beats incredibly fast, as this revelation processes itself."
    "他重重叹了口气，慢慢把手覆在我的手上。{w}\n过了一会儿，他微笑着与我十指相扣。{w}\n随着这个发现慢慢消化，我的心跳得飞快。"

# game/script.rpy:167370
translate chinese map174_01187469:

    # "He lets out a soft laugh, and rests his hands behind his head, laying back.{w}\nMy heart beats incredibly fast, as this revelation slowly processes itself in my head.{w}\nThe final vision The Monarchy had given me, was of Pro betraying all of us...?"
    "他轻笑一声，双手枕在脑后，向后躺下。{w}\n随着这个发现在我脑中慢慢消化，我的心跳得飞快。{w}\n君主国给我的最后一段幻象，是普洛背叛我们所有人……？"

# game/script.rpy:167374
translate chinese map174_30fe9eb3:

    # "What was going on...? Why would he do that...?"
    "这是怎么回事……？他为什么要那样做……？"

# game/script.rpy:167402
translate chinese map174_5774e00b:

    # voice "se/y01286b.ogg"
    # char_pro "There was this little boy, who got abandoned by his parents.\nHe didn't know why, and that hurt him so much. Maybe they just didn't want him.\nBut why...? What did he ever do to them? It made no sense, and he hated that."
    voice "se/y01286b.ogg"
    char_pro "从前有个小男孩，被父母抛弃了。\n他不知道为什么，那让他非常痛苦。也许他们就是不想要他。\n可是为什么……？他对他们做过什么？这毫无道理，而他恨透了这一点。"

# game/script.rpy:167406
translate chinese map174_5df5a2af:

    # voice "se/y01287.ogg"
    # char_pro "He had to grow up on the streets, living on the scraps that other people threw away.\nIt wasn't just his parents, you know. It almost seemed like nobody wanted him at all.\nThat just made things worse. Can you imagine feeling unwanted by the world...?"
    voice "se/y01287.ogg"
    char_pro "他不得不在街头长大，靠别人扔掉的食物残渣过活。\n不只是他的父母，你知道。几乎好像根本没人想要他。\n这让事情更糟。你能想象被整个世界嫌弃的感觉吗……？"

# game/script.rpy:167421
translate chinese map174_4c2907ea:

    # "As he starts telling me this story, the anxiety slowly dissipates.{w}\nPro was a swindler, right? Maybe he was only pretending to kill me.{w}\nI don't think Pro could hurt me. There must be a deeper meaning here."
    "当他开始讲这个故事时，我的焦虑慢慢消散。{w}\n普洛是个骗子，对吧？也许他只是假装要杀我。{w}\n我不觉得普洛会伤害我。这里一定有更深的含义。"

# game/script.rpy:167436
translate chinese map174_c0ccfa7f:

    # voice "se/y01288.ogg"
    # char_pro "He started to pick up on people's secrets. You know, just little things.\nAfter a while, he found out that people would pay anything to learn these secrets.\nAs a teenager, he used this ability to live a luxurious life of gluttony and sloth."
    voice "se/y01288.ogg"
    char_pro "他开始打探人们的秘密。你知道，都是些小事。\n过了一阵，他发现人们愿意付出任何代价来得知这些秘密。\n少年时，他靠这项本事过着暴食与懒惰的奢华生活。"

# game/script.rpy:167440
translate chinese map174_c50b7927:

    # voice "se/y01289.ogg"
    # char_pro "He knew secrets that could topple cities, or destroy people's relationships.\nBut none of that gave him satisfaction, because there was {i}one{/i} thing he never knew.\nWhy his parents abandoned him. Why they didn't want him. Did he deserve it...?"
    voice "se/y01289.ogg"
    char_pro "他知道能颠覆城市、摧毁人际关系的秘密。\n但这些都没给他满足感，因为有{i}一件{/i}事他永远不知道。\n他的父母为什么抛弃他。他们为什么不想要他。是他活该吗……？"

# game/script.rpy:167444
translate chinese map174_c990daf7:

    # voice "se/y01290.ogg"
    # char_pro "It was too humiliating to admit, so he made up another story.\nHis parents died during The Occupation. That was much less embarrassing.\nEverybody believed him, and that helped him fit in with a {i}new{/i} group of people."
    voice "se/y01290.ogg"
    char_pro "承认这个太丢人，所以他编了另一个故事。\n他的父母在“占领”期间死了。这远没那么难堪。\n所有人都相信了他，这也帮他融入了{i}一群新人{/i}。"

# game/script.rpy:167448
translate chinese map174_6a737df2:

    # voice "se/y01291.ogg"
    # char_pro "This new group of people, The Rebellion, wanted to use his skills for good.\nThey accepted him with open arms, which is something nobody had ever done before.\nHe knew he found his place in the world, and since then, he's served this new family."
    voice "se/y01291.ogg"
    char_pro "这群新人——反抗军——想用他的本事来做善事。\n他们张开双臂接纳了他，这是以前从没有人做过的事。\n他知道自己找到了在世上的一席之地，从那以后，他一直侍奉这个新家庭。"

# game/script.rpy:167452
translate chinese map174_add5766b:

    # voice "se/y01292.ogg"
    # char_pro "He keeps prodding the locals for information, picking up all sorts of secrets.\nHe wants to know why people do the things they do — and what motivates them.\nHe does this so nobody has to suffer like he did. Simply {i}not{/i} knowing the reason."
    voice "se/y01292.ogg"
    char_pro "他不断向当地人打探消息，搜集各种各样的秘密。\n他想知道人们为什么做那些事——是什么驱动着他们。\n他这样做，是为了没人再像他那样痛苦。仅仅因为{i}不知道{/i}原因。"

# game/script.rpy:167467
translate chinese map174_4ade83fa:

    # "I notice he starts to get sad, and tears are forming in his eyes.{w}\nHe's talking about himself. He's the boy in the story, I can tell.{w}\nPerhaps telling me as if it were a story made it easier for him."
    "我注意到他开始难过，眼里泛起泪水。{w}\n他是在说他自己。我看得出，他就是故事里的那个男孩。{w}\n也许把它当作故事来讲，对他来说更容易些。"

# game/script.rpy:167482
translate chinese map174_75a804ae:

    # voice "se/y01293.ogg"
    # char_pro "So everybody thinks this guy is bad. A blackmailer, and a swindler.\nThey might be right, but it's just how he grew up. He had no control.\nHe had nobody to show him how to act. Nobody to care, or love him."
    voice "se/y01293.ogg"
    char_pro "所以所有人都觉得这家伙是坏人。一个敲诈犯，一个骗子。\n他们也许说得对，但他就是这么长大的。他无从选择。\n没人教他该怎么做人。没人在乎他，也没人爱他。"

# game/script.rpy:167498
translate chinese map174_c1a968ff:

    # voice "se/y01294.ogg"
    voice "se/y01294.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:167500
translate chinese map174_80ff66bd:

    # char_pro "At least, until now..."
    char_pro "至少，直到现在……"

# game/script.rpy:167514
translate chinese map174_8f250d07:

    # "He squeezes my hand tighter, and then sits up on the bed.{w}\nResting on his knees, he makes sure his face is level to mine."
    "他更紧地握住我的手，然后在床上坐起来。{w}\n他跪坐着，让自己的脸与我的齐平。"

# game/script.rpy:167539
translate chinese map174_f1876324:

    # voice "se/y01295.ogg"
    # char_pro "I'm sure you've already guessed it, but the boy is me.\nEvery action has a reason. Even mine, as bad as the actions are.\nI only want to see my parents again, face to face — and ask them."
    voice "se/y01295.ogg"
    char_pro "我确定你已经猜到了，那个男孩就是我。\n每个行为都有原因。即使是像我这样恶劣的行为。\n我只想再见父母一面，面对面——然后问他们。"

# game/script.rpy:167553
translate chinese map174_cfbe5870:

    # voice "se/y01296.ogg"
    # char_pro "Why did they hate me...?\nWhy did they throw me away like garbage?\nIf they weren't proud of me, are they proud now...?"
    voice "se/y01296.ogg"
    char_pro "他们为什么恨我……？\n他们为什么像扔垃圾一样把我扔掉？\n如果他们不曾以我为傲，那现在会吗……？"

# game/script.rpy:167557
translate chinese map174_95765573:

    # voice "se/y01297.ogg"
    # char_pro "I'd do anything to learn where they are right now.\nFollow any order, take any course of action.\nI hope you can understand, [firstname]."
    voice "se/y01297.ogg"
    char_pro "为了知道他们现在在哪，我什么都愿意做。\n服从任何命令，采取任何行动。\n希望你能理解，[firstname]。"

# game/script.rpy:167572
translate chinese map174_caefb60d:

    # "I nod, and raise my free hand up to stroke the side of his face.{w}\nHe lets out a soft gasp in response, and looks directly in my eyes."
    "我点头，抬起空着的手轻抚他的脸颊。{w}\n他轻吸一口气作为回应，直直看进我的眼睛。"

# game/script.rpy:167587
translate chinese map174_9c4eb2e1:

    # voice "se/y01298.ogg"
    # char_pro "Thank you..."
    voice "se/y01298.ogg"
    char_pro "谢谢你……"

# game/script.rpy:167602
translate chinese map174_a7bc0d66:

    # "I lean in closer, lowering my hand down to his side.{w}\nWe kiss, and I can feel him tremble softly, as if he's shy.{w}\nA single tear trails from his eyes as our lips press together."
    "我凑得更近，把手放低到他身侧。{w}\n我们接吻，我能感觉到他轻轻颤抖，仿佛很害羞。{w}\n双唇相触时，一滴泪从他眼角滑落。"

# game/script.rpy:167611
translate chinese map174_c7b9f23f:

    # "No matter what happened — he'd always be welcome at my side.{w}\nWe continue to kiss, the sweet scent of the candle slowly filling the room.{w}\nThe perfect atmosphere, the perfect mood, to express our feelings for one another."
    "无论发生什么，我身边永远有他的位置。{w}\n我们继续亲吻，蜡烛的甜香慢慢充满房间。{w}\n完美的氛围，完美的情绪，去表达我们对彼此的感情。"

# game/script.rpy:167626
translate chinese map174_23fd8560:

    # voice "se/y01299.ogg"
    voice "se/y01299.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:167628
translate chinese map174_5f3d68c5:

    # char_pro "Until The Rebellion took him in, of course.\nI'm sure you already guessed it, but that boy is me.\nAll of my actions, however bad, have had a reason."
    char_pro "当然，直到反抗军收留了他。\n我确定你已经猜到了，那个男孩就是我。\n我所有的行为，无论多坏，都有原因。"

# game/script.rpy:167641
translate chinese map174_8c1ed7aa:

    # voice "se/y01300.ogg"
    # char_pro "I want to keep going, until I learn about my parents.\nWhere are they now...? Why did they throw me away...?\nIf they weren't proud of me, then would they be proud now?"
    voice "se/y01300.ogg"
    char_pro "我想继续走下去，直到查明我父母的事。\n他们现在在哪……？他们为什么把我扔掉……？\n如果他们不曾以我为傲，那现在会吗？"

# game/script.rpy:167645
translate chinese map174_1113e25c:

    # voice "se/y01301.ogg"
    # char_pro "I hope you can understand. I really do.\nI'd do anything to learn where they are right now. I'd follow any order.\nI just want to see them face to face, and finally learn the reason why."
    voice "se/y01301.ogg"
    char_pro "希望你能理解。真的。\n为了知道他们现在在哪，我什么都愿意做。我会服从任何命令。\n我只想面对面见到他们，最终弄清原因。"

# game/script.rpy:167659
translate chinese map174_ecd4a63d:

    # voice "se/y01302.ogg"
    # char_pro "That's why I threw myself into this world of secrets, and trickery.\nI thought that if I kept going, maybe one day, I'd learn the truth.\nI guess we'll find out before this war is over. Right, [firstname]...?"
    voice "se/y01302.ogg"
    char_pro "这就是为什么我投身于这个充满秘密和诡计的世界。\n我想，如果我继续下去，也许有一天能得知真相。\n我猜我们会在战争结束前弄明白。对吧，[firstname]……？"

# game/script.rpy:167677
translate chinese map174_f90dd0ee:

    # "I nod, and give him a soft smile. It meant a lot that he opened up to me.{w}\nIt must suck to not know the truth of something like that. I can't even imagine.{w}\nBut it explains why he's so obsessed with learning about actions and motivations."
    "我点头，给他一个温柔的微笑。他向我敞开心扉，这对我意义重大。{w}\n这种事不知道真相一定很难受。我甚至无法想象。{w}\n但这也解释了他为什么如此执着于探究行为和动机。"

# game/script.rpy:167686
translate chinese map174_ebfd9efc:

    # "We talk for a bit longer, about nothing important, before parting ways.{w}\nPerhaps he wanted to ease the tension in the room after dropping those facts.{w}\nAfter we're done, he seems happy, and we seem closer. There was no loss here, today."
    "我们又聊了一会儿，没什么重要的，然后各自离开。{w}\n也许他抛下那些事实后，想缓解房里的紧张气氛。{w}\n聊完后，他看起来很开心，我们也似乎更亲近了。今天在这里，没有损失。"

# game/script.rpy:167727
translate chinese map019_f7c2da77:

    # "We enter the outskirts of Valinorth, and take in deep breaths.{w}\nThe air is so fresh, and pure. It's almost hard to explain.{w}\nHowever, our enjoyment is hindered by Zamira's worried look."
    "我们走进瓦利诺斯的外围，深吸一口气。{w}\n空气如此清新纯净。几乎难以形容。{w}\n然而，扎米拉担忧的神色打断了我们的享受。"

# game/script.rpy:167759
translate chinese map019_628a9831:

    # voice "se/z00425.ogg"
    voice "se/z00425.ogg"

