    # char_fortaime "I know I hate the trade ban they put on Mazeo, but this isn't personal.\nLifting those bans and uniting the nations would create peace.\nIsn't that our goal at the end of this, [firstname]?"
    char_fortaime "我知道我讨厌他们对马泽奥实施的贸易禁令，但这不是私人恩怨。\n解除那些禁令、团结各国，会带来和平。\n这不就是我们最终的目标吗，[firstname]？"

# game/script.rpy:169766
