# game/script.rpy:170786
translate chinese click_map012_14_EV014_10776163:

    # "The river runs through the forest, trickling slowly.{w}\nIt'd be a downhill hike, due to Valinorth's location.{w}\nI wonder where this stream would end up, though.{w}\nIn Valinorth, we redirected them all to the water tank."
    "河流穿过森林，缓缓流淌。{w}\n由于瓦利诺斯的地势，这一路都是下坡。{w}\n不过我倒想知道，这条溪流最终会流向哪里。{w}\n在瓦利诺斯，我们把它们全都引流到蓄水池里。"

# game/script.rpy:170823
translate chinese click_map012_15_EV015_7dd1e8ba:

    # "The trees out here looked different than they did at home.{w}\nBack in Valinorth, they were touched by civilization.{w}\nOut here, they were untouched, and looked more wild.{w}\nEven the scent in the air seemed a lot different."
    "这里的树木看起来和家乡的不一样。{w}\n在瓦利诺斯，它们带着文明的痕迹。{w}\n在这里，它们无人触碰，显得更加野性。{w}\n连空气中的气味似乎都大不相同。"

# game/script.rpy:170904
translate chinese click_map012_21_EV021_d13e0e8a:

    # "I tried looking as far back as I could.{w}\nI thought I might be able to see where the stream led.{w}\nBut it went on too far, and I couldn't see a thing.{w}\nIt would be good to use as a landmark, so we don't get lost."
    "我试着尽量往远处看。{w}\n我以为能看到溪流通向何处。{w}\n但它延伸得太远，我什么也看不清。{w}\n用它当路标应该不错，这样我们就不会迷路。"

# game/script.rpy:170941
translate chinese click_map012_22_EV022_30b136cf:

    # "The ground is soft, and full of grass.{w}\nIt's growing out of control, I noticed right away.{w}\nThere was nobody out here to trim it like in the village.{w}\nIt's odd how so much can change due to an invisible line."
    "地面松软，长满了草。{w}\n我一眼就注意到，它疯长得没人管。{w}\n这里没人像村里那样修剪它。{w}\n真奇怪，一条看不见的界线竟能带来这么多变化。"

# game/script.rpy:170978
translate chinese click_map012_23_EV023_5edc7922:

    # "The leaves are swaying in the wind.{w}\nA few fall down, and they soar around majestically.{w}\nWe're far enough from Eastcrown that they didn't wilt.{w}\nIt's amazing how much the spirits helped out our settlement."
    "树叶在风中摇曳。{w}\n几片飘落下来，庄严地盘旋飞舞。{w}\n我们离东冠足够远，所以它们没有枯萎。{w}\n众灵对我们的聚居地帮助之大，真是不可思议。"

# game/script.rpy:171049
translate chinese map026_ab548722:

    # "Damek returned to the surface with Gryz at his side.{w}\nThe older man took a deep breath, enjoying the fresh air.{w}\nIt was a little stuffy down there. But they could make do."
    "达梅克回到地面，格瑞兹就在他身旁。{w}\n那位年长的男人深吸一口气，享受着新鲜空气。{w}\n下面有点闷。但他们还能凑合。"

