    # char_ulric "How exciting.\nYou'll have to tell me more once we grab Pro.\nAfter that, we're going to evacuate Valinorth."
    char_ulric "真让人兴奋。\n等我们找到普洛，你可得跟我多说点。\n那之后，我们要去疏散瓦利诺斯。"

# game/script.rpy:173893
translate chinese map022_5f4bb4e0:

    # voice "se/z00501.ogg"
    voice "se/z00501.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:173895
translate chinese map022_b7337b32:

    # char_ulric "Well I guess I'll have to loosen you up a little.\nMaybe we'll grab a drink while we meet up with Pro.\nAfter that, we have to go evacuate Valinorth — and quick."
    char_ulric "看来我得让你放松一点才行。\n也许见到普洛的时候我们喝一杯。\n那之后，我们得去疏散瓦利诺斯——而且要快。"

# game/script.rpy:173916
translate chinese map022_199b7c2b:

    # "It seems like he's able to piece things together.{w}\nThe vision of his death — and Sovy — was Valinorth's destruction.{w}\nHe wastes no time in suggesting our immediate course of action."
    "看来他能把线索串起来。{w}\n他死亡的幻象——还有索维——意味着瓦利诺斯的毁灭。{w}\n他毫不耽搁地提出我们该立刻采取的行动。"

# game/script.rpy:173946
translate chinese map022_93d40dd3:

    # voice "se/z00502.ogg"
    voice "se/z00502.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:173948
translate chinese map022_ae15e56e:

    # char_valessa "Actually, Mylus is taking care of that.\nThe village is gathering for a celebration tonight.\nThe perfect time to group up and escape, right?"
    char_valessa "其实，迈勒斯正在处理这件事。\n今晚全村要聚在一起庆祝。\n正是集合撤离的绝佳时机，对吧？"

# game/script.rpy:173973
translate chinese map022_b0af721e:

    # voice "se/z00503.ogg"
    voice "se/z00503.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:173975
translate chinese map022_19422ff5:

    # char_ulric "Really? I'm starting to wonder why I'm even here.\nEither way, Pro and I will take you to Damek.\nGlad to hear this vision of yours won't come to pass."
    char_ulric "真的？我都开始怀疑我来这儿干什么了。\n不管怎样，我和普洛会带你们去见达梅克。\n很高兴听说你们这个幻象不会成真。"

# game/script.rpy:173996
translate chinese map022_0ac3f492:

    # "That much is true. He'd avoid Valinorth entirely.{w}\nToo bad the attack on Valinorth wasn't something we could avoid."
    "这话没错。他会完全避开瓦利诺斯。{w}\n可惜对瓦利诺斯的袭击是我们避不开的。"

# game/script.rpy:174026
translate chinese map022_3a62a8d6:

    # voice "se/z00504.ogg"
    voice "se/z00504.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:174028
translate chinese map022_47bd4da9:

    # char_ulric "Shall we get things started...?\nUnless you want to talk more, I'm up for that too."
    char_ulric "我们开始吧……？\n除非你还想再聊聊，我也奉陪。"

# game/script.rpy:174049
translate chinese map022_dd9c562e:

    # "I can't tell if he's being genuine or sarcastic.{w}\nIt's hard to get a read on this man, and that's odd.{w}\nHis resolve in last night's vision, his demeanor, was clear."
    "我分不清他是真心还是在讽刺。{w}\n这个人很难看透，而这很奇怪。{w}\n昨晚幻象中他的决心，他的神态，都很清晰。"

# game/script.rpy:174051
translate chinese map022_48233380:

    # "I feel like, even though we barely talked, we're on the same page.{w}\nHe seems to know why we're here, where we're going, and what we need to do.{w}\nThat makes things a bit easier. Endless planning would be tedious."
    "我觉得，尽管我们几乎没说过话，却很有默契。{w}\n他似乎知道我们为什么来、要去哪里、需要做什么。{w}\n这让事情简单了些。无休止的盘算会很乏味。"

# game/script.rpy:174082
translate chinese map022_34f06f9d:

    # voice "se/z00505.ogg"
    voice "se/z00505.ogg"

