# game/script.rpy:174112
translate chinese map022_faeb1b07:

    # "We all look at each other before nodding.{w}\nIt seems like everyone else is following my lead.{w}\nI could probe Ulric for information, or head right inside."
    "我们互相看了看，然后点头。{w}\n似乎其他人都听我指挥。{w}\n我可以向乌尔里克打探消息，或者直接进去。"

# game/script.rpy:174126
translate chinese map022_cd902177:

    # "Ulric has now permanently joined your party."
    "乌尔里克已永久加入你的队伍。"

# game/script.rpy:174486
translate chinese click_map015_6_EV006_0ff4c380:

    # "The tavern looks old, but well taken care of.{w}\nIf it wasn't given frequent care, it would be dilapidated.{w}\nThe love given to this place by the owner clearly shines through."
    "酒馆看起来老旧，但打理得很好。{w}\n如果不是经常照料，它早就破败了。{w}\n店主对这地方倾注的爱意显而易见。"

# game/script.rpy:174490
translate chinese click_map015_6_EV006_2b5a6c9a:

    # voice "se/a00069.ogg"
    voice "se/a00069.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:174492
translate chinese click_map015_6_EV006_7d6d83da:

    # char_fortaime "It's a lot taller than I thought it'd be."
    char_fortaime "比我想象的高多了。"

# game/script.rpy:174495
translate chinese click_map015_6_EV006_b7f457d4:

    # voice "se/a00070.ogg"
    # char_valessa "Well it doubles as a sort of \"hotel\".\nI'm assuming the topmost floors are private rooms."
    voice "se/a00070.ogg"
    char_valessa "它同时也兼作某种“旅馆”。\n我猜最上面几层是客房。"

# game/script.rpy:174499
translate chinese click_map015_6_EV006_0624df6b:

    # voice "se/a00071.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "Oh, really? That's cool.\nMaybe we can rest before we leave."
    voice "se/a00071.ogg"
    char_fortaime "哦，真的？那不错。\n也许我们走之前能休息一下。"

# game/script.rpy:174503
translate chinese click_map015_6_EV006_8eea2f3a:

    # voice "se/a00072.ogg"
    # char_valessa "If we have the time, perhaps we can.\nIt might be nice to explore this place in person.\nI've read about it, and heard lots of stories."
    voice "se/a00072.ogg"
    char_valessa "如果有时间，或许可以。\n亲自探索这个地方应该不错。\n我读到过关于它的东西，也听过很多故事。"

# game/script.rpy:174507
translate chinese click_map015_6_EV006_28fcb0d4:

    # voice "se/a00073.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "What kind of stories...?"
    voice "se/a00073.ogg"
    char_fortaime "什么样的故事……？"

# game/script.rpy:174511
translate chinese click_map015_6_EV006_0d22b818:

    # voice "se/a00074.ogg"
    # char_valessa "If they're true — you'll see for yourself."
    voice "se/a00074.ogg"
    char_valessa "如果它们是真的——你自己就会看到了。"

# game/script.rpy:174549
translate chinese click_map015_15_EV015_bc473785:

    # "The trees stretch up as high as the eye can see.{w}\nIt's still bright out, so sun pierces through the canopy.{w}\nThankfully, it's not too overwhelming. It simply looks beautiful."
    "树木高耸入云，一眼望不到顶。{w}\n天色还亮，阳光穿透树冠洒下来。{w}\n幸好还不算太刺眼。只是看着很美。"

# game/script.rpy:174553
translate chinese click_map015_15_EV015_539e1c01:

    # voice "se/a00075.ogg"
    voice "se/a00075.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:174555
translate chinese click_map015_15_EV015_af638cd9:

    # char_fortaime "Wow, look at all these trees...!\nThey'd be perfect for climbing!\nMind if I take a quick detour?"
    char_fortaime "哇，看看这些树……！\n简直太适合攀爬了！\n介意我稍微绕个道吗？"

# game/script.rpy:174558
translate chinese click_map015_15_EV015_50fe577f:

    # voice "se/a00076.ogg"
    # char_valessa "Come on, Fortaime. We don't have time.\nAren't there more important matters at hand?"
    voice "se/a00076.ogg"
    char_valessa "算了吧，福泰姆。我们没时间。\n眼下没有更重要的事吗？"

# game/script.rpy:174562
translate chinese click_map015_15_EV015_9968f435:

    # voice "se/a00077.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "If I don't practice, how will I ever climb The Grand Tree!?\nYou gotta give me some time every once in a while, Valessa."
    voice "se/a00077.ogg"
    char_fortaime "要是不练习，我怎么可能爬得上巨树！？\n你偶尔也得给我点时间啊，瓦莱莎。"

# game/script.rpy:174566
translate chinese click_map015_15_EV015_a54f26b7:

    # voice "se/a00078.ogg"
    # char_valessa "Perhaps. But not now.\nI don't have time to treat any injuries."
    voice "se/a00078.ogg"
    char_valessa "也许吧。但不是现在。\n我可没时间给你治伤。"

# game/script.rpy:174570
translate chinese click_map015_15_EV015_0d95e37c:

    # voice "se/a00079.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "I can treat them myself!"
    voice "se/a00079.ogg"
    char_fortaime "我自己能治！"

# game/script.rpy:174574
translate chinese click_map015_15_EV015_3ce8b126:

    # voice "se/a00080.ogg"
    # char_valessa "Really? You sure fooled me."
    voice "se/a00080.ogg"
    char_valessa "是吗？你倒是骗到我了。"

# game/script.rpy:174612
translate chinese click_map015_37_EV037_2321e564:

    # "I'm assuming in the dark, this helps people find Peregrino.{w}\nHowever, right now, it seems to serve no real purpose.{w}\nTo come here during the day, you'd have to know exactly where it was."
    "我猜在黑暗中，这东西能帮人找到佩雷格里诺。{w}\n不过眼下，它似乎没什么实际用处。{w}\n白天来这里，你得确切知道它在哪儿才行。"

# game/script.rpy:174616
translate chinese click_map015_37_EV037_8ba6336b:

    # voice "se/a00081.ogg"
    voice "se/a00081.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:174618
translate chinese click_map015_37_EV037_7fa21a1e:

    # char_fortaime "I'm sure glad we had Zamira here to guide us.\nWithout him, I'm pretty sure we'd have gotten lost."
    char_fortaime "还好有扎米拉在这儿给我们带路。\n没他的话，我们肯定会迷路。"

# game/script.rpy:174621
translate chinese click_map015_37_EV037_853ac97f:

    # voice "se/a00082.ogg"
    # char_valessa "Let's not think about that, alright?\nI'm just thankful we have such great friends.\nThey're all risking a lot for us, you know?"
    voice "se/a00082.ogg"
    char_valessa "别想那个了，好吗？\n我只庆幸我们有这么好的朋友。\n你知道，他们都在为我们冒很大的风险。"

# game/script.rpy:174625
translate chinese click_map015_37_EV037_43aed0af:

    # voice "se/a00083.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "True. But honestly, we're risking even more.\nWhen this is all over, we could go down in history.\nIt makes sense that they'd want to be remembered too."
    voice "se/a00083.ogg"
    char_fortaime "没错。但说实话，我们冒的风险更大。\n等这一切结束，我们可能会名留青史。\n他们也想被记住，这也说得通。"

# game/script.rpy:174629
translate chinese click_map015_37_EV037_0a59c63a:

    # voice "se/a00084.ogg"
    # char_valessa "Remembered...?\nDo you mean they're helping us for glory?\nI'd like to think that they were just being nice."
    voice "se/a00084.ogg"
    char_valessa "被记住……？\n你是说他们帮我们是为了荣耀？\n我倒愿意相信他们只是出于好心。"

# game/script.rpy:174633
translate chinese click_map015_37_EV037_9bfc2c3b:

    # voice "se/a00085.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "I wish that's how people worked.\nYou really think Zamira did this for free?\nHe must be receiving some kind of payment."
    voice "se/a00085.ogg"
    char_fortaime "我倒希望人都是那样的。\n你真觉得扎米拉是白帮忙的？\n他肯定收了某种报酬。"

# game/script.rpy:174637
translate chinese click_map015_37_EV037_5084bb0b:

    # voice "se/a00086.ogg"
    # char_valessa "Aren't we going on this journey for \"free\"?\nThere's no promise of fame, money, {i}or{/i} glory."
    voice "se/a00086.ogg"
    char_valessa "我们不也是“免费”踏上这趟旅程的吗？\n既没有名声、金钱，也{i}没有{/i}荣耀的承诺。"

# game/script.rpy:174641
translate chinese click_map015_37_EV037_11d7a9e6:

    # voice "se/a00087.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "But the possibility can be even more appealing.\nEither way, {i}any{/i} help we can get is good.\nNo need to dig into people's motives, Valessa."
    voice "se/a00087.ogg"
    char_fortaime "但那种可能性反而更诱人。\n不管怎样，能得到{i}任何{/i}帮助都是好事。\n没必要深究别人的动机，瓦莱莎。"

# game/script.rpy:174645
translate chinese click_map015_37_EV037_92d9336c:

    # voice "se/a00088.ogg"
    # char_valessa "You're the one that did it though..."
    voice "se/a00088.ogg"
    char_valessa "可刚才那么说的人是你……"

# game/script.rpy:174697
translate chinese Ulric1_map015_58_0_bf5fce45:

    # char_ulric "Hey." nointeract
    char_ulric "嘿。" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:174714
translate chinese Ulric1_map015_58_0_0c516efd:

    # voice "se/y00447.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Absolutely. I'd recognize that thing anywhere.\nI'm surprised you have it out in the open like that.\nWe went through such great lengths to hide it."
    voice "se/y00447.ogg"
    char_ulric "当然。那东西我一眼就能认出来。\n我很意外你竟然就那样大喇喇地露在外面。\n我们当年可是费尽心思才把它藏起来。"

# game/script.rpy:174732
translate chinese Ulric2_map015_58_0_688be752:

    # voice "se/y00448.ogg"
    voice "se/y00448.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:174734
translate chinese Ulric2_map015_58_0_be0103ff:

    # char_ulric "About The Blade of Exodus? It's extraordinary.\nI have no idea where it came from, or the full range of its power.\nIt can repurpose life into an energy that serves the wielder."
    char_ulric "是说出放逐之刃吗？它非同凡响。\n我不知道它从何而来，也不知道它力量的全部范围。\n它能把生命转化为供持有者驱使的能量。"

# game/script.rpy:174737
translate chinese Ulric2_map015_58_0_c0eb65bb:

    # voice "se/y00449.ogg"
    # char_ulric "That gear at the base can spin, which should be impossible.\nIt's almost like some parts of the blade exist in a different world.\nI'm starting to think that's the case. Where else would it store all that power?"
    voice "se/y00449.ogg"
    char_ulric "底部那个齿轮能转动，这按理说是不可能的。\n就好像剑的某些部分存在于另一个世界。\n我开始觉得真是这样。不然它把那么多力量储存在哪儿？"

# game/script.rpy:174755
translate chinese Ulric3_map015_58_0_183c99c6:

    # voice "se/y00450.ogg"
    voice "se/y00450.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:174757
translate chinese Ulric3_map015_58_0_840082a2:

    # char_ulric "It's practically cheating. Whoever wields it has infinite power.\nI don't think of The Triumvirate as Gods. They were just abusing this weapon.\nNow that they don't have it — taking them down should be child's play."
    char_ulric "这简直就是作弊。谁持有它，谁就有无穷的力量。\n我不把三人执政团当神看。他们不过是滥用这件武器罢了。\n如今他们没了它——扳倒他们应该轻而易举。"

# game/script.rpy:174774
translate chinese Ulric3_map015_58_0_43dc5138:

    # voice "se/y00451.ogg"
    voice "se/y00451.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:174776
translate chinese Ulric3_map015_58_0_867eee29:

    # char_ulric "I have no idea, and I don't think we'll ever find out.\nIt must tap into a person's spirit before it enters the spirit realm.\nThat's the only non-physical part of us that could be considered energy."
    char_ulric "我毫无头绪，也不觉得我们会有弄明白的一天。\n它一定是在一个人的灵进入灵界之前将其抽取。\n那是我们身上唯一能被视作能量的非物质部分。"

# game/script.rpy:174793
translate chinese Ulric3_map015_58_0_3c8a7a14:

    # voice "se/y00453.ogg"
    voice "se/y00453.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:174795
translate chinese Ulric3_map015_58_0_437cbcc1:

    # char_ulric "I'm assuming they've always had it. It's how they came to power.\nSome people seem to think they used the blade to create our entire world.\nNot many people know about it, though — and they see The Triumvirate as Gods."
    char_ulric "我猜他们一直都有它。他们就是靠它掌权的。\n有些人似乎认为他们用那把剑创造了我们的整个世界。\n不过知道这件事的人不多——而且他们把三人执政团奉为神明。"

# game/script.rpy:174798
translate chinese Ulric3_map015_58_0_6dc1a61c:

    # voice "se/y00454.ogg"
    # char_ulric "They really aren't. They're just men who came upon a greater power.\nAnd now {i}we{/i} have that greater power. We can rule Alestia far better than them.\nI think we should destroy that blade after we win. It's a tool of pure corruption."
    voice "se/y00454.ogg"
    char_ulric "他们根本不是神。他们只是撞上了更强大力量的凡人。\n而现在{i}我们{/i}拥有了那更强大的力量。我们能比他们更好地统治阿莱斯蒂亚。\n我觉得我们赢了之后应该毁掉那把剑。它是纯粹腐败的产物。"

# game/script.rpy:174820
translate chinese Ulric3_map015_58_0_1e7197cf:

    # voice "se/y00455.ogg"
    voice "se/y00455.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:174822
translate chinese Ulric3_map015_58_0_d7d55e15:

    # char_ulric "It wasn't too long ago. Maybe half a year. The Rebellion planned an attack.\nOur previous leader planned it down to even the {i}smallest{/i} detail.\nSteal the blade, map out their castle — and pave way for our future liberation."
    char_ulric "不算太久，大概半年前。反抗军策划了一次袭击。\n我们之前的那位领袖把它计划到了{i}最细微{/i}的细节。\n偷走那把剑，摸清他们城堡的地形——为我们未来的解放铺路。"

# game/script.rpy:174825
translate chinese Ulric3_map015_58_0_56d4d04a:

    # voice "se/y00456.ogg"
    # char_ulric "I'll be honest. He knew he was going to die. He used his final moments to get the blade.\nSome people think it's a little fishy. How could we win so easily? Did they let us win?\nI don't think it's that deep. They just didn't expect our leader to effectively commit suicide."
    voice "se/y00456.ogg"
    char_ulric "老实说，他知道自己会死。他用最后的时刻拿到了那把剑。\n有些人觉得有点蹊跷。我们怎么能赢得这么容易？是他们故意放水吗？\n我觉得没那么复杂。他们只是没料到我方领袖会那样自杀式进攻。"

# game/script.rpy:174843
translate chinese Ulric4_map015_58_0_c5bc3cbd:

    # voice "se/y00457.ogg"
    voice "se/y00457.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:174845
translate chinese Ulric4_map015_58_0_602d501d:

    # char_ulric "I was. Change the subject."
    char_ulric "我确实会。换个话题吧。"

# game/script.rpy:174862
translate chinese Ulric4_map015_58_0_858bb01b:

    # voice "se/y00458.ogg"
    voice "se/y00458.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:174864
translate chinese Ulric4_map015_58_0_bb736648:

    # char_ulric "I'm sure you won't. I don't think any of us will.\nThe scope of his planning went farther than I could've imagined.\nBeing The Elder of Valinorth, he planned every aspect of your involvement."
    char_ulric "我相信你不会。我觉得我们谁都不会。\n他谋划的规模远超我的想象。\n身为瓦利诺斯的长老，他把你参与的每个环节都计划好了。"

# game/script.rpy:174867
translate chinese Ulric4_map015_58_0_75dac8d9:

    # voice "se/y00459.ogg"
    # char_ulric "I guess breaking Valinorth's non-partisan stance made perfect sense to him.\nEvery little piece was in place. The liberation of Alestia was finally attainable.\nI just hope that you're everything he thought you'd be. Wielding that blade isn't easy."
    voice "se/y00459.ogg"
    char_ulric "我猜打破瓦利诺斯的中立立场，在他看来完全合理。\n每一小块拼图都各就各位。阿莱斯蒂亚的解放终于触手可及。\n我只希望你不负他的期望。挥舞那把剑可不容易。"

# game/script.rpy:174885
translate chinese Ulric4_map015_58_0_37a85e13:

    # voice "se/y00460.ogg"
    voice "se/y00460.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:174887
translate chinese Ulric4_map015_58_0_5bb329a0:

    # char_ulric "He already is, and I'm happy to serve him. Things are going swimmingly.\nIt helps that he was one of the founding members of The Rebellion, too.\nAt that point, though; he was too young to lead. Things are different now."
    char_ulric "他已经是了，我很乐意为他效力。一切进展顺利。\n而且他也是反抗军的创始成员之一，这也有帮助。\n不过那时候他还太年轻，不能领导。现在情况不同了。"

# game/script.rpy:174890
translate chinese Ulric4_map015_58_0_a75dffc4:

    # voice "se/y00461.ogg"
    # char_ulric "He's done a fine job of honoring our leader's legacy, and guiding us to victory.\nHe had to make a few hard decisions, but I trust his judgment without question.\nEverything is going according to plan. Our final assault is all we need."
    voice "se/y00461.ogg"
    char_ulric "他很好地继承了我们领袖的遗志，引领我们走向胜利。\n他不得不做出几个艰难的决定，但我无条件信任他的判断。\n一切都在按计划进行。我们只差最后一场进攻。"

# game/script.rpy:174912
translate chinese Ulric4_map015_58_0_003e8e74:

    # voice "se/y00462.ogg"
    voice "se/y00462.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:174914
translate chinese Ulric4_map015_58_0_59200aa6:

    # char_ulric "Wait — he used The Blade of Exodus on me? That's impossible.\nThere's no way he'd be able to wield it. You're the only one.\nEven Damek nearly died the first time he touched it."
    char_ulric "等等——他用放逐之刃对我施了法？这不可能。\n他绝不可能驾驭它。你是唯一能做到的人。\n就连达梅克第一次碰它时都差点死掉。"

# game/script.rpy:174917
translate chinese Ulric4_map015_58_0_59f130b1:

    # voice "se/y00463.ogg"
    # char_ulric "I'm still surprised though, he had a small vision when he did.\nPerhaps he has some spiritual energy inside of him...\nEither way — hopefully I went out in a blaze of glory."
    voice "se/y00463.ogg"
    char_ulric "不过我还是很惊讶，他那样做时看到了一个小幻象。\n也许他体内也有某种灵力……\n不管怎样——但愿我是轰轰烈烈地死去的。"

# game/script.rpy:174935
translate chinese Ulric5_map015_58_0_c5a555d4:

    # voice "se/y00464.ogg"
    voice "se/y00464.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:174937
translate chinese Ulric5_map015_58_0_f70acaef:

    # char_ulric "Yeah, that sounds like me. I wouldn't have it any other way.\nI'm just thankful that this vision won't come to pass. I have a lot of life left in me.\nThat makes me wonder, though — what was the purpose of seeing something like that?"
    char_ulric "是啊，那听起来像我。我也不想以别的方式死去。\n我只庆幸这个幻象不会成真。我还有很多日子要活。\n不过这让我好奇——看到那样的东西，究竟是为了什么？"

# game/script.rpy:174940
translate chinese Ulric5_map015_58_0_35021a7e:

    # voice "se/y00465.ogg"
    # char_ulric "I can understand a vision of Valinorth being attacked. But seeing me, and watching me die?\nWe've never even met. How is it possible to know what I look like, and how I act?\nI know the spirits give visions of the future, but that's so specific; and it won't happen."
    voice "se/y00465.ogg"
    char_ulric "我能理解看到瓦利诺斯遭袭的幻象。但看到我，亲眼看着我死？\n我们甚至从未见过面。怎么可能知道我的长相和举止？\n我知道众灵会赐予未来的幻象，但那也太具体了；而且它不会发生。"

# game/script.rpy:174958
translate chinese Ulric5_map015_58_0_006516d2:

    # voice "se/y00466.ogg"
    voice "se/y00466.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:174960
translate chinese Ulric5_map015_58_0_5ddb8949:

    # char_ulric "Sovy is an incredibly strong adversary, even without the blade.\nBut if he's able to wield it? We better make sure it never enters his hands.\nHis strength — coupled with that blade? I don't scare easily, but that's terrifying."
    char_ulric "索维是个强得可怕的对手，就算没有那把剑也一样。\n但如果他能驾驭它呢？我们最好确保它永远不落进他手里。\n他的力量——再加上那把剑？我不容易害怕，但那确实很可怕。"

# game/script.rpy:174977
translate chinese Ulric5_map015_58_0_f6d1c30f:

    # voice "se/y00467.ogg"
    voice "se/y00467.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:174979
translate chinese Ulric5_map015_58_0_a06b35b1:

    # char_ulric "There's no way he should be able to. I imagine even {i}you're{/i} having trouble.\nIt's not meant for just anybody to wield. You need an incredible spiritual connection.\nDamek might have a small one, but Sovy? A man like that has {i}no{/i} connection to the spirits."
    char_ulric "他绝不可能做到。我猜就连{i}你{/i}驾驭起来也很吃力。\n它不是随便什么人都能用的。你需要与众灵有非同寻常的联结。\n达梅克或许有一点，但索维？那样的人与众灵{i}毫无{/i}联结。"

# game/script.rpy:175000
translate chinese Ulric5_map015_58_0_140a4159:

    # voice "se/y00468.ogg"
    voice "se/y00468.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:175002
translate chinese Ulric5_map015_58_0_40429d21:

    # char_ulric "Hard to say. That depends on your ability to wield it.\nThe Triumvirate had that blade for an eternity. You don't have that much time.\nNot to put too much pressure on your shoulders. It's just the truth."
    char_ulric "很难说。那取决于你驾驭它的能力。\n三人执政团持有那把剑过了漫长的岁月。你没有那么多时间。\n不是想给你太多压力。只是事实如此。"

# game/script.rpy:175019
translate chinese Ulric6_map015_58_0_a4e01b53:

    # voice "se/y00469.ogg"
    voice "se/y00469.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:175021
translate chinese Ulric6_map015_58_0_3e9e2ef4:

    # char_ulric "Yeah, but you also saw me die, right?\nThese visions aren't as reliable as I've been led to believe.\nRather than seeing the future, it's almost like it shows you what to {i}avoid{/i}."
    char_ulric "是啊，但你也看到我死了，对吧？\n这些幻象并不像我听说的那么可靠。\n与其说是预见未来，倒不如说它是在告诉你该{i}避开{/i}什么。"

# game/script.rpy:175024
translate chinese Ulric6_map015_58_0_8a9efc57:

    # voice "se/y00470.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Too bad we can't avoid what's coming to Valinorth.\nWhen Damek touched the blade, he saw Valinorth fall, and The Rebellion win.\nIt seems like he's embracing what he saw. Good thing you're not, or else I'd be dead."
    voice "se/y00470.ogg"
    char_ulric "可惜我们避不开降临瓦利诺斯的事。\n达梅克碰那把剑时，他看见瓦利诺斯陷落，反抗军获胜。\n看来他接受了所看到的一切。幸好你没有，否则我就死定了。"

# game/script.rpy:175042
translate chinese Ulric6_map015_58_0_34f8e767:

    # voice "se/y00471.ogg"
    voice "se/y00471.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:175044
translate chinese Ulric6_map015_58_0_3d107c80:

    # char_ulric "You mean how do I feel without our most valuable assets? Pretty terrible.\nWithout visions to guide us, and the power of that blade, we'd be dead.\nThere's no way we could take them down through conventional means."
    char_ulric "你是说失去我们最宝贵的战力后我感觉如何？糟透了。\n没有幻象指引我们，没有那把剑的力量，我们早就死了。\n我们绝不可能用常规手段扳倒他们。"

# game/script.rpy:175047
translate chinese Ulric6_map015_58_0_c6591291:

    # voice "se/y00472.ogg"
    # char_ulric "However — at the moment, everything is in our favor. Everything.\nWe just need to be careful. Do {i}not{/i} let The Triumvirate or Sovy take that blade back.\nIf we can do that, victory is as good as ours. A new future will rise to greet Alestia."
    voice "se/y00472.ogg"
    char_ulric "不过——眼下，一切都有利于我们。一切。\n我们只需小心行事。{i}千万不要{/i}让三人执政团或索维夺回那把剑。\n只要做到这点，胜利就等同于是我们的。一个崭新的未来将迎向阿莱斯蒂亚。"

# game/script.rpy:175065
translate chinese Ulric6_map015_58_0_e0522d37:

    # voice "se/y00473.ogg"
    voice "se/y00473.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:175067
translate chinese Ulric6_map015_58_0_22863b5e:

    # char_ulric "Scary is an understatement. But I've never been more certain of our victory.\nDamek is pretty excited to meet you, actually. You're going to help us win this war."
    char_ulric "说可怕都太轻了。但我从没像现在这样笃定我们会胜利。\n其实达梅克很期待见到你。你会帮我们打赢这场战争。"

# game/script.rpy:175088
translate chinese Ulric6_map015_58_0_f2073be5:

    # voice "se/y00474.ogg"
    voice "se/y00474.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:175090
translate chinese Ulric6_map015_58_0_300a93a8:

    # char_ulric "I'm fully aware of that. It'll take some training to get used to it.\nWhen we get to Mazeo, Damek will place you under a strict training regiment.\nYou need to get as much practice as possible before we launch our attack."
    char_ulric "我很清楚这一点。得经过一些训练才能适应。\n到了马泽奥，达梅克会让你接受严格的训练。\n在我们发动进攻之前，你需要尽可能多练习。"

# game/script.rpy:175107
translate chinese Ulric7_map015_58_0_33834cf5:

    # voice "se/y00475.ogg"
    voice "se/y00475.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:175109
translate chinese Ulric7_map015_58_0_411c3487:

    # char_ulric "Of course, and I'm glad you look at it that way.\nPractice makes perfect. We can't expect you to use it immediately.\nJust do your best to be careful. You know what that thing is capable of."
    char_ulric "当然，很高兴你能这么想。\n熟能生巧。我们不会指望你立刻就能用。\n尽力小心就好。你知道那东西有多大能耐。"

# game/script.rpy:175126
translate chinese Ulric7_map015_58_0_fb62f35b:

    # voice "se/y00476.ogg"
    voice "se/y00476.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:175128
translate chinese Ulric7_map015_58_0_8d37ff55:

    # char_ulric "I'll pass, thanks."
    char_ulric "我就不了，谢谢。"

# game/script.rpy:175145
translate chinese Ulric7_map015_58_0_0bcf92f9:

    # voice "se/y00477.ogg"
    voice "se/y00477.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:175148
translate chinese Ulric7_map015_58_0_a1138728:

    # char_ulric "Damek was able to use it, only for a brief second.\nAny longer than that, and he would've died.\nI think this one rests on your shoulders alone." nointeract
    char_ulric "达梅克能用它，但也只有短短一瞬。\n再多哪怕一会儿，他就会死。\n我觉得这件事只能落在你一个人肩上了。" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:175163
translate chinese Ulric7_map015_58_0_70050918:

    # voice "se/y00478.ogg"
    # char_ulric "And yet, here we are.\nLet's just go with the flow.\nNo use fighting what's set in stone."
    voice "se/y00478.ogg"
    char_ulric "可我们终究还是走到了这一步。\n就顺其自然吧。\n跟注定的事较劲也没用。"

# game/script.rpy:175181
translate chinese Ulric7_map015_58_0_f61f6155:

    # voice "se/y00479.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Good. Fighting your calling is never the right idea.\nJust embrace it, and let's do great things together.\nYou'll make it out of this as a hero, you know."
    voice "se/y00479.ogg"
    char_ulric "很好。抗拒自己的使命从来都不是明智之举。\n坦然接受它，让我们一起成就伟业。\n你知道，你会以英雄的身份走出这一切。"

# game/script.rpy:175209
translate chinese Ulric7_map015_58_0_82f9df1a:

    # voice "se/y00480.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Well, The Rebellion was formed around twenty years ago.\nSurvivors of The Occupation banded together, and sought justice.\nAdults trained orphaned children, to create the perfect soldiers."
    voice "se/y00480.ogg"
    char_ulric "反抗军大约是在二十年前成立的。\n占领的幸存者聚集到一起，寻求正义。\n成年人训练失去双亲的孩子，以打造完美的士兵。"

# game/script.rpy:175213
translate chinese Ulric7_map015_58_0_f2f25639:

    # voice "se/y00481.ogg"
    # char_ulric "A long time has passed, and now the children are old enough to fight.\nThat, and they've been perfectly trained. Almost their only purpose.\nDamek was one of these children. The previous leader raised him as his own."
    voice "se/y00481.ogg"
    char_ulric "很久过去了，如今那些孩子已经长大到可以战斗了。\n而且他们受过完美的训练。那几乎是他们唯一的用途。\n达梅克就是这些孩子中的一个。前任领袖把他当作亲生儿子养大。"

# game/script.rpy:175231
translate chinese Ulric8_map015_58_0_7919384c:

    # voice "se/y00482.ogg"
    voice "se/y00482.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:175233
translate chinese Ulric8_map015_58_0_1f4dfcf7:

    # char_ulric "Obviously I'm a little older. I wasn't a victim of The Occupation.\nWhen it happened, I was just arriving in Mazeo to sell my sword arm.\nI moved here from Alarinthia as soon as I had the chance."
    char_ulric "显然我年纪大一些。我不是占领的受害者。\n那件事发生时，我刚抵达马泽奥，准备当佣兵卖命。\n一有机会我就从阿拉林西亚搬到了这里。"

# game/script.rpy:175236
translate chinese Ulric8_map015_58_0_e94846ba:

    # voice "se/y00483.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Imagine wanting to get a new start, and arriving in the middle of a war zone.\nThat's pretty much what happened. So I did what anybody else would do...\nI joined the winning side — The Triumvirate — with the hopes of making money."
    voice "se/y00483.ogg"
    char_ulric "想象一下，你本想开始新生活，结果抵达的却是战区中央。\n差不多就是这样。于是我做了任何人都会做的事……\n我加入了赢的那一方——三人执政团——想着能赚点钱。"

# game/script.rpy:175240
translate chinese Ulric8_map015_58_0_50e0a7a4:

    # voice "se/y00484.ogg"
    # char_ulric "It was going well, but then I realized they were killing children.\nI turned on them as quickly as I joined them, fighting for Mazeo. \nI was one of the first rebels — got to watch Damek grow up first-hand." nointeract
    voice "se/y00484.ogg"
    char_ulric "一开始挺顺利，但后来我意识到他们在屠杀孩子。\n我背叛他们的速度和我加入他们一样快，转而替马泽奥而战。 \n我是最早的反抗者之一——亲眼看着达梅克长大。" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:175256
translate chinese Ulric8_map015_58_0_089e9467:

    # voice "se/y00485.ogg"
    # char_ulric "That's purely subjective, but I happen to think you're right.\nThe Triumvirate needs to be taken down, or held accountable for what they did.\nLeaders should never get a free pass to commit atrocities. Never."
    voice "se/y00485.ogg"
    char_ulric "这纯粹是主观看法，不过我恰好觉得你说得对。\n三人执政团必须被扳倒，或为他们的所作所为负责。\n领袖绝不该被免于为暴行负责。绝不。"

# game/script.rpy:175260
translate chinese Ulric8_map015_58_0_36bf5791:

    # voice "se/y00486.ogg"
    # char_ulric "I'm sure there's been insurrections in the past. There must've been.\nBut the thing about us — is that we have The Blade of Exodus. Our victory."
    voice "se/y00486.ogg"
    char_ulric "我相信过去一定有过起义。肯定有。\n但我们不同的一点——是我们拥有放逐之刃。我们的胜利。"

# game/script.rpy:175278
translate chinese Ulric8_map015_58_0_04a4d774:

    # voice "se/y00487.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Look, I realized the error of my ways, and did everything to make amends.\nWe can't say the same about The Triumvirate. They've chosen tyranny.\nYou can be mad at me all you want, but that's old news. A lifetime ago."
    voice "se/y00487.ogg"
    char_ulric "听着，我认识到了自己的错误，并竭尽全力弥补。\n三人执政团就不能这么说了。他们选择了暴政。\n你尽管生我的气，但那都是陈年旧事了。恍如隔世。"

# game/script.rpy:175296
translate chinese Ulric8_map015_58_0_e93b2edf:

    # voice "se/y00488.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Glad to know we think alike. Most people get upset when I tell them.\nThe most important thing, is that I'm a changed man. Our enemy is not.\nThey need to be held accountable. They've done horrible things."
    voice "se/y00488.ogg"
    char_ulric "很高兴我们想法一致。大多数听我说完都会生气。\n最重要的是，我已经洗心革面了。而我们的敌人没有。\n他们必须承担责任。他们做过骇人听闻的事。"

# game/script.rpy:175300
translate chinese Ulric8_map015_58_0_db8dcfee:

    # voice "se/y00489.ogg"
    # char_ulric "And what's worse — is that they don't see them as wrong.\nThat's why it falls upon our hands to take them down. \nWith that blade? We finally have the means to do it."
    voice "se/y00489.ogg"
    char_ulric "更糟的是——他们并不认为那些事是错的。\n所以我们才必须亲手扳倒他们。 \n有了那把剑？我们终于有了做到的手段。"

# game/script.rpy:175318
translate chinese Ulric8_map015_58_0_b2906daa:

    # voice "se/y00490.ogg"
    voice "se/y00490.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:175320
translate chinese Ulric8_map015_58_0_851ff4a6:

    # char_ulric "He's a good man. I've watched him grow into a capable soldier.\nHe always has this way of being happy, no matter the odds.\nEven if we lost almost every rebel, he'd find a way to keep us going."
    char_ulric "他是个好人。我看着他成长为一个能干的战士。\n无论处境如何，他总有办法保持快乐。\n就算我们几乎折损了所有反抗者，他也能找到办法让我们继续前进。"

# game/script.rpy:175323
translate chinese Ulric8_map015_58_0_d39c00b0:

    # voice "se/y00491.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Cracking a joke or two is always in his nature, even in grim circumstances.\nIt can lighten the mood, that's for sure. Nothing is worse than low morale.\nThat's probably what he's best at. Keeping the soldiers happy, and motivated." nointeract
    voice "se/y00491.ogg"
    char_ulric "即便在最严峻的时候，讲一两个笑话也总是他的天性。\n那确实能缓和气氛。没什么比士气低落更糟了。\n那大概是他最擅长的。让士兵们开心、有干劲。" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:175339
translate chinese Ulric8_map015_58_0_2ec9fe3b:

    # voice "se/y00492.ogg"
    # char_ulric "I feel the same way. I'm confident that he'll lead us to victory."
    voice "se/y00492.ogg"
    char_ulric "我也有同感。我确信他会带领我们走向胜利。"

# game/script.rpy:175357
translate chinese Ulric8_map015_58_0_85a76e53:

    # voice "se/y00493.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Yeah, but it works. The morale of our troops is proof of that.\nCold and calculated, but also personable and witty. He's really unique."
    voice "se/y00493.ogg"
    char_ulric "是啊，但确实有效。我们部队的士气就是证明。\n冷酷而精于算计，却又平易近人、风趣机智。他真的很特别。"

# game/script.rpy:175375
translate chinese Ulric8_map015_58_0_44b8b44e:

    # voice "se/y00494.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Tell that to him yourself. I'm sure he'll get a kick out of it.\nHe can lead any way he wants, as long as the army is happy and strong.\nIf you're worried about him getting cocky because of that blade? Don't."
    voice "se/y00494.ogg"
    char_ulric "你自己去跟他说吧。我相信他会很受用。\n只要军队快乐而强大，他想怎么领导都行。\n你担心他会因为那把剑变得自负？不用。"

# game/script.rpy:175389
translate chinese Ulric8_map015_58_0_3bea026a:

    # voice "se/y00495.ogg"
    # char_ulric "He's aware that The Blade of Exodus isn't a \"free victory\" card.\nThe way he approaches strategy is really something else.\nYou'll probably warm up to him. I know I did."
    voice "se/y00495.ogg"
    char_ulric "他清楚放逐之刃不是一张“免费的胜利”牌。\n他研究战略的方式确实非同一般。\n你大概会渐渐喜欢上他。反正我是。"

# game/script.rpy:175407
translate chinese Ulric8_map015_58_0_e476c21d:

    # voice "se/y00496.ogg"
    voice "se/y00496.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:175409
translate chinese Ulric8_map015_58_0_7c407c6f:

    # char_ulric "Absolutely. Everybody lost something special that day.\nFamilies were torn apart, many people lost the will to live.\nA lot of the children only wanted one thing — revenge."
    char_ulric "当然。那天每个人都失去了珍贵的东西。\n家庭被拆散，许多人失去了活下去的意志。\n很多孩子只想要一件事——复仇。"

# game/script.rpy:175412
translate chinese Ulric8_map015_58_0_795c8c1c:

    # voice "se/y00497.ogg"
    # char_ulric "And a lot of the adults {i}saw{/i} one thing — an army ripe for training.\nThey banded together, and The Rebellion slowly became what it is today.\nWe're finally strong enough to {i}do{/i} something; and that's special."
    voice "se/y00497.ogg"
    char_ulric "而许多成年人{i}看到{/i}的是一件事——一支等着被训练成型的军队。\n他们聚到一起，反抗军慢慢变成了今天的样子。\n我们终于强大到可以{i}有所作为{/i}了；这很了不起。"

# game/script.rpy:175430
translate chinese Ulric9_map015_58_0_454b91cd:

    # voice "se/y00498.ogg"
    voice "se/y00498.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:175432
translate chinese Ulric9_map015_58_0_1ada6193:

    # char_ulric "Really? That's news to me. What a bad day to be in Mazeo.\nI guess it makes sense, though. You look like you carry purpose.\nYou'll fit right in. I'm sure almost every rebel could relate."
    char_ulric "真的？这我倒不知道。那真是倒霉的日子，偏偏在马泽奥。\n不过我想这也说得通。你看起来像是身负使命的人。\n你会很融入的。我相信几乎每个反抗者都能感同身受。"

# game/script.rpy:175449
translate chinese Ulric9_map015_58_0_4f2636d5:

    # voice "se/y00499.ogg"
    voice "se/y00499.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:175451
translate chinese Ulric9_map015_58_0_cf83a334:

    # char_ulric "Yeah. The bulk of the victims were children who lost their parents.\nFast-forward some twenty-odd years, and they're grown men and women.\nNobody would send children to war. It was important to wait — and train."
    char_ulric "是啊。大部分受害者是失去父母的孩子。\n快进二十来年，他们已是成年的男女。\n没人会把孩子送上战场。重要的是等待——以及训练。"

# game/script.rpy:175468
translate chinese Ulric9_map015_58_0_d2fa57bc:

    # voice "se/y00500.ogg"
    voice "se/y00500.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:175471
translate chinese Ulric9_map015_58_0_1f3f399e:

    # char_ulric "What else were we supposed to do? It's not like we forced them.\nThey wanted to fight — to be trained — and we wanted an army.\nWe were able to achieve unity, and grow into the force we've become." nointeract
    char_ulric "我们还能怎么做？又不是我们强迫他们的。\n他们想战斗——想接受训练——而我们需要一支军队。\n我们得以团结一致，成长为如今这支部队。" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:175486
translate chinese Ulric9_map015_58_0_669ed3a9:

    # voice "se/y00501.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Yeah. Think about it for a moment. Without them, we'd stand no chance.\nSome people think their future was stolen, but if we win, we can get it back.\nNo occupations, no families being torn apart. That's the true purpose of it all."
    voice "se/y00501.ogg"
    char_ulric "是啊。你想想看。没有他们，我们毫无胜算。\n有些人觉得他们的未来被偷走了，但如果我们胜利，就能夺回来。\n没有占领，没有家庭被拆散。这才是这一切真正的目的。"

# game/script.rpy:175504
translate chinese Ulric9_map015_58_0_1d774f4d:

    # voice "se/y00502.ogg"
    # char_ulric "You don't have to. It's easy to get caught up in the present.\nWhen we win a beautiful future for everybody? That's when you'll see.\nThis is necessary. Their future isn't truly gone — we can take it back."
    voice "se/y00502.ogg"
    char_ulric "你不必明白。人很容易陷在当下。\n等我们为所有人赢得美好的未来时？那时你就会明白。\n这是必要的。他们的未来并非真的消失——我们能够夺回来。"

# game/script.rpy:175526
translate chinese Ulric9_map015_58_0_25eff893:

    # voice "se/y00503.ogg"
    voice "se/y00503.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:175529
translate chinese Ulric9_map015_58_0_214e4346:

    # char_ulric "Not really. But it's not numbers that we need. Just strategy.\nThe Triumvirate's Honor Guard is weak. One man could easily kill fifty.\nAnd with that blade on our side, they can't make any more. Just a matter of time." nointeract
    char_ulric "不太够。但我们需要不是数量，而是策略。\n三人执政团的荣誉卫队很弱。一个人就能轻松杀掉五十个。\n再加上那把剑站在我们这边，他们造不出更多了。只是时间问题。" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:175544
translate chinese Ulric9_map015_58_0_faafaa4d:

    # voice "se/y00504.ogg"
    # char_ulric "That's for sure. Without that blade, we'd never win.\nAs I've always said — we can't take them down with conventional means.\nThere's a lot resting on your shoulders. I hope you're up to the task."
    voice "se/y00504.ogg"
    char_ulric "那是当然。没有那把剑，我们绝不可能赢。\n我早就说过——我们没法用常规手段扳倒他们。\n有很多东西压在你肩上。希望你担得起。"

# game/script.rpy:175562
translate chinese Ulric9_map015_58_0_52d087a0:

    # voice "se/y00505.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Of course it can. If you don't believe that — you must be new to conflict.\nBattles are fought and won on the war table, far before any sword is drawn."
    voice "se/y00505.ogg"
    char_ulric "当然能。如果你不信——那你一定没经历过冲突。\n战役早在拔剑之前，就已经在作战桌上打完了。"

# game/script.rpy:175580
translate chinese Ulric9_map015_58_0_9e2bcc08:

    # voice "se/y00506.ogg"
    # char_ulric "That's not really true. If it were a losing battle, we'd have lost already.\nWe've come this far, and got that blade, precisely because it's {i}not{/i} a losing battle.\nScratch that thought from your mind. You'll come to see that victory is clear."
    voice "se/y00506.ogg"
    char_ulric "那倒未必。如果这是一场必败之战，我们早就输了。\n我们走到今天，拿到那把剑，正是因为它{i}不是{/i}必败之战。\n打消那个念头吧。你会看到胜利是明确的。"

# game/script.rpy:175594
translate chinese Ulric9_map015_58_0_db393b7a:

    # voice "se/y00507.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Once you master that blade, you'll tear through their very soul.\nMaybe bind them to a suit of armor. I've always been a sucker for irony."
    voice "se/y00507.ogg"
    char_ulric "等你掌握了那把剑，你会撕裂他们的灵魂。\n也许把他们束缚在一副盔甲里。我一直都偏爱这种讽刺。"

# game/script.rpy:175612
translate chinese Ulric9_map015_58_0_3478f797:

    # voice "se/y00508.ogg"
    voice "se/y00508.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:175614
translate chinese Ulric9_map015_58_0_76757ecf:

    # char_ulric "There's not much to say. He doubled as The Elder of Valinorth.\nYou probably already know everything there is to know. You worked with him.\nThe secrets he kept from you? Well, you've already been told."
    char_ulric "没什么好说的。他同时还兼任瓦利诺斯的长老。\n该知道的事你大概都已经知道了。你曾和他共事。\n他瞒着你的那些秘密？嗯，你都已经被告知了。"

# game/script.rpy:175617
translate chinese Ulric9_map015_58_0_6ea93e61:

    # voice "se/y00509.ogg"
    # char_ulric "He sacrificed himself to get {i}you{/i} that blade. Now he's gone.\nDamek buried him underground, in Mazeo's tunnels. Our new home.\nIn fact, you could see his grave if you wanted. Pay some respects."
    voice "se/y00509.ogg"
    char_ulric "他牺牲了自己，才让{i}你{/i}拿到那把剑。现在他走了。\n达梅克把他葬在地下，马泽奥的隧道里。我们的新家。\n其实，你想的话可以去看看他的墓。去表达些敬意。"

# game/script.rpy:175635
translate chinese Ulric10_map015_58_0_16b77b4e:

    # voice "se/y00510.ogg"
    voice "se/y00510.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:175637
translate chinese Ulric10_map015_58_0_63441f4b:

    # char_ulric "I doubt we will. He gave us a hand of winning cards.\nDamek is securing our HQ, and planning our final attack right now.\nWe'll sail to Balteus, and take them down for good."
    char_ulric "我怀疑我们不会。他给了我们一手必胜的牌。\n达梅克正在确保我们总部安全，此刻还在筹划最后一场进攻。\n我们将乘船前往巴尔泰乌斯，把他们彻底扳倒。"

# game/script.rpy:175654
translate chinese Ulric10_map015_58_0_3efaa6d6:

    # voice "se/y00511.ogg"
    voice "se/y00511.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:175656
translate chinese Ulric10_map015_58_0_a6dba1fd:

    # char_ulric "I heard that he was. He had a lot of stuff to deal with.\nFinding out about his Father's true role, {i}and{/i} leading Valinorth.\nI can't even begin to imagine what the inside of his head is like."
    char_ulric "我听说他是。他有很多事要应付。\n得知他父亲的真实身份，{i}还要{/i}领导瓦利诺斯。\n我都无法想象他脑子里是什么样子。"

# game/script.rpy:175673
translate chinese Ulric10_map015_58_0_476d651e:

    # voice "se/y00512.ogg"
    voice "se/y00512.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:175675
translate chinese Ulric10_map015_58_0_b1e839fe:

    # char_ulric "I guess it is. But I doubt Damek was thinking that far ahead.\nIt was just the most convenient place to bury his body.\nThose tunnels were being dug up — lots of tools lying around."
    char_ulric "我想是吧。但我不觉得达梅克想得那么远。\n那只是埋葬他遗体最方便的地方。\n那些隧道正在被挖掘——到处都扔着工具。"

# game/script.rpy:175702
translate chinese Ulric10_map015_58_0_db443f91:

    # voice "se/y00513.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Lots of pirates, and people who are after money, no matter what.\nDon't trust random people, and don't buy anything from a stranger.\nYou'd get swindled and robbed far before you found anyone genuine."
    voice "se/y00513.ogg"
    char_ulric "有很多海盗，还有很多为钱什么都干得出来的人。\n别随便相信人，也别从陌生人手里买东西。\n你还没遇到一个正经人，就先被坑被抢了。"

# game/script.rpy:175706
translate chinese Ulric10_map015_58_0_f1a60723:

    # voice "se/y00514.ogg"
    # char_ulric "The occupation didn't make things too much better. It's still dangerous.\nMazeo's spirit idol was also on its final days. Dim and defeated.\nAt least, that's what we thought — until very recently."
    voice "se/y00514.ogg"
    char_ulric "占领也没让情况好多少。那里依然危险。\n马泽奥的灵像也到了最后的日子。黯淡而衰败。\n至少我们一直是这么以为的——直到最近。"

# game/script.rpy:175726
translate chinese Ulric13_map015_58_0_5f23e88a:

    # voice "se/y00515.ogg"
    voice "se/y00515.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:175728
translate chinese Ulric13_map015_58_0_0ec0327a:

    # char_ulric "Well, there's a church in Mazeo. It's supposed to be for Triumvirate worship.\nAt the altar there, rests a very dim spirit idol. We assumed it was dying.\nBut it's not even the true spirit idol. The true one rests deep underground."
    char_ulric "嗯，马泽奥有座教堂。本该是用来供奉三人执政团的。\n那里的祭坛上摆着一尊非常黯淡的灵像。我们以为它快消亡了。\n但它根本不是真正的灵像。真正的那尊深埋在地下。"

# game/script.rpy:175741
translate chinese Ulric13_map015_58_0_83f4ce4e:

    # voice "se/y00516.ogg"
    # char_ulric "The one in the church was merely {i}receiving{/i} energy from the true idol.\nThat's why it was so dim. The source of power was far away.\nNobody knows about this except for The Rebellion. It's our secret."
    voice "se/y00516.ogg"
    char_ulric "教堂里的那尊只是在从真正的灵像{i}接收{/i}能量。\n所以才那么黯淡。力量的源头远在天边。\n除了反抗军，没人知道这件事。这是我们的秘密。"

# game/script.rpy:175755
translate chinese Ulric13_map015_58_0_320b648c:

    # voice "se/y00517.ogg"
    # char_ulric "We want to try tapping into it for power.\nIt's our only chance, too — since Alarinthia's idol was destroyed.\nAnd from what I've heard, Valinorth's died out a while back as well."
    voice "se/y00517.ogg"
    char_ulric "我们想试着从中汲取力量。\n这也是我们唯一的机会——因为阿拉林西亚的灵像已被摧毁。\n而且据我所知，瓦利诺斯的那尊不久前也消亡了。"

# game/script.rpy:175773
translate chinese Ulric12_map015_58_0_29cee875:

    # voice "se/y00518.ogg"
    voice "se/y00518.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:175775
translate chinese Ulric12_map015_58_0_681b6e69:

    # char_ulric "Is that so...? I suppose that's why you're so important.\nIts energy went into you — and now you can wield the blade.\nI hope you don't misuse this gift. I'll admit, I'm a bit intimidated."
    char_ulric "是吗……？我猜这就是你这么重要的原因。\n它的能量进入了你体内——现在你能驾驭那把剑了。\n希望你不要滥用这份恩赐。我承认，我有点忌惮。"

# game/script.rpy:175792
translate chinese Ulric12_map015_58_0_2a280d59:

    # voice "se/y00519.ogg"
    voice "se/y00519.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:175794
translate chinese Ulric12_map015_58_0_0449cb7a:

    # char_ulric "I'm not sure. It's one of Alarinthia's many legends.\nApparently, at the dawn of history, The Triumvirate destroyed it.\nThat's why Alarinthia grew into what it is today — an arid wasteland."
    char_ulric "我不确定。那是阿拉林西亚众多传说之一。\n据说在历史的黎明时期，三人执政团摧毁了它。\n这就是为什么阿拉林西亚变成了今天的样子——一片干旱的荒原。"

# game/script.rpy:175797
translate chinese Ulric12_map015_58_0_ac994b68:

    # voice "se/y00520.ogg"
    # char_ulric "If The Triumvirate did it, we have to wonder why.\nDo the spirit idols pose some threat to their rule...?\nThat's why Damek wants to try tapping into Mazeo's true idol."
    voice "se/y00520.ogg"
    char_ulric "如果是三人执政团干的，我们就得想想为什么。\n灵像是否对他们的统治构成了某种威胁……？\n这就是达梅克想尝试汲取马泽奥那尊真正灵像的力量的原因。"

# game/script.rpy:175815
translate chinese Ulric12_map015_58_0_c067cd8e:

    # voice "se/y00521.ogg"
    voice "se/y00521.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:175817
translate chinese Ulric12_map015_58_0_0c077945:

    # char_ulric "The Triumvirate suspected it. That's why they were digging in Mazeo.\nBut after twenty years, they found nothing. It was Damek who discovered it.\nWe decided to keep it secret. He's coming up with a plan for it right now."
    char_ulric "三人执政团怀疑过。所以他们才在马泽奥挖掘。\n但二十年后，他们什么也没找到。是达梅克发现了它。\n我们决定保密。他此刻正在为它制定计划。"

# game/script.rpy:175834
translate chinese Ulric12_map015_58_0_72fa3801:

    # voice "se/y00522.ogg"
    voice "se/y00522.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:175836
translate chinese Ulric12_map015_58_0_5ceeb915:

    # char_ulric "I suppose so — if The Triumvirate didn't destroy all the others.\nBut right now, the idol in Mazeo is the only one we know about.\nThat is, unless there's one in Balteus. But I doubt it."
    char_ulric "我想是的——要是三人执政团没有把其他的都毁掉的话。\n但目前，马泽奥的灵像是我们唯一知道的一尊。\n除非巴尔泰乌斯也有一尊。但我不觉得。"

# game/script.rpy:175839
translate chinese Ulric12_map015_58_0_aba8a35f:

    # voice "se/y00523.ogg"
    # char_ulric "I mean, The Triumvirate {i}could{/i} have one hidden there. Maybe.\nBut there's no way to know for sure. We should focus on what we {i}do{/i} know."
    voice "se/y00523.ogg"
    char_ulric "我是说，三人执政团{i}可能{/i}在那儿藏了一尊。也许吧。\n但没法确定。我们该专注于我们{i}确实{/i}知道的事。"

# game/script.rpy:175861
translate chinese Ulric12_map015_58_0_8813850f:

    # voice "se/y00524.ogg"
    voice "se/y00524.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:175863
translate chinese Ulric12_map015_58_0_94dc9bfa:

    # char_ulric "Yeah. The occupation didn't do much to help, no matter what anyone says.\nI think I'm qualified to speak on the matter. I mean, I've lived there forever.\nThere's still an active piracy network. Smuggling things from Mazeo to Alarinthia."
    char_ulric "是啊。不管别人怎么说，占领都没帮上什么忙。\n我觉得我有资格谈这件事。毕竟我在那儿住了那么久。\n那里还有活跃的海盗网络。从马泽奥往阿拉林西亚走私东西。"

# game/script.rpy:175880
translate chinese Ulric15_map015_58_0_8aa618dc:

    # voice "se/y00525.ogg"
    voice "se/y00525.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:175882
translate chinese Ulric15_map015_58_0_ac5cb89c:

    # char_ulric "Yeah. The elimination of piracy was just an excuse.\nI think they were searching for the spirit idol underneath Mazeo.\nBut what they wanted it for — and what they'd do with it — I have no idea."
    char_ulric "是啊。剿灭海盗只是个借口。\n我觉得他们在寻找马泽奥地下的灵像。\n但他们要它做什么——会拿它干什么——我毫无头绪。"

# game/script.rpy:175899
translate chinese Ulric15_map015_58_0_86d36094:

    # voice "se/y00526.ogg"
    voice "se/y00526.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:175901
translate chinese Ulric15_map015_58_0_c168261b:

    # char_ulric "Probably not. Not unless they had some reason to help us. A big one.\nA liberated Alestia would have no room for rampant piracy, right?\nThere'd be no reason to help a cause that hurts their livelihood."
    char_ulric "大概不会。除非他们有某种理由帮我们。而且是很重大的理由。\n一个获得解放的阿莱斯蒂亚不会容忍海盗横行，对吧？\n没理由去帮一个损害他们生计的事业。"

# game/script.rpy:175904
translate chinese Ulric15_map015_58_0_a0c3a829:

    # voice "se/y00527.ogg"
    # char_ulric "Right now, they're a wild card. Not on our side — but not against us, either.\nWe should use that to our advantage while we can. They might turn on us later."
    voice "se/y00527.ogg"
    char_ulric "眼下，他们是张未知牌。不站在我们这边——但也不与我们为敌。\n我们该趁还能利用时加以利用。他们以后可能会转过来对付我们。"

# game/script.rpy:175922
translate chinese Ulric15_map015_58_0_2cc6ea9c:

    # voice "se/y00528.ogg"
    voice "se/y00528.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:175924
translate chinese Ulric15_map015_58_0_023de7be:

    # char_ulric "I'll be by your side. Damek should be, as well. You'll be fine.\nWe know the lay of the land, and how to deal with people. Just follow our lead.\nBesides, most of our time will be in the Rebel HQ — it's safe there."
    char_ulric "我会在你身边。达梅克应该也会。你不会有事。\n我们熟悉那里的地形，也知道怎么和人打交道。跟着我们走就行。\n何况，我们大部分时间都会待在反抗军总部——那里很安全。"

# game/script.rpy:175941
translate chinese Ulric15_map015_58_0_33bbf47d:

    # voice "se/y00529.ogg"
    voice "se/y00529.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:175943
translate chinese Ulric15_map015_58_0_ae474bd4:

    # char_ulric "Alestia will be free. We won't have any restriction on trade.\nThat's a good thing, and a bad thing. The pirate will fight against it.\nWe could take down The Triumvirate, only to find ourselves against a pirate army."
    char_ulric "阿莱斯蒂亚将获得自由。贸易不会再有任何限制。\n这既是好事，也是坏事。海盗会反对它。\n我们可能扳倒了三人执政团，却发现自己要面对一支海盗大军。"

