    # char_ulric "I just don't agree with the way things are done over there.\nThe strongest tribe gets to rule the land. It's a constant power struggle.\nEither way, Alarinthia isn't my home. My {i}true{/i} home is Mazeo."
    char_ulric "我只是不认同那边的行事方式。\n最强的部落统治这片土地。永远都在争权夺势。\n不管怎样，阿拉林西亚不是我的家。我{i}真正{/i}的家是马泽奥。"

