    # voice "se/y00533.ogg"
    # char_ulric "I think of it different. If you don't like your family — find a new one.\nI've spilled enough blood to hold no blind allegiance to it."
    voice "se/y00533.ogg"
    char_ulric "我看法不同。如果你不喜欢你的家人——那就找个新的。\n我流的血已经够多，不会再去盲目效忠什么。"

