    # char_ulric "That's a very grim way of looking at things.\nWhen the flames go out, and the ash blows away - you can go back.\nIt still exists. It'll just be a {i}new{/i} Valinorth. Don't be pessimistic."
    char_ulric "你这看法太悲观了。\n等火焰熄灭，灰烬吹散——你就能回去。\n它依然存在。只是会变成一个{i}新的{/i}瓦利诺斯。别这么消极。"

# game/script.rpy:176064
