    # voice "se/y00535.ogg"
    # char_ulric "He recently rose through the ranks, and has given us tons of trouble.\nWhen The Triumvirate gets in our way — he's likely responsible.\nHe makes himself a lot more \"known\". Way different than the last Inquisitor."
    voice "se/y00535.ogg"
    char_ulric "他最近一路升迁，给我们添了不少麻烦。\n每当三人执政团挡我们的路——多半都是他搞的。\n他让自己“出名”得多。和上一任审判官很不一样。"

