translate chinese map023_78c2e838:

    # "When we enter Peregrino, we're greeted to an argument.{w}\nNormally I'd look around the tavern, but this seemed pretty heated.{w}\nThe barkeep, angry, seems to yell at an annoyed man in front of him."
    "我们走进佩雷格里诺时，迎面而来的是一场争吵。{w}\n平时我会四下看看酒馆，但这场争吵似乎相当激烈。{w}\n愤怒的酒保似乎在冲面前一个恼火的男人大喊。"

