# game/script.rpy:176637
translate chinese map023_35193a3d:

    # char_jit_map023_1_0_16 "Absolutely not! There's no way!\nTake that letter back to Damek in pieces!\nI'm not giving up my beloved Peregrino, Pro."
    char_jit_map023_1_0_16 "绝对不行！想都别想！\n把那封信撕成碎片还给达梅克！\n我不会放弃我心爱的佩雷格里诺，普洛。"

# game/script.rpy:176658
translate chinese map023_b54f0015:

    # "It would seem that he's talking to Pro. The man we came here to meet.{w}\nFor some reason, I find him extremely familiar. I can't pinpoint why."
    "看来他是在跟普洛说话。就是我们来这里要见的人。{w}\n不知为何，我觉得他异常眼熟。却说不清为什么。"

