# game/script.rpy:176813
translate chinese map023_8cf84b93:

    # "I decide to sit back and watch the events unfold.{w}\nAs heated as it seemed, I doubt it would escalate to violence.{w}\nAnd since I'm standing back — even if it did — I'd remain safe."
    "我决定退到一旁，看着事态发展。{w}\n尽管看起来火爆，但我怀疑不会升级成暴力。{w}\n而且既然我退在后面——就算真打起来——我也能安然无恙。"

