    # char_pro "It's for Valinorth's safety, you know!\nWith an army here, the village would be safe...\nFuture attacks could be stopped before they even start!"
    char_pro "这是为了瓦利诺斯的安全，你知道的！\n有一支军队在这儿，村子就能安全……\n未来的袭击可以在开始之前就被阻止！"

