    # char_jit_map023_1_0_16 "At the cost of my home, you mean!\nI refuse to do this — you can't make me!"
    char_jit_map023_1_0_16 "你是指拿我的家当代价！\n我拒绝这么做——你逼不了我！"

# game/script.rpy:177074
