    # char_pro "You're acting like a child, Airen!\nLike I said, you can still live here.\nIt just wouldn't be a tavern anymore."
    char_pro "你表现得像个孩子，艾琳！\n我说过了，你还可以住在这儿。\n只是它不再是酒馆了而已。"

# game/script.rpy:177101
