    # char_pro "That's exactly why we {i}can{/i} change our minds!\nAiren, stop being stubborn. Lives are at stake, here!\nLook me in the eyes and tell me your tavern is worth those lives!"
    char_pro "这正是我们{i}可以{/i}改变主意的原因！\n艾琳，别固执了。这里可是人命关天！\n看着我的眼睛，告诉我你的酒馆值得用那些人的命来换！"

# game/script.rpy:177155
