    # char_pro "Or do you not know the secret of Peregrino?"
    char_pro "还是说你不知道佩雷格里诺的秘密？"

# game/script.rpy:177254
translate chinese map023_0db6c1f9:

    # "The secret of Peregrino? What does he mean?{w}\nI look at Valessa and Fortaime, and they shrug.{w}\nHe must've recognized me from the blade on my back."
    "佩雷格里诺的秘密？他是什么意思？{w}\n我看向瓦莱莎和福泰姆，他们耸了耸肩。{w}\n他一定是从我背上的剑认出了我。"

# game/script.rpy:177284
translate chinese map023_88d1f658:

    # voice "se/z00528.ogg"
    voice "se/z00528.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:177286
translate chinese map023_63276a6f:

    # char_pro "Back when your Elder formed a treaty with Mazeo?\nWell, it's not like they trusted each other immediately.\nBoth sides were scared of walking into a trap."
    char_pro "当年你们的长老和马泽奥缔结条约的时候？\n嗯，他们也不是一上来就互相信任。\n双方都怕自己走进陷阱。"

# game/script.rpy:177299
translate chinese map023_828c9074:

    # voice "se/z00529.ogg"
    voice "se/z00529.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:177301
translate chinese map023_4aa0edc8:

    # char_pro "So what was the best thing to do? Meet each other halfway.\nThat's right. This place was built for secret Rebellion meetings.\nBut things are changing. Valinorth {i}deserves{/i} an army to protect it."
    char_pro "那最好的办法是什么？各让一步，折中会面。\n没错。这地方就是为了反抗军的秘密会议而建的。\n但情况在变。瓦利诺斯{i}理应{/i}有一支军队来保护它。"

# game/script.rpy:177322
translate chinese map023_58d61528:

    # "It seems like The Rebellion wants Valinorth to be resettled as well.{w}\nThat puts me at ease. I was worried they might throw it away like nothing.{w}\nAll the patrons look pretty happy here, but Valinorth {i}could{/i} benefit from an army."
    "看来反抗军也希望瓦利诺斯重新迁回。{w}\n这让我安心了些。我原本担心他们会把它轻易抛弃。{w}\n这里的顾客看起来都挺开心，但瓦利诺斯{i}确实{/i}能从一支军队中受益。"

# game/script.rpy:177324
translate chinese map023_40bde7e9:

    # "I think about the \"secret\" he just told me. It sort of makes sense.{w}\nA tavern in the middle of the forest isn't the best place to run a business.{w}\nDamek must be lining Airen's pockets to serve The Rebellion's needs."
    "我琢磨着他刚告诉我的那个“秘密”。这倒说得通。{w}\n开在森林正中的酒馆可不是做生意的理想地点。{w}\n达梅克一定在往艾琳口袋里塞钱，好让这里满足反抗军的需求。"

# game/script.rpy:177351
translate chinese map023_64eb2da1:

    # voice "se/z00530.ogg"
    voice "se/z00530.ogg"

