    # char_jit_map023_1_0_16 "Don't tell me you're considering this, [firstname]."
    char_jit_map023_1_0_16 "别告诉我你在考虑这件事，[firstname]。"

# game/script.rpy:177381
translate chinese map023_8f6d25f4:

    # "Talk about putting me on the spot. I hope this isn't a frequent event.{w}\nI don't feel like this is my choice, but due to current circumstances — it is.{w}\nMylus resigned as The Elder, leaving me in charge until I elect a replacement."
    "真是把我架到火上烤。希望这不是常有的事。{w}\n我不觉得这是该由我做的选择，但眼下的情况——确实如此。{w}\n迈勒斯辞去了长老之位，在我选出继任者之前，由我掌管。"

# game/script.rpy:177383
translate chinese map023_840c5f86:

    # "That reminds me. I'd still have to choose between Valessa and Fortaime.{w}\nHowever, it's probably best to take things one step at a time. First — Peregrino.{w}\nI strike a pose that implies I'm in deep thought, but truly, I'm at a loss for words."
    "这倒提醒了我。我还得在瓦莱莎和福泰姆之间做选择。{w}\n不过，最好还是一步一步来。首先——佩雷格里诺。{w}\n我摆出一副深思熟虑的样子，但其实，我是不知道该说什么。"

# game/script.rpy:177413
translate chinese map023_f34a7d8a:

    # voice "se/z00532.ogg"
    voice "se/z00532.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:177415
translate chinese map023_2300d886:

    # char_pro "Think about it logically for a second.\nIf this was a barracks, Valinorth would be safe.\nWe'd fight off The Triumvirate forces {i}for{/i} you."
    char_pro "从逻辑上想一想。\n如果这里是兵营，瓦利诺斯就会安全。\n我们会{i}替{/i}你们击退三人执政团的军队。"

# game/script.rpy:177428
translate chinese map023_e3910eb9:

    # voice "se/z00533.ogg"
    voice "se/z00533.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:177430
