    # char_pro "It may be too late now, but we can plan for the future.\nDamek is {i}requesting{/i} this of Airen, but you can {i}order{/i} it.\nHe'll be expecting answers as soon as we arrive in Mazeo."
    char_pro "现在或许已经太迟，但我们可以为将来打算。\n达梅克是在向艾琳{i}请求{/i}，但你{i}可以下令{/i}。\n我们一到马泽奥，他就会等着要个答复。"

# game/script.rpy:177451
