    # voice "se/z00536.ogg"
    voice "se/z00536.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:177506
translate chinese map023_234fb98b:

    # char_ulric "We have a lot to do. We can't waste time over stupid fights.\nHelp them resolve this, so we can talk about {i}important{/i} stuff."
    char_ulric "我们有很多事要做。不能把时间浪费在无聊的争吵上。\n帮他们解决这事，这样我们才能谈{i}重要的{/i}事。"

# game/script.rpy:177527
translate chinese map023_44ce3faf:

    # "This is all happening so quickly, I can't even find the time to think.{w}\nIt feels surreal, almost like I'm in a dream, or a vision. But it's real.{w}\nAny attempt at collecting my thoughts goes on to be promptly interrupted."
    "这一切发生得太快，我连思考的时间都没有。{w}\n感觉很不真实，几乎像置身梦中，或是幻象里。但它是真的。{w}\n每次我试图整理思绪，都会立刻被打断。"

# game/script.rpy:177557
translate chinese map023_5bb906de:

    # voice "se/z00537.ogg"
    voice "se/z00537.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:177559
translate chinese map023_339457a6:

    # char_jit_map023_1_0_16 "There's no reason to turn this into a barracks, though!\nIf you win this war, Alestia will be safe and peaceful.\nDamek is being hasty — he's not thinking straight."
    char_jit_map023_1_0_16 "可是没理由把它变成兵营啊！\n如果你们赢了这场战争，阿莱斯蒂亚就会安全和平。\n达梅克太仓促了——他头脑不清醒。"

# game/script.rpy:177573
translate chinese map023_77437209:

    # voice "se/z00538.ogg"
    voice "se/z00538.ogg"

