    char_jit_map023_1_0_16 "[firstname]，我求你了。 \n别把我的家夺走。"

# game/script.rpy:177613
translate chinese map023_a07b2803:

    # "Everyone stares at me, expecting me to make a decision.{w}\nTheir watchful gaze fills me with anxiety, and I tense up.{w}\nMaybe I should ask for advice before making a decision."
    "所有人都盯着我，等着我做决定。{w}\n他们注视的目光让我焦虑，身体也绷紧了。{w}\n也许在决定之前，我该先征求些建议。"

# game/script.rpy:177648
translate chinese TheChoice_map023_1_0_5568b24b:

    # voice "se/z00540.ogg"
    voice "se/z00540.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:177650
translate chinese TheChoice_map023_1_0_3c1a249b:

    # char_ulric "Look, I already told you to hurry up.\nThere's no downside to placing an army here.\nAiren is just being whiny, and resistant to change."
    char_ulric "听着，我已经跟你说过快点。\n在这里驻扎军队没有任何坏处。\n艾琳只是在无理取闹，抗拒改变。"

# game/script.rpy:177663
translate chinese TheChoice_map023_1_0_b18b994d:

    # voice "se/z00541.ogg"
    voice "se/z00541.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:177665
translate chinese TheChoice_map023_1_0_888088b8:

    # char_ulric "You have the chance to prove yourself as a capable leader.\nDon't cave under his demands and give him what he wants.\nAn effective leader does what's best for {i}everybody{/i}."
    char_ulric "你有机会证明自己是个能干的领袖。\n别在他的要求下屈服，别给他想要的。\n一个称职的领袖做的是对{i}所有人{/i}最好的事。"

# game/script.rpy:177678
translate chinese TheChoice_map023_1_0_93f4c3d3:

    # voice "se/z00542.ogg"
    voice "se/z00542.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:177680
translate chinese TheChoice_map023_1_0_5c3a9bfb:

    # char_ulric "Think about Alestia when you make a choice, not Airen.\nThat advice will help you every time you need to make a decision.\nCatering to individual people is a great way to garner hate."
    char_ulric "做选择时要想着阿莱斯蒂亚，而不是艾琳。\n这条建议在你每次需要做决定时都会有用。\n一味迎合个别人，是招来怨恨的好办法。"

# game/script.rpy:177725
translate chinese TheChoice_map023_1_0_62fbfa6f:

    # voice "se/z00543.ogg"
    voice "se/z00543.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:177727
translate chinese TheChoice_map023_1_0_6823cbb4:

    # char_valessa "Whoa, you actually want my input on this?\nI guess it {i}is{/i} my duty to assist you, but I'm surprised.\nI'm only supposed to guide you when it comes to visions."
    char_valessa "哇，你真的想听我的意见？\n我想{i}确实{/i}有责任协助你，但我很意外。\n我本该只在幻象的事上指引你。"

# game/script.rpy:177740
translate chinese TheChoice_map023_1_0_b43af9fb:

    # voice "se/z00544.ogg"
    voice "se/z00544.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:177742
translate chinese TheChoice_map023_1_0_b0e1cb10:

    # char_valessa "If I had to choose, I'd keep this place the way it is.\nAfter the war, Valinorth, and the rest of the world, will be safe.\nWhy would we train an army {i}after{/i} we've taken down The Triumvirate?"
    char_valessa "如果非让我选，我会让这地方保持原样。\n战争结束后，瓦利诺斯，甚至整个世界，都会安全。\n我们何必在扳倒三人执政团{i}之后{/i}还训练一支军队？"

# game/script.rpy:177745
translate chinese TheChoice_map023_1_0_051aad0b:

    # voice "se/z00545.ogg"
    # char_valessa "If I were The Elder, I'd commit myself to maintaining our independence.\nThat means living outside of conflict, like we've been doing for millennia.\nSiding with The Rebellion, and putting an army here, will tie us to future wars."
    voice "se/z00545.ogg"
    char_valessa "如果我是长老，我会致力于维持我们的独立。\n那意味着置身冲突之外，就像我们几千年来一直做的那样。\n站在反抗军这边，在这里驻扎军队，会把我们卷进未来的战争。"

# game/script.rpy:177759
translate chinese TheChoice_map023_1_0_5b38e97b:

    # voice "se/z00546.ogg"
    voice "se/z00546.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:177761
translate chinese TheChoice_map023_1_0_6678bcf8:

    # char_valessa "Until today, even {i}you{/i} were raised in an independent Valinorth.\nI can understand a temporary alliance, but we should go back to normal.\nI honestly think it's kind of an insulting idea. We can take care of ourselves."
    char_valessa "直到今天，连{i}你{/i}都是在独立的瓦利诺斯长大的。\n我能理解暂时的结盟，但之后我们该回归常态。\n说真的，我觉得这想法有点侮辱人。我们能照顾好自己。"

# game/script.rpy:177806
translate chinese TheChoice_map023_1_0_55efecc6:

    # voice "se/z00547.ogg"
    voice "se/z00547.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:177808
translate chinese TheChoice_map023_1_0_28efaff5:

    # char_fortaime "It's an interesting situation, to say the least.\nBut that doesn't mean the right decision is hard to make.\nWe should ally with The Rebellion, and place an army here."
    char_fortaime "这局面至少可以说很有意思。\n但这不代表正确的决定难做。\n我们该与反抗军结盟，并在这里驻扎军队。"

# game/script.rpy:177821
translate chinese TheChoice_map023_1_0_6e6ed307:

    # voice "se/z00548.ogg"
    voice "se/z00548.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:177823
translate chinese TheChoice_map023_1_0_773fd265:

    # char_fortaime "If our Elder had done that, then Valinorth would be fine.\nIn my opinion, we need to work toward a united Alestia.\nThat would've saved us this time. It can save us in the future."
    char_fortaime "如果我们的长老当初这么做了，瓦利诺斯就会安然无恙。\n在我看来，我们该朝着统一阿莱斯蒂亚的方向努力。\n那样这次就能救我们。将来也能。"

# game/script.rpy:177836
translate chinese TheChoice_map023_1_0_940ea0ec:

    # voice "se/z00549.ogg"
    voice "se/z00549.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:177838
translate chinese TheChoice_map023_1_0_52dc1477:

    # char_fortaime "Either way, I know you also need to choose a new Elder.\nIf you already have someone in mind, then try to cater to {i}them{/i}.\nIt's important that they're left with a nation they'll be proud to lead."
    char_fortaime "不管怎样，我知道你还需要选一位新长老。\n如果你心里已经有人选，那就尽量照顾{i}他{/i}的想法。\n重要的是，留给他们的国家要让他们引以为傲。"

# game/script.rpy:177876
translate chinese TheChoice_map023_1_0_03fd75e1:

    # "I couldn't leave Valinorth defenseless in the future.{w}\nI had to do everything I could to prevent future attacks.{w}\nMy first order as acting Elder was to militarize Peregrino."
    "我不能让瓦利诺斯将来毫无防备。{w}\n我必须竭尽所能防止未来的袭击。{w}\n作为代理长老，我的第一道命令就是把佩雷格里诺军事化。"

# game/script.rpy:177907
translate chinese TheChoice_map023_1_0_f9115233:

    # voice "se/z00550.ogg"
    voice "se/z00550.ogg"

