    # char_jit_map023_1_0_16 "Hmph — I thought you'd be smarter, [firstname].\nStealing people's homes? No better than The Triumvirate.\nI hope you understand what kind of image this gives off."
    char_jit_map023_1_0_16 "哼——我还以为你会更聪明些，[firstname]。\n抢夺别人的家？和三人执政团没什么两样。\n希望你能明白这会给人什么印象。"

# game/script.rpy:177920
