    # voice "se/z00552.ogg"
    voice "se/z00552.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:177922
translate chinese TheChoice_map023_1_0_4faa1f5d:

    # char_jit_map023_1_0_16 "I'm not going to argue with you, out of respect.\nValinorth has been my home for ages, and I love the people.\nLook like we're {i}both{/i} losing our homes with no say in the matter."
    char_jit_map023_1_0_16 "出于尊重，我不会跟你争。\n瓦利诺斯长久以来都是我的家，我爱这里的人。\n看来我们{i}俩{/i}都要在这件事上毫无发言权地失去自己的家了。"

# game/script.rpy:177948
translate chinese TheChoice_map023_1_0_9332392b:

    # "He crosses his arms and walks off, ensuring I feel guilty.{w}\nWas that really it...? Was my word considered law?{w}\nI don't think I've fully grasped the extent of my power yet."
    "他抱起双臂走开了，让我不禁心生愧疚。{w}\n就这样结束了……？我的话被当作法律了吗？{w}\n我觉得自己还没完全领会我权力的分量。"

# game/script.rpy:177950
translate chinese TheChoice_map023_1_0_8eece839:

    # "Airen's immediate surrender implies that he was bluffing earlier.{w}\nOr at the very least — he was all talk — trying to intimidate Pro.{w}\nSpeaking of Pro, he turns to me, and gives me a wide smile."
    "艾琳立刻屈服，说明他之前只是在虚张声势。{w}\n或者至少——他只是嘴上强硬——想吓唬普洛。{w}\n说到普洛，他转向我，绽开一个大大的笑容。"

# game/script.rpy:177972
translate chinese TheChoice_map023_1_0_b9afc6e7:

    # "I couldn't steal Airen's home from him. It was wrong.{w}\nWe'd have to find other ways to keep Valinorth safe.{w}\nForcefully seizing property would give off a bad image."
    "我不能把艾琳的家夺走。那是错的。{w}\n我们得另想办法保护瓦利诺斯。{w}\n强行没收财产会给人留下坏印象。"

# game/script.rpy:177974
translate chinese TheChoice_map023_1_0_e5c1013d:

    # "We're above that. We're not like The Triumvirate."
    "我们不屑于那种做法。我们不像三人执政团。"

# game/script.rpy:178004
translate chinese TheChoice_map023_1_0_f1727f63:

    # voice "se/z00553.ogg"
    voice "se/z00553.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:178006
translate chinese TheChoice_map023_1_0_24a2bbe7:

    # char_pro "Are you serious!? Come on!\nYou can't just leave your village defenseless..."
    char_pro "你是认真的吗！？拜托！\n你不能就这样让你的村子毫无防备……"

# game/script.rpy:178032
translate chinese TheChoice_map023_1_0_ce8b7686:

    # voice "se/z00554.ogg"
    voice "se/z00554.ogg"

