    # char_jit_map023_1_0_16 "Now now, Pro. You're the one that brought him into this.\nWe need to take his word as law — that's how it works.\nThank you so much, [firstname]. This calls for a celebration!"
    char_jit_map023_1_0_16 "好了好了，普洛。是你把他牵扯进来的。\n我们得把他的决定当作法律——规矩就是这样。\n太感谢你了，[firstname]。这值得庆祝一下！"

# game/script.rpy:178039
translate chinese TheChoice_map023_1_0_bc0ce3ac:

    # voice "se/z00555.ogg"
    voice "se/z00555.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:178041
translate chinese TheChoice_map023_1_0_b02bb859:

    # char_jit_map023_1_0_16 "Now now, Pro. You're the one that brought her into this.\nWe need to take her word as law — that's how it works.\nThank you so much, [firstname]. This calls for a celebration!"
    char_jit_map023_1_0_16 "好了好了，普洛。是你把她牵扯进来的。\n我们得把她的决定当作法律——规矩就是这样。\n太感谢你了，[firstname]。这值得庆祝一下！"

# game/script.rpy:178067
translate chinese TheChoice_map023_1_0_dea07b2f:

    # "Airen runs off and starts to prepare some drinks.{w}\nPro crosses his arms and looks at me with a scowl."
    "艾琳跑开去准备酒水了。{w}\n普洛抱起双臂，皱着眉看着我。"

# game/script.rpy:178101
translate chinese TheChoice_map023_1_0_b7167722:

    # voice "se/z00556.ogg"
    voice "se/z00556.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:178103
translate chinese TheChoice_map023_1_0_4c54428c:

    # char_pro "Thank you {i}so{/i} much!\nWithout you, that would've gone on forever.\nUlric was right. We have other things to tend to."
    char_pro "真是{i}太{/i}感谢你了！\n没有你，那事会没完没了。\n乌尔里克说得对。我们还有别的事要处理。"

# game/script.rpy:178129
translate chinese TheChoice_map023_1_0_7f06b4c8:

    # "He walks over to a nearby table, high-fiving Ulric along the way.{w}\nThe large man looks at me, and nods, signalling his approval.{w}\nBut after that, he walks toward the table as well. Time for a meeting?"
    "他走向附近的一张桌子，路上和乌尔里克击了个掌。{w}\n那个大个子看着我，点了点头，表示赞许。{w}\n但之后，他也朝那张桌子走去。是要开会了吗？"

# game/script.rpy:178155
translate chinese TheChoice_map023_1_0_4bb82dfe:

    # voice "se/z00557.ogg"
    voice "se/z00557.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:178157
translate chinese TheChoice_map023_1_0_66a198d9:

    # char_pro "Just met and you're already a thorn in my side.\nOh well. I just hope you don't come to regret that choice.\nIf you don't, then expect future generations to {i}hate{/i} you."
    char_pro "才刚认识，你就已经成了我的眼中钉。\n算了。我只希望你别为那个选择后悔。\n要是不后悔，那就等着后代{i}恨{/i}你吧。"

# game/script.rpy:178160
translate chinese TheChoice_map023_1_0_50ac5cd7:

    # voice "se/z00558.ogg"
    # char_pro "Oh well. I guess I should look on the bright side of things.\nAt least they can have a drink while their village burns down again."
    voice "se/z00558.ogg"
    char_pro "算了。我想我该往好处看。\n至少他们村子再次烧起来的时候，还能喝上一杯。"

# game/script.rpy:178187
translate chinese TheChoice_map023_1_0_321b0008:

    # "His sarcasm was noted, and his joke was far too soon.{w}\nHe shrugs at Ulric as he walks to a nearby table and sits down.{w}\nA few moments later, Ulric follows suit. Was it time for a meeting?"
    "他的讽刺我记下了，而那玩笑开得太不是时候。{w}\n他冲乌尔里克耸耸肩，走到附近一张桌子旁坐下。{w}\n片刻之后，乌尔里克也跟着坐了过去。是要开会了吗？"

# game/script.rpy:178194
translate chinese TheChoice_map023_1_0_21bbc629:

    # "I wave to Valessa and Fortaime as I walk over to the table.{w}\nA few moments later, we're all seated together, exchanging glances.{w}\nWe wait for someone to break the silence, unsure of what will happen next."
    "我朝瓦莱莎和福泰姆挥了挥手，然后走向那张桌子。{w}\n片刻之后，我们都坐到了一起，互相交换着眼神。{w}\n我们等着有人打破沉默，不知道接下来会发生什么。"

