translate chinese Pro1_map016_16_0_5109c018:

    # voice "se/y00541.ogg"
    # char_pro "I joined shortly after the occupation. The previous leader recruited me.\nIt seems that children with revenge on their minds was in both high demand {i}and{/i} supply.\nI grew up with Damek, and a bunch of other kids our age. They trained us all in war."
    voice "se/y00541.ogg"
    char_pro "我是在占领开始后不久加入的。上一任领袖招募了我。\n看来怀着复仇之心的孩子，既需求旺盛，{i}又{/i}供应充足。\n我和达梅克，还有一群同龄的孩子一起长大。他们把我们全都训练成了战士。"

# game/script.rpy:181092
translate chinese Pro1_map016_16_0_4cd77f73:

    # voice "se/y00542.ogg"
    # char_pro "Ulric joined a little bit later. He's older, and was already trained.\nAs you could've guessed, I lost my family during the occupation. A common tale as of late.\nBut we're finally ready to take on The Triumvirate. We'll take back the future they stole."
    voice "se/y00542.ogg"
    char_pro "乌尔里克稍晚一些加入。他年纪更大，而且早就受过训练。\n你可能已经猜到了，我在占领期间失去了家人。近来这种事很常见。\n但我们终于准备好迎战三人执政团了。我们要夺回被他们偷走的未来。"

# game/script.rpy:181110
