    # char_pro "He's a really nice guy, and we've shared a lot of the same struggles.\nThere's no one else I'd rather march into battle with. I mean it.\nHis tactics, his strategy — it's really something else."
    char_pro "他是个很好的人，我们经历过许多相同的磨难。\n要说并肩作战，我最想跟的就是他。我是认真的。\n他的战术，他的谋略——真的非同凡响。"

# game/script.rpy:181115
translate chinese Pro11_map016_16_0_6f0710ee:

    # voice "se/y00543.ogg"
