    # char_pro "Yeah, and the transition between leaders was pretty seamless.\nHe was close to our previous leader, so he picked up on a lot of stuff.\nIt's almost like he was being trained from the start to take over."
    char_pro "是啊，而且两位领袖之间的交接相当顺畅。\n他和我们上一任领袖关系很近，所以学到了很多东西。\n简直就像他从一开始就被培养着要接班。"

