translate chinese Pro2_map016_16_0_07455b39:

    # char_pro "He's been obsessed with these underground tunnels, lately.\nHe wants our headquarters to be hidden, and well guarded.\nI think he's trying to strike a deal with the Mayor of Mazeo."
    char_pro "他最近迷上了那些地下隧道。\n他想让我们的总部既隐蔽又守备森严。\n我觉得他是想和马泽奥的市长谈笔交易。"

# game/script.rpy:181176
translate chinese Pro2_map016_16_0_13dca331:

    # voice "se/y00547.ogg"
    # char_pro "That means the Mayor is defecting from The Triumvirate. That's good.\nWe have a huge advantage as long as that secret isn't leaked.\nBut there's something else he's been talking about as well."
    voice "se/y00547.ogg"
    char_pro "也就是说市长要叛离三人执政团了。这是好事。\n只要这个秘密不泄露，我们就握有巨大的优势。\n但他还谈起过另一件事。"

# game/script.rpy:181180
translate chinese Pro2_map016_16_0_7f1340d3:

    # voice "se/y00548.ogg"
    # char_pro "In the same tunnels he wants to claim, he discovered a spirit idol.\nA massive one, flowing with unfathomable amounts of energy.\nI think he wants to tap into it with that blade, and use that power."
    voice "se/y00548.ogg"
    char_pro "在他想占据的那批隧道里，他发现了一尊灵像。\n一尊巨大的灵像，涌动着难以估量的能量。\n我觉得他想用那把剑与之共鸣，借取那份力量。"

# game/script.rpy:181184
translate chinese Pro2_map016_16_0_cd8dcd54:

    # voice "se/y00549.ogg"
    # char_pro "You're living proof that idols can empower people, right?\nIf we could do that to our army? We'd be almost unstoppable."
    voice "se/y00549.ogg"
    char_pro "你就是灵像能赋予人力量的活证据，对吧？\n如果我们能对我们的军队这么做呢？那我们几乎就无可阻挡了。"

# game/script.rpy:181202
translate chinese Pro2_map016_16_0_5870d43b:

    # voice "se/y00550.ogg"
    voice "se/y00550.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:181204
translate chinese Pro2_map016_16_0_a0f0137b:

    # char_pro "With the right strategy, and that special blade? Of course.\nI'm just glad that Damek is the best strategist I've ever seen.\nThen there's you. I'm not so sure about you, yet."
    char_pro "有正确的战略，再加上那把特殊的剑？当然。\n我只是庆幸达梅克是我见过最出色的战略家。\n然后就是你。对你我还没那么有把握。"

# game/script.rpy:181207
translate chinese Pro2_map016_16_0_3b382e00:

    # voice "se/y00551.ogg"
    # char_pro "With the right training, I think you'll be fine.\nSo that's what we'll do when we get to Mazeo. Train.\nAnd no complaining about the hours. The fate of Alestia is at stake."
    voice "se/y00551.ogg"
    char_pro "只要训练得当，我想你会没事的。\n所以到了马泽奥我们就这么办。训练。\n还有，别抱怨训练时间长。阿莱斯蒂亚的命运危在旦夕。"

