# game/script.rpy:182703
translate chinese map024_d660aa8e:

    # "I make my way toward one of the private rooms. It's time to get some rest.{w}\nIt's been a long day,and the subsequent days show no signs of changing pace.{w}\nThis new life would simply be the nature of things. Everything was different."
    "我朝其中一间包房走去。该休息了。{w}\n今天真是漫长的一天，而接下来的日子也没有放缓的迹象。{w}\n这种新生活大概就是往后的常态了。一切都变了。"

# game/script.rpy:182705
translate chinese map024_e584133b:

    # "I let that settle in for a while. It'd be almost impossible to sleep as things stood.{w}\nAll of our lives were flipped around in an instant. Not only that, but put in danger, too.{w}\nThere's no guarantee that any of us would survive this; and we didn't have a choice but to fight."
    "我让这个念头在心里沉淀了一会儿。就现状而言，几乎不可能睡得着。{w}\n我们所有人的生活都在一瞬间被彻底翻转。不仅如此，还被置于危险之中。{w}\n没人能保证我们谁都能活下来；而我们除了战斗别无选择。"

# game/script.rpy:182707
translate chinese map024_cda0d337:

    # "At least I didn't. Regardless of my feelings, I couldn't turn my back on Alestia.{w}\nIf I did that — I'd be saying my own life was more important than our entire world.{w}\nNo matter how hard I tried, there's no way I could convince myself that was true."
    "至少我没有选择。不管我心里怎么想，我都无法背弃阿莱斯蒂亚。{w}\n如果我那样做——就等于在说我的命比整个世界更重要。{w}\n无论怎么努力，我都没法说服自己那是真的。"

# game/script.rpy:182709
translate chinese map024_d0cc870f:

    # "I sit on the edge of the bed, and let out a loud sigh as I lay back."
    "我坐在床边，躺下时长长地叹了口气。"

# game/script.rpy:182715
translate chinese map024_83f6ac5e:

    # "I don't get much rest before I'm shaken wide awake.{w}\nThe door to my room slowly opens. It's Valessa and Fortaime.{w}\nIt seems they've disregarded both my privacy {i}and{/i} desire to sleep."
    "我没休息多久就被人摇得彻底清醒。{w}\n房门缓缓打开。是瓦莱莎和福泰姆。{w}\n看来他们既无视了我的隐私，{i}也{/i}无视了我想睡觉的愿望。"

# game/script.rpy:182733
