    # "I rub the fatigue out of my eyes and stare at them for a few moments.{w}\nIt seemed that lately, people had a tendency of putting me on the spot.{w}\nTheir intentions were pure, however. To stop me from being overwhelmed."
    "我揉了揉疲惫的眼睛，盯着他们看了一会儿。{w}\n最近似乎人人都倾向于把我推到风口浪尖。{w}\n不过他们的用意是好的。是为了不让我被压垮。"

# game/script.rpy:183048
translate chinese map024_129f4599:

    # "Any effort to alleviate the pressure shouldn't go unnoticed.{w}\nI cross my arms and continue to stare at them. They look concerned.{w}\nThis is almost like an \"intervention\". I doubt they'll leave without results."
    "任何缓解压力的努力都不该被忽视。{w}\n我抱起双臂，继续盯着他们。他们看起来有些担忧。{w}\n这几乎像是一场“劝诫会”。我怀疑他们不达目的是不会走的。"

