# game/script.rpy:184003
translate chinese Choices_map024_1_0_0089cc28:

    # "He winks at me, and starts walking toward the door.{w}\nBut like Valessa did a moment earlier, he hesitates.{w}\nDid he have something important to say before he left?"
    "他冲我眨了眨眼，朝门口走去。{w}\n但就像刚才瓦莱莎那样，他犹豫了。{w}\n他是在离开前有什么重要的话要说吗？"

