    char_fortaime "嘿，呃，其实我一直想问你……\n你觉得我今晚能睡在你房间吗？\n一直在说袭击啊之类的事——把我吓着了。"

# game/script.rpy:184038
translate chinese Choices_map024_1_0_673a43cc:

    # voice "se/z00646.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "I mean, I'd feel a little safer with friends nearby.\nI can sleep on the floor if you don't want me to bother you.\nYou won't even know I'm here, I can promise you that." nointeract
