    char_fortaime "我是说，有朋友在身边我会觉得安全一点。\n如果你不想我打扰你，我可以睡地上。\n我保证，你甚至不会察觉我在这儿。" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:184055
translate chinese Choices_map024_1_0_2316b29f:

    # voice "se/z00647.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "Thanks! I was really hoping you'd say that.\nI won't make a sound, I promise!"
    voice "se/z00647.ogg"
    char_fortaime "谢谢！我真希望你会答应。\n我保证，一点声音都不会出！"

# game/script.rpy:184082
translate chinese Choices_map024_1_0_09453dd7:

    # "He quickly grabs a sheet and curls up on the floor.{w}\nI decide to leave him be, and return to my bed.{w}\nI'm so tired, I practically collapse on it."
    "他迅速抓了条床单，蜷在地板上。{w}\n我决定不去管他，回到自己床上。{w}\n我太累了，几乎是瘫倒上去的。"

# game/script.rpy:184102
