    # voice "se/z00648.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "Whoa, are you serious? Thanks!\nI didn't want to ask in case you weren't comfortable.\nBut I can't turn down the comfort of a warm bed."
    voice "se/z00648.ogg"
    char_fortaime "哇，你是认真的吗？谢谢！\n我之前不敢问，怕你会不自在。\n但我没法拒绝一张暖床的舒适。"

# game/script.rpy:184129
