    char_fortaime "哦，我明白。我不是想太冒昧。\n我想我一个人也没问题。也许我去找乌尔里克。\n总之，别管我。你好好休息，好吗？"

# game/script.rpy:184189
translate chinese Choices_map024_1_0_4a848fec:

    # "He promptly leaves the room, letting out a loud yawn.{w}\nWhat an interesting evening. Just one thing after another.{w}\nBut with everything out of the way, it was finally time to rest."
    "他立刻离开房间，打了个大大的哈欠。{w}\n真是个有趣的夜晚。一件事接着一件事。{w}\n但既然事情都处理完了，终于该休息了。"

# game/script.rpy:184191
translate chinese Choices_map024_1_0_407edbfd:

    # "I make my way back to the bed, and practically collapse on it.{w}\nHopefully I'd get enough sleep for our journey to The Outlook.{w}\nI find the most comfortable position I can, and surrender to heavy eyelids."
    "我回到床边，几乎是瘫倒上去。{w}\n但愿我能睡足，应付前往瞭望台的旅程。{w}\n我找了个最舒服的姿势，任由沉重的眼皮合上。"

# game/script.rpy:184210
translate chinese Choices_map024_1_0_2de1c578:

    # "I needed to side with Valessa, she was right.{w}\nWe only got involved in this because of our alliance with Mazeo.{w}\nIf we maintained our independence, Valinorth would be safe and sound."
    "我需要站在瓦莱莎这边，她是对的。{w}\n我们卷进这一切，只是因为和马泽奥的联盟。{w}\n如果我们保持独立，瓦利诺斯会安然无恙。"

# game/script.rpy:184212
translate chinese Choices_map024_1_0_3958417b:

    # "Not only that, but our culture, and hierarchy were important too.{w}\nThere'd be no place for Seers and Scribes in the rest of Alestia.{w}\nAfter this was all said and done, Valinorth would remain strong and free."
    "不仅如此，我们的文化和等级制度也很重要。{w}\n在阿莱斯蒂亚其他地方，先知和书记官将无处容身。{w}\n等这一切尘埃落定，瓦利诺斯仍会强大而自由。"

