    # char_jit_map044_1_0_28 "Alright, I'll humor you for a moment.\nEven if I play along, and your Rebellion comes to rule Alestia?\nThey'll lift the trade bans, effectively ruining piracy for good."
    char_jit_map044_1_0_28 "好吧，我就陪你玩一会儿。\n就算我配合你，你们的反抗军真的统治了阿莱斯蒂亚？\n他们会解除贸易禁令，那等于彻底毁掉海盗这一行。"

# game/script.rpy:187166
translate chinese map044_0bdb382f:

    # voice "se/x00198.ogg"
    voice "se/x00198.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:187168
translate chinese map044_551f955c:

    # char_jit_map044_1_0_28 "Why should I fight to kill my own profession?"
    char_jit_map044_1_0_28 "我为什么要拼命去毁掉自己的营生？"

# game/script.rpy:187193
translate chinese map044_16d1fcbc:

    # voice "se/x00199.ogg"
    voice "se/x00199.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:187195
translate chinese map044_43affd1c:

    # char_jit_map044_1_0_16 "There are much better things to do in this world, Alex.\nI could pay you with anything you wanted — or any job you wanted.\nJust name it, and I'll make it happen. These are dire times, you know."
    char_jit_map044_1_0_16 "这世上比这更好的事多的是，亚历克斯。\n你要什么报酬都行——想要什么差事也行。\n尽管开口，我来办。你知道的，眼下是非常时期。"

# game/script.rpy:187220
translate chinese map044_4673dde4:

    # voice "se/x00200.ogg"
    voice "se/x00200.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:187222
translate chinese map044_59c9c743:

    # char_jit_map044_1_0_28 "I doubt this offer extends to the rest of our crew.\nI'd love a reward, and a new job, but not if it screws them over.\nThey'll be doing the bulk of the fighting. Not me, or Nada."
    char_jit_map044_1_0_28 "我怀疑这条件不会惠及我们其他船员。\n报酬和新差事我乐意要，但不能害了他们。\n打仗的主力是他们。不是我，也不是娜达。"

# game/script.rpy:187235
translate chinese map044_9e07012f:

    # voice "se/x00201.ogg"
    voice "se/x00201.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:187237
translate chinese map044_c1cbf18d:

    # char_jit_map044_1_0_28 "That is, if I can even convince them to do this.\nOne of our core tenets is that we don't take sides."
    char_jit_map044_1_0_28 "前提还是我能不能说服他们干这事。\n我们不选边站，这是我们的核心信条之一。"

# game/script.rpy:187262
translate chinese map044_9b039766:

    # voice "se/x00202.ogg"
    voice "se/x00202.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:187264
translate chinese map044_29a63856:

    # char_jit_map044_1_0_16 "Even when the victor is clear?"
    char_jit_map044_1_0_16 "就算胜者已定？"

# game/script.rpy:187289
translate chinese map044_4cc1b20d:

    # voice "se/x00203.ogg"
    voice "se/x00203.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:187291
translate chinese map044_8069e0a1:

    # char_jit_map044_1_0_28 "Even so.\nDuring the occupation, we fought for our own survival.\nBoth The Triumvirate {i}and{/i} the citizens of Mazeo attacked us."
    char_jit_map044_1_0_28 "即便如此。\n占领期间，我们为自己的生存而战。\n三人执政团{i}和{/i}马泽奥的市民都袭击过我们。"

# game/script.rpy:187294
translate chinese map044_a21caace:

    # voice "se/x00204.ogg"
    # char_jit_map044_1_0_28 "We worked for decades to unite the pirates into what they are today.\nDoing this will split them apart again. You'll make an enemy out of Nada.\nShe's pretty much the leader, and her influence is immeasurable."
    voice "se/x00204.ogg"
    char_jit_map044_1_0_28 "我们花了几十年才把海盗们团结成今天这个样子。\n这么做会让他们再次分裂。你会和娜达为敌。\n她基本上就是首领，影响力不可估量。"

# game/script.rpy:187320
translate chinese map044_87f8c1bc:

    # voice "se/x00205.ogg"
    voice "se/x00205.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:187322
translate chinese map044_2b5060cc:

    # char_jit_map044_1_0_16 "I'm well aware of that, and I've taken it into consideration.\nA divide in your numbers will still give me the right amount of men.\nYou can show the rest of the pirates they're on the wrong side of this."
    char_jit_map044_1_0_16 "我很清楚，也已经考虑过了。\n你们的人就算分裂，留给我的兵力也刚刚好。\n你可以让其余的海盗看看，他们站错了边。"

# game/script.rpy:187325
translate chinese map044_0354c7be:

    # voice "se/x00206.ogg"
    # char_jit_map044_1_0_16 "Any divide that comes, I'm sure we can mend it.\nBesides, Damek hasn't {i}said{/i} he's going to harm piracy.\nI'm sure we can come to some sort of deal, Alex."
    voice "se/x00206.ogg"
    char_jit_map044_1_0_16 "就算出现分裂，我相信我们也能弥合。\n再说，达梅克并没{i}说过{/i}他要打击海盗。\n我相信我们能谈成某种交易，亚历克斯。"

# game/script.rpy:187351
translate chinese map044_738b5113:

    # voice "se/x00207.ogg"
    voice "se/x00207.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:187353
translate chinese map044_1834515f:

    # char_jit_map044_1_0_28 "No matter what the deal is, you can't win over {i}everybody{/i}.\nAs soon as The Triumvirate falls, you'll have another war lined up.\nHell — they might even join the white-cloaks out of spite."
    char_jit_map044_1_0_28 "不管是什么交易，你都不可能收服{i}所有人{/i}。\n三人执政团一倒，下一场战争就排上日程了。\n见鬼——他们甚至可能出于怨气加入白袍军。"

# game/script.rpy:187378
translate chinese map044_be89aeb5:

    # voice "se/x00208.ogg"
    voice "se/x00208.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:187380
translate chinese map044_a903c83b:

    # char_jit_map044_1_0_16 "I'm willing to take the risk.\nBut I'll do my best to make sure they're satisfied.\nThere will be a place for {i}everyone{/i} in our new Alestia."
    char_jit_map044_1_0_16 "我愿意冒这个险。\n但我会尽力让他们满意。\n在我们新的阿莱斯蒂亚里，会{i}人人{/i}都有位置。"

# game/script.rpy:187393
translate chinese map044_57ab93f8:

    # voice "se/x00209.ogg"
    voice "se/x00209.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:187395
translate chinese map044_c4b9d296:

    # char_jit_map044_1_0_16 "The pirates are in a great position to make demands.\nAs the Mayor of Mazeo, I can give you anything you want.\nThere's no way Nada could turn an offer like that down."
    char_jit_map044_1_0_16 "海盗们正处在提条件的好位置。\n作为马泽奥的市长，你要什么我都能给。\n娜达不可能拒绝这样的条件。"

# game/script.rpy:187420
translate chinese map044_e42de0f6:

    # voice "se/x00210.ogg"
    voice "se/x00210.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:187422
translate chinese map044_bd8f79a2:

    # char_jit_map044_1_0_28 "Very well. Let's talk terms."
    char_jit_map044_1_0_28 "很好。我们来谈条件吧。"

# game/script.rpy:187461
translate chinese map033_e9c0c940:

    # "Damek ventured back underground from the Church of Mazeo.{w}\nAfter a lengthy journey through the tunnels — he was home.{w}\nThe deed was secured, and they had everything they needed."
    "达梅克从马泽奥教堂再次潜入地下。{w}\n在隧道里走了漫长的路——他到家了。{w}\n地契到手了，他们需要的一切都齐了。"

# game/script.rpy:187488
translate chinese map033_543b4028:

    # voice "se/x00157.ogg"
    voice "se/x00157.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:187490
translate chinese map033_cf99f034:

    # char_damek "Why did the Honor Guard do all of this...?\nThey single-handedly sheltered and armed our forces."
    char_damek "荣誉卫队为什么做了这一切……？\n他们单凭一己之力就为我们的部队提供了庇护和武器。"

# game/script.rpy:187511
translate chinese map033_0b24da95:

    # "One of the rebels notices Damek's sudden entrance.{w}\nHe quickly stands up, and greets the General with a smile."
    "一个反抗军成员注意到达梅克突然进来。{w}\n他迅速站起身，笑着迎接将军。"

# game/script.rpy:187541
translate chinese map033_5ae7853a:

    # voice "se/x00158.ogg"
    voice "se/x00158.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:187547
translate chinese map033_d6b4b914:

    # char_jit_map033_1_0_35 "Damek, Sir!\nEverything is going according to plan.\nOur forces have started to relocate."
    char_jit_map033_1_0_35 "达梅克，长官！\n一切都按计划进行。\n我们的部队已经开始转移。"

# game/script.rpy:187572
translate chinese map033_1e99ec00:

    # voice "se/x00159.ogg"
    voice "se/x00159.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:187574
translate chinese map033_3f5719fb:

    # char_damek "Perfect timing, Vance.\nI just received the deed from Gryz.\nIt took some convincing, but I did it."
    char_damek "来得正好，万斯。\n我刚从格瑞兹那里拿到地契。\n费了些口舌，不过办成了。"

# game/script.rpy:187599
translate chinese map033_91e1c1a6:

    # voice "se/x00160.ogg"
    voice "se/x00160.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:187602
translate chinese map033_541fbf5e:

    # char_jit_map033_1_0_35 "Wait — you didn't already have the deed?\nWhy were we moving everybody down here...?"
    char_jit_map033_1_0_35 "等等——你之前还没拿到地契？\n那我们为什么把所有人都转移到这儿来……？"

# game/script.rpy:187627
translate chinese map033_6e2c0efa:

    # voice "se/x00161.ogg"
    voice "se/x00161.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:187629
translate chinese map033_cf713ef1:

    # char_damek "Oops. You didn't hear anything, alright?\nBesides, I knew I could win him over.\nThis was just a bit of a... \"head start\"."
    char_damek "哎呀。你什么都没听见，好吗？\n再说，我知道我能说服他。\n这不过是……“抢先一步”罢了。"

# game/script.rpy:187642
translate chinese map033_03df0c91:

    # voice "se/x00162.ogg"
    voice "se/x00162.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:187644
translate chinese map033_27bc7ea7:

    # char_damek "And cut the formalities — call me Damek.\nWe've been through enough. This isn't about rank.\nI think of us all as a family, not an army."
    char_damek "还有，别搞那些客套——叫我达梅克。\n我们一起经历得够多了。这不是讲军衔的时候。\n我把我们所有人都当家人，而不是军队。"

# game/script.rpy:187669
translate chinese map033_e33e2dfe:

    # voice "se/x00163.ogg"
    voice "se/x00163.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:187671
translate chinese map033_56086368:

    # char_jit_map033_1_0_35 "Of course, Damek.\nI'm amazed at our new HQ, to be honest.\nHow did you secure all of this stuff...?"
    char_jit_map033_1_0_35 "当然，达梅克。\n说实话，我对我们的新总部感到惊叹。\n你是怎么弄到这些东西的……？"

# game/script.rpy:187696
translate chinese map033_a8eee899:

    # voice "se/x00164.ogg"
    voice "se/x00164.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:187698
translate chinese map033_2d5f8864:

    # char_damek "It wasn't me, Vance.\nThe Honor Guard was planning a {i}long{/i} stay.\nThey're responsible for everything you see."
    char_damek "不是我弄的，万斯。\n荣誉卫队本来是打算{i}长期{/i}驻留的。\n你看到的一切都是他们置办的。"

# game/script.rpy:187723
translate chinese map033_c7e5de61:

    # voice "se/x00165.ogg"
    voice "se/x00165.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:187725
translate chinese map033_fef9944b:

    # char_jit_map033_1_0_35 "You mean those {i}things{/i}?\nWhy would they build stuff they have no use for?\nThey can't really fight, and they have no need for sleep."
    char_jit_map033_1_0_35 "你是说那些{i}东西{/i}？\n他们为什么会建造自己用不上的东西？\n他们根本没法打仗，也不需要睡觉。"

# game/script.rpy:187746
translate chinese map033_0bb610dd:

    # "Damek smirked and grabbed a blade from the nearby shelf."
    "达梅克笑了笑，从旁边的架子上抓起一把剑。"

# game/script.rpy:187776
translate chinese map033_866073d3:

    # voice "se/x00166.ogg"
    voice "se/x00166.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:187778
translate chinese map033_c74983e7:

    # char_damek "They must've known {i}someone{/i} would use it.\nEither way — The Triumvirate doesn't know about this.\nTheir own Honor Guard is defying orders, it would seem."
    char_damek "他们一定知道{i}有人{/i}会用得上。\n不管怎样——三人执政团并不知道这事。\n看来他们自己的荣誉卫队在违抗命令。"

# game/script.rpy:187799
translate chinese map033_c26b87f2:

    # "Vance followed Damek's lead, and grabbed a blade as well."
    "万斯学着达梅克的样子，也抓起一把剑。"

# game/script.rpy:187829
translate chinese map033_fa4ce806:

    # voice "se/x00167.ogg"
    voice "se/x00167.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:187831
translate chinese map033_fabf7b77:

    # char_jit_map033_1_0_35 "So there's discord among them...?\nNever thought we'd live to see that."
    char_jit_map033_1_0_35 "这么说他们内部也有矛盾……？\n从没想过我们这辈子能见到这种事。"

# game/script.rpy:187856
translate chinese map033_2649cfb0:

    # voice "se/x00168.ogg"
    voice "se/x00168.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:187858
translate chinese map033_499ae377:

    # char_damek "Yeah, but it also proves The Triumvirate isn't all-knowing.\nThere's no way they'd let this happen if they were.\nThey're just like us. We can take them down."
    char_damek "是啊，但这也证明三人执政团并非无所不知。\n要是他们真全知全能，绝不会让这种事发生。\n他们和我们一样。我们能打倒他们。"

# game/script.rpy:187879
translate chinese map033_8d3a5ed7:

    # "He flourishes his blade, and holds it out."
    "他耍了个剑花，把剑横举起来。"

# game/script.rpy:187909
translate chinese map033_b82f214b:

    # voice "se/x00169.ogg"
    voice "se/x00169.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:187911
translate chinese map033_26fd37ef:

    # char_damek "That is — if we're strong enough."
    char_damek "前提是——我们足够强。"

# game/script.rpy:187936
translate chinese map033_ac643268:

    # voice "se/x00170.ogg"
    voice "se/x00170.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:187938
translate chinese map033_c126343f:

    # char_jit_map033_1_0_35 "It's a spar you want...?"
    char_jit_map033_1_0_35 "你是想切磋一下……？"

# game/script.rpy:187959
translate chinese map033_28663144:

    # "Vance smirks and mimics the flourish of his General.{w}\nA few of the nearby rebels stop in their tracks to watch."
    "万斯咧嘴一笑，模仿起将军的剑花。{w}\n附近几个反抗军成员停下脚步围观。"

# game/script.rpy:187989
translate chinese map033_8526f920:

    # voice "se/x00171.ogg"
    voice "se/x00171.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:187991
translate chinese map033_e8be045c:

    # char_damek "Just need to make sure you haven't gotten sloppy.\nAs soon as The Triumvirate finds out — a fight is coming."
    char_damek "只是得确认你没生疏。\n三人执政团一旦发现——一场战斗就要来了。"

# game/script.rpy:188016
translate chinese map033_5cd29e15:

    # voice "se/x00172.ogg"
    voice "se/x00172.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:188018
translate chinese map033_4d76a548:

    # char_jit_map033_1_0_35 "Don't worry Damek. I'm ready."
    char_jit_map033_1_0_35 "别担心，达梅克。我准备好了。"

# game/script.rpy:188039
translate chinese map033_deae60eb:

    # "They charge at each other, and their swords clash.{w}\nThe loud clang of steel against steel fills their HQ.{w}\nAs the audience grows in size, their morale rises in tandem."
    "两人冲向对方，剑刃相交。{w}\n钢铁相击的巨响回荡在整个总部。{w}\n围观的人越来越多，他们的士气也随之高涨。"

# game/script.rpy:188078
translate chinese map025_f7d87326:

    # "After a trek that was longer than expected, we finally reach The Outlook.{w}\nThere was a long uphill walk, so my legs are strained and tired.{w}\nThat, along with my lack of sleep, was an unfortunate combination."
    "走了比预想更远的路，我们终于到了瞭望台。{w}\n一路长长的上坡，我的腿又酸又累。{w}\n再加上睡眠不足，真是糟糕的组合。"

# game/script.rpy:188105
translate chinese map025_5b68d8bf:

    # voice "se/z00705.ogg"
    voice "se/z00705.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:188107
translate chinese map025_b219f3fb:

    # char_ulric "Well, here we are.\nZamira told me you've never been.\nTake a look down there. What do you think?"
    char_ulric "好了，我们到了。\n扎米拉跟我说过你没来过这儿。\n往下看看吧。觉得怎么样？"

# game/script.rpy:188128
translate chinese map025_70d2b3ca:

    # "He lets out a soft laugh, like he's anticipating our reaction.{w}\nAfter a few more steps, we reach the high ground, and everything comes into view.{w}\nThe scope of our world, and just how small Valinorth really was, finally dawned upon me."
    "他轻轻笑了一声，仿佛在期待我们的反应。{w}\n又走了几步，我们来到高处，眼前豁然开朗。{w}\n我终于意识到我们的世界有多辽阔，而瓦利诺斯又有多渺小。"

# game/script.rpy:188158
translate chinese map025_371c5004:

    # voice "se/z00706.ogg"
    voice "se/z00706.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:188160
translate chinese map025_c728ddf5:

    # char_fortaime "Whoa..."
    char_fortaime "哇……"

# game/script.rpy:188185
translate chinese map025_5a4d03a2:

    # voice "se/z00707.ogg"
    voice "se/z00707.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:188187
translate chinese map025_1e8f14bd:

    # char_valessa "That's amazing!"
    char_valessa "太惊人了！"

# game/script.rpy:188208
translate chinese map025_00135485:

    # "They stop to catch their breath, as they run up the hill in excitement.{w}\nWe can see the entirety of Mazeo, and it looks so tiny from up here.{w}\nBut I know it's {i}much{/i} larger than Valinorth, so this is hard to comprehend."
    "他们兴奋地跑上山坡，停下来喘口气。{w}\n整个马泽奥尽收眼底，从这里看过去小得可怜。{w}\n但我知道它比瓦利诺斯{i}大得多{/i}，所以这实在让人难以置信。"

# game/script.rpy:188238
translate chinese map025_d1c17ec2:

    # voice "se/z00708.ogg"
    voice "se/z00708.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:188240
translate chinese map025_d2090e2d:

    # char_fortaime "That's Mazeo...?"
    char_fortaime "那就是马泽奥……？"

# game/script.rpy:188265
translate chinese map025_bc822027:

    # voice "se/z00709.ogg"
    voice "se/z00709.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:188267
translate chinese map025_e6502128:

    # char_ulric "Yeah. We can probably reach it in a few more hours.\nBut take a while to enjoy the view — it's really something else.\nAnd it's not like we'll be coming back here anytime soon, right?"
    char_ulric "是啊。再走几个小时应该就能到了。\n不过多花点时间欣赏风景吧——真的很不一般。\n反正我们短期内也不会再回来了，对吧？"

# game/script.rpy:188280
translate chinese map025_555070bd:

    # voice "se/z00710.ogg"
    voice "se/z00710.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:188282
translate chinese map025_f4958df2:

    # char_valessa "Yeah..."
    char_valessa "是啊……"

# game/script.rpy:188303
translate chinese map025_54ec05e5:

    # "Pro takes a few steps forward, writing in some kind of journal.{w}\nHe watches Ulric, not even needing to stare at the paper as he wrote."
    "普洛上前几步，在本子上写着什么。{w}\n他望着乌尔里克，写字时甚至不用看纸。"

# game/script.rpy:188333
translate chinese map025_737c7265:

    # voice "se/z00711.ogg"
    voice "se/z00711.ogg"

