    # char_fortaime "Anyway, we should head to the Town Square.\nWith this vision business, we'll have a busy day.\nDon't waste too much time, alright?"
    char_fortaime "总之，我们该去中央广场了。\n出了幻象这档子事，今天有得忙了。\n别浪费太多时间，好吗？"

# game/script.rpy:189826
translate chinese map082_cc9541ae:

    # "Fortaime has now permanently joined your party.{w}\nA comrade joining your party also retroactively unlocks content.{w}\nFor example, you can bring Fortaime to your home and talk to him there.{w}\nIt is a good idea to form a habit of revisiting previous areas."
    "福泰姆现已永久加入你的队伍。{w}\n同伴加入队伍还会追溯性地解锁内容。{w}\n例如，你可以带福泰姆回家，在那里和他交谈。{w}\n养成重访旧区域的习惯是个好主意。"

# game/script.rpy:190416
translate chinese click_map088_5_EV005_f82e94bd:

    # "This is my home. There's not much more to say.{w}\nI know it's a mess inside, but I'll have to fix that later.{w}\nMaybe Fortaime and I could have a private word inside."
    "这是我家。没什么好多说的。{w}\n我知道里面乱糟糟的，但只能以后再收拾了。{w}\n也许我和福泰姆可以进去私下聊两句。"

# game/script.rpy:190419
translate chinese click_map088_5_EV005_e265c059:

    # voice "se/a00013.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "A bit bigger than my house, but mine has more rooms.\nWhich is better though, more rooms or more space?\nMy interior design books don't really cover that aspect." nointeract
    voice "se/a00013.ogg"
    char_fortaime "比我家大一点，不过我家房间更多。\n到底哪个更好呢，房间多还是空间大？\n我的室内设计书里还真没讲过这方面。" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:190425
translate chinese click_map088_5_EV005_4f94e9da:

    # voice "se/a00014.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "So, you think more space is better?\nI guess you'll just have to invite me over more often.\nAnd if you ever change your mind, you're welcome at my place."
    voice "se/a00014.ogg"
    char_fortaime "这么说，你觉得空间大更好？\n那你就得多请我来做客了。\n要是你哪天改变主意，也欢迎来我那儿。"

# game/script.rpy:190431
translate chinese click_map088_5_EV005_741046c3:

    # voice "se/a00015.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "Oh, so it's privacy you want?\nThere's plenty of that back at my place.\nWhenever you need it, I'm just down the street."
    voice "se/a00015.ogg"
    char_fortaime "哦，所以你是想要清静？\n我那儿清静得很。\n什么时候需要，我就在街对面。"

# game/script.rpy:190437
translate chinese click_map088_5_EV005_1d122316:

    # voice "se/a00016.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "The master has spoken.\nI guess it's true though. Work with what you have.\nAnd if you don't have it, someone else surely will!"
    voice "se/a00016.ogg"
    char_fortaime "大师发话了。\n不过还真有道理。有什么就用什么。\n要是你没有，别人肯定有！"

