    # voice "se/w00007.ogg"
    voice "se/w00007.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:190586
translate chinese click_map088_8_EV008_728402c7:

    # char_valessa "Yeah, of course.\nOnce we get to Mazeo, I'll buy you some for real.\nAn apology is lame, I'm gonna make up for what I did."
    char_valessa "嗯，当然。\n等我们到了马泽奥，我真给你买。\n光道歉太敷衍了，我要补偿我做过的。"

# game/script.rpy:190634
translate chinese click_map088_9_EV009_df091f1b:

    # "The higher up you live, the more you have to pay.{w}\nHouses up there, with great views, are way too expensive.{w}\nOf course, The Elder happily lives above everybody else.{w}\nThankfully, that's not reflected in the way he treats us."
    "住得越高，花费就越多。{w}\n上面的房子视野绝佳，价格也贵得离谱。{w}\n当然，长老乐呵呵地住在所有人之上。{w}\n好在，他待我们的方式并没有沾上那股高高在上。"

# game/script.rpy:190636
translate chinese click_map088_9_EV009_2c9cb382:

    # "I notice the streams of water are in full flow today.{w}\nWe siphon off water from falls higher up in the mountains.{w}\nThat's how we fill the water tank each and every day.{w}\nEach morning, every citizen does a \"water run\", so to speak."
    "我注意到今天的水流很充沛。{w}\n我们从山上更高处的瀑布引水。{w}\n我们每天就是这样把水塔灌满的。{w}\n每天早晨，每个村民都要跑一趟“取水”，可以这么说。"

# game/script.rpy:190638
translate chinese click_map088_9_EV009_5807d5cf:

    # "These runs are a requirement for everyone in Valinorth.{w}\nWithout them, the tank would overflow and flood our village.{w}\nI should do mine before it gets too late, actually.{w}\nOne person might not matter, but that's a bad mentality."
    "在瓦利诺斯，每个人都必须参加取水。{w}\n要是没人做，水塔就会溢出，淹没我们的村庄。{w}\n其实我该趁早去完成自己那份。{w}\n少一个人或许无关紧要，但那种心态很要不得。"

# game/script.rpy:190675
translate chinese click_map088_70_EV070_11711138:

    # "I must be blessed with peaceful neighbors.{w}\nI've never heard a single peep come from next door.{w}\nFortaime is loud, but thankfully he lives across the street.{w}\nWith him next door, I'd probably die of sleep deprivation."
    "我大概是摊上了安静的邻居。{w}\n隔壁一点动静都没听到过。{w}\n福泰姆嗓门大，好在他住在街对面。{w}\n要是他住隔壁，我恐怕得因睡眠不足而死。"

# game/script.rpy:190678
translate chinese click_map088_70_EV070_1a587e4e:

    # voice "se/a00017.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "Aww, are you thinking about me?\nI saw the way you looked at me just now.\nGive it to me straight, what's going on?" nointeract
    voice "se/a00017.ogg"
    char_fortaime "哎呀，你在想我吗？\n我看到你刚刚看我的眼神了。\n老实说吧，怎么回事？" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:190684
translate chinese click_map088_70_EV070_4075d256:

    # voice "se/a00018.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "I'll take that as a compliment, actually.\nThe louder you are, the more fun you're having!\nYou'll have to come and join me sometime."
    voice "se/a00018.ogg"
    char_fortaime "其实我就当那是夸奖了。\n你越吵，说明你玩得越开心！\n哪天你得来跟我一起玩。"

# game/script.rpy:190690
translate chinese click_map088_70_EV070_552c62c4:

    # voice "se/a00019.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "I guess you could say that, yeah.\nBeing a Scribe-in-training is pretty hard work.\nIt's fun to unwind after everything is said and done."
    voice "se/a00019.ogg"
    char_fortaime "这么说也行吧，没错。\n当见习书记官可辛苦了。\n等一切忙完再放松一下，挺爽的。"

# game/script.rpy:190695
translate chinese click_map088_70_EV070_320acfb1:

    # "He laughs and turns away from me.{w}\nThere's a hint of a blush on his face, but he covers it up.{w}\nHe's quite reckless in his youth, but isn't almost everyone?"
    "他笑着从我身边转开。{w}\n他脸上隐约泛红，却掩饰了过去。{w}\n他年纪轻轻，行事莽撞，可谁又不是呢？"

# game/script.rpy:190732
translate chinese click_map088_88_EV088_a9c4444b:

    # "I often see Fortaime up here, just passing the time.{w}\nClimbing the trees of Valinorth is his number one hobby.{w}\nHe always talks about how he'll climb The Grand Tree one day."
    "我常在这里看到福泰姆，只是打发时间。{w}\n爬瓦利诺斯的树是他最大的爱好。{w}\n他总说，总有一天要去爬巨树。"

# game/script.rpy:190769
translate chinese click_map088_120_EV120_88635c45:

    # "That's Valinorth's post office at the end of the road.{w}\nVillage-wide notices are posted there, and we all have boxes.{w}\nSometimes it's easier to catch someone by mail when they're busy.{w}\nI haven't checked my box in a while, but I rarely get any messages."
    "路尽头的那个是瓦利诺斯的邮局。{w}\n全村的公告都贴在那里，我们每人都有一个信箱。{w}\n有时候别人忙，寄信反而更容易找到他们。{w}\n我有一阵子没查看信箱了，不过我本来就很少收到信。"

# game/script.rpy:190771
translate chinese click_map088_120_EV120_1cab61c3:

    # "I only really interact with Valessa and Fortaime.{w}\nWe can't carry out our duties unless we're together in person.{w}\nIf I got mail from someone else, it would likely be junk.{w}\nIf Mylus needed me, he'd come to me in person too."
    "我真正有来往的，也就瓦莱莎和福泰姆。{w}\n不聚在一起，我们就没法履行职责。{w}\n要是收到别人的来信，多半也是些没用的东西。{w}\n迈勒斯要是需要我，也会亲自来找我。"

# game/script.rpy:190776
