    # char_fortaime "Whoa, you really have to think that one through!\nThis is the most important day of your life. \nAre you sure you want to do that with {i}me{/i}?" nointeract
    char_fortaime "哇，这可真得好好想清楚！\n这是你一生中最重要的日子。\n你确定要跟{i}我{/i}一起吗？" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:190817
translate chinese click_map088_120_EV120_aa7eb862:

    # voice "se/a00026.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "If you're certain, then I'd love to!\nMaybe I'll even give you a refresher course.\nI'm assuming you don't get to do much dancing."
    voice "se/a00026.ogg"
    char_fortaime "你要是确定，那我乐意之至！\n说不定我还能给你补补课。\n我猜你平时没什么机会跳舞吧。"

# game/script.rpy:190823
translate chinese click_map088_120_EV120_a02a8364:

    # voice "se/a00027.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "Sounds good, just let me know!\nI think your induction will be something special.\nYou should spend it with someone special, as well."
    voice "se/a00027.ogg"
    char_fortaime "听起来不错，告诉我一声就行！\n我觉得你的授职仪式会很不寻常。\n你也该和一个特别的人一起度过。"

# game/script.rpy:190862
translate chinese click_map088_129_EV129_12c4ac25:

    # "I wonder why the spirits are getting stronger.{w}\nOr, maybe their grip on my mind is getting stronger.{w}\nEither way, a lot of books on them are outdated.{w}\nEven Fortaime is struggling to catch up."
    "不知道灵体为什么会越来越强。{w}\n又或者，是它们对我心智的钳制越来越紧。{w}\n不管怎样，关于它们的书很多都过时了。{w}\n连福泰姆都快跟不上了。"

# game/script.rpy:190923
translate chinese click_map088_129_EV129_5b112412:

    # "This is Fortaime's house, and it's in tip-top condition.{w}\nIt looks brand new, he must take very good care of it.{w}\nAs I get closer, I notice a book left out on his porch.{w}\nIt has his name on the front, so I can only assume it's his own work."
    "这是福泰姆的家，状态好得没话说。{w}\n看起来跟新的一样，他一定很爱惜。{w}\n走近些，我注意到他家门廊上放着一本书。{w}\n封面上有他的名字，我只能猜那是他自己的作品。"

# game/script.rpy:190964
translate chinese click_map088_129_EV129_e7e4eb15:

    # voice "se/a00028.ogg"
    voice "se/a00028.ogg"

