translate chinese click_map088_129_EV129_d5716a35:

    # char_fortaime "Of course, the spirits grow stronger every day.\nIt's already gotten to a point where a Scribe is near useless.\nI have more volumes written on this subject, I'm sure you'll find them."
    char_fortaime "当然，灵体每天都在变强。\n已经到了书记官几乎派不上用场的地步。\n关于这方面我写了更多卷册，你一定能找到。"

# game/script.rpy:190982
translate chinese click_map088_129_EV129_399b5157:

    # voice "se/a00031.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "Can you believe how much stronger they've gotten, though?\nI wrote this book years ago, and it's almost outdated.\nWe've been able to witness so much growth in one generation."
    voice "se/a00031.ogg"
    char_fortaime "可你能相信它们变强了多少吗？\n这本书是我几年前写的，如今几乎过时了。\n我们竟能在同一代人里见证这么大的变化。"

# game/script.rpy:191006
translate chinese click_map088_134_EV134_501ce5ff:

    # "In Valinorth, we're very in tune with the spirits.{w}\nMany believe that's because we're surrounded by nature.{w}\nThat is, however, except for the stretches of road we created.{w}\nThey're semi-recent, and they caused a pretty large uproar."
    "在瓦利诺斯，我们与灵体非常契合。{w}\n许多人相信，这是因为我们被自然环绕。{w}\n不过，我们自己修的那几段路算是例外。{w}\n它们是近些年才建的，当时引起了相当大的争议。"

# game/script.rpy:191008
translate chinese click_map088_134_EV134_be79fdb7:

    # "Some thought it would lead to more and more deforestation.{w}\nThankfully, it never escalated, and became very convenient.{w}\nIt didn't harm our connection with the spirits, either.{w}\nIn fact, over time, that bond only appears to get stronger."
    "有人担心这会导致越来越多的滥伐。{w}\n还好事情没有恶化，反而带来了极大的便利。{w}\n也没有损害我们与灵体的联系。{w}\n事实上，随着时间推移，这份羁绊似乎只增不减。"

# game/script.rpy:191083
translate chinese Valessa1_map088_177_1_b41c75c8:

    # char_valessa "Hey." nointeract
    char_valessa "嘿。" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:191102
translate chinese Valessa1_map088_177_1_2e1e5bb0:

    # voice "se/y00175.ogg"
    # char_valessa "Yeah, of course I do!\nIt's so peaceful, and everyone is so nice.\nI don't think Valinorth has any real downsides."
    voice "se/y00175.ogg"
    char_valessa "嗯，当然喜欢！\n这里这么安宁，大家又都这么友善。\n我觉得瓦利诺斯没什么真正的缺点。"

# game/script.rpy:191108
translate chinese Valessa1_map088_177_1_08fb17bb:

    # voice "se/y00176.ogg"
    # char_valessa "We're not plagued with piracy like Mazeo.\nOur hierarchy works, and we're always stable.\nIf I ever got the chance to leave, I doubt I would."
    voice "se/y00176.ogg"
    char_valessa "我们不像马泽奥那样被海盗问题困扰。\n我们的等级制度运转良好，一直很稳定。\n就算有机会离开，我想我也不会走。"

# game/script.rpy:191114
translate chinese Valessa1_map088_177_1_fa28a5a4:

    # voice "se/y00177.ogg"
    # char_valessa "That's partly why I've never left the village.\nI know that Peregrino is out there, and Sauleberg.\nBut I've only heard stories. I've never actually been."
    voice "se/y00177.ogg"
    char_valessa "这也是我一直没离开过村子的部分原因。\n我知道外面有佩雷格里诺，还有索尔伯格。\n但我只听过传闻。从没真正去过。"

# game/script.rpy:191136
translate chinese Valessa2_map088_177_1_dc39a054:

    # voice "se/y00178.ogg"
    voice "se/y00178.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:191138
translate chinese Valessa2_map088_177_1_fd683d9f:

    # char_valessa "It's a watering hole, like a bar.\nIt's popular for people on their way to Valinorth.\nThat's why it's called \"The Pilgrim's Tavern\"."
    char_valessa "那是个酒馆，像酒吧一样的地方。\n前往瓦利诺斯的人常在那儿落脚。\n所以它叫“朝圣者酒馆”。"

# game/script.rpy:191143
translate chinese Valessa2_map088_177_1_c6c0bb0f:

    # voice "se/y00179.ogg"
    # char_valessa "It's a good business idea, in my opinion.\nThe road to and from Valinorth is long and arduous.\nI bet everybody wants to stop and grab a drink."
    voice "se/y00179.ogg"
    char_valessa "在我看来，这是个不错的生意点子。\n往返瓦利诺斯的路又长又难走。\n我敢打赌，谁都想停下来喝一杯。"

# game/script.rpy:191149
translate chinese Valessa2_map088_177_1_410f9b85:

    # voice "se/y00180.ogg"
    # char_valessa "At least, that's what I've heard.\nWe don't get too many outsiders, but it's still in business.\nIt makes me wonder if there's something more to that place."
    voice "se/y00180.ogg"
    char_valessa "至少，我是这么听说的。\n我们这儿来不了多少外人，可它还在营业。\n这让我不禁好奇，那地方是不是另有玄机。"

# game/script.rpy:191171
translate chinese Valessa2_map088_177_1_5a7ae817:

    # voice "se/y00181.ogg"
    voice "se/y00181.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:191173
translate chinese Valessa2_map088_177_1_18b2ea46:

    # char_valessa "Apparently, each nation has a spirit idol.\nIt's where the spirit realm reaches out into the physical world.\nSauleberg is home to ours, but it's been closed off for a while."
    char_valessa "据说，每个国家都有一尊灵像。\n那是灵界延伸到现实世界的地方。\n我们这尊就供在索尔伯格，不过已经封闭有一阵子了。"

# game/script.rpy:191178
translate chinese Valessa2_map088_177_1_056878b4:

    # voice "se/y00182.ogg"
    # char_valessa "It happened around the time we were born, actually.\nSo I've never actually seen one in person.\nJust in drawings that Fortaime and I can find."
    voice "se/y00182.ogg"
    char_valessa "其实，那差不多发生在我们出生的时候。\n所以我从没亲眼见过灵像。\n只在福泰姆和我能找到的图画里见过。"

# game/script.rpy:191184
translate chinese Valessa2_map088_177_1_b1bdd6ea:

    # voice "se/y00183.ogg"
    # char_valessa "You know how nature is supposed to hold spiritual energy?\nWell, that energy has to come from somewhere, right?\nThe idol is actually what delivers it to the land."
    voice "se/y00183.ogg"
    char_valessa "你知道大自然本该承载着灵力吧？\n那这股能量总得有个来源，对吧？\n其实就是灵像把能量输送到大地的。"

# game/script.rpy:191190
translate chinese Valessa2_map088_177_1_f6279cd8:

    # voice "se/y00184.ogg"
    # char_valessa "But one idol can't cover all of Alestia.\nSo like I said, each nation is supposed to have their own.\nThey're like national treasures, to be heavily guarded."
    voice "se/y00184.ogg"
    char_valessa "但一尊灵像覆盖不了整个阿莱斯蒂亚。\n所以就像我说的，每个国家都该有自己的一尊。\n它们就像国宝，必须严加看守。"

# game/script.rpy:191212
translate chinese Valessa2_map088_177_1_b88ca266:

    # voice "se/y00185.ogg"
    voice "se/y00185.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:191214
translate chinese Valessa2_map088_177_1_1ebd29db:

    # char_valessa "I'm not holding my breath, to be honest.\nWe're rather self-sustaining here in Valinorth.\nAs long as we have Seers and Scribes, we'll be good."
    char_valessa "说实话，我不抱什么期望。\n瓦利诺斯挺自给自足的。\n只要我们有先知和书记官，就没问题。"

# game/script.rpy:191219
translate chinese Valessa2_map088_177_1_cdc188de:

    # voice "se/y00186.ogg"
    # char_valessa "Everything pertaining to our livelihood can be foreseen.\nSo far, we haven't had to forge any alliances or treaties.\nAnd remember, it's been this way for thousands of years."
    voice "se/y00186.ogg"
    char_valessa "一切与我们生计相关的事都能被预见。\n到目前为止，我们从不需要缔结什么盟约或条约。\n别忘了，这样的状态已经持续了几千年。"

# game/script.rpy:191225
translate chinese Valessa2_map088_177_1_a87b57b0:

    # voice "se/y00187.ogg"
    # char_valessa "Not that I'm against alliances, or anything like that.\nBut we have no purpose to leave, so I probably won't.\nI need to stay where my role is deemed most important."
    voice "se/y00187.ogg"
    char_valessa "倒不是说我反对结盟之类的。\n只是我们没有离开的理由，所以我也许不会走。\n我得留在最需要我发挥作用的地方。"

# game/script.rpy:191253
translate chinese Valessa2_map088_177_1_18cdbf6b:

    # voice "se/y00188.ogg"
    # char_valessa "It's an experience, to say the least.\nHis attention span isn't the best, you know?\nHe'll zone out in the middle of our studies."
    voice "se/y00188.ogg"
    char_valessa "至少可以说，是种“体验”。\n你知道的，他的注意力可不怎么样？\n我们在学习时他会走神。"

# game/script.rpy:191259
translate chinese Valessa2_map088_177_1_44d518c0:

    # voice "se/y00189.ogg"
    # char_valessa "And he always finds a way to make things humorous.\nIt can be somewhat frustrating when I'm trying to teach him.\nBut maybe that's just me, and I need to loosen up a little." nointeract
    voice "se/y00189.ogg"
    char_valessa "而且他总有办法把事情说得搞笑。\n我教他的时候，有时候还真挺让人头疼。\n不过也许只是我太较真，该放松一点。" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:191277
translate chinese Valessa2_map088_177_1_00b8859c:

    # voice "se/y00190.ogg"
    # char_valessa "I knew I wasn't the only one who thought so!\nCompared to him, I can seem a little boring.\nBut that's not true. He's just over the top."
    voice "se/y00190.ogg"
    char_valessa "我就知道不只我这么想！\n跟他一比，我可能显得有点无聊。\n可不是那样。只是他太夸张了。"

# game/script.rpy:191283
translate chinese Valessa2_map088_177_1_026c2646:

    # voice "se/y00191.ogg"
    # char_valessa "I've always been pretty mature for my age.\nPerhaps I gained some of his maturity instead.\nAt least he gets along well with the children."
    voice "se/y00191.ogg"
    char_valessa "我一直比同龄人成熟。\n也许我反而从他那儿分到了一些成熟。\n至少他和孩子们相处得很好。"

# game/script.rpy:191305
translate chinese Valessa2_map088_177_1_0a3b2516:

    # voice "se/y00192.ogg"
    # char_valessa "Yeah, yeah, I guess you're right.\nBut we're in positions that are {i}very{/i} sacred.\nIf we don't take this seriously, we'll end up failing."
    voice "se/y00192.ogg"
    char_valessa "是是是，你说得对。\n可我们身处的位置{i}极其{/i}神圣。\n要是我们不认真对待，最终会搞砸。"

# game/script.rpy:191311
translate chinese Valessa2_map088_177_1_0a2389ce:

    # voice "se/y00193.ogg"
    # char_valessa "Maybe I'm just picking up Fortaime's slack.\nI feel like the villagers hold us to a certain \"standard\".\nIf it were just him, he'd fall way short of those standards."
    voice "se/y00193.ogg"
    char_valessa "也许我只是在替福泰姆补漏。\n我感觉村民对我们有某种“标准”。\n要是只有他一个，他远达不到那些标准。"

# game/script.rpy:191317
translate chinese Valessa2_map088_177_1_6dcfcce1:

    # voice "se/y00194.ogg"
    # char_valessa "I must sound like an awful person right now.\nI just feel like we all need to act professionally...!"
    voice "se/y00194.ogg"
    char_valessa "我现在听起来一定像个很糟的人。\n我只是觉得，我们都该拿出该有的担当……！"

# game/script.rpy:191339
translate chinese Valessa2_map088_177_1_c16a1229:

    # voice "se/y00195.ogg"
    # char_valessa "I guess so. We {i}could{/i} hate each other's guts.\nThat would make protecting Valinorth quite hard.\nConsidering that, I think things are pretty good."
    voice "se/y00195.ogg"
    char_valessa "也许吧。我们{i}本可以{/i}互相恨之入骨。\n那样一来，守护瓦利诺斯可就难了。\n这么一想，我觉得现在这样挺好。"

# game/script.rpy:191345
translate chinese Valessa2_map088_177_1_2c940f4a:

    # voice "se/y00196.ogg"
    # char_valessa "I guess I'll just work on my tolerance for his antics.\nI kind of thought you'd agree, and now I feel weird.\nBut if this is just a \"Valessa\" problem, I'll fix it."
    voice "se/y00196.ogg"
    char_valessa "我想我只能提高对他那些闹腾的容忍度了。\n我还以为你会赞同，现在感觉有点怪。\n但如果这只是“瓦莱莎”自己的问题，我会解决。"

# game/script.rpy:191351
translate chinese Valessa2_map088_177_1_9e8c14c1:

    # voice "se/y00197.ogg"
    # char_valessa "As always, you have a way of putting things in perspective.\nSorry if it sounded like I was bashing his personality.\nIt was more like an observation, that's all."
    voice "se/y00197.ogg"
    char_valessa "你总有办法帮人看清大局。\n如果我听起来像是在贬低他的性格，抱歉。\n那更像是一种观察，仅此而已。"

# game/script.rpy:191375
translate chinese Valessa2_map088_177_1_10c6b27c:

    # voice "se/y00198.ogg"
    # char_valessa "Yeah, definitely!\nI've been preparing for weeks.\nI's not too complicated, at least for me."
    voice "se/y00198.ogg"
    char_valessa "嗯，当然！\n我已经准备了好几周。\n不算太复杂，至少对我来说。"

# game/script.rpy:191381
translate chinese Valessa2_map088_177_1_828872c6:

    # voice "se/y00199.ogg"
    # char_valessa "It might be a little harder for you.\nBut basically, just recite after Mylus.\nAfter that, it's one big celebration."
    voice "se/y00199.ogg"
    char_valessa "对你来说可能会稍微难一点。\n但基本上，只要跟着迈勒斯念就行。\n之后就是一场盛大的庆祝。"

# game/script.rpy:191387
translate chinese Valessa2_map088_177_1_5840dac0:

    # voice "se/y00200.ogg"
    # char_valessa "My role is minimal, this is your special day.\nAs long as you can handle the spotlight, you're good.\nYou won't have to memorize anything, or make a huge speech."
    voice "se/y00200.ogg"
    char_valessa "我的角色无关紧要，这是属于你的日子。\n只要你能应付得了众人的目光就行。\n你不用背任何东西，也不用发表长篇讲话。"

# game/script.rpy:191407
translate chinese Valessa3_map088_177_1_4862ad3a:

    # voice "se/y00201.ogg"
    voice "se/y00201.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:191409
translate chinese Valessa3_map088_177_1_c4353e02:

    # char_valessa "Apparently, Mylus' Father was caught up in other things.\nIt must've been important to shun something like this.\nI wonder if it's related to his disappearance...?"
    char_valessa "据说，迈勒斯的父亲当时被别的事缠住了。\n能让他推掉这种事，一定很重要。\n不知道这和他的失踪有没有关系……？"

# game/script.rpy:191414
translate chinese Valessa3_map088_177_1_035c1a66:

    # voice "se/y00202.ogg"
    # char_valessa "Anyway, that's why it hasn't happened until now.\nIt's supposed to happen when you're much younger.\nBut I don't see any reason why it can't happen now."
    voice "se/y00202.ogg"
    char_valessa "总之，这就是为什么拖到现在才办。\n本来应该在你小得多的时候就举行。\n但我看不出有什么理由说现在不行。"

# game/script.rpy:191436
translate chinese Valessa3_map088_177_1_54f9cd16:

    # voice "se/y00203.ogg"
    voice "se/y00203.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:191438
translate chinese Valessa3_map088_177_1_3243a9af:

    # char_valessa "You pledge yourself to Valinorth, and its protection.\nUntil the end of your days, you'll serve our village.\nIn return, you pretty much get to live a life of luxury."
    char_valessa "你宣誓效忠瓦利诺斯，并守护它。\n直到生命尽头，你都将为我们的村庄效力。\n作为回报，你基本上能过上养尊处优的生活。"

# game/script.rpy:191443
translate chinese Valessa3_map088_177_1_910866f4:

    # voice "se/y00204.ogg"
    # char_valessa "The benefits are amazing, and a long time coming.\nI hear you'll get a house near Mylus, and loyal servants.\nYou have to be stress-free. Mental strain affects visions." nointeract
    voice "se/y00204.ogg"
    char_valessa "待遇非常优厚，而且拖欠已久了。\n我听说你会得到一栋靠近迈勒斯的房子，还有忠诚的仆人。\n你必须保持无忧无虑。精神压力会影响幻象。" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:191461
translate chinese Valessa3_map088_177_1_f592dd65:

    # voice "se/y00205.ogg"
    # char_valessa "Yeah, and I'm actually kind of jealous.\nBut we'll be spending a lot of time together.\nSo I guess I get access to that stuff by association."
    voice "se/y00205.ogg"
    char_valessa "嗯，其实我有点羡慕。\n不过我们会经常待在一起。\n所以我想，我也算沾光能享受到那些东西。"

# game/script.rpy:191483
translate chinese Valessa3_map088_177_1_ce6db71a:

    # voice "se/y00206.ogg"
    # char_valessa "Isn't it a little late to be getting cold feet?\nWe've already been performing these duties forever.\nThis ceremony won't change much. It's just tradition."
    voice "se/y00206.ogg"
    char_valessa "现在打退堂鼓，是不是有点晚了？\n这些职责我们早就一直在履行了。\n这场仪式改变不了什么。不过是传统罢了。"

# game/script.rpy:191489
translate chinese Valessa3_map088_177_1_89223db5:

    # voice "se/y00207.ogg"
    # char_valessa "Try not to worry about it too much, alright?\nEverything will be the same tomorrow.\nSame old you. Same old Valinorth."
    voice "se/y00207.ogg"
    char_valessa "尽量别太担心，好吗？\n明天一切都会照旧。\n还是老样子的你。还是老样子的瓦利诺斯。"

# game/script.rpy:191511
translate chinese Valessa3_map088_177_1_74f76aa7:

    # voice "se/y00208.ogg"
    # char_valessa "It might be, but that doesn't mean it's not awesome.\nYou're the most important person in Valinorth, remember?\nYou should be treated with as much respect as possible."
    voice "se/y00208.ogg"
    char_valessa "也许吧，但这不代表它不棒。\n你可是瓦利诺斯最重要的人，记得吗？\n你理应得到尽可能多的尊重。"

# game/script.rpy:191517
translate chinese Valessa3_map088_177_1_31008d8c:

    # voice "se/y00209.ogg"
    # char_valessa "I'm sure you can turn that stuff down.\nBut it'd be the first time in history that anyone did.\nI think you need to take it, and get rid of your stress."
    voice "se/y00209.ogg"
    char_valessa "我相信你可以拒绝那些东西。\n可那将是历史上头一遭。\n我觉得你该接受，好让自己卸下压力。"

# game/script.rpy:191539
translate chinese Valessa3_map088_177_1_59247ee4:

    # voice "se/y00210.ogg"
    voice "se/y00210.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:191541
translate chinese Valessa3_map088_177_1_d7a07611:

    # char_valessa "As soon as the sun starts to set.\nSo luckily, we still have a few hours.\nPlenty of time to meet with Mylus."
    char_valessa "太阳一开始落山就举行。\n所以还好，我们还有几个小时。\n足够去见迈勒斯了。"

# game/script.rpy:191562
translate chinese Valessa3_map088_177_1_8b09389b:

    # voice "se/y00211.ogg"
    voice "se/y00211.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:191564
translate chinese Valessa3_map088_177_1_4444b1a9:

    # char_valessa "This only happens once a generation, so I'm not sure.\nBut I've heard that it goes until the sun starts to rise.\nThat's a bit too much for me. We'll see how long I can last."
    char_valessa "这种事一代人才有一次，所以我也说不准。\n但我听说派对会一直持续到太阳升起。\n对我来说有点吃不消。看看我能撑多久吧。"

# game/script.rpy:191569
translate chinese Valessa3_map088_177_1_74ad5e16:

    # voice "se/y00212.ogg"
    # char_valessa "From what I've seen, you're pretty stressed today.\nI think this ceremony, and the party, will help you unwind.\nAfter it's done, we can take care of whatever we need to."
    voice "se/y00212.ogg"
    char_valessa "据我观察，你今天压力挺大的。\n我想这场仪式和派对能帮你放松。\n等结束之后，我们再处理该处理的事。"

# game/script.rpy:191606
translate chinese Valessa3_map088_177_1_9072c197:

    # "This character is not in your party."
    "该角色不在你的队伍中。"

# game/script.rpy:191665
translate chinese map097_bf15c44e:

    # "Pro slammed his hand of cards down on the table.{w}\nHis opponents scoffed, and shouted accusations of cheating.{w}\nHe smirked as he made his way to the bar, laughing them off.{w}\nWith his newfound riches, he'd celebrate over a drink."
