translate chinese map090_e6b2b699:

    # "Valessa has now permanently joined your party.{w}\nLike before, new content has been unlocked in old areas.{w}\nBut a new feature, \"Parallel Chronicles\", has also been unlocked.{w}\nA brief tutorial on that will follow after this dialogue window."
    "瓦莱莎现已永久加入你的队伍。{w}\n和之前一样，旧区域中解锁了新内容。{w}\n此外还解锁了一项新功能——“平行编年史”。{w}\n本对话框结束后，会有简短的教学说明。"

# game/script.rpy:193261
translate chinese click_map089_7_EV007_3a0ae374:

    # "Houses near the tank are reserved for the elderly.{w}\nSomething about minimizing travel time to our water source.{w}\nOf course, houses near here are way too humid to be comfortable.{w}\nBut for some reason, they don't complain, and happily reside inside."
    "水塔附近的房子是留给老人的。{w}\n据说是为了缩短他们到水源的路程。{w}\n当然，这附近的房子潮得根本住不舒服。{w}\n可不知为何，他们毫无怨言，还乐呵呵地住在里面。"

