# game/script.rpy:193312
translate chinese click_map089_17_EV017_6b87373c:

    # "These eaves carry water from the falls to the tank.{w}\nIt's completely self-sustaining, and requires little upkeep.{w}\nWe just have to empty the tank each morning to get our fill.{w}\nIt's something we can't live without, so it never goes unused."
    "这些引水檐把瀑布的水引到水塔。{w}\n整套系统完全自给自足，几乎不用维护。{w}\n我们只要每天早上把水塔排空，取够自家用的水。{w}\n这是不可或缺的东西，所以从不闲置。"

