# game/script.rpy:193661
translate chinese click_map089_58_EV058_a1eb0ee2:

    # "Water runs down the side of the tanks at a steady rate.{w}\nThat's a sign that it's gotten full, and requires attention.{w}\nFor a moment I'm glad that so much water is in the center of Valinorth.{w}\nIf we could somehow redirect the flow, it could easily combat fire."
    "水匀速地从水塔侧面淌下。{w}\n这说明水塔已满，需要处理。{w}\n有那么一瞬间，我很庆幸瓦利诺斯的中心有这么多水。{w}\n要是能想办法改变水流的方向，灭火轻而易举。"

# game/script.rpy:193704
translate chinese click_map089_71_EV071_f7e19d8f:

    # voice "se/a00035.ogg"
    # char_valessa "Whoa, that's disgusting...!\nThose things could be so dirty, you know.\nAt least wait until there's no one around."
    voice "se/a00035.ogg"
    char_valessa "哇，真恶心……！\n你知道，那些东西可能特别脏。\n至少等没人的时候再去碰。"

# game/script.rpy:193710
translate chinese click_map089_71_EV071_1114f484:

    # voice "se/a00036.ogg"
    # char_valessa "I saw you staring down that faucet...\nTrust me, I've been tempted more than once.\nBut the villagers need a better example."
    voice "se/a00036.ogg"
    char_valessa "我看见你盯着那个水龙头了……\n相信我，我不止一次也心动过。\n但村民们需要一个更好的榜样。"

# game/script.rpy:193748
translate chinese click_map089_95_EV095_8daf7e48:

    # "The ground here is paved, and dry.{w}\nIt's not wet like the rest of the soil.{w}\nThis would be the best place for me to stand."
    "这里的地面铺了石板，是干的。{w}\n不像其他地方的泥土那样潮湿。{w}\n这里最适合我站。"

# game/script.rpy:193786
translate chinese click_map089_100_EV100_bdbb6c30:

    # "It appears to be written by Mylus' Father, the previous Elder."
    "看起来是迈勒斯的父亲，也就是上一任长老写的。"

# game/script.rpy:193847
translate chinese click_map089_100_EV100_ba8cbd0e:

    # "There's a book sitting here, it's wet and stained.{w}\nMost likely water damage, due to its proximity to the tank.{w}\nWhen I approach it, Fortaime laughs and apologizes to me."
    "这里放着一本书，又湿又脏。{w}\n多半是因为离水塔太近，被水泡坏了。{w}\n我走近时，福泰姆笑着向我道歉。"

# game/script.rpy:193850
translate chinese click_map089_100_EV100_30235e08:

    # voice "se/a00038.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "Sorry, I think I dropped that when I was waiting!\nIt's something I picked up from Mylus' house a few days ago.\nYou're free to take it, I have no use for it anymore."
    voice "se/a00038.ogg"
    char_fortaime "抱歉，我想是我在这儿等的时候掉的！\n这是我几天前从迈勒斯家拿的。\n你尽管拿去，我用不上了。"

# game/script.rpy:193923
translate chinese map092_f5da0e6a:

    # "Damek and Ulric gathered in the town square come morning.{w}\nThe road to Valinorth would be long and fraught with danger.{w}\nBut this time, Damek was certain he'd sent the right man."
    "清晨，达梅克和乌尔里克在中央广场碰面。{w}\n前往瓦利诺斯的路漫长且危机四伏。{w}\n但这一次，达梅克确信自己派对了人。"

