    # char_the_triumvirate "Sovy, what is the meaning of this intrusion?"
    char_the_triumvirate "索维，你这样闯入是什么意思？"

# game/script.rpy:194432
translate chinese map093_2bd88a58:

    # voice "se/x00055.ogg"
    voice "se/x00055.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:194434
translate chinese map093_5621e7d8:

    # char_sovy "Halin has finished his interrogation, Masters.\nI thought it would be wise to relay the results.\nUnless you were plotting behind our backs...?"
    char_sovy "主上，哈林已经审问完毕。\n我想把结果转达给你们才是明智之举。\n除非……你们一直在背地里谋划什么？"

# game/script.rpy:194461
translate chinese map093_9c40b020:

    # voice "se/x00056.ogg"
    voice "se/x00056.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:194463
translate chinese map093_1439e54d:

    # char_the_triumvirate "We would never do such a thing.\nInformation is granted to you as we see fit.\nIf you are left in the dark, it is not permanent."
    char_the_triumvirate "我们绝不会做那种事。\n情报何时给你们，由我们决定。\n就算你们暂时不知情，也不会是永久的。"

# game/script.rpy:194478
translate chinese map093_9a9264be:

    # voice "se/x00057.ogg"
    voice "se/x00057.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:194480
translate chinese map093_c8c248d6:

    # char_the_triumvirate "But please, tell us what Halin discovered.\nWe have a feeling our theories are similar."
    char_the_triumvirate "不过，请告诉我们哈林发现了什么。\n我们有种感觉，我们的推测是相似的。"

# game/script.rpy:194507
translate chinese map093_d0725466:

    # voice "se/x00058.ogg"
    voice "se/x00058.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:194509
translate chinese map093_c0645369:

    # char_sovy "Yes, of course.\nThe Exodus Wielder {i}is{/i} located in Valinorth.\nI am ready to launch our attack at a moment's notice."
    char_sovy "是的，当然。\n放逐之刃的持有者{i}确实{/i}在瓦利诺斯。\n我随时准备发动进攻。"

# game/script.rpy:194526
translate chinese map093_12902137:

    # voice "se/x00059.ogg"
    # char_the_triumvirate "Good. Then it is time you hear the rest.\nValinorth is just a small part of our larger plan.\nWe see no more reason to withold this information."
    voice "se/x00059.ogg"
    char_the_triumvirate "很好。那么是时候让你听听其余的部分了。\n瓦利诺斯只是我们更大计划中的一小部分。\n我们再没有理由隐瞒这些情报了。"

# game/script.rpy:194554
translate chinese map093_4c1359c1:

    # voice "se/x00060.ogg"
    voice "se/x00060.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:194556
translate chinese map093_c14025dd:

    # char_sovy "That much was obvious, Masters.\nWhy did you keep it from me for so long?\nHalin and I are more than loyal enough...!"
    char_sovy "这点显而易见，主上。\n你们为什么瞒了我这么久？\n我和哈林已经足够忠诚了……！"

# game/script.rpy:194583
translate chinese map093_92079d3a:

    # voice "se/x00061.ogg"
    voice "se/x00061.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:194585
translate chinese map093_e340ed33:

    # char_the_triumvirate "Sovy, this is not a matter of loyalty.\nWe are sure you'll understand when you hear.\nIt would not be wise to doubt our word."
    char_the_triumvirate "索维，这无关忠诚。\n我们相信，你听了之后就会明白。\n怀疑我们的话，可不是明智之举。"

# game/script.rpy:194612
translate chinese map093_17157a2f:

    # voice "se/x00062.ogg"
    voice "se/x00062.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:194614
translate chinese map093_ba668e7a:

    # char_sovy "Yes, yes. My apologies.\nNobody likes being left in the dark.\nI will ensure my words sound less doubtful."
    char_sovy "是，是。我道歉。\n没人喜欢被蒙在鼓里。\n我会注意，别让我的话听起来那么充满怀疑。"

# game/script.rpy:194619
translate chinese map093_bf6bf2f1:

    # voice "se/x00063.ogg"
    # char_sovy "If there is a greater plan at play, I am honored.\nI find no greater pleasure than serving your cause.\nSo please, tell me what you wish, and it will happen."
    voice "se/x00063.ogg"
    char_sovy "如果背后还有更大的计划，我深感荣幸。\n为你们的事业效力，是我最大的快乐。\n所以请告诉我你们的意愿，我一定会办到。"

# game/script.rpy:194647
translate chinese map093_3fbb8c24:

    # voice "se/x00064.ogg"
    voice "se/x00064.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:194649
translate chinese map093_95f1608e:

    # char_the_triumvirate "We've led you to believe that Valinorth is our goal.\nHowever, it is just the beginning of a much larger plan."
    char_the_triumvirate "我们一直让你以为瓦利诺斯就是我们的目标。\n然而，那只是一个更宏大计划的开端。"

# game/script.rpy:194666
translate chinese map093_1d6311d5:

    # voice "se/x00065.ogg"
    # char_the_triumvirate "Today, you will learn the {i}true{/i} nature of the spirit realm."
    voice "se/x00065.ogg"
    char_the_triumvirate "今天，你将了解到灵界{i}真正{/i}的本质。"

# game/script.rpy:194705
translate chinese map230_7837f4ea:

    # "I look at the water tank, thinking of the vision that started this all.{w}\nBack then, I thought we could use the water to fight the flames.{w}\nLittle did I know, that entire vision was just a trick to bait us."
    "我看着水塔，想起这一切起始的那个幻象。{w}\n当时我以为我们可以用水来扑灭火焰。{w}\n却不知那整个幻象不过是引我们上钩的诡计。"

# game/script.rpy:194707
translate chinese map230_ab05f935:

    # "However, that was the first time I ever laid eyes on Sovy.{w}\nI'll never forget what he did to me. He killed me without hesitation.{w}\nBut is he different now? Or was he ever really like that to begin with...?"
    "不过，那是我第一次见到索维。{w}\n我永远不会忘记他对我做的事。他毫不犹豫地杀了我。{w}\n可他现在变了吗？还是说他本来就不是那样的人……？"

# game/script.rpy:194732
translate chinese map230_ce0c9bdb:

    # voice "se/y01868.ogg"
    voice "se/y01868.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:194734
translate chinese map230_6d9e23ce:

    # char_sovy "So, this is Valinorth. I've heard stories, but never been.\nWell — unless you count that vision The Triumvirate tricked you with.\nI must apologize for that. I knew what was going on, and I played along."
    char_sovy "那么，这就是瓦利诺斯。我听过不少传闻，却从未来过。\n嗯——除非把三人执政团骗你看到的那个幻象也算上。\n为此我必须道歉。我知道当时是怎么回事，却还是配合了。"

# game/script.rpy:194747
translate chinese map230_1b0fe0ed:

    # voice "se/y01869.ogg"
    # char_sovy "It's not like I could've done anything else. Valinorth was too far away.\nThat, and they still had me under their thrall. I was theirs to command.\nAt least I was able to break free. I feel bad for Halin, I truly do."
    voice "se/y01869.ogg"
    char_sovy "我当时也做不了别的。瓦利诺斯太远了。\n何况他们仍控制着我。我任由他们驱使。\n至少我总算挣脱了。我真为哈林感到难过，真的。"

# game/script.rpy:194762
translate chinese map230_ef9f251d:

    # "He looks around the town square.{w}\nIt looks like he's enamored by Valinorth.{w}\nAlmost as if he's looking at a wonder of the world."
    "他环顾中央广场。{w}\n看起来他迷上了瓦利诺斯。{w}\n仿佛在观赏世界奇观。"

# game/script.rpy:194787
translate chinese map230_b0add101:

    # voice "se/y01870.ogg"
    # char_sovy "I need to ask — what did you think of me...?\nThe moment we met in that vision. Who was I to you?\nA mindless slave? A killer? Or perhaps a man who was lost?" nointeract
    voice "se/y01870.ogg"
    char_sovy "我得问一句——你当时怎么看我……？\n我们在那个幻象里相遇的那一刻。我对你来说是谁？\n一个没有思想的奴隶？一个杀手？还是……一个迷失的人？" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:194803
translate chinese map230_5b5763fd:

    # voice "se/y01871.ogg"
    # char_sovy "I guess I was. Oh well, it was worth a shot.\nI commited atrocities in their name. I feel irredeemable. \nThe fact that your'e giving me a chance? That's a {i}true{/i} miracle."
    voice "se/y01871.ogg"
    char_sovy "我想我是吧。算了，问一下也无妨。\n我以他们的名义犯下过暴行。我觉得自己无可救药。\n你竟然愿意给我一个机会？那真是{i}不折不扣{/i}的奇迹。"

# game/script.rpy:194819
translate chinese map230_2c44a1f1:

    # voice "se/y01872.ogg"
    # char_sovy "All I ever wanted was to ensure that Alestia's true rulers remained in power.\nLittle did I know, The Triumvirate was lying to me all along. {i}You{/i} are the true ruler.\nNow I know why they wanted to kill you so bad. You're a massive threat. Plain and simple."
    voice "se/y01872.ogg"
    char_sovy "我一直只想确保阿莱斯蒂亚真正的统治者掌权。\n却不知三人执政团从头到尾都在骗我。{i}你{/i}才是真正的统治者。\n现在我知道他们为什么那么想杀你了。你是巨大的威胁。就这么简单。"

# game/script.rpy:194837
translate chinese map230_7e5b46f8:

    # voice "se/y01873.ogg"
    # char_sovy "Excuse me...? Please, don't make jokes like that.\nI'm being serious here, [firstname]. You should be serious, too.\nI really hope the weight of our cause doesn't rest on someone so childish."
    voice "se/y01873.ogg"
    char_sovy "什么……？拜托，别开那种玩笑。\n我是认真的，[firstname]。你也该认真点。\n我真希望我们事业的重量，不是压在一个这么幼稚的人身上。"

# game/script.rpy:194853
translate chinese map230_114ad1c0:

    # voice "se/y01874.ogg"
    # char_sovy "I guess you're right. But The Triumvirate made that vision.\nI know they did it to trick you — but I was still a part of it.\nHow they portrayed me would be how they {i}saw{/i} me."
    voice "se/y01874.ogg"
    char_sovy "你说得也许对。可那个幻象是三人执政团造出来的。\n我知道他们是为了骗你——可我还是参与了其中。\n他们把我塑造成什么样，就说明他们{i}看{/i}我是什么样。"

# game/script.rpy:194870
translate chinese map230_edc4c627:

    # "He shakes his head, and looks around the town some more.{w}\nHis eyes become fixated on the post office, and he smiles slightly."
    "他摇摇头，又打量了镇子一会儿。{w}\n他的目光定格在邮局上，微微笑了。"

# game/script.rpy:194895
translate chinese map230_49555b4a:

    # voice "se/y01875.ogg"
    # char_sovy "A post office...? I haven't seen one of those in ages.\nI couldn't travel much when I was younger, so I collected stamps.\nThe drawings of places around Alestia — that was the closest I ever got."
    voice "se/y01875.ogg"
    char_sovy "邮局……？我好久没见过邮局了。\n我年轻时没法到处走，所以就集邮。\n那些印着阿莱斯蒂亚各地风景的图案——是我离那些地方最近的一次。"

# game/script.rpy:194910
translate chinese map230_bc253daf:

    # "He walks toward it, so I make sure to follow him.{w}\nThis is the first time he's ever mentioned anything about his past.{w}\nIt's hard to imagine that he was anything other than The Grand Inquisitor."
    "他朝那里走去，我也跟了上去。{w}\n这是他第一次提起自己的过去。{w}\n很难想象他除了大审判官之外还有别的样子。"

# game/script.rpy:194935
translate chinese map230_887c6a3a:

    # voice "se/y01876.ogg"
    # char_sovy "But the art never really matches up with the place when you see it in person.\nI remember collecting the Balteus set, and being shocked when I actually got there.\nIt's not really a good or a bad difference. It's just interesting to see how they compare." nointeract
    voice "se/y01876.ogg"
    char_sovy "但等你亲眼见到那些地方，图案其实跟实地并不一样。\n我记得收集巴尔泰乌斯那套邮票时，真正到了那里，我大吃一惊。\n这算不上好或坏的差别。只是把两者对照看看，挺有意思。" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:194951
translate chinese map230_e44cbce6:

    # voice "se/y01877.ogg"
    # char_sovy "That's not really something I'd like to talk about right now.\nDo you mind if I go inside and buy some really quick?\nIt won't take too long, I promise. Just wait for me."
    voice "se/y01877.ogg"
    char_sovy "这事我现在不太想谈。\n介意我进去快速买一些吗？\n我保证不会太久。等等我。"

# game/script.rpy:194967
translate chinese map230_477b2786:

    # voice "se/y01878.ogg"
    # char_sovy "Oh, wonderful. Then you won't mind if I go buy some...?\nI shouldn't be too long. It's just for old time's sake, you know?\nJust wait for me. We can get back on track as soon as I return."
    voice "se/y01878.ogg"
    char_sovy "哦，太好了。那你不介意我进去买一些吧……？\n应该不会太久。你知道，就是怀旧一下。\n等等我。我一回来我们就继续正事。"

# game/script.rpy:194989
translate chinese map230_e294b066:

    # "I nod, and he smiles at me.{w}\nHe runs into the post office and buys some stamps.{w}\nA look of childlike glee is worn on his face when he returns."
    "我点点头，他冲我笑了笑。{w}\n他跑进邮局，买了一些邮票。{w}\n他回来时，脸上带着孩子般的喜悦。"

# game/script.rpy:195014
translate chinese map230_5000e8b8:

    # voice "se/y01879.ogg"
    voice "se/y01879.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:195016
translate chinese map230_744d09ff:

    # char_sovy "Thank you, [firstname].\nYou know what it's like — sometimes you just need to do something.\nThis is the first time I've truly been free, so I almost couldn't resist."
    char_sovy "谢谢你，[firstname]。\n你懂的——有时候你就是想做点什么。\n这是我第一次真正自由，所以我几乎按捺不住。"

# game/script.rpy:195029
translate chinese map230_aed1dbe2:

    # voice "se/y01880.ogg"
    # char_sovy "I'll save these, and perhaps we can write each other after the war.\nYou'll be incredibly busy, so I can't expect to earn a lot of your time." nointeract
    voice "se/y01880.ogg"
    char_sovy "我会把这些收好，也许战后我们可以互相写信。\n你会忙得不可开交，所以我也不敢奢望能占用你多少时间。" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:195045
translate chinese map230_f238694d:

    # voice "se/y01881.ogg"
    # char_sovy "Perfect. We'll figure something out when the time comes.\nFor now, I think we have to focus on more important things."
    voice "se/y01881.ogg"
    char_sovy "好极了。到时候我们再想办法。\n眼下，我想我们得专注于更重要的事。"

# game/script.rpy:195063
translate chinese map230_463402c3:

    # voice "se/y01882.ogg"
    # char_sovy "I'm not sure how to respond to that, so I won't.\nLet's focus on more important things for now."
    voice "se/y01882.ogg"
    char_sovy "我不知道该怎么回应那句话，那就不回应了。\n先专注于更重要的事吧。"

# game/script.rpy:195079
translate chinese map230_a4a4db31:

    # voice "se/y01883.ogg"
    # char_sovy "Very well. I suppose I'll survive either way.\nLet's focus on more important things for now, then."
    voice "se/y01883.ogg"
    char_sovy "好吧。我想不管怎样我都活得下去。\n那我们就先专注于更重要的事吧。"

# game/script.rpy:195095
translate chinese map230_25e899e0:

    # voice "se/y01884.ogg"
    # char_sovy "Well, I wouldn't go that far — but suit yourself.\nIn that case, let's focus on something more important."
    voice "se/y01884.ogg"
    char_sovy "嗯，我倒不会说得那么夸张——随你吧。\n既然如此，我们就专注于更重要的事。"

# game/script.rpy:195112
translate chinese map230_ef36d6a5:

    # "He looks at the blade on my back, and assumes a thinking pose."
    "他看着我背上的剑，摆出思索的姿势。"

# game/script.rpy:195137
translate chinese map230_0042303c:

    # voice "se/y01885.ogg"
    # char_sovy "You could use some training, couldn't you?\nAnything to give you an edge in the upcoming battle.\nI have years of practice, so I can teach you almost everything."
    voice "se/y01885.ogg"
    char_sovy "你需要练练，对吧？\n任何能在接下来的战斗中占上风的东西。\n我练了多年，几乎什么都能教你。"

# game/script.rpy:195141
translate chinese map230_69ccc0d1:

    # voice "se/y01886.ogg"
    # char_sovy "We shouldn't stay here too long, though. Schedules and all that.\nIf we start training while we travel, it'll be more efficient in the end.\nWe can't waste too much time before setting sail for Balteus."
    voice "se/y01886.ogg"
    char_sovy "不过我们不该在这儿待太久。行程什么的。\n如果我们在旅途中开始训练，效果会更好。\n启航前往巴尔泰乌斯之前，不能浪费太多时间。"

# game/script.rpy:195156
translate chinese map230_fe6c5736:

    # "I nod. It's true — he could teach me a lot about this blade.{w}\nI feel like I'd be needing that knowledge in the coming days.{w}\nPerhaps having him join us wasn't a bad idea after all."
    "我点点头。的确——关于这把剑，他能教我很多。{w}\n我感觉接下来的日子里，我会需要这些知识。{w}\n也许让他加入我们，终究不是个坏主意。"

# game/script.rpy:195181
translate chinese map230_632fa1c1:

    # voice "se/y01887.ogg"
    # char_sovy "Wonderful. Normally, I'd call you an Apprentice at this point.\nBut I'm past that. I need to drop the behavior that The Triumvirate taught me.\nSo — you're not an Apprentice to me — you're a friend; and I'll help you."
    voice "se/y01887.ogg"
    char_sovy "太好了。换作以前，这时候我会称你为学徒。\n但我已经不再那样了。我得丢掉三人执政团教给我的那套做派。\n所以——对我来说你不是学徒——你是朋友；而我会帮你。"

# game/script.rpy:195203
translate chinese map230_46427fb2:

    # "We start walking away from the town square, and he inspects his stamps.{w}\nIt was crazy how different he seems from how he was before. I'm taken aback.{w}\nBut if this was the new him, and not some sort of facade — he'd be welcomed."
    "我们开始离开中央广场，他端详着那些邮票。{w}\n他和从前简直判若两人，这太不可思议了。我不禁愣住。{w}\n但如果这就是新的他，而非某种伪装——那他值得被接纳。"

# game/script.rpy:195242
translate chinese map099_1f654898:

    # "The Grand Tree towers above everything else in Valinorth.{w}\nAnd because of Valinorth's altitude, it towers above the world.{w}\nWe take slow steps across the makeshift bridge, holding onto the sides."
    "巨树高耸于瓦利诺斯的一切之上。{w}\n而由于瓦利诺斯本身的海拔，它仿佛高耸于整个世界之上。{w}\n我们扶着两侧，缓缓走过那座临时搭建的桥。"

# game/script.rpy:195244
translate chinese map099_0d697c48:

    # "Valessa stops in her tracks, taking in the surroundings.{w}\nA hint of confusion appears on her face as she breaks the silence.{w}\nStopping as well, Fortaime and I listen to her words."
    "瓦莱莎停下脚步，环顾四周。{w}\n她打破沉默时，脸上浮现出一丝困惑。{w}\n我和福泰姆也停下来，听她说话。"

# game/script.rpy:195272
translate chinese map099_dcff9fb6:

    # voice "se/z00324.ogg"
    voice "se/z00324.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:195274
translate chinese map099_e0dceaab:

    # char_valessa "Alright, we really need to talk.\n[firstname]. What are you thoughts on all of this?\nYou've been totally silent since we left Mylus'."
    char_valessa "好了，我们真的得谈谈。\n[firstname]。你对这一切怎么看？\n自从离开迈勒斯那儿，你就一句话都没说。"

# game/script.rpy:195281
translate chinese map099_6781514b:

    # voice "se/z00325.ogg"
    voice "se/z00325.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:195283
translate chinese map099_e0dceaab_1:

    # char_valessa "Alright, we really need to talk.\n[firstname]. What are you thoughts on all of this?\nYou've been totally silent since we left Mylus'."
    char_valessa "好了，我们真的得谈谈。\n[firstname]。你对这一切怎么看？\n自从离开迈勒斯那儿，你就一句话都没说。"

# game/script.rpy:195311
translate chinese map099_45dfeff3:

    # voice "se/z00326.ogg"
    voice "se/z00326.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:195313
translate chinese map099_e7b2e628:

    # char_fortaime "Hey Valessa, no prying.\nLet him open up when he wants to."
    char_fortaime "嘿，瓦莱莎，别追问了。\n等他想说的时候自然会开口。"

# game/script.rpy:195320
translate chinese map099_6a21233c:

    # voice "se/z00327.ogg"
    voice "se/z00327.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:195322
