    # char_fortaime "I have more to say though, so hold on.\nOur parents went to Mazeo together, as a group of friends.\nNow we're doing the same. And trust me, I'm worried."
    char_fortaime "不过我还有话要说，等等。\n我们的父母当年是一群朋友，一起去了马泽奥。\n现在我们也在做同样的事。相信我，我很担心。"

# game/script.rpy:195888
translate chinese map099_85529103:

    # voice "se/z00352.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "They got caught up in a fight, and we will too.\nBut I don't want to die. I want to save Alestia...\nSo promise me we'll stay together, right until the end." nointeract
    voice "se/z00352.ogg"
    char_fortaime "他们卷进了一场战斗，我们也会。\n但我不想死。我想拯救阿莱斯蒂亚……\n所以答应我，我们会一直在一起，直到最后。" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:195907
translate chinese map099_df2f091d:

    # voice "se/z00353.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "There we go, that's the spirit!\nWith that attitude, we'll never lose.\nNow let's get that blade, and head to Mazeo."
    voice "se/z00353.ogg"
    char_fortaime "这就对了，这才像话！\n有这种心态，我们绝不会输。\n现在去取那把剑，然后出发去马泽奥。"

# game/script.rpy:195926
translate chinese map099_b4d98eba:

    # voice "se/z00354.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "But we're still friends, right...?\nAnd no matter what, friends stick together.\nSo let's get that blade, and head to Mazeo."
    voice "se/z00354.ogg"
    char_fortaime "但我们还是朋友，对吧……？\n不管发生什么，朋友都会并肩同行。\n所以，我们去拿那把剑，然后前往马泽奥。"

# game/script.rpy:195945
translate chinese map099_7593b742:

    # voice "se/z00355.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "Oh, I guess I see things differently.\nI have no problem protecting you if things get hairy.\nLet's get that blade, then. We'll take this step-by-step."
    voice "se/z00355.ogg"
    char_fortaime "哦，看来我的想法不太一样。\n要是事情变得棘手，我保护你也没问题。\n那就去拿那把剑吧。我们一步一步来。"

# game/script.rpy:195966
translate chinese map099_59b91780:

    # voice "se/z00356.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "Well, it's not like we're saving the world or anything.\nI know I make a lot of jokes, but I was being serious!\nI guess we can talk on the way. Let's get that blade."
    voice "se/z00356.ogg"
    char_fortaime "好吧，又不是说我们在拯救世界什么的。\n我知道我平时爱开玩笑，但刚才我是认真的！\n我们可以路上再聊。去拿那把剑吧。"

# game/script.rpy:195985
translate chinese map099_546fa7df:

    # voice "se/z00357.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "Nothing to say? Really?\nOh well, I guess I was hoping for too much.\nLet's get that blade. We'll talk more on the way."
    voice "se/z00357.ogg"
    char_fortaime "没什么要说的？真的？\n算了，看来是我期望太高了。\n去拿那把剑吧。路上再多聊。"

