    char_valessa "其实，我想我找到了自己的目标。\n我要为守护最亲近的朋友而战。\n所以，那个约定呢？我会一直在这里。直到最后。"

# game/script.rpy:196068
translate chinese map099_e19f7d0e:

    # "I nod, and they smile at one another.{w}\nA few moments later, we continue our trek to The Grand Tree.{w}\nThis time, however, we reach our goal with no interruptions."
    "我点点头，她们相视一笑。{w}\n片刻之后，我们继续向巨树跋涉。{w}\n不过这一次，我们一路无阻地抵达了目的地。"

# game/script.rpy:196099
translate chinese map100_547fd3a6:

    # "As soon as we enter, we all spread out.{w}\nPerhaps covering more ground would help us find it easier.{w}\nHowever, much to our surprise, it's out in the open."
    "我们一进去，便四下散开。{w}\n也许搜寻的范围越大，就越容易找到它。{w}\n然而，出乎我们意料，它竟就摆在明处。"

# game/script.rpy:196129
