    # "It's wrapped up in a sack, in front of The Grand Tree's altar.{w}\nThe general shape and size was easily discernable to me.{w}\nIt was the instrument of my death, and Valinorth's destruction."
    "它被裹在一个布袋里，就放在巨树的祭坛前。{w}\n它的大致形状与大小，我一眼便能辨认。{w}\n那是夺走我性命、毁灭瓦利诺斯的凶器。"

# game/script.rpy:196184
