# game/script.rpy:196332
translate chinese map100_b12d7258:

    # "I kneel down and pull off the letter, breaking some adhesive.{w}\nIt's from Mylus, and it gives us a bit more information.{w}\nNone of us have really left Valinorth, so guidance is helpful."
    "我跪下来撕下信纸，扯开了些许黏胶。{w}\n信是迈勒斯写的，给了我们一些补充信息。{w}\n我们谁都没真正离开过瓦利诺斯，所以指点很有帮助。"

# game/script.rpy:196374
translate chinese map100_e8f20adf:

    # "I put the letter in my pocket, and look at Fortaime and Valessa.{w}\nIt seems that our next objective was clear. Much better than before.{w}\nIf Mylus simply threw us into the wild, we'd get lost immediately."
    "我把信揣进口袋，看向福泰姆和瓦莱莎。{w}\n看来我们的下一个目标很明确了。比之前清楚多了。{w}\n要是迈勒斯就这么把我们扔进荒野，我们立马就会迷路。"

# game/script.rpy:196404
