# game/script.rpy:196436
translate chinese map100_4dc1dfad:

    # char_fortaime "Or maybe it's a title for whoever wields it.\nYou know, something like Seer or Seeress.\nWhat about it...? Should we call you Exodus?" nointeract
    char_fortaime "或者是持有者的称号。\n你知道的，就像先知那样的名号。\n怎么样……？要不我们叫你“放逐者”？" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:196464
translate chinese map100_a1b6292b:

    # voice "se/z00368.ogg"
    # char_valessa "Yeah, I agree!\nWe want to blend in, not stand out.\nThat would be like walking around with a huge label."
    voice "se/z00368.ogg"
    char_valessa "对，我同意！\n我们要的是融入人群，而不是引人注目。\n那就像走到哪儿都顶着个大标签一样。"

# game/script.rpy:196493
translate chinese map100_4cdf220f:

    # voice "se/z00369.ogg"
    # char_valessa "Don't tell me you're considering it...?\nCome on, we need to blend in, not stand out.\nMight as well put a huge label on yourself."
    voice "se/z00369.ogg"
    char_valessa "别告诉我你真在考虑……？\n得了吧，我们需要融入人群，而不是引人注目。\n那还不如直接给自己贴个大标签。"

# game/script.rpy:196522
translate chinese map100_b2dde017:

    # voice "se/z00370.ogg"
    # char_valessa "Yeah, especially if The Triumvirate wants it back.\nWalking around as Exodus would put a huge target on us.\nThat's not something we can afford if we want to blend in."
    voice "se/z00370.ogg"
    char_valessa "是啊，尤其三人执政团还想把它夺回去。\n顶着“放逐者”的名号到处走，会让我们成为活靶子。\n想融入人群，我们可负担不起这个。"

# game/script.rpy:196550
