    # char_fortaime "Alright, alright. Forget I suggested it.\nLet's get out of here before we waste too much time.\nWe're supposed to meet someone named Zamira, right?"
    char_fortaime "好吧好吧，当我没提议过。\n趁还没浪费太多时间，我们赶紧离开这儿。\n我们要去见一个叫扎米拉的人，对吧？"

# game/script.rpy:196579
