    # char_fortaime "Yeah. None of us have ever left Valinorth before.\nI'm sure it'll be great. We can even check out Sauleberg!\nGrab the blade, [firstname]. The villagers would never question you."
    char_fortaime "是啊。我们谁都没离开过瓦利诺斯。\n肯定会很棒的。我们甚至还能去看看索尔伯格！\n拿起那把剑吧，[firstname]。村民们绝不会质疑你的。"

# game/script.rpy:196644
translate chinese map100_b69e3466:

    # "I nod. As the Seer, they wouldn't care what I carried.{w}\nBut I can understand if they saw an outsider with this blade.{w}\nMylus' plan of using Zamira was definitely the best course of action."
    "我点点头。身为先知，他们不会在意我带着什么。{w}\n但我也能理解，若是他们看到外人拿着这把剑会作何感想。{w}\n迈勒斯利用扎米拉的计划，无疑是最佳之策。"

# game/script.rpy:196649
translate chinese map100_e6ff3a92:

    # "I nod. As the Seeress, they wouldn't care what I carried.{w}\nBut I can understand if they saw an outsider with this blade.{w}\nMylus' plan of using Zamira was definitely the best course of action."
    "我点点头。身为女先知，他们不会在意我带着什么。{w}\n但我也能理解，若是他们看到外人拿着这把剑会作何感想。{w}\n迈勒斯利用扎米拉的计划，无疑是最佳之策。"

# game/script.rpy:196656
translate chinese map100_f0b84fdd:

    # "As we venture to Mazeo, however, some people might stare.{w}\nBut we're in a group, so I doubt they'd try anything.{w}\nI pity the person who picked a fight with the Blade of Exodus."
    "不过，当我们前往马泽奥时，或许会有人盯着看。{w}\n但我们结伴而行，我想他们不敢轻举妄动。{w}\n敢跟放逐之刃动手的人，我倒是要同情他了。"

# game/script.rpy:196662
translate chinese map100_9caffae2:

    # "I carefully unwrap the package.{w}\nThe sight of the weapon causes me to tense up.{w}\nI can almost feel the pain of last night's vision."
    "我小心翼翼地拆开包裹。{w}\n一看到那件武器，我便浑身紧绷。{w}\n昨夜幻象中的痛楚，几乎又涌上心头。"

# game/script.rpy:196668
translate chinese map100_4923e228:

    # "Valessa and Fortaime look down, seeing it for the first time.{w}\nI exchange glances with them, before my eyes return to the blade.{w}\nI grip it for the first time, and that's when everything changes."
    "瓦莱莎和福泰姆低下头，第一次见到它。{w}\n我与他们对视一眼，随后目光又落回剑上。{w}\n我第一次握住了它，而就在那一刻，一切都变了。"

# game/script.rpy:196684
translate chinese map100_7272e6e4:

    # "With a blinding flash of white light, I fall back.{w}\nLanding on the floor, I'm unable to see, or move.{w}\nIt isn't much longer until I can't breathe, either."
    "一道刺目的白光闪过，我向后倒去。{w}\n摔在地上，我既看不见，也动弹不得。{w}\n没过多久，我连呼吸都做不到了。"

# game/script.rpy:196686
translate chinese map100_3f7473f9:

    # "I hear Valessa and Fortaime call out to me.{w}\nBut as my senses are robbed, their shouts slowly fade.{w}\nA series of visions plays out before me, and I can do little but watch."
    "我听见瓦莱莎和福泰姆在呼唤我。{w}\n可随着我的感官被剥夺，他们的呼喊也渐渐远去。{w}\n一幕幕幻象在我眼前上演，而我只能眼睁睁看着。"

# game/script.rpy:196710
translate chinese map100_b14349d7:

    # voice "se/z00375.ogg"
    voice "se/z00375.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:196716
translate chinese map100_7bdddaec:

    # char_jit_map100_1_0_309 "You mean this was all just a trap!?\nNo, I don't believe it. I'm not giving up!"
    char_jit_map100_1_0_309 "你是说这一切都只是个陷阱！？\n不，我不信。我绝不放弃！"

# game/script.rpy:196742
translate chinese map100_85bc6fc0:

    # voice "se/z00376.ogg"
    voice "se/z00376.ogg"

