translate chinese map100_4d545bd1:

    # char_jit_map100_1_0_319 "To think all of that was stored in {i}this{/i}.\nAfter we tell the people, everything will change."
    char_jit_map100_1_0_319 "没想到那么多东西，就封存在{i}这{/i}里面。\n等我们告诉民众之后，一切都会改变。"

