    # char_jit_map100_1_0_329 "We will aid you in this fight.\nBut you are no longer a Rebellion.\nToday, you become something {i}much{/i} more."
    char_jit_map100_1_0_329 "我们会在这场战斗中助你一臂之力。\n但你们不再是反抗军了。\n从今天起，你们将成为{i}远为{/i}不凡的存在。"

# game/script.rpy:196806
translate chinese map100_6fa2f088:

    # voice "se/z00378.ogg"
    voice "se/z00378.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:196812
translate chinese map100_7556421e:

    # char_jit_map100_1_0_340 "Wait! Think about what you're doing!\nWithout us, there {i}is{/i} no freedom...!"
    char_jit_map100_1_0_340 "等等！想想你在做什么！\n没有我们，就{i}根本{/i}没有自由……！"

# game/script.rpy:196838
translate chinese map100_99aa1dec:

    # voice "se/z00379.ogg"
    voice "se/z00379.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:196844
translate chinese map100_c2a46f76:

    # char_jit_map100_1_0_350 "Don't worry. Nothing personal.\nJust playing with the hand I've been dealt."
    char_jit_map100_1_0_350 "别担心。不是针对你。\n只是打好我手里的这副牌罢了。"

# game/script.rpy:196855
translate chinese map100_a6de41bc:

    # "The shadowed man approaches me, with a dagger in his hand.{w}\nI can't fight back. I can just watch as he sinks it into my gut.{w}\nSoon after, I'm paralyzed on the ground. I can hear him laughing."
    "那阴影中的男人手持匕首向我走来。{w}\n我无力反抗，只能眼看他把刀刺进我的腹部。{w}\n紧接着，我瘫倒在地，耳边是他放肆的笑声。"

# game/script.rpy:196887
translate chinese map100_1bfbbad9:

    # "I gasp for air as I grip the spot where he stabbed me.{w}\nValessa and Fortaime let out huge sighs of relief.{w}\nIn my other hand, I hold the Blade of Exodus tightly."
    "我喘着粗气，捂住被刺中的地方。{w}\n瓦莱莎和福泰姆长长地松了一口气。{w}\n我的另一只手里，紧紧攥着放逐之刃。"

# game/script.rpy:196889
translate chinese map100_c4ef669b:

    # "I throw it across the room, as I slowly regain my breath.{w}\nThey help me rise to a sitting position, the concern on their faces clear.{w}\nThankfully, I'm able to relax before they decide to question me."
    "我把它扔到房间另一头，慢慢缓过气来。{w}\n他们扶我坐起身，脸上的担忧显而易见。{w}\n幸好，在他们开口追问之前，我先放松了下来。"

