    # char_valessa "Maybe Mylus knew that touching it was risky.\nIf you wear this outfit, you can sheathe the blade.\nIt might be best to conceal it, and minimize contact."
    char_valessa "也许迈勒斯知道碰它是件危险的事。\n穿上这套衣服，你就能把剑收进鞘里。\n最好把它藏起来，尽量减少接触。"

