# game/script.rpy:197189
translate chinese map100_3c47dfd3:

    # "She tilts her head to an alcove at the back of The Grand Tree.{w}\nI guess it would provide sufficient privacy, so I grab the clothes.{w}\nThey turn their backs to me as an extra gesture of consideration."
    "她朝巨树后方的一个壁龛偏了偏头。{w}\n那里应该足够隐蔽，于是我拿起衣服。{w}\n他们转过身去，算是额外的体贴。"

# game/script.rpy:197191
translate chinese map100_afc8c864:

    # "It looks like a mixture of Valessa and Fortaime's outfit.{w}\nMade of flexible material, it was clearly ready for a fight.{w}\nThe scabbard is adjustable. I could position it for my dominant hand."
    "它看起来像是瓦莱莎和福泰姆服装的结合。{w}\n用料柔韧，一看就是为战斗而备。{w}\n剑鞘可以调节。我可以按惯用手来调整位置。"

# game/script.rpy:197202
translate chinese map100_d2ce230a:

    # "I tilt it to the left, for easy access with my left hand.{w}\nNot that I expected to be touching the blade all too often.{w}\nWhen the rest of the outfit is on, I walk back out in the open."
    "我把它调到左侧，方便左手取用。{w}\n倒也不是说我打算经常碰那把剑。{w}\n穿戴整齐后，我重新走回空地。"

# game/script.rpy:197208
translate chinese map100_9c5fd793:

    # "I tilt it to the right, for easy access with my right hand.{w}\nNot that I expected to be touching the blade all too often.{w}\nWhen the rest of the outfit is on, I walk back out in the open."
    "我把它调到右侧，方便右手取用。{w}\n倒也不是说我打算经常碰那把剑。{w}\n穿戴整齐后，我重新走回空地。"

# game/script.rpy:197242
