    # voice "se/z00393.ogg"
    voice "se/z00393.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:197282
translate chinese map100_a7417afa:

    # char_valessa "That's everything we need, then?\nI mean, aside from the blade."
    char_valessa "那我们需要的东西都齐了？\n我是说，除了那把剑。"

# game/script.rpy:197293
translate chinese map100_f07cc16e:

    # "We all look to where I threw it earlier.{w}\nBefore we left, I'd have to touch it again.{w}\nI can sense the anxiety within my friends."
    "我们都看向先前我把它扔出去的地方。{w}\n离开之前，我还得再碰它一次。{w}\n我能感觉到朋友们心中的不安。"

# game/script.rpy:197323
translate chinese map100_12d88e11:

    # voice "se/z00394.ogg"
    voice "se/z00394.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:197325
translate chinese map100_30bce74b:

    # char_fortaime "Look. Whatever happens, we're here for you.\nI doubt it'll be as bad as last time, and you're fine."
    char_fortaime "听着。无论发生什么，我们都在你身边。\n我想不会像上次那么糟，而且你现在也没事。"

# game/script.rpy:197349
translate chinese map100_bf9fb11b:

    # "He could've worded that a bit better, but there was truth to it.{w}\nIt was such a shock last time because I didn't expect it at all.{w}\nBut I was the Seer of Valinorth. I was meant to wield this blade."
    "他这话说得不太中听，但也不无道理。{w}\n上次之所以那么震惊，是因为我毫无防备。{w}\n但我是瓦利诺斯的先知。这把剑本就该由我来执掌。"

# game/script.rpy:197354
translate chinese map100_612c1ed4:

    # "He could've worded that a bit better, but there was truth to it.{w}\nIt was such a shock last time because I didn't expect it at all.{w}\nBut I was the Seeress of Valinorth. I was meant to wield this blade."
    "他这话说得不太中听，但也不无道理。{w}\n上次之所以那么震惊，是因为我毫无防备。{w}\n但我是瓦利诺斯的女先知。这把剑本就该由我来执掌。"

# game/script.rpy:197358
translate chinese map100_ce4fe217:

    # "I slowly walk towards it, kneeling down when I get there.{w}\nWhatever happened this time, I wouldn't let it control me.{w}\nAs I grab it, I remind myself that I am one with the spirits."
    "我缓步走向它，到跟前便跪了下来。{w}\n无论这次会发生什么，我都不会被它左右。{w}\n握住它的那一刻，我提醒自己：我与灵体同在。"

# game/script.rpy:197375
translate chinese map100_7be9c848:

    # "The white light overtakes me again, but that's all.{w}\nI can still move, breathe, and sense my surroundings.{w}\nDeep within me, I feel a connection defying explanation."
    "白光再次将我笼罩，但也仅此而已。{w}\n我仍能活动、呼吸，感知周围的一切。{w}\n在内心深处，我感到一种无法言说的连结。"

# game/script.rpy:197377
translate chinese map100_2def0542:

    # "It's beautiful, and I'd like to stay this way forever.{w}\nUnfortunately, the feeling soon turns into something more.{w}\nIn a matter of seconds, the source of beauty is one of fright."
    "那感觉很美，我愿永远如此。{w}\n可惜，这份感觉很快变成了别的东西。{w}\n不过几秒，美好的源泉便成了恐惧的源头。"

# game/script.rpy:197379
translate chinese map100_4354d962:

