# game/script.rpy:197570
translate chinese map100_76a5ca08:

    # "A new feature, Party Banter, has been unlocked.{w}\nFollowing this text box, a brief tutorial will display.{w}\nPrevious areas of Valinorth have been updated."
    "新功能“队伍闲聊”已解锁。{w}\n本对话框之后，将显示一段简短的教学。{w}\n瓦利诺斯先前的区域已更新。"

# game/script.rpy:197590
translate chinese map100_e8b2411f:

    # "You can now leave Valinorth via the world map.{w}\nClicking the icon near EXIT, will meet up with Zamira.{w}\nThe icon leading to Main Street will function as normal."
    "现在你可以通过世界地图离开瓦利诺斯了。{w}\n点击“出口”附近的图标，就能与扎米拉会合。{w}\n通往主街的图标功能照常。"

# game/script.rpy:197952
translate chinese click_map102_8_EV008_3612648c:

    # "This looks like the perfect place to rest.{w}\nI have a seat, and try taking in everything I can.{w}\nIn such a short period of time, everything changed.{w}\nI hope that we're able to set things right."
    "这里看起来是绝佳的歇脚之处。{w}\n我坐下来，尽量把眼前的一切都收入眼底。{w}\n如此短暂的时间里，一切都变了。{w}\n但愿我们能让一切重回正轨。"

# game/script.rpy:197989
translate chinese click_map102_9_EV009_363e8a18:

    # "A faint glow comes from the back of The Grand Tree.{w}\nProbably an indicator of spiritual energy inside.{w}\nBut after what Mylus told us, I wonder how much is left."
    "巨树的后方透出微弱的光芒。{w}\n大概是内部灵力的一种征兆。{w}\n但听完迈勒斯的话，我不禁怀疑还剩多少。"

# game/script.rpy:198026
translate chinese click_map102_10_EV010_2ef14ca3:

    # "This isn't a spirit idol, but it looks similar to one.{w}\nPerhaps the energy present caused a small one to grow.{w}\nIt seems to defy physics, floating and rotating.{w}\nThe perpetual motion is actually entrancing."
    "这不是灵像，但外形与之相似。{w}\n也许是此处的灵力催生出了一个小小的灵像。{w}\n它悬浮旋转，仿佛不受物理法则约束。{w}\n这种永恒的运动，竟令人着迷。"

# game/script.rpy:198063
translate chinese click_map102_11_EV011_9a2f7286:

    # "This is it. This is where I grabbed The Blade of Exodus.{w}\nWhere I saw those visions, and the future to come.{w}\nAs a Seer of Valinorth, only I could wield it.{w}\nI was to be the instrument of Alestia's liberation."
    "就是这里。我就是在这里握住了放逐之刃。{w}\n在这里，我看到了那些幻象，以及即将到来的未来。{w}\n身为瓦利诺斯的先知，只有我能执掌它。{w}\n我注定要成为解放阿莱斯蒂亚的利器。"

