translate chinese map096_a9673a9e:

    # "Shane paced around his prison cell, feeling the walls.{w}\nLooking for any structural weaknesses, anything he could use.{w}\nHe'd been in here far too long, and the isolation was messing with him."
    "肖恩在牢房里来回踱步，摸索着墙壁。{w}\n寻找任何结构上的薄弱处，任何能利用的东西。{w}\n他被关在这里太久了，与世隔绝让他快疯了。"

