    # char_shane "Come on Shane, there's gotta be something.\nYou were supposed to break out of here ages ago.\nThis mission is a bust. Damek must be worried sick."
    char_shane "振作点，肖恩，总会有办法的。\n你早就该逃出去了。\n这次任务砸了。达梅克一定担心坏了。"

# game/script.rpy:198413
translate chinese map096_18bab57a:

    # "He knocked on the hard wall of the cell, and found nothing.{w}\nHe'd been here ever since Damek assumed control of The Rebellion.{w}\nHis objective was to get caught on purpose, and scan their castle.{w}\nBut his intel would do little good if this was his final resting place."
    "他敲了敲牢房坚硬的墙壁，一无所获。{w}\n自达梅克接管反抗军以来，他就一直被关在这里。{w}\n他的任务就是故意被捕，再探查他们的城堡。{w}\n可要是这里成了他的葬身之地，那情报就毫无意义了。"

# game/script.rpy:198443
