# game/script.rpy:199336
translate chinese click_map101_5_EV005_59b69979:

    # "I look off the side of the bridge, and shiver.{w}\nIt's higher than you'd think, that's for sure.{w}\nThe grass is almost as tall as a fully grown man.{w}\nFalling down there? Now {i}that{/i} would be scary."
    "我朝桥边望去，不禁打了个寒颤。{w}\n这桥比你想的要高得多，这是肯定的。{w}\n下面的草几乎有成年人那么高。{w}\n摔下去？那{i}才{/i}叫可怕。"

# game/script.rpy:199339
translate chinese click_map101_5_EV005_a563d40c:

    # voice "se/a00045.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "Look, you can see some of the roots...!\nThey say The Grand Tree reaches all over Alestia.\nIn that way, Valinorth is connected to everything."
    voice "se/a00045.ogg"
    char_fortaime "看，能看到一些树根……！\n据说巨树的根系遍及整个阿莱斯蒂亚。\n这样说来，瓦利诺斯与万物都相连。"

# game/script.rpy:199377
translate chinese click_map101_7_EV007_7a09145b:

    # "The trees go on forever, but they are all small in comparison.{w}\nThe Grand Tree looms above all else, and it's incredible.{w}\nI can't see how far back they go, but some sun rays shine through.{w}\nFrom here, it looks as if all of Alestia is one large forest."
    "树林绵延无尽，但相比之下都显得矮小。{w}\n巨树高耸于万物之上，令人叹为观止。{w}\n我看不清它们延伸到多远，但有几缕阳光透了下来。{w}\n从这里望去，整个阿莱斯蒂亚仿佛就是一片巨大的森林。"

# game/script.rpy:199414
translate chinese click_map101_8_EV008_f3d949e8:

    # "These posts guide you to The Grand Tree's entrance.{w}\nThere isn't much upkeep given to the grass on the sides.{w}\nIf you jumped off, you'd be fully submerged in grass.{w}\nIt might not look like it, but this is a high bridge."
    "这些立柱指引着通往巨树入口的路。{w}\n两侧的杂草没怎么打理。{w}\n要是跳下去，你会整个陷进草里。{w}\n也许看不太出来，但这是座高桥。"

# game/script.rpy:199451
translate chinese click_map101_9_EV009_f3d949e8:

    # "These posts guide you to The Grand Tree's entrance.{w}\nThere isn't much upkeep given to the grass on the sides.{w}\nIf you jumped off, you'd be fully submerged in grass.{w}\nIt might not look like it, but this is a high bridge."
    "这些立柱指引着通往巨树入口的路。{w}\n两侧的杂草没怎么打理。{w}\n要是跳下去，你会整个陷进草里。{w}\n也许看不太出来，但这是座高桥。"

# game/script.rpy:199488
translate chinese click_map101_10_EV010_0f45bd25:

    # "This bridge leads all the way to The Grand Tree.{w}\nIt's a farther walk than it looks, that's for sure.{w}\nTownspeople pitch in to make sure it's always stable.{w}\nWouldn't want the bridge to break halfway across."
    "这座桥一直通向巨树。{w}\n走起来比看起来远得多，这是肯定的。{w}\n镇民们出力维护，确保它始终稳固。{w}\n可不想走到半路桥塌了。"

# game/script.rpy:199525
translate chinese click_map101_11_EV011_973ad809:

    # "Without a doubt, the most impressive sight in Valinorth.{w}\nNo one knows just how high The Grand Tree grows.{w}\nBut the bottom of it is hollow, and easily accessed.{w}\nIt became a sacred ground for Seers and Scribes to meet."
    "毫无疑问，这是瓦利诺斯最令人震撼的景象。{w}\n没人知道巨树究竟能长多高。{w}\n但它的底部中空，很容易进入。{w}\n这里成了先知与书记官会面的圣地。"

# game/script.rpy:199530
translate chinese click_map101_11_EV011_67ae78c4:

    # voice "se/a00046.ogg"
    voice "se/a00046.ogg"

