translate chinese click_map101_11_EV011_357c272e:

    # char_fortaime "Mark my words, [firstname].\nOne day I'm going to climb The Grand Tree.\nIt's my calling, I can feel it...!"
    char_fortaime "记住我的话，[firstname]。\n总有一天我要爬上巨树。\n这是我的使命，我能感觉到……！"

