# game/script.rpy:199576
translate chinese click_map101_12_EV012_4dc8135e:

    # "You can see the tint of the leaves start to change.{w}\nThe higher up you go, the more crimson they get.{w}\nBloodleaves grow at the top of The Grand Tree.{w}\nNo one knows the reason for this phenomenon."
    "你能看到叶片的色泽开始变化。{w}\n越往上，越是深红。{w}\n血叶生长在巨树的顶端。{w}\n没人知道这种现象的缘由。"

# game/script.rpy:199653
translate chinese map094_270ffe56:

    # "We enter Mylus' House with an aura of purpose.{w}\nThough they didn't know what I saw, they knew it was important.{w}\nWe see him shuffling papers at his table, oblivious to our existence."
    "我们带着一股郑重其事的气息走进迈勒斯家。{w}\n尽管他们不知道我看到了什么，却知道那很重要。{w}\n他正在桌边翻弄纸张，丝毫没注意到我们。"

# game/script.rpy:199683
translate chinese map094_e5e09e46:

    # voice "se/z00251.ogg"
    voice "se/z00251.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:199685
translate chinese map094_d4deb2a6:

    # char_valessa "Hey, Mylus...\nWe need to have a word."
    char_valessa "嘿，迈勒斯……\n我们得跟你谈谈。"

# game/script.rpy:199708
translate chinese map094_99b96e3f:

    # "He doesn't seem to respond, and continues his business.{w}\nFortaime seems anxious, and taps his foot on the floor.{w}\nA few moments later, Valessa gives up and interjects."
    "他似乎没有回应，继续忙自己的事。{w}\n福泰姆显得焦躁，脚尖不停点地。{w}\n片刻之后，瓦莱莎放弃等待，插了话。"

# game/script.rpy:199738
translate chinese map094_ae57747c:

    # voice "se/z00252.ogg"
    voice "se/z00252.ogg"

