    # char_valessa "Mylus, snap out of it!\nWe need to talk about something important!"
    char_valessa "迈勒斯，清醒一点！\n我们有重要的事要谈！"

# game/script.rpy:199763
translate chinese map094_ce432f07:

    # "She slams a fist down on the table, startling Mylus.{w}\nHe jumps back a few feet in fright, and then laughs.{w}\nWhatever he was looking at, it fully engrossed him."
    "她一拳头砸在桌上，惊得迈勒斯一跳。{w}\n他吓得后退了几步，随即笑了起来。{w}\n不管他刚才在看什么，都让他全神贯注。"

# game/script.rpy:199790
