    voice "se/z00253.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:199793
translate chinese map094_8f7a97ff:

    # char_mylus "You know what they say about death, right...?\nWhen we die, we go on to live in the realm of spirits.\nWith that logic, spiritual energy should be infinite."
    char_mylus "你知道关于死亡的传说吧……？\n我们死后，灵会在灵界继续存续。\n按这个逻辑，灵力本应无穷无尽。"

# game/script.rpy:199820
translate chinese map094_3dedd3a3:

    # voice "se/z00254.ogg"
    voice "se/z00254.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:199822
translate chinese map094_79f6aeb0:

    # char_valessa "I'm not really sure how to respond to that...?\nI mean, we've had Seers and Scribes for thousands of years.\nI'm pretty sure we'll have them for thousands more to come."
    char_valessa "我真不知道该怎么回应你……？\n我是说，先知和书记官已经存在了几千年。\n我相信往后几千年的光景也不例外。"

# game/script.rpy:199839
translate chinese map094_efe43380:

    # voice "se/z00255.ogg"
    # char_mylus "Wouldn't that be beautiful...?\nSorry for rambling, but we should all have a seat.\nI'm afraid things aren't going to go as planned."
    voice "se/z00255.ogg"
    char_mylus "那该多好啊……？\n抱歉我扯远了，不过我们都坐下来吧。\n恐怕事情不会按计划发展了。"

# game/script.rpy:199863
translate chinese map094_a265672f:

    # "He motions to the back of his house, a carpeted area.{w}\nWith no chairs in sight, it looks like we'd be sitting on the floor.{w}\nWe make our way over there, questioning just what he meant."
    "他示意我们到他家后方铺着地毯的一角。{w}\n那里看不到椅子，看来我们得坐在地上。{w}\n我们走过去，心里琢磨着他那话到底是什么意思。"

