    # "Fortaime is fuming with anger, and very upset.{w}\nI guess Mylus was right, plans have changed.{w}\nBut the timing, along with my vision, was odd."
    "福泰姆气得冒烟，满心愤懑。{w}\n看来迈勒斯说得没错，计划有变。{w}\n但这时机，再加上我的幻象，实在蹊跷。"

