# game/script.rpy:200096
translate chinese map094_d0a51cf2:

    # "I take a deep breath, as we all sit down.{w}\nThat was the moment I told them everything.{w}\nHow Valinorth was destroyed by The Triumvirate."
    "我们都坐下时，我深吸了一口气。{w}\n就在那一刻，我把一切都告诉了他们。{w}\n瓦利诺斯是如何被三人执政团毁灭的。"

# game/script.rpy:200098
translate chinese map094_cb655eb6:

    # "I told them about the blaze, and the agony.{w}\nHow the man who led the attack had a mystical blade.{w}\nNot only did it kill Ulric, but it killed me as well."
    "我向他们讲述了那场大火，那份痛苦。{w}\n讲述了领头之人手持一把神秘之剑。{w}\n它不仅杀了乌尔里克，也杀了我。"

# game/script.rpy:200100
translate chinese map094_a0a1757e:

    # "When I finish my story, I'm met with silence.{w}\nThey look amongst themselves, in shock and confusion.{w}\nThat's fine. It was a lot to process all at once."
    "我讲完后，迎接我的是一片沉默。{w}\n他们面面相觑，震惊又困惑。{w}\n没关系。一下子要消化的东西太多了。"

