    # char_mylus "It is, and unfortunately it's just the start.\nBut there are still some important matters at hand.\nBefore I send you off, I'll tell you everything."
    char_mylus "是真的，而且可惜这只是个开始。\n但眼下还有几件要紧的事。\n在送你们出发之前，我会把一切都告诉你们。"

# game/script.rpy:200301
translate chinese map094_db0548a3:

    # "He smiles at each of us before taking a deep breath.{w}\nI notice large bags under his eyes, signs of unrest.{w}\nHe must've been living with this secret for a while."
    "他冲我们每个人笑了笑，然后深吸一口气。{w}\n我注意到他眼下浓重的黑眼圈，是寝食难安的痕迹。{w}\n他一定独自守着这个秘密很久了。"

# game/script.rpy:200322
