    # char_mylus "I didn't want to tell you until you needed to know.\nI'm just lucky that this vision waited until I was ready.\nThe Triumvirate wants to occupy Valinorth, as they did Mazeo."
    char_mylus "在你们需要知道之前，我本不想说。\n幸好这个幻象一直等到我准备妥当才出现。\n三人执政团想占领瓦利诺斯，就像他们对待马泽奥那样。"

# game/script.rpy:200339
translate chinese map094_2dd00c3e:

    # voice "se/z00269.ogg"
    voice "se/z00269.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:200341
