    # char_mylus "I know what you three lost in Mazeo, and I'm sorry.\nBut what they plan to bring to Valinorth is far, far worse.\nPunishment for my Father's involvement with The Rebellion."
    char_mylus "我知道你们三个在马泽奥失去了什么，我很抱歉。\n但他们打算带给瓦利诺斯的，要糟糕得多。\n那是对我父亲参与反抗军的惩罚。"

# game/script.rpy:200364
translate chinese map094_fdc8b2fc:

    # "Just like that empty armor seemed to imply.{w}\nSo Valinorth {i}did{/i} have some relation to The Rebellion.{w}\nAnd it wasn't just during Mylus' short reign, either."
    "正如那副空铠甲似乎暗示的那样。{w}\n所以瓦利诺斯{i}确实{/i}与反抗军有些关联。{w}\n而且还不只是在迈勒斯短暂的执政期间。"

