translate chinese map094_ba0b4245:

    # char_valessa "Yeah, you're right.\nWe'd do the same thing even if Mylus didn't tell us to.\nFind something to defend ourselves with, and leave Valinorth."
    char_valessa "是啊，你说得对。\n就算迈勒斯不说，我们也会这么做。\n找点东西防身，然后离开瓦利诺斯。"

# game/script.rpy:201402
translate chinese map094_55b2fef8:

    # voice "se/z00318.ogg"
    voice "se/z00318.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:201404
translate chinese map094_b6cd38d1:

    # char_valessa "But he said the spirits gave you all their power?\nAnd they cut their influence from Valinorth for good?\nThis changes Alestia's entire history, not just our actions."
    char_valessa "但他说灵体把全部力量都给了你？\n还永久切断了他们在瓦利诺斯的影响？\n这改变的是整个阿莱斯蒂亚的历史，而不只是我们的行动。"

# game/script.rpy:201419
translate chinese map094_bbe08870:

    # voice "se/z00319.ogg"
    voice "se/z00319.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:201421
translate chinese map094_968fb64d:

    # char_valessa "I can't say I fully understand, but it makes sense.\nMylus' Father foresaw all of this, and took action.\nI feel hatred. But at the same time, I feel hope."
    char_valessa "我不能说我完全明白，但这也说得通。\n迈勒斯的父亲预见了这一切，并采取了行动。\n我心中有恨。但与此同时，也怀有希望。"

# game/script.rpy:201448
translate chinese map094_7b0f7a71:

    # voice "se/z00320.ogg"
    voice "se/z00320.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:201450
translate chinese map094_1049f6ad:

    # char_fortaime "Let's take this one step at a time, Valessa.\nWe'll grab the weapon, and make our way out of here.\nThe rest can fall into place as we move on."
    char_fortaime "我们一步一步来吧，瓦莱莎。\n先拿到武器，再想办法离开这里。\n其余的，边走边看自然会有头绪。"

# game/script.rpy:201473
translate chinese map094_cfdbee56:

    # "We nod, and we stand up as well.{w}\nWith an attack on the way, we had to move.{w}\nMylus would take care of evacuating everyone else.{w}\nIf we got that blade first, Sovy couldn't use it."
    "我们点点头，也站起身来。{w}\n袭击将至，我们必须行动。{w}\n迈勒斯会负责疏散其他人。{w}\n只要我们抢先拿到那把剑，索维就用不了它。"

# game/script.rpy:201503
translate chinese map094_c0ae2468:

    # voice "se/z00321.ogg"
    voice "se/z00321.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:201505
translate chinese map094_469ce3f3:

    # char_valessa "So, to The Grand Tree, then?\nI'll try to maintain one modicum of sanity.\nIt's not like our lives were just turned around."
    char_valessa "那么，去巨树？\n我会尽量保持一丝理智。\n又不是说我们的生活刚刚天翻地覆了。"

# game/script.rpy:201532
translate chinese map094_ce463c3d:

    # voice "se/z00322.ogg"
    voice "se/z00322.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:201534
translate chinese map094_d6e45ad5:

    # char_fortaime "I'm sure we'll manage, as long as we're together...\nI'm not giving up on any of you, I promise."
    char_fortaime "只要我们在一起，我相信总能应付……\n我向你们保证，我不会放弃你们任何一个人。"

# game/script.rpy:201561
translate chinese map094_fecf4269:

    # voice "se/z00323.ogg"
    voice "se/z00323.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:201563
translate chinese map094_d5c0ae44:

    # char_fortaime "There's nothing we can't do if we all pitch in.\nLet's go to The Grand Tree, and get that blade!"
    char_fortaime "只要大家齐心协力，就没有办不到的事。\n走，去巨树，把那把剑拿到手！"

# game/script.rpy:202211
translate chinese click_map095_8_EV008_11bedf1c:

    # "Hmm..."
    "嗯……"

