    # voice "se/a00039.ogg"
    # char_valessa "Hey, it's a ladder!" nointeract
    voice "se/a00039.ogg"
    char_valessa "嘿，是架梯子！" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:202220
translate chinese click_map095_8_EV008_6a0fe907:

    # voice "se/ValGen07.ogg"
    # char_valessa "Hmm..."
    voice "se/ValGen07.ogg"
    char_valessa "嗯……"

# game/script.rpy:202225
translate chinese click_map095_8_EV008_11bedf1c_1:

    # "Hmm..."
    "嗯……"

# game/script.rpy:202263
translate chinese click_map095_9_EV009_13573d79:

    # "I wonder what Valinorth's future truly holds."
    "不知道瓦利诺斯的未来究竟会如何。"

# game/script.rpy:202324
translate chinese click_map095_9_EV009_efbf41c4:

    # "Mylus isn't using this desk, so I assume it's fair game.{w}\nI push aside a few papers, looking for anything of note.{w}\nA book on Sauleberg grabs my interest, as he brought it up.{w}\nApparently, the spirit idol there has stopped giving off energy."
    "迈勒斯没在用这张桌子，我想翻翻也无妨。{w}\n我拨开几张纸，寻找任何值得留意的东西。{w}\n一本关于索尔伯格的书引起了我的兴趣，毕竟他刚提起过。{w}\n看样子，那里的灵像已经不再释放灵力了。"

# game/script.rpy:202364
translate chinese click_map095_9_EV009_f8b1044b:

    # voice "se/a00043.ogg"
    voice "se/a00043.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:202366
translate chinese click_map095_9_EV009_007cf309:

    # char_fortaime "I had no idea that they were hiding such a secret.\nValinorth could run out of spiritual energy for good...?\nThe cold from Eastcrown could easily kill us off!"
    char_fortaime "我完全不知道他们还藏着这样的秘密。\n瓦利诺斯的灵力可能会彻底枯竭……？\n东冠的寒气轻易就能要了我们的命！"

# game/script.rpy:202369
translate chinese click_map095_9_EV009_e749991a:

    # voice "se/a00044.ogg"
    # char_valessa "Fortaime, don't worry.\nIt could be thousands of years before we run out.\nBesides, at this point, it's still conjecture."
    voice "se/a00044.ogg"
    char_valessa "福泰姆，别担心。\n也许还要几千年才会耗尽。\n再说，眼下这还只是猜测。"

# game/script.rpy:202393
translate chinese click_map095_10_EV010_fd4c5c03:

    # "It's a mess underneath the desk as well.{w}\nI guess Mylus has more pressing matters on his mind.{w}\nIt must've been relieving to tell us all that he did."
    "桌子底下也乱成一团。{w}\n看来迈勒斯心里有更要紧的事。{w}\n把那些都告诉我们，他一定松了口气。"

# game/script.rpy:202430
translate chinese click_map095_11_EV011_4840d42e:

    # "I look through all the books, but nothing seems interesting.{w}\nEverything that Mylus found worth in was already on the table.{w}\nThat, and on his little desk by the window facing Valinorth.{w}\nMust be great to live in a place with such a nice view."
    "我翻遍了所有的书，没什么有意思的。{w}\n迈勒斯觉得有价值的东西，都已经摆在桌上了。{w}\n还有窗边那张面向瓦利诺斯的小书桌上。{w}\n住在风景这么好的地方，一定很棒。"

# game/script.rpy:202467
translate chinese click_map095_12_EV012_8d110f63:

    # "It's a map of the known world, far on the back of the wall.{w}\nWe're in Valinorth, with Mazeo a little bit North of us.{w}\nTo the East of Mazeo is Alarinthia, and further north is Balteus.{w}\nI have a feeling we'd be going to Balteus, The Triumvirate's doorstep."
    "那是墙最里侧的一张已知世界地图。{w}\n我们在瓦利诺斯，马泽奥就在我们北边一点。{w}\n马泽奥以东是阿拉林西亚，再往北是巴尔泰乌斯。{w}\n我有种预感，我们会去巴尔泰乌斯——三人执政团的家门口。"

# game/script.rpy:202504
translate chinese click_map095_13_EV013_280a6f3e:

    # "The carpeted area is warm, next to a large fireplace.{w}\nOnly the most expensive homes in Valinorth have these.{w}\nScattered about the carpet are various trinkets and pipes.{w}\nI guess an Elder isn't mystical enough without a smoking pipe."
    "铺地毯的那一角挨着一座大壁炉，暖意融融。{w}\n瓦利诺斯只有最昂贵的宅邸才有这种配置。{w}\n地毯上散落着各种小玩意和烟斗。{w}\n看来长老少了根烟斗，就不够有神秘感。"

# game/script.rpy:202541
translate chinese click_map095_14_EV014_0e9dee6f:

    # "I can see the entire town from here, and it's beautiful.{w}\nI take a deep breath and admire the view, one final time.{w}\nThis might be the last time I see Valinorth fully intact.{w}\nWhen my vision came to pass, only ruin would remain here."
    "从这里能看见整个镇子，美极了。{w}\n我深吸一口气，最后一次欣赏这景色。{w}\n这也许是我最后一次见到完好无损的瓦利诺斯。{w}\n当我的幻象成真，这里只会剩下废墟。"

# game/script.rpy:202579
translate chinese click_map095_26_EV026_11316cbb:

    # "I've never been able to see the Bloodleaves fall.{w}\nMaybe one day, as I've heard it's quite the sight."
    "我从没见过血叶飘落。{w}\n也许有一天吧，听说那景象相当壮观。"

# game/script.rpy:202637
translate chinese click_map095_26_EV026_b3d150c9:

    # "I examine the table, looking at the scattered pieces of paper.{w}\nMylus is deep in his studies, and I'd really hate to bother him.{w}\nI want to read some as well, so I try to grab something he's put aside."
    "我端详着桌子，看着散落的纸张。{w}\n迈勒斯正埋头钻研，我实在不想打扰他。{w}\n我也想读一些，于是试着去拿他搁在一旁的东西。"

# game/script.rpy:202677
translate chinese click_map095_26_EV026_895e6e61:

    # voice "se/a00041.ogg"
    voice "se/a00041.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:202679
translate chinese click_map095_26_EV026_dabfe6d0:

    # char_fortaime "Eastcrown is a pretty scary place.\nI've thought about going there, but I'm too scared.\nApparently, it's cold enough to kill you in minutes!"
    char_fortaime "东冠是个相当可怕的地方。\n我想过去那儿，但胆子不够。\n据说那里冷得几分钟就能要命！"

# game/script.rpy:202682
translate chinese click_map095_26_EV026_23673be1:

    # voice "se/a00042.ogg"
    # char_valessa "\"The Fall of the Bloodleaves\" is beautiful though.\nI've seen it a couple times since I was born.\nNot sure what other purpose Eastcrown serves."
    voice "se/a00042.ogg"
    char_valessa "不过“血叶飘落”确实很美。\n我出生以来见过几次。\n不知道东冠还有别的什么用处。"

# game/script.rpy:202707
translate chinese click_map095_30_EV030_13573d79:

    # "I wonder what Valinorth's future truly holds."
    "不知道瓦利诺斯的未来究竟会如何。"

# game/script.rpy:202787
translate chinese Fortaime1_map095_143_0_bda70beb:

    # char_fortaime "Hey." nointeract
    char_fortaime "嘿。" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:202804
translate chinese Fortaime1_map095_143_0_619fbc5b:

    # voice "se/y00242.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "It's a little overwhelming, to be honest.\nI know I acted all cool, but I'm not really sure.\nI'm used to a simple life, and now that's all gone."
    voice "se/y00242.ogg"
    char_fortaime "说实话，有点让人招架不住。\n我知道我装作很淡定，其实心里没底。\n我习惯了简单的生活，如今一切都没了。"

# game/script.rpy:202810
translate chinese Fortaime1_map095_143_0_48c19fd0:

    # voice "se/y00243.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "As far as I know, Valinorth is the last spiritual nation.\nIf we lose our connection, what's going to happen?\nWill Alestia just be completely devoid of spirits?"
    voice "se/y00243.ogg"
    char_fortaime "据我所知，瓦利诺斯是最后一个灵性国度。\n要是我们失去了连结，会怎么样？\n阿莱斯蒂亚会彻底没有灵体吗？"

# game/script.rpy:202816
translate chinese Fortaime1_map095_143_0_aaf93e78:

    # voice "se/y00244.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "And not only that, but The Triumvirate being evil?\nAs far as I know, they've always been benevolent.\nI know what we lost in Mazeo, but I've moved on."
    voice "se/y00244.ogg"
    char_fortaime "不止如此，三人执政团是邪恶的？\n据我所知，他们一向仁慈。\n我知道我们在马泽奥失去了什么，但我已经释怀了。"

# game/script.rpy:202822
translate chinese Fortaime1_map095_143_0_7b322f47:

    # voice "se/y00245.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "Anyway, I can process all of that later.\nI'm more worried about what's going to happen to {i}us{/i}.\nNot Valinorth, or Alestia. Just you, me, and Valessa."
    voice "se/y00245.ogg"
    char_fortaime "总之，那些我可以以后再慢慢消化。\n我更担心{i}我们{/i}会怎样。\n不是瓦利诺斯，也不是阿莱斯蒂亚。只是你、我，还有瓦莱莎。"

# game/script.rpy:202842
translate chinese Fortaime2_map095_143_0_6dd8aa1b:

    # voice "se/y00246.ogg"
    voice "se/y00246.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:202844
translate chinese Fortaime2_map095_143_0_75579ed5:

    # char_fortaime "Nothing anymore, I'm afraid.\nIt seems their goals have changed to conquest.\nWith Mazeo, it made sense. But not with us."
    char_fortaime "恐怕已经没有信任可言了。\n看来他们的目标已经变成了征服。\n对马泽奥，还说得通。但对我们，说不通。"

# game/script.rpy:202849
translate chinese Fortaime2_map095_143_0_e8ac3cdd:

    # voice "se/y00247.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "I thought they were our Gods. Our protectors.\nI'm starting to doubt that they even cared.\nI mean, was this their goal all along?"
    voice "se/y00247.ogg"
    char_fortaime "我以为他们是我们的神明。我们的庇护者。\n我开始怀疑他们是否真的在意过。\n我是说，这难道一直是他们的目的？"

# game/script.rpy:202855
translate chinese Fortaime2_map095_143_0_cecb81ec:

    # voice "se/y00248.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "All four nations, under their thumb.\nIf they just asked first, we could've cut a deal.\nBut straight to violence? I don't get it." nointeract
    voice "se/y00248.ogg"
    char_fortaime "四个国家，全都任他们摆布。\n要是他们先开口商量，我们本可以达成协议。\n可一上来就用暴力？我真不明白。" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:202871
translate chinese Fortaime2_map095_143_0_08225e7e:

    # voice "se/y00249.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "Yeah, and part of me wishes we still could.\nI mean, the attack hasn't happened yet.\nBut I know that's a stupid wish to have."
    voice "se/y00249.ogg"
    char_fortaime "是啊，我有一部分还盼着能有那个机会。\n毕竟，袭击还没发生。\n但我知道这是个愚蠢的念头。"

# game/script.rpy:202877
translate chinese Fortaime2_map095_143_0_e970bc61:

    # voice "se/y00250.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "You don't beg for your life against those odds.\nThey're coming with everything they've got.\nAnd from what you said, their power is incredible."
    voice "se/y00250.ogg"
    char_fortaime "面对那样的实力悬殊，求饶也没用。\n他们会倾巢而出。\n而且照你说的，他们的力量强得可怕。"

# game/script.rpy:202897
translate chinese Fortaime2_map095_143_0_8ca3f027:

    # voice "se/y00251.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "Yeah, there's no sense begging for lenience.\nNormally, I'd say that it's impossible to win.\nBut with that blade? Things seem different to me."
    voice "se/y00251.ogg"
    char_fortaime "是啊，求他们手下留情毫无意义。\n换作平时，我会说这场仗根本赢不了。\n但有了那把剑？在我看来就不一样了。"

# game/script.rpy:202901
translate chinese Fortaime2_map095_143_0_31d52ab8:

    # voice "se/y00252.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "Mylus said it was important to them, right?\nIf they're weak, we can't hold back.\nThis is our chance to save Alestia!"
    voice "se/y00252.ogg"
    char_fortaime "迈勒斯说那对他们很重要，对吧？\n既然他们虚弱，我们就不能留手。\n这是我们拯救阿莱斯蒂亚的机会！"

# game/script.rpy:202921
translate chinese Fortaime2_map095_143_0_5d485346:

    # voice "se/y00253.ogg"
    voice "se/y00253.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:202923
translate chinese Fortaime2_map095_143_0_9ed970fc:

    # char_fortaime "Yeah, but not as good as us.\nAlestia would be better if the spirits were everywhere.\nValinorth is perfect, and we were truly lucky to live here."
    char_fortaime "是啊，但没我们这么好。\n要是灵体无处不在，阿莱斯蒂亚会更好。\n瓦利诺斯是完美的，能住在这里，我们真的很幸运。"

# game/script.rpy:202928
translate chinese Fortaime2_map095_143_0_7c726dfa:

    # voice "se/y00254.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "But I guess those days are coming to an end.\nWithout spiritual energy, we'll succumb to the cold.\nThe winds from Eastcrown will take over Valinorth."
    voice "se/y00254.ogg"
    char_fortaime "但我想那样的日子要结束了。\n没有灵力，我们会败给严寒。\n东冠吹来的寒风将吞噬瓦利诺斯。"

# game/script.rpy:202934
translate chinese Fortaime2_map095_143_0_244aa855:

    # voice "se/y00255.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "I hope there's something we can do.\nMaybe after this, we should come back home.\nIf we could just get that idol to shine again."
    voice "se/y00255.ogg"
    char_fortaime "希望能有办法。\n也许这件事之后，我们该回家看看。\n要是能让那尊灵像再次亮起来就好了。"

# game/script.rpy:202954
translate chinese Fortaime2_map095_143_0_6ca0b935:

    # voice "se/y00256.ogg"
    voice "se/y00256.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:202956
translate chinese Fortaime2_map095_143_0_f67ab0c7:

    # char_fortaime "Thanks, that means a lot to me.\nBut I wouldn't want to come off as whiny.\nRight now, we need to combine our strengths."
    char_fortaime "谢谢，这对我意义重大。\n但我不想显得像是在抱怨。\n眼下，我们需要齐心协力。"

# game/script.rpy:202961
translate chinese Fortaime2_map095_143_0_2b2f9ff4:

    # voice "se/y00257.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "A pity party seems appealing, but it'd be a waste.\nWe can't afford to throw away the sacrifice of Mylus' Father."
    voice "se/y00257.ogg"
    char_fortaime "自怨自艾虽然诱人，却只是浪费时间。\n我们不能辜负迈勒斯父亲的牺牲。"

# game/script.rpy:202981
translate chinese Fortaime2_map095_143_0_2e38101a:

    # voice "se/y00258.ogg"
    voice "se/y00258.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:202983
translate chinese Fortaime2_map095_143_0_1b34d4c8:

    # char_fortaime "Yeah, definitely!\nWe're a team for a reason.\nThere's nothing we can't handle!"
    char_fortaime "是啊，当然！\n我们是一支队伍，这不是没有理由的。\n没有什么我们应付不了！"

# game/script.rpy:202988
translate chinese Fortaime2_map095_143_0_29dc3dce:

    # voice "se/y00259.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "I'm ready whenever you are, [firstname].\nLet's grab that blade and head to Mazeo.\nWhatever you need, I'll be by your side."
    voice "se/y00259.ogg"
    char_fortaime "你准备好了我随时出发，[firstname]。\n去拿那把剑，然后前往马泽奥。\n无论你需要什么，我都会在你身边。"

# game/script.rpy:203014
translate chinese Fortaime2_map095_143_0_277f37da:

    # voice "se/y00260.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "I never thought I'd be leaving Valinorth, [firstname].\nIn fact, I came to terms with that a long time ago.\nBut here I am, leaving it behind for good, and I'm scared."
    voice "se/y00260.ogg"
    char_fortaime "我从没想过自己会离开瓦利诺斯，[firstname]。\n其实，我早就认命了。\n可如今我真的要永远离开它了，我很害怕。"

# game/script.rpy:203020
translate chinese Fortaime2_map095_143_0_b5e82de3:

    # voice "se/y00261.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "Everything I've read about the outside world is scary.\nPiracy, deathly cold, and even deathly heat.\nWe had it good here. A really nice middle ground."
    voice "se/y00261.ogg"
    char_fortaime "我读过的关于外面世界的一切都很可怕。\n海盗、致命的严寒，甚至还有致命酷热。\n我们这里日子过得好。一个很舒适的中庸之地。"

# game/script.rpy:203026
translate chinese Fortaime2_map095_143_0_37be60c3:

    # voice "se/y00262.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "This is where it gets confusing for me, though.\nMazeo was supposed to be safer because of The Triumvirate.\nThey occupied it, with force, but they've kept it peaceful."
    voice "se/y00262.ogg"
    char_fortaime "不过，让我困惑的地方在这里。\n因为有三人执政团，马泽奥本该更安全。\n他们用武力占领了那里，却也维持了和平。"

# game/script.rpy:203032
translate chinese Fortaime2_map095_143_0_674ad961:

    # voice "se/y00263.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "They could easily do the same thing to Valinorth.\nBut killing everyone, and burning it to the ground?\nThey've crossed a line that no one ever should."
    voice "se/y00263.ogg"
    char_fortaime "他们完全可以把同样的手段用在瓦利诺斯。\n但杀光所有人，再一把火烧成灰烬？\n他们越过了任何人都不该越过的底线。"

# game/script.rpy:203052
translate chinese Fortaime3_map095_143_0_bce92cd4:

    # voice "se/y00264.ogg"
    voice "se/y00264.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:203054
translate chinese Fortaime3_map095_143_0_b71101f8:

    # char_fortaime "I'm sure it might be worse in my head.\nBut with all the stuff I've read, it's still scary.\nI'm used to routine, so anything new is frightening."
    char_fortaime "我脑子里想的也许比现实更糟。\n但读了那么多东西，还是觉得吓人。\n我习惯了按部就班，所以任何新鲜事都让我害怕。"

# game/script.rpy:203059
translate chinese Fortaime3_map095_143_0_66240b55:

    # voice "se/y00265.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "Mazeo is full of merchants, pirates, and mercenaries.\nLet's do our best not to make anyone mad.\nYou never know how far their influence spreads."
    voice "se/y00265.ogg"
    char_fortaime "马泽奥到处都是商人、海盗和雇佣兵。\n我们尽量别惹恼任何人。\n你永远不知道他们的势力能伸多远。"

# game/script.rpy:203078
translate chinese Fortaime3_map095_143_0_f1c8f451:

    # voice "se/y00266.ogg"
    voice "se/y00266.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:203080
translate chinese Fortaime3_map095_143_0_a2c350f1:

    # char_fortaime "Whoa, really?\nYou think we could take on pirates?\nThat's a bit far-fetched, if you ask me."
    char_fortaime "哇，真的？\n你觉得我们能对付海盗？\n要我说，这有点异想天开。"

# game/script.rpy:203085
translate chinese Fortaime3_map095_143_0_fd7e2066:

    # voice "se/y00267.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "But I guess we make a pretty good team.\nIf things get bad, we can play the status card.\nDon't want Mazeo-Valinorth relations to suffer."
    voice "se/y00267.ogg"
    char_fortaime "不过我想我们配合得还不错。\n要是事情闹大，我们可以打出身份牌。\n可不想让马泽奥和瓦利诺斯的关系受影响。"

# game/script.rpy:203105
translate chinese Fortaime3_map095_143_0_127ddfff:

    # voice "se/y00268.ogg"
    voice "se/y00268.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:203107
translate chinese Fortaime3_map095_143_0_eebc801a:

    # char_fortaime "Which is boring, if you ask me.\nI'll try not to say anything witty.\nPirates aren't the best with humor."
    char_fortaime "要我说，这挺无聊的。\n我会尽量别说俏皮话。\n海盗可不太懂幽默。"

# game/script.rpy:203112
translate chinese Fortaime3_map095_143_0_9851a3e3:

    # voice "se/y00269.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "Besides, I'm sure Damek will be there waiting.\nHe'll make sure we get off to the right start.\nWe're going to Mazeo. We'll need protection."
    voice "se/y00269.ogg"
    char_fortaime "再说，达梅克肯定会在那儿等着。\n他会确保我们一开始就走对路。\n我们要去马泽奥。我们需要保护。"

# game/script.rpy:203132
translate chinese Fortaime3_map095_143_0_aa09efa4:

    # voice "se/y00270.ogg"
    voice "se/y00270.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:203134
translate chinese Fortaime3_map095_143_0_4b903023:

    # char_fortaime "Maybe Damek will tell us more about that.\nI'm sure there's a lot to catch up on.\nThis Rebellion isn't exactly \"new\"."
    char_fortaime "也许达梅克能告诉我们更多。\n肯定有很多事要补课。\n这支反抗军可算不上“新”。"

# game/script.rpy:203139
translate chinese Fortaime3_map095_143_0_1f7fd8ba:

    # voice "se/y00271.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "I'm willing to bet there's more at play.\nBut with Valinorth, there's nothing secret at all.\nThey're planning to raze our village, plain and simple."
    voice "se/y00271.ogg"
    char_fortaime "我敢打赌另有隐情。\n但对付瓦利诺斯，根本没什么秘密可言。\n他们就是打算把我们的村子夷为平地，就这么简单。"

# game/script.rpy:203145
translate chinese Fortaime3_map095_143_0_f3301b99:

    # voice "se/y00272.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "You mentioned that it {i}might{/i} be for the blade?\nThat excuse would never fly for an attack this large.\nAt least for Mazeo, they said they were fighting piracy."
    voice "se/y00272.ogg"
    char_fortaime "你提过这{i}也许{/i}是为了那把剑？\n这么大的攻势，那种借口根本说不通。\n至少对马泽奥，他们说是为了打击海盗。"

# game/script.rpy:203151
translate chinese Fortaime3_map095_143_0_267f5dd7:

    # voice "se/y00273.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "I'm sure they want their blade back, but yeah.\nThat desire and this attack are two separate things.\nI'm sure we'll find out the truth if we keep moving forward."
    voice "se/y00273.ogg"
    char_fortaime "他们肯定想夺回那把剑，不过也是。\n那个念头和这次袭击是两码事。\n只要继续往前走，我相信我们会查明真相。"

# game/script.rpy:203171
translate chinese Fortaime3_map095_143_0_e65871c9:

    # voice "se/y00274.ogg"
    voice "se/y00274.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:203173
translate chinese Fortaime3_map095_143_0_53ff1417:

    # char_fortaime "That's what worries me about all of this.\nThey push, and we're expected to push back.\nWhat if we don't like fighting...?"
    char_fortaime "这正是这一切让我担心的地方。\n他们紧逼，我们就得回击。\n可要是我们不喜欢打仗呢……？"

# game/script.rpy:203180
translate chinese Fortaime3_map095_143_0_72911136:

    # voice "se/y00275.ogg"
    voice "se/y00275.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:203182
translate chinese Fortaime3_map095_143_0_352cce70:

    # char_fortaime "That fight-or-die mentality is a terrible thing.\nIt can drive good men to do horrible things.\nPlease, don't let that happen to you, [firstname]."
    char_fortaime "那种不是你死就是我活的心态太可怕了。\n它能让好人做出可怕的事。\n求你，别让这种事发生在你身上，[firstname]。"

# game/script.rpy:203189
translate chinese Fortaime3_map095_143_0_0da3547a:

    # voice "se/y00276.ogg"
    voice "se/y00276.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:203191
translate chinese Fortaime3_map095_143_0_352cce70_1:

    # char_fortaime "That fight-or-die mentality is a terrible thing.\nIt can drive good men to do horrible things.\nPlease, don't let that happen to you, [firstname]."
    char_fortaime "那种不是你死就是我活的心态太可怕了。\n它能让好人做出可怕的事。\n求你，别让这种事发生在你身上，[firstname]。"

# game/script.rpy:203209
translate chinese Fortaime3_map095_143_0_1a9dbac3:

    # voice "se/y00277.ogg"
    voice "se/y00277.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:203211
translate chinese Fortaime3_map095_143_0_78d28dea:

    # char_fortaime "Please, don't change too much.\nWe're going to be fighting for peace.\nThat's not worth anything if I can't share it with {i}you{/i}."
    char_fortaime "求你，别变太多。\n我们是为和平而战。\n如果不能和{i}你{/i}一起分享，那和平就毫无意义。"

# game/script.rpy:203230
translate chinese Fortaime3_map095_143_0_483e1aa4:

    # voice "se/y00278.ogg"
    voice "se/y00278.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:203232
translate chinese Fortaime3_map095_143_0_be131f04:

    # char_fortaime "Good. I'm glad you're putting thought into it.\nDon't act recklessly in the face of victory.\nVictory is nothing if we can't share it together."
    char_fortaime "好。很高兴你在认真思考。\n面对胜利时别鲁莽行事。\n如果不能一起分享，胜利也毫无意义。"

# game/script.rpy:203257
translate chinese Fortaime3_map095_143_0_1a3fbc1b:

    # voice "se/y00279.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "I wouldn't mind taking one last look at the village.\nIt's so weird, knowing that an attack is coming.\nThis could be the last time we see our homes?"
    voice "se/y00279.ogg"
    char_fortaime "我不介意最后再看一眼村子。\n知道袭击将至，感觉真奇怪。\n这可能是我们最后一次见到家园了？"

# game/script.rpy:203263
translate chinese Fortaime3_map095_143_0_c0ab7260:

    # voice "se/y00280.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "How are we just supposed to accept that?\nI expect we'll have plenty of time to grieve, but...\nIs that something we should really have to do?"
    voice "se/y00280.ogg"
    char_fortaime "我们怎么能就这么接受？\n我想我们会有很多时间去哀悼，可是……\n这真是我们该承受的吗？"

# game/script.rpy:203269
translate chinese Fortaime3_map095_143_0_d9224260:

    # voice "se/y00281.ogg"
    # char_fortaime "We don't have to look around, but I'd appreciate it.\nIf I find something I want to take with me, I'll grab it.\nI'd much rather leave Valinorth behind with no regrets."
    voice "se/y00281.ogg"
    char_fortaime "我们不必四处看看，但我会很感激。\n要是有想带走的东西，我就拿上。\n我更希望能毫无遗憾地离开瓦利诺斯。"

# game/script.rpy:203288
translate chinese Fortaime3_map095_143_0_ecc9cbbe:

    # voice "se/y00282.ogg"
    voice "se/y00282.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:203290
translate chinese Fortaime3_map095_143_0_7b9f8e9a:

    # char_fortaime "Thank you so much, [firstname].\nI can't put my finger on it, but I know I'm not ready.\nOne last walk through Valinorth is all I could ever ask for."
    char_fortaime "太谢谢你了，[firstname]。\n我说不清为什么，但我知道自己还没准备好。\n能在瓦利诺斯最后走一走，我就心满意足了。"

# game/script.rpy:203309
translate chinese Fortaime3_map095_143_0_92118a44:

    # voice "se/y00283.ogg"
    voice "se/y00283.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:203311
translate chinese Fortaime3_map095_143_0_71c05f27:

    # char_fortaime "I understand, but at least try.\nIt's never easy, leaving a life behind. I get that.\nBut one moment now could save you tons of sleepless nights."
    char_fortaime "我明白，但至少试着做吧。\n抛下过往的生活从来都不容易，这我懂。\n可现在花一点时间，能替你省去无数个无眠之夜。"

# game/script.rpy:203398
translate chinese Valessa1_map095_147_0_b41c75c8:

    # char_valessa "Hey." nointeract
    char_valessa "嘿。" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:203415
translate chinese Valessa1_map095_147_0_8d4763d5:

    # voice "se/y00213.ogg"
    # char_valessa "You mean everything that Mylus told us?\nI'm freaking out. I can hardly believe it.\nBut the spirits would never lie to us, right?"
    voice "se/y00213.ogg"
    char_valessa "你是说迈勒斯告诉我们的那些？\n我快疯了。我简直不敢相信。\n但灵体绝不会骗我们，对吧？"

# game/script.rpy:203421
translate chinese Valessa1_map095_147_0_297caa70:

    # voice "se/y00214.ogg"
    # char_valessa "I can't believe The Triumvirate is our enemy.\nI know they had their reasons with Mazeo, but...\nThere's no reason to attack Valinorth. Not at all!"
    voice "se/y00214.ogg"
    char_valessa "我不敢相信三人执政团是我们的敌人。\n我知道他们对马泽奥有他们的理由，可是……\n袭击瓦利诺斯根本毫无理由。完全没有！"

# game/script.rpy:203441
translate chinese Valessa2_map095_147_0_f03806a0:

    # voice "se/y00215.ogg"
    voice "se/y00215.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:203443
translate chinese Valessa2_map095_147_0_8ff74df4:

    # char_valessa "Then why don't they ask for it...?\nThere's no need to attack us like this.\nIt makes me wonder if there's more to Mazeo."
    char_valessa "那他们为什么不开口要……？\n没必要这样攻打我们。\n让我不禁怀疑马泽奥的事另有隐情。"

# game/script.rpy:203448
translate chinese Valessa2_map095_147_0_1fa58cba:

    # voice "se/y00216.ogg"
    # char_valessa "They said they took it over to fight piracy.\nBut I think they're acting in their own interest.\nBurning down our village? They don't care about Alestia." nointeract
    voice "se/y00216.ogg"
    char_valessa "他们说占领那里是为了打击海盗。\n但我觉得他们是在谋一己之利。\n烧毁我们的村子？他们根本不在乎阿莱斯蒂亚。" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:203466
translate chinese Valessa2_map095_147_0_6076ad0f:

    # voice "se/y00217.ogg"
    # char_valessa "It only makes sense, right?\nIt must have something to do with the spirits.\nTyrants can't stand when something is in their way."
    voice "se/y00217.ogg"
    char_valessa "这不难理解，对吧？\n一定跟灵体有关。\n暴君最受不了有东西挡他们的道。"

# game/script.rpy:203488
translate chinese Valessa2_map095_147_0_7b38f75c:

    # voice "se/y00218.ogg"
    # char_valessa "I'd have a hard time believing that.\nThey don't want the blade. They want us dead.\nStealing is easy. That's not what they're doing here."
    voice "se/y00218.ogg"
    char_valessa "这我可很难相信。\n他们要的不是那把剑。他们要的是我们死。\n偷东西很容易。他们此举可不是偷。"

# game/script.rpy:203494
translate chinese Valessa2_map095_147_0_a7ec7836:

    # voice "se/y00219.ogg"
    # char_valessa "All I can think about is the realm of spirits.\nIt's been getting stronger, but maybe it's too strong?\nMaybe they've started to see it as a threat."
    voice "se/y00219.ogg"
    char_valessa "我满脑子想的都是灵界。\n它一直在变强，但也许强过头了？\n也许他们开始把它视为威胁。"

# game/script.rpy:203516
translate chinese Valessa2_map095_147_0_e4018d97:

    # voice "se/y00220.ogg"
    voice "se/y00220.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:203518
translate chinese Valessa2_map095_147_0_0fc9d154:

    # char_valessa "I always thought they were good rulers.\nSometimes you have to make tough decisions.\nMazeo shocked us all, but we've all moved on."
    char_valessa "我一直以为他们是好统治者。\n有时你不得不做出艰难的决定。\n马泽奥的事让我们震惊，但我们都已释怀。"

# game/script.rpy:203523
translate chinese Valessa2_map095_147_0_9ffacad8:

    # voice "se/y00221.ogg"
    # char_valessa "There's also a line you're not meant to cross, though.\nBurning down an innocent village is way past that.\nNo goal could justify what they plan to do with Valinorth."
    voice "se/y00221.ogg"
    char_valessa "但也有不该跨越的底线。\n烧毁一个无辜的村庄，远远越过了那条线。\n他们打算对瓦利诺斯做的事，任何目标都无法为之辩护。"

# game/script.rpy:203545
translate chinese Valessa2_map095_147_0_0c8ea632:

    # voice "se/y00222.ogg"
    voice "se/y00222.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:203547
translate chinese Valessa2_map095_147_0_2616646f:

    # char_valessa "Honestly, I don't know.\nI usually look to you when I think about that.\nBut without spiritual energy? Things will change."
    char_valessa "老实说，我不知道。\n想到这些时，我通常会指望你。\n但没有了灵力？一切都会变。"

# game/script.rpy:203552
translate chinese Valessa2_map095_147_0_991eddeb:

    # voice "se/y00223.ogg"
    # char_valessa "We're up in mountains, and the spirits keep us warm.\nWithout them, Valinorth would freeze and wilt away.\nWe'd have to migrate to Mazeo, like Mylus said."
    voice "se/y00223.ogg"
    char_valessa "我们身处山中，是灵体让我们保持温暖。\n没有他们，瓦利诺斯会冻僵、凋零。\n我们就得像迈勒斯说的那样，迁往马泽奥。"

# game/script.rpy:203558
translate chinese Valessa2_map095_147_0_71305117:

    # voice "se/y00224.ogg"
    # char_valessa "One thing I know, is that The Triumvirate is ruined.\nThere's no way people will side with this attack.\nIt's only a matter of time before word starts spreading."
    voice "se/y00224.ogg"
    char_valessa "有一点我很确定，三人执政团完了。\n人们不可能支持这次袭击。\n消息传开只是时间问题。"

# game/script.rpy:203564
translate chinese Valessa2_map095_147_0_d6775ae5:

    # voice "se/y00225.ogg"
    # char_valessa "I think I need to concern myself with {i}Alestia's{/i} future.\nThe Rebellion will probably be swarming with new recruits.\nWe can fight back, so no one else loses their home." nointeract
    voice "se/y00225.ogg"
    char_valessa "我想我该关心的，是{i}阿莱斯蒂亚{/i}的未来。\n反抗军大概会涌入大批新兵。\n我们能反击，这样就不会再有别人失去家园。" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:203582
translate chinese Valessa2_map095_147_0_f3a8474a:

    # voice "se/y00226.ogg"
    # char_valessa "And it all starts with that special blade.\nI guess we should head to The Grand Tree.\nNo sense leaving without it, right?"
    voice "se/y00226.ogg"
    char_valessa "而这一切都始于那把特别的剑。\n我想我们该去巨树了。\n不带它就离开，没道理，对吧？"

# game/script.rpy:203604
translate chinese Valessa2_map095_147_0_d9b031c7:

    # voice "se/y00227.ogg"
    # char_valessa "Sometimes there isn't, you know?\nYou can never change history from your comfort zone.\nIf it's true about you and the blade, I'll have your back."
    voice "se/y00227.ogg"
    char_valessa "你知道，有时候确实没有。\n待在舒适区里，永远改变不了历史。\n如果你和那把剑的传说是真的，我会支持你。"

# game/script.rpy:203632
translate chinese Valessa2_map095_147_0_0de94ad2:

    # voice "se/y00228.ogg"
    # char_valessa "There's something I never thought I'd hear.\nThousands of Seers, and they {i}never{/i} left Valinorth.\nI guess we're meant to play bigger roles than we thought."
    voice "se/y00228.ogg"
    char_valessa "这真是我从没想过会听到的话。\n成千上万的先知，他们{i}从未{/i}离开过瓦利诺斯。\n看来我们注定要扮演比想象中更重要的角色。"

# game/script.rpy:203638
translate chinese Valessa2_map095_147_0_f4113871:

    # voice "se/y00229.ogg"
    # char_valessa "But to answer your question? No, I'm not ready.\nUnfortunately, my opinion doesn't count for much.\nI'll have to come to terms with this as we move on." nointeract
    voice "se/y00229.ogg"
    char_valessa "但要回答你的问题？不，我还没准备好。\n可惜我的意见没什么分量。\n我只能边走边慢慢接受这一切。" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:203656
translate chinese Valessa2_map095_147_0_ba5743d1:

    # voice "se/y00230.ogg"
    # char_valessa "Oh no, I wouldn't want to trouble you.\nYou have enough going on, I'd just be a bother.\nThanks for the offer though, I'll keep it in mind."
    voice "se/y00230.ogg"
    char_valessa "哦，不，我不想麻烦你。\n你已经有够多事要忙，我只会添乱。\n不过谢谢你的好意，我会记在心上。"

# game/script.rpy:203678
translate chinese Valessa2_map095_147_0_a03f9436:

    # voice "se/y00231.ogg"
    # char_valessa "Really? You seem so calm and collected.\nEither way, it's good to know I'm not alone.\nIf you're ever having trouble, just talk to me."
    voice "se/y00231.ogg"
    char_valessa "真的？你看起来那么沉稳镇定。\n不管怎样，知道我不是一个人就好。\n要是你有难处，随时跟我说。"

# game/script.rpy:203700
translate chinese Valessa2_map095_147_0_6ef2e2e5:

    # voice "se/y00232.ogg"
    # char_valessa "Really? I guess I'm the odd one out.\nEven Mylus, our Elder, seemed so eager to leave.\nI'd like to see the world, but not under these circumstances."
    voice "se/y00232.ogg"
    char_valessa "真的？看来我是格格不入的那个。\n连我们的长老迈勒斯，看着都那么急着离开。\n我想看看外面的世界，但不是在这样的情形下。"

# game/script.rpy:203724
translate chinese Valessa2_map095_147_0_8499b93d:

    # voice "se/y00233.ogg"
    # char_valessa "I'll decide when I see it.\nYou and Mylus made it seem really incredible.\nBut at the end of the day, it's just a sword."
    voice "se/y00233.ogg"
    char_valessa "等我见到它再决定吧。\n你和迈勒斯把它说得神乎其神。\n可说到底，它不过是一把剑。"

# game/script.rpy:203730
translate chinese Valessa2_map095_147_0_ae109e05:

    # voice "se/y00234.ogg"
    # char_valessa "I doubt it'll be the turning point of this battle.\nOf course, I wouldn't mind being proven wrong.\nWhat else can you tell me about it...?"
    voice "se/y00234.ogg"
    char_valessa "我怀疑它不会成为这场战斗的转折点。\n当然，我倒不介意被证明是错的。\n你还能告诉我些什么……？"

# game/script.rpy:203750
translate chinese Valessa3_map095_147_0_220abc39:

    # voice "se/y00235.ogg"
    voice "se/y00235.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:203752
translate chinese Valessa3_map095_147_0_609c025d:

    # char_valessa "Wait, that's really confusing.\nIt looks like a blade, but serves another purpose?\nTell me more. I'd like to know what makes it special."
    char_valessa "等等，这真让人糊涂。\n它看着像把剑，却有别的用途？\n多说点。我想知道它特别在哪里。"

# game/script.rpy:203773
translate chinese Valessa3_map095_147_0_cee93a14:

    # voice "se/y00236.ogg"
    voice "se/y00236.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:203775
translate chinese Valessa3_map095_147_0_17e97329:

    # char_valessa "So, it still works as a standard weapon.\nBut I'm curious about the other functions it has.\nWe'd never do this for a run-of-the-mill sword."
    char_valessa "所以，它作为普通武器也照样能用。\n但我对它其他的功能很好奇。\n换成一把普通剑，我们绝不会这么大费周章。"

# game/script.rpy:203796
translate chinese Valessa3_map095_147_0_71106937:

    # voice "se/y00237.ogg"
    voice "se/y00237.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:203798
translate chinese Valessa3_map095_147_0_8e0e7069:

    # char_valessa "So the more he killed, the more he had to serve him?\nAnd Ulric's life powered a bunch of armored suits...?\nThat means their army could always outnumber Alestia!"
    char_valessa "所以杀得越多，就越多人为他效力？\n乌尔里克的性命还驱动了一堆铠甲……？\n那意味着他们的军队永远能压过阿莱斯蒂亚！"

# game/script.rpy:203803
translate chinese Valessa3_map095_147_0_ed1506be:

    # voice "se/y00238.ogg"
    # char_valessa "I'm starting to see why it might be a threat.\nBut we won't be stealing life like that, right?\nWe should keep it from them, and limit their numbers." nointeract
    voice "se/y00238.ogg"
    char_valessa "我开始明白它为何会是个威胁了。\n但我们不会那样窃取性命，对吧？\n我们该把它从他们手中夺走，限制他们的兵力。" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:203821
translate chinese Valessa3_map095_147_0_f9ba72c9:

    # voice "se/y00239.ogg"
    # char_valessa "Let's put a pin in that one, alright?\nI don't think we should resort to their means.\nAt that point, what separates the two sides?"
    voice "se/y00239.ogg"
    char_valessa "这个先搁一搁，好吗？\n我觉得我们不该效仿他们的手段。\n到了那一步，两方还有什么区别？"

# game/script.rpy:203827
translate chinese Valessa3_map095_147_0_8dc18631:

    # voice "se/y00240.ogg"
    # char_valessa "We can use it as a weapon, sure.\nBut we shouldn't kill Alestians for greater numbers.\nWe can build a strong army through {i}peaceful{/i} means."
    voice "se/y00240.ogg"
    char_valessa "我们当然可以把它当武器用。\n但不应为了扩充兵力而杀害阿莱斯蒂亚人。\n我们可以通过{i}和平{/i}的方式组建强大的军队。"

# game/script.rpy:203849
translate chinese Valessa3_map095_147_0_f3d67fed:

    # voice "se/y00241.ogg"
    # char_valessa "Good, I was starting to worry.\nWithout that blade, their army is finite.\nThey can't hide behind numbers like before."
    voice "se/y00241.ogg"
    char_valessa "好，我正开始担心呢。\n没有那把剑，他们的军队是有限的。\n他们没法再像以前那样靠人数取胜。"

# game/script.rpy:203936
translate chinese map098_dfa07468:

    # "Damek conversed with Gryz, the Mayor of Mazeo.{w}\nThere was much to be done before The Rebellion could settle down.{w}\nBut first on his agenda, was procuring the city's undergound tunnels.{w}\nA place to operate in secrecy would be essential to their continued success."
    "达梅克正与马泽奥市长格瑞兹交谈。{w}\n反抗军要安顿下来，还有太多事要做。{w}\n但他的当务之急，是获取这座城市的地下隧道。{w}\n一个能秘密行动的地方，对他们持续的成功至关重要。"

# game/script.rpy:203966
translate chinese map098_121ccdad:

    # voice "se/x00018.ogg"
    voice "se/x00018.ogg"

# game/script.rpy:203968
translate chinese map098_86d87b75:

    # char_damek "Come on Gryz, this must be possible.\nEven their Honor Guard barely monitors the place.\nWhen they do, they're oblivious to our existence."
    char_damek "得了吧，格瑞兹，这一定办得到。\n连他们的荣誉卫队都几乎不监视那里。\n就算监视，他们也察觉不到我们的存在。"

# game/script.rpy:203973
translate chinese map098_5c041391:

    # voice "se/x00019.ogg"
    # char_damek "If we don't push them, they won't push back.\nAlthough, one final push might be required.\nEither way, we need that deed as a rightful claim."
    voice "se/x00019.ogg"
    char_damek "我们不去招惹他们，他们就不会反击。\n不过，也许最后还差临门一脚。\n无论如何，我们需要那份地契作为合法的所有权。"

# game/script.rpy:204001
