    # char_jit_map098_1_0_36 "Damek, for the last time, it's not so simple!\nIf The Triumvirate knew I was helping you, they'd kill me.\nI wouldn't be surprised if they damaged Mazeo as well."
    char_jit_map098_1_0_36 "达梅克，我最后说一次，没这么简单！\n要是三人执政团知道我帮你，他们会杀了我。\n他们就算毁掉马泽奥，我也不意外。"

# game/script.rpy:204034
translate chinese map098_d2d8c5fe:

    # voice "se/x00021.ogg"
    voice "se/x00021.ogg"

