    # char_jit_map098_1_0_36 "Everything has a paper trail, Damek.\nThey keep track of every step I take.\nAt the end of the day, I'm still their General."
    char_jit_map098_1_0_36 "凡事都会留下书面记录，达梅克。\n我走的每一步他们都盯着。\n说到底，我终究还是他们的将军。"

# game/script.rpy:204070
translate chinese map098_26fce461:

    # voice "se/x00023.ogg"
    # char_jit_map098_1_0_36 "I understand that you want those tunnels.\nBut it would be too risky. They'd find us out.\nI'm not gambling with my life, understand?"
    voice "se/x00023.ogg"
    char_jit_map098_1_0_36 "我明白你想要那些隧道。\n但风险太大了。他们会查出我们。\n我不会拿命去赌，明白吗？"

